#: src/auto_pickup.cpp:497
msgid ""
"* is used as a Wildcard.  A few Examples:\n"
"\n"
"wooden arrow    matches the itemname exactly\n"
"wooden ar*      matches items beginning with wood ar\n"
"*rrow           matches items ending with rrow\n"
"*avy fle*fi*arrow     multiple * are allowed\n"
"heAVY*woOD*arrOW      case insensitive search\n"
"\n"
"Pickup based on item materials:\n"
"m:kevlar        matches items made of Kevlar\n"
"M:copper        matches items made purely of copper\n"
"M:steel,iron    multiple materials allowed (OR search)"
msgstr ""
"* est utilisé comme aide à la recherche. Quelques exemples :\n"
"\n"
"wooden arrow correspond exactement au nom de l'article\n"
"wooden ar* correspond aux éléments commençant par wood ar\n"
"*rrow correspond aux articles se terminant par rrow\n"
"*avy fle*fi*arrow plusieurs * sont autorisés\n"
"heAVY*woOD*arrOW recherche insensible à la casse\n"
"\n"
"Ramassage basé sur les matériaux de l'article :\n"
"m:kevlar correspond aux articles fabriqués en Kevlar\n"
"M:cuivre correspond aux articles fabriqués uniquement en cuivre\n"
"M:acier,fer plusieurs matériaux autorisés (recherche OR)"

