#: src/overmap.cpp:7800
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This is automated emergency shelter beacon %d%d.  Supplies, amenities and "
"shelter are stocked."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'une balise automatisée pour les abris d'urgence %d%d. Les "
"fournitures, les commodités et les abris sont stockés."

#: src/overmap.cpp:7804
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This is FEMA camp %d%d.  Supplies are limited, please bring supplemental "
