#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ACTIVE_CLOAKING"
msgid ""
"This gear has <info>cloaking tech</info> that will <good>make you "
"invisible</good> when active, at the cost of <info>power from a UPS</info>."
msgstr ""
"Cet équipement dispose d'une <info>technologie de camouflage</info> qui "
"<good>vous rendra invisible</good> lorsqu'il est actif, au prix de "
"l'<info>alimentation d'un onduleur</info>."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ALARMCLOCK"
msgid "This gear has an <info>alarm clock</info> feature."
msgstr "Cet équipement possède une <info>alarme</info>."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ALLOWS_BODY_BLOCK"
msgid ""
"This item <info>won't prevent you from blocking with your body, such as arms "
"or legs</info> when wielded as a weapon."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ALLOWS_NATURAL_ATTACKS"
msgid ""
"This clothing won't hinder special attacks that involve <info>mutated or "
"cybernetic anatomy</info>."
msgstr ""
"Ces vêtements n'entraveront pas les attaques spéciales impliquant <info>une "
"anatomie mutée ou cybernétique</info>."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ALLOWS_REMOTE_USE"
msgid ""
"This item can be activated or reloaded from an adjacent tile without picking "
"it up."
msgstr ""
"Cet objet peut être activé ou rechargé depuis une case adjacente sans le "
"ramasser."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "CAN_USE_IN_DARK"
msgid "This item can use all of its features in darkness."
msgstr "Cet objet peut être utilisé dans le noir."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ALWAYS_AIMED"
msgid "This gun is <good>always fully aimed</good>."
msgstr "Cette arme est <good>toujours totalement visée</good>."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "AURA"
msgid "This is in your <info>outer aura</info>."
msgstr "Ceci est dans votre <info>aura externe</info>."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BAROMETER"
msgid ""
"This gear is equipped with an accurate barometer (which is used to measure "
"atmospheric pressure)."
msgstr ""
"Cet équipement est équipé d'un baromètre précis (qui sert à mesurer la "
"pression atmosphérique)."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BELT_CLIP"
msgid ""
"This item can be <info>clipped onto a belt loop</info> of the appropriate "
"size."
msgstr ""
"Cet objet peut être <info>attaché à un passant de ceinture</info> de la "
"taille appropriée."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "BELT_CLIP"
msgid "Item must clip onto a belt loop"
msgstr "L'objet doit pouvoir s'accrocher à un passant de ceinture"

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BELTED"
msgid "This gear is <info>strapped</info> onto you."
msgstr "Cet équipement est <info>sanglé</info> sur vous."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BIONIC_INSTALLATION_DATA"
msgid ""
"This item <info>provides</info> instructions and other required data for "
"several bionics, allowing installation of them with <good>minimal failure "
"chance</good>."
msgstr ""
"Cet objet <info>fournit</info> des instructions et d'autres données requises "
"pour plusieurs implants bioniques, permettant leur installation avec un "
"<good>risque d'échec minimal</good>."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BIONIC_NPC_USABLE"
msgid ""
"A <good>follower</good> could <info>make use of this CBM</info> if installed "
"properly."
msgstr ""
"Une <good>recrue</good> pourrait <info>utiliser ce MBC</info> s'il est "
"installé correctement."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BLIND"
msgid "This gear <bad>prevents</bad> you from <info>seeing</info> anything."
msgstr "Cet équipement vous <bad>empêche</bad> de <info>voir</info> quoi que ce soit."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BLOCK_WHILE_WORN"
msgid "This item can be used to block attacks when worn."
msgstr "Cet objet permet de bloquer des attaques lorsqu'il est porté."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "CALORIES_INTAKE"
msgid "This item enables you to keep track of calorie intake."
msgstr "Cet objet vous permet de suivre l’apport calorique."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "CALORIE_BURN"
msgid ""
"This item enables you to keep track of calorie consumption.  Includes "
"CALORIES_INTAKE."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "CASELESS_ROUNDS"
msgid "Being caseless rounds, these <bad>cannot be disassembled or reloaded</bad>."
msgstr ""
"Ces cartouches n'ont pas d'étuis, les rendant <bad>impossible à désassembler "
"ou recharger</bad>."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "CBM"
msgid ""
"This item is a Compact Bionic Module.  You'll need to <info>use specialized "
"machinery</info> or <info>ask a surgeon</info> to install it into your body."
msgstr ""
"Cet objet est un module bionique compact.  Vous devrez <info>utiliser des "
"machines spécialisées</info> ou <info>demander à un chirurgien</info> de "
"l'installer dans votre corps."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "COLLAR"
msgid ""
"This clothing has a <info>wide collar</info> that can keep your mouth warm if "
"it is unencumbered."
msgstr ""
"Ce vêtement a un <info>col large</info> qui peut garder votre bouche au chaud "
"si elle est nue."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "COLLAPSE_CONTENTS"
msgid "Contents are hidden by default in inventory view."
msgstr "Les contenus sont masqués par défaut dans la vue d'inventaire."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "DEAF"
msgid "This gear <bad>prevents</bad> you from <info>hearing any sounds</info>."
msgstr "Cet équipement vous <bad>empêche</bad> d'<info>entendre le moindre son</info>."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "OVERHEATS"
msgid ""
"Continuously firing this weapon will cause it to <bad>overheat</bad> and "
"<info>can potentially damage it</info>."
msgstr ""
" Le fait de tirer continuellement avec cette arme entraîne une surchauffe et "
"peut potentiellement l'endommager."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "DIAMOND"
msgid ""
"This item has a <good>diamond coating</good> improving its <info>cutting or "
"piercing damage</info>."
msgstr ""
"Cet objet est recouvert d'un <good>diamant</good> améliorant ses <info>dégâts "
"de coupe ou de perforation</info>."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "GEMSTONE"
msgid ""
"This item is a precious gemstone, used for ornamentation.  This is mostly "
"useless post-Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Cet objet est une pierre précieuse, utilisée pour l'ornementation.  Ceci "
"malheureusement est plus ou moins inutile après le Cataclysme."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "DIG_TOOL"
msgid ""
"While wielded, this item allows you to mine through rocks and other hard "
"obstacles by moving into tiles with them.  Note that automatic mining option "
"should be set to true for this to work."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque vous l'utilisez, cet objet vous permet de creuser des roches et "
"d'autres obstacles durs en vous déplaçant dans les cases avec eux. Notez que "
"l'option d'extraction automatique doit être définie sur \"vrai\" pour que "
"cela fonctionne."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "DURABLE_MELEE"
msgid ""
"As a weapon, this item is <good>well-made</good> and will <info>withstand the "
"punishment of combat</info>."
msgstr ""
"En tant qu'arme, cet objet<good>de bonne facture</good> et <info>résistera "
"aux coups du combat</info>."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "EASY_CLEAN"
msgid ""
"This gun is made of <info>relatively simple parts</info> which makes powder "
