#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Scorpion Kung Fu"
#. ~ Clause text "buff_scorpion_static" of UI widget
#. "ma_buff_indicator_template"
msgid "Scorpion's Venom"
msgstr "Venin du Scorpion"

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#. ~ Description of buff "Scorpion Kung Fu" in martial art "Scorpion's Venom"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your venom is a constant threat that nothing can escape from.\n"
"\n"
"+15% damage."
msgstr ""
"Votre venin est une menace permanente dont personne ne réchappe.\n"
"\n"
"+15% dégats."

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json data/json/ui/ma_style.json
#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Scorpion Kung Fu"
#. ~ Clause text "buff_scorpion_onmove" of UI widget
#. "ma_buff_indicator_template"
msgid "Scorpion's Charge"
msgstr "Charge du Scorpion"

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#. ~ Description of buff "Scorpion Kung Fu" in martial art "Scorpion's Charge"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Rush forward and catch your prey!\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage.\n"
"Enables \"Pincer Fist\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns.  Stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json data/json/ui/ma_style.json
#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Scorpion Kung Fu"
#. ~ Clause text "buff_scorpion_onattack" of UI widget
#. "ma_buff_indicator_template"
msgid "Scorpion's Intimidation"
msgstr "Intimidation du Scorpion"

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#. ~ Description of buff "Scorpion Kung Fu" in martial art "Scorpion's
#. Intimidation"
msgid ""
"Nothing is scarier than an angry scorpion.  Your attacks can keep others at "
"bay.\n"
"\n"
"+1 dodge attempt.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#. ~ Name of martial art
msgid "Toad Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu du Crapaud"

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#. ~ Description of martial art "Toad Kung Fu"
msgid ""
"One of the Five Deadly Venoms, used by Liang Shen.  Masters of Toad Style can "
"focus their Strength to protect against all attacks.  You have powerful armor "
"against physical attacks, though you will lose focus when you move.  You can "
"meditate by pausing, giving yourself more armor for a short time."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Toad Kung Fu"
msgid "You pause for a moment and focus on your invincible body."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Toad Kung Fu"
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a toad-like stance."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json data/json/ui/ma_style.json
#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Toad Kung Fu"
#. ~ Clause text "buff_toad_static" of UI widget "ma_buff_indicator_template"
msgid "Toad's Iron Skin"
msgstr "Peau de Fer du Crapaud"

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#. ~ Description of buff "Toad Kung Fu" in martial art "Toad's Iron Skin"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your body is as strong as iron, but only if you don't move.\n"
"\n"
"Bash, cut, and stab armor increased by 100% of Strength."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json data/json/ui/ma_style.json
#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Toad Kung Fu"
#. ~ Clause text "buff_toad_onmove" of UI widget "ma_buff_indicator_template"
msgid "Iron Skin Dissipation"
msgstr "Dissipation de la peau du fer"

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#. ~ Description of buff "Toad Kung Fu" in martial art "Iron Skin Dissipation"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Moving causes you to lose your iron skin.\n"
"\n"
"Bash, cut, and stab armor reduced by 20% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 5 turns.  Stacks 5 times."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json data/json/ui/ma_style.json
#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Toad Kung Fu"
#. ~ Clause text "buff_toad_onpause" of UI widget "ma_buff_indicator_template"
msgid "Toad's Meditation"
msgstr "Méditation du Crapaud"

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#. ~ Description of buff "Toad Kung Fu" in martial art "Toad's Meditation"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By concentrating for a moment, you can bolster the strength of your iron "
"skin.\n"
"\n"
"Bash, cut, and stab armor increased by 50% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json data/json/ui/ma_style.json
#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Toad Kung Fu"
#. ~ Clause text "buff_toad_ongethit" of UI widget
#. "ma_buff_indicator_template"
msgid "Toad's Venom"
msgstr "Venin du Crapaud"

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#. ~ Description of buff "Toad Kung Fu" in martial art "Toad's Venom"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your venom is a harsh lesson about the strength of your iron body.\n"
"\n"
"+15% damage.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#. ~ Name of martial art
msgid "Viper Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu de la Vipère"

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#. ~ Description of martial art "Viper Kung Fu"
msgid ""
"A legacy of the Five Deadly Venoms, used by Qi Dong.  Viper Style (originally "
"called Snake Style) is punishing to stunned opponents.  Stunning a foe with a "
"Viper Bite will allow you to finish them off with the legendary Viper Strike."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Viper Kung Fu"
msgid "You prepare to strike your foes' weaknesses."
msgstr "Vous vous préparez à frapper les points faibles de vos adversaires"

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Viper Kung Fu"
#, c-format
