#: data/mods/Aftershock/missions/bounty_hunter_missions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/missions/bounty_hunter_missions.json
#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_feral_fancy_rapier" placed on map update on
#. start of mission "Finish your mission"
#. ~ Name of the monster "afs_mon_reaver" placed on map update on start of
#. mission "The bounty is on Salus IV"
msgid "The Aristocrat"
msgstr "L'Aristocrate"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_feral_maid_broom" placed on map update on start
#. of mission "Finish your mission"
msgid "The Servant"
msgstr "Le Servant"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill your mark"
msgstr "Tuez votre cible"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill your mark"
msgid ""
"Your employer could be no longer responding but you have decided to finish "
"your mission.  Hunt down and kill your mark."
msgstr ""
"Votre employeur ne répond peut-être plus mais vous avez décidé de terminer "
"votre mission.  Traquez et tuez votre cible."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Life vow"
msgstr "Vœu à vie"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Life vow"
msgid ""
"Live your life to the fullest, prove to yourself that you can survive this "
"new obstacle in the same way that you have survived the last."
msgstr ""
"Vivez pleinement votre vie, prouvez-vous que vous pouvez survivre à ce nouvel "
"obstacle de la même façon que vous avez survécu au précédent."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Prepare for your next show"
msgstr "Préparez-vous pour votre prochain spectacle"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Prepare for your next show"
msgid ""
"Become the best clown, make sure that your next show will make everyone laugh "
"by training your social skills to perfection."
msgstr ""
"Devenez le·a meilleur·e clown·esse, assurez-vous que votre prochain spectacle "
"fera rire tout le monde en développant vos compétences sociales à la "
"perfection."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find a memory of your master"
msgstr "Trouvez un souvenir de votre maître·sse"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Find a memory of your master"
msgid "Find and wield a whip to remember your master even when separated."
msgstr ""
"Trouvez et équipez un fouet pour vous souvenir de votre maître·sse même en "
"son absence."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Obtain your black belt"
msgstr "Obtenez votre ceinture noire"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Obtain your black belt"
msgid ""
"You could have become a master in martial arts if you had the chance, so "
"train until you achieve the level of a master in the old world, and find "
"yourself a nice black belt to commemorate the occasion."
msgstr ""
"Vous auriez pu devenir un·e maître·sse en arts martiaux si vous aviez eu le "
"temps, alors entraînez-vous jusqu'à atteindre le niveau de maître dans "
"l'ancien monde, et trouvez-vous une jolie ceinture noire pour commémorer "
"l'occasion."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find a real katana"
msgstr "Trouvez un vrai katana"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Find a real katana"
msgid ""
"The world has ended, but as an authentic samurai you lack a katana, you must "
"find one, quickly."
msgstr ""
"C'est la fin du monde, mais en tant qu'authentique samouraï·onna-bugeisha, il "
"vous manque un katana, vous devez en trouver un rapidement."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find a new rifle"
msgstr "Trouvez un nouveau fusil"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Find a new rifle"
msgid ""
"When you were escaping an evacuation point that was overrun, you had to leave "
"your rifle behind.  Shame on you, what's a hunter without their hunting "
"rifle?  You have to find one immediately."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque vous vous êtes enfui·e d'un point d’évacuation envahi, vous avez dû "
"laisser votre fusil sur place.  Honte à vous, qu'est-ce qu'un chasseur sans "
"son fusil de chasse?  Il vous faut en trouver un nouveau immédiatement."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Protect your canine friends"
msgstr "Protégez vos amis canins"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Protect your canine friends"
msgid ""
"You have saved your dogs from the fall of the world, but they could still "
"suffer from danger everywhere.  Police dogs used some Kevlar harnesses for "
"protection…  Maybe your friends could use some too?"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez sauvé vos chiens de la fin du monde, mais ils pourraient encore "
"être confrontés à des dangers partout.  Les chiens policiers utilisaient des "
"harnais en Kevlar pour se protéger…  Peut-être que vos amis pourraient en "
"utiliser aussi?"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Hunt big game"
msgstr "Chassez du gros gibier"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Hunt big game"
msgid ""
"The end of the world could have arrived, but you still crave for that one big "
"hunt.  Search and kill a black bear to remember the old days."
msgstr ""
"La fin du monde a bien pu arriver, mais vous avez toujours envie de cette "
"grande chasse.  Cherchez et tuez un ours noir pour vous souvenir du bon vieux "
"temps."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Become the protagonist"
msgstr "Devenez le protagoniste"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Become the protagonist"
msgid ""
"The world has become like an anime!  Zombies, mutants, the end of "
"civilization as we know it…  You must become the protagonist if you want to "
"survive, the plot armor will help you.  Go and kill 50 zombies to show your "
"protagonist potential."
msgstr ""
"Le monde est devenu comme un animé!  Zombies, mutants, la fin de la "
"civilisation telle que nous la connaissons…  Vous devez devenir le "
"protagoniste si vous voulez survivre, l'armure de l'intrigue vous y aidera.  "
"Allez tuer 50 zombies pour montrer votre potentiel de protagoniste."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Make the cops pay"
msgstr "Faites payer les flics"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Make the cops pay"
msgid ""
"They wanted to put you behind bars, but are now dead, make them pay with "
"blood, unliving blood."
msgstr ""
"Ils voulaient vous mettre derrière les barreaux, mais ils sont maintenant "
"morts, faites-les payer avec du sang, du sang mort-vivant."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Continue with your evolution"
msgstr "Continuez votre évolution"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Continue with your evolution"
msgid ""
"Your evolution to a more perfect form was interrupted by the Cataclysm.  "
"Restart your transformation process whatever it costs."
msgstr ""
"Votre évolution vers une forme plus parfaite a été interrompue par le "
"Cataclysme.  Relancez votre processus de transformation quoi qu’il en coûte.  "

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Recover a part of yourself"
msgstr "Retrouver la partie de vous qui a été prise"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Recover a part of yourself"
msgid ""
"They took away something from you, something important.  You feel a "
"connection with this weather, maybe you can recover some portion of what you "
"lost in one of these storms."
msgstr ""
"Ils vous ont pris quelque chose, quelque chose d'important.  Vous ressentez "
"un lien avec cette météo, peut-être pourriez-vous récupérer une partie de ce "
"que vous avez perdu dans l'une de ces tempêtes."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Social butterfly"
msgstr "Papillon social"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Social butterfly"
msgid ""
"You have always had good social abilities.  Go and recruit 2 followers and "
"establish your leadership among them.  Don't forget to order them to build a "
"base of operations for you in the form of a survivor camp."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez toujours eu de bonnes habiletés sociales.  Allez recruter 2 recrues "
"et établissez votre leadership parmi eux.  N'oubliez pas de leur ordonner de "
"vous construire une base d'opérations sous la forme d'un camp de survivants.  "

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill your rivals"
msgstr "Tuez vos rivaux"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill your rivals"
msgid ""
"As a real ninja, you can't allow competitors for the night.  Kill 10 shady "
"zombies and demonstrate who is the real ninja here."
msgstr ""
"En tant que vrai ninja, vous ne pouvez pas tolérer de la concurrence dans le "
"noir.  Tuez 10 zombies ténébreux et montrez qui est le vrai ninja ici."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find some cosplay suits"
msgstr "Trouvez des costumes de cosplay"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Find some cosplay suits"
msgid ""
"The world could have ended, but there are still some fantastic costumes out "
"there, just waiting for you to wear them.  Search them until you find them."
msgstr ""
"C'est peut être la fin du monde, mais il existe encore des costumes "
"fantastiques qui n'attendent que que vous les portiez.  Cherchez jusqu'à ce "
"que vous en trouviez."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find some skates"
msgstr "Trouvez des patins"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Find some skates"
msgid ""
"You are a skater at heart, and as such you need some skates to drive by, any "
"kind will suffice."
msgstr "Vous vous devez de trouver des rollers ou des patins."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Dress with style"
msgstr "Habillez-vous avec classe"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Dress with style"
msgid ""
"You need to always dress in style and fashion.  Find a dress or tuxedo for "
"your personal use."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find a tabletop game"
msgstr "Trouvez un jeu de société"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Find a tabletop game"
msgid ""
"As a Game Master, it's just unacceptable that you now lack your means to "
"play.  Find any tabletop game to play with any survivors you could find, even "
"a cards game will suffice."
msgstr ""
"En tant que maître de jeu, il est tout simplement inacceptable que vous "
"n'ayez plus les moyens de jouer.  Trouvez n'importe quel jeu de table pour "
"jouer avec tous les survivants que vous pourriez trouver, même un jeu de "
"cartes suffira."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Ready or Not"
msgstr "Prêt·e ou Non"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Ready or Not"
msgid "Survive all day from the crazy inhabitants of the mansion."
msgstr "Survivez une journée aux résidents cinglés du manoir."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find Antibiotics Before You Die!"
msgstr "Trouvez des Antibiotiques Avant de Mourir!"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Refuel your helicopter."
msgstr "Ravitaillez votre hélicoptère."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Refuel your helicopter."
msgid ""
"You were flying towards a nearby private airport before your forced landing.  "
"You could still reach it by ground, and scavenge it for fuel."
msgstr ""
"Vous voliez vers un aéroport privé à proximité avant votre atterrissage "
"forcé.  Vous pourriez toujours l'atteindre par voie terrestre et y chercher "
"du carburant."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Return to base"
msgstr "Retourner à la base"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Return to base"
msgid ""
"Your helicopter was crashed to the ground, communications were lost with "
"ground base, and the rest of your team died while landing, at least you still "
"know the way back to the base."
msgstr ""
"Votre hélicoptère s'est écrasé au sol, les communications avec votre base ont "
"été perdues, et le reste de votre équipe est mort lors de l'atterrissage.  Au "
"moins, vous connaissez toujours le chemin pour retourner à la base."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Go to the refueling stop"
msgstr "Rendez-vous à l'arrêt de ravitaillement"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Go to the refueling stop"
msgid ""
"Your bird is now on the ground, never again able to fly, you could search for "
"a new one in the closest refueling stop requisitioned by the military."
msgstr ""
"Votre oiseau est désormais au sol, plus jamais capable de voler, vous "
"pourriez essayer d'en trouver un nouveau en vous rendant au point de "
"ravitaillement le plus proche ayant été réquisitionné par l'armée."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Deliver Your Cargo"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Deliver Your Cargo"
msgid ""
"You're not sure who orders takeout when the world's ending, but that doesn't "
"matter.  Evacuation doesn't matter.  Nothing, indeed, matters, save for "
"safely delivering your precious cargo to its destination: a remote mansion."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill your pursuer"
msgstr "Tuez votre poursuivant"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill your pursuer"
msgid ""
"Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you "
"relentlessly.  You can outrun it but never truly escape it.  It won't end "
"until one of you dies."
msgstr ""
"Depuis le début du Cataclysme, une chose vous pourchasse impitoyablement. "
"Vous pouvez la distancer, mais jamais la semer. Ceci ne peut se conclure "
"qu'avec votre mort ou celle de votre poursuivant."

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Survive your pursuer"
msgstr "Survivez votre poursuivant"

#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Survive your pursuer"
msgid ""
"Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you "
"relentlessly.  You can fight it but never truly kill it.  It won't end until "
"you die."
msgstr ""
"Depuis le début du Cataclysme, une chose vous pourchasse impitoyablement. "
"Vous pouvez la distancer, mais jamais la semer, la tuer, mais jamais "
"définitivement.  Ceci ne pourra se conclure qu'avec votre mort."

