msgid "royal robe"
msgid_plural "royal robes"
msgstr[0] "robe royale"
msgstr[1] "robes royales"
msgstr[2] "robes royales"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "royal robe"
msgid ""
"An ornately decorated robe with an unfamiliar royal symbol on it.  The "
"humanoid figure on the seal has two pairs of eyes.  It is the only one of its "
"kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Une robe richement décorée sur laquelle figure un symbole royal que vous "
"n'avez jamais vu.  La figure humanoïde sur le sceau a deux paires d'yeux.  "
"Elle est unique en son genre.\n"
"Ceci pourrait avoir des pouvoirs inconnus; essayez de l'activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ancient burial shroud"
msgid_plural "ancient burial shrouds"
msgstr[0] "linceul antique"
msgstr[1] "linceuls antiques"
msgstr[2] "linceuls antiques"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "ancient burial shroud"
msgid ""
"A cloak of thin, faded cloth.  The faint silhouette of a long-dead humanoid "
"is barely visible on it.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Une cape en tissu fin et délavé. On y distingue à peine la silhouette d'un "
"humanoïde mort depuis longtemps. Elle est unique en son genre.\n"
"Elle peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus, essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ornate fur coat"
msgid_plural "ornate fur coats"
msgstr[0] "manteaux de fourrure ornés"
msgstr[1] "manteaux de fourrure ornés"
msgstr[2] "manteaux de fourrure ornés"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "ornate fur coat"
msgid ""
"A heavy, finely crafted coat made of the fur of an unidentifiable creature.  "
"It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Un manteau lourd et finement ouvragé, fait de la fourrure d'une créature non "
"identifiable. Il est unique en son genre.\n"
"Il peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus ; essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ancient stone mask"
msgid_plural "ancient stone masks"
msgstr[0] "masque de pierre antique"
msgstr[1] "masques de pierre antiques"
msgstr[2] "masques de pierre antiques"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "ancient stone mask"
msgid ""
"A sinister mask made of a smooth green stone.  It is the only one of its "
"kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Un masque sinistre fait d'une pierre verte lisse. Il est unique en son genre.\n"
"Il peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus, essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ancient bronze helmet"
msgid_plural "ancient bronze helmets"
msgstr[0] "casque en bronze antique"
msgstr[1] "casques en bronze antiques"
msgstr[2] "casques en bronze antiques"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "ancient bronze helmet"
msgid ""
"A helmet with an imposing face plate.  Though the corrosion has completely "
"defaced the symbols written on the sides, it seems sturdy.  It is the only "
"one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Un casque avec une plaque frontale imposante. Bien que la corrosion ait "
"complètement effacé les symboles inscrits sur les côtés, il semble solide. Il "
"est unique en son genre.\n"
"Il peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus, essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of ornate leather gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of ornate leather gloves"
msgstr[0] "paires de gants en cuir ornés"
msgstr[1] "paires de gants en cuir ornés"
msgstr[2] "paires de gants en cuir ornés"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of ornate leather gloves"
msgid ""
"A set of worn leather gloves embossed with gold.  The unidentifiable leather "
"it is made from is oddly soft.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Un ensemble de gants en cuir usés et embossés d'or. Le cuir non identifiable "
"dont ils sont faits est étrangement doux. Il est unique en son genre.\n"
"Il peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus ; essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of ancient leather boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of ancient leather boots"
msgstr[0] "paires de bottes en cuir anciennes"
msgstr[1] "paires de bottes en cuir anciennes"
msgstr[2] "paires de bottes en cuir anciennes"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of ancient leather boots"
msgid ""
"A pair of ancient leather boots.  Though the flaps of leather are crudely "
"sewn together, the red hue it is dyed with is striking.  It is the only one "
"of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Une paire de bottes en cuir anciennes. Bien que les pans de cuir soient "
"grossièrement cousus ensemble, la teinte rouge qu'ils arborent est frappante. "
"Elle est unique en son genre.\n"
"Elle possède peut-être des pouvoirs inconnus ; essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "amber ring"
msgid_plural "amber rings"
msgstr[0] "bague d'ambre"
msgstr[1] "bagues d'ambre"
msgstr[2] "bagues d'ambre"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "amber ring"
msgid ""
"A band of gold with a smooth piece of amber set into it.  A strange worm is "
"encased in the amber, making a perfect spiral with its sealed body.  It is "
"the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Une bande d'or dans laquelle est enchâssée une pièce d'ambre lisse. Un "
"étrange ver est enfermé dans l'ambre, formant une spirale parfaite avec son "
"corps scellé. Il est unique en son genre.\n"
"Il peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus ; essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ancient staff"
msgid_plural "ancient staffs"
msgstr[0] "bâton antique"
msgstr[1] "bâtons antiques"
msgstr[2] "bâtons antiques"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "ancient staff"
msgid ""
"A well-balanced stick of treated wood with metal caps.  A red stone is "
"embedded in the handle.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Un bâton bien équilibré en bois traité avec des capuchons en métal. Une "
"pierre rouge est incrustée dans le manche. Il est unique en son genre.\n"
"Il peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus, essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/unique_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ancient sword"
msgid_plural "ancient swords"
msgstr[0] "épée antique"
msgstr[1] "épées antiques"
msgstr[2] "épées antiques"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "ancient sword"
msgid ""
"A sword made out of a striking black metal.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Une épée faite d'un métal noir saisissant. Elle est unique en son genre.\n"
"Elle peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus, essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ancient harp"
msgid_plural "ancient harps"
msgstr[0] "harpe antique"
msgstr[1] "harpes antiques"
msgstr[2] "harpes antiques"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "ancient harp"
msgid ""
"A harp made of black wood.  Faint hypnotic notes ring in the air each time "
"you touch it.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Une harpe en bois noir. De faibles notes hypnotiques résonnent dans l'air "
"chaque fois qu'on la touche. Elle est unique en son genre.\n"
"Elle peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus, essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ancient athame"
msgid_plural "ancient athames"
msgstr[0] "athamé antique"
msgstr[1] "athamés antiques"
msgstr[2] "athamés antiques"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "ancient athame"
msgid ""
"A ritual knife used by some ancient civilization.  Unreadable runes are "
"carved into the handle.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Un couteau rituel utilisé par une ancienne civilisation. Des runes illisibles "
"sont gravées sur le manche. Il est unique en son genre.\n"
"Il peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus ; essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ancient spear"
msgid_plural "ancient spears"
msgstr[0] "lance ancienne"
msgstr[1] "lances anciennes"
msgstr[2] "lances anciennes"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "ancient spear"
msgid ""
"A sturdy wooden pole with a sharp metal spike on the end.  The handle has the "
"symbol of a blue sun on it.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Une solide perche en bois avec une pointe métallique acérée à l'extrémité. Le "
"manche porte le symbole d'un soleil bleu. Il est unique en son genre.\n"
"Elle peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus ; essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ancient club"
msgid_plural "ancient clubs"
msgstr[0] "massue antique"
msgstr[1] "massues antiques"
msgstr[2] "massues antiques"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "ancient club"
msgid ""
"A misshapen rod of gnarled, knotted wood.  The knots in the wood exhibit a "
"strange fractal pattern.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Une tige difforme de bois noueux et noueux. Les nœuds du bois présentent un "
"étrange motif fractal. Il est unique en son genre.\n"
"Elle peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus ; essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "set of oddly interlocked rings"
msgid_plural "sets of oddly interlocked rings"
msgstr[0] "ensembles d'anneaux bizarrement imbriqués"
msgstr[1] "ensembles d'anneaux bizarrement imbriqués"
msgstr[2] "ensembles d'anneaux bizarrement imbriqués"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "set of oddly interlocked rings"
msgid ""
"A set of three rings linked together.  There's something about the way the "
"rings connect to each other that gives you a headache.  It is the only one of "
"its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Un ensemble de trois anneaux reliés entre eux. La façon dont les anneaux sont "
"reliés les uns aux autres donne mal à la tête. Il est unique en son genre.\n"
"Il peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus ; essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "strange triangle"
msgid_plural "strange triangles"
msgstr[0] "triangle étrange"
msgstr[1] "triangles étranges"
msgstr[2] "triangles étranges"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "strange triangle"
msgid ""
"A large triangle made out of three thick rectangles that connect to each "
"other in an angle.  No matter how much you turn it around, you can't seem to "
"comprehend how it links together.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Un grand triangle composé de trois rectangles épais qui se rejoignent en "
"formant un angle. On a beau le tourner dans tous les sens, on ne parvient pas "
"à comprendre comment il s'articule. Il est unique en son genre.\n"
"Il peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus, essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "impossible trident"
msgid_plural "impossible tridents"
msgstr[0] "trident impossible"
msgstr[1] "tridents impossibles"
msgstr[2] "tridents impossibles"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "impossible trident"
msgid ""
"A large trident made entirely out of an indiscernible material.  The prong in "
"the middle seems to fade away into nothingness when looked at from the top, "
"but you can clearly see the shaft connecting the tip of the weapon from the "
"bottom.  It's giving you a headache.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Un grand trident fait entièrement d'un matériau indiscernable. La pointe du "
"milieu semble s'évanouir dans le néant quand on la regarde d'en haut, mais on "
"voit clairement la hampe qui relie la pointe de l'arme d'en bas. Cela vous "
"donne mal à la tête. Il est unique en son genre.\n"
"Elle peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus, essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "self-crossing flask"
msgid_plural "self-crossing flasks"
msgstr[0] "bouteille ouroboros"
msgstr[1] "bouteilles ouroboros"
msgstr[2] "bouteilles ouroboros"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "self-crossing flask"
msgid ""
"A transparent flask with a neck that connects directly to its bottom without "
"overlapping itself, even though it clearly does.  You can put things in it, "
"but attempting to follow their path through the neck is impossible.  It is "
"the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Une fiole transparente dont le col se raccorde directement au fond sans se "
"chevaucher, même si c'est manifestement le cas. On peut y mettre des objets, "
"mais il est impossible de suivre leur parcours à travers le col. Elle est "
"unique en son genre.\n"
"Il peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus ; essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "four-dimensional cube"
msgid_plural "four-dimensional cubes"
msgstr[0] "cube quadridimensionnel"
msgstr[1] "cubes quadridimensionnels"
msgstr[2] "cubes quadridimensionnels"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "four-dimensional cube"
msgid ""
"It's a cube that constantly shrinks and grows in size.  It's two cubes linked "
"by the vertices, with ever-shifting sides folding onto each other, over and "
"over.  It's four cubes in the exact same position.  It's a cube fading to ash "
"then reverting to pristine form repeatedly.  It's all of these at once, and "
"none of them at all.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"C'est un cube qui rétrécit et grandit constamment. C'est deux cubes reliés "
"par les sommets, dont les côtés en perpétuel mouvement se replient l'un sur "
"l'autre, encore et encore. C'est quatre cubes dans la même position. C'est un "
"cube qui se réduit en cendres puis reprend sa forme originelle à plusieurs "
"reprises. C'est tout cela à la fois, et rien du tout. Il est unique en son "
"genre.\n"
"Il peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus ; essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "irrational cube"
msgid_plural "irrational cubes"
msgstr[0] "cube irrationnel"
msgstr[1] "cubes irrationnels"
msgstr[2] "cubes irrationnels"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "irrational cube"
msgid ""
"A large wire-frame cube.  The interior wires somehow appear to be over the "
"exterior wires, no matter which angle you look at the cube from.  Trying to "
"trace the lines with your finger is probably not a good idea.  It is the only "
"one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Un grand cube grillagé. Les fils intérieurs semblent se superposer aux fils "
"extérieurs, quel que soit l'angle sous lequel vous regardez le cube. Essayer "
"de tracer les lignes avec le doigt n'est probablement pas une bonne idée. Ce "
"cube est unique en son genre.\n"
"Il peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus ; essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wobbly ring"
msgid_plural "wobbly rings"
msgstr[0] "anneau ambigu"
msgstr[1] "anneaux ambigus"
msgstr[2] "anneaux ambigus"

#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#. ~ Description of "wobbly ring"
msgid ""
"A chunky ring that folds onto itself continuously, preventing its use as an "
"esoteric piece of jewelry.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Un anneau épais qui se replie continuellement sur lui-même, ce qui l'empêche "
"d'être utilisé comme bijou ésotérique. Il est unique en son genre.\n"
"Il peut avoir des pouvoirs inconnus ; essayez de les activer."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "AEA_ADRENALINE"
msgid "Artifact Adrenaline"
msgstr "Adrénaline d'Artéfact"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "AEA_ADRENALINE ( Artifact Adrenaline )"
msgid "Causes a surge of adrenaline to flow throughout your body."
msgstr "Provoque une poussée d'adrénaline dans tout le corps."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Message of spell "AEA_ADRENALINE ( Artifact Adrenaline )"
msgid "You're filled with a roaring energy!"
msgstr "Vous êtes rempli d'une énergie bouillonante!"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "AEA_BLOOD"
msgid "Artifact Blood"
msgstr "Sang d'Artéfact"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "AEA_BLOOD ( Artifact Blood )"
msgid "Causes blood to leak from nearby terrain."
msgstr "Provoque des fuites de sang sur les terrains avoisinants."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Message of spell "AEA_BLOOD ( Artifact Blood )"
msgid "Blood soaks out of the ground and walls."
msgstr "Du sang suinte du sol et des murs."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "AEA_HEAL"
msgid "Artifact Heal"
msgstr "Guérison d'Artéfact"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "AEA_HEAL ( Artifact Heal )"
msgid "Will heal injuries all over your body."
msgstr "Guérit les blessures sur tout le corps."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Message of spell "AEA_HEAL ( Artifact Heal )"
msgid "You feel healed."
msgstr "Vous vous sentez soigné."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "AEA_CONFUSED"
msgid "Artifact Confused"
msgstr "Confusion d'Artéfact"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "AEA_CONFUSED ( Artifact Confused )"
msgid "Causes nearby enemies to become confused."
msgstr "Rend les ennemis proches confus."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "AEA_PAIN"
msgid "Artifact Pain"
msgstr "Douleur d'Artéfact"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "AEA_PAIN ( Artifact Pain )"
msgid "Owchie, that hurts."
msgstr "Aïe, ça fait mal."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Message of spell "AEA_PAIN ( Artifact Pain )"
msgid "You're wracked with pain!"
msgstr "Vous êtes vrillé par la douleur!"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "AEA_TELEPORT"
msgid "Artifact Teleport"
msgstr "Téléportation d'Artéfact"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "AEA_TELEPORT ( Artifact Teleport )"
msgid "Randomly teleports you a short distance."
msgstr "Vous téléporte de façon aléatoire sur une courte distance."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Message of spell "AEA_TELEPORT ( Artifact Teleport )"
msgid "You teleport!"
msgstr "Vous êtes téléporté(e)!"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "AEA_ATTENTION"
msgid "Artifact Attention"
msgstr "Attention d'Artéfact"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "AEA_ATTENTION ( Artifact Attention )"
msgid "You're not quite sure what you did, but something is watching you for it."
msgstr ""
"Vous n'êtes pas tout à fait sûr de ce que vous avez fait, mais quelque chose "
"vous surveille pour cela."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Message of spell "AEA_ATTENTION ( Artifact Attention )"
msgid "You feel like your action has attracted attention."
msgstr "Vous sentez que votre action a attiré l'attention."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "AEA_TELEGLOW"
msgid "Artifact Teleglow"
msgstr "Lueur Téléportante d'Artéfact "

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "AEA_TELEGLOW ( Artifact Teleglow )"
msgid "DO YOU HEAR THE VOICES TOO?"
msgstr "\"ENTENDEZ-VOUS LEURS VOIX?\""

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Message of spell "AEA_TELEGLOW ( Artifact Teleglow )"
msgid "You feel unhinged."
msgstr "Vous vous sentez au bord de la rupture."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "AEA_VOMIT"
msgid "Artifact Vomit"
msgstr "Vomissement d'Artéfact "

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "AEA_VOMIT ( Artifact Vomit )"
msgid "Causes the caster to vomit."
msgstr "Fait vomir le lanceur de sorts."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Message of spell "AEA_VOMIT ( Artifact Vomit )"
msgid "A wave of nausea passes through you!"
msgstr "Une vague de nausée vous traverse!"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "AEA_SHADOWS"
msgid "Artifact Shadows"
msgstr "Ombres d'Artéfact "

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "AEA_SHADOWS ( Artifact Shadows )"
msgid "Summons shadows."
msgstr "Invoque les ombres."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Message of spell "AEA_SHADOWS ( Artifact Shadows )"
msgid "Shadows form around you."
msgstr "Des ombres se forment autour de vous."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "AEA_STAMINA_EMPTY"
msgid "Artifact Stamina Empty"
msgstr "Drain d'Endurance d'Artéfact "

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "AEA_STAMINA_EMPTY ( Artifact Stamina Empty )"
msgid "Does a variable amount of stamina damage."
msgstr "Inflige une quantité variable de dégâts d'endurance."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Message of spell "AEA_STAMINA_EMPTY ( Artifact Stamina Empty )"
msgid "Your body feels like jelly."
msgstr "Votre corps vous donne l'impression d'être de la gelée."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "AEA_RADIATION"
msgid "Artifact Radiation"
msgstr "Radiation d'Artéfact "

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "AEA_RADIATION ( Artifact Radiation )"
msgid "Causes radiation."
msgstr "Provoque des radiations."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Message of spell "AEA_RADIATION ( Artifact Radiation )"
msgid "Horrible gases are emitted!"
msgstr "D'horribles gaz se répandent!"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "AEA_HURTALL ( Artifact Hurtall )"
msgid "Hurts all monsters within your view distance."
msgstr "Blesse tous les monstres à distance de vue."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "AEA_ACIDBALL"
msgid "Artifact Acidball"
msgstr "Boule d'Acide d'Artéfact"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "AEA_ACIDBALL ( Artifact Acidball )"
msgid "Fires an acidball."
msgstr "Lance une boule d'acide."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "art_eff_pet"
msgid "Pet"
msgstr "Animal de compagnie"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "art_eff_pet ( Pet )"
msgid "Makes the target a pet."
msgstr "Fait de la cible un animal de compagnie."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "art_flies_buzz"
msgid "Artifact Flies Buzz"
msgstr "Artifact Flies Buzz"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "art_flies_buzz ( Artifact Flies Buzz )"
#. ~ Message of spell "art_flies_buzz ( Artifact Flies Buzz )"
msgid "Flies buzz around you."
msgstr "Les insectes vrombissent autour de vous."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "art_summon_flies"
msgid "Artifact Summon Flies"
msgstr "Invocation de Mouches d'Artéfact"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "art_summon_flies ( Artifact Summon Flies )"
msgid "Summons some flies."
msgstr "Invoque des mouches."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Message of spell "art_summon_flies ( Artifact Summon Flies )"
msgid "Giant flies appear!"
msgstr "Des mouches géantes apparaissent!"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "art_summon_bees"
msgid "Artifact Summon Bees"
msgstr "Invocation d'Abeilles d'Artéfact"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "art_summon_bees ( Artifact Summon Bees )"
#. ~ Message of spell "art_summon_bees ( Artifact Summon Bees )"
msgid "Giant bees appear!"
msgstr "Des abeilles géantes apparaissent!"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "art_summon_wasps"
msgid "Artifact Summon Wasps"
msgstr "Invocation de Guêpes d'Artéfact"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "art_summon_wasps ( Artifact Summon Wasps )"
msgid "Summons some wasps."
msgstr "Invoque des guêpes."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Message of spell "art_summon_wasps ( Artifact Summon Wasps )"
msgid "Giant wasps appear!"
msgstr "Des guêpes géantes apparaissent!"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "AEA_BUGS"
msgid "Artifact Bugs"
msgstr "Insectes d'Artéfact"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "AEA_BUGS ( Artifact Bugs )"
msgid "Summons some bugs."
msgstr "Invoque des arthropodes."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "AEA_NOISE"
msgid "Artifact Noise"
msgstr "Bruit d'Artéfact"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "AEA_NOISE ( Artifact Noise )"
msgid "Makes a noise at your location."
msgstr "Fait du bruit à l'endroit où il se trouve."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "AEA_NOISE ( Artifact Noise )"
msgid "a deafening boom"
msgstr "un boom assourdissant"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Message of spell "AEA_NOISE ( Artifact Noise )"
msgid "You hear a deafening boom from your location!"
msgstr "Vous entendez un bruit assourdissant provenant de votre emplacement!"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "AEA_LIGHT"
msgid "Artifact Light"
msgstr "Lumière d'Artéfact"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "AEA_LIGHT ( Artifact Light )"
msgid "Makes some light."
msgstr "Fait de la lumière."

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Message of spell "AEA_LIGHT ( Artifact Light )"
msgid "You glow brightly!"
msgstr "Vous luisez intensément!"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Name of spell "AEA_DIM"
msgid "Artifact Dim"
msgstr "Assombrissement d'Artéfact"

#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#. ~ Description of spell "AEA_DIM ( Artifact Dim )"
