#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ink_grand_spray"
msgid "Your ink glands spray some ink into your attacker's eyes!"
msgstr "Vos glandes à encre pulvérisent de l'encre dans les yeux de votre agresseur!"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_insect_wings_shutoff"
msgid "You don't have the stamina to keep buzzing."
msgstr "Vous n'avez plus l'énergie nécessaire pour continuer à agiter vos ailes."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_social2_penalty"
msgid "You could use some friendly company."
msgstr "Vous pourriez avoir besoin d'une compagnie amicale."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_asocial2_penalty"
msgid "You'd really rather be by yourself."
msgstr "Tu préférerais vraiment être seul."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/LIXA_EOCs_spells_traps.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LIXA_UNFOLD_ENTRY"
msgid ""
"You step into a space that unfolds around you, becoming endless and "
"completely flat.  Every side of every surface is on display.  You look down "
"at your hands; you can see the front, the back, the insides and outsides of "
"every vein and bone, all in the same place on one surface.  You can't imagine "
"what has happened to your eyes to let you understand what you are seeing.  Or "
"your brain."
msgstr ""
"Vous entrez dans un espace qui se déploie autour de vous, devenant infini et "
"complètement plat. Chaque face de chaque surface est exposée. Vous regardez "
"vos mains ; vous pouvez voir l'avant, l'arrière, l'intérieur et l'extérieur "
"de chaque veine et de chaque os, le tout au même endroit sur une seule "
"surface. Vous ne pouvez pas imaginer ce qui est arrivé à vos yeux pour vous "
"permettre de comprendre ce que vous voyez. Ou à votre cerveau."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/LIXA_EOCs_spells_traps.json
#. ~ Success message in teleportation in nested effect in switch statement in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_LIXA_BACK"
#. ~ Success message in teleportation in nested effect in switch statement in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_LIXA_FORWARD"
msgid "You walk for a long while."
msgstr "Vous marchez longtemps."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/LIXA_EOCs_spells_traps.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LIXA_unfold_return"
msgid ""
"There is a soft sound, like a champagne cork popping in an empty concert "
"hall.  The world is as it was again.  The LIXA device still hums quietly as "
"it finishes powering down."
msgstr ""
"On entend un léger bruit, comme un bouchon de champagne qui saute dans une "
"salle de concert vide. Le monde est redevenu comme avant. L'appareil LIXA "
"continue de bourdonner doucement alors qu'il finit de s'éteindre."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/labyrinth_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LS_Teleport_to_labyrinth"
msgid "Nope!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/labyrinth_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LS_Teleport_to_labyrinth"
msgid "Zwoink."
msgstr "Zwoink."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/labyrinth_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LS_Exit_labyrinth"
msgid "Zworunk"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/labyrinth_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LS_Exit_labyrinth_sparkling_chasm"
msgid ""
"As you fall into the chasm, you see a multitude of stars, spots, and other "
"shapes.  It's like your sinking ever further into a liquid solution, and "
"falling through the air at the same time.  Your head throbs with pain as the "
"pressure increases, and you black out.  When you come to, you're back in "
"reality disoriented but unharmed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_glass_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/abyssal_hunger_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/elemental_eruptions.json
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC "EOC_nether_glass_lost_tp"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_nether_glass_event"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_NEXT_LEVEL"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_EXIT"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ENTER_ABYSSAL_HUNGER_DUNGEON"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ENTER_ABYSSAL_HUNGER_NEXT_LEVEL"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ENTER_ABYSSAL_HUNGER_NEXT_LEVEL"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC "EOC_ABYSSAL_HUNGER_EXIT"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_UNDINE_WARP_POOL_BOTTOM_FLOOR"
msgid "Something is very wrong!"
msgstr "Quelque chose de vraiment vraiment mauvais est en train de se produire!"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_glass_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_nether_glass_yrax_encounter" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_nether_glass_event"
msgid "The emptiness yields before an all-encompassing construct."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_glass_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_nether_glass_yrax_encounter" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_nether_glass_event"
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ARTIFACT_MEDIUM"
msgid "Reality twists and deforms as wriggling chunks of it fall on the ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_monster_death.json
#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in switch
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_YUGG_DEATH"
msgid ""
"As it stops moving, the creature quickly begins to darken and turn "
"translucent, shattering like glass soon after."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_monster_death.json
#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in switch
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_YUGG_DEATH"
msgid ""
"As it stops moving, the creature's skin turns darker and it falls limp like a "
"pool noodle."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_monster_death.json
#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in switch
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_YUGG_DEATH"
msgid ""
"As it stops moving, the creature seems to lose all detail and falls limply on "
"the ground with a wet thud."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_monster_death.json
#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in switch
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_YUGG_DEATH"
msgid ""
"As it stops moving, the creature seems to stiffen as it skins seems to harden "
"and take a form not dissimilar to stone."
msgstr ""
"Alors qu'elle cesse de bouger, la créature semble se raidir, sa peau se "
"durcissant et prenant une forme proche de la pierre."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_monster_death.json
#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in switch
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_YUGG_DEATH"
msgid ""
"As it falls to the ground, strands of fog seem to tear away from the corpse.  "
"The giant worm dissolves in the air in front of your eyes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MORALE_GOOD"
msgid "You feel a warm sense of being at home."
msgstr "Vous avez l'impression comfortable d'être rentré(e) à la maison."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_ACCEPTANCE_1"
msgid "You suddenly feel a weight you didn't know you had on you, being lifted away."
msgstr ""
"Vous ressentez un poids dont vous ignorez jusque là l'existence soudainement "
"disparaître."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_ACCEPTANCE_2"
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel wakeful and energized, as if something that was slowing you "
"down is now gone."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous sentez soudainement éveillé(e) et plein(e) d'énergie, comme si "
"quelque chose qui vous ralentissait avait disparu."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_ACCEPTANCE_3"
msgid "You suddenly feel as if invisible shackles are being lifted away…"
msgstr "Vous avez soudain l'impression qu'on vous enlève des chaînes invisibles…"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_ACCEPTANCE_4"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_5"
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel a profound sense of belonging take root inside you, "
"spreading throughout your body.  It fades quickly, but something warm remains…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_ACCEPTANCE_4"
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel a profound sense of belonging take root inside you, but "
"then abruptly grow cold.  You reach out for it, but it's gone now, taken away "
"by the indoors.  You long for the sky…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_FOCUS_GOOD"
msgid "Everything suddenly feels more clear."
msgstr "Tout semble soudain plus clair."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MORALE_BAD"
msgid "You suddenly feel like you shouldn't be here."
msgstr "Vous avez soudainement le sentiment que vous ne devriez pas être ici."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_FOCUS_BAD"
msgid "You try to recall what you were about to do, but you can't focus…"
msgstr ""
"Vous essayez de vous rappeler ce que vous étiez sur le point de faire, mais "
"vous n'arrivez plus à vous concentrer…"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_STR_BAD"
msgid "You suddenly feel feeble.  Your muscles wobble."
msgstr "Vous vous sentez soudainement faible.  Vos muscles vacillent."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DEX_BAD"
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel a sharp pain in your hand.  You reach out to grab it, and "
"miss."
msgstr ""
"Vous ressentez soudainement une douleur aiguë dans votre main. Vous la tendez "
"puis essayez de la saisir avec votre autre main mais ratez."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_PER_BAD"
msgid "You blink one time, and everything seems bigger."
msgstr "Vous clignez des yeux une fois, et tout vous semble plus grand."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_INT_BAD"
msgid "You stop to think, but you can't seem to remember about what."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous arrêtez pour réfléchir sur quelque chose, mais vous n'arrivez pas à "
"vous souvenir de quoi."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_SHAKES"
msgid "You feel anxious for no reason."
msgstr "Vous vous sentez anxieux/anxieuse sans raison."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_NAUSEA"
msgid "You suddenly feel as if your stomach and its contents are fighting."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez soudainement l'impression que votre estomac et son contenu se "
"battent."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_STUN"
msgid "For a brief moment, you feel rejected by the world."
msgstr "Pendant un bref instant, vous vous sentez rejeté(e) par le monde."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DOWNED"
msgid "Gravity suddenly exerts immense pressure, forcing you to the ground!"
msgstr "La gravité exerce soudainement une immense pression, vous plaquant au sol!"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DAMAGE_CONSTANT"
msgid "Your vision suddenly fills with cold sparks.  You feel so alone…"
msgstr ""
"Votre vision s'emplit soudainement d'étincelles froides. Vous vous sentez si "
"seul(e)…"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_PAIN_CONSTANT"
msgid ""
"Faint sparks surround your body as you suffer with every action you take, as "
"if you weren't intended to do them."
msgstr ""
"De faibles étincelles entourent votre corps et vous souffrez à chaque action "
"que vous prenez, comme si vous n'étiez pas destiné(e) à les faire."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_PAIN"
msgid ""
"Faint sparks suddenly appear and disappear around you, as if rejecting your "
"very existence.  Pain flares across your body."
msgstr ""
"De faibles étincelles apparaissent et disparaissent soudainement autour de "
"vous, comme si elles rejetaient votre existence même. Une poussée de douleur "
"aiguë traverse votre corps."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_0"
msgid ""
"You feel invigorated by what you just experienced, so…  What is this feeling "
"of regret for leaving that place?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_1"
msgid ""
"You feel like the shackles of your body are loosening a little.  The world "
"seems to accept your distorted presence for now.  You wonder if what you "
"currently feel would have been greater if only you had gone deeper…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_2"
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel in calm, your body a little faster, and your surroundings "
"less hostile than what you remember.  Before this new sensation passes away "
"though, you hear a little voice in your head saying \"deeper…\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_3"
msgid ""
"You return to your reality with a sense of ecstasy, your body feels great, "
"your shackles have come loose and you feel powerful because of it.  But you "
"can feel it, this exhilarating feeling is only the beginning, you need to go "
"deeper…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_4"
msgid ""
"You feel in communion with the world around you, the world is no longer "
"rejecting you, at least for now, YOU are rejecting IT.  Your whole body "
"craves for what you could have gained if only you had gone a little deeper…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_5"
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel a profound sense of belonging take root inside you, "
"temporally amplifying your grasp of reality.  For some time you will be the "
"master of your surroundings."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/effects_on_condition/altered_eocs.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_premonition_instances.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CAUSE_EARLY_PORTAL_STORM"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CAUSE_EARLY_PORTAL_STORM_ACTUAL"
msgid ""
"You suddenly register a buzzing in your senses.  It's getting louder, and "
"your head starts to throb.  Somewhere nearby, a tiny cataclysm has begun "
"(check mission log for details)."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CAUSE_PORTAL_STORM"
msgid "Reality is breaking!"
msgstr "La réalité se brise!"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CANCEL_PORTAL_STORM"
msgid ""
"As suddenly as it began, the portal storm fades.  Reality returns to normal.  "
"Hopefully the scarring is minimal…"
msgstr ""
"Aussi soudainement qu'elle a commencé, la tempête dimensionnelle s'estompe. "
"La réalité revient à la normale. Espérons que les cicatrices seront minimes…"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_SHIFTING_MASS"
msgid ""
"Small gashes in reality open nearby, revealing an endless expanse of black "
"water.  An alien being spills through before the portals close."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_SHIFTING_MASS"
msgid ""
"Small gashes in reality open nearby, revealing an endless expanse of black "
"water.  Several alien beings spill out before the portals close."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ARTIFACT_WEAK"
msgid "A chunk of reality gets loose and falls on the ground."
msgstr "Un morceau de la réalité environnante se déloge et chute au sol."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ARTIFACT_WEAK"
msgid "Chunks of reality get loose and fall on the ground."
msgstr "Des morceaux de la réalité environnante se délogent et chutent au sol."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ARTIFACT_MEDIUM"
msgid "Reality twists and deforms as a wriggling chunk of it falls on the ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ARTIFACT_STRONG"
msgid "A chunk of reality tears itself asunder and takes shape on the ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ARTIFACT_STRONG"
msgid "Chunks of reality tear themselves asunder and take shape on the ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_IMPOSSIBLE_SHAPE"
msgid ""
"You cannot remember how the impossible shape came to be here.  The pain in "
"your head suggests that that's a good thing."
msgstr ""
"Vous ne vous rappelez pas comment cette forme impossible s'est manifestée là "
"où elle est. La migraine dans votre crâne suggère que ceci est pour le mieux."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_IMPOSSIBLE_SHAPE"
msgid ""
"You cannot remember how the impossible shapes came to be here.  The pain in "
"your head suggests that that's a good thing."
msgstr ""
"Vous ne vous rappelez pas comment ces formes impossibles se sont manifestées "
"là où elles sont. La migraine dans votre crâne suggère que ceci est pour le "
"mieux."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_FLATLANDER"
msgid ""
"something glides into your field of vision out of thin air, slipping between "
"the space between atoms."
msgstr ""
"quelque chose venant de nul part apparait dans votre champ de vision, se "
"faufilant dans l'espace séparant les atomes."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_FLATLANDER"
msgid ""
"several things glide into your field of vision out of thin air, slipping "
"between the spaces between atoms."
msgstr ""
"plusieurs choses apparaissent de nul part dans votre champ de vision, se "
"faufilant dans l'espace séparant les atomes."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_GIANT_APPENDAGE"
msgid "A gigantic limb tears its way into reality."
msgstr "Un membre gigantesque déchire son chemin pour tâtonner dans cette réalité."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_GIANT_APPENDAGE"
msgid "Gigantic limbs tear their way into reality around you."
msgstr ""
"Des membres gigantesques déchirent leur chemin pour tâtonner dans cette "
"réalité."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/json/mapgen/haunting.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_MEMORIES"
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_conjure_memories"
msgid "A flickering silhouette appears nearby."
msgstr "Une silhouette vacillante apparait près de vous."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/json/mapgen/haunting.json
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_MEMORIES"
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_conjure_memories"
msgid "Human silhouettes appear and surround you."
msgstr "Des silhouettes humaines apparaissent et vous encercle."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ABSENCE"
msgid ""
"The very notion of empty space is made a cruel joke.  Nearby nothing becomes "
"even less."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_SWARM_STRUCTURE"
msgid "The swarm structure was always here, right?"
msgstr "Cet essaim était toujours là, non?"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_PAIN"
msgid ""
"You awake with a start from what must have been a violent and horrifying "
"daydream.  Your body aches as if the wounds were real."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous réveillez en sursaut de ce qui a dû être une rêverie violente et "
"horrible. Votre corps vous fait mal comme si les blessures subies durant "
"celle-ci étaient réelles."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_SMOKE"
msgid ""
"A million tiny pinpricks in space open for an instant, and smoke fills the "
"air."
msgstr ""
"Un million de petites entailles dans l'espace s'ouvrent pendant un instant, "
"et de la fumée remplit l'air autour de vous."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_YRAX_ATTENTION"
msgid "An alien construct emerges from the storm."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player makes sound in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_TAUNT"
msgid "The voice was loud, it might have drawn attention to you!"
msgstr ""
"La voix était bruyante, peut être qu'elle a attiré l'attention de quelque "
"chose vers vous?"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_TELEPORT_STUCK_START"
msgid "The moment feels thick, as if it's not quite over."
msgstr "Le moment semble dense, comme s'il n'était pas tout à fait terminé."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player makes sound in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_TELEPORT_STUCK_LOOP"
msgid "a loud tearing sound."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Success message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_TELEPORT_STUCK"
msgid "You feel an intense sense of deja vu."
msgstr "Vous ressentez un sentiment de déjà vu intense."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_LIGHT"
msgid "The sun is snuffed out like a candle."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in
