msgid_plural "display freezers"
msgstr[0] "congélateur d'exposition"
msgstr[1] "congélateurs d'exposition"
msgstr[2] "congélateurs d'exposition"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "display freezer"
msgid ""
"A display freezer.  When turned on, it will freeze the food inside, "
"preventing any further expiration."
msgstr ""
"Un congélateur d'exposition. Lorsqu'il est mis en marche, il congèle les "
"aliments qu'il contient, les empêchant ainsi de se périmer."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "glowing tendril"
msgstr "veine luisante"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "glowing tendril"
msgid ""
"A willowy tendril growing from the floor, gently waving back and forth.  A "
"faint light spills from it."
msgstr ""
"Une vrille élancée poussant émergeant du sol, s’agitant doucement d’avant en "
"arrière.  Une faible lumière en jaillit."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
#. ~ Bashing sound
#. ~ Bashing failed sound
msgid "splorch!"
msgstr "splorch!"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "wafting anemone"
msgstr "anémone flottante"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "wafting anemone"
msgid ""
"A fleshy white protuberance growing from the floor, with a cluster of "
"tendrils protruding from it.  It looks almost exactly like a sea anemone, "
"even waving gently as though underwater."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'une protubérance blanche et charnue qui pousse sur le sol, avec "
"un groupe de vrilles qui en sortent. Elle ressemble presque exactement à une "
"anémone de mer, et s'agite même doucement comme si elle était sous l'eau."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gasping tube"
msgstr "tube haletant"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gasping tube"
msgid ""
"A meaty green stalactite with a thickened hide like that of a starfish, "
"extending from the floor to the ceiling.  In the center is a series of ports "
"somewhat like mouths, from which pour bursts of a vile-smelling gas."
msgstr ""
"Une stalactite verte et charnue, dont la peau épaissie ressemble à celle "
"d'une étoile de mer, s'étend du sol au plafond. Au centre, une série "
"d'orifices ressemblant à des bouches d'où s'échappe un gaz à l'odeur "
"nauséabonde."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "twitching frond"
msgstr "palme frémissante"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "twitching frond"
msgid ""
"A spine resembling moth antennae juts from the ground, swaying gently in the "
"air.  Every so often, a cascade of energy arcs along it and discharges into "
"the ceiling."
msgstr ""
"Une colonne vertébrale ressemblant à des antennes de papillon de nuit "
"émergeant du sol et se balançant doucement dans l'air.  De temps en temps, "
"une cascade d’énergie s’arc-boute le long de celle-ci et se déverse contre le "
"plafond."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "scarred lump"
msgstr "amas meurtri"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "scarred lump"
msgid ""
"A pile of nondescript alien flesh, twitching and belching strange gases out "
"of injured orifices."
msgstr ""
"Un tas de chair extraterrestre indescriptible, se contractant et crachant "
"d'étranges gaz hors d'orifices blessés."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-eggs.json
#. ~ Bashing failed sound
#. ~ Bashing sound
msgid "splat!"
msgstr "splat!"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "slimy pod"
msgstr "capsule de slime"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "slimy pod"
msgid ""
"A slick, translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  It is covered in a thick "
"mucus, obscuring whatever is floating in the gel-like substance inside."
msgstr ""
"Une gousse lisse et translucide suspendue à un mince pédoncule. Elle est "
"recouverte d'un mucus épais qui masque tout ce qui flotte dans la substance "
"gélatineuse qu'elle contient."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "organ pod"
msgstr "Capsule à organes"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "organ pod"
msgid ""
"A translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  Inside you can see the dimly "
"outlined shape of human organs, floating in some kind of preservative goo."
msgstr ""
"Une capsule translucide suspendue à une fine tige. À l'intérieur, on peut "
"voir les contours flous d'organes humains, flottant dans une sorte de gelée "
"de conservation."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "resin pod"
msgstr "capsule à résine"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "resin pod"
msgid ""
"A translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  Inside is a clean, clear, "
"resinous-looking fluid.  You could fairly easily tear it from the stalk and "
"take it with you."
msgstr ""
"Une gousse translucide suspendue à un mince pédoncule. À l'intérieur se "
"trouve un liquide propre, clair et résineux. Il est assez facile de "
"l'arracher de la tige et de l'emporter avec soi."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "fleshy altar"
msgstr "autel de chair"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "fleshy altar"
msgid ""
"This pulsing protuberance juts from the floor, its sides covered in scaled, "
"oozing skin.  The surface is flat, but undulates softly.  A handful of "
"unidentifiable appendages reach from the sides, suggesting a sort of "
"nightmarish living Autodoc."
msgstr ""
"Cette protubérance palpitante dépasse du sol, ses côtés sont recouverts d'une "
"peau écaillée et suintante.  La surface est plate, mais ondule doucement.  "
"Une poignée d'appendices non identifiables partent des côtés, suggérant une "
"sorte d'Autodoc vivant cauchemardesque."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "scrap antenna"
msgstr "antenne de ferraille"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "scrap antenna"
msgid ""
"This contraption looks like some sort of cobbled-together transmitter or "
"receiver antenna.  It consists of a number of mismatched blinking lights, "
"spinning servos, and dangling wires connected to a hefty metal box."
msgstr ""
"Cet engin ressemble à une sorte d’antenne émettrice ou réceptrice bricolée.  "
"Il se compose d'un certain nombre de lumières clignotantes dépareillées, de "
"servos qui tournent et de fils pendants connectés à une lourde boîte "
"métallique."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "pictographic signpost"
msgstr "signe pictographique"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "pictographic signpost"
msgid ""
"This simple scrap metal sign has a series of pictographs on it depicting what "
"seems to be a trade interaction.  There is a crude but understandable map "
"beneath it.  You should take a closer look."
msgstr ""
"Ce simple panneau de ferraille comporte une série de pictogrammes illustrant "
"ce qui semble être une interaction commerciale.  Il y a une carte grossière "
"mais compréhensible en dessous.  Vous devriez regarder de plus près."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EXODII_SIGNPOST_FALSE" in furniture
#. "pictographic signpost"'s examine action
msgid ""
"You study the signpost.  It shows a similar set of directions to the ones you "
"already have.  You cross-reference them and don't learn anything new."
msgstr ""
"Vous étudiez le panneau. Il indique un ensemble de directions similaires à "
"celles que vous connaissez déjà. Vous les croisez et n'apprenez rien de "
"nouveau."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EXODII_SIGNPOST" in furniture
#. "pictographic signpost"'s examine action
msgid ""
"You study the signpost.  It shows simply-drawn pictograms of a pair of hands "
"holding out an object, and another pair taking the object and offering a "
"pouch in return.  Beneath the pictures there's a crude but understandable map "
"with arrows pointing to what looks like some kind of castle.  You do your "
"best to relate those to landmarks you know about, and mark the likely "
"location on your map."
msgstr ""
"Vous étudiez le panneau.  Il montre des pictogrammes simplement dessinés "
"représentant une paire de mains tendant un objet et une autre paire prenant "
"l'objet et offrant un petit sac en retour.  Sous les images se trouve une "
"carte rudimentaire mais compréhensible avec des flèches pointant vers ce qui "
"ressemble à une sorte de château.  Vous faites de votre mieux pour les relier "
"aux points de repère que vous connaissez et marquez l’emplacement probable "
"sur votre carte."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "rack of robots"
msgstr "rack de  robots"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "rack of robots"
msgid ""
"A wire cage containing a number of robot parts, from chassis to limbs, firmly "
"clamped onto sturdy hanging rods.  It looks like it would be exceptionally "
"difficult to open it and get at them without damaging them, probably by "
"design."
msgstr ""
"Une cage en fil de fer contenant un certain nombre de pièces de robot, du "
"châssis aux membres, fermement fixées à de solides tiges de suspension. Il "
"semble qu'il soit extrêmement difficile de l'ouvrir et de s'en emparer sans "
"les endommager, probablement à dessein."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "spinning dish"
msgstr "plat tournant"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "spinning dish"
msgid ""
"A slowly-spinning parabolic dish engraved with an unrecognizable pattern of "
"symbols that might, at a guess, be some sort of circuitry pattern - or maybe "
"a religious incantation.  It is mounted on a completely mismatched electric "
"motor that looks fairly mundane."
msgstr ""
"Une parabole qui tourne lentement, gravée d'un motif méconnaissable de "
"symboles qui pourraient, à première vue, être une sorte de schéma de circuit "
"- ou peut-être une incantation religieuse. Elle est montée sur un moteur "
"électrique complètement dépareillé qui a l'air assez banal."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "scavenged utility light"
msgstr "lampe utilitaire récupérée"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "scavenged utility light"
msgid ""
"The bulbs emit an eerie greenish glow, and some parts of it have a curved "
"appearance as though the metal were grown in a lab, but by and large this "
"isn't a particularly unusual looking area light."
msgstr ""
"Les ampoules émettent une étrange lueur verdâtre et certaines parties ont un "
"aspect courbé, comme si le métal avait été cultivé en laboratoire, mais dans "
"l'ensemble, il ne s'agit pas d'un éclairage d'appoint particulièrement "
"inhabituel."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "clanking fluid pump"
msgstr "pompe à fluide cliquetante"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "clanking fluid pump"
msgid ""
"The huge, sweating pipes and large tank reveal this clanking and tortuous "
"piece of equipment to be some sort of fluid pump.  It is cobbled together "
"from several apparently ill-fitting parts that have been fitted with some "
"very strange-looking but surprisingly clever adapters."
msgstr ""
"Les énormes tuyaux suintant de condensation et le grand réservoir révèlent "
"que cette pièce d'équipement cliquetante et tortueuse est une sorte de pompe "
"à fluide assemblée à partir de plusieurs pièces apparemment mal ajustées qui "
"ont été munies d'adaptateurs très étranges mais étonnamment malins."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "metalloid printer"
msgstr "imprimante 3D métal"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "metalloid printer"
msgid ""
"This huge device fairly closely resembles a 3D printer, aside from its "
"industrial size.  Huge spools of various thin metallic wires atop it feed "
"into what seems to be some sort of nozzle, and massive electrical cables "
"disappear into the wall behind it."
msgstr ""
"Cet énorme appareil ressemble beaucoup à une imprimante 3D, mis à part sa "
"taille industrielle. D'énormes bobines de fils métalliques fins et variés "
"alimentent ce qui semble être une sorte de buse, et d'énormes câbles "
"électriques disparaissent dans le mur derrière l'appareil."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "circuit printer"
msgstr "imprimante à circuit"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "circuit printer"
msgid ""
"A tall device with a lattice of pipes and nozzles.  Based on the pile of "
"products sitting in the output hopper, it looks like it's used as a printer "
"for complex electronic components."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Mavrik 10-101 power core"
msgstr "source d'énergie Mavrik 10-101"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Mavrik 10-101 power core"
msgid ""
"There is a faded metallic plaque on the side of this cylindrical device.  The "
"lettering is a strange combination of English and Cyrillic script.  It reads:\n"
"Mavrik 10-101\n"
"Stabиlиtи\n"
"Saфetи\n"
"A нyuclиar фyutuр ви bilив iн"
msgstr ""
"Une plaque métallique décolorée est apposée sur le côté de cet appareil "
"cylindrique. Le lettrage est une étrange combinaison d'anglais et de "
"cyrillique. On peut y lire : \"Mavrik 10-101\n"
"Mavrik 10-101\n"
"Stabиlиtи\n"
"Saфetи\n"
"A нyuclиar фyutuр ви bilив iн"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "spherical generator"
msgstr "générateur sphérique"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "spherical generator"
msgid ""
"This huge steel-plated sphere gives off a soft hum as it, presumably, "
"generates power.  A heavy lead plate bolted to the front might describe what "
"it is, but it is written in something that looks vaguely like cuneiform."
msgstr ""
"Cette énorme sphère plaquée d'acier émet un doux bourdonnement alors qu'elle "
"génère vraisemblablement de l'énergie. Une lourde plaque de plomb boulonnée à "
"l'avant pourrait décrire ce que c'est, mais elle est écrite dans quelque "
"chose qui ressemble vaguement à du cunéiforme."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "fluidic generator"
msgstr "générateur de fluides"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "fluidic generator"
msgid ""
"Twisting reams of copper and steel pipes wrap around a central core that "
"thrums softly.  Although there are no labels in any language you recognize, "
"the cables connected to the base suggest that this is some sort of power "
"generator."
msgstr ""
"Des tuyaux de cuivre et d'acier s'enroulent autour d'un noyau central qui "
"émet un léger son. Bien qu'il n'y ait aucune étiquette dans une langue que "
"vous reconnaissez, les câbles connectés à la base suggèrent qu'il s'agit "
"d'une sorte de générateur d'énergie."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "rusty generator"
msgstr "générateur rouillé"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "rusty generator"
msgid ""
"A tall, unremarkable cylinder capped by a wide, flat saucer.  There is heavy "
"rusting at the base.  A series of connected cables suggest that it's some "
"sort of power generator."
msgstr ""
"Un cylindre haut et banal surmonté d'une large soucoupe plate.  Il y a une "
"forte rouille à la base.  Une série de câbles connectés suggère qu'il s'agit "
"d'une sorte de générateur d'électricité."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "personal charging station"
msgstr "station de rechargement personnelle"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "personal charging station"
msgid ""
"The cyborg equivalent of a bed, this is a custom-shaped near-vertical booth "
"designed to mount a heavy metal frame and connect it to a central power "
"supply and nutrient source."
msgstr ""
"L'équivalent cyborg d'un lit, il s'agit d'une cabine personnalisée presque "
"verticale conçue pour monter un lourd cadre métallique et le relier à une "
"source centrale d'alimentation en énergie et en nutriments."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "simple charging station"
msgstr "station de rechargement"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "simple charging station"
msgid ""
"A simple, unadorned, corroded metal charging and feeding station, with "
"hookups for two units somewhat larger than a human to stand side by side and "
"be recharged and refueled."
msgstr ""
"Une simple station de recharge et d'alimentation en métal corrodé, sans "
"fioritures, avec des branchements permettant à deux unités un peu plus "
"grandes qu'un humain de se tenir côte à côte et d'être rechargées et "
"ravitaillées."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "shimmering superstructure"
msgstr "superstructure chatoyante"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "shimmering superstructure"
msgid ""
"A simple metal superstructure like you might see holding up a radio tower, "
"this one seems to give off just the faintest hint of shimmer, like heat "
"waves.  The metal has a burnt, iridescent pattern.  There is a boxy, "
"unimpressive-looking device at the top of the tower."
msgstr ""
"Une simple superstructure métallique, comme celle qui soutient une tour de "
"radio, semble dégager un léger scintillement, comme des ondes de chaleur. Le "
"métal présente un motif brûlé et irisé. Au sommet de la tour se trouve un "
"appareil de forme carrée, à l'aspect peu impressionnant."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "portal enclosure"
msgstr "portail d'entrée"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "portal enclosure"
msgid ""
"A heavy metal ring attached to dozens of wires, charred by residue that gives "
"off an acrid, unfamiliar smell."
msgstr ""
"Un lourd anneau métallique relié à des dizaines de fils, carbonisé par des "
"résidus qui dégagent une odeur âcre et inconnue."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "locator antenna"
msgstr "antenne de localisation"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "locator antenna"
msgid ""
"A tall metal pole solidly fixed to the roof.  It does not look activated but "
"there's a small set of holes near its base, maybe something could be plugged "
"in one to reboot the locator."
msgstr ""
"Un grand poteau métallique solidement fixé au toit. Il n'a pas l'air activé "
"mais il y a un petit ensemble de trous près de sa base, peut-être que quelque "
"chose pourrait être branché dans l'un d'eux pour redémarrer le localisateur."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EXOWARE_LOCATOR_ACTIVE" in furniture
#. "locator antenna"'s examine action
msgid "The locator is already active"
msgstr "Le localisateur est déjà actif"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EXOWARE_LOCATOR_FALSE" in furniture
#. "locator antenna"'s examine action
msgid "You don't have anything that could reactivate this device"
msgstr "Vous n'avez rien qui serait capable de réactiver cet appareil"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EXOWARE_LOCATOR" in furniture
#. "locator antenna"'s examine action
msgid ""
"You plug the rebooter in the locator.\n"
"<color_light_green>The locator reactivates.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "crystalline flower"
msgstr "fleur cristalline"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "crystalline flower"
msgid "A crystalline structure that resembles a plant."
msgstr "Une structure cristalline qui ressemble à une plante."

