#. ~ Bashing failed sound
msgid "whish."
msgstr "whish."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "less than nothing"
msgstr "moins que rien"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "less than nothing"
msgid "There is nothing here.  Not even time or space."
msgstr "Il n'y a rien ici.  Pas même le temps ou l'espace."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "impaled officer"
msgstr "officier empalé"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "impaled officer"
msgid ""
"A dead body encased in high-tech armor hanging in the air.  Their form seems "
"twisted and refracted in the light of the strange glowing crystal that has "
"seeped out of the ground and impaled their body."
msgstr ""
"Un cadavre dans une armure de haute technologie suspendu dans les airs.  Sa "
"forme semble tordue et réfractée par la lumière de l'étrange cristal brillant "
" émergeant du sol empalant son corps."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Bashing failed sound
msgid "an absence of sound."
msgstr "une absence de son."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "impaled mercenary"
msgstr "mercenaire empalé"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "impaled mercenary"
msgid ""
"A dead body encased in military armor hanging in the air.  Their form seems "
"twisted and refracted in the light of the strange glowing crystal that has "
"seeped out of the ground and impaled their body."
msgstr ""
"Un cadavre portant de l'équipement militaire, sa forme semblant tordue et "
"réfractée par la lumière de l'étrange cristal brillant émergeant du sol "
"empalant son corps."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "empty spike"
msgstr "pointe vide"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "empty spike"
msgid ""
"A strange otherworldly spike that refracts light in strange ways.  The body "
"no longer rests on it."
msgstr ""
"Une étrange pointe d'un autre monde qui réfracte la lumière de manière "
"étrange.  Le corps ne repose plus dessus."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MISSING_BODY" in furniture "empty
#. spike"'s examine action
msgid "The body is gone but it can't have gone far, you need to destroy it."
msgstr ""
"Le corps a disparu mais il ne peut pas être allé bien loin, vous devez le "
"détruire."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "cooling unit"
msgstr "unité de refroidissement"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "cooling unit"
msgid ""
"A large, blocky appliance encased in sheet metal.  This commonplace fixture "
"is used for cooling large indoor areas."
msgstr ""
"Une machine cubique recouverte de tôle.  Cet appareil est communément utilisé "
"pour réfrigérer des grandes structures."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "central air filter"
msgstr "filtre à air central"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "central air filter"
msgid ""
"A large synthetic membrane used to filter out dust, smoke, mites, and other "
"contaminants from air that passes through it."
msgstr ""
"Une grande membrane synthétique utilisée pour filtrer la poussière, la fumée, "
"les acariens et autres contaminants de l'air qui la traverse."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "dishwasher"
msgid ""
"A large, boxy machine that uses hot water and soap to efficiently clean "
"batches of dishes.  Now that it's sat powerless for a while, a putrid scent "
"of rot is leaking from inside."
msgstr ""
"Une grande machine qui utilise de l'eau chaude et du savon pour nettoyer "
"efficacement des lots de vaisselle.  Maintenant qu'elle est restée inactive "
"pour un bon moment, une odeur putride s'en échappe."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "dryer"
msgstr "sèche-linge"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "dryer"
msgid ""
"A common household appliance used to quickly dry large batches of clothing "
"after they have been washed."
msgstr ""
"Un appareil électroménager commun utilisé pour sécher rapidement de grandes "
"quantités de vêtements après leur lavage."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "furnace"
msgstr "four"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "furnace"
msgid ""
"A gas-powered forced-air central heating unit, with an internal fan to push "
"the air through a building's ventilation system to keep it warm."
msgstr ""
"Une unité de chauffage central à air pulsé alimentée au gaz, avec un "
"ventilateur interne pour pousser l'air à travers le système de ventilation "
"d'un bâtiment afin de le garder au chaud."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "washing machine"
msgid_plural "washing machines"
msgstr[0] "machine à laver"
msgstr[1] "machines à laver"
msgstr[2] "machines à laver"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "washing machine"
msgid ""
"An appliance used to clean laundry.  It needs to be plugged into a grid that "
"provides it with electricity and large amounts of water to be used."
msgstr ""
"Un appareil utilisé pour nettoyer du linge. A besoin de larges quantités "
"d'eau et d'être branché à un circuit capable de lui fournir de l'électricité."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "oven"
msgid ""
"A standard electric convection-based oven, commonly used for heating and "
"cooking food.  It can safely contain a fire, although it's not adequately "
"ventilated.  You could disconnect it and plug it into a working power grid, "
"or power it with a UPS."
msgstr ""
"Four électrique standard à convection, couramment utilisé pour chauffer et "
"cuire des aliments. Il peut contenir un incendie en toute sécurité, bien "
"qu'il ne soit pas suffisamment ventilé. Vous pouvez le déconnecter et le "
"brancher sur un réseau électrique opérationnel, ou l'alimenter avec un "
"onduleur."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gas oven"
msgstr "four à gaz"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gas oven"
msgid ""
"A standard gas-powered oven, commonly used for heating and cooking food.  "
"With the state of nearby gas lines unknown, it's best not to put any fire "
"near it."
msgstr ""
"Un four à gaz standard, une façon populaire de cuire ou réchauffer de la "
"nourriture. Avec l'intégrité douteuse des conduites de gaz dans les environs "
"il serait probablement une bonne idée de ne pas allumer un feu dans les "
"environs."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gas oven and microwave combo"
msgstr "four à gaz et micro-ondes combinés"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gas oven and microwave combo"
msgid ""
"A standard gas-powered oven, commonly used for heating and cooking food.  "
"This one has an attached microwave.  With the state of nearby gas lines "
"unknown, it's best not to put any fire near it.  You could disassemble the "
"shelving holding them together and pull the microwave out."
msgstr ""
"Un four à gaz standard, une façon populaire de cuire ou réchauffer de la "
"nourriture. Un micro-onde y a été attaché. Avec l'intégrité douteuse des "
"conduites de gaz dans les environs il serait probablement une bonne idée de "
"ne pas allumer un feu dans les environs. Vous pourriez désassembler l'étagère "
"les combinant pour en extraire le micro-ondes."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "blacksmith bellows"
msgstr "soufflet de forge"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "blacksmith bellows"
msgid ""
"An old device for pushing air into a blacksmith's forge to strengthen the "
"fire and maintain a high temperature.  Useless in its current state, but good "
"for parts."
msgstr ""
"Un ancien appareil permettant de pousser l'air dans la forge d'un forgeron "
"pour renforcer le feu et maintenir une température élevée.  Inutile dans son "
"état actuel, mais vous pourriez en extraire des pièces utiles."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "blacksmith drop hammer"
msgstr "marteau-pilon de forge"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "blacksmith drop hammer"
msgid ""
"An anvil with a large metal hammer suspended above it in a metal framework.  "
"It would be useful for shaping softened metal plates, or you could use the "
"anvil by itself."
msgstr ""
"Une enclume avec un gros marteau en métal suspendu au-dessus dans une "
"structure métallique.  Ceci pourrait être utile pour façonner des plaques de "
"métal ramollies, ou vous pourriez juste utiliser l'enclume."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "document shredder"
msgstr "déchiqueteuse à papier"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "document shredder"
msgid ""
"A simple electronic device mounted to a large basket.  It is designed to "
"efficiently destroy paper documents with sensitive information.  Good for "
"parts, as identity theft and corporate espionage probably aren't big concerns "
"anymore."
msgstr ""
"Un simple appareil électronique avec un grand panier attaché sur le côté.  "
"Utilisé pour détruire efficacement des documents papier contenant des "
"informations sensibles.  Vous pourriez probablement en tirer des pièces "
"utiles, à moins que mystérieusement le vol d'identité et l'espionnage "
"industriel soient encore de grandes préoccupations pour vous."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "server stack"
msgstr "pile de serveur"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "server stack"
msgid ""
"A large rack of specialized computers for storing and transmitting "
"information.  Powerless and largely useless for its intended purpose, the "
"laptops mounted inside can still be used if removed."
msgstr ""
"Un grand rack d'ordinateurs spécialisés dans le stockage et la transmission "
"d'informations. Dépourvu d'énergie et largement inutile pour l'usage auquel "
"il est destiné, les ordinateurs portables montés à l'intérieur peuvent encore "
"être utilisés s'ils sont retirés."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "supercomputer"
msgstr "supercalculateur"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "supercomputer"
msgid ""
"Hanging platters assembled into an inverted cone, their positions kept stable "
"by dense threading of copper cabling."
msgstr ""
"Des plateaux suspendus assemblés en cône inversé, leurs positions maintenues "
"stables par un filetage dense de câbles en cuivre."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "large satellite dish"
msgstr "grande antenne parabolique"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "large satellite dish"
msgid ""
"A large, concave metal panel with simple electronics used to receive signals "
"from satellites.  While the hundreds of expensive machines orbiting the "
"planet will likely continue to function indefinitely, their various purposes "
"have all been lost."
msgstr ""
"Un grand panneau métallique concave doté d'un système électronique simple "
"utilisé pour recevoir les signaux des satellites.  Même si les centaines de "
"machines coûteuses en orbite autour de la planète continueront probablement à "
"fonctionner indéfiniment, leurs diverses fonctions ont toutes été perdues."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "mounted polycrystalline solar panel"
msgstr "panneau solaire polycristallin monté"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "mounted polycrystalline solar panel"
msgid ""
"A set of photovoltaic power generators, which turns solar radiation into "
"useable electricity.  While useful before the Cataclysm, they have become "
"priceless tools, invaluable to any survivor.  This one uses less efficient "
"polycrystalline solar panels."
msgstr ""
"Un ensemble de générateurs d'énergie photovoltaïque, qui transforme le "
"rayonnement solaire en électricité utilisable. Bien qu'utiles avant le "
"cataclysme, ils sont devenus des outils inestimables, précieux pour tout "
"survivant. Celui-ci utilise des panneaux solaires polycristallins moins "
"efficaces."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "mounted monocrystalline solar panel"
msgstr "panneau solaire monocristallin monté"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "mounted monocrystalline solar panel"
msgid ""
"A set of photovoltaic power generators, which turns solar radiation into "
"useable electricity.  While useful before the Cataclysm, they have become "
"priceless tools, invaluable to any survivor.  This one uses more efficient "
"monocrystalline solar panels."
msgstr ""
"Un ensemble de générateurs d'énergie photovoltaïque, qui transforme le "
"rayonnement solaire en électricité utilisable. Bien qu'utiles avant le "
"cataclysme, ils sont devenus des outils inestimables, précieux pour tout "
"survivant. Celui-ci utilise des panneaux solaires monocristallins plus "
"efficaces."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "oxygen concentrator"
msgid ""
"A machine capable of generating pure oxygen from the air.  It needs power to "
"function."
msgstr ""
"Une machine capable d'extraire de l'oxygène pur à partir de l'air ambient. A "
"besoin d'électricité pour fonctionner."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "high pressure compressor unit"
msgid ""
"A machine designed to compress an input gas to a very high pressure.  It "
"needs large amounts of power to function."
msgstr ""
"Une machine conçue pour compresser des gaz à de très hautes pressions. A "
"besoin de larges quantités d'électricité pour fonctionner."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "road barricade"
msgstr "barricade routière"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "road barricade"
msgid ""
"A large wooden blockade used to block passage through a road.  It is lined "
"with reflective tape to increase visibility.  Despite the name, it does "
"little to stop a moving car."
msgstr ""
"Une grande barricade en bois utilisée pour bloquer le passage sur une route.  "
"Elle est doublée de bandes réfléchissantes pour augmenter la visibilité.  "
"Malgré son nom, elle ne fera pas grand-chose pour arrêter une voiture en "
"mouvement avec un conducteur déterminé."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gravelbag barricade"
msgstr "barricade de sacs de gravier"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gravelbag barricade"
msgid ""
"A low wall made of stacked gravelbags, uncommonly used to catch bullets and "
"block flooding."
msgstr ""
"Un mur bas, arrivant environ à la ceinture d'un adulte moyen, de sacs remplis "
"de gravier, communément utilisés par des soldats pour s'abriter des tirs "
"ennemis, mais aussi utiles pour stopper une inondation."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Bashing sound
msgid "rrrip!"
msgstr "crrrr!"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gravelbag wall"
msgstr "mur de sacs de gravier"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gravelbag wall"
msgid "A wall of stacked gravelbags, a bit taller than an average adult."
msgstr ""
"Un mur de sac de gravier empilés jusqu'à une hauteur un peu plus grande qu'un "
"adulte moyen."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "earthbag barricade"
msgstr "barricade de sacs de terre"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "earthbag barricade"
msgid ""
"A low wall made of stacked earthbags, commonly used to catch bullets and "
"block flooding."
msgstr ""
"Un mur bas, arrivant environ à la ceinture d'un adulte moyen, de sacs remplis "
"de terre, communément utilisés par des soldats pour s'abriter des tirs "
"ennemis, mais aussi utiles pour stopper une inondation."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "earthbag wall"
msgstr "mur de sacs de terre"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "earthbag wall"
msgid "A wall of stacked earthbags, a bit taller than an average adult."
msgstr ""
"Un mur de sac de terre empilés jusqu'à une hauteur un peu plus grande qu'un "
"adulte moyen."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "lane guard"
msgstr "garde-barrière"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "lane guard"
msgid "A simple wooden post to mark the separation between street lanes."
msgstr ""
"Un poteau en bois utilisé pour marquer la séparation entre les différentes "
"voies d'une rue."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "sandbag barricade"
msgstr "barricade en sacs de sable"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "sandbag barricade"
msgid ""
"A low wall made of canvas sacks filled with sand, commonly used to catch "
"bullets and prevent flooding."
msgstr ""
"Un mur bas, arrivant environ à la ceinture d'un adulte moyen, de sacs remplis "
"de sable, communément utilisés par des soldats pour s'abriter des tirs "
"ennemis, mais aussi utiles pour stopper une inondation."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "sandbag wall"
msgstr "mur en sacs de sable"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "sandbag wall"
msgid "A wall of stacked sandbags, a bit taller than an average adult."
msgstr ""
"Un mur de sac de sables empilés jusqu'à une hauteur un peu plus grande qu'un "
"adulte moyen."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "show jump"
msgstr "barre de saut d'obstacles"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "show jump"
msgid ""
"A show jump made of a long pole, suitable for showing off your equestrian "
"skills."
msgstr ""
"Un saut d'obstacles fait d'une longue perche, adapté à la démonstration de "
"vos talents équestres."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "show jump"
msgid "The end of a show jump made of planks."
msgstr "L'extrémité d'un saut d'obstacles fait de planches."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-beach.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "scattered seaweed"
msgstr "algues éparses"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-beach.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "scattered seaweed"
msgid "Seaweed and other detritus, scattered along the high water line of the beach."
msgstr "Algues et autres détritus, éparpillés le long de la laisse de mer de la plage."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-beach.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "driftwood log"
msgstr "bûche de bois flotté"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-beach.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "driftwood log"
msgid "A small log, bleached white by sun and salt."
msgstr "Une petite bûche, blanchie par le soleil et le sel."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-beach.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "broken boat"
msgstr "bateau cassé"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-beach.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "broken boat"
msgid ""
"A section of old, sun-bleached boat, half-buried in the ground.  There's no "
"restoring it, but parts could be salvaged."
msgstr ""
"Un tronçon de vieux bateau décoloré par le soleil, à moitié enterré dans le "
"sol. Il n'est pas possible de le restaurer, mais des pièces peuvent être "
"récupérées."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
#: data/json/items/furniture/decorative.json
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "standing mirror"
msgid_plural "standing mirrors"
msgstr[0] "miroir sur pied"
msgstr[1] "miroirs sur pied"
msgstr[2] "miroirs sur pied"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "standing mirror"
msgid ""
"A full-length mirror mounted in a sleek aluminum frame.  You can easily see "
"all of the dirt and blood on your clothes, and the weariness in your eyes."
msgstr ""
"Un miroir pleine longueur monté dans un cadre en aluminium élégant.  Vous "
"pouvez facilement voir toute la saleté et le sang sur vos vêtements, ainsi "
"que la lassitude dans vos yeux."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "broken standing mirror"
msgstr "miroir sur pied brisé"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "broken standing mirror"
msgid ""
"An aluminum frame for a full-length mirror, with most of the mirror missing.  "
"What remains in the frame are large, dangerous-looking shards of fractured "
"glass."
msgstr ""
"Un cadre en aluminium pour un miroir pleine longueur, avec la majeure partie "
"du miroir manquante.  Ce qui reste dans le cadre sont de gros éclats de verre "
"fracturés d’apparence dangereuse."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "bitts"
msgstr "bollards"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "bitts"
msgid ""
"A pair of vertical iron posts mounted on a wharf, pier, or other form of "
"dock.  They are used to secure mooring lines, ropes, and similar."
msgstr ""
"Une paire de poteaux verticaux en fer montés sur un quai, une jetée ou toute "
"autre forme de quai utilisée pour attacher une variété d'amarres cordages et "
"autres choses similaires."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "cleat"
msgstr "taquet"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "cleat"
msgid ""
"A small horn cleat with two \"horns\" extending parallel to the deck or the "
"axis of the spar, and resembling a small anvil.  They are used to secure "
"mooring lines, ropes, and similar."
msgstr ""
"Petit taquet à corne dont les deux \"cornes\" s'étendent parallèlement au "
"pont ou à l'axe de l'espar et ressemblent à une petite enclume. Ils sont "
"utilisés pour fixer les amarres, les cordages et autres."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "manacles"
msgstr "menottes"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "manacles"
msgid "A pair of metal shackles with heavy chains mounted to a wall or floor."
msgstr ""
"Une paires de menottes reliées à des chaines extrêmement lourdes attachées à "
"un mur ou une section du sol."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-doors.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fences-gates.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-railroads.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_vitrified.json
#. ~ Bashing failed sound
#. ~ Bashing sound
msgid "crack."
msgstr "crack."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "statue"
msgstr "statue"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "statue"
msgid ""
"A massive block of stone that has been carefully carved into a work of "
"timeless art."
msgstr ""
"Un bloc de pierre massif soigneusement sculpté pour en faire une œuvre d’art "
"intemporelle."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-graves.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
