msgstr[0] "figurines de Battlehammer 20k"
msgstr[1] "figurines de Battlehammer 20k"
msgstr[2] "figurines de Battlehammer 20k"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Description of "Battlehammer 20k"
