msgid ""
"Evacuation plans, disaster risk projections, personnel lists, and last-minute "
"communications from just before the end, all scrubbed from FEMA servers and "
"stored in an external HDD."
msgstr ""
"Un collection de plans d'évacuations, de projections de catastrophes, de "
"listes de personnel et de communiqués envoyés à la dernière minute, tous issu "
"des serveurs de FEMA juste avant la fin du monde et sauvegardé sur un disque "
"dur externe."

