#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "unfinished koji rice"
msgid ""
"Some cooked rice mixed with yeast and koji mold fragments, set aside to let "
"koji mold grow on it so that it can make a passable sake base."
msgstr ""
"Du riz cuit mélangé à de la levure et à des fragments de moisissure koji, mis "
"de côté pour laisser la moisissure koji se développer sur le riz afin qu'il "
"puisse constituer une base de saké acceptable."

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "unfinished koji rice"
msgid "The koji mold seems to have overtaken all the rice; this batch is usable now."
msgstr ""
"La moisissure du koji semble avoir pris le dessus sur tout le riz ; ce lot "
"est maintenant utilisable."

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "unfinished koji rice"
msgid "The koji mold is still growing."
msgstr "La moisissure koji est toujours en train de pousser."

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "koji rice"
msgid_plural "koji rice"
msgstr[0] "riz koji"
msgstr[1] "riz koji"
msgstr[2] "riz koji"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "koji rice"
msgid ""
"Some rice covered in koji mold, mixed in with yeast.  Useful for making sake, "
"but not really tasty on its own.  Smells vaguely of chestnuts."
msgstr ""
"Du riz recouvert de moisissure koji, mélangé à de la levure. Utile pour la "
"fabrication du saké, mais pas vraiment savoureux en soi. Il sent vaguement la "
"châtaigne."

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "growing wild koji mold"
msgid_plural "growing wild koji mold"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "growing wild koji mold"
msgid ""
"Some cooked rice sprinkled with ash and wrapped into a corn husk.  If left "
"alone for a while, it will most likely grow koji mold."
msgstr ""
"Du riz cuit saupoudré de cendres et enveloppé dans une feuille de maïs. S'il "
"est laissé à l'abandon pendant un certain temps, il est probable que de la "
"moisissure koji se développera."

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "growing wild koji mold"
msgid "Patches of koji mold have grown on the rice; you can now extract it."
msgstr ""
"Des plaques de moisissure koji se sont développées sur le riz ; vous pouvez "
"maintenant l'extraire."

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "growing wild koji mold"
#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "soy and wheat dough"
msgid "The koji mold hasn't grown yet."
msgstr "La moissisurede  koji n'a pas encore poussée."

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grown wild koji mold"
msgid_plural "grown wild koji mold"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "grown wild koji mold"
msgid ""
"Some cooked rice sprinkled with ash and wrapped into a corn husk.  It has "
"grown patches of koji mold inside; disassemble this item to extract it."
msgstr ""
"Du riz cuit saupoudré de cendres et enveloppé dans une feuille de maïs.  Des "
"plaques de moisissure koji se sont développées à l'intérieur; démontez cet "
"objet pour l'extraire."

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "soy and wheat dough"
msgid_plural "soy and wheat dough"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "soy and wheat dough"
msgid ""
"Dough made from cooked and mashed soybeans and wheat flour, wrapped in wet "
"paper.  If left to dry for some time, it'll grow koji mold, as necessary for "
"making soy sauce."
msgstr ""
"Pâte fabriquée à partir de graines de soja et de farine de blé cuites et "
"écrasées, enveloppée dans du papier humide. Si elle est laissée à sécher "
"pendant un certain temps, elle produira de la moisissure koji, nécessaire à "
"la fabrication de la sauce soja."

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "soy and wheat dough"
msgid "The koji mold seems to have overtaken all the dough; this batch is usable now."
msgstr ""
"La moisissure du koji semble avoir pris le dessus sur toute la pâte ; ce lot "
"est maintenant utilisable."

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "soy and wheat dough with koji"
msgid_plural "soy and wheat dough with koji"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "soy and wheat dough with koji"
msgid ""
"A block of dried dough made from cooked and mashed soybeans and wheat flour, "
"covered with koji mold.  Usable for making soy sauce."
msgstr ""
"Bloc de pâte séchée composée de graines de soja cuites et écrasées et de "
"farine de blé, recouvert d'une moisissure de koji. Utilisé pour la "
"fabrication de la sauce soja."

#: data/json/items/generic.json
