"features a copper-jacketed bullet with an aluminum core, which significantly "
"reduces its armor-piercing capabilities compared to its lead-core "
"counterpart.  However, the hollow-point design enhances terminal performance "
"against unarmored targets.  In all other respects, it remains largely "
"identical to the military version."
