msgstr[0] "cartouche chevrotine calibre 12"
msgstr[1] "cartouches chevrotine calibre 12"
msgstr[2] "cartouches chevrotine calibre 12"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge buckshot"
msgid ""
"A 12 gauge shotgun shell, filled with 9 pellets of 00 buck.  A very common "
"and versatile round, they're useful for both self defense and for hunting.  "
"The spread of the shot doesn't just increase your chances to have a "
"projectile hit, it also causes a much larger wound, greatly increasing "
"lethality.  It does struggle with range, and against body armor."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge beanbag"
msgid_plural "12 gauge beanbags"
msgstr[0] "cartouche caoutchouc calibre 12"
msgstr[1] "cartouches caoutchouc calibre 12"
msgstr[2] "cartouches caoutchouc calibre 12"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge beanbag"
msgid ""
"A beanbag round for shotguns.  Designated 'less-lethal' and intended to "
"disable, but remember that 'less-lethal' does not mean 'non-lethal'."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge birdshot"
msgid_plural "12 gauge birdshot"
msgstr[0] "cartouche chevrotine petit gibier calibre 12"
msgstr[1] "cartouches chevrotine petit gibier calibre 12"
msgstr[2] "cartouches chevrotine petit gibier calibre 12"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge birdshot"
msgid ""
"Weak shotgun ammunition, filled with tiny pellets and a low powder charge.  "
"Used often for shooting clays or birds, they're a very common commercial "
"round.  Their effectiveness against human targets are quite limited outside "
"of very close ranges, serving more to hurt than kill."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge dragon's breath"
msgid_plural "12 gauge dragon's breath"
msgstr[0] "cartouche souffle du dragon calibre 12"
msgstr[1] "cartouches souffle du dragon calibre 12"
msgstr[2] "cartouches souffle du dragon calibre 12"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge dragon's breath"
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with magnesium pellets or shards, used mostly as a "
"distress flare or pyrotechnics tool.  When the round is fired, "
"high-temperature sparks and flames shoot out of the barrel.  While looking "
"very impressive, they present more of a fire hazard than an effective tool "
"for lighting up hostiles."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge flechette"
msgid_plural "12 gauge flechettes"
msgstr[0] "cartouche fléchettes calibre 12"
msgstr[1] "cartouches fléchettes calibre 12"
msgstr[2] "cartouches fléchettes calibre 12"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge flechette"
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with tiny steel darts.  While looking quite dangerous, "
"their actual effectiveness is questionable.  Despite being finned, they have "
"a tendency to tumble mid-air, leading to greater spread and reduced damage."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge explosive slug"
msgid_plural "12 gauge explosive slugs"
msgstr[0] "cartouche slug explosive calibre 12"
msgstr[1] "cartouches slug explosives calibre 12"
msgstr[2] "cartouches slug explosives calibre 12"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge explosive slug"
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell shooting a small explosive.  Banned in several states.  While "
"an explosive from a shotgun sounds impressive, its practical applications are "
"limited at best.  The loss in mass in order to accommodate an explosive give "
"it much less impact force compared to traditional ammunition.  The relatively "
"small size of the slug can only accommodate a limited amount of explosives, "
"resulting in a fairly underwhelming explosion.  These traits make it a "
"utility tool for damaging barriers and disrupting other explosive devices, "
"rather than something for anti-personnel use."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge buckshot, scrap loaded"
msgid_plural "12 gauge buckshot, scrap loaded"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge buckshot, scrap loaded"
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with whatever scrap metal was lying around.  More "
"damaging than birdshot, but fairly inaccurate."
msgstr ""
"Une cartouche de fusil à pompe remplie de divers débris métalliques.  Plus "
"destructrice que de la chevrotine, mais assez imprécis."

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge, black powder, scrap loaded"
msgid_plural "12 gauge, black powder, scrap loaded"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge, black powder, scrap loaded"
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with black gunpowder and whatever scrap metal was "
"lying around.  The logical conclusion of ammunition bootlegging.  It'll kill "
"zombies just fine, but your gun will suffer for it."
msgstr ""
"Une cartouche de fusil à pompe remplie de poudre noire et de divers débris "
"métalliques. La conclusion logique du trafic illégal de munitions. Elle tuera "
"bien les zombies, mais votre arme en souffrira."

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge slug"
msgid_plural "12 gauge slugs"
msgstr[0] "cartouche slug calibre 12"
msgstr[1] "cartouches slug calibre 12"
msgstr[2] "cartouches slug calibre 12"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge slug"
msgid ""
"A 12 gauge slug.  Unlike birdshot or buckshot, slugs are a single large "
"projectile fired from a shotgun.  They're mostly used for hunting bigger "
"game, or for longer range shots where typical buck may spread out more.  Not "
"as lethal as buckshot in certain ranges, but much more accurate and with a "
"longer range, and is more effective against armor."
msgstr ""
"Une cartouche slug de calibre 12.  Contrairement aux cartouches de "
"chevrotine, les cartouches slugs propulsent un unique projectile et son "
"principalement utilisée pour chasser le gros gibier, ou pour des tirs à des "
"distances ou de la chevrotine se disperserait trop.  Pour résumer, celles-ci "
"ne sont pas aussi dévastatrices contre des cibles molles à courte distance "
"que la chevrotine, mais bien plus précises à plus longues distance ainsi que "
"contre des ennemis blindés.."

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wax slug"
msgid_plural "wax slugs"
msgstr[0] "cartouche slug en cire"
msgstr[1] "cartouches slug en cire"
msgstr[2] "cartouches slug en cire"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "wax slug"
msgid ""
"A round of 12 gauge birdshot that has had the crimp opened, and wax poured "
"into the shot to mimic the performance of a proper slug."
msgstr ""
"Une cartouche de chevrotine à petit gibier calibre 12 ayant eu de la cire "
"mélangée avec la charge de chevrotine pour imiter les qualités balistiques "
"d'une cartouche slug, mais il va sans dire que celle-ci est inférieure à "
"l'authentique."

#: data/json/items/ammo/signal_flare.json
#. ~ Description of "signal flare"
msgid ""
"A heavy plastic cartridge made for use in flare guns.  It appears to be a "
"modified 12 gauge shotgun shell."
msgstr ""
"Une cartouche de plastique épais destinée aux pistolets de détresse. Il "
"semble que ce soit une cartouche de fusil à pompe de gabarit 12 modifiée."

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
msgid_plural "sling-ready Molotov cocktails"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#. ~ Description of "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
msgid ""
"A bottle of flammable liquid with a long fuse inserted, ready to be used in a "
"staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw this item without a sling, use "
"it light the fuse.  You will, of course, need a lighter or matches in your "
"inventory to do this.  After lighting it, throw it to cause fires."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Molotov cocktail"
msgid "Light rag"
msgstr "Allumer le chiffon"

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Molotov cocktail"
msgid "You light the Molotov cocktail!"
msgstr "Vous allumez le cocktail Molotov!"

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sling-ready grenade"
msgid_plural "sling-ready grenades"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#. ~ Description of "sling-ready grenade"
msgid ""
"A military-grade fragmentary hand grenade, modified with a retaining fuse for "
"use in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw this item without a "
"sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  You will then have "
