msgstr[1] "vestes pare-balles"
msgstr[2] "vestes pare-balles"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "stab vest"
msgid "A simple Level II protection vest."
msgstr ""
"Une simple veste pare-balles de niveau II. Elle protèges des balles de petits "
"calibre et coup de couteau. Il y a une petite poche et un emplacement a "
"scratch."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "stab vest"
msgid "security stab vest"
msgid_plural "security stab vests"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of variant "security stab vest" of item "stab vest"
msgid ""
"A slim security vest used by mall cops.  Its protection is mostly meant to "
"extend to knives and not actual bullets, but at least it kept insurance costs "
"down.  It has \"SECURITY\" written on the front lapel and across the back, "
"and features a pocket for a notebook and pen."
msgstr ""
"Un gilet de sécurité mince utilisé par la sécurité des centres commerciaux. "
"Sa protection est principalement prévue pour les couteaux et non pour les "
"balles, mais elle permet au moins de réduire les coûts d'assurance. Il porte "
"l'inscription \" SÉCURITÉ \" sur le revers avant et dans le dos, et comporte "
"une poche pour un carnet et un stylo."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "stab vest"
msgid "airsoft vest"
msgid_plural "airsoft vests"
msgstr[0] "gilet pare-balles d'airsoft"
msgstr[1] "gilets pare-balles d'airsoft"
msgstr[2] "gilets pare-balles d'airsoft"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of variant "airsoft vest" of item "stab vest"
msgid ""
"A low-cost tactical vest styled in black camouflage, used in cosplay and "
"airsoft.  It'll let you shrug off airsoft pellets like a badass, but its "
"protection is mediocre against anything that's actually dangerous.  It sports "
"several small pouches, and includes touch fasteners to attach identifying "
"patches."
msgstr ""
"Une veste tactique bon marché en camouflage noir, utilisée pour le cosplay et "
"l'airsoft. Elle vous permettra d'essuyer des balles d'airsoft comme un dur à "
"cuire, mais sa protection est médiocre contre tout ce qui est réellement "
"dangereux. Elle comporte plusieurs petites poches, ainsi que des attaches "
"tactiles pour fixer des patchs d'identification."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "soft armor vest"
msgid_plural "soft armor vests"
msgstr[0] "veste de protection souple"
msgstr[1] "vestes de protection souple"
msgstr[2] "vestes de protection souple"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "soft armor vest"
msgid "A simple soft armor ballistic vest."
msgstr ""
"Une simple veste pare-balle. Elle est équipé de trois petites poches pour "
"votre confort. "

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "soft armor vest"
msgid "security ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "security ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "gilet pare-balles de garde"
msgstr[1] "gilets pare-balles de garde"
msgstr[2] "gilets pare-balles de garde"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of variant "security ballistic vest" of item "soft armor
#. vest"
msgid ""
"A lightweight black vest used by private security, covering the chest and "
"most of the abdomen.  Soft armor plates sealed inside the fabric provide "
"solid defense against shrapnel and small-caliber rounds.  \"SECURITY\" is "
"emblazoned on the front lapel and across the back, and it features a pocket "
"for a notebook and pen."
msgstr ""
"Une veste noire légère utilisée par la sécurité privée, couvrant la poitrine "
"et la majeure partie de l'abdomen. Des plaques de blindage souples scellées à "
"l'intérieur du tissu offrent une défense solide contre les éclats d'obus et "
"les balles de petit calibre. La mention \" SÉCURITÉ \" est inscrite sur le "
"revers avant et dans le dos, et le gilet comporte une poche pour un carnet et "
"un stylo."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "soft armor vest"
msgid "press ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "press ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "gilet pare-balles de presse"
msgstr[1] "gilets pare-balles de presse"
msgstr[2] "gilets pare-balles de presse"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of variant "press ballistic vest" of item "soft armor vest"
msgid ""
"Colored a distinctive navy blue and with a flared collar extending up to the "
"chin, this soft body armor was once used by news crews reporting from combat "
"zones.  It provides good protection from shrapnel, and to a lesser degree, "
"low-caliber bullets.  \"PRESS\" is emblazoned prominently on the front lapel "
"and across the back, and it features a pocket for a notebook and pen."
msgstr ""
"De couleur bleu marine, avec un col évasé remontant jusqu'au menton, ce gilet "
"pare-balles souple était autrefois utilisé par les équipes de journalistes en "
"reportage dans les zones de combat. Elle offre une bonne protection contre "
"les éclats d'obus et, dans une moindre mesure, contre les balles de petit "
"calibre. La mention \"PRESS\" est inscrite en évidence sur le revers avant et "
"dans le dos, et le gilet comporte une poche pour un carnet de notes et un "
"stylo."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "FBI ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "FBI ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "gilet pare-balles FBI"
msgstr[1] "gilets pare-balles FBI"
msgstr[2] "gilets pare-balles FBI"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "FBI ballistic vest"
msgid ""
"A ranger green soft ballistic vest with MOLLE rigging used by federal law "
"enforcement agencies.  Soft armor plates inside the vest provide solid "
"defense against shrapnel and small-caliber rounds.  \"FBI\" is emblazoned "
"across the front and back in large, yellow lettering, and it includes a "
"pocket for storing evidence.  Use it to attach or detach pouches."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hard armor vest"
msgid_plural "hard armor vests"
msgstr[0] "gilet pare-balle rigide"
msgstr[1] "gilets pare-balles rigides"
msgstr[2] "gilets pare-balles rigides"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hard armor vest"
msgid ""
"Armored panels give this vest solid defense against small caliber firearms, "
"and front and back pockets for hard armor panels give protection from higher "
"calibers."
msgstr ""
"Des panneaux blindés donnent à ce gilet une défense solide contre les armes à "
"feu de petit calibre, et les poches avant et arrière pour des panneaux de "
"blindage dur offrent une protection contre les calibres plus élevés."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "hard armor vest"
msgid "humanitarian ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "humanitarian ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "gilet pare-balles humanitaire"
msgstr[1] "gilets pare-balles humanitaires"
msgstr[2] "gilets pare-balles humanitaires"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of variant "humanitarian ballistic vest" of item "hard armor
#. vest"
msgid ""
"Bright blue in color, this slim armor vest was used by volunteers and "
"officials from humanitarian groups during the first days of the Cataclysm "
"before order broke down completely.  \"FEMA\" is written on the front lapel "
"and across the back."
msgstr ""
"De couleur bleu vif, cette veste d'armure fine a été utilisée par des "
"volontaires et des responsables de groupes humanitaires pendant les premiers "
"jours du Cataclysme, avant que l'ordre ne soit complètement rompu. La mention "
"\"FEMA\" est inscrite sur le revers avant et dans le dos."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "hard armor vest"
msgid "police ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "police ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "gilet pare-balles de police"
msgstr[1] "gilets pare-balles de police"
msgstr[2] "gilets pare-balles de police"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of variant "police ballistic vest" of item "hard armor vest"
msgid ""
"This charcoal-colored body armor was once a common sight on police officers, "
"and it provides adequate protection against small-caliber firearms in "
"addition to featuring pouches to hold armor inserts.  \"POLICE\" is written "
"on the front lapel and across the back."
msgstr ""
"Ce gilet pare-balles de couleur anthracite était autrefois très répandu chez "
"les policiers. Il offre une protection adéquate contre les armes à feu de "
"petit calibre et comporte des poches destinées à recevoir des inserts "
"d'armure. La mention \"POLICE\" est inscrite sur le revers avant et dans le "
"dos."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "hard armor vest"
msgid "National Guard ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "National Guard ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "gilet pare-balles de garde nationale"
msgstr[1] "gilets pare-balles de garde nationale"
msgstr[2] "gilets pare-balles de garde nationale"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of variant "National Guard ballistic vest" of item "hard
#. armor vest"
msgid ""
"Styled in urban camo, this ballistic vest was issued to soldiers, and as "
"things got worse, to volunteers as well.  It was designed to stand out after "
"the chaos of the riots; \"US ARMY\" is emblazoned on the front lapel next to "
"a patch of the United States flag, and \"NATIONAL GUARD\" is written across "
"the back."
msgstr ""
"Cette veste balistique, de couleur camouflage urbain, a été distribuée aux "
"soldats et, lorsque la situation s'est aggravée, aux volontaires. Elle a été "
"conçue pour se démarquer du chaos des émeutes : \"US ARMY\" est inscrit sur "
"le revers avant à côté d'un écusson représentant le drapeau des États-Unis, "
"et \"NATIONAL GUARD\" est écrit dans le dos."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "gilet pare-balles"
msgstr[1] "gilets pare-balles"
msgstr[2] "gilets pare-balles"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ballistic vest"
msgid ""
"An enormous handmade ballistic vest built with of lots of salvaged ballistic "
"Kevlar panels.  It's bulkier than a factory made US Army vest, but it is "
"customized for the benefit of an abnormally large mutant who couldn't wear "
"such armors otherwise.  Coated in MOLLE webbing to support modular loadouts "
"for the tacticool mutant.  It could be outfitted with steel plates for "
"further protection."
msgstr ""
"Une énorme veste balistique fabriquée à la main avec de nombreux panneaux de "
"Kevlar balistique récupérés. Elle est plus volumineuse qu'une veste de "
"l'armée américaine fabriquée en usine, mais elle a été personnalisée au "
"profit d'un mutant anormalement grand qui ne pourrait pas porter ce type "
"d'armure autrement. Elle est recouverte de sangles MOLLE pour permettre au "
"mutant tactique de se doter d'un équipement modulaire. Il peut être équipé de "
"plaques d'acier pour une meilleure protection."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ballistic vest (mild steel plates)"
msgid_plural "ballistic vests (mild steel plates)"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ballistic vest (mild steel plates)"
msgid ""
"An enormous handmade ballistic vest built with lots of salvaged ballistic "
"Kevlar panels and homemade \"ballistic inserts\" made of mild steel.  The "
"thin metal isn't the most protective, but it's probably better than just "
"plain Kevlar."
msgstr ""
"Une énorme veste balistique fabriquée à la main avec de nombreux panneaux de "
"Kevlar balistique récupérés et des \"inserts balistiques\" faits maison en "
"acier doux. Le métal fin n'est pas le plus protecteur, mais il est "
"probablement meilleur que le simple Kevlar."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ballistic vest (tempered steel plates)"
msgid_plural "ballistic vests (tempered steel plates)"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ballistic vest (tempered steel plates)"
msgid ""
"An enormous handmade ballistic vest made of lots of salvaged ballistic Kevlar "
"panels and ten NIJ IIIA plates inserted into custom-made pockets - four each "
"for your front and back and one each for your sides.  Monstrously heavy but "
"extremely protective."
msgstr ""
"Une énorme veste balistique fabriquée à la main, composée de nombreux "
"panneaux de Kevlar balistique récupérés et de dix plaques NIJ IIIA insérées "
"dans des poches faites sur mesure - quatre pour l'avant et l'arrière et une "
"pour les côtés. Monstrueusement lourd, mais extrêmement protecteur."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
