msgstr[2] "paires de chaussures à talons"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of variant "pair of block heels" of item "pair of heels"
msgid ""
"These are a pair of chunky, broad-based shoes with a sturdy block-like heel, "
"and while they don't do you any favors in the mobility department, they're at "
"least more comfortable to trudge about in than their peers and won't likely "
"cause irreversible damage to your feet."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'une paire de chaussures larges et épaisses dotées d'un talon "
"solide en forme de bloc. Bien qu'elles ne favorisent pas la mobilité, elles "
"sont au moins plus confortables que d'autres et ne risquent pas de causer des "
"dommages irréversibles à vos pieds."

