msgstr[0] "holster"
msgstr[1] "holsters"
msgstr[2] "holsters"

#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
#. ~ Description of "holster"
msgid ""
"A leather strap worn on the hip for holding pistol-sized guns.  Activate to "
"holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Une courroie en cuir portée sur la hanche pour tenir des armes de la taille "
"d'un pistolet. Activer pour ranger/sortir une arme."

