"A set of rugged yet comfortable pants dyed in various scales of gray, black, "
"and dirty white, possessing a set of sizable pockets, and printed with "
"squares and irregular polygons to disrupt a wearer's silhouette within "
"man-made environments.  You would honestly not be surprised if you learned "
"that this singular pair of trousers contains 50 shades of gray."
msgstr ""

