msgstr[1] "Cuirasses musculaires"
msgstr[2] "Cuirasses musculaires"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "bell cuirass"
msgid "An ancient Greek breastplate made of bronze."
msgstr "Une cuirasse en bronze d'un style datant de la Grèce antique."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bronze cuirass"
msgid_plural "bronze cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "cuirasse en bronze"
msgstr[1] "cuirasses en bronze"
msgstr[2] "cuirasses en bronze"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "bronze cuirass"
msgid ""
"A solid, single-piece cuirass made from bronze.  It isn't particularly well "
"designed, but it does its job."
msgstr ""
"Une cuirasse solide, d'une seule pièce, fabriquée en bronze. Elle n'est pas "
"particulièrement bien conçue, mais elle fait son travail."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "leather lamellar cuirass"
msgid_plural "leather lamellar cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "cuirasse lamellaire en cuir"
msgstr[1] "cuirasses lamellaires en cuir"
msgstr[2] "cuirasses lamellaires en cuir"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "leather lamellar cuirass"
msgid ""
"A cuirass made of multiple pieces of tough leather, laced together for "
"durable yet flexible protection."
msgstr ""
"Une cuirasse composée de plusieurs pièces de cuir résistant, reliées entre "
"elles pour une protection durable mais souple."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel lamellar cuirass"
msgid_plural "mild steel lamellar cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "cuirasse lamellaire en acier doux"
msgstr[1] "cuirasses lamellaires en acier doux"
msgstr[2] "cuirasses lamellaires en acier doux"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel lamellar cuirass"
msgid ""
"A cuirass made of small strips of sheet metal laced together, something of an "
"intermediary between chain mail and plate armor.  It's less Mad Max and more "
"Garage Mongolian, but the classics are classic for a reason."
msgstr ""
"Une cuirasse consistant de petites lamelles d'acier doux reliées entre elles, "
"une étape intermédiaire entre la maille et l'armure de plaques.  C'est moins "
"Mad Max et plus Mongol de Garage, mais les classiques sont classiques pour "
"une raison."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel lamellar cuirass"
msgid ""
"A cuirass made of small strips of sheet metal laced together, something of an "
"intermediary between chain mail and plate armor.  The perfect size for an orc "
"or bipedal grizzly bear."
msgstr ""
"Une cuirasse consistant de petites lamelles d'acier doux reliées entre elles, "
"une étape intermédiaire entre la maille et l'armure de plaques.  De taille "
"parfaite pour un ogre ou un grizzli bipède."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel lamellar cuirass"
msgid ""
"A cuirass made of small strips of sheet metal laced together, something of an "
"intermediary between chain mail and plate armor.  Perfectly sized for a "
"particularly angry rat-person, yes-yes."
msgstr ""
"Une cuirasse consistant de petites lamelles d'acier doux reliées entre elles, "
"une étape intermédiaire entre la maille et l'armure de plaques.  Parfaitement "
"convenable pour une personne-rat particulièrement en colère, oui-oui."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steel lamellar cuirass"
msgid_plural "hardened steel lamellar cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "cuirasse lamellaire en acier cémenté"
msgstr[1] "cuirasses lamellaires en acier cémenté"
msgstr[2] "cuirasses lamellaires en acier cémenté"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel lamellar cuirass"
msgid ""
"A cuirass made of small strips of sheet metal laced together, something of an "
"intermediary between chain mail and plate armor.  This one has been hardened "
"for extra protection."
msgstr ""
"Une cuirasse consistant de petites lamelles d'acier cémenté reliées entre "
"elles, une étape intermédiaire entre la maille et l'armure de plaques.  "
"Parfaitement convenable pour une personne-rat particulièrement en colère, "
"oui-oui."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel lamellar cuirass"
msgid ""
"A hardened cuirass made of small strips of sheet metal laced together, "
"something of an intermediary between chain mail and plate armor.  Built "
"larger for a minotaur guarding their labyrinth."
msgstr ""
"Une cuirasse durcie consistant de petites lamelles d'acier cémenté reliées "
"entre elles, une étape intermédiaire entre la maille et l'armure de plaques.  "
"Ses dimensions lui donne l'impression d'avoir été conçue pour un minotaure "
"gardant son labyrinthe."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel lamellar cuirass"
msgid ""
"A hardened cuirass made of small strips of sheet metal laced together, "
"something of an intermediary between chain mail and plate armor.  Just the "
"right size for a fantasy dwarf."
msgstr ""
"Une cuirasse durcie consistant de petites lamelles d'acier cémenté reliées "
"entre elles, une étape intermédiaire entre la maille et l'armure de plaques.  "
"Exactement la bonne taille pour un nain de fantasy."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "carpet cuirass"
msgid_plural "carpet cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "cuirasse en moquette"
msgstr[1] "cuirasses en moquette"
msgstr[2] "cuirasses en moquette"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "carpet cuirass"
msgid ""
"A rectangular length of tough carpet with a hole cut out for your head and "
"tied around the waist.  It's decently protective for its weight and quite the "
"fashion statement."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'une longueur rectangulaire de moquette dure, percée d'un trou "
"pour la tête et nouée autour de la taille. Il offre une protection convenable "
"pour son poids et constitue une véritable mode."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ichcahuipilli"
msgid_plural "ichcahuipillis"
msgstr[0] "ichcahuipilli"
msgstr[1] "ichcahuipillis"
msgstr[2] "ichcahuipillis"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ichcahuipilli"
msgid ""
"A Mesoamerican armor of Nahuatl origin, somewhat similar to a European "
"gambeson.  It is made of unspun cotton between two layers of quilted cotton "
"crystalized by brine, edged with leather around its holes.  It is extremely "
"thick and offers superb protection, but is also heavy.  This bad boy once "
"stopped Spanish bullets and Aztec missiles alike, now its time has come to "
"stop zombie bites."
msgstr ""
"Armure mésoaméricaine d'origine nahuatl, quelque peu similaire à un gambeson "
"européen. Elle est faite de coton non filé entre deux couches de coton "
"matelassé cristallisé par la saumure, bordé de cuir autour des trous. Il est "
"extrêmement épais et offre une superbe protection, mais il est également "
"lourd. Ce mauvais garçon a déjà arrêté les balles espagnoles et les missiles "
"aztèques, et son heure est venue d'arrêter les morsures de zombies."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lorica segmentata"
msgid_plural "lorica segmentata"
msgstr[0] "lorica segmentata"
msgstr[1] "lorica segmentata"
msgstr[2] "lorica segmentata"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "lorica segmentata"
msgid ""
"An ancient Roman laminar armor, made of overlapping metal strips connected to "
"internal leather straps."
msgstr ""
"Ancienne armure romaine laminaire, faite de bandes de fer se chevauchant "
"reliées par des sangles de cuir internes."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cataphract armor"
msgid_plural "suits of cataphract armor"
msgstr[0] "armure complète de cataphracte"
msgstr[1] "armures complètes de cataphracte"
msgstr[2] "armures complètes de cataphracte"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "cataphract armor"
msgid ""
"This armor, made of interlocking plates of burnished bronze, appears to be "
"either a high-quality recreation or a genuine artifact.  Despite having an "
"ancient design, it is in mint condition aside from some battle damage.  It "
"covers from the shoulders to the hips and is of extremely high quality."
msgstr ""
"Cette armure, faite de plaques de bronze bruni qui s'emboîtent les unes dans "
"les autres, semble être soit une reconstitution de haute qualité, soit un "
"véritable artefact. Bien qu'elle soit de conception ancienne, elle est en "
"parfait état, à l'exception de quelques dommages causés par la bataille. Elle "
"couvre les épaules jusqu'aux hanches et est d'une très grande qualité."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sheet metal chest guard"
msgid_plural "sheet metal chest guards"
msgstr[0] "plastron en tôle"
msgstr[1] "plastrons en tôle"
msgstr[2] "plastrons en tôle"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "sheet metal chest guard"
msgid ""
"Two sheets of metal hammered to fit your torso and riveted to leather belts "
"to act as straps.  Heavy, uncomfortable, and difficult to move in, but it "
"should help keep your blood inside your body."
msgstr ""
"Deux feuilles de métal martelées pour s'adapter à votre torse et rivetées à "
"des ceintures de cuir pour servir de sangles. Il est lourd, inconfortable et "
"difficile à porter, mais il devrait aider à maintenir le sang à l'intérieur "
"du corps."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened sheet metal chest guard"
msgid_plural "hardened sheet metal chest guards"
msgstr[0] "plastron en tôle d'acier cémenté"
msgstr[1] "plastrons en tôle d'acier cémenté"
msgstr[2] "plastrons en tôle d'acier cémenté"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened sheet metal chest guard"
msgid ""
"A chest guard made of hammered sheet metal, hardened for added protection.  "
"It's not any easier to move in, but it is much sturdier now."
msgstr ""
"Un plastron en tôle martelée, durci pour une meilleure protection. Il n'est "
"pas plus facile à mettre en place, mais il est beaucoup plus solide."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "heavy sheet metal chest guard"
msgid_plural "heavy sheet metal chest guards"
msgstr[0] "plastron lourd en tôle"
msgstr[1] "plastrons lourds en tôle"
msgstr[2] "plastrons lourds en tôle"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "heavy sheet metal chest guard"
msgid ""
"A double-decker chest guard made from two sheets of metal layered over each "
"other and hammered to fit your torso.  Monstrously heavy, but it's quite "
"protective and the thicker material makes it sturdier."
msgstr ""
"Un protège-poitrine à deux étages composé de deux feuilles de métal "
"superposées et martelées pour s'adapter à votre torse. Il est monstrueusement "
"lourd, mais il est très protecteur et le matériau plus épais le rend plus "
"robuste."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened heavy sheet metal chest guard"
msgid_plural "hardened heavy sheet metal chest guards"
msgstr[0] "plastron lourd en tôle d'acier cémenté"
msgstr[1] "plastrons lourds en tôle d'acier cémenté"
msgstr[2] "plastrons lourds en tôle d'acier cémenté"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened heavy sheet metal chest guard"
msgid ""
"Double-thick, hardened sheet metal hammered to fit your torso.  Offers the "
"best protection a junkyard knight could ask for."
msgstr ""
"Double épaisseur de tôle trempée martelée pour s'adapter à votre torse. Offre "
"la meilleure protection qu'un chevalier de la casse puisse demander."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "light sheet metal chest guard"
msgid_plural "light sheet metal chest guards"
msgstr[0] "plastron léger en tôle"
msgstr[1] "plastrons légers en tôle"
msgstr[2] "plastrons légers en tôle"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "light sheet metal chest guard"
msgid ""
"One sheet of metal, cut in half to only cover your upper torso and back and "
"riveted to leather belts to act as straps.  It's heavy and uncomfortable, but "
"at least you can bend at the waist."
msgstr ""
"Un morceau de tôle ayant été martelé et coupé pour protéger le haut de votre "
"torse, maintenu avec des ceintures de cuir autour de vos épaules et de votre "
"dos. C'est lourd et inconfortable, mais au moins vous pouvez plier le bas de "
"votre torse."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened light sheet metal chest guard"
msgid_plural "hardened light sheet metal chest guards"
msgstr[0] "plastron léger en tôle d'acier cémenté"
msgstr[1] "plastrons légers en tôle d'acier cémenté"
msgstr[2] "plastrons légers en tôle d'acier cémenté"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened light sheet metal chest guard"
msgid ""
"Sheet metal cut to only cover your upper torso and hardened for extra "
"protection.  Provides a decent compromise between protection and being able "
"to move."
msgstr ""
"Tôle découpée pour ne couvrir que la partie supérieure du torse et durcie "
"pour une protection supplémentaire. Il s'agit d'un bon compromis entre la "
"protection et la liberté de mouvement."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bookplate"
msgid_plural "bookplates"
msgstr[0] "armure papier"
msgstr[1] "armures papier"
msgstr[2] "armures papier"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "bookplate"
msgid "A crude form of armor made from thickly-stacked paper and rolls of duct tape."
msgstr ""
"Une forme d'armure rudimentaire fabriquée à partir de feuilles de papier "
"tassées et maintenues ensemble avec beaucoup de ruban adhésif."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tireplate"
msgid_plural "tireplates"
msgstr[0] "armure de plaques en pneu"
msgstr[1] "armures de plaques en pneu"
msgstr[2] "armures de plaques en pneu"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "tireplate"
msgid ""
"Armor fashioned from overlapping chunks of tire and rolls of duct tape, "
"covering the shoulders and torso."
msgstr ""
"Armure fabriquée à partir de morceaux de pneus superposés et de rouleaux de "
"ruban adhésif, couvrant les épaules et le torse."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "base chainmail vest"
