#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel mirror armor"
msgid ""
"Mirror armor earns its name from its distinct shape and polished sheen.  "
"Round and rectangular steel plates are fastened together to protect all four "
"sides of the torso.  It can be worn on top of other armor like chainmail and "
"brigandines.  This set is crudely put together with square plates of mild "
"steel."
msgstr ""
"Un ensemble d'armure miroir consistant de plaques d'acier doux rondes et "
"rectangulaires arrangées pour protéger les quatre côtés du torse ayant obtenu "
"son nom grâce à son apparence distinctive et son lustre poli.  Ceci peut être "
"porté au-dessus d'autres pièces d'armure comme les ensembles de maille ou les "
"brigandines."

