msgstr[2] "ensembles d'armure miroir en acier trempé"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered steel mirror armor"
msgid ""
"Mirror armor earns its name from its distinct shape and polished sheen.  "
"Round and rectangular steel plates are fastened together to protect all four "
"sides of the torso.  It can be worn on top of other armor like chainmail and "
"brigandines.  Masterfully crafted with tempered steel, this set features a "
"prominent circular plate on the front that has been polished to a mirror-like "
"sheen, flanked with supporting plates intricately joined to fit  the body, "
"all meticulously decorated.  Will protect you from serious harm, as well as "
"the evil gazes of the undead."
msgstr ""
"Un ensemble d'armure miroir consistant de plaques d'acier trempé "
"magnifiquement forgées et méticuleusement décorées rondes et rectangulaires "
"arrangées pour protéger les quatre côtés du torse ayant obtenu son nom grâce "
"à son apparence distinctive et son lustre poli.  Ceci peut être porté "
"au-dessus d'autres pièces d'armure comme les ensembles de maille ou les "
"brigandines et vous offrira une protection excellente contre les attaques "
"physiques ainsi que le mauvais œil des morts-vivants."

