#: data/json/items/book/anthology.json
#. ~ Description of "Sunvault: Stories of Solarpunk & Eco-Speculation"
msgid ""
"Sunvault is the first English-language anthology to broadly collect solarpunk "
"short fiction, artwork, and poetry.  A new genre for the 21st Century, "
"solarpunk is a revolution against despair.  Focusing on solutions to "
"environmental disasters, solarpunk envisions a future of green, sustainable "
"energy used by societies that value inclusiveness, cooperation, and personal "
"freedom.  Published by Upper Rubber Boot Books."
msgstr ""

