"shows rows of adults staring placidly into a screen."
msgstr ""
"Ceci est une copie de \"La Société du Spectacle\" de Guy Debord, la "
"couverture montrant des rangées d'adultes regardant un écran placidement."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a split copy of both \"An Ethic of Sexual Difference\" and \"This Sex "
"Which Is Not One\" by Luce Irigaray."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of Baudrillard's \"Simulation and Simulacra\".  The cover "
"contains an image of a man holding a colored pill in each hand, with the "
"caption \"Welcome to the Desert of the Real.\".  You think you've seen this "
"movie."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a small, pocket version of Sartre's \"Existentialism and Humanism\".  "
"It looks to have been used as a coaster in a past life."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"Practical Ethics\" by Peter Singer.  From the local "
"university press."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a photocopied spiral-bound copy of \"Industrial Society and Its "
"Future\" by 'Freedom Club'.  The original looks to have been written on a "
"typewriter before being copied."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"Industrial Society and Its Future\" by Ted Kaczynski.  "
"Its cover is an image of a hand-crafted wooden box filled with wiring and an "
"ominous looking metal tube.  Provocative."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'un exemplaire de « Industrial Society and Its Future » (La "
"société industrielle et son avenir) de Ted Kaczynski. La couverture "
"représente une boîte en bois fabriquée à la main, remplie de câbles et d'un "
"tube métallique à l'aspect inquiétant. Provocateur."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid "This is a small reader on Hegel's Dialectics."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"The State and Revolution\" by Vladimir Lenin.  In "
"English, thankfully."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid "This is a copy of \"In Defense of Marxism\" by Leon Trotsky."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"Steal This Book\" by Abbie Hoffman.  There is a security "
"tag on the back cover.  It appears to still be active."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"Walden: Or Life In The Woods\" by Henry David Thoreau.  "
"It contains a dried and pressed leaf as a bookmark."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'un exemplaire de \"Walden: Ou la Vie dans les Bois\" écrit par "
"Henry David Thoreau.  Il contient une feuille séchée et pressée en guise de "
"marque-page.  "

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"The Female Eunuch\" by Germaine Greer.  A child has "
"scribbled over the contents page in red crayon."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'un exemplaire de \"La Femme Eunuque\" de Germaine Greer.  Un "
"enfant a griffonné le sommaire au crayon rouge."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid "This is a copy of \"An Introduction to Metaphysics\" by Bergson."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'un exemplaire de \"Introduction à la métaphysique\" écrit par "
"Bergson."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"The Four Fundamental Concepts of Psychoanalysis\" by "
"Jacques Lacan."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'un exemplaire des \"Quatre Concepts Fondamentaux de la "
"Psychanalyse\" écrit par Jacques Lacan."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid "This is a copy of Machiavelli's \"The Prince\".  With intro by Q. Skinner."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'une copie du \"Prince\" de Machiavelli ayant une introduction "
"écrite par Q. Skinner."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid "This is a copy of \"The Revolution of Everyday Life\" by Raoul Vaneigem."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'un exemplaire de \"La Révolution de La Vie Quotidienne» écrit par "
"Raoul Vaneigem."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a pocket copy of \"An Essay on Liberation\" by Herbert Marcuse.  The "
"cover contains an image of a pelican."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Either-Or\" by Søren Kierkegaard."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Allegory of the Cave\" by Plato."
msgstr "Il s'agit d'une copie de \"L'allégorie de la caverne\" de Platon."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Leviathan\" by Thomas Hobbes."
msgstr "Une copie du livre de Thomas Hobbes intitulé \"Léviathan\"."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Critique Of Pure Reason\" by Immanuel Kant."
msgstr "Une copie du livre d''Emmanuel Kant \"Critique de la raison pure\"."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Principles of Philosophy\" by René Descartes."
msgstr ""
"Une copie de l'œuvre de René Descartes intitulée \"Les Principes de la "
"Philosophie\"."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of both \"On the Genealogy of Morality\" and \"The Gay "
"Science\" by Friederich Nietzsche."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'un exemplaire de \"La Généalogie de la Morale\" et \"Le Gai "
"Savoir\" de Friedrich Nietzsche."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"The Myth of Sisyphus\", and other essays, by Albert "
"Camus.  The cover depicts a bare-chested man and a large boulder."
msgstr ""
"Une copie du livre d'Albert Camus, \"Le Mythe de Sisyphe\" et plusieurs autre "
"essais de l'auteur. La couverture est une illustration de Sisyphe poussant "
"son rocher."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"The Sickness Unto Death\" by Søren Kierkegaard.  The "
"pages are dotted with post-it notes."
msgstr ""
"Une copie du livre de Søren Kierkegaard \"La maladie jusqu'à la mort\". Les "
"pages sont couvertes de post-its laissés par le dernier lecteur l'ayant "
"possédée."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"The Defence of Terrorism\" by Leon Trotsky.  Despite the "
"title, it does not actually appear to be defending terrorism."
msgstr ""
"Une copie du livre de Léon Trotsky \"Défense du terrorisme\". Malgré ce que "
"le titre vous incline à penser, il semble que l'auteur n'essait pas de "
"défendre le terrorisme."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"Enquiry Concerning Political Justice\" by William Godwin. "
" This thick book is filled with antiquated phrases."
msgstr ""
"Une copie du livre de William Godwin \"Political Justice\". Le language "
"utilisé est archaïque."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"The Abolition of Work and Other Essays\" by Bob Black.  "
"It is likely that \"The Abolition of Work\" is the most famous essay in this "
"book."
msgstr ""
"Une copie de l'essai de Bob Black intitulé \"L'Abolition du travail\" "
"accompagné d'autre essais du même auteur."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"What is Property?\" by Pierre-Joseph Proudhon.  It looks "
"like this book has a surprisingly long track record of owners."
msgstr ""
"Une copie du livre de Pierre-Joseph Proudhon intitulé \"Qu'est-ce que la "
"propriété ?\". L'usure visible du livre donne l'impression que ce livre à une "
"longue liste d'anciens propriétaires."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"The Conquest of Bread\" by Peter Kropotkin.  There is a "
"picture of an old philosopher with magnificent beard, instead of bread, on "
"the cover."
msgstr ""
"Une copie du livre de Peter Kropotkin intitulé \"La Conquête du pain\". La "
"couverture est illustré par le portrait d'un philosophe avec une barbe "
"gigantesque."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"The Trouble with Being Born\" by Emil Cioran.  This book "
"might have been printed decades before the Cataclysm since the cover is quite "
"weathered."
msgstr ""
"Une copie du livre d'Émile Cioran intitulé \"De l'inconvénient d'être né\". "
"L'année d'édition de cette copie est probablement ancienne, vu l'usure du "
"livre."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"The World as Will and Representation\" by Arthur "
"Schopenhauer.  It contains a few undecipherable notes and scribbles."
msgstr ""
"Une copie du livre d'Arthur Schopenhauer intitulé \"Le Monde comme volonté et "
"comme représentation\". Quelques notes incompréhensible sont inscrites à "
"l'intérieur."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"Up-Wingers: A Futurist Manifesto\" by FM-2030.  It seems "
"that the author's real name is Fereidoun M. Esfandiary."
msgstr ""
"Une copie du livre de FM-2030 intitulé \"UpWingers: A Futurist Manifesto\". "
"Apparament, le vrai nom de l'auteur est Fereidoun M. Esfandiary."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"The Bastiat Collection\", a large collection of essays by "
"Frederic Bastiat."
msgstr "Une collection d'essais de Frédéric Bastiat."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"Anarchy, State, and Utopia\" by Robert Nozick, one of the "
"most influential books of modern libertarianism."
msgstr ""
"Une copie du livre de Robert Nozick intitulé \"Anarchie, État et utopie\". "
"L'une des œuvres les plus renommées du minarchisme moderne."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"Socialism\" by Ludwig von Mises, a critical examination "
"of socialism."
msgstr ""
"Une copie du livre de Ludwig von Mises intitulé \"Socialisme\". Une critique "
"du socialisme."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"The ABC of Communism\" by Nikolai Bukharin, one of the "
"most influential books of early Marxism-Leninism."
msgstr ""
"Une copie du livre de Nikolai Bukharin intitulé \"L'ABC du Communisme\". "
"L'une des œuvres Marxiste-Léninistes les plus connues."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of philosophy"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Anti-Capitalist Mentality\" by Ludwig von Mises."
msgstr ""
"Une copie du livre de Ludwig von Mises intitulé \"La mentalité "
"anti-capitaliste\"."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ ISBN 9780199552078
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Modal Logic as Metaphysics"
msgid_plural "copies of Modal Logic"
msgstr[0] "Logique Modale Métaphysique"
msgstr[1] "copies de Logique Modale"
msgstr[2] "copies de Logique Modale"

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ ISBN 9780199552078
#. ~ Description of "Modal Logic as Metaphysics"
msgid ""
"A treatise on applying logical tools to questions about that nature of "
"reality, this book contains detailed discussion of metaphysical issues."
msgstr ""
"Un traité sur l'application des outils logiques aux questions relatives à la "
"nature de la réalité, ce livre contient une discussion détaillée de questions "
"métaphysiques."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ ISBN 9780312003098
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Aesthetics: A Critical Anthology"
msgid_plural "copies of Aesthetics"
msgstr[0] "Esthétiques: Une Anthologie Critique"
msgstr[1] "copies d'Esthétiques"
msgstr[2] "copies d'Esthétiques"

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ ISBN 9780312003098
#. ~ Description of "Aesthetics: A Critical Anthology"
msgid ""
"This hardbound anthology presents a collection of readings, scholarly works, "
"and critical analyses on the subject of beauty."
msgstr ""
"Cette anthologie reliée présente une collection de lectures, de travaux "
"universitaires et d'analyses critiques sur le thème de la beauté."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ ISBN 9780199232383
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Philosophy of Information"
msgid_plural "copies of The Philosophy of Information"
msgstr[0] "La Philosophie de l'Information"
msgstr[1] "copies de La Philosophie de l'Information"
msgstr[2] "copies de La Philosophie de l'Information"

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ ISBN 9780199232383
#. ~ Description of "The Philosophy of Information"
msgid ""
"This university text details a critical investigation of the conceptual "
"nature and basic principles of information.  The student will gain a thorough "
"appreciation of the conceptual frameworks commonly used to describe and "
"advance semantic investigations."
msgstr ""
"Ce texte universitaire présente une étude critique de la nature conceptuelle "
"et des principes de base de l'information.  L'étudiant acquerra une "
"appréciation approfondie des cadres conceptuels couramment utilisés pour "
"décrire et faire progresser les recherches sémantiques."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ ISBN 9780415278485
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Being and Nothingness"
msgid_plural "copies of Being and Nothingness"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_philosophy.json
#. ~ ISBN 9780415278485
#. ~ Description of "Being and Nothingness"
msgid ""
"This paperback is a copy of Jean-Paul Sartre's \"Being and Nothingness\".  A "
"key work in the existentialist tradition."
msgstr ""
"Ce livre de poche est une copie de \"L'être et le néant\" écrit par Jean-Paul "
"Sartre.  Un ouvrage clé de la tradition existentialiste."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_pulp.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pulp novel"
msgid_plural "pulp novels"
msgstr[0] "roman de gare"
msgstr[1] "romans de gare"
msgstr[2] "romans de gare"

#: data/json/items/book/misc_pulp.json
#. ~ Description of "pulp novel"
msgid "A hardboiled detective tale filled with hard hitting action and intrigue."
msgstr ""
"Dans cette histoire pleine d'action, un policier dur à cuir doit affronter un "
"complot."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_pulp.json
#. ~ ISBN 9781949313062
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Black Valkyries From Venus"
msgid_plural "copies of Black Valkyries From Venus"
msgstr[0] "Valkyries Noires de Vénus"
msgstr[1] "copies de Valkyries Noires de Vénus"
msgstr[2] "copies de Valkyries Noires de Vénus"

#: data/json/items/book/misc_pulp.json
#. ~ ISBN 9781949313062
#. ~ Description of "Black Valkyries From Venus"
msgid ""
"You hold in your hands a weather-beaten novel written by someone named \"Lee "
"Racket.\""
msgstr ""
"Vous tenez dans vos mains un roman usé par les intempéries, écrit par un "
"certain \"Lee Racket\"."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_pulp.json
#. ~ ISBN 9780575131569
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Wrong Tomorrow"
msgid_plural "copies of Wrong Tomorrow"
msgstr[0] "Le Mauvais Demain"
msgstr[1] "copies de Mauvais Demain"
msgstr[2] "copies de Mauvais Demain"

#: data/json/items/book/misc_pulp.json
#. ~ ISBN 9780575131569
#. ~ Description of "The Wrong Tomorrow"
msgid ""
"You hold in your hands a cheap drugstore paperback written by someone named "
"\"Lee Racket.\""
msgstr ""
"Vous tenez dans vos mains un livre de poche bon marché écrit par un certain "
"\"Lee Racket\"."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_pulp.json
#. ~ ISBN 9781627551144
#. ~ Item name
msgid "No God From a Corpse"
msgid_plural "copies of No God From a Corpse"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_pulp.json
#. ~ ISBN 9781627551144
#. ~ Description of "No God From a Corpse"
#. ~ 'Hard-boiled enough to break a spoon' means melodramatic, exaggerated,
#. emotional but simple, and possessing a general lack of literary pretense.
#. Weatherworn means damaged by age.  Skirt means woman.
msgid ""
"A weatherworn paperback written by some skirt named \"Lee Racket.\"  It tells "
"how rage and jealousy can turn a man, or a woman, into a monster.  This story "
"is hard-boiled enough to break a spoon."
msgstr ""
"Un livre de poche usé par le temps, écrit par un type nommé \"Lee Racket\".  "
"Il raconte comment la rage et la jalousie peuvent transformer un homme, ou "
"une femme, en monstre.  Cette histoire est suffisamment dure pour casser une "
"cuillère."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_pulp.json
#. ~ ISBN 9781612420530
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Deep Dive"
msgid_plural "copies of The Deep Dive"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_pulp.json
#. ~ ISBN 9781612420530
#. ~ Description of "The Deep Dive"
#. ~ Broad is a dismissive and outdated term that simply means "woman."  The
#. term is used because it evokes the (decidedly misogynistic) era in which
#. the pulp genre gained popularity within the United States.
msgid ""
"This dimestore short story about space travel is written by a broad named "
"\"Lee Racket.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_pulp.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Planet of the Murderous Squids that Time Forgot!"
msgid_plural "copies of Planet of the Murderous Squids that Time Forgot!"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_pulp.json
#. ~ Description of "Planet of the Murderous Squids that Time Forgot!"
msgid ""
"In this psychedelic adventure novel of cosmic exploration, an elderly "
"assassin discovers a planet too good to be true.  Only once it is too late "
"does she discover the harrowing truth at the center of \"The Planet of the "
"Murderous Squids that Time Forgot!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_pulp.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Great Capes of Metropolis"
msgid_plural "copies of The Great Capes of Metropolis"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_pulp.json
#. ~ Description of "The Great Capes of Metropolis"
msgid ""
"In this classic pulp paperback of superheroic exploits, a group of masked "
"vigilantes with diverse superpowers learn to work together to defeat the "
"ultimate villain."
msgstr ""
"Dans ce livre de poche classique d'exploits super-héroïques, un groupe de "
"justiciers masqués dotés de super-pouvoirs divers apprend à travailler "
"ensemble pour vaincre le méchant ultime."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_pulp.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Yesterday's Murdered"
msgid_plural "copies of Yesterday's Murdered"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_pulp.json
#. ~ Description of "Yesterday's Murdered"
msgid ""
"In this fast paced pulp noir, a hard-drinking detective with nerves of steel "
"has one last shot at vengeance."
msgstr ""
"Dans ce roman noir au rythme effréné, une détective alcoolique aux nerfs "
"d'acier tente une dernière fois de se venger."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_pulp.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Flashgun Condor and the Crimson Criminal"
msgid_plural "copies of Flashgun Condor and the Crimson Criminal"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_pulp.json
#. ~ Description of "Flashgun Condor and the Crimson Criminal"
msgid ""
"A hot-blooded photographer who fights crime with film, footage, and fists, "
"Condor is more than a mere shutterbug on the crime beat.  But will she be "
"able to unravel a devious deception and bring the \"Crimson Criminal\" to "
"justice?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_scifi.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scifi novel"
msgid_plural "scifi novels"
msgstr[0] "roman de science-fiction"
msgstr[1] "romans de science-fiction"
msgstr[2] "romans de science-fiction"

#: data/json/items/book/misc_scifi.json
#. ~ Description of "scifi novel"
msgid "Aliens, ray guns, and space ships."
msgstr "Des aliens, des armes laser et des vaisseaux spatiaux."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_scifi.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "scifi novel"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of Gibson's \"Neuromancer\".  Written in the eighties, it was "
"surprisingly accurate in predicting much of modern society… until recently."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'une copie de \"Neuromancien\" de Gibson.  Écrit dans les années "
"80, il s'est avéré étonnamment précis en prédisant une grande partie de la "
"société moderne… jusqu'à récemment."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_scifi.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "scifi novel"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"The Stars My Destination\" by Alfred Bester.\n"
"\n"
"Tyger, Tyger, Burning bright,\n"
"In the forests of the night:\n"
"What immortal hand or eye,\n"
"Dare frame thy fearful symmetry?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_scifi.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "scifi novel"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"The Lathe of Heaven\" by Ursula Le Guin.  Dirty "
"finger-stains have smudged the occasional word."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_scifi.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "scifi novel"
msgid "This is a copy of \"The Dispossessed\" by Ursula Le Guin."
msgstr "Une copie de l'œuvre d'Ursula Le Guin intitulée \"Les Dépossédés\"."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_scifi.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "scifi novel"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Hyperion\" by Dan Simmons."
msgstr "Une copie du roman \"Hyperion\" écrit par Dan Simmons."

#: data/json/items/book/misc_scifi.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "scifi novel"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"Endymion\" by Dan Simmons.  It opens with a poem by D.H. "
"Lawrence:\n"
"\n"
"Give us gods.  Oh give them us!\n"
"Give us gods.\n"
"We are so tired of men\n"
"And motor-power."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_scifi.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "scifi novel"
msgid "This is a copy of Philip K. Dick's \"Do Androids Dream of Electric Sheep?\"."
msgstr ""
"Une copie de l'œuvre de Philip K. Dick intitulée \"Les androïdes rêvent-ils "
"de moutons électriques?\"."

