#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Description of "International Approaches to Securing Radioactive Sources
#. Against Terrorism"
msgid ""
"This book presents how to enhance cooperation and assistance between "
"countries in support of International Atomic Energy Agency efforts to secure "
"radioactive sources against the threat of terrorism."
msgstr ""
"Cet ouvrage explique comment renforcer la coopération et l'assistance entre "
"les pays pour soutenir les efforts de l'Agence Internationale de l'Énergie "
"Atomique (IAEA) visant à sécuriser les sources radioactives contre la menace "
"terroriste."

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Principles of Forensic Psychiatry"
msgid_plural "copies of Principles of Forensic Psychiatry"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Description of "Principles of Forensic Psychiatry"
msgid ""
"This text addresses standards in the assessment and treatment of aggression "
"and violence as well as psychological and neuroimaging assessments."
msgstr ""
"Ce texte aborde les normes d'évaluation et de traitement de l'agression et de "
"la violence ainsi que les évaluations psychologiques et de neuro-imagerie."

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Guide to Reflective Conflict Resolution"
msgid_plural "copies of The Guide to Reflective Conflict Resolution"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Description of "The Guide to Reflective Conflict Resolution"
msgid ""
"The back cover of this hardbound book reads: \"Why should professionals care "
"about reflective practice?  How do its principles and methods increase "
"competence?  What characteristics distinguish reflective practitioners?\""
msgstr ""
"La quatrième de couverture de ce livre relié est ainsi libellée : Pourquoi "
"les professionnels doivent-ils s'intéresser à la pratique réflexive ? Comment "
"ses principes et ses méthodes permettent-ils d'accroître les compétences ? "
"Quelles sont les caractéristiques qui distinguent les praticiens réflexifs ?"

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Oxbridge Handbook of Mood Ailments"
msgid_plural "copies of The Oxbridge Handbook of Mood Ailments"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Description of "The Oxbridge Handbook of Mood Ailments"
msgid ""
"The Oxbridge Handbook of Mood Ailments provides detailed coverage of the "
"characterization, understanding, and treatment of affective disorders.  It "
"provides coverage of unipolar depression, bipolar disorder, and known "
"variants of these illnesses."
msgstr ""
"L'Oxbridge Handbook of Mood Ailments fournit une couverture détaillée de la "
"caractérisation, de la compréhension et du traitement des troubles affectifs. "
"Il couvre la dépression unipolaire, le trouble bipolaire et les variantes "
"connues de ces maladies."

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Phonological Acquisition and Disorders"
msgid_plural "copies of Phonological Acquisition and Disorders"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Description of "Phonological Acquisition and Disorders"
msgid ""
"Studying the phonologies of children with non-organic speech disorders, this "
"volume details the latest findings in optimality theory, phonological "
"acquisition and disorders.  It is intended for linguists and psychologists."
msgstr ""
"Étudiant les phonologies d'enfants souffrant de troubles non organiques de la "
"parole, ce volume détaille les dernières découvertes en matière de théorie de "
"l'optimalité, d'acquisition phonologique et de troubles. Il s'adresse aux "
"linguistes et aux psychologues."

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Therapeutic Gardens and Healing Spaces"
msgid_plural "copies of Therapeutic Gardens and Healing Spaces"
msgstr[0] "Jardins thérapeutiques et Espaces de Guérison"
msgstr[1] "copies de \"Jardins thérapeutiques et Espaces de Guérison\""
msgstr[2] "copies de \"Jardins thérapeutiques et Espaces de Guérison\""

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Description of "Therapeutic Gardens and Healing Spaces"
msgid ""
"This book addresses how to design therapeutic gardens.  It illustrates a "
"variety of landscape designs appropriate for public spaces that promote "
"mental health."
msgstr ""
"Ce livre explique comment concevoir des jardins thérapeutiques. Il illustre "
"une variété d'aménagements paysagers adaptés aux espaces publics qui "
"favorisent la santé mentale."

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Advances in Drug Delivery Systems"
msgid_plural "copies of Advances in Drug Delivery Systems"
msgstr[0] "Progrès dans les systèmes d'administration de médicaments"
msgstr[1] "copies de \"Progrès dans les systèmes d'administration de médicaments\""
msgstr[2] "copies de \"Progrès dans les systèmes d'administration de médicaments\""

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Description of "Advances in Drug Delivery Systems"
msgid ""
"This softcover reprint covers an array of topics in pharmacology.  The "
"physicochemical concepts of the refinement of bioresponsive drug delivery are "
"presented in detail alongside a variety of current approaches employed in the "
"development of zero order release systems."
msgstr ""
"Cette réimpression à couverture souple couvre un large éventail de sujets en "
"pharmacologie. Les concepts physico-chimiques de l'affinement de "
"l'administration de médicaments bioréactifs sont présentés en détail, ainsi "
"qu'une variété d'approches actuelles employées dans le développement de "
"systèmes de libération d'ordre zéro."

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Using Art to Treat Eating Disorders"
msgid_plural "copies of Using Art to Treat Eating Disorders"
msgstr[0] "Utiliser l'Art pour Traiter les Troubles Alimentaires"
msgstr[1] "copies de Utiliser l'Art pour Traiter les Troubles Alimentaires"
msgstr[2] "copies de Utiliser l'Art pour Traiter les Troubles Alimentaires"

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Description of "Using Art to Treat Eating Disorders"
msgid ""
"An introductory guide for those wanting to explore the use of art to address "
"eating disorders.  Art therapy is a particularly effective therapeutic "
"intervention, as it allows people to express uncomfortable thoughts and "
"feelings nonverbally."
msgstr ""
"Un guide d'introduction pour ceux qui souhaitent explorer l'utilisation de "
"l'art pour traiter les troubles de l'alimentation. L'art-thérapie est une "
"intervention thérapeutique particulièrement efficace, car elle permet aux "
"personnes d'exprimer non verbalement des pensées et des sentiments "
"désagréables."

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "A Clinical Guide to Video Gamers"
msgid_plural "copies of A Clinical Guide to Video Gamers"
msgstr[0] "Un Guide Clinique sur les Joueurs de Jeux Vidéos"
msgstr[1] "copies de Un Guide Clinique sur les Joueurs de Jeux Vidéos"
msgstr[2] "copies de Un Guide Clinique sur les Joueurs de Jeux Vidéos"

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Description of "A Clinical Guide to Video Gamers"
msgid ""
"This scholarly work considers the role that games play in psychological "
"experiences and mental health.  Chapters examine the factors that compel "
"individual gamers to select and identify with particular games and "
"characters, as well as the different play styles, genres, and archetypes "
"common in video games."
msgstr ""
"This scholarly work considers the role that games play in psychological "
"experiences and mental health. Chapters examine the factors that compel "
"individual gamers to select and identify with particular games and "
"characters, as well as the different play styles, genres, and archetypes "
"common in video games."

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Paranoia and the History of Madness"
msgid_plural "copies of Paranoia and the History of Madness"
msgstr[0] "Paranoïa et l'Histoire de la Folie"
msgstr[1] "copies de Paranoïa et l'Histoire de la Folie"
msgstr[2] "copies de Paranoïa et l'Histoire de la Folie"

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Description of "Paranoia and the History of Madness"
msgid ""
"This book is an analysis of the use and misuse of paranoia throughout history "
"and in contemporary society.  The impact of paranoia on societies is explored "
"in detail."
msgstr ""
"Ce livre est une analyse de l'utilisation et de l'abus de la paranoïa à "
"travers l'histoire et dans la société contemporaine. L'impact de la paranoïa "
"sur les sociétés est exploré en détail."

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Psychoanalysis and Colonialism"
msgid_plural "copies of Psychoanalysis and Colonialism"
msgstr[0] "Psychanalyse et Colonialisme "
msgstr[1] "copies de Psychanalyse et Colonialisme "
msgstr[2] "copies de Psychanalyse et Colonialisme "

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Description of "Psychoanalysis and Colonialism"
msgid ""
"Freud referred to women's sexuality as a \"dark continent\" for "
"psychoanalysis, drawing on colonial use of the same phrase to refer to "
"Africa.  This book details how the problematic universalism of psychoanalysis "
"led theorists to reject its relevance for postcolonial critique."
msgstr ""
"Freud a qualifié la sexualité des femmes de « continent noir » pour la "
"psychanalyse, s'inspirant de l'utilisation coloniale de la même expression "
"pour désigner l'Afrique. Ce livre explique comment l'universalisme "
"problématique de la psychanalyse a conduit les théoriciens à rejeter sa "
"pertinence pour la critique postcoloniale."

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Psychology of Stalking"
msgid_plural "copies of The Psychology of Stalking"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Description of "The Psychology of Stalking"
msgid ""
"This book explores stalking from social, psychiatric, psychological and "
"behavioral perspectives.  Topics include psychiatric diagnoses, "
"offender-victim typologies, cyberstalking, false victimization syndrome, "
"erotomania, domestic violence, the stalking of public figures, and many other "
"aspects of stalking."
msgstr ""
"Cet ouvrage explore le harcèlement sous l'angle social, psychiatrique, "
"psychologique et comportemental. Il aborde notamment les diagnostics "
"psychiatriques, les typologies auteur-victime, le cyberharcèlement, le "
"syndrome de la fausse victimisation, l'érotomanie, la violence domestique, le "
"harcèlement de personnalités publiques et bien d'autres aspects du "
"harcèlement."

