msgstr[2] "copies du Talmud, Vol. 7, Traité Shevi'it (Partie 2)"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 7, Tractate Shevi'it (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 7 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Shevi'it.  It "
"continues the discussion of the Shemitah year, the seventh year where fields "
"must lie fallow."
msgstr ""
"Ceci est volume 7 de 51, contenant la deuxième partie du Traité Shevi'it, "
"continuant de discuter de l'année Shemitah, la septième année où les champs "
"doivent rester en jachère."

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 8, Tractate Terumot (Part 1)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 8, Tractate Terumot (Part 1)"
msgstr[0] "Talmud, Vol. 8, Traité Terumot (Partie 1)"
msgstr[1] "copies du Talmud, Vol. 8, Traité Terumot (Partie 1)"
msgstr[2] "copies du Talmud, Vol. 8, Traité Terumot (Partie 1)"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 8, Tractate Terumot (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 8 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Terumot.  It "
"discusses terumot, portions of agriculture produce that are given directly to "
"the Kohanim priestly class."
msgstr ""
"Ceci est volume 8 de 51, contenant la première partie du Traité Terumot, et "
"traitant du terumot, la portion des produits agricoles directement donnée aux "
"prêtres Kohanim."

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 9, Tractate Terumot (Part 2)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 9, Tractate Terumot (Part 2)"
msgstr[0] "Talmud, Vol. 9, Traité Terumot (Partie 2)"
msgstr[1] "copies du Talmud, Vol. 9, Traité Terumot (Partie 2)"
msgstr[2] "copies du Talmud, Vol. 9, Traité Terumot (Partie 2)"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 9, Tractate Terumot (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 9 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Terumot.  It "
"continues the discussion of terumot, portions of agriculture produce that are "
"given directly to the Kohanim priestly class."
msgstr ""
"Ceci est volume 9 de 51, contenant la deuxième partie du Traité Terumot, et "
"continue d'élaborer sur le terumot, la portion des produits agricoles "
"directement donnée aux prêtres Kohanim."

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 10, Tractate Maasrot"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 10, Tractate Maasrot"
msgstr[0] "Talmud, Vol. 10, Traité Maasrot"
msgstr[1] "copies du Talmud, Vol. 10, Traité Maasrot"
msgstr[2] "copies du Talmud, Vol. 10, Traité Maasrot"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 10, Tractate Maasrot" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 10 of 51, containing Tractate Maasrot.  It discusses the "
"separation of the harvest into tithes, and the portions given to the Tribe of "
"Levi, the poor, or the people of Jerusalem."
msgstr ""
"Ceci est volume 10 de 51, et contient le Traité Maasrot et traitant de la "
"séparation de la moisson en différentes dîmes, et les portions réservées pour "
"la Tribu de Levi, les pauvres ou le peuple de Jérusalem."

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 11, Tractate Maaser Sheni"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 11, Tractate Maaser Sheni"
msgstr[0] "Talmud, Vol. 11, Traité Maaser Sheni"
msgstr[1] "copies du Talmud, Vol. 11, Traité Maaser Sheni"
msgstr[2] "copies du Talmud, Vol. 11, Traité Maaser Sheni"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 11, Tractate Maaser Sheni" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 11 of 51, containing Tractate Maaser Sheni.  It discusses the "
"practice of consuming a portion of the yearly harvest in Jerusalem, or "
"exchanging it for money used to buy food in Jerusalem to hold a feast."
msgstr ""
"Ceci est volume 11 de 51, et contient le Traité Maaser Sheni, traitant de la "
"pratique de consommer une portion de la récolte annuelle à Jérusalem, ou de "
"l'échanger pour de l'argent utilisé pour acheter de la nourriture à Jérusalem "
"pour organiser un banquet."

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 12, Tractate Challah"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 12, Tractate Challah"
msgstr[0] "Talmud, Vol. 12, Traité Challah"
msgstr[1] "copies du Talmud, Vol. 12, Traité Challah"
msgstr[2] "copies du Talmud, Vol. 12, Traité Challah"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 12, Tractate Challah" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 12 of 51, containing Tractate Challah.  It discusses the "
"practice of baking bread with the first portion of harvested grain and "
"tithing it as an offering."
msgstr ""
"Ceci est volume 12 de 51 et contient le Traité Challah, traitant de la "
"pratique de fabriquer du pain avec la première portion du grain moissonné et "
"de payer la dîme avec celui-ci."

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 13, Tractates Orlah & Bikkurim"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 13, Tractates Orlah & Bikkurim"
msgstr[0] "Talmud, Vol. 13, Traités Orlah et Bikkurim"
msgstr[1] "copies du Talmud, Vol. 13, Traités Orlah et Bikkurim"
msgstr[2] "copies du Talmud, Vol. 13, Traités Orlah et Bikkurim"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 13, Tractates Orlah & Bikkurim" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 13 of 51, containing Tractates Orlah and Bikkurim.  Both "
"tractates discuss the practice of letting a fruit tree grow for three years "
"before harvesting it."
msgstr ""
"Ceci est volume 13 de 51 et contient les Traité Orlah et Bikkurim, les deux "
"traités concernant la pratique de laisser un arbre fruitier pousser trois ans "
"avant de cueillir ses fruits."

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 14, Tractate Shabbat (Part 1)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 14, Tractate Shabbat (Part 1)"
msgstr[0] "Talmud, Vol. 14, Traité Shabbat (Partie 1)"
msgstr[1] "copies du Talmud, Vol. 14, Traité Shabbat (Partie 1)"
msgstr[2] "copies du Talmud, Vol. 14, Traité Shabbat (Partie 1)"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 14, Tractate Shabbat (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 14 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Shabbat.  It "
"discusses the thirty-nine types of prohibited labor."
msgstr ""
"Ceci est volume 14 de 51, contenant la première partie du Traité Shabbat, "
"concernant les trente-neuf types de labeurs interdits durant le Shabbat."

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 15, Tractate Shabbat (Part 2)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 15, Tractate Shabbat (Part 2)"
msgstr[0] "Talmud, Vol. 15, Traité Shabbat (Partie 2)"
msgstr[1] "copies du Talmud, Vol. 15, Traité Shabbat (Partie 2)"
msgstr[2] "copies du Talmud, Vol. 15, Traité Shabbat (Partie 2)"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 15, Tractate Shabbat (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 15 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Shabbat.  It "
"discusses the prohibitions of carrying items or transporting animals on "
"Shabbat."
msgstr ""
"Ceci est volume 15 de 51, contenant la deuxième partie du Traité Shabbat, "
"concernant les interdictions divers sur le transport d'animaux ou d'objets "
"durant le Shabbat."

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 16, Tractate Shabbat (Part 3)"
