msgstr[2] "morceaux de gras contaminé"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "chunk of tainted fat"
msgid ""
"A watery yellow glob of fat from some unnatural creature or other.  You could "
"eat it, but it will poison you."
msgstr ""
"De la graisse jaune et visqueuse d'une créature contre nature. Vous pourriez "
"en manger mais ça vous empoisonnera."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
