#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw hide"
msgid_plural "raw hide"
msgstr[0] "peau brute"
msgstr[1] "peau brute"
msgstr[2] "peau brute"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "raw hide"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from an animal.  You can cure it for "
"storage and tanning, or eat it if you're desperate enough."
msgstr ""
"Une peau pliée récupérée sur un animal. Vous pouvez la nettoyer pour la "
"stocker et la tanner, ou la manger si vous êtes suffisamment désespéré."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tainted hide"
msgid_plural "tainted hide"
msgstr[0] "peau contaminée"
msgstr[1] "peau contaminée"
msgstr[2] "peau contaminée"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "tainted hide"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from an unnatural creature.  The smell "
"of rot is overwhelming, and it has an ghastly unnatural feeling with a wide "
"variety of cuts, divots, and malformed lumps covering the sickly green-gray "
"skin.  This can't be used for anything useful."
msgstr ""
"Une section de peau brute pliée avec précaution ayant été extraite d'un "
"cadavre ambulant.  L'odeur de décomposition s'en émanant est accablante et "
"les coupures, ganglions et creux parsemant sa surface vert grisâtre rende "
"celle-ci absolument repoussante au toucher.  Vous ne pensez pas qu'il soit "
"possible d'en faire quoi que ce soit d'utile."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tainted skin scraps"
msgid_plural "tainted skin scraps"
msgstr[0] "morceau de peau contaminée"
msgstr[1] "morceaux de peau contaminée"
msgstr[2] "morceaux de peau contaminée"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "tainted skin scraps"
msgid ""
"Shredded scraps of raw skin from an unnatural creature.  It can't have much "
"use."
msgstr ""
"Des lambeaux de peau pourris issus d'une créature réanimée, plus ou moins "
"inutile pour quoi que ce soi."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw human skin"
msgid_plural "raw human skin"
msgstr[0] "peau humaine brute"
msgstr[1] "peau humaine brute"
msgstr[2] "peau humaine brute"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "raw human skin"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from a human.  Despite some dubious "
"historical accounts, the usefulness of human skin is limited, and can't be "
"made into leather.  The skin is still edible, if you're that desperate."
msgstr ""
"Une section de peau humaine brute pliée avec précaution.  Malgré de "
"nombreuses rumeurs douteuses, l' utilité de la peau humain comme matériau est "
"assez limitée, et ne peut en aucun cas être utilisée pour fabriquer du cuir.  "
"Toujours comestible sous cette forme, si vous êtes assez désespéré·e pour "
"considérer manger cela."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw demihuman skin"
msgid_plural "raw demihuman skin"
msgstr[0] "peau demi-humaine brute"
msgstr[1] "peau demi-humaine brute"
msgstr[2] "peau demi-humaine brute"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "raw demihuman skin"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from a demihuman.  Despite being from a "
"human-enough body, the leather has this distinct unnatural and alien feeling "
"to it, and would be a very poor substitute for leather.  The skin is still "
"edible, if you're that desperate."
msgstr ""
"Une section de peau brute pliée délicatement ayant été extraite d'une "
"créature humanoïde étrange.  Bien que celle-ci soit issue d'un corps plus ou "
"moins humain, le cuir possède une texture distincte et atypique qui ferait "
"d'elle un très mauvais substitut pour du vrai cuir si vous décidiez de la "
"traiter.  Toujours comestible sous cette forme, si vous êtes assez "
"désespéré·e pour considérer manger cela."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw pelt"
msgid_plural "raw pelt"
msgstr[0] "fourrure brute"
msgstr[1] "fourrure brute"
msgstr[2] "fourrure brute"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "raw pelt"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from a fur-bearing animal.  It still "
"has the fur attached.  You can cure it for storage and tanning, or eat it if "
"you're desperate enough."
msgstr ""
"Une fourrure pliée récupérée sur un animal. Vous pouvez la nettoyer pour la "
"stocker et la tanner, ou la manger si vous êtes suffisamment désespéré."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tainted pelt"
msgid_plural "tainted pelt"
msgstr[0] "fourrure contaminée"
msgstr[1] "fourrure contaminée"
msgstr[2] "fourrure contaminée"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "tainted pelt"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw pelt harvested from an unnatural creature.  The smell "
"of rot is overwhelming, with bits of flesh cling to the mangy, sickly patches "
"of fur still present on the pelt.  This can't be used for anything useful."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw human pelt"
msgid_plural "raw human pelt"
msgstr[0] "fourrure humaine brute"
msgstr[1] "fourrure humaine brute"
msgstr[2] "fourrure humaine brute"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "raw human pelt"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from a fur-bearing mutant human.  It "
"still has the fur attached.  You can cure it for storage and tanning, or eat "
"it if you're desperate enough."
msgstr ""
"Une fourrure brute attentivement pliée ayant été dépecée d'un humain mutant. "
"Vous pouvez la nettoyer pour la stocker et la tanner, ou la manger si vous "
"êtes suffisamment désespéré(e)."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "seeping heart"
msgid_plural "seeping hearts"
msgstr[0] "cœur suintant"
msgstr[1] "cœurs suintants"
msgstr[2] "cœurs suintants"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#. ~ Description of "seeping heart"
msgid ""
"A thick mass of flesh superficially resembling a mammalian heart.  It's the "
"size of your fist and covered in dimpled grooves."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "putrid heart"
msgid_plural "putrid hearts"
msgstr[0] "cœur putride"
msgstr[1] "cœurs putrides"
msgstr[2] "cœurs putrides"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "putrid heart"
msgid ""
"A thick, hulking mass of flesh that's easily the size of your head, "
"superficially resembling a mammalian heart and covered in ribbed grooves.  "
"It's still full of whatever passes for blood in jabberwocks, and is heavy in "
"your hands.  After everything you've seen lately, you can't help but remember "
"old sayings about eating the hearts of your enemies…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "desiccated putrid heart"
msgid_plural "desiccated putrid hearts"
msgstr[0] "cœur putride desséché"
msgstr[1] "cœurs putrides desséchés"
msgstr[2] "cœurs putrides desséchés"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "desiccated putrid heart"
msgid ""
"A huge strip of muscle - all that remains of a putrid heart that has been "
"sliced open and drained of blood.  It could be eaten if you're hungry, but "
"looks *disgusting*."
msgstr ""
"Une énorme bande de muscle, tout ce qui reste d'un cœur putride ayant été "
"ouvert et saigné. Vous pourriez mangez ceci si vous avez faim, mais son "
"apparence est repoussante."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "reverberating organ"
msgid_plural "reverberating organs"
msgstr[0] "organe réverbérant"
msgstr[1] "organes réverbérants"
msgstr[2] "organes réverbérants"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "reverberating organ"
msgid ""
"A tubular leathery organ of an alien creature, comprised of tough muscle "
"tissue.  Dozens of deep ridges make up the slimy surface, like a disgusting "
"rendition of an accordion."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "alien grub"
msgid_plural "alien grubs"
msgstr[0] "asticot étrange"
msgstr[1] "asticots étranges"
msgstr[2] "asticots étranges"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "alien grub"
msgid ""
"A segmented chitinous shell with curious markings is sheltering a weird alien "
"larva, squirming and wiggling around.  Theorizing what it could eventually "
"turn into, you're unsure if it is safe to keep around."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "alien fronds"
msgid_plural "alien fronds"
msgstr[0] "frondes extraterrestres"
msgstr[1] "frondes extraterrestres"
msgstr[2] "frondes extraterrestres"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "alien fronds"
msgid ""
"The fleshy fronds harvested from an alien plant.  Eating these membranous "
"leaves and gut-like stems is likely a terrible idea, and yet they have a "
"paradoxically pleasant and inviting sweet smell.  Might be non-vegan."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "leech flower"
msgid_plural "leech flowers"
msgstr[0] "fleur sangsue"
msgstr[1] "fleurs sangsues"
msgstr[2] "fleurs sangsues"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "leech flower"
msgid ""
"The alien beauty of this indigo flower is betrayed by its disgustingly fleshy "
"composition.  What from afar appear to be petals are but layered membranes of "
"transparent veiny flesh, given color by a covering of blue iridescent ichor.  "
"Even if it is certainly poisonous, it has a pleasant medicinal smell to it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "leech flower"
msgid "Even a close smell of this alien flower feels deeply intoxicating."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
