#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid "A large clump of frog eggs.  They're gelatinous and transparent."
msgstr "Un gros tas d'œufs de grenouille, gélatineux et transparents."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"This is a dense cluster of dark frog's eggs, not dissimilar in appearance to "
"caviar."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'un amas dense d'œufs de grenouille foncés, dont l'aspect n'est "
"pas très différent de celui du caviar."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"A thin film of frog eggs floats together atop the water in a roughly circular "
"mass."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'un amas dense d'œufs de grenouille foncés, dont l'aspect n'est "
"pas très différent de celui du caviar."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid "These eggs float in long strands, drifting in the still water."
msgstr "Ces œufs flottent en longs filaments, dérivant dans l'eau calme."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid "A spiral strand of frog eggs adorns a patch of underwater vegetation."
msgstr "Une spirale d'œufs de grenouille orne une parcelle de végétation sous-marine."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"A loose grouping of surprisingly few frog's eggs, anchored to submerged "
"vegetation."
msgstr ""
"Groupement lâche d'un nombre étonnamment faible d'oeufs de grenouille, ancrés "
"dans la végétation submergée."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid "A small patch of frog's eggs rests on the water's surface."
msgstr "Un petit groupe d'œufs de grenouille repose à la surface de l'eau."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"A tight, spherical cluster of eggs, often found near submerged vegetation.  "
"This cluster is polar, with dark pigment collected near the tops of the eggs "
"and white left on the underside."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"A globular mass of frog's eggs.  The individual eggs are colored a dark brown "
"on top and a yellow-cream on the bottom."
msgstr ""
"Un amas globulaire d'œufs de grenouille.  Le haut des hauts est coloré d'un "
"marron sombre, le bas d'un jaune crémeux."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid "A thin sheet of clear, gelatinous eggs with dark embryos peppered throughout."
msgstr ""
"Une fine couche d'œufs gélatineux et transparents avec des petits embryions "
"noirs tâchant le centre de chaque œuf."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"This softball-sized mass of gooey eggs clings together like a bunch of soft, "
"transparent grapes.  The \"seeds\" inside these appear to be growing legs."
msgstr ""
"Cet amas d'œufs gluants de la taille d'un point ressemble à une grappe de "
"raisins mous et transparents.  Les \"graines\" à l'intérieur on l'air d'être "
"en train de pousser des jambes."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"Several short strands of tightly clustered black eggs connected together by "
"their viscous coverings."
msgstr ""
"Plusieurs lanières courtes d'œufs noirs serrés les uns aux autres connectées "
"entre elles par la surface des globules visqueux."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cluster of giant frog's eggs"
msgid_plural "clusters of giant frog's eggs"
msgstr[0] "grappe d'œufs de grenouille géants"
msgstr[1] "grappes d'œufs de grenouille géants"
msgstr[2] "grappes d'œufs de grenouille géants"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of giant frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"A large clump of very large frog eggs.  They're gelatinous, transparent and "
"larger than even chicken's eggs."
msgstr ""
"Un gros amas de très gros œufs de grenouille. Ils sont gélatineux, "
"transparents et plus gros que les œufs de poule."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of giant frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"From a distance you could mistake it for a cluster of gigantic caviar.  It is "
"only on close inspection that you can make out the faint translucence of "
"these softball-sized frog eggs."
msgstr ""
"De loin, on pourrait croire qu'il s'agit d'une grappe de caviar gigantesque. "
"Ce n'est qu'en y regardant de près que l'on peut distinguer la faible "
"translucidité de ces œufs de grenouille de la taille d'un ballon de football."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of giant frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"A thick flotilla of enormous frog eggs floats together atop the water in a "
"roughly circular mass."
msgstr ""
"Une épaisse flottille d'énormes œufs de grenouilles flotte sur l'eau en une "
"masse à peu près circulaire."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of giant frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"Looking like a submerged buoy-line, this long strand of softball-sized, "
"gelatinous eggs floats gently in the still water."
msgstr ""
"Semblable à une ligne de bouée immergée, ce long cordon d'œufs gélatineux de "
"la taille d'une balle molle flotte doucement dans l'eau calme."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of giant frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"This is a spiral strand of giant frog eggs.  Its increased weight and size "
"nearly smothers the submerged vegetation it clings to."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'une spirale d'œufs de grenouilles géantes. Son poids et sa taille "
"élevés étouffent presque la végétation submergée à laquelle il s'accroche."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of giant frog's eggs"
msgid "A patch of giant frog's eggs resembling a very thick, clear sack of oranges."
msgstr ""
"Un amas d'œufs de grenouille énormes ressemblant un sac translucide de "
"grosses oranges."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of giant frog's eggs"
msgid "These golfball-sized frog eggs cling together by their sticky membranes."
msgstr ""
"Des œufs de grenouille de la taille de boules de golf attachés les uns aux "
"autres avec des membranes gluantes."

