msgstr[1] "tabac à mâcher"
msgstr[2] "tabac à mâcher"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "chewing tobacco"
msgid ""
"Mint-flavored chewing tobacco.  While absolutely terrible for your health, it "
"was once a favorite among baseball players, cowboys, and other macho types."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hydrogen peroxide"
msgid_plural "hydrogen peroxide"
msgstr[0] "peroxyde d'hydrogène"
msgstr[1] "peroxyde d'hydrogène"
msgstr[2] "peroxyde d'hydrogène"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "hydrogen peroxide"
msgid ""
"Dilute hydrogen peroxide, for use as an antiseptic and for bleaching hair or "
"textiles.  Foams a little when in contact with organic matter, but otherwise "
"harmless."
msgstr ""
"Eau oxygénée diluée, à utiliser comme antiseptique et pour blanchir les "
"cheveux ou les textiles. Mousse un petit peu en contact avec de la matière "
"organique, mais sans aucun danger."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "skunk spray neutralizing solution"
msgid_plural "skunk spray neutralizing solution"
msgstr[0] "solution neutralisante de de spray de moufette"
msgstr[1] "solution neutralisante de de spray de moufette"
msgstr[2] "solution neutralisante de de spray de moufette"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "skunk spray neutralizing solution"
msgid ""
"A combination of hydrogen peroxide, baking soda, and dish soap that works "
"together to transform skunk spray thiocetates into odorless acids."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "skunk spray neutralizing
#. solution"
msgid "You cover yourself in the solution everywhere the spray touched your body."
msgstr "Vous vous couvrez de solution partout où le spray touche votre corps."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "cigarette"
#. ~ Description of variant "cigarette" of item "cigarette"
msgid ""
"A mixture of dried tobacco leaf, pesticides, and chemical additives, rolled "
"into a filtered paper tube.  Stimulates mental acuity and reduces appetite.  "
"Highly addictive and hazardous to health, but lung cancer is kind of the "
"least of your concerns at this point."
msgstr ""
"Un mélange de feuilles de tabacs séchées, de pesticides et d'additifs "
"chimiques roulés dans un tube de papier et équipés d'un filtre. Elles "
"stimulent l'acuité mentale et réduisent l'appétit. Addictives, elles sont un "
"danger pour votre santé, mais un cancer du poumon dans 20 ans est maintenant "
"le moindre de vos soucis."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "cigarette"
msgid "menthol cigarette"
msgid_plural "menthol cigarettes"
msgstr[0] "cigarette au menthol"
msgstr[1] "cigarettes au menthol"
msgstr[2] "cigarettes au menthol"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of variant "menthol cigarette" of item "cigarette"
msgid ""
"A cigarette with a menthol flavor, the only type of flavored cigarette "
"permitted for sale in the US.  The FDA had previously proposed a ban on them, "
"but the world ended before it could be implemented.  It feels somewhat nicer "
"to smoke than a regular cigarette."
msgstr ""

