#. ~ Description of variant "Glock 20 pistol" of item "Glock pistol"
msgid ""
"A full-sized version of the highly successful Glock, chambered in "
"hard-hitting 10mm Auto.  The third model of Glock designed, all other "
"full-sized, large framed Glocks are adaptations of this one."
msgstr ""
"Une version pleine grandeur du très populaire Glock, chambré en 10 mm Auto. "
"Le troisième modèle de Glock conçu, tous les autres Glocks de grande taille "
"et à cadre large sont des adaptations de celui-ci."

#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
