msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/gun/4570.json
#. ~ Description of gun "breech-loading reproduction rifle"
#. ~ Description of "breech-loading reproduction rifle"
msgid ""
"A reproduction of an antique single-shot .45-70 rifle once used to hunt "
"buffalo and other large game in the late 19th Century.  Highly accurate and "
"powerful for the time, this one is made to handle modern smokeless ammunition."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/gun/4570.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "breech-loading reproduction rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "breech-loading reproduction rifle"
msgid "1874 Sharps"
msgid_plural "1874 Sharpses"
msgstr[0] "fusil 1875 Sharps"
msgstr[1] "fusils 1875 Sharps"
msgstr[2] "fusils 1875 Sharps"

#: data/json/items/gun/4570.json
#. ~ Description of variant "breech-loading reproduction rifle" of gun "1874
#. Sharps"
#. ~ Description of variant "1874 Sharps" of item "breech-loading reproduction
#. rifle"
msgid ""
"The Sharps rifle series are antique, falling block rifles that saw service "
"far back as the American Civil War.  The 1874 Sharps is one of the first "
"rifles to utilize metallic cartridges, a revolutionary technology back in "
"those days.  While they were chambered in 45-70, modern day smokeless loads "
"would blow up older versions.  Thankfully, this reproduction from Uberti can "
"handle modern day 45-70 loads."
msgstr ""
"Les séries de fusils Sharps sont des fusils anciens à bloc tombant qui ont "
"servi dès la guerre de Sécession. Le Sharps 1874 est l'un des premiers fusils "
"à utiliser des cartouches métalliques, une technologie révolutionnaire à "
"l'époque. Alors qu'elles étaient en calibre 45-70, les cartouches sans fumée "
"des temps modernes auraient fait exploser les anciennes versions. "
"Heureusement, cette reproduction d'Uberti peut supporter les charges modernes "
"de 45-70."

#: data/json/items/gun/458wm.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Safari rifle"
msgid_plural "Safari rifles"
msgstr[0] "fusil de Safari"
msgstr[1] "fusils de Safari"
msgstr[2] "fusils de Safari"

#: data/json/items/gun/458wm.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Safari rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Safari rifle"
msgid ""
"A bolt-action sporting rifle for hunting dangerous game, chambered in the "
"powerful .458 Winchester Magnum cartridge."
msgstr ""
"Un fusil à verrou conçu pour la chasse au gibier dangereux particulièrement "
"puissant grace aux cartouches de calibre .458 Winchester Magnum pour "
"lesquelles il est chambré."

#: data/json/items/gun/458wm.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Safari rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Safari rifle"
msgid "Winchester Model 70 Safari rifle"
msgid_plural "Winchester Model 70 Safari rifles"
msgstr[0] "fusil Winchester Model 70 Safari"
msgstr[1] "fusils Winchester Model 70 Safari"
msgstr[2] "fusils Winchester Model 70 Safari"

#: data/json/items/gun/458wm.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Safari rifle" of gun "Winchester Model 70 Safari
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Winchester Model 70 Safari rifle" of item "Safari
#. rifle"
msgid ""
"This is a Winchester Model 70 Safari Express chambered in .458 Winchester "
"Magnum, a fine bolt-action rifle for hunting dangerous game.  A fixture of "
"American gun culture, the Model 70 has been held in high regard by shooters "
"since it was introduced in 1936."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'une Winchester Model 70 Safari Express en calibre .458 Winchester "
"Magnum, un excellent fusil à verrou pour la chasse au gibier dangereux. Le "
"modèle 70, qui fait partie intégrante de la culture américaine en matière "
"d'armes à feu, est tenu en haute estime par les tireurs depuis son "
"introduction en 1936."

#: data/json/items/gun/45colt.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "double-barrel derringer"
msgid_plural "double-barrel derringers"
msgstr[0] "pistolet derringer à double baril"
msgstr[1] "pistolets derringer à double baril"
msgstr[2] "pistolets derringer à double baril"

#: data/json/items/gun/45colt.json
#. ~ Description of gun "double-barrel derringer"
#. ~ Description of "double-barrel derringer"
msgid ""
"The Bond Arms Derringer is a series of multi-barrel compact pistols.  Most "
"commonly chambered for .45 Colt, with chambers long enough to accept .410 "
"shotgun shells."
msgstr ""
"Le Bond Arms Derringer est une série de pistolets compacts à canons "
"multiples. Ils sont le plus souvent en calibre .45 Colt, avec des chambres "
"suffisamment longues pour accepter des cartouches de fusil de chasse .410."

#: data/json/items/gun/45colt.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "double-barrel derringer"
#. ~ Variant name of item "double-barrel derringer"
msgid "Bond Arms Derringer"
msgid_plural "Bond Arms Derringers"
msgstr[0] "Bond Arms Derringer"
msgstr[1] "Bond Arms Derringers"
msgstr[2] "Bond Arms Derringers"

#: data/json/items/gun/45colt.json
#. ~ Description of variant "double-barrel derringer" of gun "Bond Arms
#. Derringer"
#. ~ Description of variant "Bond Arms Derringer" of item "double-barrel
#. derringer"
msgid ""
"Derringers are old-fashioned conceal carry weapons, usually sporting one or "
"two barrels.  The Bond Arms Derringer is a modern series of multi-barrel "
"compact pistols.  Most commonly chambered for .45 Colt, with chambers long "
"enough to accept .410 shotgun shells.  Though, with modern handguns, "
"derringers have become less and less practical as a conceal carry option."
msgstr ""
"Les Derringers sont des armes de port dissimulé à l'ancienne, généralement "
"dotées d'un ou deux canons. Le Bond Arms Derringer est une série moderne de "
"pistolets compacts à plusieurs canons. Ils sont le plus souvent en calibre 45 "
"Colt, avec des chambres suffisamment longues pour accepter des cartouches de "
"fusil de chasse de calibre 410. Cependant, avec les armes de poing modernes, "
"les Derringer sont devenus de moins en moins pratiques comme option de port "
"dissimulé."

#: data/json/items/gun/45colt.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "cowboy six-shooter"
msgid_plural "cowboy six-shooters"
msgstr[0] "revolver à six coups de cowboy"
msgstr[1] "revolvers à six coups de cowboy"
msgstr[2] "revolvers à six coups de cowboy"

#: data/json/items/gun/45colt.json
#. ~ Description of gun "cowboy six-shooter"
#. ~ Description of "cowboy six-shooter"
msgid ""
"A reproduction of an antique firearm, chambered in .45 Colt.  Due to the lack "
"of a swing-out cylinder, each cartridge must be reloaded and ejected manually."
msgstr ""
"Reproduction d'une arme à feu ancienne, au calibre .45 Colt. En raison de "
"l'absence de cylindre pivotant, chaque cartouche doit être rechargée et "
"éjectée manuellement."

#: data/json/items/gun/45colt.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "cowboy six-shooter"
#. ~ Variant name of item "cowboy six-shooter"
msgid "Colt Single Action Army"
msgid_plural "Colt Single Action Armies"
msgstr[0] "revolver Colt Single Action Army"
msgstr[1] "revolvers Colt Single Action Army"
msgstr[2] "revolvers Colt Single Action Army"

#: data/json/items/gun/45colt.json
#. ~ Description of variant "cowboy six-shooter" of gun "Colt Single Action
#. Army"
#. ~ Description of variant "Colt Single Action Army" of item "cowboy six-
#. shooter"
msgid ""
"A famous revolver for many westerns, the Colt Single Action Army has seen "
"plenty of military service, production ends, and production restarts.  While "
"originally in a large amount of chamberings, it is mostly found in .45 Colt "
"chamberings today.  While reloading is slow due to the lack of a swing-out "
"cylinder, it was still much faster than earlier revolvers of the time thanks "
"to using metallic cartridges.  It's also sometimes referred to as the "
"Peacemaker, Model P, M1873 or shortened to SAA."
msgstr ""
"Célèbre revolver de nombreux westerns, le Colt Single Action Army a connu de "
"nombreuses périodes de service militaire, d'arrêt et de reprise de la "
"production. Bien qu'il ait été fabriqué à l'origine dans un grand nombre de "
"calibres, on le trouve aujourd'hui principalement dans le calibre .45 Colt. "
"Bien que le rechargement soit lent en raison de l'absence de cylindre "
"pivotant, il était beaucoup plus rapide que les premiers revolvers de "
"l'époque grâce à l'utilisation de cartouches métalliques. Il est aussi "
"parfois appelé Peacemaker, Model P, M1873 ou abrégé en SAA."

#: data/json/items/gun/45colt.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "cowboy six-shooter"
#. ~ Variant name of item "cowboy six-shooter"
msgid "Uberti 1873 Cattleman"
msgid_plural "Uberti 1873 Cattlemans"
msgstr[0] "revolver Uberti 1873 Cattleman"
msgstr[1] "revolvers Uberti 1873 Cattleman"
msgstr[2] "revolvers Uberti 1873 Cattleman"

#: data/json/items/gun/45colt.json
#. ~ Description of variant "cowboy six-shooter" of gun "Uberti 1873
#. Cattleman"
#. ~ Description of variant "Uberti 1873 Cattleman" of item "cowboy six-
#. shooter"
msgid ""
"This 7.5\" barreled Uberti Cattleman is a modern reproduction of the "
"legendary Colt Single Action Army, or Colt Peacemaker, one of the first "
"revolvers to use a modern self-contained cartridge.  Made famous by Westerns, "
"it is still in demand for Cowboy Action Shooting, reenactors, and collectors. "
" Unlike modern revolvers, the cylinder cannot swing out for loading, and "
"spent brass must be ejected one at a time."
msgstr ""
"Cet Uberti Cattleman à canon de 7,5 pouces est une reproduction moderne du "
"légendaire Colt Single Action Army, ou Colt Peacemaker, l'un des premiers "
"revolvers à utiliser une cartouche moderne autonome. Rendu célèbre par les "
"westerns, il est toujours très demandé par les amateurs de cow-boys, les "
"reconstituteurs et les collectionneurs. Contrairement aux revolvers modernes, "
"le barillet ne peut pas pivoter pour le chargement et les douilles doivent "
"être éjectées une par une."

#: data/json/items/gun/45colt.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid ".45/.410 shotshell revolver"
msgid_plural ".45/.410 shotshell revolvers"
msgstr[0] "Revolver à cartouches .45/.410"
msgstr[1] "Revolvers à cartouches .45/.410"
msgstr[2] "Revolvers à cartouches .45/.410"

#: data/json/items/gun/45colt.json
#. ~ Description of gun ".45/.410 shotshell revolver"
#. ~ Description of ".45/.410 shotshell revolver"
msgid ""
"A stainless steel 5 shot revolver, capable of firing .410 shells or 45 Colt "
"cartridges."
msgstr ""
"Un revolver à 5 coups en acier inoxydable, capable de tirer des cartouches de "
".410 ou de 45 Colt."

#: data/json/items/gun/45colt.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".45/.410 shotshell revolver"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".45/.410 shotshell revolver"
msgid "Taurus Judge"
msgid_plural "Taurus Judges"
msgstr[0] ".45/.410 revolver à cartouches (le Juge Taureau)"
msgstr[1] ".45/.410 revolvers à cartouches (le Juge Taureau)"
msgstr[2] ".45/.410 revolvers à cartouches (le Juge Taureau)"

#: data/json/items/gun/45colt.json
#. ~ Description of variant ".45/.410 shotshell revolver" of gun "Taurus
#. Judge"
#. ~ Description of variant "Taurus Judge" of item ".45/.410 shotshell
#. revolver"
msgid ""
"Marketed for home defense, the Taurus Judge is a 5 shot cylinder revolver, "
"capable of firing .410 shotshells or .45 Colt cartridges out of it's 3 inch "
"barrel.  While it doesn't compete ballistically with a proper rifle, or even "
"a full length revolver, it's still a handy handgun against the undead and "
"soon to be."
msgstr ""
"Commercialisé pour la défense domestique, le Juge Taureau est un revolver à 5 "
"coups, capable de tirer des cartouches de .410 ou de .45 Colt à partir de son "
"canon de 3 pouces. Bien qu'il ne rivalise pas, sur le plan balistique, avec "
"un véritable fusil, ni même avec un revolver pleine longueur, il reste une "
"arme de poing pratique contre les morts-vivants et ceux qui le deviendront "
"bientôt."

#: data/json/items/gun/46.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "H&K MP7A2"
msgid_plural "H&K MP7A2s"
msgstr[0] "H&K MP7A2"
msgstr[1] "H&K MP7A2s"
msgstr[2] "H&K MP7A2s"

#: data/json/items/gun/46.json
#. ~ Description of gun "H&K MP7A2"
#. ~ Description of "H&K MP7A2"
msgid ""
"Designed as a personal defense weapon, the MP7 fires the high-powered "
"4.6x30mm round while being lightweight, compact in size, and practically "
"recoil-free."
msgstr ""
"Conçu comme arme de défense personnelle, le MP7 tire des balles de 4,6x30 mm "
"très puissantes tout en étant léger, compact et pratiquement sans recul."

#: data/json/items/gun/460sw.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
