msgid_plural "double-barreled shotguns"
msgstr[0] "fusil à pompe à double baril"
msgstr[1] "fusils à pompe à double baril"
msgstr[2] "fusils à pompe à double baril"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "double-barreled shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "double-barreled shotgun"
msgid ""
"The classic double-barreled shotgun, with the barrels arranged side-by-side.  "
"It consists of little more than 2 barrels, a striker to hit the shell, and a "
"wooden stock"
msgstr ""
"Un fusil à pompe à double baril arrangés horizontalement de façon classique.  "
"Les composants ne sont pas grand chose de plus que les barils, des percuteurs "
"pour déclencher les cartouches, et une crosse en bois."

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "double-barreled shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "double-barreled shotgun"
msgid "S&R Ranger 12 gauge shotgun"
msgid_plural "S&R Ranger 12 gauge shotguns"
msgstr[0] "fusil à pompe calibre 12 S&R Ranger"
msgstr[1] "fusils à pompe calibre 12 S&R Ranger"
msgstr[2] "fusils à pompe calibre 12 S&R Ranger"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
