"A reinforced plastic tonfa; the core is filled with capacitors and a "
"high-yield rechargeable storage battery.  When a switch on the handle is "
"pressed, a high-voltage current is transmitted to the two electrodes mounted "
"in the end of the weapon, and by extension to anyone unfortunate enough to be "
"in contact with them.  The integral flashlight is turned on, continually "
"draining power and lighting the surrounding area."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
