"improve USMC hand-to-hand fighting capabilities.  The bayonet is optimized to "
"function as a fighting knife, sporting an ergonomic handle that will minimize "
"hand fatigue during combat.  The blade tip is sharper in profile than other "
"bayonets to assist in penetrating body armor, and also features a small "
"serrated section to provide for some utility."
msgstr ""

