"Lightweight, but a deadly slashing weapon.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the "
"sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"Une épée incurvée associée avec les troupes de cavalerie du début de l'époque "
