#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "sharpened saber"
msgid ""
"What was once a mostly-harmless fencing saber has had its rounded tip snapped "
"off and has been crudely sharpened to a point.  Though it still lacks a "
"cutting edge, it is now considerably more lethal, yet still familiar to the "
"practiced fencer."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "electrified saber"
msgid_plural "electrified sabers"
msgstr[0] "sabre d'escrime électrifié"
msgstr[1] "sabres d'escrime électrifiés"
msgstr[2] "sabres d'escrime électrifiés"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "electrified saber"
msgid ""
"The modifications made to this fencing saber may not be sporting, but they "
"might give you an edge in this final competition.  Extra effort has been made "
"to insulate the grip and a high voltage stun gun has been attached to the "
"guard, wired to the tip along the saber's groove.  Thrusting the sharpened "
"tip into a foe and activating the momentary switch will deliver a painful "
"electric shock."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hollow cane"
