#. ~ Description of "tempered steel broadsword"
msgid ""
"An early modern sword that saw use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  "
"Called 'broad' to contrast with the slimmer rapiers.\n"
"\n"
"Made of tempered steel, this is a masterpiece.  The grip, the balance, the "
"blade, all perfect.  This is the peak of the swordsmith's craft."
msgstr ""
"Une épée du début de l'Époque moderne ayant été utilisée du seizième au "
"dix-huitième siècle. Appelée \"broad\" en contraste avec les rapières plus "
"minces en vogue durant la même période.\n"
"\n"
"Forgée à partir d'acier trempé, cette arme est un chef d'œuvre. La poignée, "
"l'équilibre, la lame, tous parfaits. Ceci est la quintessence de l'art du "
"forgeron."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "broadsword"
msgid ""
"An Early Modern sword that saw use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  "
"This sword appears to be made very poorly, but it should still stand up to a "
"few swings."
msgstr ""
"An Early Modern sword that saw use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th centuries. "
"This sword appears to be made very poorly, but it should still stand up to a "
"few swings."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "broadsword"
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of an Early Modern sword that saw use in the "
"16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  Called 'broad' to contrast with the slimmer "
"rapiers."
msgstr ""

