"A baseball-sized rock with a somewhat sharp edge that also chips in a "
"semi-predictable way if struck.  With the right skills, you could give it a "
"better edge."
msgstr ""
"Une pierre de la taille d'un poing possédant un assez bon tranchant et facile "
"à tailler avec les savoir faire nécessaire."

