"recycler en fil de Nomex."

#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scraps of carpet"
msgid_plural "scraps of carpet"
msgstr[0] "morceaux de moquette"
msgstr[1] "morceaux de moquette"
msgstr[2] "morceaux de moquette"

#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
#. ~ Description of "scraps of carpet"
msgid ""
"A misshapen section of loose carpet.  Not useful for much on its own and can "
"be discarded."
msgstr ""
"Un petit morceaux informe de moquette, pas très utile et probablement juste "
"bon comme combustible."

#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
#. ~ Item name
