#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "brazier"
msgid ""
"A large metal stand used to contain a fire.  Fires set in a brazier will not "
"spread to surrounding flammable objects."
msgstr ""
"Un grand support en métal utilisé pour contenir un feu. Les feus dans un "
"brasero ne se propageront pas aux objets inflammables environnants."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift brazier"
msgid ""
"A portable brazier fashioned from a steel bucket by punching small holes on "
"the sides to improve the air supply.  It is too small to fit any fuel item "
"larger than some splintered wood.  Fires set in this bucket will not spread "
"to surrounding flammable objects."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "hobo stove"
msgid ""
"A small, improvised wood stove, made from a metal can or similar container of "
"the right size.  It's too small to fit anything much larger than splintered "
"wood.  Activate it to deploy."
msgstr ""
"Un petit poêle à bois improvisé, fabriqué à partir d'une boîte de conserve en "
"métal ou un contenant similaire.  Trop petit pour contenir du combustible aux "
"dimensions beaucoup plus grande que des éclats de bois.  Activez l'objet pour "
"le déployer."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "portable stove"
msgid ""
"A foldable wood stove to safely lit fires while camping in the wilderness.  "
"Activate it to deploy."
msgstr ""
"Un poêle pliable utilisée par les campeurs pour cuire de la nourriture avec "
"un risque d'incendie limité. Activez-la pour la déployer."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "fire barrel (200 L)"
#. ~ Description of "fire barrel (100 L)"
msgid ""
"A large metal barrel used to contain a fire.  It has multiple holes punched "
"in its walls for air supply.  Fires set in a fire barrel will not spread to "
"surrounding flammable objects."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "camp chair"
msgid "A folded chair for camping.  Activate it to set it down for a place to sit."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "deck chair"
msgid "Folded deck chair, deploy to sit down."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "folding chair"
msgid "Folded plastic chair on a metal frame, deploy to sit down."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "deployable antenna"
msgid_plural "deployable antennas"
msgstr[0] "antenne déployable"
msgstr[1] "antennes déployables"
msgstr[2] "antennes déployables"

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "deployable antenna"
msgid ""
"A directional antenna and accompanying tripod, folded into a shape vaguely "
"resembling an umbrella."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "cot"
msgid ""
"A military-style folding cot.  While it may not be quite as comfortable as a "
"bed, it's better than slumming it on the ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ "done_message" action message of item "cot"
msgid "You unfold the cot and place it on the ground."
msgstr "Vous dépliez le lit de camp et le placez sur le sol."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "metal butchering rack"
msgid ""
"A metal butchering rack designed to hang a carcass in the air.  It is folded "
"for easy transportation."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "metal smoking rack"
msgid ""
"A metal rack designed to smoke food for better preservation and taste.  It is "
"folded for easy transportation."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "folding table"
msgid ""
"A metal folding table for off-road trips.  It is currently folded for easy "
"transportation."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "leather tarp"
msgid ""
"A large sheet of leather.  You could use it as a picnic blanket, but it's "
"more valuable as a surface for butchering as it does not soak up blood.  It's "
"rolled and ready for carrying."
msgstr ""
"Une large plaque de cuir. Vous pourriez l'utiliser comme une nappe de "
"pique-nique, mais ceci serait mieux utilisée comme une surface sur laquelle "
"dépecer quelque chose et ayant pour avantage de ne pas s'imprégner de sang. "
"Pour l'instant enroulée pour être plus facile à porter."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "fiber mat"
msgid ""
"A large mat woven from fibrous material.  You could use it as a picnic "
"blanket, but it's more valuable as a surface for butchering.  Too thin to be "
"used as a comfortable sleeping mat.  It's rolled and ready for carrying."
msgstr ""
"Un large tapis tissé à partir de fibres grossières. Vous pourriez l'utiliser "
"comme une nappe de pique-nique, mais ceci serait mieux utilisé comme une "
"surface sur laquelle dépecer quelque chose. Trop fin pour dormir dessus "
"confortablement. Pour l'instant enroulé pour être plus facile à porter."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "folded butter churn"
msgid_plural "folded butter churns"
msgstr[0] "baratte à beurre pliée"
msgstr[1] "barattes à beurre pliées"
msgstr[2] "barattes à beurre pliées"

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "folded butter churn"
msgid ""
"A large wooden container used to turn raw milk into butter and buttermilk.  "
"This model uses a foot crank and holds three gallons of raw milk."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "water mill"
msgid ""
"A small water-powered mill that can convert starchy products into flour.  "
"Needs to be placed via the construction menu."
msgstr ""
"Un petit moulin à eau qui permet de transformer les produits amylacés en "
"farine. Doit être placé via le menu de construction."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "wind mill"
msgid ""
"A small wind-powered mill that can convert starchy products into flour.  "
"Needs to be placed via the construction menu."
msgstr ""
"Un petit moulin à vent qui permet de transformer les produits amylacés en "
"farine. Doit être placé via le menu de construction."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "screw press"
msgid ""
"A large screw press for manually pressing oil out of fruit or seed paste.  "
"Needs to be placed via the construction menu."
msgstr ""
"Une grande presse à vis pour extraire manuellement l'huile de la pâte de "
"fruits ou de graines. Doit être placée via le menu de construction."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "manual tire changer"
msgid ""
"A floor-mounted machine containing all the levers, clamps, and mounts "
"required to remove or fit a tire, plus an integrated foot pump to inflate it."
msgstr ""
"Machine montée au sol contenant tous les leviers, pinces et supports "
"nécessaires au démontage ou au montage d'un pneu, ainsi qu'une pompe à pied "
"intégrée pour le gonfler."

