msgid "The %s's interior compartment sizzles with destructive energy."
msgstr "Le compartiment intérieur du %s grésille d'énergie dévastatrice."

#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "EMP hack"
msgid_plural "EMP hacks"
msgstr[0] "drone EMP"
msgstr[1] "drones EMP"
msgstr[2] "drones EMP"

#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
#. ~ Description of monster "EMP hack"
msgid ""
"An automated kamikaze drone, this small quadcopter robot appears to have an "
"EMP grenade inside."
msgstr ""
"Un drone kamikaze automatisé, ce petit quadricoptère semble avoir été équipé "
"d'une grenade IEM."

#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "C-4 hack"
msgid_plural "C-4 hacks"
msgstr[0] "drone C-4"
msgstr[1] "drones C-4"
msgstr[2] "drones C-4"

#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
#. ~ Description of monster "C-4 hack"
msgid ""
"An automated kamikaze drone, this small quadcopter robot appears to have some "
"C-4 inside."
msgstr ""
"Un drone kamikaze automatisé, ce petit quadricoptère semble avoir été équipé "
"d'une charge de C-4."

#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "flashbang hack"
msgid_plural "flashbang hacks"
msgstr[0] "drone flashbang"
msgstr[1] "drones flashbang"
msgstr[2] "drones flashbang"

#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
#. ~ Description of monster "flashbang hack"
msgid ""
"An automated kamikaze drone, this small quadcopter robot appears to have a "
"flashbang inside."
msgstr ""
"Un drone kamikaze automatisé, ce petit quadricoptère semble avoir été équipé "
"d'une grenade flashbang."

#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tear gas hack"
msgid_plural "tear gas hacks"
msgstr[0] "drone lacrymogène"
msgstr[1] "drones lacrymogènes"
msgstr[2] "drones lacrymogènes"

#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tear gas hack"
msgid ""
"An automated kamikaze drone, this small quadcopter robot appears to have a "
"tear gas canister inside."
msgstr ""
"Un drone kamikaze automatisé, ce petit quadricoptère semble avoir été équipé "
"d'une grenade lacrymogène."

#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grenade hack"
msgid_plural "grenade hacks"
msgstr[0] "drone grenade"
msgstr[1] "drones grenade"
msgstr[2] "drones grenade"

#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grenade hack"
msgid ""
"An automated kamikaze drone, this small quadcopter robot appears to have a "
"grenade inside."
msgstr ""
"Un drone kamikaze automatisé, ce petit quadricoptère semble avoir été équipé "
"d'une grenade."

#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "manhack"
msgid_plural "manhacks"
msgstr[0] "drone à lames"
msgstr[1] "drones à lames"
msgstr[2] "drones à lames"

#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
#. ~ Description of monster "manhack"
msgid ""
"An automated anti-personnel drone, a small quadcopter robot surrounded by "
"whirring blades."
msgstr ""
"Un drone kamikaze automatisé, ce petit quadricoptère ne porte rien mais ses "
"pales on été remplacées avec des lames ayant l'air vicieusement affutées."

#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "balloon sniper-drone"
msgid_plural "balloon sniper-drones"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
#. ~ Description of monster "balloon sniper-drone"
msgid ""
"This unusual contraption looks like a combination of a weather balloon and a "
"quadcopter.  Beneath the crude box containing its components hangs a small "
"articulated rig wielding an integrated rifle.  Its propellers flicker to life "
"briefly, then shut down again, keeping it mostly stationary despite the air "
"currents.  It looks capable of hanging in the air for quite a long time "
"before running out of power."
msgstr ""
"Cet engin insolite ressemble à une combinaison de ballon-sonde et de "
"quadricoptère. Sous la boîte rudimentaire contenant ses composants pend un "
"petit dispositif articulé armé d'un fusil intégré. Ses hélices clignotent "
"brièvement, puis s'arrêtent à nouveau, le maintenant presque immobile malgré "
"les courants d'air. Il semble capable de rester en l'air pendant un temps "
"assez long avant de tomber en panne de batterie."

#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "balloon sniper-drone"
msgid "tick!"
msgstr "tick!"

#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "taser hack"
msgid_plural "taser hacks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
#. ~ Description of monster "taser hack"
msgid ""
"An automated drone, this small quadcopter robot appears to have a taser "
"strapped to the front.  While extremely fast, it is very fragile."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral human"
msgid_plural "feral humans"
msgstr[0] "féral"
msgstr[1] "féraux"
msgstr[2] "féraux"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral human"
msgid ""
"Their pupils are dilated and what can be seen of the iris and sclera are "
"bloodshot.  This pipe-wielding maniac still breathes, but the zombies treat "
"them like one of their own."
msgstr ""
"Ses yeux sont injectés de sang, le regard fixe et sauvage. Armé d'une pipe, "
"ce fou furieux est encore vivant, mais les zombies l'ont accepté parmi eux."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral human"
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "mon_feral_human_crowbar"
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral mechanic"
msgid "The feral human throws a rock!"
msgstr "Le féral lance une pierre!"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cunning feral"
msgid_plural "cunning ferals"
msgstr[0] "féral rusé"
msgstr[1] "féraux rusés"
msgstr[2] "féraux rusés"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cunning feral"
msgid ""
"This feral human's eyes look more focused, and its movements steadier, than "
"others of their kind.  They're carrying a crude spear, and have assembled "
"some basic armor from scavenged clothing and bits of riot armor, though you "
"can see several gaps.  Despite these signs of greater intelligence, this "
"creature is still only a few steps away from being a zombie themself."
msgstr ""
"Les yeux de cet humain sauvage semblent plus concentrés et ses mouvements "
"plus stables que ceux de ses semblables. Il porte une lance rudimentaire et a "
"assemblé une armure de base à partir de vêtements récupérés et de morceaux "
"d'armure anti-émeute, bien que vous puissiez voir plusieurs lacunes. Malgré "
"ces signes de plus grande intelligence, cette créature n'est qu'à quelques "
"pas d'être elle-même un zombie."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral troglobite"
msgid_plural "feral troglobites"
msgstr[0] "troglobite féral"
msgstr[1] "troglobites féraux"
msgstr[2] "troglobites féraux"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral troglobite"
msgid ""
"This person is still alive but completely crazed, changed by something they "
"were exposed to down here.  Their face is dominated by unnaturally large, "
"faintly glowing eyes and needle-sharp teeth poking through their lips.  They "
"remind you of something out of a campy monster movie - and of the good times "
"when underground cannibals were less of a real concern."
msgstr ""
"Cette personne est toujours en vie mais complètement démente, changée par "
"quelque chose à quoi elle a été exposée ici-bas. Son visage est dominé par "
"des yeux anormalement grands qui brillent faiblement et des dents acérées qui "
"dépassent de ses lèvres. Ils vous rappellent quelque chose d'un film de "
"monstres kitsch - et des bons moments où les cannibales souterrains étaient "
"moins une préoccupation réelle."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_crowbar"
msgid ""
"Their pupils are dilated and what can be seen of the iris and sclera are "
"bloodshot.  This crowbar-wielding maniac still breathes, but the zombies "
"treat them like one of their own."
msgstr ""
"Ses yeux sont injectés de sang, le regard fixe et sauvage. Armé d'un "
"pied-de-biche, ce fou furieux est encore vivant, mais les zombies l'ont "
"accepté parmi eux."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "deranged axeman"
msgid_plural "deranged axemen"
msgstr[0] "tueur à la hache fou furieux"
msgstr[1] "tueurs à la hache fou furieux"
msgstr[2] "tueurs à la hache fou furieux"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "deranged axeman"
msgid ""
"They stumble along dragging a large bloodstained axe.  Their face is twisted "
"into a sadistic grin, and they walk among the dead as though already one of "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Ils avancent en titubant, traînant une grande hache tachée de sang. Leur "
"visage est contordu en un sourire sadique, et ils marchent parmi les morts "
"comme s'ils en faisaient déjà partie."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral mechanic"
msgid_plural "feral mechanics"
msgstr[0] "mécanicien féral"
msgstr[1] "mécaniciens féraux"
msgstr[2] "mécaniciens féraux"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral mechanic"
msgid ""
"This wild human-like creature was probably a mechanic before the Cataclysm.  "
"You can see it by his worker uniform, or by his blood-covered hammer in hand, "
"or by his all-hating view."
msgstr ""
"Cette créature sauvage ressemblant à un humain était probablement un "
"mécanicien avant le Cataclysm. On peut le deviner à son uniforme de travail, "
"à son marteau ensanglanté ou à son regard haineux."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_pipe_fungal_corpse"
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_magician_fungal_corpse"
msgid ""
"Delicate fungal stalks sprout in rows from sores covering this person's body, "
"and their facial expression is pure agony."
msgstr ""
"De délicats champignons poussent en rangées sur les plaies recouvrant le "
"corps de cette personne, et leur expression faciale est pure agonie."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_crowbar_fungal_corpse"
msgid ""
"Delicate fungal stalks sprout in rows from sores on this person's arms, and "
"their facial expression is pure agony.  Their mouth opens and closes softly "
"in a silent moan."
msgstr ""
"Des champignons fragiles émergent en rangées des plaies qui couvrent ses "
"bras, et son visage exprime une souffrance intense. Sa bouche s'ouvre et se "
"ferme doucement, laissant échapper un gémissement silencieux."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_axe_fungal_corpse"
msgid ""
"Delicate fungal stalks sprout in rows from sores on this person's arms, and "
"their facial expression is pure agony."
msgstr ""
"Delicate fungal stalks sprout in rows from sores on this person's arms, and "
"their facial expression is pure agony."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mad scientist"
msgid_plural "mad scientists"
msgstr[0] "savant fou"
msgstr[1] "savants fous"
msgstr[2] "savants fous"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mad scientist"
msgid ""
"A researcher who has stared too long into the abyss, and now shambles about "
"muttering nonsense under their breath.  For some reason, the zombies don't "
"seem to mind that this person is obviously still alive.  They're clutching a "
"tiny but razor-sharp blade in one shaky hand."
msgstr ""
"Un chercheur qui a regardé trop longtemps dans l'abîme, et qui maintenant "
"erre en marmonnant des absurdités sous son souffle. Pour une raison ou une "
"autre, les zombies ne semblent pas s'inquiéter du fait que cette personne est "
"manifestement encore en vie. Ils tiennent dans une main tremblante une lame "
"minuscule mais tranchante comme un rasoir."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral security guard"
msgid_plural "feral security guards"
msgstr[0] "agent de sécurité féral"
msgstr[1] "agents de sécurité féraux"
msgstr[2] "agents de sécurité féraux"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral security guard"
msgid ""
"This security guard still breathes, but has been lost to some terrible "
"madness.  They move among the undead, with a baton in their arms and saucer "
"pupils scanning for threats in a mockery of their former duty."
msgstr ""
"e gardien de sécurité respire encore, mais il a sombré dans une terrible "
"folie. Il se déplace parmi les morts-vivants, une matraque à la main et les "
"pupilles dilatées scrutant les alentours à la recherche de menaces, dans une "
"parodie de son ancien devoir."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_labsecurity_flashlight"
msgid ""
"At first glance, this disheveled figure could almost pass for a survivor, but "
"the bloodshot eyes give them away as one of the humans who have gone feral "
"and joined the undead without dying.  Their uniform suggests that this was at "
"some point a security guard, and they still carry a stun gun and a heavy-duty "
"flashlight that looks like it could easily double as a club."
msgstr ""
"u premier coup d'œil, cette figure débraillée pourrait presque passer pour un "
"survivant, mais les yeux injectés de sang les trahissent comme l'un des "
"humains qui ont perdu la raison et se sont joints aux morts-vivants sans "
"mourir. Cette personne est peut-être un ancien garde de sécurité, mais "
"maintenant elle est l'un des leurs, armée d'un pistolet à impulsion "
"électrique et d'une lampe-torche lourde qui ressemble à un gourdin. Il est "
"évident qu'elle a dû se battre pour survivre, mais à quel prix ?"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral servant"
msgid_plural "feral servants"
msgstr[0] "serviteur féral"
msgstr[1] "serviteurs féraux"
msgstr[2] "serviteurs féraux"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral servant"
msgid ""
"Once a fancy servant of some rich family, this maniac walks around with a "
"broom in hand, searching for a victim to sweep off this mortal coil."
msgstr ""
"Autrefois serviteur de luxe d'une riche famille, ce maniaque se promène avec "
"un balai à la main, à la recherche d'une victime à balayer de son enveloppe "
"mortelle."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral servant"
msgid ""
"Once a fancy servant of some rich family, this maniac walks around with a "
"candlestick in hand, ready to snuff out your life."
msgstr ""
"Autrefois serviteur de luxe d'une riche famille, ce maniaque se promène avec "
"un chandelier à la main, prêt à mettre fin à vos jours."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral servant"
msgid ""
"Once a fancy servant of some rich family, this maniac walks around with a "
"knife in hand, searching for some victims to butcher."
msgstr ""
"Autrefois serviteur de luxe d'une riche famille, ce maniaque se promène avec "
"un chandelier à la main, prêt à mettre fin à vos jours."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "well dressed feral"
msgid_plural "well dressed ferals"
msgstr[0] "féral en tenue de bal"
msgstr[1] "féraux en tenue de bal"
msgstr[2] "féraux en tenue de bal"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "well dressed feral"
msgid ""
"Wearing fancy clothes and with a rapier in hand, this maniac was once a "
"socialite.  They smile with madness and seem like they want to invite you to "
"dinner."
msgstr ""
"Portant des vêtements chics et une rapière à la main, ce maniaque était "
"autrefois un mondain. Il sourit avec folie et semble vouloir vous inviter à "
"dîner."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "armored feral"
msgid_plural "armored ferals"
msgstr[0] "féral en armure"
msgstr[1] "féraux en armure"
msgstr[2] "féraux en armure"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "armored feral"
msgid ""
"Clad in ancient armor and with a mace in hand, this maniac walks around in "
"search of their next prey.  You can see stains of dried blood all over their "
"mace."
msgstr ""
"Vêtu d'une armure ancienne et une masse à la main, ce maniaque se promène à "
"la recherche de sa prochaine proie. On peut voir des taches de sang séché sur "
"sa masse."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "armored feral"
msgid ""
"Clad in ancient armor and with a battle axe in hand, this maniac walks around "
"in search of their next prey.  You can see stains of dried blood all over "
"their axe."
msgstr ""
"Vêtu d'une armure ancienne et une hache de guerre à la main, ce maniaque se "
"promène à la recherche de sa prochaine proie. On peut voir des taches de sang "
"séché sur sa hache."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral prepper"
msgid_plural "feral preppers"
msgstr[0] "prepper féral"
msgstr[1] "preppers féraux"
msgstr[2] "preppers féraux"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral prepper"
msgid ""
"A quick glance at this person would suggest that they have prepared well "
"enough for the apocalypse, with their armor equipped and some makeshift mace "
"in their hands.  Unfortunately, their bloodshot eyes, and the excluding "
"treatment by the undead, shows that they have turned feral."
msgstr ""
"Un rapide coup d'œil à cette personne suggère qu'elle s'est bien préparée à "
"l'apocalypse, avec son armure équipée et une masse de fortune dans les mains. "
"Malheureusement, ses yeux injectés de sang et l'exclusion dont il fait "
"l'objet de la part des morts-vivants montrent qu'il est devenu sauvage."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral prepper"
msgid ""
"A quick glance at this person would suggest that they have prepared well "
"enough for the apocalypse, with their armor equipped and some military-grade "
"knife in their hands.  Unfortunately, their bloodshot eyes, and the excluding "
"treatment by the undead, shows that they have turned feral."
msgstr ""
"Un rapide coup d'œil à cette personne laisserait penser qu'elle s'est bien "
"préparée à l'apocalypse, avec son armure équipée et un couteau de qualité "
"militaire dans les mains. Malheureusement, ses yeux injectés de sang et "
"l'exclusion dont elle fait l'objet de la part des morts-vivants montrent "
"qu'elle est devenue sauvage."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "crazed survivalist"
msgid_plural "crazed survivalists"
msgstr[0] "survivaliste féral"
msgstr[1] "survivalistes féraux"
msgstr[2] "survivalistes féraux"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "crazed survivalist"
msgid ""
"Grasping a sharp bladed weapon, this feral prepper has an athletic physique, "
"a sign that they trained extensively before turning feral.  In addition to "
"remembering how to use a flashlight, their survival instincts seem to kick in "
"when critically harmed, causing them to act in self-preservation unlike most "
"of their fellows."
msgstr ""
"Saisissant une arme tranchante, ce prepper sauvage a un physique athlétique, "
"signe qu'il s'est beaucoup entraîné avant de devenir sauvage. Outre le fait "
"qu'il sait se servir d'une lampe de poche, son instinct de survie semble se "
"manifester lorsqu'il est gravement blessé, ce qui lui permet d'agir pour se "
"préserver, contrairement à la plupart de ses congénères."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mad militia"
msgid_plural "mad militias"
msgstr[0] "milicien féral"
msgstr[1] "miliciens féraux"
msgstr[2] "miliciens féraux"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mad militia"
msgid ""
"Wearing a tactical camo uniform with a Kevlar vest, this person seems to have "
"been a militia member, now turned feral.  Their hands grip unto a "
"semi-automatic rifle as their bloodshot eyes scan for threats; a flashlight "
"strapped to their helmet illuminates their presence and surroundings."
msgstr ""
"Portant un uniforme tactique camouflage et une veste en kevlar, cette "
"personne semble avoir été un membre de la milice, devenu sauvage. Ses mains "
"s'agrippent à un fusil semi-automatique tandis que ses yeux injectés de sang "
"scrutent les menaces ; une lampe de poche attachée à son casque éclaire sa "
"présence et son environnement."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral soldier"
msgid_plural "feral soldiers"
msgstr[0] "soldat féral"
msgstr[1] "soldats féraux"
msgstr[2] "soldats féraux"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral soldier"
msgid ""
"Wearing a military uniform with an armored vest, this person seems to be a "
"highly trained military professional, now turned feral.  Tense, dirty hands "
"grip a combat knife as their bloodshot eyes scan for threats."
msgstr ""
"Portant un uniforme militaire et un gilet pare-balles, cette personne semble "
"être un professionnel militaire hautement qualifié, devenu sauvage. Ses mains "
"sales et tendues tiennent un couteau de combat tandis que ses yeux injectés "
"de sang scrutent les menaces."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral biker"
msgid_plural "feral bikers"
msgstr[0] "motard féral"
msgstr[1] "motards féraux"
msgstr[2] "motards féraux"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral biker"
msgid ""
"A rough-looking feral human, clad in black leather and wielding a pump-action "
"shotgun, that seems to be empty already.  It seems body-armor wasn't one of "
"their priorities however."
msgstr ""
"Un humain sauvage à l'allure rude, vêtu de cuir noir et armé d'un fusil à "
"pompe, qui semble déjà vide. Il semble que l'armure corporelle n'était pas "
"l'une de leurs priorités."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral swimmer"
msgid_plural "feral swimmers"
msgstr[0] "nageur féral"
msgstr[1] "nageurs féraux"
msgstr[2] "nageurs féraux"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral swimmer"
msgid ""
"Clad in swimwear and with a stick in hand, this once normal person is now a "
"bloodthirsty maniac."
msgstr ""
"Ne portant rien à part un maillot de bain et tenant un bâton dans les mains, "
"cette personne auparavant normale n'est maintenant plus qu'une brute "
"sanguinaire."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral crewman"
msgid_plural "feral crewmen"
msgstr[0] "matelot féral"
msgstr[1] "matelots féraux"
msgstr[2] "matelots féraux"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral crewman"
msgid ""
"Clad in a grimy and tattered naval uniform, this former sailor clutches a "
"massive wrench as some form of makeshift weapon.  At a distance, you could "
"mistake them as being another survivor.  However, upon closer inspection you "
"make note of how their veins are visibly bulging, their wide open eyes have a "
"primal, animalistic quality to their gaze, and their breaths come in ragged, "
"wheezing pants.  Whatever the Cataclysm has done to the military crewman that "
"this twitching shell of their former self once was, you're certain that "
"they're not fully human anymore."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_sailor_axe"
msgid ""
"Spattered from head to toe in large swaths of dried viscera, the deep blue of "
"this person's tattered naval uniform has been stained the color of rust.  "
"Having seemingly had enough presence of mind to consider arming itself, this "
"former crewman carries a crash axe in its shaking hands.  The veins on the "
"back of their neck are visibly bulging, their eyes bloodshot, and a mass of "
"crisscrossing blackened veins stand out against the pale skin of their face "
"as they regard the area around them for perceived threats."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_sailor_mop"
msgid ""
"Clutching a stout mop in their quivering hands, this crewman was presumably "
"assigned to basic deck sweeping in their final moments, before the Cataclysm "
"struck and stripped them of their humanity.  Dressed in basic naval fatigues, "
"you'd be forgiven for believing them to be another survivor.  However, their "
"bloodshot eyes, blackened veins, and spastic twitching tell a far different "
"story."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_sailor_lug_wrench"
msgid ""
"Still dressed in a grease spattered uniform, this crewman appears to have "
"once been a naval engineer.  With tangled hair, oil stained working attire, "
"and a lug wrench clenched in their fist, you assume that they were either "
"assigned to shipside maintenance or responsible for servicing onboard "
"aircraft.  Now all that's left of the crewman that this person once was is a "
"madly twitching, psychopathic monster."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral marine"
msgid_plural "feral marines"
msgstr[0] "marine féral"
msgstr[1] "marines féraux"
msgstr[2] "marines féraux"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral marine"
msgid ""
"This twitching, bloodied person is still clad in a ragged naval uniform, the "
"insignia of the marines visible on their coat and a corresponding tattoo on "
"their forearm.  Clutching a rifle in their quivering hands, you see them "
"repeatedly pull the weapon's trigger, constantly muttering incoherently and "
"yanking back on the gun's charging handle every time the rifle fails to fire. "
" Seemingly having lost the capability to comprehend that their weapon is "
"empty, you'd feel relatively safe were it not for the gleaming bayonet still "
"attached to the end of their firearm."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral officer"
msgid_plural "feral officers"
msgstr[0] "officier de marine féral"
msgstr[1] "officiers de marine féraux"
msgstr[2] "officiers de marine féraux"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral officer"
msgid ""
"This person, clad in the tattered uniform of a naval officer, twitches "
"erratically as their bloodshot eyes dart about and their breaths come in "
"ragged pants.  The Cataclysm has clearly done something horrible to this "
"military professional, inaudible mutterings emanating from their lips as they "
"creep about like a skittish animal.  In their quivering hands they clutch a "
"service pistol, the officer's fingers nervously fidgeting with the weapon.  "
"They may not be an undead corpse, but you doubt that they're any more "
"rational than the zombies which now infest the world."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral cop"
msgid_plural "feral cops"
msgstr[0] "policier féral"
msgstr[1] "policiers féraux"
msgstr[2] "policiers féraux"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral cop"
msgid ""
"Another of the crazed humans among the dead.  This police officer angrily "
"mutters to themselves, wandering about with a truncheon in hand in search of "
"someone to brutalize."
msgstr ""
"Un autre humain fou parmi les morts. Ce policier marmonne avec colère, "
"errant, matraque à la main, à la recherche de quelqu'un à brutaliser."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_cop_fungal_infected"
msgid ""
"A maddened and crazed police officer infected by the fungus.  Their body "
"armor is overgrown with fungal matter.  Though obviously in pain they don't "
"seem any less keen to batter you to death with their baton."
msgstr ""
"Un policier fou et dément, infecté par le champignon. Son armure est envahie "
"par la matière fongique. Bien qu'ils souffrent visiblement, ils ne semblent "
"pas moins désireux de vous frapper à mort avec leur matraque."

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral prisoner"
msgid_plural "feral prisoners"
msgstr[0] "prisonnier féral"
msgstr[1] "prisonniers féraux"
msgstr[2] "prisonniers féraux"

#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral prisoner"
msgid ""
"This frenzied prisoner has somehow avoided turning into one of the undead "
"thus far, though seeing how zombies seem to ignore this shiv-wielding, "
"blood-stained maniac, they are likely not far off from that fate."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "alpha razorclaw"
msgid_plural "alpha razorclaws"
msgstr[0] "pince-rasoir alpha"
msgstr[1] "pince-rasoirs alphas"
msgstr[2] "pince-rasoirs alphas"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "alpha razorclaw"
msgid ""
"A blood-red, gigantic razorclaw.  With its sword-like pincers, it serves as a "
"protector of the nest."
msgstr ""
"Un crustacé mutant gigantesque ayant une carapace rouge sang dure et épaisse. "
"Deux de ses bras sont munis de pinces plus digne d'être des épées plus qu'une "
"arme naturelle de quoi que ce soit, et vous avez l'impression que celui-ci "
"est plus que disposé à vous faire rencontrer celles-ci si vous vous approchez "
"trop de son nid."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fish fry"
msgid_plural "fish fry"
msgstr[0] "alevin"
msgstr[1] "alevins"
msgstr[2] "alevins"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fish fry"
msgid ""
"A minuscule half-translucent fish larva.  Impossible to identify which "
"species it belongs to."
msgstr ""
"Une alevin miniscule presque translucide. Vous auriez beaucoup de mal à "
"distinguer à quel espèce il appartient avant que celui-ci devienne un peu "
"plus large."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "fish fry"
#. ~ Death message of monster "tadpole"
#. ~ Death message of monster "stingray fry"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s is smashed to non-recognizable pieces."
msgstr "L'%s est écrabouillé en un nuage de chair et de sang."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mutant fish fry"
msgid_plural "mutant fish fry"
msgstr[0] "alevin mutant"
msgstr[1] "alevins mutants"
msgstr[2] "alevins mutants"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mutant fish fry"
msgid ""
"A half-translucent fish larva… though this one is far larger than the usual.  "
"Impossible to identify which species it belongs to but you can safely tell "
"that it is going to outgrow normal fish you're used to seeing."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "brown trout"
msgid_plural "brown trouts"
msgstr[0] "truite brune"
msgstr[1] "truites brunes"
msgstr[2] "truites brunes"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "brown trout"
msgid ""
"A brown trout.  A fish made popular by father-son fishing trips, except for "
"the part where you have to gut it."
msgstr ""
"Une truite brune. Une prise populaire durant les weekends de pêche entre père "
"et fils, le vidage étant moins agréable."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "brook trout"
msgid_plural "brook trouts"
msgstr[0] "truite mouchetée"
msgstr[1] "truites mouchetées"
msgstr[2] "truites mouchetées"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "brook trout"
msgid ""
"A brook trout.  A fish made popular by father-son fishing trips, except for "
"the part where you have to gut it."
msgstr ""
"Une truite mouchetée. Une prise populaire durant les weekends de pêche entre "
"père et fils, le vidage étant moins agréable."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lake trout"
msgid_plural "lake trouts"
msgstr[0] "truite grise"
msgstr[1] "truites grises"
msgstr[2] "truites grises"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lake trout"
msgid ""
"A lake trout.  A fish made popular by father-son fishing trips, except for "
"the part where you have to gut it."
msgstr ""
"Une truite grise. Une prise populaire durant les weekends de pêche entre père "
"et fils, le vidage étant moins agréable."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rainbow trout"
msgid_plural "rainbow trouts"
msgstr[0] "truite arc-en-ciel"
msgstr[1] "truites arc-en-ciels"
msgstr[2] "truites arc-en-ciels"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rainbow trout"
msgid ""
"A rainbow trout.  A fish made popular by father-son fishing trips, except for "
"the part where you have to gut it."
msgstr ""
"Une truite arc-en-ciel. Une prise populaire durant les weekends de pêche "
"entre père et fils, le vidage étant moins agréable."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Atlantic salmon"
msgid_plural "Atlantic salmon"
msgstr[0] "saumon atlantique"
msgstr[1] "saumons atlantiques"
msgstr[2] "saumons atlantiques"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Atlantic salmon"
msgid "An Atlantic salmon.  A very fatty, nutritious fish.  Tastes great smoked."
msgstr ""
"Un saumon d'Atlantique. Un poisson très gras et nourrissant. Excellent une "
"fois fumé. "

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "kokanee salmon"
msgid_plural "kokanee salmon"
msgstr[0] "saumon kokani"
msgstr[1] "saumons kokanis"
msgstr[2] "saumons kokanis"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "kokanee salmon"
msgid "A Kokanee salmon.  A very fatty, nutritious fish.  Tastes great smoked."
msgstr ""
"Un saumon kokani. Un poisson très gras et nourrissant. Excellent une fois "
"fumé. "

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lake whitefish"
msgid_plural "lake whitefish"
msgstr[0] "grand corégone"
msgstr[1] "grands corégones"
msgstr[2] "grands corégones"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lake whitefish"
msgid ""
"A lake whitefish, closely related to salmon.  One can assume they taste just "
"as nice when smoked."
msgstr ""
"Un grand corégone, un cousin proche du saumon, vous assumez qu'il à un goût "
"aussi bon que celui-ci fumé."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "round whitefish"
msgid_plural "round whitefish"
msgstr[0] "ménomini rond"
msgstr[1] "ménominis ronds"
msgstr[2] "ménominis ronds"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "round whitefish"
msgid ""
"A round whitefish, closely related to salmon.  One can assume they taste just "
"as nice when smoked."
msgstr ""
"Poisson blanc rond, étroitement lié au saumon. On peut supposer qu'il a le "
"même goût lorsqu'il est fumé."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "largemouth bass"
msgid_plural "largemouth bass"
msgstr[0] "achigan à grande bouche"
msgstr[1] "achigans à grande bouche"
msgstr[2] "achigans à grande bouche"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "largemouth bass"
msgid "A largemouth bass.  Very popular with sport fishermen."
msgstr "Un achigan à grande bouche. Très populaire avec les pêcheurs sportifs."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "smallmouth bass"
msgid_plural "smallmouth bass"
msgstr[0] "achigan à petite bouche"
msgstr[1] "achigans à petite bouche"
msgstr[2] "achigans à petite bouche"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "smallmouth bass"
msgid ""
"A smallmouth bass.  Infamously intolerant to pollution, the presence of "
"smallmouth bass is a good indicator of how clean a body of water is."
msgstr ""
"Un achigan à petite bouche, un poisson notoirement susceptible à la pollution "
"de son environment, son absence étant un mauvais signe pour la qualité d'un "
"plan d'eau."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "striped bass"
msgid_plural "striped bass"
msgstr[0] "bar rayé"
msgstr[1] "bars rayés"
msgstr[2] "bars rayés"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "striped bass"
msgid ""
"A striped bass.  Mostly a saltwater fish, they migrate to fresher water to "
"spawn."
msgstr ""
"Un bar rayé. Normalement un poisson d'eau salé, il effectue une migration "
"dans des eaux plus douces pour se reproduire."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "yellow perch"
msgid_plural "yellow perches"
msgstr[0] "perchaude"
msgstr[1] "perchaudes"
msgstr[2] "perchaudes"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "yellow perch"
msgid ""
"A small, sprightly perch.  It is a very bony fish, still has some tasty meat "
"on it though."
msgstr "Une perchaude, un petit poisson vif, bourré d'arrêtes mais pas mal à manger."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "walleye"
msgid_plural "walleyes"
msgstr[0] "doré jaune"
msgstr[1] "dorés jaunes"
msgstr[2] "dorés jaunes"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "walleye"
msgid "A walleye.  A green-brown medium-sized fish with a white belly."
msgstr "Un doré jaune, un poisson de taille moyenne possédant un ventre blanchâtre."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "banded sunfish"
msgid_plural "banded sunfish"
msgstr[0] "crapet à bandes"
msgstr[1] "crapets à bandes"
msgstr[2] "crapets à bandes"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "banded sunfish"
msgid "A banded sunfish.  A small fish related to bass and bluegill."
msgstr "Un crapet à bandes, un cousin des bars."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pumpkinseed"
msgid_plural "pumpkinseeds"
msgstr[0] "perche soleil"
msgstr[1] "perches soleil"
msgstr[2] "perches soleil"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pumpkinseed"
msgid "A pumpkinseed sunfish.  A small fish related to bass and bluegill."
msgstr "Une perche soleil, un petit poisson cousin des crapets et des bars."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bluegill"
msgid_plural "bluegills"
msgstr[0] "crapet arlequin"
msgstr[1] "crapets arlequins"
msgstr[2] "crapets arlequins"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bluegill"
msgid "A bluegill, an invasive species in Japan.  Commonly gutted and cooked whole."
msgstr "Un crapet arlequin. Habituellement vidé puis cuit entier."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "redbreast sunfish"
msgid_plural "redbreast sunfish"
msgstr[0] "crapet rouge"
msgstr[1] "crapets rouges"
msgstr[2] "crapets rouges"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "redbreast sunfish"
msgid "A redbreast sunfish.  A small fish related to bass and bluegill."
msgstr "Un crapet rouge, un petit poisson cousin des bars."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "green sunfish"
msgid_plural "green sunfish"
msgstr[0] "crapet vert"
msgstr[1] "crapets verts"
msgstr[2] "crapets verts"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "green sunfish"
msgid "A green sunfish.  A small fish related to bass and bluegill."
msgstr "Un crapet vert, un petit poisson cousin des bars."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rock bass"
msgid_plural "rock bass"
msgstr[0] "crapet de roche"
msgstr[1] "crapets de roche"
msgstr[2] "crapets de roche"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rock bass"
msgid ""
"A rock bass.  Related to sunfish, this tiny fish has a camouflage-like "
"patterning and red eyes."
msgstr ""
"Un crapet de roche, techniquement plus un bar qu'un crapet, ce tout petit "
"poisson est muni d'un motif de peau camouflage et d'yeux rouges."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black crappie"
msgid_plural "black crappie"
msgstr[0] "marigane noire"
msgstr[1] "mariganes noires"
msgstr[2] "mariganes noires"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black crappie"
msgid "A black crappie.  A medium-sized fish also known as a 'calico bass'."
msgstr ""
"Une marigane noire, un poisson de taille moyenne aussi connu sous le nom de "
"basse calico."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "warmouth"
msgid_plural "warmouths"
msgstr[0] "crapet sac-à-lait"
msgstr[1] "crapets sac-à-lait"
msgstr[2] "crapets sac-à-lait"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "warmouth"
msgid ""
"A warmouth, similar to a rock bass.  This small fish is related to the "
"sunfish."
msgstr "Un crapet sac-à-lait, proche cousin du crapet de roche."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "brown bullhead"
msgid_plural "brown bullheads"
msgstr[0] "barbotte brune"
msgstr[1] "barbottes brunes"
msgstr[2] "barbottes brunes"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "brown bullhead"
msgid "A brown bullhead, a type of catfish.  Delicious when battered and fried."
msgstr "Une barbotte brune, une espèce de poisson chat délicieuse panée et frite."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "yellow bullhead"
msgid_plural "yellow bullheads"
msgstr[0] "barbote jaune"
msgstr[1] "barbotes jaunes"
msgstr[2] "barbotes jaunes"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "yellow bullhead"
msgid ""
"A yellow bullhead, a type of catfish.  Delicious when battered and fried, "
"though smaller than its brown cousin."
msgstr ""
"Une barbotte jaune, une sorte de poisson-chat. Délicieuse lorsqu'elle est "
"panée et frite, bien qu'elle soit plus petite que sa cousine brune."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "channel catfish"
msgid_plural "channel catfish"
msgstr[0] "barbue de rivière"
msgstr[1] "barbues de rivière"
msgstr[2] "barbues de rivière"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "channel catfish"
msgid "A channel catfish.  It has a forked tail and long whiskers."
msgstr ""
"Une barbue de rivière, une espèce de poisson chat possédant une queue "
"fourchue et de longues moustaches."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "white catfish"
msgid_plural "white catfish"
msgstr[0] "poisson-chat blanc"
msgstr[1] "poissons-chats blancs"
msgstr[2] "poissons-chats blancs"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "white catfish"
msgid "A white catfish.  A small whiskered fish with a broad head."
msgstr "Un poisson chat blanc possédant des moustaches courtes et une tête large."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "northern pike"
msgid ""
"A northern pike.  Pike can be pretty aggressive fish, careful around those "
"teeth."
msgstr ""
"Un brochet du nord, un poisson assez agressif, donc attention à ne pas vous "
"faire mordre."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "chain pickerel"
msgid_plural "chain pickerels"
msgstr[0] "brochet maillé"
msgstr[1] "brochets maillés"
msgstr[2] "brochets maillés"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "chain pickerel"
msgid "A chain pickerel.  It looks like a pike, but slightly smaller."
msgstr "Une espèce de brochet plus petite que la normale."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "American pickerel"
msgid_plural "American pickerels"
msgstr[0] "chabot américain"
msgstr[1] "chabots américains"
msgstr[2] "chabots américains"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "American pickerel"
msgid ""
"An American pickerel.  It looks like a pike, but unlike its chain pickerel "
"cousin, this one is way smaller."
msgstr ""
"Un brochet américain. Il ressemble à un brochet, mais contrairement à son "
"cousin le doré, il est beaucoup plus petit."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "muskellunge"
msgid_plural "muskellunges"
msgstr[0] "Maskinongé"
msgstr[1] "Maskinongés"
msgstr[2] "Maskinongés"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "muskellunge"
msgid ""
"A muskellunge.  Closely related to pike but even larger, it shares the same "
"aggression and sharp teeth."
msgstr ""
"Un maskinongé. Apparenté au brochet mais encore plus gros, et partageant son "
"agressivité et ses dents pointues."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "white sucker"
msgid_plural "white suckers"
msgstr[0] "meunier noir"
msgstr[1] "meuniers noirs"
msgstr[2] "meuniers noirs"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "white sucker"
msgid "A white sucker.  It has a streamlined body with a round mouth."
msgstr "Un meunier blanc. Il a un corps profilé avec une bouche ronde."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "European carp"
msgid_plural "European carp"
msgstr[0] "carpe européenne"
msgstr[1] "carpes européennes"
msgstr[2] "carpes européennes"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "European carp"
msgid ""
"A golden-yellow common carp.  Some people think they don't taste great, but "
"you can't afford to be choosy in the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Une carpe commune aux reflets dorés. Certains trouvent que ce poisson n'a pas "
"un goût terrible mais le Cataclysme ne vous laisse pas vraiment le luxe du "
"choix."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grass carp"
msgid_plural "grass carps"
msgstr[0] "carpe de roseau"
msgstr[1] "carpes de roseau"
msgstr[2] "carpes de roseau"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grass carp"
msgid "A huge grass carp.  A golden, herbivorous fish."
msgstr "Une carpe de roseau, un poisson herbivore doré énorme."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "goldfish"
msgid_plural "goldfish"
msgstr[0] "poisson rouge"
msgstr[1] "poissons rouges"
msgstr[2] "poissons rouges"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "goldfish"
msgid ""
"Yes, this is that common pet fish.  Though, given its size and the fact that "
"it's still alive, you can take a wild guess that this one is feral."
msgstr ""
" Oui, c'est un poisson de compagnie courant. Cependant, vu sa taille et le "
"fait qu'il soit encore en vie, vous pouvez deviner qu'il est sauvage."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bowfin"
msgid_plural "bowfins"
msgstr[0] "poisson-castor"
msgstr[1] "poissons-castors"
msgstr[2] "poissons-castors"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bowfin"
msgid ""
"A bowfin.  These fish are related to gar but without the huge teeth, "
"skin-rending scales, and aggression."
msgstr ""
"Un poisson-castor, un cousin du brochet dépourvu de son agressivité, de ses "
"dents pointues, écailles coupantes, mais ayant reçu en compensation une tête "
"couverte de longues plaques osseuses."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "longnose gar"
msgid_plural "longnose gar"
msgstr[0] "lépisosté osseux"
msgstr[1] "lépisostés osseux"
msgstr[2] "lépisostés osseux"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "longnose gar"
msgid "A large ancient type of fish with a mean jaw and poisonous eggs."
msgstr "Un grand poisson ancien avec une mâchoire méchante et des œufs venimeux."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "burbot"
msgid_plural "burbots"
msgstr[0] "lotte"
msgstr[1] "lottes"
msgstr[2] "lottes"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "burbot"
msgid ""
"A relatively large fish that looks like a cross between a catfish and an eel, "
"and is the only freshwater fish from the order that cods hail from."
msgstr ""
"Un poisson relativement grand qui ressemble à un croisement entre un "
"poisson-chat et une anguille, et qui est le seul poisson d'eau douce de "
"l'ordre auquel appartient le cabillaud."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lake sturgeon"
msgid_plural "lake sturgeon"
msgstr[0] "esturgeon jaune"
msgstr[1] "esturgeons jaunes"
msgstr[2] "esturgeons jaunes"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lake sturgeon"
msgid ""
"A very large armored bottom-feeder, the lake sturgeon is one of the largest "
"unmutated fish one can find in the freshwater regions of New England."
msgstr ""
"Très grand mangeur de fond blindé, l'esturgeon jaune est l'un des plus grands "
"poissons non mutés que l'on puisse trouver dans les régions d'eau douce de la "
"Nouvelle-Angleterre."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shortnose sturgeon"
msgid_plural "shortnose sturgeon"
msgstr[0] "esturgeon à museau court"
msgstr[1] "esturgeons à museau court"
msgstr[2] "esturgeons à museau court"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shortnose sturgeon"
msgid ""
"While the shortnose sturgeon is still large, it is nothing compared to its "
"cousin - the lake sturgeon.  What really sets it apart, however, is its "
"signature shorter snout."
msgstr ""
"Bien que l'esturgeon à museau court soit encore grand, il n'est rien comparé "
"à son cousin, l'esturgeon jaune. Ce qui le distingue vraiment, c'est son "
"museau plus court."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fallfish"
msgid_plural "fallfish"
msgstr[0] "ouitouche"
msgstr[1] "ouitouches"
msgstr[2] "ouitouches"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fallfish"
msgid "A fallfish.  These fish are small cyprinids, related to carp."
msgstr "Un ouitouche, un petit cyprinidé apparenté aux carpes."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lobster"
msgid_plural "lobsters"
msgstr[0] "homard"
msgstr[1] "homards"
msgstr[2] "homards"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lobster"
msgid ""
"A dark greenish crustacean in its natural habitat.  These were once "
"considered pests barely worth eating, then some marketing genius started "
"selling them to people as a delicacy and they took off in popularity… and "
"price."
msgstr ""
"Un crustacé noir verdâtre dans son habitat naturel. Autrefois considérés "
"nuisibles et valant à peine d'être mangés, un génie du marketing décida un "
"jour de les vendre comme un met raffiné, causant ceux-ci à gagner en "
"popularité… et en prix."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "crayfish"
msgid_plural "crayfish"
msgstr[0] "écrevisse"
msgstr[1] "écrevisses"
msgstr[2] "écrevisses"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "crayfish"
msgid ""
"This crustacean looks like a tiny lobster, but is actually a completely "
"different species.  If you could get ahold of a bunch more of these, a hefty "
"pot of boiling water, and some spicy seasonings…"
msgstr ""
"Un crustacé ayant l'air d'un homard miniature, et très bon cuit dans une "
"marmite avec des épices."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "crustacean larva"
msgid_plural "crustacean larvae"
msgstr[0] "larve de crustacé"
msgstr[1] "larves de crustacé"
msgstr[2] "larves de crustacé"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "crustacean larva"
msgid ""
"A minuscule half-translucent crustacean larva.  Impossible to identify which "
"species it belongs to."
msgstr ""
"Une larve de crustacé presque translucide, il est complètement impossible "
"d'identifier précisement à quelle espèce elle appartient."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "American eel"
msgid_plural "American eels"
msgstr[0] "anguille américaine"
msgstr[1] "anguilles américaines"
msgstr[2] "anguilles américaines"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "American eel"
msgid ""
"An American eel.  They used to be quite common in these parts until the dams "
"were built.  They'll get a second chance now that those aren't running."
msgstr ""
"Une anguille américaine, commune dans les environs avant la construction de "
"masse de barrages, mais sa population va peut être rebondir maintenant que "
"ceux-ci ne fonctionnent plus."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized crayfish"
msgid_plural "oversized crayfish"
msgstr[0] "écrevisse géante"
msgstr[1] "écrevisses géantes"
msgstr[2] "écrevisses géantes"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized crayfish"
msgid ""
"A mutant crayfish the size of a dog, with a brown carapace, claws, and long "
"antennae."
msgstr ""
"Une écrevisse mutante de la taille d'un chien possédant une carapace brune, "
"des pinces menaçantes et de longues antennes."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant crayfish"
msgid_plural "giant crayfish"
msgstr[0] "écrevisse gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "écrevisses gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "écrevisses gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant crayfish"
msgid ""
"A mutant, terrestrial variety of crayfish, this massive crustacean resembles "
"a humongous lobster."
msgstr ""
"Une écrevisse terrestre gigantesque ressemblant à un homard de taille "
"mythique."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "colossal crayfish"
msgid_plural "colossal crayfish"
msgstr[0] "écrevisse colossale"
msgstr[1] "écrevisses colossales"
msgstr[2] "écrevisses colossales"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "colossal crayfish"
msgid "An enormous mutated gray crayfish with pincer claws and long antennae."
msgstr ""
"Une écrevisse mutante énorme munie de pinces redoutables et de longues "
"antennes."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant crayfish larva"
msgid_plural "giant crayfish larvae"
msgstr[0] "larve d'écrevisse géante"
msgstr[1] "larves d'écrevisse géantes"
msgstr[2] "larves d'écrevisse géantes"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant crayfish larva"
msgid "A large crayfish larva already larger than non-mutated adults of its kind."
msgstr ""
"Une larve d'écrevisse mutante gigantesque déjà plus large que les adultes "
"non-mutants de son espèce."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "razorclaw"
msgid_plural "razorclaws"
msgstr[0] "pince-rasoir"
msgstr[1] "pince-rasoirs"
msgstr[2] "pince-rasoirs"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "razorclaw"
msgid ""
"A man-sized crustacean clad in iron-like chitin, capable of emitting horrible "
"shrieking noises.  Often spotted near shipwrecks or other dark, damp places, "
"which it uses as nesting grounds."
msgstr ""
"Un crustacé mutant de la taille d'un homme adulte possédant une carapace en "
"chitine épaisse et très résistante, capable d'émettre des crissements "
"horribles avec ses mandibules. Cet monstruosité préfère fréquenter les épaves "
"ou autres endroits similairement humides et sombres pouvant être utilisés "
"comme sites de ponte."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant carp"
msgid_plural "giant carps"
msgstr[0] "carpe gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "carpes gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "carpes gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant carp"
msgid ""
"This thing looks like a carp, but huge and very, very angry.  Death is the "
"gift of the carp god."
msgstr ""
"Cette chose à l'apparence d'une carpe, mais absolument gigantesque et "
"vraiment, vraiment très susceptible, votre mort sera une bonne offrande pour "
"le dieu des carpes."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant salmon"
msgid_plural "giant salmon"
msgstr[0] "saumon gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "saumons gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "saumons gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant salmon"
msgid ""
"A mutated salmon roughly the size of a person.  Quite dangerous to the "
"inexperienced angler."
msgstr ""
"Un saumon mutant de la taille d'une personne et très dangereux pour le "
"pêcheur du dimanche."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "huge salmon"
msgid_plural "huge salmon"
msgstr[0] "saumon gargantuesque"
msgstr[1] "saumons gargantuesques"
msgstr[2] "saumons gargantuesques"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "huge salmon"
msgid "A huge mutant salmon grown almost to the size of an alligator."
msgstr ""
"Un saumon aux proportions démesurées ayant presque la taille d'un alligator "
"adulte."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "leaper salmon"
msgid_plural "leaper salmon"
msgstr[0] "saumon bondissant"
msgstr[1] "saumons bondissants"
msgstr[2] "saumons bondissants"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "leaper salmon"
msgid ""
"A huge mutant salmon, one that outgrows even the other ones present.  On its "
"sides, beneath the fins, are visible two flesh-colored tubes which propel "
"water as it leaps."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "seweranha"
msgid_plural "seweranhas"
msgstr[0] "piranha d'égout"
msgstr[1] "piranhas d'égout"
msgstr[2] "piranhas d'égout"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "seweranha"
msgid ""
"A large, mutant variety of carp.  It has shimmering green scales and a mouth "
"lined with three jagged rows of razor-sharp teeth."
msgstr ""
"Un carpe mutante doté d'écailles vert luisant et d'une gueule bordée de trois "
"rangées de dents aiguisées comme des rasoirs."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Atlantic mackerel"
msgid_plural "Atlantic mackerel"
msgstr[0] "maquereau bleu"
msgstr[1] "maquereaus bleus"
msgstr[2] "maquereaus bleus"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Atlantic mackerel"
msgid "An Atlantic mackerel, known for its distinctive striped pattern."
msgstr "Un maquereau bleu célèbre pour ses rayures distinctives."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "summer flounder"
msgid_plural "summer flounder"
msgstr[0] "cardeau d'été"
msgstr[1] "cardeaux d'été"
msgstr[2] "cardeaux d'été"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "summer flounder"
msgid ""
"A flatfish, the summer flounder, also known as a fluke, likes to stay "
"camouflaged against the ocean floor."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black sea bass"
msgid_plural "black sea bass"
msgstr[0] "bar noir"
msgstr[1] "bars noirs"
msgstr[2] "bars noirs"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black sea bass"
msgid ""
"A small, robust fish, the black sea bass is known for its dark, mottled color "
"and meaty texture."
msgstr ""
"Un petit poisson robuste, le bar noir est connu pour ses couleurs sombres "
"tachées et la texture charnue de sa viande."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scup"
msgid_plural "scup"
msgstr[0] "pagre"
msgstr[1] "pagres"
msgstr[2] "pagres"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scup"
msgid ""
"Also known as porgy, the scup is a small fish commonly found in Atlantic "
"coastal waters, recognizable by its silver body with blue and purple tinges."
msgstr ""
"Le pagre est un petit poisson commun dans les eau côtières de l'Atlantique, "
"reconnaissable par sa peau argentée teintée de bleu et de violet."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bluefish"
msgid_plural "bluefish"
msgstr[0] "tassergal"
msgstr[1] "tassergals"
msgstr[2] "tassergals"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bluefish"
msgid ""
"The bluefish, a moderately proportioned marine fish, is known for its "
"aggressive nature and sharp teeth.  It sports a distinct blue-green "
"coloration."
msgstr ""
"Un tassergals, un poisson océanique aux proportions respectables ayant un "
"tempérament agressif et des dents pointues. Sa peau est teintée bleu-vert."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Atlantic cod"
msgid_plural "Atlantic cod"
msgstr[0] "morue franche"
msgstr[1] "morues franches"
msgstr[2] "morues franches"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Atlantic cod"
msgid ""
"A large, white-meat fish known for its mild flavor and flaky texture.  Highly "
"prized in both commercial and recreational fishing."
msgstr ""
"Un poisson à la viande blanche pouvant atteindre une taille impressionnante, "
"la viande en question étant réputé pour sa saveur douce et sa texture "
"feuilletée. Une prise préférée des pécheurs commerciaux et sportifs."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "haddock"
msgid_plural "haddock"
msgstr[0] "aiglefin"
msgstr[1] "aiglefins"
msgstr[2] "aiglefins"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "haddock"
msgid ""
"A popular food fish, the haddock is recognized by its dark lateral line and a "
"black blotch above the pectoral fin."
msgstr ""
"Un poisson populaire pour sa viande, l'aiglefin est distingué par une longue "
"ligne latérale sombre et une tache noire au dessus de ses nageoires "
"pectorales."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Atlantic bluefin tuna"
msgid_plural "Atlantic bluefin tuna"
msgstr[0] "thon rouge du nord"
msgstr[1] "thons rouges du nord"
msgstr[2] "thons rouges du nord"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Atlantic bluefin tuna"
msgid ""
"One of the largest and fastest fish in the waters of New England, the bluefin "
"tuna is a streamlined predator with a dark blue back and silvery sides."
msgstr ""
"L'un des plus gros et véloces poissons dans les eaux de la Nouvelle "
"Angleterre, le thons rouges du nord est un prédateur profilé aux flancs "
"argentés bleu sombre."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Atlantic halibut"
msgid_plural "Atlantic halibut"
msgstr[0] "flétan atlantique"
msgstr[1] "flétans atlantiques"
msgstr[2] "flétans atlantiques"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Atlantic halibut"
msgid ""
"The largest flatfish in the ocean, known for its dense, firm texture and mild "
"flavor."
msgstr ""
"Le plus gros poissons plats océanique, réputé pour la texture dense et ferme "
"de sa viande et la saveur douce de celle-ci."

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pollock"
msgid_plural "pollock"
msgstr[0] "goberge"
msgstr[1] "goberges"
msgstr[2] "goberges"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pollock"
msgid ""
"A member of the cod family, pollock is a versatile fish known for its white, "
"delicate meat and mild taste."
msgstr ""
"Un membre de la famille de la morue, la goberge est un poisson versatile "
"connu pour sa viande blanche est délicate au goût léger."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal blossom"
msgid_plural "fungal blossoms"
msgstr[0] "bouquet mycellaire"
msgstr[1] "bouquets mycellaires"
msgstr[2] "bouquets mycellaires"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal blossom"
msgid ""
"A broad fungus, looking much like a glowing blue sunflower.  It appears to "
"emit finer spores than the typical fungal emission."
msgstr ""
"Un champignon large, ressemblant à un tournesol bleu lumineux. Il semble "
"émettre des spores plus fines que l'émission fongique typique."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal hedgerow"
msgid_plural "fungal hedgerows"
msgstr[0] "haie mycellaire"
msgstr[1] "haies mycellaires"
msgstr[2] "haies mycellaires"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal hedgerow"
msgid ""
"Looking at first glance like a dull gray privet, this \"hedge\" is really a "
"mass of barbed fungal tendrils, defending the fungal tower."
msgstr ""
"Cette \"haie\", qui ressemble à première vue à un troène gris terne, est en "
"réalité une masse de vrilles fongiques barbelées qui défendent la tour "
"fongique."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json data/json/monsters/misc.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "fungal hedgerow"
#. ~ Death message of monster "fungal wall"
#. ~ Death message of monster "spore cloud"
#. ~ Death message of monster "ancient red dragon"
#. ~ Death message of monster "vengeance spirit"
#. ~ Death message of monster "will-o-wisp"
#. ~ Death message of monster "will-o'-the-wisp"
#. ~ Death message of monster "flying shark"
#. ~ Death message of monster "endless snake"
#. ~ Death message of monster "swarm of teeth"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s disintegrates!"
msgstr "Le %s se désintègre!"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal tendril"
msgid_plural "fungal tendrils"
msgstr[0] "vrille mycellaire"
msgstr[1] "vrilles mycellaires"
msgstr[2] "vrilles mycellaires"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal tendril"
msgid "A long and delicate-looking tendril with a sharp tip."
msgstr "Un long et délicat tentacule avec une pointe acérée."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal wall"
msgid ""
"A veritable wall of fungus, grown as a natural defense by the fungal spire.  "
"New spores erupt from the surface every few seconds, and tendrils constrict "
"around it, pulling new mass into its shape.  They move with an inexorable "
"strength that could snap limbs."
msgstr ""
"Un mur fongique ayant été érigé comme structure défensive par la tour "
"mycellaire.  De nouvelles spores s'échappent de sa surface à intervalles "
"rapides et réguliers, et des filaments s'agitent autour pour y ajouter plus "
"de matériaux.  Son mouvement est lent mais possède une force inexorable qui "
"vous donne l'impression que vous mettre dans le chemin de cette chose et vous "
"faire écraser ne la ralentira qu'à peine."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungaloid"
msgid_plural "fungaloids"
msgstr[0] "mycelloïde"
msgstr[1] "mycelloïdes"
msgstr[2] "mycelloïdes"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungaloid"
msgid ""
"A pale white fungus, one meaty gray stalk supporting a bloom at the top.  "
"Spores are periodically expelled from its gills, and a few tendrils extend "
"from the base, allowing mobility and some basic means of defense."
msgstr ""
"Un fongus pâle blanc, une tige charnue grise avec une fleur en haut. Ses "
"branchies crachent des spores périodiquement, et des vrilles étendent sa "
"base, lui permettant de se mouvoir et comme moyen de défense rudimentaire."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungaloid shambler"
msgid_plural "fungaloid shamblers"
msgstr[0] "Marcheur fongique"
msgstr[1] "Marcheurs fongiques"
msgstr[2] "Marcheurs fongiques"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungaloid shambler"
msgid ""
"A large white fungus, a bulging gray stalk supporting a bloom at the top.  "
"Spores float from its gills and tendrils extend from the base.  Chunks of "
"rock, metal, bone, and wood are held by tendrils as a kind of armor."
msgstr ""
" Un immense champignon blanc, un tronc gris renflé surmonté d'une floraison. "
"Des spores se dispersent dans l'air, et des tentacules s'étendent du bas. Des "
"morceaux de roche, de métal, d'os et de bois sont accrochés à ces tentacules, "
"formant une sorte d'armure."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "fungaloid shambler"
msgid "The fungaloid shambler throws a rock!"
msgstr "Le marcheur fongique lance une pierre!"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal spire"
msgid_plural "fungal spires"
msgstr[0] "cathédrale mycellaire"
msgstr[1] "cathédrales mycellaires"
msgstr[2] "cathédrales mycellaires"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal spire"
msgid ""
"An enormous fungal spire, towering over the ground.  It pulsates slowly, "
"continuously growing new defenses."
msgstr ""
"Une énorme tour fongique dominant les environs.  Elle palpite lentement et "
"développe continuellement de nouvelles défenses."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant fungal blossom"
msgid_plural "giant fungal blossoms"
msgstr[0] "bouquet mycellaire géant"
msgstr[1] "bouquets mycellaires géants"
msgstr[2] "bouquets mycellaires géants"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant fungal blossom"
msgid ""
"An immense fungal blossom, towering over its surroundings.  It pulses with a "
"soft blue glow, continuously pumping its spores into the air."
msgstr ""
"Un immense bouquet micellaire surélevant tout ce qui l'entoure. Il scintille "
"d'une lumière bleue et libère en permanence des spores dans l'air."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_terrain/overmap_terrain_fungal.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/overmap_terrain.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/overmap_terrain.json
#: data/mods/alt_map_key/overmap_terrain_pink.json
#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Overmap terrain name
msgid "fungal tower"
msgid_plural "fungal towers"
msgstr[0] "tour mycellaire"
msgstr[1] "tours mycellaires"
msgstr[2] "tours mycellaires"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal tower"
msgid ""
"An enormous fungal tower.  On closer inspection, its cap is supported by LOTS "
"of fungal tendrils of various thicknesses, emerging from yet more bristling "
"tendrils at ground level.  Between this redundancy and their noticeable "
"movement creating frequent gaps, it's tough to get a solid shot on the thing."
msgstr ""
"Une énorme tour fongique. Son chapeau est maintenu par de nombreuses vrilles "
"de tailles diverses et des racines hérissés. Ses mouvement saccadés le "
"rendent difficile à toucher."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal sporeling"
msgid_plural "fungal sporelings"
msgstr[0] "sporeling mycellaire"
msgstr[1] "sporelings mycellaires"
msgstr[2] "sporelings mycellaires"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal sporeling"
msgid ""
"A fungal stalk several feet in height.  Two vicious-looking tendrils extend "
"from its thorned and leathery exterior, and it moves about faster than the "
"larger fungaloids."
msgstr ""
"Une tige fongique de plusieurs dizaines de centimètres de haut. Deux vrilles "
"menaçantes s'étendant de sa surface tannée couverte d'épines. Cet organisme "
"se déplaçant beaucoup plus vite que la plupart des autres créatures "
"mycellaires dans les environs."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "spore cloud"
msgid_plural "spore clouds"
msgstr[0] "nuage de spores"
msgstr[1] "nuages de spores"
msgstr[2] "nuages de spores"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "spore cloud"
msgid "A mass of spores the size of a balled fist, wafting around in the air."
msgstr "Un amas de spores de la taille d'un poing, se baladant dans l'air."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal ant"
msgid_plural "fungal ants"
msgstr[0] "fourmi mycellaire"
msgstr[1] "fourmis mycellaires"
msgstr[2] "fourmis mycellaires"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal ant"
msgid ""
"Pale, sickly gray in color, this giant ant's cracked exoskeleton is barely "
"held together by coils of fungus erupting from every joint in its body."
msgstr ""
"L'exosquelette d'une pâleur grise maladive et fendu de cette fourmi géante "
"est à peine maintenu en un morceau par des fonges qui jaillissent des "
"articulations de l'animal."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal spider"
msgid_plural "fungal spiders"
msgstr[0] "araignée mycellaire"
msgstr[1] "araignées mycellaires"
msgstr[2] "araignées mycellaires"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal spider"
msgid ""
"The abdomen of this sickly-looking giant spider is now home to many lumps of "
"blooming fungi.  It leaves behind a trail of tainted secretions as it "
"struggles to drag itself along the ground."
msgstr ""
"L'abdomen de cette araignée géante à l'apparence pitoyable est maintenant "
"l'hôte de nombreuses taches de champignons proliférants et sa marche "
"laborieuse laisse derrière elle une trainée de soie moisie lorsque ces "
"filières heurtent le sol."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal wasp"
msgid_plural "fungal wasps"
msgstr[0] "guêpe mycellaire"
msgstr[1] "guêpes mycellaires"
msgstr[2] "guêpes mycellaires"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal wasp"
msgid ""
"A huge wasp the size of a large cat.  It's bright yellow markings have faded "
"and ripped to show a disgusting mass of mold and rot beneath.  Her wings jut "
"into extremely odd angles, making flight impossible.  Even still, it chases "
"anything without any sense of self-preservation."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal wasp guard"
msgid_plural "fungal wasp guards"
msgstr[0] "guêpe gardienne mycellaire"
msgstr[1] "guêpes gardiennes mycellaires"
msgstr[2] "guêpes gardiennes mycellaires"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal wasp guard"
msgid ""
"A wasp worker split down the middle.  While it's condition looks fatal, it "
"doesn't seem to die, supposedly by the large mushroom growing from once it's "
"wings were.  It's emotionless face still seems to cry with pain and anger."
msgstr ""
" Une  guêpe ouvrière fendue en deux. Bien que son état semble fatal, elle ne "
"semble pas mourir, apparemment grâce au grand champignon qui pousse à "
"l'endroit où étaient ses ailes. Son visage inexpressif semble toujours "
"pleurer de douleur et de colère."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal wasp queen"
msgid_plural "fungal wasp queens"
msgstr[0] "reine guêpe mycellaire"
msgstr[1] "reines guêpes mycellaires"
msgstr[2] "reines guêpes mycellaires"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal wasp queen"
msgid ""
"A mutated wasp queen that has been consumed by a sickly gray mold covering "
"it's body.  Abandoning it's duty to laying eggs, it seemingly searches for "
"anything to attack, as a mist of spores emit from it's mandibles."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant fungal wasp"
msgid_plural "giant fungal wasps"
msgstr[0] "guêpe mycellaire géante"
msgstr[1] "guêpes mycellaires géantes"
msgstr[2] "guêpes mycellaires géantes"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant fungal wasp"
msgid ""
"A gigantic wasp worker, It's body now a host for a plethora of mushrooms and "
"spores.  Her abdomen glows faintly with a blue light, each pulse bringing a "
"new crack for fungal growths to escape from.  It's stinger seems to have a "
"soul of it's own, reaching out towards anything that isn't infested like "
"itself."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant fungal wasp guard"
msgid_plural "giant fungal wasp guards"
msgstr[0] "guêpe gardienne mycellaire gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "guêpes gardiennes mycellaires gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "guêpes gardiennes mycellaires gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant fungal wasp guard"
msgid ""
"A wasp worker which seems to move like a puppet on strings.  It ambles "
"backwards, its stinger, grotesquely swollen and pulsating, serving as a "
"perverse compass guiding it forward, seeking relentlessly for "
"something—anything—to pierce.  It periodically contracts and then abruptly "
"expands, ejecting a fine mist of spores into the surrounding air."
msgstr ""
"Une guêpe ouvrière qui semble se déplacer comme une marionnette sur des fils. "
"Elle déambule en arrière, son dard grotesque gonflé et pulsatile servant de "
"boussole perverse la guidant vers l'avant, cherchant inlassablement quelque "
"chose - n'importe quoi - à percer. Elle se contracte périodiquement puis se "
"dilate brusquement, éjectant un fin brouillard de spores dans l'air "
"environnant."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant fungal wasp queen"
msgid_plural "giant fungal wasp queens"
msgstr[0] "reine guêpe mycellaire gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "reines guêpes mycellaires gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "reines guêpes mycellaires gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant fungal wasp queen"
msgid ""
"The head of this colossal queen wasp appears to be attached by only a few "
"slender threads, wobbling precariously as additional tendrils sprout from the "
"silky white exoskeleton.  Her batch of eggs has decayed due to lack of proper "
"care, yet they seem to twitch, as if something within is attempting to break "
"free from the hardened shells."
msgstr ""
"La tête de cette colossale reine guêpe semble être attachée par seulement "
"quelques fils, vacillant précairement alors que des tentacules "
"supplémentaires poussent de l'exosquelette blanc soyeux. Sa couvée d'œufs "
"s'est décomposée en raison du manque de soins appropriés, mais ils semblent "
"trembler, comme si quelque chose à l'intérieur essayait de s'échapper des "
"coquilles durcies."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal bee"
msgid_plural "fungal bees"
msgstr[0] "abeille mycellaire"
msgstr[1] "abeilles mycellaires"
msgstr[2] "abeilles mycellaires"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal bee"
msgid ""
"A mutant bee the size of a small dog.  It's fur, once used to collect pollen "
"has been trapped with thousands of spores.  it moves erratically on the "
"ground, seemingly having great difficulty to keep any sense of coordination "
"as visible growths of mold worsen underneath the thin hairs."
msgstr ""
"Une abeille mutante de la taille d'un petit chien. Sa fourrure, autrefois "
"utilisée pour collecter du pollen, est piégée avec des milliers de spores. "
"Elle se déplace de manière erratique sur le sol, semblant avoir beaucoup de "
"mal à conserver tout sens de coordination alors que des croissances visibles "
"de moisissure s'aggravent sous les poils fins."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant fungal bee"
msgid_plural "giant fungal bees"
msgstr[0] "abeille mycellaire géante"
msgstr[1] "abeilles mycellaires géantes"
msgstr[2] "abeilles mycellaires géantes"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant fungal bee"
msgid ""
"A sickly-sweet smelling gray goo pours from the mandibles of this dog-sized "
"insect, stirs an odd sense of hunger within you.  However, the writhing "
"syringe-looking needle and thick plumes of spores around quickly quell your "
"appetite."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "alpha fungal bee"
msgid_plural "alpha fungal bees"
msgstr[0] "abeille mycellaire alpha"
msgstr[1] "abeilles mycellaires alpha"
msgstr[2] "abeilles mycellaires alpha"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "alpha fungal bee"
msgid ""
"This oversized insect's every move is coerced by a seemingly invisible "
"entity, like a puppet on strings.  Thousands of live spores fume from it's "
"mandibles, forming thick clouds.  A stark blue gel leaks from it's "
"splintering limbs, bubbling and sizzling, revealing soft, pulsing gray "
"material beneath."
msgstr ""
"Chaque mouvement de cet insecte surdimensionné à l'air d'être gouverné comme "
"une marionette par une force invisible.  Ses mandibules dégagent un flot "
"constant de spores formant des nuages épais dans ses environs et de la "
"gélatine bleu vibrant suinte de son exosquelette fragmenté sous lequel est "
"visible de la matière grise palpitante."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "whispering fungi"
msgid_plural "whispering fungis"
msgstr[0] "champignon murmurant"
msgstr[1] "champignons murmurants"
msgstr[2] "champignons murmurants"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "whispering fungi"
msgid ""
"Large, yellow, coral-like fungi grow from this spot, their spires riddled "
"with intersecting holes.  Despite lack of wind, it seems to wave at a set "
"rhythm, occasionally pulsing out spores.  A chorus of weak, whistly voices, "
"mixed with different accents and languages—some you recognize, others that "
"seem like meaningless gibberish—emanates from it."
msgstr ""

