"drips with a frothing gray sludge."
msgstr ""
"Un humain rond et gras en décomposition, avec la chair infestée par les "
"spores. Un liquide grisâtre et mousseux s'écoule de sa bouche."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted zombie wretch"
msgid_plural "dusted zombie wretches"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted zombie wretch"
msgid ""
"This small child lies on the ground shaking gently, dusted with a thick gray "
"powder.  The chest of the child appears to have broken open like a gory "
"flower and there is strange pulsing movement and also unpleasant wet sounds "
"within."
msgstr ""
"Ce petit enfant gît sur le sol en tremblant doucement, saupoudré d'une "
"épaisse poudre grise. La poitrine de l'enfant semble s'être ouverte comme une "
"fleur sanglante et il y a d'étranges pulsations et des bruits humides "
"désagréables à l'intérieur."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk wretch"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk wretches"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk wretch"
msgid ""
"This small child lies on the ground smiling serenely, a short stalk of gray "
"fungus bursting triumphantly from the top of the little head.  The chest of "
"the child appears to have broken open like a gory flower and there is strange "
"pulsing movement and also unpleasant wet sounds within."
msgstr ""
"Ce petit enfant est allongé sur le sol et sourit sereinement, une courte tige "
"de champignon gris jaillissant triomphalement du sommet de sa tête. La "
"poitrine de l'enfant semble s'être ouverte comme une fleur sanglante et il y "
"a d'étranges pulsations et des bruits humides désagréables à l'intérieur."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal wretch"
msgid_plural "fungal wretches"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal wretch"
msgid ""
"This severely deformed child lies on its back, its ribs exposed to the sky.  "
"With its limbs contorted in ways only possible through a lack of bones, the "
"child's ribcage stretches far beyond the boundaries of human biology, "
"appearing akin to a bony hive coated in quivering fungal matter.  Spores "
"occasionally waft from its hollowed interior, and, periodically, you can "
"catch sight of weak movement within the abomination's guts."
msgstr ""
"Cet enfant gravement déformé est couché sur le dos, les côtes exposées au "
"ciel. La cage thoracique de l'enfant s'étire bien au-delà des limites de la "
"biologie humaine, ressemblant à une ruche osseuse recouverte de matière "
"fongique frémissante. Des spores s'échappent parfois de son intérieur creusé "
"et, périodiquement, vous pouvez apercevoir un faible mouvement dans les "
"entrailles de l'abomination."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "fungal wretch"
msgid ""
"Through a plume of fungal spores, a small beast struggles to take flight from "
"the wretch's abdomen!"
msgstr ""
"A travers un panache de spores fongiques, une petite bête tente de s'envoler "
"de l'abdomen du malheureux !"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted raptor"
msgid_plural "dusted raptors"
msgstr[0] "raptor saupoudré"
msgstr[1] "raptors saupoudrés"
msgstr[2] "raptors saupoudrés"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted raptor"
msgid ""
"Heavily dusted with a thick gray powder, this small, winged predator darts "
"through the air on three spongy wings that look like stretched human hands.  "
"A sheer, jagged spike juts out from the point where the wings meet."
msgstr ""
"Ce petit prédateur ailé, fortement saupoudré d'une épaisse poudre grise, "
"s'élance dans les airs sur trois ailes spongieuses qui ressemblent à des "
"mains humaines étirées. Une pointe acérée et dentelée jaillit du point de "
"jonction des ailes."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk raptor"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk raptors"
msgstr[0] "raptor à tige fongique"
msgstr[1] "raptors à tige fongique"
msgstr[2] "raptors à tige fongique"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk raptor"
msgid ""
"This small, winged predator darts through the air on three spongy wings that "
"look like stretched human hands.  A sheer, jagged spike juts out from the "
"point where the wings meet, joined by a short stalk of gray fungus reaching "
"upward."
msgstr ""
"Ce petit prédateur ailé s'élance dans les airs sur trois ailes spongieuses "
"qui ressemblent à des mains humaines étirées. Une pointe acérée et dentelée "
"jaillit du point de rencontre des ailes, rejointe par une courte tige de "
"champignon gris s'élevant vers le haut."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal raptor"
msgid_plural "fungal raptors"
msgstr[0] "raptor mycellaire"
msgstr[1] "raptors mycellaires"
msgstr[2] "raptors mycellaires"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal raptor"
msgid ""
"Infested by a thick crust of fungal growth, this small, winged predator darts "
"through the air on three spongy wings that look like stretched human hands.  "
"A sheer, jagged spike juts out from the point where the wings meet.  It looks "
"like nothing you've seen on Earth, and yet strangely like it is made of human "
"parts."
msgstr ""
"Infesté d'une épaisse croûte de champignons, ce petit prédateur ailé s'élance "
"dans les airs sur trois ailes spongieuses qui ressemblent à des mains "
"humaines étirées. Une pointe acérée et dentelée jaillit du point de jonction "
"des ailes. Il ne ressemble à rien de ce que vous avez vu sur Terre, et "
"pourtant, étrangement, il semble être fait de parties humaines."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
