msgid_plural "fungal runners"
msgstr[0] "sprinteur mycellaire"
msgstr[1] "sprinteurs mycellaires"
msgstr[2] "sprinteurs mycellaires"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal runner"
msgid ""
"Fungal sprouts seem to support the host's broken legs like crude splints.  "
"Even with its eyes shrouded with tiny spores, it darts towards anything that "
"seems to move in a small radius."
msgstr ""
"Des germes fongiques semblent soutenir les jambes cassées de l'hôte comme de "
"vulgaires attelles. Même si ses yeux sont recouverts de minuscules spores, il "
"s'élance vers tout ce qui semble bouger dans un petit rayon."

