msgid "This badly decayed corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr ""
"Ce cadavre en état de décomposition avancée a été abondamment recouvert d'une "
"épaisse poudre grise."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk rotter"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk rotters"
msgstr[0] "zombie putréfié à tige fongique"
msgstr[1] "zombies putréfiés à tige fongique"
msgstr[2] "zombies putréfiés à tige fongique"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk rotter"
msgid ""
"This badly decayed corpse has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting "
"from the skull."
msgstr ""
"Sur ce cadavre en état de décomposition avancée, une courte tige de "
"champignon gris a poussé sur le crâne."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal rotter"
msgid_plural "fungal rotters"
msgstr[0] "carcasse fongique"
msgstr[1] "carcasses fongiques"
msgstr[2] "carcasses fongiques"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal rotter"
msgid ""
"The rotten skin that flakes from the host's body seems to be covered in tiny "
"blue dots; occasional popping and crackling sounds are heard, like cracking "
"wood.  This corpse can't be discerned as human by the naked eye."
msgstr ""
"La peau pourrie qui pèle de la peau de ce cadavre ambulant n'ayant plus "
"qu'une silhouette vaguement humanoïde à l'air d'être couverte de tâches "
"bleues, et vous pouvez entendre des bruits des claquements et craquements "
"ressemblant à du bois sec chaque fois que celui-ci bouge."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted tough zombie"
msgid_plural "dusted tough zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie athlétique saupoudré"
msgstr[1] "zombies athlétiques saupoudrés"
msgstr[2] "zombies athlétiques saupoudrés"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted tough zombie"
msgid "This muscular moving corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr ""
"Ce cadavre musclé et mouvant a été lourdement recouvert d'une épaisse poudre "
"grise."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk bulk"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk bulks"
msgstr[0] "zombie athlétique à tige fongique"
msgstr[1] "zombies athlétiques à tige fongique"
msgstr[2] "zombies athlétiques à tige fongique"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk bulk"
msgid ""
"This muscular corpse has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the "
"skull."
msgstr ""
"Sur ce cadavre musclé, une courte tige de champignon gris a poussé à partir "
"du crâne."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal bulk"
msgid_plural "fungal bulks"
msgstr[0] "bloc fongique"
msgstr[1] "blocs fongiques"
msgstr[2] "blocs fongiques"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal bulk"
msgid ""
"This terrifying fungal construct seems to have lost all facial features, its "
"face covered in thick fungal sprouts.  Its arms end in jagged points as "
"fungal tendrils burst forth."
msgstr ""
"Cette terrifiante construction fongique semble avoir perdu tous ses traits, "
"son visage étant recouvert d'épaisses pousses fongiques. Ses bras se "
"terminent par des pointes déchiquetées, tandis que des vrilles fongiques en "
"jaillissent."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted brute zombie"
msgid_plural "dusted brute zombies"
msgstr[0] "brute zombie saupoudrée"
msgstr[1] "brutes zombies saupoudrées"
msgstr[2] "brutes zombies saupoudrées"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted brute zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie's entire body bulges with distended muscles heavily dusted with a "
"thick gray powder."
msgstr ""
"Le corps entier de ce zombie est bardé de muscles distendus fortement "
"saupoudrés d'une épaisse poudre grise."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk brute"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk brutes"
msgstr[0] "brute zombie à tige fongique"
msgstr[1] "brutes zombies à tige fongique"
msgstr[2] "brutes zombies à tige fongique"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk brute"
msgid ""
"This inhumanly muscular corpse has numerous festering wounds and has grown a "
"short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr ""
"Ce cadavre à la musculature inhumaine présente de nombreuses plaies "
"suppurantes et une courte tige de champignon gris a poussé sur son crâne."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal brute"
msgid_plural "fungal brutes"
msgstr[0] "brute mycellaire"
msgstr[1] "brutes mycellaires"
msgstr[2] "brutes mycellaires"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal brute"
msgid ""
"This bulky fungal construct seems to have lost all facial features, its chest "
"and face covered in thick fungal sprouts.  Its arms and legs are grotesquely "
"swollen."
msgstr ""
"Cette construction fongique volumineuse semble avoir perdu tous ses traits, "
"sa poitrine et son visage étant recouverts d'épaisses pousses fongiques. Ses "
"bras et ses jambes sont grotesquement gonflés."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted zombie hulk"
msgid_plural "dusted zombie hulks"
msgstr[0] "zombie mastodonte saupoudré"
msgstr[1] "zombies mastodontes saupoudrés"
msgstr[2] "zombies mastodontes saupoudrés"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted zombie hulk"
msgid ""
"This zombie's muscular body has swollen to six times the size of an average "
"person and has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr ""
"Le corps musclé de ce zombie a gonflé jusqu'à atteindre six fois la taille "
"d'une personne moyenne et a été fortement recouvert d'une épaisse poudre "
"grise."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk hulk"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk hulks"
msgstr[0] "mastodonte à tige fongique"
msgstr[1] "mastodontes à tige fongique"
msgstr[2] "mastodontes à tige fongique"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk hulk"
msgid ""
"This enormous muscular corpse has swollen six times larger and has grown a "
"short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr ""
"Cet énorme cadavre musclé s'est multiplié par six et une courte tige de "
"champignon gris est sortie du crâne."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal hulk"
msgid_plural "fungal hulks"
msgstr[0] "mastodonte mycellaire"
msgstr[1] "mastodontes mycellaires"
msgstr[2] "mastodontes mycellaires"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal hulk"
msgid ""
"This inhumanly warped and swollen fungal construct is entirely covered in "
"thick fungal sprouts.  The body shape is still roughly humanoid but the size "
"is too large, about the size of six people combined."
msgstr ""
"Cette construction fongique inhumainement déformée et gonflée est entièrement "
"recouverte d'épaisses pousses fongiques. La forme du corps est encore à peu "
"près humanoïde, mais la taille est trop grande, environ la taille de six "
"personnes réunies."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted crawling zombie"
msgid_plural "dusted crawling zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie rampant saupoudré"
msgstr[1] "zombies rampants saupoudrés"
msgstr[2] "zombies rampants saupoudrés"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted crawling zombie"
msgid ""
"This moving corpse with badly damaged legs has been heavily dusted with a "
"thick gray powder."
msgstr ""
"Ce cadavre mobile aux jambes très abîmées a été abondamment recouvert d'une "
"épaisse poudre grise."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk crawler"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk crawlers"
msgstr[0] "zombie rampant à tige fongique"
msgstr[1] "zombies rampants à tige fongique"
msgstr[2] "zombies rampants à tige fongique"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk crawler"
msgid ""
"This moving corpse with badly damaged legs has grown a short stalk of gray "
"fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr ""
"Ce cadavre en mouvement, aux jambes très abîmées, a vu pousser une courte "
"tige de champignon gris qui jaillit du crâne."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal zombie crawler"
msgid_plural "fungal zombie crawlers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal zombie crawler"
msgid ""
"This fungal monster struggles to move as bulbous mushrooms grow from its "
"exposed back.  Its leg seems to be wrapped in sturdy tendrils, and its arms "
"visibly swell and pop gruesomely with each drag along the ground."
msgstr ""
"Ce monstre fongique s'efforce de bouger tandis que des champignons bulbeux "
"poussent sur son dos exposé. Sa jambe semble enveloppée de vrilles robustes, "
"et ses bras gonflent visiblement et éclatent de façon effroyable à chaque "
"fois qu'il se traîne sur le sol."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted fat zombie"
msgid_plural "dusted fat zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie obèse saupoudré"
msgstr[1] "zombies obèses saupoudrés"
msgstr[2] "zombies obèses saupoudrés"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted fat zombie"
msgid "This heavy moving corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "Ce cadavre lourd et mobile a été saupoudré d'une épaisse poudre grise."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk feeder"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk feeders"
msgstr[0] "carcasse à tige fongique"
msgstr[1] "carcasses à tige fongique"
msgstr[2] "carcasses à tige fongique"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk feeder"
msgid ""
"This heavy corpse has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the "
"skull."
msgstr "Sur ce lourd cadavre, une courte tige de champignon gris est sortie du crâne."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal feeder"
msgid_plural "fungal feeders"
msgstr[0] "nourrice fongique"
msgstr[1] "nourrices fongiques"
msgstr[2] "nourrices fongiques"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal feeder"
msgid ""
"Thousands upon thousands of fungal bulbs, sprouts and tendrils jut out from "
"every angle of this walking carcass.  Large patches of yellow pulsating mold "
"seem to be growing in the zombie's fat folds."
msgstr ""
"Des milliers et des milliers de bulbes, de germes et de vrilles fongiques "
"jaillissent de tous les angles de cette carcasse ambulante. De grandes "
"plaques de moisissure jaune pulsante semblent se développer dans les plis "
"graisseux du zombie."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted scarred zombie"
msgid_plural "dusted scarred zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie balafré saupoudré"
msgstr[1] "zombies balafrés saupoudrés"
msgstr[2] "zombies balafrés saupoudrés"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted scarred zombie"
msgid "This heavily scarred moving corpse has been covered with a thick gray powder."
msgstr ""
"Ce cadavre en mouvement, très marqué, a été recouvert d'une épaisse poudre "
"grise."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungalizing scarred zombie"
msgid_plural "fungalizing scarred zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungalizing scarred zombie"
msgid ""
"This heavily scarred moving corpse has grown a short stalk of gray fungus "
"bursting from the skull."
msgstr ""
"Ce cadavre en mouvement, lourdement cicatrisé, a vu pousser une courte tige "
"de champignon gris qui jaillit du crâne."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scarred fungal zombie"
msgid_plural "scarred fungal zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie fongique balafré"
msgstr[1] "zombies fongiques balafrés"
msgstr[2] "zombies fongiques balafrés"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scarred fungal zombie"
msgid ""
"The tough callouses and scar tissue of this unfortunate corpse are the only "
"remaining signs of something once made of flesh; any spot seemingly soft "
"enough has been thoroughly punctured by thick fungal tendrils that have "
"started to creep over this disfigured husk."
msgstr ""
"Les callosités coriaces et le tissu cicatriciel de ce malheureux cadavre sont "
"les seuls signes restants de quelque chose qui était autrefois fait de chair "
"; tout endroit apparemment assez mou a été minutieusement perforé par "
"d'épaisses vrilles fongiques qui ont commencé à s'étendre sur cette enveloppe "
"défigurée."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted acidic zombie"
msgid_plural "dusted acidic zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie acide saupoudré"
msgstr[1] "zombies acides saupoudrés"
msgstr[2] "zombies acides saupoudrés"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted acidic zombie"
msgid "This acrid smelling moving corpse has been covered with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "Ce cadavre mobile à l'odeur âcre a été recouvert d'une épaisse poudre grise."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungalizing acid zombie"
msgid_plural "fungalizing acid zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungalizing acid zombie"
msgid ""
"This sickly looking moving corpse with prominent yellow veins has grown a "
"short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr ""
"Ce cadavre mobile à l'aspect maladif et aux veines jaunes proéminentes a "
"développé une courte tige de champignon gris qui jaillit du crâne."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "acidic fungal zombie"
msgid_plural "acidic fungal zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie fongique acidique"
msgstr[1] "zombies fongiques acidiques"
msgstr[2] "zombies fongiques acidiques"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "acidic fungal zombie"
msgid ""
"A grotesque fusion of rot and mycelium, this zombie's flesh is pocked with "
"open sores that lazily drool a strange yellow-green acid.  Pale fungal stalks "
"have burst through its corroded skin, their slimy caps dripping with what "
"seems to be the same fluid.  The air around it is thick with the scent of rot "
"and acrid chemicals."
msgstr ""
"Fusion grotesque de pourriture et de mycélium, la chair de ce zombie est "
"parsemée de plaies ouvertes qui bavent paresseusement un étrange acide "
"jaune-vert. Des tiges fongiques pâles ont éclaté à travers sa peau corrodée, "
"leurs capuchons visqueux dégoulinant de ce qui semble être le même fluide. "
"L'air qui l'entoure est chargé d'une odeur de pourriture et de produits "
"chimiques âcres."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal dog"
msgid_plural "fungal dogs"
msgstr[0] "chien mycellaires"
msgstr[1] "chiens mycellaires"
msgstr[2] "chiens mycellaires"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal dog"
msgid ""
"The deformed, animated, and again reanimated corpse of a what looked like the "
"concept of a canine.  It has lost almost all of its dog-like features, except "
"for its constant aggressive growling, and tendency to bite.  It shakes its "
"fur like a wet dog, sending tiny spore clouds everywhere."
msgstr ""
"Le cadavre déformé, animé et à nouveau réanimé d'un être qui ressemblait à un "
"canidé.Il a perdu presque toutes ses caractéristiques canines, à l'exception "
"de ses grognements agressifs constants et de sa tendance à mordre. Il secoue "
"sa fourrure comme un chien mouillé, envoyant de minuscules nuages de spores "
"partout."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "antlered fungal horror"
msgid_plural "antlered fungal horrors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "antlered fungal horror"
msgid ""
"This formerly-majestic beast has lost any semblance of what a moose is, aside "
"from its outgrown antlers, now covered in writhing fungal tendrils, seemingly "
"trying to break into the cracking bone.  The animated corpse seems to be in a "
"state of constant disrepair, held together by strange, sticky blue orbs."
msgstr ""
"Cette bête autrefois majestueuse a perdu tout aspect de ce qu'est un élan, à "
"l'exception de ses bois devenus trop grands, désormais recouverts de vrilles "
"fongiques se tortillant, semblant essayer de pénétrer dans l'os qui se "
"fissure. Le cadavre animé semble être dans un état de délabrement constant, "
"tenant ensemble par d'étranges orbes bleus collants."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal pouncer"
msgid_plural "fungal pouncers"
msgstr[0] "félin fongique"
msgstr[1] "félins fongiques"
msgstr[2] "félins fongiques"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal pouncer"
msgid ""
"This four legged, oversized cat seems to spew spores from its pawpads with "
"each clumsy landing, as if constantly gaining and losing balance in air."
msgstr ""
"Ce chat surdimensionné à quatre pattes semble cracher des spores de ses "
"coussinets à chaque atterrissage maladroit, comme s'il gagnait et perdait "
"constamment l'équilibre dans l'air."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid " rotten fungal horse"
msgid_plural " rotten fungal horses"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster " rotten fungal horse"
msgid ""
"This hulking horse-figure seems to re-learn galloping with every step, as "
"large fungi cling and sprout off of its mane.  It travels towards anything "
"moving, even though in the center of each eye lies multiple fungal blooms."
msgstr ""
"Ce cheval massif semble réapprendre le galop à chaque pas, alors que de "
"grands champignons s'accrochent à sa crinière et y poussent. Il se dirige "
"vers tout ce qui bouge, même si au centre de chaque œil se trouvent de "
"multiples fleurs fongiques."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tiger fungal wight"
msgid_plural "tiger fungal wights"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tiger fungal wight"
msgid ""
"This rotting tiger has lost its stumble, as large fungal bulbs seem to have "
"extended its pawpads thoroughly.  Its head crackles when trying to turn, "
"seemingly stuck facing forward."
msgstr ""
"Ce tigre en décomposition a perdu son équilibre, car de gros bulbes fongiques "
"semblent avoir atteint ses coussinets en profondeur. Sa tête craque lorsqu'il "
"essaie de se tourner, apparemment bloquée vers l'avant."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal wight"
msgid_plural "fungal wights"
msgstr[0] "nécrophage mycellaire"
msgstr[1] "nécrophages mycellaires"
msgstr[2] "nécrophages mycellaires"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal wight"
msgid ""
"This deer's thick fur is spotted with blue orbs that seem to pop and ooze "
"every few minutes, and its rotten skin seems unable to fall off, held "
"together by thick fungal bedding underneath."
msgstr ""
"L'épaisse fourrure de ce cerf est tachetée d'orbes bleus qui semblent surgir "
"et suinter toutes les quelques minutes, et sa peau pourrie semble incapable "
"de se détacher, maintenue par une épaisse couche de champignons."

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal reindeer"
msgid_plural "fungal reindeer"
msgstr[0] "renne fongique"
msgstr[1] "rennes fongiques"
msgstr[2] "rennes fongiques"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal reindeer"
msgid ""
"This bumpy, discolored reindeer resembles a malformed Rudolph, its nose "
"having a faintly glowing red fungal sprout.  It'd look almost comical if it "
"wasn't mutilating bodies with its innate strength."
msgstr ""
"Ce renne bosselé et décoloré ressemble à un Rudolph malformé, son nez "
"présentant un germe fongique rouge légèrement incandescent. Il aurait presque "
"l'air comique s'il ne mutilait pas des corps avec sa force innée."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dark wyrm"
msgid_plural "dark wyrms"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dark wyrm"
msgid ""
"A huge mutated worm living deep underground.  It has a round, gaping mouth "
"lined with dagger-like teeth, and its flesh is slick with bubbling blue slime."
msgstr ""
"Un ver mutant énorme habitant les grandes profondeurs et doté d'une gueule "
"ronde béante bordées de dents de la taille de dagues, sa peau couverte de "
"mucus bleue bouillonnant."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "graboid"
msgid_plural "graboids"
msgstr[0] "graboid"
msgstr[1] "graboids"
msgstr[2] "graboids"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "graboid"
msgid ""
"This huge subterranean creature is a far cry from its earthworm ancestors.  "
"Despite only seeing its head, you can tell its grown to a mind-boggling size. "
" While the image may be quite unsettling, it doesn't appear to pay you any "
"mind."
msgstr ""
"Cette énorme créature souterraine est bien loin de ses ancêtres les vers de "
"terre. Même si l'on ne voit que sa tête, on devine qu'elle a atteint une "
"taille stupéfiante. Bien que l'image soit assez troublante, il ne semble pas "
"faire attention à vous."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "graboid half worm"
msgid_plural "graboid half worms"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "graboid half worm"
msgid "A squiggling severed portion of a wounded graboid."
msgstr "Une partie coupée d'un graboïde blessé qui se tortille."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant half worm"
msgid_plural "giant half worms"
msgstr[0] "demi-vers gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "demi-vers gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "demi-vers gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant half worm"
msgid "A squiggling severed portion of a wounded giant worm."
msgstr "Un morceau ondulant coupé d'un ver géant blessé."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant earthworm"
msgid_plural "giant earthworms"
msgstr[0] "ver de terre gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "vers de terre gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "vers de terre gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant earthworm"
msgid ""
"A huge, mutated garden worm peeking out from the earth - pink, ringed, and "
"most importantly docile.  Despite its size and looks, it appears to be "
"peaceful."
msgstr ""
"Un énorme ver de terre mutant, rose, annelé et surtout docile, sort de terre. "
"Malgré sa taille et son apparence, il semble paisible."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized earthworm"
msgid_plural "oversized earthworms"
msgstr[0] "ver de terre surdimensionné"
msgstr[1] "vers de terre surdimensionnés"
msgstr[2] "vers de terre surdimensionnés"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized earthworm"
msgid ""
"A disturbingly large wriggling earthworm with the moist earth still clinging "
"to its slimy body.  Despite its size it appears to be peaceful, a refreshing "
"change for once."
msgstr ""
"Un ver de terre gigotant d'une taille inquiétante, la terre humide "
"s'accrochant encore à son corps visqueux. Malgré sa taille, il semble "
"paisible, un changement rafraîchissant pour une fois."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized half worm"
msgid_plural "oversized half worms"
msgstr[0] "demi-ver surdimensionné"
msgstr[1] "demi-vers surdimensionnés"
msgstr[2] "demi-vers surdimensionnés"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized half worm"
msgid "A squiggling severed portion of a wounded oversized worm."
msgstr "Partie sectionnée d'un ver surdimensionné blessé."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "earthworm larva"
msgid_plural "earthworm larvae"
msgstr[0] "larve de ver de terre"
msgstr[1] "larves de ver de terre"
msgstr[2] "larves de ver de terre"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "earthworm larva"
msgid "A white wriggling worm."
msgstr "Un ver de terre juvénile à la couleur laiteuse de taille impressionnante."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized cockroach"
msgid_plural "oversized cockroaches"
msgstr[0] "cafard surdimensionné"
msgstr[1] "cafards surdimensionnés"
msgstr[2] "cafards surdimensionnés"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized cockroach"
msgid "An aggressive mutant cockroach the size of a small dog."
msgstr "Un cafard mutant agressif de la taille d'un petit chien."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skittering plague"
msgid_plural "skittering plagues"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skittering plague"
msgid ""
"A giant, sickly-looking cockroach that appears to be using the undead as its "
"primary food source.  The diet of infected flesh doesn't seem to harm it, but "
"something about the roach's biology is clearly changing.  It doesn't seem "
"interested in you."
msgstr ""
"Un cafard énorme à l'apparence maladive ayant l'air d'utiliser les "
"morts-vivants comme la base de son alimentation. Ce régime repoussant n'a pas "
"l'air de significativement lui être nuisible, mais sa physiologie est "
"clairement en train d'être modifiée. Heureusement pour vous, vous avez l'air "
"beaucoup trop vivant(e) pour que cette créature vous remarque."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "plague nymph"
msgid_plural "plague nymphs"
msgstr[0] "nymphe pestilentielle"
msgstr[1] "nymphes pestilentielles"
msgstr[2] "nymphes pestilentielles"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "plague nymph"
msgid ""
"A sickly-looking mutant cockroach about the size of a rat, raised from birth "
"on a healthy diet of zombie flesh.  It still has enough natural instinct left "
"to avoid approaching you."
msgstr ""
"Un cafard mutant de la taille d'un rat ayant l'air cadavérique du à son "
"alimentation depuis la naissance consistant uniquement de viande de zombie, "
"malgré cela, cette monstruosité a toujours assez d'instinct de conservation "
"pour ne pas s'approcher de vous."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "plague vector"
msgid_plural "plague vectors"
msgstr[0] "vecteur de peste"
msgstr[1] "vecteurs de peste"
msgstr[2] "cafard mutant géant"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "plague vector"
msgid ""
"This giant cockroach has been feeding on the undead for some time and started "
"to mutate chaotically.  Extra limbs and growths sprout from its thorax, and "
"it is notably aggressive even to creatures much larger than itself."
msgstr ""
"Ce cafard géant se nourrit de morts-vivants depuis un certain temps et a "
"commencé à muter de façon chaotique. Des membres supplémentaires et des "
"excroissances jaillissent de son thorax, et il est particulièrement agressif, "
"même envers des créatures beaucoup plus grandes que lui."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant cockroach"
msgid_plural "giant cockroaches"
msgstr[0] "cafard gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "cafards gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "cafards gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant cockroach"
msgid ""
"A mutant cockroach the size of a dog.  This size advantage is apparently all "
"it needs to start regarding humans as food!"
msgstr ""
"Un cafard mutant de la taille d'un chien, à cette taille, cette abomination a "
"apparemment décider d'ajouter l'homme à son menu!"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant cockroach nymph"
msgid_plural "giant cockroach nymphs"
msgstr[0] "nymphe de cafard gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "nymphes de cafard gigantesque"
msgstr[2] "nymphes de cafard gigantesque"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant cockroach nymph"
msgid "A baby mutant cockroach about the size of a rat."
msgstr "Un cafard nouveau-né de la taille d'un rat."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pregnant giant cockroach"
msgid_plural "pregnant giant cockroaches"
msgstr[0] "cafard gigantesque enceinte"
msgstr[1] "cafards gigantesques enceintes"
msgstr[2] "cafards gigantesques enceintes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pregnant giant cockroach"
msgid ""
"A mutant cockroach the size of a small dog.  Its abdomen is heavily swollen "
"with eggs."
msgstr ""
"Un cafard mutant de la taille d'un petit chien, son abdomen plein à craquer "
"d'œufs."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized silverfish"
msgid_plural "oversized silverfish"
msgstr[0] "lépisme surdimensionné"
msgstr[1] "lépismes surdimensionnés"
msgstr[2] "lépismes surdimensionnés"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized silverfish"
msgid "An oversized mutated silverfish the size of a small dog."
msgstr ""
"Un lépisme (aussi connu sous le nom de poisson d'argent) mutant "
"surdimensionné de la taille d'un petit chien."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant silverfish"
msgid_plural "giant silverfish"
msgstr[0] "lépisme gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "lépismes gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "lépismes gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant silverfish"
msgid ""
"A mutant silverfish roughly the size of a person.  Doesn't seem at all "
"interested in you."
msgstr ""
"Un lépisme (aussi connu sous le nom de poisson d'argent) mutant de la taille "
"d'une personne.  Fait de son mieux pour vous ignorer royalement."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant silverfish nymph"
msgid_plural "giant silverfish nymphs"
msgstr[0] "nymphe de lépisme géante"
msgstr[1] "nymphes de lépisme géantes"
msgstr[2] "nymphes de lépisme géantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant silverfish nymph"
msgid "A baby mutant silverfish about the size of a rat."
msgstr ""
"Un lépisme juvénile (aussi connu sous le nom de poisson d'argent) mutant de "
"la taille d'un rat."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized bee"
msgid_plural "oversized bees"
msgstr[0] "abeille surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "abeilles surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "abeilles surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized bee"
msgid "A mutant bee the size of a small dog."
msgstr "Une abeille mutante de la taille d'un chien."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant bee"
msgid_plural "giant bees"
msgstr[0] "abeille gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "abeilles gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "abeilles gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant bee"
msgid ""
"With a stinger the size of a kitchen knife, this dog-sized insect's black and "
"yellow markings warn you to leave it undisturbed."
msgstr ""
"Avec un dard de la taille d'un couteau de cuisine, cet insecte grand comme un "
"chien, présente des marques jaunes vous prévenant de le laisser tranquille."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "alpha bee"
msgid_plural "alpha bees"
msgstr[0] "abeille alpha"
msgstr[1] "abeilles alpha"
msgstr[2] "abeilles alpha"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "alpha bee"
msgid ""
"An enormous mutant bee with black and white markings and a long stinger "
"spelling doom."
msgstr ""
"Une abeille mutante énorme recouverte de marques noires et blanches doté d'un "
"dard tellement long et effilé qu'il pourrait être appelé une épée."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized centipede"
msgid_plural "oversized centipedes"
msgstr[0] "centipède surdimensionné"
msgstr[1] "centipèdes surdimensionnés"
msgstr[2] "centipèdes surdimensionnés"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized centipede"
msgid ""
"A brightly-colored mutant centipede the size of a small dog, skittering "
"quickly in the underbrush.  Probably won't think you're suitable prey, but "
"beware its venom."
msgstr ""
"Un mille-pattes mutant aux couleurs vives, de la taille d'un petit chien, qui "
"se faufile rapidement dans les sous-bois. Il ne vous prendra probablement pas "
"pour une proie convenable, mais méfiez-vous de son venin."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant centipede"
msgid_plural "giant centipedes"
msgstr[0] "centipède gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "centipèdes gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "centipèdes gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant centipede"
msgid ""
"A two-meter-long centipede with a menacing set of venom-dripping mandibles "
"and a worrying number of grabbing appendages, moving swiftly on dozens of "
"spindly legs.  It has a pair of small compound eyes, but seems to mostly "
"orient itself with its antennae."
msgstr ""
"Un centipède de deux mètres de long, doté d'une série de mandibules "
"menaçantes qui laissent échapper du venin et d'un nombre inquiétant "
"d'appendices de préhension, se déplaçant rapidement sur des douzaines de "
"pattes grêles.  Il possède une paire de petits yeux composés, mais semble "
"s'orienter principalement à l'aide de ses antennes."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "centipede larva"
msgid_plural "centipede larvae"
msgstr[0] "larve de centipède"
msgstr[1] "larves de centipède"
msgstr[2] "larves de centipède"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "centipede larva"
msgid ""
"A juvenile centipede.  Despite its young age it is still quite large and you "
"reckon these mandibles could pack quite a bite."
msgstr ""
"Un centipède juvénile. Malgré son jeune age il reste assez gros et vous "
"devriez probablement faire attention à ses mandibules."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "centipede matriarch"
msgid_plural "centipede matriarchs"
msgstr[0] "matriarche centipède"
msgstr[1] "matriarches centipèdes"
msgstr[2] "matriarches centipèdes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "centipede matriarch"
msgid ""
"A giant centipede grown even larger, hind segments curled up to protect a "
"huge clump of eggs and its children of different ages.  Sometimes one of its "
"young gets shaken off by its clutchmates and disappears into the underbrush."
msgstr ""
"Un centipède géant devenu encore plus large, ses segments antérieurs enroulés "
"pour protéger un amas d'œufs énorme couvert de sa progéniture à différents "
"stades de développement. Parfois l'un de ceux-ci se fait expulsé par sa "
"fratrie et s'enfuit hors de vue."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "centipede matriarch"
msgid "A small centipede is shaken off in the struggle!"
msgstr "Un petit centipède est expulsé durant la lutte!"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "armored centipede"
msgid_plural "armored centipedes"
msgstr[0] "centipède géant blindé"
msgstr[1] "centipèdes géants blindés"
msgstr[2] "centipèdes géants blindés"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "armored centipede"
msgid ""
"A huge mutated centipede covered in interlocking chitinous plates of metallic "
"gray, reminding you more of a runaway train car than any living animal.  Its "
"mandibles end in jagged points, seemingly specialized to hunt prey at least "
"as well-armored as itself.  You really don't want to try if you'd fare better."
msgstr ""
"Un énorme mille-pattes mutant recouvert de plaques chitineuses gris métallisé "
"imbriquées les unes dans les autres, évoquant davantage un wagon de train à "
"la dérive qu'un quelconque animal vivant. Ses mandibules se terminent en "
"pointes déchiquetées, apparemment spécialisées pour chasser des proies au "
"moins aussi bien armées que lui. Vous n'avez vraiment pas envie d'essayer si "
"vous vous en sortez mieux."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized house centipede"
msgid_plural "oversized house centipedes"
msgstr[0] "scutigère surdimensionné"
msgstr[1] "scutigères surdimensionnés"
msgstr[2] "scutigères surdimensionnés"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized house centipede"
msgid ""
"A mass of spindly legs the size of a large dog.  It is watching you intently, "
"but doesn't go out of its way to hunt you."
msgstr ""
"Une masse de pattes grêles de la taille d'un gros chien. Il vous observe "
"attentivement, mais ne cherche pas à vous chasser."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant house centipede"
msgid_plural "giant house centipedes"
msgstr[0] "scutigère gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "scutigères gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "scutigères gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant house centipede"
msgid ""
"A house centipede grown to immense size, with a slender body the size of a "
"child held up by a constantly-twitching mess of legs.  Already a fearsome "
"hunter at its normal scale, both its hunger and range of acceptable prey grew "
"to match its new size."
msgstr ""
"Un mille-pattes ayant atteint une taille gigantesque, avec un corps mince de "
"la taille d'un enfant, soutenu par un ensemble de pattes en perpétuel "
"mouvement. Déjà redoutable chasseur à son échelle normale, sa faim et son "
"éventail de proies acceptables se sont accrus pour correspondre à sa nouvelle "
"taille."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant house centipede larva"
msgid_plural "giant house centipede larvae"
msgstr[0] "larve de scutigère géante"
msgstr[1] "larves de scutigère géantes"
msgstr[2] "larves de scutigère géantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant house centipede larva"
msgid "A baby house centipede about the size of a rat."
msgstr "Un scutigère juvénile de la taille d'un rat."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant dragonfly naiad"
msgid_plural "giant dragonfly naiads"
msgstr[0] "naïade de libellule gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "naïades de libellule gigantesque"
msgstr[2] "naïades de libellule gigantesque"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant dragonfly naiad"
msgid ""
"A predatory, aquatic dragonfly larva, normally barely a centimeter long and "
"feeding on small fishes, grown to the size of a catfish.  Underneath its "
"sharp mandibles you can see that its folded lower jaw has changed into "
"something resembling a barbed spear."
msgstr ""
"Une larve de libellule aquatique et carnivore, normalement longue d'un "
"centimètre et chassant petits poissons et insectes, mais celle-ci a atteint "
"la taille d'un poisson-chat. Sous mandibules aiguisées vous apercevez que sa "
"mâchoire inférieure s'est transformée en quelque chose ressemblant à une "
"lance barbelée."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant dragonfly"
msgid_plural "giant dragonflies"
msgstr[0] "libellule gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "libellules gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "libellules gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant dragonfly"
msgid ""
"A ferocious, bright green dragonfly, still lightning-fast despite growing to "
"the size of a schoolchild.  Its head is little more than a basketball-sized "
"pair of rainbow compound eyes, and its legs - already specialized for "
"grasping prey - end in curved talons."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fused dragonflies"
msgid_plural "fused dragonflies"
msgstr[0] "libellules géantes accouplées"
msgstr[1] "libellules géantes accouplées"
msgstr[2] "libellules géantes accouplées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fused dragonflies"
msgid ""
"What appears to be a single, enormous insect with a swollen abdomen is "
"actually the unholy union of two dragonflies in the act of mating, bodies "
"still locked into the telltale heart shape.  The remains of their wings and "
"abdomens form an egg sac they sluggishly pull between them, periodically "
"dropping a handful of glistening eggs."
msgstr ""
"Bien que cette abomination de loin à l'air d'être un seul énorme insecte doté "
"d'un abdomen ballonné, un second coup d'œil révèle que ceci est un couple de "
"libellules mutantes coincées dans leur position de reproduction en forme de "
"cœur, ce qui reste de leurs ailes et de leurs abdomens ayant formé un sac "
"d'œufs qu'elles peinent à trainer derrière elles, duquel s'échappe "
"périodiquement une poignée d'œufs luisants."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized firefly"
msgid_plural "oversized fireflies"
msgstr[0] "luciole surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "lucioles surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "lucioles surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized firefly"
msgid ""
"A mutated firefly grown to the size of a large housecat, brightly glowing "
"abdomen bobbing up and down as it tries to impress its unseen mate.  It looks "
"strangely uninterested in you and everything else."
msgstr ""
"Une luciole mutante de la taille d'un gros chat, son abdomen luisant ce "
"trémoussant pour essayer d'attirer un partenaire en ignorant le monde autour "
"d'elle."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "firefly larva"
msgid_plural "firefly larvae"
msgstr[0] "larve de luciole"
msgstr[1] "larves de luciole"
msgstr[2] "larves de luciole"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "firefly larva"
msgid ""
"An oversized larva of a firefly.  Shockingly large when compared to the "
"adults of its kind."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized fly"
msgid_plural "oversized flies"
msgstr[0] "mouche surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "mouches surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "mouches surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized fly"
msgid ""
"A mutant housefly the size of a small dog.  Its buzzing is high-pitched and "
"somehow sad."
msgstr ""
"Une mouche domestique mutante de la taille d'un petit chien. Son "
"bourdonnement aigu sonne… triste?"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant fly"
msgid_plural "giant flies"
msgstr[0] "mouche gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "mouches gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "mouches gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant fly"
msgid ""
"A tremendous housefly the size of a dog, predictably accompanied by a loud, "
"incessant buzzing sound."
msgstr ""
"Une mouche gigantesque de la taille d'un chien émettant un bourdonnement "
"incessant."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant grub"
msgid_plural "giant grubs"
msgstr[0] "larve géante"
msgstr[1] "larves géantes"
msgstr[2] "larves géantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant grub"
msgid "A grub the size of a small dog."
msgstr "Une larve de la taille d'un petit chien."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "frigate fly"
msgid_plural "frigate flies"
msgstr[0] "mouche gargantuesque"
msgstr[1] "mouches gargantuesques"
msgstr[2] "mouches gargantuesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "frigate fly"
msgid ""
"A mutant housefly the size of a cow, creating a loud buzzing sound as it "
"inexplicably stays airborne."
msgstr ""
"Une mouche domestique mutante de la taille d'une vache, beaucoup trop grosse "
"pour voler et néanmoins émettant un bourdonnement incessant en faisant "
"exactement ce qui devrait lui être impossible."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized mosquito"
msgid_plural "oversized mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "moustique surdimensionné"
msgstr[1] "moustiques surdimensionnés"
msgstr[2] "moustiques surdimensionnés"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized mosquito"
msgid "A mutant mosquito the size of a small dog, buzzing and fluttering erratically."
msgstr ""
"Un moustique mutant de la taille d'un petit chien, volant de façon erratique "
"en bourdonnant."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant mosquito"
msgid_plural "giant mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "moustique gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "moustiques gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "moustiques gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant mosquito"
msgid ""
"A giant mutant mosquito the size of a dog, fluttering erratically.  Its face "
"is dominated by a long, spear-tipped proboscis."
msgstr ""
"Un moustique mutant gigantesque de la taille d'un chien, doté d'une longue "
"trompe se terminant par une pointe de lance vicieuse, volant de façon "
"erratique."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant mosquito larva"
msgid_plural "giant mosquito larvae"
msgstr[0] "larve de moustique géante"
msgstr[1] "larves de moustique géantes"
msgstr[2] "larves de moustique géantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant mosquito larva"
msgid "A large mosquito larva.  A bit more unsettling now that it isn't microscopic."
msgstr ""
"Une grosse larve de moustique. Un peu plus troublante maintenant qu'elle "
"n'est plus microscopique."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bloodbank mosquito"
msgid_plural "bloodbank mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "moustique gargantuesque"
msgstr[1] "moustiques gargantuesques"
msgstr[2] "moustiques gargantuesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bloodbank mosquito"
msgid ""
"A mutant mosquito the size of a cow, with huge, thin wings and legs.  Its "
"face is dominated by a long, spear-tipped proboscis."
msgstr ""
"Un moustique mutant de la taille d'une vache, doté d'une longue trompe se "
"terminant par une pointe de lance vicieuse, ainsi que des pattes et des ailes "
"fines gigantesques."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized moth fly"
msgid_plural "oversized moth flies"
msgstr[0] "mouche d'égout surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "mouches d'égout surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "mouches d'égout surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized moth fly"
msgid "A mutant moth fly the size of a rabbit."
msgstr "Un papillon de nuit mutant de la taille d'un lapin."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant moth fly"
msgid_plural "giant moth flies"
msgstr[0] "mouche d'égout gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "mouches d'égout gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "mouches d'égout gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant moth fly"
msgid "A moth fly the size of a small dog.  It appears to pay you no mind."
msgstr ""
"Un papillon de nuit de la taille d'un petit chien. Elle semble ne pas faire "
"attention à vous."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant moth fly larva"
msgid_plural "giant moth fly larvae"
msgstr[0] "larve de mouche d'égout géante"
msgstr[1] "larves de mouche d'égout géantes"
msgstr[2] "larves de mouche d'égout géantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant moth fly larva"
msgid "A large moth fly larva."
msgstr "Une larve de mouche d'égout de la taille d'un rat."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized cellar spider"
msgid_plural "oversized cellar spiders"
msgstr[0] "araignée de cave surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "araignées de cave surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "araignées de cave surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized cellar spider"
msgid ""
"A cellar spider - also known as \"daddy long-legs\" - grown to distressing "
"size.  Its body is about the size of your head, with the long, spindly legs "
"raising it up to your knee.  It tries getting away from you with an "
"unnervingly fluid run."
msgstr ""
"Une araignée de cave - également connue sous le nom de « papa à longues "
"pattes » - a atteint une taille inquiétante. Son corps est à peu près de la "
"taille de votre tête, et ses longues pattes filiformes l'élèvent jusqu'à "
"votre genou. Elle tente de s'éloigner de vous en courant avec une fluidité "
"déconcertante."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant cellar spider"
msgid_plural "giant cellar spiders"
msgstr[0] "araignée de cave gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "araignées de cave gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "araignées de cave gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant cellar spider"
msgid ""
"A huge brown spider in constant movement, with a small body the size of a "
"child held up at chest level by a set of spindly legs that branch into "
"three-pronged graspers at the end.  Unlike the smaller variant it obviously "
"decided hunting you is worth a try, and follows you with mandibles chittering "
"in anticipation."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'une énorme araignée brune en mouvement constant, dont le petit "
"corps de la taille d'un enfant est maintenu au niveau de la poitrine par un "
"ensemble de pattes grêles qui se ramifient en pinces à trois branches à "
"l'extrémité. Contrairement à la variante plus petite, elle a manifestement "
"décidé que la chasse valait la peine d'être tentée, et elle vous suit en "
"faisant claquer ses mandibules en signe d'anticipation."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cellar spiderling"
msgid_plural "cellar spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "araignée de cave juvénile"
msgstr[1] "araignées de cave juvéniles"
msgstr[2] "araignées de cave juvéniles"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cellar spiderling"
msgid "A juvenile cellar spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr "Une araignée de cave juvénile, de la taille d'une bouteille de bière."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mommy long-legs"
msgid_plural "mommy long legs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mommy long-legs"
msgid ""
"This surprisingly shy giant cellar spider holds a head-sized ball of crawling "
"spiderlings of different ages in its mandibles, carefully balancing on her "
"long legs not to drop the precious cargo.  She seems uninterested in you."
msgstr ""
"Cette araignée géante de cave, étonnamment timide, tient dans ses mandibules "
"une boule de la taille d'une tête contenant des araignées rampantes d'âges "
"différents. Elle se tient soigneusement en équilibre sur ses longues pattes "
"pour ne pas laisser tomber sa précieuse cargaison. Elle ne semble pas "
"s'intéresser à vous."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "mommy long-legs"
msgid "The spiderlings fall to the ground!"
msgstr "Les jeunes araignées tombent au sol !"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "warehouse spider"
msgid_plural "warehouse spiders"
msgstr[0] "araignée d'entrepôt"
msgstr[1] "araignées d'entrepôt"
msgstr[2] "araignées d'entrepôt"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "warehouse spider"
msgid ""
"A tangle of branching chitinous legs operating seemingly independently, "
"somehow still managing to carry a cow-sized central body.  A number of "
"malformed, twitching legs hang from the cephalothorax, but the head -and "
"especially the mandibles- still seem to be in working order."
msgstr ""
"Un enchevêtrement de pattes chitineuses ramifiées fonctionnant apparemment de "
"manière indépendante, tout en parvenant à porter un corps central de la "
"taille d'une vache. Un certain nombre de pattes malformées et agitées pendent "
"du céphalothorax, mais la tête - et surtout les mandibules - semblent encore "
"en état de marche."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "warehouse spider"
msgid "The maimed legs start twitching erratically!"
msgstr "Les pattes mutilées commencent à se contracter de façon erratique !"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "detached spider leg"
msgid_plural "detached spider legs"
msgstr[0] "patte d'araignée détachée"
msgstr[1] "pattes d'araignées détachées"
msgstr[2] "pattes d'araignées détachées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "detached spider leg"
msgid ""
"The strangely branching leg of a mutated cellar spider that… fell?  crawled?  "
"off of the main body when hurt.  It now flails about blindly, irregular "
"clawed appendages grasping at anything that comes close."
msgstr ""
"La patte étrangement articulée d'une araignée de cave mutante qui… est "
"tombée?  a rampé?  s'est détachée du corps principal lorsqu'elle a été "
"blessée.  Elle s'agite désormais à l'aveuglette, ses appendices griffus "
"irréguliers s'agrippant à tout ce qui s'approche d'elle."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized jumping spider"
msgid_plural "oversized jumping spiders"
msgstr[0] "araignée sauteuse surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "araignées sauteuses surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "araignées sauteuses surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized jumping spider"
msgid ""
"A mutant spider the size of a small dog with long forelegs, big eyes, and "
"oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Une araignée mutante de la taille d'un petit chien possédant de longues "
"pattes avant et des crocs surdimensionnés. Deux de ses huit yeux sont "
"particulièrement larges et développés, une seconde plus petite mais toujours "
"relativement gigantesque paire de chaque côté de celle-ci, cet équipement "
"visuel impressionnant étant utilisé par cette créature pour jauger ses "
"environs avec une intelligence déroutante."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant jumping spider"
msgid_plural "giant jumping spiders"
msgstr[0] "araignée sauteuse gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "araignées sauteuses gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "araignées sauteuses gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant jumping spider"
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mutant spider with big forelegs and two pairs of "
"inquisitive-looking eyes.  It can leap quite quickly, even into the treetops."
msgstr ""
"Une araignée mutante de la taille d'une large chien possédant de longues "
"pattes antérieures et quatres de ses huit yeux étant particulièrement larges "
"et remplis d'intelligence et curiosité surprenante venant d'un arachnide "
"permettant à cette créature de bondir remarquablement rapidement et loin "
"entre arbres et structures."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "jumping spiderling"
msgid_plural "jumping spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "araignée sauteuse juvénile"
msgstr[1] "araignées sauteuses juvéniles"
msgstr[2] "araignées sauteuses juvéniles"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "jumping spiderling"
msgid "A juvenile jumping spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "missile spider"
msgid_plural "missile spiders"
msgstr[0] "araignée missile"
msgstr[1] "araignées missile"
msgstr[2] "araignées missile"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "missile spider"
msgid ""
"An enormous hairy mutated spider the size of a cow, with strong forelegs and "
"a raised, bloated thorax.  Its vast increase in size has caused it to lose "
"much of its mobility, and when near it you can smell rotten eggs for some "
"reason…"
msgstr ""
"Une araignée géante et poilue de la taille d'une vache possédant de "
"puissantes pattes antérieures et un thorax surélevé et gonflé réduisant "
"considérablement son agilité et vitesse, une faible odeur d'œufs pourris s'en "
"émanant et atteignant vos narines..."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized trapdoor spider"
msgid_plural "oversized trapdoor spiders"
msgstr[0] "araignée terricole surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "araignées terricoles surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "araignées terricoles surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized trapdoor spider"
msgid ""
"A dark brown mutant spider the size of a dog with a bulbous thorax, big eyes, "
"and oversized fangs."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant trapdoor spider"
msgid_plural "giant trapdoor spiders"
msgstr[0] "araignée terricole gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "araignées terricoles gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "araignées terricoles gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant trapdoor spider"
msgid ""
"A gigantic dark brown spider with a bulbous thorax.  It digs a deep "
"underground burrow that serves as a pit to trap unwary prey."
msgstr ""
"Une gigantesque araignée brun foncé au thorax bulbeux. Elle creuse un profond "
"terrier souterrain qui sert de fosse pour piéger les proies imprudentes."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "trapdoor spiderling"
msgid_plural "trapdoor spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "araignée terricole juvénile"
msgstr[1] "araignées terricoles juvéniles"
msgstr[2] "araignées terricoles juvéniles"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "trapdoor spiderling"
msgid "A juvenile trapdoor spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr "Une araignée de trappe juvénile, de la taille d'une bouteille de bière."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "deathtrap spider"
msgid_plural "deathtrap spiders"
msgstr[0] "araignée terricole gargantuesque"
msgstr[1] "araignées terricoles gargantuesques"
msgstr[2] "araignées terricoles gargantuesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "deathtrap spider"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized mutant spider with strong, thick legs and a bulbous thorax, dark "
"brown in color.  Anything it pulls into its underground lair is unlikely to "
"see the light of day again."
msgstr ""
"Une araignée mutante de la taille d'une vache, aux pattes fortes et épaisses "
"et au thorax bulbeux, de couleur brun foncé. Tout ce qu'elle attire dans son "
"repaire souterrain a peu de chances de revoir la lumière du jour."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized web spinning spider"
msgid_plural "oversized web spinning spiders"
msgstr[0] "araignée tisseuse surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "araignées tisseuses surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "araignées tisseuses surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized web spinning spider"
msgid ""
"A light gray mutant spider the size of a dog with a long legs, big eyes, and "
"oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Une araignée mutante gris clair de la taille d'un chien avec de longues "
"pattes, de grands yeux et des crocs surdimensionnés."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant web spider"
msgid_plural "giant web spiders"
msgstr[0] "araignée tisseuse gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "araignées tisseuses gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "araignées tisseuses gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant web spider"
msgid ""
"A giant, light gray mutant grass spider, it waits for prey to become ensnared "
"in the vast webs that it weaves between the trees."
msgstr ""
"Gigantesque araignée mutante gris clair, elle attend que ses proies se "
"prennent au piège dans les vastes toiles qu'elle tisse entre les arbres."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wyrd spider"
msgid_plural "wyrd spiders"
msgstr[0] "araignée tisseuse gargantuesque"
msgstr[1] "araignées tisseuses gargantuesques"
msgstr[2] "araignées tisseuses gargantuesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wyrd spider"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized mutated grass spider with long spindly legs, light gray in color. "
" It moves ponderously, depending on its webs to prevent prey from fleeing."
msgstr ""
"Une araignée mutante de la taille d'une vache, aux longues pattes grêles, de "
"couleur gris clair. Elle se déplace lourdement et s'appuie sur ses toiles "
"pour empêcher ses proies de fuir."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "web spiderling"
msgid_plural "web spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "araignée tisseuse juvénile"
msgstr[1] "araignées tisseuses juvéniles"
msgstr[2] "araignées tisseuses juvéniles"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "web spiderling"
msgid ""
"A juvenile giant grass spider, about the size of a beer bottle.  Too young to "
"be venomous, or to walk proficiently for that matter."
msgstr ""
"Une araignée géante juvénile, de la taille d'une bouteille de bière. Elle est "
"trop jeune pour être venimeuse ou pour marcher efficacement."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized black widow spider"
msgid_plural "oversized black widow spiders"
msgstr[0] "veuve noire surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "veuves noires surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "veuves noires surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized black widow spider"
msgid ""
"A black mutant spider the size of a small dog with a long legs, big eyes, and "
"oversized fangs.  There is a red hourglass shape on its thorax."
msgstr ""
"Une araignée mutante noire de la taille d'un petit chien avec de longues "
"pattes, de grands yeux et des crocs surdimensionnés. Son thorax est orné d'un "
"sablier rouge."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant black widow"
msgid_plural "giant black widows"
msgstr[0] "veuve noire gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "veuves noires gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "veuves noires gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant black widow"
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mutated black widow spider.  There is a red hourglass shape on "
"its thorax.  A highly venomous nightmare come to life."
msgstr ""
"Une veuve noire mutante de la taille d'un chien. Son thorax est orné d'un "
"sablier rouge. Un cauchemar très venimeux qui prend vie."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black death widow"
msgid_plural "black death widows"
msgstr[0] "veuve noire gargantuesque"
msgstr[1] "veuves noires gargantuesques"
msgstr[2] "veuves noires gargantuesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black death widow"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized mutated black widow spider with a distinctive red hourglass shape "
"on its thorax.  Still possesses its infamous venom, but it probably doesn't "
"even need that to crush you like a bug."
msgstr ""
"Une veuve noire mutante de la taille d'une vache, dont le thorax est orné "
"d'un sablier rouge caractéristique. Elle possède toujours son fameux venin, "
"mais elle n'en a probablement pas besoin pour vous écraser comme un insecte."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black widow spiderling"
msgid_plural "black widow spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "veuve noire nouvelle-née"
msgstr[1] "veuves noires nouvelles-nées"
msgstr[2] "veuves noires nouvelles-nées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black widow spiderling"
msgid ""
"The horrid spawn of a giant black widow spider.  Though, given the size that "
"it currently is, it appears relatively harmless."
msgstr ""
"L'horrible rejeton d'une veuve noire géante. Bien que, compte tenu de sa "
"taille actuelle, elle semble relativement inoffensive."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized wolf spider"
msgid_plural "oversized wolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "araignée-loup surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "araignées-loup surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "araignées-loup surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wolf spider"
msgid ""
"A shaggy brown mutant spider the size of a dog with eight long legs, two "
"especially big eyes, and oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Une araignée mutante brune et hirsute de la taille d'un chien, dotée de huit "
"longues pattes, de deux yeux particulièrement grands et de crocs "
"surdimensionnés."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant wolf spider"
msgid_plural "giant wolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "araignée-loup gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "araignées-loup gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "araignées-loup gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant wolf spider"
msgid ""
"A wolf spider mutated to about thirty times its normal size, it moves quickly "
"and aggressively to catch and consume prey."
msgstr ""
"Une araignée-loup mutée à environ trente fois sa taille normale, elle se "
"déplace rapidement et agressivement pour attraper et consommer ses proies."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wolf spiderling"
msgid_plural "wolf spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "araignée-loup juvénile"
msgstr[1] "araignées-loup juvéniles"
msgstr[2] "araignées-loup juvéniles"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wolf spiderling"
msgid "A juvenile wolf spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr ""
"Une araignée-loup juvénile atteignant plus ou moins la taille d'une bouteille "
"de bière."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "necrowolf spider"
msgid_plural "necrowolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "araignée-loup gargantuesque"
msgstr[1] "araignées-loup gargantuesques"
msgstr[2] "araignées-loup gargantuesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "necrowolf spider"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized, hairy mutant wolf spider.  Its mouthparts have noticeably "
"changed, and it moves much more slowly now with the additional weight it "
"needs to carry."
msgstr ""
"Une araignée-loup mutante, poilue et de la taille d'une vache. Ses pièces "
"buccales ont sensiblement changé et elle se déplace beaucoup plus lentement "
"maintenant avec le poids supplémentaire qu'elle doit porter."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wasp larva"
msgid_plural "wasp larvae"
msgstr[0] "larve de guêpe"
msgstr[1] "larves de guêpe"
msgstr[2] "larves de guêpe"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wasp larva"
msgid ""
"A dog-sized white grub, featureless apart from a vestigal mouthpart.  It "
"hangs upside-down in its cell, and regurgitates sweet-smelling fluid in "
"return for the scraps of viscera fed to it by the workers below."
msgstr ""
"Un ver blanc de la taille d'un chien, sans autre caractéristique qu'une "
"bouche vestigiale. Il est suspendu à l'envers dans sa cellule et régurgite un "
"liquide à l'odeur sucrée en échange des morceaux de viscères que lui donnent "
"les travailleurs du dessous."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wasp pupa"
msgid_plural "wasp pupae"
msgstr[0] "pupe de guêpe"
msgstr[1] "pupes de guêpe"
msgstr[2] "pupes de guêpe"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wasp pupa"
msgid ""
"A wasp larva undergoing metamorphosis into a full-grown giant wasp.  It looks "
"like a strangely immobile adult coated in a thin white membrane, its legs and "
"wings packed tightly into its cell."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized wasp"
msgid_plural "oversized wasps"
msgstr[0] "guêpe surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "guêpes surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "guêpes surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wasp"
msgid ""
"A huge wasp the size of a large cat with bright yellow markings on her "
"jet-black carapace and a threatening stinger.  She flies around erratically, "
"searching for smaller prey."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized wasp guard"
msgid_plural "oversized wasp guards"
msgstr[0] "guêpe gardienne surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "guêpes gardiennes surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "guêpes gardiennes surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wasp guard"
msgid ""
"A mutated wasp worker, buzzing around the nest.  While her foraging sisters "
"are relatively content to leave you be, this one won't hesitate to attack "
"anything she considers a threat to the nest.  Don't linger."
msgstr ""
"Une guêpe ouvrière mutante qui bourdonne autour du nid. Alors que ses "
"consœurs butineuses se contentent de vous laisser tranquille, celle-ci "
"n'hésitera pas à attaquer tout ce qu'elle considère comme une menace pour le "
"nid. Ne vous attardez pas."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized wasp queen"
msgid_plural "oversized wasp queens"
msgstr[0] "reine guêpe surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "reines guêpes surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "reines guêpes surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wasp queen"
msgid ""
"A mutated wasp queen grown to the size of a person, laying a single white egg "
"in each empty cell she comes across while scurrying around on the paper walls "
"of her home.  She struggles to fit into some of them, but the newer cells "
"seem to be getting larger…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant wasp"
msgid_plural "giant wasps"
msgstr[0] "guêpe gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "guêpes gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "guêpes gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp"
msgid ""
"A gigantic wasp worker, scouring the landscape for an easy meal to feed the "
"next generation.  Her abdomen glowers with ominous yellow stripes and ends in "
"a half-hidden stinger the size of a kitchen knife."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant wasp guard"
msgid_plural "giant wasp guards"
msgstr[0] "guêpe gardienne gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "guêpes gardiennes gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "guêpes gardiennes gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp guard"
msgid ""
"A wasp worker grown to the size of a person, buzzing around her home.  While "
"her foraging sisters are relatively content to live and let live, this one "
"won't hesitate to attack anything she considers a threat to the nest.  Don't "
"linger."
msgstr ""
"Une guêpe ouvrière de la taille d'une personne bourdonne autour de sa maison. "
"Alors que ses consœurs butineuses se contentent de vivre et de laisser vivre, "
"celle-ci n'hésite pas à attaquer tout ce qu'elle considère comme une menace "
"pour le nid. Ne vous attardez pas."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant wasp queen"
msgid_plural "giant wasp queens"
msgstr[0] "reine guêpe gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "reines guêpes gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "reines guêpes gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp queen"
msgid ""
"A yellowjacket queen grown to the size of a horse, towering over her "
"daughters.  Even with her abdomen swollen with eggs and wings long unused she "
"still poses a threat to interlopers, should her children have failed at "
"subduing them."
msgstr ""
"Une reine de la jaquette jaune ayant atteint la taille d'un cheval, dominant "
"ses filles. Même avec son abdomen gonflé d'œufs et ses longues ailes "
"inutilisées, elle représente toujours une menace pour les intrus, si ses "
"enfants n'ont pas réussi à les soumettre."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dermatik larva"
msgid_plural "dermatik larvae"
msgstr[0] "larve de dermatik"
msgstr[1] "larves de dermatik"
msgstr[2] "larves de dermatik"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik larva"
msgid ""
"A fat white grub as big as a squirrel, with a pair of large, spadelike "
"mandibles."
msgstr ""
"Un gros ver blanc de la taille d'un écureuil, doté d'une paire de grandes "
"mandibules en forme d'épée."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dermatik"
msgid_plural "dermatiks"
msgstr[0] "dermatik"
msgstr[1] "dermatiks"
msgstr[2] "dermatiks"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik"
msgid ""
"A colorful parasitoid wasp grown to the size of a dog, with a huge ovipositor "
"extruding from her abdomen.  She darts around in search of a suitable home "
"for her many, many children."
msgstr ""
"Une guêpe parasitoïde colorée de la taille d'un chien, avec un énorme "
"ovipositeur sortant de son abdomen. Elle se déplace à la recherche d'une "
"habitation convenable pour ses très nombreux enfants."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dermatik midwife"
msgid_plural "dermatik midwives"
msgstr[0] "nourrices dermatik"
msgstr[1] "nourrices dermatik"
msgstr[2] "nourrices dermatik"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik midwife"
msgid ""
"A dermatik grown even larger, her wings and ovipositor chewed off by her "
"sisters.  She now stands watch in the nest, tending to the unfortunate hosts "
"dragged home and ensuring they don't perish before their purpose is fulfilled."
msgstr ""
"Une guêpe dermatik encore plus grosse que la normale, son ovipositeur et ses "
"ailes ayant été arrachés par ses sœurs, celli-ci gardant maintenant le nid et "
"prenant soin des hôtes infortunés y ayant été traînés pour que ceux-ci ne "
"périssent pas avant que leur mission soit accomplie."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "motionless deer"
msgid_plural "motionless deers"
msgstr[0] "cerf immobilisé"
msgstr[1] "cerfs immobilisés"
msgstr[2] "cerfs immobilisés"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "motionless deer"
msgid ""
"A paralyzed, emaciated deer.  It spasms as it notices your presence, "
"terrified eyes darting around the muddy chamber when it fails to stand and "
"flee."
msgstr ""
"Un cerf paralysé et décharné. Il a des spasmes lorsqu'il remarque votre "
"présence, et ses yeux terrifiés parcourent la chambre boueuse lorsqu'il ne "
"parvient pas à se lever et à s'enfuir."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "motionless deer"
msgid "The sudden motion of their host cause some dermatik larvae to flee!"
msgstr "Le mouvement soudain de leur hôte fait fuir certaines larves de dermatites !"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "helpless dog"
msgid_plural "helpless dogs"
msgstr[0] "chien mourant"
msgstr[1] "chiens mourants"
msgstr[2] "chiens mourants"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "helpless dog"
msgid ""
"A barely living dog, panting in a pool of slime and blood.  As you draw near "
"it lets out a faint whimper, and you see the smallest hint of a twitch in its "
"tail."
msgstr ""
"Un chien à peine vivant, haletant dans une mare de bave et de sang. Lorsque "
"vous vous approchez de lui, il émet un faible gémissement, et vous apercevez "
"le moindre frémissement de sa queue."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "twitching spider"
msgid_plural "twitching spiders"
msgstr[0] "araignée secouée de spasme"
msgstr[1] "araignées secouées de spasmes"
msgstr[2] "araignées secouées de spasmes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "twitching spider"
msgid ""
"A giant, mutated spider lying on its back, legs twitching without pause.  A "
"translucent slime, mixed with its ichor seeps from its joints, and its chitin "
"is marked by numerous exit wounds."
msgstr ""
"Une araignée géante et mutante, couchée sur le dos, dont les pattes s'agitent "
"sans relâche. Une bave translucide, mélangée à son ichor, suinte de ses "
"articulations, et sa chitine est marquée par de nombreuses blessures de "
"sortie."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized ant"
msgid_plural "oversized ants"
msgstr[0] "fourmi surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "fourmis surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "fourmis surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized ant"
msgid ""
"A mutant red ant the size of a dog, covered in chitinous plates.  She "
"possesses a pair of wriggling antennae and vicious-looking mandibles."
msgstr ""
"Fourmi rouge mutante de la taille d'un chien, recouverte de plaques "
"chitineuses. Elle possède une paire d'antennes frétillantes et des mandibules "
"à l'aspect vicieux."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant ant"
msgid_plural "giant ants"
msgstr[0] "fourmi gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "fourmis gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "fourmis gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant ant"
msgid ""
"An enormous red ant covered in chitinous plates.  She possesses a pair of "
"wriggling antennae and vicious-looking mandibles."
msgstr ""
"Une énorme fourmi rouge recouverte de plaques chitineuses. Elle possède une "
"paire d'antennes frétillantes et des mandibules à l'aspect vicieux."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized acidic ant"
msgid_plural "oversized acidic ants"
msgstr[0] "fourmi artilleuse surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "fourmis artilleuses surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "fourmis artilleuses surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized acidic ant"
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mutant brown ant with a swollen abdomen that ends with a small "
"orifice at the tip.  Glistening liquid drips out periodically."
msgstr ""
"Fourmi brune mutante de la taille d'un chien, dont l'abdomen gonflé se "
"termine par un petit orifice à l'extrémité. Un liquide scintillant s'en "
"échappe périodiquement."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant acidic ant"
msgid_plural "giant acidic ants"
msgstr[0] "fourmi acide gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "fourmis acides gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "fourmis acides gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant acidic ant"
msgid ""
"A monstrous brown ant with a swollen abdomen that ends with a small orifice "
"at the tip.  Glistening liquid seems to drip out periodically."
msgstr ""
"Monstrueuse fourmi brune dont l'abdomen gonflé se termine par un petit "
"orifice à l'extrémité. Un liquide scintillant semble s'écouler périodiquement."

