#, c-format
msgid "The %s's body leaks acid."
msgstr "Le corps du %s suinte de l'acide."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "acidic ant larva"
msgid_plural "acidic ant larvae"
msgstr[0] "larve de fourmi acide"
msgstr[1] "larves de fourmi acide"
msgstr[2] "larves de fourmi acide"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "acidic ant larva"
msgid ""
"A squirming yellow grub that seems to be oozing liquid from both ends of its "
"body.  It appears its chitin hasn't developed enough to resist acid."
msgstr ""
"Un ver jaune qui se tortille et qui semble suinter du liquide par les deux "
"extrémités de son corps. Il semble que sa chitine ne soit pas assez "
"développée pour résister à l'acide."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant acidic queen ant"
msgid_plural "giant acidic queen ants"
msgstr[0] "reine fourmi acide gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "reines fourmis acides gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "reines fourmis acides gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant acidic queen ant"
msgid ""
"An enormous brown ant with an elongated, pulsating abdomen.  Her orifice "
"seems developed only for egg-laying rather than spraying acid like the rest "
"of the colony, but she doesn't seem affected by the acrid liquid either."
msgstr ""
"Une énorme fourmi brune à l'abdomen allongé et palpitant. Son orifice semble "
"développé uniquement pour la ponte et non pour la projection d'acide comme le "
"reste de la colonie, mais elle ne semble pas non plus affectée par l'âcreté "
"du liquide."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant acidic soldier ant"
msgid_plural "giant acidic soldier ants"
msgstr[0] "fourmi soldate acide gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "fourmis soldates acides gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "fourmis soldates acides gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant acidic soldier ant"
msgid ""
"A massive woolly brown ant that towers over the worker ants with a giant head "
"crest.  Along with her huge mandibles, a corrosive liquid seeps from the end "
"of her bloated abdomen."
msgstr ""
"Une fourmi brune laineuse massive qui domine les fourmis ouvrières avec une "
"crête de tête géante. En plus de ses énormes mandibules, un liquide corrosif "
"s'écoule de l'extrémité de son abdomen boursouflé."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "super soldier acidic ant"
msgid_plural "super soldier acidic ants"
msgstr[0] "fourmi acide super soldate"
msgstr[1] "fourmis acides super soldates"
msgstr[2] "fourmis acides super soldates"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "super soldier acidic ant"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized, woolly brown ant.  Corrosive liquid seeping from her huge "
"mandibles.  Given the relative strength of ants to their body size, you don't "
"doubt that this one could shove cars around or rip through solid walls."
msgstr ""
"Une fourmi brune laineuse de la taille d'une vache. Un liquide corrosif "
"s'échappe de ses énormes mandibules. Compte tenu de la force relative des "
"fourmis par rapport à leur taille, il ne fait aucun doute que cette fourmi "
"pourrait bousculer des voitures ou percer des murs solides."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ant larva"
msgid_plural "ant larvae"
msgstr[0] "larve de fourmi"
msgstr[1] "larves de fourmi"
msgstr[2] "larves de fourmi"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ant larva"
msgid ""
"A pulsating sausage of glistening white flesh, the size of a large cat.  On "
"one end is a set of squirming mouth parts."
msgstr ""
"Une saucisse de chair blanche luisante, de la taille d'un gros chat. À l'une "
"de ses extrémités se trouve un ensemble de pièces buccales qui se tortillent."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant queen ant"
msgid_plural "giant queen ants"
msgstr[0] "reine fourmi gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "reines fourmis gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "reines fourmis gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant queen ant"
msgid ""
"A colossal red ant with a bulging, bloated thorax.  She moves slowly and "
"deliberately, tending to nearby eggs and continually laying more."
msgstr ""
"Une fourmi rouge colossale au thorax bombé et boursouflé. Elle se déplace "
"lentement et délibérément, s'occupant des œufs à proximité et en pondant "
"continuellement d'autres."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant soldier ant"
msgid_plural "giant soldier ants"
msgstr[0] "fourmi soldate gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "fourmis soldates gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "fourmis soldates gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant soldier ant"
msgid ""
"A huge and hairy red ant almost twice the size of other giant ants.  Bulging "
"pincers extend from her jaws."
msgstr ""
"Une fourmi rouge énorme et velue, presque deux fois plus grande que les "
"autres fourmis géantes. Ses mâchoires sont munies de pinces saillantes."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "super soldier ant"
msgid_plural "super soldier ants"
msgstr[0] "fourmi super soldate"
msgstr[1] "fourmis super soldates"
msgstr[2] "fourmis super soldates"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "super soldier ant"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized, hairy red ant.  Bulging pincers extend from her jaws.  Given the "
"relative strength of ants to their body size, you don't doubt that this one "
"could shove cars around or rip through solid walls."
msgstr ""
"Une fourmi rouge poilue de la taille d'une vache. Des pinces saillantes "
"sortent de ses mâchoires. Compte tenu de la force relative des fourmis par "
"rapport à leur taille, il ne fait aucun doute que cette fourmi pourrait "
"bousculer des voitures ou percer des murs solides."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized locust"
msgid_plural "oversized locusts"
msgstr[0] "criquet surdimensionné"
msgstr[1] "criquets surdimensionnés"
msgstr[2] "criquets surdimensionnés"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized locust"
msgid ""
"A yellow and brown mutated locust the size of a small dog, with big eyes and "
"long, powerful legs."
msgstr ""
"Un criquet mutant jaune et brun de la taille d'un petit chien, avec de grands "
"yeux et de longues et puissantes pattes."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant locust"
msgid_plural "giant locusts"
msgstr[0] "locuste gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "locustes gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "locustes gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant locust"
msgid ""
"A yellow and brown mutated locust the size of a dog with big eyes and long, "
"powerful legs.  You don't think it'll eat you, but it could cause massive "
"damage to nearby plants."
msgstr ""
"Un criquet mutant jaune et brun de la taille d'un chien avec de grands yeux "
"et de longues pattes puissantes. Vous ne pensez pas qu'il vous mangera, mais "
"il pourrait causer d'énormes dégâts aux plantes avoisinantes."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "famine"
msgid_plural "famines"
msgstr[0] "famines"
msgstr[1] "famines"
msgstr[2] "famines"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "famine"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized yellow and brown mutated locust with huge, staring eyes and long, "
"powerful legs.  The bane of the post-apocalyptic farmer."
msgstr ""
"Un criquet mutant jaune et brun de la taille d'une vache, avec d'énormes yeux "
"fixes et de longues pattes puissantes. Le fléau du fermier post-apocalyptique."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "locust nymph"
msgid_plural "locust nymphs"
msgstr[0] "nymphe de locuste"
msgstr[1] "nymphes de locuste"
msgstr[2] "nymphes de locuste"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "locust nymph"
msgid ""
"A locust the size of a rabbit.  You'd hate to think what a swarm of these "
"could do."
msgstr ""
"Un criquet de la taille d'un lapin. On n'ose imaginer ce qu'une nuée de ces "
"insectes pourrait faire."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized aphid"
msgid_plural "oversized aphids"
msgstr[0] "puceron surdimensionné"
msgstr[1] "pucerons surdimensionnés"
msgstr[2] "pucerons surdimensionnés"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized aphid"
msgid ""
"This huge aphid is as big as a hamster.  It's not as thirsty as bigger ones, "
"but a herd of these could eat your crops easily."
msgstr ""
"Cet énorme puceron est aussi gros qu'un hamster. Il n'est pas aussi assoiffé "
"que les plus gros, mais un troupeau de pucerons pourrait facilement dévorer "
"vos récoltes."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant aphid"
msgid_plural "giant aphids"
msgstr[0] "puceron gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "pucerons gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "pucerons gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant aphid"
msgid ""
"A green aphid about the size of a rabbit.  It is constantly searching for "
"plants to suck from."
msgstr ""
"Puceron vert de la taille d'un lapin. Il est constamment à la recherche de "
"plantes à sucer."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized praying mantis"
msgid_plural "oversized praying mantises"
msgstr[0] "mante religieuse surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "mantes religieuses surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "mantes religieuses surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized praying mantis"
msgid ""
"A green mutant insect with sharp grappling spikes on its front legs.  It's a "
"little smaller than an adult person."
msgstr ""
"Insecte mutant vert dont les pattes avant sont hérissées de pointes acérées. "
"Il est un peu plus petit qu'un adulte."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant praying mantis"
msgid_plural "giant praying mantises"
msgstr[0] "mante religieuse gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "mantes religieuses gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "mantes religieuses gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant praying mantis"
msgid ""
"An enormous green insect grown to about the size of a bear.  It moves in a "
"weird, dance-like pattern and looks ready to chop your head off at any moment."
msgstr ""
"Un énorme insecte vert de la taille d'un ours. Il se déplace en dansant "
"bizarrement et semble prêt à vous couper la tête à tout moment."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "praying mantis nymph"
msgid_plural "praying mantis nymphs"
msgstr[0] "nymphe de mante religieuse géante"
msgstr[1] "nymphes de mante religieuse géantes"
msgstr[2] "nymphes de mante religieuse géantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "praying mantis nymph"
msgid ""
"A mantis nymph about the size of a dog.  Even though its far smaller than the "
"adults, you have a feeling it wouldn't take kindly to you coming too close."
msgstr ""
"Une nymphe de mante religieuse de la taille d'un chien. Bien qu'elle soit "
"beaucoup plus petite que les adultes, vous avez l'impression qu'elle "
"n'apprécierait pas que vous vous approchiez trop près d'elle."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "great mantis"
msgid_plural "great mantises"
msgstr[0] "mante religieuse gargantuesque"
msgstr[1] "mantes religieuses gargantuesques"
msgstr[2] "mantes religieuses gargantuesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "great mantis"
msgid ""
"This ferocious cow-sized mantis stalks the fields of New England.  It's "
"probably capable of killing a moose with its powerful arms."
msgstr ""
"Cette féroce mante de la taille d'une vache rôde dans les champs de la "
"Nouvelle-Angleterre. Elle est probablement capable de tuer un élan avec ses "
"bras puissants."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant mole cricket"
msgid_plural "giant mole crickets"
msgstr[0] "courtilière gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "courtilières gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "courtilières gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant mole cricket"
msgid ""
"An enormous underground bug.  Beware its ear-splitting screech and strong "
"shovel-like front legs."
msgstr ""
"Un énorme insecte souterrain. Il faut se méfier de son cri perçant et de ses "
"puissantes pattes avant en forme de pelle."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mole cricket nymph"
msgid_plural "mole cricket nymphs"
msgstr[0] "nymphe de courtilière"
msgstr[1] "nymphes de courtilière"
msgstr[2] "nymphes de courtilière"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mole cricket nymph"
msgid "A whitish mole cricket nymph the size of a dog."
msgstr "Une nymphe de courtilière blanchâtre ayant la taille d'un chien."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized lady bug"
msgid_plural "oversized lady bugs"
msgstr[0] "coccinelle surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "coccinelles surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "coccinelles surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized lady bug"
msgid ""
"This is a mutated lady bug the size of a big dog.  While not as dangerous as "
"her giant sisters, she's still troublesome to deal with."
msgstr ""
"Ceci est une coccinelle de la taille d'un gros chien. Elle a l'air assez "
"aggressive et probablement coriace, et vous frissonnez en pensant ce qui vous "
"arriverait si celle-ci était encore plus grosse."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant lady bug"
msgid_plural "giant lady bugs"
msgstr[0] "coccinelle gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "coccinelles gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "coccinelles gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant lady bug"
msgid ""
"The normal-sized version of this red and black beetle is generally considered "
"cute, and is adored by children and associated with good luck.  This monster, "
"on the other hand is clearly a ferocious predator capable of killing swarms "
"of ants, aphids, and unprepared humans."
msgstr ""
"La version normale de ce coléoptère rouge et noir est généralement considérée "
"comme mignonne, adorée par les enfants et associée à la chance. Ce monstre, "
"en revanche, est clairement un prédateur féroce capable de tuer des essaims "
"de fourmis, des pucerons et des humains non préparés."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lady bug larva"
msgid_plural "lady bug larvae"
msgstr[0] "larve de coccinelle"
msgstr[1] "larves de coccinelle"
msgstr[2] "larves de coccinelle"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lady bug larva"
msgid ""
"A large armored larva looking not unlike a centipede.  Even though it's just "
"a juvenile the armor on its back already looks functional."
msgstr ""
"Une grande larve blindée ressemblant à un mille-pattes. Bien qu'il ne "
"s'agisse que d'un juvénile, l'armure sur son dos semble déjà fonctionnelle."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized grasshopper"
msgid_plural "oversized grasshoppers"
msgstr[0] "sauterelle surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "sauterelles surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "sauterelles surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized grasshopper"
msgid "A large grasshopper a few times bigger than a regular one."
msgstr ""
"Une sauterelle géante, toujours petite, mais beaucoup plus grande qu'une "
"sauterelle normale devrait être."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant grasshopper"
msgid_plural "giant grasshoppers"
msgstr[0] "sauterelle gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "sauterelles gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "sauterelles gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant grasshopper"
msgid ""
"A huge green grasshopper about the size of a big dog, with long and strong "
"back legs.  It hops, it hops and never stops."
msgstr ""
"Une sauterelle verte aussi grande qu'un chien, possédant des jambes de "
"derrière volumineuse. Cet insecte géant saute, saute, et ne s'arrête jamais "
"de sauter."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grasshopper nymph"
msgid_plural "grasshopper nymphs"
msgstr[0] "nymphe de sauterelle géante"
msgstr[1] "nymphes de sauterelle géantes"
msgstr[2] "nymphes de sauterelle géantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grasshopper nymph"
msgid "A grasshopper nymph the size of a rabbit."
msgstr "Une nymphe de sauterelle de la taille d'un lapin."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant stag beetle larva"
msgid_plural "giant stag beetle larvae"
msgstr[0] "larve de lucane géante"
msgstr[1] "larves de lucane géantes"
msgstr[2] "larves de lucane géantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant stag beetle larva"
msgid ""
"Something about this cow-sized larva is pitiable, despite its immense size "
"and sickening cream color."
msgstr ""
"Cette larve de la taille d'une vache a quelque chose de pitoyable, malgré sa "
"taille immense et sa couleur crème écœurante."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant stag beetle"
msgid_plural "giant stag beetles"
msgstr[0] "lucane gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "lucanes gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "lucanes gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant stag beetle"
msgid ""
"It was called a giant even before the Cataclysm, but now this mutant beetle "
"is the size of a small horse.  It looks ready to molt again, even though "
"parts of the shell are still soft."
msgstr ""
"On l'appelait déjà géant avant le cataclysme, mais ce coléoptère mutant a "
"aujourd'hui la taille d'un petit cheval. Il semble prêt à muer à nouveau, "
"même si certaines parties de sa carapace sont encore molles."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/summoned.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "massive stag beetle"
msgid_plural "massive stag beetles"
msgstr[0] "lucane gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "lucanes gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "lucanes gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "massive stag beetle"
msgid ""
"This enormous stag beetle has reached mutated maturity, but continues to "
"grow.  Thankfully, that growth is exposing vulnerable cracks of flesh in the "
"strained chitin."
msgstr ""
"Cet énorme coléoptère a atteint une maturité mutante, mais continue de "
"grandir. Heureusement, cette croissance expose des fissures de chair "
"vulnérables dans la chitine tendue."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/summoned.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "massive stag
#. beetle"
msgid "a soft section of chitin"
msgstr "Une section de chitine souple"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/summoned.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "massive stag
#. beetle"
msgid "a crack in the chitin"
msgstr "une fissure dans la chitine"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "titan stag beetle"
msgid_plural "titan stag beetles"
msgstr[0] "lucane titanesque"
msgstr[1] "lucanes titanesques"
msgstr[2] "lucanes titanesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "titan stag beetle"
msgid ""
"This stag beetle rivals an armored personnel carrier in size, bearing horns "
"that could fell a tree and chitin thick enough to ignore most bullets.  Its "
"bulky shell looks nigh-impenetrable, and the cracks have sealed with a foul "
"paste."
msgstr ""
"Ce coléoptère rivalise en taille avec un véhicule blindé de transport de "
"troupes. Il porte des cornes capables d'abattre un arbre et une chitine "
"suffisamment épaisse pour ignorer la plupart des balles. Sa carapace "
"volumineuse semble presque impénétrable, et les fissures sont scellées par "
"une pâte nauséabonde."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "titan stag beetle"
msgid "a foul scar in the chitin"
msgstr "une fissure infectée dans la chitine"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant antlion larva"
msgid_plural "giant antlion larvae"
msgstr[0] "larve de fourmilion géante"
msgstr[1] "larves de fourmilion géantes"
msgstr[2] "larves de fourmilion géantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant antlion larva"
msgid ""
"This huge grub has powerful mandibles and a hungry look.  It hides in the "
"dirt and awaits its prey."
msgstr ""
"Cet énorme ver a des mandibules puissantes et un regard affamé. Il se cache "
"dans la terre et attend sa proie."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant adult antlion"
msgid_plural "giant adult antlions"
msgstr[0] "fourmilion gigantesque adulte"
msgstr[1] "fourmilions gigantesques adultes"
msgstr[2] "fourmilions gigantesques adultes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant adult antlion"
msgid ""
"A ferocious mutant flying antlion as big as a cat, darting through the air "
"with a cluster of fangs for a mouth.  Despite its dangerous looks, it doesn't "
"seem interested in you."
msgstr ""
"Un féroce fourmilier volant mutant de la taille d'un chat, s'élançant dans "
"les airs avec un groupe de crocs en guise de bouche. Malgré son allure "
"dangereuse, il ne semble pas s'intéresser à vous."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized water strider"
msgid_plural "oversized water striders"
msgstr[0] "araignée d'eau surdimensionnée"
msgstr[1] "araignées d'eau surdimensionnées"
msgstr[2] "araignées d'eau surdimensionnées"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized water strider"
msgid ""
"This water bug is several times larger than a regular one.  Its movements are "
"fast and fluid."
msgstr ""
"Cette punaise d'eau est plusieurs fois plus grande qu'une punaise ordinaire. "
"Ses mouvements sont rapides et fluides."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant water strider"
msgid_plural "giant water striders"
msgstr[0] "araignée d'eau gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "araignées d'eau gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "araignées d'eau gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant water strider"
msgid ""
"This water glider is about as big as a domestic cat.  Its legs are more "
"fin-like and a swollen body is mostly submerged underwater."
msgstr ""
"Ce planeur d'eau est à peu près aussi grand qu'un chat domestique. Ses pattes "
"ressemblent davantage à des nageoires et son corps gonflé est en grande "
"partie immergé sous l'eau."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "water strider nymph"
msgid_plural "water strider nymphs"
msgstr[0] "nymphe d'araignée d'eau géante"
msgstr[1] "nymphes d'araignée d'eau géantes"
msgstr[2] "nymphes d'araignée d'eau géantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "water strider nymph"
msgid "A water strider nymph the size of a rabbit."
msgstr "Une nymphe d'araignée d'eau de la taille d'un lapin."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized butterfly"
msgid_plural "oversized butterflies"
msgstr[0] "papillon surdimensionné"
msgstr[1] "papillons surdimensionnés"
msgstr[2] "papillons surdimensionnés"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized butterfly"
msgid ""
"An oversized butterfly with vibrant colored markings.  Unlike the other big "
"insects of the Cataclysm this is a very peaceful nectivore."
msgstr ""
"Un papillon surdimensionné aux couleurs éclatantes. Contrairement aux autres "
"gros insectes du Cataclysme, ce papillon est très pacifique."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant butterfly"
msgid_plural "giant butterflies"
msgstr[0] "papillon gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "papillons gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "papillons gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant butterfly"
msgid ""
"A mutated butterfly larger than a human.  Despite its size it is very "
"lightweight and feeds mainly on the nectar produced by triffid flowers."
msgstr ""
"Papillon mutant plus grand qu'un humain. Malgré sa taille, il est très léger "
"et se nourrit principalement du nectar produit par les fleurs de triffide."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "emperor butterfly"
msgid_plural "emperor butterflies"
msgstr[0] "papillon empereur gargantuesque"
msgstr[1] "papillons empereurs gargantuesques"
msgstr[2] "papillons empereurs gargantuesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "emperor butterfly"
msgid ""
"An enormous butterfly with regal looking wings.  This giant of the sky flies "
"cheerfully under the sun, leaving dust as it passes."
msgstr ""
"Un énorme papillon aux ailes majestueuses. Ce géant du ciel vole joyeusement "
"sous le soleil, laissant de la poussière sur son passage."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized moth"
msgid_plural "oversized moths"
msgstr[0] "papillon de nuit surdimensionné"
msgstr[1] "papillons de nuit surdimensionnés"
msgstr[2] "papillons de nuit surdimensionnés"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized moth"
msgid ""
"An oversized moth with its typical wood-like motifs.  It is as peaceful as "
"the mutated butterflies found during the day."
msgstr ""
"Un papillon de nuit surdimensionné avec ses motifs typiques en forme de bois. "
"Il est aussi paisible que les papillons mutants que l'on trouve dans la "
"journée."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant moth"
msgid_plural "giant moths"
msgstr[0] "papillon de nuit gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "papillons de nuit gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "papillons de nuit gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant moth"
msgid ""
"A mutated moth larger than a human.  It silently flies with its huge wings "
"after dusk looking for nocturnal flowers to feed upon."
msgstr ""
"Un papillon de nuit mutant de la taille d'un humain volant silencieusement "
"après le crépuscule utilisant ses ailes massives à la recherche de fleurs en "
"quête du nectar le soutenant."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lunar moth"
msgid_plural "lunar moths"
msgstr[0] "papillon lunaire gargantuesque"
msgstr[1] "papillons lunaires gargantuesques"
msgstr[2] "papillons lunaires gargantuesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lunar moth"
msgid ""
"A majestic moth painted in pale colors.  This giant of the night only comes "
"out after the moon is out, leaving glittering dust."
msgstr ""
"Un papillon de nuit majestueux aux couleurs pâles. Ce géant de la nuit "
"n'émerge qu'après l'émergence de la lune et laisse derrière lui une trainée "
"de poudre fine."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant caterpillar"
msgid_plural "giant caterpillars"
msgstr[0] "chenille gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "chenilles gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "chenilles gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant caterpillar"
msgid ""
"The larval stage of a butterfly or a moth.  This one appears to be about your "
"size so you can only imagine the size of the insect that it will grow into."
msgstr ""
"Le stade larvaire d'un papillon. Celui-ci à l'aire d'être aussi large que "
"vous et vous vous demandez quel monstre émergera après sa transformation."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant cocoon"
msgid_plural "giant cocoons"
msgstr[0] "cocon gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "cocons gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "cocons gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant cocoon"
msgid ""
"A caterpillar undergoing a metamorphosis.  Considering the size of the cocoon "
"you have a feeling the emerging adult will be massive as well."
msgstr ""
"Une chenille géante étant en train de se métamorphoser. Considérant la taille "
"du cocon, vous avez l'impression que l'adulte qui en émergera sera encore "
"plus déraisonnablement massif."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cicada nymph"
msgid_plural "cicada nymphs"
msgstr[0] "nymphe de cigale"
msgstr[1] "nymphes de cigale"
msgstr[2] "nymphes de cigale"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cicada nymph"
msgid ""
"The mutated larval form of a cicada.  It doesn't produce noise like the "
"adults but its digging claws seem suited for scratching."
msgstr ""
"Une forme larvaire mutante d'une cigale ne produisant pas le bruit typique de "
"sa forme adulte mais possédant des griffes ayant l'air d'être aussi adaptées "
"à creuser qu'à griffer."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant cicada"
msgid_plural "giant cicadas"
msgstr[0] "cigale gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "cigales gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "cigales gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant cicada"
msgid ""
"A huge cicada the size of a person.  These insects are mostly harmless but "
"may bite if attacked and produce a loud buzzing sound."
msgstr ""
"Une cigale énorme de la taille d'une personne. Ces insectes sont plus ou "
"moins inoffensifs mais se défendront en cas d'attaque, connaissant le bruit "
"démesuré que celles de taille normale sont déjà capable d'emettre, vous avez "
"peur de ce que celle-ci pourrait émettre si quelque chose la dérange."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant woodlouse"
msgid_plural "giant woodlice"
msgstr[0] "cloporte gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "cloportes gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "cloportes gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant woodlouse"
msgid ""
"A woodlouse grown to the size of a dog.  These humble crustaceans are "
"harmless and enjoy damp places."
msgstr ""
"Un cloporte ayant atteint la taille d'un chien. Ces humbles crustacés sont "
"inoffensifs et apprécient les endroits humides."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "woodlouse manca"
msgid_plural "woodlouse mancae"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "woodlouse manca"
msgid ""
"Woodlice reproduce by carrying their eggs in a pouch and releasing them as "
"juveniles.  Their mancae look like small adults except for their pale color."
msgstr ""
"Les cloportes se reproduisent en transportant leurs œufs dans une poche et en "
"les libérant sous forme de jeunes. Leurs mancenilliers ressemblent à de "
"petits adultes, à l'exception de leur couleur pâle."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant water tiger"
msgid_plural "giant water tigers"
msgstr[0] "tigre d'eau gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "tigres d'eau gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "tigres d'eau gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant water tiger"
msgid ""
"The predatory, aquatic larva of a diving beetle grown to large proportions.  "
"It is quite slow but still a good ambusher."
msgstr ""
"La larve prédatrice et aquatique d'un scarabée plongeur ayant atteint de "
"grandes proportions. Elle est assez lente, mais reste une bonne embuscade."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant diving beetle"
msgid_plural "giant diving beetles"
msgstr[0] "dytique gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "dytiques gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "dytiques gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant diving beetle"
msgid ""
"Water beetles can be found in all freshwater environments, with diving "
"beetles being their predatory variant.  These however seem to have grown far "
"larger with the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"On trouve des scarabées aquatiques dans tous les environnements d'eau douce, "
"les scarabées plongeurs étant leur variante prédatrice. Ces derniers semblent "
"toutefois s'être considérablement agrandis avec le Cataclysme."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant water scorpion"
msgid_plural "giant water scorpions"
msgstr[0] "scorpion d'eau gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "scorpions d'eau gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "scorpions d'eau gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant water scorpion"
msgid ""
"A slender relative of the water bug, grown close to human size.  It uses its "
"long tail as a snorkel while ambushing prey."
msgstr ""
"Un parent svelte de la punaise d'eau, dont la taille est proche de celle de "
"l'homme. Elle utilise sa longue queue comme un tuba lorsqu'elle tend une "
"embuscade à ses proies."

