#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fleshy shambler"
msgid ""
"An amalgamation of throbbing organs from various creatures have fused "
"together into this lurching, vaguely-humanoid shape.  Its myriad "
"roughly-formed mouths susurrate in a chorus of sibilant groans and whispers."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
