#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bat"
msgid_plural "bats"
msgstr[0] "chauve-souris"
msgstr[1] "chauves-souris"
msgstr[2] "chauves-souris"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bat"
msgid ""
"One of the vesper bats, a family of winged insect-eating mammals.  It roosts "
"in caves and other hollows, and uses a form of echolocation to aerially "
"navigate through tricky terrain at rapid speeds."
msgstr ""
"L'une des espèces de chauve-souris vespérales, des mammifères volants "
"mangeurs d'insectes. Elles s'installent dans les cavernes et les caves, et "
"utilisent une forme d'écholocation pour se diriger à vive allure dans un "
"environnement accidenté."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black bear cub"
msgid_plural "black bear cubs"
msgstr[0] "ourson noir"
msgstr[1] "oursons noirs"
msgstr[2] "oursons noirs"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black bear cub"
msgid ""
"A juvenile American black bear.  This one isn't much of a threat, but be wary "
"of its parent; black bears are known for their protectiveness."
msgstr ""
"Un ours noir juvénile. Bien qu'il ne soit pas vraiment très dangereux, prenez "
"gare à sa mère très protectrice probablement dans les environs."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black bear"
msgid_plural "black bears"
msgstr[0] "ours noir"
msgstr[1] "ours noirs"
msgstr[2] "ours noirs"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black bear"
msgid ""
"The American black bear.  A large omnivorous scavenger, it has powerful claws "
"and jaws, and is an effective ambush hunter.  Most individuals are shy around "
"humans, but they're fiercely protective of their cubs."
msgstr ""
"L'ours noir d'Amérique.  Un imposant omnivore opportuniste doté d'une "
"mâchoire et des griffes puissantes en faisant un chasseur d'embuscade "
"efficace.  Bien qu'il soit assez redoutable pour poser un réel danger à "
"l'homme, il préfère l'éviter généralement en l'absence d'oursons à protéger."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "beaver"
msgid_plural "beavers"
msgstr[0] "castors"
msgstr[1] "castors"
msgstr[2] "castors"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "beaver"
msgid ""
"The North American beaver, the continent's largest rodent.  Its paddle-shaped "
"tail helps ferry it through the water, and its prominent teeth can chew "
"through wood, which it uses to build dam-like nests in lakes and streams."
msgstr ""
"Le castor du Canada, le plus gros rongeur du continent. Sa queue en forme de "
"pagaie l'aide à nager; ses dents peuvent couper du bois qu'il utilise pour "
"fabriquer des nids en forme de barrages sur les lacs et cours d'eau."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "beaver kit"
msgid_plural "beaver kits"
msgstr[0] "castoreau"
msgstr[1] "castoreaux"
msgstr[2] "castoreaux"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "beaver kit"
msgid "A small baby beaver."
msgstr "Un bébé castor."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black rat"
msgid_plural "black rats"
msgstr[0] "rat noir"
msgstr[1] "rats noirs"
msgstr[2] "rats noirs"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black rat"
msgid ""
"The black rat, an omnivorous rodent with sheer black fur and a long, rough "
"tail.  Harbinger of pestilence, famine, and mange, it will sometimes swarm "
"over the dead or dying."
msgstr ""
"Le rat noir, un rongeur omnivore avec une fine fourrure noir et une longue "
"queue rêche. Signe avant-coureur de la peste, de la famine et de la gale, les "
"rats déferlent parfois en groupe sur les cadavres ou les mourants."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lab rat"
msgid_plural "lab rats"
msgstr[0] "rat de laboratoire"
msgstr[1] "rats de laboratoire"
msgstr[2] "rats de laboratoire"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lab rat"
msgid ""
"The albino Norway rat, an omnivorous rodent with sleek white fur and a long, "
"rough tail.  While its ancestors were harbingers of plague, these clever "
"animals are omnipresent in modern biomedical research.  Due to its albino "
"nature, its vision in both day and nighttime environments is very diminished."
msgstr ""

