#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wild boar piglet"
msgid_plural "wild boar piglets"
msgstr[0] "marcassin"
msgstr[1] "marcassins"
msgstr[2] "marcassins"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wild boar piglet"
msgid ""
"Originally not native in the U.S., this wild omnivore is a crossbreed between "
"the Eurasian wild boar escaped from hunting reserves and the domesticated pig "
"gone feral in the wilderness.  This one is just a baby, and is surprisingly "
"cute."
msgstr ""
"Originairement pas natif au Etats-Unis, cet omnivore sauvage est un hybride "
"de sangliers sauvages s’étant échappés de réserves de chasse et de cochons "
"domestiques retournes a l'état sauvage"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wild boar"
msgid_plural "wild boars"
msgstr[0] "sanglier"
msgstr[1] "sangliers"
msgstr[2] "sangliers"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wild boar"
msgid ""
"Originally not native in the U.S., this wild omnivore is a crossbreed between "
"the Eurasian wild boar escaped from hunting reserves and the domesticated pig "
"gone feral in the wilderness.  Its population has skyrocketed during the last "
"few decades."
msgstr ""
"Initialement non originaire des États-Unis, cet omnivore sauvage est un "
"croisement entre des sangliers eurasiens échappés des réserves de chasse et "
"le cochon domestique retourné à l'état sauvage.  Sa population a explosé au "
"cours des dernières décennies."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bobcat"
msgid_plural "bobcats"
msgstr[0] "lynx"
msgstr[1] "lynx"
msgstr[2] "lynx"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bobcat"
msgid ""
"A spotted wild cat living across much of North America.  It is not a serious "
"threat to humans, but it can be aggressive when threatened."
msgstr ""
"Un chat sauvage tacheté vivant dans une grande partie de l’Amérique du Nord.  "
"Ce n’est pas une menace sérieuse pour les humains, mais il peut se montrer "
"agressif lorsqu’il est menacé."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shorthair kitten"
msgid_plural "shorthair kittens"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shorthair kitten"
msgid "A cuddly kitten meowing and scampering amidst the death.  Currently feral."
msgstr ""
"Un chaton calineux qui miaule et gambade au milieu des morts.  Sauvage, il "
"vous faudra quelque chose pour l'apprivoiser."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shorthair cat"
msgid_plural "shorthair cats"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shorthair cat"
msgid ""
"In the absence of human stewardship, this small, domesticated predator has "
"grown wary of humans.  Harried by the elements and the rigors of survival, it "
"has become very skittish but is still motivated by food."
msgstr ""
"En l'absence de ses maitres humains, ce petit prédateur domestiqué est devenu "
"plus méfiant de ceux-ci. Dans sa lutte contre les éléments et ce que la "
"survie lui demande, celui-ci est devenu très nerveux mais toujours motivé par "
"l'appel de la nourriture."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/mammal.json
#. ~ Feed message of monster "shorthair cat"
#. ~ Feed message of monster "mon_bobcat"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s seems to like you!  Or maybe it just tolerates your presence better.  "
"It's hard to tell with felines."
msgstr ""

