#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_cat_isherwood"
msgid ""
"A small domesticated predator gone feral in the absence of human stewardship. "
" Located near the old Isherwood cabin."
msgstr ""
"Un petit prédateur domestiqué redevenu sauvage en l'absence de ses maîtres "
"humains. Situé près de la vieille cabane des Isherwoods."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
