#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "golden chonker"
msgid ""
"Oh lawd, he comin'!  This impressive feline would once have been celebrated "
"on internet cat forums for its chonkiness and majestic golden mane.  Appears "
"surprisingly well-groomed despite its bulk."
msgstr ""
"Oh mon Dieu, il arrive ! Cet impressionnant félin aurait autrefois été "
"célébré sur les forums de chats sur Internet pour sa chonkiness et sa "
"majestueuse crinière dorée. Il semble étonnamment bien soigné malgré sa "
"corpulence."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "yellow kitten"
msgid_plural "yellow kittens"
msgstr[0] "chaton jaune"
msgstr[1] "chatons jaunes"
msgstr[2] "chatons jaunes"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "yellow kitten"
msgid ""
"This poor little kitten is starving!  You wonder if you have some cat food "
"around…"
msgstr ""
"Ce pauvre petit chaton est affamé!  Vous vous demandez si vous avez de la "
"nourriture pour chat à portée de main…"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
