msgstr[2] "chats noirs"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black cat"
msgid "A black ball of fur with prominent green eyes staring right into your soul."
msgstr "Un chat noir comme la nuit doté d'yeux verts presque hypnotisants."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
