msgstr[1] "tamias"
msgstr[2] "tamias"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "chipmunk"
msgid ""
"The eastern chipmunk, a tiny omnivorous rodent with a characteristic striped "
"coat.  It spends much of the day patrolling its elaborate burrow and the "
"precious stores of foraged food within."
msgstr ""
"Le tamia rayé est un minuscule rongeur omnivore au pelage rayé "
"caractéristique. Il passe une grande partie de la journée à patrouiller dans "
"son terrier élaboré et dans les précieuses réserves de nourriture qui s'y "
"trouvent."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cougar"
msgid_plural "cougars"
msgstr[0] "cougar"
msgstr[1] "cougars"
msgstr[2] "cougars"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cougar"
msgid ""
"The Eastern cougar, a large feline predator.  Once thought extinct in this "
"region, conservation efforts were successful in restoring a thriving "
"population.  Fast and silent, this predator can cover long distances with "
"powerful leaps and pounces, catching its prey with its deadly claws before "
"delivering the finishing blow with its enormous fangs."
msgstr ""
"Le couguar de l'Est, un grand prédateur félin. Autrefois considéré comme "
"éteint dans cette région, les efforts de conservation ont permis de rétablir "
"une population florissante. Rapide et silencieux, ce prédateur peut parcourir "
"de longues distances en faisant des bonds puissants, en attrapant sa proie "
"avec ses griffes mortelles avant de lui donner le coup de grâce avec ses "
"énormes crocs."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cougar kitten"
msgid_plural "cougar kittens"
msgstr[0] "chaton de cougar"
msgstr[1] "chatons de cougar"
msgstr[2] "chatons de cougar"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cougar kitten"
msgid ""
"A cute and currently defenseless cougar kitten, meowing at its surroundings "
"in search of its mother.  Be careful, these kittens grow quite big and "
"ferocious in just a few months."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tiger"
msgid_plural "tigers"
msgstr[0] "tigre"
msgstr[1] "tigres"
msgstr[2] "tigres"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tiger"
msgid ""
"The majestic tiger, a large feline predator.  Native to Asia, they are now "
"most populous in private reserves in the United States.  Fast and powerful, "
"this predator is one of the most recognizable and beloved animals in the "
"world.  Also one of the deadliest."
msgstr ""
"Un tigre majestueux, ce grand félin originaire d'Asie était assez répandu à "
"travers les réserves animales et zoo américains avant le Cataclysme. Ce "
"prédateur est phénoménalement rapide et fort, et n'hésitera pas à vous "
"inclure dans son diner."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "calf"
msgid_plural "calves"
msgstr[0] "vachette"
msgstr[1] "vachettes"
msgstr[2] "vachettes"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "calf"
msgid ""
"The domestic cow, a baleful, ruminating farm animal.  This one is still a "
"juvenile; it'll take a while before you can get any milk or a meaningful "
"amount of meat from her."
msgstr ""
"Une vache domestique, un animal de ferme ruminant. Celle-ci est toujours "
"juvénile et il vous faudra un bon moment pour espérer tirer un bon rendement "
"de lait ou de viande d'elle."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cow"
msgid_plural "cows"
msgstr[0] "vache"
msgstr[1] "vaches"
msgstr[2] "vaches"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cow"
msgid ""
"The domestic cow, a baleful, ruminating farm animal.  She is quite muscular, "
"and would be a great source of milk if domesticated or of meat and leather if "
"slaughtered."
msgstr ""
"Une vache domestique, un animal de ferme ruminant. Assez musclée, vous "
"pourriez en tirer un bon rendement de viande en l'abattant ou la garder pour "
"son lait en la domestiquant."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "coyote"
msgid_plural "coyotes"
msgstr[0] "coyote"
msgstr[1] "coyotes"
msgstr[2] "coyotes"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "coyote"
msgid ""
"The Eastern coyote, also called the tweed wolf, is a territorial canine "
"hybrid of wolves and true coyotes.  It can be intimidated by humans and other "
"predators, but it will still fight when threatened, and the Cataclysm seems "
"to have made it more fearless than before."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "coyote pup"
msgid_plural "coyote pups"
msgstr[0] "chiot de coyote"
msgstr[1] "chiots de coyote"
msgstr[2] "chiots de coyote"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "coyote pup"
msgid ""
"A cute coyote pup.  Despite the temptation, perhaps it is wise to refrain "
"from petting it."
msgstr ""
"Un petit coyote mignon.  Malgré la tentation, il vaudrait peut être mieux "
"pour vous de ne pas essayer de le caresser."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fawn"
msgid_plural "fawns"
msgstr[0] "faon"
msgstr[1] "faons"
msgstr[2] "faons"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fawn"
msgid ""
"A juvenile northern woodland white-tailed deer, a quick and strong grazing "
"animal.  Favored prey of coyotes, wolves, and giant spider mutants."
msgstr ""
"Un cerf de Virginie juvénile. Un animal brouteur coriace et rapide. Une proie "
"de prédilection des coyotes, des loups, et maintenant des araignées mutantes "
"géantes."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "deer"
msgid_plural "deer"
msgstr[0] "cerf"
msgstr[1] "cerfs"
msgstr[2] "cerfs"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "deer"
msgid ""
"The northern woodland white-tailed deer, a quick and strong grazing animal.  "
"Favored prey of coyotes, wolves, and giant spider mutants."
msgstr ""
"Un cerf des bois du nord. Fort et rapide. Il est la proie favorite des "
"coyotes et des araignées mutantes géantes."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Labrador mutt"
msgid_plural "Labrador mutts"
msgstr[0] "labrador"
msgstr[1] "labradors"
msgstr[2] "labradors"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Labrador mutt"
msgid ""
"This once-average Labrador mixed-breed dog has clearly gone feral.  Though it "
"likely still instinctively trusts humans, it's probably far from domestic by "
"now."
msgstr ""
"Ce chien de race mixte Labrador, autrefois moyen, est manifestement devenu "
"sauvage. Bien qu'il fasse encore instinctivement confiance aux humains, il "
"est probablement loin d'être domestique à l'heure actuelle."

