msgstr[1] "bulldogs (chiots)"
msgstr[2] "bulldogs (chiots)"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bulldog puppy"
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless American bulldog puppy.  Much safer to tame than an "
"adult dog."
msgstr ""
"Un adorable chiot bouledogue américain sans défense. Il est beaucoup moins "
"dangereux à apprivoiser qu'un chien adulte."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pit bull mix"
msgid_plural "pit bull mixes"
msgstr[0] "pitbull"
msgstr[1] "pitbulls"
msgstr[2] "pitbulls"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pit bull mix"
msgid ""
"The oft-misunderstood pit bull is not actually a single breed but a label for "
"several kinds of terriers.  It has average abilities, and is well-known for "
"its 'lock jaw' - which isn't real, but its incredible determination is."
msgstr ""
"Le pitbull, souvent méconnu, n'est pas une race unique, mais une appellation "
"qui regroupe plusieurs types de terriers. Il a des aptitudes moyennes et est "
"bien connu pour sa \"mâchoire de blocage\" - qui n'existe pas, mais qui est "
"le fruit d'une incroyable détermination."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pit bull puppy"
msgid_plural "pit bull puppies"
msgstr[0] "pitbull (chiot)"
msgstr[1] "pitbulls (chiots)"
msgstr[2] "pitbulls (chiots)"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pit bull puppy"
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless pit bull puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult "
"dog."
msgstr ""
"Un adorable chiot pitbull sans défense. Il est beaucoup plus facile à "
"apprivoiser qu'un chien adulte."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
