msgid ""
"It's a tiny Chihuahua.  How it has managed to survive is a miracle, although "
"its small size and aggressive nature may have proven useful."
msgstr ""
"C'est un minuscule chihuahua. Sa survie tient du miracle, même si sa petite "
"taille et son caractère agressif ont pu lui être utiles."

