msgid_plural "triffid sprigs"
msgstr[0] "brindille triffide"
msgstr[1] "brindilles triffide"
msgstr[2] "brindilles triffide"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "triffid sprig"
msgid ""
"A teeny-tiny triffid that has recently germinated.  Like a house cat, you "
"know it wants to eat you but it just can't figure out how."
msgstr ""
"Un petit triffide ayant just germé, manifestement plus que disposé à vouloir "
"vous manger, manquant juste la taille necessaire pour le faire."

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "triffid sprout"
msgid_plural "triffid sprouts"
msgstr[0] "pousse de triffide"
msgstr[1] "pousses de triffide"
msgstr[2] "pousses de triffide"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "triffid sprout"
msgid ""
"A small triffid, only a few feet tall.  It has not yet developed bark, but "
"its sting is still sharp and deadly."
msgstr ""
"Un petit triffide atteignant à peine votre taille n'étant pas encore "
"recouvert d'écorce, mais ayant tout de même un dard acéré et redoutable."

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "triffid"
msgid_plural "triffids"
msgstr[0] "triffide"
msgstr[1] "triffides"
msgstr[2] "triffides"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "triffid"
msgid ""
"A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered "
"stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralyzing sting concealed within.  "
"Nature is healing."
msgstr ""
"Plante rampante et mobile, aussi haute qu'un élan. Elle possède une seule "
"tige recouverte d'écorce qui soutient une tête fleurie dans laquelle est "
"dissimulé un aiguillon paralysant. La nature est curative."

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "triffid queen"
msgid_plural "triffid queens"
msgstr[0] "reine triffide"
msgstr[1] "reines triffides"
msgstr[2] "reines triffides"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "triffid queen"
msgid ""
"A ponderous and particularly arborescent triffid.  It has enormous red petals "
"surrounded by a haze of spores, and two thick barbed vines stick out from the "
"stems like wary harpoons."
msgstr ""
"Un triffide lourd et particulièrement arborescent. Il possède d'énormes "
"pétales rouges entourés d'une brume de spores, et deux épaisses lianes "
"barbelées sortent des tiges comme des harpons méfiants."

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "vine beast"
msgid_plural "vine beasts"
msgstr[0] "plante rampante"
msgstr[1] "plantes rampantes"
msgstr[2] "plantes rampantes"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "vine beast"
msgid ""
"An animated mass of roots and vines, creeping along the ground with alarming "
"speed.  The tangle is thick enough that the center from which they grow is "
"concealed."
msgstr ""
"Une masse animée de racines et de lianes, rampant sur le sol à une vitesse "
"alarmante. L'enchevêtrement est suffisamment épais pour que le centre à "
"partir duquel elles poussent soit dissimulé."

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungicidal triffid"
msgid_plural "fungicidal triffids"
msgstr[0] "triffide fongicide"
msgstr[1] "triffides fongicides"
msgstr[2] "triffides fongicides"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungicidal triffid"
msgid ""
"A stout, woody plant that can dig through the ground and flick spines from "
"its branches.  The thorns carry a fungicidal compound with paralytic effects."
msgstr ""
"Plante ligneuse et robuste qui peut creuser le sol et faire jaillir des "
"épines de ses branches. Les épines contiennent un composé fongicide aux "
"effets paralysants."

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "triffid flower"
msgid_plural "triffid flowers"
msgstr[0] "fleur triffide"
msgstr[1] "fleurs triffides"
msgstr[2] "fleurs triffides"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "triffid flower"
msgid ""
"A giant plant with a thick stalk adorned by a purple flower.  Its petals are "
"open with an ominous shine in the center."
msgstr ""
"Plante géante à la tige épaisse ornée d'une fleur violette. Ses pétales sont "
"ouverts avec un éclat inquiétant au centre."

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_terrain/overmap_terrain_triffid.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#: data/mods/alt_map_key/overmap_terrain_pink.json
#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Overmap terrain name
msgid "triffid heart"
msgid_plural "triffid hearts"
msgstr[0] "cœur triffide"
msgstr[1] "cœurs triffide"
msgstr[2] "cœurs triffide"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "triffid heart"
msgid ""
"A knot of tubular roots, flowing with sap and beating like a heart.  Strands "
"of vascular tissue reach out to the surrounding root walls."
msgstr ""
"Un nœud de racines tubulaires, qui coulent de sève et battent comme un cœur. "
"Des fils de tissu vasculaire s'étendent jusqu'aux parois des racines "
"environnantes."

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "improvised MP5 turret"
msgid_plural "improvised MP5 turrets"
msgstr[0] "tourelle MP5 improvisée"
msgstr[1] "tourelles MP5 improvisées"
msgstr[2] "tourelles MP5 improvisées"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "improvised MP5 turret"
msgid ""
"A 9mm MP5 attached to a motorized chassis with basic autonomous software "
"control.  There is no mechanism to reload the weapon when its magazine is "
"empty, and the fire control system is only designed for semi-automatic fire."
msgstr ""
"Un MP5 de 9 mm fixé à un châssis motorisé avec un logiciel de contrôle "
"autonome de base. Il n'y a pas de mécanisme pour recharger l'arme lorsque son "
"chargeur est vide, et le système de contrôle de tir n'est conçu que pour le "
"tir semi-automatique."

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "milspec searchlight"
msgid_plural "milspec searchlights"
msgstr[0] "projecteur militaire"
msgstr[1] "projecteurs militaires"
msgstr[2] "projecteurs militaires"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "milspec searchlight"
msgid ""
"A pylon boasting three high-powered searchlights with automated search AI, "
"continually seeking targets."
msgstr ""
"Un pylône doté de trois projecteurs très puissants et d'une IA de recherche "
"automatisée, à la recherche permanente de cibles."

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "M2HB autonomous CROWS II"
msgid_plural "M2HB autonomous CROWS II"
msgstr[0] "CROW II autonome (M2HB)"
msgstr[1] "CROW II autonomes (M2HB)"
msgstr[2] "CROW II autonomes (M2HB)"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "M2HB autonomous CROWS II"
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  This one is fitted with a .50 caliber M2HB "
"machine gun."
msgstr ""
"Système d'armement à distance dérivé du M153 CROWS II et amélioré par un "
"logiciel de fonctionnement autonome. Celui-ci est équipé d'une mitrailleuse "
"M2HB de calibre 50."

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "M249 autonomous CROWS II"
msgid_plural "M249 autonomous CROWS II"
msgstr[0] "CROW II autonome (M249)"
msgstr[1] "CROW II autonomes (M249)"
msgstr[2] "CROW II autonomes (M249)"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "M249 autonomous CROWS II"
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  This one is fitted with a 5.56 caliber M249 "
"machine gun."
msgstr ""
"Système d'armement à distance dérivé du M153 CROWS II et amélioré par un "
"logiciel de fonctionnement autonome. Celui-ci est équipé d'une mitrailleuse "
"M249 de calibre 5,56."

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "M240 autonomous CROWS II"
msgid_plural "M240 autonomous CROWS II"
msgstr[0] "CROW II autonome (M240)"
msgstr[1] "CROW II autonomes (M240)"
msgstr[2] "CROW II autonomes (M240)"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "M240 autonomous CROWS II"
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  This one is fitted with a 7.62 caliber M240 "
"machine gun."
msgstr ""
"Système d'armement à distance dérivé du M153 CROWS II et amélioré par un "
"logiciel de fonctionnement autonome. Celui-ci est équipé d'une mitrailleuse "
"M240 de calibre 7,62."

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/robots/active_bots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "riot control platform"
msgid_plural "riot control platforms"
msgstr[0] "plateforme anti-émeute"
msgstr[1] "plateformes anti-émeutes"
msgstr[2] "plateformes anti-émeutes"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "riot control platform"
msgid ""
"These TALON-derived riot control platforms were widely publicized a few years "
"before the Cataclysm as a new semi-autonomous device that could fire "
"less-lethal rounds with far more accuracy than a human, ensuring safer hits "
"against a target's limbs.  They were quickly adopted by prisons and "
"inner-city police forces, where they demonstrated that 'less lethal' does not "
"mean 'non-lethal'.  In the days before the Cataclysm, massive stockrooms of "
"these things were put into circulation.  On the bright side, although it "
"shoots autonomously, it requires a human operator to relocate, so it's not "
"mobile anymore."
msgstr ""
"Ces plateformes anti-émeutes, une adaptation policière des tourelles "
"militaires TALON était proclamée quelques années avant le Cataclysme comme "
"des engins semi-autonomes capable de tirer des munitions à létalité réduite "
"beaucoup plus précisément qu'un officer de police humain, ce qui, en théorie, "
"permettrait la neutralisation d'individus violents et dangereux avec beaucoup "
"moins de danger de blessures sérieuses. Après leur vaste adoption pars un "
"grand nombre de département de police et centres pénitenciers, dans leur "
"nouvelle résidence, ces machines ont vite montré que leur létalité réduite ne "
"veut pas dire létalité nulle. Elles furent déployés en masse durant la "
"période d'émeutes pour tenter d'endiguer la vague d'anarchie précédant le "
"pire du Cataclysme. Bien que leur cadence de tir soit toujours redoutables, "
"elles nécessitent un opérateur humain pour se repositionner, un soulagement "
"pour ceux que maintenant elles tirent dessus sans provocation."

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/robots/active_bots.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "riot control platform"
msgid ""
"\"Universal curfew is in effect.  Please return to your home.  This unit is "
"authorized to open fire.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Un couvre-feu universel est en vigueur. Veuillez retourner chez vous. Cette "
"unité autonome est autorisée à tirer.\""

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "loudspeaker"
msgid_plural "loudspeakers"
msgstr[0] "enceinte"
msgstr[1] "enceintes"
msgstr[2] "enceintes"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "loudspeaker"
msgid "A high-powered loudspeaker set to loudly repeat messages on a loop."
msgstr ""
"Un haut-parleur à haut volume conçu pour déclamer très fort des messages "
"automatiques en boucle."

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "upcycled turret"
msgid_plural "upcycled turrets"
msgstr[0] "tourelle étrange"
msgstr[1] "tourelles étranges"
msgstr[2] "tourelles étranges"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "upcycled turret"
msgid ""
"This hefty turret appears to be bolted together out of various scraps of "
"technology, many of them extremely foreign-looking.  It is equipped with a "
"hefty-looking machine gun."
msgstr ""
"Cette tourelle imposante à l'air d'avoir été construite à partir de morceaux "
"de machines diverses, beaucoup d'entre elles ayant l'air extrêmement "
"étranges, la partie la plus importante de la tourelle étant sa mitrailleuse "
"massive."

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "upcycled turret"
msgid "\"Beep.\""
msgstr "\"Beep.\""

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "custom plated turret"
msgid_plural "custom plated turrets"
msgstr[0] "tourelle à blindage customisé"
msgstr[1] "tourelles à blindage customisé"
msgstr[2] "tourelles à blindage customisé"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "custom plated turret"
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  This one is fitted with a M249 and reinforced "
"with heavy plating."
msgstr ""
"Système d'armement à distance dérivé du M153 CROWS II et amélioré par un "
"logiciel de fonctionnement autonome. Celui-ci est équipé d'un M249 et "
"renforcé par un blindage lourd."

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grocery bot"
msgid_plural "grocery bots"
msgstr[0] "robot de shopping"
msgstr[1] "robots de shopping"
msgstr[2] "robots de shopping"

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grocery bot"
msgid ""
"A popular product from Uncanny, this friendly android can carry your bag or "
"push your grocery cart for you.  You know it's friendly because its "
"human-esque face is constantly smiling at you.  According to the ads, it uses "
"a state-machine of a complexity never seen before.  Uncanny even hired "
"professional actors to record its lines.  Examine to befriend."
msgstr ""
"Un produit populaire commercialisé par Uncanny, cet androïde sympathique est "
"capable de porter votre sac ou pousser votre caddie pour vous. Vous savez que "
"ce robot est sympathique dû à son visage presque humain ayant un sourire "
"constant. Si l'on croît les publicités, ce produit utilise une machine à "
"états finis d'une complexité jamais vue, Uncanny ayant même employé des "
"acteurs professionnels pour enregistrer son dialogue. Examiner-le pour qu'il "
"vous accompagne."

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "busted grocery bot"
msgid_plural "busted grocery bots"
msgstr[0] "robot de shopping endommagé"
msgstr[1] "robots de shopping endommagés"
msgstr[2] "robots de shopping endommagés"

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Description of monster "busted grocery bot"
msgid ""
"A busted grocery bot, it can still carry your bag but its arms are too "
"damaged to push a grocery cart.  Despite its current state, it's still "
"smiling at you.  Examine to befriend."
msgstr ""
"Un robot de shopping, toujours capable de porter votre sac, mais ses bras "
"sont trop endommagés pour pousser un caddie. Malgré son état présent, son "
"visage vous sourie toujours. Examinez-le pour qu'il vous accompagne."

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cleaner bot"
msgid_plural "cleaner bots"
msgstr[0] "robot de nettoyage"
msgstr[1] "robots de nettoyage"
msgstr[2] "robots de nettoyage"

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cleaner bot"
msgid ""
"The Ford Sanitron, a utility robot designed for cleaning up waste material in "
"hazardous conditions."
msgstr ""
"Le Sanitron Ford, un robot utilitaire utilisé pour nettoyer de grandes "
"quantités de déchets dans des conditions dangereuses."

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "demining bot"
msgid_plural "demining bots"
msgstr[0] "robot démineur"
msgstr[1] "robots démineurs"
msgstr[2] "robots démineurs"

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Description of monster "demining bot"
msgid ""
"A snake-like, segmented robot built to tunnel into the ground and detonate "
"landmines."
msgstr ""
"Un robot segmenté rappelant vaguement un serpent conçu pour creuser en "
"dessous des mines et les détoner en toute sécurité"

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "nurse bot"
msgid_plural "nurse bots"
msgstr[0] "robot infirmière"
msgstr[1] "robots infirmières"
msgstr[2] "robots infirmières"

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Description of monster "nurse bot"
msgid ""
"The first product from Uncanny, a towering four-armed humanoid with a gentle "
"face.  The details of its visage are striking, but the stiffness of it makes "
"you really uncomfortable.  The end of the world did not stop it from looking "
"for patients to assist."
msgstr ""
"Le premier produit commercialisé par Uncanny, un robot humanoïde imposant à "
"quatres bras et équipé d'un visage accueillant. Le détail de son visage est "
"impressionnant, mais  sa raideur vous rends vraiment inconfortable. La fin du "
"monde ne l'a pas arrêté d'essayer de trouver des patients à aider."

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Yrax trifacet"
msgid_plural "Yrax trifacets"
msgstr[0] "trifacette Yrax"
msgstr[1] "trifacettes Yrax"
msgstr[2] "trifacettes Yrax"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Yrax trifacet"
msgid ""
"Three dual leg modules join with each lower vertex of a pyramidal body, in a "
"abstract configuration that vaguely recalls an alien arthropod.  Devoid of "
"any exterior signs that betray its artificial origin, it looks like it could "
"fold itself into a perfectly featureless quartz pyramid.  It crawls with a "
"gait like none you've seen before, its minute movements too fast for your "
"eyes to track."
msgstr ""
"Trois modules à deux jambes se joignent à chaque sommet inférieur d'un corps "
"pyramidal, dans une configuration abstraite qui rappelle vaguement un "
"arthropode extraterrestre. Dépourvu de tout signe extérieur trahissant son "
"origine artificielle, il semble pouvoir se replier en une pyramide de quartz "
"parfaitement dépourvue de caractéristiques. Il rampe d'une démarche que vous "
"n'avez jamais vue auparavant, ses mouvements infimes étant trop rapides pour "
"que vos yeux puissent les suivre."

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Yrax trifacet"
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Yrax delta"
msgid "a fast sequence of clicking tones."
msgstr "une séquence rapide de cliquetis."

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Yrax triakis"
msgid_plural "Yrax triakis"
msgstr[0] "triakis Yrax"
msgstr[1] "triakis Yrax"
msgstr[2] "triakis Yrax"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Yrax triakis"
msgid ""
"Short-snakelike limbs seamlessly extend from an aggressively faceted body.  "
"Its movements keep it low to the ground, coiled like a trap waiting to spring."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Yrax sphenocorona"
msgid_plural "Yrax sphenocoronae"
msgstr[0] "sphenocorona Yrax"
msgstr[1] "sphenocoronae Yrax"
msgstr[2] "sphenocoronae Yrax"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Yrax sphenocorona"
msgid ""
"Manipulator arrays seamlessly protract from asymmetric facets, their testing "
"spaces undisturbed by the forces affixing it to the sky."
msgstr ""
"Les réseaux de manipulateurs se déploient sans heurt à partir de facettes "
"asymétriques, leurs espaces d'essai n'étant pas perturbés par les forces qui "
"les fixent au ciel."

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "Yrax sphenocorona"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Yrax sphenocorona"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s abruptly falls to the ground!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Yrax sphenocorona"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "golden monolith"
#, c-format
msgid "Shards of gleaming alloy detach from the %s's surface!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "golden monolith"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s unfolds into an alien robot!"
msgstr "Le %s se déplie en un robot étrange!"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Yrax apeirohedron"
msgid_plural "Yrax apeirohedra"
msgstr[0] "apeirohèdre Yrax"
msgstr[1] "apeirohèdres Yrax"
msgstr[2] "apeirohèdres Yrax"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Yrax apeirohedron"
msgid "Its uncountable surfaces flow against each other in a dazzling sea of gold."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "Yrax apeirohedron"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s folds away."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Yrax quadraphract"
msgid_plural "Yrax quadraphracts"
msgstr[0] "quadraphracte Yrax"
msgstr[1] "quadraphractes Yrax"
msgstr[2] "quadraphractes Yrax"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Yrax quadraphract"
msgid ""
"A gleaming, burnished gold, four legged structure the size of a small "
"vehicle, but much taller; this looks vaguely robotic, but too smooth and "
"perfect to fit in this world.  Its legs are smooth faceted figures, with no "
"visible joints, and hold its gem-like body aloft with an eery, sculpted "
"grace.  At the peak of the gem-body is a deep, goblet-shaped crown that "
"slowly swivels about, pointing at nothing in specific.  Though nothing about "
"its appearance is familiar to you, it nevertheless strikes you with a mixture "
"of awe and dread."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "Yrax quadraphract"
msgid "The quadraphract collapses, dead at last."
msgstr "Le quadraphracte s'affaisse, enfin inerte."

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "Yrax quadraphract"
msgid "reality seems to warp around the quadraphract's crown as it fires."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Yrax quadraphract"
msgid "a deep thrumming sound."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "quadraphract leg"
msgid_plural "quadraphract legs"
msgstr[0] "jambe de quadraphracte"
msgstr[1] "jambes de quadraphracte"
msgstr[2] "jambes de quadraphracte"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of monster "quadraphract leg"
msgid ""
"A morphing lune of burnished gold attached to the greater structure.  "
"Seemingly jointless it moves with a fluid grace, allowing the quadraphract to "
"glide aboveground with a speed and agility that belies its size."
msgstr ""
"Une lune d'or bruni en train de se métamorphoser est attachée à la structure "
"principale. Apparemment dépourvue d'articulations, elle se déplace avec une "
"grâce fluide, permettant au quadraphract de planer au-dessus du sol avec une "
"vitesse et une agilité qui n'ont rien à voir avec sa taille."

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "quadraphract leg"
msgid "The quadraphract stumbles as one of its legs looses coherence and collapses."
msgstr ""
"Le quadripode trébuche, l'une de ses pattes perdant sa consistance et "
"s'effondrant."

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Yrax delta"
msgid_plural "Yrax deltas"
msgstr[0] "delta Yrax"
msgstr[1] "deltas Yrax"
msgstr[2] "deltas Yrax"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Yrax delta"
msgid ""
"A kite shaped blade of metal, darting through air and foes by indiscernible "
"means."
msgstr ""
"Une lame de métal en forme de cerf-volant, qui traverse l'air et les ennemis "
"par des moyens indiscernables."

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Yrax delta"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "charged amalgamation"
#, c-format
msgid "A bolt of electricity arcs from %s!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal dog"
msgid_plural "skeletal dogs"
msgstr[0] "chien zombifié ossifié"
msgstr[1] "chiens zombifiés ossifiés"
msgstr[2] "chiens zombifiés ossifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal dog"
msgid ""
"This undead canine has shed all of its skin, revealing a carapace of fused "
"bones and ribs.  This walking suit of bone seems to be controlled by a net of "
"veins and sinews which pulse with glistening black goo."
msgstr ""
"Ce canidé mort-vivant a perdu toute sa peau, révélant une carapace d'os et de "
"côtes fusionnés. Ce costume d'os semble être contrôlé par un réseau de veines "
"et de tendons qui pulsent avec de la glu noire scintillante."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "barghest"
msgid_plural "barghests"
msgstr[0] "barghest"
msgstr[1] "barghests"
msgstr[2] "barghests"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "barghest"
msgid ""
"A huge swollen zombie dog, smeared black with slime.  Its teeth have grown "
"longer, and its broad back ripples with muscles and oozing wounds."
msgstr ""
"Un énorme chien zombie gonflé, maculé de bave. Ses dents se sont allongées et "
"son large dos ondule de muscles et de plaies suintantes."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cuspated dog"
msgid_plural "cuspated dogs"
msgstr[0] "chien cuspidé"
msgstr[1] "chiens cuspidés"
msgstr[2] "chiens cuspidés"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cuspated dog"
msgid ""
"This dog's snout and jaw have seemingly fused together, the skin and flesh "
"ranging from completely gone to barely hanging on.  The boney mass as a whole "
"has an incredibly sharp yet jagged point.  It stumbles around, barely keeping "
"its hefty 'beak' from hitting the ground."
msgstr ""
"Le museau et la mâchoire de ce chien ont apparemment fusionné, la peau et la "
"chair ayant disparu ou tenant à peine. La masse osseuse dans son ensemble "
"présente une pointe incroyablement acérée et déchiquetée. Il trébuche, "
"empêchant à peine son énorme « bec » de heurter le sol."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "howling dog"
msgid_plural "howling dogs"
msgstr[0] "chien hurleur"
msgstr[1] "chiens hurleurs"
msgstr[2] "chiens hurleurs"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "howling dog"
msgid ""
"The underbelly of this undead canine expands and contracts arrhythmically, "
"almost like it's breathing.  Despite that, it is clearly in an advanced state "
"of decomposition.  Its snout and throat appear far too large for its species, "
"and the remains of its eyes appear much more analytical than its brethren."
msgstr ""
"Le ventre de ce canidé mort-vivant se dilate et se contracte de façon "
"arythmique, comme s'il respirait. Malgré cela, il est manifestement dans un "
"état de décomposition avancé. Son museau et sa gorge semblent bien trop "
"grands pour son espèce, et les restes de ses yeux paraissent bien plus "
"analytiques que ceux de ses congénères."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scorched dog"
msgid_plural "scorched dogs"
msgstr[0] "chien calciné"
msgstr[1] "chiens calcinés"
msgstr[2] "chiens calcinés"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scorched dog"
msgid ""
"A charred and damaged corpse of a canid, covered in fused patches of burnt "
"hide and flesh."
msgstr ""
"Le cadavre carbonisé et endommagé d'un canidé, couvert de plaques de peau et "
"de chair brûlées."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hulking horror"
msgid_plural "hulking horrors"
msgstr[0] "chien zombifié mastodonte"
msgstr[1] "chiens zombifiés mastodontes"
msgstr[2] "chiens zombifiés mastodontes"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hulking horror"
msgid ""
"What may once have been a dog is now a grotesquely swollen monstrosity, "
"standing on four limbs as wide as trash cans and showing massive, jagged "
"teeth."
msgstr ""
"Ce qui aurait pu être un chien est maintenant une monstruosité grotesque et "
"gonflée, se tenant sur quatre membres aussi larges que des poubelles et "
"montrant des dents massives et déchiquetées."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scorched hulking dog"
msgid_plural "scorched hulking dogs"
msgstr[0] "chien calciné énorme"
msgstr[1] "chiens calcinés énormes"
msgstr[2] "chiens calcinés énormes"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scorched hulking dog"
msgid ""
"A charred and damaged corpse of what you can only assume was once a horribly "
"mutated dog.  Covering its entire body is a layer of fused and melted hide, "
"giving it an armored appearance."
msgstr ""
"Le cadavre carbonisé et endommagé de ce que l'on peut supposer être un chien "
"horriblement muté. Son corps entier est recouvert d'une couche de peau "
"fondue, ce qui lui donne l'apparence d'une armure."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "boneplate wolf"
msgid_plural "boneplate wolves"
msgstr[0] "loup zombifié au blindage osseux"
msgstr[1] "loups zombifiés au blindage osseux"
msgstr[2] "loups zombifiés au blindage osseux"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "boneplate wolf"
msgid ""
"A four-legged creature covered in fused bony plates, shaped somewhat like a "
"dog or wolf.  Joints and cracks across its body ooze with black goo."
msgstr ""
"Créature à quatre pattes couverte de plaques osseuses fusionnées, ayant la "
"forme d'un chien ou d'un loup. Les articulations et les fissures de son corps "
"suintent d'une substance noire."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skull pig"
msgid_plural "skull pigs"
msgstr[0] "porc crâne"
msgstr[1] "porcs crâne"
msgstr[2] "porcs crâne"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skull pig"
msgid ""
"This undead boar appears to have been a truly massive specimen in life.  "
"Stretching eight to nine feet in length, the most arresting feature of this "
"animal is that the enamel of its tusks has spread across its face, leaving a "
"skull-like appearance with deep-set eye holes."
msgstr ""
"Ce sanglier mort-vivant semble avoir été un spécimen vraiment massif dans la "
"vie. D'une longueur de huit à neuf pieds, la caractéristique la plus "
"frappante de cet animal est que l'émail de ses défenses s'est répandu sur son "
"visage, lui donnant l'apparence d'un crâne avec des trous d'yeux profondément "
"enfoncés."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "trench pig"
msgid_plural "trench pigs"
msgstr[0] "porc de tranchée"
msgstr[1] "porcs de tranchée"
msgstr[2] "porcs de tranchée"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "trench pig"
msgid ""
"Billowing clouds of yellowish gas precede a boar-shaped shadow.  Glimpses of "
"a zombified boar are quickly obscured by the gases spewing forth from the "
"open wounds on its body."
msgstr ""
"Des nuages de gaz jaunâtres précèdent une ombre en forme de sanglier. La "
"vision d'un sanglier zombifié est rapidement masquée par les gaz qui "
"s'échappent des plaies ouvertes sur son corps."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal wolf"
msgid_plural "skeletal wolves"
msgstr[0] "loup zombifié ossifié"
msgstr[1] "loups zombifiés ossifiés"
msgstr[2] "loups zombifiés ossifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal wolf"
msgid ""
"This undead canine has shed all of its skin, revealing a carapace of fused "
"bones and ribs."
msgstr ""
"Ce canidé zombifié a perdu toute sa peau et une carapace squelettique de "
"côtes et excroissances osseuses a pris sa place."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "spearcat hunter"
msgid_plural "spearcat hunters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "spearcat hunter"
msgid ""
"This undead cougar's eyes ooze with dark, oily fluid, and its fur is torn, "
"revealing deep, festering wounds.  Its claws and teeth are unnaturally long, "
"and sharpened into dangerous looking spikes."
msgstr ""
"Un couguar mort-vivant aux yeux suintant un liquide sombre et huileux, sa "
"fourrure déchirée révélant de profondes blessures suppurantes.  Vous observez "
"que ses griffes et ses dents sont anormalement longues et aiguisées comme des "
"pieux."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal zombear"
msgid_plural "skeletal zombears"
msgstr[0] "ours zombifié ossifié"
msgstr[1] "ours zombifiés ossifiés"
msgstr[2] "ours zombifiés ossifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal zombear"
msgid ""
"As if a zombified bear wasn't already a problem, this one is layered in thick "
"bone growths that protect it from harm.  The irregular way the plates grow "
"against each other has somewhat stifled its movement, but not enough to stop "
"it from easily gaining up on you."
msgstr ""
"Comme si un ours zombifié n'était pas déjà un problème, celui-ci est "
"recouvert d'épaisses excroissances osseuses qui le protègent. La façon "
"irrégulière dont les plaques poussent les unes contre les autres a quelque "
"peu étouffé ses mouvements, mais pas assez pour l'empêcher de vous rattraper "
"facilement."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shadowcat"
msgid_plural "shadowcats"
msgstr[0] "ombre féline"
msgstr[1] "ombres félines"
msgstr[2] "ombres félines"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shadowcat"
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature, as if light itself were too "
"repulsed to touch it.  All you can make out is the outline of a large, "
"shambling cat."
msgstr ""
"Une ombre inquiétante enveloppe cette créature, comme si la lumière elle-même "
"était trop repoussée pour la toucher. Tout ce que vous pouvez distinguer est "
"la silhouette d'un large félin titubant."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "acidic zombear"
msgid_plural "acidic zombears"
msgstr[0] "ours zombifié acidique"
msgstr[1] "ours zombifiés acidiques"
msgstr[2] "ours zombifiés acidiques"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "acidic zombear"
msgid ""
"Most of this bear's fur has burnt off and its body looks to be falling apart, "
"not entirely immune to its own acidic fluids.  Despite its weakened state, "
"the strength of a bear hasn't left it."
msgstr ""
"La majeure partie de la fourrure de cet ours a brûlé et son corps semble se "
"désagréger, n'étant pas totalement immunisé contre ses propres fluides "
"acides. Malgré son état de faiblesse, la force de l'ours ne l'a pas quitté."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "acidic zombie horse"
msgid_plural "acidic zombie horses"
msgstr[0] "cheval zombifié acidique"
msgstr[1] "chevaux zombifiés acidiques"
msgstr[2] "chevaux zombifiés acidiques"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "acidic zombie horse"
msgid ""
"The abdomen of this once majestic horse has grown rotund to the point you can "
"see through the skin, at the reservoir of caustic bile inside.  Its neck is "
"equally enlarged as well as slightly longer than normal."
msgstr ""
"L'abodmen de ce cheval autrefois majestueux est devenu tellement gonflé que "
"vous pouvez observer le vaste réservoir de bile à l'intérieur à travers sa "
"peau transparente. Son cou est presque aussi bouffi et légèrement plus long "
"que la normale."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sinewy warhorse"
msgid_plural "sinewy warhorses"
msgstr[0] "destrier du carnage"
msgstr[1] "destriers du carnage"
msgstr[2] "destriers du carnage"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sinewy warhorse"
msgid ""
"A zombified horse without skin, its overgrown, bloody musculature clear for "
"all to see.  Some muscles occasionally tear from their tendons as it barrels "
"towards its target, flailing around like a loose hose before weaving back "
"into place."
msgstr ""
"Un cheval zombifié ayant perdu toute sa peau, sa musculature enflée et "
"sanglante présentée au monde entier sans ambiguïtés. Certains de ses muscles "
"se déchirent de leurs tendons lorsque cette monstruosité charge vers ses "
"proies avant de se remettre en place d'eux-mêmes."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "smoldering stallion"
msgid_plural "smoldering stallions"
msgstr[0] "étalon macramé"
msgstr[1] "étalons macramés"
msgstr[2] "étalons macramés"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "smoldering stallion"
msgid ""
"This undead horse has a charred hide as black as soot, the underside of which "
"is littered with gashes and holes.  Pillars of choking black smoke pour from "
"the wounds, smothering everything that draws near."
msgstr ""
"Ce cheval zombifié possède une peau carbonisée noire comme la suie, sa panse "
"couverte de plaies et perforations, des fumeroles sombres de fumée épaisse "
"s'en échappent, ayant l'air d'étouffer tout dans les environs."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pale charger"
msgid_plural "pale chargers"
msgstr[0] "coursier blanchâtre"
msgstr[1] "coursiers blanchâtres"
msgstr[2] "coursiers blanchâtres"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pale charger"
msgid ""
"With plates of asymmetrical bone tissue overlapping its body, this ignoble "
"steed needs no rider for you to fear its approach.  Completing its ghoulish "
"look is an overgrown skull which, judging by the flattened and battered "
"forehead, has become its main weapon."
msgstr ""
"Des plaques de tissu osseux couvrent le corps entier de ce destrier "
"repoussant n'ayant pas besoin d'un cavalier pour vous faire craindre son "
"galop. Sa tête complète son apparence squelettique, possédant un crâne enflé "
"complétant dépourvu de peau ayant l'air, vu son front visiblement aplati et "
"fissuré, d'être devenu son arme de prédilection."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "antlered hammer"
msgid_plural "antlered hammers"
msgstr[0] "horreur à ramures musclée"
msgstr[1] "horreurs à ramures musclées"
msgstr[2] "horreurs à ramures musclées"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "antlered hammer"
msgid ""
"This once-great moose's eyes ooze with dark, oily fluid, and its flesh is "
"torn and scarred.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, "
"festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"Les yeux de cet ancien grand élan suintent d'un liquide sombre et huileux, et "
"sa chair est déchirée et cicatrisée. Son corps entier est bardé de muscles "
"distendus et de plaies boursouflées et suppurantes."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "thorny moose shambler"
msgid_plural "thorny moose shamblers"
msgstr[0] "élan épineux"
msgstr[1] "élans épineux"
msgstr[2] "élans épineux"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "thorny moose shambler"
msgid ""
"This once-great moose is covered with long, matted hair twisted with thorny "
"vines that wrap together and then twist back into its body.  Long, "
"interlocking thorns wrap its antlers, dripping with a silvery liquid."
msgstr ""
"Cet élan, qui fut jadis un grand élan, est couvert de longs poils emmêlés et "
"de lianes épineuses qui s'enroulent les unes sur les autres avant de se "
"replier sur le corps. De longues épines entrelacées entourent ses bois et "
"dégoulinent d'un liquide argenté."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "jawed terror"
msgid_plural "jawed terrors"
msgstr[0] "dent de la peur"
msgstr[1] "dents de la peur"
msgstr[2] "dents de la peur"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "jawed terror"
msgid ""
"Once a normally-aggressive, normally-hungry bull shark, this undead terror is "
"now even more aggressive and more hungry, possibly thanks to its lack of a "
"functioning brain."
msgstr ""
"Autrefois un requin taureau normalement agressif et normalement affamé, cette "
"terreur mort-vivante est maintenant encore plus agressive et plus affamée, "
"peut-être grâce à l'absence d'un cerveau en état de marche."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "abyssal terror"
msgid_plural "abyssal terrors"
msgstr[0] "terreur abyssale"
msgstr[1] "terreurs abyssales"
msgstr[2] "terreurs abyssales"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "abyssal terror"
msgid ""
"Once a former apex predator of the seas, now an undead nightmare, this "
"zombified Great White shark terrorizes the waters with its relentless hunger "
"and aggression."
msgstr ""
"Auparavant un super prédateur des océans, maintenant un cauchemar "
"mort-vivant, ce grand requin blanc zombifié terrorise les eaux avec sa faim "
"insatiable et son aggression sans limites."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie dog"
msgid_plural "zombie dogs"
msgstr[0] "chien zombifié"
msgstr[1] "chiens zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "chiens zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie dog"
msgid ""
"The deformed, animated corpse of a canine; a sinewy beast which can easily "
"outpace its two-legged friends."
msgstr ""
"Le corps animé et déformé d'un chien, une bête aux muscles noueux capable de "
"facilement distancer ses amis bipèdes titubants."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Z-9"
msgid_plural "Z-9s"
msgstr[0] "Z-9"
msgstr[1] "Z-9s"
msgstr[2] "Z-9s"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Z-9"
msgid ""
"A zombified version of one of the German Shepherd dogs used in law "
"enforcement.  Its deformed body is encased in a protective Kevlar harness."
msgstr ""
"Un berger allemand de police zombifié. Son corps en putréfaction est protégé "
"par un harnais en Kevlar."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rot-weiler"
msgid_plural "rot-weilers"
msgstr[0] "rottweiler putréfié"
msgstr[1] "rottweilers putréfiés"
msgstr[2] "rottweilers putréfiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rot-weiler"
msgid ""
"An acrid smell accompanies this animated canine corpse.  Its whole body is "
"covered in chains of pulsing cysts and slime-dribbling ulcers."
msgstr ""
"An acrid smell accompanies this animated canine corpse. Its whole body is "
"covered in chains of pulsing cysts and slime-dribbling ulcers."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grim howler"
msgid_plural "grim howlers"
msgstr[0] "hurleur sinistre"
msgstr[1] "hurleurs sinistres"
msgstr[2] "hurleurs sinistres"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grim howler"
msgid ""
"A zombified wolf.  Its mouth oozes with a black substance, coating its "
"vicious-looking white fangs."
msgstr ""
"Un loup zombifié. Un liquide noir et visqueux dégringole de ses babines, "
"recouvrant ses crocs d'albâtre menaçants."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombear"
msgid_plural "zombears"
msgstr[0] "ours zombifié"
msgstr[1] "ours zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "ours zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombear"
msgid ""
"This black bear's eyes ooze with dark, oily fluid, and its flesh is torn and "
"scarred.  It shuffles as it walks."
msgstr ""
"Les yeux de cet ours noir suintent un fluide noir et visqueux et sa chair est "
"balafrée de coupures profondes. Il marche en traînant lourdement des pieds."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "festering boar"
msgid_plural "festering boars"
msgstr[0] "sanglier zombifié"
msgstr[1] "sangliers zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "sangliers zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "festering boar"
msgid ""
"A zombified omnivore descended from the wild boar.  Now it's got black goo "
"all over it, instead of mud."
msgstr ""
"Un sanglier zombifié, du sang noir s'égoutte des nombreuses blessures "
"parsemant son corps titubant."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombeaver"
msgid_plural "zombeavers"
msgstr[0] "castor zombifié"
msgstr[1] "castors zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "castors zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombeaver"
msgid ""
"This wall-eyed beast has a large wound on its side, its gore-stained ribs "
"clearly visible.  Its most prominent features are the fearsome incisors "
"dribbling thick, black goo from inside its mouth.  It doesn't look interested "
"in chewing on trees anymore."
msgstr ""
"Un castor aux yeux vides avec des plaies béantes sur ses flancs et ses côtes "
"visibles. Les incisives de cette abomination ont maintenant l'air plus aptes "
"à amputer qu'à déchiqueter des arbres."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "antlered horror"
msgid_plural "antlered horrors"
msgstr[0] "horreur à ramures"
msgstr[1] "horreurs à ramures"
msgstr[2] "horreurs à ramures"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "antlered horror"
msgid ""
"This formerly-majestic moose has succumbed to the infection that is killing "
"the world.  Shiny green blowflies swarm the vast, suppurated patches of "
"purulent flesh where its skin has sloughed away, and its remaining fur is "
"black and matted with necrotic discharge."
msgstr ""
"Cet élan autrefois majestueux a succombé à l'infection qui tue le monde. Des "
"mouches à viande d'un vert brillant pullulent sur les vastes plaques "
"suppurées de chair purulente où sa peau s'est détachée, et le reste de sa "
"fourrure est noire et emmêlée d'écoulements nécrotiques."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "decayed pouncer"
msgid_plural "decayed pouncers"
msgstr[0] "cougar zombifiée"
msgstr[1] "cougars zombifiées"
msgstr[2] "cougars zombifiées"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "decayed pouncer"
msgid ""
"A normal-looking cougar, except that its hind legs are swollen, and its eyes "
"bulge with black goo."
msgstr ""
"Une cougar à l'apparence pratiquement normale, si vous ignorez ces pattes "
"arrières gonflées de muscle et ses yeux remplis de substance visqueuse noire."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie horse"
msgid_plural "zombie horses"
msgstr[0] "cheval zombifié"
msgstr[1] "chevaux zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "chevaux zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie horse"
msgid ""
"From the deteriorated state of this undead horse's ghastly "
"features--protruding ribs, off-white skull, and decayed, tattered muscles--it "
"doesn't seem like it should put up much of a fight, but something deep inside "
"gives it power.  Black, reeking ichor drips from its wounds."
msgstr ""
"Au vu de l'état de délabrement de ce cheval mort-vivant - côtes saillantes, "
"crâne blanc cassé, muscles en lambeaux - il ne semble pas devoir se battre, "
"mais quelque chose au fond de lui lui donne de l'énergie. Un ichor noir et "
"nauséabond s'écoule de ses blessures."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tiger wight"
msgid_plural "tiger wights"
msgstr[0] "tigre zombifié"
msgstr[1] "tigres zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "tigres zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tiger wight"
msgid ""
"This tiger stumbles and sways, its jaws slack, its eyes wide open and shining "
"black."
msgstr ""
"Un tigre trébuchant et oscillant à la mâchoire molle et aux yeux brilliants "
"noirs comme la nuit."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie sheep"
msgid_plural "zombie sheep"
msgstr[0] "mouton zombifié"
msgstr[1] "moutons zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "moutons zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie sheep"
msgid ""
"This sheep's once pure white wool is now barely hanging by its rotten flesh, "
"held together by dried mud and blood.  Its legs now buckle as the rotten "
"muscles have a hard time sustaining the rest of the body."
msgstr ""
"La laine autrefois pure et blanche de ce mouton pend désormais à peine de sa "
"chair pourrie, maintenus ensemble par de la crasse et du sang séchés.  Ses "
"jambes fléchissent désormais car les muscles pourris ont du mal à soutenir le "
"reste du corps."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie goat"
msgid_plural "zombie goats"
msgstr[0] "chèvre zombifiée"
msgstr[1] "chèvres zombifiées"
msgstr[2] "chèvres zombifiées"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie goat"
msgid ""
"The moving corpse of what once was a goat is now left stumbling around, with "
"pitch black empty eyes, looking for anything alive to kill."
msgstr ""
"Le cadavre en mouvement de ce qui était autrefois une chèvre trébuche "
"maintenant, les yeux noirs et vides, à la recherche de quelque chose de "
"vivant à tuer."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie cow"
msgid_plural "zombie cows"
msgstr[0] "vache zombifiée"
msgstr[1] "vaches zombifiées"
msgstr[2] "vaches zombifiées"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie cow"
msgid ""
"Once a placid cow, this leathery horror stumbles and shudders, its pulsing "
"black eyes scanning for prey.  Dairy cows have no natural weapons, but a "
"zombie as big, heavy, and murderous as this is still extremely dangerous."
msgstr ""
"Ceci était auparavant une vache placide, cette horreur ruminante trébuche et "
"frissonne, ses yeux noirs pulsants à la recherche de proies. Bien que les "
"vaches laitières n'est pas d'armes naturelles, un zombie aussi large, massif "
"et agressif reste très dangereux."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombull"
msgid_plural "zombulls"
msgstr[0] "taureau zombifié"
msgstr[1] "taureaux zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "taureaux zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombull"
msgid ""
"This enormous, terrifyingly fast creature with oily black eyes and dreadful "
"horns was once a domestic bull.  While live bulls can be temperamental, "
"unbridled rage is now this one's only emotion."
msgstr ""
"Cette créature énorme aux yeux noirs huileux et cornes acérées à la vitesse "
"terrifiante était auparavant un taureau domestiqué. Bien qu'un taureau de son "
"vivant est renommé pour son tempérament susceptible, une rage sans fin est la "
"seule émotion survivant dans ce cadavre ambulant."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie llama"
msgid_plural "zombie llamas"
msgstr[0] "lama zombie"
msgstr[1] "lamas zombies"
msgstr[2] "lamas zombies"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie llama"
msgid ""
"This llama oozes a dark oil from a multitude of lesions and cuts.  Its wool "
"has sloughed off with parts of its skin, revealing pulsating muscles and "
"flesh.  Its mouth drips with a sickly green substance which it seems to be "
"chewing on."
msgstr ""
"Ce lama suinte une huile sombre d'une multitude de lésions et de coupures et "
"sa laine s'est détachée en unisson avec des parties de sa peau, révélant des "
"muscles et de la chair palpitants.  Sa bouche dégouline d'une substance verte "
"maladive qu'il semble mastiquer."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "zombie llama"
msgid "The vicious vicuña spits a glob of acid!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "woodland wight"
msgid_plural "woodland wights"
msgstr[0] "cerf zombifié"
msgstr[1] "cerfs zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "cerfs zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "woodland wight"
msgid ""
"A pale, stumbling, white-tailed deer, rivulets of slime running down its "
"neck.  Its limbs twist and bend in unnatural, haphazard directions, and yet "
"it moves with uncanny strength and speed.  Thanks to the Cataclysm, it has "
"now turned the tables; what was once prey, now itself preys on coyotes, "
"wolves, and giant spider mutants."
msgstr ""
"Un cerf blanc, pâle et trébuchant, dont le cou est parcouru par des gouttes "
"de bave. Ses membres se tordent et se plient dans des directions peu "
"naturelles, mais il se déplace avec une force et une rapidité étonnantes. "
"Grâce au cataclysme, il s'est transformé : ce qui était autrefois une proie "
"est aujourd'hui une proie pour les coyotes, les loups et les araignées "
"géantes mutantes."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie reindeer"
msgid_plural "zombie reindeers"
msgstr[0] "renne zombifié"
msgstr[1] "rennes zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "rennes zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie reindeer"
msgid ""
"Once a majestic caribou, this undead creature barely resembles Santa's "
"helpful reindeer and seems to only be interested in human flesh."
msgstr ""
"Autrefois un renne majestueux, cet animal ne possède plus qu'un air de "
"famille très distant avec Rudolphe, et semble plus intéressé par votre chair "
"que par la distribution de cadeaux."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json data/json/monsters/zed_dormant.json
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags.json
#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie>"
msgid "zombie"
msgid_plural "zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie"
msgstr[1] "zombies"
msgstr[2] "zombies"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie"
msgid ""
"A human body, swaying as it moves, an unstoppable rage visible in its oily "
"black eyes."
msgstr ""
"Un corps humain traînant des pieds et oscillant au rythme de ses pas, habité "
"par une rage implacable visible derrière ses yeux noirs huileux."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scarred zombie"
msgid_plural "scarred zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie balafré"
msgstr[1] "zombies balafrés"
msgstr[2] "zombies balafrés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scarred zombie"
msgid ""
"A deformed human body, its skin transformed into one thick, calloused "
"envelope of scar tissue."
msgstr ""
"Un corps humain déformé, possédant une peau couverte d'un ensemble de tissu "
"cicatrisé épais."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie cop"
msgid_plural "zombie cops"
msgstr[0] "policier zombifié"
msgstr[1] "policiers zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "policiers zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie cop"
msgid "A human body covered by a weather-beaten and badly damaged set of police gear."
msgstr ""
"Un mort-vivant portant toujours un uniforme de police gravement abîmé ayant "
"vu des meilleures années."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "crawling zombie"
msgid_plural "crawling zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie rampant"
msgstr[1] "zombies rampants"
msgstr[2] "zombies rampants"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "crawling zombie"
msgid ""
"This human corpse drags itself along slowly with its arms.  Its legs are "
"damaged beyond repair."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie se déplace lentement en se traînant avec ses bras, ses jambes étant "
"hors de service."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fat zombie"
msgid_plural "fat zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie obèse"
msgstr[1] "zombies obèses"
msgstr[2] "zombies obèses"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fat zombie"
msgid ""
"Stumbling as it moves, this corpse of an overweight human regards its "
"surroundings with an empty black gaze."
msgstr ""
"Trébuchant quand il marche, ce corps d'un humain en surpoids regarde ce qui "
"l'entoure avec un regard fixe, noir et vide."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "firefighter zombie"
msgid_plural "firefighter zombies"
msgstr[0] "pompier zombifié"
msgstr[1] "pompiers zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "pompiers zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "firefighter zombie"
msgid ""
"A decaying human body clad in tattered firefighting gear.  It staggers "
"aimlessly, reeking of smoke and decay.  Its protective mask prevents it from "
"attempting to bite you."
msgstr ""
"Un corps humain en décomposition vêtu d’équipement de pompier en lambeaux.  "
"Il titube sans but, empestant la fumée et la pourriture.  Son masque de "
"protection l'empêche de tenter de vous mordre."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hazmat zombie"
msgid_plural "hazmat zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie hazmat"
msgstr[1] "zombies hazmat"
msgstr[2] "zombie hazmat  "

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hazmat zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie is completely encased in a protective suit that apparently failed "
"to protect it from whatever this infection is.  At least it can't bite you "
"from inside that suit."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie est complètement enveloppé dans une combinaison de protection qui "
"n'a apparemment pas réussi à le protéger de cette infection, quelle qu'elle "
"soit.  Au moins, il ne peut pas vous mordre depuis l'intérieur de cette "
"combinaison."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "hazmat zombie"
msgid "a tear in its hazmat suit"
msgstr "une brèche dans la combinaison"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "decayed zombie"
msgid_plural "decayed zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie putréfié"
msgstr[1] "zombies putréfiés"
msgstr[2] "zombies putréfiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "decayed zombie"
msgid ""
"A once-dead human corpse.  Its discolored, swollen flesh is riddled with "
"festering wounds and open sores."
msgstr ""
"Un cadavre humain mort depuis un certain temps.  Sa chair décolorée et "
"gonflée est criblée de blessures purulentes et de plaies ouvertes."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "SWAT zombie"
msgid_plural "SWAT zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie SWAT"
msgstr[1] "zombies SWAT"
msgstr[2] "zombies SWAT"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "SWAT zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie was part of a specialized unit of law enforcement.  It still "
"wears a battered armor with the SWAT logo emblazoned on the front.  The "
"protective mask makes its head a difficult target, but also prevents it from "
"biting you."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie faisait partie d'une unité spécialisée des forces de l'ordre.  Il "
"porte toujours une armure battue avec le logo SWAT imprimé sur le devant.  Le "
"masque de protection fait de sa tête une cible difficile, mais l'empêche "
"également de vous mordre."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tough zombie"
msgid_plural "tough zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie athlétique"
msgstr[1] "zombies athlétiques"
msgstr[2] "zombies athlétiques"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tough zombie"
msgid ""
"This was once an athletic human, now a brutal monster.  Its facial features "
"are twisted into an expression of pure rage."
msgstr ""
"C'était autrefois un humain athlétique, maintenant un monstre brutal.  Ses "
"traits du visage sont déformés en une expression de pure rage."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sleek zombie"
msgid_plural "sleek zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie épuré"
msgstr[1] "zombies épurés"
msgstr[2] "zombies épurés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sleek zombie"
msgid "This zombie is rather sleek and scantily clothed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bouncer zombie"
msgid_plural "bouncer zombies"
msgstr[0] "videur zombifié"
msgstr[1] "videurs zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "videurs zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bouncer zombie"
msgid ""
"This muscular zombie is dressed in the tattered remnants of a security "
"uniform."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie musclé est revêtu de lambeaux de ce qui reste d'un uniforme de "
"sécurité."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie medic"
msgid_plural "zombie medics"
msgstr[0] "médecin zombifié"
msgstr[1] "médecins zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "médecins zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie medic"
msgid ""
"This shambling corpse is dressed like a medical professional.  It was either "
"a doctor, or only played one on TV."
msgstr ""
"Ce cadavre titubant est habillé comme un professionnel de la santé.  Soit "
"c'était un médecin, soit il en jouait un à la télé."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "medical horror"
msgid_plural "medical horrors"
msgstr[0] "horreur médicale"
msgstr[1] "horreurs médicales"
msgstr[2] "horreurs médicales"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Description of monster "medical horror"
msgid ""
"A former doctor of some sort, though its uniform has been torn apart.  You "
"assume the oversized muscles that cover it to be the culprit."
msgstr ""
"Ceci était probablement un professionnel de santé son uniforme de travail "
"ayant été déchirés de part et d'autre. Vous assumez que ses muscles "
"surdimensionnés sont partiellement coupables de cela."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "regenerating zombie medic"
msgid_plural "regenerating zombie medics"
msgstr[0] "secouriste zombie régénérant"
msgstr[1] "secouristes zombies régénérants"
msgstr[2] "secouristes zombies régénérants"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Description of monster "regenerating zombie medic"
msgid ""
"The zombified remains of a practitioner of medicine, you aren't certain what "
"field - your focus is instead drawn to the way that its pink flesh snakes all "
"over it, weaving its way over wounds and injuries."
msgstr ""
"Les restes zombifiés d'un praticien de la médecine, vous ne savez pas "
"exactement dans quel domaine - votre attention est plutôt attirée par la "
"façon dont sa chair rose serpente partout, se frayant un chemin au-dessus de "
"ses plaies et égratignures."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sawbones"
msgid_plural "sawbones"
msgstr[0] "médecin zombifié ossifié"
msgstr[1] "médecins zombifiés ossifiés"
msgstr[2] "médecins zombifiés ossifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sawbones"
msgid ""
"A malformed armor of misshapen bone has grown over this zombie, having pushed "
"what remains of the skin out of the way.  The clothes of a medical worker are "
"still draped over it."
msgstr ""
"Une armure d'os difformes s'est développée sur ce zombie, ayant retroussé ce "
"qui restait de la peau.  Les lambeaux d'un uniforme de professionnel médical "
"sont toujours drapés dessus."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "doctor burns"
msgid_plural "doctor burns"
msgstr[0] "docteur burns"
msgstr[1] "docteurs burns"
msgstr[2] "docteurs burns"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Description of monster "doctor burns"
msgid ""
"This is the body of a doctor or nurse of some kind.  It's hard to tell now "
"that most of its clothing has corroded away from whatever vile acid its "
"secreting."
msgstr ""
"Le cadavre animé d’un médecin ou d’une infirmière, quoi qu'il soit un peu "
"difficile de discerner cela maintenant que la plupart de ses vêtements ont "
"été rongés par l'acide ignoble suintant de sa peau."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pupating zombie crawler"
msgid_plural "pupating zombie crawlers"
msgstr[0] "zombie chrysalide rampant"
msgstr[1] "zombies chrysalides rampants"
msgstr[2] "zombies chrysalides rampants"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pupating zombie crawler"
msgid ""
"This half of a human corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers that cover "
"everything from the neck down.  Beneath the wrapping there is a strange "
"rhythmic movement, grotesque to behold."
msgstr ""
"Cette moitié de cadavre humain est enveloppée de fibres noires collantes qui "
"le recouvre du cou jusqu'à la ceinture.  Sous la membrane vous observez des "
"mouvements rythmiques étranges et repoussants."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_zombie_crawler_pupa"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_zombie_pupa"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_brute_pupa"
#, c-format
msgid "%s bursts, and gore-smeared winged beasts climb out of the corpse!"
msgstr ""
"%s explose, et des monstruosités volantes couvertes de viscères émergent des "
"ruines de son corps!"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pupating zombie"
msgid_plural "pupating zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie chrysalide"
msgstr[1] "zombies chrysalides"
msgstr[2] "zombies chrysalides"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pupating zombie"
msgid ""
"This human corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers that cover everything "
"from the neck down.  Beneath the wrapping there is a strange rhythmic "
"movement, grotesque to behold."
msgstr ""
"Ce cadavre humain est enveloppé de fibres noires collantes qui le recouvrent "
"entièrement, du cou jusqu'en bas. Sous l'enveloppe, on observe un étrange "
"mouvement rythmique, grotesque à souhait."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pupating brute"
msgid_plural "pupating brutes"
msgstr[0] "brute chrysalide"
msgstr[1] "brutes chrysalides"
msgstr[2] "brutes chrysalides"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pupating brute"
msgid ""
"This muscular human corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers that cover "
"everything from the neck down.  Beneath the wrapping there is a strange "
"rhythmic movement, grotesque to behold."
msgstr ""
"Ce cadavre humain musclé est enveloppé de fibres noires collantes qui le "
"recouvrent entièrement, du cou jusqu'en bas. Sous l'enveloppe, il y a un "
"mouvement rythmique étrange, grotesque à voir."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hive hulk"
msgid_plural "hive hulks"
msgstr[0] "mastodonte ruche"
msgstr[1] "mastodontes ruches"
msgstr[2] "mastodontes ruches"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hive hulk"
msgid ""
"The bloated torso of this gigantic corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers.  "
"Beneath the wrapping there is a strange rhythmic movement, grotesque to "
"behold."
msgstr ""
"Le torse boursouflé de ce gigantesque cadavre est enveloppé de fibres noires "
"collantes. Sous l'enveloppe, on observe un étrange mouvement rythmique, "
"grotesque à souhait."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_hulk_pupa"
#, c-format
msgid "%s opens its mouth, and a gore-smeared winged beast flies out of it!"
msgstr "%s ouvre sa gueule et une monstruosité ailée couverte de viscères en émerge!"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shady pupating zombie"
msgid_plural "shady pupating zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie chrysalide ténébreux"
msgstr[1] "zombies chrysalides ténébreux"
msgstr[2] "zombies chrysalides ténébreux"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shady pupating zombie"
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature.  You can make out the outline of "
"what once may have been a human being, but its edges bulge rhythmically in "
"places that are not anatomically possible for humans."
msgstr ""
"Une ombre inquiétante enveloppe cette créature. On peut distinguer les "
"contours de ce qui aurait pu être un être humain, mais ses bords se "
"bousculent rythmiquement à des endroits qui ne sont pas anatomiquement "
"possibles pour des humains."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_zombie_pupa_shady"
#, c-format
msgid "%s bursts, and shadowy winged beasts climb out of the corpse!"
msgstr ""
"%s explose, et des monstruosités volantes ténébreuses émergent des ruines de "
"son corps!"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "batwing zombie"
msgid_plural "batwing zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie chauve-souris"
msgstr[1] "zombies chauve-souris"
msgstr[2] "zombies chauve-souris"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Description of monster "batwing zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie's arms have stretched far beyond human limits, the skin "
"lengthened into a gruesome, fleshy membrane.  The mutation does not suit it "
"well: it moves clumsily, even compared to other zombies, but can occasionally "
"leap a significant distance."
msgstr ""
"Les bras de ce zombie se sont étirés bien au-delà des limites humaines, la "
"peau s'est allongée en une membrane charnue effroyable. Cette mutation ne lui "
"convient pas : il se déplace maladroitement, même par rapport aux autres "
"zombies, mais peut parfois faire des bonds d'une distance significative."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "garghoul"
msgid_plural "garghouls"
msgstr[0] "gargoule"
msgstr[1] "gargoules"
msgstr[2] "gargoules"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Description of monster "garghoul"
msgid ""
"This zombie's arms have stretched far beyond human limits, the skin "
"lengthened into a gruesome, fleshy membrane.  The rest has become emaciated, "
"with thin, rope-like muscles ripping through taut flesh.  While it doesn't "
"appear to be able to fly, it uses its mutated arms to make shockingly fast "
"leaps through the air."
msgstr ""
"Les bras de ce zombie se sont étirés bien au-delà des limites humaines, la "
"peau s'allongeant en une membrane charnue et effroyable. Le reste est devenu "
"émacié, avec de minces muscles ressemblant à des cordes qui déchirent la "
"chair tendue. Bien qu'il ne semble pas capable de voler, il utilise ses bras "
"mutants pour faire des bonds étonnamment rapides dans les airs."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "flesh-raptor"
msgid_plural "flesh-raptors"
msgstr[0] "raptor"
msgstr[1] "raptors"
msgstr[2] "raptors"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Description of monster "flesh-raptor"
msgid ""
"This small, winged predator darts through the air on three thinly-haired "
"wings that look like stretched human hands.  A sheer, jagged spike juts out "
"from the point where the wings meet.  It looks like nothing you've seen on "
"Earth, and yet strangely like it is made of human parts."
msgstr ""
"Ce petit prédateur ailé s'élance dans les airs sur trois ailes à poils fins "
"qui ressemblent à des mains humaines étirées. Une pointe acérée et dentelée "
"jaillit du point de jonction des ailes. Il ne ressemble à rien de ce que vous "
"avez vu sur Terre, et pourtant, étrangement, il semble être fait de parties "
"humaines."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shadow raptor"
msgid_plural "shadow raptors"
msgstr[0] "raptor ténébreux"
msgstr[1] "raptors ténébreux"
msgstr[2] "raptors ténébreux"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shadow raptor"
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature.  You can make out the outline of "
"three flapping wings connected to a jagged, pointed object."
msgstr ""
"Une ombre inquiétante enveloppe cette créature. On peut distinguer le contour "
"de trois ailes battantes reliées à un objet pointu et dentelé."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "unstable flesh-raptor"
msgid_plural "unstable flesh-raptor"
msgstr[0] "raptor de chair instable"
msgstr[1] "raptors de chair instables"
msgstr[2] "raptors de chair instables"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Description of monster "unstable flesh-raptor"
msgid ""
"This small, winged predator darts through the air on three thinly-haired "
"wings that look like stretched human hands.  A jagged spike juts out from the "
"point where the wings meet, and a bloated, fleshy belly hangs beneath.  A "
"sharp smell of rotten eggs hangs around it."
msgstr ""
"Ce petit prédateur ailé s'élance dans les airs sur trois ailes à poils fins "
"qui ressemblent à des mains humaines étirées. Une pointe dentelée sort du "
"point où les ailes se rejoignent, et un ventre boursouflé et charnu pend en "
"dessous. Une forte odeur d'œuf pourri flotte autour de lui."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zaptor"
msgid_plural "zaptors"
msgstr[0] "zaptor"
msgstr[1] "zaptors"
msgstr[2] "zaptors"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zaptor"
msgid ""
"This small, winged predator darts through the air on three thinly-haired "
"wings that look like stretched human hands.  A jagged spike with a pulsing "
"electrical glow juts out from the point where the wings meet."
msgstr ""
"Ce petit prédateur ailé s'élance dans les airs sur trois ailes à poils fins "
"qui ressemblent à des mains humaines étirées. Une pointe dentelée à l'éclat "
"électrique pulsé jaillit du point de rencontre des ailes."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "acidic zombie"
msgid_plural "acidic zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie acidique"
msgstr[1] "zombies acidiques"
msgstr[2] "zombies acidiques"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "acidic zombie"
msgid ""
"A sickly-looking zombie.  Its skin looks especially thin, with a sticky, "
"yellow fluid flowing through the clearly visible veins."
msgstr ""
"Un zombie à l'air maladif.  Sa peau semble particulièrement fine et un "
"liquide jaune et visqueux coule à travers des veines clairement visibles."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "corrosive zombie"
msgid_plural "corrosive zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie corrosif"
msgstr[1] "zombies corrosifs"
msgstr[2] "zombies corrosifs"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "corrosive zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie has swollen to immense proportions, but still manages to hold "
"itself together with semi-congealed acid all over its bloated, leathery body. "
" It moves clumsily, but spits from a large reserve of acid with uncanny "
"accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie a enflé jusqu'à atteindre des proportions immenses, mais parvient "
"toujours à se maintenir grâce à de l'acide semi-congelé sur tout son corps "
"gonflé et cuiré, se déplaçant maladroitement, mais étant capable de cracher à "
"distance à partir d'une grande réserve d'acide avec une précision étrange."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "corrosive zombie"
msgid "The corrosive zombie spits a glob of acid!"
msgstr "Le zombie corrosif crache une goutte d'acide !"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "spitter zombie"
msgid_plural "spitter zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie cracheur"
msgstr[1] "zombies cracheurs"
msgstr[2] "zombies cracheurs"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "spitter zombie"
msgid ""
"A hunched human body with its eyes pushed up into its forehead and drooping "
"cheeks, most of its face is occupied by a puckered mouth.  Its stomach is "
"swollen and nearly translucent, with a sickly yellow tint."
msgstr ""
"Un corps humain recroquevillé avec les yeux enfoncés dans son front, les "
"joues affaissées; la plus grande partie de son visage est occupée par une "
"bouche plissée. Son estomac enflé et presque translucide est d'une couleur "
"jaune blafard."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wretched puker"
msgid_plural "wretched pukers"
msgstr[0] "gerbeur pathétique"
msgstr[1] "gerbeurs pathétiques"
msgstr[2] "gerbeurs pathétiques"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wretched puker"
msgid ""
"A degenerate corpse, shambling as it walks.  Various pieces of trash and "
"waste materials have melded into the black goo leaking from its skin."
msgstr ""
"Un cadavre dégénéré, qui marche en titubant. Diverses ordures et déchets se "
"sont mélangés à la glu noire qui s'échappe de sa peau."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "acidic zombie dog"
msgid_plural "acidic zombie dogs"
msgstr[0] "chien zombifié acidique"
msgstr[1] "chiens zombifiés acidiques"
msgstr[2] "chiens zombifiés acidiques"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "acidic zombie dog"
msgid ""
"A deformed, sickly-looking animated corpse of a canine.  A dangerous-looking "
"yellow saliva drips from its mouth."
msgstr ""
"Un cadavre de chien animé, déformé et maladif.  De la salive jaune "
"d’apparence dangereuse coule de sa bouche."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "blistered horror"
msgid_plural "blistered horrors"
msgstr[0] "horreur cloquée"
msgstr[1] "horreurs cloquées"
msgstr[2] "horreurs cloquées"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "blistered horror"
msgid ""
"A huge canine with multiple large, foul-looking blisters covering its body.  "
"A corrosive liquid spills from its menacing-looking mouth."
msgstr ""
"Un énorme chien avec un corps recouvert de cloques à l'apparence nauséabonde. "
" Un liquide corrosif s'échappe de sa gueule menaçante."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tiny meat cocoon"
msgid_plural "tiny meat cocoons"
msgstr[0] "cocon de chair minuscule"
msgstr[1] "cocons de chair minuscules"
msgstr[2] "cocons de chair minuscules"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tiny meat cocoon"
msgid ""
"A small, wet sack of pink skin, with something dog-sized moving around "
"underneath the surface.  Black roots anchor it to the ground."
msgstr ""
"Un petit sac de peau rose et humide, quelque chose de la taille d'un chien se "
"mouvant sous la surface. Des fibres noires maintiennent le tout en place."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "tiny meat cocoon"
#. ~ Death message of monster "small meat cocoon"
#. ~ Death message of monster "large meat cocoon"
#. ~ Death message of monster "gigantic meat cocoon"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s explodes in a shower of gore!"
msgstr "Le %s explose en une fontaine de fluides organiques!"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "small meat cocoon"
msgid_plural "small meat cocoons"
msgstr[0] "petit cocon de chair"
msgstr[1] "petits cocons de chair"
msgstr[2] "petits cocons de chair"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "small meat cocoon"
msgid ""
"A sack of pink flesh sitting in the middle of a net of black roots.  At "
"irregular intervals it shudders as something (or multiple somethings?) inside "
"changes position.  You're not sure you want to know what's inside."
msgstr ""
"Un sac de chair rose au milieu d'une toile de fibres noires. Cette masse "
"tremble un peu à des intervalles irréguliers, quelque chose (ou quelques "
"choses?) à l'intérieur ayant l'air de changer de position. Vous n'êtes pas "
"sûr(e) de vouloir savoir ce qu'il y a l'intérieur."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "large meat cocoon"
msgid_plural "large meat cocoons"
msgstr[0] "large cocon de chair"
msgstr[1] "larges cocons de chair"
msgstr[2] "larges cocons de chair"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "large meat cocoon"
msgid ""
"A mass of pink flesh the size of a fridge squirming constantly, black veins "
"anchoring it to the ground.  Occasionally a malformed limb pushes against the "
"skin from the inside, before a churn of the cocoon pushes it back.  Not ready "
"yet, it seems."
msgstr ""
"Une masse de chair rose de la taille d'un réfrigérateur se tortillant "
"constamment, des fibres noires la maintenant ancrée au sol. Occasionnellement "
"un membre malformé pousse contre la surface depuis l'intérieur, avant qu'une "
"contraction du cocon le repousse. Pas encore prêt, on dirait."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gigantic meat cocoon"
msgid_plural "gigantic meat cocoons"
msgstr[0] "cocon de chair gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "cocons de chair gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "cocons de chair gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gigantic meat cocoon"
msgid ""
"A rigid, off-white lump of flesh the size of a small car constricted by bands "
"of rope-sized pulsing black veins that tie it to the floor below.  The whole "
"thing is shuddering constantly, and gives off an otherworldly stench."
msgstr ""
"Une masse rigide de chair blanchâtre de la taille d'une petite voiture "
"restreinte au sol par des fibres noires épaisses comme des cordes. La chose "
"tremble constamment et émet une puanteur intolérable."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "swarming amalgamation"
msgid_plural "swarming amalgamations"
msgstr[0] "amalgame pullulant"
msgstr[1] "amalgames pullulants"
msgstr[2] "amalgames pullulants"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "swarming amalgamation"
msgid ""
"A small, flat creature dashing around erratically on seven short legs.  Its "
"form is dominated by an oversized set of black mandibles on an almost "
"comically small head, featureless apart from a single black eye.  The rest of "
"the body is covered with sickly white skin crisscrossed by black veins."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "vigilant amalgamation"
msgid_plural "vigilant amalgamations"
msgstr[0] "amalgame vigilant"
msgstr[1] "amalgames vigilants"
msgstr[2] "amalgames vigilants"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "vigilant amalgamation"
msgid ""
"An inflated white body carried by five dainty legs, waving its remaining two "
"limbs constantly.  Each one is tipped by a head-sized compound eye, "
"independently scanning the horizon for prey."
msgstr ""
"Un amas gonflé de chair blanchâtre porté par cinq jambes graciles et "
"possédant deux membres additionnels couronnés d'yeux à facettes de la taille "
"de votre tête remuants constamment et scannant les environs en quête de "
"proies."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "vigilant amalgamation"
msgid "The amalgamation screams!"
msgstr "L'amalgame hurle!"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "caustic amalgamation"
msgid_plural "caustic amalgamations"
msgstr[0] "amalgame caustique"
msgstr[1] "amalgames caustiques"
msgstr[2] "amalgames caustiques"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "caustic amalgamation"
msgid ""
"A gangly creature running on six legs, its form made irregular by the green "
"pustules at the limbs' base, each feeding into a large vein leading to two "
"blackened claws.  What must have been a seventh leg fused with the creature's "
"head forming a jagged proboscis emerging from below its eyes, dripping a "
"caustic liquid."
msgstr ""
"Une créature trapue courant sur six pattes, dont la forme est rendue "
"irrégulière par les pustules vertes à la base des membres, chacune alimentant "
"une large veine menant à deux griffes noircies. Ce qui devait être une "
"septième patte fusionnait avec la tête de la créature pour former une trompe "
"dentelée qui émergeait sous ses yeux et laissait couler un liquide caustique."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "leaping amalgamation"
msgid_plural "leaping amalgamations"
msgstr[0] "amalgame bondissant"
msgstr[1] "amalgames bondissants"
msgstr[2] "amalgames bondissants"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "leaping amalgamation"
msgid ""
"A four-legged white creature about the size of a human, running with a "
"decidedly feline gait, the three remaining limbs holding an "
"almost-translucent skin membrane outstretched on its side and rear.  Much of "
"its head is taken up by a beak like a raven's, which opens to reveal a set of "
"jagged black teeth."
msgstr ""
"Créature blanche à quatre pattes de la taille d'un humain, courant d'une "
"démarche résolument féline, les trois membres restants tenant une membrane de "
"peau presque translucide tendue sur le côté et à l'arrière. La majeure partie "
"de sa tête est occupée par un bec semblable à celui d'un corbeau, qui s'ouvre "
"pour révéler une série de dents noires déchiquetées."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "charged amalgamation"
msgid_plural "charged amalgamations"
msgstr[0] "amalgame crépitant"
msgstr[1] "amalgames crépitants"
msgstr[2] "amalgames crépitants"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "charged amalgamation"
msgid ""
"A short, crablike creature waddling around on six multi-jointed legs, its "
"body dominated by a large glowing organ bulging from between the white armor "
"plates.  A single raised appendage connects to the mass, its tip surrounded "
"by brilliant white sparks."
msgstr ""
"Une petite créature ressemblant à un crabe se dandinant sur six pattes à "
"articulations multiples, dont le corps est dominé par un gros organe "
"rougeoyant qui dépasse des plaques d'armure blanches.  Un seul appendice "
"surélevé est relié à la masse, son extrémité étant entourée d'étincelles d'un "
"blanc éclatant."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "charged amalgamation"
#, c-format
msgid "A cloud of electricity explodes from the %s"
msgstr "Une nuage électrique explose hors de l'%s"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "brutish amalgamation"
msgid_plural "brutish amalgamations"
msgstr[0] "amalgame brutal"
msgstr[1] "amalgames brutaux"
msgstr[2] "amalgames brutaux"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "brutish amalgamation"
msgid ""
"A large, thickly armored creature built not unlike a bear, if a bear had a "
"long, clubbed tail and two short limbs ending in black talons framing a "
"vertical mouth on an otherwise smooth, featureless head.  On second thought, "
"not that much like a bear at all."
msgstr ""
"Une créature massive possédant une armure espèce, ressemblant un peu à un "
"ours de loin, si un ours avait une longue queue au bout de laquelle une "
"massue était attachée, ainsi qu'une palpe se finissant en griffes noire de "
"chaque côté d'une gueule verticale au milieu d'une tête lisse et sans traits "
"distinctifs. Réflexion faite, cette chose n'a rien à voir avec un ours du "
"tout."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie frog"
msgid_plural "zombie frogs"
msgstr[0] "grenouille zombifiée"
msgstr[1] "grenouilles zombifiées"
msgstr[2] "grenouilles zombifiées"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie frog"
msgid ""
"A hypothetical frog of the zombie variety.  You should not be seeing it "
"without debug."
msgstr ""
"Une grenouille hypothétique de type zombie. Vous ne devriez pas la voir sans "
"débogage."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "frog mother"
msgid_plural "frog mothers"
msgstr[0] "crapaud nourrice"
msgstr[1] "crapauds nourrices"
msgstr[2] "crapauds nourrices"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "frog mother"
msgid ""
"A large, bulbous creature with an extremely large mouth and small, stubby "
"legs with no feet.  Drenched in an oily greenish-black substance, its flesh "
"seems to rapidly decompose and reconstitute itself, and it is covered in "
"large, white pustules that seem ready to pop."
msgstr ""
"Une créature énorme et gonflée dotée d'une gueule béante et de toutes petites "
"jambes tronquées sans pieds. Recouverte d'un film huileux d'une substance "
"noir verdâtre, sa chair a l'air de rapidement se décomposer et se "
"reconstituer en amas de pustules blanches sur le point d'éclater."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "frog mother"
msgid ""
"Some of the pustules pop, and the frog mother opens her mouth and vomits "
"tadpoles!"
msgstr "Des pustules éclatent et le crapaud nourrice vomit des têtards!"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tadpole constrictor"
msgid_plural "tadpole constrictors"
msgstr[0] "têtard constricteur"
msgstr[1] "têtards constricteurs"
msgstr[2] "têtards constricteurs"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tadpole constrictor"
msgid ""
"The only resemblance this creature bears to a tadpole is its slick "
"black-green skin and slender body.  Its three appendages, resembling long "
"tentacles or pseudopods, propel it across the ground at maddening speed.  It "
"has no outward sensory organs or a mouth, and steam rises from its skin as if "
"it is burning away its own lifeforce to catch you."
msgstr ""
"La seul vague ressemblance entre cette créature et un têtard sont sa peau "
"luisante noir verdâtre et son corps épuré. Capable de propulsion à une "
"vitesse terrifiante en utilisant ses trois longs membres ressemblant à des "
"tentacules ou des pseudopodes, cette abomination dépourvue de bouche ou "
"d'yeux, vous observez clairement de la vapeur s'en échapper et réalisez "
"qu'elle est vraisemblablement en train de brûler son espérance de vie en "
"chargeant vers vous."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant zombie bullfrog"
msgid_plural "giant zombie bullfrogs"
msgstr[0] "ouaouaron zombifié gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "ouaouarons zombifiés gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "ouaouarons zombifiés gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant zombie bullfrog"
msgid ""
"The wound covered skin of this large bullfrog appears to be peeling in "
"places, revealing a black goop beneath the surface.  Its vacant stare passes "
"by anything that isn't food, and it will leap to devour anything it can."
msgstr ""
"La peau couverte de plaies de cet ouaouaron à l'air de peler à différents "
"endroits, révélant un liquide noirâtre sous la surface. Son regard vacant "
"ignore tout ce qui n'est pas comestible et se tient prêt à bondir sur quoi "
"que ce soit qui l'est."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "colossal zombie bullfrog"
msgid_plural "colossal zombie bullfrogs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "colossal zombie bullfrog"
msgid ""
"This gigantic zombified frog lets out an ear splitting unholy wail as it "
"slowly takes notice of you.  Its mostly lethargic movements are offset by its "
"ability to leap great distances using its gargantuan stout legs."
msgstr ""
"Cette gigantesque grenouille zombifiée émet un gémissement impie à vous "
"fendre l'oreille alors qu'elle vous remarque lentement. Ses mouvements "
"léthargiques sont compensés par sa capacité à sauter sur de grandes distances "
"à l'aide de ses pattes gargantuesques."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie toad"
msgid_plural "zombie toads"
msgstr[0] "crapaud zombifié"
msgstr[1] "crapauds zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "crapauds zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie toad"
msgid ""
"The revivified remains of a giant mutant toad.  Its condition has left it "
"slowed but no less dangerous."
msgstr ""
"Le cadavre réanimé d'un crapaud mutant gigantesque. Celui-ci est plus lent "
"que de son vivant, mais toujours aussi redoutable."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zapping zombfrog"
msgid_plural "zapping zombfrogs"
msgstr[0] "grenouille zombifiée dynamo"
msgstr[1] "grenouilles zombifiées dynamo"
msgstr[2] "grenouilles zombifiées dynamo"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zapping zombfrog"
msgid ""
"The hum coming from this giant, rotten frog sounds unlike any kind of "
"vocalization.  The sound is clearly a result of the bolts of electricity that "
"skip across its skin and arc between its lips."
msgstr ""
"Le bourdonnement qui émane de cette grenouille géante et pourrie ne ressemble "
"à aucune autre forme de vocalisation. Le son est manifestement le résultat "
"des éclairs d'électricité qui traversent sa peau et s'enroulent entre ses "
"lèvres."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bloated zombie toad"
msgid_plural "bloated zombie toads"
msgstr[0] "crapaud zombifié ballonné"
msgstr[1] "crapauds zombifiés ballonnés"
msgstr[2] "crapauds zombifiés ballonnés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bloated zombie toad"
msgid ""
"This zombified toad wobbles as it drags along its immense, inflated form.  A "
"yellow-brown sludge dribbles from its mouth and seeps out from its bulging, "
"cracking skin."
msgstr ""
"Ce crapaud zombifié vacille en traînant sa forme immense et gonflée. Une boue "
"jaune-brun s'écoule de sa bouche et suinte de sa peau boursouflée et "
"craquelée."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "bloated zombie toad"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s's body bursts, expelling sludge."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie treefrog"
msgid_plural "zombie treefrogs"
msgstr[0] "rainette zombifiés"
msgstr[1] "rainettes zombifiées"
msgstr[2] "rainettes zombifiées"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie treefrog"
msgid ""
"The pale, empty eyes of this large, reanimated treefrog still swivel in their "
"sockets, searching for prey.  Its steps are ungainly but its hind legs look "
"capable of great leaps."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shadow leaper"
msgid_plural "shadow leapers"
msgstr[0] "ombre bondissante"
msgstr[1] "ombres bondissantes"
msgstr[2] "ombres bondissantes"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shadow leaper"
msgid ""
"A lithe and leggy form rests flat against the ground, wreathed in darkness.  "
"When it leaps, the shadows follow with it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "warted monstrosity"
msgid_plural "warted monstrosities"
msgstr[0] "monstruosité couverte de verrues"
msgstr[1] "monstruosités couvertes de verrues"
msgstr[2] "monstruosités couvertes de verrues"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "warted monstrosity"
msgid ""
"A festering toad the size of a dune buggy.  It struggles to pull its bulk "
"towards you.  The warts covering its back appear fit to burst with yellow "
"sludge, and more of the stuff flows freely from both ends of it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "warted monstrosity"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s's body bursts, expelling a copious amount of sludge."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "death mask zombie toad"
msgid_plural "death mask zombie toads"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "death mask zombie toad"
msgid ""
"The face and head of this enormous once-frog is encased in ossified tissue.  "
"Its dead eyes peer out from this death mask of hardened bone, which curves "
"into a jagged beak around its mouth.  Even its warts appear to have stiffened "
"into dense osteoderms."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "leaping husk"
msgid_plural "leaping husks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "leaping husk"
msgid ""
"The dehydrated remains of a frog, like the unfortunate sort you might find "
"trapped between a window and screen.  This one is much larger than those and "
"surely capable of doing you real harm.  You see its dry skin crack and shed "
"wisps of tainted dust as it moves."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "leaping husk"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "leaping husk"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "batrachian mummy"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "batrachian smoker"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s crumbles!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "batrachian mummy"
msgid_plural "batrachian mummies"
msgstr[0] "momie batracienne"
msgstr[1] "momies batraciennes"
msgstr[2] "momies batraciennes"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "batrachian mummy"
msgid ""
"The ambulatory, desiccated corpse of an enormous amphibian.  What papery skin "
"remains hugs tightly to the bones and shrunken flesh beneath.  Each "
"stuttering leap it makes leaves it looking worse off as it sheds clouds of "
"ash and soot."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "batrachian smoker"
msgid_plural "batrachian smokers"
msgstr[0] "batracien fumigène"
msgstr[1] "batraciens fumigènes"
msgstr[2] "batraciens fumigènes"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "batrachian smoker"
msgid ""
"Even without the haze of smoke that constantly fumes off of it, it would be "
"difficult to tell what this once was.  The massive thing seems to have dried "
"out and shriveled up, though unevenly.  Rind through core it has warped.  Its "
"whole dry body crinkles and folds as it moves."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gastro bufo"
msgid_plural "gastro bufos"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gastro bufo"
msgid ""
"A massive toad stumbling around while leaking acid from its skin.  Doesn't "
"look friendly at all."
msgstr ""
"Un énorme crapaud se trainant ici et là en laissant échapper de l'acide de sa "
"peau.  N'a pas l'air du tout commode."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scorched zombie child"
msgid_plural "scorched zombie children"
msgstr[0] "enfant zombifié calciné"
msgstr[1] "enfants zombifiés calcinés"
msgstr[2] "enfants zombifiés calcinés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scorched zombie child"
msgid ""
"A diminutive humanoid figure, its body ravaged by fire into a blackened, "
"charred shell.  Its leathery flesh has mended in patches, and the tattered "
"clothing is still clinging to its emaciated frame making it clear it once was "
"- and still is - the body of a child."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scorched zombie brute"
msgid_plural "scorched zombie brutes"
msgstr[0] "brute zombie calcinée"
msgstr[1] "brutes zombies calcinées"
msgstr[2] "brutes zombies calcinées"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scorched zombie brute"
msgid ""
"An oversized charred human form.  The remains of its burnt and blackened "
"musculature are clearly visible between the cracks of the shell formed from "
"its melted skin."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scorched zombie"
msgid_plural "scorched zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie calciné"
msgstr[1] "zombies calcinés"
msgstr[2] "zombies calcinés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scorched zombie"
msgid ""
"A heavily burned zombie that still reeks of charred meat.  Its now leathery "
"flesh has mended into patches, giving it a more armored appearance."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scorched lasher"
msgid_plural "scorched lashers"
msgstr[0] "flagelleur calciné"
msgstr[1] "flagelleurs calcinés"
msgstr[2] "flagelleurs calcinés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scorched lasher"
msgid ""
"A heavily burned corpse with unnaturally long arms dragging behind it as it "
"moves.  The burnt scar tissue covering it gives it a mildly armored "
"appearance."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fiend"
msgid_plural "fiends"
msgstr[0] "squelette cramoisi"
msgstr[1] "squelettes cramoisis"
msgstr[2] "squelettes cramoisis"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fiend"
msgid ""
"A monstrous burnt vaguely humanoid creature, walking around on its knuckles "
"like a gorilla.  Tattered and blackened strands of muscle fibers dangle all "
"around its body, with patches of fused melded skin and bone visible between.  "
"Its forelimbs end in lengthy skeletal claws."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_zombie_scorched_rust"
msgid ""
"A heavily burned zombie that still reeks of charred meat.  Its now leathery "
"flesh has mended into patches, giving it a more armored appearance.  This one "
"appears to have metal fragments sticking out of its body."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_zombie_fiend_rust"
msgid ""
"An oversized charred human form.  The remains of its burnt and blackened "
"musculature are clearly visible between the cracks of the shell formed from "
"its melted skin.  This one appears to have metal fragments sticking out of "
"its body."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie child"
msgid_plural "zombie children"
msgstr[0] "enfant zombie"
msgstr[1] "enfants zombies"
msgstr[2] "enfants zombies"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie child"
msgid ""
"It was only a child, and little is different about it now aside from the "
"hungry look in its eyes.  You'd be hard-pressed to not feel like you were "
"killing an actual child by putting it down."
msgstr ""
"Ceci n'était auparavant qu'un enfant, et peu à changé à part la haine obscure "
"visible dans ses orbites, rendant le devoir de lui accorder miséricorde "
"difficile pour votre conscience."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "anklebiter"
msgid_plural "anklebiters"
msgstr[0] "mioche zombifié"
msgstr[1] "mioches zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "mioches zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Description of monster "anklebiter"
msgid ""
"This horrifying little mutated wretch looks to have once been a child, but "
"its massive gaping jaws are now far more suggestive of a predatory beast."
msgstr ""
"Cet horrifiant petit malheureux muté semble avoir été autrefois un enfant, "
"mais ses mâchoires béantes massives sont maintenant bien plus évocatrices "
"d'une bête prédatrice."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "creepy crawler"
msgid_plural "creepy crawlers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Description of monster "creepy crawler"
msgid ""
"What was once a child is now a mutant beast with blackened skin and massive "
"eyes.  This abomination's vile form makes a mockery of its human origin."
msgstr ""
"Ce qui était autrefois un enfant est maintenant un abomination mutante à la "
"peau noircie et aux yeux énormes, son apparence immonde étant une parodie "
"horrible de son origine humaine."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shriekling"
msgid_plural "shrieklings"
msgstr[0] "bambin hurleur"
msgstr[1] "bambins hurleurs"
msgstr[2] "bambins hurleurs"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shriekling"
msgid ""
"This heavily mutated child zombie twitches and flails its limbs in "
"painful-looking spasms as it runs about."
msgstr ""
"Cet enfant zombie fortement muté se contracte et agite ses membres dans des "
"spasmes douloureux tout en courant."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "snotgobbler"
msgid_plural "snotgobblers"
msgstr[0] "morveux"
msgstr[1] "morveux"
msgstr[2] "morveux"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Description of monster "snotgobbler"
msgid ""
"This swollen, gooey-looking mutant child looks bad, even for a zombie.  Maybe "
"that's why it seems to want a hug so badly."
msgstr ""
"Cet enfant mutant gonflé et gluant n'a pas l'air en bonne forme, même pour un "
"zombie.  C'est peut-être pour cela qu'il semble avoir tellement envie d'un "
"câlin."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sproglodyte"
msgid_plural "sproglodytes"
msgstr[0] "bambin troglodyte"
msgstr[1] "bambins troglodytes"
msgstr[2] "bambins troglodytes"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sproglodyte"
msgid ""
"This crouching child-mutant's face is dominated by a pair of huge black eyes, "
"and its fingertips end in sharp claws."
msgstr ""
"Le visage de cet enfant mutant accroupi est dominé par une paire d'énormes "
"yeux noirs, et le bout de ses doigts se termine par des griffes acérées."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "howling waif"
msgid_plural "howling waifs"
msgstr[0] "gamin hurlant"
msgstr[1] "gamins hurlants"
msgstr[2] "gamins hurlants"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Description of monster "howling waif"
msgid ""
"Undeath has not been kind to the children of the apocalypse.  This one is "
"little more than a reanimated membrane of skin stretched across tiny brittle "
"bones."
msgstr ""
"La non-vie n’a pas été tendre avec les enfants de l’apocalypse.  Celui-ci "
"n’est guère plus qu’une membrane de peau réanimée tendue sur de minuscules os "
"fragiles."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wretched hatchery"
msgid_plural "wretched hatcheries"
msgstr[0] "couveuse pathétique"
msgstr[1] "couveuses pathétiques"
msgstr[2] "couveuses pathétiques"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wretched hatchery"
msgid ""
"Lethargically resting on its back, this hideous mass of sagging flesh and "
"writhing organs, which used to be a child, twitches feebly as its midsection "
"churns.  Almost bursting from its skin, the child's ribcage has arched "
"outward, forming a hive-like construct covered by severely stretched "
"epidermis.  Through the wretched organism's taut abdominal flesh, you witness "
"small forms swarming within its ribcage—its guts roiling as new beings are "
"sculpted from pilfered flesh and bone.  The creature's limbs rest haphazardly "
"on the ground, contorted in ways that suggest the absence of bones or any "
"interior construct."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "wretched hatchery"
msgid "Ripping and tearing, a small beast burrows free of the wretch's abdomen!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_command.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal master"
msgid_plural "skeletal masters"
msgstr[0] "maître ossifié"
msgstr[1] "maîtres ossifiés"
msgstr[2] "maîtres ossifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_command.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal master"
msgid ""
"A strange zombie covered in bone plates from face to toe.  Despite the added "
"weight on its body, its movements are coordinated, almost as if capable of "
"analyzing your movements."
msgstr ""
"Un étrange zombie recouvert de plaques d'os de la tête aux pieds. Malgré le "
"poids supplémentaire de son corps, ses mouvements sont coordonnés, comme s'il "
"était capable d'analyser vos mouvements."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_command.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie lich"
msgid_plural "zombie liches"
msgstr[0] "liche zombie"
msgstr[1] "liches zombies"
msgstr[2] "liches zombies"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_command.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie lich"
msgid ""
"A twisted visage of the human body decked in bone from head to toe.  Its "
"vague shape is reminiscent of some tabletop monster, and it walks and watches "
"your actions with a cold and calculating demeanor."
msgstr ""
"Un visage tordu du corps humain, recouvert d'os de la tête aux pieds. Sa "
"forme vague rappelle celle d'un monstre de table, et il marche et observe vos "
"actions d'un air froid et calculateur."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_dormant.json
#. ~ Name of a trap
msgid "dormant zombie corpse"
msgstr "corps de zombie dormant"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_dormant.json
#. ~ Message when player triggers trap "tr_dormant_corpse"
#. ~ Message when NPC triggers trap "tr_dormant_corpse"
msgid "A zombie rises from the ground!"
msgstr "Un zombie se lève!"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_dormant.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "cause_loud_moaning ( cause loud moaning )"
msgid "a zombie moaning!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shocker brute"
msgid_plural "shocker brutes"
msgstr[0] "brute électrique"
msgstr[1] "brutes électriques"
msgstr[2] "brutes électriques"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shocker brute"
msgid ""
"A huge beast covered in visible scarring from the lightning bolts that arc "
"out of its body.  Being near it, you can hear a slight humming, like that of "
"an electrical transformer."
msgstr ""
"Une large silhouette vaguement humaine couverte de brûlures et cicatrices "
"probablement provoquées par les arcs électriques émanant de son corps, un "
"léger bourdonnement ressemblant à celui d'un transformateur électrique "
"pouvant être entendu à proximité de cette créature."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shocker zombie"
msgid_plural "shocker zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombies électriques"
msgstr[1] "zombies électriques"
msgstr[2] "zombies électriques"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shocker zombie"
msgid "A human body with pale blue flesh, crackling with electrical energy."
msgstr "Un corps humain à la chair bleu pâle, crépitant d'énergie électrique."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "incandescent husk"
msgid_plural "incandescent husks"
msgstr[0] "carcasse incandescente"
msgstr[1] "carcasses incandescentes"
msgstr[2] "carcasses incandescentes"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
#. ~ Description of monster "incandescent husk"
msgid ""
"This zombie is visible only as a glowing white silhouette that you have to "
"squint to see, cloaked in a crackling field of lightning that pulses like a "
"beating heart.  It walks slowly and deliberately, the thunderstorm "
"surrounding it eagerly jumping to anything conductive within its grasp."
msgstr ""
"Ce qui était un corps humain n'est maintenant qu'une silhouette blanche "
"aveuglante, occultée par un nuage de décharges électriques pulsant comme un "
"cœur. Vous devriez probablement gardez vos distances, jugeant la démarche "
"calme et assurée de ce mort vivant."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zapper zombie"
msgid_plural "zapper zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie zappeur"
msgstr[1] "zombies zappeurs"
msgstr[2] "zombies zappeurs"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zapper zombie"
msgid ""
"A very pale dead body with the worst case of static hair you have ever seen.  "
"Sparks of electricity frequently jump off it, lighting it up in the dark.  "
"You might not want to touch it with your bare hands, or anything conductive."
msgstr ""
"Un cadavre très pale avec le pire cas de cheveux statiques que vous ayez "
"jamais vu(e). Des étincelles électriques sont crées constamment autour de sa "
"silhouette, rendant ce zombie visible dans le noir. Vous ne voulez "
"probablement pas le toucher avec vos mains nues, ou quoi que ce soit "
"conduisant l'électricité."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "boomer"
msgid_plural "boomers"
msgstr[0] "boomer"
msgstr[1] "boomers"
msgstr[2] "boomers"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Description of monster "boomer"
msgid ""
"A rotund human body, bloated beyond belief and layered in rolls of fat.  It "
"emits a horrible odor, and a putrid pink sludge dribbles from its mouth."
msgstr ""
"Un humain rond et gras en décomposition. Il sent mauvais et un liquide rose "
"et putride s'écoule de sa bouche."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "huge boomer"
msgid_plural "huge boomers"
msgstr[0] "boomer gigantesque"
msgstr[1] "boomers gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "boomers gigantesques"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Description of monster "huge boomer"
msgid ""
"This boomer, normally swollen and ready to burst, has strengthened and "
"solidified.  The bile dribbling from its mouth also appears to have changed…"
msgstr ""
"La peau de ce boomer, normalement enflée et prête à exploser, c'est épaissie "
"et endurcie alors que la créature est devenue encore plus bouffie. La bile "
"ruisselant de sa bouche ouverte a aussi l'air d'avoir changée."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "huge boomer"
#, c-format
msgid "A %s explodes!"
msgstr "Un %s explose! "

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bloated zombie"
msgid_plural "bloated zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie ballonné"
msgstr[1] "zombies ballonnés"
msgstr[2] "zombies ballonnés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bloated zombie"
msgid ""
"With its gray skin swollen to near-rupture with putrid gas, this cyst-covered "
"zombie looks like it could violently burst under the slightest of "
"disturbances."
msgstr ""
"Gonflé de gaz putride et au bord de la rupture, ce zombie couvert de kystes "
"semble être capable d'exploser à la moindre excuse."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sleepwalker zombie"
msgid_plural "sleepwalker zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie somnifère"
msgstr[1] "zombies somnifères"
msgstr[2] "zombies somnifères"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sleepwalker zombie"
msgid ""
"A zombie swollen with a bluish, oddly sweet smelling gas.  It stumbles around "
"even more than regular zombies, as if heavily intoxicated."
msgstr ""
"Un zombie gonflé et émettant des filets d'un gaz bleuâtre depuis des orifices "
"variés et trébuchant encore plus que la normale pour un zombie, comme si ce "
"cadavre était intoxiqué au point de s'écrouler."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "swollen tearjerker"
msgid_plural "swollen tearjerkers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Description of monster "swollen tearjerker"
msgid ""
"A bloated corpse, its ballooning skin blistered and rashy and its face caked "
"in mucus.  The off-color orange gas that occasionally leaks from it makes "
"your eyes water and smells faintly of pepper."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "boomer glutton"
msgid_plural "boomer gluttons"
msgstr[0] "glouton boomer"
msgstr[1] "gloutons boomer"
msgstr[2] "gloutons boomer"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Description of monster "boomer glutton"
msgid ""
"A large, grotesque ball of flesh and fat.  Seemingly vestigial limbs flop "
"around haphazardly as it rolls across the ground.  You occasionally catch a "
"glimpse of bulging eyes and a distended gaping maw oozing some sort of black "
"sludge."
msgstr ""
"Un boule de chair et de graisse grotesque aux proportions ahurissantes. Ses "
"membres vestigiaux gigotent au hasard pendant qu'il utilise sa masse "
"sphérique pour rouler sur le sol. Vous apercevez occasionnellement dissimulé "
"au milieu d'un amas de bourrelets une paire d'yeux gonflés au dessus d'une "
"gueule béante et distendue de laquelle ruisselle une sorte de bouillie noire."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "boomer glutton"
msgid "The glutton vomits sludge!"
msgstr "Le glouton crache son vomi!"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bombardier boomer"
msgid_plural "bombardier boomers"
msgstr[0] "boomer bombardier"
msgstr[1] "boomers bombardiers"
msgstr[2] "boomers bombardiers"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bombardier boomer"
msgid ""
"This zombie's exposed ribcage is encircled by swollen lungs and other organs. "
" You would prefer to be far away when they burst."
msgstr ""
"La cage thoracique exposée de ce zombie est entourée de poumons et d'autres "
"organes enflés.  Vous préféreriez être loin quand ils éclateront."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "bombardier boomer"
msgid "A bombardier boomer explodes!"
msgstr "Un boomer bombardier explose!"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rust zombie"
msgid_plural "rust zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie rouillé"
msgstr[1] "zombies rouillés"
msgstr[2] "zombies rouillés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rust zombie"
msgid ""
"A zombie impaled with a multitude of metal fragments, each covered with a "
"thick layer of rust that seems to propagate to other parts of its body.  You "
"can't remember the last time you got a tetanus shot, so it would be best not "
"to let this thing touch you."
msgstr ""
"Un zombie empalé d'une multitude de fragments de métal couverts d'une couche "
"épaisse de rouille ayant l'air de se propager à sa chair. Vous ne vous "
"rappelez pas exactement de la dernière fois que vous avez été vacciné contre "
"le tétanos, donc il serait probablement une bonne idée de ne pas laisser "
"cette chose vous toucher."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rust shell zombie"
msgid_plural "rust shell zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rust shell zombie"
msgid ""
"Jagged fragments of rust-bitten metal have fused into this zombie's flesh and "
"displaced parts of its spine."
msgstr ""
"Des morceaux de métal incrustés de rouille ont fusionnés avec la chair de ce "
"zombie, déformant partiellement sa colonne vertébrale."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rust plated zombie"
msgid_plural "rust plated zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie rouillé blindé"
msgstr[1] "zombies rouillés blindés"
msgstr[2] "zombies rouillés blindés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rust plated zombie"
msgid ""
"Ruptures in this zombie's skin expose fragments of metal arranged like armor "
"underneath.  Black sludge can be seen in places where the rust has receded."
msgstr ""
"Les fissures et plaies de la peau de ce zombie révèlent des fragments de "
"métal rouillés arrangés comme une armure en dessous. Un liquide noir aillant "
"l'air de remplacer la rouille s'incruste sur certaines portions de ceux-ci."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rust urchin"
msgid_plural "rust urchins"
msgstr[0] "oursin rouillé"
msgstr[1] "oursins rouillés"
msgstr[2] "oursins rouillés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rust urchin"
msgid ""
"A spiked horror of a zombie covered in long, rusty spikes.  A walking tetanus "
"infection waiting to happen."
msgstr ""
"Un cadavre hérissé de longues pointes de ferraille rouillés. Une infection de "
"tétanos sur deux pieds."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rust fist brute"
msgid_plural "rust fist brutes"
msgstr[0] "brute à poings en ferraille"
msgstr[1] "brutes à poings en ferraille"
msgstr[2] "brutes à poings en ferraille"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rust fist brute"
msgid ""
"This brute of a zombie is covered in rusted metal detritus.  Chunks of metal "
"smashed through its arms have deformed them into hammers."
msgstr ""
"Cette brute zombie est recouverte de détritus métalliques rouillés.  Des "
"morceaux de métal perçant ses bras les ont déformés en marteaux."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "crawler"
msgid_plural "crawlers"
msgstr[0] "ver rose"
msgstr[1] "vers roses"
msgstr[2] "vers roses"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "crawler"
msgid ""
"A conglomeration of human parts fused together in a horrible mishmash of "
"function, slowly dragging its eldritch body across the ground."
msgstr ""
"Un conglomérat de pièces humaines fusionnées dans un horrible méli-mélo de "
"fonctions, traînant lentement son corps amalgamé le long du sol."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dissoluted devourer"
msgid_plural "dissoluted devourers"
msgstr[0] "amalgame cadavérique"
msgstr[1] "amalgames cadavériques"
msgstr[2] "amalgames cadavériques"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dissoluted devourer"
msgid ""
"Human bodies fused together into a colossus, with heads and limbs sticking "
"out of its bloated body.  The nature of the thing makes it difficult to "
"estimate how close it is to dying, and its capabilities might change if it "
"manages to assimilate more zombies into itself."
msgstr ""
"Des corps humains ayant fusionné pour former un colosse, avec des têtes et "
"des membres dépassant de son corps gonflé.  La nature de la chose rend "
"difficile d’estimer à quel point elle est proche de la mort, et ses capacités "
"pourraient changer si elle parvient à assimiler davantage de zombies en "
"elle-même."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "melded task force"
msgid_plural "melded task forces"
msgstr[0] "unité amalgamée"
msgstr[1] "unités amalgamées"
msgstr[2] "unités amalgamées"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "melded task force"
msgid ""
"A tangle of security personnel fused with their gear and with each other, "
"warped limbs and flesh-covered equipment moving in strange unison.  Every so "
"often you glimpse a pitch-black figure at its center, limbs mirroring the "
"movements of the larger mass."
msgstr ""
"Un enchevêtrement de membres du personnel de sécurité fusionnés avec leur "
"équipement et entre eux, leurs membres déformés et leur équipement couvert de "
"chair se déplaçant étrangement à l'unisson.  De temps en temps, vous "
"apercevez une silhouette noire en son centre, dont les membres reflètent les "
"mouvements de la masse plus grande."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "melded task force"
msgid ""
"The creature grows sluggish before freezing in place for a moment.  Suddenly "
"its flesh turns black and recedes to coat the central figure, which reaches "
"out towards you before collapsing into a pinprick of shimmering air.  Torn "
"uniforms and other gear tumble to the ground."
msgstr ""
"La créature devient léthargique avant de se figer sur place pendant un "
"moment. Soudain, sa chair devient noire et se retire pour recouvrir la figure "
"centrale, qui se tend vers vous avant de s'effondrer dans un filet d'air "
"miroitant. Des uniformes déchirés et d'autres équipements tombent sur le sol."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "melded task force"
msgid "A handful of flesh wriggles loose from the mass and takes flight!"
msgstr "Une poignée de chair se détache de la masse et s'envole !"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "trapped tendril"
msgid_plural "trapped tendrils"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "trapped tendril"
msgid ""
"A great tendril of mutated flesh and sharpened bone.  Emerging from a crevice "
"in the ruined floor, hundreds of human limbs seek freedom and writhe "
"incessantly from underneath its grotesque carapace.  As enormous as it may "
"be, you feel certain that this is just part of a much bigger creature, for "
"when it moves, you can feel this whole ruin tremble, as though an unseen "
"giant is struggling against the weight of its concrete tomb."
msgstr ""
"Une grande vrille de chair mutante et d'os aiguisés. Émergeant d'une crevasse "
"dans le sol en ruines, des centaines de membres humains cherchent à se "
"libérer et se tortillent sans cesse sous sa carapace grotesque. Aussi énorme "
"soit-elle, vous êtes certain qu'elle n'est qu'une partie d'une créature bien "
"plus grande, car lorsqu'elle bouge, vous pouvez sentir toute la ruine "
"trembler, comme si un géant invisible luttait contre le poids de son tombeau "
"de béton."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gangrenous flesh"
msgid_plural "gangrenous flesh"
msgstr[0] "chair gangréneuse"
msgstr[1] "chairs gangréneuses"
msgstr[2] "chairs gangréneuses"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gangrenous flesh"
msgid ""
"Covered in grievous wounds, this wretch's gray skin has bloated to "
"near-rupture with putrid gas.  Between lumps of unrecognizable gore, a human "
"head lamely follows your movements with empty, black eyes."
msgstr ""
"Covered in grievous wounds, this wretch's gray skin has bloated to "
"near-rupture with putrid gas. Between lumps of unrecognizable gore, a human "
"head lamely follows your movements with empty, black eyes."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gangrenous crawler"
msgid_plural "gangrenous crawlers"
msgstr[0] "rampeur gangreneux"
msgstr[1] "rampeurs gangreneux"
msgstr[2] "rampeurs gangreneux"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gangrenous crawler"
msgid ""
"A nightmarish, spidery abomination born from human gore.  It deftly crawls "
"between the walls and ceiling with limbs grown from its own disjointed ribs."
msgstr ""
"Une abomination cauchemardesque et arachnoïde née d'organes humains rampant "
"adroitement entre les murs et le plafond avec ses membres issus de ses "
"propres côtes fracturées."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gangrenous impaler"
msgid_plural "gangrenous impalers"
msgstr[0] "empaleur gangreneux"
msgstr[1] "empaleurs gangreneux"
msgstr[2] "empaleurs gangreneux"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gangrenous impaler"
msgid ""
"A corpse hideously twisted into an insect-like form.  A hollow tendril "
"reaches out from its open thorax."
msgstr ""
"Un cadavre hideusement déformé en une créature rappelant un insecte.  Une "
"vrille creuse sort de son thorax ouvert."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "gangrenous impaler"
msgid "The impaler launches a barb!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "gangrenous impaler"
msgid "unch"
msgstr "unch"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scissorlimbs"
msgid_plural "scissorlimbs"
msgstr[0] "araignée rasoir"
msgstr[1] "araignées rasoirs"
msgstr[2] "araignées rasoirs"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scissorlimbs"
msgid ""
"A nightmarish spider of gore standing tall among the ruins, keeping silent "
"watch of the blighted landscape.  Its spindly limbs of bone slip between the "
"rubble with otherworldly speed."
msgstr ""
"Une araignée cauchemardesque se dresse au milieu des ruines, surveillant "
"silencieusement le paysage dévasté. Ses membres d'os effilés se faufilent "
"entre les décombres avec une rapidité extraordinaire."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hanging innards"
msgid_plural "hanging innards"
msgstr[0] "intestins suspendus"
msgstr[1] "intestins suspendus"
msgstr[2] "intestins suspendus"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hanging innards"
msgid ""
"Great snakes of flesh hang from the ceiling above, madly thrashing and "
"reaching about."
msgstr ""
"De grands serpents de chair sont suspendus au plafond, s'agitant follement et "
"s'étirant dans tous les sens."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "spasming lump"
msgid_plural "spasming lumps"
msgstr[0] "tas de chair frémissante"
msgstr[1] "tas de chair frémissante"
msgstr[2] "tas de chair frémissante"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "spasming lump"
msgid ""
"A great pile of merged bodies and mutated flesh.  It spasms in an arrhythmic "
"and desperate manner."
msgstr ""
"Un grand amas de corps fusionnés et de chair mutante. Il s'agite de façon "
"arythmique et désespérée."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "flesh wall"
msgid ""
"A great lump of mutated flesh.  It resembles the innards of some gigantic "
"creature, and is covered in a grid of diminutive veins."
msgstr ""
"Une masse de chair mutante couverte d'un réseau de veines fines bloquant "
"complètement le chemin et ressemblant à l'intérieur d'une créature "
"gigantesque."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie scientist"
msgid_plural "zombie scientists"
msgstr[0] "scientifique zombifié"
msgstr[1] "scientifiques zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "scientifiques zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie scientist"
msgid ""
"The remaining protective gear, laboratory equipment, and long, formerly white "
"labcoat tell you that this zombie was some kind of researcher before turning."
msgstr ""
"Ce qui reste de son équipement de sécurité de laboratoire et de sa longue "
"blouse de laboratoire auparavant blanche semblent suggérer que ce zombie "
"était une sorte de scientifique avant d'être réanimé."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie security guard"
msgid_plural "zombie security guards"
msgstr[0] "agent de sécurité zombifié"
msgstr[1] "agents de sécurité zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "agents de sécurité zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie security guard"
msgid ""
"A shambling human corpse wearing a gray uniform and a bulletproof vest with "
"\"SECURITY\" emblazoned across the front.  It looks like this guard was quite "
"physically fit before its death; it moves quickly and powerfully, albeit "
"clumsily."
msgstr ""
"Un cadavre humain ambulant, vêtu d'un uniforme gris et d'un gilet pare-balles "
"marqué du mot \"SECURITÉ\" sur le devant. Il est évident que cette personne "
"était en bonne forme physique avant sa mort, car il se déplace rapidement et "
"puissamment malgré sa maladresse. Il est certain qu'il n'est plus en mesure "
"d'assurer la sécurité du lieu."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "phase skulker"
msgid_plural "phase skulkers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#. ~ Description of monster "phase skulker"
msgid ""
"What remains of a researcher lost to the portal storms, twisted and enervated "
"by the presences that lurk beneath natural perception.  It walks and stumbles "
"in a stuttered manner, and is granted tenuous corporeality only by grace of "
"the experimental gear it wore when it died."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "phase skulker"
msgid "The skulker shifts and melts inwards before disappearing!"
msgstr "Le skulker se déplace et fond vers l'intérieur avant de disparaître !"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/monsters/weakpoints.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "phase skulker"
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "phase shrike"
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing the "stomach_armour" weakpoint
msgid "a gap in the armor"
msgstr "un faille dans l'armure"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "phase shrike"
msgid_plural "phase shrikes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#. ~ Description of monster "phase shrike"
msgid ""
"What remains of a researcher lost to the portal storms, twisted and enervated "
"by the presences that lurk beneath natural perception.  It unnaturally "
"skitters on four bone-plated spikes, its every motion trailing an aura of "
"energetic distortion."
msgstr ""
"Ce qui reste d'un chercheur perdu dans les tempêtes dimensionnelles, changé "
"et tordu par ce qui attends juste en dessous de ce qui est censé être perçu "
"se mouvant sur quatres membres se terminant en pics osseux, chaque "
"déplacement laissant une traînée de distortion énergétique derrière cette "
"chose qui semble être rejetée par le monde."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "phase shrike"
msgid "The shrike shifts and disappears amidst an electric surge!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "slavering biter"
msgid_plural "slavering biters"
msgstr[0] "gueule affamée"
msgstr[1] "gueules affamées"
msgstr[2] "gueules affamées"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "slavering biter"
msgid ""
"A distorted and swollen human body.  Its jaws have elongated into a "
"crocodile-like snout, dripping with foul-smelling saliva."
msgstr ""
"Un cadavre humain déformé et bouffi, sa mâchoire ayant été allongée en une "
"gueule rappelant celle d'un crocodile de laquelle de la salive infâme goutte."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "slavering biter"
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "mangrove lurker"
msgid "the inside of its mouth"
msgstr "l'intérieur de sa gueule"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "brainless zombie"
msgid_plural "brainless zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie écervelés"
msgstr[1] "zombies écervelés"
msgstr[2] "zombies écervelés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "brainless zombie"
msgid ""
"A zombie like any other, except that its facial features and skull have been "
"devastated.  It's unclear what caused the damage, but between the scraps of "
"flesh you can see that its face and brain are gone, though its ears remain "
"intact."
msgstr ""
"Un zombie indiscernable de ses confrères à l'exception du fait que son crâne "
"et visage ayant été oblitérés. Il est impossible de savoir qu'est ce qui a "
"causé  autant de dégâts sur ce cadavre ambulant, mais entre les fragment "
"ruinés de sa tête, vous pouvez observer que son cerveau est totalement "
"absent, mais que ses oreilles restent intactes."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "headless horror"
msgid_plural "headless horrors"
msgstr[0] "zombie décapité"
msgstr[1] "zombies décapités"
msgstr[2] "zombies décapités"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "headless horror"
msgid ""
"This headless zombie has swollen to frightening proportions, towering almost "
"nine feet tall.  Six-foot-long feelers of black ooze blindly wave from its "
"neck, violently twitching at nearby sounds.  Its long stride allows it to "
"quickly pursue its targets, which it pummels into pulp with its huge, swollen "
"fists."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie dépourvu de tête a atteint des proportions terrifiantes, six "
"tentacules noires de deux mètres de long émergeant de son cou se dressant "
"déjà à trois mètres de haut et spasment violemment au moindre bruit dans les "
"environs. Sa haute stature lui permet d'aisement rattraper ses proies, "
"celles-ci promptement pulpées par ses poings massifs et gonflés de muscle."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bruiser zombie"
msgid_plural "bruiser zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie cogneur"
msgstr[1] "zombies cogneurs"
msgstr[2] "zombies cogneurs"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bruiser zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie's right arm has been grotesquely deformed into a massive "
"mace-like shape.  What remains of its hand has been covered in spiky bone, "
"and the upper arm's skin is clearly coming apart from the pressure on it."
msgstr ""
"Le bras droit de ce zombie a été grotesquement déformé en un amas de chair et "
"de fragments d'os ayant une forme rappelant vaguement un masse d'armes, la "
"peau du haut du bras ayant l'air d'être sur le point de se rompre dû au poids "
"additionnel qu'elle supporte."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie brute"
msgid_plural "zombie brutes"
msgstr[0] "brute zombie"
msgstr[1] "brutes zombies"
msgstr[2] "brutes zombies"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie brute"
msgid ""
"This zombie's entire body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, "
"festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez observer des muscles en train de gonfler et se réarranger sous la "
"peau distendue et couverte de plaies suppurantes de ce zombie."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie wrestler"
msgid_plural "zombie wrestlers"
msgstr[0] "catcheur zombifié"
msgstr[1] "catcheurs zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "catcheurs zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie wrestler"
msgid ""
"A slab of festering muscle the size of a well-toned bodybuilder.  With "
"popping and cracking sounds its arm muscles constantly lengthen and contract "
"as it reaches out with deformed muscular hands the size of dinner plates."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie nightstalker"
msgid_plural "zombie nightstalkers"
msgstr[0] "zombie croque-mitaine"
msgstr[1] "zombies croque-mitaines"
msgstr[2] "zombies croque-mitaines"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie nightstalker"
msgid ""
"Somehow, this brute hides in the dark like some kind of boogeyman.  Very "
"agile for such a large zombie."
msgstr ""
"D'une manière ou d'une autre, cette brute semble ce fondre aux ombres comme "
"un croque-mitaine et son agilité est déroutante venant d'un zombie aussi "
"massif."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie prowler"
msgid_plural "zombie prowlers"
msgstr[0] "zombie rôdeur"
msgstr[1] "zombies rôdeurs"
msgstr[2] "zombies rôdeurs"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie prowler"
msgid ""
"Enveloped in darkness is the outline of what used to be a person, quick and "
"spindly - and nigh invisible in the shadows.  Even with the unnatural "
"camouflage hiding its features you can make out large teeth and even larger "
"claws."
msgstr ""
"Enveloppé dans l'obscurité se trouve le contour de ce qui était autrefois une "
"personne, rapide et grêle - et presque invisible dans le noir.  Même avec le "
"camouflage artificiel qui cache ses caractéristiques, vous pouvez distinguer "
"de grandes dents et des griffes encore plus grandes."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "listener zombie"
msgid_plural "listener zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie auditeur"
msgstr[1] "zombies auditeurs"
msgstr[2] "zombies auditeurs"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "listener zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie's head was once obviously destroyed, the gaps in its scraps of "
"face now filling with a peculiar gray goo.  Human ears hang from the sides, "
"enormous and unsettling.  Thin slits at the front suggest it may have a (very "
"limited) sense of sight."
msgstr ""
"Le crâne ayant évidemment été éclaté de ce zombie est maintenant rempli d'une "
"substance visqueuse grise et ses oreilles devenues massives et déroutantes "
"pendent de chaque côté de ce qui reste de sa tête.  Les fentes fines "
"présentes à l'avant suggèrent que cette chose possède peut être une vision "
"extrêmement limitée."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "relentless hulk"
msgid_plural "relentless hulks"
msgstr[0] "mastodonte impitoyable"
msgstr[1] "mastodontes impitoyables"
msgstr[2] "mastodontes impitoyables"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "relentless hulk"
msgid ""
"A hulking zombie swollen to the size of six men.  Its inky black eyes are "
"locked on you.  No matter how far you run, it always seems to find you."
msgstr ""
"Un zombie imposant, enflé jusqu'à atteindre la taille de six hommes.  Ses "
"yeux noirs d'encre sont fixés sur vous.  Peu importe jusqu'où vous courez, il "
"semble toujours vous trouver."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grabber zombie"
msgid_plural "grabber zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie agrippeur"
msgstr[1] "zombies agrippeurs"
msgstr[2] "zombies agrippeurs"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grabber zombie"
msgid ""
"A badly deformed zombie.  Its arms dangle from its sides like the limbs of "
"some skinless ape, mindlessly groping at their surroundings."
msgstr ""
"Un corps humain aux bras déformés pendants sur ses flancs comme un "
"orang-outan nu. Ses bras grotesques tâtonnent les environs de façon mal "
"coordonnée."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grappler zombie"
msgid_plural "grappler zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie saisisseur"
msgstr[1] "zombies saisisseurs"
msgstr[2] "zombies saisisseurs"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grappler zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie's elongated arms drag along the ground as it moves.  It looks to "
"almost have a hunchback from the swollen shoulder muscles tearing though its "
"skin."
msgstr ""
"Un mort-vivant avec des bras grotesquement allongés qui traînent par terre. "
"Les muscles de ses épaules sont tellement hypertrophiés que ce mort-vivant a "
"l'air bossu."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie hollow"
msgid_plural "zombie hollows"
msgstr[0] "zombie creux"
msgstr[1] "zombies creux"
msgstr[2] "zombies creux"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie hollow"
msgid ""
"This zombie's hollow black eyes survey its surroundings as it stretches and "
"bends in ways that whoever the original body belonged to never could.  The "
"only things that seem solid on this flexible, black-veined body are the rows "
"of sharp, black teeth.  You get the feeling that the only human thing "
"remaining is the skin, worn as one might wear clothes."
msgstr ""
"Les yeux noire comme du charbon de cette abomination surveillent les environs "
"tandis que son corps se tord et plie de façon dérangeante évidemment "
"impossible pour un corps humain. La seule partie de ce corps souple et "
"parsemé de veines noires qui semble toujours solide sont les rangées de dents "
"opaques carnassières. Vous avez la forte impression que la seule chose "
"humaine restante de ce cadavre est sa peau, portée comme une combinaison."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie hulk"
msgid_plural "zombie hulks"
msgstr[0] "zombie mastodonte"
msgstr[1] "zombies mastodontes"
msgstr[2] "zombies mastodontes"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie hulk"
msgid ""
"A human corpse swollen to the size of six men, with arms as wide as trash "
"cans."
msgstr ""
"Un zombie humanoïde enflé pour atteindre la taille de six hommes, avec des "
"bras aussi larges que des poubelles."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie hunter"
msgid_plural "zombie hunters"
msgstr[0] "chasseur zombie"
msgstr[1] "chasseurs zombies"
msgstr[2] "chasseurs zombies"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie hunter"
msgid ""
"You're barely able to believe this thing was ever human; it scrambles about "
"on all fours, its nails and teeth sharpened into dangerous-looking spikes."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez du mal à vous convaincre que cette chose est jamais été humaine "
"lorsque vous l'observez se déplacer rapidement à quatre pattes, ses ongles et "
"ses dents s'étant allongés et transformés en aiguilles vicieuses."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie snapper"
msgid_plural "zombie snappers"
msgstr[0] "zombie ambûcheur"
msgstr[1] "zombies ambûcheurs"
msgstr[2] "zombies ambûcheurs"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie snapper"
msgid ""
"With a crocodile-like snout and rows of protruding teeth, this swimwear-clad "
"zombie lurks in the water."
msgstr ""
"Avec un museau semblable à celui d'un crocodile et des rangées de dents "
"saillantes, ce zombie en maillot de bain est capable d'être presque invisible "
"dans l'eau."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "zombie snapper"
msgid "the inside of the mouth"
msgstr "l'intérieur de la gueule"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie master"
msgid_plural "zombie masters"
msgstr[0] "maître zombie"
msgstr[1] "maîtres zombies"
msgstr[2] "maîtres zombies"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie master"
msgid ""
"This zombie's features have tightened, its lips pulled back into an unnatural "
"grin, revealing rows of blackened teeth beneath large, piercing eyes.  It "
"stands tall and its movements are fluid and tightly controlled.  A feeling of "
"danger permeates the surrounding air, and the light that falls on it seems "
"somehow harsher and more glaring."
msgstr ""
"Les traits de ce zombie se sont resserrés, ses lèvres retroussées en un "
"sourire contre nature, révélant des rangées de dents noircies sous de grands "
"yeux perçants.  Il se dresse haut et ses mouvements sont fluides et "
"étroitement contrôlés.  Un sentiment de danger imprègne l’air ambiant et la "
"lumière qui l’éclaire semble en quelque sorte plus dure et douloureuse."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie necromancer"
msgid_plural "zombie necromancers"
msgstr[0] "zombie nécromancien"
msgstr[1] "zombies nécromanciens"
msgstr[2] "zombies nécromanciens"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie necromancer"
msgid ""
"A twisted mockery of the human form, emaciated, with jet-black skin and "
"glowing red eyes.  It is somehow painful to look at, awakening fears deep "
"within your psyche, and even the surrounding air seems more sinister, somehow "
"darker and more dangerous."
msgstr ""
"Une parodie de la forme humaine émaciée à la peau noire sur noir et aux yeux "
"rouges maléfiques. Regarder ce zombie trop longtemps vous fait mal aux yeux "
"et révèle des peurs tapies dans votre psyché et rends l'air autour de cette "
"abomination encore plus sinistre, sombre et dangereux."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie necro-boomer"
msgid_plural "zombie necro-boomers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie necro-boomer"
msgid ""
"At first this creature looks like nothing more than a grotesque and "
"oleaginous husk, bloated and punctured by jet-black pustules.  When "
"approached, its glowing red eyes and an aching grin take form; its skin tears "
"and its guts teem with unmatched fecundity, as its gaze inspires fear of "
"nothing less than cosmic, inhuman ecstasy."
msgstr ""
"À première vue, cette créature ne ressemble à rien d’autre qu’une enveloppe "
"grotesque et oléagineuse, gonflée et percée de pustules noires comme de "
"l'encre.  De plus près, ses yeux aux lueurs rouges et son sourire douloureux "
"prennent forme; sa peau déchirée et ses tripes rengorgées deviennent "
"visibles, tandis que son regard ne renferme rien de moins qu'une extase "
"cosmique inhumaine repoussante."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "zombie necro-boomer"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s lets out an unholy screech, and the corpses around it stir."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie runner"
msgid_plural "zombie runners"
msgstr[0] "zombie coureur"
msgstr[1] "zombies coureurs"
msgstr[2] "zombies coureurs"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie runner"
msgid ""
"This recently-risen body moves quickly, darting its head back and forth and "
"gnawing at its hands."
msgstr ""
"Ce corps récemment transformé se déplace rapidement, balançant sa tête "
"d'avant en arrière tout en mastiquant ses mains."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "regenerating zombie"
msgid_plural "regenerating zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie régénérant"
msgstr[1] "zombies régénérants"
msgstr[2] "zombies régénérants"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "regenerating zombie"
msgid ""
"A hairless zombie.  Its pale, pinkish flesh appears to be squirming and "
"moving across its body, quickly covering and fixing any wounds that it "
"receives.  Its clothing is riddled with holes, suggesting someone else tried, "
"and failed, to take it down."
msgstr ""
"Un zombie glabre.  Sa chair pâle et rosâtre semble se tortiller et se "
"déplacer sur son corps, couvrant et réparant rapidement toutes les blessures "
"qu'il reçoit.  Ses vêtements sont criblés de trous, ce qui suggère que "
"quelqu'un d'autre a essayé, sans succès, de l'abattre."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fleshy hunter"
msgid_plural "fleshy hunters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fleshy hunter"
msgid ""
"A zombie prowling around on all fours; its exposed muscles churn and snake, "
"unraveling before restitching themselves elsewhere along its red-raw figure."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "regenerating abomination"
msgid_plural "regenerating abominations"
msgstr[0] "abomination régénérante"
msgstr[1] "abominations régénérantes"
msgstr[2] "abominations régénérantes"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "regenerating abomination"
msgid ""
"This zombie hardly resembles a human anymore - Its skeleton has been "
"repeatedly dismantled and reassembled into a horrid quadrupedal shape, like "
"some sort of mismatched action figure.  Slick, bloodied flesh writhes on its "
"frame with an almost viscous quality, digesting and reconstituting itself in "
"an endless ouroboros of undead flesh."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie predator"
msgid_plural "zombie predators"
msgstr[0] "zombie prédateur"
msgstr[1] "zombies prédateurs"
msgstr[2] "zombies prédateurs"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie predator"
msgid ""
"With its joints in odd places and angles, this humanoid creature prowls "
"across the landscape with surprising speed.  Its teeth and arms are sharpened "
"into fine points, and black ooze seeps out from cuts between its muscles."
msgstr ""
"Les articulations des membres de cette créature à l'apparence humaines sont "
"placées à des endroits étranges, avec des angles inhabituels, mais celle-ci "
"rôde à une vitesse incroyable. Ses dents et ses bras semblent affûtés en "
"pointes fines, et du liquide noir suinte entre ses muscles."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "screecher zombie"
msgid_plural "screecher zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie crieur"
msgstr[1] "zombies crieurs"
msgstr[2] "zombies crieurs"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "screecher zombie"
msgid ""
"A thin corpse, its chest swollen in what appears to be preparation.  A thick "
"black ooze drips from its open mouth."
msgstr ""
"Un cadavre famélique, sa poitrine gonflée en ce qui vous à l'air d'être de "
"l'anticipation, de la bave noire épaisse s'écoulant de sa bouche entrouverte."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shady zombie"
msgid_plural "shady zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie ténébreux"
msgstr[1] "zombies ténébreux"
msgstr[2] "zombies ténébreux"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shady zombie"
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature, as if light itself were too "
"repulsed to touch it.  All you can make out is its shambling, human-shaped "
"outline."
msgstr ""
"Un ombre étrange enveloppe cette créature, donnant l'impression que la "
"lumière elle-même est trop repoussée par cette abomination pour la toucher. "
"Tout ce que vous pouvez distinguer à travers est une silhouette humanoïde "
"titubante."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shrieker zombie"
msgid_plural "shrieker zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie hurleur"
msgstr[1] "zombies hurleurs"
msgstr[2] "zombies hurleurs"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shrieker zombie"
msgid ""
"An elongated human body with a swollen chest and a gaping hole where its jaw "
"used to be."
msgstr ""
"Un corps humain allongé, au buste enflé et avec un trou béant là ou se "
"trouvait sa mâchoire."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skull zombie"
msgid_plural "skull zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie crâne"
msgstr[1] "zombies crâne"
msgstr[2] "zombies crâne"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skull zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie's head is a hideous gray skull, formed of human bone fragments "
"and some sort of goo.  Jagged teeth are visible as the thing works its jaw, "
"and lidless, disturbingly human eyes stare at you from their sockets.  The "
"thing's fleshy ears are four sizes too large and droop under their own weight."
msgstr ""
"La tête de ce zombie est un crâne gris hideux, formé de fragments d'os "
"humains et d'une sorte de matière gluante.  Des dents fêlées sont visibles "
"lorsque la chose fait travailler sa mâchoire, et des yeux bizarrement humains "
"sans paupières vous fixent depuis leurs orbites.  Les oreilles charnues de la "
"chose sont quatre fois trop grandes et s'affaissent sous leur propre poids."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ocular zombie"
msgid_plural "ocular zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie oculaire"
msgstr[1] "zombies oculaires"
msgstr[2] "zombies oculaires"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ocular zombie"
msgid ""
"This otherwise-regular zombie's head is absolutely filled to the brim with "
"eyes, half of them frantically swiveling in their orbits.  The other half are "
"staring directly at you."
msgstr ""
"La tête de ce zombie ayant l'air autrement assez normal est complétement "
"bourrée d'yeux à l'apparence diverse, une moitié pivotant frénétiquement dans "
"leurs orbites, l'autre moitié fixée droit vers vous."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "smoker zombie"
msgid_plural "smoker zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie fumigène"
msgstr[1] "zombies fumigènes"
msgstr[2] "zombies fumigènes"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "smoker zombie"
msgid ""
"A blackened and twisted naked human body.  Strips of flesh hang from its "
"frame, and it emits a constant haze of thick black smoke."
msgstr ""
"Un cadavre humain noirci et déformé; des morceaux de peau pendent de sa chair "
"et ses plaies et orifices émettent constamment une fumée noire et graisseuse."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ashen brawler"
msgid_plural "ashen brawlers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ashen brawler"
msgid ""
"A gigantic, twisted human frame with a menacing stance and rapid movements.  "
"Thick clouds of smoke pour from violent-looking eviscerations spread across "
"its muscular body, and its arms appear to have elongated massively."
msgstr ""
"Une silhouette humaine gigantesque et tordue ayant une posture menaçante et "
"des mouvements rapides.  D'épais nuages de fumée s'échappent des brèches "
"brutales parsemant son corps musclé, et ses bras semblent s'être allongés "
"massivement."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "swimmer zombie"
msgid_plural "swimmer zombies"
msgstr[0] "nageur zombifié"
msgstr[1] "nageurs zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "nageurs zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "swimmer zombie"
msgid "A zombie clad in swimwear.  Probably not a very graceful swimmer anymore."
msgstr ""
"Un cadavre portant un maillot de bain. Il est douteux qu'il soit toujours un "
"bon nageur."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "webbed zombie"
msgid_plural "webbed zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie palmé"
msgstr[1] "zombies palmés"
msgstr[2] "zombies palmés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "webbed zombie"
msgid ""
"A slick and glistening human body clad in swimwear.  Its hands and feet are "
"heavily webbed, suggesting some kind of rapid evolutionary adaptation to "
"water."
msgstr ""
"Un cadavre épuré et luisant portant un maillot de bain. Ces extrémités sont "
"palmées et suggèrent une adaptation rapide au milieu aquatique."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie technician"
msgid_plural "zombie technicians"
msgstr[0] "technicien zombifié"
msgstr[1] "techniciens zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "techniciens zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie technician"
msgid ""
"Still wearing its work clothes and hardhat, this zombie likely used to work "
"on power lines or other electrical equipment."
msgstr ""
"Il porte toujours ses vêtements de travail et son casque de chantier. Ce "
"zombie travaillait sur les lignes hautes tension et les équipements "
"électriques."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie miner"
msgid_plural "zombie miners"
msgstr[0] "mineur zombifié"
msgstr[1] "mineurs zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "mineurs zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie miner"
msgid ""
"This zombie's face, hands, work clothes, and miner's helmet are fully covered "
"with stains of coal dust."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie portant une tenue de mineur est couvert d'une fine couche de poudre "
"de charbon."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "thorny shambler"
msgid_plural "thorny shamblers"
msgstr[0] "cadavre épineux"
msgstr[1] "cadavres épineux"
msgstr[2] "cadavres épineux"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "thorny shambler"
msgid ""
"A shambling undead humanoid, its body overgrown with a tangled mass of "
"otherworldly vegetation.  Hunched over and dragging its feet as it moves, the "
"bramble utterly enveloping its upper half twitches and moves with a life of "
"its own, tendrils tipped with a paralytic sting."
msgstr ""
"Un mort-vivant humanoïde titubant, son corps recouvert d'une masse "
"enchevêtrée de végétation d'un autre monde.  Courbé et traînant les pieds "
"lorsqu'il se déplace, la ronce enveloppant complètement sa moitié supérieure "
"se contracte et se déplace avec sa propre vie, ses vrilles terminées par un "
"dard paralysant."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ravenous reenactor"
msgid_plural "ravenous reenactors"
msgstr[0] "reconstitueur zombifié"
msgstr[1] "reconstitueurs zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "reconstitueurs zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ravenous reenactor"
msgid ""
"This shambling corpse is dressed in the tatters of an antiquated soldier's "
"uniform.  Either it was a historical reenactor, or zombies have also started "
"to time travel."
msgstr ""
"Ce cadavre traînant est vêtu des lambeaux d’un uniforme de soldat désuet.  "
"Soit il s’agissait d'un fan de reconstitution historique, soit les zombies "
"ont également commencé à voyager dans le temps."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fursuited zombie"
msgid_plural "fursuited zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie en fursuit"
msgstr[1] "zombies en fursuit"
msgstr[2] "zombies en fursuit"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fursuited zombie"
msgid ""
"A human body, swaying awkwardly in a torn cloth suit of an anthropomorphized "
"animal.  Black goo and blood cakes the suit, and it gives off a foul, rotting "
"odor."
msgstr ""
"Un corps humain, se balançant maladroitement dans un costume en tissu déchiré "
"représentant un animal anthropomorphisé.  Une substance visqueuse noire et du "
"sang recouvrent le costume et dégagent une odeur nauséabonde et pourrie."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_nomex.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Nomex zombie"
msgid_plural "Nomex zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie Nomex"
msgstr[1] "zombies Nomex"
msgstr[2] "zombies Nomex"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_nomex.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Nomex zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie was a firefighter in its past life, still donned in its turnout "
"equipment - said equipment has melded with its flesh, with the tough, flame "
"resistant fibers becoming incorporated into its skin as armor and body mass."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie était probablement un pompier de son vivant, et son uniforme a "
"commencé à s'intégrer à sa chair, les fibres solides et ignifugées le rendant "
"plus résistant et lourd que l'ordinaire."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_nomex.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fireproof zombie"
msgid_plural "fireproof zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie ignifugé"
msgstr[1] "zombies ignifugés"
msgstr[2] "zombies ignifugés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_nomex.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fireproof zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie appears to have once been a firefighter or similar first "
"responder, the wilted remains of its turnout gear clinging to it like a "
"molted carapace.  Fibrous streaks resembling the fireproof materials of its "
"gear run through its flesh like roots, giving the thing a mottled, off-yellow "
"appearance as it prowls on all fours."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie se déplaçant à quatre pattes a l'air d'avoir été de son vivant un "
"pompier et son uniforme lui est collé comme une sorte de carapace fondue des "
"fibres ressemblant au matériau de celui-ci parcourent sa chair comme une "
"réseau de racines, lui donnant une apparence tachetée et jaunâtre."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_nomex.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fireproof grappler"
msgid_plural "fireproof grapplers"
msgstr[0] "zombie saisisseur ignifugé"
msgstr[1] "zombies saisisseurs ignifugés"
msgstr[2] "zombies saisisseurs ignifugés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_nomex.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fireproof grappler"
msgid ""
"This zombie appears to have once been a firefighter or similar first "
"responder, its body having ripped through and absorbed the majority of its "
"uniform.  Its torso and back are swollen, and its muscles are marbled with "
"knotted growths resembling the Nomex fibers of its former gear, feeding into "
"lanky arms that drag on the floor."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie à l'air d'avoir été de son vivant un pompier, son corps ayant "
"absorbé la majorité de son uniforme.  Son torse et son dos sont gonflés, et "
"leurs muscles sont marbrés de croissances nouées ressemblant aux fibres "
"ignifugés de celui-ci s'étirent le long de ses bras disproportionnés trainant "
"au sol."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_nomex.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fireproof brute"
msgid_plural "fireproof brutes"
msgstr[0] "brute ignifugée"
msgstr[1] "brutes ignifugées"
msgstr[2] "brutes ignifugées"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_nomex.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fireproof brute"
msgid ""
"This zombie appears to have once been a firefighter or similar first "
"responder, but the uniform is hardly recognizable at this point, as the thing "
"has grown new flesh and muscle overtop.  Its sinewy body has taken on a "
"composition similar to the uniform's fire-resistant fabric, most of it "
"congealed into a pair of clubs on the ends of its hands."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie à l'air d'avoir été un pompier de son vivant, mais cela est à peine "
"reconnaissable maintenant dû à la chair et aux muscles distendus ayant "
"poussés à travers, les fibres et tendons de ceux-ci rappelant le matériau de "
"son équipement, et ses mains se sont métamorphosées en deux massues de chair "
"malformée à l'apparence redoutable."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "prisoner zombie"
msgid_plural "prisoner zombies"
msgstr[0] "prisonnier zombifié"
msgstr[1] "prisonniers zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "prisonniers zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
#. ~ Description of monster "prisoner zombie"
msgid ""
"Apparently this zombie was doing time when the Cataclysm struck.  It wears "
"black and white striped prisoner clothes, and tattoos can be seen on its "
"decaying skin."
msgstr ""
"Apparemment, ce zombie purgeait une peine lorsque le Cataclysme a frappé.  Il "
"porte des vêtements de prisonnier rayés noirs et blancs et des tatouages sont "
"visibles sur sa peau en décomposition."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "prisoner zombie brute"
msgid_plural "prisoner zombie brutes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
#. ~ Description of monster "prisoner zombie brute"
msgid "This muscular zombie wears black and white striped prisoner clothes."
msgstr "Ce zombie musclé porte un uniforme de prisonnier noir et blanc à rayures."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fat prisoner zombie"
msgid_plural "fat prisoner zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fat prisoner zombie"
msgid "This fat zombie wears black and white striped prisoner clothes."
msgstr "Ce zombie obèse porte un uniforme de prisonnier noir et blanc à rayures."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tough prisoner zombie"
msgid_plural "tough prisoner zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tough prisoner zombie"
msgid "This tough-looking zombie wears black and white striped prisoner clothes."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie à l'air coriace porte des vêtements de prisonnier à rayures noires "
"et blanches."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal zombie"
msgid_plural "skeletal zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie ossifié"
msgstr[1] "zombies ossifiés"
msgstr[2] "zombies ossifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal zombie"
msgid ""
"A monstrous overgrowth of ossified tissue has replaced this zombie's rotting "
"skin with an organic armor of dense bone.  Large clumps of black goo seep "
"from its joints as it shambles aimlessly, with sickening crackling sounds "
"filling the surrounding air."
msgstr ""
"Une monstrueuse prolifération de tissus ossifiés a remplacé la peau en "
"décomposition de ce zombie avec une armure organique composée d'os denses.  "
"De gros amas de matière gluante noire s'échappent de ses articulations alors "
"qu'il se déplace sans but, des craquements repoussants remplissant l'air "
"ambiant."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal brute"
msgid_plural "skeletal brutes"
msgstr[0] "brute ossifiée"
msgstr[1] "brutes ossifiées"
msgstr[2] "brutes ossifiées"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal brute"
msgid ""
"Distorted outgrowths of calcified bone plates cover this zombie's rotten "
"skin.  Joints and cracks around its body ooze with black goo."
msgstr ""
"Des excroissances déformées de plaques osseuses calcifiées recouvrent la peau "
"pourrie de ce zombie.  Une substance visqueuse noire suinte des articulations "
"et des fissures de son corps."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal shocker"
msgid_plural "skeletal shockers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal shocker"
msgid ""
"Heavy, jagged bone plates have grown out of the surface of this zombie's "
"skin.  Underneath, its flesh glows and crackles with the occasional jolt of "
"electricity."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal juggernaut"
msgid_plural "skeletal juggernauts"
msgstr[0] "colosse ossifié"
msgstr[1] "colosses ossifiés"
msgstr[2] "colosses ossifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal juggernaut"
msgid ""
"This hideous golem of plated bones and misshapen flesh drags its heavy, "
"pointed limbs behind it like an unwanted burden.  Formerly soft and "
"vulnerable, bones grew around its form to protect it - only, they kept "
"growing.  And growing.  And growing."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal slasher"
msgid_plural "skeletal slashers"
msgstr[0] "découpeur ossifié"
msgstr[1] "découpeurs ossifiés"
msgstr[2] "découpeurs ossifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal slasher"
msgid ""
"The fingers of this bone-clad zombie have turned into ossified blades the "
"size of large knives.  Most of the soft tissue on its head is gone, exposing "
"a significantly thickened skull."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal executioner"
msgid_plural "skeletal executioners"
msgstr[0] "exécuteur ossifié"
msgstr[1] "exécuteurs ossifiés"
msgstr[2] "exécuteurs ossifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal executioner"
msgid ""
"The hands and forearms of this tall, bone-clad zombie have transformed into "
"sword-like ossified blades.  Its jaw is partially fused with the bone mask "
"covering its face, leaving sinister-looking gaps.  Its movements are stiff "
"but precise."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal reaper"
msgid_plural "skeletal reapers"
msgstr[0] "faucheur ossifié"
msgstr[1] "faucheurs ossifiés"
msgstr[2] "faucheurs ossifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal reaper"
msgid ""
"This large, bone-armored zombie has scythe-like blades in place of its hands, "
"resembling a praying mantis.  Its face is covered by a thick, ossified mask, "
"with its only remaining facial features being eyes that ooze black goo.  Its "
"movements are filled with unnatural rage."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie soldier"
msgid_plural "zombie soldiers"
msgstr[0] "soldat zombifié"
msgstr[1] "soldats zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "soldats zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie soldier"
msgid ""
"Once a soldier, it is dressed head to toe in combat gear and carries itself "
"rather steadily for a zombie."
msgstr ""
"Autrefois un soldat, il est habillé des pieds à la tête en tenue de combat et "
"se déplace de manière plutôt stable pour un zombie."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie soldier test only"
msgid_plural "zombie soldier test only"
msgstr[0] "soldat zombifié de test"
msgstr[1] "soldats zombifiés de test"
msgstr[2] "soldats zombifiés de test"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie soldier test only"
msgid "This zombie soldier is for testing purposes only."
msgstr "Un soldat zombifié utilisé uniquement pour tester des choses."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black-ops zombie"
msgid_plural "black-ops zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie black ops"
msgstr[1] "zombies black ops"
msgstr[2] "zombies black ops"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black-ops zombie"
msgid ""
"This soldier zombie's skin radiates a sort of shadowy smoke that obscures its "
"outline, making its camouflage even harder to see against the background.  In "
"the darkness it would be nigh invisible."
msgstr ""
"La peau de ce soldat zombifié émet un sorte de fumée noire obscurcissant sa "
"silhouette et renforçant le camouflage de son uniforme jusqu'à ce qu'il soit "
"encore plus difficile à distinguer de ses environs, voir presque impossible "
"la nuit."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hunter-killer zombie"
msgid_plural "hunter-killer zombies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hunter-killer zombie"
msgid ""
"Fragments of visible uniform hint that this monstrosity was once a soldier.  "
"Anything human is invisible, hidden inside a sheath of living shadow.  It "
"moves with preternatural fluidity and grace."
msgstr ""
"Des fragments d'uniforme visible suggèrent que cette monstruosité était "
"autrefois un soldat.  Tout ce qui est humain est invisible, caché dans une "
"enveloppe d’ombre vivante.  Il bouge avec une fluidité et une grâce "
"surnaturelles."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bilious soldier zombie"
msgid_plural "bilious soldier zombies"
msgstr[0] "soldat zombifié bilieux"
msgstr[1] "soldats zombifiés bilieux"
msgstr[2] "soldats zombifiés bilieux"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bilious soldier zombie"
msgid ""
"This staggering soldier wears a burnt gasmask, now fused to its face.  "
"Through the melted, bile-encrusted ruination of the mask protrudes some sort "
"of hardened, fleshy proboscis, with steaming corrosive fluid leaking from the "
"end."
msgstr ""
"Ce soldat trébuchant porte un masque à gaz brûlé ayant fusionné avec son "
"visage.  À travers les ruines fondues et incrustées de bile du masque dépasse "
"une sorte de trompe durcie et charnue, avec un liquide corrosif fumant "
"s'échappant de l'extrémité."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "bilious soldier zombie"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s launches a corrosive dart!"
msgstr "Le %s projette un dard corrosif!"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "caustic soldier zombie"
msgid_plural "caustic soldier zombies"
msgstr[0] "soldat zombifié caustique"
msgstr[1] "soldats zombifiés caustiques"
msgstr[2] "soldats zombifiés caustiques"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "caustic soldier zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie wears what appears to have once been a soldier's uniform and "
"armor, now a series of cracked and melted plates that have fused to its skin "
"and thickened hide.  Its face and arms blister with strange, mutated tubes "
"that pulse and drip with acid."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie porte ce qui semble avoir été autrefois un uniforme et une armure "
"de soldat mais n'est maintenant qu'une série de plaques craquelées et fondues "
"ayant fusionné avec sa peau cuireuse.  Son visage et ses bras sont couverts "
"d'étranges tubes palpitant et dégoulinant d'acide."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "caustic soldier zombie"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s launches a hail of corrosive darts!"
msgstr "Le %s projette une pluie de dards corrosifs!"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Kevlar zombie"
msgid_plural "Kevlar zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie Kevlar"
msgstr[1] "zombies Kevlar"
msgstr[2] "zombies Kevlar"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Kevlar zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie dons a uniform with heavy, bulletproof materials sewn in.  "
"Peculiarly, the uniform seems to have fused to its skin in certain places, "
"its flesh gripping the edges of its gear as though the body were trying to "
"absorb it."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie porte un uniforme avec des matériaux lourds et pare-balles cousus.  "
"Curieusement, l'uniforme semble avoir fusionné avec sa peau à certains "
"endroits, sa chair agrippant les bords de son équipement comme si le corps "
"essayait de l'absorber."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Kevlar brute"
msgid_plural "Kevlar brutes"
msgstr[0] "brute blindée au Kevlar"
msgstr[1] "brutes blindées au Kevlar"
msgstr[2] "brutes blindées au Kevlar"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Kevlar brute"
msgid ""
"This zombie was once wearing some kind of uniform with heavy, bulletproof "
"materials sewn in.  At this point it's impossible to tell what kind of "
"uniform it was: the monster's skin has grown over the fabric, splitting and "
"tearing it to shreds, turning the remaining Kevlar and other bits of armor "
"material into part of its hide.  Its hands have similarly fused into large, "
"leathery cudgels."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie portait autrefois une sorte d'uniforme avec des matériaux lourds et "
"pare-balles. À ce stade, il est impossible de dire de quel type d'uniforme il "
"s'agissait : la peau du monstre a poussé sur le tissu, le fendant et le "
"déchirant en lambeaux, transformant le Kevlar restant et d'autres morceaux de "
"matériel d'armure en une partie de sa peau. Ses mains ont également fusionné "
"pour devenir de grands gourdins en cuir."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Kevlar hulk"
msgid_plural "Kevlar hulks"
msgstr[0] "colosse Kevlar"
msgstr[1] "colosses Kevlar"
msgstr[2] "colosses Kevlar"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Kevlar hulk"
msgid ""
"This zombie was once wearing some kind of now long-shredded uniform with "
"heavy, bulletproof materials sewn in.  It has grown into a hulking, "
"leatherbacked beast, its mutated skin taking on a strange texture similar to "
"the Kevlar bits embedded in it.  Its arms have twisted into enormous clubs of "
"misshapen bone that it drags on the ground behind it."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie portait autrefois une sorte d'uniforme, aujourd'hui déchiqueté "
"depuis longtemps, dans lequel étaient cousus de lourds matériaux pare-balles. "
"Il s'est transformé en une énorme bête à dos de cuir, dont la peau mutante a "
"pris une texture étrange semblable à celle des morceaux de Kevlar qui y sont "
"incorporés. Ses bras se sont tordus en d'énormes massues d'os difformes qu'il "
"traîne sur le sol derrière lui."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie military pilot"
msgid_plural "zombie military pilots"
msgstr[0] "pilote militaire zombifié"
msgstr[1] "pilotes militaires zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "pilotes militaires zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie military pilot"
msgid ""
"Once a pilot, it is wearing a flight suit and a sturdy-looking flight helmet. "
" The head twitches and adjusts constantly, following any and every source of "
"movement."
msgstr ""
"Une fois pilote, ce cadavre titubant porte une combinaison de vol et un "
"casque de vol d'apparence robuste.  Sa tête s'agite et s’ajuste constamment, "
"suivant toute source de mouvement."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "uniformed zombie"
msgid_plural "uniformed zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie en uniforme"
msgstr[1] "zombies en uniforme"
msgstr[2] "zombies en uniforme"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "uniformed zombie"
msgid ""
"This undead soldier is adorned in standard military fatigues.  It carries "
"itself rather steadily for a zombie."
msgstr ""
"Ce soldat mort-vivant est habillé des pieds à la tête en un uniforme de "
"fantassin standard et se déplace de manière plutôt stable pour un zombie."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie mariner"
msgid_plural "zombie mariners"
msgstr[0] "matelot zombifié"
msgstr[1] "matelots zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "matelots zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie mariner"
msgid ""
"Still dressed in the ragged remains of deep blue naval fatigues, it's clear "
"that this walking corpse was once a sailor of some description.  The US "
"Navy's insignia is embroidered on the shredded sleeve and shoulder of its "
"bloodied jacket, the dead crewman's battered cap is beaten into the remains "
"of its fractured skull and its inky black eyes are scanning the area around "
"it as dark ooze drips from its limply hanging maw."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie officer"
msgid_plural "zombie officers"
msgstr[0] "officier de marine zombifié"
msgstr[1] "officiers de marine zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "officiers de marine zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie officer"
msgid ""
"Dressed in the shredded blue dress uniform of a naval officer, this undead "
"corpse was evidently a higher ranking crewman in life.  Having more than "
"likely not been clad in body armor, the result now staggers before you: "
"horrific wounds exposed to the air and large portions of flesh and muscle "
"ripped from its glistening skeleton."
msgstr ""
"Vêtu de l’uniforme bleu déchiqueté d’un officier de marine, ce cadavre "
"mort-vivant était évidemment un membre d’équipage de rang supérieur de son "
"vivant.  N'ayant probablement pas été vêtu d'un gilet pare-balles, le "
"résultat est horrifiant: d'horribles blessures exposées à l'air et de grandes "
"parties de sa chair et muscles arrachés de son squelette luisant."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie marine"
msgid_plural "zombie marines"
msgstr[0] "marine zombifié"
msgstr[1] "marines zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "marines zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie marine"
msgid ""
"Dressed head to toe in naval combat equipment and with Marine insignia "
"embroidered on its gear, this lurching corpse still retains its physical "
"fitness in death.  From underneath its helmet, its inky black eyes scan the "
"area around it."
msgstr ""
"Encore habillé dans son uniforme d'infantrie de marine américaine, ce corps "
"titubant à gardé le haut niveau d'aptitude physique que ce soldat avait de "
"son vivant, et en dessous de sont casque vous observez une paire d'yeux noirs "
"comme de l'encre scannant les environs."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bestial stalker"
msgid_plural "bestial stalkers"
msgstr[0] "traqueur bestial"
msgstr[1] "traqueurs bestiaux"
msgstr[2] "traqueurs bestiaux"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bestial stalker"
msgid ""
"Lumbering about on all fours, this mutated beast's dagger-like claws clack "
"against the ground as it predatorially moves: thick strands of exposed muscle "
"tissue running across its rotting body.  The addition of its new bulk has "
"caused the skin along its arms and back to split, and the brute's teeth have "
"extended into spikes of bone.  The Marine insignias on the remains of the "
"creature's pulverized gear are the only testaments to the soldier that this "
"hulking abomination used to be."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_bestial_stalker"
msgid ""
"Lumbering about on all fours, this mutated beast's dagger-like claws clack "
"against the ground as it predatorially moves: thick strands of exposed muscle "
"tissue running across its rotting body.  The addition of its new bulk has "
"caused the skin along its arms and back to split, and the brute's teeth have "
"extended into spikes of bone.  The military insignias on the remains of the "
"creature's pulverized gear are the only testaments to the soldier that this "
"hulking abomination used to be."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "armored zombie"
msgid_plural "armored zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie blindé"
msgstr[1] "zombies blindés"
msgstr[2] "zombies blindés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "armored zombie"
msgid ""
"Despite being encased in a what was once a nigh-impenetrable combat "
"exoskeleton, something still managed to kill this soldier."
msgstr ""
"Malgré le fait que ce soldat était encastré dans une exosquelette blindé de "
"combat quasiment impénétrable, quelque chose est arrivé à percer ses défenses "
"et le zombifier."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_survivor.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "survivor zombie"
msgid_plural "survivor zombies"
msgstr[0] "survivant zombifié"
msgstr[1] "survivants zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "survivants zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_survivor.json
#. ~ Description of monster "survivor zombie"
msgid ""
"Still wearing the tattered remnants of improvised armor and weaponry, it is "
"plain to see that this zombie was once a survivor like you."
msgstr ""
"Portant toujours les résidus d'armures et d'armes improvisés, on voit bien "
"que ce zombie était un survivant comme vous."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_survivor.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie survivor test only"
msgid_plural "zombie survivor test only"
msgstr[0] "survivant zombifié de test"
msgstr[1] "survivants zombifiés de test"
msgstr[2] "survivants zombifiés de test"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_survivor.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie survivor test only"
msgid "This zombie survivor is for testing purposes only."
msgstr "Un survivant zombifié utilisé uniquement pour tester des choses."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_survivor.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "paramilitary zombie"
msgid_plural "paramilitary zombies"
msgstr[0] "paramilitaire zombifié"
msgstr[1] "paramilitaires zombifiészombies paramilitaires"
msgstr[2] "paramilitaires zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_survivor.json
#. ~ Description of monster "paramilitary zombie"
msgid ""
"Wearing military surplus gear including an armored vest with patches of local "
"militias, cartoon women, obscene statements, or local political groups.  This "
"person definitely thought they were ready for the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"Cette personne porte de l'équipement militaire de surplus, notamment un gilet "
"blindé avec des écussons de milices locales, de femmes de cartoon, de "
"déclarations obscènes ou de groupes politiques locaux.  Définitivement "
"quelqu'un qui pensait être prêt pour l'apocalypse."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_survivor.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "veteran survivor zombie"
msgid_plural "veteran survivor zombies"
msgstr[0] "survivant vétéran zombifié"
msgstr[1] "survivants vétérans zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "survivants vétérans zombifiés"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_survivor.json
#. ~ Description of monster "veteran survivor zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie once was a survivor like you, and a pretty good one at that.  "
"Unfortunately they didn't make it, despite the custom-made, heavy armor "
"pieces they wear and the gear that they are still lugging around."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie était autrefois un·e survivant·e comme vous, et un·e très bon·ne "
"survivant·e.  Malheureusement, il·elle n'a pas réussi à s'en tirer aussi "
"longtemps que vous, malgré les pièces d'armure lourdes et faites sur mesure "
"qu'il·elle porte et l'équipement qu'il·elle trimballe encore."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_tentacle.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lashing zombie"
msgid_plural "lashing zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie fouetteur"
msgstr[1] "zombies fouetteurs"
msgstr[2] "zombies fouetteurs"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_tentacle.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lashing zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie has very elongated arms.  While they're menacingly long, they "
"seem quite thin and floppy, as if they lack bones."
msgstr ""
"Ce zombie possède des bras très allongés ayant l'air menaçants mais "
"curieusement minces et mous, comme si leurs os ont été dissous."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_tentacle.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tentacled zombie"
msgid_plural "tentacled zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie tentaculaire"
msgstr[1] "zombies tentaculaires"
msgstr[2] "zombies tentaculaires"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_tentacle.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tentacled zombie"
msgid ""
"What likely used to be the arms of this zombie are now a set of strange, "
"purplish tentacles, with what appear to be vestigial fingers at the end.  "
"They trail several meters behind the tall zombie as it shambles along."
msgstr ""
"Ce qui était probablement les bras de ce zombie est maintenant une paire de "
"longues et étranges tentacules violettes au bout desquels vous discernez ce "
"qui à l'air d'être des doigts vestigiaux, traînant quelques mètres derrière "
"son corps titubant et élancé."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_tentacle.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie strider"
msgid_plural "zombie striders"
msgstr[0] "zombie longiligne"
msgstr[1] "zombies longilignes"
msgstr[2] "zombies longilignes"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_tentacle.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie strider"
msgid ""
"In front of you lies the most disgusting rendition of a starfish you've ever "
"seen.  Not just the arms, but the legs and even the head have been "
"horrendously deformed and stretched several meters long.  It walks around "
"hunchback, looking through the remains of its head for its next victim."
msgstr ""
"Devant vous se dresse l'imitation la plus hideuse d'une étoile de mer que "
"vous ayez jamais croisée.  Pas juste les bras, mais aussi les jambes et même "
"la tête ont été déformés et étirés sur quelques mètres. Sa taille "
"considérable est légèrement réduite par sa posture courbée, ce qui reste de "
"son visage ravagé scannant les environs en quête de nouvelles victimes."

#: data/json/monsters/netherum/labyrinth_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fleshborg"
msgid_plural "fleshborgs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/netherum/labyrinth_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fleshborg"
msgid ""
"Compared to the cyborgs you've seen elsewhere, this one looks almost "
"inverted.  Its body is made of smooth, segmented, paper-thin metallic plates; "
"fleshy protrusions and bits of bone jut from components growing off this base "
"frame.  It moves wildly, but not like a zombie; more like a machine gone "
"haywire."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/netherum/labyrinth_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "fleshborg"
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "advanced fleshborg"
msgid "The fleshborg launches a bony dart at you!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/netherum/labyrinth_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "advanced fleshborg"
msgid_plural "advanced fleshborgs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/netherum/labyrinth_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "advanced fleshborg"
msgid ""
"Compared to the cyborgs you've seen elsewhere, this one looks almost "
"inverted.  Its body is made of smooth, segmented, paper-thin metallic plates; "
"fleshy protrusions and bits of bone jut from components growing off this base "
"frame.  It moves with dire purpose, like a trained combat machine."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/netherum/labyrinth_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "flesh turret"
msgid_plural "flesh turrets"
msgstr[0] "tourelle de chair"
msgstr[1] "tourelles de chair"
msgstr[2] "tourelles de chair"

#: data/json/monsters/netherum/labyrinth_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "flesh turret"
msgid ""
"At first glance, this looks like a turret made from scraps.  As you look "
"closer, it becomes clear it's actually a grinding pile of cartilage, bone, "
"and tendon, slowly rotating and scanning the area."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/netherum/labyrinth_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "flesh turret"
msgid "The turret launches a bony dart at you!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/netherum/labyrinth_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Stiltwalker"
msgid_plural "Stiltwalkers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/netherum/labyrinth_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Stiltwalker"
msgid ""
"This lanky, quadrupedal entity has a loosely humanoid torso, towering high "
"over the ground on long bladed legs.  Its body is covered in what looks like "
"fur made of rusting, metallic wire, and its face is a polished, hollow mask "
"with holes where the mouth and eyes should be."
msgstr ""

