#: data/json/mutations/appearance_hair_styles.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Natural Hair Growth"
msgstr "Croissance Naturelle des Cheveux"

#: data/json/mutations/appearance_hair_styles.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Natural Hair Growth"
msgid ""
"Your hair will naturally grow out into various forms, getting longer over "
"time.  Turning this off will prevent it from growing and changing."
msgstr ""
"Vos cheveux poussent naturellement sous différentes formes et s'allongent "
"avec le temps.  En désactivant cette fonction, vous les empêchez de pousser "
"et de changer."

#: data/json/mutations/appearance_hair_styles.json
