#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find Relic"
msgstr "Trouver une relique"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Find Relic"
msgid ""
"Find a relic of a forgotten saint.  Places like "
"<color_yellow>cathedrals</color> or <color_yellow>museums</color> might have "
"one."
msgstr ""
"Trouvez une relique d'un⸱e saint⸱e oublié⸱e.  Des endroits comme les "
"<color_yellow>cathédrales</color> ou les <color_yellow>musées</color> "
"pourraient avoir ça."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Relic"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prison Visionary"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Rock"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Holy Symbol"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mad Hermit"
msgid "St. Michael the archangel defend me in battle…"
msgstr "Saint Michael l'archange donnez-moi la victoire dans les batailles à venir…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Relic"
msgid ""
"As the world seems to abandon the reality that we once knew, it becomes "
"plausible that the old superstitions that were cast aside may have had some "
"truth to them.  Please go and find me a religious relic… I doubt it will be "
"of much use but I've got to hope in something."
msgstr ""
"Alors que le monde semble abandonner la réalité que nous connaissions "
"autrefois, il devient plausible que les vieilles superstitions qui ont été "
"mises de côté aient pu contenir une part de vérité.  S'il vous plaît, allez "
"me trouver une relique religieuse…  Je doute qu'elle soit d'une grande "
"utilité mais je dois espérer en quelque chose."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Relic"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Rock"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Holy Symbol"
msgid "I wish you the best of luck, may whatever god you please guide your path."
msgstr "Je vous souhaite bonne chance, que votre dieu guide vos pas."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Relic"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prison Visionary"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Rock"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Holy Symbol"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mad Hermit"
msgid "Ya, I guess the stress may just be getting to me…"
msgstr "Ouais, j'imagine que je commence à ressentir le stress…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Relic"
msgid "I suppose a large church or cathedral may have something."
msgstr "Je suppose qu'une grande église ou une cathédrale peuvent avoir quelque chose."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Relic"
msgid "Any luck?  Please find me a small relic.  Any relic will do."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez trouvé quelque chose? Trouvez-moi juste une petite relique. "
"N'importe quel type conviendra."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Relic"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Rock"
msgid "Thank you, I need some time alone now…"
msgstr "Merci, j'ai besoin d'un petit moment de réclusion maintenant…"

