#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Retrieve Deposit Box"
msgstr "Récupérer le coffre fort"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
msgid ""
"Now I don't mean to upset you but I'm not sure what I can do with the "
"accounting ledger at the moment.  We do have a new lead though, the ledger "
"has a safe deposit box under the regional manager's name.  Guess what, dumb "
"sucker wrote down his combination.  Come with me to retrieve the box and you "
"can keep any of the goodies in it that I can't use to press charges against "
"these bastards."
msgstr ""
"Ne le prenez pas mal mais je ne vois pas ce que je pourrais faire avec le "
"grand livre des comptes pour l'instant. On a une autre piste par contre, le "
"comptable a un coffre fort à son nom. Devinez quoi, ce con a écrit la "
"combinaison. Venez avec moi pour récupérer le contenu et vous pourrez garder "
"tout ce dont je n'aurais besoin contre eux."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
msgid "You may make a tidy profit from this."
msgstr "Vous pourriez vous faire un bon profit avec ça."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
msgid ""
"I know it isn't pressing but the world is going to be just as corrupt when we "
"start rebuilding unless we take measure to stop those who seek to rule over "
"us."
msgstr ""
"Ça ne presse pas mais le monde sera toujours corrompu quand on voudra "
"reconstruire, sauf si on prend les mesures pour stopper ceux qui cherchent à "
"nous contrôler."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
msgid "This shouldn't be hard unless we run into a horde."
msgstr "Ça ne devrait pas être trop dur, sauf si on rencontre une horde."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
msgid "Great, anything I can't use to prosecute the bastards is yours, as promised."
msgstr ""
"Super, tout ce que je ne peux utiliser contre ces bâtards est à vous , comme "
"promis."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Retrieve Software"
msgstr "Récupérer un logiciel"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Retrieve Software"
msgid "Retrieve the software in their computer marked on your map."
msgstr "Récupérez le logiciel dans l'ordinateur marqué sur votre carte."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
msgid "Oh man, I can't believe I forgot to download it…"
msgstr "Oh non, je ne peux pas croire que j'ai oublié de le télécharger…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
msgid "There's some important software on my computer that I need on USB."
msgstr ""
"Il y a des logiciels importants sur mon ordinateur dont j'ai besoin sur une "
"clé USB."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
msgid "Thanks!  Just pull the data onto this USB drive and bring it to me."
msgstr ""
"Merci!  Il suffit de mettre les données sur cette clé USB et de me les "
"apporter."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Stick"
msgid "Seriously?  It's an easy job…"
msgstr "Sérieusement?  C'est une mission facile…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
msgid "Take this USB drive.  Use the console, and download the software."
msgstr "Prenez cette clé USB.  Utilisez la console et téléchargez le logiciel."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
msgid "So, do you have my software yet?"
msgstr "Alors, avez-vous mon logiciel?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Stick"
msgid "Excellent, thank you!"
msgstr "Excellent, merci!"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Stick"
msgid "Wow, you failed?  All that work, down the drain…"
msgstr "Wow, vous avez échoué?  Tout ce travail, tombé à l’eau…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Analyze Zombie Blood"
msgstr "Analyser le sang de zombie"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
msgid "It could be very informative to perform an analysis of zombie blood…"
msgstr "Il pourrait être très instructif de faire une analyse du sang des zombies…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
msgid ""
"I need someone to get a sample of zombie blood, take it to a hospital, and "
"perform a centrifuge analysis of it."
msgstr ""
"J'ai besoin de quelqu'un pour prélever un échantillon de sang de zombie, "
"l'emmener dans un hôpital et l'analyser par centrifugation."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
msgid ""
"Excellent.  Take this blood draw kit; once you've produced a zombie corpse, "
"use it to extract blood from the body, then take it to a hospital for "
"analysis."
msgstr ""
"Excellent. Prenez ce kit de prélèvement sanguin ; une fois que vous aurez "
"produit un cadavre de zombie, utilisez-le pour extraire le sang du corps, "
"puis apportez-le à un hôpital pour analyse."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
msgid "Are you sure?  The scientific value of that blood data could be priceless…"
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes sûr·e?  La valeur scientifique de ces données sanguines pourrait "
"être inestimable…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
msgid ""
"The centrifuge is a bit technical; you might want to study up on the usage of "
"computers before completing that part."
msgstr ""
"La centrifugeuse est un peu technique ; vous pourriez vouloir étudier "
"l'utilisation des ordinateurs avant de compléter cette partie."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
msgid "Well, do you have the data yet?"
msgstr "Vous avez les données?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Alien Fungus"
msgid "Excellent!  This may be the key to removing the infection."
msgstr "Excellent ! C'est peut-être la clé pour éliminer l'infection."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
msgid "Wait, you couldn't possibly have the data!  Liar!"
msgstr "Attends une seconde, vous ne pouvez pas avoir les données! Menteur!"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
msgid "What a shame, that data could have proved invaluable…"
msgstr "Quel dommage, ces données auraient pu s'avérer précieuses…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Investigate Cult"
msgstr "Enquêter sur le culte"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Investigate Cult"
msgid ""
"Investigate the strange cabin in the woods and find an item that may clue you "
"in about <color_yellow>a potential human sacrifice</color> the cult has "
"performed, such as <color_yellow>human bones or other remains</color>."
msgstr ""
"Enquêtez l'étrange cabane dans les bois et trouvez un objet qui pourrait vous "
"renseigner sur <color_yellow>un potentiel sacrifice humain</color> que le "
"culte a effectué, comme <color_yellow>des ossements humains ou d'autres "
"restes</color>."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
msgid ""
"You have no idea how interesting this diary is.  I have two very promising "
"leads… first things first, the Catholic Church has been performing its own "
"investigations into global cult phenomenon and it appears to have become very "
"interested in a local cult as of recently.  Could you investigate a location "
"for me?  I'm not sure what was going on here but the priest seemed fairly "
"worried about it."
msgstr ""
"Vous n'avez pas idée comme ce journal est intéressant. J'ai deux pistes "
"prometteuses… Tout d'abord, l'église catholique a fait sa propre enquête sur "
"le phénomènes des cultes et il est apparent qu'elle s'est intéressée à un "
"culte local récemment. Est-ce que vous pourriez enquêter quelque part pour "
"moi? Je ne suis pas sûr de ce qui se passait là bas mais cela semblait "
"préoccuper le prêtre."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
msgid ""
"I wish you the best of luck, may whatever god you please guide your path… You "
"may need it this time more than the past excursions you have gone on.  There "
"is a note about potential human sacrifice in the days immediately before and "
"after the outbreak.  The name of the cult is believed to be the Church of "
"Starry Wisdom but it is noted that accounts differ."
msgstr ""
"Je vous souhaite bonne chance, et que votre dieu vous guide... Vous en aurez "
"plus besoin qu'auparavant. Il y a une note parlant de sacrifices humains "
"juste avant et après le Cataclysme. Apparemment le nom du culte serait "
"l'Église de la Sagesse Étoilée' mais il est noté que les témoignages "
"diffèrent là dessus."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
msgid ""
"I doubt the site is still occupied but I'd carry a firearm at least… I'm not "
"sure what you might be looking for but I'm positive you'll find something out "
"of the ordinary if you look long enough."
msgstr ""
"Je ne pense pas que l'endroit soit encore occupé mais vous devriez prendre "
"une arme à feu au cas où… je pense que vous finirez par trouver quelque chose "
"qui sort de l'ordinaire si vous cherchez bien."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
msgid "I'm positive there is something there… there has to be, any luck?"
msgstr ""
"Je suis confiant sur le fait qu'il y a quelque chose là bas… toujours rien "
"trouvé?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
msgid ""
"Thank you, your account of these… demonic creations proves the fears the "
"churches had were well founded.  Our priority should be routing out any "
"survivors of this cult… I don't known if they are responsible for the "
"outbreak but they certainly know more about it than I do."
msgstr ""
"Merci de me raconter tout cela… Ces créations diaboliques prouvent que les "
"craintes des églises étaient bien fondées. Notre priorité maintenant est de "
"débusquer n'importe quel membre survivant de ce culte… Je ne sais s'ils sont "
"les responsables de tout cela mais ils seront probablement plus informés que "
"nous."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Prison Visionary"
msgstr "Visiter la prison"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prison Visionary"
msgid ""
"I have another task if you are feeling up to it.  There is a prisoner that "
"the priest made special mention of.  I was wondering if you could see what "
"may have happened to him or if he left anything in his cell.  The priest "
"admits the individual is rather unstable, to put it lightly, but the priest "
"personally believed the man was some kind of repentant visionary.  I'm not in "
"a position to cast out the account just yet… it seems the man has prophesied "
"events accurately before concerning the Church of Starry Wisdom."
msgstr ""
"J'ai une autre tâche si vous voulez. Il y a un prisonnier dont parle le "
"prêtre. Je me demandais si vous pouviez voir ce qui lui est arrivé ou s'il a "
"laissé quelque chose dans sa cellule. Le prêtre précise que l'individu est "
"plutôt imprévisible, et le voyais comme un visionnaire repentant. Je n'arrive "
"toujours pas à faire sens de tout cela... Il semblerait que cet individu ait "
"prophétisé les événements nous concernant au sujet de l'Église de la Sagesse "
"Étoilée."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prison Visionary"
msgid ""
"I wish you the best of luck, may whatever god you please guide your path… I "
"can only imagine that the prison will be a little slice of hell.  I'm not "
"sure what they would have decided to do with the inmates when they knew death "
"was almost certain."
msgstr ""
"Bonne chance, et que votre dieu guide vos pas... Je me doute que la prison "
"risque d'être un véritable enfer. Je me demande ce qu'ils ont fait des "
"détenus alors qu'ils savaient leur mort certaine."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prison Visionary"
msgid ""
"The worst case scenario will probably be that the prisoners have escaped "
"their cells and turned the building into their own little fortress.  Best "
"case, the building went into lock-down and secured the prisoners in their "
"cells.  Either way, navigating the building will pose its own difficulties."
msgstr ""
"Le pire scénario serait que les prisonniers se sont échappés de leur cellule "
"et ont fait de la prison leur forteresse. Dans le meilleur des cas, les "
"prisonniers sont enfermés dans leur cellule. Dans tout les cas, le bâtiment "
"présentera des difficultés."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prison Visionary"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mad Hermit"
msgid "Thank you, I'm not sure what to make of this but I'll ponder your account."
msgstr "Merci, je ne sais pas bien quoi en faire mais je vais le considérer."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
msgid "Well damn, you must be the guys here to pick me up…"
msgstr "Bon sang, vous devez être les gars qui viennent me chercher…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
msgid ""
"I got the brief so I know what I'm getting into.  Let me be upfront, treat me "
"like shit and I'm going to cover my own hide.  However, you treat me well and "
"give me something to believe in, even if it's just a shiny bit of metal, and "
"I'll do you right.  Without a strong band a man doesn't stand a chance in "
"this world.  You ready to take charge boss?  This world could use a Sheriff "
"just about now."
msgstr ""
"J'ai reçu le briefing donc je sais dans quoi je m'embarque.  Laissez-moi être "
"franc⸱he, traitez-moi comme de la merde et je vais sauver ma propre peau.  "
"Cependant, vous me traitez bien et me donnez quelque chose en quoi croire, "
"même si ce n'est qu'un morceau de métal brillant, et je ferai de mon mieux.  "
"Sans un groupe solide, un homme n’a aucune chance dans ce monde.  Êtes-vous "
"prêt à prendre les commandes, patron⸱ne?  Ce monde aurait bien besoin d’un⸱e "
"shérif à l’heure actuelle."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
msgid ""
"Before we get into a major fight just make sure we have the gear we need, "
"boss."
msgstr ""
"Avant de nous lancer dans une grosse bagarre, assurez-vous bien que nous "
"disposons de l'équipement dont nous avons besoin, patron⸱ne."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
msgid ""
"I don't think you're going to find many other survivors who haven't taken up "
"a faction yet."
msgstr ""
"Je ne pense pas que vous trouverez beaucoup d'autres survivants qui n'ont pas "
"encore rejoint une faction."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
msgid "I'm a pretty good shot with a rifle or pistol."
msgstr "Je tire assez bien avec un pistolet ou un fusil."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
msgid "Any problems boss?"
msgstr "Un problème patron·ne?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
msgid "Wait… are you really making me a deputy?"
msgstr "Attendez… vous voulez vraiment faire de moi un⸱e adjoint·e?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me the heart of a Jabberwock"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill two March lords in my name"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill this suspicious dog for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill five Mi-Go guards for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill an armored centipede for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill the remains of a dreamforged automaton"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a chunk of a triffid heart"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a titan stag beetle for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a piece of the darkest shadow"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a star-crowned hound in my name"
msgid "I don't think so…"
msgstr "Je ne crois pas non…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me the heart of a Jabberwock"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill two March lords in my name"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill this suspicious dog for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill five Mi-Go guards for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill an armored centipede for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill the remains of a dreamforged automaton"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a chunk of a triffid heart"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a titan stag beetle for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a piece of the darkest shadow"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a star-crowned hound in my name"
msgid "Quitting already?"
msgstr "Vous partez déjà?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill 100 Zombies"
msgstr "Tuer 100 zombies"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
msgid "You seem to know this new world better than most…"
msgstr "Vous semblez connaitre ce monde mieux que quiconque…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
msgid ""
"You're kitted out better than most… would you be interested in making this "
"world a little better for the rest of us?  The towns have enough supplies for "
"us survivors to start securing a foothold but we don't have anyone with the "
"skills and equipment to thin the masses of undead.  I'll lend you a hand to "
"the best of my ability but you really showed promise taking out that other "
"beast.  You, I, and a 100 zombies laid to rest, what do you say?"
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes mieux vêtu que la plupart... ça vous intéresserez de rendre le "
"monde un peu meilleur pour nous autres? Les villes ont suffisamment de "
"fournitures pour nous, mais nous n'avons pas les compétences pour venir à "
"bout des masses de zombies. Je vous aiderais du mieux que je peux mais vous "
"avez vraiment fait vos preuves avec cette autre bête. Vous, moi, et 100 "
"zombies à abattre, qu'en dites vous?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
msgid ""
"Hell ya, we may get ourselves killed but we'll be among the first legends of "
"the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"Putain ouai, on va peut être y rester mais on fera partie des légendes de "
"l'apocalypse."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
msgid ""
"Hey, I know I wouldn't volunteer for it either… but then I remember that most "
"of us survivors won't make it unless someone decides to take the initiative."
msgstr ""
"Hé, je ne me serais pas porté·e volontaire non plus… mais la plupart des "
"autres survivants ne s'en sortiront pas si personne ne prend l'initiative."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
msgid "I'd secure an ammo cache and try to sweep a town in multiple passes."
msgstr ""
"Je sécuriserais une cache de munitions et j'esserais de nettoyer une ville "
"avec plusieurs passages."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
msgid "Got this knocked out?"
msgstr "Vous l'avez assomé?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
msgid ""
"Man… you're a goddamn machine.  It was a pleasure working with you.  You "
"know, you may just change our little neck of the world if you keep this up."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes une putain de machine… c'était un plaisir de travailler avec vous.  "
"Vous savez, vous pourriez changer notre monde en ruine si vous continuez "
"comme ça."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
msgid "I don't think that was quite a hundred dead zeds."
msgstr "Je ne sais pas si ça fait une centaine de zombies."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill Horde Master"
msgstr "Tuer le Maître de la Horde"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
msgid "I've heard some bad rumors so I hope you are up for another challenge…"
msgstr ""
"J'ai entendu de drôles de rumeurs alors j'espère que vous êtes prêt pour un "
"autre challenge…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
msgid ""
"Apparently one of the other survivors picked up on an unusually dense horde "
"of undead moving into the area.  At the center of this throng there was a "
"'leader' of some sort.  The short of it is, kill the son of a bitch.  We "
"don't know what it is capable of or why it is surrounded by other zombies but "
"this thing reeks of trouble.  Do whatever it takes but we can't risk it "
"getting away."
msgstr ""
"Apparemment un des survivants a rameuté une horde de zombie dans la zone. Au "
"centre de celle-ci il y avait un genre de 'meneur'. Pour aller droit au but, "
"tuez moi cette enflure. On ne sait pas de quoi il est capable ou pourquoi il "
"se fait entourer. Faites tout ce qui est possible pour en venir à bout, mais "
"on ne peut pas risquer de le laisser filer."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
msgid "I'll lend you a hand but I'd try and recruit another gunslinger if you can."
msgstr ""
"Je vous donnerais un coup de main mais j'essayerais de recruter un autre "
"flingueur."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
msgid "What's the use of walking away, they'll track you down eventually."
msgstr "Quel intérêt de les éviter, ils vous pisteront probablement."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
msgid ""
"Don't risk torching the building it may be hiding in if it has a basement.  "
"The sucker may still be alive under the rubble and ash."
msgstr ""
"Ne prenez pas le rique de brûler le bâtiment, il pourrait se cacher dans le "
"sous-sol. Il serait toujours en vie sous les décombres."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
msgid "May that bastard never get up again."
msgstr "Que ce bâtard ne se relève jamais."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
msgid "I don't think we got it yet."
msgstr "Je ne crois pas qu'on l'ai eu encore."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_zombie_master" placed on map update on start of
#. mission "Kill Horde Master"
msgid "Demonic Soul"
msgstr "Âme Démonique"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill Jabberwock"
msgstr "Tuer le jabberwock"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
msgid ""
"The eater of the dead… something was ripping zombies to shreds and only "
"leaving a few scattered limbs…"
msgstr ""
"Le mangeur de morts… quelque chose déchirait les zombies en morceaux, ne "
"laissant que des membres éparpillés…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
msgid ""
"A few days ago another survivor and I were trying to avoid the cities by "
"staying in the woods during the day and foraging for gear at night.  It "
"worked well against the normal zeds but one night something caught onto our "
"trail and chased us for ten minutes or so until we decided to split up and "
"meet-up back here.  My buddy never showed up and I don't have the means to "
"kill whatever it was.  Can you lend a hand?"
msgstr ""
"Il y a quelques jours, un autre survivant et moi essayions d'éviter les "
"villes en restant dans les bois pendant la journée et en cherchant du "
"matériel la nuit.  Cela a bien fonctionné contre les zombies normaux, mais "
"une nuit, quelque chose s'est accroché à notre piste et nous a poursuivis "
"pendant environ dix minutes jusqu'à ce que nous décidions de nous séparer et "
"de nous retrouver ici.  Mon copain ne s'est jamais présenté et je n'ai pas "
"les moyens de tuer ce que c'était.  Pouvez-vous donner un coup de main?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
msgid "Thanks, make sure you're ready for whatever the beast is."
msgstr "Merci, préparez vous bien pour affronter cette bête."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
msgid "Hey, I know I wouldn't volunteer for it either."
msgstr "Hé, Je ne me serais pas porté volontaire non plus."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
msgid "I'd carry a shotgun at least, it sounded pretty big."
msgstr "Je prendrais au moins un fusil à pompe, au bruit elle doit être énorme."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
msgid ""
"You look a little shaken up, I can't tell you how glad I am that you killed "
"it though."
msgstr ""
"Vous tremblez un peu, vous n'imaginez pas a quel point ça me fait plaisir que "
"vous l'ayez tué."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
msgid "Something in the shadows still seems to stare at me when I look at the woods."
msgstr "Quelque chose semble encore m'observer quand je regarde les bois."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
msgid "I'm glad you came back alive… I wasn't sure if I had sent you to your death."
msgstr ""
"Content que vous soyez revenu·e en un seul morceau… je me demandais si je ne "
"vous avais pas envoyé vers votre mort."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill Zombie Mom"
msgstr "Tuer la maman zombifiée"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Bear"
msgid "Oh god, I can't believe it happened…"
msgstr "Oh non, je ne peux pas croire que ce soit arrivé…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
msgid ""
"My mom… she's… she was killed, but then she just got back up… she's one of "
"those things now.  Can you put her out of her misery for me?"
msgstr ""
"Ma maman… Elle est… Elle a été tuée, mais elle s'est relevée.  C'est une de "
"ces choses maintenant…  Pouvez-vous mettre fin à sa souffrance pour moi?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Bear"
msgid "Thank you… she would've wanted it this way."
msgstr "Merci. Elle l'aurait voulu ainsi."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Bear"
msgid "Please reconsider, I know she's suffering…"
msgstr "Pensez-y… Je sais qu'elle souffre."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
msgid "Find a gun if you can, make it quick…"
msgstr "Prenez une arme à feu si vous peux, finissez-ça plus vite…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
msgid "Well…?  Did you… finish things for my mom?"
msgstr "Eh bien? Est-ce que vous avez… pris les choses en main au sujet de ma mère?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Bear"
msgid "Thank you.  I couldn't rest until I knew that was finished."
msgstr ""
"Merci.  Je ne pouvais pas me reposer avant de savoir que cette chose était "
"morte."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Bear"
msgid "Really… that's too bad."
msgstr "Vraiment…  dommage."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Null mission"
msgstr "Mission nulle"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Reach Farm House"
msgstr "Atteindre la ferme"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
msgid "I just need a place to start over…"
msgstr "Il me faut juste un endroit pour tout recommencer…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
msgid ""
"I've accepted that everyone I used to know is dead… one way or another.  I "
"really wish I could have done something to save my brother but he was one of "
"the first to go.  I'd like to start over, just rebuild at one of the farms in "
"the countryside.  Can you help me secure one?"
msgstr ""
"J'ai accepté que tout ceux que j'ai connu sont morts... d'une manière ou "
"d'une autre. J'espérais vraiment pouvoir sauver mon frère. J'aimerais tout "
"recommencer, reconstruire ma vie dans une ferme loin des villes. Vous "
"m'aideriez?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
msgid ""
"Thank you, let's find a remote one so we don't have to worry about many "
"zombies."
msgstr "Merci, trouvons en une loin pour ne pas avoir a se préocuper des zombies."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
msgid "Please, I just don't know what to do otherwise."
msgstr "S'il vous plait, Je ne sais vraiment pas quoi faire sinon."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
msgid "Traveling the backroads would be a good way to search for one."
msgstr "Suivre les routes isolées est un bon moyen d'en trouver."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
msgid "Shall we keep looking for a farm house?"
msgstr "Devons nous continuer à chercher une ferme?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
msgid ""
"Well, my adventuring days are over.  I can't thank you enough.  Trying to "
"make this place self sustaining will take some work but the future is looking "
"brighter.  At least it ought to be safe for now.  You'll always be welcome "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Et bien, mon aventure s'arrête ici. Je ne vous remercierais jamais assez. "
"Rendre cet endroit suffisant à lui même va demander pas mal de travail, mais "
"l'avenir est déjà plus prometteur. Au moins il est relativement tranquille "
"pour l'instant. Vous serez toujours le bienvenu ici."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
msgid "I guess it was just a pipe dream."
msgstr "Je suppose que ce n'était qu'une illusion."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/refugee_caravans.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Reach FEMA Camp"
msgstr "Atteindre le camp de la FEMA"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
msgid "Maybe they escaped to one of the camps…"
msgstr "Peut-être se sont-ils réfugiés dans un des camps…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
msgid ""
"I can't thank you enough for bringing me the patient records but I do have "
"another request.  You seem to know your way around… could you take me to one "
"of the FEMA camps?  I know some were overrun but I don't want to believe all "
"of them could have fallen."
msgstr ""
"Je ne peux pas vous remercier assez pour m'avoir apporté les dossiers des "
"patients mais j'ai une autre requête. Vous sembler connaître les environs... "
"Pouvez vous m'emmener à un des camps FEMA? Je sais que certains ont été "
"envahis mais je ne peux pas croire qu'ils soient tous tombés. "

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
msgid "Thank you, just bring me to the camp… I just want to see."
msgstr "Merci, amènez-moi juste au camp… je veux juste voir."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
msgid "Please, I don't know what else to do."
msgstr "S'il vous plait, je ne sais pas quoi faire d'autre."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
msgid "We should go at night, if it is overrun then we can quickly make our escape."
msgstr "On devrait y aller de nuit, s'il a été envahi on pourra s'échapper plus vite."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
msgid "Any leads on where a camp might be?"
msgstr "Où pourrait-t-on trouver un camp?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
msgid "I guess this wasn't as bright an idea as I thought."
msgstr "J'imagine que c'était pas une idée aussi lumineuse que je pensais."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Reach Safety"
msgstr "Atteignez un Lieu Sûr"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Recover Priest's Diary"
msgstr "Récupérer le journal du prêtre"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
msgid ""
"Find something that may reveal what the church's stance is on these events.  "
"Something like <color_yellow>a priest's diary</color> would suffice."
msgstr ""
"Trouvez quelque chose qui pourrait révéler la position de l'Église sur ces "
"événements.  Quelque chose comme <color_yellow>le journal d'un prêtre</color> "
"suffirait.  "

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
msgid ""
"From what I understand, the creatures you encountered surrounding this relic "
"were unlike anything I've heard of.  It is laughable that I now consider the "
"living dead to be part of our ordinary reality.  Never-the-less, the church "
"must have some explanation for these events.  I have located the residence of "
"a local clergy man, could you go to this address and recover any items that "
"may reveal what the church's stance is on these events?"
msgstr ""
"De ce que j'ai pu comprendre, les créatures qui protégeaient cette relique ne "
"ressemblaient a rien que je ne connaisse. C'est amusant de devoir considérer "
"que les mort-vivants font désormais partie de notre réalité. Cependant "
"l'église doit avoir des réponses sur ces événements. J'ai localisé la maison "
"d'un prêtre local, vous pourriez aller à cette addresse et ramener tout "
"indice que l'église aurait sur ces événements?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
msgid ""
"If the information is confidential the priest must have it hidden within his "
"own home."
msgstr "Si l'information est confidentielle le prêtre a dû la cacher dans sa maison."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
msgid "Thank you, a diary is exactly what I was looking for."
msgstr "Merci, un journal est exactement ce que je cherchais."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Recruit Tracker"
msgstr "Recrutez le Traqueur"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Recruit Tracker"
msgid ""
"Go to the cabin in the woods where the Tracker is camping and "
"<color_yellow>recruit them</color>."
msgstr ""
"Rendez-vous à la cabane dans les bois où campe le⸱a Traqueur⸱se et "
"<color_yellow>recrutez-les</color>."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
msgid ""
"We've got another problem to deal with but I don't think we can handle it on "
"our own.  So, I sent word out and found us a volunteer… of sorts.  He's vain "
"as hell but has a little skill with firearms.  He was supposed to collect "
"whatever he had of value and is going to meet us at a cabin in the woods.  "
"Wasn't sure how long we were going to be so I told him to just camp there "
"until we picked him up."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons un autre problème à résoudre, mais je ne pense pas que nous "
"puissions le résoudre seuls.  Alors, j'ai envoyé un message et nous avons "
"trouvé un bénévole… de quelque sorte.  Il⸱Elle est vaniteux⸱se comme l'Enfer "
"mais a un peu d'habileté avec les armes à feu.  Il⸱Elle était censé⸱e "
"récupérer tout ce qu'il⸱elle avait de valeur et va nous rejoindre dans une "
"cabane dans les bois.  Je ne savais pas combien de temps nous allions "
"prendre, alors je lui ai dit de camper là jusqu'à ce que nous le récupérions."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
msgid ""
"Roger, if he's a no-show then any other gunslinger will do… but I doubt he'll "
"quit before we even begin."
msgstr ""
"Roger, s'il ne se présente pas, n'importe quel autre flingueur fera "
"l'affaire… mais je doute qu'il abandonne avant même que nous ayons commencé."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
msgid ""
"I hope the bastard is packing heat… else we'll need to grab him a gun before "
"we hit our next target."
msgstr ""
"J'espère que ce⸱tte bâtard⸱e est armé⸱e… sinon nous devrons lui donner une "
"arme avant d'atteindre notre prochaine cible."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
msgid "Found a gunslinger?"
msgstr "Tu as trouvé un mercenaire?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
msgid ""
"Great, just let me know when you are ready to wade knee-deep in an ocean of "
"blood."
msgstr ""
"Super, faites-moi savoir quand vous serez prêt·e à patauger jusqu'aux genoux "
"dans un océan de sang."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find Lost Dog"
msgstr "Retrouver un chien perdu"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
msgid "Oh, my poor puppy…"
msgstr "Oh, mon pauvre chiot…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
msgid "I left my poor dog in a house, not far from here.  Can you retrieve it?"
msgstr ""
"J'ai laissé mon pauvre chien à la maison, pas loin d'ici. Est-ce que vous "
"pouvez aller le chercher?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
msgid "Thank you!  Please hurry back!"
msgstr "Merci! Revenez vite!"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
msgid "Please, think of my poor little puppy!"
msgstr "S'il vou plaît! Pensez au pauvre chien!"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
msgid ""
"Take my dog whistle; if the dog starts running off, blow it and he'll return "
"to your side."
msgstr ""
"Prenez ce sifflet à ultrasons. Si le chien s'éloigne, sifflez et il reviendra "
"vers vous."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
msgid "Have you found my dog yet?"
msgstr "Avez-vous déjà trouvé mon chien?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
msgid "Thank you so much for finding him!"
msgstr "Merci mille fois de l'avoir ramené"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
msgid "Oh no!  My poor puppy…"
msgstr "Oh non!  Mon pauvre petit chien…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
msgstr "Rentrez à l'intérieur de l'armurerie et récupérez la photo de famille"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
msgid "I need you to get my family photo from the armory safe."
msgstr ""
"J'ai besoin que vous récupériez ma photo de famille que j'ai laissé dans le "
"coffre fort de l'armurerie."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
msgid ""
"I left the only photo I have from my family in the armory.  I don't have the "
"code, can you get in?"
msgstr ""
"J'ai laissé la seule photo de ma famille que j'ai dans le coffre fort de "
"l'armurerie. Je ne connais pas le code qui l'ouvre, est-ce que vous pouvez la "
"récupérer pour moi?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve valued
#. possession"
msgid "Thanks, it's great to see someone willing to help a out."
msgstr ""
"Merci, ça fait plaisir de voire qu'il y a toujours des gens prêts à aider "
"leur prochain de nos jours."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve valued
#. possession"
msgid ""
"Well, I'll find someone else to do it for me, real shame with all those guns "
"locked up too…"
msgstr ""
"Je trouverais bien quelqu'un de plus intéressé, dommage pour vous, il y a "
"comme même beaucoup d'armes à feu dans ce coffre fort en plus de la photo…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve valued
#. possession"
msgid "You look like a resourceful sort, maybe you can hack it or something."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez l'air d'être débrouillard, peut être que vous pourriez hacker le "
"verrou ou quelque chose comme ça?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
msgid "Got the photo?  Should've been in my gun safe."
msgstr "Vous avez la photo? Elle devait être quelque part dans le coffre fort."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve valued
#. possession"
msgid "Thanks!  I'll be sure to put in a good word for you around town."
msgstr "Merci!  Je n'oublierait pas de dire un bon mot de vous en ville."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_missions.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Smokes, let's go."
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve valued
#. possession"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Go into deep woods to retrieve family seeds"
msgid "OK, then hand it over."
msgstr "Ok, passe le moi."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Smokes, let's go."
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Go into deep woods to retrieve family seeds"
msgid "Shit happens."
msgstr "C'est la Vie."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
msgstr "Prouvez votre valeur à Foodperson"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
msgid ""
"Prove your dedication to the Foodperson and Foodplace as a whole by finding "
"<color_yellow>10 Foodplace loyalty cards</color>."
msgstr ""
"Prouvez votre dévouement à l'égard de Foodperson et de Foodplace dans son "
"ensemble en trouvant <color_yellow>10 cartes de fidélité Foodplace</color>."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
msgid "Prove your dedication to Foodplace."
msgstr "Prouvez votre dévouement à Foodplace."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
msgid ""
"Show me the proof of your loyalty to the great Foodplace, and I'll consider "
"you worthy of my friendship.  Ten loyalty cards should be enough, I'm sure "
"you already have much more than that waiting for you at home, right?"
msgstr ""
"Montrez-moi la preuve de votre loyauté envers Foodplace, et je vous "
"considérerai digne de mon amitié.  Dix cartes de fidélité devraient suffire, "
"je suis sûr que vous en avez déjà bien plus qui vous attendent chez vous, non?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
msgid "That's the spirit!  Good luck kid."
msgstr "C'est l'idée!  Bonne chance, gamin·e."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
msgid "That's alright not everyone is cutout for this."
msgstr "Ce n'est pas grave, tout le monde n'est pas fait pour ça."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
msgid ""
"Those are very precious, people would probably keep them on their person or "
"in bank vaults.  And definitely not throw them in the trash!"
msgstr ""
"Ceux-ci sont très précieux, les gens les gardent probablement sur eux ou dans "
"des coffres-forts bancaires.  Et surtout ne les jetez pas à la poubelle!"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
msgid "How is it going?  Do you have them?"
msgstr "Comment ça se passe?  Est-ce que vous avez ce que j'ai démandé?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
msgid ""
"YES!  I knew you could do it!  You proved your worth and I'm proud to call "
"you a friend."
msgstr ""
"OUI!  Je savais que vous pouviez le faire!  Vous avez prouvé votre valeur et "
"je suis fier·ère de vous appeler un⸱e ami⸱e."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
msgid "Well… where are they?"
msgstr "Eh bien… où sont-ils?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
msgid "I'm so disappointed in you kid…"
msgstr "Vous me décevez terriblement, gamin⸱e…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Prove You're A Survivor"
msgstr "Prouvez que Vous Êtes Un⸱e Survivant⸱e"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
msgid ""
"Prove you're a survivor by surviving for 10 days after the Cataclysm, and "
"then returning to the person who gave you this mission."
msgstr ""
"Prouvez que vous êtes un⸱e survivant⸱e en survivant 10 jours après le "
"Cataclysme, puis en retournant à la personne qui vous a confié·e cette "
"mission."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
msgid "It's hard to tell who actually has the skills to survive these days…"
msgstr ""
"Il est difficile de dire qui possède réellement les compétences nécessaires "
"pour survivre de nos jours…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
msgid ""
"It's hard surviving out here on our own, and we'd probably have a better "
"chance working together.  Problem is, I don't really know you and what you're "
"capable of.  You might have what it takes, or you might not.  Either way, I'm "
"going to need some proof.  Come back in a few days and I'll gladly follow "
"you.  It's basically a win-win for me: either you come back and I'll know "
"you've got what it takes, or you don't and I'll know that I was right not to "
"follow you."
msgstr ""
"Il est difficile de survivre seul, et nous aurions probablement plus de "
"chances de travailler ensemble.  Le problème est que je ne vous connais pas "
"vraiment ni de quoi vous êtes capable.  Vous pourriez avoir ce qu’il faut, ou "
"pas.  Quoi qu'il en soit, j'ai besoin d'une preuve.  Revenez dans quelques "
"jours et je vous suivrai avec plaisir.  C'est fondamentalement "
"gagnant-gagnant pour moi: soit vous revenez et je saurai que vous avez ce "
"qu'il faut, ou je ne vous revoie jamais je saurais que j'ai eu raison de ne "
"pas vous suivre."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
msgid "I'll see you then… or I won't, and then I'll know I made the right decision."
msgstr ""
"A la revoyure alors… ou peut être pas, et dans ce cas là je saurai que j'ai "
"pris la bonne décision."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
msgid "Don't die.  If you're asking me for advice, that doesn't bode well for you."
msgstr ""
"Ne mourrez pas.  Devoir me demander des conseils n’augure rien de bon pour "
"vous."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
msgid "Well, you're not dead… yet."
msgstr "Hé bien, vous n'êtes pas encore mort⸱e… pour l'instant."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
msgid ""
"I'll be honest, I wasn't really expecting to see you again.  A promise is a "
"promise, I'll follow you now!"
msgstr ""
"Pour être honnête, je ne m'attendais pas vraiment à vous revoir.  Une "
"promesse est une promesse, je vous suis maintenant!"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
msgid "I know time is relative and all that."
msgstr "Je sais que le temps est relatif et tout ça."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
msgid "I'm not quite sure how you failed to survive AND are talking to me."
msgstr ""
"Je ne suis pas vraiment sûr(e) comment est-ce que vous êtes à la fois en "
"train de me parler ET avez échoué à survivre."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
msgstr "Rassemblez des tiges de quenouilles pour créer de la gelée"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
msgid ""
"Gather <color_light_blue>60 cattail stalks</color> from the swamp and bring "
"them back to <color_light_red>learn how to craft cattail jelly</color>.  "
"Raise your <color_light_blue>survival skill to at least 1</color> by "
"harvesting cattail stalks.  <color_light_blue>Bring back the provided bag "
"with the 60 cattail stalks in them</color> as well."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
msgid ""
"Medical services are a little sparse following <the_cataclysm>, but people "
"have been surviving using their wits and the bounty of Mother Nature for a "
"long time.  Care to learn a little?"
msgstr ""
"Les services médicaux sont un peu rares suite à/au <the_cataclysm>, mais les "
"gens survivent depuis longtemps grâce à leur intelligence et aux bienfaits de "
"Mère Nature.  Envie d'en apprendre un peu?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
msgid ""
"Did you know that cattails are a source of a jelly that works as an "
"antiseptic and analgesic?  Something like that is likely to be mighty helpful "
"out here.  I want you to take this bag, head to the nearest swamp, collect 60 "
"cattail stalks, and bring them back here.  In exchange, I'll show you how to "
"harvest the jelly."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
msgid ""
"Great!  <color_yellow>This bag should be big enough to hold all of the stalks "
"we'll need.  Don't forget to bring it back.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk_fluff.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Your loss."
msgstr "Tant pis pour vous."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
msgid "The cattails grow in the fresh water in swamps.  You can't miss them."
msgstr ""
"Les quenouilles poussent dans les marais, il devrait y en avoir assez dans "
"n'importe lequel."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
msgid ""
"Got those cattail stalks yet?  Don't forget to <color_yellow>bring back my "
"bag with the stalks in them</color> and to work on improving your survival "
"skill as well."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
msgid "Great!  Hand them over and I'll show you how this works."
msgstr "Super!  Donnez-les moi et je vais vous montrer comment cela fonctionne."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
msgid "OK, then hand them over."
msgstr "Ok, passez les moi."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
msgid "Well, that's a shame."
msgstr "Hé bien, c'est dommage."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid "You learn how to craft cattail jelly."
msgstr "Vous apprenez comment fabriquer de la gelée de quenouille."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Angry pyromaniac"
msgstr "Pyromane en colère"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Angry pyromaniac"
msgid ""
"Bring the pyromaniac to <color_light_blue>their rival's house</color> and "
"don't forget to <color_yellow>bring at least 200 units of gasoline</color>.  "
"After you got there, talk to the pyromaniac to start burning the house."
msgstr ""
"Amenez le pyromane à <color_light_blue>la maison de son rival</color> et "
"n'oubliez pas <color_yellow>d'apporter au moins 200 unités d'essence</color>. "
"Une fois sur place, parlez au pyromane pour qu'il commence à brûler la maison."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pyromaniac"
msgid "Oh man, I want to fucking burn it so bad…"
msgstr "Ahlala, j'ai tellement envie de brûler ce truc…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pyromaniac"
msgid ""
"I'm so fucking infuriated!  I've got an enemy that ruined my life, and now I "
"want to get revenge!  I don't care about <the_cataclysm>, I just want to burn "
"his house!  Would you help me, <name_g>?"
msgstr ""
"Je suis tellement en colère ! J'ai un ennemi qui a ruiné ma vie, et "
"maintenant je veux me venger ! Je m'en fiche du <the_cataclysm>, je veux "
"juste brûler sa maison ! Voulez-vous m'aider, <name_g> ?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pyromaniac"
msgid ""
"Good.  Let's go to his house and goddamn burn it down!  Oh, by the way, could "
"you bring gasoline with you, <name_g>?  I was so angry I forgot to bring it "
"with me…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pyromaniac"
msgid "Seriously?  It's such an easy job…"
msgstr "Sérieusement?  C'est un boulot tellement facile…"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pyromaniac"
msgid "Maybe we can find some gasoline at a gas station."
msgstr "Peut être que nous pouvons trouver du carburant à une station essence."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pyromaniac"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pizzaiolo"
msgid "Are you ready, <name_g>?"
msgstr "Êtes-vous prêt(e) <name_g>?"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pyromaniac"
msgid ""
"Sweet, sweet revenge!  Ah, smells so nice!  Feels like the smell of napalm in "
"the morning!  All his stuff, and probably even that <name_b>, will burn to "
"ashes in a matter of minutes.  You helped me get my revenge, so I'll follow "
"you to the end, <name_g>!"
msgstr ""
"Douce, douce vengeance!  Ah, ça sent si bon!  C'est comme l'odeur du napalm "
"le matin!  Toutes ses affaires, et probablement même <name_b>, vont être "
"réduites en cendres en quelques minutes.  Vous m'avez aidé à me venger, alors "
"je vous suivrai jusqu'au bout <name_g>!"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pyromaniac"
msgid "Wow, you failed?  How…"
msgstr "Vous avez échoué? Comment est-ce que vous auriez possiblement pu faire cela???"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Investigate Strange Location"
msgstr "Investiguer Lieu Étrange"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Investigate Strange Location"
msgid ""
"You could find this place upside down, dizzy and blindfolded.  Its presence "
"is too altered to allow the mercy of ignorance."
msgstr ""
"Vous pourriez trouver cet endroit à l'envers, étourdi⸱e et les yeux bandés.  "
"Sa présence est trop altérée pour permettre la clémence de l'ignorance."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Center of the storm"
msgstr "Centre de la tempête"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Center of the storm"
msgid ""
"This is the center of the portal storm, you could find it upside down, dizzy "
"and blindfolded.  Its presence is too altered to allow the mercy of ignorance."
msgstr ""
"Ceci est le centre de la tempête dimensionnelle, vous pourriez le trouver à "
"l'envers, étourdi⸱e et les yeux bandés.  Sa présence est trop altérée pour "
"pour permettre la clémence de l'ignorance."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Faction succession"
msgstr "Succession de faction"

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Faction succession"
msgid ""
"You have some time left until you can transfer control to your companions, "
"provided you have <color_yellow>established a Basecamp</color> and "
"<color_yellow>have at least 1 NPC companion</color>."
msgstr ""
"Il vous reste un peu de temps avant de pouvoir transférer le contrôle à vos "
"compagnons, à condition <color_yellow>d'avoir établi un Camp de Base</color> "
"et <color_yellow>d'avoir au moins un compagnon PNJ</color>."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_FACTION_SUCCESSION_IMMEDIATE"
msgid ""
"You've been badly wounded.  It might be better to rest for a while and let "
"someone else scavenge.  (Changing characters is now available at any camp "
"board.)"
msgstr ""

