#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
