#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Any jobs you need done?"
msgstr "Vous avez un job à me donner?"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "It's nice to see you again <u_name>.  What can I do for you?"
msgstr "C'est chouette de vous revoir, <u_name>. Que puis-je faire pour vous ?"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Nice to meet you too, I'm <u_name>."
msgstr "C'est un plaisir de vous rencontrer, je m'appelle <u_name>."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hands up!  Hand over everything you've got, and nobody gets hurt!"
msgstr ""
"Les mains en l'air ! Donnez-moi tout ce que vous avez, et personne ne sera "
"blessé !"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "So, what can I do for you?"
msgstr "Donc, qu'est ce que je peux faire pour vous?"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, I'm still gathering resources and cooking new stuff.  Maybe "
"ask again after <interval>."
msgstr ""
"Malheureusement, je suis encore en train de rassembler des ressources et de "
"cuisiner de nouveaux produits. Peut-être re-demandez après <interval>."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Alright.  thanks nonetheless."
msgstr "D'accord, mais merci quand même."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_computers.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hmm."
msgstr "Hmm."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm out of some things, <name_g>.  It takes a while to source the good stuff "
"- days usually - but I'm working hard to replace it.  What can I get you in "
"the meantime?"
msgstr ""
"Je suis à court de certaines choses, <name_g>. Il faut un certain temps pour "
"se procurer les bonnes choses - plusieurs jours en général - mais je "
"m'efforce de les remplacer. Que puis-je vous offrir en attendant ?"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'll see what I've got around here for you.  I've gotta warn you: it's gonna "
"be expensive.  Hard to stay supplied in the apocalypse, you know.  What do "
"you need?"
msgstr ""
"Je vais voir ce que j'ai ici pour vous. Je dois vous prévenir : ça va coûter "
"cher. Difficile de rester approvisionné pendant l'apocalypse, vous savez. De "
"quoi avez-vous besoin ?"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[10$]  I'll buy some bandages."
msgstr "[10$]  J'aimerais acheter des pansements."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[40$]  I'll buy some aspirin."
msgstr "[40$]  J'aimerais acheter de l'aspirine."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[50$]  I'll buy some sprayable fungicide."
msgstr "[50$] J'aimerais acheter du fongicide pulvérisable."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[50$]  I'll buy some powder fungicide."
msgstr "[50$] J'aimerais acheter du fongicide en poudre."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[50$]  I'll buy some disinfectant."
msgstr "[50$]  J'aimerais acheter du désinfectant."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[120$]  I'll buy some antibiotics."
msgstr "[120$]  J'aimerais acheter des antibiotiques."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[140$]  I'll buy some antifungal drugs."
msgstr "[140$] J'aimerais acheter des médicament antifongiques."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[200$]  I'll buy some black gunpowder."
msgstr "[200$] J'aimerais acheter de la poudre noire."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[300$]  I'll buy some napalm."
msgstr "[300$]  J'aimerais acheter du napalm."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Is there anything else you need?"
msgstr "Vous avez besoin de quelque chose d'autre?"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "No, that's all."
msgstr "Non c'est tout."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/NPC_Elvira_Fish.json
#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#. ~ Appears in the Great Library as essentially a shopkeeper.  Faction
#. critical.
msgid "Elvira Fish"
msgstr "Elvira Fish"

#: data/json/npcs/campus/NPC_Elvira_Fish.json
#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#. ~ Appears in the Great Library as essentially a shopkeeper.  Faction
#. critical.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Elvira is a young librarian, one of the few surviving librarians from
#. before.  She is also heir to the fabulous Fish fortune, but she threw that
#. all away to pursue her passion for library science.
msgid "Circulations"
msgstr "Circulations"

#: data/json/npcs/campus/NPC_Elvira_Fish.json
#. ~ Job description of "Circulations" NPC class
#. ~ Elvira is a young librarian, one of the few surviving librarians from
#. before.  She is also heir to the fabulous Fish fortune, but she threw that
#. all away to pursue her passion for library science.
msgid "I'm a librarian."
msgstr "Je suis une libraire."

