#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_line.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Snippet in category "<whats_up>"
#. ~ Friendly or neutral greetings.
msgid "What's your story?"
msgstr "Quelle est votre histoire?"

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Have you heard anything about the rest of the world?"
msgstr "Avez-vous entendu parler du reste du monde ?"

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Some, here and there.  My responsibilities keep me here but I have spoken "
"with traveling merchants.  They thought we wanted guns and were confused that "
"we wished to trade books for books.  I must assume that most of the other "
"survivors are more violent and less scholarly."
msgstr ""
"Un peu, ici et là. Mes responsabilités me retiennent ici, mais j'ai parlé "
"avec des marchands ambulants. Ils pensaient que nous voulions des armes et "
"étaient que nous voulions échanger des livres contre d'autres livres. Je dois "
"supposer que la plupart des autres survivants sont plus violents et moins "
"érudits."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Are there any other settlements around?"
msgstr "Il y a d'autres communautés dans les environs?"

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "That's fine for now."
msgstr "C'est bon pour le moment."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Yes we are.  We still have some of our original collection, but far too much "
"of it was stolen or destroyed, and of course it was far from complete even "
"before.  Some of us go out to try and rebuild the collection from towns "
"nearby, but mostly we rely on people passing through like you.  We especially "
"want anything rare and hard to find."
msgstr ""
"Oui, c'est le cas. Il nous reste une partie de notre collection d'origine, "
"mais une trop grande partie a été volée ou détruite, et bien sûr, elle était "
"déjà loin d'être complète. Certains d'entre nous vont essayer de reconstituer "
"la collection dans les villes voisines, mais nous comptons surtout sur les "
"gens de passage comme vous. Nous recherchons tout particulièrement les objets "
"rares et difficiles à trouver."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_DOCTOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll keep that in mind."
msgstr "Je garderai ça en tête."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*frowning.  \"Listen, we are doing our best here.  Most of our original staff "
"is gone and people keep stealing and breaking things for no reason.  We're "
"just trying to protect some information for the future.\""
msgstr ""
"*froncement de sourcils. \"Ecoutez, nous faisons de notre mieux ici. La "
"plupart de notre personnel d'origine est parti et les gens continuent de "
"voler et de casser des choses sans raison. Nous essayons juste de protéger "
"certaines informations pour l'avenir. \""

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Okay, I'm sorry."
msgstr "Ok, le suis désolé(e)."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "But why bother then?"
msgstr "Mais pourquoi s'embêter alors ?"

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "*deep breath, tired smile.  \"How else can I help you?\""
msgstr ""
"*inspire profondément, fait un sourire fatigué. \"Y-a-t'il un autre moyen de "
"vous aider ?"

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*frowning, grimacing.  \"I don't know.  It's.  I can't talk about this right "
"now.\""
msgstr ""
"*fronce les sourcils, grimace. « Je ne sais pas. Je ne peux pas en parler "
"maintenant. »"

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Of course, I'm sorry."
msgstr "Bien sûr, pardon."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Oh.  Um.  I guess I like stories.  And quiet."
msgstr "Oh. Hum. J'imagine que j'aime les histoires. Et le calme."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How did you end up here?"
msgstr "Comment est-ce que vous vous êtes retrouvé(e) ici?"

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Oh, well I took a job here about a year before <the_cataclysm>, and I was "
"living alone when things got bad and I thought I might be safer here with "
"work friends.  My friends Beatrice and Ross and I got some supplies ready and "
"then more people started to join us.  And then it got bad.  But I think that "
"has settled down some now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Oh.  Um.  I don't.  I don't think that makes sense right now.  I have enough "
"help here, and we.  Maybe when things are more settled but not now.  But you "
"might ask others if they need help."
msgstr ""
"Oh.  Hum.  Je ne…  Je ne pense pas que cela ait un sens pour le moment.  J'ai "
"assez d'aide ici, et nous.  Peut-être quand les choses seront plus établies, "
"mais pas maintenant.  Mais vous pourriez demander aux autres s'ils ont besoin "
"d'aide."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Another time, then."
msgstr "Un autre jour dans ce cas là."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm useful!  I have skills!"
msgstr "Je suis utile!  J'ai des compétences!"

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Maybe I could change your mind…?~"
msgstr "Peut être que je pourrais vous faire changer d'avis…?~"

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Um.  Right, I guess you made it this far.  But.  Really I don't have "
"something right now.  But really if you could find some books to trade us "
"that would be great.  We really should be rebuilding the collection.  Really. "
" Um."
msgstr ""
"Hum. Bon, je suppose que vous êtes arrivé jusqu'ici. Mais... Vraiment, je "
"n'ai rien pour l'instant. Mais si vous pouviez trouver des livres à nous "
"échanger, ce serait super. Nous devrions vraiment reconstituer notre "
"collection. Vraiment. Euh..."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Um.  Well.  You shouldn't.  I shouldn't.  Um.  I don't.  Let's talk about "
"something else."
msgstr "Hum. Ok . Tu devrais pas. Je ne devrais pas. Hum. Non. Parlons d'autre chose."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Yes, so I hear.  One trader I talked to said they have a whole market "
"somewhere with all kinds of useful things.  Not a lot of books though, it "
"sounds like."
msgstr ""
"De ce que j'entends oui. Un marchand à qui j'ai parlé m'a dit qu'ils ont un "
"endroit où échanger quelques part remplis de choses utiles. Pas beaucoup de "
"livres par contre j'ai l'impression."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Trying to keep the library here in good order.  She's seen some hard times "
"recently and needs a lot of love.  Past that, well…I guess it would be good "
"to get the rest of the campus cleaned up.  That's what Jack wants to do but "
"we don't have any guns and we don't want to.  I know Callista wants to get "
"classes going again as soon as possible though I imagine we have some "
"problems with the academic interests of the students still with us and the "
"teachers we have left."
msgstr ""
"J'essaie de maintenir la bibliothèque en bon état. Elle a connu des moments "
"difficiles récemment et a besoin de beaucoup d'amour. Après cela, eh bien... "
"je suppose qu'il serait bon de nettoyer le reste du campus. C'est ce que Jack "
"veut faire, mais nous n'avons pas d'armes et nous ne voulons pas en avoir. Je "
"sais que Callista veut que les cours reprennent dès que possible, mais "
"j'imagine que nous avons quelques problèmes avec les intérêts académiques des "
"étudiants qui sont encore avec nous et les professeurs qui nous restent."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You're really just going to keep going like nothing happened?"
msgstr "Tu vas juste faire comme si de rien n'était ?"

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I hope it works out for you."
msgstr "J'espère que ça va marcher pour toi."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*frowning.  \"It's not.  I'm not saying nothing happened.  We lost a lot.  I "
"lost a lot.  We just need to go forward.  We need to put things back together "
"and help people.  That's why this place is here.  What else would we do?  We "
"can't give up too."
msgstr ""
"*en fronçant les sourcils. « Ce n'est pas ça. Je ne dis pas qu'il ne s'est "
"rien passé. Nous avons perdu beaucoup. J'ai beaucoup perdu. Nous devons juste "
"aller de l'avant. Nous devons reprendre les choses en main et aider les gens. "
"C'est la raison d'être de cet endroit. Que ferions-nous d'autre ? Nous ne "
"pouvons pas non plus abandonner."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Oh, we did have a President, Mx. Rose.  As things were starting to get bad "
"they locked themself into the administrative building with all of the senior "
"staff.  It's a good thing too because that building is full of the dead now, "
"just like the rest except the library here.  For now everyone is still trying "
"to operate under the old library structure, so I guess I'm in charge now as "
"the most senior library staff left, though we have some survivors here from "
"the other buildings from other divisions.  Callista Rupp from Academics is "
"here, she taught physics.  I think she was at MIT for a while.  And Jack "
"Springer from Facilities is here too, he's probably the only really practical "
"person here, very handy!  It was his idea to board up the other buildings."
msgstr ""
"Oh, nous avons eu un président, Mx. Rose. Lorsque les choses ont commencé à "
"se gâter, elle s'est enfermée dans le bâtiment administratif avec tous les "
"cadres supérieurs. C'est une bonne chose, car ce bâtiment est maintenant "
"plein de morts, tout comme le reste, à l'exception de la bibliothèque. Pour "
"l'instant, tout le monde essaie encore de fonctionner selon l'ancienne "
"structure de la bibliothèque, alors je suppose que c'est moi qui suis en "
"charge maintenant en tant qu'employé le plus ancien de la bibliothèque, bien "
"qu'il y ait quelques survivants des autres bâtiments d'autres divisions. "
"Callista Rupp, du service académique, est ici, elle enseignait la physique. "
"Je crois qu'elle a travaillé au MIT pendant un certain temps. Jack Springer, "
"de la division Facilities, est également présent. Il est probablement la "
"seule personne vraiment opérationnelle ici, il est très bricoleur ! C'est lui "
"qui a eu l'idée de barricader les autres bâtiments."

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&You see this crazed fellows eyes darting around anxiously, always "
"anticipating impending doom.  Every now and then you can even hear them "
"whimper in fear.  Although they do not seem aggressive, they definitely are "
"out of their mind."
msgstr ""
"Vous voyez ce type aux yeux fous regarder autour de lui avec anxiété, "
"toujours en train d'anticiper un malheur imminent. De temps en temps, on peut "
"même l'entendre gémir de peur. Bien qu'il ne semble pas agressif, il est "
"certainement à côté de la plaque."

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You need to get to safety!"
msgstr "Vous devez vous mettre à l'abri !"

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Awkwardly distance yourself.]"
msgstr "[Prend ses distance bizarrement.]"

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "&They shriek and stumble backwards, as if you just became a threat."
msgstr ""
"Ils poussent des cris et reculent en trébuchant, comme si vous veniez de "
"devenir une menace."

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm gonna kill all these <freaking> things!"
msgstr "Je vais buter toutes ces <freaking> de choses !"

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "&They let out a bellowing warcry and wave their knife."
msgstr "&Pousse un cri de guerre et brandit son couteau."

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'M INVINCIBLE!"
msgstr "JE SUIS INVINCIBLE!"

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Are you crazy?  Get out of here!"
msgstr "T'es pas bien ? Sort de là !"

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Leave them to their futile fight.]"
msgstr "[Laissez-les à leur combat futile.]"

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Like hell I will!"
msgstr "Bien sûr !"

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Fuck that, I'm not going out like a coward!"
msgstr "La merde, je sortirais pas comme un(e) lâche !"

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Stand aside citizen, I'll handle this!"
msgstr "Écarte-toi, citoyen, je m'en occupe !"

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Don't worry, I'm with the police<punc>"
msgstr "Ne t'inquiète pas, je suis de la police <punc>"

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&The officer scans the area, looking for trouble.  They have a dangerous "
"glint in their eyes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Back away.]"
msgstr "[Reculez.]"

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm gonna kill all these <swear> things!"
msgstr "Je vais buter tout ces <swear> de trucs !"

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "&They let out a bellowing warcry and wave their gun."
msgstr "&Pousse un cri de guerre et brandit son arme à feu."

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&They are still breathing but unable to move and speak.  You are unsure if "
"they are even fully conscious and yet shudder at the thought of being trapped "
"inside your body."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Leave them to their ultimate fate.]"
msgstr "[Les abandonner à leur destin tragique.]"

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "No!  I just know it, they are still alive!"
msgstr "Non ! je le sais, iels sont encore en vie !"

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Let them keep on searching.]"
msgstr "[Laissez-les continuer de chercher.]"

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Have you seen my child?"
msgstr "Vous avez vu mon enfant?"

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I am not leaving without my little one!"
msgstr "Je ne pars pas sans mon enfant !"

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Where is my kid?"
msgstr "Où est mon enfant?"

#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Your child is likely dead by now and you should get to safety!"
msgstr "Votre enfant est probablement mort, vous devriez vous mettre à l’abri !"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "No, just no…"
msgstr "Non, juste non…"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Just let me sleep, <name_b>!"
msgstr "Laissez moi dormir, <name_b>!"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Make it quick, I want to go back to sleep."
msgstr "Faites vite, j'aimerairs retourner dormir."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Just few minutes more…"
msgstr "Encore quelques minutes…"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Anything to do before I go to sleep?"
msgstr "Quelque chose à faire avant que j'aille dormir?"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Wake up!"
msgstr "Debout!"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Go back to sleep."
msgstr "Retournez dormir."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"This character was previously put into a suspension state due to an AI bug.  "
"If you have reason to believe the problem was fixed, you can wake them up.  "
"Do you want to do that now?"
msgstr ""
"Ce personnage a été précédemment mis en état de suspension en raison d'un bug "
"de l'IA. Si vous avez des raisons de croire que le problème a été réglé, vous "
"pouvez le réveiller. Voulez-vous faire ça maintenant ?"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Yes, wake up!"
msgstr "Oui, réveille toi !"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "No, go back to sleep."
msgstr "Non, retourne dormir."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OVERRIDES.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OVERRIDES.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid " *pshhhttt* I'm reading you boss, over."
msgstr "*pshhhttt* Je vous reçois patron, terminé."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OVERRIDES.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OVERRIDES.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "What is it, friend?"
msgstr "Qu'y a-t-il, mon ami·e?"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[rules] Let's talk about how we'll work together."
msgstr "[Règles] Parlons de la manière dont on va travailler ensemble."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like to know a bit more about your abilities."
msgstr "J'aimerais en savoir un peu plus sur vos compétences."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Please go to this location."
msgstr "Veuillez vous rendre à cet endroit."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "There's something I want you to do."
msgstr "Il y a quelque chose que je veux que vous fassiez."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I just wanted to talk for a bit."
msgstr "Je voulais juste parler un peu."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can you help me understand something?  (HELP/TUTORIAL)"
msgstr "Pouvez-vous m'aider à comprendre quelque chose?  (AIDE/TUTORIEL)"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[DEBUG MIND CONTROL] Now listen closely… (DEBUG FUNCTIONS)"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm going to go my own way for a while."
msgstr "Je vais continuer tout seul un moment."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
" *tshk* Are you serious?  This isn't a cell phone.  Can it wait until we're "
"in the same place?"
msgstr ""
