msgid "MVI 0022.mov"
msgstr "MVI 0022.mov"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_PREPPER_1_COMPUTER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Enigma code cracked by Turing -> modern encryption technology -> internet "
"sentience arises and gives birth to AI in Chinese lab using new forms of "
"computation, aka: BIO-TECHNOLOGY, human AND robotic components TOGETHER.  "
"State media announces as 'fusion technology'.  Bio-weapon escapes lab, OF "
"COURSE.  Self-replicating bio-technology = imminent replacement of humanity.  "
"US gov now ACTIVELY manufacturing cover-ups for escaped bio-weapon to "
"maintain peace.  Follows same pattern as Roswell, Trinity (what they told the "
"public), oil pollution coverup (in my opinion).  Recent New York 'mass "
"psychosis events' instigated by them as cover.  PAID ACTORS on speed dial but "
"the THREAT IS REAL.  They are buying time, but what is the play?"
msgstr ""
"Code Enigma déchiffré par Turing -> technologie de cryptage moderne -> la "
"sensibilité à l'internet apparaît et donne naissance à l'IA dans un "
"laboratoire chinois utilisant de nouvelles formes de calcul, alias : "
"BIO-TECHNOLOGIE, composants humains ET robotiques ENSEMBLE. Les médias d'État "
"parlent de \"technologie de fusion\". L'arme biologique s'échappe du "
"laboratoire, bien sûr. Biotechnologie auto-reproductible = remplacement "
"imminent de l'humanité. Le gouvernement américain s'emploie activement à "
"dissimuler l'évasion de l'arme biologique afin de maintenir la paix. Cela "
"suit le même schéma que Roswell, Trinity (ce qu'ils ont dit au public), la "
"dissimulation de la pollution pétrolière (à mon avis). Les récents "
"\"événements de psychose de masse\" de New York ont été provoqués par eux "
"pour servir de couverture. Des acteurs rémunérés en numérotation rapide, mais "
"la menace est réelle. Ils gagnent du temps, mais qu'est-ce qui se joue ?"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_PREPPER_1_COMPUTER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Gov assigns names based off numerological conversions of house numbers.  "
"Robert Williamson: 205 W Orchard Avenue.  Robert (78) + Williamson (127) = "
"205.  Despite the beautiful weather, he keeps the curtains closed and no one "
"has even visited yet.  And he's been here for more than two weeks!  I only "
"ever see him when he's coming or going from work.  I assume it's work, even "
"if the hours are strange sometimes.  Black car, out of state plates, looks "
"brand new.  Fed behavior, if you ask me… Is he actually going somewhere or "
"just trying to convince me he's legitimate?  Is he on the job when he leaves "
"or on the job when he's here?  Further investigation required."
msgstr ""
"Le gouvernement attribue les noms sur la base des conversions numériques des "
"numéros de maison. Robert Williamson : 205 W Orchard Avenue. Robert (78) + "
"Williamson (127) = 205. Malgré le beau temps, il garde les rideaux fermés et "
"personne ne lui a encore rendu visite. Et il est là depuis plus de deux "
"semaines ! Je ne le vois que lorsqu'il va ou vient du travail. Je suppose que "
"c'est le travail, même si les horaires sont parfois bizarres. Voiture noire, "
"plaques d'immatriculation étrangères, elle a l'air toute neuve. Est-ce qu'il "
"va vraiment quelque part ou est-ce qu'il essaie juste de me convaincre qu'il "
"est légitime ? Est-il au travail lorsqu'il part ou au travail lorsqu'il est "
"ici ? Une enquête plus approfondie s'impose."

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_PREPPER_1_COMPUTER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Non-perishables, MREs, canned soup, dehydrated milk, oats/rice, lemon juice, "
"protein powder.  Ammo, in crates if possible - just ask Rachel at RFA?  Large "
"drums (HDPE), reusable containers, spare fuel can.  More novels and TV from "
"home.  Iodine, colloidal silver, gas mask and filters for fallout."
msgstr ""
"Denrées non périssables, MRE, soupe en conserve, lait déshydraté, avoine/riz, "
"jus de citron, protéines en poudre. Munitions, dans des caisses si possible - "
"demandez à Rachel à RFA ? Grands fûts (PEHD), conteneurs réutilisables, bidon "
"d'essence de rechange. Plus de romans et de télévision à la maison. Iode, "
"argent colloïdal, masque à gaz et filtres pour les retombées."

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_PREPPER_1_COMPUTER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&A video file starts playing.  It's quite low resolution, very shaky, and the "
"sound is somewhat muffled as the cameraperson appears to be filming inside "
"from their car.  On screen a man is walking away from the camera towards a "
"nondescript white building with large windows.  The glare of the sunlight "
"makes it hard to tell but it looks like… an airport terminal!  The man is "
"very far away, wearing an orange safety vest and a hard hat, and he appears "
"to be carrying a laptop bag.  You hear the person behind the camera mutter, "
"\"I've only ever seen him come and go through that door.  No one else in the "
"entire time I've been watching…\"  The man walks straight into the building, "
"only looking back briefly as he swipes a keycard at the door and enters."
msgstr ""
"&Un fichier vidéo commence à être lu. Il s'agit d'une vidéo en basse "
"résolution, très instable, et le son est quelque peu étouffé car la personne "
"qui filme semble filmer l'intérieur depuis sa voiture. À l'écran, un homme "
"s'éloigne de la caméra et se dirige vers un bâtiment blanc quelconque doté de "
"grandes fenêtres. L'éblouissement de la lumière du soleil ne permet pas de le "
"distinguer, mais on dirait... un terminal d'aéroport ! L'homme est très "
"éloigné, il porte un gilet de sécurité orange et un casque de protection, et "
"il semble porter un sac d'ordinateur portable. On entend la personne derrière "
"la caméra marmonner : \"Je ne l'ai jamais vu aller et venir que par cette "
"porte. Personne d'autre depuis que je regarde...\"  L'homme entre directement "
"dans le bâtiment, ne jetant qu'un bref coup d'œil en arrière avant de glisser "
"une carte magnétique dans la porte et d'entrer."

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_PREPPER_1_COMPUTER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Continue watching…"
msgstr "Continuer de regarder…"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_PREPPER_1_COMPUTER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&The cameraperson sighs.  The view slowly zooms out for a few seconds, but "
"then suddenly jerks to the left.  \"Ay… hey, look at these motherfuckers!\"  "
"The camera zooms in on two teenagers next to a car in the parking lot.  "
"They're both laughing and shouting very loudly, almost seemingly intoxicated… "
" One kid takes a step back, then kicks in the taillight of the car.  The "
"other appears from around the other side of it, dragging their keys along it, "
"scratching up the paint.  The boy who was kicking begins violently punching "
"the window with his bare fist.  The cameraperson lets out an astonished gasp, "
"\"Like New York…\"  One punch, two punch, and with a third smash his arm goes "
"through the glass!  He stares at the other teenager and they both let out a "
"burst of laughter that lasts a little too long.  The cameraperson mutters a "
"concerned \"Uhhh…\" and sets the camera on the seat.  The recording abruptly "
"ends."
msgstr ""
"&Le caméraman soupire. La vue dézoome lentement pendant quelques secondes, "
"puis se déplace brusquement vers la gauche. \"Ay... hey, regardez ces "
"enfoirés !\" La caméra zoome sur deux adolescents à côté d'une voiture dans "
"le parking. Ils rient et crient très fort, semblent presque ivres... L'un "
"d'eux recule d'un pas, puis donne un coup de pied dans le feu arrière de la "
"voiture. L'autre surgit de l'autre côté de la voiture, traînant ses clés le "
"long de celle-ci, rayant la peinture. Le garçon qui donnait des coups de pied "
"commence à frapper violemment la vitre à poings nus. Le caméraman pousse un "
"cri d'étonnement : \"Comme à New York...\" Un coup de poing, deux coups de "
"poing, et d'un troisième coup de poing, son bras traverse la vitre ! Il "
"regarde fixement l'autre adolescent et tous deux laissent échapper un éclat "
"de rire qui dure un peu trop longtemps. Le caméraman marmonne un \"Uhhh...\" "
"inquiet et pose la caméra sur le siège. L'enregistrement s'arrête brusquement."

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_PREPPER_1_COMPUTER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Error: 'open': command not found."
msgstr "Erreur : 'ouvrir' : commande introuvable."

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Shady Hills Corporation.\n"
" You are logged in as: Randolph VanBuren, Community Manager.\n"
"\n"
" WARNING!  ERROR A101; FAILURE DETECTED IN POWER SUPPLY.\n"
" RESERVE POWER ACTIVATED.  CONTACT INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY DEPARTMENT "
"IMMEDIATELY!"
msgstr ""
"Shady Hills Corporation.\n"
"Vous êtes connecté en tant que : Randolph VanBuren, Community Manager.\n"
"\n"
"ATTENTION ! ERREUR A101 ; DÉFAILLANCE DÉTECTÉE DANS L'ALIMENTATION "
"ÉLECTRIQUE.\n"
"ALIMENTATION DE RÉSERVE ACTIVÉE. CONTACTEZ IMMÉDIATEMENT LE SERVICE "
"INFORMATIQUE !"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Access Main Drives"
msgstr "Accéder aux Disques Durs Principaux"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "RETURN TO DESKTOP"
msgstr "RETOURNER AU BUREAU"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "RE: Seriously!?"
msgstr "RE: Sérieusement!?"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "RE: Noise complaint"
msgstr "RE: Nuisance sonore"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "RE: Horrible smell"
msgstr "RE: Odeur horrible"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Jamie Forest, Community Resident, Unit A02\n"
"  TO: Shady Hills Corporation, Service Portal\n"
"  RE: Seriously!?\n"
"\n"
" My son just told me he keeps receiving advertisements in the mail for a "
"nursing home.  He told me that your company runs it!  Are you trying to get "
"rid of me!?  You're sick!  I demand you have your CEO call me!"
msgstr ""
"DE: Jamie Forest, Résident de la Communauté, Unité A02\n"
"  POUR: Shady Hills Corporation, Portail de Service\n"
"  RE: Sérieusement!?\n"
"\n"
" Mon fils vient de me dire qu'il n'arrête pas de recevoir des publicités dans "
" son courrier pour une maison de retraite. Il m'a dit que c'est votre "
"communauté qui la gère! Est-ce que vous êtes en train d'essayer de vous "
"débarrasser de moi? Vous êtes malade ou quoi? Je veux appeler votre directeur!"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Larry Landborn, Unit B11\n"
"  TO: Shady Hills Corporation, Service Portal\n"
"  RE: Noise complaint\n"
"\n"
"  Hello.  I am once again requesting your help with my neighbor in B10.  "
"There are loud sounds from all times of day.  She claims her grandkids are "
"visiting but the noises have been non-stop for weeks!"
msgstr ""
"DE: Larry Landborn, Unité B11\n"
"  POUR: Shady Hills Corporation, Portail de Service\n"
"  RE: Plainte pour tapage\n"
"\n"
"  Bonjour. J'envoie de nouveau une requête d'aide avec ma voisine dans "
"l'unité B10. Il y a des bruits forts toute la journée. Elle me dit que se "
"sont ses petits enfants étant là pour visiter, mais je ne vois jamais "
"personne d'autre chez elle!"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Sandra Shells, Unit B06\n"
"  TO: Shady Hills Corporation, Service Portal\n"
"  RE: Horrible smell\n"
"\n"
"  There's a bad smell coming from unit B07.  Please look into it.  Thanks."
msgstr ""
"DE: Sandra Shells, Unité B06\n"
"  POUR: Shady Hills Corporation, Portail de Service\n"
"  RE: Odeur horrible\n"
"\n"
"  Il y a une odeur horrible provenant d'unité B07, veuillez examiner la "
"situation. Merci."

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"MY PC.\n"
" You are logged in as: ADMINISTRATOR.\n"
"\n"
"  WARNING!  ERROR IN POWER SUPPLY DETECTED.  RESERVE POWER ACTIVATED.  SAVE "
"ALL WORK AND SAFELY SHUT DOWN THIS DEVICE IMMEDIATELY!"
msgstr ""
"MON PC.\n"
" Vous êtes connecté(e) en temps que: ADMINISTRATEUR.\n"
"\n"
"  AVERTISSEMENT! ERREUR D'ALIMENTATION DÉTECTÉE. BATTERIE D'URGENCE ACTIVÉE. "
"VEUILLEZ SAUVEGARDER TOUT DOSSIER PUIS ÉTEINDRE CET APPAREIL IMMÉDIATEMENT!"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Connect to BINGO CHAMPIONSHIPS ONLINE"
msgstr "Connecter à BINGO CHAMPIONSHIPS ONLINE"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The webpage cannot be found :( Check your connection and try again, or "
"contact your Internet Service Provider."
msgstr ""
"La page web est introuvable :( Vérifiez votre connexion et réessayez, ou "
"contactez votre fournisseur d'accès à Internet."

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Error connecting to server.  You will be unable to send or receive new "
"messages.  Check your connection and try again, or contact your Internet "
"Service Provider."
msgstr ""
"Erreur de connexion au serveur. Vous ne pourrez pas envoyer ou recevoir de "
"nouveaux messages. Vérifiez votre connexion et réessayez, ou contactez votre "
"fournisseur d'accès à Internet."

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "RE: Security Gate"
msgstr "RE: Barrière de Sécurité"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "RE: Survivor's Club"
msgstr "RE: Club des Survivants"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "RE: Your Daily BINGO News!"
msgstr "RE: Vos Actualités de BINGO Quotidiennes!"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Randolph VanBuren, Shady Hills Community Manager\n"
"\n"
"  RE: Security Gate\n"
"\n"
"  Greetings everyone in our fine community.  I wanted to give you an update "
"on Shady Hills' official stance on the security and safety of our esteemed "
"residents.  We are doing everything in our power to keep you safe from harm.  "
"We understand the news has been frightening lately with talk of violence in "
"the streets.  Rest assured you are safe inside of our neighborhood.  Out of "
"an abundance of caution we are installing a new front gate to the entrance of "
"the neighborhood.  This gate will keep back even the most violent of "
"criminals.  Should you have any questions or concerns, please contact our "
"service portal.\n"
"\n"
"  Thank you for your trust in Shady Hills,\n"
" Randolph VanBuren"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Jamie Forest, Community Resident, Unit A02\n"
"\n"
"  RE: Survivor's Club!?\n"
"\n"
"  Hey there!  Thanks for your interest in our club.  We are really excited to "
"have you!  I'll have to come check out your panic room sometime!  A few of us "
"are going to check out the cave in the park if you want to join us.  "
"Officially, it's supposed to be off limits, but what are they going to do "
"about it?  I heard it even connects to the sewers, maybe if the world really "
"goes to hell like they're all thinking, we can make use of it!  I'm kidding, "
"I don't believe that crap."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: BINGO CHAMPIONSHIPS ONLINE\n"
"\n"
"  Your Daily BINGO News!\n"
"\n"
"  Thank you for being a member of BINGO CHAMPIONSHIPS ONLINE!  Today we have "
"an interview with our latest champion, WINIFRED SMITH!  Click the link below "
"to hear her incredible story!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_TRAIN_DATA.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Request Monorail"
msgstr "Requérir un Monorail"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_TRAIN_DATA.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Download Train Data"
