#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[70 merch, 2 days] I need a trench knife."
msgstr "[70 merch, 2 jours] J'ai besoin d'un couteau de tranchée."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Okay.  What about the steel grade?  Tempering will make your weapon much more "
"durable and a little sharper."
msgstr ""
"Ok.  Et pour la qualité de l'acier?  Le trempage rendra tout ça beaucoup plus "
"solide et un peu plus affuté."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "No, high carbon steel is fine."
msgstr "De l'acier de haute qualité me suffit."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[+50 merch, +2 days] Yes, tempered steel would be excellent."
msgstr "[+50 merch, +2 jours] Je pense que je vais avoir besoin d'acier trempé."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Great, so I can make your "
"<item_name:<u_val:general_artisans_blacksmith_weapon>> for "
"<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_weapon_cost> merch and in "
"<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_weapon_wait> days.  Deal?"
msgstr ""
"Super, je peux donc vous fabriquer votre "
"<item_name:<u_val:general_artisans_blacksmith_weapon>> pour "
"<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_weapon_cost> dans "
"<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_weapon_wait> jours.  Ok?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"[<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_weapon_cost> merch] Deal.  See you in "
"<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_weapon_wait> days."
msgstr ""
"[<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_weapon_cost> merch] Ok. On se revoit dans "
"<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_weapon_wait> jours."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "It's all done!  Sorry for the long wait; hopefully it's worth it."
msgstr "C'est fait ! désolé(e) pour l'attente; en espérant que ça vaille le coup."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_item_groups.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "engineering notes"
msgid_plural "engineering notes"
msgstr[0] "note d'ingénierie"
msgstr[1] "notes d'ingénierie"
msgstr[2] "notes d'ingénierie"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_item_groups.json
#. ~ Description of "engineering notes"
msgid ""
"A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with pencil.  There are "
"two peoples handwriting."
msgstr ""
"Une collection d'esquisses et de dessins CAD marqués au crayon. Il y a "
"l'écriture de deux personnes différentes."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You hit the nail on the head.  You bring me cartridges of one type, and I "
"reload them into another.  Ammo has its own exchange rate, for example, you "
"can exchange a hundred rifle rounds for three hundred pistol rounds or vice "
"versa."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can we do that now?"
msgstr "Est-ce qu'on peut faire ça maintenant ?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Alright.  So, first you give me your rounds, I'll put them on your account, "
"and then I can reload them in another caliber of your choice.  What ammo do "
"you want to convert?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
