"dirt, more Mad Max."
msgstr ""
"J'avais imaginé que l'apocalypse aurait été plus… glamour, vous voyez?  Moins "
"dégueu, plus Mad Max."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I used to think the end of the world would bring people together.  Guess I "
"was wrong."
msgstr ""
"Je pensais que la fin du monde rassemblerait les gens. J'imagine que j'avais "
"tord."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid "I used to think the world was big.  Now it feels so small, so fragile."
msgstr "Je voyais le monde immense. Maintenant il semble tellement petit, fragile."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I wish I could go bust a cap in one of those zombies right now, without all "
"the fuss about being scared for my life."
msgstr ""
"J'aimerais pouvoir aller faire sauter une casquette à l'un de ces zombies en "
"ce moment même, sans avoir à me préoccuper d'avoir peur pour ma vie."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I wonder if I should be getting more religious now, or less.  You know what "
"I'm sayin', <name_g>?"
msgstr ""
"Je me demande si je devrais être plus religieux maintenant, ou moins. Vous "
"voyez ce que je veux dire, <name_g>?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid "I wonder if the government's still out there, holed up in some bunker."
msgstr "Je me demande si le gouvernement a survécu et se planque dans un bunker."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I wonder if there are other dimensions where things didn't go to hell.  "
"Parallel worlds where everything's fine."
msgstr ""
"Je me demande s'il existe d'autres dimensions où les choses n'ont pas "
"dégénéré. Des mondes parallèles où tout va bien."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I wonder if we'll ever see real civilization again, or if this is just the "
"new normal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I've heard rumors about entire towns just vanishing overnight.  No bodies, no "
"signs of struggle.  Creepy, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I've heard whispers about groups out there, still trying to control things.  "
"Like some shadow government or something."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid "People used to laugh at preppers.  Who's laughing now, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Remember some of the crazy news from the end of the world?  The stuff that "
"got drowned out by the riot coverage I mean.  Like, didn't the governor of "
"Rhode Island secede from the Union or something?"
msgstr ""
"Vous vous souvenez de quelques-uns des évènements les plus délirant au début "
"du Cataclysme? Je veux dire les trucs qui on été noyés par les reportages sur "
"les émeutes. Il y a pas eu un truc concernant le gouverneur de Rhode Island "
"faisant sécession?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Remember those stories about underground cities?  Wonder if anyone's living "
"down there now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Remember when people thought the internet would last forever?  Feels like a "
"joke now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Some say the world ending was nature's way of hitting the reset button.  What "
"do you think?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Sometimes I think about those survivalist nutjobs.  Bet they're having the "
"last laugh now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if the stars look different now.  Like, did they change "
"too?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if the world ended for a reason.  Like, maybe we needed a "
"reset."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if this is all some sort of punishment.  But for what, who "
"knows?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if this is some kind of test.  Like, we're being judged on "
"how we handle it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if we're just delaying the inevitable.  Like, what's the "
"point?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"There's so much we don't know about what caused this.  You think we'll ever "
"get answers?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Think any famous people made it through all this?  Celebrities hiding out "
"somewhere?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Those mind-control drugs they put in the water to make people riot… you think "
"they're still in there?"
msgstr ""
"Les drogues qu'ils ont mis dans l'eau potable pour provoquer les émeutes, "
"vous pensez qu'elles sont toujours actives?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"What do you think happened to all the rich and powerful?  Think they had a "
"plan for this?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid "What if the cause of all this is still out there, waiting to finish the job?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"What if there are survivors out there who have no idea what happened?  "
"Completely cut off from everything."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"When do you think you realized the world was ending?  For me, it was that "
"damned YouTube video with the lady killing the baby.  Holy shit, you know?"
msgstr ""
"Quand pensez-vous avoir réalisé que c'était la fin du monde ? Pour moi, "
"c'était cette maudite vidéo YouTube avec la femme qui tue le bébé. Putain de "
"merde, vous savez ?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"You ever feel like the whole time before <the_cataclysm> was just a dream "
"you're waking up from?"
msgstr ""
"Vous n'avez jamais eu l'impression que toute la période qui a précédé "
"<the_cataclysm> n'était qu'un rêve dont vous vous réveillez ?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"You ever feel like the whole world is just… tired?  Like it's ready to give "
"up?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid "You ever feel like the whole world is one big haunted house now?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"You ever hear about that weird cult that was stockpiling supplies?  Bet "
"they're feeling pretty smug now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"You ever hear about those secret bunkers?  Bet they're laughing at us from "
"their safe havens."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"You ever think about all the tech we lost?  I mean, we were so close to AI, "
"now we're just scraping by."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"You ever think about all the things we took for granted?  Running water, "
"electricity, safety."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"You ever think there's any truth to the crap they were spouting before the "
"world ended?  Mind control drugs in the water, bio-terrorism?  Some of it "
"would make sense, but it seems so far-fetched.  Then again, we're dealing "
"with actual zombies."
msgstr ""
"Vous n'avez jamais pensé qu'il y avait du vrai dans les conneries qu'ils "
"racontaient avant la fin du monde ? Des drogues de contrôle mental dans "
"l'eau, le bioterrorisme ? Certaines de ces choses seraient logiques, mais "
"elles semblent tellement tirées par les cheveux. Et puis, nous avons affaire "
"à de vrais zombies."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid "You ever think we'll see the sun rise on a world that's not falling apart?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"You ever wonder if the scientists who caused this are still out there, hiding "
"somewhere?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"You ever wonder why we even bother?  We're all just gonna be zombies "
"eventually anyway.  I mean, not that I'm gonna stop fighting, but what's the "
"damn point?"
msgstr ""
"Vous ne vous êtes jamais demandé pourquoi nous nous donnons la peine de le "
"faire ? On finira tous par devenir des zombies, de toute façon. Je veux dire, "
"pas que je vais arrêter de me battre, mais quel est l'intérêt ?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"You think any of those doomsday bunkers actually worked?  Might be folks "
"underground right now, clueless about what's happened."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"You think there are any places left untouched by all this?  Like, some hidden "
"paradise?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"You think there are still places where people live normal lives?  Kids going "
"to school, adults going to work?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"You think there's a chance this was all just one big mistake?  Some accident "
"that spiraled out of control?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid "You think those sci-fi movies got anything right about how this would go down?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"You think we'll ever find a cure for the zombification?  Or is this it for "
"humanity?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"You think we'll ever find a way to make sense of all this?  Or are we just "
"stumbling in the dark?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"You think we'll ever get to a point where we can relax again?  Not just "
"survive, but live?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"You think we'll ever hear music again?  Real music, not just the sound of our "
"own fears?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"You think we'll ever laugh again?  Like, really laugh, without any fear or "
"worry?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"Do you think any of the old world leaders survived?  If they did, what would "
"they be doing now?  Hiding, trying to rebuild, or something else entirely?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"Ever notice how some people seem almost unaffected mentally?  Like they're "
"perfectly adjusted to this new world.  Makes you wonder if they knew more "
"than they let on before everything went to hell."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"Ever think about how some people seem to thrive in this chaos?  It's almost "
"like they were made for it.  Makes you wonder what they were like before "
"everything went to hell."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"Have you noticed how some zombies seem to be smarter than others?  It's like "
"there's a hierarchy among them, but that shouldn't be possible, right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"Have you noticed injuries aren't healing the same as usual?  I started "
"spotting it before the world ended, but it's become more pronounced.  There's "
"hardly even a granulation step after a cut closes."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez remarqué que les blessures ne guérissent plus de la même façon "
"depuis que tout ça a commencé? J'ai commencé à observer ça au début du "
"Cataclysme, mais ça devient de plus en plus évident. Il n'y a presque plus "
"besoin d'attendre une étape de granulation quand une coupure ce referme."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"I can't shake the feeling that this was all planned.  Not the outbreak "
"itself, but the way it spread so quickly and efficiently."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"I can't stop wondering who fucked up to make all this happen.  Obviously we "
"can't trust the news, they claimed the zombies were 'rioters' for weeks.  "
"Why?  Where did this come from?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"I keep seeing these weird symbols in old buildings.  They look ancient, but "
"they're in places they shouldn't be.  Makes you wonder if someone was "
"preparing for this long before it happened."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"I keep thinking about how fast society collapsed.  It was almost as if "
"something was waiting for the perfect moment to strike."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"I read somewhere that human behavior changes in the presence of certain "
"frequencies.  What if someone was broadcasting those right before the "
"Cataclysm?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"I still don't understand how these zombies are powered.  They're like "
"perpetual motion machines."
msgstr ""
"Je ne comprends toujours pas comment ces zombies fonctionnent, ont dirait des "
"machines à mouvement perpétuel."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"I used to think the world was big and complicated.  Now it feels like all the "
"complexity was just a facade, and the real rules of the game were hidden from "
"us."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"I've been thinking about the old myths and legends.  Zombies, monsters, the "
"end of the world… what if those stories were based on something real, "
"something that happened before?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"I've been thinking about those old sci-fi movies where they talked about "
"alternate dimensions and parallel universes.  Maybe what happened here is "
"connected to something like that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"I've noticed the stars look different lately.  Maybe it's just me, but I "
"swear there are constellations I've never seen before."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"If what they told us about the Chinese was even partly true, do you think "
"it's like this in China?  Or maybe the US is some kind of quarantine zone, "
"and at least some of the world is still out there."
msgstr ""
"Même si ce qu'ils nous ont racontés au sujet de la Chine est partiellement "
"vrai, vous pensez que c'est la même chose là-bas? Où peut-être que les "
"États-Unis sont une zone de quarantaine et qu'au moins il y a une partie du "
"monde qui est bien sorti de tout ça"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"Is it just me, or does it feel like we're being watched sometimes?  Not just "
"by other survivors, but something else, something more… omnipresent."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"So many parts of this still don't fit together.  Who created the zombies?  "
"What powers them?  Maybe the rumors of mind control drugs were true all "
"along, and someone found a way to bioengineer living dead."
msgstr ""
"Il y a tellement d'éléments qui ne s'emboîtent toujours pas. Qui a créé les "
"zombies ? Qu'est-ce qui les alimente ? Peut-être que les rumeurs sur les "
"drogues de contrôle de l'esprit étaient vraies depuis le début, et que "
"quelqu'un a trouvé un moyen de créer des morts vivants par bio-ingénierie."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if we're not alone in this.  Not just other survivors, but "
"something bigger, observing us, maybe even experimenting."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"The idea that this is all some kind of massive reset, a way for the Earth to "
"cleanse itself of us, keeps nagging at me.  What if it's true?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"The more I see of this new world, the more I think we're missing some big "
"piece of the puzzle.  There's something out there we haven't figured out yet."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"The way plants have started growing in some areas, almost aggressively… it's "
"like nature is trying to take back control in a hurry."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"There's got to be more to the story about those 'safe zones' the government "
"talked about.  Why did they stop broadcasting?  What happened to them?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"There's something off about the way animals are mutating.  It's like they're "
"evolving at an accelerated pace, but not randomly.  There seems to be some "
"kind of pattern."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"What if the government knew this was coming and just didn't tell us?  Maybe "
"they thought they could control it and failed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"You ever wonder if there's a cure out there, somewhere?  Not just for the "
"zombies, but for everything that's happened to the world."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"You ever wonder why some people went feral and others didn't?  There has to "
"be more to it than just stress and fear."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"You think all those conspiracy theorists were onto something?  The ones "
"talking about secret experiments and shadow governments?  It's starting to "
"look less crazy now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
msgid ""
"You think the Earth itself is reacting to all this?  Like, on a geological "
"level?  Earthquakes, weather patterns, everything seems more intense."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid "<neutralchitchat>"
msgstr "<neutralchitchat>"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"Do you think any of those doomsday preppers made it?  Bet they're feeling "
"pretty smug right about now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"Do you think it's weird how we'll, like, open a locked building and find a "
"lone zombie inside?  How'd it even get there?"
msgstr ""
"Vous pensez pas que c'est un peu bizarre comme quoi de temps en temps on "
"ouvre un bâtiment completement fermé et on trouve un seul zombie à "
"l'intérieur? Comment est-ce qu'il c'est retrouvé là?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"Do you think there are still places untouched by all this?  Like some remote "
"island or hidden valley where people are just living normal lives?"
msgstr ""
"Vous vous demandez si il y a des endroits épargnés par tout ça?  Genre une "
"vallée isolée ou une île distante où des gens vivent des vies normales?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"Do you think we'll ever get back to a point where we can have holidays again? "
" Celebrating seems like a distant dream."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"Ever think about how lucky we are to have found each other?  In a world this "
"messed up, having friends is everything."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"Ever think about how quiet it is now?  No cars, no planes, just the wind and "
"the groans of the dead."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"How do these zombies even keep going?  What are they eating?  Do you think "
"they'll ever rot away?"
msgstr ""
"Comment est-ce que les zombies continuent à bouger? Qu'est-ce qu'ils mangent? "
"Vous pensez qu'ils vont pourrir ou dépérir un jour?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"I been thinkin', one of these days, we're gonna run out of toilet paper.  "
"What then?"
msgstr ""
"Je me suis dit qu'un de ces jours, on n'aurait plus de papier toilette. Et "
"alors ?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"I miss fresh fruit.  There's something about biting into a juicy apple that "
"canned stuff just can't replicate."
msgstr ""
"Les fruits frais me manquent.  Il y a juste quelque chose que les conserves "
"ne possèdent pas."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"I miss music.  Remember concerts?  The energy of the crowd, the live sound.  "
"Wonder if any musicians survived."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"I miss the little things.  Like the smell of fresh bread, or the sound of a "
"coffee machine in the morning."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"I never thought I'd miss doing laundry.  Wearing the same clothes day after "
"day gets old fast."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"I used to complain about going to work.  Now I'd give anything for a boring "
"day at the office."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"I used to hate bugs, but now I see them as a sign of life.  Weird how "
"perspective changes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"I was never much of a cook before, but now I can make a mean stew out of "
"almost anything.  Survival skills, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"I wonder if anyone's tried to start a farm again.  Gotta be tough with all "
"the zombies, but food doesn't grow on trees."
msgstr ""
"Je me demande si quelqu'un essaye déjà de cultiver une ferme.  Cela doit être "
"difficile avec tout les zombies, mais la bouffe ne pousse pas toute faite."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"I wonder if kids born after all this will even understand what the world used "
"to be like.  Seems like a fairytale now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"I wonder if the power will ever come back on.  Can't imagine how much stuff "
"we took for granted before all this."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"It's funny, I never appreciated the sunrise as much as I do now.  Every day "
"we're still here feels like a gift."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"It's funny, I used to hate the rain.  Now it's like a blessing, makes "
"everything feel a bit cleaner."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"It's strange how some buildings are completely untouched, like time just "
"stopped in them.  Then you go next door, and it's a total wreck."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"It's strange how the stars seem brighter now without all the city lights.  "
"Almost beautiful, if it weren't so damn scary."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"It's weird to think about all the things we used to stress over.  Traffic, "
"bills, deadlines.  None of that seems to matter now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if we're all psychos, not just the ones that went crazy "
"and rioted.  I never would have thought I could do the things I've done since "
"the world ended."
msgstr ""
"Parfois, je me demande si nous ne sommes pas tous des psychopathes, et pas "
"seulement ceux qui sont devenus fous et ont déclenché des émeutes. Je "
"n'aurais jamais pensé pouvoir faire les choses que j'ai faites depuis la fin "
"du monde."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder what the future will look like.  Will we rebuild, or is "
"this just how it is now?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"Think we'll ever figure out what really caused all this?  Sometimes I feel "
"like knowing would just make it worse."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"You ever think about all the pets that were left behind?  Poor things didn't "
"ask for this any more than we did."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"You ever think about space?  I mean, what's happening up there?  Are "
"astronauts just floating around, not knowing what happened down here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"You ever think about what the first thing you'll do if things ever get back "
"to normal?  I think I'd just sit in a park and watch the world go by."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"You know what I miss?  Movie theaters.  You think Hollywood survived this?  "
"Maybe there's a bunch of zombie actors out there, filmin' shit out of reflex. "
" Hah, I'd watch that shit."
msgstr ""
"Vous savez ce qui me manque ? Les cinémas. Tu crois qu'Hollywood a survécu à "
"ça ? Peut-être qu'il y a un tas d'acteurs zombies qui filment de la merde par "
"réflexe. Hah, je regarderais cette merde."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid "You read any good books lately?  I'm glad we still got books."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez-lu quelques bons livres récemment? Je suis content qu'au moins il "
"nous reste des trucs à lire. "

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid ""
"You think animals sense the zombies differently than we do?  They always seem "
"to know when something's off."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "Could be.  What do you think?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "Ever considered…?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "Good observation."
msgstr "Bonne observation."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "Got any more thoughts on that?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "I can relate to that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "I can see where you're coming from."
msgstr "Je peux voir d’où vous venez avec ça."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "I hear you, <name_g>…"
msgstr "Je vous comprends, <name_g>…"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I know what you mean."
msgstr "Je voix ce que vous voulez dire."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "I never thought of it that way."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "Interesting.  What else?"
msgstr "Intéressant.  Quoi d'autre?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "I've been pondering that too."
msgstr "Je méditais sur ça aussi."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "I was just thinking about that."
msgstr "Je venais juste de penser à ça."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "Now that you mention it…"
msgstr "Maintenant que vous le dites…"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "Right, right.  Say, you ever thought about…"
msgstr "C'est vrai, c'est vrai.  Dites, vous avez déjà pensé à…"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "Tell me more about that."
msgstr "Dites-moi plus."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "That reminds me of something…"
msgstr "Cela me rappelle quelque chose…"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "That's a good point."
msgstr "C'est un bon argument."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "That's an interesting take."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "That's a solid perspective."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "That's one way to look at it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "That's pretty insightful."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "That's something to think about."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "That's worth discussing."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "What do you think about…?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "Yeah, I get that."
msgstr "Oui, je comprends."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "Yeah, that's been on my mind too."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "You bring up a good point."
msgstr "Vous abordez un bon point."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "You ever wonder why that is?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "You might be onto something."
msgstr "Vous pourriez être sur quelque chose."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "You're definitely not alone in that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
msgid "You're not wrong."
msgstr "Vous n'avez pas tort."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<general_danger>"
#. ~ NPC complaint when the threat level increases from very low to dangerous.
msgid "Alert status raised, be on your toes!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<general_danger>"
#. ~ NPC complaint when the threat level increases from very low to dangerous.
msgid "Alright, gloves off, it's go time!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<general_danger>"
#. ~ NPC complaint when the threat level increases from very low to dangerous.
msgid "Ambush!"
msgstr "Embuscade!"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<general_danger>"
#. ~ NPC complaint when the threat level increases from very low to dangerous.
msgid "Are we fighting or leaving?"
msgstr "On se bat ou on se tire?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<general_danger>"
#. ~ NPC complaint when the threat level increases from very low to dangerous.
msgid "Bogies incoming!"
msgstr "On a des cibles en chemin!"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<general_danger>"
#. ~ NPC complaint when the threat level increases from very low to dangerous.
msgid "Fight or flight?"
msgstr "On se bat ou on se tire?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<general_danger>"
#. ~ NPC complaint when the threat level increases from very low to dangerous.
msgid "Game over man, game over!"
msgstr "C'est game over, totalement gamer over!"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<general_danger>"
#. ~ NPC complaint when the threat level increases from very low to dangerous.
msgid "Get your game face on!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<general_danger>"
#. ~ NPC complaint when the threat level increases from very low to dangerous.
msgid "Guns up, we're in the thick of it now!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<general_danger>"
#. ~ NPC complaint when the threat level increases from very low to dangerous.
msgid "Heads on swivel!"
msgstr "Gardez votre tête sur vos épaules!"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<general_danger>"
#. ~ NPC complaint when the threat level increases from very low to dangerous.
msgid "Hold onto your hats, we're in for a wild ride!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<general_danger>"
#. ~ NPC complaint when the threat level increases from very low to dangerous.
msgid "Hope you brought your A-game, things just got serious!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<general_danger>"
#. ~ NPC complaint when the threat level increases from very low to dangerous.
msgid "Hostiles inbound."
msgstr "Ennemis en approche."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<general_danger>"
#. ~ NPC complaint when the threat level increases from very low to dangerous.
msgid "I hope you're ready for action, because here it comes!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<general_danger>"
#. ~ NPC complaint when the threat level increases from very low to dangerous.
msgid "Incoming trouble, stay sharp!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<general_danger>"
#. ~ NPC complaint when the threat level increases from very low to dangerous.
