"road, alongside the words KEATON ON HIS WAY TO BUY MORE PAINT CHIPS."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_bored_snips"
msgid ""
"This is an adorable drawing of a troll-like creature with a snout like an "
"aardvark.  Next to it are the words \"Please don't tell anyone I'm down here!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/LIXA_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "LIXA_lab_graffiti_bored_snips"
msgid ""
"This is a drawing of a horned, ogre-like creature sitting in an arm chair, "
"wearing a small pair of reading glasses and holding what is presumably a "
"normal sized book delicately between each finger and thumb.  Underneath are "
"the words \"But how does he turn the pages?\", followed, in a different hand, "
"by \"Carefully.\""
msgstr ""
"Ceci est un dessin d'une sorte d'ogre avec de longues cornes assit dans un "
"fauteuil et portant des petites lunettes de lecture, un livre présumément de "
"taille normale tenu entre les pouces et index de ses deux mains énormes. "
"En-dessous est griffonné \"Mais comment tourne-t-il les pages?\" suivit par "
"\"Délicatement.\""

