#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
msgid ""
"MISSING CAT\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a shorthair cat with rosette markings training its claws on a "
"scratching post.]\n"
"\n"
"Cheddar is a male 3.5 y/o brown Bengal cat who went missing on April 8.  She "
"was last seen wearing a striped collar.\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU SEE HIM, CONTACT US IMMEDIATELY: 978-555-3760\n"
"\n"
"YOU CAN HELP!\n"
"Please photograph this poster and share it on social media."
msgstr ""
"CHAT PERDU\n"
"\n"
"[Photo: un chat au pelage court tacheté faisant ses griffes sur un poteau à "
"griffer.]\n"
"\n"
"Cheddar est un chat-léopard mâle de 3,5 ans porté disparu le 8 avril. Il a "
"été vu pour la dernière fois muni d'un collier à rayures.\n"
"\n"
"SI VOUS LE VOYEZ, NOUS CONTACTEZ IMMÉDIATEMENT: 978-555-3760\n"
"\n"
"VOUS POUVEZ NOUS AIDER!\n"
"Prenez une photo de cette affiche et partagez-là sur les réseaux sociaux."

#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
msgid ""
"DEXTER IS LOST!\n"
"AGAIN!!!  He was scared off by the neighbor's dogs on 6th May & doesn't know "
"how to get home…\n"
"…he's not very clever at finding his way back!\n"
"He's a 3 y/o male Devon Rex cat with soft gray fur and big blue eyes.\n"
"He's chipped and should be wearing a yellow collar with a tag that has his "
"name & my phone number on it.\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a short-haired gray cat sitting next to four similar-looking "
"felines.  Dexter is circled in and has a bright red arrow pointing at him.]\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU SEE MY DEXTER, PLEASE DIAL 978-555-8152!\n"
"\n"
"!!!REWARD OFFERED!!!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
msgid ""
"ATTENTION\n"
"MISSING CAT\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a hairless, wrinkled cat with lemon-shaped eyes wearing a "
"striped T-shirt.]\n"
"\n"
"RAMSES went missing from the car park at Companion Care Vets in Oakland on "
"30th March.\n"
"He is a Canadian Sphynx with a gray spot covering its stomach.\n"
"She is wearing a striped T-shirt and a pink collar.\n"
"\n"
"If found, please contact me at: ifoundramsesthecat@gmail.com"
msgstr ""
"ATTENTION\n"
"CHAT PERDU\n"
"\n"
"[Photo: Un chat sans poils, à la peau ridée et aux yeux jaunes portant un "
"t-shirt rayé.]\n"
"\n"
"RAMSÈS a disparue du parking de la clinique vétérinaire du sud d'Oakland le "
"30 mars.\n"
"C'est un sphinx canadien ayant une tâche grise sur son ventre.\n"
"Elle porte un t-shirt rayé et un collier rose.\n"
"\n"
"Si vous la trouvez, veuillez me contacter sur: jaitrouvéramsèslechat@gmail.com"

#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
msgid ""
"HAVE YOU SEEN MARBLES?\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a gray cat with gently curving stripes covering its body.  It "
"stares at the camera as if it's hypnotized by it.]\n"
"\n"
"MARBLES IS VERY FRIENDLY AND ENERGETIC.  MISSING SINCE THE EVENING OF MARCH "
"21.  IF SPOTTED OR FOUND, PLEASE CALL ME AT 774-555-9361.\n"
"\n"
"THANK YOU!!!"
msgstr ""
"AVEZ-VOUS VUE BILLE?\n"
"\n"
"[Photo: une chatte grise avec des rayures courbées couvrant son pelage. Elle "
"fixe la caméra comme si hypnotisée.]\n"
"\n"
"BILLES EST TRÈS GENTILLE ET ÉNERGÉTIQUE. PERDUE DEPUIS LE SOIR DU 21 MARS. SI "
"VOUS L'APERCEVEZ OU LA RETROUVEZ, VEUILLEZ M'APPELER AU 774-555-9361.\n"
"\n"
"MERCI!!!"

#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
msgid ""
"PLEASE PLEASE HELP ME!\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a longhaired tri-color cat with heterochromia lying on top of a "
"cat tree.]\n"
"\n"
"My name is Buttons and I'm a calico cat with large orange and black patches.  "
"My left eye is blue and the other is green.  I went missing on the evening of "
"April 15th and I haven't been seen since.  I love people and will come if "
"called.\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU HAVE SEEN BUTTONS, PLEASE DON'T HESITATE TO CONTACT ME: 508-555-1050"
msgstr ""

