#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid "CHINESE VICTORY AT HAND"
msgstr "UNE VICTOIRE CHINOISE À PORTÉE DE MAINS"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid ""
"CHINESE VICTORY AT HAND.  Emperor Tsang Gu Yen of Grand China arrived in full "
"state in Burlington, Vermont today to issue his proclamation that America, "
"like all countries of Earth, now belongs to the New Grand Chinese Empire.  "
"Freedom has fallen.  Rebel against his forces while you still can!"
msgstr ""
"LA VICTOIRE CHINOISE EST PROCHE. L'empereur Tsang Gu Yen de la Grande Chine "
"est arrivé en grande pompe à Burlington, dans le Vermont, aujourd'hui, pour "
"proclamer que l'Amérique, comme tous les pays de la Terre, appartient "
"désormais au nouveau Grand Empire chinois. La liberté est tombée. "
"Rebellez-vous contre ses forces tant que vous le pouvez encore !"

