#. penalty, anger, and lighter flavor text.
msgid "Hopefully whatever you can glean from this autopsy is worth the effort."
msgstr ""
"Espérons que ce que vous pouvez apprendre de cette autopsie vaut la peine de "
"ce que vous êtes en train de faire."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "msg_human_dissection_no_prof"
#. ~ Message indicating we are dissecting without the stomach for it, but not
#. actually butchering.  Lower morale penalty
msgid ""
"This is nothing like dissecting a frog in biology class.  You feel sick "
"inside."
msgstr ""
"Ceci n'est absolument pas comme disséquer une grenouille durant un cours de "
"biologie. Vous vous sentez malade."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "msg_human_dissection_no_prof"
#. ~ Message indicating we are dissecting without the stomach for it, but not
#. actually butchering.  Lower morale penalty
msgid "You wonder how anyone manages to do this ghastly work."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous demandez comment quiconque est capable de faire ceci dans le cadre "
"de leur travail."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "msg_human_dissection_no_prof"
#. ~ Message indicating we are dissecting without the stomach for it, but not
#. actually butchering.  Lower morale penalty
msgid ""
"The grim nature of your task deeply upsets you, leaving you feeling disgusted "
"with yourself."
msgstr ""
"La nature hideuse de votre tâche vous dérange profondément, vous laissant "
"écœuré(e) de vous-même."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "msg_human_butchery"
#. ~ Message showing a character disgust of butchering a fellow human.  Do not
#. include dissection or dismemberment.
msgid "You clench your teeth at the prospect of this gruesome job."
msgstr "Vous avez les dents serrées à la perspective de ce travail macabre."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "msg_human_butchery"
#. ~ Message showing a character disgust of butchering a fellow human.  Do not
#. include dissection or dismemberment.
msgid "This will haunt you in your dreams."
msgstr "Cela vous hantera dans vos rêves."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "msg_human_butchery"
#. ~ Message showing a character disgust of butchering a fellow human.  Do not
#. include dissection or dismemberment.
msgid ""
"You try to look away, but this gruesome image will stay on your mind for some "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Vous essayez de détourner le regard, mais cette image macabre restera gravée "
"dans votre esprit pendant un certain temps."

