msgid ""
"\"i say we call the material from melting down cars 'massachusetite' or "
"'vermontsteel' or 'connecticut composite'\""
msgstr ""
"\"on devrait appeler le métal qu'on récolte de voitures cassées "
"\"massachusetite\", \"acier vermont\" ou \"composite connecticut\"\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes what you need when you're infected, bleeding, sick and hungover "
"is a J and some chips.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"This has to be China's fault.  Seriously, why is nobody suspecting the "
"people we're having a cold war with!  This is an invasion!  These aren't "
"zombies, it's just camouflage!  WAKE UP, SHEEPLE!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Hahahahaa stupid fuck in his mansion, with his plate armor and big axe.  "
"Guy never swung the thing in his life.  Can't block bullets, dipshit\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hahahahaa, vieux débile dans son manoir de bourgeois, avec son armure de "
"plaques et sa hache de guerre. Richard n'a jamais frappé quoi que ce soit "
"avec. L'armure de plaques n'est pas pare-balles, couillon\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I woke up with a dozen bears in a tribe outside the vault.  One was covered "
"in red markings, glowing-- speaking.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"poor guy.  watched him from afar with my binocs for months and months.  "
"today he died fighting.  feels like i knew him even though i never "
"approached.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"ENGLAND DID THIS\""
msgstr "\"C'EST LA FAUTE À L'ANGLETERRE\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"That little fakkin rat din say anythin till we whacked him with a steel "
"chain!  Then 'e just wanted to know if he could buy the chain!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"tom, adorned with fluid sacs three layers deep, crawls to safety like a "
"slug\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"my friend turned fuckin insane and ate his arms and then his sister's arms! "
" he looked rather cross\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"Starting today, the hallucinations are my only friends.\""
msgstr "\"À partir d'aujourd'hui, les hallucinations sont mes seules amies.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"For sale: zombaby shoes, very filthy\""
msgstr "\"À vendre: Chaussure de bébé zombifié, très mauvaise condition\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Started my own brewery recently.  I just need some glass bottles, now!  "
"Several thousand!  I'm planning way ahead.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Heard recently of some radio op who lives in a skyscraper, announcing where "
"those hordes are going.  Couldn't find the frequency, though.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"Woah, bud!  Not all cannibals eat meat!\""
msgstr "\"Wow bonjour les préjugés! Pas tout les cannibales sont carnivores!\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"ay why aint my bullets fuckin explodin\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"Those Fiktok clan people picked this place clean… no food…\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"The fewer people in New England, the stronger we'll become.\""
msgstr "\"Moins il y a de gens dans New England, plus on deviendra forts.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"It all boils down to the Apex Predator.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"Got my mortar and pestle.  Now if I could just find some avocados…\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai obtenu un mortier et un pilon.  Si je pouvais trouver quelques "
"avocats…\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"saw a girl standing with the mushrooms.  spores coming out of slits in her "
"neck.  she looked happy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai vu un fille rester avec les champignons. Des spores sortaient de "
"fentes dans son cou. Elle avait l'air contente.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Found some pink berries.  Eating them makes bushes into more pink berries.  "
"Infinite berry.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"m ust grow                 unity\""
msgstr "\"be soin d e se rép a n dr e              unité\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"AMY IS FUNGUS.  DO NOT LISTEN IF SHE ASKS YOU TO TAKE OFF MASK\""
msgstr ""
"\"AMY S'EST FAIT AVOIR PAR LES CHAMPIGNONS. N'ÉCOUTEZ-LA PAS SI ELLE VOUS "
"DEMANDE DE RETIRER VOTRE MASQUE À GAZ\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"my rabbi follows a new god now.  asks us to call him a local guide.  i dont "
"mind, he keeps us fed\""
msgstr ""
"\"mon rabbin a changé de confession. il nous demande de l'adresser comme "
"guide local. je m'en fiche un peu tant qu'il nous garde bien nourris."

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"Fungus are helping us.  Help them and they will unite us\""
msgstr "\"Les champignons sont nos alliés. Ils nous uniront tous si vous les aidez\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Saw a boy couldnt be older than 16.  Walked straight through the mushroom "
"tower.  THROUGH IT\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai vu un garçon qui ne devait pas avoir plus de 16 ans. Il a marché droit "
"à travers la tour mycellaire. À TRAVERS\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Found some food in a box outside my house.  We ate it and now the "
"fungaloids aren't harming us.  I think we are a mushroom now\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"saw the girl again.  she looked dead exhausted and walked right into the "
"fungus.  30 mins later and she walked out good as new\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"HADENSBROOK REBUILT AROUND FUNGUS.  THEY EAT GRAY APPLES AND SPREAD IT\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"mycus must grow\""
msgstr "\"le mycus doit prospérer\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"School bus with solar panels = TRUST.  Gave us berries and seeds, we were "
"out of food\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"d o nThelp scho Ol buss makE seeeedS ARe FUNGUS!! !\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Go to every fungus patch you find but WEAR A SUIT.  Food there is very very "
"filling.  Look for pink berries, blue flowers\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"red blue yellow berry seed sap bloom flowers tower mycus mycus mycus.\""
msgstr "\"baie rouge bleue jaune graine sève floraison fleurs tour mycus mycus mycus.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Husband 30 yrs died in bombs.  Mushrooms brought him back.  GIVE YOURSELF "
"TO THEm AND THEY WILL HELP YOU\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mari de 30 ans mort dans un bombardement. Champignons me l'on ramené. "
"REJOIGNEZ-LEs ET LEUR BÉNEVOLENCE VOUS SAUVERA\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Lisa always was a fan of sports.  Thank God these Global Athletics Games in "
"Harran started some time before the outbreak, so she was able to leave New "
"England before it was quarantined.  I can only hope there are no zombies, as "
"we do have here, in the city she flew to.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Don't mix powders, them books said.  Do Not Mix powders.  Didn't listen did "
"I.  Blew my goddamn pinky off, near lost my right eye.\""
msgstr ""
"Ne mélangez pas les poudres, les livres disait. Ne Mélangez Pas Les Poudres. "
"Est-ce que j'ai écouté? Maintenant j'ai un petit doigt en moins et je suis "
"passé à deux doigts de perdre mon œil droit."

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"followed what toby wrote down.  shells looked like theyd hold more, I put "
"in some more.  traded most to h raiders for crank.  shot my 38 today and it "
"fuckn exploded.  low on crank, good as dead, no gun, no toby.  headed to "
"montreal real sorry bout the bullets\""
msgstr ""
"\"jé suivi les instructions que toby m'vait laissé.  balles avait l'air un "
"pti peu vide, donc j'en ai rajouté.  j'ai échangé cque jé fabriqué au x "
"pillards pour un peu d'meth.  jé essayé d'tirer mon 38 aujourdhui et il a "
"explosé dans mes mains.  jsuis presque a cour de meth, un homme mort, sans "
"pistolet, sans toby.  jvai essayer d'atteindre montréal, jsuis vraiment "
"désolé pour les balles\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"…damn those hybrid cars are efficient.  wish I was smart enough to finagle "
"that engine controller out of it… heard scrapper Joe put one in his "
"deathmobile and now doesn't need gas at all… then again, Joe is full of shit…\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"⋯bioluminescent, 5' diameter⋯  appears to be an immense disembodied "
"eyeball, capable of flight and [illegible] thought\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"What's the deal with boiling water?  Rain water is distilled naturally!  "
"It's perfectly safe, you could save so much time if you didn't boil it.  I "
"drunk some river water, and I'm fine!\""
msgstr ""
"\"C'est quoi cette lubie de bouillir son eau? L'eau de pluie et distillée de "
"façon naturelle! C'est parfaitement sain de la boire, vous pourriez "
"économiser tellement de temps si vous arrêtiez de la bouillir. J'ai bu de "
"l'eau de rivière il y a pas longtemps et je vais bien!\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Went to the emergency shelter, some guy walked in, walked out, grabbed a "
"rock, smashed a bench to bits, carved a plank out of it, walked out again.  "
"Haven't seen them in 3 days… wonder what their story is.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Je suis allé à l'abri d'évacuation, un gars avec un caillou dans les mains "
"est rentré pendant que j'essayait de piquer un somme, il a utilisé le caillou "
"pour réduire en miettes un banc, a pris une planche plus ou moins intacte, et "
"ensuite, sans rien dire de plus, est sorti. Ça c'est passé il y a trois "
"jours… je me demande qu'elle est son histoire."

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"This note is covered in gray goo, ew… \"I know I have a fetish but THIS IS "
"TOO MUCH.  My hands are made of slime.  My hair is slime.  My body is covered "
"in slime.  I can't even use a crowbar 'cause of slime.  Wherever I go I leave "
"a trail of slime.  Everything's slime.  My bag is falling off my back into "
"slime.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"A page from a notebook, with a morse code reference and the following decoded "
"message: \"Whiskey echo whiskey - Lima alpha delta\""
msgstr ""
"Une page de carnet avec un code morse et le message décodé \"Whiskey Echo "
"Whiskey - Lima Alpha Delta\"."

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"See if you want to be, extra annoying you can, nod off to the, dump and go, "
"help, Erin to dig up the, last, peice\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I saw one of those Foodplace workers on the street.  Honestly, they look no "
"different alive than dead.\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai vu un employé de Foodplace en train de tituber dans la rue. "
"Honnêtement, ils n'ont pas l'air vraiment pire qu'avant.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I can imagine people sending their 'love and prayers' on social media.  "
"Love doesn't kill zeds, prayer doesn't put food in my belly.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I used to take everything at face value.  If you couldn't measure it, "
"couldn't explain it, couldn't put a number to it, it wasn't real.  Then this "
"shit happened.  Real funny.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "This note is covered in gray goo, ew… \"Blorble\""
msgstr "Cette note est couverte de boue grise, beurk… \"Blorble\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Saw some chick in the forest.  Her body is all green and shit, and she was "
"covered in leaves and vines.\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai vu une gonzesse dans la forêt. Son corps était totalement vert et elle "
"était couverte de feuilles, mousses et lianes.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Good news: My teachers aren't trying to tear my limbs off about my "
"homework.  Bad news: My teachers are trying to tear my limbs off regardless.\""
msgstr ""
"Bonne nouvelle: Mes professeurs n'essaient plus de me tailler en pièces au "
"sujet de mes devoirs. Mauvaise nouvelle: Mes professeurs veulent juste me "
"tailler en pièces."

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"G, I've stopped the bleeding, I'll be fine.  Can't stay here any longer, "
"there's too much commotion outside.  Meet me back at our usual spot, we will "
"retrieve our stuff together, don't go alone.  Be careful when exiting out the "
"back, I saw one of them running around with a spear.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, j'ai arrêté l’hémorragie, tout va bien se passer. Je ne peut pas rester "
"ici, trop d'activité là dehors. Retrouve-moi à notre lieu de rendez-vous "
"habituel, l'on ira récupérer nos trucs ensemble, n'y va pas tout seul. Fait "
"attention lorsque tu sortira par l'arrière, j'ai vu l'un d'entre eux en train "
"d'arpenter les environs avec une lance dans ses mains."

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"To whoever may find this, I've had enough of cowering and hiding.  I have "
"realized I can't outlast whatever this is.  I saw something different at the "
"grocery store down the block.  Skulking around on all four, faster than all "
"the others.  It jumped at me from behind a car.  It's as if they were all "
"changing.  I'm sure I'll see many more of these as time goes on.  I'm "
"leaving.  Whatever you want, take it.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"G, I hope you're finding my notes and the supply drops.  Use my binocs, if "
"they're still there, and check out the roof.  Avoid the huge tower.  I don't "
"know what's inside, but the noises that come out of it can't signal anything "
"good.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, j'espère que tu trouve mes notes et mes caches de provisions. Utilise "
"mes jumelles, si elle sont toujours là, et jette un coup d'œil aux alentours "
"depuis le toit. Évite la tour gigantesque à moitié effondrée. Je ne sais pas "
"ce qu'il y a à l'intérieur, mais les bruits qui s'en dégage ne signalent rien "
"de bon.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Anyone reading this, stay off the roads.  Me and the boys were ambushed by "
"some goons there.  If you see a fallen tree blocking your path, just turn "
"around and go back.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Si quelqu'un lit ceci, éviter les routes. Mes amis et moi nous sommes fait "
"pris en embuscade pars des bandits en voyageant sur l'une d'entre elles. Si "
"vous voyez un arbre bloquant la route, faite juste demi-tour promptement.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Mike, we have your dog and that ginger fuck you run around with.  You know "
"where to find us.  Come alone, it's time to pay up.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"5 gallons of water, 3 cans of chicken, 3 cans of soup, 14 9mm rounds.  "
"GUNSHOP -> CHECK GARAGE -> CUT THROUGH YARDS -> HOME\""
msgstr ""
"\"20 litres d'eau, 3 conserves de poulet, 3 conserves de soupe, 14 cartouches "
"de calibre 9mm. ARMURERIE -> VÉRIFIER LE GARAGE -> COUPER À TRAVERS LES "
"JARDINS -> MAISON\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"G, don't head straight through, go around.  There's a glowing one just "
"hanging out in the alley.  I tried stabbing it but it zapped me with some "
"sort of static electricity and I ran back here.  I'll try to whack it with a "
"club next time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, ne passe pas directement à travers, contourne. Il y en à un qui brille "
"une lueur aveuglante dans l'allée. J'ai essayé de le poignarder, mais il m'a "
"électrocuté et j'ai décidé de m'enfuir et de me réfugier ici. J'essaierai "
"d'utiliser une massue pour l'écerveler la prochaine fois que je le "
"rencontrerait.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"STOP FOLLOWING ME I CAN HEAR YOU IN THE DARK\""
msgstr "\"ARRÊTEZ DE ME SUIVRE JE PEUX VOUS ENTENDRE DANS LA NUIT\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"G, if you find this, I'm at the farm just out of town.  I'll need to stay "
"there a few days, I've been wounded by one of those overgrown bastards, shot "
"a spike right into my thigh.  I'll wait for you there as long as I can, stay "
"safe.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, si tu trouve ceci, je me suis réfugiée dans la ferme juste hors de la "
"ville. J'ai besoin de rester là plusieurs jours, je me suis fait blessée, "
"l'une de ces abominations à tirer un dard directement à travers ma cuisse. Je "
"resterais ici jusqu'à ce que je sois guérie, j'espère que tes périples sont "
"moins désastreux.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"G, the city is full of them.  I don't know how, it's as if we never came "
"through here.  They're the same ones we'd put down, I am sure of it.  They "
"got back up and now look more dangerous than ever.  I saw one of them just "
"snatch a bird right off the roof with its long hands.  You have to use the "
"sewers.  I know we agreed not to travel underground, but as horrible as it is "
"down there, I fear our world up here is no longer ours either.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, ils submergent totalement la ville. Je ne sais pas comment, c'est comme "
"si nous n'étions jamais passé à travers. Ce sont les mêmes que nous avons "
"abattus, j'en suis sûre. Ils se sont relevés et beaucoup d'entre eux ont "
"l'air plus dangereux que jamais. Je viens d'en voir un attraper un oiseau sur "
"un gouttière avec ses bras absurdement longs et le fourrer dans sa bouche. Tu "
"devrais probablement utiliser les égouts. Je sais que nous nous étions dit de "
"ne jamais utiliser les souterrains à nouveau, mais peu importe les dangers du "
"monde en dessous, je ne crois pas que le monde d'au dessus nous appartienne "
"encore.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"G, move only after dark.  I saw lights in the distance, I think there might "
"be someone living around here.  Wish I had my radio right now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, ne bouge qu'après que le soleil se soit couché. J'ai vu des lumières au "
"loin, je pense que quelqu'un vit dans les environs. Comme je voudrais avoir "
"ma radio sur moi là maintenant.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"G, I have not found any of your notes, which means you're either taking a "
"different path or have already made your way back home.  In the case you're "
"still out here somewhere, if you see the sky suddenly grow dark, hide indoors "
"immediately, I have a feeling this storm is far from over.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, je n'ai trouvé aucune de tes notes, ce qui veut dire que soit tu est en "
"train de prendre un chemin différent où que tu est déjà rentré au bercail. Au "
"cas où tu est encore au large, si tu vois le ciel s'assombrir, cache toi à "
"l'intérieur d'un bâtiment immédiatement, j'ai bien peur que cette tempête "
"soit loin d'être terminée.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"2236\""
msgstr "\"2236\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"G, be careful around those bulging and pulsating corpses.  I saw one today. "
" I think there's something eating away at those things.  I didn't stick "
"around to find out.  I burnt the entire building down, just to be sure, so "
"you should have relatively safe passage.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, fait attention à ces corps gonflés et pulsants. J'en ai vu un "
"aujourd'hui. Je crois qu'il y a quelque chose les dévorant de l'intérieur. "
"J'ai juste mis feu au bâtiment, pour être sûre, donc si tu passe par là, tu "
"devrais être relativement en sécurité.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"G, I ran into an actual human today!  He was looking for his daughter.  We "
"exchanged some food and traded information on the surrounding area.  He spoke "
"of a family living on a farm out in the fields, surviving and thriving!  "
"Maybe it's time we carved ourselves a peaceful place in this hell.  We'll "
"discuss this once we meet back home.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, j'ai rencontré un autre être humain aujourd'hui! Il était à la recherche "
"de sa fille. Nous avons troqué de la nourriture et des informations sur les "
"environs. Il m'a parlé d'une famille vivant assez bien sur une ferme isolée! "
"Peut être qu'il serait temps que nous nous construisons un endroit sûr et "
"agréable au milieu de ce cauchemar. On pourra discuter de tout ça lorsque "
"nous serons tout les deux de retour à la maison.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"G, there's something not right with the forests here.  The ground there "
"feels soft and is overgrown with some sort of mushrooms.  Be careful not to "
"breathe in the dust they kick up, I accidentally took a whiff and have been "
"coughing and vomiting since.  The map shows there's a cabin just outside "
"town, I'll lay low there until I feel better.  I'm almost home.  I know you "
"will be waiting for me there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, il y a quelque chose de bizarre avec les forêts dans les environs, le "
"sol est bizarrement doux et humide et recouvert d'une sorte de tapis de "
"champignons. Fait attention à ne pas respirer la poussière que ceux-ci "
"relâchent, j'ai en accidentellement ingérer une bouffée et je n'ai pas "
"arrêter de tousser et vomir depuis. La carte que j'ai trouvée indique un "
"chalet dans les environs, je vais essayer de m'abriter là jusqu'à ce que je "
"me sente mieux. Je suis presque de retour à la maison. Je sais que tu sera là "
"à m'attendre.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I saw a zombie covered in shrooms emitting some strange dust.  When another "
"zombie got close, the two tore each other apart.  I'd rather not stay here "
"anymore.  Im packing up my stuff soon.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I can see a large tower in the distance, And strange stalk-like creatures "
"are around it.  I feel sick just looking at it, and fire hasn't solved it.  "
"Those things seem to stay around it though.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"These berries are delicious!  Maybe taking these were worth it.  And the "
"more I eat, the more of it appears!  it's like an infinite food cycle!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I found a corpse with strange berries shoved down their gullet, seems to "
"have choked to death on the stuff.  greedy bastard\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"Don't trust them.  The mushrooms aren't your friends.  They're delusional\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ne leur faites pas confiance.  Les champignons ne sont pas vos amis.  Ils "
"délirent\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"trust me!  The mushrooms are your friends!  They brung her back!  they'll "
"bring everybody back!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"It's been weeks since I've seen anyone else.  The silence is deafening, "
"almost as if the world is holding its breath.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Found an old photo of my family today.  God, I miss them.  If only I could "
"turn back time.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Saw a group of them today, huddled around something.  When I got closer, I "
"realized they were eating one of their own.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"Started talking to myself more often.  It's scary how normal it feels now.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I tried to build a makeshift radio.  All I get is static and an occasional "
"eerie whisper.  Maybe I'm going mad.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"If you're reading this, I'm heading to the old church.  It seems safer "
"there.  The walls are thick, and I need some peace.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I heard a child laughing today.  It was just in my head.  Has to be.  "
"There's no way a child could survive this.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"The water smells strange.  Can't remember the last time I drank something "
"that didn't taste like chemicals.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"They found me.  I can hear them scratching at the door.  If anyone finds "
"this, I'm sorry I couldn't make it.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Every night, I dream of the beach.  The sound of waves.  The smell of salt. "
" Waking up is the worst part.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Chaque nuit, je rêve de la plage.  Le son des vagues.  L'odeur du sel.  "
"S'en réveiller est dur.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"There are eyes in the dark.  Watching.  Waiting.  I can't stay here any "
"longer.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Il y a des yeux dans la nuit.  Ils observent, ils m'attendent.  Je ne peut "
"pas rester ici plus longtemps.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"All the lights are out.  It's like the world is sleeping.  Or maybe it's "
"dead.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I found a stash of old comic books.  For a few moments, I was a kid again.  "
"Then reality set back in.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"Met a guy today.  Said he's immune.  Bullshit, right?  No one is immune.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Ran out of ammo today.  Guess it's back to the good old-fashioned baseball "
"bat.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"My watch stopped working.  Funny how something so small can make you feel "
"completely lost.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"If you find this, head to the old mill on the outskirts.  There's a safe "
"place there.  For now.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I think the government knew about this.  They were prepared.  We're just "
"the collateral damage.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Je pense que le gouvernment était au courant de ce qui se passait.  Ils "
"étaient préparés et nous sommes juste des dégâts collatéraux.\""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Saw a plane today.  Low and slow.  Could be a sign of hope, or just another "
"trap.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes I forget what the world was like before.  It's like a distant "
"memory, fading away.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"My hands are shaking so badly, I can barely write.  Not sure if it's fear "
"or the cold.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Heard gunshots last night.  Not sure if that means someone survived or "
"someone else died.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"The nights are the worst.  That's when the voices come.  Whispering things "
"I don't want to hear.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Why do the zombies avoid the old cemetery?  It's like something even they "
"fear.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"I miss hot showers.  Hell, I miss being clean.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"There's a weird fungus growing everywhere.  I'm starting to think it's not "
"just a plant.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"The sky looks different now.  Like it's always twilight.  The sun never "
"fully rises.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"If I make it through this, I swear I'll never complain about anything ever "
"again.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Saw a woman today, just standing there, staring at the sky.  She didn't "
"even notice me.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I found an old music box.  It still works.  Played it for a while, trying "
"to remember happier times.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"Why did this happen?  Who's to blame?  Was it us?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes I think it would be easier to just give up.  But then I think of "
"you, and I keep going.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"They're evolving.  Saw one today that looked almost… not human.  God help "
"us.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Found an old map.  Marked a few places I want to check out.  Maybe there's "
"hope out there.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"The smell of death is everywhere.  It's inescapable.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Met a trader today.  Bartered some ammo for food.  There's still a spark of "
"humanity left.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"I saw a pack of wild dogs today.  They're surviving better than we are.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Got bit today.  Not sure how much time I have left.  Just wanted to say I "
"love you.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"If you find this, know that I tried my best.  I hope you fare better.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"They say there's a safe zone in the north.  I don't know if it's true, but "
"I have to try.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"The wind howls through the empty streets, like the world itself is "
"mourning.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"They scream when they burn.  The sound haunts me.  But it's the only way to "
"be sure.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"Found a severed hand today.  It was clutching a note that read 'Kill me.'\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I can hear the whispers in my head.  They tell me to do things.  Horrible "
"things.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"The darkness is alive.  I swear I saw it move.  It's watching me.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I tried to cut it out, but it just keeps growing.  I can feel it under my "
"skin, crawling.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"The baby was stillborn.  We didn't bury it.  It got up and walked away.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I watched as they tore him apart, piece by piece.  He was still screaming "
"when they started eating his guts.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"Don't trust the shadows.  They move when you're not looking.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I can't sleep.  Every time I close my eyes, I see their faces.  The ones I "
"couldn't save.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I thought I heard my mom calling me from the basement.  But she's been dead "
"for years.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"They don't just bite.  They infect you with something.  You start to rot "
"from the inside out.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I keep hearing scratching in the walls.  Something's in there, trying to "
"get out.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I found a pile of bones today.  They were arranged in a circle, like some "
"kind of ritual.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"There's something wrong with the air.  It tastes… metallic.  Makes my head "
"feel heavy.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I saw my reflection in the mirror, but it wasn't me.  It smiled and its "
"eyes were black.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"They don't just kill you.  They take over your body, use you like a puppet.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"I woke up covered in blood.  I don't know whose blood it is.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"The voices are getting louder.  They tell me to do unspeakable things.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"I found a tooth embedded in my arm.  It wasn't mine.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Saw a man eating his own fingers today.  He didn't stop until he choked on "
"the bones.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"The ground outside my house is moving, like it's breathing.  I can't go out "
"there.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"I heard children laughing in the forest.  There are no children left.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"Something's growing inside me.  I can feel it moving, shifting.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I saw a woman gouging out her eyes.  Said she didn't want to see the "
"monsters anymore.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"Don't drink the water.  It makes you see things.  Terrible things.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"They don't have faces anymore.  Just blank, smooth skin.  And they scream.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"I found a room full of dolls.  Their eyes followed me as I moved.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"Something's wrong with the sky.  It's… pulsating.  Like it's alive.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"The flies are everywhere.  They whisper secrets in your ears.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I found a journal.  It describes rituals.  Dark, horrifying rituals.  I "
"think they worked.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"The birds are watching us.  They're not birds anymore.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Heard someone singing today.  Followed the sound, but there was no one "
"there.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"I saw a man turn inside out.  His screams still echo in my ears.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"I found a hand nailed to a tree.  It was pointing west.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"The rain burns.  It's like acid.  My skin is covered in blisters.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Something crawled out of the sewer today.  It wasn't human.  It wasn't "
"anything I've ever seen.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I watched my friend rot alive.  It started with his eyes, then his skin "
"just peeled away.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"I found a child's shoe.  It was filled with teeth.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"The trees have faces now.  They whisper my name when I pass by.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I saw a man dragging his entrails behind him.  He was still alive, begging "
"for help.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Don't trust the light.  It draws you in, but it's a trap.  A trap set by "
"them.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"I found a cocoon.  Something inside was moving.  It looked almost… human.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"I saw a face in the fog.  It wasn't human.  It smiled at me.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"The ground is covered in blood.  It's seeping up from below.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"I hear them in the walls.  Scratching, clawing.  They're coming.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"I found a mirror.  My reflection waved at me, but I didn't move.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"They've started to speak.  Their voices are garbled, but they're learning "
"our language.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I saw a man without a shadow today.  He looked right through me, like I "
"wasn't there.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"The sun never sets anymore.  It just hangs there, glaring down at us.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"To my dearest Emily, if you're reading this, I want you to know that I "
"never stopped looking for you.  Please be safe.  I love you more than "
"anything.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Sarah, I'm so sorry I couldn't keep my promise.  I tried to get back, but "
"they were everywhere.  I hope you made it to the shelter.  I love you, "
"forever.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Mom, if you find this, know that I'm sorry.  I should've listened to you "
"and stayed put.  I hope you're safe.  Love, your stubborn son.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Dear Lily, daddy's gone to find food.  I'll be back soon.  Be brave for me, "
"princess.  I love you to the moon and back.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Anna, I found a safe place.  Follow the trail of red ribbons.  I'll be "
"waiting for you.  I love you, always.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"To my beloved wife, I've gone to find help.  If I don't make it, please "
"remember our happy times and stay strong.  All my love, always.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Michael, I heard there's a safe zone up north.  I'm heading there.  Please, "
"if you're still alive, meet me there.  I can't do this without you.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"To my little brother, I'm so sorry I wasn't there to protect you.  I hope "
"you're with mom and dad now.  I miss you more than words can say.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Ellie, if you find this, I'm heading to the coast.  I pray you're safe and "
"we'll be together soon.  I love you, now and always.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Dear John, I waited as long as I could.  Supplies are running low, and I "
"need to move on.  Please find me.  I'll be leaving signs.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"To my sweet daughter, I left your favorite doll in the blue house on Elm "
"Street.  I hope it gives you comfort.  Stay safe, my angel.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Dear Maria, I think of you every day.  I'm sorry for all the fights.  I'd "
"give anything to see your smile again.  I love you, always.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Jake, if you find this, I'm sorry I couldn't be stronger.  Please forgive "
"me and stay alive for both of us.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"To my darling wife, I'm sorry I couldn't protect our family.  I hope you "
"and the kids are somewhere safe.  I love you all so much.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"My love, I've gone to find medicine.  I'll be back.  Hold on just a little "
"longer.  I can't lose you.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"To my brave little boy, daddy had to leave to find food.  Be strong and "
"take care of mommy.  I love you more than anything.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Rachel, every night I dream of you.  I hope you're safe and we'll see each "
"other again.  I miss you so much.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Dear Sam, I found a safe place.  Look for the red X on the old barn.  I'll "
"be waiting for you.  Stay strong.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"To my beautiful wife, I don't know if I'll make it back.  But please know "
"that you and the kids were my everything.  I love you.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"My dear Emma, I left a map in the old treehouse.  Follow it to find me.  "
"I'm sorry I couldn't be there to protect you.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"To my beloved family, I tried my best to keep us all together.  If you find "
"this, please remember me and take care of each other.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Dad, I'm heading to the city to find help.  Please be safe and wait for me. "
"I love you.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Dear Laura, the world is a nightmare now, but I hold onto the hope that "
"you're safe.  I love you more than life itself.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Mom, I'm so sorry I left.  I thought I could find food.  Please forgive me "
"and stay safe.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"To my sweet son, I've hidden some supplies in the attic.  Be brave and "
"remember I love you.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Jessica, if you're reading this, I made it to the old cabin.  It's safe "
"here.  Please come find me.  I need you.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"To my loving husband, I'm sorry I couldn't hold on longer.  I hope you find "
"peace and remember our love.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Mom, dad, I'm heading to the farm.  If you're out there, meet me there.  I "
"miss you both so much.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"To my little sister, I left you a teddy bear in the bunker.  Hold onto it "
"and know I'm always with you.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Dear Mark, I've gone to look for a way out.  If you find this, know that I "
"love you and will always be with you in spirit.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Sarah, I think of you every day.  I hope you're alive and we'll find each "
"other again.  I love you.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"To my dear wife, I'm sorry I couldn't protect you.  Please forgive me.  I "
"love you eternally.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"To my brave daughter, if you find this, know that daddy loves you and is "
"always with you, even if you can't see me.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Anna, I found shelter in the old mill.  It's safe here.  Please come find "
"me.  I need you.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"To my darling son, I've left you all the supplies I could gather.  Be "
"strong and know that I love you.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"My dearest Emily, I'm sorry I couldn't be there to protect you.  I hope "
"you're somewhere safe.  I love you so much.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"To my sweet wife, I tried to find help but I'm running out of time.  Please "
"stay strong.  I love you always.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Mom, I'm sorry for everything.  I hope you're safe.  I love you more than "
"words can say.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Dear John, I found a place to hide.  It's safe for now.  Please come find "
"me.  I miss you.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"To my beloved daughter, I'm sorry I couldn't protect you.  I love you with "
"all my heart.  Stay strong.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
msgid ""
"The bark of this \"plant\" has a bark like texture, but is more leathery in "
"consistency."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
msgid ""
"The smell emanating from the creature when you dissect it reminds you of "
"vegetables."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
msgid "The monster's sap is sticky and somewhat greenish."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
msgid ""
"While outwardly plant like, the creature's muscles look surprisingly similar "
"to those of normal animals."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
msgid ""
"Thick fibers are found throughout the body of the creature.  Perhaps they "
"serve a scaffolding purpose similar to that of (very flexible) bones."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
msgid ""
"The creature's whip like sting drips from poison.  You take extra care not to "
"accidentally scratch yourself on it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest_deeper>"
msgid ""
"The creature appears to have a vascular system vaguely similar to those of "
"animals, with a branching network of vein, although the organization is "
"unfamiliar."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest_deeper>"
msgid ""
"You find what you think is a heart, although it doesn't look like any "
"configuration you know of from Earth.  In fact, you find four hearts, each "
"seemingly supporting a lateral quarter of the body."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest_deeper>"
msgid ""
"A sac connected to the sting is filled with some fluid.  Might it perhaps "
"have some useful properties?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest_deeper>"
msgid ""
"While the roots of the plant creature contain muscles and veins, they also "
"contain finer networks indicating a use for nutrient uptake when the roots "
"are lodged into the soil."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest_deeper>"
msgid ""
"At the top of the creature you find what you assume is a brain, although it "
"seems to employ quadrilateral symmetry and thus is shaped and organized "
"completely differently from that of terrestrial versions."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
msgid ""
"There is a picture of a kitten pouncing; blood faintly drips from its claws.  "
"\"I'd kill!  For you to be my valentine.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
msgid ""
"A police robot stalks between office cubicles while an indistinct person "
"hides under a desk.  \"Don't hide from love!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
msgid "A picture of a bloody steak.  \"My love can feed you.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
msgid ""
"A rustic campground at night lit by a campfire.  \"We should go away "
"together.  Where no one can find us.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
msgid ""
"A girl with a giant spoon stirs a cauldron with a boy inside and a fire "
"below.  \"You suit my taste just right, Valentine\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
msgid ""
"A person stepping out from the forest.  \"Don't be afraid, it's me, your "
"valentine!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
msgid ""
"A building that says 'Crematorium' on it.  \"Ashes to ashes, dust to dust, "
"show me a Valentine, that I can trust\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
msgid ""
"A popular RPG character.  \"We should adventure together.\"  In the "
"background, a village in flames."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
msgid ""
"A picture of a room that looks like your bedroom.  \"I can't wait to see you "
"again, Valentine.  Sweet dreams.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
msgid ""
"A girl smiles into the camera.  Behind her a house is on fire.  \"I'm "
"burning, I'm burning, I'm burning for you, my valentine!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Blocked"
msgid "There's nothing that way but a plane of featureless black."
msgstr ""
"Il n'y a rien dans cette direction à part une étendue parfaitement plate de "
"verre noir."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
msgid ""
"With all this glass, you expected it to be brighter here.  It's not.  That's "
"okay, it would have hurt your eyes otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Avec tout ce verre, vous vous seriez attendu·e à ce que les choses soient "
"plus lumineuses ici, mais non.  Vous supposez que ce n'est pas plus mal, cela "
"vous aurait fait mal aux yeux de toute façon."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
msgid "A gust of wind blows across the farm.  Glass chimes in the breeze."
msgstr "Une brise de vent souffle à travers la ferme.  Du verre carillonne."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
msgid "You are suddenly very aware of your heartbeat, but only for a moment."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes soudainement très conscient·e des battements de votre cœur pour un "
"court moment."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
msgid ""
"The glass around you isn't sparkling; it doesn't reflect.  The glimmers that "
"cross it in the corner of your eye are your imagination."
msgstr ""
"Le verre autour de vous ne scintille pas, ne réfléchit pas.  Les lueurs le "
"parcourant dans le coin de votre vue ne sont que le fruit de votre "
"imagination."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
msgid "It's very cold here."
msgstr "Il fait vraiment froid ici."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
msgid ""
"You didn't realize there had been an ache at the base of your neck all day "
"until just now, when you notice it's gone."
msgstr ""
"Vous ne vous étiez pas rendu·e compte d'une douleur lançant votre cou toute "
"la journée jusqu'à maintenant, et celle-ci s'évanouit quelques moments plus "
"tard."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
msgid ""
"There's nothing here, really.  How long has it been since you've felt truly "
"safe?"
msgstr ""
"Il n'y a rien ici, vraiment.  Depuis quand vous êtes vous vraiment senti·e en "
"sécurité?"

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
msgid ""
"You find yourself wondering what the glass tastes like.  You're ashamed of "
"the thought."
msgstr ""
"Vous songez quel goût le verre aurait, et ceci vous dégoûte un peu "
"soudainement."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
msgid ""
"The glass is solid under your feet.  It supports you completely, but the "
"feeling of it under your feet is dull, somehow."
msgstr ""
"Le verre est solide sous vos pieds.  Il vous supporte totalement, mais la "
"sensation est d'une manière ou d'une un peu sourde."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
msgid ""
"You can't see it's light, but you know the sun is there.  It's the same "
"perfect black as the rest of the sky."
msgstr ""
"Vous ne pouvez pas voir sa lumière, mais vous pouvez sentir la présence du "
"soleil, mais celui est aussi noir que le reste du ciel."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
msgid ""
"You are seized with a brief desire to smash something, anything.  You don't "
"know why you'd think such an unseemly thing.  It doesn't feel at all like you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
msgid ""
"The edges of the glass are very sharp.  But that is the nature of glass.  "
"Isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
msgid ""
"You think, for a moment, that you might start flying.  You don't, but it "
"doesn't trouble you much."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
msgid ""
"Somewhere, inside a ribcage, something is beating very fast.  Something about "
"that strikes you as very funny."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
msgid "How long has it been since you blinked?  It probably doesn't matter."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
msgid ""
"You spend a moment looking at your reflection in the glass.  What a nice "
"smile you have!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
msgid ""
"How very smooth it all is.  Even the sharp parts; especially the sharp parts. "
" Pristine, and perfect."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
msgid "You're so glad you decided to visit."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
msgid ""
"You were shivering, a little bit ago.  It's stopped now.  You must have "
"warmed up."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
msgid ""
"Everything seems so much more real than usual.  It's all right there.  Reach "
"out; touch it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
msgid ""
"The place you left behind was much worse than this.  All noise and uneven "
"edges."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you should rest?  The furniture here is all hard glass, but you're "
"sure it won't trouble you.  You can't imagine anything hurting, here."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
msgid "The people here are so kind.  Their smiles are so bright."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
msgid "Everything here is in its proper place.  Except you.  But there's still time."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
msgid ""
"Some of the dust is blown up into a thick cloud.  You take a deep lungful; "
"it's like incense, but cleaner."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
msgid "Your teeth are the best part of you, really."
msgstr "Vos dents sont la plus jolie partie de votre corps."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
msgid ""
"Before you decided to visit, you might have thought you were feeling pain.  "
"How silly you were!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
msgid ""
"It feels like your ribs are finally able to tuck inwards, where they belong, "
"now that all that mess and noise is settling down."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
msgid "What a wonderful place.  What a wonderful place!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
msgid ""
"You catch a glimpse of your hands.  They're all wrong.  They won't do at all. "
" Not all askew like this."
msgstr ""
"Vous jetez un coup d'œil à vos mains.  Rien ne va.  Ceci ne va pas du tout.  "
"Tout est de travers."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
msgid ""
"The glass is singing.  Or is that you?  No, it's both.  Your voices are "
"beautiful together."
msgstr ""
"Le verre chante.  Ou est-ce vous?  Non, tout chante, les voix sont tellement "
"harmonieuses."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
msgid ""
"When you turn your head, you can hear the wet click of tendons in your neck.  "
"How dreadful.  It won't be a problem, soon."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque vous tournez votre tête, vous pouvez ressentir le clic humide des "
"tendons de votre cou.  Affreux, mais ceci cessera d'être un problème très "
"bientôt."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
msgid ""
"It would be a very good idea to lie down and close your eyes.  You could "
"listen to the glass sing you to sleep."
msgstr ""
"Il serait une très bonne idée de vous allonger et de fermer vos yeux.  Vous "
"pourriez écouter la berceuse du verre."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
msgid ""
"Your head feels heavy on your neck, your arms heavy on your shoulders.  What "
"an awful demand, to expect you to hold them up with a few strips of muscle.  "
"You poor thing."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
msgid ""
"What a blessing it is, to be in a place without distractions like this.  What "
"a joy, to think clearly for the first time in your life."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
msgid ""
"You were thinking about leaving, before.  You don't remember why; the thought "
"has been trimmed so neatly."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
msgid ""
"Stand straighter.  Straighter.  Not like that.  How will you ever fit in like "
"that?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
msgid ""
"The wind stirs the glass, and interrupts its melody with ugly noise.  You "
"think you might like to kill the wind."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
msgid ""
"You remember thinking they were reflections.  You laugh, high and bright and "
"perfect."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
msgid ""
"Your nerves are alight.  Not crackling like they were before; instead, "
"perfect snaps, one two three one two three four."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
msgid ""
"You'd really like to sit down.  No, no, not that; and let your heavy head bow "
"your spine?  Lying would be much better.  Lying flat."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
msgid ""
"There are so many parts of you that are wrong.  But that's not their fault.  "
"Once they're clipped away and laid out, they'll all fit."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
msgid ""
"Every move you make, your bones crackle and pop.  They're getting closer.  "
"How wonderful!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
msgid ""
"Something somewhere is screaming.  Forcing air out of the nasty sacks in its "
"chest.  You're so glad that's not you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
msgid ""
"For the first time in your life, you are free of the ugly sound of your pulse "
"in your ears.  How did you ever function, beaten down by that hideous rhythm?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
msgid ""
"It's been quite a while since you had a thought.  Noticing that, itself, "
"screeches unpleasantly in your cold, clear mind."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
msgid ""
"You try to walk in time, one two three one two three four, but your legs "
"aren't right.  They need to be fixed."
msgstr ""
"Vous essayez de maintenir une cadence, un deux trois un deux trois quatre, "
"mais vos jambes ne vont pas. Elles ont besoin d'être soignées."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
msgid ""
"Something is pushing out from under your skin.  Taking the ugly mess away, to "
"iron it flat."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
msgid ""
"You don't have enough edges.  You could fix that.  Right now.  Look; the "
"glass is so sharp."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
msgid ""
"Don't let go of this.  Cling tighter.  No, tighter.  If it breaks, the pieces "
"will be prettier anyway."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
msgid ""
"Look how well it all fits together.  Nice, neat lines.  The curves are the "
"best; a million little lines and a million again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
msgid "Stop moving.  You're ruining it."
msgstr "Arrêtez de bouger.  Vous êtes en train de tout ruiner."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
msgid ""
"You can't cut well enough yet, but you're so close.  Smaller and sharper and "
"cleaner, all of it."
msgstr ""
"Vous ne coupez toujours pas assez bien, mais vous êtes tellement proche. Tout "
"est tellement plus aiguisé, plus affiné, plus propre."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
msgid ""
"Every motion shaves you down, finer and finer and finer and finer and finer "
"and finer."
msgstr ""
"Chaque mouvement vous affine, de plus en plus en plus en plus en plus en plus "
"aiguisé(e)."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
msgid ""
"It's so selfish of you to keep yourself this ugly whole, when you could be so "
"many perfect pieces."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes tellement égoïste, rester sous cette forme complète tellement "
"hideuse, lorsque vous pourriez être une multitude de fragments parfaits."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
msgid ""
"You have brought pain to this place of peace; the pain of being incorrect.  "
"It is awful of you.  But you are forgiven."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
msgid ""
"Such a rare and beautiful blessing, you have been given.  You are so grateful "
"that you might cry, if you still needed that ugly function."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
msgid ""
"You've done so well!  You've been so patient, while you are being fixed.  "
"This is why you were chosen for it.  You deserve it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
msgid "Sleep now.  It will be dreamless, and empty, as it always should have been."
msgstr "Reposez-vous. Votre sommeil sera sans rêves, comme il aurait toujours dû être."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
msgid "Thoughts are slow now.  Simple.  Clean."
msgstr "Vos pensées sont tellement lentes maintenant. Simples. Propres."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
msgid "Sharper.  Sharper.  Sharper."
msgstr "Plus aiguisé(e). Plus aiguisé(e). Plus aiguisé(e)."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
msgid "You're almost complete."
msgstr "Vous êtes presque complet/complète."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
msgid "You should rest.  You've never rested before now."
msgstr "Vous devriez vous reposer. Vous ne vous êtes jamais vraiment reposé(e)."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
msgid "You're glittering.  Finally, you're glittering."
msgstr "Vous scintillez, vous scintillez finalement."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
msgid "This is it.  Your flourishing.  Your apotheosis."
msgstr "Voilà.  Votre épanouissement.  Votre apothéose."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
msgid "The parts of you you don't need are howling.  They don't understand yet."
msgstr ""
"Les parties de vous dont vous n'avez pas besoin hurlent. Elles ne comprennent "
"pas encore."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
msgid "All your facets are here.  Every one smooth, perfect."
msgstr "Toutes vos facettes sont là. Chacune d'entre elles lisses et parfaites."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
msgid "Cold.  So cold.  Perfect.  Perfect."
msgstr "Froid.  Tellement froid.  Parfait.  Parfait."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
msgid "The song.  The silence.  The song.  The silence.  The song.  The silence."
msgstr "La mélodie. Le silence. La mélodie. Le silence. La mélodie. Le silence."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
msgid "Smooth.  Clean.  The best of you, finally."
msgstr "Lisse. Propre. Juste le meilleur de vous, enfin."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
msgid "Almost nothing left now.  It's all been shaved away."
msgstr "Presque rien ne reste. Tout a été limé."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
msgid "Look how you catch the light, now.  Never look away."
msgstr ""
"Regardez comment vous reflétez la lumière maintenant. N'arrêtez jamais de "
"regarder."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
msgid "Be still, now.  There is nothing left to do."
msgstr "Arrêtez de bouger. Vous n'avez rien à faire."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
msgid "Edges.  Lines.  Points.  Happy.  Happy."
msgstr "Tranchants.  Lignes.  Pointes.  Joie.  Joie."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
msgid "Let go, now.  Let what you are clutching become perfect too."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Final"
msgid ""
"You don't think about what has happened to you.  You don't think, ever again. "
" There's no need.  Every part of you is finally as it should be."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_1"
msgid "Blood drips from your cuts.  It doesn't reach the ground."
msgstr "Du sang goutte de vos coupures, mais n'atteint pas le sol."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_1"
msgid "Your cuts don't hurt anymore.  Or do they?  It's different, somehow."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_1"
msgid "Blood falls from your wounds in ugly little drops.  It's disgusting."
msgstr "Du sang tombe de vos blessures en petites gouttes hideuses. Répugnant."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_1"
msgid "You feel a little better, with some of your blood gone.  Cleaner."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous sentez un peu mieux, vous étant débarrassé(e) d'un peu de votre "
"sang. Plus propre."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_2"
msgid ""
"It's horrible, the stuff dripping from you.  How kind it is of the glass to "
"let you be free of it."
msgstr ""
"Le liquide qui goutte de votre corps est horrible. Heureusement que le verre "
"vous donne la miséricorde de vous en débarasser."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_2"
msgid ""
"You are not open enough.  How will you be clean and dry, with only these few "
"little cuts?"
msgstr ""
"Vous n'êtes pas assez ouvert(e). Comment pourrez-vous être propre et sain(e) "
"avec seulement ces quelques coupures?"

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_2"
msgid ""
"Your blood isn't quite liquid anymore.  Slurry, like crushed ice.  It's not "
"good enough yet."
msgstr ""
"Votre sang n'est plus parfaitement liquide, vous donnant l'impression d'être "
"plus comme de la glace pilée. Pas encore satisfaisant."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_2"
msgid ""
"Out it comes, the nasty fluid sloshing through your tubes.  Out it comes to "
"be fixed."
msgstr ""
"Cela sort, le fluide dégoûtant clapotant à travers vos tubes. Cela sort pour "
"être corrigé."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_3"
msgid "More.  Bleed more.  You're almost clean."
msgstr "Plus. Saignez plus. Vous êtes presque propre."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_3"
msgid "Your fluids are so ugly.  You're so close to being free."
msgstr "Vos fluides sont tellement affreux. Vous êtes tellement proche d'être libre."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_3"
msgid ""
"Look.  You're bleeding snowflakes.  A thousand little parts of you are "
"finding themselves."
msgstr ""
"Regardez. Vous saignez des flocons de neige. Un millier de petite parties de "
"vous transformées en ce qu'elles devraient vraiment être."

#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_3"
msgid ""
"If you broke your skin just a little more, it would be that much easier to "
"lift it away."
msgstr ""
"Si vous brisiez votre peau juste un peu plus, il serait tellement plus facile "
"de vous en débarrasser."

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Freakazoid_1"
msgid ""
"The scariest thing in the world would be… if all the air in the world turned "
"to WOOD!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Freakazoid_2"
msgid ""
"Okay, like, the scariest thing in the world would be… if like you went to "
"grab something and it wasn't there!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Simpsons_1"
msgid "Could Jesus microwave a burrito so hot, that he himself couldn't eat it?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Simpsons_2"
msgid "They call them fingers, but I never see them fing."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Simpsons_3"
msgid "…oh, there they go."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Timothy_Leary"
msgid "Science is all metaphor."
msgstr "La science est une métaphore."

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_IASIF"
msgid "Science is a liar sometimes."
msgstr "La science ment de temps en temps."

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Durr"
msgid "Science is… wait, what was I talking about again?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Dazed_and_Confused_1"
msgid ""
"Behind every good man there is a woman, and that woman was Martha Washington, "
"man."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Dazed_and_Confused_2"
msgid ""
"Every day, George would come home, and she would have a big fat bowl waiting "
"for him when he came in the door, man."
msgstr ""
"Chaque jour, George rentrait à la maison, et elle lui aurait préparé un bon "
"gros bol pour son arrivée, mon gars."

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Dazed_and_Confused_3"
msgid "She was a hip, hip, hip lady, man."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Dazed_and_Confused_4"
msgid "Walkin' down the hall, by myself, smokin' a j with fifty elves."
msgstr ""
"Et j'march dans le couloir, à moi tout seul, et j'fum un bedo avec quinze "
"elfes."

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Half_Baked_1"
msgid "You ever see the back of a twenty dollar bill… on weed?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Half_Baked_2"
msgid ""
"Oh, there's some crazy shit, man.  There's a dude in the bushes.  Has he got "
"a gun?  I dunno!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Half_Baked_3"
msgid "RED TEAM GO, RED TEAM GO!"
msgstr "ALLER LES ROUGES, ALLER LES ROUGES !"

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Half_Baked_4"
msgid "That weed was the shiz-nittlebam snip-snap-sack."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Bible"
msgid "You have a sudden urge to flip your bible open to Genesis 1:29…"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez une envie soudaine d'ouvrir votre bible et de lire le passage "
"Genèse 1:29…"

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Big_Lebowski"
msgid "That rug really tied the room together…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Mitch_Hedberg"
msgid "I used to do drugs… I still do, but I used to, too."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Bob_Marley"
msgid "The herb reveals you to yourself."
msgstr "L'herbe vous révèle à vous-même."

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Bill_Hicks"
msgid ""
"You suddenly realize that all matter is merely energy condensed to a slow "
"vibration, and we are all one consciousness experiencing itself subjectively."
msgstr ""
"Vous réalisez soudainement que toute la matière n'est qu'énergie condensée en "
"une vibration lente, et que nous sommes tous une même conscience qui se "
"découvre subjectivement."

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Steve_Martin_1"
msgid "I usually only smoke in the late evening."
msgstr "Je fume généralement uniquement en soirée."

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Steve_Martin_2"
msgid ""
"Oh, occasionally the early evening, but usually the late evening, or the "
"mid-evening."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Steve_Martin_3"
msgid "Just the early evening, mid-evening and late evening."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Steve_Martin_4"
msgid ""
"Occasionally, early afternoon, early mid-afternoon, or perhaps the late "
"mid-afternoon."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Steve_Martin_5"
msgid "Oh, sometimes the early-mid-late-early-morning."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Steve_Martin_6"
msgid "…But never at dusk."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Cheech_and_Chong"
msgid "Dave's not here, man."
msgstr "Dave est pas là, mec/meuf."

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Real_Life_1"
msgid "Man, a cheeseburger sounds SO awesome right now."
msgstr "Man, un cheeseburger me donne TROP envie là maintenant."

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Real_Life_2"
msgid "Eh… maybe not."
msgstr "Euh… peut-être pas."

#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Real_Life_3"
msgid "I guess, maybe, without the cheese… yeah."
msgstr "J'imagine, peut-être, sans le fromage… ouais."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
msgid ""
"This looks like a stomach and length of intestine, if they were made of lung "
"tissue.  Every now and then you notice it expanding or contracting slightly.  "
"It looks dangerous to eat, maybe even to handle."
msgstr ""
"Ceci à l'air d'être un estomac et un morceau d'intestins, si ceux-ci avait la "
"même apparence qu'un poumon.  Vous l'observez de temps à autre se contracter "
"puis se gonfler légèrement.  Ceci a l'air toxique à manger, peut être même à "
"manipuler."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
msgid ""
"A clump of rotten entrails.  The sallow membranes that link these lobes of "
"flesh together are lined with blackened veins and capillaries.  A caul of "
"slime coats them all in a greasy sheen.  You should not put this anywhere "
"near your mouth."
msgstr ""
"Un morceau d'entrailles pourries.  Les membranes cireuses attachant ensemble "
"les amas de chair sont sillonnées de membranes et vaisseaux capillaires "
"noirâtres et une couche d'huile malsaine recouvre le tout.  Vous devriez "
"garder ceci loin de votre bouche."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
msgid ""
"Zombie guts.  Your appetite may have been spoiled by one look at the twisted, "
"compacted tubes and sacs that form this clump of foul entrails.  Why then "
"does it make you think of frozen spaghetti and meatballs?"
msgstr ""
"Des entrailles de zombie.  Rien qu'un coup d'œil vers cet amas compacté et "
"déformé de tubes et poches en voie de décomposition et l'image de spaghettis "
"congelés vous venant à l'esprit ruine votre appétit."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
msgid ""
"The inner contents of the walking dead.  It's hard to tell exactly what kind "
"of tissue this may have once been.  Several structures appear to have molded "
"together."
msgstr ""
"Un amas indistinct de choses ayant été contenues dans les entrailles d'un "
"mort-vivant.  Plusieurs organes ont l'air d'avoir fusionnés bizarrement et il "
"vous est difficile de déterminer exactement quoi est quoi."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
msgid ""
"The stained skull of what was once a human being.  It is rotted and "
"noticeably warped from its living form."
msgstr "Le crâne pourri et déformé de ce qui était un être humain."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
msgid ""
"The stained skull of a former human.  Whatever turned their flesh to walking "
"in death, it left its mark on their bones."
msgstr ""
"Le crâne tâché de ce qui était un être humain. Ce qui a animé sa chair a "
"manifestement laissé ses marques sur ses os."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
msgid ""
"A rotted skull from a human zombie.  It feels more flexible than it should, "
"like stiff leather, no longer natural bone."
msgstr ""
"Le crâne pourri d'un zombie humanoïde ayant une consistance plus flexible "
"qu'un crâne devrait être, similaire à du cuir dur et non pas de l'os."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
msgid ""
"The brain has ossified inside this tainted skull.  It doesn't feel noticeably "
"heavier and you surmise that the brain-turned-bone must be deeply porous or "
"hollow itself."
msgstr ""
"Le cerveau s'est partiellement ossifié à l'intérieur du crâne pourri. Vu que "
"la tête n'a pas l'air particulièrement lourde vous supposez que les tissus "
"cérébraux métamorphosés en os doivent être poreux ou même vides."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
msgid ""
"This pitted human skull is filled with teeth, few of them where they should "
"be.  You can see them growing in the hollows that have developed, their roots "
"grown long and winding, more like those of a tree."
msgstr ""
"Ce crâne mangé par la décomposition est rempli de dents, peu d'entre elles là "
"où elles devraient être. Vous pouvez voir différents stades de développement "
"encrées à des orifices et rainures présentes dans l'os, leurs racines longues "
"et tortueuses ressemblant à celles d'un arbre."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
msgid ""
"The teeth of this lopsided human skull have melded together like hot wax and "
"joined with the maxilla.  The eye sockets are drooping and canted to the side "
"as if shaped while soft.  Most of the suture joints of the cranium are fused "
"over with thick lines of growth as if soldered together with bone."
msgstr ""
"Les dents de ce crâne humain asymétrique ont fusionnées comme un sol bloc de "
"cire chaude avec l'os maxillaire, tandis que ses orbites sont affaissées et "
"obliques comme si elles avait été façonnées par un potier incompétent. Vous "
"remarquez aussi que la plupart des points de suture de la couronne crânienne "
"se sont épaissies comme si un soudeur voulait les renforcer."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "arm_zed_desc"
msgid ""
"A rotted and then shredded arm.  Not much use unless you want to scrape the "
"rancid meat from the bones."
msgstr ""
"Un bras pourri puis déchiqueté. Probablement pas très utile à part si vous "
"voulez retirer ce qui reste de viande rancide de ses os."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "arm_zed_desc"
msgid ""
"Little tainted meat remains on whatever limb bones these were.  It still "
"bends at the joint but doesn't look to be moving on its own anymore."
msgstr ""
"Peut de viande s'accroche encore sur les os de ce membre. Vous pouvez encore "
"plier l'articulation mais vous ne pensez pas que ceci peut encore bouger de "
"son propre grès."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "arm_zed_desc"
msgid ""
"This jaundiced zombie's arm still bears a full sleeve tattoo.  Quality work "
"from what you can tell through all the rot."
msgstr ""
"Le bras jauni de ce zombie porte toujours un tatouage intégral. Du travail de "
"qualité vu ce qui survit toujours malgré la décomposition."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "leg_zed_desc"
msgid ""
"You think this decaying severed limb ends in a foot.  It's actually hard to "
"tell after the hell it's been through."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez l'impression que ce membre détaché pourrissant a un pied sur l'une "
"de ses extrémités mais cela est difficile à dire avec son état déplorable."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "leg_zed_desc"
msgid ""
"A fat zombie haunch.  It doesn't look tasty but the shape is undeniably close "
"to a large fried chicken leg.  The skin is even the right texture, though for "
"the wrong reasons."
msgstr ""
"Un cuissot bien gras de zombie. Pas appétissant du tout mais la forme est "
"indéniablement semblable à un pilon de poulet frit énorme, la peau ayant "
"même, pour toutes les mauvaises raisons, une texture similaire."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
msgid ""
"As you make your first cut into its skin, a pressurized jet of decaying blood "
"almost hits your face."
msgstr ""
"Un jet pressurisé de sang pourri vous prends pratiquement en plein visage "
"lorsque vous faites votre première entaille dans le corps."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
msgid ""
"The overbearing sweet smell of decay emanating from the carcass forces you to "
"take short breaks during your work to not puke."
msgstr ""
"L'odeur douceâtre envahissante de décomposition s'émanant de la carcasse vous "
"force à prendre des petites pauses durant vos efforts pour ne pas vomir."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
msgid "As you cut through the muscle, it tenses up in reaction."
msgstr ""
"Vous essayez de couper à travers un muscle et celui-ci tente de vous resister "
"en se tendant."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
msgid ""
"You spot a few flies and maggots in the corpse, their chosen carcass not "
"seeming to be very good for them, as most seem moribund."
msgstr ""
"Vous remarquez quelques mouches et asticots dans la carcasse, leur choix de "
"résidence n'ayant pas l'air d'être très bon pour eux, la plupart ayant une "
"apparence moribonde et des mouvements léthargiques."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
msgid ""
"Random cavities in its body make you think it was at least partially feeding "
"on its own tissues to keep functioning."
msgstr ""
"Des cavités aléatoires à l'intérieur du corps vous fait penser que cette "
"chose était au moins partiellement en train d'absorber ses propres tissus "
"pour continuer à fonctionner."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
msgid "The corpse twitches as you begin.  It didn't feel like rigor mortis."
msgstr ""
"Le corps se crispe lorsque vous commencez à l'examiner. Cela n'avait pas "
"l'air d'être dû à de la raideur cadavérique."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
msgid ""
"The body stirs as you open it up, suggesting it's still trying to attack, and "
"reminding you to be cautious."
msgstr ""
"Le corps s'agite en peu lorsque vous commencez à l'ouvrir, suggérant que "
"celui-ci essaie toujours de vous attaquer, un rappel inquiétant de la "
"nécessité d'être vigilant(e) durant votre dépeçage."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
msgid ""
"You begin your dissection - though, vivisection would be more appropriate, as "
"you find the corpse not as still as you once thought."
msgstr ""
"Vous commencez votre dissection, quoi que vivisection serait probablement le "
"mot le plus approprié, le corps n'étant pas aussi immobile qu'il avait l'air."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"The majority of the digestive tract seems to have reshaped into a singular "
"stomach."
msgstr ""
"La majorité du tube digestif de cette créature à l'air de s'être refaçonné en "
"un estomac gigantesque."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid "Some organs have atrophied or outright dissolved entirely."
msgstr "Certains organes ont l'air de s'être atrophiés ou d'avoir disparu entièrement."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid "The heart is overtaken by a mass of fistulas and other growths."
msgstr ""
"Le cœur est recouvert par un amas de fistules et autres excroissances "
"anormales."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
msgid ""
"The thing's innards resemble one giant tumor more than the body of a human "
"being."
msgstr ""
"Les entrailles de la chose ressemblent plus à une tumeur gigantesque qu'au "
"corps d'un être humain."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
msgid ""
"The thing's feet are entirely calloused and the smaller toes are completely "
"vestigal, simply a bump with a dead nail on them."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
msgid ""
"This person had a tattoo on their arm - said tattoo has reappeared in "
"multiple spots along the inner tissues and the walls of organs."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"The front part of the brain is completely missing, with spongy, half-formed "
"bone in its place."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
msgid ""
"While its individual fingers appear to be losing their dexterity, the "
"zombie's flexor muscles are tense and swollen."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
msgid ""
"This person had an artificial hip, but it's completely overgrown with bone "
"now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"Organs in the lower abdomen, mainly the kidneys and the reproductive organs, "
"are absent."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid "The heart makes an odd, swallowing sound on occasion as you work around it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"You try pulling out some teeth to better analyze them, only to find they've "
"fused with the jawbone."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"Inside the chest is some unfamiliar organ, a Frankenstein of nearby tissues "
"and black veins."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"Inside the chest is some unfamiliar organ, fatty and wrinkled like brain "
"tissue."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"Your search nets you no explanation as to how the creature's black blood "
"still circulates through it, and you come to the disturbing conclusion it "
"moves on its own."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"The vestibular organs seem to be nonfunctional, but your question of how the "
"creature balances itself is answered by an odd mass in the center of the "
"brain, that you liken to a gyroscope."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"While some parts of the blackened brain have lost their wrinkles, in others "
"the wrinkles are surprisingly uniform."
msgstr ""
"Certaines parties du cerveau noirci ont perdu leurs rides, dans d’autres les "
"rides sont étonnamment uniformes."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"You find a clump of malformed tissue leading deeper inwards, at the center of "
"which is a bullet."
msgstr ""
"Vous trouvez un amas de tissu malformé menant plus profondément vers "
"l’intérieur, au centre duquel se trouve une balle."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid "Its tissue has significant trouble separating from the bone in some spots."
msgstr ""
"Le tissu du cadavre a beaucoup de mal à se séparer de l’os à certains "
"endroits."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid "The skin is loose on the muscle in some places and melded with it in others."
msgstr ""
"La peau a l'air d'être complétement détachée des muscles en dessous à "
"certains endroits et d'avoir fusionné avec à d'autres."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid "The thing's innards churn slightly even as you dig through them."
msgstr ""
"Les entrailles de la chose bougent légèrement alors même que vous fouillez à "
"travers."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"As you finish up, you notice your earliest cuts seem to be the tiniest bit "
"smaller."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes sur le point de finir votre inspection et remarquez que vos "
"premières coupes semblent être un tout petit peu plus petites."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"To your \"delight,\" you find a tapeworm in its gut, turgid but seemingly "
"dead."
msgstr ""
"À votre \"grand plaisir\", vous trouvez un ténia dans son intestin, "
"turgescent mais apparemment mort."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"As you cut into its stomach, the insane fragmentary remains of some creature "
"it devoured, which appears to have melded with its own tissues, attempt to "
"claw at your hand before you bludgeon them until they cease moving."
msgstr ""
"Alors que vous coupez à travers l'estomac, les restes fragmentaires insensés "
"d'une créature dévorée semblant avoir fusionné avec ses tissus tentent de "
"vous griffer la main, vous forçant à les matraquer jusqu'à ce qu'ils cessent "
"de bouger."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"The thing's innards resemble one giant tumor more than the body of a living "
"being."
msgstr ""
"Les entrailles de cette chose ressemblent plus à une tumeur géante qu'au "
"corps d'un être vivant."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid "The thing has extra teeth leading all the way down into the stomach."
msgstr "Cette chose a des dents additionnelles descendant jusque dans l'estomac."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
msgid ""
"The lungs of this creature are cavernous, seemingly having been repurposed "
"from their respiratory function to house an impressive volume of air."
msgstr ""
"Les poumons de cette créature sont caverneux et leur fonction respiratoire "
"semble avoir été exploitée et amplifiée pour abriter un volume d'air "
"impressionnant."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
msgid ""
"Its massive diaphragm seems to have been the only correctly sustained muscle "
"of this starved corpse."
msgstr ""
"Le diaphragme énorme de cette créature famélique à l'air d'être son seul "
"muscle encore correctement entretenu."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
msgid ""
"A careless move dislodges some remaining air causing the throat of the undead "
"monster to emit one more choked scream."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
msgid ""
"The slack jaws and starved body of this creature make you think that it would "
"have struggled to seriously harm anything on its own."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
msgid ""
"Its distended lungs seem to be partially lined with a black and sticky mucus "
"membrane."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
msgid ""
"Removing its bone plates proves more arduous than you would have thought, "
"requiring you to almost put your entire weight on your tool to pry them off."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
msgid ""
"Black liquid bubbles in the places where you managed to remove its skeletal "
"growths."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
msgid ""
"This one's armor falls off surprisingly easily, almost as if whatever puppets "
"it wishes for it to lose the extra weight."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
msgid ""
"The layout and segmentation of its bony carapace disturbingly resembles what "
"you want to call plate mail, but it's closer to the armor of an arthropod."
msgstr ""
"L'arrangement et la segmentation de sa carapace osseuse rappelle de façon "
"dérangeante à de l'armure lamellaire mélangée à un exosquelette d'arthropode."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
msgid ""
"These plates are almost impossible to remove until you realize they are "
"linked to the internal skeleton with calcified pillars you must break before "
"removing its armor."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
msgid ""
"The sheer pungent acrid odor of the carcass makes you temporarily recoil and "
"reconsider the safety of delving into its entrails."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
msgid ""
"The sputters of acid on your gear you earned by digging into this corpse "
"could maybe warrant the use of some water to douse."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
msgid ""
"Pressed against the liver is a swollen gland the size of a golfball, still "
"somewhat functioning, pumping out acrid fluids."
msgstr ""
"Pressée contre le foie se trouve une glande enflée de la taille d'une balle "
"de golf, qui fonctionne encore quelque peu, pompant des fluides âcres."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
msgid ""
"Most cavities in its anatomy seem to have been filled with an acidic solution "
"mixed with a foul black liquid and pieces of its slowly melting tissues."
msgstr ""
"La plupart des cavités de son anatomie semblent avoir été remplies d'une "
"solution acide mélangée à un liquide noir fétide et à des morceaux de tissus "
"fondant lentement."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
msgid ""
"You are almost certain that its flesh should not be able to contain such a "
"virulently aggressive liquid, yet, it does."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes pratiquement sûr(e) que sa chair ne devrait pas être capable de "
"retenir un liquide aussi virulant et agressif, mais d'une manière ou d'une "
"autre, cette créature ne se réduit pas soi-même en un tas de bouillie fumante."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
msgid ""
"You have to step back as a gland you inadvertently cut into seems to perform "
"a neutralization reaction between its contents and the rest of its fluids."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes obligé(e) de reculer, l'une des glandes que vous avez éventré ayant "
"l'air d'effectuer un réaction de neutralisation avec une autre quantité des "
"fluides de la créature."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
msgid ""
"This corpse seems completely ordinary now, and dissection brings you no "
"further to asserting what gave the creature its peculiar properties."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
msgid ""
"The lingering shadows surrounding it make your work quite a lot harder as "
"they seem to deliberately grow more opaque around your tool as if they wished "
"to hide the monster's secrets."
msgstr ""
"Les ombres persistantes qui l'entourent rendent votre travail beaucoup plus "
"difficile car elles semblent délibérément devenir plus opaques autour de "
"votre outil comme si elles souhaitaient cacher les secrets du monstre."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
msgid ""
"You spot a few pores still weakly sputtering thin puffs of black smoke, "
"investigating them further reveals glands full of fuming black liquid linked "
"to the pores with long tubes."
msgstr ""
"Vous remarquez plusieurs pores élargis crachant encore faiblement de petits "
"jets de fumée noire, vous décidez d'investiguer ceux-ci et vous rendez compte "
"que ceux-ci sont reliés par de longs tubes à des glandes remplies d'un "
"liquide noire en ébullition."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
msgid ""
"You make one incision and the resulting cloud of black smoke forces you to "
"take a short break as it becomes impossible to see anything."
msgstr ""
"Une incision dans la carcasse cause un nuage de fumée tellement épais qu'il "
"vous force à patienter un petit moment, voir quoi que ce soit étant devenu "
"impossible."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
msgid ""
"Despite it not being very evident from the outside, it seems the entire "
"digestive tract of the abomination was bloated with its obscuring smoke."
msgstr ""
"Malgré le fait que ceci n'était pas vraiment évident de l'extérieur, vous "
"découvrez que l’entièreté du système digestif de l'abomination était gonflée "
"par sa fumée noire."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
msgid ""
"The black camouflage evaporates off the body where you put your tool through, "
"completely odorless."
msgstr ""
"Le camouflage noir s'évapore de la surface du cadavre en fines fumeroles sans "
"odeur lorsque vous posez votre outil dessus."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
msgid ""
"The inner tissues are a mosaic of somewhat normal flesh and flesh interlaced "
"with fibers of the armor."
msgstr ""
"Les tissus internes sont une mosaïque de chair plus ou moins normale et de "
"chair entrelacée avec les fibres de l'armure."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
msgid ""
"Separating what is flesh and what is synthetic is difficult, as some parts "
"appear to be between the two."
msgstr ""
"Il est difficile de séparer ce qui est chair et ce qui est synthétique, "
"certains tissus on l'air d'être les deux."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
msgid ""
"Fibers of Kevlar-like material spread through the body like a cobweb, "
"originating from a tiny entry wound in the abdomen."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
msgid ""
"You cut off some scraps of the uniform that were still adhered to the body, "
"finding tendrils of flesh anchored into them."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez coupé quelques morceaux de l'uniforme qui étaient encore collés au "
"corps, trouvant des vrilles de chair ancrées à l'intérieur."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
msgid ""
"Upon closer examination, some of the Kevlar isn't Kevlar - its off color and "
"composition suggest it's the creature's flesh reformed to imitate it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
msgid ""
"Some strands of the bulletproof material snake deep into the body like roots "
"of an invading organism."
msgstr ""
"Des fils du matériau pare-balles serpentent profondément à travers le corps "
"comme des racines d'un organisme invasif."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
msgid ""
"Strong fibers run alongside the muscles in a way that you want to compare to "
"marbling."
msgstr ""
"Des fibres solides longent les muscles d’une manière que vous ne pouvez pas "
"vous empêcher à comparer à du marbrage."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
msgid ""
"Under the skin, crushing against the ribcage, you find a thick growth of "
"flesh and Kevlar formed from a mutated diaphragm."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
msgid ""
"The sheer scale of the carcass leaves you only with a luxury of choice on "
"where to start your work."
msgstr ""
"L’ampleur de la carcasse ne vous laisse que le luxe de choisir par où "
"commencer votre travail."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
msgid ""
"Its legs seem to have been reinforced with a strange lattice of skeletal "
"bracing and muscle fibers to support its immense bulk."
msgstr ""
"Ses jambes semblent avoir été renforcées par un étrange treillis de renforts "
"squelettiques et de fibres musculaires pour soutenir sa masse immense."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
msgid ""
"Along joints in the limbs and torso you find strange new muscly organs filled "
"with fluid, suggesting this behemoth moved with some form of organic "
"hydraulics."
msgstr ""
"Le long des articulations des membres et du torse, vous trouvez d’étranges "
"nouveaux organes musculaires remplis de liquide, suggérant que ce monstre se "
"déplaçait avec une certaine forme d’hydraulique organique."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
msgid ""
"Portions of the spine and surrounding bones have grown and fused into a "
"single piece, presumably to hold up the creature's bulk - but even then, it "
"still shows signs of strain."
msgstr ""
"Des parties de la colonne vertébrale et des os environnants ont grandi et "
"fusionné en un seul morceau, probablement pour soutenir la masse de la "
"créature – mais malgré cela, vous observez tout de même des signes de tension "
"et usure considérables."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
msgid ""
"The ropey muscles are still unbelievably tense along the corpse's back, your "
"own back aches just looking at them."
msgstr ""
"Les muscles cordés sont toujours incroyablement tendus le long du dos du "
"cadavre, votre propre dos vous fait mal rien qu'en les regardant."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
msgid ""
"You find that shoulder and upper arm bones are supported by smaller, similar "
"bone growths."
msgstr ""
"Vous constatez que les os de l’épaule et du haut du bras sont soutenus par "
"des excroissances osseuses plus petites aux fonctions similaires."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
msgid ""
"The more delicate joints in the body such as the wrists and neck have fused "
"with surrounding tissue."
msgstr ""
"Les articulations les plus délicates du corps, comme les poignets et le cou, "
"ont fusionné avec les tissus environnants."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
msgid ""
"Your search for the source of the creature's size has you discover a cluster "
"of glandular organs deep in the body, most of which you are unable to "
"identify."
msgstr ""
"Votre enquête sur ce qui aurait pu causer la taille démesurée de cette "
"créature vous amène à découvrir une grappe d'organes glandulaires logés "
"profondément dans le corps, la plupart étant impossible à identifier."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
msgid ""
"It seems most of the creature was grown as some sort of suit looking as if it "
"was piloted by the still normal sized human corpse found in a fetal position "
"in its torso."
msgstr ""
"Il semble que la majorité de cette créature se soit développée en une sorte "
"de combinaison, comme si elle était pilotée par le cadavre humain encore de "
"taille normale trouvé en position fœtale dans son torse."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
msgid ""
"The overall anatomy of this enormous monstrosity leaves you only to wonder "
"how it possibly could achieve the range of motion you witnessed while it was "
"still standing."
msgstr ""
"L’anatomie globale de cette énorme monstruosité vous laisse songeur quant à "
"comment elle pouvait atteindre l’amplitude de mouvement dont vous avez été "
"témoin alors qu’elle était encore debout."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
msgid ""
"You cut into its abdomen, and discover its utter lack of internal organs, the "
"expected cavity replaced by nothing but more flesh and muscle."
msgstr ""
"Vous coupez son abdomen et découvrez une absence totale d'organes internes, "
"la cavité attendue remplacée par rien d'autre que plus de chair et de muscles."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
msgid ""
"The sheer remaining tension in each of the muscles of its arms and shoulders "
"makes them unwind with a sonorous thwang each time you cut one off the "
"supporting bones."
msgstr ""
"La tension qui reste dans chacun des muscles de ses bras et de ses épaules "
"les fait se détendre avec un bruit sourd à chaque fois que vous en coupez un "
"de son os de soutien."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
msgid ""
"The tremendous growth of its upper body's muscle mass must have rendered the "
"creature almost incapable of efficiently surveying its surroundings."
msgstr ""
"L’énorme croissance de la masse musculaire du haut de son corps a dû rendre "
"cette créature presque incapable d’observer efficacement son environnement."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
msgid ""
"You realize the muscles of the zombie's arms are hollow, their marrow "
"replaced by a thick oily black liquid.  You wonder if the ridiculous muscle "
"mass surrounding them is the other half of a strange hydraulic system."
msgstr ""
"Vous réalisez que les muscles des bras du zombie sont creux, leur moelle "
"remplacée par un épais liquide noir et huileux.  Vous vous demandez si la "
"masse musculaire ridicule qui les entoure n’est pas l’autre moitié d’un "
"étrange système hydraulique."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
msgid ""
"You cut into the arms of the creature and realize that instead of what you "
"would expect from what you know of normal human anatomy, its muscles wind "
"around the bones in what looks like a tight spring."
msgstr ""
"Vous coupez les bras de la créature et réalisez qu'au lieu de ce à quoi vous "
"vous attendriez d'après ce que vous savez de l'anatomie humaine normale, ses "
"muscles s'enroulent autour des os pour ressembler à un ressort puissant."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
msgid ""
"While you are cutting into it, the creature suddenly moves and grabs one of "
"your limbs.  Despite considerable effort, you are unable to pry open the "
"creature's iron grip and resign yourself to chop off the hand instead."
msgstr ""
"Pendant que vous la coupez, la créature bouge soudainement et saisit l'un de "
"vos membres.  Malgré des efforts considérables, vous ne parvenez pas à vous "
"dégager de la poigne de fer du mort-vivant et vous vous résignez à lui couper "
"la main."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
msgid ""
"Opening its jaw wide, you notice the presence of multiple additional tongues "
"deeper it in its throat."
msgstr ""
"En ouvrant grand sa mâchoire, vous remarquez la présence de plusieurs langues "
"supplémentaires plus profondément dans sa gorge."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
msgid ""
"You notice cysts in its fur, you cut into them and alternatively find acrid "
"fluids, flakes of bone or twitching strands of muscle."
msgstr ""
"Vous remarquez des kystes dans sa fourrure, vous les coupez et vous trouvez "
"alternativement des fluides âcres, des flocons d'os ou des brins de muscles "
"qui se contractent."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
msgid ""
"The rear of this greying zombified dog shows strange reinforcements, as if a "
"previous pathology was being remediated."
msgstr ""
"L’arrière de ce chien zombifié grisonnant présente d’étranges renforts, comme "
"si une pathologie antérieure était en cours de guérison."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
msgid ""
"Inside its muzzle you notice strange glands and fibrous growths, almost as if "
"the creature's sense of smell was in the process of being overhauled."
msgstr ""
"À l'intérieur de son museau, vous remarquez d'étranges glandes et des "
"excroissances fibreuses, presque comme si l'odorat de la créature était en "
"train d'être remodelé."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
msgid ""
"Lodged into the neck area of the creature and grown over you find a corroded "
"tag reading the following \"Max my best friend forever\"."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
msgid ""
"You find strange tubular glands across the creature contained alternating "
"layers of two alien tissue types soaked in a black liquid, its smell putrid "
"but saltier than usual for a zombie."
msgstr ""
"Vous trouvez des glandes tubulaires dispersées à travers cette créature "
"contenant des couches alternées de tissus étranges imbibés d'un liquide "
"noirâtre, le tout possédant une odeur putride mais nettement plus salée que "
"la normale pour des tripes de zombie."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
msgid ""
"Uncomfortable static forces you to ground yourself multiple times during your "
"work."
msgstr ""
"Des forces électrostatiques inconfortables vous obligent à toucher le sol "
"plusieurs fois pendant votre travail."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
msgid ""
"A roaming insect attracted by the carcass gets fried after landing on an "
"organ glowing a faint blue, making you decide to avoid it with the utmost "
"care."
msgstr ""
"Un insecte errant attiré par la carcasse est frit après avoir atterri sur un "
"organe qui brille d'un bleu pâle, ce qui vous incite à décider de l'éviter "
"avec la plus grande prudence."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
msgid ""
"The creature's heart seems to still be beating, but rather than pumping "
"blood, it strangely reminds you of some sort of biological dynamo."
msgstr ""
"Le cœur de la créature semble battre encore, mais plutôt que de pomper le "
"sang, il rappelle étrangement une sorte de dynamo biologique."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
msgid ""
"There are bundles of nerves snaking all throughout the tissues, still "
"channeling small amounts of electricity."
msgstr ""
"Vous observez des faisceaux de nerfs serpentant partout à travers les tissus "
"de la carcasse, toujours en train d'acheminer des faibles charges "
"d'électricité."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
msgid ""
"The blackened veins of the creature seem strangely rigid, and you see faint "
"crackles of electricity course across them."
msgstr ""
"Les veines noircies de la créature semblent étrangement rigides et vous "
"observez de légers crépitements électriques les traverser."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_mushroom_general>"
msgid ""
"Despite the carcass lying still, you still notice churning while "
"investigating its entrails, as if whatever was originally animating this "
"corpse is wrestling with the mycelium fibers to retake control."
msgstr ""
"Bien que la carcasse soit immobile, vous remarquez des tissus se réarrangeant "
"lorsque vous examinez ses entrailles, comme si ce qui animait à l'origine ce "
"cadavre luttait avec les fibres du mycélium pour reprendre le contrôle."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_mushroom_general>"
msgid ""
"Under the stomach you notice a wrinkled fruit that you can't help but think "
"somewhat appetizing despite where you found it."
msgstr ""
"Sous l'estomac, vous remarquez un fruit ridé que vous ne pouvez vous empêcher "
"de trouver quelque peu appétissant malgré l'endroit où vous l'avez trouvé."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_mushroom_general>"
msgid ""
"The skin feels absolutely turgid, oozing water mixed in with traces of a "
"black liquid where you make your incisions."
msgstr ""
"La peau a une consistence absolument turgide, suintant de l'eau mixée avec un "
"liquide noirâtre là où vous faites vos incisions."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_mushroom_general>"
msgid ""
"Fungal stalks still sway gently despite the lack of movement of the formerly "
"shambling corpse."
msgstr ""
"Des vrilles fongiques continuent à se balancer doucement malgré le fait que "
"la carcasse titubante à laquelle elles sont attachées ait totalement cessé de "
"bouger. "

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_mushroom_general>"
msgid ""
"The putrefied blood that leaks from your incisions is visibly saturated with "
"spores."
msgstr ""
"Le sang putréfié qui s’écoule de vos incisions est visiblement saturé de "
"spores."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
msgid ""
"The cavities of this creature are filled with lethargic winged creatures "
"hanging off tubes oozing a grayish milky substance."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
msgid ""
"The corpse is inundated with smaller forms, increasing in complexity and size "
"as you near its central cavity where they wait for their release in neat "
"clusters."
msgstr ""
"Les entrailles de ce cadavre sont remplies à craquer de petites créatures "
"croissant progressivement en taille et complexité le plus vous vous approchez "
"d'une cavité centrale ou celle-ci ont l'air d'être préparée à être lancées en "
"rangées ordonnées. "

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
msgid ""
"The inside of this carcass resembles more an industrial production line than "
"anything vaguely natural."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
msgid ""
"You find several unfinished creatures inside the main cavity, you have a "
"vague feeling something greater discarded them, founding them wanting."
msgstr ""
"Vous trouvez des embryons de créatures malformées au fond de la cavité "
"principale à l'intérieur du cadavre, et vous avez une vague impression que "
"quelque chose les a jugées insuffisantes."

#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
msgid ""
"You are almost certain this zombie was pregnant before its undeath, the fetus "
"within the womb having been twisted into the abomination it was carrying."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes presque certain·e que cette femme zombifiée était enceinte avant de "
"mourir, le fœtus dans l'utérus ayant été transformé en l'abomination qu'elle "
"portait."

