#. ~ Description of "IX-2110 computer"
msgid ""
"The original Imagos IX-2110, a general use wrist computer originally designed "
"to support operations within hazardous environments.  Among the most "
"successful pieces of technology ever created, millions of these were produced "
"and sold to the explorers that first tamed the stars during the early "
"Hyperspace Era.  The slow attrition of technological prowess since the "
"discontinuity has left slightly slower than its modern counterparts."
msgstr ""

