#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "recall rig"
msgid ""
"A complex antennae assembly worn around the upper torso that allows its user "
"to teleport towards previously configured teleport pads.  Although relatively "
"functional, it's much inferior to the translocation systems of old, and a "
"successful teleport requires standing perfectly still for several minutes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cast_spell_items.json
