#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Description of "Solar Panels CBM"
msgid ""
"Installed on your back is a set of retractable solar panels.  When in direct "
"sunlight, they will automatically deploy and slowly recharge your power level."
msgstr ""
"Un set de panneau solaires repliables est installé sur votre dos. A la "
"lumière direct du soleil, il se déploieront automatiquement et rechargerons "
"lentement votre énergie."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
