"An improved ulnar sheath equipped with thermal inductors allows for the super "
"heating of all types of implanted bladed weaponry.  While this bionic is "
"active, any deployed bionic blades will deal additional fire damage to "
"targets."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/bionics.json
