"Designed to defeat modern body armor, the Rivtech 5x50mm flechette round "
"features a biodegradable sabot and a single, fin-stabilized penetrator."
msgstr ""
"Conçue pour contrer les armures modernes, les munitions 5x50mm Rivtech "
"flechette comprennent un sabot biodégradable et un pénétrateur stabilisé par "
"ailerons."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/5x50.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/5x50.json
