"Designed to defeat modern body armor, the Rivtech 5x50mm RA119 penetrator "
"round features a biodegradable sabot and a single, fin-stabilized tungsten "
"alloy projectile."
msgstr ""
"Conçue pour contrer les armures modernes, les munitions pénétrante 5x50mm "
"Rivtech RA119 comprennent un sabot biodégradable et un projectile stabilisé "
