#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "exosuit heavy flamethrower"
msgid_plural "exosuit heavy flamethrowers"
msgstr[0] "lance-flammes lourd d'exosuit"
msgstr[1] "lance-flammes lourds d'exosuit"
msgstr[2] "lance-flammes lourds d'exosuit"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#. ~ Description of "exosuit heavy flamethrower"
msgid ""
"A bulky flamethrower unit mounted on the shoulder of an exosuit.  An internal "
"compressor adds extra range and spread to the flame compared to most handheld "
"flame units."
msgstr ""
"Un module lance-flammes encombrant conçu pour être monté sur un point "
"d'accroche d'épaule d'exosuit.  Un compresseur interne permet à la portée et "
"à la dispersion du jet de flamme d'être supérieure à la plupart des "
"lance-flammes portables."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "exosuit sonic cannon"
msgid_plural "exosuit sonic cannons"
msgstr[0] "canon sonique d'exosuit"
msgstr[1] "canons soniques d'exosuit"
msgstr[2] "canons soniques d'exosuit"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#. ~ Description of "exosuit sonic cannon"
msgid ""
"A 'less-lethal' weapon mounted on the shoulder of an exosuit, it emits an "
"extremely loud high-frequency pulse in a wide arc.  Useful for discouraging "
"crowds, less useful for stealthy operations."
msgstr ""
"Une arme \"moins létale\" conçue pour être montée sur un point d'accroche "
"d'épaule d'exosuit et émettant des vagues sonores à haute fréquence "
"douloureusement bruyantes en un large arc.  Utile pour dissuader les foules, "
"beaucoup moins utile durant une opération furtive."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "exosuit microwave cannon"
msgid_plural "exosuit microwave cannons"
msgstr[0] "canon à micro-ondes d'exosuit"
msgstr[1] "canons à micro-ondes d'exosuit"
msgstr[2] "canons à micro-ondes d'exosuit"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#. ~ Description of "exosuit microwave cannon"
msgid ""
"A 'less-lethal' weapon mounted on the shoulder of an exosuit.  Causes a "
"painful burning sensation as water molecules are turned to high temperature "
"vapor.  Infamous for it's use by UICA forces used it to break up protests, "
"the effectiveness can be hard to predict due to variables like the moisture "
"in the air and protective layers on the target."
msgstr ""
"Une arme \"moins létale\" conçue pour être montée sur un point d'accroche "
"d'épaule d'exosuit.  Cause une sensation de brûlure douloureuse à ses cibles, "
"l'humidité à la surface de la peau étant soudainement vaporisée.  Notoire "
"pour son utilisation par les forces de l'ordre de l'ACIU pour disperser des "
"manifestants, l'effet de l'arme dépends énormément du niveau d'humidité "
"ambiante et du niveau de protection possédé par la cible."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "exosuit electrolaser"
msgid_plural "exosuit electrolasers"
msgstr[0] "électrolaser d'exosuit"
msgstr[1] "électrolasers d'exosuit"
msgstr[2] "électrolasers d'exosuit"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#. ~ Description of "exosuit electrolaser"
msgid ""
"An extremely dangerous weapon only deployed for heavy combat, this is mounted "
"on the shoulder of an exosuit.  A laser creates a channel of ionized plasma "
"which acts as a conduit for the follow-up massive energy charge.  The result "
"is a powerful explosion that can impact a large area.  Requires significant "
"energy reserves, draining a standard power cartridge per shot."
msgstr ""

