#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Izhevsk PLC-75"
msgid_plural "Izhevsk PLC-75s"
msgstr[0] "Izhevsk PLC-75"
msgstr[1] "Izhevsk PLC-75s"
msgstr[2] "Izhevsk PLC-75s"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Izhevsk PLC-75"
#. ~ Description of "Izhevsk PLC-75"
msgid ""
"Straight from the bureaus of the old Soviet Union the PLC-75 is the crude and "
"brutal answer to the constraints posed by the design of heavy laser ordnance. "
" Its use of antiquated flashtube pumped laser technology makes it unwieldy "
"and wholly incompatible with modern equipment, whether this offers any "
"consolation to downrange targets remains a matter of contentious dispute."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Shikishma A-82 tactical laser"
msgid_plural "Shikishma A-82 tactical lasers"
msgstr[0] "laser tactique Shikishma A-82"
msgstr[1] "lasers tactiques Shikishma A-82"
msgstr[2] "lasers tactiques Shikishma A-82"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Shikishma A-82 tactical laser"
#. ~ Description of "Shikishma A-82 tactical laser"
msgid ""
"Crown jewel of Shikishma armories, and possible product of unsanctioned data "
"scavenging, the A-82 is the undisputed market leader when it comes to man "
"portable laser weaponry.  Sustained fire is likely to cause secondary "
"explosions as target layers are vaporized."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
