#. ~ Description of monster "infeme"
msgid ""
"The Infeme are uplifted from apes and other near-human ancestors.  The Zulu "
"word for monkey became the catch-all term for many species of uplifts whether "
"majority chimp, gorilla or baboon.  Several worlds experienced a series of "
"events similar to the old pre-spaceflight movie series 'Planet of the Apes' "
"during the Discontinuity."
msgstr ""

