#: data/mods/Aftershock/monsterdrops/monsterdrops.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsterdrops/monsterdrops.json
#. ~ Harvest message
msgid ""
"The freeze-burned leather parts easily, and thousands of fleshy floating "
"bubbles erupt from the distended carcass.  Most fly away before you can reach "
"them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MIGO"
msgid "You dream of warm, alien winds."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MIGO"
msgid "You dream of landscapes lit by the light of alien moons."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MIGO"
msgid ""
"You stand at the edge of a fissure into strange earth.  Mustard brown gasses "
"caress and lift your fronds"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MIGO"
msgid ""
"You dream of being vivisected by humans.  One asks if the other thinks you "
"can feel pain."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MIGO"
msgid ""
"Trapped in a cage, you mimic the sounds of your guard's spawn.  He threatens "
"you and enters the cage.  He screams, you recall."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MIGO"
msgid ""
"It's your birthday.  But everyone has given you these hideous metal and "
"plastic objects."
msgstr ""
"C'est votre anniversaire, mais pour une raison quelconque tout le monde ne "
"vous donne que des objets en métal et en plastique hideux."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MIGO"
msgid ""
"The stars await you, your chariot of fire is ready.  The holds are full of "
"slaves."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MIGO"
msgid "You have transitioned from a dying race to a glorious future."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MASTODON"
msgid ""
"You have a strange dream about thundering ponderously through ancient, "
"brittle tundras that crackle under your thick round feet."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MASTODON"
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange, languorous, heavy feeling."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MASTODON"
msgid ""
"You dream of swinging your heavy head to shake the clinging snow and ice from "
"your large, limpid brown eyes.  The weight is off, as if you had something… "
"extra on either side of your mouth, and though you are surrounded by snow and "
"bitter pelting winds, you feel confident and toasty-warm beneath your shaggy "
"coat."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MASTODON"
msgid ""
"Your dream is a stream of shaggy loam-brown fur trailing into an ocean of "
"punishing, icy white.  Together, you are all strong.  When you look around, "
"you see elephantine faces looking back from all angles and you know they "
"mirror your own.  You just… know."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MASTODON"
msgid ""
"You dream of your usual patient languor being interrupted by a flash of white "
"teeth against a carmine-soaked muzzle.  In an instant a thunderous fury "
"overtakes you and you trumpet your rage… right before you bring that "
"trumpeting snout, bring down those heavy spears of ivory on either side of "
"it, down upon your attacker.  They lie, bones shattered, bleeding out their "
"red into the icy white and causing it to steam  Just like that, your calm is "
"restored."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MASTODON"
msgid ""
"You dream of slowly, patiently, plodding through the world to go from goal to "
"goal, unrushed and unworried, for you are far too large and tough to kill for "
"anyone or anything to bother trying to attack.  And if they do… it'll be the "
"last mistake of their life.  Waking up gives you a brief jolt of fear and "
"dysphoria, for your body feels so weak and fragile and incorrect compared to "
"the powerful thing you know you are."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MASTODON"
msgid ""
"Your thoughts within your dream may be slow, and it may take you some time to "
"reach a conclusion, but what's the rush?  What's the hurry?  You are a huge "
"and ancient thing with a pedigree that stretches back to a time before "
"sapient life first had the gall to raise a sharpened stick and call itself "
"superior.  You are huge and powerful and all that work against you shall "
"fall.  You… you have all the time in the world, now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MASTODON"
msgid ""
"Life is lonely without a family of Tusked Ones beside you, thundering as one "
"through this desolate world in search of the hidden places.  Perhaps… perhaps "
"you should start your family."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/esper.json
