#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/factions.json
#. ~ NPC faction name
msgid "PrepNet Phyle"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/factions.json
#. ~ Description of NPC faction "PrepNet Phyle"
msgid ""
"A multitude of frontier homesteading groups brought together by their use of "
"the PrepNet communication protocols.  Spread out onto the edges of the "
"frontier, enthusiastically squatting and building tiny kingdoms often "
"consisting of just a couple families or like-minded individuals.  Their "
"mutual aid societies are wildly varied in their laws; influenced by the "
"people who set them up, but they all share in a distrust for those that wish "
"to impose restrictions upon new colonization efforts."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/factions.json
#. ~ NPC faction name
msgid "United Interstellar Coordination Agency"
msgstr "Agence de Coordination Interstellaire Unie"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/factions.json
#. ~ Description of NPC faction "United Interstellar Coordination Agency"
msgid ""
"A loose confederation and military alliance composed by Solar Corporations, "
"Governments, and other politically relevant organizations united by their "
"desire to restore Earth's dominion over the Orion Arm.  Due to the "
"disinterest of the Salus Charter owners and the recent rediscovery of the "
"system, UICA administers Salus IV using a combination of military and "
"civilian law designed to maximize wealth extraction, with the bulk of their "
"forces concentrated within Port Augustmoon.\n"
"\n"
"Corruption and nepotism are rampant across UICA's frontier administrations, "
"management is generally more interested in lining their own pockets than in "
"any sort of solar revanchist rhetoric."
msgstr ""
"Une confédération et alliance militaire vague et fluide composée de "
"Compagnies Solaires, Gouvernements et autres organisations politiques ayant "
"suffisamment d'influence ayant pour but commun de rétablir la domination "
"terrienne sur le Bras d'Orion.  Dû au désintérêt des propriétaires de la "
"Charte de Salus et la redécouverte récente du système, l'ACIU administre "
"Salus IV avec un mélange de loi martiale et civile conçue pour maximiser "
"l'extraction de ressources, avec la majorité de l'infrastructure nécessaire "
"pour cela concentrée dans l'enceinte de Port Augustmoon.\n"
"\n"
"La corruption et le népotisme sont omniprésents au sein des administrations "
"périphériques de l'ACIU, dû à ceci, les fonctionnaires employés par celles-ci "
"sont beaucoup plus concernés par comment se remplir les poches plus "
"efficacement que l'agenda terrien revanchiste de l'organisation à laquelle "
"ils appartiennent."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/factions.json
#. ~ NPC faction name
msgid "Wraitheon Industries ltd."
msgstr "Wraitheon Industries ltd."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/factions.json
#. ~ Description of NPC faction "Wraitheon Industries ltd."
msgid ""
"A massive, multi-system corporation with major investments across artificial "
"intelligence, shipbuilding, military cybernetics and applied robotics.  Among "
"the oldest of the Solar Corporations, it is a major player in the Orion Arm, "
"and a key military supplier of UICA's military hardware.  It is best known "
"for its normally secretive and highly advanced research and archaeology "
"division."
msgstr ""
"Un conglomérat massif ayant des investissements majeurs dans des dizaines de "
"système parmi les secteurs de l'intelligence artificielle, la construction de "
"vaisseaux, la cybernétique militaire et la robotique appliquée.  L'une des "
"plus vénérables Corporations Solaires et un des acteurs majeurs du Bras "
"d'Orion, ainsi qu'un des fournisseurs clés de l'ACIU.  Possède un département "
"de recherche et archéologie à la réputation trouble."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/factions.json
#. ~ NPC faction name
msgid "Mercurial Genomics ltd."
msgstr "Mercurial Genomics ltd."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/factions.json
#. ~ Description of NPC faction "Mercurial Genomics ltd."
msgid ""
"A massive, multi-system corporation specializing in genetic engineering, "
"terraforming, and biotechnology.  Before the discontinuity, it heavily "
"invested in extrasolar colonization and the study of alien life.  "
"Theoretically it holds the planetary colonization charter for Salus IV, per "
"UICA's constitional treaty, but the corporation's interests currently lie "
"elsewhere."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/factions.json
#. ~ NPC faction name
msgid "Independents"
msgstr "Indépendants"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/factions.json
#. ~ Description of NPC faction "Independents"
msgid ""
"A loose group of salvors, mercenaries and frontiersmen working as free agents "
"or in representation of interest groups too small or remote to have official "
"presence in the system.  Equally likely to cooperate among themselves as they "
"are to fight each other."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/factions.json
#. ~ NPC faction name
msgid "Whately Family"
msgstr "Les Whatelys"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/factions.json
#. ~ Description of NPC faction "Whately Family"
msgid ""
"The Whately's are an old New England family of eccentrics.  Eccentrics being "
"the kind words used about them."
msgstr ""
"Les Whately sont une vieille famille d'excentriques venant de Nouvelle "
"Angleterre. Excentriques étant le mot le plus gentil utilisé pour les décrire."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/frankenstein_classes.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/frankenstein_classes.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Make a Frankenstein BG story
msgid "Abomination"
msgstr "Abomination"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/frankenstein_classes.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/frankenstein_classes.json
#. ~ Job description of "Abomination" NPC class
#. ~ Make a Frankenstein BG story
msgid "The mi-go took me and vivisected me.  Now you've given me a body again."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/frankenstein_classes.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/frankenstein_classes.json
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ An abomination you have revived.
msgid "Cyborg Abomination"
msgstr "Abomination Cyborg"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "What did you bring me?"
msgstr "Qu'est ce que vous m'avez amené?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Do you smell something?"
msgstr "Vous sentez quelque chose?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "New test subjects!  I'm so glad you showed up!"
msgstr "Un nouveau sujet de test! Je suis tellement heureuse que vous soyiez venu(e)!"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can I do anything for you?  Do I want to?"
msgstr ""
"Je peux faire quelque chose pour vous? Est-ce que je veux faire quelque chose "
"pour vous?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Millyficent Whately.  I'm so glad you finally arrived.  It's been a while "
"since I last received new lab partners."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm so hungry, can you help me?"
msgstr "J'ai tellement faim, vous pouvez m'aider?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You are aware of the Cataclysm?"
msgstr "Vous êtes au courant du Cataclysme à l'extérieur?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I am your new lab partner."
msgstr "Je suis votre nouvelle partenaire de laboratoire."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Welcome to my lab!  Here we explore the boundaries of the possible beyond the "
"reach of small minds."
msgstr ""
"Bienvenue dans mon laboratoire! Ici nous explorons les limites de ce qui est "
"possible, bien au delà des sensibilités des esprits étroits en dehors."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can you give me something to eat then?"
msgstr "Est-ce que vous pouvez me donner quelque chose à manger dans ce cas-là?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"No, no, no!  No food without successfully completed experiments.  We mustn't "
"break the contract!"
msgstr ""
"Non, non, non! Rien à manger tant que les expériences ne sont pas complétées. "
"Nous ne devons pas briser le contrat!"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What do I have to do?"
msgstr "Que dois-je faire?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I don't think you are well."
msgstr "Je ne croix pas que vous allez très bien."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Well after I did my graduate thesis on theoretical xenobiology the government "
"hired me to join the most interesting program.  Yes there were deaths but we "
"learned so much."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"What I know is that I pay well for test subjects and I deliver results and at "
"this rate we will not be releasing on time!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Ever since they moved me to my own lab my research has progressed so much "
"faster."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Mi-go biology"
msgstr "Biologie Mi-go"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Mi-go biology"
msgid "Find fetid goop."
msgstr "Trouvez de la bouillie fétide."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go biology"
msgid "I need 14 fetid goops from mi-go locations."
msgstr "J'ai besoin de 14 unités de bouillie fétide."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go biology"
msgid ""
"My experiments are at a critical point.  Could you find about… 14 fetid goops "
"for me?"
msgstr ""
"Mes expériences ont atteintes un point critique. Pourriez-vous trouver… 14 "
"bouillies fétides pour moi?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go biology"
msgid "Find a mi-go base, find a way inside, smash things until you find what I need."
msgstr ""
"Trouvez une base mi-go, trouvez un moyen de rentrer à l'intérieur, et ensuite "
"casser tout ce que vous trouvez jusqu'à ce que vous trouviez ce dont j'ai "
"besoin."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go biology"
msgid "Taste this."
msgstr "Goutez ça."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go biology"
msgid "You are holding back the evolution of the human race."
msgstr "Vous freinez l'évolution de l'espèce humaine."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Mi-go Resin"
msgstr "Résine Mi-go"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Mi-go Resin"
msgid "Find 50 chunks of mi-go resin."
msgstr "Trouvez 50 morceaux de résine de mi-go."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go Resin"
msgid "I need 50 chunks of mi-go resin."
msgstr "J'ai besoin de 50 morceaux de résine de mi-go."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go Resin"
msgid ""
"I need to understand more about their environment and how they create it.  "
"This research wasn't even possible previously.  Bring me fifty chunks of "
"mi-go resin."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go Resin"
msgid ""
"My notes suggest that their building materials are alive.  I need you to help "
"me confirm that."
msgstr ""
"Mes notes suggèrent que leurs matériaux de construction sont vivants. J'ai "
"besoin de votre aide pour confirmer ceci."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go Resin"
msgid "You can't just walk away from this.  We're changing the world!"
msgstr ""
"Vous ne pouvez pas juste abandonner ceci. Nous sommes en train de changer le "
"monde!"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go Resin"
msgid ""
"Find their buildings, jackhammer them.  What did you do before the world "
"changed for the better, cold call salesman?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go Resin"
msgid "Have you found my resin?"
msgstr "Vous avez trouver la résine?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go Resin"
msgid "Drink this."
msgstr "Buvez."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go Resin"
msgid "Did you act on Broadway?  Because I bet that skill isn't useful anymore."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go Resin"
msgid "I wonder if I could trade you to them for what I need?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Mutagen"
msgid "Bring me 3 mutagen."
msgstr "Ramenez-moi 3 doses de mutagène."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mutagen"
msgid "I need three mutagen."
msgstr "J'ai besoin de trois doses de mutagène."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mutagen"
msgid ""
"I need some mutagen and I don't want to spend the time making it myself.  "
"Bring me three doses, if you would be so kind."
msgstr ""
"J'ai besoin de mutagène et je n'ai pas le temps de le fabriquer moi-même. "
"Ramenez-moi trois doses, s'il vous plaît."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mutagen"
msgid "Mutagen makes the world go round, it's definitely more valuable than love."
msgstr "Le mutagène fait tourner le monde, et vaut définitivement plus que l'amour."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mutagen"
msgid "Are you scared of where I'm taking you?"
msgstr "Avez-vous peur de la où je vous mène?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mutagen"
msgid ""
"If you can't make it yourself go hit up a government lab.  Be prepared for "
"anything in there."
msgstr ""
"Si vous n'êtes pas capable de le fabriquer vous même, cherchez dans un "
"laboratoire, et préparez-vous à n'importe quoi là dedans."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mutagen"
msgid "Mutagen?  Why are you in front of me if not?"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez le mutagène? Pourquoi est-ce que vous êtes ici si vous ne l'avez "
"pas?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Humming Hearts"
msgstr "Cœurs Bourdonnants"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Humming Hearts"
msgid "Find 2 humming hearts."
msgstr "trouvez 2 cœurs bourdonnants."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Humming Hearts"
msgid "Parts, parts, parts.  Bring me some hearts."
msgstr "Des organes, des organes, des organes. Ramenez-moi des cœurs."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Humming Hearts"
msgid ""
"The Whately's are known in these parts for gathering body parts.  Ha!  That's "
"just rumors and hearsay.  But I do need two humming hearts."
msgstr ""
"Les Whatelys sont accusés dans le coin de collectionner des morceaux de "
"corps. Haha! Ce ne sont que des rumeurs et ouï-dires. Mais j'aurais besoin de "
"deux cœurs bourdonnants."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Humming Hearts"
msgid ""
"I have some relatives you should meet, if you don't mind hard work for the "
"advancement of science."
msgstr ""
"J'ai des parents que vous devriez rencontrer, si vous n'objectez pas au durs "
"labeurs pour l'avancement des sciences. "

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Humming Hearts"
msgid "Even I understand this is dangerous."
msgstr "Même quelqu'un comme moi comprends que ceci est dangereux."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Humming Hearts"
msgid "Let's see what improvements we can divine from these beauties."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
msgstr "Trouvez Cyrus Whately"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
msgid ""
"Cyrus and his family were poorly liked even for Whately's before the end of "
"the world.  They went so far off grid that they may not even know anything "
"has changed.  I need to know he's alive and where his research has taken him."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
msgid ""
"My great uncle Cyrus had an unconventional relationship with both his "
"neighbors and the mi-go before the Cataclysm.  I'd like to know where he has "
"gotten with his research since I haven't heard from him in years."
msgstr ""
"Mon grand oncle Cyrus avait une relation atypique avec à la fois ses voisins "
"et les mi-go avant le Cataclysme. J'aimerais savoir où en sont ses "
"recherches, ne l'ayant pas vu depuis des années."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
msgid "Can you go find my uncle and let him know where I am?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
msgid "Of course you said yes, you want to know what he's found just as much as I do!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
msgid ""
"Oh well.  I was hoping to teach you some new things, so you could start your "
"own experiments."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
msgid ""
"I've given you directions to that branch of the family's bunker.  Yes I said "
"bunker did you think he'd be in a tower?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
msgid ""
"Thanks, now that he knows I'm here he's sent some of my cousins.  Now that I "
"have more disposable help, take a copy of my early research."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
msgid "I hope he didn't meet Leandrus' fate…"
msgstr "J'espère qu'il n'a pas partagé le destin de Leandrus…"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/npc.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/npc.json
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Abomination.  Change the chat if this loads.
msgid "Cousin"
msgstr "Cousin"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "How's the weather?"
msgstr "Comment est la météo?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Howdy!  You seem new, what brings you here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How do I join the phyle?"
msgstr "Comment est-ce que je peux joindre la phyle?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm a gardener for PrepNet Phyle.  Who are you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I am a beggar who really needs something to eat."
msgstr "Je suis un(e) mendiant(e) qui a vraiment besoin de quelque chose à manger."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I am just a fellow survivor."
msgstr "Just un survivant, comme vous."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm bringing order back to the land."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"This is a PrepNet Phyle orchard.  We were a community of survivalists "
"gathering resources to prepare for climate change, but it left us better "
"prepared for what actually happened than most."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What can I buy here?"
msgstr "Que puis-je acheter ici?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Only the insane will prosper, I guess."
msgstr "Seuls les fous prospéreront, je suppose."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"This food has to go back to our core communities.  But maybe we can trade "
"some food for services."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I can pay."
msgstr "Je peux payer."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Well I'm heading out then"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You have to earn the right to trade with us.  Plus we created our own "
"currency before the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "It was worth a try."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What kind of currency?"
msgstr "Quelle sorte de monnaie?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"This is just an outpost, you'd have to find our main camp and currently we "
"don't want you to."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I didn't want to join your club anyway."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Here?  Fruits and berries.  Maybe the occasional piece of farm equipment, but "
"you'll need crypto coins."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Ok."
msgstr "Ok."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Crypto coins?  Are you insane, there isn't any global internet now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I got introduced to the movement through Mutual Aid Society.  From there it "
"became an all consuming part of my life to prepare for a post consumption "
"world.  It seems to have worked better for us than for many others."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It can get lonely out here between caravans.  But there's plenty of work and "
"my Cyber Mastiffs.  If a horde comes through we hunker down in a nearby "
"shelter if it's too large for us."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm glad you stay busy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"We use so-called crypto coins for money here.  They were a pre-Cataclysm "
"attempt to abstract money even further and create electronic cash.  Now it's "
"a joke because we use physical coins.  Barter only gets you so far.  And one "
"day we'll have the Net back up."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Big Game Hunting"
msgstr "Chasse au gros gibier"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Big Game Hunting"
msgid "Find 50 fur pelts."
msgstr "Trouvez 50 fourrures."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Big Game Hunting"
msgid "I need 50 fur pelts."
msgstr "J'ai besoin de 50 fourrures."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Big Game Hunting"
msgid ""
"I've got to maintain the orchard but at nights I work on prepping winter "
"clothes.  Could you find about… 50 fur pelts for me?"
msgstr ""
"Je dois entretenir le verger, mais le soir, je prépare mes vêtements d'hiver. "
"Pourriez-vous trouver une cinquantaine de fourrures pour moi ?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Big Game Hunting"
msgid "There's a lot of places to look.  The entire outdoors is full of wild animals."
msgstr ""
"Il y a beaucoup d'endroits où chercher. La nature entière est remplie "
"d'animaux sauvages."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Bread"
msgid "Find 50 flour."
msgstr "Trouvez 50 unités de farine"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bread"
msgid "I need 50 flour."
msgstr "J'ai besoin de 50 unités de farine"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bread"
msgid "Flour would let me break the monotony of fruit and meats."
msgstr "La farine me permettrait de rompre la monotonie des fruits et des viandes."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bread"
msgid ""
"Thanks for accepting this task.  Otherwise I might kill a stranger for a "
"sandwich.  Just kidding."
msgstr ""
"Merci d'avoir accepté cette tâche. Autrement je pourrais tuer un inconnu pour "
"un sandwich. Je plaisante."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bread"
msgid ""
"Flour is not that hard to find.  I'd look for them in residential areas and "
"professional kitchens or bakeries."
msgstr ""
"La farine n'est pas si difficile à trouver. Je la chercherais dans les zones "
"résidentielles et dans les cuisines professionnelles ou les boulangeries."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bread"
msgid "Have you found the flour?"
msgstr "Vous avez trouvé la farine?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Gallon Jugs"
msgstr "Bidons"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Gallon Jugs"
msgid "Find 5 gallon jugs."
msgstr "Trouvez 5 bidons."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gallon Jugs"
msgid "I need storage for various liquid products when the fruits come in."
msgstr ""
"J'ai besoin de choses pour contenir des produits liquides lorsque les fruits "
"seront récoltés."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gallon Jugs"
msgid ""
"Every season we produce so much fruit.  Some of it will be turned into juice "
"and some into alcohol.  I need easy containers to load it on the caravan."
msgstr ""
"Chaque saison, nous produisons beaucoup de fruits. Une partie sera "
"transformée en jus et une autre en alcool. J'ai besoin de conteneurs faciles "
"à charger sur la caravane."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gallon Jugs"
msgid "Thank you for accepting.  I'm almost out after the last caravan."
msgstr "Merci d'avoir accepter, je suis presque à court depuis la dernière caravane."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gallon Jugs"
msgid "I guess I'll have to make stomach waterskins."
msgstr "Je suppose que je vais avoir besoin de faire de gourdes à partir d'estomacs."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gallon Jugs"
msgid "Gallon jugs are not that rare to find.  They are commonly found in kitchens."
msgstr ""
"Il n'est pas rare de trouver des pichets de gallon. On les trouve couramment "
"dans les cuisines."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gallon Jugs"
msgid "Do you have those jugs now?"
msgstr "Est-ce que vous avez les bidons?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gallon Jugs"
msgid "I am grateful for the help you've done.  I have one more task to do."
msgstr ""
"Je suis infiniment reconnaissant(e) pour toute l'aide que vous nous avez "
"apporté, mais j'ai une dernière tâche pour vous."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Burnt Out CBMs"
msgstr "MBCs Grillés"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Burnt Out CBMs"
msgid "Find 5 burnt out CBMs."
msgstr "Trouvez 5 MBCs grillés."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Burnt Out CBMs"
msgid "We have the ability to manufacture CBMs but lack resources."
msgstr ""
"Nous sommes capables de produire des MBCs, mais manquons les matériaux "
"nécessaires."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Burnt Out CBMs"
msgid "If you can bring me burnt out CBMs we can recycle them into new ones."
msgstr ""
"Si vous pouvez m'amener des MBCs grillés, nous pouvons les recycler en de "
"nouveaux."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Burnt Out CBMs"
msgid "Thank you for accepting.  You're really making yourself useful to the phyle."
msgstr "Merci d'avoir accepté. Vous vous rendez vraiment utile au phyle."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Burnt Out CBMs"
msgid "These materials are often in dangerous areas.  I understand your decision."
msgstr ""
"Les MCB se trouvent souvent dans des lieux à haut risque, je comprends votre "
"décision."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Burnt Out CBMs"
msgid ""
"Zombie scientists, technicians, shocker zombies.  These are not undertaken "
"lightly."
msgstr ""
"Des scientifiques zombies, des techniciens, des zombies choqueurs. Ils ne "
"sont pas à prendre à la légère."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Burnt Out CBMs"
msgid "Do you have those CBMs now?"
msgstr "Est-ce que vous avez les MBCs?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Burnt Out CBMs"
msgid ""
"I am grateful for the help you've done.  I think we might be able to "
"introduce you to others soon."
msgstr ""
"Je vous suis reconnaissant de l'aide que vous avez apportée. Je pense que "
"nous pourrons bientôt vous présenter aux autres."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "sadie_injection"
msgid "Sadie's injection"
msgstr "L'injection de Sadie"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Sadie's injection"
msgid "A wave of cold runs through your body and you feel dizzy"
msgstr "Une vague de froid vous traverse et vous vous sentez pris/e de vertige"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Sadie's injection"
msgid "The effects of Sadie's injection appear to be wearing off now"
msgstr "Les effets de l'injection de Sadie ont l'air d'être en train de s'évanouir"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Sadie's injection"
msgid ""
"Several hundred lines of text list a series of complex biological molecules "
"with unknown interactions.  Many appear to be associated with healing and "
"immune response.  Only a few are known to be poisonous and many are known "
"carcinogens.  Several have psychological and hormonal effects."
msgstr ""
"Plusieurs centaines de lignes de texte énumèrent une série de molécules "
"biologiques complexes dont les interactions sont inconnues. Nombre d'entre "
"elles semblent être associées à la guérison et à la réponse immunitaire. "
"Seules quelques-unes sont connues pour être toxiques et beaucoup sont des "
"carcinogènes connus. Plusieurs ont des effets psychologiques et hormonaux."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Are we meeting again or did we already do that part?"
msgstr "Est-ce qu'on se retrouve ou est-ce qu'on a déjà fait cette partie?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "You remind me of my friend Billy."
msgstr "Tu me rappelles mon ami Billy."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "What an amazing world to be alive in, more or less."
msgstr "Quel monde incroyable dans lequel vivre, plus ou moins."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"My head always beats when I see you.  Or is that my heart?  I should check "
"that."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "It's always so nice to be seen."
msgstr "C'est toujours aussi agréable d'être vu."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Hello Billy.  Back again to try and kill me?  It won't work, you should just "
"give up."
msgstr ""
"Salut Billy. Tu reviens pour essayer de me tuer ? Ça ne marchera pas, tu "
"devrais abandonner."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What, who is Billy?"
msgstr "Quoi, qui est Billy?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Die foul creature!"
msgstr "Vous mourrez créature immonde!"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What did you just inject me with?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que tu viens de m'injecter?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Would you like to come with me Sadie?"
msgstr "Voulez-vous venir avec moi Sadie?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can you inject me with whatever that was again?"
msgstr "Pouvez-vous m'injecter ce que c'était encore?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr "Au revoir."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Oh.  I see now.  You have different sexual traits than Billy, likely due to a "
"mutation or cybernetic enhancement, useful in mating rituals, the act of "
"reproduction, and establishing social hierarchies.  Very good, I accept that "
"you are either not Billy or have changed enough that we can establish a new "
"relationship beyond violence, for example based around the gathering of food, "
"mating, or shared hobbies such as badminton or photography.  How do you wish "
"to proceed with our relationship not-Billy?"
msgstr ""
"Oh. Je comprends maintenant. Vous avez des traits sexuels différents de ceux "
"de Billy, probablement dus à une mutation ou à une amélioration cybernétique, "
"utiles pour les rituels d'accouplement, l'acte de reproduction et "
"l'établissement de hiérarchies sociales. Très bien, j'accepte que vous ne "
"soyez pas Billy ou que vous ayez suffisamment changé pour que nous puissions "
"établir une nouvelle relation au-delà de la violence, par exemple autour de "
"la collecte de nourriture, de l'accouplement ou de passe-temps communs comme "
"le badminton ou la photographie. Comment souhaitez-vous poursuivre notre "
"relation, pas-Billy ?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like to understand more about you first.  Are you human, more or less?"
msgstr "J'aimerais d'abord en savoir plus sur vous. Êtes-vous humain/e, plus ou moins?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I am your new friend and I'm here to help you."
msgstr "Je suis votre nouvel/le ami/e et je suis là pour vous aider."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Yes, much of what you see is human I think.  I don't have the proper "
"equipment to be entirely sure and I have some strange memories.  My beacon "
"has already told you that I am Sadie.  Beyond that I don't know much to tell "
"you.  I know a great deal about medicine.  I have some strange responses to "
"physical stimuli that I don't completely understand.  I think I must be a "
"medical experiment of some kind.  My chest hurts in a really yummy way."
msgstr ""
"Oui, la plupart de ce que vous voyez est humain je crois. Je n'ai pas "
"l'équipement approprié pour être totalement sûre et j'ai des mémoires "
"étranges. Ma balise vous a déjà dit que je m'appelle Sadie. À part cela je ne "
"sais pas grand chose que je pourrais vous dire. Je connais beaucoup de choses "
"sur le sujet des sciences médicales. J'ai des étranges réactions à certains "
"stimuli physiques que je ne comprends pas totalement. Je pense que je doit "
"être une sorte d'expérience médicale. Mon cœur me fait mal d'une façon "
"vraiment agréable."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can I help you?"
msgstr "Je peux vous aider?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I should go."
msgstr "Je devrais partir."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I have so many memories, but they feel like they belong to other people?  And "
"animals too I think?  It makes me dizzy and I have to sit down."
msgstr ""
"J'ai tellement de souvenirs, mais j'ai l'impression qu'ils appartiennent à "
"d'autres personnes ? Et à des animaux aussi, je crois ? Cela me donne le "
"vertige et je dois m'asseoir."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I don't know her."
msgstr "Je ne la connais pas."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Yes.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "Oui.  Parlons de quelque chose d'autre."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Things stay pretty much the same here.  Sometimes I feel bad, and that feels "
"good, and sometimes I feel good, and that feels good too.  Overall things are "
"better than you might expect, but this may be a common experience, in which "
"case things are exactly as you might expect.  Does that make sense?"
msgstr ""
"Les choses restent à peu près les mêmes ici. Parfois, je me sens mal, et cela "
"me fait du bien, et parfois je me sens bien, et cela me fait du bien aussi. "
"Dans l'ensemble, les choses sont meilleures que ce à quoi on pourrait "
"s'attendre, mais il peut s'agir d'une expérience commune, auquel cas les "
"choses sont exactement comme on pourrait s'y attendre. Est-ce que cela a un "
"sens ?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Perfect sense."
msgstr "Tout à fait."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I hope you like it, it's one of my favorite things in the world, actually a "
"lot of them all blended together.  It should feel really good.  Or really "
"bad, I guess I don't know much about your body chemistry.  You're still "
"alive, that's a really good sign!"
msgstr ""
"J'espère que vous l'aimerez, c'est l'une de mes choses préférées au monde, en "
"fait beaucoup de choses mélangées ensemble.Ça devrait faire beaucoup de bien. "
"Ou beaucoup de mal, je suppose que je ne connais pas bien la chimie de votre "
"corps. Vous êtes toujours en vie, c'est un très bon signe !"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Wonderful.  Please don't inject me with anything else unless I ask for it in "
"the future."
msgstr ""
"Merveilleux. S'il vous plaît, ne m'injectez rien d'autre à moins que je ne le "
"demande à l'avenir."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm so glad you liked it.  It really means a lot to me that we have similar "
"body chemistry.  That's so important for all kinds of biological and "
"emotional compatibility for example organ transplants and the reproductive "
"act.  This shows how I feel about you, I think."
msgstr ""
"Je suis tellement heureuse que vous ayez apprécié. Cela signifie vraiment "
"beaucoup pour moi que nous ayons des chimies corporelles similaires. Ceci est "
"tellement important pour toute sorte de formes de compatibilités biologiques "
"et émotionnelles come par exemple les greffes et l'act reproductif. Cela "
"montre ce que je ressens pour vous, je crois."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm glad we get along so well Sadie."
msgstr "Je suis content que nous nous entendions si bien Sadie."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Let's go explore.  There's still so much these eyes haven't seen.  Wait, are "
"these new eyes?  Where did I put my old eyes?  Are they pretty?"
msgstr ""
"Allons explorer. Il y a encore tant de choses que ces yeux n'ont pas vues. "
"Attendez, ce sont de nouveaux yeux? Où ai-je mis mes vieux yeux? Sont-ils "
"jolis?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I can't wait to see how wonderful the world must be.  I've heard the "
"shrieking and moaning and cries for help and I just know it's going to be "
"perfect if everyone out there is as sweet and loving as you and Billy."
msgstr ""
"J'ai hâte de voir à quel point le monde doit être merveilleux. J'ai entendu "
"les cris, les gémissements et les appels à l'aide et je sais juste que ce "
"sera parfait si tout le monde est aussi gentil et aimant que toi et Billy."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Yes, everyone left is exactly like Billy and me, or worse."
msgstr "Oui, tous ceux qui restent sont exactement comme Billy et moi, ou pire."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "They're even better.  Let's go."
msgstr "Ils sont encore meilleurs. Allons-y."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Heart for Sadie"
msgstr "Un coeur pour Sadie"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Heart for Sadie"
msgid "Find a special organ"
msgstr "Trouver un organe spécial"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Heart for Sadie"
msgid "I want your organ."
msgstr "Je veux ton organe."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Heart for Sadie"
msgid ""
"I've been feeling really yummy since the last time Billy came to work on me, "
"and I think it's because my heart is gone.  Like literally gone.  I checked.  "
"Billy did a really good job taking it out, but I want to leave this storage "
"unit with you and if I'm going to do that I need a working heart.  My first "
"idea was to take yours, but you probably need it even more.  You know who has "
"a nice big juicy heart?  Billy does.  And I bet I know where Billy is."
msgstr ""
"Depuis la dernière fois que Billy est venu travailler sur moi, je me sens "
"très mal, et je pense que c'est parce que mon cœur a disparu. Genre "
"littéralement parti. J'ai vérifié. Billy a fait un très bon travail en le "
"retirant, mais je veux quitter cette unité de stockage avec vous et si je "
"dois le faire, j'ai besoin d'un cœur en état de marche. Ma première idée "
"était de prendre le tien, mais tu en as probablement encore plus besoin. Tu "
"sais qui a un bon gros coeur juteux ? Billy. Et je parie que je sais où est "
"Billy."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Heart for Sadie"
msgid "Aw, I heart that you're going to help me get that big organ."
msgstr "Ooh, j'aime que vous m'aidiez à obtenir ce gros organe."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Heart for Sadie"
msgid ""
"This makes me sad.  Which makes me happy.  So thanks?  Let me know if you "
"change your mind.  I probably shouldn't go without a heart for too too long "
"but I'm kind of enjoying it.  It's like always being on the edge of something "
"horrible, but in a nice way."
msgstr ""
"Cela me rend triste. Ce qui me rend heureux. Alors, merci ? Faites-moi savoir "
"si vous changez d'avis. Je ne devrais probablement pas rester sans cœur trop "
"longtemps, mais j'aime bien ça. C'est comme si j'étais toujours au bord de "
"quelque chose d'horrible, mais d'une manière agréable."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Heart for Sadie"
msgid ""
"Please be careful cutting that heart out.  If you ruin it I don't know about "
"another good one nearby.  Maybe practice on some friends and neighbors first, "
"you really want to be sure and get it right.  If you break Billy's heart I "
"can use a heart from another of whatever Billy is, but I can't use regular "
"hearts, and I don't know where to find more Billy types."
msgstr ""
"Faites attention en découpant ce cœur. Si vous l'abîmez, je n'en connais pas "
"d'autre à proximité. Entraînez-vous d'abord sur des amis et des voisins, vous "
"voulez vraiment être sûr de vous. Si vous brisez le cœur de Billy, je peux "
"utiliser un cœur d'un autre Billy, mais je ne peux pas utiliser de cœur "
"normal, et je ne sais pas où trouver d'autres du même type que Billy."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Heart for Sadie"
msgid "Do you have my heart?"
msgstr "Vous avez mon cœur?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Heart for Sadie"
msgid ""
"Ooh, Billy had a really good heart.  Can you turn away please?  I just need "
"to do some quick open chest surgery here.  Just a quick cut here *ooh* and I "
"need to break this and this *SNAP* *oh!* and just sew some little things "
"together here quickly.  Not as much blood as you'd think.  I should probably "
"look into that later, there should be more blood in there.  Ah, good enough, "
"I can do a better job closing up later.  Kind of tingly, feeling everything "
"moving again in there.  See, heart surgery isn't hard if you have the right "
"attitude.  Well now, you need a good reward for everything you've done for "
"me.  Here, let me inject you with this."
msgstr ""
"Ooh, Billy avait vraiment un bon cœur. Pouvez-vous vous tourner, s'il vous "
"plaît ? J'ai juste besoin de faire une opération rapide à thorax ouvert ici. "
"Juste une coupure rapide ici *ooh* et je dois casser ceci et cela *SNAP* "
"*oh!* et juste recoudre quelques petites choses ici rapidement. Y a pas "
"autant de sang qu'on pourrait le penser. Je devrais probablement regarder ça "
"plus tard, il devrait y avoir plus de sang là-dedans. Ah, c'est bon, je "
"pourrai mieux refermer plus tard. C'est un peu excitant de sentir que tout "
"bouge à nouveau là-dedans. Vous voyez, la chirurgie cardiaque n'est pas "
"difficile si vous avez la bonne attitude. Vous avez besoin d'une bonne "
"récompense pour tout ce que vous avez fait pour moi. Laissez-moi vous "
"injecter ceci."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Heart for Sadie"
msgid "I don't know why, but I feel better.  Also worse.  Maybe I'm good without it."
msgstr ""
"Je ne sais pas pourquoi, mais je me sens mieux. Pire aussi. Peut-être que je "
"suis bien sans ça."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Heart for Sadie"
msgid ""
"Oh no, my heart.  Thank you for trying though, your failure gives me "
"pleasure.  What else are you bad at?"
msgstr ""
"Oh non, mon coeur. Merci d'avoir essayé, ton échec me fait plaisir. En quoi "
"d'autre êtes-vous mauvais?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/sadie.json
#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_flesh_golem_afs" placed on map update on start
#. of mission "Heart for Sadie"
msgid "Billy"
msgstr "Billy"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/threshold_recruit_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/threshold_recruit_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#, no-c-format
msgid "[MASTODON 75%] Come, join the herd before you're left behind."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/threshold_recruit_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/threshold_recruit_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#, no-c-format
msgid "[MI-GO 50%] Let's see just how much we can improve ourselves."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Outsider."
msgstr "Étranger."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Hospitality rites are civilization."
msgstr "Les rituels d'hospitalité sont le fondement d'une vraie civilization."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Guest."
msgstr "Invité."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "How's the madness outside?"
msgstr "Comment vont les choses dehors?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "We don't get outsiders around here all that much."
msgstr "Nous ne recevons pas souvent d'étrangers par ici."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How do I join the family?"
msgstr "Comment je peux joindre la famille ?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm a member of the Whately Family.  Who are you?"
msgstr "Je suis un membre de la famille Whately, qui êtes-vous?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I am lost and really need something to eat."
msgstr "Je suis perdu(e) et j'ai vraiment besoin de quelque chose à manger."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I've done some tasks for your relatives."
msgstr "J'ai accompli des tâches pour des membres de votre famille."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Welcome to Whately lands.  Behave yourself or we'll harvest you for parts."
msgstr ""
"Bienvenue sur les terres de Whately. Tenez-vous bien ou nous vous récolterons "
"en pièces détachées."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Family bonds above all, huh?"
msgstr "Les liens de famille avant tout non?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "We aren't in the habit of breaking bread with outsiders."
msgstr "Nous n'avons pas l'habitude de rompre le pain avec des étrangers."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How do I join your family?"
msgstr "Comment puis-je rejoindre votre famille?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Then let's see what you've got to trade."
msgstr "Voyons ce que vous avez à marchander."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Only blood allowed, and the family Elders can make you of the blood."
msgstr ""
"Seul le sang est autorisé, et les aînés de la famille peuvent faire de vous "
"un membre de ce sang."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Well that sounds creepy."
msgstr "Eh bien, cela semble glauque."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I was born part of the family.  We've never been accepted here but our wealth "
"and talents have kept us alive through the centuries."
msgstr ""
"Je suis né/e dans la famille. Nous n'avons jamais été acceptés ici, mais "
"notre richesse et nos talents nous ont permis de survivre à travers les "
"siècles."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Family keeps me busy and our experiments and projects take up the rest of my "
"time."
msgstr ""
"La famille me tient occupé/e et nos expériences et projets occupent le reste "
"de mon temps."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_doctor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_doctor.json
#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "Mercurial Medical Agent"
msgstr "Agent de Mercurial Medical"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_doctor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Clinic is open, yes.  If you need medical assistance, this is the place."
msgstr ""
"La clinique est ouverte, oui. Si vous avez besoin d'une assistance médicale, "
"c'est ici."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_doctor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_doctor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[1200$, 30m] I need you to patch me up."
msgstr "[$200, 30m] J'ai besoin que vous me raccommodiez."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_doctor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_doctor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[2400$, 1h] I need you to patch my friends up."
msgstr "[$500, 1h] J'ai besoin que vous raccommodiez mes compagnons."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_gun_trader.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_gun_trader.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ All guns are more expensive here.
msgid "Gun trader "
msgstr "Vendeur d'Armes"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_gun_trader.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_gun_trader.json
#. ~ Job description of "Gun trader " NPC class
#. ~ All guns are more expensive here.
msgid "Gun trader"
msgstr "Vendeuse d'armes"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_gun_trader.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_outfitter.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_gun_trader.json
