#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_outfitter.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_outfitter.json
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
