#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_5.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/vatgrown_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Tell me more?"
msgstr "Dites-moi en plus?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Eventually they took the bones from my body.  It's strange though, I still "
"hear the song calling to me, even in this new body."
msgstr ""
"Finalement, ils ont retiré les os de mon corps. Mais c'est étrange, j'entends "
"toujours la chanson qui m'appelle, même dans ce nouveau corps."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I just spent what felt like weeks in a dream that I was acting as a targeting "
"computer for some kind of alien turret."
msgstr ""
"Je viens de passer ce qui m'a semblé être des semaines à rêver que je servais "
"d'ordinateur de ciblage pour une sorte de tourelle extraterrestre."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Where are you from then?"
msgstr "D'où êtes-vous dans ce cas-là?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Now I'm in some kind of Mary Shelley nightmare?  I mean at least I have "
"mobility."
msgstr ""
"Maintenant, je suis dans une sorte de cauchemar à la Mary Shelley ? Au moins, "
"j'ai de la mobilité."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What does that have to do with anything?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que ça a à voir avec tout le reste ?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm going to keep going with this dream, hopefully soon I'll get to one where "
"I can fly."
msgstr ""
"Je vais continuer à poursuivre ce rêve, et j'espère arriver bientôt à un "
"moment où je pourrai voler."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Antes do Cataclisma eu era o cientista que encabeçava um laboratório militar "
"no meu país.  Foram dias difíceis…"
msgstr ""
"Antes do Cataclisma eu era o cientista que encabeçava um laboratório militar "
"no meu país.  Foram dias difíceis…"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Nós estávamos pesquisando um remédio que curasse um virus altamente letal na "
"época, mas os resultados dos testes mostravam que o remédio era mais letal do "
"que o próprio virus.  Então, ao invés de recolherem os remédios das "
"prateleiras, eles nos forçaram a vendê-lo como sendo a cura para o vírus."
msgstr ""
"Nós estávamos pesquisando um remédio que curasse um virus altamente letal na "
"época, mas os resultados dos testes mostravam que o remédio era mais letal do "
"que o próprio virus.  Então, ao invés de recolherem os remédios das "
"prateleiras, eles nos forçaram a vendê-lo como sendo a cura para o vírus."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Ummm?"
msgstr "Euhhhh?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Bem… aqueles sem cérebro seguiram cegamente o líder.  Quanto àqueles com "
"algum cérebro… bom, acho que você está conversando com um deles agora"
msgstr ""
"Bem… aqueles sem cérebro seguiram cegamente o líder.  Quanto àqueles com "
"algum cérebro… bom, acho que você está conversando com um deles agora"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Things have been getting weird for the last couple of years.  Then we started "
"hearing rumors of strange lights in the sky at night."
msgstr ""
"Depuis quelques années, les choses deviennent bizarres. Nous avons commencé à "
"entendre des rumeurs de lumières étranges dans le ciel la nuit."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"One night I heard my neighbor calling for me to come help him.  I went "
"outside wondering what he could possibly need my help with in the middle of "
"the night."
msgstr ""
"Une nuit, j'ai entendu mon voisin m'appeler pour que je vienne l'aider. Je "
"suis sorti/e en me demandant ce qu'il pouvait bien avoir besoin de mon aide "
"au milieu de la nuit."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Some kind of hideous alien was standing over my neighbors disemboweled "
"corpse.  It looked at me and said 'You're a great neighbor' then everything "
"faded to black.  I feel like everything in my body fits differently now."
msgstr ""
"Une sorte d'extraterrestre hideux se tenait au-dessus du cadavre éventré de "
"mon voisin. Il m'a regardé et m'a dit : « Vous êtes un/e bon/ne voisin/e », "
"puis tout est devenu noir. J'ai l'impression que toutes les parties de mon "
"corps s'emboîtent différemment maintenant."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_3.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I worked in a top secret lab.  Things kept getting crazier and crazier "
"outside and the scientists inside started making desperate experiments.  They "
"worked on something called interdimensional portals."
msgstr ""
"Je travaillais dans un laboratoire top secret. Les choses devenaient de plus "
"en plus folles à l'extérieur et les scientifiques à l'intérieur ont commencé "
"à faire des expériences désespérées. Ils travaillaient sur ce qu'on appelle "
"les portails interdimensionnels."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_3.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The eggheads kept saying we needed to find a way out of here before "
"everything went sideways.  So we needed to open more portals even if we "
"hadn't had time to take all the precautions."
msgstr ""
"Les crânes d'œuf n'ont cessé de répéter qu'il fallait trouver un moyen de "
"sortir d'ici avant que tout ne dérape. Nous devions donc ouvrir d'autres "
"portails, même si nous n'avions pas eu le temps de prendre toutes les "
"précautions nécessaires."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_3.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"One day they opened a portal trying to find an earthlike planet and suddenly "
"portals were opening all over the lab and these fast and dangerous aliens "
"overwhelmed the lab.  They killed most of the staff and took the rest "
"prisoner."
msgstr ""
"Un jour, ils ont ouvert un portail pour tenter de trouver une planète "
"semblable à la terre et soudainement, des portails se sont ouverts dans tout "
"le laboratoire et ces extraterrestres rapides et dangereux ont envahi le "
"laboratoire. Ils ont tué la plupart des employé/es et fait prisonnier/ès les "
"autres."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Monsters!  Monsters everywhere.  Everyone is suspect, how do I know you "
"aren't a monster?"
msgstr ""
"Des monstres ! Des monstres partout. Tout le monde est suspect, comment "
"savoir si vous n'êtes pas un monstre ?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Are you ok?"
msgstr "Vous allez bien?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You can't trust anyone these days.  Everyone is either a cannibal or a "
"monster or a government spook."
msgstr ""
"De nos jours, on ne peut faire confiance à personne. Tout le monde est soit "
"un cannibale, soit un monstre, soit un espion du gouvernement."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Why would you trust me then?"
msgstr "Pourquoi me faire confiance alors ?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Because, what if I'm the monster?"
msgstr "Parce que, et si j'étais un monstre ?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "If you think this Universe is bad, you should see some of the others."
msgstr ""
"Si vous pensez que cet univers est mauvais, vous devriez voir certains des "
"autres."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Believing something existed and then finding out it didn't was like reaching "
"the top of the stairs and thinking there was one more step."
msgstr ""
"Croire que quelque chose existe et découvrir ensuite que ce n'est pas le cas, "
"c'est comme arriver en haut de l'escalier en pensant qu'il y avait encore une "
"marche."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I think a lot of psychopaths are just geniuses who drove so fast that they "
"lost control."
msgstr ""
"Je pense que beaucoup de psychopathes sont des génies qui ont conduit si vite "
"qu'ils ont perdu le contrôle."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BG_traits_afs.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyborg_npcs/backgrounds/bg_traits_cyborg.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BG_traits_afs.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/cyborg_npcs/backgrounds/bg_traits_cyborg.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Survivor Story"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Survivor"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Whately Story"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cyberninja Story"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sadie Story"
msgid "This NPC could tell you about how they survived the Cataclysm"
msgstr "Ce PNJ pourrait vous raconter comment il/elle a survécu au Cataclysme"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BG_traits_afs.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BG_traits_afs.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Whately Story"
msgstr "Histoire Whately"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BG_traits_afs.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BG_traits_afs.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Cyberninja Story"
msgstr "Histoire de Cyberninja"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BG_traits_afs.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BG_traits_afs.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sadie Story"
msgstr "Histoire de Sadie"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I underwent experimental treatments paid for by the cartels to become a more "
"fearsome enforcer."
msgstr ""
"J'ai subi des traitements expérimentaux payés par les cartels pour devenir un "
"homme de main plus redoutable."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Half of the guys I underwent gene therapy with died, but hey if I had to "
"guess 90 percent of everyone is dead now?"
msgstr ""
"La moitié des personnes avec lesquelles j'ai subi une thérapie génique sont "
"mortes, mais si je devais deviner, 90 % d'entre elles sont mortes aujourd'hui "
"?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Only the insane will prosper."
msgstr "Seuls les dingues prospéreront."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"As a corporate wetworks specialist I'm used to crazy situations.  But this is "
"like nothing I've ever experienced."
msgstr ""
"En tant que spécialiste des travaux d'humidification en entreprise, j'ai "
"l'habitude des situations rocambolesques. Mais celle-ci ne ressemble à rien "
"de ce que j'ai connu."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What are you going to do now?"
msgstr "Qu'est ce que vous allez faire maintenant?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm gonna find somewhere that people are making a stand.  And if I can agree "
"with their plans I'll make my stand with them."
msgstr ""
"Je vais trouver un endroit où les gens prennent position. Et si je suis "
"d'accord avec leurs projets, je prendrai position avec eux."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Where is that?"
msgstr "Où est-ce?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Right now you are looking like the best leader I've met so far in this "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Pour l'instant, vous semblez être le meilleur leader que j'ai rencontré "
"jusqu'à présent dans ce Cataclysme."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I was born at the bottom of the habitat.  No silver spoon in my mouth."
msgstr ""
"Je suis né au bas de l'échelle de l'habitat. Je n'ai pas eu de cuillère en "
"argent dans la bouche."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "That must have been rough."
msgstr "Ça a du être dur."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I saw my best friend die in front of me by the time I was eight."
msgstr "J'ai vu ma meilleure amie mourir devant mes yeux, j'avais 8 ans."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I guess it prepared me for everyone dying yesterday."
msgstr "J'imagine que ça m'a préparé/e à voir tout le monde mourir hier."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I've spent my life in the hive.  When things started turning strange I snuck "
"out of the city."
msgstr ""
"J'ai passé ma vie dans la ruche. Quand les choses ont commencé à devenir "
"étranges, j'ai quitté la ville en cachette."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You seem like you are out of your element."
msgstr "Vous avez l'air d'être en dehors de votre élément."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I've never seen so many trees outside of a video.  And there is so much "
"wildlife."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai jamais vu autant d'arbres en dehors d'une vidéo. Et il y a tellement "
"de faune et de flore."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What will you do?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que vous allez faire?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm going to live my best life in a dead world."
msgstr "Je vais vivre ma meilleure vie dans un monde mort."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "There's so much sky out here.  It's horrible."
msgstr "Il y a tellement de ciel ouvert dehors. C'est insupportable."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "It might be worse than the dead rising."
msgstr "C'est peut-être pire que les morts-vivants."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm going to kill my way back into the city so I can get out from under this "
"sky."
msgstr ""
"Je vais me frayer un chemin jusqu'à la ville pour pouvoir sortir de sous ce "
"ciel."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "Lizard Mutant"
msgstr "Mutant Reptilien"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#. ~ Job description of "Lizard Mutant" NPC class
msgid ""
"I'm looking for lizard mutagen… this world is no place for humans anymore, "
"and I don't plan to keep being one."
msgstr ""
"Je cherche du mutagène lézard… Ce monde n'est plus un endroit pour les "
"humains, et je ne compte pas rester l'un d'entre eux."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "Rabbit Mutant"
msgstr "Mutant Lapin"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#. ~ Job description of "Rabbit Mutant" NPC class
msgid ""
