"\n"
" Our love is true\n"
"\n"
" I hope to see you\n"
"\n"
" On Croatan 2\n"
"\n"
" My dearest, please join me.  I don't believe there are many shuttles left "
"before people will be stuck here forever.\""
msgstr ""

