msgstr "Pas de Pré-Requis"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/core_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_bombastic_perks_initialize"
msgid ""
"Bombastic Perks is loaded, configuration menu should appear.  If the mod is "
"properly loaded you should have a new mutation called \"perk menu\".  If you "
"do not, you can enable the mod manually by activating the "
"\"EOC_bombastic_perks_try_configure\" EOC in debug."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/core_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_bombastic_perks_try_configure"
msgid ""
"Configuration menu closed, if Bombastic Perks was not properly configured "
"menu will open again in 30 seconds."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Welcome to Bombastic Perks.  Once you complete this configuration, your "
"character should receive a \"perk menu\" trait which you can use to check "
"your EXP, level, and browse available perks.\n"
"Please configure the mod with the settings below."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Use Default Settings"
msgstr "Utiliser les Paramètres par Défaut"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Customize Settings"
msgstr "Customiser les Paramètres"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "How much experience should be required to get to the first level?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Default (100 exp)"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Custom Value"
msgstr "Valeur Customisée"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "How much more experience should be required to get to each additional level?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Default (300 XP)"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Should some perks be allowed to be locked behind prerequisites?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Prerequisites (default)"
msgstr "Prérequis (défaut)"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Normal perks are considered lifestyle perks and are small bonuses to help "
"your character progress.  Playstyle perks on the other hand can vary wildly "
"in power, in some cases aren't well balanced, and will define your "
"character's playstyle.  Do you want to enable playstyle perks and if so, how "
"many perk points should they cost?"
msgstr ""
"Les avantages normaux sont considérés comme des avantages du mode de vie et "
"sont de petits bonus qui aident votre personnage à progresser.  Les avantages "
"de style de jeu, quant à eux, peuvent varier considérablement en puissance, "
"dans certains cas ne sont pas bien équilibrés, et définiront le style de jeu "
"de votre personnage.  Souhaitez-vous activer les avantages de style de jeu "
"et, si oui, combien de points doivent-ils coûter?  "

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Default (4 perk points)"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Enabled, Custom Cost"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You are about to enable the mod with:\n"
"First perk at: <u_val:exp_to_perk> exp.\n"
"Additional exp required per level: <u_val:exp_per_level>.\n"
"<u_val:dialogue_perks_prereq_note>\n"
"<u_val:dialogue_perks_playstyle_note>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Confirmer"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/absit_invidia.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ANTI_EVIL_EYE_GEAR"
msgid "Wearing this will protect you from the Evil Eye."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/absit_invidia.json
#. ~ "description" action message of item "salt"
msgid "Throw some salt over your shoulder."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/absit_invidia.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PERK_ABSIT_INVIDIA_SALT"
msgid ""
"You toss the salt over your shoulder and mutter under your breath the words "
"that you remember from your childhood."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/bellringer.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_perk_bellringer"
msgid "Bell-ringing"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/bellringer.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Bell-ringing"
msgid "This is really going to hurt.  Applied to targets of the Bellringer perk."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/belowthebelt.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing the "groin" weakpoint
msgid "the groin"
msgstr "l'aine"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/closedfist.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/openpalm.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/pinchedfingers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "callused hands"
msgid_plural "callused hands"
msgstr[0] "mains calleuses"
msgstr[1] "mains calleuses"
msgstr[2] "mains calleuses"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/closedfist.json
#. ~ Description of "callused hands"
msgid ""
"You've dealt so many blows your hands are rough with calluses.  The bottoms "
"of your hand can deal blows hard enough to hammer or finely crush objects."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/dice_addition_damage.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "eoc_perk_dice_addition_damage"
msgid "Damage dice result: 1D<context_val:dice_side_nums> = <context_val:dice_result>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/duck_and_weave.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_perk_duck_and_weave"
msgid "Running without Rhythm"
msgstr "Courir sans Rythme"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/duck_and_weave.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Running without Rhythm"
msgid "You definitely won't attract the worm.  +5 effective dodge, +1 dodge attempt."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/early_to_rise.json
#. ~ Morale text
msgid "Early Riser"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_zombie"
msgid "Zombie Empathy"
msgstr "Empathie Zombie"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie Empathy"
msgid ""
"You are really feeling for the last zombie you killed.  That must have been "
"really hard for it to die again.  Though you aren't really feeling pain right "
"now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Zombie Empathy"
msgid "You feel a bit hungry for brains."
msgstr "Vous avez une petite faim de cerveaux."

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Zombie Empathy"
msgid "Brains are overrated anyways."
msgstr "Les cerveaux sont tellement surfaits ces jours-ci."

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Zombie Empathy"
msgid "Zombie?"
msgstr "Zombie?"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Animal Empathy"
msgid ""
"You are really feeling for the last animal you killed.  Reminds you of that "
