msgstr[2] "estomacs de sauropodes"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "sauropod stomach"
msgid ""
"The stomach of an enormous sauropod dinosaur.  It is surprisingly durable and "
"very roomy."
