#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
msgid "You dream of a strange jungle with giant ferns."
msgstr "Vous rêvez d'une jungle étrange remplie de fougères géantes."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
msgid "Dreams of being the king are all you can remember."
msgstr ""
"Des rêves où vous êtes au sommet du monde sont les seuls dont vous pouvez "
"vous rappeler."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
msgid ""
"You brush through tree sized ferns as you hunt for your prey.  The rain falls "
"slick upon your skin."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez de naviguer à travers des fougères gigantesques à la recherche de "
"proie, la pluie rebondissant sur vos écailles luisantes."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
msgid "Thunderous footsteps shake the earth, are they yours?"
msgstr "Des pas tonitruant font trembler le sol, est-ce les vôtres?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
msgid "Your teeth, how do you have so many teeth?  Am I growing extra teeth?"
msgstr ""
"Vos dents, pourquoi ai-je autant de dents? Est-ce que je suis en train d'en "
"pousser de nouvelles?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
msgid "The hairless apes around you smell like food.  Are they?"
msgstr "Les singes nus autour de vous dégagent un arome appetiqq "

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
msgid "So close, you can taste the rebirth of a glorious past."
msgstr ""
"Tellement proche, vous êtes presque capable de goûter la renaissance d'un "
"passé glorieux."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
msgid "King, nay not a king.  A god among beasts."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez d'être un(e) souverain(e) de toute les créatures, non, pas un(e) "
"souverain(e). Une déité."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
msgid "The warm sun upon your skin.  A heavier air, golden dreams."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez du soleil torride sur vos écailles et d'une air plus lourd, un "
"temps parfait."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
msgid "You dream of eating the largest fern you've ever seen."
msgstr "Vous rêvez de manger la plus grosse fougère que vous ayez jamais vue."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
msgid ""
"Large, you are becoming larger every day.  Armored skin, to protect you from "
"the world.  These are the gifts you are receiving."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes large, est vous le devenez de plus en plus chaque jour qui passe, "
"votre peau blindée vous protéger du monde. Ceux-ci sont les dons que vous "
"recevez."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
msgid ""
"You dream of before the Cataclysm, but you are different somehow.  The other "
"humans all seem so soft to you."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez du monde avant le Cataclysme, mais vous vous sentez different. Les "
"autres humains semblent fragiles comparés à vous."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
msgid ""
"Slower, trudging through the universe, you cease to notice those that try to "
"stop you as you walk through them."
msgstr ""
"Vous bougez plus lentement, piétinant tout ceux essayant de vous arrêter sans "
"même les remarquer."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
msgid "Why is this world so cold compared to the one in your dreams?"
msgstr "Pourquoi est ce que le monde est aussi froid comparé à celui dans vos rêves?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
msgid ""
"Is this how superman feels?  Bulletproof?  But superman is much faster than "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Est-ce ainsi que Superman se sent? Invulnérable aux balles? Mais Superman est "
"bien plus rapide que vous."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
msgid "Nothing less than an asteroid can kill you."
msgstr "Rien de moins qu'une astéroïde pourrait vous tuer."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
msgid "The warm sun upon your skin after escaping from a hard shell."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez du soleil réchauffant vos écailles après que vous soyez sorti(e) "
"d'une coquille épaisse."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
msgid ""
"Large, you are becoming larger every day.  Majestic horns, to protect you "
"from the world and show your power.  These are the gifts you are receiving."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes large, est vous le devenez de plus en plus chaque jour qui passe, "
"vos cornes majestueuses vous protègent du monde et montre votre puissance. "
"Ceux-ci sont les dons que vous recevez."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
msgid ""
"You dream of before the Cataclysm, but you are different somehow.  The other "
"humans all seem so flat and weak to you."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez d'avant le Cataclysme, mais vous êtes différent(e) d'une manière "
"ou d'une autre. Tout les autres humains semblent tellement plats et faibles "
"comparés à vous."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
msgid ""
"Wandering peacefully through the woods with your family, easily knocking down "
"anything in your path, fearing nothing."
msgstr ""
"Vous rêvez de parcourir les forêts paisiblement avec votre famille, écrasant "
"facilement tout se dressant sur votre chemin, ne craignant rien."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
msgid ""
"Giant teeth come down on you, finding horns.  The screaming and blood is not "
"yours."
msgstr ""
"Des dents gigantesques s'abattent sur vous, ne rencontrant que des cornes "
"acérées.  Les cris et le sang qui ensuivent ne sont pas les vôtres."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
msgid ""
"While you are not the most feared, your majestic horns and powerful herd "
"command respect."
msgstr ""
"Malgré le fait que vous n'êtes pas l'être le plus terrible, vos cornes "
"majestueuses et votre large troupeau imposent le respect."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation class name
msgid "Tyrant"
msgstr "Tyran"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Tyrant"
msgid "You feel additional teeth working their way into your mouth."
msgstr "Vous sentez de nouvelles dents pousser dans votre bouge."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Tyrano Sapien"
msgstr "Tyrano Sapien"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Tyrano Sapien"
msgid "Thunder lizard, dragon, tyrant.  All these names pale before your majesty."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation class name
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stego"
msgstr "Stégosaure"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Stego"
msgid "You feel your skin toughen.  You are the armor."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stego"
msgid "Slow, methodical, heavily armored.  A walking tank."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Horns"
msgid "You feel your face, scalp, and neck stretch and change into something greater."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Horns"
msgid "Big, strong, fierce, brave, and a loyal friend, always leading with horns."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Tough-Skinned"
msgstr "Peau Coriace"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Tough-Skinned"
msgid ""
"Your skin is getting tougher.  Greatly improves protection against all sorts "
"of damage.  Makes you less dextrous though."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Diamond-Skinned"
msgstr "Peau de Diamant"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Diamond-Skinned"
msgid ""
"Your skin is developing Kevlar-like qualities.  Makes you slower though, and "
"is rather cumbersome."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Apatosaurus Back"
msgstr "Dos d'Apatosaure"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Apatosaurus Back"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are capable of carrying inhuman amounts - more than others with similar "
"strength could.  Your maximum weight carried is increased by 70%."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Serrated Teeth"
msgstr "Dents Crénelées"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Serrated Teeth"
msgid ""
"Your mouth has reshaped to accommodate many serrated teeth.  They make it "
"impossible to wear mouthgear and difficult to eat… but tear giant wounds in "
"your prey."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Serrated Teeth" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "You tear into %s with your serrated teeth!"
msgstr "Vous déchiquetez le/la %s avec vos dents dentelées!"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Serrated Teeth" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tears into %2$s with their serrated teeth!"
msgstr "%1$s déchiquète le/la %2$s avec ses dents dentelées!"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Triceratops Horns"
msgstr "Cornes de Tricératops"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Triceratops Horns"
msgid ""
"You have three long, pointed horns, like those of a triceratops.  They allow "
"you to make a strong piercing headbutt attack, but prevent wearing headwear "
"that is not made of fabric."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Triceratops Horns" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "You stab %s with your three pointed horns!"
msgstr "Vous poignardez le/la %s avec vos trois cornes!"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Triceratops Horns" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stabs %2$s with their three pointed horns!"
msgstr "%1$s poignarde le/la %2$s avec ses trois cornes!"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Horned Tail"
msgstr "Queue à Cornes"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Horned Tail"
msgid ""
"You have a long, thick, tail with sharp pointed horns.  It helps you balance "
"a bit but also makes a heavy bludgeon.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Horned Tail" attacks
#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Dragon Tail" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "You smash %s with your tail!"
msgstr "Vous fracassez %s avec votre queue!"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Horned Tail" attacks
#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Dragon Tail" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s smashes %2$s with their tail!"
msgstr "%1$s fracasse le/la %2$s avec sa queue!"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Pack Leader"
msgstr "Chef de Meute"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Pack Leader"
msgid ""
"Puny as they may seem, a leader needs a pack, and some of those hairless "
"bipeds may yet prove some worth.  You gain combat skills at an elevated rate, "
"and maintain a level of critical thinking that supports cooperation."
msgstr ""

