#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<eyes_blind>"
msgid "Something snaps behind your eyes, and the world turns black."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<eyes_blind>"
msgid "A sudden sharp pain in your eyes, then you are lost in the darkness."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<eyes_blind>"
msgid "Your eyes fail you, and everything turns dark."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<eyes_glare>"
msgid "The lights grow uncomfortably bright."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<eyes_stun>"
msgid "The world starts turning wildly, and you stumble."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<arm_itch>"
msgid "Your arms start itching."
msgstr "Vos bras vous démangent."

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<arm_itch>"
msgid "Something is crawling under your skin."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<arm_itch>"
msgid "You pause for a moment.  The movement under your skin doesn't."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<arm_pain>"
msgid "Your arms hurt!"
msgstr "Vos bras vous font mal!"

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<arm_pain>"
msgid "Your arms cramp!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<arm_pain>"
msgid "Something shifts in your arm, painfully."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<arm_drop>"
msgid "Your hands seize up for a moment, and you drop your weapon!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<arm_drop>"
msgid "Your arms fall down paralyzed, and your weapon tumbles to the ground!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bird_dream>"
msgid ""
"You are but a child again, fighting over the dinner's remains with your "
"brothers and sisters.  There were times for mirth and playfulness, but this "
"is not one of those - the time nears when the smallest will be cast aside, "
"and you're all terrified of being chosen."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bird_dream>"
msgid ""
"You soar above the plains, but the pickings are slim today.  The shadows "
"lengthen already, and you turn homewards with a flick of your wings, steeling "
"yourself to the disappointed cries of your chicks and another hungry night.  "
"You must do better tomorrow, lest this year's brood will be lost too."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bird_failure>"
msgid ""
"You long for the skies, to watch the tiny problems of the ground disappear "
"below you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bird_failure>"
msgid "You remember feeling less attached to the ground.  What are you missing?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bird_failure>"
msgid "You need more if you are to fly South before the cold comes.  Much more."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bird_failure>"
msgid "Is your beak strong enough?  Your feathers long?  No, you need more."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bird_failure>"
msgid ""
"You need enough bird primer and catalyst in your system while you are "
"sleeping to complete your change."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bird_failure>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<raptor_failure>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
msgid ""
"You won't be able to change without enough catalyst, the right primer and "
"being asleep."
msgstr ""
"Vous ne serez pas capable de changer sans dormir, avoir assez de catalyseur "
"et la bonne amorce."

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<raptor_dream>"
msgid ""
"You prowl the forest with your nestmates in search of prey - you're a strong "
"brood with bright feathers and sharp talons, but fortune seems to elude you "
"lately.  You take them towards the edge of the forest, where the air always "
"smells of smoke, and sneak up on a pack of monkeys with too-colorful fur "
"sitting on a fallen tree and chattering amongst themselves.  The smallest "
"notices you and waves excitedly, just before you pounce."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<raptor_dream>"
msgid ""
"You dream of blood on your talons, and the air catching your feathers as you "
"try to balance on your struggling prey.  It feels almost like a game, "
"something you'd have played in a previous life.  Lost in thought you almost "
"miss the moment when the threshing grows still, until your brothers' screech "
"brings you back to the present - time to eat."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<raptor_failure>"
msgid "Slow.  Too slow.  Slower than prey."
msgstr "Lent(e).  Trop lent(e).  Plus lent(e) que vos proies."

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<raptor_failure>"
msgid "You'll never wet your talons at this rate.  You need to become better."
msgstr ""
"Vous n'allez jamais être capable de plonger vos serres dans de la chair à ce "
"rythme.  Vous avez besoin de devenir meilleur(e)."

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<raptor_failure>"
msgid ""
"Scenes of a chase, claws, blood on the leaves flash before your eyes.  You "
"need more to truly understand it."
msgstr ""
"Une scène de poursuite, des griffes, du sang éclaboussant les feuilles flashe "
"soudainement devant vos yeux.  Vous avez besoin de plus pour comprendre "
"l'entièreté de cette vision."

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<raptor_failure>"
msgid ""
"Not a care in the world, only the hunt.  How you wish you were that far gone "
"already."
msgstr ""
"Aucun soucis, juste la chasse.  Comme vous aimeriez être déjà à ce niveau de "
"complétion."

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<raptor_failure>"
msgid ""
"You need enough raptor primer and catalyst in your system while you are "
"sleeping to complete your change."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez besoin de suffisamment d'amorce mutagènique et mutagène raptor dans "
"votre système lorsque vous dormez pour compléter votre métamorphose."

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<arm_feathers_dream>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<wings_bird_dream>"
msgid "<bird_dream>"
msgstr "<bird_dream>"

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<arm_feathers_dream>"
msgid "<raptor_dream>"
msgstr "<raptor_dream>"

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<arm_feathers_dream>"
msgid ""
"You are desperate to stop your disgusting ape hands from pulling out handfuls "
"of your beautiful feathers, but they move on their own accord.  You manage to "
"hold one of the useless things between your talons, and bring your beak down "
"on it…Just a dream.  Still, food for thought."
msgstr ""
"Vous essayez désespérément d'empécher vos mains de singe dégoutantes "
"d'arracher par poignées vos plumes magnifiques, mais celles-ci sont dirigées "
"par leur propre volonté.  Vous réussissez enfin à plaquer au sol l'une de ces "
"stupides choses avec vos serres et abattez votre bec dessus…  Juste en rêve.  "
"Mais peut être que vous devriez considérer faire quelque chose de similaire…"

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<arm_feathers_success>"
msgid ""
"You wake to a sudden itch in your arms, and you shake them vigorously.  To "
"your painful surprise a new cover of long, strong feathers broke the surface, "
"bloody dead skin and plumage falling on the ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<wings_bird_dream>"
msgid ""
"Clouds surround you as you soar through the sky.  You look down and see the "
"wilderness stretching out as far as the eye can see, but you can't stay here. "
" You need to go somewhere else, to the land of warmth and plenty.  Your eyes "
"wander over your beautiful wings propelling you along, and you're mesmerized "
"by their rhythmic beating.  Much better than your…hands.  You have hands, not "
"wings.  Not yet."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<wings_bird_success>"
msgid ""
"You dream of jumping from a cliff for your first flight, but the feathers on "
"your clumsy arms can't hold you.  You hit the ground, and your hands are "
"mangled beyond recognition.  After waking, the pain persists, and you're "
"startled to see your useless fingers snap and disappear in your rich plumage. "
" Good riddance, you think, before falling unconscious."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
msgid "You need the right nectar, otherwise you will never be queen."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
msgid "You long for a safe, dark place to complete your change."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
msgid "You could build a hive, if only you were better.  What are you missing?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
msgid "More of the <color_yellow> good nectar</color>.  That's what you need."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
msgid "You can't be expected to metamorphose with so little.  You need more."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
msgid ""
"You need enough insect primer and catalyst in your system while you are "
"sleeping to complete your change."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_dream>"
msgid ""
"You and your sisters have worked diligently, made your home safe and "
"prosperous.  You felt so proud.  But lately Mother has been growing slower, "
"and more cells are empty than with brood.  You see hesitation on your sisters "
"as well…does the hive need you to step up?  Would they follow?  Could you "
"defeat Her?"
msgstr ""
"Vous et vos sœurs avez œuvré avec diligence, rendu votre foyer sûr et "
"prospère. Vous vous sentiez si fière. Mais dernièrement, Mère ralentit et il "
"y a plus de cellules vides que remplies par la nouvelle génération. Vous "
"ressentez de l'hésitation venant aussi de vos sœurs… est-ce que l'essaim a "
"besoin que vous preniez les devants ? Est-ce qu'elles vous suivraient? "
"Pourriez-vous La vaincre?"

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_dream>"
msgid ""
"You dream of a dark, damp place permeated by the smell of sawdust.  You feel "
"like this is all you've ever known, each bend in the walls and scratch on the "
"floor your handiwork.  It feels like home, but deep down you know that you'll "
"have to change and emerge into the dangerous, light-battered outside."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_dream>"
msgid ""
"You have stuffed yourself to bursting for the fourth time today, but your "
"hunger doesn't abate.  You would need to escape your too-small skin to be "
"able to eat enough, you're sure of it.  Take the knife to one of the stretch "
"marks on your back, and part the skin - it springs to the side readily and "
"with no pain.  You work your way down your sides, changing the knife between "
"hands as needed and free your <color_light_green>new skin</color> from its "
"fleshy prison."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_dream>"
msgid ""
"Getting the bodybag was harder than you would have thought, and ordinary "
"garbage bags would just not do.  You eat your fill for the last time with "
"this mouth, undress (you won't need clothes after the change), and climb in "
"the bag.  Closing the zipper from the inside is a challenge, but you need "
"complete darkness for what comes now.  You wait.\n"
"And wait.\n"
"And wait.\n"
"\n"
"Could you have been wrong?  You were so sure the time was right.\n"
"You need to get out of here, but you can't move your…anything.  Do you even "
"have anything to move?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_eye_dream>"
msgid "<insect_dream>"
msgstr "<insect_dream>"

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_eye_dream>"
msgid ""
"Your try going about your day as usual, but your vision seems to dim every "
"few seconds for no reason.  You reach to your eyes in annoyance and feel a "
"disgusting fleshy membrane periodically covering them with a squeaky, wet "
"motion.  You grasp them tightly and pull hard despite the pain until they "
"tear off with a shower of red ichor coating your eyes.  You lick it away, and "
"finally you can see clearly."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_eye_success>"
msgid ""
"After another day of dazed mundanity you make your way back home to your "
"dingy cellar apartment, but miss a step and fall down the stairs, landing on "
"your face with a wet thud.  Consciousness fades, but the pain stays.  The "
"pain, and the feeling of myriad cockroach legs running on your skin, coating "
"your wounds in a skittering, biting cloak.\n"
"\n"
"You wake, shedding the weird apey memories, and you are stunned by a dizzying "
"cavalcade of colors you could never have imagined before.  This is a step in "
"the right direction, you decide, regarding your newly-expanded perspective "
"with appreciation before the vertigo takes you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_eocs/limb_changing_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_eye_2_success>"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PRE_EYES_INSECT"
msgid "<insect_eye_success>"
msgstr "<insect_eye_success>"

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_eye_2_success>"
msgid ""
"You dream of a throbbing headache, and the feeling of an imminent molt.  You "
"find a suitable recess, freeze in place and **push**, trying to rip your old "
"exoskeleton up with you pressure of your new armor but nothing happens.  All "
"the pressure seems to well up into your head, and finally you feel a wet snap "
"and a shower of too-warm mammal ichor on your feelers.\n"
"\n"
"You wake up in a puddle of your own blood under your head, a puddle you can "
"see despite looking straight up.  It will be some time before your eyes' "
"crystals harden properly, but already the colors are even richer than they "
"were before, and the world seems somehow sluggish."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/recipes.json
#. ~ Description of the category "prosthetic arms"
msgid ""
"Recipes related to constructing prosthetic arms of varying materials and "
"designs."
msgstr ""
"Toutes les recettes concernant la fabrication de prothèses de bras de "
"différents types et matériaux."

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/recipes.json
#. ~ name of the nested group
msgid "prosthetic legs"
msgstr "prothèses de jambe"

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/recipes.json
#. ~ Description of the category "prosthetic legs"
msgid ""
"Recipes related to constructing prosthetic legs of varying materials and "
"designs."
msgstr ""
"Toutes les recettes concernant la fabrication de prothèses de jambes de "
"différents types et matériaux."

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/armor/arm_prosthetics.json
#. ~ Description of "prosthetic right arm"
msgid ""
"A prosthetic arm, used as a replacement limb for those missing one.  Its "
"modern design and sleek ergonomics make it very comfortable and highly "
"suitable for use, and advanced designing makes it look exactly like the "
"original.  With grips attached to the hands and inbuilt springs, this "
"prosthetic also allows some use of function.  This one is for the right arm."
msgstr ""
"Un bras prothétique, utilisé comme membre de remplacement pour les personnes "
"qui en sont dépourvues. Son design moderne et son ergonomie élégante la "
"rendent très confortable et très adaptée à l'utilisation, et sa conception "
"avancée lui permet de ressembler exactement à l'original. Grâce aux poignées "
"fixées aux mains et aux ressorts intégrés, cette prothèse permet également "
"une certaine utilisation des fonctions. Cette prothèse est destinée au bras "
"droit."

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/armor/arm_prosthetics.json
#. ~ Description of "prosthetic left arm"
msgid ""
"A prosthetic arm, used as a replacement limb for those missing one.  Its "
"modern design and sleek ergonomics make it very comfortable and highly "
"suitable for use, and advanced designing makes it look exactly like the "
"original.  With grips attached to the hands and inbuilt springs, this "
"prosthetic also allows some use of function.  This one is for the left arm."
msgstr ""
"Un bras artificiel, utilisé comme membre de remplacement pour les personnes "
"qui en sont dépourvues. Son design moderne et son ergonomie élégante la "
"rendent très confortable et très adaptée à l'utilisation, et sa conception "
"avancée lui permet de ressembler exactement à l'original. Grâce aux poignées "
"fixées aux mains et aux ressorts intégrés, cette prothèse permet également "
"une certaine utilisation des fonctions. Cette prothèse est destinée au bras "
"droit."

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/armor/arm_prosthetics.json
#. ~ Description of "neuroprosthetic right arm"
msgid ""
"A neuroprosthetic arm, used as a replacement limb for those missing one.  Its "
"modern design and sleek ergonomics make it very comfortable and highly "
"suitable for use, and advanced designing makes it look exactly like the "
"original.  As a bleeding edge design, this one relies on wires attached to "
"the forehead to provide motor input, allowing the arm to be operated just "
"like the original limb, a precious commodity in these times.  This one is for "
"the right arm."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/armor/arm_prosthetics.json
#. ~ Description of "neuroprosthetic left arm"
msgid ""
"A neuroprosthetic arm, used as a replacement limb for those missing one.  Its "
"modern design and sleek ergonomics make it very comfortable and highly "
"suitable for use, and advanced designing makes it look exactly like the "
"original.  As a bleeding edge design, this one relies on wires attached to "
"the forehead to provide motor input, allowing the arm to be operated just "
"like the original limb, a precious commodity in these times.  This one is for "
"the left arm."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/armor/arm_prosthetics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wooden prosthetic right arm"
msgid_plural "wooden prosthetic right arms"
msgstr[0] "prothèse de bras droit en bois"
msgstr[1] "prothèses de bras droit en bois"
msgstr[2] "prothèses de bras droit en bois"

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/armor/arm_prosthetics.json
#. ~ Description of "wooden prosthetic right arm"
msgid ""
"A prosthetic arm, used as a replacement limb for those missing one.  Dating "
"back to antiquity, this wooden arm was often used by many individuals as a "
"simple way to hide the loss of one of their limbs.  Outside of that, its "
"rigidity and lack of flexibility make it nearly useless for practical "
"purposes, though it can help with very basic tasks, like lifting objects.  "
"This one is for the right arm."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/armor/arm_prosthetics.json
#. ~ Item name
