#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Description of "magus's elastic potential energy contraption (off)"
msgid ""
"This elaborate contraption of wooden sticks under tension and tightly wound "
"strings has a pebble with a magus rune on in its center.  Once activated, "
"this device will transform the stored elastic potential energy into arcane "
"energy, boosting your caster level of magus spells by 1 for as long as the "
"stored energy lasts."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "magus's elastic potential energy
#. contraption (off)"
msgid "You squeeze the machine and its interior starts spinning."
msgstr ""

