#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/recipe_books.json
#. ~ Description of "Black Dragons: Swamp Ruins"
msgid ""
"This book details black dragons: The most evil of dragons, who live in ruins "
"generally in swamps.  Immune to acid and breathe acid.  The book also details "
"how to prepare its hide and craft various armors that make use of some of its "
"acid resistance."
msgstr ""

