"around themselves."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque les choses se compliquent, les durs invoquent des murs de roche "
"gigantesques autour d'eux."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Spear of Brambles"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Spear of Brambles"
msgstr[0] "Parchemin de Lance de Ronces"
msgstr[1] "Parchemins de Lance de Ronces"
msgstr[2] "Parchemins de Lance de Ronces"

