msgstr[2] "sorciers féraux"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral wizard"
msgid ""
"Stumbling about with strange ravings and odd motions, this crazed individual "
"walks among the dead as one of their own.  Occasional flashes and sparks "
"erupt from their twisted and grimy fingers as they perform arcane motions."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral wizard"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s chants and gestures erratically!"
msgstr "%1$s évoque un sort avec des gestures et intonations erratiques!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral thaumaturgical researcher"
msgid_plural "feral thaumaturgical researchers"
msgstr[0] "chercheur thaumaturgique féral"
msgstr[1] "chercheurs thaumaturgiques féraux"
msgstr[2] "chercheurs thaumaturgiques féraux"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral thaumaturgical researcher"
msgid ""
"A researcher with the look of the stereotypical academic mage, their lab coat "
"bearing an arcane sigil on the breast pocket.  The bloodshot eyes and "
"constant muttering, accompanied by the occasional gesture that releases a "
"burst of sparks, tell you that research is currently far from their minds."
msgstr ""
"Un chercheur ayant l'apparence stéréotypée d'un mage académique portant une "
"blouse de laboratoire ornée d'un sceau occulte sur la poche de poitrine. Ses "
"yeux injectés de sang et ses marmonnements constants, accompagnés par ses "
"gestures occasionnelles relâchant une bouffée d'étincelles vous indiquent que "
"leur recherche n'a plus l'air de leur être très importante."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral thaumaturgical
#. researcher"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and light explodes everywhere!"
msgstr "%1$s agite ses mains et de la lumière explose de partout!"

