#. ~ Description of monster "feral animist"
#. ~ Description of monster "feral high animist"
msgid ""
"The feral looks mostly like any other person other than some of the trappings "
"of a wizard, but there is an unaccountable aura around them.  When you look "
"at them, the hair on the back of your neck stands on end, and faint whispers "
"like a scratching at the walls echo just at the edge of your hearing."
msgstr ""

