msgstr[2] "maîtres technomanciens féraux"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral high technomancer"
msgid ""
"This feral human has obvious bionic enhancements in what would have been the "
"sign of a powerful technomancer before the Cataclysm.  They move with much "
"more speed and grace than most feral humans you've seen."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral high technomancer"
#, c-format
