#: data/mods/Magiclysm/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "BOSTON WAND BUST NABS THREE"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"BOSTON WAND BUST NABS THREE\n"
"\n"
"Officers with the Bureau of Alcohol, Thaumaturgy, and Firearms have seized "
"almost 60 wands, including greater combat wands, during the arrest of three "
"Italian nationals in Boston yesterday.  Davide Messina, 34, Michele "
"Pellegrino, 29, and Lokúr Santoro, 128, all of Rome, Italy, are being charged "
"with three counts of wand trafficking as well as two counts of conspiracy.  "
"The charges allege that Messina, Pellegrino, and Santoro met with an unnamed "
"party as part of a smuggling operation to transport combat wands through "
"America to final destinations in Central and South America."
msgstr ""
"SAISIE DE BAGUETTES CAPTURE TROIS\n"
"\n"
"Des agents du Bureau de l'Alcool, de la Thaumaturgie et des Armes à Feu ont "
"saisi presque 60 baguettes, incluant des baguettes offensives supérieures, "
"durant l'interpellation de trois ressortissants italiens hier à Boston.  "
"Davide Messina, 34, Michèle Pellegrino, 29, et Lokúr Santoro, 128, tout trois "
"originaires de Rome, Italie, sont accusés de trois chefs de traffic de "
"baguettes et deux chefs de complicité.  L'accusation allègue que Messina, "
"Pellegrino et Santoro ont rencontré un tiers à l'identité inconnue pour "
"organiser une opération de contrebande de baguettes de combat à travers les "
"États-Unis vers une variété de destinations en Amérique du Sud et Centrale."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/snippets/newspapers.json
