#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Intense Concentration"
msgid "It's taking a lot of concentration to maintain your powers."
msgstr "Maintenir vos pouvoirs vous demande beaucoup de concentration."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_nether_attunement_power_surge"
