msgstr "En Train de se Projeter Astralement"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Astrally Projecting"
#. ~ Description of effect type "Etheric Form"
