#. "G-Tz77 "Tlapetlaniliztli" battle rifle"
msgid ""
"A shipboard battle rifle, whose non-kinetic ammunition was designed to avoid "
"puncturing ship hulls during engagements.  The G-Tz77 has been a mainstay of "
"the Imperial Navy for decades at this point and seen service on the surface "
"of and in orbit around dozens of worlds.  This is just one more in its long "
"history of protecting the Ēxcān Tlahtōlōyān."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "G-Tz77 "Tlapetlaniliztli" battle rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "G-Tz77 "Tlapetlaniliztli" battle rifle"
msgid "odd rifle"
msgid_plural "odd rifles"
msgstr[0] "fusil étrange"
msgstr[1] "fusils étranges"
msgstr[2] "fusils étranges"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Description of variant "G-Tz77 "Tlapetlaniliztli" battle rifle" of gun
#. "odd rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "odd rifle" of item "G-Tz77 "Tlapetlaniliztli"
#. battle rifle"
msgid ""
"This is recognizably a rifle but it's like nothing you've ever seen.  The "
"magazine seems to be inserted into the stock and the barrel is almost as big "
"around as your wrist.  When you hold it, some kind of electronic display "
"above the grip shows a series of odd symbols."
msgstr ""
"Ceci est manifestement une sorte de fusil mais il ne vous est pas possible de "
"dire plus grand chose que ça.  Le chargeur à l'air d'être inséré dans la "
"crosse et le baril à plus ou moins le diamètre de votre poignet.  Un écran "
"électronique au dessus de la poignée s'allume lorsque vous prenez le fusil en "
"main et affiche une série de symboles étranges."

