#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Imperial Navy battle helmet"
msgid ""
"An all-encompassing helmet, standard issue for Imperial warrior orders.  "
"Containing integral hearing protection and air filtration while still leaving "
"your mouth free, highlights distant targets to provide easier targeting in "
"battlefield conditions, has integral nightvision and thermal sensing, "
"provides some protection against telepathic assault, and looks great while "
"doing it.  This one has the eagle and stars of the Itzcuāuhtli Corps on it."
msgstr ""

