msgid "pāncahcallō torso armor"
msgid_plural "sets of pāncahcallō torso armor"
msgstr[0] "ensemble d'armure de torse pāncahcallō"
msgstr[1] "ensembles d'armure de torse pāncahcallō"
msgstr[2] "ensembles d'armure de torse pāncahcallō"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Description of "pāncahcallō torso armor"
msgid ""
"A set of torso and upper-arm armor made with mixed leather overlaid with "
"sheets of ichcayolli, pāncahcallō armor derives its effectiveness from the "
"integral generator capable of projecting an ehēcatepantli barrier that "
"provides most of the armor's protection."
msgstr ""
"Un ensemble d'armure corporelle couvrant le torse et le haut des bras avec du "
"cuir entrepercé de plaques d'ichcayolli, la protection fournie par une armure "
"pāncahcallō dépend principalement du générateur intégré capable de projeter "
"un barrière ehēcatepantli autour de la personne la portant."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
