#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
#. ~ Description of monster "guardian amalgamation"
msgid ""
"A four-legged creature with a crab-like shell, with two eyes on stubby stalks "
"and a small mouth filled with sharp fangs.  Three additional limbs with "
"bulbous growths on their ends wave around, seemingly randomly except when "
"they point briefly at one of the walking dead."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "guardian amalgamation"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves its three appendages in the air."
msgstr "%1$s agite ses trois membres en l'air."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "whispering amalgamation"
msgid_plural "whispering amalgamations"
msgstr[0] "amalgame murmurant"
msgstr[1] "amalgames murmurants"
msgstr[2] "amalgames murmurants"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
#. ~ Description of monster "whispering amalgamation"
msgid ""
"A smooth, round body skittering around on seven jointed legs, this "
"abomination does not seem to have any sensory organs at all.  When you look "
"at it, you hear faint whispers in the back of your mind."
msgstr ""
"Un masse de chair ronde et lisse se déplaçant sur sept jambes articulées, "
"cette abomination n'a l'air de posséder aucun organe sensoriel visible, mais "
"vous entendez des murmures indistincts à l'arrière de votre crâne lorsque "
"votre regard erre dessus."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
