msgid "%1$s waves its fronds and the flames gutter and die."
msgstr "%1$s agite ses frondes et les flammes sont soudainement asphyxiées."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid flamebreaker"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid riftcaller"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves its fronds at %3$s."
msgstr "%1$s agite ses frondes vers %3$s."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "triffid riftcaller"
msgid_plural "triffid riftcallers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
#. ~ Description of monster "triffid riftcaller"
msgid ""
"A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered "
"stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralyzing sting concealed within.  "
"Occasionally it vanishes and reappears elsewhere."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid riftcaller"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves its fronds at %3$s and the air around %3$s solidifies into shapes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie blank"
msgid_plural "zombie blanks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie blank"
msgid ""
"This zombie looks fairly ordinary, other than walking slightly more quickly "
"than the standard shambling.  But there's something subtly wrong about it.  "
"When you look directly at it, gray static flickers on the edge of your vision "
"and you hear a very low droning hum."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie null"
msgid_plural "zombie nulls"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie null"
msgid ""
"This zombie's limbs are elongated and its torso is stretched, causing it to "
"occasionally drop on all fours to skitter faster than a normal walk.  When "
"you look directly at it, gray static flickers on the edge of your vision and "
"you hear a very low droning hum."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie breaker"
msgid_plural "zombie breakers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie breaker"
msgid ""
"An enormous hump takes up most of this zombie's back, fusing its head "
"directly into its torso.  It moves slowly but seems more aware than most of "
"its kind, constantly looking around rather than staring blankly ahead.  When "
"you look directly at it, you feel a cold chill at the base of your skull."
msgstr ""
"Une énorme bosse occupe la majorité du dos de ce zombie, fusionnant sa tête "
"avec son torse.  Celui-ci se déplace lentement mais à l'air plus attentif que "
"ses congénères, scannant constamment les environs au lieu de fixer l'horizon "
"avec un regard vide.  Vous ressentez un frisson le long de votre dos lorsque "
"vous le fixez des yeux trop longtemps."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "nether-void"
msgid_plural "nether-voids"
msgstr[0] "vide de néant"
msgstr[1] "vides de néant"
msgstr[2] "vides de néant"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "nether-void"
msgid ""
"Thoughts of old creepy Internet memes arise unbidden as you see this zombie.  "
"It's almost ten feet tall but incredibly thin, with spindly legs and with "
"arms that hang down almost all the way to the ground.  Occasionally, it drops "
"on all fours to clamber with uncanny speed over some bit of rubble.  When you "
"look directly at it, gray static flickers on the edge of your vision and you "
"hear a very low droning hum."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "nether-void"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s looks at %3$s and the static on the edge of your vision creeps inward "
"for a moment."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/path_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Noetic Flexibility"
msgstr "Souplesse Noétique"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/path_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Noetic Flexibility"
msgid ""
"Your expanded mind is far more capable of understanding Netherum Mathematics "
"than a mere human's.  You have an greater chance of awakening new psionic "
"paths."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Headblind"
msgstr "Non-Éveillé(e)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Headblind"
msgid "You have a normal human (lack of) capacity for psionic powers."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez des pouvoirs psioniques normaux pour un humain (c'est à dire vous "
"n'en avez pas)."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Efficient System"
msgstr "Système Performant"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Efficient System"
msgid ""
"Thanks to your powers, you need less food and drink than the average person "
"and are more efficient at processing it."
msgstr ""
"Grâce à vos pouvoirs, vous avez besoin de moins de nourriture et d'eau que la "
"moyenne et vous êtes plus efficace avec votre utilisation de ce que vous "
"ingérez."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Psionic Senses"
msgstr "Sens Psioniques"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Psionic Senses"
msgid ""
"Your powers protect you from some sensory disruption and allow you to detect "
"creatures from beyond."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Galvanic Armor"
msgstr "Armure Galvanique"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Galvanic Armor"
msgid ""
"Your powers help protect you from electrical damage and slightly reduce the "
"intensity of pain you feel."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Photon Regulation"
msgstr "Régulation Photonique"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Photon Regulation"
msgid "Your powers passively filter the amount of photons your eyes receive."
msgstr ""
"Vos pouvoirs filtrent passivement la quantité de photons que vos yeux "
"reçoivent."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Internal Fire"
msgstr "Fournaise Interne"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Internal Fire"
msgid ""
"You naturally heat the air around you slightly, making it more comfortable in "
"the cold.  It also helps prevent you from getting too wet."
msgstr ""
"Vous chauffez naturellement l'air autour de vous, rendant le froid plus "
"comfortable et vous aidez à lutter contre l'humidité."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Grasping Hand"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Grasping Hand"
msgid ""
"Thanks to a minor application of telekinesis, the items you want to grab are "
"always quick to hand."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Telepathic Suggestion"
msgstr "Suggestion Télépathique"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Telepathic Suggestion"
msgid "You are subtly influencing the minds of the people you speak to."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Spacial Recalibration"
msgstr "Recalibration Spatiale"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Spacial Recalibration"
msgid ""
"You can keep otherworldly eyes off you to some extent, and you will sometimes "
"instinctively teleport to avoid danger."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Bloom of Vitality"
msgstr "Efflorescence de Vitalité"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Bloom of Vitality"
msgid ""
"Your psionic powers speed your healing slightly and increase your overall "
"resilience, and any broken limbs you have mend straight and true."
msgstr ""
"Vos pouvoirs psioniques accélèrent votre guérison légèrement et vous rendent "
"plus coriace ainsi qu'aide vos membres brisés à guérir sans complications."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/scenario.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Heart of Fire"
msgid "The fire in your soul rises and falls, but never truly goes out."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Intuitive Artistry"
msgid "Gazing into the near future lets you know what part goes where."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Lifting Hand"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Lifting Hand"
msgid "With a modicum of concentration you can carry a single item with your powers."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Elixir PK Surge"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Elixir PK Surge"
msgid ""
"Thanks to the crystalline elixir, you can lash out with unfocused surges of "
"telekinetic power."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Elixir PK Surge" to
#. "TELELIXIRDOWN_active"
msgid "You unleash your powers."
msgstr "Vous déchainez vos pouvoirs."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Elixir PK Surge (active)"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Elixir PK Surge (active)"
msgid "You are lashing out with your elixir-forged telekinetic powers."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Elixir PK Surge (active)" to
#. "TELELIXIRDOWN"
msgid "You rein your powers back in for now."
msgstr "Vous réfrénez vos pouvoirs pour l'instant."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Player spell casting message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELELIXIR_CAST"
msgid "Your crystal-fueled powers activate!"
msgstr "Vos pouvoirs cristallins sont activés!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Psionic negation"
msgstr "Négation psionique"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Psionic negation"
msgid "The anchor crown you're wearing is shutting down your psionic powers."
msgstr "La couronne d'ancrage que vous portez annule vos pouvoirs psioniques."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Telepathic Dampening"
msgstr "Étouffage Télépathique"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Telepathic Dampening"
msgid "The telepathic dampener you're wearing is protecting your mind."
msgstr "L'étouffeur télépathique que vous portez protège votre esprit."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Golden Radiance"
msgstr "Radiance Dorée"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Golden Radiance"
msgid "You can make the air around you emit a strong light."
msgstr "Vous êtes capable de faire briller l'air autour de vous intensément."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Golden Radiance" to
#. "PHOTOLIXIR_LIGHT_active"
msgid "The air around you starts glowing brightly."
msgstr "L'air autour de vous commence à émettre une lueur intense."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Golden Radiance (on)"
msgstr "Radiance Dorée (activée)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Golden Radiance (on)"
msgid "The air around you is emitting a bright light."
msgstr "L'air autour de vous émets une lueur intense."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Golden Radiance (on)" to
#. "PHOTOLIXIR_LIGHT"
msgid "The air around you loses its radiance."
msgstr "L'air autour de vous perds son rayonnement."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Awakened Biokinetic"
msgstr "Biokinétique Éveillé(e)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Awakened Biokinetic"
msgid "Mental control over bodily processes."
msgstr "Le contrôle mental des processus corporels."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Awakened Clairsentient"
msgstr "Clairvoyant(e) Éveillé(e)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Awakened Clairsentient"
msgid "The ability to extend the senses beyond the body."
msgstr "La capacité d'étendre les sens au-delà du corps."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Awakened Electrokinetic"
msgstr "Électrokinétique Éveillé(e)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Awakened Electrokinetic"
msgid "Mental control of lightning and electricity."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Awakened Photokinetic"
msgstr "Photokinétique Éveillé(e)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Awakened Photokinetic"
msgid "Mental control of visible light and electromagnetic waves."
msgstr "Le contrôle mental des vagues électromagnétique et de la lumière visible."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Awakened Pyrokinetic"
msgstr "Pyrokinétique Éveillé(e)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Awakened Pyrokinetic"
msgid "Mental control of heat and flame."
msgstr "Le contrôle mental sur la chaleur et les flammes."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Awakened Telepath"
msgstr "Télépathe Éveillé(e)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Awakened Telekinetic"
msgstr "Télékinétique Éveillé(e)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Awakened Telekinetic"
msgid "Mental control over the motion of objects and people at a distance."
msgstr "Le contrôle mental sur le mouvement des objets ou personnes à distance."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Awakened Teleporter"
msgstr "Téléporteur Éveillé"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Awakened Teleporter"
msgid ""
"The ability to move without crossing the intervening space, as well as some "
"control over space itself."
msgstr ""
"La capacité de se mouvoir sans physiquement traverser l'espace entre deux "
"points, ainsi qu'un certain contrôle sur celui-ci."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Awakened Vitakinetic"
msgstr "Vitakinétique Éveillé(e)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Awakened Vitakinetic"
msgid "Mental control over health and vitality."
msgstr "Le contrôle mental sur la santé et vitalité."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Headblind"
msgid ""
"You've seen people do some crazy things after the Cataclysm, but you've never "
"managed to figure out how they do it.  You can never learn psionic powers."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Latent Psion"
msgstr "Psionique Latent·e"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Latent Psion"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, you were lucky in some way.  Maybe you never lost your "
"keys, or maybe you always made that last green light before getting home, or "
"maybe you never had to take a sick day in your life.  Now after the "
"Cataclysm, you have the potential for even more power.  Your first attempt to "
"awaken psionic powers will always be successful."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, vous étiez veinard·e.  Peut être que vous ne perdiez "
"jamais vos clés et le feu tournait rouge ou vert lorsque cela vous était "
"avantageux, ou peut être que vous n'aviez jamais eu la grippe.  Maintenant, "
"après le Cataclysme, vous avait le potentiel d'achever encore plus et votre "
"première tentative d'éveiller des pouvoir psioniques réussira toujours."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Limited Awakening"
msgstr "Éveillement Partiel"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Limited Awakening"
msgid ""
"You managed to awaken psionic powers, but it was a struggle and you're not "
"sure you'll be able to do it again.  You are subject to the random odds of "
"awakening new powers."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes parvenu·e à éveillé des pouvoirs psioniques, mais ceci fût "
"difficile et vous n'êtes pas sûre de pouvoir le faire à nouveau.  Vous avez "
"maintenant des probabilités aléatoires de débloquer de nouveaux pouvoirs."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fifth Sun People"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fifth Sun People"
msgid ""
"You aren't from this universe and hopefully someday you can go home.  This is "
"a hidden trait, used for dialogue."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Psychic Vampire"
msgstr "Vampire Psychique"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Psychic Vampire"
msgid ""
"You can drain a bit of vital energy from victims when attacking their minds "
"with telepathy or their bodies with vitakinesis."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "VERDANT HAND Combat Protocols"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "VERDANT HAND Combat Protocols"
msgid ""
"Who needs weapons?  Thanks to your biokinesis, you deal more melee damage "
"while fighting with your bare hands.  This damage improves as your unarmed "
"skill and biokinetic prowess increase."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Improved Concentration"
msgstr "Concentration Améliorée"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Improved Concentration"
msgid ""
"You can keep your mind on something even if there are plenty of distractions. "
" The number of psionic powers you can maintain at once is increased by 1."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Easily Distracted"
msgstr "Aisément Distrait·e"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Easily Distracted"
msgid ""
"Any day now you're going to buckle down and oh hey is that a butterfly?  The "
"number of psionic powers you can maintain at once is reduced by 1."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Debug Concentration"
msgstr "Concentration de Débugage"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Concentration"
msgid ""
"You could keep every single bug in the game in mind simultaneously with this "
"one."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Extended Channeling"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Extended Channeling"
msgid ""
"You can take more time and care in channeling your powers.  It will take 25x "
"as long to evoke them, but it will be much easier to activate them and you "
"will be less likely to gain Nether Attunement while doing so."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Extended Channeling Active"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Extended Channeling Active"
msgid "The active trait for Extended Channeling.  It's a bug if you can see it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Torrential Channeling"
msgstr "Canalisation Torrentielle"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Torrential Channeling"
msgid ""
"You can draw deeply on the Nether, increasing the strength of your powers but "
"making making them harder to initiate and control."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Torrential Channeling Active"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Torrential Channeling Active"
msgid "The active trait for Torrential Channeling.  It's a bug if you can see it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I am the heart of the storm!"
msgstr "Je suis le cœur de la tempête!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "&They smile as lightning crackles over their skin."
msgstr "Ce dément souri, des étincelles et arcs électriques bondissant sur sa peau."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How are you doing that?"
msgstr "Comment est-ce que vous faites cela?"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "*Back away slowly*"
msgstr "*Reculer lentement*"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I have the power of the storm!  I will save this world!"
msgstr "J'ai le pouvoir de l'orage! Je suis capable de sauver ce monde!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "&They say nothing, merely looking at you with glowing eyes."
msgstr ""
"Cette personne ne vous réponds pas, et ne fait que vous fixer avec ses yeux "
"d'un bleu déroutant ayant l'air de luire et crépiter."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "This isn't real…  It's just tricks right?  Haha.  It's just tricks and lights…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "It's not like any tricks I've ever seen…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Hahaha!!  Burn!  BURN!!"
msgstr "Hahaha!! Brûlez! BRÛLEZ!!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "&They cackle loudly as flames burst from their outstretched hand."
msgstr ""
"&Les flammes se déversant de sa main tendue causent le dément à glousser "
"bruyamment."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "All will burn!"
msgstr "Tout brûlera!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Isn't it beautiful?  BURN THEM ALL!"
msgstr "N'est-ce pas magnifique? ILS DOIVENT TOUS BRÛLER!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "The flames have chosen me!"
msgstr "Les flammes m'ont choisies!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Get out of here!"
msgstr "Sortez d'ici!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "No, no no!  Go away!"
msgstr "Non, non non!  Partez!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "*doesn't look at you at all.  They just keep yelling at the horde."
msgstr "*ne vous regarde pas du tout et continue à crier des invectives aux hordes."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What's with those clusters of weird plants I've seen around?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Oh, right, the alien plants.  The portals bring them.  As far as I've
#. seen in the past, it's just going to keep getting worse.
msgid ""
"Sure, the plants o' otherworlds.  Them as comes from the wibbles.  Like as "
"this'n's seen, 'tis all down 'n down, an I'm ken."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid " 'Down 'n down'?  So it's going to keep happening until…what?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "From the portals…like you, right?  You've seen this before?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I've gotta go.  See you later, Rubik."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Until the normal world is covered in alien biomes and then all falls to
#. dust.  That's just how it goes.
msgid ""
"Til the green and brown be yellowred and blue afore it be to grey and black.  "
"'Tis the course."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Is there any way to stop it?  Can we cut them down or burn them or something?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "The course?  What's going to happen?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You could burn it, but the portals will just bring it back.  No, there's
#. no stopping it at this point.  Even if you burned every single one you
#. found, you're just one person and there's an endless supply of them, so
#. it's futile.  There's only one way this goes.
msgid ""
"Aye, mayhap, but more'll dribble through the wobbles.  You can't athwart all "
"o' the bridges.  If'n you light each and every, you're only one against many. "
" 'Twould be no point.  The road only goes one way."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Well, we'll see about that.  Can we talk about something else?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Many times.  It doesn't always go the same, and sometimes they only show
#. up right before we leave the world, but they always do.
msgid ""
"Time an' time.\"  Rubik pauses for a moment.  \"There be eddies and ripples, "
"aye, an' sometime they come just afore we make to wobble on, but they surely "
"do."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Premonition] *Determine if <npc_name> is a threat*"
msgstr "[Prémonition] *Déterminez si <npc_name> constitue une menace*"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&You extend your senses, alert for danger, and are surprised that at the "
"result.  There is danger here, but it's muted, and certainly Rubik doesn't "
"bear you any malice.  If any place is safe in the hell that the Earth has "
"become, this is it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Telepathy] *Read <npc_name>'s mind*"
msgstr "[Télépathie] *Lire les pensées de <npc_name>*"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&You weren't expecting to be able to understand Rubik's thoughts.  Whatever "
"language it is, this \"Anglic\", the resemblance to English is clearly a "
"fortunate coincidence.  But you are surprised that your telepathic scan "
"doesn't pick up anything at all.  Just a faint static hum, rising and falling "
"in an irregular pattern."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "*Withdraw from <npc_name>'s mind*."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Telepathy] *Go deeper*."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&Your awareness of the outside world fades as you fall into Rubik's mind.\n"
"\n"
"You see a child in a thriving metropolis, doing odd jobs for spare coins, "
"playing in the alleys with friends, coming home at dusk for supper.  You see "
"a young adult running from a group of zombies.  You see this castle, or near "
"enough--some towers are missing, some missing towers are there, but obviously "
"the same--and its denizens fending off an attack from a group of winged "
"things.  You see a conversation in a language you've never heard before among "
"a group of Exodii, before everyone files into rooms, secures themselves with "
"restraints, and there's a brief moment of searing pain and then darkness, "
"filled with static and bursts of light half-glimpsed in your peripheral "
"vision.\n"
"\n"
"You see worlds.  World after world, in a procession over…decades?  Centuries? "
" You can't tell; you have no sense of time during the vision.  Most worlds "
"were less advanced than the Earth, and the few survivors fought the dead with "
"human wave tactics and trench warfare, or lines of musketeers, or archers "
"from behind the trees.  Sometimes, doughty warriors clad in iron or bronze "
"hurled themselves at the enemy with sword and shield in hand, until they fell "
"and their corpses rose again.  In one world, the survivors fought with "
"powered armor and particle-beam weapons.  But on every world, slowly, "
"inexorably, the dead or the fungus or the walking trees or things you have no "
"name for ground down the defenders until humanity was on the brink of "
"extinction and, with a few survivors in tow, the Exodii powered up their jump "
"devices and continued the Long Retreat.\n"
"\n"
"In the end, not once, in a dozen or a hundred or you know not how many "
"worlds, was there anything left to save."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "*Withdraw from Rubik's mind*."
msgstr "*Retirez-vous des pensées de Rubik.*"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "&Rubik is looking at you oddly.  The silence is palpable."
msgstr "&Vous fixe des yeux bizarrement.  Le silence est palpable."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Sorry, I must have zoned out for a moment there.  It's been a long day.  You "
"were saying?"
msgstr ""
"Désolé, je me suis détaché(e) pendant un moment. La journée a été longue. "
"Vous disiez?"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/computer_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Project OBSIDIAN RING.\n"
"\n"
"Project NOBLE HORIZON.\n"
"\n"
"Enter login credentials."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/computer_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Try a random username and password"
msgstr "Essayez un nom d'utilisateur et mot de passe aléatoire"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/computer_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&You input the first combination of username and password that comes to mind, "
"and of course it doesn't work.  Rather than trigger a lockout due to too many "
"attempts, you decide to come back when you have some idea what to do."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/computer_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Project OBSIDIAN RING.\n"
"\n"
"Project GRAY DAWN.\n"
"\n"
"Enter login credentials."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/computer_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Project OBSIDIAN RING.\n"
"\n"
"Project LOST RAIN.\n"
"\n"
"Enter login credentials."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Vitakinesis] I noticed that you're really sick."
msgstr "[Vitakinésie] J'ai remarqué que vous étiez vraiment malade."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Vitakinesis] You don't look so good."
msgstr "[Vitakinésie] Vous n'avez pas l'air en forme."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Vitakinesis] Is there something wrong with your eyes?"
msgstr "[Vitakinésie] Vous avez quelque chose qui ne va pas avec vos yeux?"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "And?"
msgstr "Et?"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Yeah, it is what it is."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Those storms at the end of world…  I was fine before them."
msgstr "Ces tempêtes durant la fin du monde…  J'allais bien avant elles."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "You noticed, did you?"
msgstr "Vous avez remarqué(e)?"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Yeah, I've had it for years at this point.  Not much I can do about it now, "
"though."
msgstr ""
"Oui j'ai souffert de ça depuis des années, mais ce n'est pas comme si je "
"pouvais y faire quoi que soit maintenant."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Really wish I had gotten some more treatment before, you know."
msgstr ""
"J'aimerais vraiment avoir eu l'opportunité de recevoir un traitement pour ça "
"avant tout ce qui c'est passé…"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I can cure your illness for you."
msgstr "Je peux guérir votre maladie."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "We'll talk about that after you're done operating that vehicle."
msgstr "L'on parlera de ça après que vous aurez fini de conduire."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I don't want to talk about that while I'm operating a vehicle!"
msgstr "Je ne veux pas parler de ça lorsque je suis en train de conduire!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm too tired, let me rest first."
msgstr "Je suis trop fatigué, laisse-moi me reposer d'abord."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I already told you no.  Let it go."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I have some reason to refuse healing."
msgstr "J'ai une raison de refuser d'être guéri·e."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "* coughs.  \"Yeah, I'm not feeling so great"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "No.  No I don't."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Yeah, I think I'm coming down with something."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Ugh, yeah.  If only I could call in sick, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I can cure it for you."
msgstr "Je peux les guérir pour vous."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "They just itch like crazy at all time lately."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Yeah, I guess.  Must have got something in them."
msgstr "Oui je suppose que je dois avoir quelque chose dans mes yeux."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "You're going to what?  How are you going to do that?"
msgstr "Vous allez faire quoi? Comment allez-vous faire cela?"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"You've seen what I can do, right?  Let me try.  (Note: By doing this you will "
"absorb <npc_name>'s disease into yourself.)"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Never mind then."
msgstr "Ça ne fait rien."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Forget it, let's get going."
msgstr "Oublie ça, allons-y."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I don't think so.  I know there are zombies out there and the world is all "
"fucked up, but I'd rather keep that fucked-up-ness as far away from me as "
"possible.  No offense."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Alright, if you insist."
msgstr "D'accord, si vous insistez."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Alright, it can't be worse than what I'm already going through."
msgstr "D'accord, ça ne peut pas être beaucoup plus pire que ce que j'ai déjà."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Sure, I'll try anything at this point."
msgstr "D'accord, je suis partant·e pour essayer quoi que ce soit à ce stade."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Okay.  The medicine's going to run out someday and then I'll really be "
"fucked.  If this works…"
msgstr ""
"D'accord.  Les médocs vous être périmés à un de ces jours et là je serais "
"vraiment dans la mouise.  Si cela marche…"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Yeah, I feel awful.  What have I got to lose?"
msgstr "Oui, c'est affreux. Qu'est-ce que j'ai à perdre?"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hold still.  *Remove <npc_name>'s cold*"
msgstr "Restez tranquille. *Guérissez le rhume de <npc_name>*"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"You touch <npc_name> and reach out with your powers, looking for the illness "
"within them.  You soon find it, a shadow over their lungs, and draw it into "
"yourself."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hold still.  *Remove <npc_name>'s flu*"
msgstr "Restez tranquille. *Guérissez la grippe de <npc_name>*"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hold still.  *Remove <npc_name>'s pinkeye*"
msgstr "Restez tranquille. *Guérissez la conjonctivite de <npc_name>*"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"You touch <npc_name> and reach out with your powers, looking for the illness "
"within them.  You soon find it, a shadow over their eyes, and draw it into "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"Vous touchez <npc_name> et étendez vos pouvoirs, cherchant la maladie à "
"l'intérieur. Vous la trouvez en peu de temps, une ombre couvrant ses yeux, et "
"vous vous retirez en la transférant vers vous."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hold still.  *Remove <npc_name>'s asthma*"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"You touch <npc_name> and reach out with your powers, looking for the illness "
"within them.  You soon find it, a shadow over their lungs, and draw it into "
"yourself.  It tries to find purchase in your lungs, but it can't; plastic and "
"steel are immune to the weaknesses of the flesh.  Denied purchase there, it "
"settles into the surrounding tissue."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hold still.  *Remove <npc_name>'s chemical imbalance*"
msgstr "Restez tranquille.  *Traitez le déséquilibre chimique de <npc_name>*"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
