#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Synaptic Overload Check] *Attack <npc_name>'s mind*."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid "<npc_name> repelled your attack on their mind!"
msgstr "<npc_name> repousse votre attaque sur son esprit!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Mood Stablization Check] I'm not going to hurt you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Premonition] *Determine if the voice is a threat*"
msgstr "[Prémonition] *Déterminez si la voix est une menace*"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Premonition 8+] *Determine if the voice is a threat*"
msgstr "[Prémonition +8] *Déterminez si la voix est une menace*"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Telepath] *Read the voice's mind(?)*"
msgstr "[Télépathe] *Lire les pensées de la voix(?)*"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&You reach out to the voice's location(?) and try to touch its thoughts.  In "
"an instant, your mind is filled by a babble of your *own* thoughts, at "
"exactly the moment you think them, which then repeat again as you realize "
"what is happening and your thoughts about the experience are reflected back "
"at you and your brain is filled with an agonizing cacophony until you break "
"the connection."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous rendez à l'endroit où se trouve la voix (?) et essayez de toucher "
"ses pensées. En un instant, votre esprit est rempli d'un babillage de vos "
"*propres* pensées, exactement au moment où vous les pensez, qui se répètent "
"ensuite à mesure que vous réalisez ce qui se passe et que vos pensées sur "
"l'expérience vous sont renvoyées, et votre cerveau est rempli d'une "
"cacophonie angoissante jusqu'à ce que vous rompiez la connexion."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Well, that was a mistake."
msgstr "Eh bien, cela était une erreur."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&You extend your senses, alert for danger, and are immediately almost "
"blinded.  In the heart of the portal storm, there's danger everywhere.  In "
"the air and ground, in the things half-glimpsed that vanish when you look at "
"them, and in yourself, just waiting for the right conditions to be unleashed. "
" If there's anything sinister in the voice's offer, you cannot tell."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "*Close your inner eye*"
msgstr "*Fermez votre œil intérieur*"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&You extend your senses, alert for danger.  Shutting out the ever-present "
"danger of the post-Cataclysmic world and the portal storm, you focus on the "
"voice.  There is danger there, but not directly.  Whatever the outcome of its "
"offer, it is not meant as a trap."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Clarity 3+] *Is the voice lying?*"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&You open your inner eye and in its light you see the truth.  This *is* you.  "
"Was you.  Might be you.  You know it like you know yourself.  Whatever game "
"it's playing, its intentions are not malicious.  They are your own."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"[Gateway 8+] Thanks, but here I can leave without your help.  Be seeing you.  "
"(End your story)"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&Normally you need to have been to your destination to teleport to it, but "
"here in the heart of the chaos you can sense other worlds.  Other times.  An "
"endless torrent of possibility, flowing continuously around and over and "
"through you.  None of it lasts long enough for you to get a good glimpse, but "
"almost anywhere has to be better than here.  With a simple act of will, you "
"reach out and grasp one chance as it floats by, open a doorway, and leave "
"your dying world behind.\n"
"\n"
"And what happens to you afterwards, well, that's another story."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "That's what life's about: making the right choice at the right time."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_interdimensional_traveler.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Telepath] *Read the strange person's mind*"
msgstr "[Télépathe] *Lisez les pensées de cette personne étrange*"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_interdimensional_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "«Jasz vata aralas mat!  On de farah shatan!  Mazeh jast ond!»"
msgstr "«Jasz vata aralas mat!  On de farah shatan!  Mazeh jast ond!»"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_interdimensional_traveler.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Well, that didn't help either."
msgstr "Bon, cela n'a pas vraiment aidé non plus."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&A quick check reveals nothing out of the ordinary.  To <npc_name>, you're "
"just another face in the crowd."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&You open your senses, alert for danger, but don't sense anything.  "
"<npc_name> bears you no ill will at all."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "«Oh great.  Another one.»"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "«Idle hands make a waste of time.»"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "«We need to post sentries outside that'll turn some of these people away.»"
msgstr ""
"\"Nous devons poster des sentinelles à l'extérieur qui repousseront certains "
"de ces gens.\""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"«We really should start locking the doors at night so these people can't get "
"in.»"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "«Wow, I'm amazed he's lived this long.»"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "«Wow, I'm amazed she's lived this long.»"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "«No point in learning his name.  He'll probably be dead soon anyway.»"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "«No point in learning her name.  She'll probably be dead soon anyway.»"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&You open your senses, alert for danger, but don't sense anything.  "
"<npc_name> is sincere in their friendliness, or least isn't hiding a dagger "
"behind their back."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "«Not bad playing tour guide.  Better than having to fight.»"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "«Another day after <the_cataclysm>.  One foot in front of the other.»"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "«So tired.  That's what I get for drawing the night shift.»"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "«At least in here I can see them coming.  If I were out there…»"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "«How much did it take to get here?  What has he lost?»"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "«How much did it take to get here?  What has she lost?»"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "It's you."
msgstr "C'est vous."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&You barely open up your senses before you're met with an overpowering sense "
"of menace.  <npc_name> isn't planning to kill you at this exact second but "
"that could change at any moment."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "«Just what I need.  Come on, leave me alone.»"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "«How am I supposed to…ugh, just go away.»"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "«Who does this asshole think he is?»"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Telepathy 8+] *Go deeper*."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&It's only a moment, but that's enough.  You are looking from behind a tree "
"onto a road where a crude roadblock has been set up.  There's a refugee bus, "
"one of the same ones parked outside the refugee center, stopped at the "
"roadblock, and as the driver gets out to look at the roadblock, there's a "
"loud crack and two spots of red appear on his chest and leg.  As he begins to "
"fall and the people in the bus start screaming, the raiders emerge from the "
"trees, already running with guns raised."
msgstr ""
"&Ce n'est qu'un instant, mais c'est suffisant.  De derrière un arbre, vous "
"jetez un regard sur une route où un barrage grossier a été mis en place.  Un "
"bus de réfugiés, du même type que ceux qui sont garés à l'extérieur du centre "
"de réfugiés, est arrêté au barrage, et alors que le chauffeur sort pour "
"essayer d'ouvrir la voie, un grand crac résonne et deux taches rouges "
"apparaissent sur son torse et sa jambe.  Alors qu'il chute et les gens dans "
"le bus commencent à crier, les pillards émergent des arbres, courant à pleine "
"vitesse leurs armes en main."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "&Only a few moments have passed.  <npc_name> hasn't noticed anything amiss."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"He was only a child, <npc_name>, and you killed him.  Do you remember the "
"blood on his Superman shirt?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I didn't tell you my na-\"  <npc_name>'s face goes white.  \"What the fuck!  "
"You some kind of freak?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "It's over.  Give up."
msgstr "C'est fini, rendez-vous."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Telekinesis Check] *Try to rip <npc_name>'s weapon away*"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Transposition Check] *Teleport away <npc_name>'s weapon*."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid "You failed to teleport <npc_name>'s weapon!"
msgstr "Votre téléportation de l'arme de <npc_name> échoue!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Oubliette Check] *Banish <npc_name> to another dimension*."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"<npc_name> seems ready to attack you but suddenly freezes in place.  For a "
"moment, caught between worlds, they stare straight ahead.  As the cold and "
"the darkness of a teleport begin to overtake them and the air around them "
"wavers like summer heat, they open their mouth to scream.\n"
"\n"
"And then, they are gone."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid "You failed to teleport <npc_name>!"
msgstr "Votre téléportation de <npc_name> échoue!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*stares at you with eyes wide as their weapon vanishes into thin air.  Their "
"mouth works silently but no sounds come out."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Get out of here or you'll be next."
msgstr "Dégage de là ou tu sera le/la prochain/e."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*starts as the weapon is ripped out of their hands and falls to the floor.  "
"\"Holy shit!  What the fuck?!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Leave or I'll do the same to you."
msgstr "Pars ou je vous ferais la même chose."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Alright, alright, I'm leaving.  Holy shit."
msgstr "Bien, bien, je pars. Merde."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I changed my mind.  You're better off in the ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*immediately backs away.  They never turn their back on you, but in a few "
"moments they go out the door and are gone."
msgstr ""

