#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/nether_attunement.json
#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_CENTERING_MEDITATION"
msgid ""
"Through practice, you've learned how to calm and focus yourself during "
"meditation.  If you meditated properly, you could channel the additional "
"nether energy you have accumulated out into your surroundings, though doing "
"so will be extremely tiring.  It will also help shield you from nether "
"energies for a short time afterwards."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/nether_attunement.json
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_CENTERING_MEDITATION"
msgid "grounding meditation"
msgstr "méditation d'ancrage"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/nether_attunement.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_CENTERING_MEDITATION" in
#. result of recipe crafting "EOC_CENTERING_MEDITATION"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_INCANDESCENT_MEDITATION" in
#. result of recipe crafting "EOC_INCANDESCENT_MEDITATION"
msgid ""
"After your meditations, your mind is free and clear.  The odd feelings caused "
"by excessive psionic channeling have entirely left you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/nether_attunement.json
#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_INCANDESCENT_MEDITATION"
msgid ""
"By gazing into the flames, you can reduce your exposure to the energies of "
"the Nether."
msgstr ""
"En fixant les flammes, vous êtes capable de réduire votre vulnérabilité aux "
"énergies du Néant."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/nether_attunement.json
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_INCANDESCENT_MEDITATION"
msgid "incandescent meditation"
msgstr "méditation incandescente"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/nether_attunement.json
#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_MATRIX_DRAIN_MEDITATION"
msgid ""
"That report indicated there was a way to channel the additional nether energy "
"from long-term psionic use into a focusing object.  All you need is a drained "
"matrix crystal and time."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/nether_attunement.json
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_MATRIX_DRAIN_MEDITATION"
msgid "channeling protocol PGS38"
msgstr "protocole de canalisation PGS38"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/nether_attunement.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MATRIX_DRAIN_MEDITATION" in result
#. of recipe crafting "EOC_MATRIX_DRAIN_MEDITATION"
msgid ""
"You channel all of your powers into the drained matrix crystal in your hands. "
" As you do, the faint light in its depths grows steadily brighter and the "
"crystal begins to feel warm in your hands.  Suddenly, the crystal "
"shatters…and with it, the strange feelings caused by using your powers vanish."
msgstr ""

