#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
msgid ""
"BURNING MAN!  Eyewitnesses at the recent Bank Rhode Island fire in Cranston "
"stated that they saw a man standing in the burning building, waving his arms "
"as though directing the flames.  The fire raged out of control for nearly "
"four hours before local firefighters were able to extinguish it, but never "
"spread beyond the bank building.  No human remains were found in the debris; "
"investigation is ongoing."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
msgid ""
"THE END.  I have written the horoscopes column for almost a decade now but "
"this is the first true prediction of the future I have written.  The end of "
"the world is at hand, in weeks if not in days.  Take your loved ones, leave "
"the cities, head for the hills.  The government will not save you.  This will "
"be my last column."
msgstr ""
"LA FIN DES TEMPS.  J'ai écrit la colonne des horoscopes pour presque une "
"dizaine d'années maintenant mais ceci est la première vraie prédiction du "
"futur que je vais faire imprimer.  La fin du monde est proche, dans les "
"prochaines semaines ou même jours.  Rassemblez vos proches, quittez les "
"villes, cachez-vous dans les forêts.  Le gouvernement ne vous sauvera pas.  "
"Ceci est ma dernière colonne."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
msgid ""
"LOCAL MAN DISAPPEARS.  Jackson Townsend of Bangor was reported missing this "
"morning.  According to his wife Julie, he was eating breakfast with his "
"family before work when he suddenly looked up and then disappeared.  No foul "
"play is suspected at this time."
msgstr ""
"HOMME LOCAL DISPARAÎT.  Jackson Townsend de Bangor a été rapporté disparu ce "
"matin.  Selon sa femme Julie, il mangeait son petit dejeuner avec sa famille "
"lorsqu'il regarda vers le haut avant de soudainement disparaître.  Aucun acte "
"de malfaisance est soupçonné pour le moment."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Amazing I lived through whatever the fuck happened to the sky but I should "
"be glad.  Ever since then I've been in the best health of my life.  I got "
"caught by a Z while foraging--fucking stupid of me I know--and it bit me.  I "
"put it down and by the time I was done beating it to hell the wound had "
"already stopped bleeding.  It's almost gone now and I won't even have a scar. "
" No infection, no fever, nothing.  Not sure what's going on but maybe I "
"should go outside again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"C'est incroyable que j'aie survécu à ce qui est arrivé au ciel, mais je "
"devrais m'en réjouir. Depuis, je n'ai jamais été en aussi bonne santé. Je me "
"suis faite attraper par un Z alors que je cherchais de la nourriture - je "
"sais que je suis stupide - et il m'a mordu. Je l'ai mis à terre et quand j'ai "
"eu fini de le battre, la blessure avait déjà cessé de saigner. Elle a presque "
"disparu maintenant et je n'aurai même pas de cicatrice. Pas d'infection, pas "
"de fièvre, rien. Je ne sais pas trop ce qui se passe, mais je devrais "
"peut-être sortir à nouveau.\""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"I call the fire and it comes.  I send the fire and they burn.  Glorious.\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai appelé le feu et il est venu. J'ai envoyé le feu et ils ont brûlé. "
"C'était glorieux\""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I put that crystal I found under my pillow and all I got was nightmares.  "
"Burning cities, the dead walking, horrible monsters, things kidnapping "
"people.  I threw it away but it didn't help.  Now I have nightmares when I'm "
"awake too.\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai mis ce cristal que j'ai trouvé sous mon oreiller et la seule chose que "
"cela m'a causé a été des cauchemars. Des cités en flammes, les morts "
"titubants à travers les rues, des monstres horribles et des créatures "
"étranges kidnappant ceux survivant toujours. Je l'ai jeté mais cela n'a eu "
"aucun effet. Les cauchemars continuent même lorsque que je suis éveillée "
"maintenant.\""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Jumping is definitely the reason I'm still alive.  Feels awful but only for "
"a moment.  When that thing grabbed me I bet it thought its dinner was made.  "
"I kind of wish I could have seen the look on its face when I just "
"disappeared.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Pouvoir sauter d'un endroit à un autre est définitivement pourquoi je suis "
"toujours en vie. La sensation est horrible mais ne dire qu'un moment. Lorsque "
"cette chose m'a attrapé je pensais que tout était foutu. J'aurais comme même "
"bien aimé voir sa tête lorsque j'ai juste disparu.\" "

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Using the Force is way easier than going into the houses.  Stand out in a "
"storm.  You'll thank me later, if you survive.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"This is it, the next stage in human evolution.  The sheep weren't worthy "
"and will fall before the ascension of Homo Superior.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"All this meditating has finally paid off.  You need me to get you "
"something, leave me a note at the old gas station south of Ashland on 93.  "
"You'll have what you need in a couple days.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Those things, the ones that sound like people, it's not just their claws.  "
"I saw them lift another guy clear off his feet from thirty feet away and take "
"him apart while he screamed and screamed.  All the while saying shit like "
"\"The store is closing in fifteen minutes.\"  I don't care what they have in "
"those towers, I'm never going anywhere near them again.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I always knew there was something off about that office building on main.  "
"I'm not going to check it out because downtown is overrun but I saw weird "
"lights from the top floor two lights running.  Something's still happening up "
"there.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"Met some girl living out in the wilds west of town.  She snuck up perfectly "
"behind me and held me at gunpoint until she was sure I wouldn't try to steal "
"from her.  Once we had that cleared up, told me to skip north and avoid 90 "
"because some assholes had set up a roadblock.  I asked her how she knew where "
"I was going and she said, \"It was revealed to me in a dream.\"  I should "
"have listened to her.\""
msgstr ""

