#: data/mods/No_Hope/modinfo.json
#. ~ MOD name
msgid "No Hope"
msgstr "Sans Espoir  "

#: data/mods/No_Hope/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of MOD "No Hope"
msgid ""
"Aims to make the world more inhospitable and challenging in as many ways as "
"possible, items needed for survival and vehicles are much harder to obtain, "
"destruction and banditry is prevelent, even the weather has taken a turn for "
"the worse, see in game help menu by pressing 0 once in-game for full feature "
"list and option explanations."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "laser turret"
msgid_plural "laser turrets"
msgstr[0] "tourelle laser"
msgstr[1] "tourelles laser"
msgstr[2] "tourelles laser"

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "laser turret"
msgid ""
"The TX-5LR Cerberus is an upgrade to its predecessors.  It features a state "
"of the art revolving laser cannon system with three barrels that charge from "
"high-capacity batteries embedded in its hull."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "turret"
msgid_plural "turrets"
msgstr[0] "tourelle"
msgstr[1] "tourelles"
msgstr[2] "tourelles"

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "turret"
msgid ""
"The General Atomics TX-1 Guardian, a small, pill-shaped automated gun turret "
"using state of the art ATR systems to dynamically reorient itself to new "
"friends and enemies alike.  There is no mechanism to reload the weapon when "
"its magazine is empty and the fire control system is only designed for semi "
"automatic fire."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "antimateriel turret"
msgid_plural "antimateriel turrets"
msgstr[0] "tourelle anti-matérielle"
msgstr[1] "tourelles anti-matérielles"
msgstr[2] "tourelles anti-matérielles"

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "antimateriel turret"
msgid ""
"Leadworks LLC's T-107A1 Interdictor, an automated .50BMG antimateriel rifle.  "
"Credited with forestalling countless car-bombing attempts, it has always been "
"kept under extremely tight control, so as to itself maintain extremely tight "
"control of its area.  And then the Cataclysm struck."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "milspec turret"
msgid_plural "milspec turrets"
msgstr[0] "tourelle militaire"
msgstr[1] "tourelles militaires"
msgstr[2] "tourelles militaires"

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "milspec turret"
msgid ""
"Leadworks LLC's T-4A1 Sentry.  It features improved firmware over General "
"Atomics' TX-1 9x19mm model and an automated 5.56mm carbine."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "M240 autonomous CROWS II"
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  Thousands of these were deployed by the US "
"military before the Cataclysm and they were valued for their use in engaging "
"infantry without exposing the operator.  This one is fitted with a M240."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tripod"
msgid ""
"The Honda Regnal, a tall robot walking on three spidery legs.  For weapons, "
"it has a trio of spiked retractable cables and a flamethrower mounted on its "
"head."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "tripod"
msgid "Giant flames erupt from the heat of a tripod!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Beagle Mini-Tank UGV"
msgid_plural "Beagle Mini-Tank UGVs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Beagle Mini-Tank UGV"
msgid ""
"The Northrop Beagle is a refrigerator-sized urban warfare UGV.  Sporting an "
"anti-tank missile launcher, 40mm grenade launcher, and numerous anti-infantry "
"weapons, it's designed for high-risk urban fighting."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "chicken walker"
msgid_plural "chicken walkers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "chicken walker"
msgid ""
"The Northrop ATSV, a massive, heavily-armed and armored robot walking on a "
"pair of reverse-jointed legs.  Armed with a 40mm anti-vehicle grenade "
"launcher, 5.56 anti-personnel gun, and the ability to electrify itself "
"against attackers, it is an effective automated sentry, though production was "
"limited due to a legal dispute."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "security bot"
msgid_plural "security bots"
msgstr[0] "robot de sécurité"
msgstr[1] "robots de sécurité"
msgstr[2] "robots de sécurité"

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "security bot"
msgid ""
"The Northrop Watchman X-1 is a production series of heavily armored combat "
"robots.  Initially designed for military patrol and escort service, it rolls "
"on a set of hydraulic treads and is armed with a M16A4."
msgstr ""
"Le Northrop Watchman X-1 est une série de robots de combat lourdement "
"blindés. Initialement conçu pour les patrouilles militaires et les services "
"d'escorte, il roule sur un ensemble de bandes de roulement hydrauliques et "
"est armé avec une M16A4."

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "moose"
msgid ""
"The Eastern moose, the largest living species of deer.  The bulls are quite "
"ill-tempered, especially in the rutting season."
msgstr ""
"L'orignal de l'est, la plus grande espèce vivante de cerfs. Les mâles ont "
"assez mauvais caractère, en particulier en période de rut."

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "flaming eye"
msgid ""
"An enormous disembodied eyeball the size of a person, flying through the air "
"through some unknown agency.  Wreathed in unnatural flickering blue flame, it "
"possesses a blazing yellow iris with a slitted pupil like that of a cat and "
"trails a set of flailing black tendrils as it slowly drifts about; its "
"unearthly presence filling you with dread at the prospect of falling under "
"its baleful gaze."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "flaming eye"
msgid "A piercing beam of light bursts forth!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "staring eye"
msgid_plural "staring eyes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "staring eye"
msgid ""
"An enormous disembodied eyeball the size of a person, flying through the air "
"through some unknown agency.  Its unearthly presence filling you with dread "
"at the prospect of falling under its baleful gaze."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie burner"
msgid_plural "zombie burners"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie burner"
msgid ""
"When bullets weren't enough to stop the end of the world, the military tried "
"fire instead.  Their failure is made manifest in this gas-masked husk, its "
"black suit torn and ripped.  Its flamethrower, dangling limply at its side, "
"is attached to a tank of napalm strapped onto its back, which trickles its "
"contents onto the ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie technician"
msgid ""
"Still wearing its work clothes and hardhat, this zombie likely used to work "
"on power lines or other electrical equipment.  As it approaches, everything "
"metal you're carrying shifts very slightly in the zombie's direction, as if "
"attracted by a strong magnetic force."
msgstr ""
"Un cadavre ambulant portant toujours sa tenue de travail et son casque de "
"sécurité. De son vivant, ce zombie travaillait probablement comme électricien "
"ou un emploi similaire. Vous ressentez tout ce que vous portez de métallique "
"être tiré un peux vers lui, suggérant que ce mort-vivant produit un champ "
"magnétique puissant."

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json data/mods/Sky_Island/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie bio-operator"
msgid_plural "zombie bio-operators"
msgstr[0] "soldat bionique zombifié"
msgstr[1] "soldats bioniques zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "soldats bioniques zombifiés"

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json data/mods/Sky_Island/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie bio-operator"
msgid ""
"This armored soldier zombie appears to have been some sort of special forces "
"agent.  Its malfunctioning equipment sends out occasional showers of sparks."
msgstr ""
"Ce soldat zombie blindé semble avoir été une sorte d'agent des forces "
"spéciales. Son équipement défectueux projette de temps à autre des gerbes "
"d'étincelles."

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mass of zombie spiders"
msgid_plural "masses of zombie spiders"
msgstr[0] "essaim d'araignées zombifiées"
msgstr[1] "essaims d'araignées zombifiées"
msgstr[2] "essaims d'araignées zombifiées"

#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mass of zombie spiders"
msgid ""
"Thousands, maybe millions of spiders piled up high, each slowly oozing sticky "
"green pus, struggling to keep the fetid mass together and moving."
msgstr ""
"Des milliers, peut être même des millions d'araignées minuscules empilées, "
"chacune émettant du pus verdâtre de leurs articulations, et faisant de son "
"mieux pour garder l'amas cohérent et capable de se déplacer."

#: data/mods/No_Hope/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "necropolis_intro"
msgid ""
"WELCOME HOME!  Your decision to join our family will lead you to become part "
"of the next generation of job creators.  With us you will already have a foot "
"in the door when it is time to rebuild the nation!"
msgstr ""
"BIENVENUE À LA MAISON! Votre décision de nous rejoindre vous permet de faire "
"partie de la nouvelle génération de créateurs d'emploi. Avec nous vous avez "
"déjà un pied dans la place quand il sera temps de reconstruire la nation!"

#: data/mods/No_Hope/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "necropolis_intro"
msgid ""
"NEED A NEW JOB?  Now that you have secured a comfortable home, try looking "
"into one of the many promising career opportunities that have positions open. "
" Openings such as GEOLOGICAL ENGINEERING ASSISTANT or FACILITY TECHNICIAN "
"offer limitless growth potential!  Please contact your employment adviser if "
"you have any questions."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "necropolis_intro"
msgid ""
"GOOD WITH YOUR HANDS?  Engineering always needs another hand keeping our home "
"in good working order!  As an incentive, everyone working on level 3 will "
"receive additional hazardous pay and time off.  Please go to the engineering "
"office on level 3 if you are interested."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "necropolis_intro"
msgid ""
"WANT TO CONTINUE YOUR EDUCATION?  Our educational facilities are top notch "
"and offer courses for individuals at all age groups.  Many new careers are "
"opening up to those who are willing to learn a new craft.  Our library and "
"research labs will keep even the hungriest minds fed!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "red carpet, overhead light"
msgstr "moquette rouge, plafonnier"

#: data/mods/No_Hope/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "red carpet, overhead light"
msgid ""
"A soft red carpet with a still-functioning light attached to the ceiling "
"above."
msgstr ""
"De la moquette douce rouge avec un plafonnier au-dessus encore en assez bon "
"état pour éclairer les alentours."

#: data/mods/No_Hope/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "rock floor, overhead light"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "rock floor, overhead light"
msgid ""
"A relatively flat area of rock and stone with a still-functioning light "
"attached to the ceiling above."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/No_Hope/zed_radiation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "charred nightmare"
msgid_plural "charred nightmares"
msgstr[0] "cauchemar carbonisé"
msgstr[1] "cauchemars carbonisés"
msgstr[2] "cauchemars carbonisés"

#: data/mods/No_Hope/zed_radiation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "charred nightmare"
msgid ""
"Intense radiation has spurred a unique form of necrosis and regeneration, it "
"is impossible to tell if this creature was ever human."
msgstr ""
"Des rayonnements intenses ont provoqué une forme unique de nécrose et de "
"régénération; il est impossible de dire si cette créature a jamais été "
"humaine."

#: data/mods/No_Hope/zed_radiation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "irradiated wanderer"
msgid_plural "irradiated wanderers"
msgstr[0] "vagabond irradié"
msgstr[1] "vagabonds irradiés"
msgstr[2] "vagabonds irradiés"

#: data/mods/No_Hope/zed_radiation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "irradiated wanderer"
msgid ""
"This rotting corpse seeps a glowing ooze from its lesions.  A strange "
"tattered jumpsuit marks it as an oddity across the wasteland."
msgstr ""
"Ce cadavre en décomposition laisse échapper un suintement rougeoyant de ses "
"lésions.  Une étrange combinaison en lambeaux le marque comme une vision "
"insolite au milieu de l'apocalypse."

#: data/mods/No_Hope/Mapgen/missile_silo.json
#. ~ Computer name placed on map silo_finale
msgid "Missile Controls"
msgstr "Contrôles du Missile"

#: data/mods/No_Hope/Mapgen/missile_silo.json
