#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"It's done.  They're all dead.  Warp shards filter in from seams in reality.  "
"Your reward rains down on you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill the warp-draining horde!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining horde!"
msgid ""
"A horde of low level zombies are congregating at a location where warp "
"resonance is high.  Clear them out for a small reward of warp shards."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill the warp-draining evolved zombies!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining evolved zombies!"
msgid ""
"A swarm of evolved zombies are congregating at a location where warp "
"resonance is high.  Clear them out for a medium reward of warp shards."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill the warp-draining evolved horde!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining evolved horde!"
msgid ""
"A huge horde of evolved zombies are congregating at a location where warp "
"resonance is high.  Clear them out for a large reward of warp shards."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill the warp-draining fearsome zombies!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining fearsome zombies!"
msgid ""
"A swarm of rather powerful zombies are congregating at a location where warp "
"resonance is high.  Clear them out for a large reward of warp shards."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill the warp-draining elite zombies!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining elite zombies!"
msgid ""
"A swarm of extremely dangerous zombies are congregating at a location where "
"warp resonance is high.  Clear them out for a very large reward of warp "
"shards."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill the warp-draining zombie lord!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining zombie lord!"
msgid ""
"A single supremely powerful zombie has been found at a location where warp "
"resonance is high.  Destroy it for a very large reward of warp shards."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill the warp-draining zombie superteam!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining zombie superteam!"
msgid ""
"A team of supremely powerful zombies has been found at a location where warp "
"resonance is high.  Destroy it for a very large reward of warp shards."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill the warp-draining zombie leader!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining zombie leader!"
msgid ""
"A supremely powerful zombie has been found at a location where warp resonance "
"is high.  Be warned that it will be accompanied by an elite swarm!  Destroy "
"them all for a huge reward of warp shards."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill the warp-draining zombie horde lord!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining zombie horde lord!"
msgid ""
"A supremely powerful zombie has been found at a location where warp resonance "
"is high.  Be warned that it will be accompanied by an massive horde of weaker "
"zombies!  Destroy them all for a huge reward of warp shards."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill the warp-draining mi-go threat!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining mi-go threat!"
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining mi-go overlord!"
msgid ""
"A group of lethal mi-gos are draining a location where warp resonance is "
"high.  Destroy them all for a very large reward of warp shards."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill the warp-draining mi-go overlord!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill the armed interloper!"
msgstr "Tuez l'intru armé!"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the armed interloper!"
msgid ""
"The warp has marked a single human being for death.  They will likely carry a "
"ranged weapon.  They will be alone.  Their sins are not your concern.  All "
"you need to know is that it must be done."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill the interloper!"
msgstr "Tuez l'intru!"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the interloper!"
msgid ""
"The warp has marked a single human being for death.  They will likely carry a "
"melee weapon.  They will be alone.  Their sins are not your concern.  All you "
"need to know is that it must be done."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill the guarded interlopers!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the guarded interlopers!"
msgid ""
"The warp has marked human beings for death.  They may be accompanied.  Their "
"sins are not your concern.  All you need to know is that it must be done."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill 10 Zombies this expedition"
msgstr "Tuez 10 zombies durant cette expédition"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill 10 Zombies this expedition"
msgid ""
"Zombies have absorbed latent energies which must be released into the stream "
"of warp once more.  Kill at least 10 zombified humans or creatures before "
"returning to your sanctuary for bonus warp shards."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill 50 Zombies this expedition"
msgstr "Tuez 50 zombies durant cette expédition"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill 50 Zombies this expedition"
msgid ""
"Zombies have absorbed latent energies which must be released into the stream "
"of warp once more.  Kill at least 50 zombified humans or creatures before "
"returning to your sanctuary for bonus warp shards."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill 100 Zombies this expedition"
msgstr "Tuez 100 zombies durant cette expédition"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill 100 Zombies this expedition"
msgid ""
"Zombies have absorbed latent energies which must be released into the stream "
"of warp once more.  Kill at least 100 zombified humans or creatures before "
"returning to your sanctuary for bonus warp shards."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill a Mi-Go this expedition"
msgstr "Tuez un Mi-Go durant cette expédition"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill a Mi-Go this expedition"
msgid ""
"The mi-go have sucked up latent energies which must be released into the "
"stream of warp once more.  Kill at least one mi-go creature before returning "
"to your sanctuary for bonus warp shards."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill 3 nether creatures this expedition"
