#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "fungal mat"
msgstr "tapis mycellaire"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal mat"
msgid ""
"A dense layer of mutated underground fungus grown by the termites.  "
"Completely unrelated to the alien fungus found in the surface."
msgstr ""
"Un tapis épais de mycélium mutant entretenu par les termites dans leurs "
"colonies. Complétement étranger aux champignons extraterrestres présents à la "
"surface."

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "underground fungus"
msgstr "champignons souterrains"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "underground fungus"
msgid ""
"This is a large clump of mutated fungi grown by the termites deep "
"underground.  It looks slightly toxic but edible and it should be ripe for "
"harvest on winter."
msgstr ""
"Un tapis de mycélium mutant cultivé par les termites dans leurs colonies, "
"cette section à l'air un peu toxique mais probablement comestible et devrait "
"être mûre en hiver. "

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "underground fungus"
msgid ""
"This is a large clump of mutated fungi grown by the termites deep "
"underground.  It doesn't seem to be ready for harvest yet."
msgstr ""
"Un tapis de mycélium mutant cultivé par les termites dans leurs colonies, "
"cette section n'a pas l'air encore prête à être récoltée. "

