"A lungfish.  This strange fish has relatives in both Africa and Australia, "
"all of them can breathe air and some consider them living fossils."
msgstr ""
"Un dipneuste. Ce poisson étrange ayant des cousins en Australie et en Afrique "
"est capable de respirer à l'air libre, beaucoup les appelant des fossiles "
"vivants."

