"An enormous termite dedicated to the defense of the colony.  It has a pair of "
"enormous mandibles capable of cutting bone and chitin."
msgstr ""
"Une termite énorme dédiée à la défense de sa colonie possédant d'énormes "
"mandibules capable de couper à travers os et chitine."

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant termite soldier"
