"An enormous termite dedicated to the defense of the colony.  It has a strange "
"horn-like projection on its head."
msgstr ""
"Une termite gigantesque dédiée à la défense de la colonie et possédant une "
"étrange protubérance ressemblant à une corne entre ses deux yeux."

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "giant termite soldier"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s sprays some chemical out of its head!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
