msgstr[1] "termites ailées gigantesques"
msgstr[2] "termites ailées gigantesques"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant termite alate"
msgid ""
"An enormous winged termite dedicated to spreading new colonies.  Does not "
"appear violent, but perhaps you should not test its patience."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
