#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bush elephant"
msgid ""
"The African Bush Elephant is a massive terrestrial animal with two long tusks "
"protruding from its mouth.  Elephantry is on the rise since the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
