#. ~ Description of monster "wallaby joey"
msgid ""
"A baby wallaby.  Most of the time they hide inside their mother's pouch but "
"eventually grow too big."
msgstr ""
"Un bébé wallaby. Ils passent la plupart de leur temps cachés dans la poche de "
"leur mères mais deviennent inévitablement trop grands pour faire ceci après "
"un certain temps."

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wallaby"
msgid_plural "wallabies"
msgstr[0] "wallaby"
msgstr[1] "wallabies"
msgstr[2] "wallabies"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wallaby"
msgid ""
"A small to large hopping marsupial from Australia and New Guinea.  Even "
"before the Cataclysm there were many feral populations of them around the "
"world."
msgstr ""
"Un marsupial généralement petit mais pouvant atteindre de larges proportions "
"originaires d'Australie et de Nouvelle Guinée. Même avant le Cataclysme "
"beaucoup de populations retournées à la nature existaient à travers le monde."

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
