msgstr[1] "lézards anolis"
msgstr[2] "lézards anolis"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "anole"
msgid ""
"A member of the Anolis genus.  These tiny lizards are similar to chameleons, "
"living mostly on trees and using a flap on their neck during mating season."
msgstr ""
"Un membre du genre Anolis. Ces lézards minuscules sont similaires aux "
"caméléons, étant principalement arboricoles, les mâles utilisant la voile de "
"peau lâche et colorée de leur cou durant la saison des amours."

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
