"A member of the Varanus genus.  It's a fairly adaptable lizard brought from "
"Eurasia to via exotic pet trade."
msgstr ""
"Un membre du genre Varanus. Un lézard assez adaptable amené d'Eurasie à "
"travers le commerce des animaux exotiques."

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "crocodile"
msgid ""
"The American crocodile, found from the Orinoco up to southernmost Florida.  "
"It's well adapted to thrive in both fresh and salty waters and can get very "
"large."
msgstr ""

