msgid "Your hands move wicked quick!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "terrible_strength"
msgid "Terrible Strength"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Terrible Strength"
msgid "You have a terrible strength!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_evil_eye"
msgid "Evil Eye"
msgstr "Mauvais Œil"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Evil Eye"
msgid "Something is definitely wrong."
msgstr "Quelque chose ne va vraiment pas."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_sylph_underground_timer"
msgid "Underground in Dead Air"
msgstr "L'Air Meurt Sous Terre"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Underground in Dead Air"
msgid ""
"You were not born to crawl beneath the dirt like a mole.  You need to get out "
"to the open sky."
msgstr ""
"Vous n'êtes pas né(e) pour ramper sous la terre comme une taupe. Vous avez "
"besoin de vous déplacez sous le ciel ouvert."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_broke_fae_ban"
msgid "Broken Ban"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Broken Ban"
msgid ""
"You've broken one of the ancient laws that bind the fae and are suffering "
"thereby."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Touching Iron"
msgid ""
"You are in contact with iron, the ancient bane of the fae.  It will cause you "
"pain and discomfort until removed."
msgstr ""
"Votre peau est en contact ou simplement à proximité avec du fer, un élément "
"vous étant insupportable dû à votre nature féerique.  Ceci vous fera souffrir "
"considérablement jusqu'à ce que vous cessiez de porter ou tenir l'objet en "
"fer causant cet effet."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Touching Steel"
msgid ""
"You are in contact with steel, the closest material to iron, the ancient bane "
"of the fae.  It will cause you pain and discomfort until removed."
msgstr ""
"Votre peau est en contact ou simplement à proximité avec de l'acier, un métal "
"principalement composé de fer, un élément vous étant insupportable dû à votre "
"nature féerique.  Ceci vous fera souffrir considérablement jusqu'à ce que "
"vous cessiez de porter ou tenir l'objet en acier causant cet effet."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Touching Steel"
msgid "As the steel touches you, your skin begins to burn."
msgstr ""
"L'acier rentre en contact avec votre peau et celle-ci commence à vous brûler "
"intolérablement."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Touching Steel"
msgid "The burning from the steel finally fades."
msgstr "Le toucher brûlant de l'acier sur votre peau s'apaise finalement."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Touching Iron"
msgid "As the iron touches you, your skin begins to itch fiercely."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Touching Iron"
msgid "The itch from the iron finally fades."
msgstr "La démangeaison du fer sur votre peau s'apaise finalement."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "natures_commune"
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_commune_with_nature"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Commune with Nature"
msgstr "Communion avec Mère Nature"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Commune with Nature"
msgid ""
"You are in tune with the natural world, drawing strength from it and calming "
"natural animals."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes en harmonie avec la nature, votre presence calme les animaux et "
"votre corps est revigoré(e)."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Commune with Nature"
msgid "You can feel the lifeblood of nature all around, welcoming you as kin."
msgstr ""
"Vous ressentez la vitalité de la nature tout autour de vous, vous accueillant "
"un membre de sa famille."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Commune with Nature"
msgid "Your communion with nature fades."
msgstr "Votre connection avec la nature s'évanouit."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_hungry_roots"
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_roots_spell"
#. ~ The name is a reference to the poem "Goblin Market" by Christina
#. Rossetti.
msgid "Hungry Thirsty Roots"
msgstr "Racines Affamées et Assoiffées"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Hungry Thirsty Roots"
msgid "Roots and vines clutch at you."
msgstr "Des racines et vignes vous immobilisent."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Hungry Thirsty Roots"
msgid "Roots and vines entangle you!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "arvore_verdant_infusion"
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_verdant_infusion"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Verdant Infusion"
msgstr "Infusion Verdoyante"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Verdant Infusion"
msgid "You are filled with the vitality of nature."
msgstr "Vous êtes rempli(e) de vitalité naturelle."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Verdant Infusion"
msgid "You can feel the power of nature flowing through you."
msgstr "Vous ressentez le pouvoir de la nature se répandre à travers vous."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Verdant Infusion"
msgid "The power of nature fades from you."
msgstr "Le pouvoir de la nature en vous s'évanouit."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_arvore_seedbearer_available"
msgid "Seed-Bearer"
msgstr "Porte-Graines"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Seed-Bearer"
msgid "You can bring forth a fine bunch of seeds, ready for planting."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "arvore_perennial_rebirth_cooldown"
msgid "Reborn"
msgstr "Renaissance"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Reborn"
msgid "You were reborn and your soul and new body are still finding their balance."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_arvore_poison_pollen"
msgid "Night-Blooming Flower"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Night-Blooming Flower"
