#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Lithic Rigidity "
msgid "It's very hard for you to move."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Lithic Rigidity "
