#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "grimy handwritten recipe"
msgid ""
"A scrap of paper.  Something's written on it, scrawled in bad handwriting.  "
"You can barely make out the words 'Blood treatment' followed by a list of "
"ingredients."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sylph parchment"
msgid_plural "sylph parchments"
msgstr[0] "parchemin sylphique"
msgstr[1] "parchemins sylphiques"
msgstr[2] "parchemins sylphiques"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "sylph parchment"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry that I won't be there to greet you when you awaken into sentience "
"my offspring, but this world is dying and I must take the roads back home "
"before they darken and grow cold.  Even if I were here you would likely find "
"my company to be short lived as the tradition of our people is to witness the "
"waking and greet our offspring then leave them to explore the world on their "
"own.  However, I have summoned some lesser creatures of the underhill realms "
"to guard this place and you for as long as they can.  Most everything else in "
"this world will attempt to kill you.  I have included instructions for how to "
"make a healing item as well as a developmental potion that you can take to "
"bring yourself further into your destiny and will grant new abilities, "
"somewhat randomly I'm afraid.  I hope that you survive long enough to become "
"what I hoped for you to be and that you are able to find one of the trodden "
"paths from this place into the borderlands and from there deeper into Fae "
"where you will hopefully find me.  All of my hopes and dreams ride with you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dollkin tablet"
msgid_plural "dollkin tablets"
msgstr[0] "tablettes d'esprit de porcelaine"
msgstr[1] "tablettes d'esprit de porcelaine"
msgstr[2] "tablettes d'esprit de porcelaine"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "dollkin tablet"
msgid ""
"My dearest child, you are awaking into a cold dying world alone and without "
"parents.  Honestly, this is for the best, for I was brought to life amongst "
"the mortals of this realm and the parenting I would be able to pass on to you "
"is entirely tragic.  I will spare you from that fate.  However, I have "
"summoned some lesser creatures of the underhill realms to guard this place "
"and you for as long as they can.  Most everything else in this world will "
"attempt to kill you.  I have included instructions for how to make a healing "
"item as well as a developmental potion that you can take to bring yourself "
"further into your destiny and will grant new abilities, somewhat randomly I'm "
"afraid.  I hope that you survive long enough to become what I hoped for you "
"to be and that you are able to find one of the trodden paths from this place "
"into the borderlands and from there deeper into Fae where you will hopefully "
"find me.  All of my hopes and dreams ride with you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "flametouched parchment"
msgid_plural "flametouched parchments"
msgstr[0] "parchemin léché par les flammes"
msgstr[1] "parchemins léchés par les flammes"
msgstr[2] "parchemins léchés par les flammes"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "flametouched parchment"
msgid ""
"If you are reading this you have woken up to sentience as I planned.  My "
"timing however was not great in that I've been forced to leave before showing "
"you the hunting ground that I've brought you into existence in.  How I envy "
"the experience you will have rampaging through the ashes of the old world.  "
"There is significant danger in this world and in time you will be one of the "
"most dangerous beings in it.  However, since that time is not yet I have "
"summoned some lesser creatures of the underhill realms to guard this place "
"and you for as long as they can.  Most everything else in this world will "
"attempt to kill you.  I have included instructions for how to make a healing "
"item as well as a developmental potion that you can take to bring yourself "
"further into your destiny and will grant new abilities, somewhat randomly I'm "
"afraid.  I hope that you rise to the top of this crush of predators I've been "
"forced to abandon you among.  Good luck and good hunting."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "waterkin tablet"
msgid_plural "waterkin tablets"
msgstr[0] "tablette d'esprit aqueux"
msgstr[1] "tablettes d'esprit aqueux"
msgstr[2] "tablettes d'esprit aqueux"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "waterkin tablet"
msgid ""
"Spawn of my intentions, I address you from across space and time on today the "
"day of your hatching.  As is the custom of our people you have been left in "
"an uncivilized and barbaric place.  You must make your way back to us to "
"become one of us.  For now you will take a name like those of the dead "
"civilization we've deposited you in.  While you must develop on your own and "
"find your way back to us, I have summoned some lesser creatures of the "
"underhill realms to guard this place and you for as long as they can.  Most "
"everything else in this world will attempt to kill you, be sure to kill it "
"first.  I have included instructions for how to make a healing item as well "
"as a developmental potion that you can take to bring yourself further into "
"your destiny and will grant new abilities, somewhat randomly I'm afraid.  The "
"depths will tremble one day in your wake and upon that day you will know how "
"to find us.  If you fail we shall never know your name, like all the other "
"lost children."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plantkin parchment"
msgid_plural "plantkin parchments"
msgstr[0] "tablette d'esprit végétal"
msgstr[1] "tablettes d'esprit végétal"
msgstr[2] "tablettes d'esprit végétal"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "plantkin parchment"
msgid ""
"My beloved child, the Cataclysm struck at this world at a crucial time in "
"your development and we were forced to leave you behind to be born alone or "
"to mercy kill the life you were becoming.  When that was the choice upon us "
"it felt like no choice at all.  If that was the kinder fate, I am sorry but "
"my hopes to meet you one day were too strong.  I am shamed that our clan will "
"be unable to provide you shade and company but, I have summoned some lesser "
"creatures of the underhill realms to guard this place and you for as long as "
"they can.  Most everything else in this world will attempt to kill you.  I "
"have included instructions for how to make a healing item as well as a "
"developmental potion that you can take to bring yourself further into your "
"destiny and will grant new abilities, somewhat randomly I'm afraid.  I hope "
"that you survive long enough to become what I hoped for you to be and that "
"you are able to find one of the trodden paths from this place into the "
"borderlands and from there deeper into Fae where you will hopefully find me.  "
"All of my hopes and dreams ride with you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "earthkin tablet"
msgid_plural "earthkin tablets"
msgstr[0] "tablette d'esprit terrestre"
msgstr[1] "tablettes d'esprit terrestre"
msgstr[2] "tablettes d'esprit terrestre"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "earthkin tablet"
msgid ""
"Brethren of soil and stone.  How our tribe longed to see you stretch forth "
"from the forming pit like so many others before you.  It is shame that will "
"take many generations of our people to wash away that we were unable to stay "
"to bring you with us.  However, I have summoned some lesser creatures of the "
"underhill realms to guard this place and you for as long as they can.  Most "
"everything else in this world will attempt to kill you.  I have included "
"instructions for how to make a healing item as well as a developmental potion "
"that you can take to bring yourself further into your destiny and will grant "
"new abilities, somewhat randomly I'm afraid.  I hope that you survive long "
"enough to become what I hoped for you to be and that you are able to find one "
"of the trodden paths from this place into the borderlands and from there "
"deeper into Fae where you will hopefully find me.  We await you joining our "
"chorus in the deep caves of Fae, once you find your way here."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Walking the shadowed path of Blood"
msgid_plural "copies of Walking the shadowed path of Blood"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "Walking the shadowed path of Blood"
msgid ""
"This handwritten book contains a very thorough detailing of all what a "
"vampire needs to reach their full potential.  You already know most of it, "
"but some parts have yet to be read."
msgstr ""

