msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins mosaïque"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins mosaïque"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "patchwork goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit is closer to an art project than to a fruit.  Numerous stitches "
"hold together red-tinted parts of many different fruits so tightly it acts as "
"a single, consistent whole."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pristine goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "pristine goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelin immaculé"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins immaculés"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins immaculés"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "pristine goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit has a perfectly unblemished surface that cannot be tarnished or "
"dirtied, no matter what happens to it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "numbing goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "numbing goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelin engourdissant"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins engourdissants"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins engourdissants"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "numbing goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This gray dented fruit numbs your fingers as you hold it and its smell numbs "
"your nose the same way."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_NUMB"
msgid "Everything goes numb."
msgstr "Tout s'engourdit."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_NUMB"
msgid "You don't feel more numb than you currently are."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_NUMB_REMOVE"
msgid "The numbness goes away."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "whispering goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "whispering goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelin murmurant"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins murmurants"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins murmurants"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "whispering goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit is similar to a sphere of smoke.  Faint sounds come from this "
"fruit.  They almost sound like whispers."
msgstr ""
"Un fruit ayant l'apparence d'une sphère de fumée.  Des bruits ténus presque "
"comme des murmures s'en émanent."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_SPAWN_SHADOWS"
msgid "A few shadows emerge from the ground near you."
msgstr "Quelques ombres émergent du sol autour de vous."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "recoloring goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "recoloring goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelins coloré"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins colorés"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins colorés"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "recoloring goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This rectangle fruit smells of lavender and has a mushy texture.  Its colors "
"grow more vibrant for a second when you blink."
msgstr ""
"Ce fruit rectangulaire à une odeur de lavande et une texture molle, ces "
"couleurs ayant momentanément plus vives chaque fois que vous clignez des yeux."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_HEAL_AFTER_SLEEP_HEALING"
msgid "Some of the aches of yesterday are gone."
msgstr "Quelques douleurs d'hier s'estompent."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fractal goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "fractal goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelin fractal"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins fractals"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins fractals"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "fractal goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This spherical fruit is made of smaller versions of itself, which are also "
"made of smaller versions of themselves.  Should you have a microscope, you "
"could look at the fractal as it becomes smaller and smaller."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sticky goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "sticky goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelin collant"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins collants"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins collants"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "sticky goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"Reeking of glass cleaner, this disk-shaped fruit sticks to anything it "
"touches.  Despite this, you have no issue removing any dust sticking to it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pressurized goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "pressurized goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelin pressurisé"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins pressurisés"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins pressurisés"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "pressurized goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This capsule-shaped goblin fruit behaves as a pressurized tank when you press "
"its surface with your finger.  Fortunately, it doesn't appear to be able to "
"explode if pierced or bitten."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "balloon goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "balloon goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelin ballon"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins ballon"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins ballon"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "balloon goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit is nothing more than a thin layer of fruit filled with air.  It "
"has a heady aroma that makes you a little lightheaded."
msgstr ""
"Ce fruit n'est rien de plus qu'une petit couche fruitée remplie d'air.  "
"L'arôme enivrant fait flotter votre tête."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boring goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "boring goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelin barbant"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins barbants"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins barbants"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "boring goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit is the most boring thing you've ever seen.  Everything about it is "
"boring: its drab dark brown color, its smell, its lack of feature, even its "
"taste is boring.  It's not a good fruit.  It's not a bad fruit.  It's just "
"boring."
msgstr ""
"Ce fruit doit être la chose la plus ennuyante que vous ayez jamais vu.  Tout "
"est tellement barbant: sa couleur marron terne, son odeur, son manque de "
"détails, même sont goût n'a rien de spécial.  Ce n'est pas un bon fruit.  Ce "
"n'est pas un mauvais fruit.  C'est juste barbant."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mud-covered goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "mud-covered goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelin couvert de boue"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins couverts de boue"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins couverts de boue"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "mud-covered goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit is always covered in fresh mud.  You try to wipe it away, but it "
"always come back."
msgstr ""
"Ce fruit est constamment couvert d'une fine couche de boue fraiche, peu "
"importe si vous essayez de l'essuyer."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cavernous goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "cavernous goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelin caverneux"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins caverneux"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins caverneux"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "cavernous goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit has the shape of a hollow cylinder.  It has a notable smell of "
"freshly-upturned earth."
msgstr ""
"Ce fruit à la forme d'un cylindre creux et l'odeur de terre fraîchement "
"meublée."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "arguing goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "arguing goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelin argumentatif"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins argumentatifs"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins argumentatifs"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "arguing goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit reminds you of a small bowling ball.  You can hear it as it tries "
"to convince you to not eat it.  It won't succeed, right?"
msgstr ""
"Ce fruit vous rappelle une petite boule de bowling.  Vous entendez des "
"légères protestations contre être mangé lorsque vous le rapprochez de votre "
"bouche, cela ne vous convaincra pas, non?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "urchin goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "urchin goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelin oursin"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins oursin"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins oursin"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "urchin goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This spherical fruit bears many spines, yet all of of them are dulled.  It "
"smells faintly of cinnamon and aftershave."
msgstr ""
"Ce fruit sphérique à l'odeur de cannelle et après-rasage possède de "
"nombreuses épines, mais toutes sont émoussées."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rushing goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "rushing goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "rushing goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This pale fruit is surrounded by small lines of wind revolving around it.  "
"The lines grow thicker the further the fruit is from the ground."
msgstr ""
"Ce fruit pâle est entouré de petites brises s'intensifiant le plus celui-ci "
"est éloigné du sol."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sapphire goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "sapphire goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelin saphir"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins saphir"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins saphir"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "sapphire goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit is easily mistakable for a fist-sized sapphire.  Its color, "
"rigidity and facets bring to mind a gemstone, unlike its green stem."
msgstr ""
"Ce fruit pourrait être aisément confondu avec un saphir de la taille d'un "
"poing.  Sa couleur, sa rigidité et ses facettes toutes renforcent cet a "
"priori, un peu ruiné par sa tige verte."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "shy goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "shy goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelin timide"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins timides"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins timides"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "shy goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit shaped akin to a chunk torn from a beehive is warm, but becomes "
"cold as long as anyone is looking at it.  It has a strong odor, between maple "
"and oak, but only when unobserved."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "weeping goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "weeping goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelin suintant"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins suintants"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins suintants"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "weeping goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This blue tear-shaped fruit drips with water.  You try to collect it, but it "
"fades away before touching the container."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_CALL_RAIN"
msgid "A few droplets fall from the sky, but nothing more happen."
msgstr "Quelques gouttelettes tombent du ciel, mais rien d'autre se passe."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_CALL_RAIN_TRUE"
msgid "A light drizzle starts falling from the sky."
msgstr "Une bruine légère tombe des cieux."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_STOP_RAIN"
msgid "The drizzle the fruit caused ends."
msgstr "La petite averse causée par le fruit s'estompe."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "furry goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "furry goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelin poilu"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins poilus"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins poilus"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "furry goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit what a kiwi would be if kiwi had decimeter-long beige fur.  It "
"smells of steel and lilies."
msgstr ""
"Ce fruit à l'apparence d'un kiwi si un kiwi avait un pelage beige d'un "
"décimètre de longueur et une odeur vous rappelant l'acier et la fleur de lys."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_ANIMAL_IGNORE"
msgid "Nearby animals tolerate your presence a little more."
msgstr "Les animaux autour de vous tolèrent votre présence un peu plus."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_ANIMAL_IGNORE"
msgid "Animals can't tolerate your presence more than they are currently doing."
msgstr "Les animaux ne peuvent pas tolérer votre présence encore plus."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_ANIMAL_IGNORE_REMOVE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "GOBLIN_FRUIT_ANIMAL_IGNORE_ATTACK_RANGED"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "GOBLIN_FRUIT_ANIMAL_IGNORE_ATTACK_MELEE"
msgid "Nearby animals stop ignoring your presence."
msgstr "Les animaux autour de vous arrêtent d'ignorer votre présence."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "remolding goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "remolding goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelin mouvant"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins mouvants"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins mouvants"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "remolding goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This gray fruit is hard to pierce, as it reshapes itself to close any hole "
"you make in it.  Ironically, the fruit keeps tearing its surface apart, "
"making its reshaping a sisyphean task."
msgstr ""
"Un fruit gris étant difficile à percer dû à sa capacité de se refaçonner pour "
"boucher tout trou que vous y infliger.  L'ironie est que ce processus cause "
"sa surface à se déchirer et réparer de façon sisyphéenne."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_MEND_BONE"
msgid "The bones of your left arm mend together in an instant!"
msgstr "Les os de votre bras gauche guérissent en un instant!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_MEND_BONE"
msgid "The bones of your right arm mend together in an instant!"
msgstr "Les os de votre bras droit guérissent en un instant!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in false effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_MEND_BONE"
msgid "The bones of your left leg mend together in an instant!"
msgstr "Les os de votre jambe gauche guérissent en un instant!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in nested effect in else statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_MEND_BONE"
msgid "The bones of your right leg mend together in an instant!"
msgstr "Les os de votre jambe droite guérissent en un instant!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in nested effect in else statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_MEND_BONE"
msgid "You feel your bones itch for a moment, but nothing happens."
msgstr ""
"Vous ressentez vos os démangeant pendant un moment, mais rien d'autre ne se "
"produit."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cloudy goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "cloudy goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruit gobelin nuageux"
msgstr[1] "fruits gobelins nuageux"
msgstr[2] "fruits gobelins nuageux"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "cloudy goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit looks like a crystal ball filled with clouds.  When you look into "
"it, you see fragments of your most intense dreams."
msgstr ""
"Ce fruit donne l'impression d'être une boule de cristal remplie de nuages.  "
"Lorsque vous plongez vos yeux à l'intérieur, vous observez des fragments de "
"vos rêves les plus intenses."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_CURE_DREAMLESS"
msgid "Not even the power of this fruit could grant you access to dream magic."
msgstr ""
"Même le pouvoir de ce fruit est incapable de vous faire accéder à la magie "
"des rêves."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_CURE_DREAMLESS"
msgid ""
"Your dreams are still digesting another cloudy fruit, preventing this one "
"from having any effect."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in false effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_CURE_DREAMLESS"
msgid "Your mind fills with dreams of an intensity you have never seen before!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in nested effect in else statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_CURE_DREAMLESS"
msgid "Your mind fills with oddly real dreams!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in else
#. statement in false effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_CURE_DREAMLESS"
msgid "Your mind fills with dreams you could make real!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in else
#. statement in nested effect in else statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_CURE_DREAMLESS"
msgid "You feel your Eater potential grow!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in else
