#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Description of "Malleus Maleficarum"
msgid ""
"A hardcover translation of the infamous 15th century book used as a reference "
"work for witchcraft trials for centuries.  This translation seems to have "
"some handwritten notes in some of the margins."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Cunning Book of Home and Hearth"
msgid_plural "copies of The Cunning Book of Home and Hearth"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Description of "The Cunning Book of Home and Hearth"
msgid ""
"This mass-market paperback purports to pass down the ancient traditional "
"secrets of English cunning folk, though if that were true, they probably "
"could have gotten more than $12.95 for it.  There are a lot of descriptions "
"of rituals and procedures in here, though--maybe some of them deserve further "
"investigation."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Bloodstoppers and Bearwalkers: Folk Traditions of Michigan's Upper Peninsula"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of Bloodstoppers and Bearwalkers: Folk Traditions of Michigan's Upper "
"Peninsula"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Description of "Bloodstoppers and Bearwalkers: Folk Traditions of
#. Michigan's Upper Peninsula"
msgid ""
"This is an anthropological collection of American folk beliefs in the Upper "
"Peninsula of Michigan, consisting of stories, legends, descriptions of "
"rituals, tall tales, and anything else the author heard during his period of "
"study.  The \"Bloodstoppers\" of the title are individuals believed to be "
"able to stop the flow of blood from a wound, with an incantation or ritual or "
"sheer force of will, and the bearwalkers were allegedly sorcerers who could "
"assume the shape of a bear and cause misfortune."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Ward your Dreams for a Good Night's Sleep!"
msgid_plural "copies of Ward your Dreams for a Good Night's Sleep!"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Description of "Ward your Dreams for a Good Night's Sleep!"
msgid ""
"This is a very thin booklet, more of a pamphlet, about various ways to "
"protect from nightmares.  There are quite a few techniques in here, though "
"you're a bit skeptical about whether the author took the end of the world "
"into their calculations."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Monas Hieroglyphica"
msgid_plural "copies of Monas Hieroglyphica"
msgstr[0] "Monas Hieroglyphica"
msgstr[1] "copies de Monas Hieroglyphica"
msgstr[2] "copies de Monas Hieroglyphica"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Description of "Monas Hieroglyphica"
msgid ""
"This is a thin reproduction of John Dee's Monas Hieroglyphica.  A complicated "
"work whose meaning has long been lost without access to the occult oral "
"tradition of it's time.  It's possible that some remnants of that oral "
"tradition still exist today, but it is unknown if they would be able to fully "
"interpret this spellbook."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Parchment of sight beyond sight"
msgid_plural "Parchments of sight beyond sight"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Description of "Parchment of sight beyond sight"
msgid "A short parchment that will supposedly teach you how to see through walls."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid ""
"The Bathhouse at Midnight: An Historical Survey of Magic and Divination in "
"Russia"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of The Bathhouse at Midnight: An Historical Survey of Magic and "
"Divination in Russia"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Description of "The Bathhouse at Midnight: An Historical Survey of Magic
#. and Divination in Russia"
msgid ""
"This encyclopediac tome by W. F. Ryan concerns a wide variety of folk magic "
"practices in pre-modern Russia, including their social context, the way that "
"the Church had to work against folk practices like leaving items on the altar "
"for six weeks so they would gain protective powers, the dangers of being "
"alone in the bathhouse, ways to find and keep a husband or wife, when to "
"throw an axe handle over your shoulder when walking into the forest, and how "
"the government mostly suppressed magic because magical power (real or "
"imagined) would have been a threat to secular power.  The description of some "
"of these rituals are extremely detailed."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Book of the Sacred Magic of Abramelin the Mage"
msgid_plural "copies of The Book of the Sacred Magic of Abramelin the Mage"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Description of "The Book of the Sacred Magic of Abramelin the Mage"
msgid ""
"Translated from the French edition by Samuel L MacGregor Mathers, this tome "
"compiles the journeys of a man named Abraham of Worms to Egypt, where he "
"learned occult secrets from the wizard Abramelin who lived in a small town "
"near the Nile.  The magic contained within focuses mostly on the creation of "
"magic squares which, when used in ceremonies by an initiate, provide magical "
"effects."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid ""
"Psychic Self-Defense: The Classic Instruction Manual for Protecting Yourself "
"Against Paranormal Attack"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of Psychic Self-Defense: The Classic Instruction Manual for Protecting "
"Yourself Against Paranormal Attack"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Description of "Psychic Self-Defense: The Classic Instruction Manual for
#. Protecting Yourself Against Paranormal Attack"
msgid ""
"A very popular 20th century occult book about protecting yourself against "
"psychic attack, haunting, vampirism (the psychic kind, not the kind with "
"fangs), and other otherworldly phenomenon."
msgstr ""

