#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Luna-Attuned Revenant"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s lashes out as it attempts to be exposed to the moonlight again!"
msgstr ""

