"You have gained a portion of the might of your fae ancestors.  +1 Strength "
"and Dexterity."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fae Puissance"
msgstr "Pouvoir Féerique"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Puissance"
msgid "You have gained the might of your fae ancestors.  +2 Strength and Dexterity."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fae Discernment"
msgstr "Discernement Féerique"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Discernment"
msgid ""
"You have gained a portion of the wits of your fae ancestors.  +1 Intelligence "
"and Perception."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fae Acumen"
msgstr "Perspicacité Féerique"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Acumen"
msgid ""
"You have gained the wits of your fae ancestors.  +2 Intelligence and "
"Perception."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fae Sight"
msgstr "Vision Féerique"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Sight"
msgid ""
"You can sense other nearby creatures from the Bright Lands.  Activate to "
"enable your fae senses.  It has a small chance to cost some of your mana each "
"turn it is in use."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wyrd Sight"
msgid ""
"You can sense other nearby creatures from the Bright Lands.  Activate to "
"enable your fae senses."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cloud of Steam"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to create a cloud of "
"damaging steam."
msgstr ""
"Permet à un Sylphe d'invoquer un nuage de vapeur bouillante pour brûler ses "
"ennemis."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cloud of Steam"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine gains the ability to create a cloud of "
"damaging steam."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Create Light"
msgstr "Créer de la Lumière"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Create Light"
msgid "Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to create light."
msgstr "Permet à un Sylphe de manifester de la lumière."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Create Light"
msgid "Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to create light."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Born of the Elements"
msgstr "Né(e) des Éléments"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Born of the Elements"
msgid "Your connection to this world is deep and rewards you with additional mana."
msgstr ""
"Votre connection avec le monde qui vous entoure est profonde et vous fait "
"posséder plus de mana que la moyenne."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Change with the Seasons"
msgstr "Changer avec les Saisons"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Walking Ley Line"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Wind Blows, the Willow Bends"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability, you gain the ability to enhance your dodge "
"capabilities."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Gossamer Artisan"
msgstr "Artisan de Tulle"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Gossamer Artisan"
msgid ""
"Like your fae ancestors, you can turn gossamer into clothing and armor.  "
"Activate this trait to learn a gossamer recipe (once per week)."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Gossamerwright"
msgstr "Création de Tulle"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Gossamerwright"
msgid ""
"Your manipulation of gossamer has advanced to the point where you can make it "
"yourself out of mundane cotton and moonlight."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Desire for Conversation"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Desire for Conversation"
msgid ""
"The Dollkin casts this spell to force a conversation with anyone, once.  If "
"they've heard the Dollkin out and decided they wish not to speak again it "
"will not work."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "FINAL DISCUSSION"
msgstr "DISCUSSION FINALE"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "FINAL DISCUSSION"
msgid "This person won't speak with them again if this goes poorly."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
msgid "You pull a goblin fruit from the flames."
msgstr "Vous tirez un fruit gobelin des flammes."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
msgid "You must have a nearby source of flames or heat to call forth a goblin fruit."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_FIRE_FLY"
msgid "You must be standing in flames to cast Burning Ascension."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_WATER_TO_BOOZE"
msgid ""
"From the fiery depths of your spirit, knowledge of how to turn various other "
"water into strong alcohol fills your mind."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_WATER_TO_FUEL"
msgid ""
"From the fiery depths of your spirit, knowledge of how to turn various other "
"water into lamp oil fills your mind."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_REBORN_IN_FLAMES"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SALAMANDER_REBORN_IN_FLAMES_COOLDOWN" in nested EOCs in false effect
#. in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_REBORN_IN_FLAMES"
msgid ""
"As your body takes its final wound, your fae spirit drinks in the heat of the "
"flames and your flesh is renewed."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_GRANT_COOKING_HEAT"
msgid "Your hands grow warm."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_GRANT_COOKING_HEAT"
msgid "The heat from your hands fades away."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_HEALTH_FOR_MANA"
msgid "You have no need to restore your mana now!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_SMOKE_FORM_ASCEND"
msgid "You must be in warm air to ascend!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SALAMANDER_SMOKE_FORM_ASCEND_OUTSIDE_CHECK"
msgid "You soar upward on the rising smoke."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SALAMANDER_SMOKE_FORM_ASCEND_OUTSIDE_CHECK"
msgid "The ceiling above blocks your attempt to rise!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_BERSERK_STANCE_ON"
msgid "You are already under the effects of Wildfire Soul!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_make_fire"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Enkindle"
msgstr "Embraser"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_make_fire ( Enkindle )"
msgid ""
"Born from fire, it is easy for a Salamander to bring forth that fire and set "
"something alight."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_flame_punch_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Blazing Blow"
msgstr "Frappe Ardente"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_flame_punch_spell ( Blazing Blow )"
msgid ""
"Wreathe your fist in flames and punch a single target, causing fire damage "
"and knocking them backward."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_flaming_whip_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "A Hundred Tongues of Flame"
msgstr "Une Centaine de Langues de Feu"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_flaming_whip_spell ( A Hundred Tongues
#. of Flame )"
msgid "Summon a flaming whip to scourge your enemies."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_smoke_teleport_spell"
msgid "In a Cloud of Smoke"
msgstr "Dans un Nuage de Fumée"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_smoke_teleport_spell ( In a Cloud of
#. Smoke )"
msgid ""
"Like fire leaping over a firebreak, you can vanish and reappear somewhere "
"nearby, leaving a thick cloud of smoke in your former location."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_cure_conditions"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Burning Away Your Impurities"
msgstr "Brûler les Impuretés"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_cure_conditions ( Burning Away Your
#. Impurities )"
msgid ""
"As fire burns dead wood, you can burn away poison or sickness in your target. "
" However, just as fire is dangerous to touch, it damages the target as well."
msgstr ""
"Comme les flammes brûlent le bois mort, vous pouvez embraser tout poisons ou "
"maladies présents dans votre cible, mais être exposer d'aussi près au pouvoir "
"des flammes causera des dégâts mineurs."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_fire_dot_spell"
msgid "The Fire in the Marrow"
msgstr "Brasier dans la Moelle"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_fire_dot_spell ( The Fire in the Marrow
#. )"
msgid ""
"Kindle a flame within the target, slowly burning them from the inside.  This "
"spell does damage only slowly, but there is little defense against being "
"burned from the inside out."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_increase_speed_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fanning the Spark"
msgstr "Attiser l'Étincelle"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_increase_speed_spell ( Fanning the Spark
#. )"
msgid "You can infuse yourself or an ally with the blazing speed of fire."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez infusez un allié ou vous-même avec la vitesse fulgurante des "
"flammes."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_emit_heat"
msgid "Stoking the Inner Furnace"
msgstr "Attiser le Four Interne"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_emit_heat ( Stoking the Inner Furnace )"
msgid "Like a bonfire, you can throw off large quantities of heat."
msgstr "Comme un feu de joie, vous pouvez émettre de larges quantités de chaleur."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_summon_fire_spirit"
msgid "Calling the Children of the Inferno"
msgstr "Appeler les Enfants de l'Enfer"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_summon_fire_spirit ( Calling the
#. Children of the Inferno )"
msgid "A lesser fire spirit is summoned to support you."
msgstr "Invoque un petit élémental de flammes pour vous aider."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_summon_firebird_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Flame of the Firebird"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_summon_firebird_spell ( Flame of the
#. Firebird )"
msgid ""
"Summon a delicate bird made of pure flame.  The bird will last only a few "
"moments, but if it sees an enemy it will eagerly dive upon them and erupt "
"into a fireball."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_ash_breath_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Exhalation of Ashes"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_ash_breath_spell ( Exhalation of Ashes
#. )"
msgid ""
"You can breathe out a cloud of thick smoke, concealing your presence or "
"causing humans to choke."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_fire_breath"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Breath of the Firedragon"
msgstr "Souffle du Dragon Infernal"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_fire_breath ( Breath of the Firedragon
#. )"
msgid "Like the legendary dragon, you can spray fire in a cone in front of you."
msgstr ""
"Comme un dragon légendaire, vous pouvez projeter des flammes en un cône dans "
"une direction."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_dash_boom_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fiery Charge"
msgstr "Charge Ardente"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_dash_boom_spell ( Fiery Charge )"
msgid ""
"Hurl yourself forward in a burst of speed, causing an explosion at your "
"arrive point."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_explosion_trap_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sigil of Detonation"
msgstr "Sceau de Détonation"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_explosion_trap_spell ( Sigil of
#. Detonation )"
msgid "Place a magical rune on a the ground that will explode when stepped on."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_cultivate_goblin_fruit ( Cultivate
#. Goblin Fruit )"
msgid ""
"You may spin a bit of fae magick into the flames, bringing forth a goblin "
"fruit.  Goblin fruit have a variety of effects, never predictable but always "
"at least somewhat beneficial.  This spell may only be cast outdoors in "
"natural surroundings."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_fire_fly"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Burning Ascension"
msgstr "Ascension Flamboyante"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_fire_fly ( Burning Ascension )"
msgid ""
"Like the rising heat of fire, you can ascend into the air and walk with the "
"smoke for a short time before falling safely back to the earth."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_ally_flame_immune_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Anointed with Incandescence"
msgstr "Oint d'Incandescence"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_ally_flame_immune_spell ( Anointed with
#. Incandescence )"
msgid ""
"You draw on your own fiery nature and infuse a portion of it into an ally, "
"rendering them immune to warm temperatures and fire."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_explosion_and_heal_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Phoenix's Last Cry"
msgstr "Le Dernier Cri du Phénix"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_explosion_and_heal_spell ( The Phoenix's
#. Last Cry )"
msgid ""
"Like the rebirth of the legendary phoenix, you explode into flames, causing "
"fire to engulf the entire nearby area.  You will heal faster for six hours "
"after casting this spell."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Salamander Skin"
msgstr "Peau de Salamandre"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Salamander Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin has turned the color of an autumnal bonfire.  Your skin is now an "
"orange red with dark freckles.  This has no gameplay effects."
msgstr ""
"La couleur de votre peau s'est altérée vers un rouge tacheté de noir "
"rappelant un feu de joie automnal.  Ceci n'a aucun effet notable."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Burning Coals Skin"
msgstr "Peau de Braises"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Burning Coals Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin has magickal flames flaring out of it on occasion.  You can operate "
"in warmer climates than normal humans but begin to take damage from getting "
"wet, and you always smell of smoke and ashes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Flame Skin"
msgstr "Peau Feu de Joie"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Enkindle"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to set something "
"nearby on fire."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fiery Charge"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to rush forward "
"and cause an explosion at the place they land."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sigil of Detonation"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to lay a fiery "
"trap which will burst into searing flames when stepped on."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "In a Puff of Smoke"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "In a Puff of Smoke"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to vanish in a "
"burst of smoke and reappear somewhere nearby."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Blazing Blow"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to punch a target "
"with a fiery fist, causing damage and hurling them back."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Summon Fire Spirit"
msgstr "Invoquer Esprit du Feu"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Summon Fire Spirit"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to summon a fire "
"spirit."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Exhalation of Ashes"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to breathe out a "
"cloud of thick smoke."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Breath of the Firedragon"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to breathe a cone "
"of flames."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Flame of the Firebird"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to summon a bird "
"made of roaring flames to their aid."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fanning the Spark"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to increase their "
"own or an ally's speed."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "A Hundred Tongues of Flame"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to summon a "
"flaming whip to aid them in battle."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stoking the Inner Fire"
msgstr "Attiser le Flammes Internes"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stoking the Inner Fire"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to emit large "
"quantities of heat."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Burning Away Your Impurities"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to cure "
"deleterious conditions at the cost of damage."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to pluck a goblin "
"fruit from the flames."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Burning Water"
msgstr "Eau de Vie"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Burning Water"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander learns how to convert water into "
"very strong alcohol."
msgstr ""
"Une Salamandre possédant ce pouvoir apprend soudainement comment convertir de "
"l'eau en de l'alcool très pur."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fire From Water"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fire From Water"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander learn how to convert water directly "
"into fuel.  This is an intensely draining activity."
msgstr ""
"Une Salamandre possédant ce pouvoir apprends comment convertir de l'eau en du "
"carburant.  Ceci est très épuisant."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Salamander Eyes"
msgstr "Yeux de Salamandre"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Salamander Eyes"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander's eyes begin reflecting their mood, "
"with warm yellows and deep reds when happy and blazing oranges, blues, and "
"whites when angry.  Glare no longer impacts them and they can always see "
"exactly what temperature it is."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Heat Sight"
msgstr "Vision Thermique"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Heat Sight"
msgid ""
"With their new eyes, the Salamander can see heat and pick out others in "
"darkness."
msgstr ""
"La vision d'une Salamandre lui permet de discerner la chaleur et les "
"créatures l'émettant même dans le noir total."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Reading the Heartfires"
msgstr "Lire les Braises"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Reading the Heartfires"
msgid ""
"The Salamander's ability to see heat has sharpened greatly, and they can pick "
"out subtle change in a person's skin caused by blood flow.  This makes "
"persuasion and lying easier."
msgstr ""
"Votre vision thermique de Salamandre s'est affinée jusqu'à vous permettre de "
"discerner des changements subtils de températures à travers le corps d'une "
"personne causés par son sang.  Cela rends persuader et mentir plus facile "
"pour vous."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Salamander Ears"
msgstr "Oreilles de Salamandre"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Salamander Ears"
msgid ""
"The Salamander's ears narrow to a point, like tongues of leaping flame.  "
"While distinctive, this has no gameplay effects."
msgstr ""
"Les oreilles d'une Salamandre s'affinent en plusieurs pointes ressemblants à "
"des langues de feu dansantes.  Ceci rends votre apparence frappante mais n'a "
"aucun vrai effet sur votre ouïe."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Heat Quickens the Blood"
msgstr "La Chaleur Vivifie le Sang"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Heat Quickens the Blood"
msgid ""
"The Salamander gains strength from heat and becomes faster in hot weather.  "
"However, cold weather produces a corresponding slowing effect."
msgstr ""
"Les Salamandres puisent leur énergie à partir de la chaleur environnante, et "
"deviennent plus vives lorsqu'il fait chaud.  Inversement, les températures "
"basses rendent leurs mouvements plus lents que la normale."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Heat Fuels the Flames"
msgstr "La Chaleur Alimente les Flammes"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Heat Fuels the Flames"
msgid ""
"The Salamander gains strength from heat and becomes faster and heals much "
"quicker in hot weather.  However, cold weather produces a corresponding "
"slowing effect."
msgstr ""
"Les Salamandres puisent leur énergie à partir de la chaleur environnante, et "
"deviennent plus vives ainsi que guérissent plus vite lorsqu'il fait chaud.  "
"Inversement, les températures basses rendent leurs mouvements et guérison "
"plus lents que la normale."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Incandescent Artisan's Alacrity"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Incandescent Artisan's Alacrity"
msgid ""
"As fae spirits of fire, Salamanders also partake of the heat of the forge and "
"the glow of white-hot iron.  Your crafting speed will increase while standing "
"in fire or hot air."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Searing Footsteps"
msgstr "Foulées Brûlantes"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Searing Footsteps"
msgid ""
"The Salamander can enhance their inner fire to the point where they leave "
"fiery footprints everywhere they travel.  Activate this trait to leave a "
"trail of fire in your wake at the cost of mana for every footstep."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Within the Firelight"
msgstr "Baigné(e) par la Lumière du Feu"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Within the Firelight"
msgid ""
"As a distant fire reveals that which is nearby, the Salamander can see what "
"surrounds their kin.  The Salamander may see through the eyes of any "
"creatures they summon."
msgstr ""
"Comme un feu distant révélant tout chose dans les environs, une Salamandre "
"est capable de voir ce qui est proche des créatures auxquelles elle est liée. "
" Ceci vous permet de voir ce que les créatures que vous invoquez voient."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Adding Wood to the Campfire"
msgstr "Ajouter du Bois au Feu de Camp"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Adding Wood to the Campfire"
msgid ""
"Fires require fuel, and so does the Salamander.  This trait allows them to "
"eat twice as much at once."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fueling the Hungry Oven"
msgstr "Approvisionner la Fournaise Affamée"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fueling the Hungry Oven"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like a coal furnace, the Salamander devours food to keep functioning.  They "
"may eat three times as much at once and eat food 50% faster."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Burning New Wood"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Burning New Wood"
msgid ""
"In times of extreme need, the Salamander can fuel their powers with their own "
"body.  Activate this to restore mana at the cost of health."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Campfire Stands Watch"
msgstr "Le Feu de Camp Monte la Garde"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Campfire Stands Watch"
msgid ""
"The Salamander needs less sleep than a human.  However, they will also need "
"to eat slightly more."
msgstr ""
"Une Salamandre a besoin de moins de repos qu'un humain mais demande un peu "
"plus de nourriture pour survivre."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Bonfire Blazes Until the Revelers Have Gone"
msgstr "Le Feu de Joie Flamboie Jusqu'à ce que Tout les Célébrants Soient Partis"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Bonfire Blazes Until the Revelers Have Gone"
msgid ""
"The Salamander needs much less sleep than a human.  However, they will also "
"need to eat significantly more."
msgstr ""
"Une Salamandre a besoin de beaucoup moins de repos qu'un humain mais ceci "
"rends son appétit vorace."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Watchfire Burns Throughout the Night"
msgstr "Le Feu de Garde Brûle à Travers La Nuit"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Watchfire Burns Throughout the Night"
msgid ""
"Like a blazing signal fire, a Salamander never stops shining.  They never "
"need to sleep if they do not want to, and when they do, they need much less "
"sleep than normal.  However, they require twice as much food as a human."
msgstr ""
"Comme un feu rugissant dans une tour de garde, une Salamandre n'arrête jamais "
"d'illuminer les alentours, n'ayant pas d'obligation de dormir, et dormant "
"beaucoup moins qu'un humain si celle-ci décide de dormir tout de même. Ceci a "
"tout de même comme inconvénient conséquent d'avoir l'appétit de deux humains."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Inner Fire Cannot Be Quenched"
msgstr "Le Four Intérieur ne Peut Pas Être Étouffé"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Inner Fire Cannot Be Quenched"
msgid ""
"Accursed water.  Its touch dampens your flames, and you will no longer have "
"anything to do with it.  You do not need to drink."
msgstr ""
"Maudite eau. Son contact atténue vos flammes, et vous n'aurez plus besoin "
"d'avoir quelque chose à voir avec celle-ci. Vous n'avez plus aucun besoin de "
"boire."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Breathing in Cinders"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Breathing in Cinders"
msgid ""
"Smoke is the breath of fire and a Salamander is born of flames.  You suffer "
"no negative effects from smoke inhalation."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Strength of the Crackling Fire"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Strength of the Crackling Fire"
msgid "Like a fire fueled with fresh wood, you have increased strength.  +1 Strength."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Strength of the Blazing Bonfire"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Strength of the Blazing Bonfire"
msgid ""
"Like the bonfire that will burn through the night, you have greatly increased "
"strength.  +3 Strength."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fiery Speed"
msgstr "Flammes Fougueuses"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fiery Speed"
msgid "Like a fire sparks kindling in flame, you have increased speed.  +2 Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"Comme une étincelle embrasant du sous-bois sec, votre vitesse est "
"ahurissante, vous accordant +2 à votre Dextérité."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Blazing Speed"
msgstr "Flammes Fulgurantes"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Blazing Speed"
msgid ""
"Like a forest fire moving faster than a running horse, you have greatly "
"increased speed.  +5 Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous déplacez comme un feu de forêt plus rapide qu'un cheval au galop, "
"vous accordant +5 à votre Dextérité."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Outracing the Prairie Fire"
msgstr "Distancer le Feu de Prairie"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Outracing the Prairie Fire"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Salamander can move even faster than a racing prairie fire.  -10% move "
"and attack speed."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sparking Thoughts"
msgstr "Songes Remplies d'Étincelles"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sparking Thoughts"
msgid "Your thoughts are as fast as a forest fire.  +2 Intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Vos pensées se déplacent aussi rapidement qu'un feu de forêt, vous accordant "
"+2 à votre Intelligence."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Effortlessly-Rising Smoke"
msgstr "Fumée s’Élevant Sans Effort"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Effortlessly-Rising Smoke"
msgid ""
"Like smoke rising to the sky, the Salamander cannot be kept down.  This trait "
"may be activated to immediately clear the Stunned, Dazed, or Downed effects."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stove's Caress"
msgstr "Caresse de la Fournaise"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stove's Caress"
msgid ""
"Instead of simply causing a burst of heat, the Salamander can emit heat from "
"their hands at will, allowing them to use it to cook."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Inured to Flame"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Inured to Flame"
msgid ""
"A creature born and bred of fire, the Salamander is utterly immune to heat "
"and flame of any kind.  However, they will take additional damage from cold."
msgstr ""
"Une créature née et faite pour les flammes, la Salamandre est totalement "
"invulnérables aux flammes et à la chaleur peu importe la source de celle-ci. "
"Cependant, le froid vous causera davantage de dégâts et inconfort."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Burning Ascension"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to hurl themselves "
"skyward while standing in a fire."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mana Bonfire"
msgstr "Brasier de Mana"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana Bonfire"
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Salamander is a font of mana, like a well-fueled bonfire.  25% extra mana."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Crackling Mana Bonfire"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Crackling Mana Bonfire"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Salamander's mana surges within them, ready to burst out at the slightly "
"opportunity.  25% extra mana and -15% spell casting speed."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "On Wings of Flame"
msgstr "Ailes Embrasées"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "On Wings of Flame"
msgid ""
"With an act of will, you can extend wings of flame from your back.  These "
"aetherial wings are not hindered by clothing or armor, but also do not have "
"enough substance to allow you to fly.  However, they can break a fall or be "
"used in combat."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "On Wings of Flame" to
#. "SALAMANDER_SUMMON_WINGS_ON"
msgid "Flaming wings extend from your back!"
msgstr "Des ailes de feu jaillissent de votre dos!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "On Wings of Flame (active)"
msgstr "Ailes Embrasées (activées)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "On Wings of Flame (active)"
msgid ""
"You are extending wings of aetherial flame from your back.  You can attack "
"enemies with them and will not take damage from falls."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when player with mutation "On Wings of Flame (active)" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "You buffet %s with your fiery wings!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "On Wings of Flame (active)" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s buffets %2$s with their fiery wings!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "On Wings of Flame (active)" to
#. "SALAMANDER_SUMMON_WINGS"
msgid "The wings on your back gutter and die."
msgstr "Les ailes sur votre dos vacillent est disparaissent."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "In Flames, Reborn Like the Phoenix"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "In Flames, Reborn Like the Phoenix"
msgid ""
"Like the bird of legend, the Salamander can recreate themselves from the heat "
"and smoke of a fire.  If their body takes fatal damage while standing in a "
"fire, their fae spirit will use those flames to renew themselves.  This can "
"generally occur no more often than once every 14 days, though there is a "
"small chance it can occur more often."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Anointed with Incandescence"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to make an ally "
"immune to heat and flame."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Phoenix's Last Cry"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability create a massive "
"explosion of flames around themselves and draw on its energy to increase "
"their healing rate."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Form of Billowing Smoke"
msgstr "Forme de Fumée Ascendante"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Form of Billowing Smoke"
msgid ""
"The Salamander may transform into smoke.  They will have only a dim awareness "
"of their surroundings, but can freely move including through the air and will "
"be nearly immune to attack.  They will be unable to attack anyone else "
"themselves, however."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Form of Billowing Smoke Appearance"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Form of Billowing Smoke Appearance"
msgid ""
"This mutation carries the sprite override info for Form of Billowing Smoke.  "
"You shouldn't be able to see it in game."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Smoke Form Ascension"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Smoke Form Ascension"
msgid "While in hot air or a fire, you may ascend upwards"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "In No Other Fire Shall I Burn"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "In No Other Fire Shall I Burn"
msgid "The Salamander is completely immune to radiation."
msgstr "La Salamandre est totalement invulnérable aux radiations."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wildfire Soul"
msgid ""
"As a banked fire can suddenly spring up with a gust of wind, the Salamander "
"can surge into raging activity.  Activating this trait will make the "
"Salamander immune to pain and add +3 Strength and Dexterity for as long as it "
"is active.  However, when it ends, all the previously put-off pain and more "
"returns."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_spell_learning_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_MAKE_FIRE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_DASH_BOOM"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_EXPLOSION_TRAP"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_SMOKE_TELEPORT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_FLAME_PUNCH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_SUMMON_FIRE_SPIRIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_ASH_BREATH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_FLAME_BREATH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_SUMMON_FIREBIRD"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_INCREASE_SPEED"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_SUMMON_WHIP"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_EMIT_HEAT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_CURE_CONDITIONS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_FIRE_DOT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_CREATE_LIGHT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_FLY_IN_FIRE_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_FLAME_IMMUNITY_ALLY"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_EXPOSION_AND_HEAL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_CULTIVATE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_MAKE_GOSSAMER"
msgid ""
"Your time spent among the heat and flames has increased your facility with "
"your fae magicks."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_LIGHTNING_MELEE_ATTACKS_ON"
msgid "Lightning sparks from you hands."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SYLPH_LIGHTNING_MELEE_ATTACKS_PER_TURN"
msgid "You do not have enough mana to maintain your fulgurating strikes!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_REVEAL_OVERMAP"
msgid "You must be outdoors to cast Like a Bird on the Wing."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
msgid "Leap two stories up"
msgstr "Bondir deux étages"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
msgid "Leap four stories up"
msgstr "Bondir quatre étages"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
msgid "Leap six stories up"
msgstr "Bondir six étages"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
msgid "Leap straight up two stories."
msgstr "Bondissez deux étages en l'air."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
msgid "Leap straight up four stories."
msgstr "Bondissez quatre étages en l'air."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
msgid "Leap straight up six stories."
msgstr "Bondissez six étages en l'air."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_SELECTOR_TWO"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_SELECTOR_FOUR"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_SELECTOR_SIX"
msgid "With a burst of wind, you leap into the air."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_SELECTOR_TWO"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_SELECTOR_FOUR"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_SELECTOR_SIX"
msgid "You cannot jump with a ceiling above you!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_FLY_AT_WILL"
msgid "You do not have enough mana to fly!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_CLOUD_FORM_ON"
msgid "Your body falls apart into billowing clouds."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_CLOUD_FORM_PER_TURN"
msgid "You do not have enough mana to maintain your cloud body!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_MASSIVE_LIGHTNING_BOLT"
msgid "You must be outdoors to cast Fist of Heaven's Fury."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_WIND_TRANSLOCATE_CHECK"
msgid ""
"You must be outdoors and in a strong wind or high above the earth to "
"translocate."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_WIND_ATTUNEMENT_CHECK"
msgid "You must be outdoors and high above the earth to cast this spell."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
msgid ""
"You must have a strong enough wind or be above ground level to call forth a "
"goblin fruit."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "zap_electrical_emission"
msgid "Zap"
msgstr "Zap"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "zap_electrical_emission ( Zap )"
msgid "Electricity emits from your extremities."
msgstr "De l'électricité est émise de vos extrémités."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "zap_electrical_emission ( Zap )"
#. ~ Message of spell "electrical_field ( Electrical Field )"
#. ~ Message of spell "lightning_field ( Lightning Field )"
msgid "tsszappp!"
msgstr "tsszappp!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_call_lightning ( Lightning Bolt )"
msgid ""
"The goto ability for many Sylphs, this does just what you expect: you shoot "
"lightning from your fingertips.  However, this lightning is more directed "
"than most lightning, and travels in a line through most non-solid targets."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_crash_of_lightning"
msgid "Crash of lightning"
msgstr "Coup de Tonnerre"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_crash_of_lightning ( Crash of lightning )"
msgid ""
"The crash of lightning strikes your foes with a blast of electricity and a "
"physical force that knocks them prone."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clap_of_thunder"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Clap of Thunder"
msgstr "Coup de Tonnerre"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clap_of_thunder ( Clap of Thunder )"
msgid "A thunder clap at a distance."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electrical_field"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Electrical Field"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electrical_field ( Electrical Field )"
msgid "Summons a field of electricity."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "electrical_field ( Electrical Field )"
msgid "zzzpptttt!"
msgstr "zzzpptttt!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "lightning_field"
msgid "Lightning Field"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "lightning_field ( Lightning Field )"
msgid "Summons a field of lightning."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "lightning_field ( Lightning Field )"
msgid "cracklezzbit!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_reveal_overmap_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Like a Bird on the Wing"
msgstr "Comme un Oiseau Parcourant les Cieux"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_reveal_overmap_spell ( Like a Bird on the
#. Wing )"
msgid ""
"Concentrating for a moment, you can hurl your senses into the air, seeing the "
"landscape spread out before you.  This spell only works outdoors."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_charge_dash_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stormwind Stride"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_charge_dash_spell ( Stormwind Stride )"
msgid "Charge forward like a sudden gust of wind."
msgstr "Charger en une ligne droite comme une soudaine bouffée de vent."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_increase_ally_speed_spell ( Favonian
#. Murmuration )"
msgid ""
"With a burst of fae magick, you infuse the speed of the west wind into one of "
"your allies, allowing them to move much more quickly for a time."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_bonus_melee_range_spell ( Breeze-Cutting
#. Blows )"
msgid ""
"The Sylph strikes through the air so precisely that the air itself is cut and "
"carries their force outward.  While the spell is in effect, the Sylph can "
"make melee strikes and affect distant targets."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_cultivate_goblin_fruit ( Cultivate Goblin
#. Fruit )"
msgid ""
"You may spin a bit of fae magic into the winds, bringing forth a goblin "
"fruit.  Goblin fruit have a variety of effects, never predictable but always "
"at least somewhat beneficial.  This spell may only be cast outdoors in "
"natural surroundings."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_air_sprite"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Call the Children of the Winds"
msgstr "Appeler les Enfants des Vents"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_air_sprite ( Call the Children of the Winds
#. )"
msgid "A lesser air elemental is summoned to support you."
msgstr "Invoque un petit élémental d'air pour vous aider."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ominous_wind"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ominous Wind"
msgstr "Vent Menaçant"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ominous_wind ( Ominous Wind )"
msgid ""
"A whistling wind gusts past your shoulder in the direction you've pointed.  "
"It creates a fearful effect in your foes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pushing_wind"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Pushing Wind"
msgstr "Vent Bousculeur"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pushing_wind ( Pushing Wind )"
msgid "Shove something away with a burst of elemental air."
msgstr "Bousculez quelque chose en arrière avec un souffle élémental d'air."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "pushing_wind ( Pushing Wind )"
msgid "You hurl your target away."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_clear_the_air"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Purifying the Air"
msgstr "Purifier l'Air"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_clear_the_air ( Purifying the Air )"
msgid ""
"Reassert the purity of the air around yourself, removing contaminants such as "
"smoke or pollen."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "sylph_clear_the_air ( Purifying the Air )"
msgid "The air begins to smell sweet."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_hindering_wind_spell ( Hindering Winds )"
msgid ""
"Surround a target with a blanket of buffeting winds, slowing them and "
"hindering their freedom of movement."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_massive_lightning_bolt_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fist of Heaven's Fury"
msgstr "Frappe de la Furie des Cieux"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_massive_lightning_bolt_spell ( Fist of
#. Heaven's Fury )"
msgid ""
"Call down a thundering lightning bolt to blast your enemies with the fury of "
"the heavens."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "sylph_massive_lightning_bolt_spell ( Fist of Heaven's
#. Fury )"
msgid "Lightning crashes down from the heavens!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_wind_translocation_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Going Wither the Wind May Lead"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_wind_translocation_spell ( Going Wither the
#. Wind May Lead )"
msgid ""
"The wind blows where it will, through fences and open windows, across fields "
"and over rivers  The Sylph can blow with it, traveling high above the earth "
"and alighting on a location they have previously been."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_wind_translocation_attune"
msgid "Going Wither the Wind May Lead Attunement"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_wind_translocation_attune ( Going Wither the
#. Wind May Lead Attunement )"
msgid ""
"Attune to a location for later traveling.  You must attune high above the "
"earth and outdoors."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sylph Skin"
msgstr "Peau Sylphique"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sylph Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin has turned the rolling grey of the clouds.  Your skin is now an "
"ever-shifting color of clouds shifting from stormy to rainy to barely there.  "
"This has no gameplay effects."
msgstr ""
"La couleur de votre peau s'est altérée vers une teinte grisâtre de nuages "
"tour à tour issus d'un ciel orageux, menaçant de la pluie, paisible comme par "
"une journée de soleil et étirés comme par des vents puissants.  Ceci n'a "
"aucun effet notable."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Cloud Skin"
msgstr "Peau Nuageuse"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Storm Skin"
msgstr "Peau de Tonerre"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Breathe Without Air"
msgstr "Respirer sans Air"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Breathe Without Air"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to breathe without "
"oxygen.  This will prevent damage from a lack of oxygen."
msgstr ""
"En obtenant ce pouvoir, le Sylphe gagne la capacité de respirer sans oxygène. "
"Ceci vous permettra de ne pas prendre de dégâts dans une situation où vous "
"n'avez pas d'oxygène."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sylph Eyes"
msgstr "Yeux Sylphiques"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sylph Eyes"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph's eyes begin reflecting their mood with "
"lightning and storms when angry and clear skies when happy.  Glare no longer "
"impacts them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sylph Ears"
msgstr "Oreilles Sylphiques"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sylph Ears"
msgid ""
"The Sylph's ears are longer and pointed, like a wisp of cloud trailing across "
"the sky.  They can hear better and no matter how loud the thunder, their ears "
"will not ring from it."
msgstr ""
"Des oreilles sylphiques longues et pointues, comme un brin de nuage s'étirant "
"dans le ciel et permettant aux sylphes d'entendre mieux que la normale peut "
"importe vent et pluie,  et empêchant le tonnerre de les assourdir."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Voice of Thunder"
msgstr "Voix Tonitruante"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Voice of Thunder"
msgid ""
"The Sylph can make their voice boom like a peal of thunder, shouting so "
"loudly that they can be heard from hundreds of yards away."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Clap of Thunder"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to create a loud clap "
"of thunder noise at a distance."
msgstr ""
"Ce pouvoir permet au Sylphe de créer de puissants bruits de coup de tonnerre "
"à distance."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ominous Wind"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to summon and ominous "
"wind that damages sapient creatures morale."
msgstr ""
"Ce pouvoir permet au Sylphe d'invoquer un vent sinistre capable de briser le "
"courage d'une créature capable de ressentir de la peur."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stormwind Stride"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to rush forward in a "
"burst of wind."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Favonian Murmuration"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability increase the speed of "
"one of their allies."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Like a Bird on the Wing"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to see surrounding "
"terrain as though standing on high."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Breeze-Cutting Blows"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to strike so precisely "
"that the air will carry their melee attacks a short distance."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Slow Fall"
msgstr "Chute Lente"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Slow Fall"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph ceases to fall at speeds that would "
"damage themselves, no matter how high the fall is."
msgstr ""
"Ce pouvoir permet au Sylphe de ralentir une chute à une vitesse dangereuse "
"qui pourrait le blesser, peu importe sa hauteur."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Carried on the Breeze"
msgstr "Porté(e) par la Brise"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Carried on the Breeze"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph can direct their falls, moving "
"horizontally in a gust of wind if they step off a ledge and landing safely on "
"the ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Updraft Leap"
msgstr "Bond d'Air Ascendant"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Updraft Leap"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph can leap straight into the air, riding "
"the wind currents for a few seconds before descending to the earth."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Resist Cold"
msgstr "Resister au Froid"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Resist Cold"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Born of a Gale"
msgid "The Sylph gains a resistance to cold and cold based damage."
msgstr "Ce pouvoir offre au Sylphe une résistance au froid et aux dégâts de froid."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Born of a Gale"
msgstr "Né(e) d'un Coup de Vent"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Dancing On Winter Winds"
msgstr "Dancer sur les Brises Hivernales"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Dancing On Winter Winds"
msgid ""
"The sylph is nearly immune to mundane cold and heavily resistant to "
"cold-based damage."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wind-Carried Weapons"
msgstr "Armes Poussées par le Vent"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wind-Carried Weapons"
msgid ""
"The winds surge around the Sylph as they attack, guiding their projectiles to "
"the target.  The range of the Sylph's weapons is increased."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Winds Guide Me"
msgstr "Les Vents Me Guident"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Winds Guide Me"
#, no-c-format
msgid "When outdoors, the Sylph moves 10% faster."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Outrunning the Gale"
msgstr "Courir plus vite que la Tempête"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Outrunning the Gale"
#, no-c-format
msgid "When outdoors, the Sylph moves 10% faster and has +10% increased speed."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Gusting Evasion"
msgstr "Esquives Soufflantes"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Gusting Evasion"
msgid ""
"The Sylph slips away from attacks as easily as the wind finds its way through "
"cracks in a wall.  They gain +1 bonus dodge attempt per turn (+2 if they have "
"the Sylph trait)."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to grow a goblin fruit "
"when outdoors and the wind is blowing strongly."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Pushing Wind"
msgid "The Sylph learns how to use the wind to push their opponents."
msgstr "Ce pouvoir permet au Sylphe d'utiliser le vent pour repousser ses ennemis."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Hindering Winds"
msgid ""
"The Sylph learns how to surround a single target with buffeting winds, "
"slowing their movements and knocking them off-balance."
msgstr ""
"Ce pouvoir permet au Sylphe d'apprendre comment encercler un cible avec des "
"bourrasques violentes luttant contre ses mouvements et la déstabilisant."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Purifying the Air"
msgid ""
"The Sylph can remove contaminants from the air such as smoke or pollen and "
"leave only pure air behind."
msgstr ""
"Un Sylphe est capable d'extraire les matières contaminant l'air dans ses "
"environs comme de la fumée ou du pollen et ainsi le purifier."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Electrical Emissions"
msgstr "Émissions Électriques"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Electrical Emissions"
msgid ""
"Sylphs often develop electrical emissions that can culminate in lightning "
"bolts."
msgstr ""
"Un Sylphe peut utiliser les charges électriques ambiantes pour lancer des "
"éclairs."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Electrical Field"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to summon electrical "
"fields."
msgstr "Ce pouvoir permet à un Sylphe d'invoquer un nuage électrique."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fist of Heaven's Fury"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to call down the "
"thunderstorm's judgement on a location while outdoors."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Call the Children of the Winds"
msgid "Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to summon an air sprite."
msgstr "Ce pouvoir permet à un Sylphe d'invoquer un petit élémental d'air."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fulgurating Strikes"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fulgurating Strikes"
msgid ""
"At will, the Sylph may cause their attacks to carry a charge, whose power "
"grows with their mastery of lightning.  Each attack costs mana while this "
"trait is active."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Spring Breeze Stride"
msgstr "Foulée de la Brise de Printemps"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Spring Breeze Stride"
msgid "The Sylph's moves like the wind.  +2 Dexterity."
msgstr "Le sylphe glisse comme le vent.  +2 Dextérité."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Storm-Runner's Speed"
msgstr "Vitesse du Chevaucheur de Tempêtes"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Storm-Runner's Speed"
msgid "The Sylph's moves like a sudden burst of wind.  +5 Dexterity."
msgstr "Les mouvements du sylphe ont la violence de bourrasques.  +5 Dextérité."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ice-Clear Thoughts"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ice-Clear Thoughts"
msgid "The Sylph's mind has the clarity of pure frozen water.  +2 Intelligence."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Lightning Mind"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Lightning Mind"
msgid "The Sylph's thoughts move as quickly as a bolt of lightning.  +4 Intelligence."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Eagle's Sight"
msgid ""
"Like a bird soaring on the wind, the Sylph's keen eyes take in their "
"surroundings.  +3 Perception."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Zephyr Chant"
msgstr "Chant de Zéphyr"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Zephyr Chant"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like the blowing winds, the Sylph's mana races from of their body at their "
"command.  -20% spell casting speed when outdoors."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Whistling Zephyr Chant"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Whistling Zephyr Chant"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The wind finds it way through any crack, and so does the Sylph's mana come to "
"their call regardless of what movements they make.  -20% spell casting speed "
"when outdoors and the Sylph no longer needs to gesture to use their magick."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Surmounting the Clouds"
msgstr "Surmonter les Nuages"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Surmounting the Clouds"
msgid ""
"Born of the winds, the Sylph can walk on them as easily as the ground.  While "
"this trait is active, the Sylph will not fall and may walk on the air as they "
"like.  It requires 3 mana per turn to fuel their steps."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Going Wither the Wind May Lead"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to travel along the "
"blowing winds to another location they have previously been to."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Body of Cloud"
msgstr "Corps Nuageux"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Body of Cloud"
msgid ""
"The Sylph may transform into misty cloud.  They will be insubstantial and "
"unable to interact with the environment, but also able to move incredibly "
"quickly and attacks will simply pass through them.  Each second in the cloud "
"form will cost 10 mana."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Body of Cloud Appearance"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Body of Cloud Appearance"
msgid ""
"This mutation carries the sprite override info for Body of Cloud.  You "
"shouldn't be able to see it in game."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "As Free as the Wind"
msgstr "Aussi Libre que le Vent"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "As Free as the Wind"
msgid ""
"Like the wind, the Sylph goes where they will with no one to stop them.  They "
"are immune to anything that would restrict their movement, such as grabs, "
"terrain costs, or slippery terrain."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Winds Always At My Back"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Winds Always At My Back"
msgid ""
"The winds surround the Sylph and carry them along regardless of their "
"physical condition.  They suffer no penalties to dexterity or speed due to "
"pain."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_spell_learning_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CLAP_OF_THUNDER"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_OMINOUS_WIND"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_PUSHING_WIND"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CLEAR_THE_AIR"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_ELECTRICAL_EMISSIONS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CHARGE_DASH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_INCREASE_ALLY_SPEED"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_BONUS_MELEE_RANGE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_REVEAL_OVERMAP"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_SUMMON_AIR_SPRITE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CLOUD_OF_STEAM"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CREATE_LIGHT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CALL_LIGHTNING"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CRASH_OF_LIGHTNING"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_MASSIVE_LIGHTNING_BLAST"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_WIND_TRANSLOCATE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SLYPH_WIND_BLOWS_WILLOW_BENDS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CULTIVATE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_MAKE_GOSSAMER"
msgid ""
"Your time spent among the blowing winds has increased your facility with your "
"fae magicks."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_COMPLETED_ROLL_REMAINDER_ELEMENTAL_RECIPE"
msgid "These are all the ways you can alter these elements now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SUCCESFUL_ROLL_REMAINDER_ELEMENTAL_RECIPE"
msgid "You learn how to alter an element."
msgstr "Vous apprenez comment altérer un élément."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_UNDINE_LEARN_SALTWATER_TO_FRESHWATER"
msgid ""
"Drawn from some atavistic well, knowledge of how to turn fresh water into "
"salt water, and vice versa, fills your mind."
msgstr ""
"Puisé d'une ancienne source de savoir, une Ondine possédant ce pouvoir "
"apprends soudainement comment transformer de l'eau salée en eau douce et "
"vice-versa."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_LEARN_FOUL_WATER"
msgid ""
"Drawn from some atavistic well, knowledge of how to turn foul water into "
"clean, pure water, and vice versa, fills your mind."
msgstr ""
"Puisé d'une ancienne source de savoir, une Ondine possédant ce pouvoir "
"apprends soudainement comment rendre de l'eau trouble et malsaine et "
"inversement comment en faire de l'eau douce et potable."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_LEARN_LIQUID_TO_WATER"
msgid ""
"Drawn from some atavistic well, knowledge of how to turn various other "
"liquids directly into water fills your mind."
msgstr ""
"Puisé d'une ancienne source de savoir, une Ondine possédant ce pouvoir "
"apprends soudainement comment créer de l'eau à partir de liquides variés."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
msgid ""
"You must be standing in water or near a large body of water to call forth a "
"goblin fruit."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_WATER_FORM_ON"
msgid "Your body falls apart in a rush of water."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_WATER_FORM_OFF"
msgid "Your body reconstitutes itself from the waters."
msgstr "Votre corps se reconstitue à partir des eaux."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_fog"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Create Fog"
msgstr "Créer Brouillard"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_fog ( Create Fog )"
msgid "Summons a field of fog."
msgstr "Invoque une zone de brouillard."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "create_fog ( Create Fog )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "acidic_mist ( Acidic Mist )"
msgid "sussurus!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "create_fog ( Create Fog )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "fog_bank ( Fog Bank )"
#. ~ Message of spell "fog_bank ( Fog Bank )"
#. ~ Message of spell "acidic_mist ( Acidic Mist )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "deadly_mist ( Deadly Mist )"
#. ~ Message of spell "deadly_mist ( Deadly Mist )"
msgid "whoosh!"
msgstr "pioouu!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "fog_bank"
msgid "Fog Bank"
msgstr "Banc de Brouillard"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "fog_bank ( Fog Bank )"
msgid "Summons a bank of fog."
msgstr "Invoque un banc de brouillard."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "grant_buoyancy"
msgid "Grant buoyancy"
msgstr "Accorder flottaison"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "grant_buoyancy ( Grant buoyancy )"
msgid "You become more buoyant."
msgstr "Vous flottez plus aisèment."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "acidic_mist"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Acidic Mist"
msgstr "Brume Acide"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "acidic_mist ( Acidic Mist )"
msgid "Summons an acidic mist."
msgstr "Invoque une brume acidique."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "deadly_mist"
msgid "Deadly Mist"
msgstr "Brume Meurtrière"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "deadly_mist ( Deadly Mist )"
msgid "Summons a deadly mist."
msgstr "Invoque une brume mortelle."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "water_pocket"
msgid "Water Pocket"
msgstr "Poche d'Eau"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "water_pocket ( Water Pocket )"
msgid ""
"This spell summons a pocket made of churning water that contains an air "
"bubble inside and prevents any items in it from being damaged by water."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "undine_acid_resist_ally_spell ( Caustic Cloak )"
msgid ""
"Weave a cloak of fae magicks around a target, surrounding them with a thin "
"shell of acidic mist.  This protects them somewhat from acid damage and will "
"sometimes damage an attacker as well."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "undine_cultivate_goblin_fruit ( Cultivate Goblin
#. Fruit )"
msgid ""
"You may spin a bit of fae magic into the waters, bringing forth a goblin "
"fruit.  Goblin fruit have a variety of effects, never predictable but always "
"at least somewhat beneficial.  This spell may only be cast when standing or "
"water or a near a large body of water."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "undine_bash_and_slow_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Crushing Pressure"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "undine_bash_and_slow_spell ( Crushing Pressure )"
msgid ""
"You may bring the force of the ocean's depths onto your enemy, crushing them "
"and slowing them briefly."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "undine_drag_inward_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Whirlpool Catches the Shoal"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "undine_drag_inward_spell ( Whirlpool Catches the
#. Shoal )"
msgid ""
"Create a whirling field of magickal waters, dragging everything within it "
"toward a central point and slowing them with the force of the current."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "wave_rider"
msgid "Summon Wave Rider"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "wave_rider ( Summon Wave Rider )"
msgid "You summon a water based vehicle to propel you across the waves."
msgstr ""
"Vous invoquez un véhicule à partir des eaux capable de vous propulser à "
"travers les vagues."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_fish"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Summon Fish"
msgstr "Invoquer Poisson"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_fish ( Summon Fish )"
msgid "A fish arrives from somewhere.  It may not be that useful on land."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "charm_fish"
msgid "Charm Fish"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "charm_fish ( Charm Fish )"
msgid "A friendly fish arrives from somewhere.  It may not be that useful on land."
msgstr ""
"Un poisson allié arrive de quelque part. Ceci pourrait ne pas être très utile "
"à terre."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_kraken"
msgid "Summon Kraken"
msgstr "Invoquer Kraken"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_kraken ( Summon Kraken )"
msgid "A friendly kraken arrives from somewhere.  It may not be that useful on land."
msgstr ""
"Un kraken allié arrive de quelque part. Ceci pourrait ne pas être très utile "
"à terre."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_water_sprite"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Calling the Children of the Waves"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_water_sprite ( Calling the Children of the
#. Waves )"
msgid "A lesser water elemental is summoned to support you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "undine_tidal_wave_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Tidal Wave"
msgstr "Raz-de-marée"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "undine_tidal_wave_spell ( Tidal Wave )"
msgid ""
"Create a magickal wall of water and bring it crashing down on your enemies, "
"buffeting and carrying them away."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Undine Skin"
msgstr "Peau Ondine"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Undine Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin has turned the color of the Mediterranean Sea.  Your skin is now a "
"brilliant turquoise color.  This has no gameplay effects."
msgstr ""
"La couleur de votre peau s'est altérée vers un turquoise frappant rappelant "
"les eaux de la Méditerranée.  Ceci n'a aucun effet notable."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Liquid Skin"
msgstr "Peau Liquide"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wave Skin"
msgstr "Peau Ondulante"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Create Fog"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine gains the ability to create a cloud of "
"fog."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Grant Buoyancy"
msgstr "Accorder Flottaison"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Grant Buoyancy"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine gains the ability to grant one person "
"the ability to float and swim."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Acidic Mist"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine gains the ability to create an acidic "
"mist that damages any creatures inside it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Caustic Cloak"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine gains the ability to weave an "
"enchantment on an ally which will protect them from acid and causes anything "
"who attacks that ally to be splashed with acid themselves."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine gains the ability to grow a goblin fruit "
"from a natural water source."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "One Foot in the River and One in the Sea"
msgstr "Un Pied dans la Rivière et Un dans la Mer"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "One Foot in the River and One in the Sea"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine learns how to convert salt water into "
"freshwater and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"Une Ondine possédant ce pouvoir apprend soudainement comment convertir de "
"l'eau douce en de l'eau salée et vice-versa."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Breathe Underwater"
msgstr "Respiration Aquatique"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Breathe Underwater"
msgid "The Undine has gained the ability to breathe underwater."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Cleansing the Poison Well"
msgstr "Assainir le Puit Empoisonné"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cleansing the Poison Well"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine learns how to foul water, making it "
"murky and possibly infested.  Conversely, the Undine can also cleanse water "
"that is not already clean."
msgstr ""
"Une Ondine possédant ce pouvoir apprend soudainement comment troubler de "
"l'eau et la rendre sale ainsi qu'inversement rendre de l'eau malsaine propre."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Return to Primordial Waters"
msgstr "Ramener aux Eaux Primordiales"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Return to Primordial Waters"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine learns how to convert various liquids "
"into freshwater."
msgstr ""
"Une Ondine possédant ce pouvoir apprend soudainement comment convertir des "
"liquides variés en de l'eau douce."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Resist Fire"
msgstr "Résister les Flammes"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Resist Fire"
msgid "You've gained a resistance to fire."
msgstr "Vous avez obtenue une résistance aux flammes."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Resist Acid"
msgstr "Resister à l'Acide"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Resist Acid"
msgid "You've gained a resistance to acid."
msgstr "Vous avez obtenue une résistance à l'acide."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Sea Bears Me Up"
msgstr "La Mer me Soulève"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Sea Bears Me Up"
msgid ""
"The waves themselves answer your call and support you, allowing you to walk "
"on the surface of the water.  Activate to walk on water."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Let the Waves Wash Over Me"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Let the Waves Wash Over Me"
msgid ""
"As the Undine is one with the waters, so too is anything they carry.  Their "
"gear is immune to being dissolved or broken by water."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Summon Rain"
msgstr "Invoquer Pluie"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Summon Rain"
msgid "Allows the Undine to change the weather to rain.  (Currently not working)"
msgstr ""
"Permet à l'Ondine d'altérer la météo et causer de la pluie.  (Ne fonctionne "
"pas pour l'instant)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Summon Fish"
msgid ""
"Allows the Undine to summon fish and eventually charm them.  Practice this "
"enough and you will be able to befriend sea monsters."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Crushing Pressure"
msgid ""
"Allows the Undine to slow and damage a single target, as though they were "
"caught in the depths of the ocean."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Whirlpool Catches the Shoal"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Tidal Wave"
msgid ""
"Allows the Undine to force an entire group inward toward a central point, as "
"though caught in a whirlpool."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Undine Eyes"
msgstr "Yeux Ondins"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Undine Eyes"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine's eyes begin reflecting their mood with "
"colors of the deep waters, pitch black when angry or sad and green-blue when "
"pleased.  Glare no longer impacts them, and neither do light levels when "
"trying to sleep.  They can also see without problem underwater."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Undine Ears"
msgstr "Oreilles Ondines"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Undine Ears"
msgid ""
"The Undine's ears are longer and pointed, like a stream of water poured into "
"a glass from on high.  This is purely cosmetic."
msgstr ""
"Des oreilles ondines, longues et pointues, comme de l'eau se déversant d'un "
"verre. Ceci est purement cosmétique."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Calling the Children of the Waves"
msgid ""
"Allows the Undine to summon a minor water elemental to support them in the "
"world for a short time."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Embrace of the Waters"
msgstr "Étreinte des Eaux"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Embrace of the Waters"
msgid ""
"Surrounded by the waters, Undines find it easy to rest.  Falling asleep "
"underwater is easy for you, and you spend less time asleep when you rest "
"there.  You can also eat underwater, though you can't drink."
msgstr ""
"Les créatures ondines trouvent le sommeil plus aisément submergées par les "
"eaux, et ce sommeil plus reposant sera ainsi plus court. Il  vous est aussi "
"possible de manger sous l'eau, boire est malheureusement impossible immergé."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Sea Sustains Me"
msgstr "La Mer Apaise ma Soif"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Sea Sustains Me"
msgid ""
"Undines are born of the flowing waters and the waters provide for their "
"children.  While submerged in fresh water, any thirst you have will be slaked."
msgstr ""
"Les créatures ondines sont nées des eaux vives et celles-ci veillent sur "
"elles. Submergé(e) dans de l'eau douce, votre soif sera automatiquement "
"satisfaite."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Flow Like Water"
msgid ""
"With the Undine's more fluid skin has come more fluid motion.  Activate this "
"trait to immediately escape a grab and suffer less damage from falls for a "
"few seconds."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Like a Fish in the River"
msgstr "Comme un Poisson dans la Rivière"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Like a Fish in the River"
msgid ""
"The Undines are born of the waters and water is their home.  This trait "
"allows them to move much faster when in water."
msgstr ""
"Les ondines sont nées des eaux et celles-ci sont leur foyer.  Ce trait vous "
"permet de bouger beaucoup plus rapidement à travers de l'eau."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Crashing Waves"
msgstr "Vagues Déferlantes"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Crashing Waves"
msgid ""
"The waters come to the Undine's defense.  When attacked, there is a chance "
"that a burst of water will surge out and push their attackers back."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Pounding Surf Strikes"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Pounding Surf Strikes"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like the relentless pounding of the waves against the shore, the Undine's "
"strikes hammer into their enemies.  While this trait is active, the Undine "
"does 25% more melee damage."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "All Rivers Flow to the Sea"
msgstr "Toutes les Rivières Mènent à la Mer"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "All Rivers Flow to the Sea"
msgid ""
"Water falls as rain, flows into streams, and then into rivers to the sea, and "
"rises as clouds to fall as rain once again.  While submerged in a river, "
"lake, or the ocean, the Undine can exploit this connection to locate other "
"sources of water."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Waves Erode the Stones"
msgstr "L'Eau Érode les Pierres"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Waves Erode the Stones"
msgid ""
"Even the weakest waves will erode the strongest rock, given enough time.  +1 "
"Strength."
msgstr ""
"Même les vagues les plus faibles érodent les pierres les plus solides au bout "
"d'un certain temps. +1 Force."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Waves Erode the Shore"
msgstr "Les Vagues Érodent le Littoral"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Waves Erode the Shore"
msgid ""
"Year by year, meter by meter, the waves gradually erode the beaches.  +3 "
"Strength."
msgstr "Année par année, mètre par mètre, les vagues érodent les plages. +3 Force."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Grace of the Creek"
msgstr "Grâce du Ruisseau"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Grace of the Creek"
msgid ""
"The Undine's flexibility has increased, allowing them to move in increasingly "
"more fluid ways.  +2 Dexterity."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Grace of the Stream"
msgstr "Grâce de la Rivière"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Grace of the Stream"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like the babbling brook, the Undine flows over everything in their way.  +4 "
"Dexterity.  However, they must also drink 15% more water."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Grace of the River"
msgstr "Grâce du Fleuve"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Grace of the River"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like the flowing river, the Undine can twist back on themselves and pass "
"through any obstacle.  +6 Dexterity.  However, they must also drink 25% more "
"water."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Seeing the Depths"
msgstr "Observer les Profondeurs"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Seeing the Depths"
msgid ""
"The Undine's senses take in their environment like a fisher gazing to the "
"bottom of a clear pond.  +2 Perception."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Pond's Depths Do Not Freeze"
msgstr "Le Fond de l'Étang Ne Gèle Pas"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Pond's Depths Do Not Freeze"
msgid ""
"Though the ice over the top grows thick, the water below remains liquid.  The "
"Undine is completely immune to cold temperatures when underwater."
msgstr ""
"Même si une couche de glace épaisse recouvre la surface, l'eau en dessous "
"reste liquide. L'Ondine est totalement insensible au froid lorsque celle-ci "
"est submergée."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fluid Body"
msgstr "Corps Fluide"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fluid Body"
msgid ""
"Even the Undine's internal organs are becoming more liquid.  Bashing and "
"cutting damage is reduced even further, and ballistic damage is halved.  "
"However, the Undine needs to drink more water."
msgstr ""
"Même les organes internes de l'Ondine sont partiellement liquides. Les dégâts "
"contendants et coupants sont encore davantage atténués, et les dégâts "
"balistiques sont réduits de moitié. Malheureusement, les besoins d'eau de "
"l'Ondine sont accrus."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Like the Flowing Fountain"
msgstr "Comme une Fontaine Vive"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Like the Flowing Fountain"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like the fountain continuously flowing with water, the Undine's mana "
"regenerates 50% faster while standing in or under water."
msgstr ""
"Comme une fontaine dont l'eau est constamment remplacée, la mana de l'Ondine "
"se régénère 50% plus vite lorsque celle-ci se tient dans ou sous l'eau."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Like the Rushing Fountain"
msgstr "Comme une Fontaine Rugissante"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Like the Rushing Fountain"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like the fountain continuously flowing to the brim with water, the Undine's "
"mana regenerates 50% faster and they have 50% more mana while standing in or "
"under water."
msgstr ""
"Comme un fontaine aux flots rugissants, la mana de l'Ondine se régénère 50% "
"plus vite et a un maximum augmenté de 50% lorsque celle-ci se tient dans ou "
"sous l'eau."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Like the Overflowing Fountain"
msgstr "Comme une Fontaine Débordante"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Like the Overflowing Fountain"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like the fountain overflowing with water, the Undine's mana regenerates 50% "
"faster, they have 50% more mana, and their stamina regenerates 100% faster "
"while standing in or under water."
msgstr ""
"Comme une fontaine débordant d'eau, la mana de l'Ondine régénère 50% plus "
"vite, a un maximum augmenté de 50%, et son endurance régénère 100% plus vite "
"lorsque celle-ci se tient dans ou sous l'eau."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Form of the Flowing Waters"
msgstr "Forme des Eaux Vives"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Form of the Flowing Waters"
msgid ""
"You may transform your body into pure water, becoming much more difficult to "
"hurt (except by fire), able to flow easily over all terrain, and capable of "
"moving much faster and more stealthily when in water.  However, you will be "
"unable to attack, cold will do triple damage to you, and cold weather will "
"affect you more."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Water Form"
msgstr "Forme Liquide"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Water Form"
msgid ""
"You are a mass of pure water.  It is much harder to damage you, and you can "
"move over any terrain without penalty, but you cannot attack."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Watery Camouflage"
msgstr "Camouflage Aquatique"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Watery Camouflage"
msgid ""
"Being made entirely of water, it is easy for you to disguise yourself when "
"underwater."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Sea Is Always With Me"
msgstr "La Mère Est Toujours De Mon Côté"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Sea Is Always With Me"
msgid ""
"The Undine can draw a bit of extra water into their watery skin, fortifying "
"them for journeys away from a water source."
msgstr ""
"Une Ondine peut emmagasiner un peu d'eau dans sa peau fluide lui permettant "
"de mieux endurer les déplacements éloignés de plans d'eau."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_spell_learning_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_CREATE_FOG"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_GRANT_BUOYANCY"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_ACIDIC_MIST"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_DEADLY_MIST"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_WAVE_RIDER"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_WATER_SEALED"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_SUMMON_FISH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_CHARM_FISH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_SUMMON_KRAKEN"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_ACID_RESIST_ALLY"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_BASH_AND_SLOW_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_DRAG_INWARD_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_TIDAL_WAVE_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_SUMMON_WATER_SPRITE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_CLOUD_OF_STEAM"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_CULTIVATE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_MAKE_GOSSAMER"
msgid ""
"Your time spent among the flowing waters has increased your facility with "
"your fae magicks."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
msgid "Lady Boann"
msgstr "Dame Boann"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "fae noblewoman"
msgstr "noble fée"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Job description of "fae noblewoman" NPC class
msgid "I'm in charge of the faeries of my court."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Begone, slayer.  I will have no dealings with you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Greetings, kinsman."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Greetings, kinswoman."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Greetings, elder cousin."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Greetings, nightwalker."
msgstr "Salutations rôdeur⋅se nocturne."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Greetings, child of the moon."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Greetings, mortal."
msgstr "Salutations mortel·le."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Greetings."
msgstr "Salutations."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I-"
msgstr "Je-"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Boann dismissively waves a hand before you can say anything, and you are "
"enveloped by a swirl of multicolored lights."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I came here with my court when the Hedge between our worlds thinned and the "
"border marches expanded.  They came for conquest and I came here for "
"coexistence."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So you're a good faerie?"
msgstr "Donc vous êtes une bonne fée?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How can I join your court?"
msgstr "Comment puis-je rejoindre votre cour?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I am ready to leave this world for yours."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about the Jabberwock."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about the march lords."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about that dog."
msgstr "J'aimerais un peu plus d'information sur ce chien."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about the Mi-Go guards."
msgstr "J'aimerais un peu plus d'information sur les gardes Mi-Go."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about the armored centipede."
msgstr "J'aimerais un peu plus d'information sur le centipède blindé."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about the automaton."
msgstr "J'aimerais un peu plus d'information sur l'automate."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about the triffid heart"
msgstr "J'aimerais un peu plus d'information sur le cœur triffide."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about the titan stag beetle"
msgstr "J'aimerais un peu plus d'information sur le lucane titanesque."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about the shadow and its piece"
msgstr ""
"J'aimerais un peu plus d'information sur l'ombre ténébreuse et comment en "
"obtenir un morceau."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about the star-crowned hound"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed the Jabberwock.  [Give her the heart]"
msgstr "Je suis de retour, le Jaseroque est mort, voici son cœur."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_melian_mantis_mount' in an effect
msgid "Bladepetal"
msgstr "Lame-Pétale"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed the March Lords."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed that dog-like thing."
msgstr "Je suis de retour, la chose ressemblant à un chien est morte."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed the Mi-Go guards."
msgstr "Je suis de retour, les gardes Mi-Go sont morts."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed the armored centipede"
msgstr "Je suis de retour, le centipède blindé est mort."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed the automaton."
msgstr "Je suis de retour, l'automate est hors de service."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed the triffid heart.  [Give her the heart chunk]"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed the titan stag beetle"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed the Shadow.  [Give her the piece of shadow]"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed the star-crowned hound"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Some of my kind might find that word pejorative, but it's what you've called "
"us for so very long.  It had been quite a while since we were last able to "
"come in numbers to this world, until the last few years."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Why were you able to return?"
msgstr "Pourquoi furent vous capable de revenir?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Well those of us who aren't faeries have other places to be now."
msgstr ""
"Et bien ceux d'entre nous qui ne sommes pas des fées ont d'autres endroit ou "
"être a ce moment."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The same thing that is causing the portal storms made travel between our "
"worlds easier again.  We have to engage in fairly strenuous decontamination "
"procedures on our way back but we've had those in place for aeons."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Decontamination?  You can leave here and not worry about the risen dead?"
msgstr ""
"Décontamination? Vous pouvez quitter cet endroit et ne pas vous soucier des "
"morts réanimés?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How can I join your court?  I want to leave here when you do!"
msgstr "Comment puis-je rejoindre votre cour? Je veux partir avec vous!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm going to head on now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"If we die here, we will rise just like you, we are within the belly of the "
"beast, so to speak here.  But yes when we go elsewhere we don't bring this "
"with us, that would be rude."
msgstr ""
"Si nous mourrons ici, nous ne relèverons de la même façon que vous, nous "
"sommes dans la panse de la bête ici, pour ainsi dire. Mais oui lorsque nous "
"nous déplaçons quelque part d'autre nous n'amenont pas ceci avec nous, cela "
"serait un comportement très grossier."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Please take me away with you."
msgstr "S'il vous plaît, emmenez-moi avec vous."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I haven't decided if I believe you or not but I'll see you around."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai pas décidé(e) si je vous croit ou non, mais je suppose que je vous "
"reverrais un autre jour."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Well you can't just join by asking, you need to accomplish a series of "
"progressively more difficult quests, bringing me trophies and relics proving "
"your worth to join our ranks."
msgstr ""
"Vous ne pouvez pas vous joindre à moi juste en demandant, vous avez besoin "
"d'accomplir une liste de quêtes progressivement plus ardues, m'amenant "
"trophées et reliques pour prouver votre valeur et remporter l'honneur de "
"rejoindre nos rangs."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Do you have a quest for me now?"
msgstr "Avez-vous une quête pour moi?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I have no other quests for you.  Once you'll have completed them all, you'll "
"become part of my court and allowed to move offworld when you will wish so."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"(Boann hands you a list) Here is a list of the quests to complete to become "
"part of my court.  They are very difficult, but their rewards will be worth "
"it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I have no new quests for now.  Once you'll have completed them, you'll become "
"one of my knights and able to accomplish the quests that will make you a "
"member of my court."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"(Boann hands you a list) Here is a list of the quests to complete to become "
"one of my knights.  Take your time, they can be accomplished when you want."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "And when I'll be a knight you'll bring me out of here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Bring me the heart of a Jabberwock]"
msgstr "[Ramenez-moi le cœur d'un Jaseroque]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Find and kill two March Lords]"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Kill the suspicious dog]"
msgstr "[Tuez le chien louche]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Kill five Mi-Go guards]"
msgstr "[Tuez cinq gardes Mi-go]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Kill an armored centipede]"
msgstr "[Tuez un centipède blindé]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Kill the remains of a dreamforged automaton]"
msgstr "[Tuez les vestiges d'un automate oniriques]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Bring me back a chunk of a triffid heart]"
msgstr "[Ramenez-moi un morceau de cœur triffide]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Kill a titan stag beetle]"
msgstr "[Tuez un lucane titanesque]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Bring me back a piece of the darkest shadow]"
msgstr "[Ramenez-moi un morceau d'ombre ténébreuse]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Kill a star-crowned hound]"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You won't be a member of my court yet.  After another few quests, you will, "
"and you along with all those that follow you will be brought out of this "
"world whenever you wish so."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can I see the quest list again?"
msgstr "Pouvez-vous me lister les quêtes disponibles à nouveau?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me the heart of a Jabberwock"
msgid ""
"Prove to me that you have the heart of a knight.  Bring me the putrid heart "
"of a Jabberwock."
msgstr ""
"Prouvez-moi que vous avez le cœur d'un chevalier. Amenez-moi le cœur putride "
"d'un Jaseroque."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the Jabberwock?"
msgstr "Je vais m'en charger. Où est-ce que je peux trouver ce Jaseroque?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Do you have any advice?"
msgstr "Vous avez des conseils pour moi?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm not sure if I want to do it.  See you."
msgstr "Je ne suis pas sûr·e de vouloir m'occuper de ça.  À plus tard."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You will need incredible melee skills to handle this or an impressive gun.  "
"Otherwise it do not have hidden tricks or notable intelligence so it'll be a "
"straightforward fight."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can I see the other quests first?"
msgstr "Puis-je savoir quelles autres quêtes sont disponibles d'abord?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me the heart of a Jabberwock"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill two March lords in my name"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill this suspicious dog for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill five Mi-Go guards for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill an armored centipede for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill the remains of a dreamforged automaton"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a chunk of a triffid heart"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a titan stag beetle for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a piece of the darkest shadow"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a star-crowned hound in my name"
msgid "I had no doubts in you."
msgstr "Je n'avais aucun doute que vous réussiriez."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can I see the other quests?"
msgstr "Pouvez vous m'informer d'autres quêtes?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me the heart of a Jabberwock"
msgid "I'm pleased to grant you a Melian mount of your own."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can I talk about something else?"
msgstr "Pouvons nous parler d'autre chose?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill two March lords in my name"
msgid ""
"Prove your allegiance to me.  Kill two March Lords so all will know which "
"side you fight."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it."
msgstr "Je m'en chargerais."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"They are fearsome opponents but lack long-range attacks.  You can find them "
"in the border patrol offices with their soldiers."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill two March lords in my name"
msgid "I'm pleased to grant you the right to call upon the daffodil warriors."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill this suspicious dog for me"
msgid ""
"A dog-like being has been found nearby.  Whatever it is, it's not a dog.  "
"Kill it, and I will teach you how to see beyond barriers."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the dog?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill this suspicious dog for me"
msgid ""
"Do not be deceived by its looks.  It is not a regular dog.  Be very careful "
"as we do not know what it can do."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I will now grant you the knowledge to see beyond all walls, written on this "
"parchment."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill five Mi-Go guards for me"
msgid ""
"A knight must be able to face harsh conditions.  Kill five Mi-Go guards and "
"you'll receive an object able to refuel your magical energy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the guards?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill five Mi-Go guards for me"
msgid ""
"Something to protect yourself from the fumes and heat is a must.  They are "
"smart enough to feel fear, so if they're injured enough they'll stop "
"attacking and try to flee."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it. Where's the guards?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill five Mi-Go guards for me"
msgid "Here is the object.  As promised, using it will recharge your mana."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill an armored centipede for me"
msgid ""
"A knight must know how to triumph despite their foe's armor.  Kill an armored "
"centipede and I'll grant you an insignia, so you might be recognized as one "
"of my knights."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the centipede?"
msgstr "Je vais m'en charger. Où se trouve le centipède?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill an armored centipede for me"
msgid ""
"Study the weak spots of weaker centipedes, it'll give you an advantage.  Its "
"armor isn't as effective against blunt and piercing weapon than it is against "
"slashing weapons and bullets."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill an armored centipede for me"
msgid "I'm honored to grant you this insignia."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill the remains of a dreamforged automaton"
msgid ""
"A rampaging automaton has been spotted.  Destroy it, and you'll be granted a "
"great weapon."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the automaton?"
msgstr "Je vais m'en charger.  Où se trouve l'automate?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"My scouts mentioned that it relies on electricity to attack.  Find a way to "
"shield yourself against that, and it'll be much easier to kill.  They also "
"mentioned how damaged the automaton's exposed insides are, so I wouldn't "
"attempt to use weapons that only damage the insides if I were you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm pleased to grant you this frostrimed estoc."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a chunk of a triffid heart"
msgid ""
"I want you to brave the harshest environments.  Bring me a chunk of a triffid "
"heart and I'll grant you a powerful set of armor."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the triffids?"
msgstr "Je vais m'en charger.  Où sont les triffides?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a chunk of a triffid heart"
msgid ""
"Tear gas is deadly to them.  In addition, they don't go along with anything "
"that isn't a triffid."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a chunk of a triffid heart"
msgid "I'm pleased to grant you a set of armor appropriate for a knight."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a titan stag beetle for me"
msgid ""
"A knight must be able to triumph of all beasts.  Kill a titan stag beetle and "
"you'll receive a magical musical instrument."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the beetle?"
msgstr "Je vais m'en charger. Où se trouve la lucane?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a titan stag beetle for me"
msgid ""
"Mundane weapons won't do much so try to find something that bypasses its "
"armor.  It's also very slow so keeping your distance is easy.  Learning the "
"weak points of smaller beetles and using high-power ammunitions can work too "
"but expect its shell to block most shots."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I give you Väinämöinen's Kantele.  Take care of it, it's very precious."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"There is a shadow that haunts the night.  Bring me proof that you killed it "
"and I'll grant you the right to bear my banner."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a piece of the darkest shadow"
msgid ""
"To encounter it, stand alone or accompanied by at most two allies in a field "
"or a forest at night.  It might take multiple nights for it to show itself so "
"prepare something to do while you wait.  Light massively weaken it so ensure "
"the battlefield is well lit.  Separate it from its minions, as it can create "
"more than you'll manage to kill and heal its wounds over time.  It is also "
"particularly resilient against bullets so engage in melee if you manage to "
"get close enough."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a piece of the darkest shadow"
msgid ""
"I am honored to give you this banner.  Wear it with pride, as you more than "
"earned that right."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a star-crowned hound in my name"
msgid ""
"Knight, I ask you to kill a star-crowned hound.  This will be a difficult "
"challenge but I trust that you will prevail against this mighty foe.  Kill it "
"and a necklace that will amplify your magical abilities will be yours."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the hound?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a star-crowned hound in my name"
msgid ""
"It is strong but slow, so disengaging is possible.  It will summon hounds, "
"but they quickly fade away so they aren't that much of an issue compared to "
"it.  Stand away from corners in walls as it can teleport to them.  It has no "
"armor against fire, electricity and blunt weapons but it quickly heal all its "
"wounds so continuous heavy damage is the key to kill it.  If you cannot "
"manage to injure it, do not hesitate to withdraw and try another way to kill "
"it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a star-crowned hound in my name"
msgid "I give you this necklace as a gift for your services.  May it serve you well."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Are you certain?  Leaving this world is a one-way trip.  There is still a "
"very long time before it becomes urgent to do so and many things to gain from "
"staying here a little longer."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I changed my mind.  I'll stay for now"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I am sure.  Bring me out of here.  (This will end the game)"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I am sure.  Bring me and my followers out of here.  (This will end the game)"
msgstr ""
"Je suis sûr(e). Amenez-moi et mes recrues loin de tout ça. (Cela mettra fin "
"au jeu)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"(Boann lead you and your followers to a hidden ritual circle) This is the "
"exit point.  After the ritual, you will all go through the decontamination "
"process before you are allowed to claim your own barony, as fit for a member "
"of my court.  Your followers will then claim a small part of it for their "
"homes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"(Boann lead you to a hidden ritual circle) This is the exit point.  After the "
"ritual, you'll go through the decontamination process before being allowed to "
"claim your own barony, as fit for a member of my court."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"A whole new world, filled with possibilities.  A place where the Cataclysm "
"isn't.  What you do now is another story."
msgstr ""

