msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_read_vampire_anathema_book.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_read_vampire_mentor_book.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Close the book]"
msgstr "[Fermez le livre]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_read_vampire_anathema_book.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I've been a vampire hunter since as far as I can remember.  I spent my entire "
"life killing all the vampires I could find but I recently realized that doing "
"so was futile with my current power.  I need more power.  No matter how many "
"vampires I kill, there's always more.\n"
"I became a vampire so I could kill them all, but even that wasn't enough.  "
"I've followed the mentor's instructions until they had nothing more to tell "
"me but that wasn't enough.\n"
"I need to find a way to reach power undreamt of.  To protect everyone from "
"the vampire threat, I must become the strongest vampire ever seen."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_read_vampire_anathema_book.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"After so long spent experimenting on vampire blood, I found a way to push "
"vampirism beyond its absolute limits.\n"
"By taking vampire blood, a drop of my own blood, some blood no human nor "
"vampire could ever want to drink and an assortment of poisons and toxins, it "
"is possible to apply the process of an ancient poison-making method to "
"vampire blood, forcing it to devour itself to become stronger.\n"
"When the process was over and I drank the remaining blood, I could now drink "
"vampire blood to become more of a vampire than they are, with all the power "
"this brings."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_read_vampire_anathema_book.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"After drinking enough vampire blood, I gained new abilities.  I could store "
"more blood inside me, my vampiric abilities all became stronger, I could feed "
"from vampire blood, my wounds closed at incredible speeds in the dark and "
"more.  At the point I now am, every time I drink vampire blood my vampiric "
"abilities grow stronger."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_read_vampire_anathema_book.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"In addition to manifesting more of the vampires' classical weaknesses, some "
"time after beginning to consume vampires for power I started to burn away "
"under the sun even while fully covered.\n"
"Only being indoors or underground protected me if I didn't block the sun with "
"shadows.\n"
"I did felt a passing impulse to drink more vampire blood and the first few "
"doses made me think my mind would unravel, but that passed.  It might be that "
"this path gives a single weakness not seen in other vampires to those far "
"enough on it, but testing this would require creating vampires and I won't "
"ever tolerate this."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_read_vampire_anathema_book.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"There are other hunters, but they are traitors to the cause.  All of them.\n"
"How can they attack me?  How can some of them team up with vampires to attack "
"me?\n"
"It is worse than I thought.  I am the last true hunter.  The duty of purging "
"the world of vampires is mine and mine alone now.  I still let my past allies "
"decide between running away or dying, but so many refuse to flee.\n"
"They force my hand over and over, I hope they will remember that."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_read_vampire_mentor_book.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"[You skim through the book, searching for the components your mentor told you "
"about, until you find the section with the components and their rituals]"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_read_vampire_mentor_book.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Read about the stormwrought blood]"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_read_vampire_mentor_book.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Read about the concentrated underhill essence]"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_read_vampire_mentor_book.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Read about the dream-drainer mosquito's heart]"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_read_vampire_mentor_book.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Read about the moonstruck pearl]"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_read_vampire_mentor_book.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Read about the Abyssal Hunger's shard]"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_read_vampire_mentor_book.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"To produce one unit of stormwrought blood, you need twenty-five liters of "
"blood.  Any blood a vampire can feed from will do, but you must not mix "
"different blood types or else the ritual will fail.\n"
"\n"
"This ritual needs to be done within five meters of a tear in reality, or the "
"blood will fail to attune to its energies.\n"
"\n"
"When the ritual will be completed, a storm charged with the same energies "
"will begin.  Stay in it until the blood is simmering and it'll be ready to be "
"used.  Do not worry if it doesn't fully charge the first time for these "
"storms are frequently seen these days."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_read_vampire_mentor_book.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"To extract the two liters of Fae essence the ritual requires, you will need "
"to have one lump of steel and one lump of cast iron on your person or nearby "
"enough to be included in the ritual, Fae parts and a container for the liquid "
"essence.\n"
"\n"
"Iron, and to a lesser extend steel, are anathema to the Fae, a fact that the "
"following ritual takes advantage of to separate the essence from the "
"butchered corpse by temporarily amplifying their Fae-bane properties, pushing "
"the essence out of the remains.\n"
"\n"
"Any Fae part will do, as long as their level of relative physics is higher "
"than nothing."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_read_vampire_mentor_book.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"To create a dream-drainer mosquito's heart, you'll need to gather some doses "
"of lotus blossom, a handful of wyld candies, a small pile of dreamdross and a "
"liter of Fae blood to create the dream-draining catalyst.\n"
"\n"
"Once it is completed, find a mosquito and activate the catalyst while no "
"farther than five meters away from it.  It must be a mosquito, anything else "
"won't work.  The mosquito will then gorge itself on the catalyst and will "
"suddenly transform into a dream-eating nightmare.\n"
"\n"
"Once the dream-drainer mosquito appears, kill it and the heart will be yours.\n"
"\n"
"Be careful, as this mosquito wields powers akin to those of the Eaters of "
"Dreams such as the ability to heal its wounds and throw piercing projectiles "
"at you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_read_vampire_mentor_book.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"To obtain a moonstruck pearl, you will need the skull of a March Lord, a "
"bunch of glass shards, a handful of faewild dust, ten kilograms of Fae meat, "
"enough bones to make a makeshift skeleton for that meat, some silver and the "
"heart of a mythic monster.  The skull must be one of a March lord, for only "
"they are resilient enough to contain the tremendous energies you will soon "
"harness.\n"
"\n"
"Once the revenant's effigy is completed, place it outdoors and wait until the "
"full moon shines brightly in the sky.  Only then will you take it in your "
"arms and utter the last few words of the ritual before the Luna-Attuned "
"Revenant rises and reappears near you.\n"
"\n"
"This revenant is a powerful foe, directly fueled by the moon itself and "
"blessed with the ability to always see its foes.  Its attacks are very "
"destructive and hard to dodge but you can severely weaken it by luring it "
"anywhere the moon cannot reach it.  If you do this be warned that it will "
"violently lash out at anything standing between itself and the moon.\n"
"\n"
"Fortunately, the revenant cannot regenerate and its flesh lacks any kind of "
"protection other than needing to be extremely heavily damaged to cause it to "
"decohere and die, granting you the moonstruck pearl.\n"
"\n"
"Remember to quickly kill it, for the sun's rays will instantly slay the "
"revenant, preventing you from obtaining the pearl.  Also keep in mind that "
"the revenant will attempt to take revenge on you for its current state and is "
"likely to priorize attacking you over its own wellbeing."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_read_vampire_mentor_book.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"To reach the space where the aforementioned shard can be found, you will need "
"a few chunks of sulfur, a bottle of strong alcohol, red meat from an animal, "
"meat from a mutant, meat from a human and meat from a Fae.  With all these "
"components, the ritual will be possible to accomplish.\n"
"\n"
"However, do not initiate the ritual if you aren't in the condition to fight "
"through hordes of foes, as it is what awaits you once you have completed the "
"ritual.  You will be swallowed instantly by a nightmarish being known as the "
"Abyssal Hunger and end up somewhere within it, where things akin to the cells "
"of a body will attack you.\n"
"\n"
"As you progress through the layers of its body, resistance will increase as "
"you get closer to what constitutes its brain.  Within it, shards can be "
"found.  Extract one, and you will return in our world at the exact place "
"where you left it.\n"
"\n"
"Try to stay away from the red globules, they're incredibly powerful but "
"almost fully blind.  The green globules will try to drag you closer to the "
"red ones so be ready to kill all of them as quickly as you can.  Preparing "
"ways to do so is a good idea, and so is bringing a source of light and "
"preparing for a half-hour where the only thing you will do is fighting for "
"your life."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I've been listening to those things eat the others they've brought back to "
"here."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Can you get me out of this spider pit?"
msgstr "Est-ce que vous pouvez me sortir de cette tanière d'araignées?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I hate spiders!"
msgstr "Je déteste les araignées!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Let's get out of here before more spiders show up."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I don't need another mouth to feed.  Get out of my sight."
msgstr "Je n'ai pas besoin d'un autre bouche à nourrir. Hors de ma vue."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"[Investigation 2] Are you feeling ok after all of this?  I can see some of "
"your wounds."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"They bit me and when I woke up I had wounds that feel like they have "
"something under them.  You don't think they could have put something in me, "
"do you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm going to bring you a bottle of antiparasitics.  Let's do ten to make sure."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I've brought the antiparasitic for you.  Do you want it?"
msgstr "J'ai amener des antiparasitaires pour vous.  Vous en voulez?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
#. ~ Mission name
#, c-format
msgid "Bring 10 antiparasitic pills to %s"
msgstr "Ramenez 10 pilules antiparasitaires à %s"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 antiparasitic pills to %s"
msgid ""
"If you think those things put something inside of me we need to get me "
"medicine asap!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 antiparasitic pills to %s"
msgid ""
"Please bring me some antiparasitic drugs, I don't want anything hatching out "
"of ME!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 antiparasitic pills to %s"
msgid "Hopefully nothing is wrong with me"
msgstr "Espérons que rien ne cloche en moi."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 antiparasitic pills to %s"
msgid "You've managed to terrify me."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 antiparasitic pills to %s"
msgid "Every itch leaves me with a panic attack now"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 antiparasitic pills to %s"
msgid "Thank you so very much I hope this works!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 antiparasitic pills to %s"
msgid "You're telling me you brought it but you aren't giving them to me."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_rescue.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring 10 antiparasitic pills to %s"
msgid "Please try harder and get me some medicine, I don't know how long I've got!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fae creature"
msgstr "Créature féerique"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae creature"
msgid "You are a creature of Faerie."
msgstr "Vous êtes une créature féerique."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can I drink some of your blood?  I really need some of it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It'll have to wait, unfortunately.  If I let you do that too often it'll be "
"very bad for my health."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Drink from them] Thank you.  Can we talk about something else?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Drink from them] Thank you.  See you later."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I changed my mind.  Keep your blood."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm not letting you do that this soon after last time.  I need that blood "
"too, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"If you really need to, then sure you can.  Don't make an habit out of it, "
"however."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Nope.  I'm not going to be your blood bag.  Find someone else for that."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"(As you approach to ask about letting you drink their blood, your senses tell "
"you that whatever blood they have in their veins wouldn't nourish you at all, "
"so you decide to not ask your question)"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "feed_from_recently"
msgid "Gave you blood"
msgstr "Vous a donné du sang"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Gave you blood"
msgid "This person won't accept to let you drink more of their blood for a while."
msgstr "Cette personne ne vous laissera pas boire leur sang pour un bon moment."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Use your powers to affect their mind]"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"[You ponder your options and think about the blood you have in you]\n"
"\n"
"You could spend a little blood to slightly influence their opinion of you.\n"
"\n"
"You could spend more blood to make them your friend.\n"
"\n"
"Or you could spend a massive amount of blood to turn them into a renfield, a "
"human obsessed with serving their vampire masters.  In this case the master "
"is you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Spend a little blood to make them like you a bit more]"
msgstr "[Dépensez un petit peu de sang pour améliorer un peu son opinion de vous]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Spend a moderate amount of blood to make them your friend]"
msgstr "[Dépensez un volume conséquent de sang pour faire de lui/elle votre ami·e]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Spend a massive amount of blood to make them your renfield]"
msgstr "[Dépensez un volume massif de sang pour faire de lui/elle votre renfield]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Don't spend any blood]"
msgstr "[Ne dépensez pas de sang]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[You do not have enough blood in you to manipulate someone's mind]"
msgstr "[Vous n'avez pas assez de sang pour manipuler les pensées de quelqu'un]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"[As your blood is consumed to reshape who they are, you see something die in "
"their eyes, replaced by an obsession to follow your orders]"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I want to discuss with you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Just follow me and my orders for now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Maybe there will be non-mentor vampire NPCs someday.  For now, there's
#. only the mentors.
msgid "vampire"
msgstr "vampire"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "Vampire Mentor"
msgstr "Mentor Vampirique"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Job description of "Vampire Mentor" NPC class
msgid "An ancient vampire, willing to assist those who want to further their curse."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Sorry I must go.  Bye!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Welcome.  What do you seek here?  Fortune?  Safety?  A friend?  A mentor?  "
"What brought you here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I want to talk."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I want a mentor."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I want to kill vampires."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I've done it.  I am now a true vampire."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Before, you said there was more that I needed to learn?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I've lost the book you gave me.  Do you have another?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I have brought back the components you need for the ritual."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid "The mentor vanishes in a fine mist."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Do you want to chat for a bit?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "What do you wish to discuss?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can I do something for you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What did you meant by \"mentor\"?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I just wanted to look around.  See you."
msgstr "Je voulais juste jeter un coup d'œil, à plus tard."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I can help you become a stronger vampire, if it is what you wish."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I can share with you the gift of vampirism, if it is what you wish."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I want to become a stronger vampire."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I want to become a vampire."
msgstr "Je veux devenir un·e vampire."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You already made me as strong as a vampire can be.  See you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Maybe later.  Bye."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"There are many vampires in this place.  Feel free to kill the others, I am "
"not affiliated with them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm here to kill all vampires, no exceptions.  Prepare to die."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"You seem more reasonable than the rest.  Would you like to be cured of your "
"curse?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "It can wait.  Can we talk?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "It can wait.  Can we discuss what you meant by \"mentor\"?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I am an old vampire, wishing to see more embrace and develop that gift."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It's a safe place for the blood-drinkers.  Here, it's only them, their "
"servants and their food.  And also those who wish to become blood-drinkers "
"themselves."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I am overjoyed that a new person decided to take their place as a new ruler "
"of the night!  Soon, you'll be ready for the final step, the one that will "
"allow you to fully walk the path!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can you help me walk that path?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I just wanted to share the news.  See you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Yes.  The gifts of the blood are somewhat random, as are its curses.  But now "
"that you have come into your true power, there are ways to expand your "
"talents and to modify your weaknesses.  It will require a great deal of blood "
"and time, but I can show you the way."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Yes.  I want more power."
msgstr "Oui.  Je veux plus de pouvoir."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Maybe later, but not now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Concentrate on the blood and watch closely."
msgstr "Concentrez-vous sur le sang et observez-le de près."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"You learn how to expand your blood gifts and how to change your vampiric "
"weaknesses."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I can do it, if you truly want it.  I've seen that those who willingly become "
"vampires are more likely to fully walk the path so I won't attempt to force "
"you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I am sure.  Grant me vampirism."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"[bites you] Here you go.  You might not notice the effects at first, but keep "
"some human blood close for when your thirst will appear and some shelter for "
"when the sun will start to burn your skin.  There are levels of vampiric "
"power that cannot be achieved through time alone.  When you'll reach that "
"point, come back here and I'll help you reach them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Got it.  See you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You are ready for the next step.  However, I must warn you: there is no "
"coming back from that.  Your vampirism will become impossible to lose.  Do "
"you wish to proceed?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Your vampirism isn't potent enough.  Come back when your mortal hungers will "
"begin to be replaced by immortal hungers.  They are the signs that your power "
"increased enough to withstand what you'll gain from my help."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I am certain.  Make me more powerful."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I do not wish to be struck as a vampire forever."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I cannot assist you until you bring back the components.  How is the search "
"going?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You are now ready to fully walk the path.  This time, you'll need to gather a "
"few components before the ritual can be done.  I'll give you this book so you "
"know what to look for."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll begin the search then."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A book?  You said I would only need a few components!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "It's progressing.  See you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "It'll wait for now.  See you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It's not something I do, it's something you'll do.  I know it'll be asking a "
"lot from you, but I hope you'll understand why we are doing it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Don't tell me.  I'm going."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"To become a true vampire, you must kill someone that cherishes you with your "
"own hands.  It might be hard to bear at first, but with time you'll see how "
"much it was worth it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "That's all?"
msgstr "C'est tout?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it, if it what it takes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"[Uncaring] Make someone love me and then kill them in return for immortality "
"and power?  What's the downside?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Pacifist] That's monstrous, of course I won't do that!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm not doing that.  Bye."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"They need to be completely trusting of you, someone that consider themselves "
"your \"best friend forever\".  They also need to declare how much they love "
"you right before you kill them, then you'll become a true vampire.  And I "
"almost forgot: you also need to kill them in melee combat or else it won't "
"work.\n"
"\n"
"And when you are done, return to me.  There is more that you must learn."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Do not worry about the pain, my friend.  It is always temporary, no matter "
"how much it hurts.  After that, you won't ever be temporary again.  Keep in "
"mind that they need to be completely trusting of you, someone that consider "
"themselves your \"best friend forever\".  They also need to declare how much "
"they love you right before you kill them, then you'll be freed from your "
"limited time as you become a true vampire.  And I almost forgot: you also "
"need to kill them in melee combat or else it won't work.\n"
"\n"
"And when you are done, return to me.  There is more that you must learn."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Here's the book.  It contains everything you need to know about the "
"components you need to acquire.  Be sure to read it thoroughly as the rituals "
"have very specific conditions to be accomplished.  Come back here when you'll "
"have them all and you will fully walk the path."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thank you.  I'll bring back these components."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"This book contains the rituals allowing to obtain the components.  Each of "
"them requires a complicated process to get.  I'm giving you this book so you "
"won't come back asking for more information every two hours."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I do have another copy, however you'll have to buy it at a steep price.  Each "
"of these are written by hand these days so we can't let people treat them "
"like disposable things."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[$100] I'll buy the book."
msgstr "[$100] Je peux acheter le livre."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "We?"
msgstr "Nous?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll come back later for that.  See you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm not the only vampire looking to assist others on the path.  We wrote this "
"book together and occasionally meet to update and refine it, all in the goal "
"of helping new vampires reach their true potential as easily as possible."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Where are these other mentors?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "See you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I do not know of their whereabouts.  All what matters is that we know where "
"to meet, but with the end of the world all meetings has been postponed "
"indefinitely."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"[Your mentor takes the components and engages in a complex ritual, before "
"passing you a bowl filled with a red liquid].  Drink it, and you'll have "
"completed the process of walking the path."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Drink it]"
msgstr "[Buvez]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You have now reached the apex of the vampiric condition and do not need "
"further guidance.  Go forth and claim your title and crown of ruler of the "
"night!  Make it clear that you are the one on the throne!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Got it.  Farewell, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"No.  I've long passed the point of no return.  Either your cure won't do "
"anything, or it'll kill me."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Then you must die."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I understand.  Can we talk?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "No thanks.  I am here to help others, not because I need help."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Then I'd like your help as a mentor."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Then I'd like your help as a vampire slayer."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"No thanks.  I've decided long ago to never gamble my life for someone else's "
"cause.  I prefer waiting on the side, helping those who want my help."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I want your help, mentor."
msgstr "J'ai besoin de votre aide mon mentor."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I do not care for such frivolous things."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill your best friend"
msgstr "Tuez votre meilleur⋅re ami⋅e"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill your best friend"
msgid "Kill someone that is very close to you to push your vampirism further."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill your best friend"
msgid ""
"If you wish to become a true vampire, you must sacrifice someone that really, "
"really likes you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill your best friend"
msgid ""
"It brings me joy to see someone willing to fully walk the path.  Remember, "
"pain is always temporary, no matter how it hurts.  By this sacrifice, you "
"won't ever be temporary again."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill your best friend"
msgid "I understand.  Some never wanted to walk the path.  Such wasted potential."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill your best friend"
msgid ""
"They need to be completely trusting of you, someone that thinks of themselves "
"as your \"best friend forever\".  In addition, keep in mind that the "
"sacrifice must be killed by none and nothing other than you, or else you'll "
"have to find a new sacrifice."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill your best friend"
msgid "Have you found someone that considers you the best person in the world?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill your best friend"
msgid ""
"You visibly succeeded.  You should gain more vampiric aptitudes soon.  "
"However, you haven't fully walked the path yet.  Give your powers some time "
"to grow, come here again and I'll explain what to do to completely walk the "
"path!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill your best friend"
msgid ""
"Either your vampirism isn't advanced enough, or you tried to bypass the "
"sacrifice.  Either way, do that sacrifice."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill your best friend"
msgid "Someday you'll find a suitable sacrifice."
msgstr "Un jour vous trouverais un sacrifice acceptable."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find the components for the vampiric ritual"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the components for the vampiric ritual"
msgid "Gather the components your book mention and bring them to your mentor."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Before things ended did you see any of the interviews with some of the "
"remaining Wampanoag?  They kept saying things about other races coming back "
"to this planet.  That's crazy, right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"A few nights after I got here, I saw lights in the woods off in the distance. "
" I don't know why, but I ran back into the house turned off all the lights "
"and closed the blinds.  It was just so eerie!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"There could be anything out there.  Remember towards the end before the "
"apocalypse?  I remember tons of weird stuff I heard on the radio.  Like, I "
"heard out past Bunyan there were strange trees and species showing up in the "
"deep woods, stuff no one had ever seen before.  The Border Patrol was going "
"in about 'species previously thought extinct' or something like that.  Didn't "
"make sense to me.  Why the heck was the *Border Patrol* talking about "
"*closing off forests*?  Weird stuff.  I guess that means I don't have a clue "
"what's out there now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I still can't decide if our leaders thought Canada was a threat or what?  Why "
"else did they militarize the border patrol up here just as bad it had been on "
"the southern border for decades?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I remember talking to a friend coming back from Vegas a few years back and he "
"mentioned Border Patrol had those big armored Bear Cub vehicles with a "
"roadblock going into one of the canyons outside of Vegas.  Hundreds of miles "
"from any border.  Weird stuff man, I wonder if it's all connected?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"What does this story remind me of?  Is it, Rip van Winkle?  Didn't he join "
"some party and come home a dozen years later?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Maybe we should avoid drinking anything there?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Is Lewis Carrol hiding behind a bush over there?  Because if not, this sounds "
"insane and insanely dangerous.  But no one else has even given us a hint "
"about a way off this world of the dead.  Can we really pass this by?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "It's you and me buddy, to infinity and beyond!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Autumn Glamour] *Use Scarecrow's Mien*."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid "The glamour fails to take hold!"
msgstr "Votre charme ne parvient pas à faire effet!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "<color_light_green>[Hypnotic Gaze] *Look directly into their eyes*</color>."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "*blanches and takes a step back before turning and fleeing."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Watch them go."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*stares stupidly as you meet <mypossesivepronoun> gaze and overwhelm "
"<mypossesivepronoun> pitiful mind.  Pathetic.  Like a lamb awaiting the "
"slaughter."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*stares blankly as you meet <mypossesivepronoun> gaze and overwhelm "
"<mypossesivepronoun> mind.  As <mypossesivepronoun> hands fall listlessly to "
"<mypossesivepronoun> sides, <mypossesivepronoun> gaze becomes unfocused and "
"<mypossesivepronoun> mouth drops half-open."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Ha.  Mortals are nothing but cattle."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Well, that's one problem solved."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"[Paraclesian:Elemental] Oh you're much less aggressive than other humans.  "
"Are you a different breed?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Paraclesian:Dollkin] Finally a normal human!  What's happened here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You mean the ferals?  Almost everyone left alive will try to kill you just "
"like the zombies out there."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "You mean the ferals?  How can you not know about the ferals?  Is this a trap?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"When the world broke it seems like it broke most people's minds and locked "
"them in on a single response to everything around them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Where have you been?  It's the end of the world and most people have gone "
"crazy!  Are you trying to distract me?"
msgstr ""

