msgid "Supernatural Abilities And Their Usage In Operative Work_5/6.mp4"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_xedra"
#. ~ Messages, logs and videos, that xedra agent may have on it's laptop
msgid ""
"SAATUIOW_1/6.mp4\n"
"*The video seems to be a record of some drill in a large classroom.  The "
"first few minutes are spent preparing the projector, then a person comes to "
"the lectern*\n"
"Good morning everyone, my name is *illegible*, and I am the assistant of "
"doctor *illegible*.\n"
"Today's lesson would be pretty general, because it's a theme on which we "
"still lack information and a lot must be discussed.  We also don't have "
"proper terms, so don't be surprised if part of it is picked from game slang "
"and part from fantasy novels.  The lesson would be more than experimental.\n"
"Okay.  You saw the name of the lesson before, it has a long, unreadable name, "
"but overall it is described as \"magic\".  Yes, magic, because we still don't "
"know why and don't know how it works.  You may hear a story about an altered "
"objects that doesn't work, works in the wrong way, does something different, "
"or even harms the user, but most of you don't know - No, Jamey, I know you "
"know it, you are our consultant here, not a student.\n"
"Yes, I forgot to present: this is Jamey, he is our retired field agent and a "
"pretty experienced eater.  More on that later.\n"
"So yes, you don't know… *The lecturer silently watches at Jamey for a few "
"seconds*… that some \"subjects\" - I say \"subjects\", because some of them "
"are not humans, we saw a similar result from apes, dogs, rats, and even, uh, "
"was it a computer program?… Anyway, some \"subjects\" can not only touch "
"these items without self-harm, but they can also, eh, use them?  It's not "
"really \"using\", we think they'd rather \"redirect\" their paranormal "
"properties into a more acceptable form.  Yes, they \"redirect\" the power, "
"energy, mana, you name it, into a direction that gives them supernatural "
"abilities.  They are not really limited, some individuals are able to use all "
"of them, but most are not - the rules of these processes are unclear, so we "
"classified them into a few branches…"
msgstr ""
"SAATUIOW_1/6.mp4\n"
"*La vidéo a l'air d'être un enregistrement d'une sorte d'exercice dans une "
"grande classe. Les premières minutes sont dévouées à préparer le projecteur, "
"une personne s'avançant ensuite devant le pupitre*\n"
"Bonjour tout le monde, mon nom est *inintelligible*, et je suis une "
"assistante de docteur *inintelligible*.\n"
"La leçon d'aujourd'hui doit être un peu générale, le thème étant quelque "
"chose au sujet de quoi nous n'avons pas encore toutes les informations et "
"beaucoup doit être abordé. Nous n'avons pas encore de termes appropriés, donc "
"ne soyez pas surpris si nous utilisons des mots issus d'argot de jeux ou de "
"romans de fantasy. Cette leçon sera définitivement assez expérimentale.\n"
"Ok, vous avez déjà vu le nom de la leçon auparavant, celui-ci est long et "
"incompréhensible, mais celui-ci pourrait être plus ou moins résumé sous le "
"nom de \"magie\". Oui, magie, vu que nous ne savons pas comment ceci "
"fonctionne et pourquoi. Vous avez peut être entendu des histoires au sujet "
"d'objets altérés ne fonctionnant pas, fonctionnant d'une mauvaise façon, "
"faisant quelque chose de différent, ou même nuit à l'utilisateur, mais aucun "
"d'entre vous ne sait - Non Jamey, je sais que vous savez pourquoi, vous êtes "
"notre consultant ici, pas un étudiant.\n"
"Oui, j'ai oublié de vous présenter, voici Jamey, un agent de terrain retraité "
"et un mangeur assez expérimenté. Plus là dessus plus tard.\n"
"Donc oui, vous ne savez pas... *la présentatrice regarde Jamey "
"silencieusement quelques secondes*… Que certains \"sujets\" - Je dit "
"\"sujets\" parce que certains d'entre eux ne sont pas humains, nous avons "
"observé des résultats similaires avec des singes, chiens, rats et, hmm, "
"était-ce un programme informatique? Bref, certains \"sujets\" peuvent non "
"seulement toucher ces objets sans aucun effets néfastes, mais peuvent aussi "
"hmm, les utiliser_ Ce n'est pas vraiment les \"utiliser\" et plutôt "
"\"rediriger\" leur propriétés paranormales en une forme plus acceptable. Oui, "
"ils peuvent \"rediriger\" le pouvoir, l'énergie, la mana, peut importe "
"comment vous voulez l'appeler en une direction capable de leur donner des "
"pouvoirs supernaturels. Ceux-ci ne sont pas vraiment limités, certains "
"individus sont capables d'utiliser toutes formes, mais la plupart ne le sont "
"pas - les règles de ces processus ne sont pas encore très claires, donc nous "
"les avons classifiés en quelques branches..."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_xedra"
#. ~ Messages, logs and videos, that xedra agent may have on it's laptop
msgid "Supernatural Abilities And Their Usage In Operative Work_2/6.mp4"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_xedra"
#. ~ Messages, logs and videos, that xedra agent may have on it's laptop
msgid ""
"SAATUIOW_2/6.mp4\n"
"…The first branch utilizes \"the knowledge\", people of this type \"know\" "
"how to make tools, that seem impossible without decades of development or "
"that violate a huge part of the physical laws we all know.  They are our most "
"valuable resource: engineers that can build a railgun using M16 parts, "
"assemble an EMP bomb using only a PlayStation and a few tools, a phone camera "
"that sees through the walls, a Humvee engine that can use whiskey as fuel "
"*cough cough*… yeah, the list of their abilities is pretty huge, and they can "
"provide these tools to other users.  Sadly, they do not last long outside of "
"their hands, breaking apart in a few weeks.\n"
"- *illegible*\n"
"No, there is no correlation between the user's IQ and the time it stopped "
"working, we thought about it already.\n"
"- *illegible*\n"
"Yes, I know about Worm, and yes, it is surprisingly accurate in this part…\n"
"…\n"
"…\n"
"Overall, their abilities are really wide, but it is really hard to "
"differentiate them from their usefulness - currently we have only a few "
"prototypes, useful for field agents like you, and a dozen of toothbrushes, "
"modified to clean teeth better.  Two of them expect to be lethal.  Currently, "
"most of them are busy with the \"Legion\" project in an attempt to turn the "
"table, you may check about it later…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_xedra"
#. ~ Messages, logs and videos, that xedra agent may have on it's laptop
msgid "Supernatural Abilities And Their Usage In Operative Work_3/6.mp4"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_xedra"
#. ~ Messages, logs and videos, that xedra agent may have on it's laptop
msgid ""
"SAATUIOW_3/6.mp4\n"
"…The second branch utilizes, eh, \"the ethereal\" or \"extradimensional\" "
"thingy, we like to name them \"dealers\".  Now I think it's a bad idea to "
"split them like this, but anyway.  So yeah, it is easy to detect dealers, "
"because some interdimensional creatures, usually hostile to humans, do not "
"attack them.  We think they can kind of make a \"deal\" with sapient "
"creatures, and yes, every creature they deal with is sapient, in one form or "
"another, and I also don't understand how it works, that's what they told me.  "
"Eeh, yeah, they \"deal\" with these creatures from the other side, they spend "
"their life energy to merc them.  The one who was capable of talking said it "
"was a pleasant dish, the same as our pancakes.  The ability to use such "
"things is not cheap, and many dealers disappeared in unknown circumstances, "
"but let's not talk about it…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_xedra"
#. ~ Messages, logs and videos, that xedra agent may have on it's laptop
msgid "Supernatural Abilities And Their Usage In Operative Work_4/6.mp4"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_xedra"
#. ~ Messages, logs and videos, that xedra agent may have on it's laptop
msgid ""
"SAATUIOW_4/6.mp4\n"
"…Another one is our hard workers - our smiths.  They are not as dreadful as "
"technicians in their abilities, they can not create a nuke out of a "
"microwave, but they can create something that even technicians can't "
"understand.  At least the best of them, most of our smiths produce common "
"tools and armor we use in our work.  You may think they are \"worse\", or "
"\"weaker\" than other branches, or you may think they are some dumb blue "
"collars.  And that's mostly right.  Mostly.  But… But…\n"
"Did you ever see an anti-tank bow?  The bow that can throw arrows at a rifle "
"distance, penetrate the armored vehicle, and kill a whole squad inside, while "
"being completely silent?  I saw one, and it was a damn great experience.\n"
"- *illegible*\n"
"Are you a smith?\n"
"- *illegible*\n"
"You are pretty smart, then.  Yes, that's their biggest advancement - their "
"products do not fade as fast as technicians' work.  The second most "
"beneficial part of their work is the material they use.  It has a "
"complicated, unpronounceable name, but we simply call it \"dross\".  There is "
"a group of people that like to call it \"dreamdross\" and overall have some "
"\"dream\" fetish with this arcane stuff, but hell we are serious "
"organizations if our researchers are inspired by some \"dreams can come "
"true\" bullshit.  Anyway, dross is the main part of two branches: for smiths "
"and for eaters.  The substance-producing process is pretty tricky, because "
"you need to find a person with a magic inclination - usually it's a person "
"touched by altered objects, creatures, or altered event victims, but there "
"are exceptions: our consultant Jamey has had no contact with portals before "
"yet happened to be a talented eater…  *illegible* *cough cough*…  So yes, you "
"need to find such a person and teach them how to produce it.\n"
"- *illegible*\n"
"- Yes, there is situations, where common people produce some amount of dross "
"after death, why do you ask?\n"
"- *illegible*\n"
"- [Lector stares at the questioner for a good ten seconds.]\n"
"…How useful… may be the strategy… where we… kill… innocent people… just to "
"find some dross?\n"
"…\n"
"…\n"
"…I think I'll be fired… If I do not say \"we will never kill an innocent to "
"get some resources\", but okay, theorizing, it's not viable still - the "
"amount of dross we can obtain in such a way is negligible.  But again, don't "
"even ask about it again.\n"
"Turning back to dross, the exact characteristics of the material…  are not "
"great.  It's pretty fragile, loose, and light - totally not a thing you can "
"use to make a weapon - strong and sturdy.  But of course, it's not the main "
"property of metal.  The main feature of the metal is its ability to accept "
"and process magic.  Any magic, I'd say, but it's not true, some stuff we "
"can't do at all, and some stuff can only be done by high level smiths.  It's "
"not a big surprise, but even the senior smiths are able to make a huge "
"variety of stuff with improved effects.  The most popular option is "
"hardening, of course.  So, most items that are made fully from dross or use "
"dross inserts are usually not that much stronger than steel stuff but lighter "
"- sometimes so much lighter it has no weight at all - if I recall correctly, "
"our DSAPI has a weight of like 500 grams or so?  You get the idea…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_xedra"
#. ~ Messages, logs and videos, that xedra agent may have on it's laptop
msgid ""
"SAATUIOW_5/6.mp4\n"
"And the last branch we separate is a branch of eaters.  There is nothing "
"really special about them; compared to any other branch, they do not have "
"some really odd abilities like summoning creatures or throwing fireballs.  "
"Instead, all magic that happens with them is limited to their own bodies, and "
"oh god, how good they are at this.  They are meat tanks.  Not in the sense "
"that they transform their bodies or something like this, no.  Totally not.  "
"They just can do the same stuff as tank - break asphalt while running at 60 "
"miles per second and throw fifty kilo balls with sniper precision.\n"
"A simple example for you: do you see our friend here?  How strong do you "
"think he is?  I mean, right now, when there is an army of soldiers, SWAT, and "
"people from the police department, if you have your weapon with you, how many "
"of you may a single Jamey kill?\n"
"- *illegible*\n"
"- Two?\n"
" - *illegible*\n"
"- Five?\n"
"- *illegible*\n"
"- Dozen?\n"
"- *illegible*\n"
"Okay.  Believe me, even without his right hand, Jamey can kill all of you.  "
"Then he can move to the office room next to us and kill all the people there, "
"and then next, and then next, and then he can just demolish this whole "
"building.  Yes, it is reinforced, can survive the 155-millimeter shot.  Yes, "
"Jamey still has only one hand.  Yes, nothing will be left behind.  Am I "
"right, Jamey?\n"
"-*illegible*\n"
"Oh, you are not an operative, so you won't do it.  Yeah, you also know it's "
"bullshit and they won't kick you off because of one failure, do you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ This is extending the vanilla snippets belonging to mostly work of random
#. people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos that people share, or
#. something they can film by themselves.
msgid "cryptid sighting werewolf"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ This is extending the vanilla snippets belonging to mostly work of random
#. people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos that people share, or
#. something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"hunternetvulfgar.mp4\n"
"The video cuts in as a montage of school security cameras in hallways, as a "
"young man and woman break into the school.  As they walk past each camera, "
"that image drops and the others rearrange larger, while a popular song from "
"the 90's begins playing.  The young adults enter a classroom and are clearly "
"flirting.\n"
"Awoo oooh, got you where I want you\n"
"plays over top of the video.  The man laughs at something the woman says, and "
"throws his head back laughing while she is clearly annoyed.  His face "
"elongates as his body grows, shredding the clothes he is wearing as limbs "
"change and sprout thick fur.  She has backed away from him and put the "
"students' and teacher's desks between them.  Fully transformed into a hideous "
"wolfman, he begins his approach towards his once date now prey, smashing "
"chairs and students' desks out of his way.  Suddenly the wolfcreature pauses "
"and its ears prick up.  It turns and looks at the wall of windows in the "
"classroom.  Glass erupts into the room as the darkness outside the window "
"shows the muzzle flare of at least a dozen different guns firing.  The "
"wolfcreature is hit more times than you can count in a span of seconds and "
"falls to the ground.\n"
"The song reaches a crescendo 'Got you where I want you, got you, yeahhhhh!' "
"as his date pulls a large caliber pistol out of the teachers desk, walks over "
"to the fallen beast and calmly puts three bullets in its skull.  The video "
"ends."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ This is extending the vanilla snippets belonging to mostly work of random
#. people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos that people share, or
#. something they can film by themselves.
msgid "cryptid sighting vampire"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ This is extending the vanilla snippets belonging to mostly work of random
#. people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos that people share, or
#. something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"hunternetlinda.mp4\n"
"Electronic music plays on a black screen.  Text appears on the screen\n"
"'Stand still, pause clocks, we can make the world stop'\n"
"A video montage follows a woman across multiple days and outfits.  On "
"errands, at work, traveling in different cities.  About a minute into the "
"montage of video there are short cuts to her violently attacking people in "
"secluded settings.  Those gradually become the dominant images until it's "
"only video of her feasting on the blood of her fallen victims.  The final "
"image is her looking up; face covered, blood dripping down onto her ruined "
"outfit; eyes staring straight into the camera as the image freezes.  On the "
"now black screen, a name and address appear."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
msgid ""
"The clopping of hooves pass you by with a swift breeze, yet you did not see "
"anything except for local flora brushed by the wind."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
msgid ""
"As you are walking you suddenly hear a woman singing mournfully.  As you look "
"around trying to see where the sound is coming from you slowly realize that "
"if you take more than a step and a half in any direction the song fades away. "
" Eventually you are unable to find it again."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
msgid ""
"Something roars in the night, similar sounding to one of the Kaiju you heard "
"destroying a nearby town during the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
msgid "The night suddenly goes dead silent."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
msgid ""
"You hear a wolf howl in the distance, swiftly joined by several others.  "
"After a moment of silence, you hear another series of howls, and then "
"another.  It's only after the third set fades that you realize the howls were "
"all in exactly the same pattern; two long, three short."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
msgid ""
"You hear a scream in the distance.  Probably a deer or a bobcat, but it sure "
"sounded like a human."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
msgid ""
"Disturbed by your approach, a small animal darts away into the underbrush.  "
"It's only after it disappears that you realize it had six legs."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
msgid ""
"Your ears pop, leaving behind a high-pitched whine that fades as normal "
"sounds slowly return."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
msgid ""
"For a moment, the air smells so strongly metallic that you can almost taste "
"it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
msgid "You hear a rush of unfelt wind."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
msgid ""
"The wind makes a low murmur that sounds almost like words.  When you stop to "
"pay attention to it, it falls silent."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLEAR_1"
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLOUDY_1"
msgid "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLEAR_1"
msgid ""
"Winged shadows cross the ground, but when you look into the sky you can't see "
"any movement or shapes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLEAR_1"
msgid ""
"There is a bright red star with a dark heart that looks like a pupil, staring "
"down on you from the sky above.  Is that star in the sky every night?  Is it "
"coming closer to the planet?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLEAR_1"
msgid ""
"A helicopter passes by overhead.  All its running lights have been blacked "
"out and you suspect the rotors have been muffled.  If it hadn't passed right "
"over you, you'd have never known it was there."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLEAR_1"
msgid "Something passes across the moon for a moment, completely blotting it out."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLEAR_1"
msgid "A shooting star flashes across the sky."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLEAR_1"
msgid "A pair of owls flies by, so close that they're almost wingtip to wingtip."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLEAR_1"
msgid "For a moment, all the stars turn a dim reddish color."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLOUDY_1"
msgid ""
"A single raindrop falls on your exposed skin.  You look up, but no further "
"droplets fall."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLOUDY_1"
msgid ""
"Something above the clouds glows, creating a hazy patch of light.  It stays "
"in place for a few moments before speeding away to the <random_direction>."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLOUDY_1"
msgid ""
"You see the vague outlines of a humanoid figure in the distance.  As soon as "
"you catch sight of it, there is a blur of motion and it vanishes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLOUDY_1"
msgid ""
"You step in a small puddle, but when you bend down to look, there's nothing "
"there."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLOUDY_1"
msgid ""
"You feel something tap on your shoulder but when you spin around to look, "
"there's no one there."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLOUDY_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a slithering sound in the distance.  It's far enough away that "
"whatever is making it must be very large."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLOUDY_1"
msgid "You hear a cracking sound and then the night falls totally silent."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"You realize that all of your empty pockets have been turned inside out.  How "
"long ago this happened you can't say."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "You hear a tinkling sound on the wind."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "A horn plays somewhere far in the distance; deep, mournful, and low."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "Suddenly you smell rotten wood and tobacco."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a distant explosion.  You can't tell if it came from one of the "
"tendrils of smoke at the edge of your vision or if it's new."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "A single shot fires in the distance then silence."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "The birds are no longer singing here.  It's quiet, scary quiet."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"A rare plane leaves contrails high in the sky.  You wonder where it could be "
"coming from and where it could possibly be going."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"The sunlight seems to dim for a moment.  When you blink, it's as bright as it "
"was before."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"Your footstep suddenly crunch loudly.  When you look down, the ground beneath "
"you is carpeted with dead insects."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "The grass nearby is trampled down in a sinuous pattern."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "The air suddenly smells sickly sweet."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_SCRAGGY-BOO_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"<color_light_blue>You see a Russian sheepdog off at the edge of your vision.  "
"It walks past some scenery and vanishes.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_SCRAGGY-BOO_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"<color_light_blue>You hear a deep guttural howl, faintly across the "
"way.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_SCRAGGY-BOO_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"<color_light_green>In your mind you hear a voice, as if a big dog were "
"speaking English.  'It's dangerous here, this whole world is dangerous "
"now'.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_SCRAGGY-BOO_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"<color_light_green>Scraggy-boo speaks in your mind.  'The real mystery is how "
"to survive this place'.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You catch a small glimpse of something.  The only thing you "
"understand is how disturbed it makes you feel.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You imagine yourself reading that creepy book.  Your mind "
"reels at the idea.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>For the smallest instant, the veil hiding the truth shows a "
"crack.  What little you see shocks you to your very core.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>Your proximity to this damned book is slowly melting your "
"mind.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You feel a deep longing to leave a certain book behind "
"you.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>Your mind is on fire.  You must get rid of this book or the "
"fire won't end.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>How cathartic it would be to tear the pages from that cursed "
"book.  You ache to get rid of it as soon as possible.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>Your mind can only think about that book for a moment.  You "
"skull fills with pressure like a balloon about to pop.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>That book you found near a shredded corpse makes you dread "
"being shredded in turn.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You suddenly feel saddened.  Maybe dropping that "
"blood-stained book would make you feel better?</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>The Lies hate that you're carrying that book and decided to "
"make their sentiment known.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You dream of a world of burning paper below a single intact "
"book.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You awaken from a nightmare about a book eating your "
"brain.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You stand on a line of letters above a bottomless pit.  They "
"crack.  You fall.  You wake up.\n"
"This time.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You wake up knowing that you will soon pay for what you've "
"done.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
msgid "<color_light_red>You dream about being torn apart by unseen claws.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>In your dream, you had a cat.  Like the cat, curiosity "
"killed you.  Unlike the cat, you had far less lives and died far more "
"times.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You dream about white-hot nails burrowing in your head, each "
"of them whispering things you do not want to hear.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You wake up with a phrase resounding in your skull over and "
"over: CLEAVE THROUGH THE WORLD OF LIES.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You dream about being unraveled, the strands making you "
"falling to the ground.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You dream about silent voices ordering other things to kill "
"you.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_taint_resisted"
msgid "<color_light_red>The Lies are unraveling you as you dared resist them.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_taint_resisted"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>Small strands of skin and muscle are leaving your body and "
"piling on the floor.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_taint_resisted"
msgid "<color_light_red>Strand by strand, you are slowly unmade by the Lies.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_taint_resisted"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You do not know enough to avoid what is happening to you, "
"but you know enough for it to happen.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_taint_resisted"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>Another small strand is plucked from you and "
"discarded.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_taint_resisted"
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>If you stop reading this book, you will stop "
"unraveling.</color>"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_taint_resisted"
msgid ""
