#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "changeling_march_lord_report"
msgid "Field Report CO001141"
msgstr "Rapport de Terrain CO001141"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "changeling_march_lord_report"
msgid ""
"Field Report CO001141: We've managed to capture one of what we are calling "
"the nobles of these people.  It claims to be a 'March Lord' and that it rules "
"a small barony right across the border between our worlds."
msgstr ""
"Rapport de Terrain C0001141: Nous avons réussi a capturer l'un de ce que nous "
"appelons maintenant les nobles de ce peuple. Cette créature proclame être un "
"\"Seigneur de Marche\" ayant possession d'une petite baronnie juste à la "
"frontière entre leur monde et le notre."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "changeling_march_lord_report"
msgid "Interrogation Report: CO001141-a1:"
msgstr "Rapport d'Interrogation: CO001141-a1:"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "changeling_march_lord_report"
msgid ""
"Interrogation Report: CO001141-a1: Chapfax Æelgar Llywelyn, as our prisoner "
"has identified himself can both speak and write our language.  Chapfax had "
"listened to use speak about him for days and only today did he respond to any "
"of our questions.  He claims this is because we just now began to interest "
"him."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "changeling_march_lord_report"
msgid "Interrogation Report: CO001141:"
msgstr "Rapport d'Interrogation: CO001141:"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "changeling_march_lord_report"
msgid ""
"Interrogation Report: CO001141: The creature has spent three days sitting and "
"watching our attempts to communicate.  It has made no attempts to communicate "
"back to us."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "changeling_march_lord_report"
msgid "Interrogation Report: CO001141-b1:"
msgstr "Rapport d'Interrogation: CO001141-b1:"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "changeling_march_lord_report"
msgid ""
"Interrogation Report: CO001141-b2: Chapfax has only spoken with specific "
"staff members and ignores any interaction from others.  We are trying to find "
"a pattern of who he is choosing and why."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "changeling_march_lord_report"
msgid "Interrogation Report: CO001141-f7:"
msgstr "Rapport d'Interrogation: CO001141-f7:"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "changeling_march_lord_report"
msgid ""
"Interrogation Report: CO001141-f7: In the last 24 hours half of the staff "
"members Chapfax interacted with have gone missing.  Some even disappeared "
"from this office, we have no idea what has happened to them and if this is "
"some kind of kidnapping to ransom back Chapfax.  The so-called March Lord, "
"has said that he doesn't imagine it is anyone from his barony but that there "
"are many across the borderlands.  And that beyond those border lands are the "
"great states of the 'Far Lands'."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "changeling_march_lord_report"
msgid "Interrogation Report: CO001141-f75:"
msgstr "Rapport d'Interrogation: CO001141-f75:"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "changeling_march_lord_report"
msgid ""
"Interrogation Report: CO001141-f75: Chapfax has been unusually talkative "
"since we informed him of the missing staff, I finally asked him why he was "
"being so talkative suddenly and he looked at me right in the eyes and "
"sorrowfully said 'I don't imagine anything I say will matter soon, I can feel "
"a change coming in your world and I'd prefer to watch it from my home.  I'll "
"grant you and your family safe passage if we leave before nightfall.'  I know "
"the riots and weirdness have been escalating *the report stops midsentence*."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "desk_postit_field_agent"
