#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/lilin_spell_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in nested effect in else statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_INSTANT_HEAL"
msgid ""
"The moon is obscured by clouds and you cannot draw on its light to heal "
"yourself!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/lilin_spell_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in nested effect in else statement in false effect in EoC
