#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Boating License" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've trained in how to pilot marine craft, as well as general boating and "
"swimming safety."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez reçu une formation pour conduire de façon compétente un engin "
"nautique, ainsi que des leçons d'entretien et de nage."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Driving License" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You got your driving license and know how to drive a car, change the oil and "
"tires, and other basics."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez passé votre code de la route et avez les connaissances théoriques "
"et pratiques pour conduire une voiture, changer son huile et ses pneus et "
"autres activités de maintenance basiques."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Simple Home Cooking" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've been living on your own long enough that you know how to cook basic "
"dishes and feed yourself."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez vécu seule assez longtemps pour apprendre comment cuisiner des "
"repas basiques et garder votre estomac plein."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Computer Literate" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Either through school, your job, or from your family, you've learned the "
"basics of how to use a computer."
msgstr ""
"Soit à travers votre éducation, votre travail, ou grace à votre famille, vous "
"avez appris les connaissances basiques nécessaires pour utiliser un "
"ordinateur."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Social Skills" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've spent a significant portion of your life living among other people and "
"are familiar with social norms.  You know how to talk with other people, and "
"how to convey your emotions and understand those of others."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez passé votre vie jusqu'ici au milieu d'autre personnes et avez une "
"assez bonne connaissance des normes sociales, vous permettant d'avoir de "
"facilement avoir des conversations basiques, de transmettre vos émotions et "
"de comprendre celles des autres."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "High School Graduate" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've graduated from high school and thus know a little bit about applied "
"science and electronics."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez passé votre diplôme de lycée, vous donnant des connaissances "
"basiques concernant les sciences appliquées et l'électronique."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mundane Survival" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've managed to survive modern life in a first world country.  Through your "
"ordeals you've learned how to treat scrapes and bruises, and how to assemble "
"basic furniture."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez réussi à survivre à la vie moderne dans un pays industrialisé.  Au "
"fil de vos épreuves, vous avez appris à soigner les égratignures et les "
"contusions, et à assembler des meubles de base."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Heroin Dependence" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The last thing you remember was meeting God behind the local Foodplace.  Then "
"people started eating each other.  This doesn't feel like a fever dream."
msgstr ""
"La dernière chose dont vous vous souvenez, c'est d'avoir rencontré Dieu "
"derrière le Foodplace local.  Puis les gens ont commencé à se manger les uns "
"les autres.  Cela ne ressemble pas à un trip."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Nicotine Dependence" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your coworkers always muttered when you had to duck outside every hour for a "
"smoke, but it ended up saving your life when things got bad.  You'll need to "
"find a steady supply of nicotine if you want to keep the cravings at bay."
msgstr ""
"Vos collègues marmonnaient toujours lorsque vous deviez sortir au moins une "
"fois par heure pour fumer une cigarette, mais cela a fini par vous sauver la "
"vie lorsque les choses ont mal tourné.  Vous feriez mieux de trouver un "
"approvisionnement régulier en nicotine si vous souhaitez maîtriser les envies "
"de fumer."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Crack Cocaine Dependence" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Cocaine.  It is, indeed, a helluva drug.  You blew your money on some rocks, "
"and before you knew it you were turning tricks behind the local pharmacy just "
"to score a little more.  Where are you going to get your fix now?"
msgstr ""
"La cocaïne.  C’est en effet une sacrée drogue.  Vous avez dépensé votre "
"argent sur des pierres de crack, et avant de vous en rendre compte, vous "
"faisiez des tours de magie derrière la pharmacie locale juste pour en avoir "
"un peu plus.  Où allez vous trouver votre dose maintenant?"

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Amphetamine Dependence" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're not entirely sure what happened last night, but you woke up on the "
"floor and everything has completely gone to shit.  The only thing running "
"through your head, though, is where you're gonna find your next hit."
msgstr ""
"Vous ne savez pas exactement ce qui est arrivé la nuit dernière, mais tout "
"est parti en cacahouète, et la seule chose qui vous trotte dans la tête c'est "
"de savoir où trouver votre prochaine dose."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Painkiller Dependence" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After a bad accident, you became hooked on the opiates prescribed to you for "
"the pain.  With the pharmacies shut down and your dealers turned undead, "
"satisfying those cravings just got a lot more difficult."
msgstr ""
"Après un grave accident, vous êtes devenu accro aux opiacés qui vous ont été "
"prescrits pour soulager la douleur.  Avec la fermeture des pharmacies et la "
"transformation de vos revendeurs en morts-vivants, satisfaire ces envies est "
"devenu beaucoup plus difficile."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Alcohol Dependence" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"One drink became two, two became too many, and before long you were only able "
"to find solace at the bottom of a bottle.  God-damn, you need a drink."
msgstr ""
"Un verre est devenu deux, deux est devenu beaucoup trop, et très vite rien "
"d'autre que le fond d'une bouteille est devenu capable de vous comforter. "
"Merde vous avez besoin de boire."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Sleeping Pill Dependence" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You'd been having trouble falling asleep, so you started taking prescription "
"sleep meds.  Now you can hardly seem to fall asleep at all without them, and "
"you'll need plenty of rest to face the days ahead."
msgstr ""
"Vous aviez du mal à vous endormir, alors vous avez commencé à prendre des "
"somnifères sur ordonnance.  Désormais, vous avez du mal à vous endormir du "
"tout sans eux et vous aurez besoin de beaucoup de repos pour affronter les "
"jours à venir."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Caffeine Fiend" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Caffeine gave you life and without it you are nothing.  Your dependence upon "
"it was so extreme that you can barely function in its absence and you've done "
"lasting psychological harm to yourself.  You'd better find a steady supply, "
"and fast."
msgstr ""
"La caféine vous insufflait la vie et sans elle vous n'êtes rien.  Votre "
"dépendance à son égard était si extrême que vous pouvez à peine fonctionner "
"en son absence et vous vous êtes infligée un préjudice psychologique durable. "
" Vous feriez mieux de trouver un approvisionnement régulier et rapide."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Caffeine Dependence" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Coffee was your faithful companion every morning, and without it you feel "
"like a zombie.  Thanks to all the actual zombies shambling about, getting "
"your caffeine fix will be much harder now."
msgstr ""
"Le café était votre fidèle compagnon chaque matin, et sans lui, vous vous "
"sentez comme une zombie.  Tous les zombies traînant dans les environs "
"rendront obtenir votre dose de caféine désormais beaucoup plus difficile."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cosplay" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You liked to make your own costumes and wear them to various conventions.  "
"Now that everyone is dead or dying, maybe this will be useful for something "
"else."
msgstr ""
"Vous aimiez confectionner vos propres costumes et les porter lors de diverses "
"conventions.  Maintenant que tout le monde est mort ou mourant, peut-être que "
"cela servira à autre chose."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lockpicking (Beginner)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Whether it was for fun, innocent utility, or criminal intent, you learned the "
"basics of how to silently pick locks.  Now, being able to get into secured "
"places just got a lot more useful."
msgstr ""
"Que ce soit pour le plaisir, un loisir innocent ou une intention criminelle, "
"vous avez appris les bases du crochetage silencieux des serrures.  Désormais, "
"pouvoir accéder à des endroits sécurisés est devenu beaucoup plus utile."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lockpicking (Expert)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Maybe you're a certified locksmith, a career burglar, or an intense hobbyist. "
" Regardless, you've spent so long picking locks you could pop most open in "
"under a minute easy, with the right tools."
msgstr ""
"Peut-être êtes-vous une serrurière certifiée, une cambrioleuse de carrière ou "
"une amatrice acharnée.  Quoi qu’il en soit, vous avez passé tellement de "
"temps à crocheter des serrures que vous pourriez les ouvrir en moins d’une "
"minute facilement, avec les bons outils."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Parkour" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've practiced parkour for many years, and made the world your playground.  "
"It wouldn't be a lie to say that running is your life.  Which is good, "
"because now that the end has come, you're running for your life."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez pratiqué le parkour pendant des années et avez fait du monde votre "
"terrain de jeu.  Ça ne serait pas un mensonge d'affirmer que le freerun c'est "
"votre vie.  Ce qui est bien, parce que maintenant que la fin est arrivée, "
"vous courez pour votre vie."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Camping" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You enjoyed camping in the vast wilderness as a means of escaping the pace of "
"modern life.  The wilderness isn't filled with people, so it must be safe.  "
"Right?  It must be."
msgstr ""
"Vous aimiez camper dans les vastes étendues sauvages pour échapper au rythme "
"de la vie moderne.  La nature sauvage n’a pas une abondance d'humains, elle "
"doit donc être sûre.  Non?"

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bushcraft" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You take camping to a whole new level.  You have spent nights and weekends "
"surviving in the wild with just a knife to aid you.  Maybe this skill for "
"self-sufficiency can keep you safe."
msgstr ""
"Vous portez le camping à un tout autre niveau.  Vous avez passé des nuits et "
"des fins de semaine à survivre dans la nature avec juste un couteau pour vous "
"aider.  Peut-être que cette capacité d’autosuffisance peut assurer votre "
"sécurité."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Piloting" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're probably one of the last people alive who knows how to safely operate "
"a flying vehicle.  It remains to be seen whether you'll live long enough to "
"make use of that skill."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes probablement l’une des dernières personnes en vie à savoir comment "
"conduire un véhicule volant en toute sécurité.  Reste à savoir si vous vivrez "
"assez longtemps pour utiliser cette compétence."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Reading" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You love reading, but you never seemed to have enough time.  Maybe the "
"Cataclysm is a blessing in disguise."
msgstr ""
"Vous adorez lire, mais vous ne semblez jamais avoir assez de temps pour "
"indulger votre passion.  Peut-être que le Cataclysme est une bonne chose."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Chemical Cooking" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you produced illicit chemicals for your own consumption, or to sell "
"to others.  Or maybe you're just a real nerd about chemistry.  In any case, "
"you know your way around a Periodic Table."
msgstr ""
"Peut-être avez-vous synthétisé des produits chimiques illicites pour votre "
"propre consommation ou pour les distribuer.  Ou peut-être que vous êtes juste "
"une grande passionnée de chimie.  Qu'importe, vous connaissez bien le tableau "
"périodique."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Archery (Beginner)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've used a bow before and maybe taken a class or two.  You won't be "
"pulling off any trick shots but at least you can usually get an arrow to fly "
"forward instead of spinning off to the side."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez tenu un arc dans vos mains précédemment et peut-être avez fait "
"attention à un cours ou deux.  Vous n'allez pas faire des prodiges, mais au "
"moins il vous est possible de généralement faire voler une flèche droit "
"devant au lieu de la faire vriller vers le sol ou le côté."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Archery (Intermediate)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You enjoy nocking back an arrow and hearing it whistle through the air.  If "
"you can get the proper gear together and stay on-target, you'll have a good, "
"quiet alternative to using guns."
msgstr ""
"La routine d'encocher une flèche et l'entendre siffler à travers l'air vous "
"fait du bien au cœur.  Si votre équipement est convenable et vos cibles ne "
"sont pas dures à viser, vous disposerez d'une alternative silencieuse et "
"efficace aux armes à feu."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Archery (Expert)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a modern day Robin Hood and probably have hella back muscles.  Perhaps "
"you're an Olympic archer in training or maybe you're descended from the "
"longbowmen of old.  In either case, sniping zombie heads should be as easy as "
"pinning apples to trees for you."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes une Robine des Bois moderne et vos muscles dorsaux sont "
"probablement considérables.  Peut-être êtiez-vous une archère olympique ou "
"peut-être vos ancêtres étaient à Crécy et Azincourt.  Peu importe, empaler "
"des crânes de zombies ne devrait pas être plus dur que percer des pommes "
"lancées en l'air sur un arbre."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Swimming (Beginner)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You can swim.  Probably not very well, and you won't break any speed records, "
"but, you CAN swim."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez nager. Probablement pas très bien, et vous ne battrez aucun "
"record de vitesse, mais vous POUVEZ nager."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Swimming (Intermediate)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a strong swimmer, and you're pretty sure zombies aren't.  You can't "
"swim forever, but it's certainly an advantage over the undead."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes une bonne nageuse et vous êtes presque sûre que les zombies ne le "
"sont pas.   Vous ne pouvez pas nager éternellement, mais c'est certainement "
"un avantage contre les morts-vivants."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Swimming (Expert)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're an excellent swimmer and may be part fish.  Plus, all that swimming "
"has left you in great shape.  There aren't any zombie sharks in the water, "
"right?"
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes une excellente nageuse et peut-être avait un peu de poisson en "
"vous.  De plus, toute cette natation vous a permit de rester en forme "
"admirable.  Il n'y a pas de requins zombies dans l'eau, non?"

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Baseball (Beginner)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You used to play baseball, occasionally.  Maybe you were on your school team "
"growing up, but it was never a focus of yours.  Hopefully you can still "
"remember how to use a bat when your life depends on it."
msgstr ""
"Vous jouiez au baseball, de temps en temps.  Peut-être avez-vous fait partie "
"de votre équipe scolaire en grandissant, mais cela n’a jamais été votre "
"priorité.  Espérons que vous vous souviendrez encore de la façon d'utiliser "
"une batte si votre vie en dépend."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Baseball (Intermediate)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You got the stance, you got the grip, you got the game.  Swinging at a "
"zombie's head is close enough to swinging at a baseball… right?"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez la posture, vous avez la prise, vous avez le jeu. Écraser des têtes "
"de zombies ne devrait pas être trop différent d'une balle de baseball… non?"

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Baseball Pitcher (Expert)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're accustomed to striking out poor batters at the plate and can probably "
"throw a mean knuckleball.  Now you get to practice your fastball, but perhaps "
"with rocks or grenades this time."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez l'habitude de frapper des frappeurs médiocres au bâton et vous "
"savez probablement lancer une bonne balle papillon. Maintenant, vous pouvez "
"vous entraîner à lancer une balle rapide, mais peut-être avec des pierres ou "
"des grenades cette fois."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Baseball (Expert)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You didn't quite make it into the big leagues, but you were close.  Now it's "
"time to go for the grand slam or you'll be dealing with worse than a strike "
"out."
msgstr ""
"Vous n'avez pas réussi à intégrer les ligues majeures, mais vous en étiez "
"proche. Il est désormais temps de tenter le grand chelem, sinon vous risquez "
"de subir pire qu'un strike-out."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Wrestling (Beginner)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Maybe you've taken a few classes at a gym somewhere, or used to be on the "
"youth team, or maybe you just liked to rough-house with your friends or "
"family growing up.  You're not entirely unused to grappling, but you're "
"hardly an expert."
msgstr ""
"Peut-être avez-vous suivi quelques cours dans un gymnase quelque part, ou "
"fait partie d'une équipe de jeunes, ou peut-être avez-vous simplement aimé "
"vous bagarrer avec vos amis ou votre famille en grandissant.  Vous n'êtes pas "
"totalement novice aux prises et retournements, mais certainement pas une "
"experte."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Wrestling (Intermediate)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"While not the type of wrestler to use folding chairs as weapons, you have "
"experience wrasslin' and tusslin' with others out on the mat.  There's no "
"referees around to see, but hopefully your skills will help you avoid getting "
"pinned by the undead."
msgstr ""
"Bien que vous ne soyez pas le genre de lutteuse à utiliser des chaises "
"pliantes comme armes, vous avez de l'expérience concernant les prises et "
"retournements sur le tapis.  Il n'y a plus d'arbitres vous observant, donc "
"espérons que vos compétences vous aideront à éviter de vous faire coincer par "
"les morts-vivants."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Wrestling (Expert)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were likely on the 100+ wins list back in school and maybe you're a "
"collegiate wrestler or you're using it as part of something like MMA.  "
"Considering how grabby those zombies are, you should get plenty of use out of "
"your skills."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez probablement sur la liste des plus de 100 victoires à votre école "
"et peut-être êtiez-vous une lutteuse collégiale ou intégriez le style dans le "
"cadre de quelque chose comme la MMA.  Compte tenu des grippes de fer de ces "
"zombies, vous feriez mieux de tirer pleinement parti de vos compétences."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Video Gaming" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You loved immersing yourself in virtual worlds through video games.  Now "
"you're faced with real survival horror, and no extra lives."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez adoré vous immerger dans des mondes virtuels à travers les jeux "
"vidéo.  Vous êtes désormais confrontée à une situation de survival horror, "
"sans vies supplémentaires."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Trapping" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You liked to trap little wild animals such as mice and other rodents.  This "
"skill could be useful for working with more deadly devices, if you're "
"creative enough."
msgstr ""
"Vous aimiez piéger de petits animaux sauvages comme les souris et autres "
"rongeurs.  Cette compétence pourrait être utile pour travailler avec des "
"dispositifs plus léthaux, si vous êtes suffisamment créative."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dodgeball" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Dodging fast-moving balls as though your life depended on it was fun.  "
"Dodging zombies isn't as fun, but your life certainly depends on it."
msgstr ""
"Esquiver les balles rapides comme si votre vie en dépendait était amusant.  "
"Esquiver les zombies n'est pas aussi amusant, mais votre vie en dépend "
"certainement."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Electronic Tinkering" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You found unexpected solace while soldering components to circuit boards."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez trouvé du réconfort inattendu en soudant des composants sur des "
"circuits imprimés."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "DIY Crafting (Intermediate)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You spent much of your time making useful things out of bits and bobbles."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez passé une grande partie de votre temps à fabriquer des objets "
"utiles à partir de bricoles."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "DIY Crafting (Expert)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Whether due to circumstances forcing ingenuity or just an unhealthy "
"fascination with tinkering you're a certified MacGyver with a very wide range "
"of fabrication knowledge.  You could probably make a functioning cannon out "
"of a paper clip and some bubble gum."
msgstr ""
"Que ce soit en raison des circonstances qui vous ont forcé à faire preuve "
"d'ingéniosité ou simplement d'une fascination malsaine pour le bricolage, "
"vous êtes un MacGyver certifié possédant un très large éventail de "
"connaissances en matière de fabrication. Vous pourriez probablement fabriquer "
"un canon fonctionnel à partir d'un trombone et d'un chewing-gum."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cooking (Beginner)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You can cook well enough that you didn't have to live on instant noodles and "
"takeout, but you've only really learned the bare minimum."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez cuisiner suffisamment bien pour ne pas avoir à vivre de nouilles "
"instantanées et de plats à emporter, mais vous n'avez vraiment appris que le "
"strict minimum."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cooking (Intermediate)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You enjoyed cooking for yourself and others.  The grocery stores are closed "
"for good, so you might need to start getting creative with your recipes."
msgstr ""
"Vous aimiez cuisiner pour vous et pour les autres.  Les épiceries sont "
"fermées pour de bon, vous devrez donc peut-être commencer à faire preuve de "
"créativité avec vos recettes."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cooking (Expert)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're an excellent chef capable of making delicious meals out of almost "
"anything and have a wide array of culinary knowledge.  Sadly, the undead "
"would rather eat you than your meals."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes une excellente cheffe capable de préparer de délicieux repas avec "
"presque tout et possédez un large éventail de connaissances culinaires.  "
"Malheureusement, les morts-vivants préfèrent vous manger plutôt que vos repas."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cheesemaking" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The art of producing the finest quality cheeses has been passed down through "
"your family for generations.  How useful these skills will be in the "
"apocalypse remains to *brie* seen."
msgstr ""
"L’art de produire des fromages de la plus haute qualité se transmet dans "
"votre famille depuis des générations. Il reste à voir dans quelle mesure ces "
"compétences seront utiles dans l'apocalypse."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Home canning" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Whether it was something practiced in your family or something you took it up "
"to extend the shelf life of your groceries, you know how to preserve produce "
"and meat in cans or mason jars.  With the electricity down and refrigerators "
"dead, saying your skills could come in handy is an understatement."
msgstr ""
"Que ce soit une pratique familiale ou une méthode que vous avez adoptée pour "
"prolonger la durée de conservation de vos produits d'épicerie, vous savez "
"comment conserver les fruits et légumes et la viande dans des boîtes de "
"conserve ou des bocaux Mason. Avec la panne d'électricité et les "
"réfrigérateurs hors service, dire que vos compétences pourraient s'avérer "
"utiles est un euphémisme."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Paintball" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Pretending to shoot at your friends has always been fun.  Now you can do it "
"for real."
msgstr ""
"Faire semblant de tirer sur ses amis a toujours été amusant.  Maintenant, "
"vous pouvez le faire pour de vrai."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Plinking" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You enjoyed target plinking with your airsoft pistol.  You're a good shot, "
"but you'll need a real gun for it to matter."
msgstr ""
"Vous appréciait le tir à la cible avec votre pistolet airsoft et pouvez "
"toucher une cible pas mal, mais une vraie arme à feu est une toute autre "
"créature."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Skeet Shooting" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Where the skeet go, your shot follows.  Throw enough pellets downrange, and "
"you'll at least hit something."
msgstr ""
"Là où va le pigeon d'argile, votre tir suit.  Tirez suffisamment de plombs et "
"vous toucherez au moins quelque chose."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Public Speaking" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are an incredibly social individual, with the projection and vocabulary "
"to make people listen."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes une personne incroyablement sociale, dotée de la projection et du "
"vocabulaire nécessaires pour que les gens vous écoutent."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Street Fighting (Intermediate)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've been in quite a few fights in the street.  You can throw and dodge a "
"punch better than most."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez participé à pas mal de bagarres de rue. Et pouvez assener et "
"esquiver un coup de poing mieux que la plupart."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Street Fighting (Expert)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Maybe you're the muscle of some criminal gang, maybe you're a bouncer at a "
"club, or maybe you're just a huge asshole.  You've constantly been getting "
"into fights with strangers on the streets for most of your life, and somehow "
"you ain't dead yet, so you must be doing something right."
msgstr ""
"Peut-être que tu es le bras droit d'un gang de criminels, peut-être que tu es "
"le videur d'une boîte de nuit, ou peut-être que tu es juste un gros connard. "
"Tu t'es constamment battu avec des inconnus dans la rue pendant la majeure "
"partie de ta vie, et d'une manière ou d'une autre, tu n'es pas encore mort, "
"donc tu dois faire quelque chose de bien."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Knife Throwing" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You learned how to throw knives before the world ended, a skill that can be "
"deadly in the right situation."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez appris à lancer des couteaux avant la fin du monde, un talent qui "
"pourrait être utile dans ce nouveau monde."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Sewing (Intermediate)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are quite good at sewing torn clothes back together, and have even made "
"your own clothes a few times."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez assez talentueuse à raccommoder des vêtements déchirés, et avez "
"même à l'occasion cousus vos propres vêtements."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Sewing (Expert)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Despite modern technology making career tailors obsolete you've spent much of "
"your life hand-making clothing of all sorts, whether for historical purposes "
"or to sell as artisanal goods.  Too bad you can't stitch the holes in reality "
"closed."
msgstr ""
"Malgré le fait que la technologie moderne rende obsolètes les tailleurs "
"professionnels, vous avez passé une grande partie de votre vie à "
"confectionner à la main des vêtements de toutes sortes, que ce soit à des "
"fins historiques ou pour les vendre comme produits artisanaux. Dommage que "
"vous ne puissiez pas recoudre les trous dans la réalité."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Fencing (Intermediate)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were in a fencing club, and you weren't too shabby with a saber.  If you "
"can get your hands on a real sword, you'll be a formidable fighter."
msgstr ""
"Vous faisiez partie d'un club d'escrime et n'étais pas trop mauvaise avec un "
"sabre.  Si vous parvenez à mettre la main sur une véritable épée, vous serez "
"une redoutable combattante."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Fencing (Expert)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've spent so long practicing your fencing you wouldn't look out of place "
"in the Renaissance dueling with ne'er-do-wells and rapscallions.  En Garde!"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez passé tellement de temps à pratiquer l'escrime que vous ne seriez "
"pas dépaysé lors d'un duel de la Renaissance avec des vauriens et des "
"scélérats. En garde !"

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Motorsports" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a big fan of cars and other things that go vroom, whether it's fixing "
"them or driving them.  You may not be a professional, but you know your way "
"around an engine."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes un grand fan des voitures et autres objets qui font du bruit, que "
"ce soit pour les réparer ou les conduire. Vous n'êtes peut-être pas un "
"professionnel, mais vous savez vous y prendre avec un moteur."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Racing" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a real speed demon in anything with an engine!  Pulling off hairpin "
"turns at high speeds is a difficult skill to master but you can drift with "
"the best of them."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes un véritable démon de vitesse sur tout ce qui a un moteur ! Réussir "
"des virages en épingle à cheveux à grande vitesse est une compétence "
"difficile à maîtriser, mais vous pouvez déraper avec les meilleurs d'entre "
"eux."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cardio Kickboxing" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've trained in non-combat kickboxing at a gym as a way to exercise.  While "
"you were taught the moves, you've never sparred or fought anything more "
"dangerous than a falling punching bag.  Whether you can remember your "
"training when push kick comes to jab is up to you."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous êtes entraîné au kickboxing non-combat dans une salle de sport pour "
"faire de l'exercice. Bien qu'on vous ait appris ces mouvements, vous n'avez "
"jamais combattu contre quelque chose de plus dangereux qu'un sac de frappe "
"qui tombe. C'est à vous de décider si vous pouvez vous souvenir de votre "
"entraînement lorsque le coup de pied poussé devient un coup de poing."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Martial Arts" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have received some martial arts training at a local dojo.  You start with "
"your choice of Karate, Judo, Aikido, Tai Chi, Taekwondo, or Pankration."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez suivi une formation en arts martiaux dans un dojo local. Vous "
"débutez par le karaté, le judo, l'aïkido, le tai-chi, le taekwondo ou le "
"pancrace, selon votre choix."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Self-Defense" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have taken some self-defense classes at a local gym.  You start with your "
"choice of Boxing, Kickboxing, Capoeira, Krav Maga, Muay Thai, Ninjutsu, Wing "
"Chun, or Zui Quan."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez suivi des cours d'autodéfense dans une salle de sport locale. Vous "
"commencez par choisir entre la boxe, le kickboxing, la capoeira, le krav "
"maga, le muay thaï, le ninjutsu, le wing chun ou le zui quan."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Shaolin Kung Fu" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have studied the arts of the Shaolin monks.  You start with one of the "
"five animal fighting styles: Tiger, Crane, Leopard, Snake, or Dragon."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez étudié les arts des moines Shaolin. Vous démarrez avec l'un de ces "
"cinq styles de combats: Tigre, Grue, Léopard, Serpent ou Dragon."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Black Belt" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've been doing martial arts for years and have earned the coveted black "
"belt in a martial art of your choice."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez pratiqué des arts martiaux pendant des années et avez obtenu une "
"ceinture noire convoitée dans un style de votre choix."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Melee Training (Intermediate)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have practiced fighting with weapons.  You start with your choice of "
"Barbaran Montante, Bōjutsu, Eskrima, Fencing, Fior Di Battaglia, Medieval "
"Swordsmanship, Niten Ichi-Ryu, Pencak Silat, or Sōjutsu."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez pratiqué le combat avec des armes. Vous commencez par choisir entre "
"le Barbaran Montante, le Bōjutsu, l'Eskrima, l'Escrime, la Fior Di Battaglia, "
"l'Escrime médiévale, le Niten Ichi-Ryu, le Pencak Silat ou le Sōjutsu."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Melee Training (Expert)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Despite firearms making traditional melee weapons largely obsolete, you have "
"extensive experience fighting in hand-to-hand combat with tools of war.  "
"Maybe it was full-contact HEMA or SCA sparring, or maybe you're just a badass "
"commando with a machete.  You start with your choice of Barbaran Montante, "
"Bōjutsu, Eskrima, Fencing, Fior Di Battaglia, Medieval Swordsmanship, Niten "
"Ichi-Ryu, Pencak Silat, or Sōjutsu."
msgstr ""
"Malgré le fait que les armes à feu rendent les armes de mêlée traditionnelles "
"plus ou moins obsolètes, vous avez une vaste expérience de combat en corps à "
"corps en utilisant des instruments de guerre variés. Peut être cette "
"expérience vient de duels AMHE ou SAC, ou peut être vous êtes juste une "
"commando badass équipée d'une machette. Vous commencez le jeu avec un choix "
"entre la Montante Barbaran, le Bōjutsu, l'Eskrima, l'Escrime, la Fior Di "
"Battaglia, l'Escrime Médiévale, le Niten Ichi-Ryu, le Pencak Silat ou le "
"Sōjutsu comme style de combat."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Fine Dining" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You loved going to all kinds of restaurants and experiencing everything the "
"world of culinary arts had to offer.  Nowadays, those chefs are all dead, so "
"it'll be up to you to recreate the joys of your past."
msgstr ""
"Vous aimiez fréquenter toutes sortes de restaurants et découvrir tout ce que "
"le monde des arts culinaires avait à offrir.  Aujourd'hui, ces chefs sont "
"tous morts, ce sera donc à vous de recréer les joies de votre passé."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Competitive Eating" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a professional eater before the Cataclysm and frequently "
"participated in eating contests.  Thanks to your training, you can eat huge "
"amounts of food without getting sick, and while eating forty hot dogs in ten "
"minutes might not be too useful in the apocalypse, your fortitude might help "
"you survive off food other survivors would pass over."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez un mangeur professionnel avant le Cataclysme et participiez "
"fréquemment à des concours de nourriture. Grâce à votre entraînement, vous "
"pouvez manger d'énormes quantités de nourriture sans tomber malade, et même "
"si manger quarante hot-dogs en dix minutes ne vous sera peut-être pas très "
"utile en cas d'apocalypse, votre courage pourrait vous aider à survivre en "
"vous nourrissant de nourriture que les autres survivants refuseraient."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Marathon Running" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You ran the Boston Marathon every year.  That conditioning should make you "
"better equipped than most in avoiding the dead."
msgstr ""
"Vous couriez le Marathon de Boston chaque année. Cet entraînement devrait "
"probablement vous rendre plus apte à distancer les morts que la plupart des "
"personnes toujours vivantes."

#: data/json/hobbies.json data/mods/innawood/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Book Hating" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Reading is for nerds!  You've managed to make hatred of the written word a "
"central part of your identity.  Or, perhaps, you have a barrier that makes "
"books additionally challenging and frustrating for you.  Whatever the reason, "
"boring books are more boring, and you can't have fun by reading books."
msgstr ""
"La lecture c'est pour les intellos! Vous avez réussi a faire de votre haine "
"pour le mot écrit une partie centrale de votre identité. Ou peut être vous "
"avez des difficultés rendant la lecture plus difficile et frustrante pour "
"vous que la moyenne. Quelle que soit la raison, les livres ennuyeux sont plus "
"ennuyeux pour vous et les livres ne vont remontent pas le moral."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Butchering" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You absolutely love meat, and dislike eating fruits and vegetables.  Your "
"particular tastes have turned you into a decent amateur butcher."
msgstr ""
"Vous adorez la viande, et n'appréciez pas trop les fruits et légumes.  Vos "
"goûts particuliers ont fait de vous une bouchère amateure décente."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Vegetarian Foraging" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have been a vegetarian for so long that eating meat makes you feel sick.  "
"You like to supplement your diet with wild plants and mushrooms foraged in "
"the woods."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes végétarienne depuis si longtemps que manger de la viande vous rend "
"malade.  Vous aimez compléter votre alimentation avec des plantes et des "
"champignons sauvages cueillis dans les bois."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Skating" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are skilled in maneuvering on skates.  You suffer lower penalties to "
"dodging and are less likely to fall down if hit in melee combat while you're "
"wearing rollerskates or rollerblades."
msgstr ""
"Vous manœuvrez habilement avec des patins. Vous subissez des pénalités "
"moindres en esquivant et êtes moins susceptible de tomber si vous êtes "
"touchée en corps à corps alors que vous portez des patins à roulettes ou des "
"rollers."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arts and Crafts" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You loved doing crafts at home.  Now, you might want to channel those skills "
"into making more practical things."
msgstr ""
"Vous aimiez bricoler à la maison. Vous pourriez désormais mettre ces "
"compétences au service de la fabrication d'objets plus pratiques."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Car Restoration" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Spending time every weekend in your garage working on an old classic car was "
"your favorite pastime.  You never finished the car, but at least you learned "
"a little over the years."
msgstr ""
"Passer du temps chaque week-end dans votre garage à travailler sur une "
"vieille voiture classique était votre passe-temps favori. Vous n'avez jamais "
"terminé la voiture, mais au moins vous avez appris un peu au fil des ans."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Practical Jokes" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Pranks and physical jokes are a passion of yours, from the setup right "
"through to playing innocent at the end."
msgstr ""
"Les farces et les blagues physiques sont votre passion, depuis la préparation "
"jusqu'à jouer l'innocent à la fin."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Modeling" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were deep into the fashion scene, keeping up on the latest trends and "
"even modeling clothes yourself.  Having style and good looks is just as, if "
"not more, important to you than practicality."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez à fond dans la mode, toujours à l'affût des dernières tendances, "
"et vous faisiez même du mannequinat. Pour vous, avoir du style et être belle, "
"c'est au moins aussi important, voir plus, que l'aspect pratique."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Pottery" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a master of throwing on the potter's wheel, able to shape clay into "
"whatever shape you need."
msgstr ""
"Vous maîtrisez parfaitement la tour de potier et êtes capable de donner à "
"l'argile n'importe quelle forme dont vous avez besoin."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Handloading" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You figured you could save money on ammo by learning to make your own.  Now "
"that the factories are shut down, your abilities just went from handy to "
"lifesaving."
msgstr ""
"Vous pensiez que vous pourriez économiser de l'argent sur les munitions en "
"apprenant à fabriquer les vôtres.  Maintenant que les usines sont fermées, "
"cette compétence est passée de pratique à salvatrice."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Tabletop Gaming" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As the Game Master, you've guided players' journeys through dungeons and "
"fortresses.  Now, you're the last member of your party."
msgstr ""
"En tant que Maître du jeu, vous avez guidé les joueurs dans leurs aventures à "
"travers les donjons et les forteresses. Vous êtes désormais le dernier membre "
"de votre groupe."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ham Radio" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You whiled your nights away using, building, and repairing old ham radios.  "
"Now you have no one to talk to. But you won't give up hope, and maybe your "
"electronics knowledge can help you somehow."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez passé vos nuits à utiliser, construire et réparer de vieilles "
"radios amateur.  Maintenant, vous n'avez personne à qui parler.  Mais vous ne "
"perdrez pas espoir et peut-être que vos connaissances en électronique "
"pourront vous aider d’une manière ou d’une autre."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Golf" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The backswing's a breeze, and your drive could get skulls into the green if "
"you tried."
msgstr ""
"Le backswing est un jeu d'enfant, et votre drive pourrait envoyer des crânes "
"sur le green si vous essayiez."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cyclist (Beginner)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Whether through regular commuting, or just riding for the joy of it, you're "
"no stranger to bicycles."
msgstr ""
"Que ce soit pour vos déplacements réguliers ou simplement pour le plaisir, "
"vous n'êtes pas étrangère aux vélos."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cyclist (Intermediate)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've shed gallons of sweat, and more than a little blood, riding the "
"streets and trails as a cyclist."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez versé des litres de sueur et plus qu'un peu de sang en parcourant "
"les rues et les sentiers en tant que cycliste."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cyclist (Expert)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've honed the fitness and form of a professional bicycle racer.  When "
"you're riding, your wheels are like an extension of your body."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez perfectionné la condition physique et la forme d’une cycliste "
"professionnelle.  Lorsque vous roulez, vos roues sont comme une extension de "
"votre corps."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Basketball (Beginner)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You used to shoot some b-ball outside of the school… at least, until a couple "
"of corpses who were up to no good started making trouble in your neighborhood."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez joué un peu de basket durant vos années scolaires et vous jouiez "
"toujours quelques matchs amicaux avec vos amis de temps en temps."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Basketball (Intermediate)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Your ability to play point or post will beat the undead in overtime."
msgstr ""
"Votre capacité à jouer en pointe ou en poste vous permettra de vaincre les "
"morts-vivants en prolongation."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Basketball (Expert)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You can sink 3-pointers all day, and dribble around the most determined "
"defenders."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez marquer des tirs à trois points toute la journée et performiez "
"bien au niveau professionnel national."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Football (Beginner)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You'd occasionally play touch or flag football at the park, but never got too "
"serious about it."
msgstr ""
"Vous jouiez occasionnellement au touch football ou au flag football au parc, "
"mais jamais très sérieusement."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Football (Intermediate)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're no stranger to throwing the ol' pigskin and taking a few tackles.  "
"Hopefully your skills in dodging defenders will help you charge through the "
"hordes of undead."
msgstr ""
"Vous n'êtes pas étranger à l'art de lancer le ballon et de vous faire tacler. "
"Espérons que vos compétences en matière d'esquive des défenseurs vous "
"aideront à foncer à travers les hordes de morts-vivants."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Football (Expert)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You played college ball, ya know.  You could have gone pro if the world "
"hadn't ended."
msgstr ""
"Tu as joué au basket-ball à l'université, tu sais. Tu aurais pu devenir pro "
"si le monde n'avait pas pris fin."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Soccer (Beginner)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You used to kick a ball around with your friends, having fun together.  "
"Though it may not be the case anymore."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Soccer (Intermediate)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your fondness for the beautiful game shows with your flairs, skills and "
"tackles.  Whether you can go past the backline of the undead is a question "
"yet to be answered."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Soccer (Expert)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were on trial at a professional club, ready to get a contract.  What a "
"great opportunity for you, if only your coaches were still alive."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Shooting (Beginner)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've been to a gun range once or twice and maybe took a firearm safety "
"class.  At the very least, you're confident you can point the gun in the "
"correct direction."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez une ou deux heures passées au stand de tir sous la ceinture et avez "
"peut être passé un cours vous ayant appris comment au moins pointer une arme "
"à feu dans la bonne direction sans être un danger public."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Shooting (Intermediate)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You liked going to the local gun range and shooting at some targets or "
"blasting cans off of fence posts with a variety of firearms.  Maybe if you "
"just imagine targets on those undead, this could help."
msgstr ""
"Vous aimiez aller au stand de tir local et tirer sur des cibles ou faire "
"exploser des canettes sur des poteaux de clôture avec diverses armes à feu. "
"Peut-être que si vous imaginiez simplement des cibles sur ces morts-vivants, "
"cela pourrait vous aider."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "First Aid" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've got training and some experience in dealing with urgent injuries.  In "
"the absence of any medical professionals, that'll have to do."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez suivi une formation et possédez une certaine expérience dans le "
"traitement des blessures urgentes. En l'absence de professionnels de la "
"santé, vous devrez vous contenter de cela."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Trap Shooting" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You loved the smell of gunsmoke and blowing ceramic discs out of the sky.  "
"Your future will likely involve shooting things a little fleshier than clay "
"pigeons."
msgstr ""
"Vous aimez l'odeur de la fumée des armes à feu et le fait de faire exploser "
"des disques de céramique dans le ciel. Votre avenir consistera probablement à "
"tirer sur des choses un peu plus charnues que des pigeons d'argile."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Backyard Grilling" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You enjoyed inviting the neighborhood to a backyard cookout on the weekends.  "
"You, of course, were the grill master."
msgstr ""
"Vous aimiez inviter le voisinage à faire la cuisine dans votre jardin le "
"week-end. Vous étiez, bien sûr, le maître du gril."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Carpentry" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"With enough time and materials, you could make a boat from scratch.  These "
"undead can't swim, right?"
msgstr ""
"Avec suffisamment de temps et de matériaux, vous pourriez fabriquer un bateau "
"à partir de rien. Ces morts-vivants ne savent pas nager, n'est-ce pas ?"

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Woodworking - Luthier" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've learned woodworking in the field of making musical instruments.  "
"You'll be able to create musical instruments in the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez appris le travail du bois dans le domaine de la fabrication "
"d'instruments de musique. Vous pourrez créer des instruments de musique "
"durant le Cataclysme."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Home Improvement" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You'd fix up any holes and appliances in your own home with nothing but your "
"two hands and some elbow grease.  You did it to save money on repairmen, but "
"now it seems you'll do it to save your life."
msgstr ""
"Vous répariez les trous et les appareils de votre maison avec vos deux mains "
"et de l'huile de coude. Vous le faisiez pour économiser l'argent des "
"réparateurs, mais il semble maintenant que vous le ferez pour sauver votre "
"vie."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Fishing" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A quiet day at the lake would be a welcome break from the hordes.  Though, "
"now that you think about it, the fish have been acting strangely vicious "
"lately too."
msgstr ""
"Une journée tranquille au bord du lac serait une pause bienvenue parmi les "
"hordes. D'ailleurs, maintenant que vous y pensez, les poissons se sont "
"montrés étrangement vicieux ces derniers temps."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Home Gunsmithing" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You could have been the next Browning, if not for the those pesky corpses "
"walking around.  It's time to test for accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Vous auriez pu devenir le prochain Browning, si vous n'aviez pas eu ces "
"cadavres ennuyeux qui se promènent. Il est temps de tester la précision."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Roller Derby" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Being able to body your way through the pack is always useful, whether your "
"opponent is living or rotting."
msgstr ""
"Savoir comment charger à travers une foule est toujours utile, que vos "
"obstacles soient vivants ou en voie de décomposition."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Roller Hockey" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your time in the rink has taught you that sometimes the best way forward is "
"straight through whoever's trying to block you."
msgstr ""
"Le temps passé sur la patinoire vous a appris que la meilleure façon "
"d'avancer est parfois de passer au travers de celui qui essaie de vous "
"bloquer."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Deep Frying" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You'd have been a hit at the county fair, but you're cooking for one now."
msgstr ""
"Vous auriez été un succès à la foire du comté, mais vous cuisinez pour un "
"autre maintenant."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Homebrewing" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your white lightning could knock out an elephant, but you're drinking alone "
"now."
msgstr ""
"Votre gnôle maison pourrait assommer un éléphant, mais vous buvez seul "
"maintenant."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Sports Coaching" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"They tore apart your team, but you're determined to keep the team spirit "
"alive."
msgstr ""
"Ils ont déchiré votre équipe, mais vous êtes déterminé à maintenir l'esprit "
"d'équipe."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Gardening" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Your green thumb will come in handy when the grocery stores are overrun."
msgstr ""
"Votre main verte sera bien utile lorsque les magasins d'alimentation seront "
"pris d'assaut."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ropemaking" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Your knots are strong, whether they're made from cloth or natural cordage."
msgstr ""
"Vos nœuds sont solides, qu'ils soient faits à partir de tissu ou de cordage "
"naturel."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Backpacking" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You enjoyed trekking on long trails in nature with all your necessities "
"strapped to your back."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez aimé faire de longues randonnées dans la nature avec tout ce dont "
"vous avez besoin attaché à votre dos."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Trivia" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You loved learning and sharing interesting facts about many different topics. "
" None of them are useful anymore, but your strong memory certainly is."
msgstr ""
"Vous aimiez apprendre et partager des faits intéressants sur de nombreux "
"sujets. Aucun d'entre eux n'est plus utile aujourd'hui, mais votre solide "
"mémoire l'est assurément."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Scrap Art" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent hours welding discarded scrap into large and intricate designs.  "
"Some said you were just welding junk into bigger junk.  You call it art."
msgstr ""
"Vous passiez des heures à souder des rebuts pour en faire de grands dessins "
"complexes. Certains disaient que vous ne faisiez que souder de la ferraille "
"dans de la ferraille encore plus grande. Vous appelez cela de l'art."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Moshing" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You went to loud concerts and spent your time in the mosh pits.  Now that "
"everything's gone to hell, the whole world is your mosh pit."
msgstr ""
"Vous alliez à des concerts bruyants et passiez votre temps à faire du pogo "
"dans la fosse. Maintenant que tout est parti en vrille, le monde entier fait "
"du pogo."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Fire Performing" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Whether you twirled, spun, juggled, or ate it, your manipulation of flaming "
"objects was impressive and terrifying to behold."
msgstr ""
"Qu'il s'agisse de virevolter, de filer, de jongler ou de manger, la "
"manipulation d'objets enflammés était impressionnante et terrifiante à voir."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Social Dancing" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You loved meeting new people on the dance floor.  These zombies aren't "
"terribly friendly, but they're ready to tango!"
msgstr ""
"Vous aimez rencontrer de nouvelles personnes sur la piste de danse. Ces "
"zombies ne sont pas très amicaux, mais ils sont prêts à danser le tango !"

#: data/json/hobbies.json data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Meditation" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You make a habit of clearing your thoughts and finding your center, even "
"amidst the chaos of the world."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez l’habitude de vider vos pensées et de trouver votre centre, même au "
"milieu du chaos du monde."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Vagabond" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Circumstance left you wandering the world, alone.  Now there is nothing to go "
"back to, even if you wanted to.  Perhaps your experience in fending for "
"yourself will prove useful in this new world."
msgstr ""
"Les circonstances vous ont laissé errer seule à travers le monde.  "
"Maintenant, il n'y a nul part où revenir, même si vous le vouliez.  Peut-être "
"que votre expérience et débrouillardise s’avérera utile dans ce nouveau monde."

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Survivor" for female
#. ~ Description of profession "Paradox Survivor" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Some would say that there's nothing particularly notable about you, but "
"you've survived, and that's more than most could say right now."
msgstr ""
"Certains diraient que vous n'avez rien de particulièrement remarquable, mais "
"vous avez survécu, et c’est plus que ce que la plupart pourraient dire à "
"l’heure actuelle."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Video Blogger" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You made a career out of creating and commentating video content and posting "
"it on various platforms.  Now most of your fans are dead, alongside your "
"equipment.  Maybe you didn't cultivate the most practical skillset through "
"your career, but you have learned a thing or two about troubleshooting "
"software and getting people to listen to you."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez fait carrière en créant et en commentant du contenu vidéo et en le "
"publiant sur diverses plateformes.  Aujourd’hui, la plupart de vos fans sont "
"morts, tout comme votre équipement.  Peut-être que vous n'avez pas développé "
"les compétences les plus pratiques avec votre occupation précédente, mais "
"vous avez appris une ou deux choses sur le dépannage des logiciels et comment "
"persuader les gens de vous écouter."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Sheltered Survivor" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"At the start of the Cataclysm, you hunkered down in a bomb shelter.  You've "
"spent the past months eating canned food, reading books, and tinkering.  Now "
"it is winter - time to face the world above."
msgstr ""
"Au début du Cataclysme, vous vous êtes cachée dans un abri anti-bombes.  Vous "
"avez passé les derniers mois à manger des conserves, à lire des livres et à "
"bricoler.  C'est maintenant l'hiver, il est temps d'affronter le monde d'en "
"haut."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Sheltered Militia" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"At the start of the Cataclysm, you hunkered down in a bomb shelter with your "
"collection of guns.  You've spent the past months eating canned food and "
"practicing your aim.  Now it is winter - time to face the world above."
msgstr ""
"Au début du Cataclysme, vous vous êtes cachée dans un abri anti-bombes avec "
"votre collection d'armes.  Vous avez passé les derniers mois à manger des "
"conserves et à vous entraîner à viser.  C'est maintenant l'hiver, il est "
"temps d'affronter le monde d'en haut."

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Tailor" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Tailoring may not seem like the most useful skill when the world has ended.  "
"Most people wouldn't expect a simple tailor to live very long.  This is your "
"opportunity to prove them wrong."
msgstr ""
"La couture ne semble peut-être pas être la compétence la plus utile à la fin "
"du monde.  La plupart des gens ne s’attendraient pas à ce qu’une simple "
"tailleuse vive très longtemps.  C’est l’occasion de leur prouver qu’ils ont "
"tort."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Chef" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Bork bork!  Years in the kitchen have left you carrying a prodigious bulk, "
"but you managed to escape the carnage with your trusty butcher knife and only "
"a small collection of stains on your uniform."
msgstr ""
"Des années passées en cuisine vous ont laissé un poids prodigieux, mais vous "
"avez réussi à échapper au carnage avec votre fidèle couteau de boucher et "
"seulement une petite collection de taches sur votre uniforme."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Butcher" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent most of your adult life in a butcher shop.  Your trusty knife has "
"seen many different creatures and you know how to butcher them."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez passé la plus grande partie de votre vie adulte dans une boucherie. "
"Votre couteau fidèle a touché une grande variété de créatures et vous êtes "
"parfaitement capable de les dépecer."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Churl" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"What the deuyl?  Ye ne wist noo thing of this straunge plaas nor what wycked "
"enchauntment brought ye hidder.  Wyth this accoustrement ye must needs "
"underfongen to find newe lyflode in the most hidous Cataclysm man hath "
"witnessed sithen that deluge Noe rood out in his greet schippe."
msgstr ""
"Qu'est-ce donq que c'est?  Vous ne savez guieres de choses de ce liu "
"estrange, ne quel enchantement monstrueux vous a mené à cet contré.  Avéc "
"cest accoutrement bizarre, il vous convient de quérir nouvelles manières de "
"subsister en cest Cataclysme hideus, tel que l'omme n'a gueres veu depuis Noé "
"en son arche benie lors du Déluge."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lab Technician" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Thanks to years of study and hard work in the lab, you're familiar with the "
"basics of scientific inquiry.  Only one question remains: can you undo the "
"very Cataclysm your colleagues helped create?"
msgstr ""
"Grâce à des années d'études et de travail acharné en laboratoire, vous "
"connaissez les bases de la recherche scientifique.  Une seule question "
"demeure: parviendrez-vous à défaire le Cataclysme que vos collègues ont "
"contribué à créer?"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Chemical Engineer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You know your way around the periodic table and can name ten different "
"industrial processes that involve any given chemical, but that did not "
"prevent the prospect of employment from looking bleak for you.  Fortunately, "
"the Cataclysm might just be the thing to save you from a dead end job."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Home Mechanic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've always loved cars, and there's nothing like getting under the hood and "
"fixing it yourself.  You've kept ahold of some handy tools for the job, and "
"at least now you'll never want for parts."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez toujours aimé les voitures, et il n'y a rien de tel que de passer "
"sous le capot et de les réparer vous-même.  Vous avez conservé des outils "
"pratiques pour le travail et au moins maintenant vous ne manquerez plus de "
"pièces."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mechanical Engineer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've always loved machines, and have extensively incorporated them into "
"your career.  Not long after receiving your degree, you seem to be the one "
"being subjected to a stress test, and it remains unclear if you will retain "
"your structural integrity."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Scoundrel" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your flexible outlook on the law, the scuffles you've been in (and avoided) "
"at the bar, and your impressive ability to weasel your way out of the "
"consequences of your actions - all these skills have helped ensure your "
"survival.  How much longer will they hold out?"
msgstr ""
"Votre vision flexible de la loi, les bagarres auxquelles vous avez survécu "
"(et évitées) au bar et votre impressionnante capacité à vous échapper des "
"conséquences de vos actes - toutes ces compétences ont contribué à assurer "
"votre survie.  Mais combien de temps encore cela tiendra?"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Beekeeper" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You used to be a professional apiarist, building and maintaining beehives.  "
"You had to abandon your precious bees when the Cataclysm struck, but at least "
"you managed to grab some utensils and honey."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez apicultrice professionnelle, construisant et entretenant des "
"ruches.  Vous avez dû abandonner vos précieuses abeilles lorsque le "
"Cataclysme a frappé, mais vous avez au moins réussi à récupérer quelques "
"ustensiles et du miel."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Baseball Player" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You played with the local team.  You're the only one left, but now you can "
"use your trusty bat for another purpose.  Home run!"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez joué avec l'équipe locale.  Vous êtes la seule qui reste, mais vous "
"pouvez désormais utiliser votre fidèle batte à d'autres fins.  Coup de "
"circuit!"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Basketball Player" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your first major game was abruptly canceled when zombies stormed the court.  "
"Quick feet and good reflexes meant you were among the lucky few to escape the "
"stadium alive."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Football Player" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your epic touchdown was ruined when your coach's guts were torn out by undead "
"fans.  Now you're first pick in the apocalypse draft."
msgstr ""
"Votre touché épique a été gâché lorsque les tripes de votre entraîneur ont "
"été arrachées par des fans morts-vivants.  Maintenant, vous êtes le premier "
"choix dans la sélection de l'apocalypse."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "True Foodperson" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are the true Foodperson.  Some might think Foodperson is just a mascot, "
"but you know better.  The mask has become your face, you are real, and the "
"only thing standing between this world and oblivion is you."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes la véritable Foodperson.  Certains pourraient penser que Foodperson "
"n’est qu’une mascotte, mais vous savez mieux.  Le masque est devenu votre "
"visage, vous êtes réelle et la seule chose qui se dresse entre ce monde et "
"l’oubli, c’est vous."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Professional Cyclist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a promising cyclist with a bright career in front of you before this "
"all happened.  Perhaps you'll never get to participate in the grand tours "
"now, but as the saying goes, life is like riding a bicycle: you've got to "
"keep moving."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez une cycliste prometteuse avec une brillante carrière devant vous "
"avant que tout cela n’arrive.  Peut-être que vous n'aurez plus jamais "
"l'occasion de participer aux grands tours, mais comme le dit le proverbe, la "
"vie est comme faire du vélo: il faut continuer à avancer."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Major General" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks from a no-name private to a big shot "
"Major General, respected and decorated.  On the downside, years of desk duty "
"have left your shooting skills rusty, and all the medals in the world won't "
"protect you now."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez gravi les échelons, passant de recrue anonyme à Major Général, "
"respectée et décorée.  Malheureusement, des années de travail au bureau ont "
"laissé vos compétences de tir rouillées, et toutes les médailles du monde ne "
"vous protégeront plus maintenant."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Marine Infantrywoman" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are one of the few and the proud: a member of the US Marine Corps.  Now "
"that military command has collapsed in on itself as far as you can tell, you "
"suppose that it falls to you to carry the memory of the Corps forward into "
"the future.  Semper fi."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes l'une des rares et fières: membre du Corps des Marines des "
"États-Unis d'Amérique.  Maintenant que le commandement militaire s'est "
"effondré sur lui-même, pour autant que vous puissiez le constater, vous "
"supposez qu'il vous incombe de perpétuer la mémoire du Corps dans le futur.  "
"Semper fi."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Navy Sailor" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a sailor of the US Navy, and spent the last few years working shipside "
"aboard an aircraft carrier.  Though you're trained in combat, maintenance of "
"the vessel has been your primary duty.  After some event beyond your "
"understanding, the carrier has become a floating graveyard in the middle of "
"nowhere.  This is going to take more than a cup of coffee and a monkey wrench "
"to fix."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Navy Diver" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a Naval Special Warfare diving group, a skilled soldier "
"adept at underwater infiltration and marine combat.  You were suiting up for "
"a practice dive when the aircraft carrier you were stationed on was somehow "
"flung from the Yellow Sea to who knows where.  You seem to be the only one "
"who survived with your sanity intact, but it's not safe to stay here.  At "
"least you're already dressed to abandon ship."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez membre d'un groupe de plongée de combat, une soldate qualifiée "
"adepte de l'infiltration sous-marine et du combat aquatique.  Vous vous "
"prépariez pour une plongée d'entraînement lorsque le porte-avions sur lequel "
"vous étiez stationnée a été projeté de la mer Jaune vers on ne sait où.  Vous "
"semblez être la seule à avoir survécu avec votre santé mentale intacte, mais "
"il n'est pas prudent de rester ici.  Au moins, vous êtes déjà prête à "
"abandonner le navire."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Veteran" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After being discharged from the armed forces, you were sent to a veterans' "
"hospital for treatment.  Just when you thought you'd overcome your traumas "
"and readjusted to civilian life, the world has come to an end and your worst "
"nightmare has become a reality: life in an endless battlefield."
msgstr ""
"Après avoir été démobilisée, vous avez été envoyée dans un hôpital pour "
"anciens combattants pour y être soignée.  Juste au moment où vous pensiez "
"avoir surmonté vos traumatismes et à vous réadapter à la vie civile, le monde "
"a pris fin et votre pire cauchemar est devenu réalité: la vie sur un champ de "
"bataille sans fin."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Recruit" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Joining the military has been your dream for years.  You finally got in, just "
"in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of national "
"emergency.  As far as you can tell, military command abandoned you in this "
"hellhole when you missed the emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"Rejoindre l'armée était l'un de vos rêves d'enfant. Vous y avez finalement "
"réussi. Cependant votre formation à été interrompue par une sorte d'urgence "
"nationale. De ce que vous savez, vos supérieurs vous ont abandonnée dans cet "
"enfer lorsque vous avez manqué l'évacuation d'urgence."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Combat Mechanic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Early in your military career, you were hand-picked for extra training in the "
"mechanic's trade, keeping the armor running.  It's been years since you last "
"touched a rifle, and the dead men are marching again…"
msgstr ""
"Au début de votre carrière militaire, vous avez été triée sur le volet pour "
"suivre une formation supplémentaire dans le métier de mécanicienne, afin "
"d'assurer le fonctionnement des blindés.  Cela fait des années que vous "
"n'avez pas touchée un fusil, et les morts marchent à nouveau…"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Combat Engineer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your job was simple: Keep the army moving.  You built bridges, you built "
"roads, you destroyed fortifications, and you cleared mines.  It has been "
"years since you last handled a rifle in basic training; now might be the time "
"to dust off those skills."
msgstr ""
"Votre mission était simple: Permettre à l'armée d'avancer. Vous aviez pour "
"tâche de construire ponts et routes, détruire les fortifications sur votre "
"chemin et déminer. La dernière fois que vous avez tenu un fusil était des "
"années auparavant durant votre entraînement basique, mais peut être qu'il ne "
"serait pas une mauvaise idée de dépoussierer ces connaissances maintenant."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Non-Commissioned Officer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a veteran of several peacekeeping missions.  You led your squad as a "
"sort of parental figure, and they relied on you to give orders and keep them "
"alive.  You failed them.  And now you're alone."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes une vétérane de plusieurs missions de maintien de la paix.  Vous "
"dirigiez votre équipe comme une sorte de figure parentale, et ils comptaient "
"sur vous pour donner des ordres et les maintenir en vie.  Vous leur avez fait "
"défaut.  Et maintenant vous êtes seule."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rifleman" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When you were young, you dreamed of being a soldier.  War is hell and hell is "
"war, but you never thought it would be this bad."
msgstr ""
"Quand vous étiez jeune, vous rêviez d'être soldate.  La guerre est l'Enfer et "
"l'Enfer est la guerre, mais vous n'auriez jamais pensé que ce serait aussi "
"horrible."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Navy SEAL Marksmen" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Recruited into the ranks of the US Navy's Special Warfare forces as a "
"designated sniper, your training in precision marksmanship and maritime "
"operations was extensive.  As a proficient soldier and combative in all "
"respects, you provided overwatch and long-range elimination services in the "
"line of duty.  Now, with naval command imploding and your spotter MIA, your "
"skills with a rifle and covert operations are the only things standing "
"between you and the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Navy SEAL" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a member of the SEALs; a key component of the US Navy's special "
"forces and a proficient combatant in both maritime and ground operations.  "
"'The only easy day was yesterday', and with the chain of command in ruins, "
"you may fulfill your final mission in any way you see fit."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Special Operator" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were the best of the best, the military's finest.  That's why you're "
"still alive, even after all your comrades fell to the undead.  As far as you "
"can tell, military command abandoned you in this hellhole when you missed the "
"emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtiez l'as des as, l'élite des militaires. C'est ce qui explique "
"pourquoi vous êtes encore en vie, alors que vos camarades se sont fait "
"prendre par les morts vivants. Tout ce que vous pouvez vous dire maintenant "
"c'est que votre commandement vous a abandonné quand vous avez loupé "
"l'évacuation."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Maid" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were hired to take care of the housekeeping for a wealthy family.  "
"Naturally, when things got bad, they all took off on a family vacation to "
"somewhere unknown, leaving you to your fate."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez été embauchée pour vous occuper du ménage d’une famille aisée.  "
"Naturellement, lorsque les choses ont mal tourné, ils sont tous partis en "
"vacances en famille vers un endroit inconnu, vous laissant à votre sort."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Captive" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were following a road at night, trying to get away from the horrors of "
"the city, when you heard a voice calling out in the dark.  You followed, "
"hoping they were friendly, but suddenly felt a searing pain in your head and "
"blacked out.  You just woke up in this strange place… are you even on Earth "
"anymore?"
msgstr ""
"Vous suiviez une route la nuit, essayant d'échapper aux horreurs de la ville, "
"lorsque vous avez entendu une voix vous appellant dans le noir.  Vous l'avez "
"suivie, espérant trouver de l'aide, mais vous avez soudainement ressenti une "
"douleur fulgurante à l'arrière de votre crâne et vous avez perdu "
"connaissance.  Vous venez de vous réveiller dans cet endroit étrange… "
"êtes-vous encore sur Terre?"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rescuer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were ready.  You went in determined to find and rescue your friends.  Now "
"the atmosphere in these twisting corridors grows heavy, and you don't feel "
"quite so confident anymore.  You might be the one in need of a rescue soon."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez prête.  Vous êtes entrée déterminée à retrouver et à sauver vos "
"amis.  Maintenant, l'atmosphère dans ces couloirs sinueux devient lourde et "
"vous ne vous sentez plus aussi confiante.  C’est peut-être vous qui aurez "
"bientôt besoin de secours."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Medical Resident" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Fresh out of med school, you've got little in the way of practical experience "
"and just a handful of first-aid supplies.  You just hope it will be enough if "
"'physician, heal thyself' turns out to be more literal than you expected."
msgstr ""
"Fraîchement sortie de l'école de médecine, vous avez peu d'expérience "
"pratique et juste une poignée de fournitures de premiers secours.  Vous "
"espérez simplement que cela suffira si \"médecin, guéris-toi toi-même\" "
"s'avère plus littéral que prévu."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Doctor" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a patient-facing doctor practicing general or specialized medicine.  "
"While your bedside manner might not get you far in this new world, your "
"medical skills will certainly help."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Pharmacist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a pharmacist working in a community pharmacy.  No simple "
"pill-pusher, you have a plethora of knowledge of drug preparation, "
"biochemistry, and biology.  With your trusty mortar and pestle, you hope to "
"grind the undead to a pulp."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez pharmacienne et travailliez dans une pharmacie de quartier. Vous "
"n'êtes pas une simple gratte-papier, vous avez une connaissance approfondie "
"de la préparation des médicaments, de la biochimie et de la biologie. Avec "
"votre fidèle mortier et votre pilon, vous espérez réduire les morts-vivants "
"en bouillie."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Gangster" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The boss always said he could rely on you to pull through on the tough jobs.  "
"Shame he got himself smoked.  No problem; the world's always got a place for "
"someone with your kind of talents."
msgstr ""
"Le patron a toujours dit qu'il pouvait compter sur vous pour mener à bien les "
"tâches difficiles.  Dommage qu'il se soit fait fumer.  Aucun problème; le "
"monde a toujours une place pour quelqu'un avec votre genre de talent."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Security Guard" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You had a boring, underpaid job watching cameras and patrolling hallways, but "
"things have suddenly gotten a lot more dangerous.  You have some useful "
"equipment, but you've never had any call to use it until now."
msgstr ""
"Vous aviez un taff ennuyant et sous-payé qui ne consistait qu'à regarder les "
"caméras de surveillance et à patrouiller dans des couloirs, mais les choses "
"sont devenues beaucoup plus dangereuses.  Vous avez des choses utiles sur "
"vous, mais vous n'avez jamais eu à l'utiliser, du moins jusqu'à présent."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Landscaper" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You used to mow lawns and trim hedges for the wealthy.  Contract work was "
"getting scarce even before the zombies came, but now you've got nothing left "
"except your tools and expertise."
msgstr ""
"Vous aviez l’habitude de tondre les pelouses et de tailler les haies pour les "
"riches.  Le travail sous contrat se faisait rare avant même l'arrivée des "
"zombies, mais maintenant vous n'avez plus rien à part vos outils et votre "
"expertise."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Nursing Assistant" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You went on providing in-home care for the elderly even as the whole world "
"fell apart around you.  You can only pray that you don't see your former "
"clients among the walking dead…"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez continué à fournir des soins à domicile aux personnes âgées alors "
"même que le monde entier s’effondrait autour de vous.  Vous ne pouvez que "
"prier de ne pas voir vos anciens clients parmi les morts-vivants…"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Survivalist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Living off the land, far from civilization, is nothing new to you.  The only "
"difference is all the monsters that suddenly want you dead.  Your equipment "
"is basic, but versatile… except that your canteen's run out!"
msgstr ""
"Vivre de la terre, loin de la civilisation, n’a rien de nouveau pour vous.  "
"La seule différence, ce sont tous les monstres qui veulent soudainement votre "
"mort.  Votre équipement est basique, mais polyvalent… mais votre gourde est "
"épuisée!"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hobo" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Society drove you to the fringes and left you with no home, no family, no "
"friends.  But for all the crap thrown your way, you're still breathing.  For "
"now."
msgstr ""
"La société vous a poussée en marge et vous a laissée sans foyer, sans "
"famille, sans amis.  Mais malgré toutes les conneries qu'ont vous a infligé, "
"vous respirez toujours.  Pour l'instant."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Helicopter Pilot" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You got your pilot's license and earned a living ferrying businessmen and "
"tourists around.  The Cataclysm has grounded you for now, but the sky still "
"calls to you…"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez obtenu votre brevet de pilote et gagnait votre vie en transportant "
"des hommes d'affaires et des touristes.  Le Cataclysme vous a cloué au sol "
"pour le moment, mais le ciel vous appelle toujours…"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "K9 Officer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent your career busting drug smugglers with your faithful canine "
"companion.  Now the world has ended, and none of that matters anymore.  Your "
"loyal dog is still at your side, though, ready to face the Cataclysm with you."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez passé votre carrière à interpeller les trafiquants de drogue avec "
"votre fidèle compagnon canin.  Maintenant, le monde a pris fin, et plus rien "
"de tout cela n’a d’importance, mais votre fidèle chien est toujours à vos "
"côtés, prêt à affronter le Cataclysme avec vous."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mounted Police Officer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have spent many long years forging a bond with your equine companion, "
"from running down common thugs, to entertaining kids when you ride on by.  "
"The Cataclysm is upon you, but at least you have each other."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dog Lover" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent your days running around with your faithful dogs by your side.  "
"When the world ended, you grabbed your companions along with some of their "
"things to protect them.  The zombies could be nearby, but at least your "
"canine friends won't have to worry about the rain."
msgstr ""
"Vous passiez vos journées à courir partout avec vos fidèles chiens à vos "
"côtés.  À la fin du monde, vous avez saisi vos compagnons avec certaines de "
"leurs affaires pour les protéger.  Les zombies pourraient être à proximité, "
"mais au moins vos amis canins n'auront pas à s'inquiéter de la pluie."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Crazy Cat Lady" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Everyone is dead?  Oh well, it doesn't matter; it's not like you got along "
"with people much anyway.  Your beloved cats are all the friends you need!"
msgstr ""
"Tout le monde est mort?  Eh bien, cela n'a pas d'importance; de toute façon, "
"ce n'est pas comme si vous vous entendiez beaucoup avec les gens.  Vos chats "
"bien-aimés sont tous les amis dont vous avez besoin!"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Police Officer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Just a small-town deputy, you got the call and were ready to come to the "
"rescue.  Soon it was you who needed rescuing, and you were lucky to escape "
"with your life.  Who's going to respect your authority when the government "
"this badge represents might not even exist anymore?"
msgstr ""
"Juste une policière d'une petite ville, vous avez reçu l'appel et étiez prête "
"à venir à la rescousse.  Bientôt, c'est vous qui avez eu besoin d'être "
"secourue, et vous avez eu la chance de vous en sortir saine et sauve.  Qui va "
"respecter votre autorité maintenant que le gouvernement que représente ce "
"badge n’existe plus?"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Police Detective" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were on the brink of a major breakthrough in your latest homicide case "
"when the Cataclysm struck.  Now your prime suspect is dead.  Everyone's dead. "
" You could really use a smoke."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez sur le point de réaliser une avancée majeure dans votre dernière "
"affaire d’homicide lorsque le Cataclysme a frappé.  Maintenant, votre "
"principal suspect est mort.  Tout le monde est mort.  Vous avez vraiment "
"besoin d'une cigarette."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "SWAT Officer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As a member of the police force's most elite division, you are more than "
"adequately trained and equipped to survive the brutal onslaught of the "
"apocalypse.  Unfortunately, the chain of command has broken down; your only "
"mission now is to stay alive."
msgstr ""
"En tant que membre de la division la plus élite des forces de police, vous "
"êtes plus qu'adéquatement formée et équipée pour survivre à l'assaut brutal "
"de l'apocalypse.  Malheureusement, la chaîne de commandement est rompue; "
"votre seule mission maintenant est de rester en vie."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "SWAT CQC Specialist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As a member of the police force's most elite division, you were given special "
"training and became an expert in close-quarters combat.  Unfortunately, the "
"chain of command has broken down; your only mission now is to stay alive."
msgstr ""
"En tant que membre de la division la plus élite de la police, vous avez suivi "
"une formation spéciale et êtes devenue une experte du combat rapproché.  "
"Malheureusement, la chaîne de commandement est rompue; votre seule mission "
"maintenant est de rester en vie."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Police Sniper" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your skill as a sharpshooter served you well in the line of duty, protecting "
"the innocent with a single, well-placed bullet.  Now your own life is on the "
"line, and you can't afford to miss if you don't want to end up as something's "
"dinner."
msgstr ""
"Vos compétences de tireuse d'élite vous ont bien servi dans l'exercice de vos "
"fonctions, protégeant les innocents avec une seule balle bien placée.  "
"Maintenant, votre propre vie est en jeu, et vous ne pouvez pas vous permettre "
"de manquer si vous ne voulez pas servir de dîner à quelque chose."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Riot Control Officer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The riots were brutal, even before the dead rose and started to devour the "
"living.  The line you were holding broke.  It was only through a bit of luck "
"and a lot of head-bashing that you got away in one piece, and the worst is "
"yet to come."
msgstr ""
"Les émeutes ont été brutales, avant même que les morts ne se lèvent et ne "
"commencent à dévorer les vivants.  La ligne que vous teniez s'est brisée et "
"ce n’est que grâce à un peu de chance et à beaucoup de coups de matraque aux "
"crânes que vous êtes parvenue à vous en sortir saine et sauve, et le pire est "
"encore à venir."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Motorized Police Officer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Just a small-town deputy, you got the call and were ready to ride to the "
"rescue.  Soon it was you who needed rescuing, and you had to abandon your "
"motorcycle to escape.  Who's going to respect your authority when the "
"government this badge represents doesn't exist anymore?"
msgstr ""
"Juste une policière d'une petite ville, vous avez reçu un appel et étiez prêt "
"à venir à la rescousse.  Bientôt, c'est vous qui avez eu besoin d'être "
"secourue et vous avez dû abandonner votre moto pour vous échapper.  Qui va "
"respecter votre autorité maintenant que le gouvernement que représente ce "
"badge n’existe plus?"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Used Car Saleswoman" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"They said you'd sell your own mother for a dollar.  How dare they!  You've "
"been around the block a few times, and you'd charge way more than a dollar - "
"and get it, too!"
msgstr ""
"Ils disaient que vous vendriez votre propre mère pour un dollar.  Comment "
"osent-ils!  Vous avez fait plusieurs fois le tour du pâté de maisons et vous "
"factureriez bien plus d'un dollar - et le chèque toucherait votre compte "
"bancaire!"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Modern Archer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A great fan of the archers of old, but at the same time a follower of the "
"latest trends in archery.  You always tried to keep up with the times, "
"acquiring a takedown bow as well as several accessories to complement it.  "
"You can only hope all the training you did with them can help you survive in "
"this trying times."
msgstr ""
"Grande fan des archers d’autrefois, mais en même temps adepte des dernières "
"tendances en matière de tir à l’arc.  Vous avez toujours essayé d'être dans "
"l'air du temps en acquérant un arc démontable ainsi que plusieurs accessoires "
"pour le compléter.  Vous ne pouvez qu’espérer que vos efforts avec votre "
"équipement vous aideront à survivre en ces temps difficiles."

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bow Hunter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting, and quickly developed a talent "
"for archery.  Why, if the world ended, there's nothing you'd want at your "
"side more than your trusty bow.  So, when it did, you made sure to bring it "
"along."
msgstr ""
"Depuis que vous êtes enfant, vous adorez la chasse et vous avez rapidement "
"développé un talent pour le tir à l'arc.  Vous ne voudriez rien d'autre que "
"votre arc fidèle pour braver la fin du monde."

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Crossbow Hunter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting, and crossbow hunting was "
"always your favorite.  Why, if the world ended, there's nothing you'd want at "
"your side more than your trusty crossbow.  So, when it did, you made sure to "
"bring it along, though most of your bolts were lost during the escape."
msgstr ""
"Depuis que vous étiez une gamine, vous adoriez chasser, et la chasse à "
"l'arbalète a toujours été votre préférée.  Eh bien, si le monde prenait fin, "
"il n'y a rien que vous voudriez plus à vos côtés que votre fidèle arbalète.  "
"Alors, quand c’est arrivé, vous vous êtes assurée de l’emporter."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Shotgun Hunter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting, and one year you got a shotgun "
"for your birthday.  Why, if the world ended, there's nothing you'd want at "
"your side more than your trusty shotgun.  So, when it did, you made sure to "
"bring it along."
msgstr ""
"Depuis que vous étiez une gamine, vous adoriez chasser, et avez reçu un fusil "
"de pompe pour l'un de vos anniversaires.  Eh bien, si le monde prenait fin, "
"il n'y a rien que vous voudriez plus à vos côtés que votre fidèle fusil.  "
"Alors, quand c’est arrivé, vous vous êtes assurée de l’emporter."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rifle Hunter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting, and you fancy yourself a crack "
"shot.  Why, if the world ended, there's nothing you'd want at your side more "
"than your trusty rifle.  So, when it did, you made sure to bring it along."
msgstr ""
"Quant vous étiez enfant, vous chassiez avec votre grand-père. Vous avez "
"énormément appris. Depuis vous avez repris le flambeaux ... et son fusil de "
"chasse."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Big-Bore Hunter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You always harbored a passion for hunting and a particular fondness for "
"big-bore rifle calibers and affordable conversion kits.  Whether it was their "
"cost-effective nature or the simple, testosterone-amplifying notion that you "
"could retool your rifle to belt out .50-caliber bullets, you preferred them "
"for your hunting trips.  Now, with your converted rifle in hand, you fancy "
"that there isn't any game too large for you to take down."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez toujours eu une passion pour la chasse et un penchant particulier "
"pour les fusils de gros calibre et les kits de conversion abordables.  Qu'il "
"s'agisse de leur nature rentable ou de l'idée simple et amplificatrice de "
"testostérone selon de pouvoir rééquiper votre fusil pour tirer des balles de "
"calibre .50, vous les préfériez pour vos voyages de chasse.  Maintenant, avec "
"votre fusil converti en main, vous imaginez qu'il n'y a pas de gibier trop "
"gros pour être abattu par vous."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hillbilly Girl" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You n' yer kin always figured shit would hit the fan some day, but never like "
"this!  When they turned on you, you grabbed yer gun and a six pack, and "
"hauled ass in the family truck."
msgstr ""
"Vot' famille avait toujours pensé que tout aller bien finir par se foutre en "
"l'air un jour, mais jamais d'même! Quand y se sont retournés contre vous, "
"vous avez pris vot' arme et d'la bière, et vous avez bougé vot' cul hors de "
"là dans la camionnette familiale."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Handy Woman" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You used to work at a local hardware store, and you did plenty of home "
"renovations yourself.  Now you look out at the horizon of a ruined world, and "
"wonder - are your meager skills, and the few supplies you grabbed on the way "
"out, sufficient to help rebuild?"
msgstr ""
"Vous travailliez dans une quincaillerie locale et vous avez effectué "
"vous-même de nombreuses rénovations à domicile.  Maintenant, vous regardez "
"l'horizon d'un monde en ruine et vous demandez: vos maigres compétences et "
"les quelques fournitures que vous avez récupérées en sortant seront-elles "
"suffisantes pour aider à la reconstruction?"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Trucker" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You once ruled the road in your big rig.  When the riots hit, you hopped in "
"and drove it to safety.  Now it's just you and your truck against the world."
msgstr ""
"Autrefois, vous dominiez la route dans votre gros véhicule.  Lorsque les "
"émeutes ont éclaté, vous êtes montée à bord et vous l'avez conduit en lieu "
"sûr.  Maintenant, c'est juste vous et votre camion contre le monde."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rideshare Driver" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You love driving, and decided to start making some money doing it.  On your "
"way to pick up a customer, a riot broke out around you.  You took a long "
"detour to safety, only to find yourself somewhere unfamiliar."
msgstr ""
"Vous aimez conduire et avez décidée de commencer à gagner de l’argent en le "
"faisant.  Alors que vous alliez chercher un client, une émeute a éclaté "
"autour de vous.  Vous avez fait un long détour pour vous mettre en sécurité, "
"mais vous vous êtes retrouvée dans un endroit inconnu."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Paramedic Firefighter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"On your way to respond to an emergency call, you nearly drove straight into a "
"riot in the city.  Turning off of the burning, debris-covered streets, you "
"took a long detour only to find yourself lost.  That call will have to wait - "
"you're in an emergency of your own now."
msgstr ""
"Alors que vous répondiez à un appel d'urgence, vous avez failli conduire "
"droit dans une émeute en ville.  En quittant les rues en feu et couvertes de "
"débris, vous avez fait un long détour et vous êtes retrouvée perdue.  Cet "
"appel devra attendre – vous êtes confrontée à une urgence personnelle "
"maintenant."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Servicewoman" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Employed by a large company, you performed installation and troubleshooting "
"services at the homes of ungrateful luddites.  Driving back from your last "
"call, you were suddenly swarmed by what you believed to be angry rioters.  "
"You veered off onto an old, neglected side road to escape, only to find "
"yourself lost and low on gas."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez employée par une grande compagnie pour effectuer des services "
"d'installation et de réparation dans les maisons de luddites ingrats. Lors ce "
"que vous reveniez de votre dernier job, vous avez été soudainement encerclée "
"par une horde de ce que vous pensiez être une horde d'émeutiers enragés. Vous "
"avez réussie à vous extraire, mais vous êtes perdue en choisissant une veille "
"route négligée, tombant à court d'essence peu après."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bus Driver" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You made a living driving kids to and from school, a career choice you "
"regretted almost every day.  None of the brats were at their normal stops, "
"and the noise of your bus quickly attracted hordes of zombies.  You escaped, "
"but now you've gotten lost.  At least you're getting a break from the hellish "
"screams of children, though you're starting to hear new ones…"
msgstr ""
"Vous gagniez votre vie en conduisant des enfants à l'école, un choix de "
"carrière que vous regrettiez presque chaque jour. Aucun des gamins n'était à "
"son arrêt habituel, et le bruit de votre bus a rapidement attiré des hordes "
"de zombies. Vous vous êtes échappé, mais maintenant vous vous êtes perdu. Au "
"moins, vous faites une pause dans les cris d'enfer des enfants, bien que vous "
"commenciez à en entendre de nouveaux..."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Police Interceptor" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"An on-duty officer, you received the call and were ready to respond to the "
"robbery.  It all went to shit, your backup got eaten, and you were lucky to "
"escape with your life and patrol car."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez une officière de police au milieu de votre journée de service "
"quand vous avez reçu un appel et étiez prêt à réagir à un vol.  Tout est "
"parti en vrille, vos renforts ont été dévorés et vous avez eu de la chance de "
"vous échapper avec votre vie et votre voiture de patrouille."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Militia" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You and a group of like-minded individuals built a hideout in the woods from "
"which to launch looting raids in a jury-rigged pickup.  The last run went "
"bad, and now all your comrades are dead.  Every breath you take now is an act "
"of rebellion against the cruelty of this doomed world.  Do not let that flame "
"of hope perish inside you."
msgstr ""
"Vous et un groupe d'individus partageant les mêmes idées avez construit une "
"cachette dans les bois à partir de laquelle vous pouviez piller les environs "
"avec un pickup modifié.  Votre dernière expédition s'est mal passée, et "
"maintenant tous vos camarades sont morts.  Chaque souffle s'échappant de vos "
"lèvres à partir de maintenant est un acte de rébellion contre la cruauté de "
"ce monde maudit.  Ne laissez pas la flamme de l’espoir périr en vous."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Park Ranger" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your days of patrolling the park and protecting people and wildlife from each "
"other have taught you many useful skills.  After finding a gruesome scene at "
"a campsite and getting no response when you radioed for help, you stockpiled "
"as many supplies as possible and set out in your pickup looking for answers."
msgstr ""
"Vos journées passées à patrouiller dans le parc et à protéger les gens et la "
"faune les uns des autres vous ont permis d'acquérir de nombreuses compétences "
"utiles.  Après avoir découvert une scène horrible à un site de camping et "
"n'avoir obtenu aucune réponse lorsque vous avez demandé de l'aide par radio, "
"vous avez stocké autant de ravitaillement que possible et êtes parti dans "
"votre camionnette pour savoir ce qui s'est passé."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lumberjill" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have your trusty wood axe, and you're okay.  You felled trees before the "
"world ended, and you suspect the undead aren't nearly as tough."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez votre fidèle hache et tout va bien.  Vous abattiez des arbres avant "
"la fin du monde et vous pensez que les morts-vivants ne sont probablement "
"aussi coriaces."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Fast Food Cook" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The diners at the fancy burger joint where you worked were even more "
"irritable and unreasonable than usual today.  You showed them the meaning of "
"fast food… by running for your life!"
msgstr ""
"Les convives du restaurant de hamburgers où vous travailliez étaient encore "
"plus irritables et déraisonnables que d'habitude aujourd'hui.  Vous leur avez "
"montré le sens de la restauration rapide… en courant pour sauver votre vie!"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Electrician" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Small businesses often hired you for electrical work.  You were halfway "
"through your latest job when the whole power grid went dead."
msgstr ""
"Les petites entreprises vous embauchaient souvent pour des travaux "
"électriques. Vous étiez au milieu de votre dernier job lorsque tout le réseau "
"électrique est tombé en panne."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Electrical Engineer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Fresh out of college, you were quite eager to get some practical engineering "
"experience and leave your mark on the world, one solder joint at a time.  "
"Now, you are not even sure if the complete failure of the power grid makes "
"your field obsolete or all the more necessary."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Computer Hacker" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Caffeine pills and all-nighters in front of a computer screen made you an "
"expert at writing and cracking code.  The power's gone out, and suddenly your "
"elite skills seem significantly less useful.  At least there's no one "
"stopping you from your dream of breaking into a military mainframe now."
msgstr ""
"Les pilules de caféine et les nuits blanches devant un écran d’ordinateur ont "
"fait de vous une experte en écriture et en déchiffrement de code.  "
"L'électricité a été coupée et vos compétences d'élite semblent soudainement "
"moins utiles.  Au moins, personne ne vous empêche désormais de réaliser votre "
"rêve de pénétrer dans un ordinateur central militaire.  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Backpacker" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"For the past few years you've been traveling the world, sightseeing and "
"living off your parents' trust fund.  You came home to find the world in "
"ruins, and the only thing between you and death is the open road and your "
"backpack."
msgstr ""
"Vous venez de rentrer d'une série de voyages ayant duré quelque années, "
"faisant du tourisme au quatre coins du monde et vivant sur l'argent de vos "
"parents, mais au moment où vous avez enfin retrouvé le chemin de la maison, "
"celle-ci est maintenant ruinée par les hordes de mort-vivants, et vous n'avez "
"plus que la route infinie et votre compagnon de toujours, votre sac à dos, "
"entre vous et la mort."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Student" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Just an average student, you find yourself facing a test you never studied "
"for, and the stakes are a bit higher than geometry.  Maybe there'll be "
"something useful in one of these books you've been lugging around all year."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes une étudiante lambda, et vous vous faites maintenant face à un "
"examen extrêmement difficile que vous n'avez pas révisé pour, et les enjeux "
"sont un peu plus élevés que de redoubler. Mais peut être que vous pouvez "
"trouver quelque chose d'utile dans les livres que vous avez du trimbaler "
"toute l'année?"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Shower Victim" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You just stepped out of a nice, hot shower to find the world had ended.  "
"You've got some soap, along with the most massively useful thing ever… a "
"towel."
msgstr ""
"Vous veniez de sortir d’une bonne douche chaude et avez découvert que le "
"monde était fini.  Vous avez du savon, ainsi que la chose la plus utile qui "
"soit… une serviette."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Biker" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent most of your life on a motorcycle, out on the open road with your "
"club.  Now they're all dead.  Time to ride or die."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez passé la plus grande partie de votre vie sur une moto, parcourant "
"les routes avec votre club. Maintenant qu'ils sont tous morts, il est temps "
"pour vous de rouler ou crever."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ballroom Dancer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Things got a little weird on your way to your weekly dance class.  Zombies "
"don't seem to know how to dance, but you're not about to let them step on "
"your toes."
msgstr ""
"Les choses sont devenues un peu bizarres lorsque vous étiez en train de vous "
"rendre à votre cours de danse de la semaine.  Les zombies ne semblent pas "
"savoir danser, mais vous n'allez pas les laisser vous marcher sur les pieds."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Patient" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the diagnosis came back positive, you made a vow: to fight for your "
"life, and to never give in to despair.  Now is the time to renew that vow."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque le diagnostic s’est révélé positif, vous avez fait un vœu: vous "
"battre pour votre vie et ne jamais céder au désespoir.  Il est maintenant "
"temps de renouveler ce vœu."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Unwilling Mutant" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a human guinea pig, used by laboratory technicians to understand the "
"immense power of mutation.  You are determined to live on, if only to spite "
"them for what they did to you."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez une cobaye humaine, utilisée par les techniciens de laboratoire "
"pour comprendre l’immense pouvoir de la mutation.  Vous êtes déterminé à "
"vivre, ne serait-ce que pour la rancune de ce qu’ils vous ont fait."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Volunteer Mutant" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your dreams of becoming a mutant superhero through genetic alteration may "
"have fallen a bit short, but the scientists say you're ready.  It's time for "
"a field test."
msgstr ""
"Vos rêves de devenir une super-héroïne mutante grâce à une altération "
"génétique ont peut-être été un peu déçus, mais les scientifiques disent que "
"vous êtes prête.  Il est temps de procéder à un test sur le terrain."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hitchhiker" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your house has been demolished and your planet destroyed, but at least you "
"still have your towel."
msgstr ""
"Votre maison est démolie et votre planète détruite mais au moins il vous "
"reste votre serviette."

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Trapper" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent most of your life trapping with your father.  Both of you made a "
"decent living selling your catches and running trapping tutorials.  "
"Hopefully, your skills will come in useful against less conventional game."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez passé la majeure partie de votre vie à piéger avec votre père.  "
"Vous gagniez tous les deux décemment votre vie en vendant vos prises et en "
"dispensant des cours de piégeage.  Espérons que vos compétences vous seront "
"utiles contre du gibier moins conventionnel."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Blacksmith" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You ran into trouble coming out of class at your community college's "
"metalsmithing program, but despite the havoc you've managed to keep ahold of "
"some of the equipment you were carrying."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez rencontré des difficultés en sortant des cours de métallurgie de "
"votre collège communautaire, mais malgré le chaos, vous avez réussi à "
"conserver une partie de l'équipement que vous transportiez."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Jeweler" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were an independent artisan, who made gorgeous rings and pendants for the "
"people who afforded your services.  You doubt the market for your work has "
"fared well after the end of the world, but perhaps your proficiency with fine "
"tools and metals will come in handy somehow."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez une artisane indépendante fabriquant de magnifiques bagues et "
"pendentifs pour ceux capables de s'offrir vos services. Vous doutez que "
"beaucoup veulent toujours de vos produits, mais peut-être que votre expertise "
"métallurgique et votre longue expérience manuelle avec des outils de "
"précision se montrera utile."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Clowness" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"All you ever wanted was to make people laugh.  Dropping out of school and "
"performing at kids' parties was a dream come true until the world ended.  "
"There are precious few balloon animals in your future now."
msgstr ""
"Tout ce que vous avez toujours voulu, c'était faire rire les gens.  "
"Abandonner l'école et accomplir vos performances durant les fêtes d'enfants "
"était un rêve devenu réalité jusqu'à la fin du monde.  Il y a maintenant peu "
"d’animaux en ballon dans votre avenir."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lost Submissive" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In the rush to safety, you were separated from your master by cruel fate.  "
"Now you are on your own, with nothing to your name but a suit of really kinky "
"black leather.  Unfortunately, there are no safewords in the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"Au cours de votre fuite vers la sécurité, vous avez été séparée de votre "
"maître·sse par le sort cruel.  Maintenant, vous êtes seule, avec rien d’autre "
"à votre nom qu’un costume en cuir noir vraiment coquin.  Malheureusement, il "
"n’y a pas de mots de passe dans l’apocalypse."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Senior Citizen" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You haven't seen this much blood since the war.  The whole world's gone "
"crazy!  They ate your grandkids!  But dagnabbit, you'll make them all pay for "
"what they've done."
msgstr ""
"Vous n'aviez pas vu autant de sang depuis la dernière guerre. Le monde est "
"devenu complètement fou! Ils ont mangé vos petits enfants! Vous allez leur "
"faire payer pour ce qu'ils ont fait."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Otaku" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After many late nights with friends watching anime and eating snacks, you "
"decided to make the trip to the premier anime convention in the Northeast.  "
"Now zombies are eating everyone, and even worse, the convention is canceled!  "
"At least you were ready in case your costume tore."
msgstr ""
"Après de nombreuses soirées passées avec des amies à regarder des animés et à "
"manger des snacks, vous avez décidé de vous rendre à la première convention "
"d'animés du Nord-Est. Maintenant, les zombies mangent tout le monde et, pire "
"encore, la convention est annulée ! Au moins, vous étiez prête au cas où "
"votre costume se serait déchiré."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bride" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The Cataclysm struck on the big day and you escaped with nothing but your "
"wedding attire.  Cold feet?  You'd just like to keep your feet attached!"
msgstr ""
"Le Cataclysme a frappé durant votre grand jour et vous vous êtes enfuie avec "
"rien d'autre que votre tenue de mariage.  Les pieds froids?  Vous aimeriez au "
"moins garder vos pieds!"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Punk Rock Girl" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"All those wicked songs about the apocalypse have come to life.  Brutal!  Now "
"that the system is dead, it's time to party among the bones of the world!"
msgstr ""
"Toutes ces chansons violentes sur l’apocalypse ont pris vie.  Malade!  "
"Maintenant que le système est mort, il est temps de faire la fête parmi les "
"ossements du monde!"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Firefighter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As a first responder, you were a direct witness to the gut-wrenching horrors "
"of the apocalypse.  Separated from most of your equipment and your unit while "
"on call, you were forced to fight your way to safety with little more than "
"your trusty iron and your bunker gear to protect you."
msgstr ""
"En tant que première répondante, vous avez été une témoin directe des "
"horreurs déchirantes de l’apocalypse.  Séparée de la plupart de votre "
"équipement et de votre unité pendant une intervention, vous avez été obligée "
"de vous frayer un chemin vers la sécurité avec à peine plus que votre fidèle "
"tisonnier et votre équipement de protection."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rude Girl" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your ska band broke up after the drummer became a zombie.  Now you're alone "
"in the Cataclysm with some cigarettes and your mp3 player."
msgstr ""
"Votre groupe de ska s'est séparé après que le batteur soit devenu un zombie.  "
"Vous êtes désormais seule au milieu du Cataclysme avec quelques cigarettes et "
"votre lecteur mp3."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mail Carrier" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Neither snow nor rain nor heat nor gloom of night stays you from the swift "
"completion of your appointed rounds, but nobody said anything about zombies."
msgstr ""
"Ni la neige, ni la pluie, ni la chaleur, ni l'obscurité de la nuit ne vous "
"empêchent d'accomplir rapidement votre tournée, mais personne n'a rien dit au "
"sujet des zombies."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Convict" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your trial was contentious, but ultimately you found yourself behind bars.  "
"The Cataclysm has offered you a chance to escape, but freedom may come with a "
"steep price."
msgstr ""
"Votre procès a été controversé, mais vous vous êtes finalement retrouvée "
"derrière les barreaux.  Le Cataclysme vous a offert une chance de vous "
"échapper, mais la liberté peut avoir un prix élevé."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hardened Convict" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Most of your adult life has been spent in prison doing hard time.  It's been "
"rough but you've learned a few tricks to keep them on their toes.  Time to "
"see how tough these zombies are."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez passé la plus grande partie de votre vie d'adulte en prison. "
"C'était dur, mais vous avez appris quelques trucs pour les tenir en haleine. "
"Il est temps de voir à quel point ces zombies sont coriaces."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Death Row Convict" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a serial killer, ready to walk the green mile, but in a twist of "
"fate you're one of the few still alive.  True death comes only from your "
"hands, so you're in for a job."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez une tueuse en série, prête à marcher sur la ligne verte, mais "
"l'ironie du sort fait de vous maintenant l'une des dernières personnes en "
"vie. La vraie mort n'est obtenue que par vos labeurs, et on dirait que vous "
"avez du pain sur la planche."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Undercover Assassin Convict" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were given a target, a mission, but killing your mark seems to have "
"become much more difficult now.  Your employer cut contact with you and now "
"you have to make do with what you have."
msgstr ""
"On vous a donné une cible, une mission, mais tuer votre proie semble être "
"devenu beaucoup plus difficile maintenant.  Votre employeur a coupé tout "
"contact avec vous et vous devez désormais vous contenter de ce que vous avez."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Embezzler" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You had a genius plan to skim fractions of cents out of your company's "
"accounts.  This plan immediately failed and got you arrested.  They said you "
"were too soft for prison, but guess what?  They're dead, and you're not."
msgstr ""
"Vous aviez un plan génial pour retirer des fractions de centimes des comptes "
"de votre entreprise.  Ce plan a immédiatement échoué et vous a fait arrêter.  "
"Ils disaient que vous étiez trop douce pour la prison, mais devinez quoi?  "
"Ils sont morts, vous ne l'êtes pas.  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Meth Cook" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You clawed your way out of poverty by selling products everyone wanted, and "
"they had the nerve to put you in jail for it.  Too bad you can't sell drugs "
"to zombies."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez réussi à sortir de la pauvreté en vendant des produits que tout le "
"monde voulait, et ils ont eu le culot de vous mettre en prison pour cela.  "
"Dommage qu'on ne puisse pas vendre de drogue aux zombies.  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Political Prisoner" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You did your best to expose what was going on in those labs, but they caught "
"you and threw you in prison on trumped-up charges to silence you.  Clearly, "
"they should have listened."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez fait de votre mieux pour révéler ce qui se passait dans ces "
"laboratoires, mais ils vous ont arrêtée et jetée en prison sur la base de "
"fausses accusations pour vous faire taire.  De toute évidence, ils auraient "
"dû écouter."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rat Princess" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You probably needed psychiatric help instead of a prison sentence.  At least "
"your loyal subjects have agreed to hold the line as you make your daring "
"escape."
msgstr ""
"Vous aviez probablement besoin d’aide psychiatrique au lieu d’une peine de "
"prison.  Au moins, vos fidèles sujets ont accepté de tenir le cap pendant "
"votre audacieuse évasion."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Burglar" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"This could be your lucky break.  Plenty of loot to be pilfered, and no cops "
"to be seen.  Does it count as breaking and entering if everyone in town is "
"undead?"
msgstr ""
"Cela pourrait être votre coup de chance.  Beaucoup de butin à voler et aucun "
"flic en vue.  Est-ce que cela compte comme une introduction par effraction si "
"tout le monde en ville est mort-vivant?"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lawyer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The jury were in the palm of your hand, but after the defendant tried to eat "
"your brain, you were forced to flee the courtroom in disgrace.  Now nobody "
"seems to care about your objections."
msgstr ""
"Le jury était dans la paume de votre main, mais après que l'accusé ait tenté "
"de manger votre cerveau, vous avez été contrainte de fuir le tribunal en "
"disgrâce.  Désormais, personne ne semble se soucier de vos objections."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Pastor" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Armageddon has come!  You did everything you could to protect your community, "
"but it appears that prayers were not enough.  Now that they are all dead, you "
"should probably find something more tangible to protect you."
msgstr ""
"Armageddon est arrivé!  Vous avez fait tout ce que vous pouviez pour protéger "
"votre communauté, mais il semble que les prières n’aient pas suffi.  "
"Maintenant qu’ils sont tous morts, vous devriez probablement trouver quelque "
"chose de plus tangible pour vous protéger."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Nun" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"For your entire time as a servant of God, you helped, protected and listened "
"to your parish faithful.  But the Rapture has come, and your parish turned "
"against you.  Now all you can do is pray to the Holy Virgin, and prepare to "
"maintain your wellbeing."
msgstr ""
"Tout au long de votre vie de serviteuse de Dieu, vous avez aidé, protégé et "
"écouté vos fidèles paroissiaux.  Mais l'Enlèvement est arrivé et votre "
"paroisse s'est retournée contre vous.  Il ne vous reste plus qu'à prier la "
"Sainte Vierge et à vous préparer à maintenir votre bien-être.  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Kannushi" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the maintainers of a Shinto shrine, performing rituals and "
"sacred tasks.  You preferred it when only the spirits of the dead inhabited "
"your shrine, and not their rotting corpses."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez l'une des responsables de l'entretien d'un sanctuaire shinto, "
"exécutant des rituels et des tâches sacrées. Vous préfériez quand seuls les "
"esprits des morts habitaient le sanctuaire, et non leurs corps pourrissants."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bhikkhuni" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your life was simple at the Vihara, doing household chores and meditating.  "
"Your Sangha wanted to attain liberation from suffering, now their rotting "
"corpses will suffer forever."
msgstr ""
"Votre vie dans le Vihara vous suffisait, consistant simplement de corvées et "
"de méditation. Votre Sangha cherchait simplement à se libérer du cycle de la "
"souffrance, mais maintenant leurs corps en putréfaction souffriront pour une "
"éternité."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mourchida" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent much of your time prior to the apocalypse at the local mosque, "
"studying the words of the Prophet and the Quran and guiding your community in "
"prayer.  Back then they came from far and wide to listen to you; now they "
"come to eat your brains."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez passé beaucoup de votre temps à la mosquée locale, étudiant les "
"écrits du Prophète et du Coran, et guidant votre communauté dans vos prières. "
"Avant le cataclysme ils venaient de loin pour vous écouter, mais maintenant "
"c'est pour manger votre cervelle."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rabbi" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were davening Shacharit in shul when the Cataclysm struck.  You had "
"always taught that God will restore life to the dead after Moshiach has come, "
"but not like this!"
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez en train de mener Shacharit à la synagogue lorsque le Cataclysme a "
"frappé.  Vous avez toujours enseigné que Dieu redonnera la vie aux morts "
"après la venue du Machia'h, mais pas comme ça!"

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Guru" for female
#. ~ Description of profession "guru" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent many years traveling through the world, becoming wise and learned.  "
"Normally you can answer any question, but even you are not quite sure what to "
"do about the ravenous undead."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez parcouru le monde durant de nombreuses années, devenant sage et "
"instruite. En temps normal vous pourriez répondre à toute question, mais même "
"vous n'avez pas encore eu le temps de vous adapter aux hordes de zombies "
"affamés."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Traveling Preacher" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You devoted your life to spreading the good word, always on the road, "
"traveling from town to town.  Now everything has gone to hell, you can't host "
"your daily podcast, and the undead don't seem particularly moved by your "
"sermons."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez consacré votre vie à répandre la bonne parole, toujours sur la "
"route, voyageant de ville en ville. Aujourd'hui, tout est parti en cacahuète, "
"vous ne pouvez plus accueillir votre podcast quotidien et les morts-vivants "
"ne semblent pas particulièrement émus par vos sermons."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Novice Martial Artist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've decided today is the day to take your first lesson at the local dojo.  "
"You'll be great at it, you're sure of it."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez décidé qu'aujourd'hui est le jour pour prendre votre première leçon "
"au dojo local. Vous serez excellente, vous en êtes sûr."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Martial Artist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"'Drop the martial arts!', they said.  'Learn a skill for the REAL world!', "
"they said.  Well, you're about to show them!  SHOW THEM ALL!"
msgstr ""
"'Laisse tomber les arts martiaux!', qu'ils disaient. 'Apprends quelque chose "
"de plus utile!', qu'ils disaient. Bien, vous allez leur montrer! LEUR MONTRER "
"A TOUS!"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Black Belt" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As the world ends, you alone stand against the coming darkness with your "
"fists of steel."
msgstr ""
"C'est la fin du monde et vous êtes seule contre les ténèbres avec vos poings "
"d'acier."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Pizza Delivery Girl" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were delivering the last pizza of the night to one of your common patrons "
"when hungry zombies attempted to make a meal out of you.  Fleeing for safety, "
"you find yourself with only your wits and some leftover pizza.  And they "
"didn't even leave a tip!"
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez en train de livrer la dernière pizza de la nuit à l'un de vos "
"clients habituels lorsque des zombies affamés ont tenté de faire de vous leur "
"repas. Fuyant pour vous mettre à l'abri, vous vous retrouvez avec seulement "
"votre esprit et des restes de pizza. Et ils n'ont même pas laissé de "
"pourboire !"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Archaeologist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Following a clue from your dead grandfather's journal, you made your way to a "
"long-lost temple, but then the ground started to shake uncontrollably.  You "
"had a bad feeling about that, so you got out of there quickly."
msgstr ""
" En suivant un indice du journal de votre grand-mère décédé, vous vous êtes "
"rendue dans un temple perdu depuis longtemps, mais le sol s'est mis à "
"trembler de façon inexplicable.  Vous aviez un mauvais pressentiment, alors "
"vous avez quitté les lieux rapidement.  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Papergirl" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You set out this morning to deliver the news of the apocalypse.  The undead "
"hordes don't seem to value the latest news, but at least your trusty bicycle "
"is still in working order."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes partie ce matin pour annoncer la nouvelle de l'apocalypse.  Les "
"hordes de morts-vivants ne semblent pas apprécier les dernières nouvelles, "
"mais au moins votre fidèle vélo est toujours en état de marche."

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Farmer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A patch of soil, some water, and sunlight were all you ever needed; why "
"should things be any different now?  With a handful of seeds and your trusty "
"hoe, it's time to rebuild the Earth, one plant at a time."
msgstr ""
"Un lopin de terre, un peu d'eau et la lumière du soleil étaient tout ce dont "
"vous aviez besoin; pourquoi les choses devraient-elles être différentes "
"maintenant?  Avec une poignée de graines et votre fidèle houe, il est temps "
"de reconstruire la Terre, une plante à la fois."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "National Guardsman" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The government activated your National Guard unit to deal with the growing "
"epidemics.  Despite your best efforts, you were unable to form up before all "
"communications ceased and you found yourself alone among the dead."
msgstr ""
"Le gouvernement a activé votre unité de la Garde Nationale pour lutter contre "
"les émeutes et l'épidémie hors de contrôle.  Malgré tout vos efforts, vous "
"n'avez pas réussi à vous regrouper avant que toute communication cesse, et "
"vous vous retrouvez maintenant isolée parmi les morts-vivants."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hardened Scavenger" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"One of the lucky few who escaped the Cataclysm, you made a life for yourself "
"amidst the ruins of civilization.  Whether through force, guile, or luck, "
"you've obtained the best gear you could find."
msgstr ""
"L'une des quelques chanceuses a avoir échappé au Cataclysme, vous vous êtes "
"reconstruit une vie parmi les ruines de votre civilisation. Que ce soit par "
"la force, la ruse ou la chance, vous êtes aussi parvenue à réunir le meilleur "
"équipement que vous pouviez trouver."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Holdout" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You must have paid attention to your survival training in boot camp; "
"otherwise, you would never have lived long enough to outlast the chain of "
"command and find yourself in this predicament.  The only mission now is to "
"survive."
msgstr ""
"Vous devez avoir bien prêté attention à vos cours de survie durant votre "
"entraînement, ayant survécu à toute votre chaîne de commandement jusqu'à vous "
"retrouver seule dans ce pétrin. Votre seule mission ayant encore du sens est "
"de survivre."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mall Security" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent dull nights guarding the local mall against teen hooligans and "
"petty thieves.  Your job training didn't provide any terribly useful skills, "
"but you do have your trusty stun gun, baton, and pocket knife."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez passé des nuits ennuyeuses à garder un centre commercial local "
"contre les adolescents hooligans et les petits voleurs. Votre formation "
"professionnelle ne vous a pas donné la chance d'acquérir des compétences très "
"utiles, mais vous tout de même sur vous votre matraque, votre couteau de "
"poche et votre fidèle taser."

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Naturalist" for female
#. ~ Description of profession "naturalist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Over long years of self-imposed exile in the wilderness, you have come to an "
"understanding with Mother Nature.  The world as they knew it might have ended "
"for your forsaken species, but you can hardly tell the difference."
msgstr ""
"Au cours de longues années d’exil volontaire dans la nature, vous êtes "
"parvenue à un accord avec Mère Nature.  Le monde tel qu’ils le connaissaient "
"à bien pu prendre fin pour votre espèce perdue, mais vous pouvez "
"difficilement faire la différence."

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Fisher" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent most of your days fishing in the swamp, getting by quietly on your "
"catch.  You found the buzzing of insects enjoyable, but recently they've "
"gotten bigger and meaner.  Now their horrible noises have you spooked - you "
"just hope the fish aren't as nasty."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez passé la plupart de vos journées à pêcher dans le marais, en vous "
"débrouillant tranquillement avec vos prises.  Vous trouviez le bourdonnement "
"des insectes agréable, mais récemment, ils sont devenus plus gros et plus "
"méchants.  Maintenant, leurs bruits horribles vous font peur – vous espérez "
"juste que les poissons ne soient pas encore aussi hargneux."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ahistorical Reenactor" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were on your way to the Annual All New England Revolutionary War Living "
"History exhibition when the end of the world made traditional gender roles "
"obsolete."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez en route pour l'Exposition Annuelle de la Nouvelle-Angleterre sur "
"la Guerre d'Indépendance lorsque la fin du monde a rendu obsolètes les rôles "
"de genre traditionnels."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Historical Reenactor" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were on your way to the Annual All New England Revolutionary War Living "
"History exhibition when the end of the world permanently derailed your plans."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez en route pour l'Exposition Annuelle de la Nouvelle-Angleterre sur "
"la Guerre d'Indépendance, mais la fin du monde a certainement fait dérailler "
"vos plans."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Skater Girl (Rollerblades)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You love to skate!  You've probably spent more time on a pair of blades than "
"off.  Things have gotten pretty bad, but at least the grown-ups aren't "
"telling you where you can't roll."
msgstr ""
"Vous adorez patiner !  Vous avez probablement passée plus de temps avec une "
"paire de rollers que sans.  Les choses ont mal tourné, mais au moins les "
"adultes ne vous disent pas où vous ne pouvez pas rouler.  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Skater Girl (Skateboard)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You love to skate!  You've probably spent more time on a skateboard than off. "
" Things have gotten pretty bad, but at least the grown-ups aren't telling you "
"where you can't roll."
msgstr ""
"Vous adorez faire de la planche à roulettes ! Vous avez probablement passé "
"plus de temps avec un skateboard que sans. Les choses ont mal tourné, mais au "
"moins les adultes ne vous disent pas où vous ne pouvez pas rouler. "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Juvenile Delinquent" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You never cared for grown-ups telling you what to do, so you ended up "
"spending quite a few days in the principal's office.  Now, not needing "
"grown-ups to tell you what to do is the only reason you're alive.  Man, you "
"really should've played hooky today."
msgstr ""
"Vous n'avez jamais aimé que les adultes vous disent quoi faire, alors vous "
"avez fini par passer plusieurs jours dans le bureau du directeur.  Ne pas "
"avoir écouté les adultes vous dire quoi faire est la seule raison pour "
"laquelle vous êtes en vie.  Meuf, tu aurais vraiment dû faire l'école "
"buissonnière aujourd'hui.  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Survivalist Jr." for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your parents were crazy preppers who thought some \"Cataclysm\" was coming, "
"and insisted on preparing you for it.  Turns out they were right.  You didn't "
"get a chance to thank them.  The only thing you can do for them now is what "
"they always hoped you would do in the dark days ahead: survive."
msgstr ""
"Vos parents étaient des dingos du survivalisme n'arrêtant pas de se préparer "
"pour un \"Cataclysme\" imminent et on insisté pour que vous soyez prête. On "
"dirait qu'ils ont eu raison au final, malheureusement vous n'avez pas eu la "
"chance de les remercier de vous avoir bien éduquée pour ce nouveau monde, et "
"la seule chose que vous pouvez maintenant faire en leur mémoire est ce qu'ils "
"ont toujours voulu pour vous : survivre."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dodgeball Player" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In dodgeball, failing to dodge meant taking a ball to the head and being out "
"of the game.  In the Cataclysm, it means getting eaten by monsters.  Don't "
"slip up."
msgstr ""
"Au ballon prisonnier, ne pas esquiver signifiait prendre un ballon à la tête "
"et être hors du jeu.  Dans le Cataclysme, cela signifie se faire manger par "
"des monstres.  Ne faites pas de fautes."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Science Club Member" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The school never let your club play with the really fun chemicals, the kind "
"that make things go boom, but there aren't any teachers around to enforce the "
"rules anymore."
msgstr ""
"L'école n'a jamais laissé votre club jouer avec des produits chimiques "
"vraiment amusants, le genre qui fait exploser les choses, mais il n'y a plus "
"d'enseignants pour vous faire respecter les règles."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "A/V Club Member" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a member of the school A/V club.  You're sure there's some way you "
"can use your technical skills to help you stay alive.  You just haven't "
"figured out how to make an awesome death ray yet."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez membre du club audiovisuel de votre école.  Vous êtes sûre qu'il "
"existe un moyen d'utiliser vos compétences techniques pour vous aider à "
"rester en vie.  Vous n'avez tout simplement pas encore trouvé comment créer "
"un rayon mortel."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Teacher" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've been teaching kids all your life, experiencing the joy and aggravation "
"of imparting knowledge to young minds.  If zombies have any interest in "
"education, they're not showing it."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez enseigné à des enfants toute votre vie, vous avez connu la joie et "
"la souffrance de transmettre des connaissances à de jeunes esprits. Si les "
"zombies s'intéressent à l'éducation, ils ne le montrent pas."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Photojournalist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Covering the apocalypse up close could make your career, though finding a "
"publisher seems more difficult a prospect than usual.  You managed to hold "
"onto your camera - hopefully you can get some fantastic shots."
msgstr ""
"Votre photoreportage de l'apocalypse aurait pu être le chef-d'œuvre de votre "
"carrière, mais on dirait que trouver une éditrice pour vos photos sera encore "
"plus difficile que d'habitude. Heureusement, vous avez réussi à ne pas perdre "
"votre caméra, espérons que vous obtiendrez des photos fantastiques."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Gym Teacher" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"It was hard enough getting kids to run laps without having to worry about "
"them trying to eat your brains.  Zombies won't even line up when you blow "
"your whistle."
msgstr ""
"C'était déjà assez difficile de faire courir des enfants sans avoir à se "
"soucier de ceux-ci voulant dévorer votre cervelle, et ils ne se rangent même "
"plus en lignes lorsque vous donnez un coup de sifflet."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Miner" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a miner, not a minor!  Your canteen is dry, your jackhammer is out of "
"gas, and you're on your last pair of batteries for your mining helmet…"
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes une mineuse, pas une mineure!  Votre gourde est vide, votre "
"marteau-piqueur est à plat, et votre lampe de casque est sur sa dernière "
"paire de batteries…"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Demolition Expert" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before this all began, you were having the time of your life at your dream "
"job: blowing stuff up.  The Cataclysm means you're finally allowed to do it "
"full time."
msgstr ""
"Avant que tout ceci commence, vous vous éclatiez comme jamais en faisant "
"votre job de rêve: faire exploser des choses. Le Cataclysme vous donne "
"maintenant l'opportunité de passer à plein temps."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Traceuse" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've practiced parkour for many years, and made the world your playground.  "
"It wouldn't be a lie to say that running is your life.  Which is good, "
"because now that the end has come, you're running FOR your life."
msgstr ""
"Vous pratiquez le parkour depuis de nombreuses années et avez fait du monde "
"votre terrain de jeu.  Ce ne serait pas un mensonge de dire que le freerun "
"c'est votre vie.  Ce qui est bien, car maintenant que la fin est arrivée, "
"vous courez POUR votre vie."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Tourist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"This seemed like a great place for a vacation, but you're starting to regret "
"ever leaving home.  You came here to get a taste of New England, but New "
"England keeps trying to get a taste of you!"
msgstr ""
"Ceci avait l'air d'être un endroit parfait pour vos vacances, mais vous "
"commencez à regretter votre décision de partir. Vous êtes venue ici pour "
"savourer la Nouvelle Angleterre, mais on dirait que la Nouvelle Angleterre "
"veut plutôt vous savourer."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Naked and Afraid" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The apocalypse has caught you completely naked!  Maybe you were robbed, maybe "
"you were at a nudist beach, or maybe you just enjoy the feeling of liberation "
"brought by the wind touching your skin.  Whatever the reason, you lack "
"clothes in a time when everyone wants a piece of you."
msgstr ""
"L'apocalypse est là et vous êtes totalement nue! Peut être que vous venez "
"d'être totalement dépouillée, peut être que vous reveniez juste d'une plage "
"nudiste, ou peut être que vous aimez juste l'effet libérateur du vent "
"touchant votre peau nue. Quelque soit la raison, vous êtes dépourvue de toute "
"protection pile au moment où pratiquement tout veut maintenant vous dévorer."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Zoo Keeper" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were called in on your day off to feed the animals at the zoo.  For some "
"reason, none of your coworkers bothered showing up for work today."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez été forcée d'annuler votre jour de congé pour nourrir les animaux "
"du zoo, pour une raison qui vous échappe, aucun de vos collègues n'est "
"présente aujourd'hui."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Urban Samurai" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were always an inexplicable sight in town, with your funny hair and odd "
"Japanese clothes.  Little of this concerned you, but last week the grocery "
"service stopped coming and now the TV no longer turns on.  This displeases "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez toujours été un phénomène inexplicable en ville, avec vos cheveux "
"bizarres et vos vêtements japonais étranges. Cela ne vous préoccupait guère, "
"mais la semaine dernière, le service d'épicerie a cessé de venir et "
"maintenant la télévision ne s'allume plus. Cela vous déplaît."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Competitive Fencer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Years of training prepared you for the competitive fencing circuit, but your "
"latest tournament was cut short when zombies invaded the piste.  The referee "
"was eaten, so you're not sure if the rules are still in play."
msgstr ""
"Des années d'entraînement vous ont préparée au circuit d'escrime de "
"compétition, mais votre dernier tournoi a été interrompu lorsque des zombies "
"ont envahi la piste.  L'arbitre a été dévoré, vous ne savez donc pas si les "
"règles sont toujours en vigueur."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Career Politician" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've spent your life appealing to the people, persuading many and promising "
"much throughout your time in office.  Now that your voting base wants to eat "
"you alive, winning hearts and minds just got that much harder."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez passé votre vie à faire appel aux gens, à les convaincre et à leur "
"promettre beaucoup de choses tout au long de votre mandat.  Maintenant que "
"votre base électorale veut vous manger vivante, gagner les cœurs et les "
"esprits est devenu encore plus difficile.  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rancher" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Taking care of cows, horses, and other animals is your passion, but the ways "
"things are going, this isn't going to be just another day at the ranch."
msgstr ""
"Prendre soin des vaches, des chevaux et des autres animaux est votre passion, "
"mais au train où vont les choses, ce ne sera plus une simple journée au "
"ranch.  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Roadie" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've always worked just outside of the limelight, carrying and fixing the "
"equipment and ensuring that the performers got what they needed.  The show "
"must go on."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez toujours travaillé à l'écart des projecteurs, transportant et "
"réparant le matériel et veillant à ce que les artistes obtiennent ce dont ils "
"avaient besoin.  Le spectacle doit continuer."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Musician" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You nailed your solo, but the audience erupted into screams instead of "
"applause.  You weren't able to grab much during the panic, but at least you "
"have your loaded six string on your back."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez réussi votre solo, mais le public a poussé des cris au lieu de "
"faire des applaudissements.  Vous n'avez pas réussi à attraper grand-chose "
"pendant la panique, mais au moins vous avez votre guitare chargée sur le dos. "
" "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Kitted Survivor" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You saw a sign at the local mall advertising a discount on survival kits.  "
"You bought one, more for show than for actual use.  Now it's all you have."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez vu un panneau au centre commercial local annonçant une réduction "
"sur les kits de survie. Vous en avez acheté un, plus pour la forme que pour "
"l'usage. Maintenant, c'est tout ce que vous avez."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Wild West Gunslinger" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You made your living on Wild West exhibitions and shows, impressing tourists "
"with your displays of marksmanship.  But that world has ended, so you took "
"your trusty six-shooter and wandered into a world where it's always high noon."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez gagné votre vie grâce aux expositions et aux spectacles du Far "
"West, impressionnant les touristes avec vos démonstrations d'adresse au tir.  "
"Mais ce monde est révolu, alors vous avez pris votre fidèle six-coups et vous "
"êtes promenée dans un monde où il est toujours midi.  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Sorority Girl" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life, spending your parents' money without a care in "
"the world.  At one of your usual crazy parties, the guests became hungry for "
"more than drugs and booze, but you still have a chance to use the last symbol "
"of your luxurious life - your sports car - and get far away."
msgstr ""
"Vous meniez la grande vie, dépensant l'argent de vos parents sans vous "
"soucier du monde.  Lors d'une de vos folles soirées habituelles, les invités "
"ont eu envie de plus que de la drogue et de l'alcool, mais vous avez encore "
"la possibilité d'utiliser le dernier symbole de votre vie luxueuse - votre "
"voiture de sport - et décamper."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Marksman" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You like to think of yourself as a sniper, but really you're just infantry "
"with a bigger gun.  That said, a big gun is a definite advantage now."
msgstr ""
"Vous aimez penser que vous êtes une snipeuse, mais en réalité vous n'êtes "
"qu'une soldate d'infantrie avec un plus gros fusil. Ceci dit, avoir un gros "
"fusil est clairement un avantage ces jours-ci."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Automatic Rifleman" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were trusted with a big-ass, belt-fed machine gun and plenty of ammo to "
"lay down suppressing fire for your team.  Now that it's going to be much "
"harder to resupply, you should probably be more selective with the ol' "
"spray-and-pray."
msgstr ""
"Votre escouade vous a confié une mitrailleuse lourde énorme alimentée par "
"bande pour leur donner du tir de couverture. Maintenant que votre arme va "
"être beaucoup plus difficile à réapprovisionner, vous devriez peut être "
"économiser vos tirs."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Grenadier" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"There's no kill like overkill, and not many people in this world can boast "
"that they have a grenade launcher and know how to use it.  Just try not to "
"blow yourself up, that would be really embarrassing."
msgstr ""
"Face aux monstres, trop n'est jamais assez, et peu de gens dans ce monde "
"peuvent se vanter de posséder un lance-grenades et de savoir comment "
"l'utiliser.  Essayez simplement de ne pas vous envoyer en l'air, ce serait "
"vraiment embarrassant."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Breacher" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Doors and windows everywhere dare not speak your name.  You're going to be "
"breaking into buildings for supplies rather than combat operations now, but "
"the principle is about the same."
msgstr ""
"Les portes et fenêtres du monde entier craignent votre nom. Vous allez "
"maintenant forcer des bâtiments pour les fouiller au lieu de les vider "
"d'ennemis durant une opération de combat, mais en principe peu de choses vont "
"changer."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Sniper" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a crack shot with a rifle, and the farther you can stay away from "
"zombies, the better.  The only thing stopping you is limited ammo, so you "
"should try to find a place to restock sooner or later."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes une tireuse d'élite des forces armées, et le plus loin vous arrivez "
"à rester des zombies, le mieux c'est. La seul chose qui pourrait vous arrêter "
"est le manque de munitions, donc vous devriez probablement rapidement trouver "
"un endroit où vous réapprovisionner."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Hacker" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"'Hacker' is a silly pop-culture name, popularized by Hollywood and people "
"with little to no knowledge of what your job entails.  You prefer 'Electronic "
"Warfare Specialist,' though nobody's really left to make the distinction."
msgstr ""
"«Hackeuse» est un mot idiot de la culture pop, popularisé par Hollywood et "
"par des personnes ayant peu ou pas de connaissances sur ce qu'implique votre "
"travail. Vous préférez «Spécialiste de la guerre électronique», même s'il ne "
"reste plus vraiment personne pour en faire la distinction.  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Undercover Operative" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've been tailing your target for months, and now he's a zombie.  So much "
"for that lead.  Command isn't responding to your calls for an evac, so you'll "
"have to make do with what you have on you."
msgstr ""
"Vous suiviez votre cible depuis des mois, et celle-ci à eu l'audace d'être "
"zombifiée.  Tant pis pour cette piste.  Vos supérieurs ne répondent pas à vos "
"appels pour une évacuation, vous devrez donc vous contenter de ce que vous "
"avez sur vous."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Pilot" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You got to see things fall apart from the sky, transporting soldiers and "
"survivors from one holdout to the next.  You knew it was only a matter of "
"time before the horrors patrolling the skies shot you down."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez vu les choses s'effondrer du ciel, transportant soldats et "
"survivants d'un refuge à l'autre.  Vous saviez que ce n'était qu'une question "
"de temps avant que les horreurs qui patrouillent dans le ciel ne vous "
"abattent."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "EMT" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were responding to a call with your partner before you got separated.  "
"Now all you have is your trusty ambulance, ready to transport patients "
"through the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"Vous répondiez à un appel avec votre partenaire avant d'être séparés.  Il ne "
"vous reste plus que votre fidèle ambulance, prête à transporter les patients "
"à travers l'apocalypse."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Paramedic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were separated from your partner while out on a call.  You managed to "
"hang onto some medical supplies, but it's looking like the only life that "
"needs saving now is yours."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez été séparée de votre partenaire lors d'une intervention, et avez "
"réussi à conserver quelques fournitures médicales, mais il semble que la "
"seule vie ayant besoin d'être sauvée maintenant est la vôtre."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Combat Medic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were on the front lines when everything happened, patching up the wounded "
"and providing support.  But they wouldn't stop coming.  Now you're on your "
"own."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez en première ligne lorsque tout s’est produit, pansant les blessés "
"et apportant votre soutien.  Mais ils n'arrêteraient pas de venir.  "
"Maintenant vous devez vous débrouiller vous même."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Relief Volunteer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a nonprofit organization dedicated to helping out where "
"help was needed.  When the riots happened, you were eager to lend a hand.  "
"But you had to cut your plans short when everyone was less interested in "
"handouts, and more interested in eating you."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez membre d’une organisation à but non lucratif dédiée à aider là où "
"l'aide était nécessaire.  Lorsque les émeutes ont eu lieu, vous aviez hâte de "
"donner un coup de main.  Mais vous avez dû écourter vos projets lorsque tout "
"le monde est devenu plus intéressé par votre chair que votre charité."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Speed Queen" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You used to rule the roads before they were filled with wrecks, undead, and "
"unspeakable horrors.  At least there's no speed limits in the apocalypse!"
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez la maîtresse indisputée de la route avant qu'elle se remplisse de "
"carcasses de voiture ainsi que de zombies et autres abominations. Au moins, "
"l'apocalypse a retirée toute les limites de vitesse!"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hazmat Unit" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were deployed to autopsy one of the rioters showing feral behavior before "
"being put down.  When they got back up, you knew this was out of your pay "
"grade."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez été envoyée pour autopsier l'un des émeutiers ayant eu un "
"comportement dérangé avant d'être abattu.  Quand il s'est relevé, vous avez "
"décidé que votre n'étiez pas assez payée pour ça."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Drug Dealer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were about to make your biggest sale yet, but when you met the buyer he "
"tried to bite you.  To top it off, it seems that this wasn't some sort of bad "
"trip, as the whole town tried going for your throat too."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez sur le point de réaliser votre plus grosse vente à ce jour, mais "
"lorsque vous avez rencontré l'acheteuse, elle a essayé de vous mordre.  Pour "
"couronner le tout, il semble que ce ne soit pas une sorte de bad trip, "
"puisque toute la ville a également essayé de vous prendre à la gorge.  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mafia Boss" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Born into poverty, you joined one of the organized crime families to make a "
"living.  There, you quickly made it to the top and became the boss.  The "
"government was building a RICO case against you, but doomsday arrived first.  "
"Your crew is gone, but your past life has prepared you for a world where "
"violence is common currency."
msgstr ""
"Née dans la pauvreté, vous avez rejoint une famille du crime organisé pour "
"gagner votre vie.  Là, vous avez rapidement atteint le sommet et êtes devenue "
"la patronne.  Le gouvernement était en train de monter un dossier en béton "
"contre vous, mais la fin du monde est arrivée en premier.  Votre équipage est "
"parti, mais votre vie passée vous a préparé à un monde où la violence est "
"monnaie courante.  "

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Paranormal Investigator" for female
#. ~ Description of profession "paranormal_investigator" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were dismissed from your position as a parapsychology professor at the "
"local university and started your own business as a paranormal investigator.  "
"Your former colleagues didn't approve of your research, but it looks like "
"it's paying off now."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez été licenciée de votre poste de professeur de parapsychologie à "
"l'université locale et avez lancé votre propre entreprise en tant "
"qu'enquêtrice paranormal.  Vos anciennes collègues n’ont pas approuvé vos "
"recherches, mais il semble qu’elles portent désormais leurs fruits.  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bird Watcher" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were at your favorite park looking at the robins when the Cataclysm "
"struck.  Now all you have are your binoculars and a lot of trivia about local "
"birds to share with any survivors you may find."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez dans votre parc préféré en train d'observer les merles lorsque le "
"Cataclysme a frappé.  Il ne vous reste plus que vos jumelles et de nombreuses "
"anecdotes sur les oiseaux locaux à partager avec tous les survivant/es que "
"vous pourriez trouver.  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Portal Traveler" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were abducted from your home, taken hostage, and used as a test subject "
"in a lab.  For the last test, you were dressed in strange clothes and put in "
"a room where you started to feel… different.  You lost consciousness and woke "
"up somewhere unfamiliar."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez été enlevée de chez vous, prise en otage et utilisée comme cobaye "
"dans un laboratoire.  Pendant le dernier test, vous avez été habillée avec "
"des vêtements étranges et mise dans une pièce où vous avez commencé à vous "
"sentir… différente.  Vous avez perdu connaissance et vous vous êtes réveillée "
"dans un endroit inconnu."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Kunoichi" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are obsessed with the techniques and aesthetics of the ninja, so you "
"practiced your movements, dressed all in black, and spent big bucks to "
"acquire some tools of the trade.  Some may question your historical "
"authenticity, but you're perfectly happy living out your fantasy regardless."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes obsédée par les techniques et l'esthétique du ninja, vous avez donc "
"pratiqué vos mouvements, vous êtes habillée tout en noir et avez dépensé "
"beaucoup d'argent pour acquérir quelques outils du métier.  Certains peuvent "
"remettre en question votre authenticité historique, mais vous êtes malgré "
"tout parfaitement heureuse de vivre votre fantasme."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cheerleader" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your last cheerleader routine ended abruptly after your partners switched "
"sides to the undead team.  Let's hope your quick reflexes and flexibility "
"help you to find new members for the squad."
msgstr ""
"Votre dernière routine de Pom-Pom girl s'est terminée brusquement après que "
"vos partenaires ont changé de camp pour l'équipe des morts-vivants.  Espérons "
"que vos réflexes rapides et votre flexibilité vous aideront à trouver de "
"nouvelles membres pour l'équipe.  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Patriot" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are a true American patriot, dressed with star-spangled clothing from "
"head to toe.  The government has fallen, but the nation lives on with its "
"people."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes une véritable patriote américaine, vêtue de vêtements étoilés de la "
"tête aux pieds.  Le gouvernement est tombé, mais la nation continue de vivre "
"avec son peuple."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Prepped Patriot" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Does the American dream still exist?  Well, recent events have put that to "
"the test.  Does it still proudly live in your beating heart?  Yes.  Yes, it "
"does.  A patriot to the bitter end, you've readied yourself to go toe to toe "
"with the Cataclysm that would seek to do harm to your darling USA.  That is "
"to say, you grabbed your gun… and nothing more.  God bless America, soldier."
msgstr ""
"Le rêve américain existe-t-il encore ? Les événements récents l'ont mis à "
"l'épreuve. Est-il encore fièrement présent dans votre cœur battant ? Oui. "
"Oui, il existe. Patriote jusqu'au bout des ongles, vous vous êtes préparée à "
"affronter le cataclysme qui chercherait à nuire à vos chers États-Unis. En "
"d'autres termes, vous avez pris votre arme... et rien d'autre. Que Dieue "
"bénisse l'Amérique, soldate."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cowboy" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You liked to spend your days taking care of the horses and cows, searching "
"the perimeter of the ranch on your steed and looking out for anything "
"suspicious, that's why you managed to escape in time when shit hit the fan."
msgstr ""
"Vous aimiez passer vos journées à vous occuper des chevaux et des vaches, à "
"patrouiller le périmètre du ranch sur votre cheval et la recherche de signes "
"suspects, ce qui vous a permit de vous échapper à temps lorsque tout est "
"parti en vrille."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Tourist Swimmer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were looking forward to a nice, relaxing day at the beach.  You had to "
"run when some lunatics tried to rip your head off and play beach volleyball "
"with it, but at least you managed to grab your bag on the way out."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous attendiez à une journée agréable et relaxante à la plage, mais vous "
"avez dû vous enfuir lorsque des fous furieux ont essayé de vous arracher la "
"tête et de jouer au beach-volley avec, mais au moins vous avez réussi à "
"attraper votre sac en sortant."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Professional Swimmer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After much practice you were sure the next competition would be your big "
"break, but your rivals started killing each other and you had to escape with "
"only your competition gear on you.  Will your athleticism alone be enough to "
"keep you alive?"
msgstr ""
"Après beaucoup d'entraînement, vous étiez sûre que la prochaine compétition "
"serait votre grand succès, mais vos rivales ont commencé à s'entre-tuer et "
"vous avez dû vous échapper avec seulement votre équipement de compétition sur "
"vous.  Votre athlétisme suffira-t-il à vous maintenir en vie?  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Surfer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You went to ride the waves, but the waves ended up riding you instead when a "
"putrid hand appeared from underwater and grabbed you by the ankle.  You had "
"to ditch your surfboard in favor of a kickboard, and now you'll fight every "
"day to stay ahead of the wave of the undead."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes allée surfer sur les vagues, mais les vagues ont fini par vous "
"chevaucher lorsqu'une main putride est apparue de l'eau et vous a attrapé par "
"la cheville. Vous avez dû abandonner votre planche de surf au profit d'une "
"planche de flottaison, et maintenant vous allez vous battre tous les jours "
"pour garder une longueur d'avance sur la vague des morts-vivants."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lifeguard" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your job was to safeguard the lives of everyone at the beach, but when the "
"swimmers started drowning each other, you knew the situation was out of your "
"hands."
msgstr ""
"Votre travail consistait à protéger la vie de tout le monde sur la plage, "
"mais lorsque les nageurs ont commencé à se noyer les uns les autres, vous "
"saviez que la situation était hors de votre contrôle."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Diver" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were exploring below the waves close to shore when you noticed something "
"weird on the nearby beach, you decided to swim away when you heard the "
"screams."
msgstr ""
"Vous exploriez sous les vagues près du rivage lorsque vous avez remarqué "
"quelque chose de bizarre sur la plage voisine.  Vous avez décidé de vous "
"éloigner à la nage lorsque vous avez entendu les cris.  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ship Captain" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were the captain of your small ship, making a living by ferrying divers "
"and tourists across the waves.  The last excursion went bad after your "
"passengers tried to mutiny, but you managed to escape.  Will you ever sail "
"the open ocean again?"
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez la capitaine de votre petit navire, gagnant votre vie en "
"transportant des plongeurs et des touristes à travers les vagues.  La "
"dernière excursion s'est mal passée après que vos passagers ont tenté de se "
"mutiner, mais vous avez réussi à vous échapper.  Allez-vous un jour naviguer "
"à nouveau en haute mer?  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hitwoman" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You did the wet work for a gang, mafia, or whatever person had enough money.  "
"You were no trained assassin, but you know how to shoot a gun and get out of "
"dodge quickly."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Assassin" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were the best undercover agent they had, with a mission so vital that you "
"had to take it even with the riots going on.  Your target seems to have "
"turned feral as well as your contact, you are all alone now."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez la meilleure agente d'infiltration dont ils disposaient, avec une "
"mission si vitale que vous deviez l'accepter malgré les émeutes en cours.  "
"Votre cible semble être devenue férale, ainsi que votre contact, vous êtes "
"toute seule désormais."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Old Veteran" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've been through hell once before.  Hopefully those weekend range trips "
"have kept your skills sharp."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez déjà vécu l’Enfer une fois.  Espérons que vos séances de tir de fin "
"de semaine vous ont permit de garder votre précision."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Urban Explorer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've always admired the beauty of urban desolation, and were ready for your "
"next excursion when the end of the world hit.  You suppose that pretty much "
"every building could be considered abandoned now."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez toujours admiré la beauté de la désolation urbaine et étiez prête "
"pour votre prochaine excursion lorsque la fin du monde a frappé.  Vous "
"supposez que presque tous les bâtiments pourraient désormais être considérés "
"comme abandonnés."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Office Worker" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You felt years of your life being sapped away, slaving at your computer as "
"you subsisted on a daily pot of coffee, microwave burritos and an endless "
"supply of crumpled paper to toss.  Perhaps the Cataclysm is a refreshing "
"change of pace…"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez senti des années de votre vie être sapées, à travailler sur votre "
"ordinateur alors que vous subsistiez de jour en jour de tasses de café, "
"burritos au micro-ondes et une quantité inépuisable de papier froissé à "
"jeter.  Peut-être que le Cataclysme sera un changement de rythme "
"rafraîchissant…"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "RV Hunter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting and traveling; so when you "
"scraped enough money, you bought yourself an old RV, a gun, and hit the road. "
" You've been all over the country, hunting for good game.  Unfortunately the "
"country is all over this time, and even more unfortunately you've lost your "
"ol' reliable in the chaos.  Now you gotta find a new reliable."
msgstr ""
"Depuis que vous étiez une enfant, vous aimiez chasser et voyager; alors, "
"quand vous avez économisé assez d'argent, vous vous êtes achetée un vieux "
"camping-car, une arme à feu, et vous avez pris la route.  Vous avez parcouru "
"les quatre coins du continent à la recherche du bon gibier.  Malheureusement, "
"les chose ont l'air totalement foutues, et encore plus malheureusement, vous "
"avez perdu votre bon vieux mode de transport dans le chaos.  Peut-être "
"arriverez-vous à trouver un remplacement?"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Heist Driver" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"For as long as you can remember, you have lived a double life: a normal "
"driver by the day and a heist driver in the night.  Now there are no cops and "
"no law, but even after the Cataclysm, you drive."
msgstr ""
"D'aussi loin que vous vous en souveniez, vous avez vécu  une double vie : "
"conductrice normale le jour et conductrice de braquage la nuit.  Maintenant, "
"il n'y a plus de flics ni de loi, mais même après le Cataclysme, vous "
"conduisez.  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Explosive Ordnance Disposal Technician" for
#. female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you were fascinated with explosives and all "
"things that go boom.  As soon as you turned 18 you joined the army to become "
"an EOD technician.  While out on a call about a potential explosive in the "
"neighboring county, your team was overrun by hordes of the undead.  You are "
"alone, with nothing but your precious training, gear and love of explosives."
msgstr ""
"Depuis que vous êtes enfant, vous êtes fascinée par les explosifs et tout ce "
"qui fait boum.  Dès l’âge de 18 ans, vous avez rejoint l’armée pour devenir "
"technicienne en neutralisation des explosifs et des munitions.  Lors d'un "
"appel concernant un explosif potentiel dans le comté voisin, votre équipe a "
"été envahie par des hordes de morts-vivants.  Vous êtes seule, avec rien "
"d'autre que votre précieux entraînement, votre équipement et votre amour des "
"explosifs.  "

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mixed Martial Artist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've spent plenty of time training to become the next big thing.  But now "
"it looks like you will be fighting your life from now on.  At least that "
"training won't go to waste!"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez passé beaucoup de temps à vous entraîner pour devenir la prochaine "
"grande vedette. Mais il semblerait que vous deviez désormais vous battre "
"toute votre vie. Au moins, cette formation ne sera pas perdue !"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "FBI Special Agent" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As a member of the FBI, you dealt with crime that crossed state lines.  You "
"had gotten the go-ahead to make the biggest bust of your career; before you "
"kicked down the door, you yelled \"FBI, open up!\" and then the sky broke "
"open."
msgstr ""
"En tant que membre du FBI, vous vous occupiez de crimes qui dépassaient les "
"frontières de l'État.  Vous aviez reçu le feu vert pour faire le plus gros "
"coup de votre carrière ; avant de défoncer la porte, vous avez crié « FBI, "
"ouvrez ! » et le ciel s'est ouvert."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Futile Fighter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The cataclysm may have caught you off guard, but you're not going down "
"without a fight!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/profession_groups.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Standard Bionic Interface" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Like most people on Earth you have previously received cybernetic enhancement "
"to make life easier.  Your enhancements include a universal data link, some "
"basic power storage, and a charging cable to top up."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Speed Freak" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Were you a mercenary, a criminal, a pirate or a very dedicated adrenaline "
"junkie?  Whatever you were before, now you've got a speed freak rig pumping "
"drugs into your veins 24/7.  Statistically you'll die young, your body burned "
"out by all the drugs, but what other chance did you have to become an "
"immortal legend?  None."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Earth born" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your mannerisms and accent are a dead giveaway that you were raised on Earth. "
" Whatever your thoughts about the homeworld might be, the simple fact that "
"you can call it home is likely to affect relationships with people liable to "
"care about such things."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Armament License" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have a license to own and operate military grade weaponry and can legally "
"purchase such items without any difficulty.  A privilege usually reserved for "
"the politically or economically favored."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Space Operations" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have ample experience working in space, either on a station or on a ship. "
" You are familiar with safety protocols, capable of piloting small "
"shuttlecraft and can operate and perform maintenance on a variety of space "
"equipment and colony systems."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Empathic Leadership" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have a natural talent for leadership and can easily see yourself in "
"others.  Quite literally.  In fact, you can swap control to any other "
"character that follows you."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez un talent naturel pour mener les gens et vous pouvez facilement "
"vous voir dans les autres. Littéralement. À vrai dire, vous pouvez "
"interchanger avec n'importe quel personnage qui vous suit."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Genemod: Physical Ability" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Much more common in the Hyperspace Era, the rich or those from Earth still "
"have access to genemodding technology designed to make humanity better.  This "
"is the suite of improvements to increase strength, coordination, and sensory "
"ability as well as fix problems such as nearsightedness."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Genemod: Mental Acuity" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Much more common in the Hyperspace Era, the rich or those from Earth still "
"have access to genemodding technology designed to make humanity better.  This "
"is the suite of improvements to increase mental flexibility and memorization."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Genemod: Improved Health" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Much more common in the Hyperspace Era, the rich or those from Earth still "
"have access to genemodding technology designed to make humanity better.  This "
"is the suite of improvements to health, providing increased healing speed and "
"resistance to disease and infection."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Genemod: Efficient System" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Much more common in the Hyperspace Era, the rich or those from Earth still "
"have access to genemodding technology designed to make humanity better.  This "
"is the suite of improvements to recovery, allowing a quicker sleep cycle and "
"faster return to baseline after exertion."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Genemod: Beauty" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Much more common in the Hyperspace Era, the rich or those from Earth still "
"have access to genemodding technology designed to make humanity better.  This "
"is the suite of improvements to physical appearance, offering clearer skin, "
"more striking features, increased facial symmetry, and removing signs of "
"aging."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Esper Inheritance (Spark)" for female
#. ~ Description of profession "Esper Inheritance (Whisper)" for female
#. ~ Description of profession "Esper Inheritance (Geist)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Some long-distant member of your family received psi treatments during the "
"Hyperspace Era and somehow it stuck in their DNA.  Always unpredictable, "
"skipping multiple generations at a time, that inheritance has been passed "
"down to you.  You have no training and little idea what you're doing, but "
"you've developed a trick or two."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Deck Engineer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "A skilled ship technician, turned to independent salvage work."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rating" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a junior crewmember on a freight spaceship.  Without any "
"exceptionally valuable abilities, you spent your workshifts performing "
"miscellaneous maintenance tasks within the ship.  As such, you are moderately "
"skilled at performing all sorts of minor electrical and mechanical repairs, a "
"skillset you hope remains useful planetside…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Espatier" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are a well experienced mercenary espatier, a soldier rated for both "
"orbital and planetary combat.  Until the crash, you were part of a minor "
"mercenary outfit that provided on-board and landing-site security for freight "
"corporations, although it seems that your last contractor required more "
"protection than what you could provide.  Unfortunately, most of your more "
"specialized gear was left behind in your hasty evacuation…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Captain Schwarz Walder, Cannibal" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Several years ago, you were newly stationed at a remote corporate facility "
"when it came under a personality rewrite attack that affected all of your "
"human coworkers.  It had seemed likely that the few Uplifted staff would "
"perish and most did.  But you disappeared into the wilderness surrounding the "
"facilities and began hunting the things that had been your friends, eating "
"them to stay alive and to power your bionics.  Recapturing the facility "
"earned you a buyout of the remainder of your contract, but most people are "
"uncomfortable around you once they realize how very different you are.  Now "
"you are here on a mostly abandoned planet hunting a bounty."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cryosleep Survivor" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A sudden power failure woke you from the cryosleep sarcophagus in which you "
"had entombed yourself lifetimes ago.  It seems the emergency reanimation "
"procedure has damaged your memory, and now, bearing almost no knowledge of "
"your past life, you must find a way to survive in a ruined and alien world."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Atomic Pitchwoman" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were hired to market Rivtech's products through TV and were on your way "
"to the studio when the bombs hit.  You now enter the end of the world with "
"nothing but the snazzy clothes on your back and a bunch of plutonium-powered "
"toys."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Planar Frontierswoman" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm came, you were getting into your gear, prepared for the "
"first manned entrance through a stabilized portal in the lab - just a quick "
"five-minute scouting trip.  You were the last one left in the room when the "
"portal snapped shut and all hell broke loose.  Now that you know what was on "
"the other end, maybe that was a mercy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Vatgrown Bodyguard" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Grown in some corporate laboratory to provide the perfect bodyguard, with "
"nothing to live for but your client.  The Cataclysm ignored social strata and "
"somehow you outlived your master.  Now no one knows the conditioning words to "
"force your obedience.  While the world burns, you get your first taste of "
"life."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "CBM Engineer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You worked as a technician in a sterile, high-security facility concerned "
"with the fabrication of bionic implants.  The final evacuation order caught "
"you in the middle of your 16 hour extended shift, and you barely managed to "
"escape the building, tools in hand."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Wraitheon Executive" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The exiled scion of an unfavorable seat within the Wraitheon board of "
"directors, wealthy beyond measure even in their estrangement.  Sent to the "
"frontier in a last-ditch effort to salvage their reputation, or more likely, "
"to find a silent and politically convenient death."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Corporate Infiltrator" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A spy and mercenary at the direct service of the Solar Corporations.  Touring "
"the frontier in search of intelligence gathering and sabotage contracts.  "
"Equipped with a set of irreplaceable holographic technology that borders on "
"the miraculous."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Assistant Sub-Executive" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Through a lifetime of hard work, dedication, boot-licking and immense luck, "
"you achieved the almost impossible, and were promoted from an indentured "
"clerk to a minor managerial position.  Although you were still an expendable "
"peon among the ranks of the corporation, you earned numbers most people could "
"only dream of, and you savored it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Uplifted Enforcer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are an uplifted elephant hybrid, a precisely engineered enforcer creature "
"created by combining human, elephant and mastodon DNA.  Unlike most of your "
"war-minded kin, you sought a peaceful retirement after completing your "
"compulsive service period, and even earned the right to be considered a full "
"citizen.  Now, with the end of the world in the horizon, it seems that your "
"combat skills might come useful once again."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rogue Operator" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You worked as a mercenary across six continents for a dozen corps.  A VP at "
"the last corp decided he wanted to put you on retainer and you agreed to a "
"three month gig in return for some additional bionics.  You woke up with an "
"extra bionic, a cranial bomb that needed to be reset every month or so or it "
"blows up.  Now you have days until the bomb goes off.  Maybe you'll find "
"someone who can remove it.  Can you even sleep, for fear of death?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Engineered Deep Sea Explorer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Created with the exploration of the deep sea in mind, Cecaelia are hybridized "
"from cephalopod and fish DNA.  While you were mostly spared from the "
"corporate wars by your scientific proclivities, the polite niceties of the "
"surface are mostly forgotten underwater.  You were on dry land when the "
"Cataclysm occurred and you have no idea if it's safer here or beneath the "
"seas."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Roboticist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Scavenging and reselling abandoned robotics is what you call your \"job.\" It "
"certainly isn't official in any means of the word, but it rakes in the dough "
"and that is all that matters to you, even if it involves dangerous "
"activities, be it cracking old Wraitheon security cyphers or crossing "
"well-worn wires on ancient mining drones."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Academy Technologist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A senior technologist from the Planetary Academy of Khorat, sent to Salus IV "
"to oversee the procurement of valuable technological artifacts.  Although "
"generously equipped, you are neither a fighter nor a good fit for life in the "
"frontier.  You'd feel far more comfortable and capable commanding this "
"salvage operation from the faraway safety of your office."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Salvor" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A scavenger by necessity, born and raised in between ruins and slums.  Some "
"might be lured to your profession by romantic notions of wealth, adventure or "
"scientific discovery.  You know better."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rocket Jumper" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A skilled airborne scout and salvager equipped with a rocket pack, eking out "
"a living on the edge of legality."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Escaping Crew" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You awake in your cabin to the sound of emergency sirens and the ship's "
"computer calmly announcing in a posh English voice 'Abandon the vessel "
"immediately.', and then counting down from five minutes.  You've got just "
"enough time to hit a supply locker before you need to activate the escape pod "
"down the hall."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Whisper" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are a telepath, able to sense minds and influence thoughts.  You aren't "
"entirely sure how you got your powers, but you seem to have an instinctive "
"sense of how to use them.  That's not sinister at all, right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Spark" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are an electrokinetic, able to control electricity with your mind.  You "
"aren't entirely sure how you got your powers, but you seem to have an "
"instinctive sense of how to use them.  That's not sinister at all, right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Geist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are a telekinetic, able to move objects without touching them.  You "
"aren't entirely sure how you got your powers, but you seem to have an "
"instinctive sense of how to use them.  That's not sinister at all, right?"
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes une télékinétique, capable de mouvoir des objets sans les toucher.  "
"Vous n'êtes pas totalement sûre d'où vos pouvoirs proviennent, mais vous êtes "
"capable de les utiliser instinctivement.  Pas du tout suspect?"

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/profession.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Pizza Delivery Girl" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A late night delivery to a lonely building, a cry for help from under the "
"elevator, and a terrible conspiracy.  You are not drunk enough for this."
msgstr ""
"Une livraison nocturne à un immeuble isolé, un appel à l'aide sous "
"l'ascenseur et une terrible conspiration.  Vous n'avez pas assez bu pour ça."

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/profession.json
#. ~ Description of profession "XEDRA Remediator" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The sole survivor of a XEDRA containment team, fighting to keep the horrors "
"of the lab from escaping into the world above."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/profession.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hacktivist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"An activist pursuing a government conspiracy.  In the end you were proven "
"right, but does it even matter now?"
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez une activiste luttant contre une conspiration gouvernementale.  En "
"fin de compte, vous avez eu raison, mais est-ce que cela a de l'importance "
"aujourd'hui?"

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/profession.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Paramedic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "A paramedic, trained to save lives in the field."
msgstr "Une ambulancière, formée pour sauver des vies sur le terrain."

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/profession.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Geas Knight" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A warrior from a destroyed land, bound by ancient oaths sworn in the language "
"of stars and stone."
msgstr ""
"Un guerrier venant d'une terre détruite, lié par d'anciens serments prononcés "
"dans le langage des étoiles et de la pierre."

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/profession.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Vampire" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "An assassin more metal than meat, driven onward by their faulty cybernetics."
msgstr ""
"Une assassine composée de plus de métal que de viande, restant en mouvement "
"malgré ses implants cybernétiques défaillants."

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/profession.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Last Scion" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The last survivor of an elder race, physically frail but in command of "
"powerful sorceries wrested from the Outer Dark."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mutant Para-Amputee" for female
#. ~ Description of profession "Mutant Bilateral Amputee" for female
#. ~ Description of profession "Mutant Quadruple Amputee" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Many of the scientists investigating the immense power of mutation wondered "
"if it could cure limb loss and restore people.  You made the perfect subject "
"with which to test this.  Even though your day to experiment never came, you "
"might have some hope yet of seeing the potential cure to your problems."
msgstr ""
"De nombreux scientifiques enquêtant sur l’immense pouvoir des mutagènes se "
"demandaient si ceux-ci pouvait guérir la perte d’un membre et l'intégrité des "
"personnes.  Vous faisiez le sujet idéal pour tester cela.  Même si le moment "
"d’expérimenter n’est jamais venu, vous avez peut-être encore un espoir de "
"voir le remède potentiel à vos problèmes."

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Para-Amputee" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"By some unfortunate means, you have lost both of your legs.  Since then, you "
"have learned to live with your disability and have adapted around it very "
"well, living a normal life.  Even if society has collapsed, so long as you've "
"got your trusty wheelchair, you'll be alright."
msgstr ""
"Malheureusement, vous avez perdu vos deux jambes.  Depuis, vous avez appris à "
"vivre avec votre handicap et vous vous y êtes très bien adaptée, menant une "
"vie normale.  Même si la société s’est effondrée, tant que vous aurez votre "
"fidèle fauteuil roulant, tout ira bien."

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bilateral Amputee" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"By some unfortunate means, you have lost both of your arms.  Since then, you "
"have learned to live with your disability and have adapted around it very "
"well, living a normal life.  You only need your legs to kick somebody's ass, "
"if it comes down to it."
msgstr ""
"Que ce soit par accident, congénitalement ou dû à des amputations médicales, "
"vous avez malheureusement perdu vos deux bras.  Depuis cela vous avez appris "
"à vivre avec votre handicap et avez réussi à vous y adapter plutôt bien, "
"vivant une vie normale et heureuse.  Vous pensez que vous n'avez besoin que "
"de vos jambes pour rétamer quelqu'un si nécessaire de toute façon."

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Quadruple Amputee" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"By some unfortunate means, you have lost all of your limbs.  Since then, you "
"have learned to live with your disability and have adapted around it very "
"well, living a relatively normal life with a bit of help.  What are you going "
"to do now that all the doctors are dead?"
msgstr ""
"Que ce soit par accident, congénitalement ou dû à des amputations médicales, "
"vous avez malheureusement perdue vos quatre membres.  Depuis cela vous avez "
"appris à vivre avec votre handicap et avez réussie à vous y adapter plutôt "
"bien, vivant une vie relativement normale et heureuse avec un peu d'aide.  "
"Qu'allez-vous faire maintenant que tout les docteurs sont morts?"

#: data/mods/MMA/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Battle Angel" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "A combat-ready cyborg once salvaged from an obscure junkyard…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MMA/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hylian Adventurer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Sucked through a vortex into what appears to be a shadow realm, you will "
"continue to fight for justice."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Spellcraft (Beginner)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You took a few classes about magical theory before the Cataclysm and still "
"remember most of it."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez suivi quelques cours sur la théorie magique avant le Cataclysme et "
"vous rappelez de la majorité."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Spellcraft (Intermediate)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were either a practicing mage or made a formal study of magical theory.  "
"You could have designed spells in your spare time, if you had wanted."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez soit une magicienne possédant une assez bonne base de "
"connaissances ou quelqu'un ayant décidé de s'éduquer sur la magie théorique "
"en tant que vocation académique et auriez probablement pu concevoir de "
"nouveaux sorts dans pendant votre temps libre si vous le vouliez."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Spellcraft (Expert)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You could have taught magical theory to mages, whether you know any spells or "
"not."
msgstr ""
"Vous auriez pu enseigner la magie théorique à des magiciens même si vous ne "
"saviez pas comment lancer un seul sort."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Freshen Up)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Freshen Up, the most common spell in the pre-Cataclysm world.  "
"It saved up a lot of time before work in your old life and you've certainly "
"made a lot of use of it now that there's no more running water."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Crystallize Mana)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Crystallize Mana.  Sure, it ruined your social life and you "
"slept for 12 hours a day, but you made a tidy sum of money producing mana "
"crystals for mages who needed them.  Too bad all that money is useless now."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez l'une des centaines de millions de personnes qui ne connaissaient "
"qu'un seul sort, dans votre cas, Cristalliser Mana.  Ok, cela a ruiné votre "
"vie sociale et vous dormiez 12 heures par jour, mais vous vous êtes fait une "
"belle petite somme en vendant les cristaux de mana aux magiciens en ayant "
"besoin.  Dommage que cet argent ne vous soit plus vraiment utile maintenant."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Magical Light)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Magical Light.  It was mostly a party trick, to be honest, and "
"the weeks learning to cast a spell that any smartphone could replicate showed "
"you how much work trying to learn real magic actually was.  But the nights "
"are dark enough nowadays that you're glad you put in the effort."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Aura of Protection)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Aura of Protection.  To be honest, you originally learned it to "
"try to replace the umbrella you kept leaving at home and were very "
"disappointed when that didn't work.  It's saved you at least once from some "
"strange gas in the air, though, so all that effort paid off."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Sound Bomb)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Sound Bomb.  You mostly used it for jokes, to play pranks on "
"your friends and annoy the neighborhood dogs, but it's proven its worth now "
"at the end of the world."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Knowing the Day and the Hour)" for
#. female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Knowing the Day and the Hour.  Your non-mage friends were "
"always asking you why you bothered learning what was widely considered to be "
"the least useful spell in the world, and sometimes you weren't sure yourself. "
" Even now that the network is done, you're still not entirely sure how "
"important it is to know that it's exactly 6:12 a.m. vs. just \"sunrise\".  "
"But if it ever is important, you'll know it."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez l'une des centaines de millions de personnes qui ne connaissaient "
"qu'un seul sort, dans votre cas, Connaître le Jour et l'Heure. Vos amis et "
"connaissances ne connaissant rien à la magie demandaient constamment pourquoi "
"vous aviez pris la peine d'apprendre le sort le plus universellement "
"considéré le plus inutile au monde, et la plupart du temps vous n'aviez pas "
"vraiment de bonne réponse à cela. Même maintenant que les piles sont rares et "
"l'internet est mort, vous n'êtes toujours vraiment pas très sûre à quel point "
"il est important de savoir qu'il est exactement 6:12 et pas juste que c'est "
"l'aube. Mais si cela devient important pour une raison quelconque, vous "
"saurez exactement."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Peaceful Rest)" for female
#, c-format
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Peaceful Rest.  Ever since you were a child, you dreaded "
"bedtime.  Falling asleep was an ordeal, a battle between you and the bed, and "
"it seemed like no matter how many sheep you counted, sleep hygiene habits you "
"practiced, or exhausted you felt, it was an hour or more until you finally "
"fell into sleep.  You became a mage because you were tired of having 5% of "
"your life stuck staring at the ceiling while waiting for sleep to come, and "
"ever since the world ended, you're even more grateful you can fall asleep "
"whenever you need to."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Ignus Fatuus)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Ignus Fatuus.  It was mostly just for your amusement, summoning "
"the will-o'-the-wisps at sundown and watching them dance, but they've proven "
"handy more than once lately by leading some monster astray while you ran for "
"your life."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Summon Watcher Spirit)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Summon Watcher Spirit.  You initially learned it to keep an eye "
"on your cat while you were doing chores around the house, but it ended up "
"being even more valuable than you thought once the world ended."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Witchsight)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Witchsight.  People asked you why you would bother learning a "
"spell that only let you know if other people were mages, but every bit of "
"information helped.  A gun you can see, an expensive suit, the size and "
"strength of a person or the way they carry themselves, but a mage's talent is "
"all hidden until they a cast spell.  Unless, of course, you knew how to look, "
"and you did."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Knit the Rent Flesh)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Knit the Rent Flesh.  Certainly no one ever asked your reasons "
"for studying biomancy, especially after you saw that guy get hit by a truck "
"running a red light and managed to stop him from bleeding out before the "
"paramedics arrived.  It was disturbing to watch, but it was undoubtedly "
"effective.  As long as you're light on your feet, you won't have to worry "
"about dying of your injuries now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Carrion Feast)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Carrion Feast.  You had your reasons for studying it, "
"certainly, and perhaps it is best not to speculate about them now."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez l'une des centaines de millions de personnes qui ne connaissaient "
"qu'un seul sort. Dans votre cas, cela était Festin Nécrophage. Vous aviez vos "
"raisons de l'étudier, probablement, et peut être que nous ne devrions pas "
"nous attarder trop sur la nature de ces raisons."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Water's Cooling Touch)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Water's Cooling Touch.  You always hated summer, the "
"stickiness, the heat, the sunburns, and your dislike of the weather drove you "
"to study druidic magic to overcome it.  With your water bottle handy, you'll "
"never have to worry about being too hot in the sun again."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Traverse the Wilds)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Traverse the Wilds.  Part of the joy of hiking is taking your "
"time, of being away from the tyranny of clocks and schedules and deadlines.  "
"But sometimes, it was nice to just see the miles fly by, to reach the summit "
"before sunrise and take in the view without getting up at 2 a.m., to finish "
"the entire trail and still have time to sit down and eat a leisurely dinner.  "
"And it's not like you teleported, after all.  Regardless of the magic, you "
"still had to walk every single step."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Goodberry)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"Biohacking was your passion, trying to optimize your life through diet, "
"exercise, and sleep tricks, and you turned to druidic magic to cut out wasted "
"time.  When the Pomodoro timer went off, you scurried to the fridge, grabbed "
"a handful of berries and enchanted them, scarfed them down, and then got back "
"to work.  You never had to deal with meal replacement nonsense, you just ate "
"your berries and got things done.  Your clients are dead now and everything "
"you worked on is ash and dust, but eating those berries has proven to be the "
"best habit you picked up."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Utility Molding)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Utility Molding.  You read a pamphlet once entitled, \"One "
"Spell is All You Need!\" and thought it seemed like a good idea.  And true, "
"maybe you've never needed a mining pick before, but the ability to all up a "
"knife or a shovel or a hammer whenever you want has come in handy countless "
"times."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Tremorsense)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Tremorsense.  It kept you safe, letting you know if someone was "
"nearby even if you were absorbed in a task or listening to music, but now "
"that most of the people you meet want to eat you it's proven invaluable."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (The Turning of the Earth)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, the Turning of the Earth.  Gardening was your passion and you "
"got sick of manually digging rows in early spring or mid-summer weather.  "
"After your studies you could just cast the spell and the earth neatly parted, "
"waiting for seeds to be planted.  Once the canned food runs out, you're sure "
"you'll get even more use of your powers."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Finger Firelighter)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Finger Firelighter.  You had a lot of great conversations with "
"people, late at night outside clubs and restaurants, when they'd ask for a "
"light and you'd just snap your fingers.  Lately, though, you've used it to "
"cook food more than light cigarettes and haven't had anyone to talk to, but "
"at least the fires at night are warm."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Flames of Passion)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Flames of Passion.  Alcohol is a social lubricant, and if you "
"already had a drink in your hand, why not use it to let you loosen up and "
"make it easier to talk to people?  You were out at parties almost every "
"weekend and had a wide circle of friends.  Hopefully at least a few of them "
"made it through all of this."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Slowfall)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Slowfall.  Some people become mages due to a dream, or a goal "
"they want to pursue, but for you it was the memory of falling down the stairs "
"as a child and breaking your leg.  With your magic you could jump off a roof "
"and it was no more dangerous than jumping off a low stone wall, and that's "
"been pretty useful for some of the situations you've found yourself in since "
"the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Faerie Fire)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Faerie Fire.  Maybe it wasn't a great use of your time, but it "
"was fun at parties and one time when your cat ran off it made it very easy to "
"find her.  Since the Cataclysm, though, your magical powers have become much "
"more useful."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Sorcerer's Hand)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Sorcerer's Hand.  Alright, fine, you admit it, you learned "
"magic because of laziness.  It seems odd to say, with all the hours after "
"work and late at night, studying until you could make your keys twitch and "
"fall off the table and eventually until you can grab a drink from across the "
"room, but it's true.  You could reach nearly everything without having to get "
"up.  Anyway, you're way more active now, and being able to grab things from "
"across the room has come in handy more than once since the end of the world."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Spider Climb)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Spider Climb.  A lot of people in the rockclimbing community "
"said you were cheating, and, to be honest, they were right.  But every time "
"you saw one of those spectacular views from the summit, well, those "
"complaints didn't mean that much."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Windrunning)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Windrunning.  It's embarrassing to admit, but you became a mage "
"because you were always running late.  Just one spell made it much easier to "
"catch that bus, to beat that red light across the crosswalk, to make it to "
"work on time instead of a few minutes late.  Nowadays you have a lot more "
"practice at running and that speed still comes in handy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Fire Spark)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Fire Spark.  Most people when they wanted to light a fire "
"thought of kelvinists, but electricity always fascinated you.  You used to "
"love watching the storms roll in, sitting on your porch as the lightning "
"played across the sky, and while summoning lightning bolts wouldn't have been "
"useful for anything at all, catching fires with a spark has come in handy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Air Bubble)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Air Bubble.  It was originally because of your diving trips.  "
"You were sick of having the goggles and the respirator between you and the "
"sea, and if one simple spell would make it so you didn't have to worry about "
"that again, you were willing to put in the time to learn it.  When you had to "
"swim across that river to escape the horde a while ago, it definitely proved "
"its worth."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Lamp)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Lamp.  Sure, phones had lights, but they weren't nearly as "
"bright as a magical one was, and it was pretty nice to just recite the words "
"and light up an entire room like a high-powered flashlight.  Now that the "
"power's out, it's even more useful."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Knock)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Knock.  You originally learned it because you always forgot "
"your keys and after the third time you were locked out of your apartment, to "
"turned to magic to solve the problem.  Of course, once you did have to use "
"magic to get back in you realized that anyone else could have done the same "
"thing, so in the end it just ruined your peace of mind.  At least now you can "
"be sure there's no one home at the places you're entering."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Elf (Species)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are one of the Firstborn, called \"alfar\" or \"sidhe\" or, more "
"recently, \"elves\" by the humans.  Your people had integrated into human "
"society before the Cataclysm, doing jobs involving animals and nature since "
"modern industry was never to your liking.  Had technological development "
"continued, you might have been forced to make some unpleasant compromises, "
"but not as unpleasant as you have during the end of the world."
msgstr ""
"Vous faites partie des Premiers-nés, vous vous appelez les \"alfar\", ou "
"\"sidhe\", ou plus récemment, \"elfes\" par les humains. Votre peuple avait "
"intégré la société humaine avant le Cataclysme, privilégiant les professions "
"vous gardant en contact avec les animaux et la nature, l'industrie moderne "
"n'ayant jamais été à votre goût. Si la marche du progrès avait continué, vous "
"auriez probablement été forcés à faire des compromis moins plaisants que "
"ceux-ci, mais pas aussi déplaisants que ceux que la fin du monde vous force "
"maintenant à endurer."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dwarf (Species)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are a Child of the Stone, called \"dwarf\" by the humans.  The legends "
"tell that long ago, your people were born of stone and mined your way up to "
"the surface world and its light, where you found the other sapient species of "
"Earth.  While the scale of the human world was always a bit of a problem, you "
"fit in well due to your people's long tradition of craftsdwarfship and hard "
"work.  Now that society has collapsed, maybe you can turn that same drive to "
"rebuilding it."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes une Enfant de la Pierre, appelé \"naine\" par les humains. Les "
"légendes racontes que dans le passé lointain, votre peuple est né de la "
"pierre et a miné son chemin jusqu'au monde de la surface et sa lumière, où "
"vous avez rencontré les autres espèces intelligentes du monde. Le monde "
"humain a toujours été un peu trop grand pour vous, mais vous vous êtes "
"creusés une bonne niche avec votre longue tradition d'artisanat et de travail "
"honnête. Maintenant que cette société s'est écroulée, peut être pouvez vous "
"tourner cet amour du travail vers sa reconstruction."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Goblin (Species)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are a goblin.  Before the Cataclysm your people were always a little out "
"of place: the houses weren't designed for you, the shops weren't open when "
"you were awake, and your appearance sometimes gave human or elven children "
"nightmares that you were going to steal them or reminded dwarves of the "
"ancient wars your peoples fought.  As it turned out, you weren't what any of "
"them should have been worrying about."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lizardfolk (Species)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are one of the Scaled Ones, called \"lizardfolk\" by the warmbloods.  For "
"generations, your tribe served a dragon as its eyes and ears in the outside "
"world, until civilization encroached far enough that even all the dragon's "
"might could not hold it back.  You were sent out to integrate into the modern "
"world, but you were only there a few years before human science ended their "
"world.  Now, you have to survive in the mess they've created."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ravenfolk (Species)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are one of the Kor'uru, called \"ravenfolk\" by those who can't make the "
"appropriate clacking sound due to their lack of beak.  While your people "
"could not fly without the aid of magic, you were always drawn to explore the "
"world, and had traveled to nearly every country and continent even before "
"modern society made such travel easy.  You were well-integrated into society "
"at all levels…and that made you just as vulnerable as everyone else when it "
"fell."
msgstr ""
"Vous faites partie du peuple Kor'uru, appelés \"corvides\" par ceux ne "
"pouvant pas pronouncer les syllables correctement sans un bec.  Bien que vos "
"congénères n'étaient pas capable de voler sans l'utilisation de magie, "
"ceux-ci furent très tôt poussé à explorer le monde et visitèrent presque "
"toute contrées et continents avant que le monde moderne rende ces périples "
"aisés.  Vous étiez bien intégrés dans tout les niveaux de la société… et ceci "
"vous à rendu tout aussi vulnérable que la plupart lorsque tout s'est écroulé."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Would-be Wizard" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You found a pamphlet with bright colors claiming you can be a Wizard, oddly "
"serene with the world falling down around you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Pyromaniac Kelvinist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have loved fire all of your life.  You have now discovered your inner "
"fire, and want to exercise that upon the world."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Druid" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "The ancient circle of druids is gone with the Cataclysm.  Nature must thrive."
msgstr ""
"Votre ancien cercle de druides n'a pas survécu au Cataclysme, et faire "
"prospérer la nature à travers ces jours sombres est maintenant votre "
"responsabilité."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Novice Necromancer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You always had to hide your magic, as it was generally not an acceptable type "
"of magic in the wizarding world, but with the Cataclysm you need to pull "
"every trick out of the book."
msgstr ""
"Tu as toujours dû cacher ta magie, car elle n'était généralement pas acceptée "
"dans le monde des sorciers, mais avec le Cataclysme, tu dois utiliser toutes "
"les astuces possibles."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Novice Stormshaper" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The son of a weatherman, you were always interested in the weather.  Recently "
"you found it was possible to manipulate the weather yourself through arcane "
"means!  Unfortunately you did not have long to enjoy your power, as events "
"unfolded…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Novice Earthshaper" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were always tough in a fight.  Your coach managed to teach you a trick or "
"two to make you a little tougher."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez toujours une dure à cuire, mais votre coach à eu le temps de vous "
"refiler quelques astuces pour vous rendre encore plus solide."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Novice Technomancer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"With the recent Cataclysm, the way you found to cheat on tests may have to "
"find some other use."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Introspectionist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You segregated yourself from society because you wanted to concentrate on "
"improving yourself.  It was you and your best friend, but now the apocalypse "
"won't leave you alone."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Vengeful Preacher" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You lost your faith when your spouse died of illness.  You've been drinking "
"yourself to death ever since.  God is punishing everyone with this "
"apocalypse, you are going to show them your brand of mercy."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez perdu la foi lorsque votre conjoint est mort de maladie. Depuis, "
"vous buvez jusqu'à la mort. Dieu punit tout le monde avec cette apocalypse, "
"vous allez leur montrer votre marque de miséricorde."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Techno-Prepper" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've long suspected the world might suddenly turn over.  With your "
"training, spells, and revolver, your chances are far better than most."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Freezing Dancer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are a highly sought exotic magic dancer.  You can heat the room "
"temperature with your moves and your body, but whenever it lights too much "
"you freeze it with your magic, granting you great control over your public.  "
"They can see, but never touch."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dimensionalist Mage" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are an expert in dimensionalism, with its most common example being "
"teleportation magic, that is the reason why you could survive while your "
"colleagues could not.  Your only hope is that your highly specialized skills "
"will continue keeping you alive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Shadow Burglar" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Helped by all kind of magical tools and your great talents, you were planning "
"your next great break in.  The world ended before you had time to escape with "
"all of your ill-gained plunder, but at least now nobody can stop you now from "
"breaking whatever locks you desire."
msgstr ""
"Aidée par une variété d'outils magiques et vos talents considérables, vous "
"étiez en train de planifier votre prochaine grande casse. Le monde a pris fin "
"avant que vous puissiez disparaitre avec votre butin, mais au moins "
"maintenant personne ne peut vous empêcher de forcer les verrous que vous "
"voulez."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Magic Drunkard" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were lucky enough to find a weird flask that refills itself with whiskey! "
" You now spend your days just waiting for every refill and keeping it from "
"the hands of any envious neighbor of yours."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Magic Miner" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were the most prepared of them all.  The miner that never lacked tools "
"and could control the ground itself.  Sadly, you are not sure those abilities "
"will save you in what is to come."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez la plus préparée. La mineuse qui ne manquait jamais d'outils et "
"pouvait contrôler le sol lui-même. Malheureusement, vous n'êtes pas sûre que "
"ces talents vont vous sauver de ce qui est à venir."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Magic Maid" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are a descendant of a long line of housekeepers for magical families.  "
"Trained in several spells to facilitate your job you were easily hired to "
"take care of your current job, sadly, it looks like this could be your last."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Wild Druid" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"For a long time you lived in the wild, free of interference from whatever "
"inhabited outside the woods, now that the woods are collapsing you finally "
"return to civilization."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Archer Druid" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a skillful and committed archer druid, making constant excursions to "
"the forests in which you dedicated yourself to living off of and with what "
"nature had to offer you.  You were returning from your last travel when "
"civilization fell upon itself."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Grim Reaper" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've loved death since you can remember, always attracted to that cold and "
"fair skeletal hand, but love is often unrequited, you have not been allowed a "
"meeting yet.  One night, you had a dream, since you are not allowed to meet "
"death, why not bring that joy to everyone else instead?  After much training "
"and hardship you have now become the Grim Reaper itself."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Pseudovamp" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've long had an obsession with horror novels, and used your wealth to "
"augment yourself with spells and bionics into a denizen of the night.  Your "
"neglect to your health in your pursuit has left you pale and unlively."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Academy Wizard" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A year of enrollment in a wizard's academy has taught you patience, wisdom, "
"and a handful of useful spells.  With the teachers converted into the undead "
"and classes canceled, the final lesson has begun."
msgstr ""
"Une année d'études dans une académie magique vous a enseigné la patience, la "
"discipline et une poignée de sorts utiles.  Avec vos enseignants zombifiés et "
"vos cours annulés, votre dernière leçon débute."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Corrosive Rocker" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your metal career soared to new heights when you swapped special effects for "
"acrid gore and spiked whips.  It seems the Cataclysm is now your final tour."
msgstr ""
"Votre carrière dans la scène du métal a atteint un paroxysme lorsque vous "
"avez abandonné les effets spéciaux pour de vraies entrailles acides et des "
"fouets hérissés de fragments d'os.  On dirait que le Cataclysme va être votre "
"dernier tour."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Shock Officer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were enrolled in an experimental law enforcement program designed to "
"decrease suspect casualties and equipment costs by substituting tasers and "
"bullets for less-lethal Stormshaping."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Earthquake Brawler" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've made a name for yourself in underground magic boxing rings as an "
"unstoppable punching machine.  Now that all your opponents are undead, "
"there's no need to hold back."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Illicit Fleshmender" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After failing out of medical school, you took their mundane methods and "
"combined it with magic to save your patients.  Now that they all want to kill "
"you, the lack of a license is the least of your worries."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Wildborne Rider" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Abandoned at a young age and raised by moose, you had to master the wilds to "
"survive.  While the modern world has been devoured, you and your steed are no "
"stranger to hardship."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Deep-Cold Marksman" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a special operative conducting covert sniper ops in sub-zero "
"temperatures, and had just finished your tour when society was destroyed.  "
"Having retained your gear, it's time to join the new war."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arsonist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Penned in a cell without fuel, you've been extinguished for years for setting "
"buildings on fire.  In your escape, you grabbed your familiar tool to "
"reignite the embers."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ecoterrorist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"These bastards were destroying Earth far before the undead came, and mauling "
"those execs was worth the federal charges.  Now, you may have greater "
"priorities than pollution."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Frost Cream Woman" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You learned Kelvinist spells to keep equipment costs down on your ice cream "
"truck.  While their tastes have changed, the kids still scream for you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Knife Thrower" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You entertained the masses, displaying an expert hand tossing knives conjured "
"from nowhere.  Now, you're bringing the show to them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hy-Brasilean ambassadorial honor guard" for
#. female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a ceremonial guard for the Hy-Brasilean ambassador to the United "
"States, equipped to bring to mind the elven forest warriors of old.  You were "
"trained in archery, since you had to use your bow to impress foreign "
"dignitaries, but you never expected you'd actually have to take it into a "
"real battle.  Then the Cataclysm hit.  The ambassador and most of your fellow "
"guards are dead, and you'll probably never see home again, but hopefully your "
"skills will keep you alive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Shifter Druid" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The ancient druidic art of taking animal forms had mostly fallen out of favor "
"by the modern era, since most people didn't need to be a bear in their daily "
"lives and even if they did transform into a raven, they still had to "
"physically fly to their destination and couldn't check the internet for "
"directions.  You, however, studied the ancient arts and gained the ability to "
"transform yourself.  It's come in very handy since the world ended."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Chess Enthusiast" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You never made master, but you did very well in chess competitions before the "
"Cataclysm.  All those hours of staring at the board, trying to keep all the "
"pieces in your mind at once, have left you with a great ability to focus your "
"attention on a single problem when you need to."
msgstr ""
"Vous n'avez jamais décroché un titre de maître, mais vous vous êtes très bien "
"débrouillé durant plusieurs compétitions d'échecs avant le Cataclysme. Toutes "
"ces heures passées à fixer le jeu, essayant de suivre toutes les pièces vous "
"pensez vous permettent maintenant d'aisèment vous concentrer intensément sur "
"une seule chose si cela est nécessaire."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Chess Master" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, many of your weekends were spent either competing in "
"tournaments or studying records of past games, always trying to find the "
"patterns.  All that time has also made you a master of concentrating on a "
"specific subject, despite whatever is going on around you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Chess Grandmaster" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the best of the best, awarded a grandmaster title in your "
"early twenties.  Chess was your passion and your life, and you were good "
"enough at it to make a living competing before the Cataclysm.  You have an "
"almost-inhuman ability to focus on a task and ignore all distractions."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Biokinetic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You feel in better "
"shape than you ever have in your life, like you could run ten miles and climb "
"a mountain and then wake up and do it again.  You'll probably need it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Biokinetic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can breathe "
"underwater and twist yourself enough to squeeze through a half-closed window. "
" You can run five meters in less than a second and shrug off a punch like "
"it's nothing.  You'd almost be worried you were becoming one of those "
"rioters, except you're definitely still sane.  Right?"
msgstr ""
"Quelque chose s'est produit durant les tempêtes qui se sont déchainées durant "
"le Cataclysme, et vous pouvez maintenant faire des choses que vous auriez "
"crue impossibles auparavant.  Vous respirez sous l'eau et êtes capable de "
"vous contorsionner pour passer à travers une fenêtre à peine ouverte.  Vous "
"pouvez aussi courir cinq mètres en moins d'une seconde et encaisser des coups "
"dévastateurs comme si rien n'était.  Vous aviez un peu peur que ce qui était "
"en train de vous arriver était aussi arrivé aux émeutiers, mais vous êtes… "
"plutôt sûre que ce n'est pas le cas?"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Biokinetic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can move "
"inhumanly fast, hitting zombies before they even seem to know that you're "
"there.  You can pull out nails with your bare hands and go out in winter "
"without even a shirt and not feel the cold.  You're a new breed, Homo "
"Cataclysmicus, and if anyone is equipped to survive in this new world, it's "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Quelque chose s'est produit durant les tempêtes qui se sont déchainées durant "
"le Cataclysme, et vous pouvez maintenant faire des choses que vous auriez cru "
"impossibles auparavant.  Vous vous déplacez inhumainement rapidement lorsque "
"vous le voulez, et frappez des zombies avant même que ceux-ci savent que vous "
"êtes là.  Vous pouvez retirer des clous avec vos mains nues et vous promener "
"en plein hiver sans même un t-shirt sans inconfort.  Vous faites partie d'une "
"nouvelle race humaine, Homo Cataclysmicus, et probablement la plus équipée "
"pour survivre dans ce nouveau monde."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Clairsentient" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can read much "
"faster and can see much better in the dark, and even in total darkness you no "
"longer have any hesitation about moving.  At least once you avoided zombies "
"on the other side of a wall that you didn't hear and couldn't see, but you, "
"you just knew they were there."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Clairsentient" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can see auras "
"around people that tell you what they're feeling, and you've already used it "
"to avoid someone who was feigning being injured with the hope of stealing "
"your gear.  You can see through walls, and tell where the best place to hit "
"something is to take it down for good.  That last ability will definitely get "
"plenty of use."
msgstr ""
"Il s'est passé quelque chose pendant les tempêtes qui ont fait rage lors du "
"cataclysme, et maintenant vous pouvez faire des choses qui vous auraient "
"semblé impossibles auparavant. Vous pouvez voir les auras autour des gens et "
"savoir ce qu'ils ressentent, et vous vous en êtes déjà servi pour éviter "
"quelqu'un qui feignait d'être blessé dans l'espoir de vous voler votre "
"équipement. Vous pouvez voir à travers les murs et savoir quel est le "
"meilleur endroit pour frapper quelque chose afin de l'abattre pour de bon. "
"Cette dernière capacité sera certainement très utilisée."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Clairsentient" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can finish "
"books in a few hours and remember almost everything you read, you had to fix "
"a bicycle a few weeks ago and even though you've never tried to do that "
"before in your life, everything you needed to do just…came to you.  What's "
"more, last time the Zs attacked you, you never got a scratch.  Three of them "
"came at you at once and you dodged every attack because you could see what "
"they were going to do before they did it.  If only you could see where you "
"needed to go to be safe."
msgstr ""
"Il s'est passé quelque chose pendant les tempêtes qui ont fait rage lors du "
"cataclysme, et maintenant vous pouvez faire des choses qui vous auraient "
"semblé impossibles auparavant. Vous pouvez terminer des livres en quelques "
"heures et vous souvenir de presque tout ce que vous avez lu. Il y a quelques "
"semaines, vous avez dû réparer un vélo et, bien que vous n'ayez jamais essayé "
"de le faire de votre vie, tout ce que vous deviez faire est venu à vous. De "
"plus, la dernière fois que les Z vous ont attaqué, vous n'avez pas eu une "
"seule égratignure. Trois d'entre eux se sont jetés sur vous en même temps et "
"vous avez esquivé chaque attaque parce que vous pouviez voir ce qu'ils "
"allaient faire avant qu'ils ne le fassent. Si seulement vous pouviez voir où "
"vous devez aller pour être en sécurité."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Electrokinetic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  While running down "
"an alleyway to escape a group of rioters, you looked back and realized you "
"were going to get caught and then there was a deafening crash of thunder and "
"your vision went white.  When your hearing and sight came back, the rioters "
"were lying in a heap, some still with smoldering clothes, and you were "
"unscathed."
msgstr ""
"Il s'est passé quelque chose pendant les tempêtes qui ont fait rage lors du "
"cataclysme, et maintenant vous pouvez faire des choses qui vous auraient "
"semblé impossibles auparavant. Alors que vous couriez dans une ruelle pour "
"échapper à un groupe d'émeutiers, vous vous êtes retourné et avez réalisé que "
"vous alliez vous faire prendre, puis il y a eu un coup de tonnerre "
"assourdissant et votre vision est devenue blanche. Lorsque vous avez retrouvé "
"l'ouïe et la vue, les émeutiers gisaient en tas, certains portant encore des "
"vêtements fumants, et vous étiez indemne."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Electrokinetic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You an hurl "
"lightning bolts from your hands, like some kind of superhero, and your "
"smartphone still has a full charge even though you haven't plugged it in "
"weeks.  Some kind of huge wasp attacked you in the woods and there was a "
"crackle like thunder and it fell to the ground twitching.  You didn't stop to "
"check if it would move again."
msgstr ""
"Il s'est passé quelque chose pendant les tempêtes qui ont fait rage lors du "
"cataclysme, et maintenant vous pouvez faire des choses qui vous auraient "
"semblé impossibles auparavant. Vous pouvez lancer des éclairs à partir de vos "
"mains, comme une sorte de super-héros, et votre smartphone est toujours "
"chargé, même si vous ne l'avez pas branché depuis des semaines. Une sorte "
"d'énorme guêpe vous a attaqué dans les bois, il y a eu un crépitement comme "
"le tonnerre et elle est tombée par terre en se tortillant. Vous ne vous êtes "
"pas arrêtée pour vérifier si elle bougerait à nouveau."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Electrokinetic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You managed to "
"drive the entire week the sky broke on a single charge in your car, and while "
"you had to abandon it since then it got you out of the worst of the cities.  "
"Anything that attacks you has to face your lightning and you haven't found "
"anything yet that can withstand it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Photokinetic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You noticed that "
"light seemed to bend at the will of your thoughts, when you were almost "
"caught by a wandering horde, light slowly dimmed enough for you to hide in "
"the shadows.  You have a sense that there's more to your newfound talents."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Photokinetic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can make the "
"air glow and fire lasers from your hands, and even sometimes hear radio "
"signals.  You haven't heard any other survivors out there yet, but you listen "
"for a bit every night, just in case."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Photokinetic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  Many times a horde "
"has passed within sight of you and simply never noticed you, and the few "
"times they did, you just created illusions of yourself and all ran different "
"directions.  The few stragglers were easy to sear to ash with focused light."
msgstr ""
"Quelque chose s'est produit pendant les tempêtes qui ont fait rage pendant le "
"cataclysme, et vous pouvez désormais faire des choses qui auraient semblé "
"impossibles autrefois. Plusieurs fois, une horde est passée à votre portée et "
"ne vous a tout simplement pas remarqué, et les rares fois où ce fut le cast, "
"vous avez simplement créé des illusions de vous-même et tous ont couru dans "
"des directions différentes. Les quelques retardataires étaient faciles à "
"réduire en cendres avec une lumière focalisée."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Pyrokinetic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  With just a "
"thought, you can start a fire or make light radiate from the very air.  It's "
"already saved your life once when you burned a zombie to ash while scavenging "
"in a ruined house.  Sure, the house burned down too, but you'll definitely "
"get more control as time goes on, right?"
msgstr ""
"Quelque chose vous est arrivée lorsque les tempêtes ont fait rage durant le "
"Cataclysme et maintenant vous êtes capable d'accomplir des choses qui aurait "
"été auparavant impossibles.  Rien qu'une pensée vous permets de manifester "
"des flammes ou faire rayonner de la lumière à partir de rien.  Ceci vous a "
"déjà sauvé la vie lorsque vous avez réduit un zombie s'étant dressé sur votre "
"chemin dans une maison ruinée en une pile de cendres fumantes.  Vous avez "
"peut être aussi mis le feu au bâtiment en même temps, mais vous allez "
"probablement apprendre à vous contrôler un peu plus, non?"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Pyrokinetic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You don't even "
"know how many zombies you've burned at this point, and keeping warm in winter "
"certainly won't be a problem."
msgstr ""
"Quelque chose s'est produit pendant les tempêtes qui ont fait rage pendant le "
"cataclysme, et vous pouvez désormais faire des choses qui auraient semblé "
"impossibles auparavant. Vous ne sauriez pas dire combien de zombies vous avez "
"brûlés à ce stade, et pour rester au chaud en hiver, ce ne sera clairement "
"pas un problème."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Pyrokinetic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You are one with "
"the flames, and they come at your command and obey your every instruction.  "
"Zombies, mutants, aliens, stranger things--no matter what is out there, you "
"will incinerate it and survive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Telekinetic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can lift "
"things with your mind.  Mostly just small things, but during the chaos a "
"group of rioters jumped you and you hurled them off of you just by thinking "
"about it.  This will definitely come in handy."
msgstr ""
"Quelque chose vous est arrivé lorsque les tempêtes ont fait rage durant le "
"Cataclysme, et maintenant vous êtes capable d'accomplir des choses qui aurait "
"été auparavant impossibles. Vous êtes capable de soulever des choses avec "
"votre esprit. Juste de petites choses normalement, mais durant le chaos un "
"group d'émeutiers se sont abattus sur vous et rien qu'une pensée vous a "
"permit de les projeter à plusieurs mètres et de les assommer immédiatement en "
"heurtant un mur avec une force impressionnante. Ceci vous sera probablement "
"très utile."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Telekinetic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  Moving things at a "
"distance is child's play.  You can pick up zombies and fling them away from "
"you, shatter doors with a thought, and jump from the fifth story and land "
"with barely a bruise.  Nothing is going to get close to you now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Telekinetic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  One ton cars lift "
"off the ground with merely a thought, bullets bounce off the air before they "
"hit you, and you can smash whole groups of zombies to paste in seconds.  You "
"can even fly from rooftop to rooftop, preventing gravity from affecting you "
"by sheer force of will."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Telepath" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  The crazies were "
"bad enough during the riots, but once you were stopped by a police officer "
"whose bloodshot eyes told you that he wasn't going to let you off with a "
"warning.  But you could somehow hear his thoughts, a chaotic jumble of rage "
"and hunger and fear, you just…nudged them a little bit, and he wandered off "
"and left you alone.  It doesn't work the same way with the zombies, but you "
"can't have everything."
msgstr ""
"Quelque chose vous est arrivé lorsque les tempêtes ont fait rage durant le "
"Cataclysme, et maintenant vous êtes capable d'accomplir des choses qui aurait "
"été auparavant impossibles. Les cinglés étaient horribles durant les émeutes, "
"mais vous avez à un moment été interpellée par un policier aux yeux injectés "
"de sang vous disant qu'il n'allait pas vous laisser vous en aller sans une "
"réprimande. Mais vous étiez d'une manière ou d'une autre capable d'entendre "
"ses pensées, un fouillis chaotique de rage, famine et peur, et vous n'avez "
"rien fait d'autre que de... pousser deux out trois boutons qui l'ont amené à "
"juste s'en aller et vous laisser tranquille. Vous n'arrivez pas à faire la "
"même chose avec les zombies, mais vous ne pouvez probablement pas tout avoir."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Telepath" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  Sure, the zombies "
"are immune to telepathy, but those rioters aren't and neither are some of the "
"monsters you've run into.  At least once, you managed to warn off another "
"survivor who you knew meant to rob you.  You left him unconscious and without "
"his weapons, and if the zombies got him, well, he shouldn't have messed with "
"you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Telepath" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  Controlling human "
"minds is still too hard but at this point, animal minds are child's play.  A "
"while back, some kind of mutated wolf or dog or something jumped you in the "
"forest and after a few seconds, it was wagging its tail and jumping around "
"like a new puppy.  You wish you still had it with you, but it died fighting "
"off some kind of pink crustacean…thing, giving you time to run.  The bravest "
"dog you ever had."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Teleporter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You were fleeing "
"down a side street when you heard a crash above you.  You looked up and saw "
"something hurtling through the air down toward you, you closed your eyes and "
"wished you were anywhere but where you were, and then… you were.  Indoors, in "
"a house near the street, and you went out the back door and made good your "
"escape.  You're very, very good at escaping now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Teleporter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can step "
"through walls, and once you were surrounded by a horde and looked up and a "
"nearby rooftop and… there you were, safe and out of the zombies' line of "
"sight.  The rule of the zombie apocalypse is \"keep moving\", and you're the "
"best you've ever been at that."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Teleporter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  No wall or door is "
"a barrier to you and sometimes when you close your eyes you can travel to "
"places you've already been.  Once you were surprised by a bandit and when he "
"leveled his gun at you, you wished he was somewhere else and he "
"just…disappeared.  Nothing can keep you down now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Gateway Initiate" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  But teleporting "
"through walls isn't the most impressive part.  You spent a few days in an "
"abandoned basement and on a scavenging trip, one of those rioters surprised "
"you.  Snarling, she had you by the arm and was prepared to smash in your head "
"with a pipe and then you were just…back safe in that basement.  That will "
"definitely come in handy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Vitakinetic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You broke your leg "
"when you got caught in a riot, and when things got really bad you were "
"positive you were going to die.  But somehow, after only a few days your leg "
"didn't seem to hurt nearly as much anymore.  By the end of the week you could "
"walk on it, and by now it's like nothing ever happened.  It's not going to "
"help you fight the zombies but it'll sure help you recover afterward."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Vitakinetic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  Just last week you "
"were looking in an abandoned building and fell through a weak floor.  But you "
"barely bled, and after a few minutes lying there you picked yourself up and "
"managed to run away from the things that came to investigate the noise.  You "
"didn't have enough water to properly clean your wounds but it hasn't seemed "
"to have mattered.  You're already back to normal."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Vitakinetic" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You've suffered "
"injuries that should have killed you multiple times over by now and recovered "
"in days every time.  You've broken your leg twice, your arm once, drank bad "
"water that had you puking your guts out, nearly been disemboweled by some "
"mutated thing…every single time, your powers kept you going.  Hopefully "
"they'll see you through to the very end of all this."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Flexibility)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you were always surprisingly flexible, and that ability "
"has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  While you are not a fully "
"awakened psion, you have a single trick you can use.  Hopefully it helps you "
"survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, vous étiez toujours étonnamment souple, et votre don "
"s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  Bien que vous ne soyez pas une "
"psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez un atout dans votre poche que "
"vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous aidera à survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Adrenaline Trigger)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you always had a hidden reserve of power when you needed "
"it, and that ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  "
"While you are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can "
"use.  Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, vous aviez l'air de toujours avoir un second souffle "
"durant les heures de gym ou les bagarres, et votre don s'est amplifié avec la "
"fin du monde.  Bien que vous ne soyez pas une psionique totalement éveillée, "
"vous possédez un atout dans votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons "
"que ceci vous aidera à survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Heightened Senses)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you were more perceptive than nearly anyone you knew, "
"and that ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  While "
"you are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can use.  "
"Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, vous étiez plus au courant de ce qui se passait dans les "
"environs que la plupart, et votre don s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  "
"Bien que vous ne soyez pas une psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez "
"un atout dans votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous "
"aidera à survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Premonition)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you had a sixth sense for danger, and that ability has "
"been greatly heightened after the world ended.  While you are not a fully "
"awakened psion, you have a single trick you can use.  Hopefully it helps you "
"survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, vous aviez un sixième sens pour le danger, et votre don "
"s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  Bien que vous ne soyez pas une "
"psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez un atout dans votre poche que "
"vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous aidera à survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Astral Projection)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you sometimes felt like already new unfamiliar places, "
"like you had been there before in a dream, and that ability has been greatly "
"heightened after the world ended.  While you are not a fully awakened psion, "
"you have a single trick you can use.  Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Spark Sight)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you always had a sense of when a line was drawing power, "
"and that ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  While "
"you are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can use.  "
"Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, vous deviniez toujours si un câble était électrifié, et "
"votre don s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  Bien que vous ne soyez pas "
"une psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez un atout dans votre poche "
"que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous aidera à survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Analgesic Block)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you were never that strongly affected by pain, and that "
"ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  While you are not "
"a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can use.  Hopefully it "
"helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, des blessures faisant pleurer les autres vous laisser "
"impassible, et votre don s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  Bien que vous "
"ne soyez pas une psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez un atout dans "
"votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous aidera à "
"survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Hacking Interface)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm computers basically always did what you wanted them to, "
"and that ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  While "
"you are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can use.  "
"Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, les ordinateurs faisait pratiquement toujours ce que "
"vous vouliez, et votre don s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  Bien que "
"vous ne soyez pas une psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez un atout "
"dans votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous aidera à "
"survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Chameleoflage)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you sometimes seemed to just fade into the background, "
"and that ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  While "
"you are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can use.  "
"Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, vos amis vous disait toujours que des fois vous aviez "
"presque l'air de vous fondre dans le décor, et votre don s'est amplifié avec "
"la fin du monde.  Bien que vous ne soyez pas une psionique totalement "
"éveillée, vous possédez un atout dans votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  "
"Espérons que ceci vous aidera à survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Mirror-Mask)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm people had a hard time remembering your exact "
"appearance, and that ability has been greatly heightened after the world "
"ended.  While you are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you "
"can use.  Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, les personnes que vous n'aimiez pas avaient des "
"difficultés à se rappeler de votre visage, et votre don s'est amplifié avec "
"la fin du monde.  Bien que vous ne soyez pas une psionique totalement "
"éveillée, vous possédez un atout dans votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  "
"Espérons que ceci vous aidera à survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Radio Transception)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm your mere presence seemed to interfere with radio "
"broadcasts, and that ability has been greatly heightened after the world "
"ended.  While you are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you "
"can use.  Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, les radios n'avait juste pas l'air de bien fonctionner "
"en votre présence, et votre s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  Bien que "
"vous ne soyez pas une psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez un atout "
"dans votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous aidera à "
"survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Brilliant Flash)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you always managed to make the other guy look away "
"first, and that ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  "
"While you are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can "
"use.  Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, vous remportiez toutes les batailles de regard, et votre "
"don s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  Bien que vous ne soyez pas une "
"psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez un atout dans votre poche que "
"vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous aidera à survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Banked Flames)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you had an easy time starting a fire no matter the "
"conditions, and that ability has been greatly heightened after the world "
"ended.  While you are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you "
"can use.  Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, vous étiez capable de faire débuter un feu peu importe "
"les conditions, et votre don s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  Bien que "
"vous ne soyez pas une psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez un atout "
"dans votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous aidera à "
"survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Cloak of Warmth)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm the cold never bothered you all that much, and that "
"ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  While you are not "
"a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can use.  Hopefully it "
"helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, le froid ne vous a jamais trop gêné, et votre don s'est "
"amplifié avec la fin du monde.  Bien que vous ne soyez pas une psionique "
"totalement éveillée, vous possédez un atout dans votre poche que vous pouvez "
"utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous aidera à survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Force Shove)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm people seemed to just move out of your way when you were "
"in a hurry, and that ability has been greatly heightened after the world "
"ended.  While you are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you "
"can use.  Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, les gens avait l'air de simplement se déplacer hors de "
"votre chemin lorsque vous étiez pressée, et votre don s'est amplifié avec la "
"fin du monde.  Bien que vous ne soyez pas une psionique totalement éveillée, "
"vous possédez un atout dans votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons "
"que ceci vous aidera à survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Knockdown)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, the few times you got into a fight you could down your "
"opponents with almost no effort, and that ability has been greatly heightened "
"after the world ended.  While you are not a fully awakened psion, you have a "
"single trick you can use.  Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, les quelques fois où vous vous êtes retrouvée au milieu "
"d'une bagarre il vous fût possible de mettre à terre vos adversaires presque "
"sans effort, et votre don s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  Bien que vous "
"ne soyez pas une psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez un atout dans "
"votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous aidera à "
"survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Wave of Force)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you could move through crowds without any problem at "
"all, and that ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  "
"While you are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can "
"use.  Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, vous étiez capable de vous frayer un passage au milieu "
"d'une foule sans problème, et votre don s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  "
"Bien que vous ne soyez pas une psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez "
"un atout dans votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous "
"aidera à survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Telepathic Shield)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you never had a single nightmare that you could "
"remember, and that ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended. "
" While you are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can "
"use.  Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, vous n'étiez pas capable de vous rappeler d'avoir "
"souffert d'un seul cauchemar, et votre don s'est amplifié avec la fin du "
"monde.  Bien que vous ne soyez pas une psionique totalement éveillée, vous "
"possédez un atout dans votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que "
"ceci vous aidera à survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Sense Minds)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you always knew when someone was trying to sneak up on "
"you, and that ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  "
"While you are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can "
"use.  Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, vous pouviez toujours sentir si quelqu'un était en train "
"d'essayer de se faufiler vers vous, et votre don s'est amplifié avec la fin "
"du monde.  Bien que vous ne soyez pas une psionique totalement éveillée, vous "
"possédez un atout dans votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que "
"ceci vous aidera à survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Mood Stabilization)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you had a knack for calming people down, and that "
"ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  While you are not "
"a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can use.  Hopefully it "
"helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, vous étiez capable de calmer des situations tendues et "
"éviter des drames, et votre don s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  Bien "
"que vous ne soyez pas une psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez un "
"atout dans votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous "
"aidera à survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Mesmerize)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you were always good at holding people's attention, and "
"that ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  While you "
"are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can use.  "
"Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, vous étiez toujours capable de garder l'attention des "
"personnes autour de vous, et votre don s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  "
"Bien que vous ne soyez pas une psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez "
"un atout dans votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous "
"aidera à survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Beastmaster)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, animals always seemed to like you, and that ability has "
"been greatly heightened after the world ended.  While you are not a fully "
"awakened psion, you have a single trick you can use.  Hopefully it helps you "
"survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, les animaux avait l'air de généralement apprécier votre "
"présence, et votre don s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  Bien que vous ne "
"soyez pas une psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez un atout dans "
"votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous aidera à "
"survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Obscurity)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, people just overlooked you when you didn't want to be "
"seen, and that ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  "
"While you are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can "
"use.  Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, les gens vous ignorait lorsque vous ne vouliez pas être "
"vue, et votre don s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  Bien que vous ne "
"soyez pas une psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez un atout dans "
"votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous aidera à "
"survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Healthy Glow)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you just enjoyed good health no matter what you seemed "
"to do, and that ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  "
"While you are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can "
"use.  Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, vous étiez au top de la forme peut importe ce que vous "
"faisiez, et votre don s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  Bien que vous ne "
"soyez pas une psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez un atout dans "
"votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous aidera à "
"survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Leukocyte Accumulation)" for
#. female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm your injuries always seemed to heal pretty quickly, and "
"that ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  While you "
"are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can use.  "
"Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, vos blessures avaient toujours l'air de guérir plus "
"rapidement que la normale, et votre don s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  "
"Bien que vous ne soyez pas une psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez "
"un atout dans votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous "
"aidera à survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Detoxification)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm bee stings and poison ivy never bothered you, and that "
"ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  While you are not "
"a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can use.  Hopefully it "
"helps you survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, les piqûres d'abeilles et les orties n'avait pas l'air "
"de vous affecter et votre don s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  Bien que "
"vous ne soyez pas une psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez un atout "
"dans votre poche que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous aidera à "
"survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Immunostimulus)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you never really seemed to get sick, and that ability "
"has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  While you are not a fully "
"awakened psion, you have a single trick you can use.  Hopefully it helps you "
"survive."
msgstr ""
"Avant le Cataclysme, vous n'aviez jamais l'air de tomber vraiment malade, et "
"votre don s'est amplifié avec la fin du monde.  Bien que vous ne soyez pas "
"une psionique totalement éveillée, vous possédez un atout dans votre poche "
"que vous pouvez utiliser.  Espérons que ceci vous aidera à survivre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Awakening Psion" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You survived a portal storm and hid inside while reality broke around you, "
"and when you left to examine the damage you found a strange crystal the storm "
"had left behind.  It was captivating, and you took it with you.  Sometimes, "
"at night, you look into it before you sleep, and you almost feel like "
"something in you is responding to the glow within the crystal."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Star Athlete" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were always good at athletics.  People praised your effort and hard work, "
"but the truth was you barely needed to practice.  It all just came naturally "
"to you, as naturally as breathing.  That kept you safe during the "
"Cataclysm--you outran the dead and worse things that chased you and made it "
"out of the cities, and they're certainly the thing that will keep you going, "
"especially since now, you're stronger and faster than you've ever been."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Doomseer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You knew the world was going to end, but they never listened.  They never "
"listened!  They couldn't see the things that walked among them!  They didn't "
"know what you had seen, what you knew was coming, and where are they now?  In "
"a zombie's stomach or walking with those corpses themselves, but you're still "
"alive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Electrical Engineer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You followed your parents' wishes and became an engineer, and to your "
"surprise you were extremely good at it.  It was like the electronics you "
"built just spoke to you, like you could see inside the wires and circuits, "
"and then when the sky broke that literally came true."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez suivi les souhaits de vos parents et êtes devenu une ingénieure, et "
"à votre surprise vous étiez très bonne à votre travail.  C'était comme si les "
"composants électroniques vous murmurait dans les oreilles et vous étiez "
"capable de voir instantanément le moindre défaut dans un circuit, et tout "
"ceci est devenu plus que littéral pour vous lorsque le ciel s'est éventré."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Magician" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a young kid, you just loved magic.  Growing up you "
"managed to become a professional magician and even performed at a few big "
"shows.  You were practicing a new trick when the Cataclysm hit, when you "
"realized you don't need to practice anymore.  You can just do it, for real."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Firestarter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Fire always fascinated you.  The fires you set almost got you arrested a few "
"times, but the urge was just too powerful.  It was like they were calling to "
"you, urging you to create them.  And ever since the sky broke, you can create "
"fire with merely a thought."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Test Subject, Project ONYX LIGHTNING" for
#. female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, you were 'volunteered' for a top-secret military "
"project.  They never told you what all the injections and EEGs and hours of "
"staring at a quarter on the table were supposed to accomplish, but now that "
"you can move things with your mind you have a pretty good idea what they were "
"aiming at."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Government Interrogator (DECEASED)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You did not die in the Cataclysm because on paper, you are already dead.  You "
"assumed a new identity as part of an experimental program designed to produce "
"psychic interrogators.  They told you that you were serving your country, "
"that your gifts would be the key to winning the new Cold War that was surely "
"developing, but they didn't consider the ramifications of having a telepath "
"on the base.  You knew right away that things were much worse than the brass "
"was telling you, and your gifts let you \"persuade\" the guards to let you "
"out even in the face of the lockdown.  You had thought to go somewhere else, "
"to get away from New England, but the end came much faster than even you "
"thought it would."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Itzcuāuhtli Corps Liaison, Yohualli Ehēcatl
#. Division" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The last thing you remember was inputting the jump coordinates into the "
"tliltilhuicaātl drive and reaching out to initiate the transfer when there "
"was a power surge and it felt like the entire ship was turning inside out.  "
"Now, you have no idea where you are."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Faith Healer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"People came to you for diseases that modern medicine told them were "
"incurable, and you made them well.  At least, they felt well, and that was "
"what mattered.  Now the dead walk and do not respond to your exhortations, "
"but your healing works better on yourself than it ever has on anyone else."
msgstr ""
"Les gens venaient à vous pour guérir des maladies que la médecine moderne "
"considéraient incurables, et vous améliorez leur santé. Au moins, vous "
"supposez, ils se sentaient plus en forme, et c'était tout ce qui comptait. "
"Maintenant les morts marchent et ne répondent pas à vos exhortations, mais "
"vos pouvoirs de guérison fonctionnent mieux sur vous qu'il n'on jamais sur "
"qui que soit d'autre."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cuāuhpilli Special Forces" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were on guard duty when the ship was preparing to enter Tliltilhuicaātl "
"and had just braced for the jump when something went wrong.  The ship seemed "
"like it was turning inside out, then you seemed like you were turning inside "
"out, and suddenly you were planetside in the ruins of a dying world.  You've "
"served the Excān Tlahtōlōyān on a dozen worlds, taken five captives, and even "
"have clearance for contact with huecachane civilizations, but none of that "
"has prepared you for the Cataclysm"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mobile Task Force: Psi 7 "Sleepwalkers"" for
#. female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As a member of Psi 7, your job was to take out the dangerous rogue psychics "
"that popped up with increasing frequency as the strangeness in the world "
"increased.  Even before the end of the world you had seen enough bizarre "
"things to write a dozen books, but nothing compares to what you've seen "
"during the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Sugar Girl" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a human shaped candy brought to life under unknown circumstances.  You "
"have your whole life ahead of you and it's gonna be sweet!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Werewolf, Natural-born (Species)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You had no idea what was going on the first time it happened, when you woke "
"up with mud on your bare feet and a sour taste in your mouth, but you were "
"soon found.  The People of the Moon, they called themselves, and they said "
"you were one of them.  A werewolf.  You lived out in the wilderness for a "
"while but didn't entirely abandon human civilization, and when the Cataclysm "
"hit you ignored the evacuation warnings and struck it out on your own.  Maybe "
"some of the People are still out there."
msgstr ""
"La première fois que cela s'est produit, tu n'avais aucune idée de ce qui se "
"passait. Tu t'es réveillé avec de la boue sur tes pieds nus et un goût amer "
"dans la bouche, mais tu as rapidement été trouvé. Les Gens de la Lune, comme "
"ils s'appelaient, t'ont dit que tu étais l'un d'eux. Un loup-garou. Tu as "
"vécu dans la nature pendant un temps, mais tu n'as pas complètement abandonné "
"la civilisation humaine, et lorsque le Cataclysme a frappé, tu as ignoré les "
"avertissements d'évacuation et tu es parti seul. Peut-être que certains des "
"Gens sont toujours là-bas."

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lilit (Species)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"For most or all of your life, you've had a secret; you are a predator.  While "
"you don't need to drink blood or eat flesh or anything so crude, you must "
"absorb the spiritual essence, the \"ruach\", of living beings in order to "
"maintain your health and vitality.  You had to hide your condition before the "
"Cataclysm, especially as things became stranger in the years leading up to "
"it, but now you don't have to hide anymore.  On the other hand, your "
"potential ruach supply has taken a drastic decline."
msgstr ""
"Pendant la majeure partie de ta vie, tu as eu un secret : tu es une "
"prédatrice. Bien que tu n'aies pas besoin de boire du sang ou de manger de la "
"chair ou quoi que ce soit d'aussi cru, tu dois absorber l'essence "
"spirituelle, le \"ruach\", des êtres vivants pour maintenir ta santé et ta "
"vitalité. Tu devais cacher ta condition avant le Cataclysme, surtout à mesure "
"que les choses devenaient plus étranges dans les années qui ont précédé, mais "
"maintenant tu n'as plus besoin de te cacher. D'un autre côté, ton "
"approvisionnement potentiel en ruach a considérablement diminué."

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Vampire" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As if the world ending and you being stranded on some flying island away from "
"everything wasn't bad enough, you now feel a growing hunger for the blood of "
"others.  Whether you decide to try and cure it or see what abilities can be "
"gained from this condition is up to you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Day 1" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Starter evacuee gear, no skills - probably not going to have a good time."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Midgame" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Scavenged armor and mid-range skills, meant to represent an established "
"survivor before making the jump to (self)-fabricated custom gear."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lategame" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Heavy (survivor pneumatic) post-Cataclysm gear, excluding rare lootables."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/innawood/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ierda" for female
#. ~ Description of profession "Arvori" for female
#. ~ Description of profession "Ondua" for female
#. ~ Description of profession "Bejárónő" for female
#. ~ Description of profession "Dúkka" for female
#. ~ Description of profession "Silvestra" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are the spirit of a place that slowly gained sentience, a genius loci, "
"born alone in the wilderness.  With no parents, no kin, and no guidance, it's "
"up to you to make your own way in the world."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Unknowing Changeling, Noble (Species)" for
#. female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You grew up thinking you were human, just another person among billions, but "
"you were born Under the Hill and swapped for a human baby shortly after "
"birth.  Your parents were the nobility of the Fair Folk, the great lords and "
"ladies who traveled in spider-silk carriages on roads built of moonbeams and "
"danced the unending nights away before leading fantastic armies in battle the "
"next morning.  When the Cataclysm hit, your parents' slumbering power "
"asserted itself, giving you access to a portion of their fae magick.  "
"Hopefully it will help you survive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Unknowing Changeling, Commoner (Species)" for
#. female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You grew up thinking you were human, just another person among billions, but "
"you were born Under the Hill and swapped for a human baby shortly after "
"birth.  Your parents come from the common masses of the Fair Folk, the pooka, "
"redcaps, hobgoblins, trow, pixies, knockers, selkies, or any of the myriad of "
"others.  When the Cataclysm hit, your parents' slumbering power asserted "
"itself, revealing your heritage and giving you access to a portion of their "
"fae magick.  Hopefully it will help you survive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of profession "XE843 'Gracken' (Species)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Species XE843 is how the Xedra scientists identified your people before they "
"learned your people could speak to them after enough time around them to "
"develop a way to communicate.  They had little idea that communication is "
"your people's survival trait, coming from a much harsher environment than the "
"humans are…were blessed with, you can make allies with almost any thinking "
"being.  You informed the Xedra people of your race's name 'Gracken' but you "
"didn't tell them that most of your people they found were larval forms and "
"lacking access to the shadow materials needed would never grow up into an "
"adult form.  Now the humans' world is as deadly or moreso than your home and "
"the way back is mostly closed.  Time to try and find a route home that "
"wouldn't be a death sentence, or see what this world has to offer."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Awakened Eater" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Ever since the Cataclysm you've been able to clearly see elements of other "
"realities that have intruded your own.  You also are able to consume a "
"resource they seem to have brought with them to give you power far beyond a "
"normal human."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Awakened Dreamer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Ever since the Cataclysm you've become far more aware of the weakened gap "
"between realities.  Specifically, of what is on the other side.  "
"Surprisingly, it doesn't seem universally hostile, and you think you'd be "
"able to bring some of these entities over if you desired."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Awakened Inventor" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Ever since the Cataclysm you've begun having crazy ideas on how to create "
"technological devices.  While conventional logic would label these designs as "
"silly or even insane, something tells you that they'd work regardless."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Awakened Dreamsmith" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Ever since the Cataclysm you've gained an instinctive sense of how to work "
"dreamdross into tools and armor.  It will still take some effort to put these "
"vague ideas to proper use."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dhampir (Species)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"One of your parents was always a little odd.  They stayed out of the sun as "
"much as they could, their eyes were a bit of an odd color, and they vanished "
"without a trace before you grew old enough to ask them why they left the room "
"every time you got a scrape that drew blood.  But now that you're older, you "
"understand.  You are the child of a vampire, and have inherited a small "
"portion of their power."
msgstr ""
"L'un de vos parents était toujours un peu étrange, restant toujours à l'abri "
"du soleil, possédant des yeux d'une couleur étrange, et vous abandonna avant "
"que vous ayez l'âge nécessaire pour vous demander pourquoi il était "
"nécessaire de ne pas saigner en sa présence pour ne pas vous attirer des "
"ennuis.  Mais maintenant que vous êtes plus vieille vous comprenez.  Vous "
"êtes l'enfant d'un vampire, et vous avez hérité une fraction de leurs "
"pouvoirs."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Paraclesian Birth" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"By dint of your birth you already have some knowledge of how the universe "
"really works."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Born with the gift of gab." for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've never met another person but already you are ready for the "
"conversations that will ensue."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Knack of formless movement." for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Water takes on the shape of whatever opening is given to it.  You were born "
"with this knowledge and way of moving."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Everywhere and nowhere." for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Air expands to fill every space it encounters and by filling the space it "
"becomes diffuse and impossible to grasp.  Would you slip through the fingers "
"of those who grasp at you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Born a seedbearer." for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A gift from your birth world?  A quirk of nature?  For reasons unknown to "
"you, you can sprout seeds from this planet.  You can't control what seeds you "
"get, however."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Fire dances with itself." for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"At your birth you already danced a flaming path, enthralled with your own "
"capacity for destruction and change."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "What does the stone dream of?" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before you were born, your thoughts and dreams were those of stone.  When "
"this world sucks you into it's highs and lows, you can remember the eternity "
"that is stone."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "FBI Paranormal Investigator" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, you used to work for the Paranormal Investigation "
"Department of the FBI.  You got used to jokes at your expense, as well as "
"being constantly underfunded and disregarded by your superiors.  You were "
"returning from yet another case with nothing but a bag of suspicious candies "
"to show, when all hell broke loose.  Oh well, at least now you can be certain "
"that everyone still alive will believe you that the truth is out there."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Response Team Member" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before Xedra recruited you, you probably worked for the ATF or a PMC like "
"Kroll.  It was your job to investigate any cross-pollination incidents where "
"alternate physics regions crossed over the Nether and reached our world.  "
"Part exterminator part investigator, you made sure that any new resources and "
"contaminants were accounted for, including any intelligent life trying to "
"sneak into our world.  Local law enforcement and civilians called you "
"'Zebras' since your identification and badges only had a barcode instead of "
"any name/rank/number.  This job has shown you things you don't want to "
"remember but luckily the Zebra docs seem to have an endless supply of pills."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Foreign Agent" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You came here from another country trying to gain access to secrets the "
"United States had ripped from other worlds.  They probably had sent people to "
"your homeland to do the same.  You were out performing recon when the "
"Cataclysm struck and caught a ride with a stranger trying to find safety.  "
"Sadly you lost your companion and vehicle, getting lost in the process and "
"with now only a vague idea on how to get back to the safehouse, where you "
"hope your hidden gear remains untouched."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes venue d'un autre pays pour essayer d'accéder à des secrets que les "
"États-Unis avaient arrachés à d'autres mondes. Ils ont probablement envoyé "
"des gens dans votre pays pour faire la même chose. Vous étiez en mission de "
"reconnaissance lorsque le cataclysme a frappé et vous avez embarquée avec un "
"inconnu qui essayait de se mettre à l'abri. Malheureusement, vous avez perdu "
"votre compagnon et votre véhicule, vous vous êtes perdue dans le même temps, "
"et vous n'avez plus qu'une vague idée de la façon de retourner à votre "
"planque, où vous espérez que votre équipement caché n'a pas été touché."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Offworld Team: Jotunn Hunter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Part of Xedra's Offworld Acquisitions group, you specialized in tracking, "
"killing and retrieving useful components from the cyborg tribes that seem to "
"exist on some of the worlds Xedra had access to.  Do you feel guilt about "
"bringing back the cybernetic components that are now inside you or your "
"teammates?  Or do you worry that now they might be on this world hunting you? "
" You've lost your sidearm and spent half of your heavy ordnance.  Worst of "
"all, you're out of smokes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Offworld Team: Big Game Hunter" for
#. female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are what Xedra refers to as a non-local guide.  A mature Gracken hired on "
"to join the Offworld Acquisitions Team, you trained in human long distance "
"weaponry in order to take down big game and create new improvements to bring "
"back to your people.  They gave you a big gun and a little training in how to "
"use it and in return you help them know what things in other dimensions to "
"hunt and what to run from."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Offworld Team: Troll Slayer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Part of Xedra's Offworld Acquisitions team, you were sent to gather "
"biological specimens, they often objected strenuously to being gathered.  "
"You've got some CBMs in you but understand they probably came out of someone "
"that might have friends."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Offworld Team: Specter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Part of Xedra's Offworld Acquisitions team, you were trained to infiltrate "
"any human compatible cultures that were discovered.  You never found any with "
"technology worth stealing and you aren't sure what that says about humanity."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mobile Task Force: Upsilon 4 "Devourers"" for
#. female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Being part of Upsilon 4, you were always at the front of your unit, "
"protecting other operatives from danger ahead using your eater's abilities.  "
"This one was no different, but something went really wrong."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mobile Task Force: Theta 1 "Middle-
#. Management"" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Theta 1, also known as \"kindergarten\" between other task forces, is used "
"when missions are expected to be too dangerous to send people or when "
"reconnaissance can't obtain any important information about the target, which "
"is why otherworldly creatures, summoned by dreamers, are sent.  It's not the "
"best course of action, but the unit's nearly zero fatality rate makes it "
"worth using."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mobile Task Force: Nu 3 "Techno Savvy"" for
#. female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Despite the \"Task Force\" in their name, Nu 3 is rarely called into the "
"actual mission; their main task is reconnaissance and developing tools to "
"support another task force, even if these tools last only a few weeks.  But "
"when they do accept a task, it's almost guaranteed to be successful.  It "
"should've been your first day here, but something went really wrong."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mobile Task Force: Tau 8 "Anvil"" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Sharing the same problem with Nu 3, dreamsmiths from Tau 8 are not called on "
"the operation very often, and their main work looks really medieval.  Despite "
"this, they are really popular among other branches, as their tools and armor "
"have everything a modern soldier can dream of."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "XEDRA Operative, Department of Extra-Normal
#. Capabilities, SATOR Division" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You joined XEDRA during the years leading up to the Cataclysm, and they told "
"you that you fit the profile of a SATOR agent.  At the time you had no idea "
"what they meant, and they gave you a couple days to process when you learned "
"that magic was real, the enemies of the United States possessed it, and they "
"wanted you to learn it too.  When they sat you down and had you practice "
"writing letters into patterns for days on end you wondered if you had made a "
"mistake, but when one of those squares let you summon a loaf of bread out of "
"thin air for lunch, you changed your tune pretty quickly."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ierda" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"With the dimensional spillage that preceded the Cataclysm you are the spirit "
"of a place that slowly gained sentience, a genius loci.  As the world "
"reshapes itself you have decided to wander from your birthplace and determine "
"where you will end up.\n"
"\n"
"As a spirit of the earth, your powers are strengthened by contact with the "
"soil and the rock and weakened by separation from the living earth."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arvori" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"With the dimensional spillage that preceded the Cataclysm you are the spirit "
"of a place that slowly gained sentience, a genius loci.  As the world "
"reshapes itself you have decided to wander from your birthplace and determine "
"where you will end up.\n"
"\n"
"As a spirit of the forest, your powers are strengthened by the wild places "
"and weakened within the constructs of humanity."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ondua" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"With the dimensional spillage that preceded the Cataclysm you are the spirit "
"of a place that slowly gained sentience, a genius loci.  As the world "
"reshapes itself you have decided to wander from your birthplace and determine "
"where you will end up.\n"
"\n"
"As a spirit of the lakes and rivers, your powers are strengthened when you "
"are surrounded by water and weakened when you spend too long away from the "
"water."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bejárónő" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"With the dimensional spillage that preceded the Cataclysm you are the spirit "
"of a place that slowly gained sentience, a genius loci.  As the world "
"reshapes itself you have decided to wander from your birthplace and determine "
"where you will end up.\n"
"\n"
"As a spirit of the flames, your powers are strengthened when among heat and "
"fire and weakened by the cold."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dúkka" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"With the dimensional spillage that preceded the Cataclysm you are the spirit "
"of a place that slowly gained sentience, a genius loci.  As the world "
"reshapes itself you have decided to wander from your birthplace and determine "
"where you will end up.\n"
"\n"
"As a spirit of humanity, your powers are strengthened when among humankind or "
"in the remnants of civilization and weakened when in the wilderness."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Silvestra" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"With the dimensional spillage that preceded the Cataclysm you are the spirit "
"of a place that slowly gained sentience, a genius loci.  As the world "
"reshapes itself you have decided to wander from your birthplace and determine "
"where you will end up.\n"
"\n"
"As a spirit of the winds, your powers are strengthened when under the open "
"sky and weakened when indoors or underground."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hedge Witch" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In the years and decades leading up to the Cataclysm, things got weirder and "
"weirder.  The government tried their best to cover it up but they couldn't "
"entirely stop all knowledge from leaking out.  You were one of the people who "
"responded to the weirdness by becoming weird yourself; you spent time combing "
"through old books and found some of the charms and spells written in them "
"actually worked.  When you had the right ingredients and were in the right "
"place, you could make the impossible possible.  Maybe lighting a fire without "
"a match won't help you kill a zombie, but it's kept you warm and safe when "
"you're sure other survivors had to shiver as the night closed in."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Skinchanger (Bear)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you were the member of a cult, or a strange family legacy, or maybe "
"you just stumbled on a book that probably shouldn't have been left where you "
"could find it.  Regardless, you have the ability to turn into an animal when "
"you kill it and make a talisman out of its bones and skin.  Every change "
"requires a death, but with so much death already since the Cataclysm, what's "
"a little bit more?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cryptid Hunter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent months trying to find one of these elusive creatures, searching all "
"over the country in the hopes of proving beyond doubt that they exist.  You "
"recently found enough trustworthy information to write down a map that will "
"certainly lead you to a cryptid.  Now that the supernatural is undeniable you "
"feel that you should find a cryptid anyway, if only to say that you didn't do "
"all this work for nothing."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/profession_groups.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Standard Bionic Interface" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Like most people on Salus IV you have previously received cybernetic "
"enhancement to make life easier.  Your enhancements include a universal data "
"link, some basic power storage, and a charging cable to top up."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Goat Lady" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Nobody around?  Oh well, it doesn't matter.  Your beloved goats are all you "
"need!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lost Tribal" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were out gathering for the tribe when the sky broke and the gods called "
"to you, then you collapsed.  When you woke up, you were in an unfamiliar "
"place with new memories crowding your thoughts."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Shaman" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've trained in the medical arts, refining natural remedies into real cures "
"for disease.  Your tribe would have lived long and healthy lives, were they "
"still here."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Backpacker" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"For the past few years you've been traveling the world, sightseeing and "
"living off tribal donations.  You came home to find your home abandoned, and "
"the only thing between you and death is the open fields and your pack."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Miner" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a miner, not a minor!  Your waterskin is dry, you lost your haul, and "
"you're on your last torch…"
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes une mineuse, pas une mineure!  Votre outre est à sec, vous avez "
"perdu votre butin, et vous n'avez plus qu'une dernière torche…"

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Spear Hunter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting, and quickly developed a talent "
"for chasing down your prey with a spear.  Why, if the world ended, there's "
"nothing you'd want at your side more than your trusty spear.  So, when it "
"did, you made sure to bring it along."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Javelin Hunter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting, and quickly developed a talent "
"for javelin throwing.  Why, if the world ended, there's nothing you'd want at "
"your side more than your trusty javelins.  So, when it did, you made sure to "
"bring them along."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Canoe Fisherwoman" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent most of your days fishing in lakes and swamps, getting by quietly "
"on your catch.  While you've wandered from your canoe, you can't resist "
"coming back for another catch."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Redsmith" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You ran into trouble coming out from your forge, but despite the havoc you've "
"managed to keep some of your equipment along with your latest project."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lumberjack" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a lumberjack, and you're okay.  You felled trees before the world "
"ended, and you suspect the undead aren't nearly as tough."
msgstr ""
"Vous coupiez des arbres avant le cataclysme, et vous pensez que les "
"morts-vivants d'aujourd'hui ne sont pas aussi robustes."

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Musician" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You nailed your solo, but the audience erupted into screams instead of "
"applause.  You weren't able to grab much during the panic, but at least you "
"have your flute in your basket."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Tribal Warrior Recruit" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Joining the tribal guard has been your dream for years.  You finally got in, "
"just in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of emergency.  "
"As far as you can tell, the elders abandoned you in this hellhole when you "
"missed the emergency evac."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Tribal Swordswoman" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As a member of your tribe's elite guard, you sharpened your swordsmanship to "
"the best that you could.  Now, you're a rōnin of the woods."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Tribal Arbalist" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"From your first hunt, you showed talent with a crossbow.  While the tribe was "
"well guarded by your aim, you're all alone now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Native Settler" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were on the road with friends from your tribe to search for a new "
"settlement spot when you seemed to be yanked somewhere completely different.  "
"You see no sign of your friends, but at least you got your equipment and some "
"seeds with you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Carpenter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Living under your craftsmanship, the tribe was no longer bound to caves lest "
"they freeze in the night.  You won't have to work nearly as hard for just "
"yourself."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bricklayer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Using the earth and organic material to create durable, insulated adobe kept "
"your trade in high demand in your tribe.  Now alone, you only need to look "
"out for yourself."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Athlete" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You'll never get your shot at the Cyberolympics.  All that's left of your "
"dream is a single leftover protein shake.  Well, that and your bulging, "
"cybernetically-enhanced muscles."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Police Officer" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Mortally injured in the line of duty, you were resurrected by the surgeons "
"from the department's revolutionary Cybercop program.  Now, in these lawless "
"times, you are truly the future of law enforcement."
msgstr ""
"Mortellement blessée durant votre service, on vous a ressuscité grâce au "
"programme révolutionnaire de chirurgie Cybercop.  Désormais, dans ce monde "
"sans loi, vous êtes l'avenir des forces de l'ordre."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Commercial Cyborg" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You always had to have the latest and best gadgets and gizmos, so is it any "
"wonder that you upgraded your flesh along with your smart phone?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Firefighter" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As a second-generation augmented firefighter, you have been cybernetically "
"enhanced to operate in the most dire of emergency situations.  You're pretty "
"sure this counts."
msgstr ""
"En tant que pompier bionique de seconde génération, on vous a modifié "
"cybernétiquement pour opérer dans les milieux les plus dangereux. Le "
"Cataclysme définitivement compte comme un milieu dangereux."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Game Master" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You came into a large fortune, through luck or will, and hosted games for "
"world-famous celebrities.  You could afford to spoil your players, and so you "
"did.  You invested in bionics to make you smarter and memorized the entire "
"handbook.  Let's hope that knowledge helps you now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Gangster" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were the boss's favorite, their protege; they always counted on you to "
"get the toughest jobs done.  They invested in \"basic\" augments and the best "
"gear on the market in preparation for your biggest hit yet.  Sadly, you came "
"out of surgery to find your whole gang had been eaten."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Assassin" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The product of millions of dollars of clandestine research, you are a bionic "
"sleeper agent capable of silently engaging your target while maintaining an "
"innocuous appearance.  Your handler cut all contact a week ago."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Augmentation Associate" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When bionics first emerged, you were quick to make them into your career, and "
"spent your days overseeing their installation.  That makes you one of the few "
"non-zombies in the world that can calibrate an Autodoc, which might come in "
"handy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Surgeon" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As one of the top surgeons in the country, you were chosen for an "
"augmentation program to expand the medical field.  With your expertise and "
"augmentations, you can perform precise surgery with little assistance."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Boffin" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were employed by a major international corporation as a representative "
"and technical advisor, utilizing the incredible power of your cybernetically "
"augmented mind."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Patient" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the diagnosis came back positive, you signed up for a series of "
"experimental bionic surgeries that saved your life.  Now you're healthier "
"than you ever were before, thanks to a suite of bionic systems powered by "
"your own metabolic functions.  Make the most of your second chance at life."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque vous avez été diagnostiquée positive, vous vous êtes engagée pour "
"être un sujet d'une série d'implantations bioniques expérimentales, et cela "
"vous a sauvé la vie. Maintenant vous êtes en meilleure santé que vous n'avez "
"jamais été grâce à la gamme de systèmes bioniques alimentés par votre "
"métabolisme vous ayant été implantés. Profitez au mieux de votre seconde "
"chance de vivre."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Prepper" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You knew the end was coming.  You augmented yourself with some basic bionic "
"tools and underwent extensive survival training.  Now the end has come, and "
"it is time to see if your efforts have paid off."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Runner" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were the kind of sportsman who couldn't get off the track.  You love "
"running, and you enhanced your body with cybernetics to go even faster.  Now "
"there's plenty to run from - this is your kind of game."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Sniper" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A top-secret military program sought to convert you into the perfect sniper.  "
"Your bionics, equipment, and extensive field training enable you to drop "
"targets from implausible distances, even after weeks of total isolation in "
"enemy territory."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Soldier" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are the result of one of the military's last research programs: a "
"prototype cyborg soldier.  The wars they expected you to fight have become "
"obsolete, but war never changes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Agent" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your body conceals several bionic components, worth millions of dollars in "
"public taxes.  The government turned you into an infiltration and recon "
"specialist: you have night vision, an alarm, lock picking capabilities and a "
"hacking module."
msgstr ""
"Votre corps est bourré d'implants bioniques valant une fortune entièrement "
"payée par le contribuable. Le gouvernement a fait de vous une spécialiste de "
"l'infiltration et de l'éclairage: vous possédez une vision nocturne, un "
"réveil, ainsi que des crochets et un module de piratage intégrés."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Student" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your parents were so obsessed with making sure you aced every test that they "
"had you outfitted with bionics to enhance your intellect and memory.  Now "
"you're facing the hardest test yet, and you're not sure if those are the "
"right kind of tools for the job."
msgstr ""
"Vos parents étaient tellement obsédés par votre réussite scolaire qu'ils vous "
"ont fait implanter une panoplie de gadgets pour vous rendre plus intelligente "
"et rendre votre mémoire parfaite. Vous faites maintenant face à l'examen le "
"plus rigoureux que vous ayez jamais eu et vous n'êtes pas vraiment sûre qu'on "
"vous ait fournie les bons outils pour réussir."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Thief" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Impeccable style and a few bionic tricks up your sleeve have seen you pull "
"off a string of daring, high-profile heists.  The cops would love to get "
"their hands on you, but seem otherwise occupied."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Industrial Cyborg" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"For better or for worse, bionic augmentation has turned you into a walking "
"power tool.  Upgraded with a standard industrial-grade manual labor surgery "
"and training package, you are augmented with bionic muscles and an integrated "
"toolset, both powered by standard batteries."
msgstr ""
"Pour le meilleur ou le pire, vos employeurs ont payé l'insertion d'assez "
"d'implants bioniques dans votre corps pour faire de vous une véritable "
"machine sur pattes.  Vos opérations vous ont doté d'un assemblage industriel "
"de muscles bioniques et outils intégrés, le tout alimenté avec des piles."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Prototype Cyborg" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were normal once.  Before the tests, before the procedures, before they "
"stripped away every outward sign of your humanity.  You're more machine than "
"human now, but that might prove to be an advantage against the horrors that "
"await."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cyberjunkie" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Long ago your lifelong infatuation with bionic enhancement lead you into a "
"shady world of back-alley bionic clinics and self-installed secondhand CBMs.  "
"Your posthuman hunger still cries out to be fed; where will you get your "
"bionic fix now?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Monster" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Completely overtaken by bionic-induced psychosis, you are a deformed "
"posthuman monster, forced to hide in the shadows.  Amidst the desolation, "
"however, even a creature such as yourself might find its niche."
msgstr ""
"Complètement transformé par la psychose induite par les implants bioniques, "
"vous êtes un monstre posthumain forcé à se terrer dans l'ombre. Peut être "
"qu'avec toute cette désolation même une créature telle que vous pourrait "
"trouver sa niche."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Failed Cyborg" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After a series of surgical mistakes, your body is a wreck of bionic parts.  "
"You have a large capacity for power, but are filled with broken and useless "
"bionics.  Your ethanol power supply still works, at least."
msgstr ""
"Après une série d'erreurs chirurgicales, votre corps est une épave de pièces "
"bioniques.  Vous avez une grande capacité d'énergie, mais vous êtes remplie "
"de pièces bioniques défectueuses et inutiles.  Au moins, votre générateur à "
"éthanol fonctionne encore."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Drone Operator" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You had a job programming machines such as automatic street cleaners, "
"newsbots, and pizza delivery drones.  Bionic implants helped you control them "
"remotely.  Now all the drones carry guns instead of pizza.  At least you "
"still have a… RC car?"
msgstr ""
"Vous programmiez des machines telles que des robots de nettoyage de rue, des "
"robots distributeurs de journaux ou des robots livreurs de pizza.  Vous avez "
"reçue des implants bioniques pour les contrôler à distance, et maintenant, "
"tout les drones portent des armes, mais vous n'avez que euhhh… une voiture "
"télécommandée?"

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Razor Girl" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Through a series of painful and expensive surgeries, you became a walking "
"bionic weapon, your services as a mercenary available to the highest bidder."
msgstr ""

