#: data/mods/extra_mut_scen/mutation_scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Mutant - Chiropteran Threshold" for male
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "Start as a post-threshold Bat Mutant"
msgstr "Commencer le jeu en tant que Mutant Chiroptère ayant franchi le seuil"

#: data/mods/extra_mut_scen/mutation_scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Mutant - Lagomorph Threshold" for male
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "Start as a post-threshold Lagomorph Mutant"
msgstr "Commencer le jeu en tant que Mutant Lagomorphe ayant franchi le seuil"

#: data/mods/extra_mut_scen/mutation_scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Mutant - Raptor Threshold" for male
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "Start as a post-threshold Raptor Mutant"
msgstr "Commencer le jeu en tant que Mutant Raptor ayant franchi le seuil"

#: data/mods/extra_mut_scen/mutation_scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Mutant - Survivor Threshold" for male
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "Start as a post-threshold Survivor Mutant"
msgstr "Commencer le jeu en tant que Mutante Survivante ayant franchi le seuil"

#: data/mods/extra_mut_scen/mutation_scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Mutant - Aqueous Threshold" for male
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "Start as a post-threshold Aqueous Mutant"
msgstr "Commencer le jeu en tant que Mutant Piscien ayant franchi le seuil"

#: data/mods/extra_mut_scen/mutation_scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Mutant - Arachnid Threshold" for male
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "Start as a post-threshold Arachnid Mutant"
msgstr "Commencer le jeu en tant que Mutant Arachnéen ayant franchi le seuil"

#: data/mods/extra_mut_scen/mutation_scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Mutant - Subterranean Threshold" for male
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "Start as a post-threshold Subterranean Mutant"
msgstr "Commencer le jeu en tant que Mutant Troglodyte ayant franchi le seuil"

#: data/mods/extra_mut_scen/mutation_scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Mutant - Bear Threshold" for male
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "Start as a post-threshold Bear Mutant"
msgstr "Commencer le jeu en tant que Mutant Ursin ayant franchi le seuil"

#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "In a Cave" for male
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "Somehow, you found yourself in a cave.  Someone else is with you."
msgstr ""
"D'une manière ou d'une autre, vous vous êtes retrouvé dans une grotte. "
"Quelqu'un d'autre est là avec vous."

#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "A Lonely Cave" for male
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "Somehow, you found yourself in a cave.  Seems like you're on your own."
msgstr ""
"D'une manière ou d'une autre, vous vous êtes retrouvé dans une grotte, on "
"dirait que vous êtes seul au monde pour l'instant."

#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Infected" for male
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In the chaos and panic of evacuation, you got bitten by something!  You "
"didn't get proper medical care, and now the wound has started turning green."
msgstr ""
"Dans la panique de l'évacuation, quelque chose vous a mordu! Vous n'avez pas "
"pu vous soigner, et la plaie commence à tourner au vert."

#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Bordered" for male
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in a wilderness.  The only thing that really bothers you is a "
"mysterious sky-high wall seen in the distance."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez survécu la vague initiale de panique, et avez atteint la sécurité "
"relative de la cambrousse. La seule chose vous inquiétant un peu étant le mur "
"immense que vous voyez au loin."

#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Ambush" for male
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"It is the winter after zero hour.  As you were scavenging for food and a warm "
"place to stay at, you heard the sound of lots of movement nearby."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Last Flight" for male
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Once it became clear that the world was ending you took to the skies, hoping "
"that your flying skills could lead you to safety.  During your flight you got "
"lost and had to land on an empty field."
msgstr ""
"Lorsqu'il est devenu clair que le fin du monde avait commencée, vous avez "
"décidé d'utiliser vos talents de pilote et avez utilisé votre appareil pour "
"essayer d'atteindre une zone sûre par le ciel. Durant votre vol vous vous "
"êtes perdu et avait été forcé d'atterir dans un champ vide."

#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Wilderness" for male
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and the moaning is fainter "
"this far from civilization, but you'd better know what you're doing out here."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous trouvez parmi les arbres. Les cris et les gémissements sont "
"atténués si loin de la civilisation, mais vous feriez bien de savoir ce que "
"vous faites ici."

#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Car Crash" for male
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You decided the open road would be a better prospect than the zombie-filled "
"cities.  While en route to your destination, you were involved in a wreck.  "
"When you look around, you can no longer spot the road you were driving on.  "
"Just how hard did you hit your head?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "High Tech, Low Life" for male
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before the world ended, bionics were reserved for the rich and the famous.  "
"You might not have been either, but you wanted in.  Hidden offices "
"sequestered away in basements, anesthetic smuggled out of hospitals, and "
"desperate people with little to lose could get you what you wanted.  If you "
"went too deep, however, your augmentation may have come at a price…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Evacuee" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in one of the many government evac shelters."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez survécu à la vague de panique. Vous êtes \"relativement\" en "
"sécurité dans l'un des nombreux abris d'évacuation du gouvernement."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Refugee Center" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have made your way to a "
"refugee center."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez survécu à la première vague de panique et vous vous êtes rendue "
"dans un centre de réfugiés."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Strange Castle" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and made your way to the "
"wilderness.  You were expecting this area to be uninhabited, but instead you "
"see a large castle guarded by strange robots.  At the entrance stands a sign, "
"it reads \"Traders Come Well Avaunt\""
msgstr ""
"Vous avez survécu à la première vague de panique et vous vous êtes frayé un "
"chemin dans la nature. Vous vous attendiez à ce que cette région soit "
"inhabitée, mais au lieu de cela, vous voyez un grand château gardé par "
"d'étranges robots. À l'entrée se trouve un panneau indiquant « Traders Come "
"Well Avaunt » (Les marchands viennent en toute confiance)."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Friends to the End" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You and your friends always talked about what you'd do when the world ended… "
"now it's come true, and you've made your way to a remote cabin your friend "
"Liam always said to head for.  It's been a hell of a journey.  You hope Liam "
"and the others made it in one piece."
msgstr ""
"Vous et vos amies avez toujours parlé de ce que vous feriez à la fin du "
"monde… maintenant c'est devenu une réalité, et vous vous êtes dirigée vers un "
"chalet isolé vers lequel votre ami Liam vous a toujours dit de vous diriger.  "
"Cela a été un sacré voyage.  Vous espérez que Liam et les autres s’en sont "
"sortis en un seul morceau.  "

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Squatter" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in an abandoned building.  Unfortunately, while you're the only one "
"here now, you are definitely not the first person to be here, and in its "
"current state this building no longer seems nearly as secure as one might "
"have hoped."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez survécu à la première vague de panique et vous êtes (relativement) "
"en sécurité dans un bâtiment abandonné.  Malheureusement, même si vous êtes "
"la seule ici actuellement, vous n'êtes certainement pas la première personne "
"à être ici, et dans son état actuel, ce bâtiment ne semble plus aussi sûr "
"qu'on aurait pu l'espérer."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Missed" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Whether due to stubbornness, ignorance, or just plain bad luck, you missed "
"the evacuation and are stuck in a city full of the risen dead."
msgstr ""
"Que ce soit par entêtement, par ignorance ou tout simplement par malchance, "
"vous avez manqué l'évacuation et vous retrouvez coincée dans une ville "
"remplie de morts ressuscités."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Large Building" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Whether due to stubbornness, ignorance, or just plain bad luck, you missed "
"the evacuation and are stuck in a large building full of the risen dead."
msgstr ""
"Que ce soit par entêtement, par ignorance ou tout simplement par malchance, "
"vous avez manqué l'évacuation et vous retrouvez coincée dans un grand "
"bâtiment rempli de morts ressuscités."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Surrounded" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've attracted the attention of living dead in some way, now they're all "
"around you and you'll likely have to fight through them if you want to escape."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez attiré l'attention des morts-vivants d'une manière ou d'une autre, "
"ils sont désormais tout autour de vous et vous devrez probablement vous "
"battre à travers eux si vous voulez vous échapper."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Safe Place" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've found a safe place away from the cities and devoid of the living dead. "
" Looks like you're on your own…"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez trouvé un endroit sûr, loin des villes et dépourvu de "
"morts-vivants.  On dirait que vous êtes seule…"

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Infected" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In the chaos and panic of the evacuation, you got bitten by something!  You "
"didn't get proper medical care, and now the wound has started turning green."
msgstr ""
"Dans le chaos et la panique de l'évacuation, vous avez été mordue par quelque "
"chose!  Vous n'avez pas reçu de soins médicaux appropriés et maintenant la "
"plaie a commencé à verdir.  "

#: data/json/scenarios.json data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Hunted" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you "
"relentlessly.  You can outrun it, but it always seems to find you eventually. "
" The only escape is for one of you to die."
msgstr ""
"Depuis le début du Cataclysme, quelque chose vous poursuit sans relâche.  "
"Vous pouvez la distancer, mais elle semble toujours vous retrouver.  La seule "
"issue est que l'une de vous meure.  "

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Hunted Forever" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Since the start of the Cataclysm, they have been hunting you relentlessly.  "
"You can try to fight them, but each time one falls another takes its place.  "
"The only escape is for you to die."
msgstr ""
"Depuis le début du Cataclysme, elles vous chassent sans relâche. Vous pouvez "
"essayer de les combattre, mais à chaque fois qu'une d'entre elles tombe, une "
"autre prend sa place. Le seul moyen de s'en sortir est de mourir."

#: data/json/scenarios.json data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Fungal Infection" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "You feel spores crawling beneath your skin.  It's only a matter of time."
msgstr ""
"Vous ressentez des spores ramper sous votre peau.  Ce n’est plus qu’une "
"question de temps."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Burning Building" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The building you had chosen to reside in has suddenly caught fire!  You might "
"want to leave."
msgstr ""
"Le bâtiment où vous avez élu domicile a pris feu soudainement! Vous devriez "
"partir."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Unliving History" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"New England is dotted with old forts from the Revolutionary War, and many of "
"them are still standing.  When things started getting really bad, it seemed "
"like a natural place to hole up for a while, and it turns out that many, many "
"other people had the same idea.  The peace didn't last long.  Now everyone "
"else is undead, and you're trapped inside the walls with them.  The single "
"entrance being a tight choke point is looking a lot less useful now…"
msgstr ""
"La Nouvelle Angleterre pullule de vieux forts datant de la guerre "
"d'indépendance, et beaucoup d'entre-eux sont encore plus ou moins entiers. "
"Lorsque les choses ont commencées à devenir vraiment mauvaises, cela vous est "
"venu à l'esprit comme un bon endroit où vous cacher pendant un moment, et on "
"dirait que beaucoup, beaucoup d'autres personnes ont eu la a même idée, mais "
"n'ont pas été aussi chanceuses que vous, et maintenant ne sont qu'une horde "
"de cadavres titubants, et vous êtes coincée entre quatre ramparts avec eux. "
"La seule entrée étant un goulot d'étranglement à l'air beaucoup moins "
"pratique pour vous maintenant…"

#: data/json/scenarios.json data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Really Bad Day" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You start drunk to the point of incapacitation, depressed, infected, "
"surrounded by fire, and sick with the flu.  This day went downhill really "
"fast."
msgstr ""
"Vous commencez ivre au point d'en devenir incapable, déprimée, infectée, "
"entourée de feu et malade de la grippe.  Cette journée est partie en vrille "
"très rapidement."

#: data/json/scenarios.json data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Medieval Peasant" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Som nigromancie hath brought yow hidder!  Ye have only the hoose on youre "
"legges and the knyf at youre syde and youre prayeres to Marie moder of God."
msgstr ""
"De la nigromance vous a amené cy!  Vous n'avez qu'une robe sur vos jambes, le "
"coutel à vostre costé et vos oraisons à Marie, mère de Dieu."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Lab Patient" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The scientists stopped their experiments on you abruptly, leaving you behind "
"while they evacuated before lockdown.  Find a way to escape or starve to "
"death."
msgstr ""
"Les scientifiques ont arrêté brusquement leurs expériences sur vous, vous "
"laissant derrière eux pendant qu’ils évacuaient avant le confinement.  "
"Trouvez un moyen de vous échapper ou mourez de faim."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Lab Staff" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were deemed an essential employee and required to stay behind during the "
"lab's evacuation.  Find a way to escape or starve to death."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez considérée comme une employée essentielle et vous deviez rester "
"sur place pendant l'évacuation du laboratoire.  Trouvez un moyen de vous "
"échapper ou mourez de faim.  "

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Trans-Coast Logistics Concourse" for
#. female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were deemed an essential employee and required to stay behind during the "
"facility's evacuation.  You'd better find your lanyard with your badge before "
"the automated defenses notice that you don't have one."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez considérée comme une employée essentielle et vous deviez rester "
"sur place pendant l'évacuation de l'établissement.  Vous feriez mieux de "
"retrouver votre lanière avec votre badge avant que les défenses automatisées "
"ne s'aperçoivent que vous n'en avez pas.  "

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Bordered" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in one of the many government evac shelters.  While evacuating, you "
"noticed a mysterious sky-high wall in the distance, seemingly cutting off "
"travel in every direction around you."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez survécu à la première vague de panique et vous êtes "
"\"relativement\" en sécurité dans l'un des nombreux abris d'évacuation du "
"gouvernement.  Lors de votre évacuation, vous avez remarqué au loin un "
"mystérieux mur d'une hauteur vertigineuse, interrompant apparemment les "
"déplacements dans toutes les directions autour de vous."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Ambush" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"It is the winter after zero hour.  As you were scavenging for food and a warm "
"place to stay, you heard the sound of lots of movement nearby."
msgstr ""
"C'est l'hiver après minuit.  Alors que vous cherchiez de la nourriture et un "
"endroit chaleureux où séjourner, vous avez entendu de nombreux mouvements à "
"proximité."

#: data/json/scenarios.json data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "The Next Summer" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A little over a year has passed since the apocalypse started, and you're "
"about to face your second summer in Hell."
msgstr ""
"Un peu plus d'un an s'est écoulé depuis le début de l'apocalypse, et vous "
"êtes sur le point de faire face à votre deuxième été en Enfer."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Brave New World" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"It's been a year since the apocalypse, and winter is fast approaching.  You "
"and your company have managed to gather up enough supplies to finally settle "
"down somewhere, away from the death and destruction.  Life has been hard for "
"you, but in your heart you still hold a vision of a bright future lying ahead."
msgstr ""
"Cela fait un an depuis l'apocalypse et l'hiver approche à grands pas.  Vous "
"et vos compagnons avez réussi à rassembler suffisamment de provisions pour "
"enfin vous installer quelque part, loin de la mort et de la destruction.  La "
"vie a été dure pour vous, mais dans votre cœur vous avez toujours la vision "
"d’un avenir radieux qui vous attend."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Sheltered" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the apocalypse broke out, you were evacuated to a small underground "
"bunker.  Here you have lived, never leaving, lest the dangers of the unknown "
"find you.  Supplies are running low, and for the first time since the "
"Cataclysm, you will be forced to face the outside world."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque l’apocalypse a éclaté, vous avez été évacuée vers un petit bunker "
"souterrain.  Ici, vous avez vécu sans jamais partir, de peur que les dangers "
"de l'inconnu ne vous trouvent.  Les provisions s'épuisent et, pour la "
"première fois depuis le Cataclysme, vous serez obligée d'affronter le monde "
"extérieur.  "

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Abandoned" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Sickly and frail, you have spent most of your life in the patient's ward of "
"various hospitals.  When your current one was evacuated, you were considered "
"a lost cause and left behind.  You awaken to the sound of movement around the "
"hospital."
msgstr ""
"Malade et frêle, vous avez passé la plus grande partie de votre vie dans les "
"ailes de traitement de divers hôpitaux.  Lorsque votre dernière adresse a été "
"évacuée, vous avez été considérée comme une cause perdue et laissée pour "
"compte.  Vous vous réveillez au son de mouvements dans l'hôpital."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Prison" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm happened, you were convicted or working in a prison.  Now "
"the inmates and guards alike have turned into mindless horrors and joined "
"forces… you might need to expedite your escape plans."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque le Cataclysme s'est produit, vous avez été condamnée ou vous "
"travailliez dans une prison.  Maintenant, les détenues et les gardes se sont "
"transformées en horreurs insensées et ont uni leurs forces… vous devrez "
"peut-être accélérer vos plans d'évasion.  "

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Island Prison" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were convicted or working in a high-security prison before the Cataclysm. "
" Unfortunately, you're still in it, so you need to figure out how to escape.  "
"It's located on a remote island to boot; you'll eventually need to escape "
"that also."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez une prisonnière ou une employée dans une prison de haute sécurité "
"avant le Cataclysme.  Malheureusement, vous êtes encore à l'intérieur après, "
"et vous avez besoin de trouver un moyen de vous échapper.  De plus, la prison "
"a été construite sur une île isolée, et vous aurez donc besoin éventuellement "
"de trouver un moyen de sortir de là aussi."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Mi-Go Camp" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have found yourself in the most alien place you've ever seen.  The hot, "
"humid air and the organic appearance of the structure make you feel like "
"you're trapped inside a giant creature.  Whatever it is, you need to get out "
"of here before They find you."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous êtes retrouvée dans l'endroit le plus étrange que vous ayez jamais "
"vu, l'air chaud et humide et l'apparence organique de cette structure vous "
"donnent l'impression d'être piégée à l'intérieur d'une créature vivante. Peu "
"importe la nature de cette endroit, vous devez vous échapper avant qu'Ils "
"vous trouvent."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Experiment" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have been heavily experimented upon for the advancement of genetic "
"science, willingly or not.  Once the Cataclysm struck, you escaped the lab "
"and wandered aimlessly, ending up in a forest."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez une cobaye utilisée, volontairement ou non, pour faire progresser "
"la génétique. Lorsque le Cataclysme est survenu vous avez réussi à vous "
"échapper de votre laboratoire avant d'errer sans but au milieu d'une forêt."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "The Mascot Rises" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Business had been bad — for some reason, weeks of rioting, an evacuation "
"order, and the sky breaking with alien shadows prompted a downturn in foot "
"traffic, even among Foodplace's chain restaurants.  As an employee, upon "
"evacuation being declared, you disregarded company orders to lock up your "
"outlet and, along with another survivor, opted to close yourselves within the "
"breakroom to recuperate and plan your next move.  Will Foodplace's delicious "
"food™ be enough to placate the horde of hungry customers banging at the door?"
msgstr ""
"Les affaires allaient mal - pour une raison ou une autre, des semaines "
"d'émeutes, un ordre d'évacuation et des ombres extraterrestres dans le ciel "
"ont entraîné une baisse de la fréquentation, même dans les restaurants de la "
"chaîne Foodplace. En tant qu'employée, lorsque l'évacuation a été déclarée, "
"vous avez ignoré les ordres de l'entreprise de fermer votre point de vente "
"et, avec une autre survivante, vous avez choisi de vous enfermer dans la "
"salle de repos pour récupérer et planifier votre prochaine action. La "
"délicieuse nourriture de Foodplace™ suffira-t-elle à apaiser la horde de "
"clients affamés qui frappent à la porte ?"

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "The Last Delivery" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As the world was falling apart around you, something shook you out of your "
"stupor: a phone call on Foodplace's excellent delivery service line.  It was "
"the most incoherent babbling you've ever heard, but it was undeniably the "
"biggest order you've seen in your years working at Foodplace, and that merits "
"respect.  While you can't fix the tears in reality, this you can do!  You're "
"not sure of much anymore, but one thing is certain: that delicious food™ is "
"going to get delivered if it's the last thing you do!"
msgstr ""
"Alors que le monde s'écroulait autour de vous, quelque chose vous a tiré de "
"votre stupeur : un appel téléphonique sur la ligne de l'excellent service de "
"livraison de Foodplace. C'était le bavardage le plus incohérent que vous ayez "
"jamais entendu, mais c'était indéniablement la plus grosse commande que vous "
"ayez vue au cours de vos années de travail chez Foodplace, et cela mérite le "
"respect. Vous ne pouvez pas réparer les larmes en réalité, mais vous pouvez "
"faire ceci ! Vous n'êtes plus sûre de grand-chose, mais une chose est "
"certaine : cette délicieuse nourriture™ sera livrée si c'est la dernière "
"chose que vous faites !"

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Last Flight" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Once it became clear that the world was ending you took to the skies, hoping "
"that your flying skills could lead you to safety.  You found no standing safe "
"zones, and when your fuel ran out, were forced to land in open field."
msgstr ""
"Lorsqu'il est devenu évident que c'était la fin du monde, vous avez pris "
"l'avion, espérant que vos talents de pilote vous permettraient de vous mettre "
"à l'abri. Vous n'avez trouvé aucune zone de sécurité et, à court de "
"carburant, vous avez été contraintes d'atterrir en rase campagne."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Wilderness" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You find yourself among trees.  The screaming and moaning is fainter this far "
"from civilization, but you'd better know what you're doing out here."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous êtes retrouvé isolée au milieu d'une forêt. Les cris et les "
"gémissements sont atténués si loin de la civilisation, mais vous avez intérêt "
"à savoir vous débrouiller au milieu de la cambrousse."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Helicopter Crash" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"While being transported to a different military base, the pilot lost control "
"of the helicopter and crashed in the middle of nowhere.  You seem to be the "
"only survivor."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez à bord d'un hélicoptère vous transportant entre deux bases "
"militaires lorsque votre pilote a perdu contrôle de l'appareil et s'est "
"écrasé au milieu de nul part. Il semble que vous êtes la seule survivante."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Bottom of a Mine" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were participating in a mining operation when you found… something.  "
"You're not sure what, but it sure is dark down here."
msgstr ""
"Vous faisiez partie du personnel d'une mine quand vous avez trouvé… quelque "
"chose. Vous n'êtes pas sûre de ce que c'est, mais il fait affreusement noir."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Overrun" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Despite all the soldiers, guns, and minefields, the military base you were in "
"was overrun by the dead.  Everyone was ordered to fall back to the armory, "
"but during all the chaos you got lost and you are now stuck in the warehouse "
"by yourself.  You are not sure if anyone made it to the armory, or if you are "
"the last one alive."
msgstr ""
"Malgré tous les soldats, les armes et les champs de mines, la base militaire "
"dans laquelle vous vous trouviez a été envahie par les morts.  Tout le monde "
"a reçu l'ordre de se replier vers l'armurerie, mais pendant tout ce chaos, "
"vous vous êtes perdue et vous êtes maintenant coincée toute seul dans "
"l'entrepôt.  Vous ne savez pas si quelqu'un est arrivé à l'armurerie ou si "
"vous êtes la dernière en vie.  "

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Crazy Party" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You'd been unsurprised when your vacation — a hastily arranged holiday to a "
"remote resort to maintain distance from the riots — had been put out of its "
"misery when state-wide evacuation was ordered after weeks of worsening "
"violence, and the complex had been placed on a shortlist for civilian "
"gathering sites.  After days of waiting for a non-existent rescue and "
"refugees bringing tales of monsters and the dead, the remaining staff had "
"taken steps to keep spirits up, and last evening, they did that in the best "
"way they knew — hosting a party.  Considering that it lured scores of "
"zombies, you could probably classify that decision as a 'road to literal hell "
"paved with good intentions.'"
msgstr ""
"Vous n'avez pas été surprise lorsque vos vacances - un séjour organisé à la "
"hâte dans une station balnéaire isolée pour rester à l'écart des émeutes - "
"ont été interrompues lorsque l'évacuation de tout l'État a été ordonnée après "
"des semaines d'aggravation de la violence, et que le complexe a été placé sur "
"une liste restreinte de sites de rassemblement de la population civile. Après "
"des jours d'attente d'un sauvetage inexistant et de réfugié/es apportant des "
"récits de monstres et de morts, le personnel restant a pris des mesures pour "
"garder le moral, et hier soir, ils l'ont fait de la meilleure façon qu'ils "
"connaissaient : en organisant une fête. Si l'on considère que cette fête a "
"attiré des dizaines de zombies, on peut probablement qualifier cette décision "
"de « chemin de l'enfer littéral pavé de bonnes intentions »."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Car Crash" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You decided the open road would be a better prospect than the zombie-filled "
"cities.  While en route to your destination, you were involved in a crash "
"that totaled your vehicle.  Injured and alone, you'll need to think fast if "
"you want to survive."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez décidé que la route serait un meilleur choix que les villes "
"remplies de zombies.  Alors que vous conduisiez vers votre destination, vous "
"vous êtes retrouvée au milieu d'un accident qui a détruit votre véhicule.  "
"Blessée et seule, vous feriez mieux de réfléchir vite si vous voulez survivre."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Splintering Reality" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You found yourself alone in an open field when reality began to heave and "
"crack all around you.  You need to find shelter, and fast."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous retrouvez seule dans un champ ouvert lorsque la réalité commence à "
"se soulever et à craquer tout autour de vous. Vous devez trouver un abri, et "
"vite."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Stronger Portal Storms" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've managed to get to a shelter, but reality has grown weaker than normal, "
"and portal storms will be quite strong."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez réussi à trouver un abri, mais la réalité est devenue plus faible "
"que d'habitude et les tempêtes dimensionnelles seront assez fortes."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Frequent Portal Storms" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've managed to get to a shelter, but reality has grown weaker than normal, "
"and portal storms will be more frequent."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez réussi à trouver un abri, mais la réalité est devenue plus faible "
"que d'habitude et les tempêtes dimensionnelles seront plus fréquentes."

#: data/json/scenarios.json data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Portal Dependent" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were caught in a huge and unstable portal storm, and were utterly "
"unprotected from the full force of its effects.  You're on the tail end of "
"the storm now, and while you've survived, you feel… different."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez été prise dans une tempête dimensionnelle énorme et instable, et "
"vous n'étiez absolument pas protégée contre la pleine force de ses effets.  "
"Vous êtes maintenant à la fin de la tempête, et même si vous avez survécu, "
"vous vous sentez… différente."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Mansion Escape" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life when the world ended, surrounded by riches and "
"eating well every day.  Now you've woken up, alone and drugged, in a room of "
"your mansion that you don't recognize.  As you fight to remain conscious, you "
"hear heavy footsteps nearby.  Time to get the hell out of here."
msgstr ""
"Vous meniez la grande vie, entouré de richesses et mangeant bien tous les "
"jours lorsque le monde a pris à fin.  Maintenant, vous vous réveillez, seul "
"et drogué, dans une pièce de votre manoir que vous ne reconnaissez pas.  "
"Alors que vous luttez pour rester conscient, vous entendez des pas lourds à "
"proximité. Il est temps de foutre le camp d'ici."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Compromised Shelter" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in one of the many government evac shelters.  However, the people you "
"came with started to turn and now they're out for your flesh!  You've holed "
"up in the basement for now, but sooner or later you have to make for the "
"door… and fast!"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez survécu à la première vague de panique et vous étiez "
"\"relativement\" en sécurité dans l'un des nombreux abris d'évacuation du "
"gouvernement.  Cependant, les gens avec qui vous êtes venu ont commencé à se "
"transformer et maintenant ils veulent votre chair!  Vous êtes pour l'instant "
"enfermée dans le sous-sol, mais tôt ou tard, vous allez avoir besoin de vous "
"diriger vers la porte… et vite!"

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Aircraft Carrier" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were on a mission off the coast of North Korea when the aircraft carrier "
"you were stationed on suddenly and inexplicably found itself in the middle of "
"a lake.  You have no idea where you are or what's happened, but you have more "
"important things to worry about: everyone else aboard seems to have become "
"violently insane.  It might be time to abandon ship."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez en mission au large des côtes de la Corée du Nord lorsque le "
"porte-avions sur lequel vous étiez stationnée s'est soudainement et "
"inexplicablement retrouvé au milieu d'un lac.  Vous n'avez aucune idée d'où "
"vous êtes ni de ce qui s'est passé, mais vous avez des choses plus pressantes "
"dont vous soucier: le reste de l'équipage à l'air d'être devenu fou furieux "
"ou zombifié.  Il est peut-être temps d'abandonner le navire."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Golden Years" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After a lifetime of hard work, you managed to settle down in a posh "
"retirement community.  You saw the riots on the news but assumed they would "
"have no reason to attack some harmless old folks.  That assumption was proven "
"wrong by a group of lunatics breaking in, leaving you no choice but to deal "
"with them personally.  Welcome to your golden years."
msgstr ""
"Après une vie de travail acharné, vous avez réussi à vous installer dans une "
"communauté de retraités chic.  Vous avez vu les émeutes aux informations, "
"mais vous supposiez que personne n'aurait de raison de nuire à des personnes "
"âgées inoffensives.  Cette hypothèse s'est avérée fausse lorsqu'un groupe de "
"cinglés est entré par effraction, ne vous laissant d'autre choix que de vous "
"en occuper personnellement.  Bienvenue à vote âge d'or."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Emergency Shutdown" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm happened, you were working in a nuclear power plant.  Now "
"you're trapped inside, surrounded by the shambling bodies of what used to be "
"your coworkers.  The reactor's shut down, but you don't know if there's been "
"a radiation leak and you need to get away from here fast before you find out "
"the hard way."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque le Cataclysme est survenu, vous étiez de service dans une centrale "
"nucléaire. Vous êtes maintenant piégée à l'intérieur, cernée par les cadavres "
"titubants de vos ancients collègues. Le réacteur a heureusement été arrêté, "
"mais vous n'êtes pas sûr si une fuite radioactive est survenue et vous feriez "
"mieux de vous éloigner d'ici rapidement avant de découvrir cela par vous même."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Close Encounter" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You don't know what it was but you managed to lose it for the time being.  "
"Now you are injured, surrounded and the building is on fire.  You hope you "
"have some time before it returns to finish the job."
msgstr ""
"Vous ne savez pas ce que c'était mais vous avez réussi à le perdre pour le "
"moment.  Vous êtes désormais blessée, encerclée et le bâtiment est en feu.  "
"Vous espérez avoir un peu de temps avant que cette chose ne revienne pour "
"terminer le travail."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Surrounded in the Dark" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were camping in the wild to let things back home cool off.  One night "
"strange noises closed in on you and you were attacked.  You managed to get "
"away but can feel things moving in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Vous campiez dans la nature pour laisser les choses se calmer à la maison.  "
"Une nuit, des bruits étranges se sont rapprochés de vous et vous avez été "
"agressée.  Vous avez réussi à vous enfuir mais vous sentez que des choses "
"bougent dans l'obscurité."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Lone Survivor" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are the only one that made it.  Everyone else died nearby.  You have to "
"get out of here!"
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes la seule à s'en être sortie.  Tous les autres sont morts à "
"proximité.  Vous devez sortir d'ici!"

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Between a Rock and a Hard Place" for
#. female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were trying to scavenge for supplies, and now some rough group of bandits "
"has dragged monsters in with them where you were hiding!"
msgstr ""
"Vous essayiez juste de récupérer des provisions, et voilà qu'un groupe de "
"bandits a attiré des monstres avec eux là où vous vous cachiez!"

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Shattered Sky" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"From up here, you watched it all fall apart.  The sky cracked and "
"indescribable alien shapes writhed in the clouds.  The horizon has returned "
"to normal, but you still see shadows moving in the corner of your eye and "
"feel them calling you."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez vu tout s'effondrer de là haut.  Le ciel se déchira et des formes "
"d'outre-monde indescriptibles se tordaient dans les nuages.  L'horizon est "
"revenu à la normale, mais vous voyez toujours des ombres bouger dans le coin "
"de votre œil et vous les sentez vous appeler."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Low Profile" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You heard the global, worsening news and saw the nightmare in the cities "
"firsthand — a situation that prompted you to jump from low-rent motel to "
"cheap trailer, trying to outrun the madness.  While only you know where you'd "
"planned to go, when you heard the government's last broadcast and realized "
"'no help was coming,' you resolved to raise a dejected toast and sink to the "
"bottom of a bottle for as long as you could.  What happened in the following "
"days of drunken stupor is an enigma.  What you do know, is that it's time to "
"see how much of the world there's left to return to."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez entendu les nouvelles mondiales qui s'aggravaient et vous avez vu "
"de vos propres yeux le cauchemar dans les villes - une situation qui vous a "
"poussé à sauter d'un motel à loyer modéré à une caravane bon marché, en "
"essayant d'échapper à la folie. Vous seule savez où vous aviez prévu d'aller, "
"mais lorsque vous avez entendu le dernier message du gouvernement et que vous "
"avez compris qu'aucune aide n'arrivait, vous avez décidé de porter un toast "
"découragé et de vous enfoncer au fond d'une bouteille aussi longtemps que "
"vous le pouviez. Ce qui s'est passé au cours des jours suivants de stupeur "
"alcoolique est une énigme. Ce que vous savez, c'est qu'il est temps de voir "
"ce qu'il reste du monde à retrouver."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Mass Quarantine" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When FEMA camps ran out of space the authorities used what was left of their "
"manpower to round up people at gunpoint.  The stadiums they forced everyone "
"into did nothing to slow down the madness and it spread like wildfire.  You "
"managed to slip away from the worst violence but you are now surrounded and "
"need to escape quickly!"
msgstr ""
"Lorsque les camps FEMA ont manqué d'espace, les autorités ont utilisé ce qui "
"restait de leurs effectifs pour rassembler les gens sous la menace des armes. "
" Les stades dans lesquels ils ont forcé tout le monde n’ont rien fait pour "
"ralentir la folie et elle s’est propagée comme une traînée de poudre.  Vous "
"avez réussi à échapper aux pires violences mais vous êtes désormais encerclée "
"et devez vous échapper au plus vite!"

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Middle of Nowhere" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"During your escape you got lost and ended up at the wrong location.  Get your "
"bearings and make a plan.  You'll need it."
msgstr ""
"Lors de votre fuite, vous vous êtes perdue et vous vous êtes retrouvée dans "
"une mauvaise situation.  Établissez vos repères et commencez à planifier ce "
"que vous allez faire.  Vous en aurez besoin."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Lost Underground" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the riots came to your home, you ran underground and hid.  Now days "
"later you are lost and hear movement echoing in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque les émeutes ont éclaté chez vous, vous avez couru sous terre et vous "
"êtes cachée.  Aujourd'hui, quelques jours plus tard, vous êtes perdue et "
"entendez des mouvements résonner dans le noir."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Last Stand" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Together with some others you decided to take up arms against the horde.  Now "
"you are reconsidering whether that was a wise choice."
msgstr ""
"Vous et plusieurs autres on décidé de brandir vos armes contre la horde. Vous "
"êtes peut être en train de reconsidérer si cela était très avisé."

#: data/json/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "A Moonlight Night" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've been holed up in your basement ever since the Cataclysm happened a "
"little over a week ago, but now you've run out of food and have been forced "
"to go on a supply run on this fateful moonlit night.  You see zombies all "
"around you, but thankfully, most of them can't seem to see as well in "
"moonlight as you do."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes terrée dans votre cave depuis le cataclysme qui s'est produit il y "
"a un peu plus d'une semaine, mais vous n'avez plus rien à manger et vous êtes "
"obligée de partir à l'assaut des réserves en cette funeste nuit de clair de "
"lune. Vous voyez des zombies tout autour de vous, mais heureusement, la "
"plupart d'entre eux ne semblent pas voir aussi bien que vous au clair de lune."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/scenarios.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Robots" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"During the riots and chaos, you hid in a robot dispatch center hoping the "
"robots would protect you, but they may prove more dangerous than the zombies."
msgstr ""
"Pendant les émeutes et le chaos, vous vous êtes caché dans un centre de "
"répartition des robots dans l'espoir que les robots vous protégeraient, mais "
"ils pourraient s'avérer plus dangereux que les zombies."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Scavenger's Frontier" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The Cryosleeper slow approach allows the display of Salus IV through all its "
"forms: a fiery marble against interstellar darkness, a silver-white mirror, "
"and a final world of glaciers split by the thin ruins of an equatorial "
"metroplex.  Before long, Port Augustmoon's ancient hull comes to obstruct "
"most the viewport, and the ship's computer announces that it is time to "
"disembark."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Stranded Spacer" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"What was to be a routine cargo transfer ended in tragedy when, in a brief "
"moment of chaos, your space ship was intercepted and destroyed by a StO "
"missile.  As soon as the MAW alarm flared to life, you scrambled to the "
"nearest escape pod and barely managed to reach the uncertain safety of the "
"planet below."
msgstr ""
"Ce qui était censé être un transfert de cargo routinier se conclu en tragédie "
"lorsque durant un bref moment de chaos votre vaisseau spatial fut intercepté "
"et détruit par un missile sol-orbite. Dès que l'alarme MAW a commencé à "
"résonner à travers les couloirs vous vous êtes pressée vers la capsule de "
"sauvetage la plus proche et n'avez presque pas réussi à atteindre la sûreté "
"douteuse de la planète la plus proche."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "One Last Dance on the Ice" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've chased your quarry from the tragedies they left behind in the core of "
"civilized space; all the way out here to the fringes of inhabited space.  You "
"caught up with their ship here in the Salus system, and heavily damaged it, "
"but the combat didn't leave your ship unscathed.  Opportunistic scavengers or "
"pirates you don't know which ambushed you as you were harrying your mark's "
"ship and forcing it to ground.  You know they'll have crash landed somewhere "
"on this planet but your ship, Truth and Reconciliation will never fly again.  "
"You won't even walk away from this icy wreck if you can't destroy the squad "
"of drones and scavenger bots that have dropped in to finish you off."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/scenarios.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Abnormal Augmentations" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've already been modified mutagenically but now you were all ready for a "
"bionic implant or three - the bill footed by the corp, of course - when "
"everything went pear-shaped and all you could hear from the other rooms was "
"screaming.  For a few hours, at least.  Now all you can hear is shuffling, "
"crackling, the occasional gurgling, burbling moan, and heavy, wet thumps.  "
"Hopefully your surgery was registered as an elective because you've elected "
"to get the heck out of here!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Emergency Evacuation" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You must have hit your head when the first explosion happened.  You sit up "
"and realize everyone is gone, that the air smells like smoke, and that the "
"ship's computer is calmly announcing in a posh English voice 'Abandon the "
"vessel immediately.', and then counting down from seven minutes.  Time to "
"grab what you can and find an escape pod."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Esper" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"There are stories that before the Discontinuity, scientists had developed "
"treatments to unlock the powers of the human mind.  To read thoughts, move "
"objects at a distance, control computers by the power of will alone, and even "
"stranger things.  Just one more lost secret of the Golden Age.\n"
"\n"
"Or so you thought, but recently you had heard some tantalizing rumors about "
"espers, centered on a backwater planet on the edge of known civilization.  "
"You remember buying passage to the Salus system, arriving at Port Augustmoon "
"and buying supplies, and descending to the surface, and after that…things get "
"hazy.  You're not entirely sure where you are, and you've clearly been "
"through it, but somehow you've rediscovered that lost secret.  Now you just "
"need to make it back alive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Backrooms" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "What is this place?  You can't seem to find your way back out."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Backrooms (NPC EDITION)" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"What is this place?  You can't seem to find your way back out.  But hey, at "
"least you aren't alone.  Will you cannibalize them as a last resort?  Maybe "
"get them to surgically implant bionics into you?  Just keep them around for "
"company?  Maybe you two will protect each other?  The possibilities have just "
"widened, my friend, for you are no longer one.  You are two, and that's "
"better than what it used to be like."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Fortified" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You do not know who you are, nor do you know why you're here.  All you know "
"is that you must fight and defend yourself from the horde."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Hunted by Dinosaurs" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You find yourself among trees.  The screaming and moaning is fainter, but it "
"sounds like something bigger and more dangerous is close by."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous retrouvez au milieu d'une forêt. Vous entendez beaucoup moins de "
"cris et de gémissements, mais quelque chose de massif et dangereux rôde dans "
"les environs."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Woke up in a Dinosaur Nest" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "When you wake up, you find yourself in the swamp next to some large eggs."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque vous vous réveillez, vous vous retrouvez au milieu d'un marais à côté "
"de gros œufs."

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Fractal facility" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Room by room and level by level the facility drills into depths beyond the "
"logical.  An endless mode where the only goal is to reach the lowest level "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"Pièce par pièce et niveau par niveau, l'installation s'enfonce dans des "
"profondeurs qui dépassent l'entendement.  Un mode sans fin où le seul but est "
"d'atteindre le niveau le plus bas possible."

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - One Legged Man In An Ass Kicking
#. Contest" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"While trying to escape town, you had to dodge a horde into your holdout, "
"becoming separated from your compatriots.  You've only got one leg to your "
"name, no arms, and now you're surrounded by zombies.  Just how are you going "
"to get out of this one?"
msgstr ""
"En essayant de fuir la ville, vous avez dû esquiver une horde et vous "
"carapater dans votre repaire, perdant la trace de vos compagnons.  Vous "
"n'avez qu'une jambe, pas de bras, et maintenant vous êtes entourée de "
"zombies.  Comment allez-vous vous en sortir?"

#: data/mods/MA/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Massachusetts" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "Somewhere in New England."
msgstr "Quelque part en Nouvelle-Angleterre."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Lost Faith" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've been preaching your faith for a long time, but the recent events have "
"begun to make you doubt it.  Wandering in your temple, you just found books "
"that may restore your faith or shatter it completely."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "The Wizard's Apprentice" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have been an apprentice to a wizard for some time now, working on a "
"prototype device that could perhaps be used to escape from the Cataclysm.  "
"Something went wrong with the maiden voyage though, and your teacher "
"teleported his insides into his outsides.  Now you have to figure out how to "
"survive on your own.  At least he left his notebook…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Last Mage on Earth" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the chaos that led up to the Cataclysm began, your teacher told you "
"about a secret hideout they had prepared in the event of a terrible disaster "
"and suggested that you go wait there for a couple weeks to wait out the worst "
"of the riots.  As it turned out, things got much worse than you imagined, and "
"as the weeks turned into months and your teacher grew more and more agitated, "
"they prepared a ritual that they hoped would turn back time and allow you to "
"return to the weeks before the Cataclysm to warn the world.\n"
"\n"
"While waiting in the library for the ritual to conclude, you just heard a "
"scream from the ritual room and some rustling elsewhere in the shelter.  "
"You're not sure you're so safe here anymore…"
msgstr ""
"Lorsque le chaos précédant le Cataclysme commença, votre maître vous a "
"informé d'un refuge secret qu'il avait préparé en cas d'un désastre terrible "
"et vous suggéra de vous y cacher pour quelques semaines en attendant que le "
"pire des émeutes passe. Il s'est avéré que les choses ont pris un tournant "
"encore plus horrible que ce qu'il avait imaginé, et lorsque les semaines se "
"sont transformées en mois votre maître est devenu de plus en plus agité et "
"commença à préparer un rituel qu'il espérait pourrait vous renvoyer dans le "
"passé et avertir le monde du danger imminent.\n"
"\n"
"Vous étiez en train d'étudier dans la bibliothèque en attendant que le rituel "
"soit complété lorsque vous avez entendu un cri venant de la pièce à rituel et "
"un fracas quelque part d'autre dans le refuge. Vous n'êtes plus vraiment sûre "
"que vous devriez rester ici…"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "The Wizard's Vacation" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have been an apprentice to a wizard for some time now, you've saved for "
"years for your dream vacation at a secluded wizard tower.  Your journey of "
"self-discovery is interrupted by the Cataclysm.  Now you have to figure out "
"how to survive on your own."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Exile" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are an exile, whether because of people shunning you because of who you "
"are or from a personal choice.  The dead aren't willing to leave you be."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Dimension-Lost" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You don't understand what happened.  You were readying for a routine jump at "
"the Far Hebrides transfer point when there was a power cascade in the drive "
"and now you're here, on some other version of Tlalticpactli that may as well "
"be one of the worse levels of Mictlān.  You need to find your way back home, "
"but first you need to find a way to survive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Mindhunter" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you "
"relentlessly.  You can try to fight it, but each time it falls it will rise "
"again, its powers growing stronger and stronger.  The only escape is for you "
"to die."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Heart of Fire" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You always loved setting fires as a child, sometimes spending hours just "
"watching the flames.  That fire awakened in you during the Cataclysm, "
"powerful and almost uncontrollable.  You can call up flames from thin air, "
"burn zombies to ash with a thought, surround yourself in a blazing inferno, "
"but the fire demands release.  It's like a internal pressure, growing as long "
"as you don't use your powers, until it flows out as the flames rise.  Can you "
"survive in the new world without burning yourself to ash?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "The Sweet Life" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You open your eyes as if for the first time.  Looking at yourself, you can "
"see your skin glisten in the light.  One word comes to your mind: \"sugar\".  "
"You don't remember where you learned it, and in fact you don't seem to "
"remember anything.  Despite the circumstances, you feel quite hopeful.  "
"Everything feels new and you're going to make the best of it!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/scenario.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Warper" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As if the world ending wasn't enough, it seems some kind of extradimensional "
"powers that be have taken an interest in you.  You have been placed on a "
"floating island high above the Earth, safe but isolated.  Only by using the "
"reality-bending powers of warp technology can you visit the world below in "
"brief, randomly-targeted excursions.  Venture down, gather supplies, and "
"return with only what you can carry to upgrade your home base and your stash "
"over time.  The powers of the warp make you unable to ever truly die, so on "
"failing such an expedition, you will simply lose all items and equipment you "
"were carrying and be swiftly returned home at low health."
msgstr ""
"Comme si la fin du monde n'était pas assez, on dirait que vous avez suscité "
"l'intérêt de pouvoirs extradimensionnels.  Vous vous êtes retrouvée placée "
"sur une île flottant à très haute altitude, en sécurité mais aussi totale "
"isolation.  Vous n'êtes capable que de faire que des incursions courtes vers "
"des zones aléatoires à la surface en utilisant une technologie de "
"téléportation capable de déformer la réalité aux alentours.  Téléportez vous, "
"collectez des objets utiles, et retournez qu'avec ce que vous pouvez porter "
"pour améliorer votre refuge et votre pile de butin au fil du temps.  Les "
"pouvoirs de votre mode de transport vous rendent incapable de jamais vraiment "
"mourir, et une expédition échouée à pour seule conséquence de perdre tout ce "
"que vous aviez sur vous et de vous ramener à votre île avec des points de vie "
"bas."

#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Evacuee" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in one of the many government evac shelters.  You also took the time "
"to cobble together some improvised weaponry!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Scavenger" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are getting by in the Apocalypse.  Your gear is still scavenged from the "
"ruins of the old world, but you have gathered the skills to use it to good "
"effect.  Midsummer start."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Survivor" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are as close to thriving as anybody can be these days.  Your gear is "
"handcrafted with the threats of the new world in mind, and your skills are "
"honed to perfection.  Mid-autumn start."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/scenario.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Paraclesian Birth" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your first moments of life.  An elemental fae birth on a dying world.  Now "
"you have to figure out how to survive on your own.  (Select the location that "
"matches your profession or you may have a short journey)  P.S. This scenario "
"is still in development, PRs for additional content welcome."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/scenario.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Werewolf, Natural-born" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You had no idea what was going on the first time it happened, when you woke "
"up with mud on your bare feet and a sour taste in your mouth, but you were "
"soon found.  The People of the Moon, they called themselves, and they said "
"you were one of them.  A werewolf.  You lived out in the wilderness for a "
"while but didn't entirely abandon human civilization, and when the Cataclysm "
"hit you ignored the evacuation warnings and struck it out on your own.  Maybe "
"some of the People are still out there."
msgstr ""
"La première fois que cela s'est produit, tu n'avais aucune idée de ce qui se "
"passait. Tu t'es réveillé avec de la boue sur tes pieds nus et un goût amer "
"dans la bouche, mais tu as rapidement été trouvé. Les Gens de la Lune, comme "
"ils s'appelaient, t'ont dit que tu étais l'un d'eux. Un loup-garou. Tu as "
"vécu dans la nature pendant un temps, mais tu n'as pas complètement abandonné "
"la civilisation humaine, et lorsque le Cataclysme a frappé, tu as ignoré les "
"avertissements d'évacuation et tu es parti seul. Peut-être que certains des "
"Gens sont toujours là-bas."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/scenario.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Once Bitten" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Whether you were visiting Salem's Lot, boating on the Demeter, vacationing to "
"Transylvania, or just another lost boy or girl, you've been bitten by a "
"stranger at twilight the night before.  As a new day breaks you might want to "
"find someone to interview about how you are feeling.  Dark shadows feel more "
"inviting than yesterday and you don't feel like you are long for the day "
"shift."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/scenario.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "The Owl's Abode" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"For most or all of your life, you've had a secret; you are a predator.  While "
"you don't need to drink blood or eat flesh or anything so crude, you must "
"absorb the spiritual essence, the \"ruach\", of living beings in order to "
"maintain your health and vitality.  You had to hide your condition before the "
"Cataclysm, especially as things became stranger in the years leading up to "
"it, but now you don't have to hide anymore.  On the other hand, your "
"potential ruach supply has taken a drastic decline."
msgstr ""
"La majorité de votre existence, vous avez dissimulé un secret: vous êtes une "
"prédatrice.  Vous n'avez pas besoin de boire du sang ou de manger de la chair "
"ou quoi que ce soit d'aussi barbare, mais il vous est nécessaire d'absorber "
"de l'essence spirituelle, le \"ruach\" d'êtres vivants pour maintenir votre "
"corps et santé.  Il vous était nécessaire de ne pas rendre cela public avant "
"le Cataclysme, surtout lorsque les choses ont commencé à devenir de plus en "
"plus étranges avant que l'apocalypse soit arrivée, mais maintenant vous ne "
"devriez plus avoir besoin de vivre dans la peur.  D'un autre côté, les "
"sources potentielles de ruach se sont drastiquement diminuées en abondance."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/scenario.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Temporal Misadventure" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"During the Cataclysmic portal storms, you and several other people were lost "
"trying to escape the monsters attacking you.  Eventually, something caught "
"up, and as your fellows started turning into frozen statues you ran straight "
"into what should have been open air.  The pain of that impact was nothing "
"compared to the knife you suddenly found stabbed into your torso.  The most "
"you saw of your attacker was a quick blur before everything suddenly changed. "
" Snow covers the ground, the sun has set, you are freezing cold, and the "
"knife is still stuck in your torso.  However, you've gained a dramatic new "
"sense of time, and what is definitely the beginning of the ability to "
"manipulate it.  Even beyond the knife and the winter you never thought you'd "
"have to prepare for, your new powers tell you that there is much more wrong "
"with you than is immediately apparent.  Hopefully you can use your skills and "
"powers to survive both your new condition and every other horror of the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/innawood/player/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Paraclesian Birth, Lost and Alone" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your first moments of life, born of the elements, alone.  An elemental fae on "
"a dying world, lost in the wilderness."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/innawood/player/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Werewolf, Natural-born" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You had no idea what was going on the first time it happened, when you woke "
"up with mud on your bare feet and a sour taste in your mouth, but you were "
"soon found.  The People of the Moon, they called themselves, and they said "
"you were one of them.  A werewolf.  You lived out in the wilderness for a "
"while with them.  Maybe some of the People are still out there."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/innawood/player/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Werewolf, Naked and Unafraid" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have no idea what happened, but you're alone in the unspoiled wilderness. "
" You have mud on your feet, none of your clothes or possessions, and you "
"don't know where you are.  But you have learned there's a beast inside you, "
"and anyone who crosses you had best beware."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/innawood/player/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "The Owl, Naked and Afraid" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"For most or all of your life, you've had a secret; you are a predator.  While "
"you don't need to drink blood or eat flesh or anything so crude, you must "
"absorb the spiritual essence, the \"ruach\", of living beings in order to "
"maintain your health and vitality.  Something happened, and now you're alone "
"in the wilderness, without any of your possessions.  You'd best find others "
"quick, or you'll wither away."
msgstr ""
"La majorité de votre existence, vous avez dissimulé un secret: vous êtes une "
"prédatrice.  Vous n'avez pas besoin de boire du sang ou de manger de la chair "
"ou quoi que ce soit d'aussi barbare,  mais il vous est nécessaire d'absorber "
"de l'essence spirituelle, le \"ruach\" d'êtres vivants pour maintenir votre "
"corps et santé.  Quelque chose s'est passé, et vous êtes maintenant seule au "
"milieu de nulle part sans rien sur vous.  Vous feriez mieux de trouver "
"quelque chose à vous mettre sur la peau, et plus important, quelqu'un depuis "
"qui vous pouvez puiser votre sustenance."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/innawood/player/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Once Bitten" for female
#. ~ Description of scenario "Once Bitten, Naked and Afraid" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Whether you were visiting Salem's Lot, boating on the Demeter, vacationing to "
"Transylvania, or just another lost boy or girl, you've been bitten by a "
"stranger at twilight the night before.  And to make matters worse, when you "
"woke up, you were alone in the wilderness with no sign of humanity anywhere.  "
"You're going to have to survive somehow."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Scavenger's Frontier" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The Cryosleeper's slow approach allows the display of Salus IV in all its "
"forms: a fiery marble against interstellar darkness, a silver-white mirror, "
"and finally, a world of glaciers split by the thin ruins of an equatorial "
"metroplex.  Before long, Port Augustmoon's ancient hull comes to obstruct "
"most the viewport, and the ship's computer announces that it is time to "
"disembark."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "One Last Dance on the Ice" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've chased your quarry from the tragedies they left behind in the core of "
"civilized space; all the way out here to the fringes of inhabited space.  You "
"caught up with their ship here in the Salus system, and heavily damaged it.  "
"But the combat didn't leave your ship unscathed.  Opportunistic scavengers or "
"pirates, you don't know which, ambushed you as you were harrying your mark's "
"ship and forcing it to ground.  You know your quarry have crash landed "
"somewhere on this planet but your ship, Truth and Reconciliation, will never "
"fly again.  You won't even walk away from this icy wreck if you can't destroy "
"the squad of drones and scavenger bots that have dropped in to finish you off."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Emergency Evacuation" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You must have hit your head when the first explosion happened.  You sit up "
"and realize everyone is gone, the air smells like smoke, and that the ship's "
"computer is calmly announcing in its posh English voice: \"Abandon vessel "
"immediately, seven minutes to atmospheric entry.  Abandon vessel "
"immediately…\" Time to grab what you can and find an escape pod."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Esper" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"There are stories that before the Discontinuity, scientists had developed "
"secret treatments unlock the powers of the human mind.  To read thoughts, "
"move objects at a distance, control computers by the power of will alone, "
"were just a few of the rumored abilities that laid dormant and at the edge of "
"human potential.  But all knowledge of these treatments was lost when the "
"Discontinuity shattered interstellar civilization.\n"
"\n"
"Or so you thought, until you had heard some tantalizing rumors about espers, "
"centered on a backwater planet on the edge of known civilization.  You "
"remember buying passage to the Salus system, arriving at Port Augustmoon, "
"buying supplies, and descending to the surface, but after that things get "
"hazy…  You're not entirely sure where you are, and you've clearly been "
"through it, but somehow you've rediscovered that lost secret.  Now you just "
"need to make it back alive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Stranded Spacer" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"What was to be a routine cargo transfer ended in tragedy when, in a brief "
"moment of chaos, your space ship was intercepted and destroyed by a StO "
"missile.  As soon as the MAW alarm flared to life, you scrambled to the "
"nearest escape pod and barely managed reach the uncertain safety of the "
"planet below."
msgstr ""
"Ce qui était censé être un transfert de cargo routinier se conclu en tragédie "
"lorsque durant un bref moment de chaos votre vaisseau spatial fut intercepté "
"et détruit par un missile sol-orbite. Dès que l'alarme MAW a commencé à "
"résonner à travers les couloirs vous vous êtes pressée vers la capsule de "
"sauvetage la plus proche et n'avez presque pas réussi à atteindre la sûreté "
"douteuse de la planète la plus proche."

#: data/mods/deadly_bites/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Deadly Virus Infection" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In the panic of a fleeing crowd, you were bitten by what you can only "
"describe as a zombie.  A prickling sensation and a sense of doom washes over "
"you, and you're not sure whether it's some kind of rabies or not.  Better "
"seek out some antivirals just in case…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/extra_mut_scen/mutation_scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Mutant - Pre Threshold" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "Start as a Pre Threshold Mutant"
msgstr "Commencer le jeu en tant qu'une mutante n'ayant pas encore franchi un seuil"

#: data/mods/extra_mut_scen/mutation_scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Mutant - Prime Threshold" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "Start as a post-threshold Prime Mutant"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/extra_mut_scen/mutation_scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Mutant - Batrachian Threshold" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "Start as a post-threshold Batrachian Mutant"
msgstr "Commencer le jeu en tant que Mutante Batracienne ayant franchi le seuil"

#: data/mods/extra_mut_scen/mutation_scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Mutant - Crustacean Threshold" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "Start as a post-threshold Crustacean Mutant"
msgstr "Commencer le jeu en tant que Mutante Crustacéenne ayant franchi le seuil"

#: data/mods/extra_mut_scen/mutation_scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Mutant - Gastropod Threshold" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "Start as a post-threshold Gastropod Mutant"
msgstr "Commencer le jeu en tant que Mutante Gastropode ayant franchi le seuil"

#: data/mods/extra_mut_scen/mutation_scenarios.json
