msgid "Epicuticle"
msgstr "Épicuticule"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"STOP, Put your hands in the air!  Ha, startled you didn't I… there is no law "
"anymore…"
msgstr ""
"STOP, mettez vos mains en l'air!  Ha, je vous ai fait peur… il n'y a plus de "
"loi…"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was watching the station when things went sideways.  None of the other "
"officers returned from the last call, well not as humans anyway…"
msgstr ""
"J'étais de garde à la station quand les choses ont dérapé.  Aucun des autres "
"officiers n'est revenu de leur dernier appel, en tout cas pas en tant "
"qu'humains…"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"This is a nice, secure building.  I'd be a fool to leave.  Been living off "
"the vending machines, but I found the code for the evidence lockup so I've "
"been doing some trading with other survivors."
msgstr ""
"C'est un bâtiment agréable et sûr. Je serais idiot de partir. J'ai vécu des "
"distributeurs automatiques, mais j'ai trouvé le code de la salle des preuves, "
"alors j'ai fait quelques échanges avec d'autres survivants."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I… I'm free.  *Zzzt* I'm actually free!  *bzzz* Look, you're the first person "
"I've seen in a long time."
msgstr ""
"Je… Je suis libre.  *Zzzt* Je suis vraiment libre! *bzzz* Écoutez, vous êtes "
"la première personne que je vois depuis longtemps."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm a priest or guide of a sort.  I sing the hymns along my companions so "
"that we may learn to live in unity, both with each other and with our ailing "
"world."
msgstr ""
"Je suis une sorte de prêtre ou de guide. Je chante les hymnes avec mes "
"compagnons afin que nous apprenions à vivre en unité, les uns avec les autres "
"et avec notre monde malade."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I heard it's bad in the cities, back when the radio was still working.  Some "
"of those things came through here.  I want to stay out in the country if I "
"can stay safe."
msgstr ""
"J'ai entendu dire que c'était terrible dans les villes, à l'époque où la "
"radio fonctionnait encore. Certaines de ces choses sont arrivées jusqu'ici. "
"Je veux rester à la campagne si je peux rester en sécurité."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm a lot better now, I've been hunkering down here.  Something came by in "
"the night screaming and crying, sounded just like that woman.  Maybe a ghost, "
"I don't know.  It's good to have company again.  You're not a ghost, right?  "
"On second thought, don't tell me if you are, I probably don't want to know."
msgstr ""
"Je vais beaucoup mieux maintenant, je me suis blottie ici. Quelque chose est "
"venu dans la nuit en criant et en pleurant, ça ressemblait exactement à cette "
"femme. Peut-être un fantôme, je ne sais pas. C'est bon d'avoir à nouveau de "
"la compagnie. Tu n'es pas un fantôme, n'est-ce pas ? À bien y réfléchir, ne "
"me dis pas si tu l'es, je n'ai probablement pas envie de le savoir."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I grew up on the farm, I don't know much about ghosts and goblins, but I've "
"spent a lot of time growing food and I work hard.  It's better in the "
"country, cleaner.  Not as dangerous.  I hope."
msgstr ""
"J'ai grandi à la ferme, je ne sais pas grand chose sur les fantômes et les "
"gobelins, mais j'ai passé beaucoup de temps à cultiver de la nourriture et je "
"travaille dur. C'est mieux à la campagne, plus propre. Pas aussi dangereux. "
"J'espère."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Hey, I didn't expect to live long enough to see another living human!"
msgstr ""
"Hé, je ne m’attendais pas à vivre assez longtemps pour voir un autre être "
"humain vivant !"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I've been here since shit went down.  Just my luck I had to work."
msgstr ""
"Je suis ici depuis que la situation s'est détériorée. J'ai eu de la chance de "
"devoir travailler."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, the dishwasher made a break for it three days after things got weird.  "
"He was ripped to shreds before he made it to the street.  I figure this place "
"has gotta be safer than my apartment, and at least I've got all this food "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, le laveur de vaisselle a pris la fuite trois jours après que les "
"choses aient dégénéré. Il a été déchiqueté avant d'atteindre la rue. Je pense "
"que cet endroit doit être plus sûr que mon appartement, et au moins j'ai "
"toute cette nourriture ici."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I… um… hid.  I was in the kitchen, preparing another masterpiece when I heard "
"glass shattering followed by screaming.  I ran over to the serving window to "
"see what happened, assuming a guest had fallen and broke something.  What I "
"witnessed was the most awful thing I've ever seen.  I'm not even sure I could "
"go over it again."
msgstr ""
"Je… me suis cachée… J'était dans la cuisine, en train de préparer un nouveau "
"chef d'œuvre lorsque j'ai entendu du verre brisé et une cacophonie de cris "
"suivre cela. J'ai couru vers la fenêtre de service, assumant qu'un des "
"clients été tombé, brisant quelque chose par accident.  Ce qui c'est passé de "
"l'autre côté de cette fenêtre restera probablement la pire chose que j'ai "
"jamais vue.  Je ne suis pas sûre que j'ai envie de décrire cela à nouveau."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Some lunatic covered in a film of goo, black as oil, had fallen through one "
"of the large glass windows.  There were glass shards stuck in its head and "
"neck.  I thought the poor guy, girl-thing-whatever was dead.  People began to "
"crowd around it, some were taking pictures."
msgstr ""
"Un fou, recouvert d'une pellicule gluante, noire comme du pétrole, était "
"tombé à travers l'une des grandes vitres. Des éclats de verre étaient coincés "
"dans sa tête et son cou. J'ai cru que le pauvre type, la fille, était mort. "
"Les gens ont commencé à se rassembler autour de lui, certains prenaient des "
"photos."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"No!  I figured the thing dead until it started writhing and spazzing out for "
"a moment.  Everyone jumped back, a few screamed, and one curious stranger "
"stepped in closer, kneeling a little… it attacked him!"
msgstr ""
"Non!  J'ai cru que la chose était morte jusqu'à ce qu'elle se mette à se "
"tordre et à s'agiter pendant un moment.  Tout le monde a reculé, quelques uns "
"ont crié, et un étranger curieux s'est approché, s'est agenouillé un peu… la "
"chose l'a attaqué!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I ran to the back of the kitchen and hid as best I could.  People outside "
"were screaming and I could hear them running.  Suddenly I heard more glass "
"shatter and something skitter out of the restaurant.  I waited a moment and "
"then went and checked the dining area.  Both the stranger and the thing were "
"gone.  People were running in the streets, some even had guns so I locked all "
"the doors and blocked the windows with what I could and barricaded myself in "
"here."
msgstr ""
"J'ai couru vers le fond de la cuisine et je me suis cachée du mieux que j'ai "
"pu. Les gens à l'extérieur criaient et je les entendais courir. Soudain, j'ai "
"entendu d'autres éclats de verre et quelque chose qui sortait du restaurant. "
"J'ai attendu un moment, puis je suis allée voir ce qui se passait dans la "
"salle à manger. L'étranger et la chose avaient disparu. Les gens couraient "
"dans les rues, certains étaient même armés. J'ai donc verrouillé toutes les "
"portes et bloqué les fenêtres avec ce que je pouvais et je me suis barricadé "
"ici."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it was awhile before it was quiet again.  I heard all kinds of sounds: "
"explosions, jets flying by, helicopters, screaming, and rapid gunfire.  I "
"swear I even heard what sounded like a freaking tank drive by at one time!  "
"I've been hiding here since."
msgstr ""
"Oui, il a fallu un certain temps avant que le calme ne revienne. J'ai entendu "
"toutes sortes de bruits : des explosions, des avions à réaction qui "
"passaient, des hélicoptères, des cris et des coups de feu rapides. Je jure "
"que j'ai même entendu ce qui ressemblait à un char d'assaut passer à un "
"moment donné ! Depuis, je me cache ici."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I've been a cook since forever, this wasn't the best joint, but management "
"was cool."
msgstr ""
"Je suis cuisinier depuis toujours, ce n'était pas le meilleur endroit, mais "
"la direction était sympa."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Indeed it is I!  The one and only FOODPERSON!"
msgstr "En effet, c'est moi ! Le seul et unique FOODPERSON !"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/bg_pizzaiolo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was just a regular pizzaiolo.  My father was a pizzaiolo, my grandfather "
"was a pizzaiolo and I also became a pizzaiolo.  I was making pizza my whole "
"life, until some American <name_b>s ruined my business!  I couldn't do "
"anything about this, but now, with <the_cataclysm> and <zombies> around, I "
"have a chance to get my revenge!  And I got my revenge, thanks to a special "
"someone."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/bg_pizzaiolo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Are you kidding?  That was the best!  When I imagine the face of that "
"arrogant cook… mmm, sweet, sweet picture.  Oh, and how we beat up that "
"<freaking> food-<name_b>, I dreamed about it for so long… and my restaurant, "
"we beat the shit out of those <name_b>s.  Too bad it was trashed as hell… "
"anyway, let's hit the dirt."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/burger_flipper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Before this started, I had a crappy job flipping burgers at Sambal's Grille.  "
"Losing that isn't a big deal.  Losing my mom and dad hurts a lot more.  Last "
"time I saw them alive, I just came home from school, grabbed a snack and went "
"to work.  I don't think I even told my mom I loved her, and I was pissed at "
"my dad for some dumb shit that really doesn't matter.  Didn't matter then, "
"really doesn't now.  Things started going crazy while I was at work… the "
"military rolled into town, and the evacuation alert sounded."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/burger_flipper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I didn't evacuate.  I went home… saw some freaky shit on the way, but at the "
"time I just thought it was riots or drugs.  By the time I got there, my "
"parents were gone.  No sign of them.  There was a big mess, stuff scattered "
"everywhere like there'd been a struggle, and a little blood on the floor."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai pas évacué. Je suis rentré chez moi... j'ai vu des trucs bizarres sur "
"le chemin, mais à l'époque j'ai juste pensé que c'était des émeutes ou de la "
"drogue. Quand je suis arrivé, mes parents étaient partis. Aucune trace d'eux. "
"Il y avait un grand désordre, des objets éparpillés partout comme s'il y "
"avait eu une bagarre, et un peu de sang sur le sol."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/burger_flipper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I haven't found them yet.  Whenever I see a <zombie>, a little part of me is "
"afraid it's going to be one of them.  But then, maybe not.  Maybe they were "
"evacuated, maybe they fought and tried to wait for me but the military took "
"them anyway?  I've heard that sort of thing happened.  I don't know if I'll "
"ever know."
msgstr ""
"Je ne les ai pas encore trouvés. Chaque fois que je vois un <zombie>, une "
"petite partie de moi a peur que ce soit l'un d'entre eux. Mais ce n'est "
"peut-être pas le cas. Peut-être qu'ils ont été évacués, peut-être qu'ils se "
"sont battus et qu'ils ont essayé de m'attendre mais que les militaires les "
"ont quand même emmenés ? J'ai entendu dire que ce genre de choses arrivait. "
"Je ne sais pas si je le saurai un jour."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/codger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well now, that's a hell of a story, so settle in.  It all goes back to about "
"five years ago, after I retired from my job at the mill.  Times was tough, "
"but we got by."
msgstr ""
"C'est une sacrée histoire, alors installez-vous. Tout remonte à il y a "
"environ cinq ans, après que j'ai pris ma retraite de mon travail à l'usine. "
"Les temps étaient durs, mais nous nous en sortions."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/codger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Anyway, long story short, I were headin' back up to Mount Greenwood to check "
"on th' old ranger station again when I heard them bombs fallin' and choppers "
"flyin'.  Decided to camp out there to see it all through, but it didn't ever "
"end, now, did it?  So here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/confused_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I don't even fucking know anymore.  I have no freaking idea what is going on. "
" I'm just doing what I can to stay alive.  The world ended and I bungled "
"along not dying, until I met you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was a cop.  Small town sheriff.  We got orders without even really knowing "
"what they meant.  At some point one of the g-men on the phone told me it was "
"a Chinese attack, something in the water supply… I don't know if I believe it "
"now, but at the time it was the best explanation.  At first it was weird, a "
"few people - <zombies> - fighting like rabid animals.  Then it got worse.  I "
"tried to control things, but it was just me and my deputies against a town in "
"riot.  Then things really got fucked up."
msgstr ""
"Je faisais partie de la police. Sheriff d'une petite ville. Nous recevions "
"des ordres sans aucun sens. À un moment l'un des hommes du gouvernement m'a "
"dit à téléphone que c'était une attaque chinoise, quelque chose dans l'eau "
"publique... Je ne sais pas si j'y croix encore beaucoup, mais sur le moment "
"cela me semblait être une bonne explication. Au début c'était très bizarre, "
"quelques gens - <zombies> - se battant comme des animaux enragés. Après cela, "
"tout s'est empiré. J'ai essayé de garder la situation sous contrôle, mais ce "
"n'était que moi et quelque uns de mes adjoints contre une ville en émeute. "
"Après ça, après ça tout s'est empiré encore plus. "

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"A big-ass hole opened up right in the middle of town, and a nightmarish demon "
"crawled out, right in front of the church.  We unloaded into it, but bullets "
"just bounced off.  Got some civilians in the crossfire.  It started just "
"devouring people like potato chips into a gullet that looked like a rotting "
"asshole with teeth, and… well, I lost my nerve.  I ran.  I think I might have "
"been the only person to escape.  I haven't been able to even look at my badge "
"since then."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was SWAT.  By all rights I should be dead.  We were called to control "
"\"riots\", which we all know were the first <zombie> hordes.  Fat lot of good "
"we were.  Pretty sure we killed more civilians.  Even among my crew, morale "
"was piss poor and we were shooting wild.  Then something hit us, something "
"big.  Might have been a bomb, I really don't remember.  I woke up pinned "
"underneath the SWAT van.  I couldn't see anything… but I could hear it.  "
"<swear!>  I could hear everything.  I spent hours, maybe days under that van, "
"not even trying to get out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Eventually yes.  It had been quiet for hours.  I was parched, injured, and "
"terrified.  My training was maybe the only thing that kept me from freaking "
"out.  I decided to try to pull myself out and see how bad my injuries were.  "
"It was quite easy.  The side of the van was torn open, and it turned out I "
"was basically just lying under a little debris, with the ruins of the van "
"tented around me.  I wasn't even too badly hurt.  I grabbed as much gear as I "
"could, and I slipped out.  It was night.  I could hear fighting farther away "
"in the city, so I went the other way.  I made it a few blocks before I ran "
"into any <zombies>… I ran from them.  I ran, and I ran, and I ran some more.  "
"And here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm>, I was a cop.  I got shot just a couple days before "
"everything went down… I made a bad call in a drug bust and a scumbag got me "
"right in the gut, it was barely stopped by my vest.  I took some pretty bad "
"internal bruising.  I never thought getting shot would save my life, but I "
"was off duty recuperating when the worst of it hit."
msgstr ""
"Avant <the_cataclysm>, je faisais partie de la police. Je me suis fait "
"tiré(e) dessus quelque jours avant que tout s'écroula... J'ai pris une "
"mauvaise décision durant une saisie de drogue et un salaud m'a eu pile dans "
"le bide, mon gilet n'ayant presque pas arrêté la balle. Je m'en suis tiré "
"avec beaucoup de contusions. Je n'aurais jamais pensé que me faire tirer "
"dessus sauverait ma vie, mais j'étais en congé de convalescence lorsque le "
"pire est arrivé."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"At first I wanted to help.  The riots, fighting in the streets, it was too "
"much for me to just sit in my house and hear about it on the news.  Then a "
"buddy of mine called me from just off the front lines.  He'd been hurt and he "
"wasn't making much sense, but what he told me… well, you can imagine the kind "
"of stuff he told me.  Everything the worst of the internet was making up, and "
"more.  Instead of packing up to try to volunteer back onto active duty, I "
"took his advice and packed up to leave.  My house was on the edge of town and "
"the riots hadn't reached it yet, but from what I'd heard it was smarter to "
"get out than to hold tight.  I slipped out that night, took my quad out, and "
"camped a few days in the woods, waiting for it to blow over.  It never did."
msgstr ""
"Au début, je voulais aider. Les émeutes, les combats dans les rues, c'était "
"trop pour moi de rester chez moi à écouter les informations. Puis un de mes "
"amis m'a appelé de l'autre côté de la ligne de front. Il avait été blessé et "
"ne comprenait pas grand-chose, mais ce qu'il m'a dit... vous pouvez imaginer "
"le genre de choses qu'il m'a racontées. Tout ce que le pire de l'internet "
"inventait, et plus encore. Au lieu de faire mes valises pour essayer de me "
"porter volontaire pour retourner au service actif, j'ai suivi son conseil et "
"j'ai fait mes valises pour partir. Ma maison se trouvait à la périphérie de "
"la ville et les émeutes ne l'avaient pas encore atteinte, mais d'après ce que "
"j'avais entendu, il était plus judicieux de partir que de s'accrocher. Je me "
"suis éclipsé cette nuit-là, j'ai sorti mon quad et j'ai campé quelques jours "
"dans les bois, en attendant que ça se calme. Cela n'a jamais été le cas."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Honestly, probably better than it sounds.  I had a good bug-out bag, a nice "
"tent, a lot of good stuff.  I hadn't suffered any internal organ damage, my "
"stomach muscles were just really badly bruised, and I'd already had some good "
"time to recover.  I think it kept me from doing anything too stupid, and "
"believe me there was a high chance of that.  For a long time I had these "
"Rambo visions of rushing into town and saving everyone, but I was still too "
"immobile.  By the time I had my strength back, it wasn't an option… we were "
"well into the rushing into town for supplies phase.  The closest I got to "
"saving any old friends was putting down the monsters wearing their faces."
msgstr ""
"Honnêtement, c'est probablement mieux qu'il n'y paraît. J'avais un bon sac de "
"survie, une bonne tente, beaucoup de bonnes choses. Je n'avais subi aucune "
"lésion des organes internes, les muscles de mon estomac étaient juste très "
"abîmés, et j'avais déjà eu le temps de récupérer. Je pense que cela m'a "
"empêché de faire quelque chose de trop stupide, et croyez-moi, il y avait de "
"fortes chances que cela arrive. Pendant longtemps, j'ai eu des visions de "
"Rambo, me précipitant dans la ville pour sauver tout le monde, mais j'étais "
"encore trop immobile. Lorsque j'ai retrouvé mes forces, ce n'était pas une "
"option... nous étions déjà bien avancés dans la phase de ravitaillement en "
"ville. Le plus près que j'ai pu sauver de vieux amis a été d'abattre les "
"monstres qui portaient leurs visages."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was just sittin' in lockup.  They took me in the night before, for a "
"bullshit parole violation.  Assholes.  I was stuck in my cell when the cops "
"all started yelling about an emergency, geared up, and left me in there "
"havin' a <freaking> staring contest with a security cam that probably wasn't "
"even on.  I was stuck in there for two god-damn days, with no food and only a "
"little water.  Then this big-ass zombie busted in.  I didn't know what the "
"fuck to think, but if my cam wasn't working, the one in the hall sure was.  "
"Tripped a motion sensor or some shit, alarm started going, and the big dumb "
"fuck turned around to get at it while its arms were still stuck in the cell "
"bars.  Ripped the whole door out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"'cuz I know how cops think.  If you can call it that.  Early days, they were "
"still going after alarms in case it meant, I dunno, survivors.  You smack "
"some fucker's sports car, it starts wailing, the cops come to take a look and "
"you can walk right behind 'em.  That's the thing about cops; they follow "
"orders, right?  Even when the world's comin' apart.  I kept my head down "
"until I got past the worst of it, but then, lucky me, I got sergeant "
"brainiac.  Figured out why someone would trip an alarm on purpose, had them "
"case all up and down the streets for me.  I wound up on the edge of town "
"layin' low under an abandoned RV for a few hours.  By then… well, they had "
"some other big problems to deal with.  For a little bit.  Might've survived "
"if they hadn't blown their wads chasing me around the block."
msgstr ""
"parce que je sais comment les flics pensent. Si on peut appeler ça comme ça. "
"Au début, ils s'en prenaient encore aux alarmes au cas où elles "
"signifieraient, je ne sais pas, des survivants. Si tu défonces la voiture de "
"sport d'un connard, elle se met à hurler, les flics viennent jeter un coup "
"d'œil et tu peux marcher juste derrière eux. C'est ça le truc avec les flics "
": ils suivent les ordres, non ? Même quand le monde s'écroule. J'ai gardé la "
"tête baissée jusqu'à ce que je passe le pire, mais ensuite, j'ai eu de la "
"chance, j'ai eu le cerveau du sergent. J'ai compris pourquoi quelqu'un "
"déclencherait une alarme volontairement, j'ai fait faire des recherches dans "
"toutes les rues pour moi. Je me suis retrouvé à la périphérie de la ville, "
"caché sous un camping-car abandonné pendant quelques heures. À ce "
"moment-là... ils avaient d'autres gros problèmes à régler. Pendant un petit "
"moment. J'aurais pu survivre s'ils ne s'étaient pas ruinés à me poursuivre."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Bullshit, that's what.  The assholes busted me on possession, wasn't even my "
"fuckin' stash.  I don't do crack, man, that shit's nasty, I was just carryin' "
"it for my buddy Johnny.  Y'know, this might be a <freaking> hellhole now, but "
"if I've seen the last power-trippin' asshole cop, it might all be worth it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was fricking lucky for <the_cataclysm>.  I was squatting in a warehouse out "
"on the edge of town.  I was in a real shitty place, and my crew had mostly "
"just been arrested in a big drug bust, but I had skipped out.  I was scared "
"they were gonna think I ratted 'em out and come get me, but hey, no worries "
"about that now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was just in a warehouse, not in Zambonia.  I had the internet.  Watched "
"those crazy videos on YouTube in real time, scared the shit out of me.  I had "
"it pretty good though, I'd lifted a bunch of canned food and shit, and I had "
"a pretty sweet little squat in that warehouse.  I'd been planning on spending "
"a long time there after all, while I figured out how to get in good with my "
"crew."
msgstr ""
"J'étais dans un entrepôt, pas en Zambie. J'avais Internet. J'ai regardé ces "
"vidéos folles sur YouTube en temps réel, ça m'a foutu la trouille. Je m'en "
"sortais plutôt bien, j'avais soulevé un tas de conserves et d'autres trucs, "
"et j'avais un joli petit squat dans cet entrepôt. J'avais prévu d'y passer un "
"long moment, le temps de trouver un moyen de m'entendre avec mon équipe."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  <zombies>.  A bunch of them, led by this big creepy-ass jet-black "
"bastard with glowing red eyes, I shit you not.  I dunno what brought them way "
"out my way but they saw me takin' a piss outside and that was that.  I took a "
"few shots at them but that creepy-ass motherfucker waves his hands and brings "
"'em back up, so I ran.  Once I got my shit together again I realized it "
"wasn't so bad, I was running out of stuff anyway.  Been livin' on what I can "
"loot ever since, until I fell in with you."
msgstr ""
"Oui. <zombies>. Un tas d'entre eux, menés par ce gros bâtard noir de jais "
"avec des yeux rouges luisants, je vous emmerde. Je ne sais pas ce qui les a "
"amenés sur mon chemin, mais ils m'ont vu pisser dehors et c'est tout. J'ai "
"tiré quelques coups de feu sur eux, mais cet enfoiré de flippant a agité ses "
"mains et les a ramenés à la surface, alors je me suis enfui. Une fois que "
"j'ai repris mes esprits, j'ai réalisé que ce n'était pas si grave, je n'avais "
"plus rien de toute façon. Depuis, je vis de ce que je peux piller, jusqu'à ce "
"que je tombe sur toi."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I mean, if he's surrounded by buddies like that and he can just bring "
"'em back, I think he's a scary bastard.  If I got him on his own I think "
"maybe I could have taken him.  Also when I was running I managed to get a "
"zombie on its own, and I smashed it to shit with a stick before the rest "
"showed up.  He tried to raise that one and it didn't get back up."
msgstr ""
"S'il est entouré de copains comme ça et qu'il peut les ramener, je pense que "
"c'est un bâtard effrayant. Si je l'avais eu tout seul, je pense que j'aurais "
"pu l'avoir. Quand je courais, j'ai aussi réussi à attraper un zombie tout "
"seul, et je l'ai réduit en bouillie avec un bâton avant que les autres "
"n'arrivent. Il a essayé de le relever et il ne s'est pas relevé."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/dreamer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"OK, this is gonna sound crazy but I, like, I knew this was going to happen.  "
"Like, before it did.  You can even ask my psychic except, like, I think she's "
"dead now.  I told her about my dreams a week before the world ended.  Serious!"
msgstr ""
"OK, ça va paraître dingue, mais je savais que ça allait arriver. Genre, avant "
"que ça n'arrive. Vous pouvez même demander à ma voyante, mais je crois "
"qu'elle est morte maintenant. Je lui ai parlé de mes rêves une semaine avant "
"la fin du monde. Sérieux !"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/dreamer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"OK, so, sometimes I dream that I am a zombie.  I just don't realize it.  And "
"I just act normal to myself and I see zombies as normal people and normal "
"people as zombies.  When I wake up I know it's fake though because if it were "
"real, there would be way more normal people.  Because they'd actually be "
"zombies.  And everyone is a zombie now."
msgstr ""
"Parfois, je rêve que je suis un zombie. Je ne m'en rends pas compte. Je me "
"comporte normalement et je vois les zombies comme des gens normaux et les "
"gens normaux comme des zombies. Quand je me réveille, je sais que c'est faux "
"parce que si c'était vrai, il y aurait beaucoup plus de gens normaux. Parce "
"qu'ils seraient en fait des zombies. Et tout le monde est un zombie "
"maintenant."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/dreamer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"So, like, there were some really bad riots, okay?  Everyone got really "
"violent and nasty, and to be honest, I was on a bit of a spirit journey for a "
"lot of it and I don't really remember too well.  But the weirdest part is, "
"nobody even *cared* about each other.  It's like all our caring got sucked "
"away.  I think it was some kind of negative energy thing.  And also that made "
"the dead, like, come back to life and stuff.  Plus, like, there were some "
"monsters?  I'm not really sure how they fit in."
msgstr ""
"Il y a eu de très mauvaises émeutes, d'accord ? Tout le monde est devenu très "
"violent et méchant, et pour être honnête, j'étais un peu en voyage spirituel "
"pendant une bonne partie de l'événement et je ne m'en souviens pas très bien. "
"Mais le plus étrange, c'est que personne ne s'est soucié des autres. C'est "
"comme si toute notre attention avait été aspirée. Je pense que c'était une "
"sorte d'énergie négative. Et aussi un truc qui faisait que les morts "
"revenaient à la vie et tout ça. Et puis, il y avait des monstres ? Je ne sais "
"pas vraiment comment ils s'intègrent."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I made it to one of those <freaking> evac shelters, but it was almost worse "
"than what I left behind.  Escaped from there, been on the run since."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I spent a lot of time rummaging for rhubarb and bits of vegetables in the "
"forest before I found the courage to start picking off some of those dead "
"monsters.  I guess I was getting desperate."
msgstr ""
"J'ai passé beaucoup de temps à chercher de la rhubarbe et des morceaux de "
"légumes dans la forêt avant de trouver le courage de commencer à éliminer "
"certains de ces monstres morts. Je crois que je commençais à être désespéré."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Not exactly.  After a while, I got brave.  I started venturing towards the "
"outskirts of town, picking off zombies here and there.  I learned about "
"traveling in at night to avoid all but those <freaking> shadow-zombies, and "
"that got me pretty far.  Eventually I cleared out a cozy little nook for "
"myself and started really feeling comfortable.  I guess I got a bit "
"complacent."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I thought I had those damned <zombies> figured out.  I got braver, started "
"heading out by day more and more.  One of those screamer zombies spotted me "
"and called in a horde, with a giant <freaking> beastie at the head of it, the "
"size of a Volkswagen and all covered in bone plates.  I know when I'm "
"outclassed.  The big guy was held back by his own horde of buddies, and I "
"managed to book it back to my place.  I closed the windows, locked it down, "
"but it was too late.  The giant followed me and just started hammering right "
"through the walls.  I grabbed what I could and made for the horizon.  Last I "
"saw of my squat, it was collapsing on the bastard.  For all I know, it died "
"in the crash, but I am not going back to find out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"What happened?  I'm not really sure.  You must know about the riots and all "
"that, that the government and the police totally failed to contain.  I don't "
"have a good guess what caused that.  I thought it was the usual stuff at "
"first, and I gotta admit, I was sort of excited and scared it was the start "
"of a revolution.  Not excited enough to join in though, and I guess anyone "
"who was is probably dead now.  I tried to wait it out at home, packed a "
"little bug-out bag, but then the internet started showing videos of rioters "
"getting back up and fighting with crazy injuries.  I don't know how many "
"people really believed it at first, but I took that as my sign and ditched "
"town for the evac shelter.  I don't know exactly what happened after that.  "
"The center I was in was heavily vandalized and empty, and I never saw anyone "
"else.  The cell phone grid was locked up, except for one emergency message "
"that came through around a day later saying the government had fallen.  Power "
"went out a few days later."
msgstr ""
"Qu'est-ce qui c'est passé? Je ne suis pas vraiment sûr(e). Vous devez savoir "
"au sujet des émeutes et tout ça que le gouvernement et la police ont "
"totalement échoué à maintenir en ordre. Je n'ai pas vraiment de bonne "
"hypothèse sur ce qui a causé ça. Je pensais que ce n'était que la routine au "
"début, et je dois admettre que j'était un peu excité(e) et avait aussi peur "
"que ceci était le début d'une révolution. Pas assez excité(e) pour m'y "
"joindre par contre, et je suppose que ceux qui ont fait cela sont déjà morts. "
"J'ai essayé d'attendre que cela passe chez moi, me suis fait un petit sac de "
"provisions s'y j'avait besoin de décamper, mais c'est durant cette période "
"que l'internet à commencé à être rempli de personnes se relevant et se "
"battant en ignorant des blessures énormes. Je ne sais pas combien de "
"personnes y croyait vraiment en début, mais j'ai pris ça comme mon signe de "
"quitter la ville et aller à un abri d'évacuation. Je ne sais pas vraiment ce "
"qui c'est passé après ça. L'abri où je suis arrivé(e) était vandalisé et "
"vide, et je n'ai jamais rencontré qui que ce soit ayant eu la même idée que "
"moi. Le réseau téléphonique était surchargé ou hors de fonction, je n'ai reçu "
"qu'un seul message d'urgence ayant réussi à passer à travers un jour après "
"que je sois arrivé(e) annonçant que le gouvernement s'était écroulé, le "
"réseau électrique rendant l'âme quelques jours après ça."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Same as most people who didn't get killed straight up during the riots.  I "
"went to one of those stupid <freaking> evacuation death traps.  I actually "
"lived there for a while with three others.  One guy who I guess had watched a "
"lot of movies kinda ran the show, because he seemed to really know what was "
"going on.  Spoiler alert: he fucking didn't."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Things went south when our fearless leader decided we had to put down one of "
"the other survivors that had been bitten.  Her husband felt a bit strongly "
"against that, and I wasn't too keen on it either; by this point, he'd already "
"been wrong about a lot.  Well, he took matters into his own hands and killed "
"her.  Then her husband decided one good turn deserves another, and killed the "
"idiot.  And then she got back up and I killed her again, and pulped our "
"former leader.  Unfortunately she'd given her husband a hell of a nip during "
"the struggle, when he couldn't get his shit together enough to fight back.  "
"Not that I fucking blame him.  We made it out of there together, but it was "
"too much for him, he clearly wasn't in it anymore… the bite got infected, but "
"it was another <zombie> that finally killed him.  And then I was alone."
msgstr ""
"Les choses se sont gâtées lorsque notre intrépide chef a décidé que nous "
"devions abattre l'un des autres survivants qui avait été mordu. Son mari s'y "
"est opposé, et je n'étais pas très enthousiaste non plus ; à ce stade, il "
"s'était déjà trompé sur beaucoup de choses. Il a donc pris les choses en main "
"et l'a tuée. Puis son mari a décidé qu'une bonne action en méritait une autre "
"et a tué l'idiot. Puis elle s'est relevée, je l'ai tuée à nouveau et j'ai "
"réduit en bouillie notre ancien chef. Malheureusement, elle avait donné à son "
"mari un sacré coup de fouet pendant la lutte, alors qu'il n'arrivait pas à se "
"ressaisir suffisamment pour riposter. Ce n'est pas que je lui en veuille. On "
"a réussi à sortir de là ensemble, mais c'était trop pour lui, il n'était "
"clairement plus dans le coup... la morsure s'est infectée, mais c'est un "
"autre <zombie> qui l'a finalement tué. Et puis je me suis retrouvée seule."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I assume you know about the riots and the military and police and the "
"freakin' nightmare monsters walking the earth beside zombies, right?  If "
"you're asking what I think caused it all, well, I dunno.  My best guess it "
"was some huge government overreach, maybe some kind of experimental bioweapon "
"that got away.  They tried to lie so much at the start about everything that "
"was going on, I don't think the whole 'Chinese attack' shit measures up.  "
"They were trying to cover something up.  As for the real end times, maybe the "
"rest of the world tried to contain it.  I heard there were honest-to-god "
"nukes going off here on American soil.  To me that seems like somewhere else, "
"maybe Europe, trying to get whatever is going on here contained.  Maybe it "
"even worked.  It's bad now but it's not like it was."
msgstr ""
"Je suppose que vous êtes au courant des émeutes, de l'armée, de la police et "
"des monstres cauchemardesques qui se promènent sur terre à côté des zombies, "
"n'est-ce pas ? Si vous me demandez ce qui a causé tout ça, eh bien, je ne "
"sais pas. Je pense qu'il s'agit d'un énorme excès du gouvernement, peut-être "
"une sorte d'arme biologique expérimentale qui s'est échappée. Ils ont "
"tellement essayé de mentir au début sur tout ce qui se passait, je ne pense "
"pas que toute cette histoire d'\"attaque chinoise\" tienne la route. Ils "
"essayaient de dissimuler quelque chose. Quant à la véritable fin des temps, "
"peut-être que le reste du monde a essayé de la contenir. J'ai entendu dire "
"que des bombes atomiques avaient explosé sur le sol américain. Pour moi, "
"c'est comme si un autre pays, peut-être l'Europe, essayait d'endiguer ce qui "
"se passe ici. Peut-être même que cela a fonctionné. La situation est grave "
"aujourd'hui, mais elle n'est plus ce qu'elle était."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"There's nothing too special about me, I'm not sure why I survived.  I got "
"evacuated with a handful of others, but we were too late to make the second "
"trip to a FEMA center.  We got attacked by the dead… I was the only one to "
"make it out.  I never looked back."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai rien qui sort vraiment de l'ordinaire, et je ne suis pas sûre "
"pourquoi j'ai réussi à survivre.  J'ai été évacuée avec quelque autres vers "
"un abri, mais il était déjà trop tard pour être collecté par un second "
"transport vers un centre FEMA.  Nous avons ensuite été attaqués par une horde "
"et... j'ai été la seule à m'en sortir."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Sheer luck I guess.  I went the absolute wrong way, into town, and wound up "
"stuck in the subway system.  I spent a few days living off vending machine "
"food.  Not the best eating, but I pulled through.  At least there weren't so "
"many zombies down there."
msgstr ""
"Juste de la pure chance je suppose.  Je me suis enfuie dans la pire "
"direction, pile vers la ville, et je me suis retrouvée coincée dans les "
"tunnels de métro.  J'ai souffert à travers quelques jours où je n'ai mangé "
"que des choses issues de distributeurs automatiques, mais au moins il n'y "
"avait pas trop de zombies."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Straight up hunger.  I didn't have any great light source down there, and I "
"didn't have much food.  I was slipping up and down to the station to buy from "
"the vending machines, but once I ran out of cash I had to make a break for "
"it.  I waited until dark and then skipped out."
msgstr ""
"J'avais juste trop faim.  Je n'avais pas grand chose là dessous et pas de "
"lampe torche correcte, donc je ne faisait que des petits allez-retours vers "
"la station pour acheter des trucs aux distributeurs, mais quand ma carte est "
"tombée à court d'argent j'ai dû me résoudre à attendre jusqu'à ce qu'il fasse "
"noir dehors et courir pour ma vie."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Straight up hunger.  I didn't have any great light source down there, and I "
"didn't have much food.  I was slipping up and down to the station to buy from "
"the vending machines, but once I ran out of cash I had to think of something "
"else.  I started raiding the surrounding area by night, and built a decent "
"little base under there."
msgstr ""
"J'avais juste trop faim.  Je n'avais pas grand chose là dessous et pas de "
"lampe torche correcte, donc je ne faisait que des petits allez-retours vers "
"la station pour acheter des trucs aux distributeurs, mais quand ma carte est "
"tombée à court d'argent j'ai dû changer ma tactique et fouiller les environs "
"durant la nuit pour ramener des choses en bas."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  I had it pretty good there, but eventually I just started going a bit "
"nuts.  Always dark, a bit cold, living off scavenged junk food… a soul can "
"only live like that for so long.  When the weather above ground got warmer "
"and the daylight hours got longer I decided to get a bit braver.  I'd learned "
"enough about the <zombies> that I was able to live pretty well after that.  "
"I've camped a few places, scavenged berries and whatnot, lived a pretty good "
"life compared to those first few months."
msgstr ""
"Oui.  C'était pas mal, mais éventuellement j'ai commencé à un peu perdre la "
"boule.  Tout était toujours si sombre, froid et humide, et je ne survivait "
"que sur de la malbouffe…  Au bout d'un moment quelqu'un ne peut plus vivre "
"comme ça.  Lorsque les journées se sont allongées et le thermomètre à grimper "
"j'ai décidé de devenir un peu plus brave.  J'avais appris assez au sujet des "
"<zombies> que j'étais plus ou moins capable d'éviter le pire et de trouver de "
"la nourriture correcte après ça."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Woah, <name_g>, I don't even know where to start.  The riots?  I think it was "
"going on sooner than that.  There were bad murmurs going on a few weeks "
"before that happened.  Lots of really scary crimes, not your usual stuff but "
"like cannibalism and some real unspeakable shit, you know?  When the riots "
"started, I think I was already primed to think of it as something different "
"from a normal equality riot or anything like that.  I think that's part of "
"how I got out safer, I had had some time to get some stuff and get going, and "
"didn't try to make shopping trips.  People were abso-fuckin-lutely crazy in "
"those days.  It was a lot like the pandemic a few years back, except the "
"police were out in the streets in force, gunning people down like it was "
"going out of style."
msgstr ""
"Woah, <name_g>, je ne sais même pas par où commencer. Les émeutes ? Je pense "
"que c'était plus tôt que ça. Il y avait de mauvais murmures quelques semaines "
"avant que ça n'arrive. Beaucoup de crimes vraiment effrayants, pas les trucs "
"habituels, mais du cannibalisme et des trucs vraiment innommables, tu vois ? "
"Lorsque les émeutes ont commencé, je pense que j'étais déjà préparé à penser "
"qu'il s'agissait de quelque chose de différent d'une émeute normale sur "
"l'égalité ou de quelque chose de ce genre. Je pense que c'est en partie ce "
"qui m'a permis de sortir plus en sécurité, j'avais eu le temps de prendre "
"quelques affaires et de me mettre en route, et je n'ai pas essayé de faire "
"des courses. Les gens étaient complètement fous à l'époque. Cela ressemblait "
"beaucoup à la pandémie d'il y a quelques années, sauf que la police était "
"dans les rues en force, abattant les gens comme si c'était démodé."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"They were shipping me with a bunch of evacuees over to a refugee center, when "
"the bus got smashed in by the biggest zombie you ever saw.  It was busy with "
"the other passengers, so I did what anyone would do and fucked right out of "
"there."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I ran until I felt like my lungs were going to jump right out of my mouth.  I "
"holed up in the forest for the night, under a fir tree.  In the morning I "
"heard someone talking, so I went to see.  I was playing it pretty careful "
"though, there were still a lot of psychos and rioters around.  I snuck up on "
"some kind of thing, some monster worse than any zombie.  Some huge bug thing, "
"saying random phrases like some kind of broken tape recorder.  It was "
"dragging a few human bodies behind it, I couldn't tell if they were dead or "
"unconscious.  Honestly I didn't wait to find out, I ducked into the bushes "
"and tried not to breath until I couldn't hear it anymore."
msgstr ""
"J'ai couru jusqu'à ce que j'aie l'impression que mes poumons allaient sauter "
"de ma bouche. Je me suis cachée dans la forêt pour la nuit, sous un sapin. Au "
"matin, j'ai entendu quelqu'un parler, alors je suis allé voir. J'ai été assez "
"prudente, car il y avait encore beaucoup de psychopathes et d'émeutiers dans "
"les parages. Je me suis approchée d'une sorte de chose, d'un monstre pire que "
"n'importe quel zombie. Un énorme insecte qui prononçait des phrases au "
"hasard, comme une sorte de magnétophone cassé. Il traînait quelques corps "
"humains derrière lui, je ne pouvais pas dire s'ils étaient morts ou "
"inconscients. Honnêtement, je n'ai pas attendu de le savoir, je me suis "
"réfugiée dans les buissons et j'ai essayé de ne pas respirer jusqu'à ce que "
"je ne l'entende plus."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Once I was okay leaving the bushes, I made my way to an old shed I could see "
"a ways off.  It was falling in but it kept the rain and wind off and gave me "
"a place out of sight.  I stayed there until I ran out of those ass-tasting "
"ration bars I'd filled my backpack with.  Then I took on the wanderin' life "
"until we met."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"My evac shelter got swarmed by some of those bees, the ones the size of dogs. "
" I took out a few with a plank, but pretty quick I realized it was either "
"head for the hills or get stuck like a pig.  The rest is history."
msgstr ""
"Mon abri d'évacuation s'est fait envahir par un essaim de ces abeilles, "
"celles de la taille de chiens. J'ai réussi à en tuer quelques unes avec une "
"planche, mais je me suis rapidement rendu compte que c'était soit décamper "
"dans les forêts environnantes soit me faire embrocher comme un cochon par des "
"dizaines de dards. Vous connaissez la suite."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm sure you've seen them, they're everywhere.  Like something out of "
"an old sci-fi movie.  Some of the others in the evac shelter got stung, it "
"was no joke.  I didn't stick around to see what the lasting effect was "
"though.  I'm not ashamed to admit I ran like a <freaking> chicken."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, excuse me if I didn't stop to fucking ask what kind of killer bugs they "
"were."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_6.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I was at home when the cell phone alert went off and told me to get to "
"an evac shelter.  So I went to an evac shelter.  And then the shelter got too "
"crowded, and people were waiting to get taken to the refugee center, but the "
"buses never came.  You must already know about all that.  It turned into "
"panic, and then fighting.  I didn't stick around to see what happened next; I "
"headed into the woods with what tools I could snatch from the lockers.  I "
"went back a few days later, but the place was totally abandoned.  No idea "
"what happened to all those people."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_6.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I gotta be honest with you, I heard a lot of stories back at the shelter, and "
"only one of them really stuck.  This is some kind of science experiment gone "
"wrong.  I don't know what caused the riots and the undead in the first place, "
"but there's no way it's this out of control everywhere.  Yeah, I got the same "
"'the government has fallen' text as everyone, but it doesn't make *sense* "
"that it could be so widespread so fast.  I think we're in some sort of "
"exclusion zone, where they're letting whatever is going on run its course to "
"see how it works so they can fight it better next time.  Somewhere out there, "
"outside the zone, it's more or less business as usual."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/ex_pilot_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Where was I?  I don't even know, what day do you think it all ended?  When I "
"thought shit was hitting the fan I took some vacation time at the airline.  "
"Next day, somebody bombed them.  No shit, just like Oklahoma city in '95.  "
"Thought that was a good sign to get out so I emailed some family out in the "
"country that I was coming over and got on the road.  Didn't even make it to "
"the interstate before I ran into the cops setting up a roadblock.  I drove "
"off the road and it all gets fuzzy from there.  Next town I got to was "
"already lynching people from the streetlights… I didn't stop for gas.  Lost "
"the car at some point, lost track of the days too.  Not sure I ever got a "
"reply to my email."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/fema_evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"That place was chaos.  I only stayed a few hours.  They had a big backhoe "
"running, digging a huge pit in a cordoned section they wouldn't let us near.  "
"Well, I managed to sneak over that way, and saw them dumping load after load "
"of the dead in the pit, pouring dirt back over them even as they revived and "
"tried to climb out.  Even with all the shit I've seen since, it haunts me.  I "
"knew then I had to get out.  Luckily for me, we were attacked the next "
"morning by some giant horror, a kind I haven't really seen since then.  While "
"the guards were busy with that, I grabbed some supplies I'd stocked up over "
"the night and I fucked right out of there.  A few others tried to get the "
"fuck out with me, but as far as I know I was the only lucky one."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm not from around here… You can probably tell from the accent, I'm from the "
"UK.  I was here doing my PhD at Dartmouth.  I was halfway to MIT for a "
"conference when <the_cataclysm> stopped me.  I was staying at a flea-ridden "
"little motel on the side of the road.  When I got up for whatever was going "
"to pass for breakfast, the fat bloody proprietor was sitting at his desk, "
"wearing the same grubby clothes from the night before.  I thought he had just "
"slept there, but when he looked at me… well, you know what those Zed-eyes "
"look like.  He lunged, and I reacted without thinking.  Smacked him on the "
"head with my tablet, again and again, until he stopped coming for me.  I "
"never thought I had anything like that in me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I wandered for a little while around the grounds, letting the adrenaline "
"fade, hoping for some kind of idea what to do.  I was out in the middle of "
"nowhere, and I didn't know the area at all.  I wasn't certain if I should "
"head back to Hanover, and try to get my belongings, or stay out where I was.  "
"Finally, I decided to rest a while until I knew what was going on.  The "
"internet told me most of what I needed; I'm sure you saw Twitter in those "
"days.  Even if I'd thought it wise to go back all the way to New Hampshire, I "
"was far too scared."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yes.  Simple hunger.  The vending machines sold only peanuts and biscuits.  I "
"wasn't about to rely on that for survival.  I stayed long enough to realize "
"no one was going to come for me, then packed up what I could and drove off.  "
"Eventually my car was caught in a downpour of acid rain that stripped the "
"tires and left me to carry on on foot, living the life of a hunter gatherer.  "
"Honestly, I think I eat better this way than I did as a grad student."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was in biochemistry.  Specifically, if you're interested, I was studying "
"the folding of non-standard nucleic acids into enzyme-like structures.  It "
"sounds more interesting than it was; most of my time was spent cursing at "
"computer screens and wishing we had more information on threose chains at "
"unusual temperatures and pressures for modeling."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Nothin' special before <the_cataclysm>.  When the dead started walking, I "
"geared up and started puttin' them back down."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Almost got killed.  One <zombie> is easy pickins, but ten is a lot, and a "
"hundred is a death trap.  I got myself in too deep, an' barely slipped out "
"with my guts still inside me.  Holed up in an old motel for a while lickin' "
"my wounds and thinkin' about what I wanted to do next.  That's when I figured "
"it out."
msgstr ""
"Je me suis presque fait tuer. Un <zombie> est une proie facile, mais dix "
"d'entre eux sont une toute autre chose, et une centaine et une mort assurée. "
"J'ai plongé trop profond, et je m'en suis sorti avec plus de trous qu'il est "
"comfortable d'avoir. Je me suis terré dans un vieux motel pendant ma "
"convalescence, et pendant que je léchais mes blessures et réfléchissait à ce "
"que je voulais faire ensuite, je me suis rendu compte de quelque chose."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"This is it.  This is what I was made for.  There in the street, smashin' "
"monster heads and prayin' I'd make it out?  I've never felt like that.  "
"Alive.  Important.  So after I got myself all stuck back together, I nutted "
"up and went back to it.  Probly killed a thousand Z since then, and I'm still "
"not tired of it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Oh, you know.  Blah blah blah, had a job and a life, everyone died.  Boo hoo. "
" I gotta be straight with you though: I honestly think I like this better.  "
"Fighting for survival every day?  I've never felt so alive.  I've killed "
"hundreds of those bastards.  Sooner or later one of them will take me out, "
"but I'll go down knowing I did something actually important."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well y'see, I'm not from these parts at all.  I was driving up from the South "
"to visit my son when it all happened.  I was staying at a motel when a "
"military convoy passed through and told us to evacuate to a FEMA shelter."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, t'vois, je suis pas du tout d'ici. Je roulais depuis le Sud pour "
"rendre visite à mon fils quand c'est arrivé.  Je m'étais installé dans un "
"motel quand un convoi militaire est arrivé et nous a ordonné d'évacuer vers "
"un abri de la FEMA."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"He lives up in Northern Canada, way in the middle of nowhere, with his crazy "
"wife and my three grandkids.  He's an environmental engineer for some oil and "
"gas company out there.  She's a bit of a hippy-dippy headcase.  I love em "
"both though, and as far as I'm concerned they all made it out of this fucked "
"up mess safe, out there in the boondocks.  I guess they think I'm dead, so "
"they'll steer clear of this hellhole, and that's the best as could be."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Lord no.  I'll be fucked if I let a kid in a too-big uniform tell me what the "
"hell to do.  I had my Hummer loaded out and ready to go offroading, I had a "
"ton of gas, and I even had as many rifles as the border was gonna let me "
"bring over.  I didn't know what I was supposed to be running from, but I sure "
"as shit didn't run."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"At first, I just kept going North, but I ran into a huge military blockade.  "
"They even had those giant walking robots like on TV.  I started going up to "
"check it out, and before I knew it they were opening fire!  I coulda died, "
"but I still have pretty good reactions.  I turned tail and rolled out of "
"there.  My Hummer had taken some bad hits though, and I found out the hard "
"way I was leaking gas all down the freeway.  Made it a few miles before I "
"wound up stuck in the ass-end of nowhere.  I settled in to wander.  I guess "
"I'm still kinda heading North, just by a pretty round-about way, you know?"
msgstr ""
"Au début, j'ai continué à aller vers le nord, mais je me suis retrouvée face "
"à un énorme blocus militaire. Il y avait même des robots géants qui "
"marchaient, comme à la télé. J'ai commencé à monter pour vérifier, et avant "
"que je m'en rende compte, ils ouvraient le feu ! J'aurais pu mourir, mais "
"j'ai encore de bonnes réactions. J'ai tourné les talons et j'ai roulé hors de "
"là. Mon Hummer avait pris quelques mauvais coups, et j'ai découvert à mes "
"dépens que je perdais de l'essence sur toute l'autoroute. J'ai fait quelques "
"kilomètres avant de me retrouver coincée au fin fond de nulle part. Je me "
"suis mis à errer. Je crois que je me dirige toujours un peu vers le nord, "
"mais par un chemin assez détourné, vous savez ?"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"We're all thinking the same thing, aren't we?  Not much this could be but "
"some kind of secret military bullshit.  At first, I thought it was our own "
"government, but after all that went down, it's just too much.  It must've "
"been the Chinese.  I wonder if those sons of bitches are sitting back home, "
"right as rain, watching us struggling down here and waiting for things to die "
"down."
msgstr ""
"Nous pensons tous la même chose, n'est-ce pas ? Il n'y a pas grand-chose qui "
"puisse être autre chose qu'une sorte de connerie militaire secrète. Au début, "
"je pensais que c'était notre propre gouvernement, mais après tout ce qui "
"s'est passé, c'est trop. Ça devait être les Chinois. Je me demande si ces "
"fils de pute sont assis chez eux, comme la pluie, à nous regarder nous "
"débattre ici et à attendre que les choses se calment."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I dunno, I'm no expert.  You might not remember, but there was that big news "
"a couple years back that supposedly China had some kind of super fusion "
"reactor.  I read a news article, apparently that was all a front for some "
"other kind of secret weapon they were working on.  Made so much energy, there "
"was no way to hide it, so they made it a story about fusion power instead.  "
"That'd explain why we never saw fusion power Stateside, don't you think?  And "
"if they were that much more advanced that they could make fusion power, who "
"knows what else they could make."
msgstr ""
"Je ne sais pas, je ne suis pas un experte. Vous ne vous en souvenez peut-être "
"pas, mais il y a eu cette grande nouvelle il y a quelques années, selon "
"laquelle la Chine aurait eu une sorte de super réacteur à fusion. J'ai lu un "
"article, apparemment ce n'était qu'une façade pour une autre sorte d'arme "
"secrète sur laquelle ils travaillaient. Le réacteur produisait tellement "
"d'énergie qu'il n'y avait aucun moyen de le cacher, alors ils en ont fait une "
"histoire sur l'énergie de fusion à la place. Cela expliquerait pourquoi nous "
"n'avons jamais vu d'énergie de fusion aux États-Unis, vous ne pensez pas ? Et "
"s'ils étaient si avancés qu'ils pouvaient produire de l'énergie de fusion, "
"qui sait ce qu'ils pourraient faire d'autre."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/high_school_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was at school.  I'm a senior.  We'd heard about riots… it started with a "
"kid showing videos of one of the big riots in Providence.  You've probably "
"seen it, the one where the woman turns to the camera and you can see her "
"whole lower lip has been ripped off, and is just flapping there?  It got so "
"bad, they went over the PA system to tell us about Chinese drugs in the water "
"supply.  Right… does anyone buy that explanation?"
msgstr ""
"J'étais à l'école. Je suis en dernière année. Nous avions entendu parler des "
"émeutes... ça a commencé avec un gamin qui montrait des vidéos de l'une des "
"grandes émeutes de Providence. Vous l'avez probablement vue, celle où la "
"femme se tourne vers la caméra et où l'on voit que toute sa lèvre inférieure "
"a été arrachée et qu'elle s'agite sur le sol ? Les choses ont tellement "
"dégénéré qu'ils ont utilisé le système de sonorisation pour nous informer de "
"la présence de drogues chinoises dans l'approvisionnement en eau. Ok... "
"est-ce que quelqu'un croit à cette explication ?"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/high_school_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I guess it got worse, because the faculty decided to put us in lockdown.  For "
"hours.  And then the school buses showed up to evacuate us.  Eventually, they "
"ran out of buses.  I was one of the lucky few who didn't have a bus to get "
"on.  The soldiers weren't much older than me… they didn't look like they knew "
"what was going on.  I lived just a few blocks away.  I snuck off."
msgstr ""
"Je suppose que ça a empiré, parce que la faculté a décidé de nous enfermer. "
"Pendant des heures. Puis les bus scolaires sont arrivés pour nous évacuer. Au "
"bout d'un moment, il n'y avait plus de bus. Je faisais partie des quelques "
"chanceuses qui n'avaient pas de bus dans lequel monter. Les soldats n'étaient "
"pas beaucoup plus âgés que moi... ils n'avaient pas l'air de savoir ce qui se "
"passait. J'habitais à quelques rues de là. Je me suis éclipsée."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/high_school_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  On the way there, I met some <zombies> for real.  They chased me, but "
"I did pretty well in track.  I lost them… but I couldn't get home, there were "
"just too many.  I wound up running more.  Stole a bike and ran more again.  "
"I'm a bit better at killing those things now, but I haven't made it home yet. "
" I guess I'm afraid of what I'll find."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I saw it all pretty early, before it all really started.  I worked at the "
"hospital.  It started with a jump in the number of code whites - that's an "
"aggressive patient.  Wasn't my training so I didn't hear about it until "
"later… but rumors started flying about hyperaggressive delirious patients "
"that coded and seemed to die, then started attacking staff, and wouldn't "
"respond to anything we hit them with.  Then a friend of mine was killed by "
"one of them, and I realized it wasn't just a few weird reports.  I called in "
"sick the next day."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, <the_cataclysm>.  I lived a fair distance out of town, and I already "
"knew something was seriously wrong, but I hadn't admitted to myself what I "
"was really seeing quite yet.  When I saw the military convoys pouring into "
"the city, I put the pieces together.  At first I thought it was just my "
"hospital.  Still, I packed up my bags, locked the doors and windows, and "
"waited for the evacuation call."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"No.  The call came too late.  I'd already seen the clouds on the horizon.  "
"Mushroom clouds, and also those insane hell-clouds.  I've heard that horrible "
"things came out of them.  I decided it was safer in my locked up house."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The military happened.  They showed up and commandeered my land for some kind "
"of forward base, demanding I evacuate to a FEMA camp.  I didn't even try to "
"argue… I had my dad's old hunting rifle, they had high tech weapons.  I heard "
"one of them joking about the FEMA camp being Auschwitz, though.  I gave their "
"evac driver the slip and decided to make for my sister's place up north.  In "
"theory I guess I'm still going that way, although honestly I'm just busy not "
"dying."
msgstr ""
"Les militaires sont arrivés. Ils sont arrivés et ont réquisitionné mon "
"terrain pour y installer une sorte de base avancée, exigeant que je sois "
"évacuée vers un camp de la FEMA. Je n'ai même pas essayé de discuter... "
"J'avais le vieux fusil de chasse de mon père, ils avaient des armes de haute "
"technologie. J'ai entendu l'un d'eux plaisanter sur le fait que le camp de la "
"FEMA était Auschwitz. J'ai fait faux bond à leur chauffeur d'évacuation et "
"j'ai décidé de me rendre chez ma sœur, dans le nord. En théorie, je crois que "
"je vais toujours dans cette direction, mais honnêtement, je suis juste "
"occupée à ne pas mourir."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was at work at the hospital, when it all went down.  It's a bit of a blur.  "
"For a while there were weird reports, stuff that sounded unbelievable about "
"patients getting back up after dying, but mostly things were business as "
"usual.  Then, towards the end, stuff just skyrocketed.  We thought it was a "
"Chinese attack, and that's what we were being told.  People coming in crazed, "
"covered in wounds from bullets and bites.  About halfway through my shift I… "
"well, I broke."
msgstr ""
"J'étais au travail à l'hôpital quand tout s'est passé. C'est un peu flou. "
"Pendant un certain temps, il y a eu des rapports bizarres, des choses qui "
"semblaient incroyables sur des patients qui se relevaient après être morts, "
"mais la plupart du temps, tout se passait comme d'habitude. Puis, vers la "
"fin, les choses sont montées en flèche. Nous pensions qu'il s'agissait d'une "
"attaque chinoise, et c'est ce qu'on nous disait. Les gens arrivaient fous, "
"couverts de blessures par balles et de morsures. Vers la moitié de mon "
"service, j'ai... eh bien, j'ai craqué."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was at work at the hospital, when it all went down.  It's a bit of a blur.  "
"For a while there were weird reports, stuff that sounded unbelievable about "
"patients getting back up after dying, but mostly things were business as "
"usual.  Then, towards the end, stuff just skyrocketed.  We thought it was a "
"Chinese attack, and that's what we were being told.  People coming in crazed, "
"covered in wounds from bullets and bites.  About halfway through my shift I… "
"well, I broke.  I'd seen such horrible injuries, and then I…  <swear!>  I "
"can't even talk about it."
msgstr ""
"J'étais au travail à l'hôpital quand tout s'est passé. C'est un peu flou. "
"Pendant un certain temps, il y a eu des rapports bizarres, des choses qui "
"semblaient incroyables sur des patients qui se relevaient après être morts, "
"mais la plupart du temps, tout se passait comme d'habitude. Puis, vers la "
"fin, les choses sont montées en flèche. Nous pensions qu'il s'agissait d'une "
"attaque chinoise, et c'est ce qu'on nous disait. Les gens arrivaient fous, "
"couverts de blessures par balles et de morsures. Vers la moitié de mon "
"service, j'ai... eh bien, j'ai craqué. J'avais vu des blessures si horribles, "
"et puis je... Je ne peux même pas en parler."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"A young mother.  I know she was a mother, because I delivered her baby.  "
"Sweet girl, she… she had a good sense of humor.  She came in, spitting that "
"black goo, fighting the orderlies, dead from a bullet wound through the "
"chest.  That's when I… I don't know if I woke up, finally, or if I finally "
"went crazy.  Either way, I broke.  I broke a lot earlier than my colleagues, "
"and that's the only reason I lived.  I skipped out, went to a dead corner of "
"the hospital I used to hide in when I was a resident.  An old stairwell "
"leading to a closed-off unit the maintenance staff were using to store old "
"equipment.  I hid there for hours, while I listened to the world crumbling "
"outside and inside."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Somehow, I don't know how, I managed to fall asleep in there.  I think it "
"might have started with me hyperventilating and passing out.  When I woke up "
"it was night, I was starving and parched, and… and the screaming had died "
"down.  At first I tried to go out the way I came in, but I peaked out the "
"window and saw one of the nurses stumbling around, spitting that black shit "
"up.  Her name was Becky.  She wasn't Becky anymore.  So, I went back up and "
"somehow made it into the storage area.  From there, the roof.  I drank water "
"from some nasty old puddle and I camped out there for a while, watching the "
"city around me burn."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I still didn't have any food.  Eventually I had to climb down the side "
"of the building… so I did, as quietly as I could.  It was night, and I have "
"pretty good nightvision.  Apparently the zombies don't, because I was able to "
"slip right past them and steal a bicycle that was just laying on the side of "
"the road.  I'd kind of scouted out my route from above… I'm not from a big "
"city, the hospital was the tallest building around.  I avoided the major "
"military blockades, and headed out of town towards a friend's old cabin.  I "
"had to fight off a couple of the <zombies>, but I managed to avoid any big "
"fuss, by some miracle."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I still didn't have any food.  Eventually I had to climb down the side "
"of the building… so I did, as quietly as I could.  It was night, and I have "
"pretty good nightvision.  Apparently the zombies don't, because I was able to "
"slip right past them and steal a bicycle that was just laying on the side of "
"the road.  I'd kind of scouted out my route from above… I'm not from a big "
"city, the hospital was the tallest building around.  I avoided the major "
"military blockades, and headed out of town towards a friend's old cabin.  I "
"had to fight off a couple of the <zombies>, but I managed to avoid any big "
"fuss, by some miracle.  I never made it to the cabin, but that's not "
"important now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"My hospital was the tallest building in town, so I saw quite a bit.  The "
"military set up blockades on the roads coming in and out of the town, and "
"there was quite a lightshow going on out there when I started up.  I think it "
"was mostly automated turrets and robots, I didn't hear much shouting.  I saw "
"a few cars and trucks try to run the barricade and get blown to high hell.  "
"There were swarms of <zombies> in the streets, traveling in packs towards "
"sounds and noises.  I watched them rip a few running cars to shreds, "
"including the people inside who were trying to get away.  You know.  The "
"usual stuff.  I was pretty numb by that point."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was called in to work at the hospital.  I don't usually work there, I'm a "
"community doctor.  I don't really love emergency medicine at the best of "
"times, and when your patient keeps trying to rip your face off, well, it "
"takes the last bit of fun out of it.  You might think I'm a coward, but I "
"slipped out early on, and I've got no regrets.  There was nothing I could "
"have done except die like everyone else.  I couldn't get out of the building, "
"the military had blockaded us in… so I went to the most secure, quiet damned "
"place in the building."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The morgue.  Seems like a dumb place to go at the start of a zombie "
"apocalypse, right?  Thing is, nobody had made it to the morgue in quite a "
"while, the bodies were reanimating too quickly and the staff were just too "
"busy.  I was shaking and puking and I could see the world was ending… I "
"bundled myself up, grabbed a few snacks from the pathologist's desk, and "
"crawled into one of those drawers to contemplate the end of the world.  After "
"breaking the handle to make sure it couldn't lock behind me, of course.  It "
"was safe and quiet in there.  Not just my cubby, the whole morgue.  At first "
"it was because nobody was dumb enough to come down there except me.  Later, "
"it was because nobody was left."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The door was good heavy steel with no window, and there was a staff room with "
"a fully stocked fridge, so when it became clear that nothing was going to get "
"any better on its own, I set up shop.  I stayed down there for a couple days. "
" I could hear explosions and screaming for the first while, then just guns "
"and explosions, and then it got really quiet.  Eventually, I ran out of "
"snacks, so I worked up the nerve to climb out a window and check out the city "
"by night.  I used that place as a base for a little while, but the area "
"around the hospital was too hot to keep it up, so I made my way out to "
"greener pastures.  And here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hunter_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I live way out of town.  I hear the small towns lasted a bit longer than the "
"big cities.  Doesn't matter to me, I was out on my end-of-winter hunting "
"trip, I'd been out of town for a week already.  First clue I had things were "
"going wrong was when I saw a mushroom cloud out near an old abandoned "
"military base, way out in the middle of nowhere.  I didn't think much about "
"that.  Then I was attacked by a demon."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hunter_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it was like a… like a soft shelled crab, with tentacle mouths, and it "
"kept talking in different voices.  I saw it before it saw me, and I capped it "
"with my Remington.  That just pissed it off, but I got another couple shots "
"off while it charged me.  Third or fourth shot took it down.  I figured out "
"shit had hit the fan, somehow.  Headed to my cabin and camped out there for a "
"while, but I had to skip out when a bunch of <zombies> showed up and trashed "
"the place.  I ran into you not much later."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hunter_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah… the… the accident got him, but when I came to he was already coming "
"back.  Thank god for seatbelts, right?  He was screeching and flapping "
"around, hanging upside down.  I thought he was just hurt at first, but he "
"just kept coming at me while I tried to talk to him.  His arm was badly hurt "
"already and instead of unbuckling himself he started… he was ripping it right "
"off pulling against the seatbelt.  That, and the crazy shit with the chopper, "
"was when I realized just how fucked up things had got.  I grabbed my hunting "
"knife and ran, but my brother got out and started crawling after me."
msgstr ""
"Oui… l'... l'accident l'a tué, mais quand je me suis réveillée il était déjà "
"en train de revenir.  Merci Dieu pour les ceintures de sécurité je suppose?  "
"Il n'arrêtait pas de gémir et de s'agiter en étant suspendu tête en bas.  Je "
"pensais qu'il était juste blessé au début, mais il n'arrêtait pas d'essayer "
"de m'atteindre lorsque que j'ai commencé a essayer de lui parler.  Son bras "
"était déjà en lambeaux et il a juste commencé… à simplement se démembrer au "
"lieu de détacher sa ceinture.  Ça, et le truc cinglé avec l'hélicoptère "
"furent les choses qui m'ont ouvert les yeux sur la gravité des choses étant "
"en train de se passer.  Je suis me suis juste tirée de là avec mon fusil de "
"chasse et j'ai commencé à courir, mais mon frère se dégagea de la voiture et "
"rampa après moi pas loin derrière."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hunter_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I ran for a little bit, but then I saw soldier zombies crawling out of that "
"chopper.  They had the same look about them as my brother did, and it was "
"them on one side and him on the other.  I'm no genius but I've seen a few "
"movies: I figured out what was happening.  I didn't want to take on Kevlar "
"armor with my knife, so I turned back and faced the other zombie.  I couldn't "
"let my brother stay… like that.  So I did what I had to, and I guess I'll "
"live with that forever."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lab_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"For me, this started a couple days before <the_cataclysm>.  I'm a biochemist. "
" I did my postdoc work with a brilliant colleague, Pat Dionne.  I hadn't "
"talked to Pat in ages… word has it, the government got wind of our thesis, "
"found out Pat did most of the heavy lifting, and that was the last we talked "
"for years.  So, I was a bit surprised to see an e-mail from "
"Pat.Dionne@FreeMailNow.co.ru… even more surprised when it was a series of "
"nostalgic references to a D&D game we played years earlier."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lab_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, the references weren't quite right.  Pat referred to things that we'd "
"never played.  The situations were close, but not right, and when I put it "
"all together, it told a story.  A story about a scholar whose kids were being "
"held captive by a corrupt government, forced to research dark magic for them. "
" And there was a clincher: A warning that the magic had escaped, a warning "
"that all heroes had to leave the kingdom before it fell."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lab_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Listen, I know it's incredibly cheesy.  That's D&D for you.  Anyway, "
"something about the tone really got to me.  I knew it was important.  I "
"wasted a little time waffling, then decided to use my outstanding vacation "
"time and skip town for a while.  I packed for the end of the world.  Turns "
"out, I packed the right stuff."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lab_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"There was, yeah, but it was cryptic.  If I had a copy of Pat's notes, I could "
"probably decipher it, but I'm sure those burned up in <the_cataclysm>.  They "
"bombed those labs, you know."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was late to evacuate when the shit hit the fan.  Got stuck in town for a "
"few days, survived by hiding in basements eating girl scout cookies and "
"drinking warm root beer.  Eventually I managed to weasel my way out without "
"getting caught by the <zombies>.  I spent a few days holed up in an abandoned "
"mall, but I needed food so I headed out to fend for myself in the woods.  I "
"wasn't doing a great job of it, so I'm kinda glad you showed up."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was home with the flu when the world went to shit, and when I recovered "
"enough to make a run to the store for groceries… well, I've been running ever "
"since."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Okay, well, I was kinda out of it those first few days.  I knew there were "
"storms, but I was having crazy fever dreams and stuff.  Honestly I probably "
"should have gone to the hospital, except then I guess I'd be dead now.  I "
"don't know what was a dream and what was the world ending.  I remember "
"heading to the fridge for a drink and noticing the light was out and the "
"water was warm, I think that was a bit before my fever broke.  I was still "
"pretty groggy when I ran out of chicken soup, so it took me a while to really "
"process how dark and dead my building was when I headed out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"You probably remember what the cities were like.  I think it was about day "
"four.  Once I stepped outside I realized what was going on, or realized I "
"didn't know what was going on at least.  I saw a bunch of rioters smashing a "
"car, and then I noticed one of them was bashing a woman's head in.  I "
"canceled my grocery trip, ran back to my apartment before they saw me, and "
"holed up there for as long as I could.  Things got comparatively quiet as the "
"dead started to outnumber the living, so I started looting what I could from "
"my neighbors, re-killing them when I had to.  Eventually the <zombies> "
"overran my building and I had to climb out and head for the hills on an old "
"bike."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"You mean what caused the riots and all that?  Well, they told us it was a "
"Chinese bioweapon but I have troubles believing anyone could engineer a "
"bioweapon that could do all this.  The only answer I can come up with, silly "
"though it sounds, is aliens."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, maybe, but I'd guess it's too disorganized to be a proper invasion.  If "
"I had to guess, I'd say there was something locked in the polar ice.  Like, "
"remember a few years back there was that big thing online about an alien body "
"found in the ice?  I don't know if you remember but it was all over the news "
"for a while until it turned out to be a hoax.  Only, since then, I've seen "
"some aliens walking around that look a *lot* like that ice body.  Maybe it "
"wasn't a hoax, maybe that was a cover-up.  So, maybe those aliens had some "
"kind of virus.  It went around the world and infected everything silently "
"until, somehow, it activated and caused the violence and monsters and "
"mutations."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Let's not dance around it: I joined the riots, at first.  I don't really "
"remember what I was thinking.  I'd protested stuff like police brutality "
"before, but this was different.  I didn't make a sign and go down there "
"expecting to chant and march, I grabbed a bat and went outside planning to "
"fuck shit up.  I've never felt so angry before.  The riots had already been "
"going on a while at that point, and to me, it just looked like the government "
"trying to squash the people again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you're telling me.  The rioters… they weren't even like humans, let "
"alone protesters.  Nothing like any protest I'd ever been in before.  That "
"didn't stop me.  I joined them, and I was as bad as a bunch of them.  Smashed "
"windows, beat up bystanders, burnt cars.  I remember ripping riot gear off a "
"cop and… nevermind.  I don't want to remember that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"At some point, I felt like I was waking up.  It was around the time they were "
"busting out those Humvees with riot control turrets on top.  Says something "
"about my frame of mind that I don't even remember if I'd seen them before "
"that point.  Anyway I heard the gunfire going off and just kinda realized I "
"was on the edges of a mob charging a heavily armed military emplacement.  "
"That's when I started seeing the mob for what it was, seeing the wild-eyed "
"animals, even the zombies.  I turned and ran."
msgstr ""
"À un moment, j'ai eu l'impression de me réveiller. C'était autour du moment "
"où les forces de l'ordre on commencées à utiliser des Humvees avec des "
"tourelles anti-émeutes sur le toit. Cela indique probablement mon état "
"d'esprit que je ne me souviens même pas si j'en avais vu d'autres avant ça. "
"Bref, une rafale de fusil m'a secoué et je me suis soudainement rendu compte "
"que j'étais sur le bord d'une horde furieuse en train de charger un "
"emplacement militaire armé jusqu'aux dents. J'ai aussi commencé à remarquer "
"la vraie nature de la foule, les animaux fous furieux avec leurs yeux "
"injectés de sang, voir carrément les zombies. Je me suis juste retournée et "
"j'ai commencé à courir."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I honestly don't know.  I wonder if some of the others would have come back "
"to their senses, given time.  I don't think I'm anything special.  Maybe a "
"lot of them did, and just weren't on the edge of the crowd at the time.  I'll "
"tell you, almost as soon as I came back to myself, I could see some of the "
"rioters looking at me like I was prey.  I didn't stick around to see what "
"would happen."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I knew the city pretty well.  I went for an abandoned building I knew about, "
"headed through a broken window, and holed up in there for a few days.  I had "
"a fair bit of stolen food and I just kept to myself.  When things started to "
"quiet down, I headed out, and here I am."
msgstr ""
"Je connaissais ma ville assez bien. Je suis rentré(e) dans un bâtiment "
"abandonné que je connaissais à travers un fenêtre brisée, et me suis "
"planqué(e) là quelques jours. J'avait une bonne pile de nourriture volée et "
"je me suis juste isolé(e). Lorsque les choses ont commencé à se calmer, je "
"suis sorti(e) de ma cachette, et me voilà je suppose."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"So, I remember the time leading up to the riots, same as anyone.  Things were "
"bad, there were some really awful crimes being reported in the news, and "
"there was a lot of racial tension as usual from the way the cops were "
"handling it.  Then people started rioting, which isn't unusual, but it was "
"weird the kind of places that the riots were starting in.  Like, upper middle "
"class neighborhoods, Midwestern small towns, things like that.  Anyway, I "
"joined the riots and I don't remember a lot of clear stuff after that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Kinda, I guess.  I heard people blaming the riots on some kind of mind "
"control drug, and frankly I'm not sure that's far off base.  That's kinda "
"what it felt like, although the whole time I really felt like myself.  It "
"wasn't until I snapped out of it that I realized how weird it was.  That "
"doesn't explain anything else though: the zombies, the monsters, all this "
"stuff is way off base.  Anything I've tried to guess just sounds like bad "
"science fiction, like demonic curses or alien weapons kinda stuff."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"That's how it goes, you know?  These are the end times.  I don't really want "
"to talk about it more than that.  And honestly, I never really felt like I "
"belonged, in the old world.  In a weird way, I actually feel like I have a "
"purpose now.  Do you ever get that?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, have you seen them yet?  They're these shitty walking flowers with a "
"big <freaking> stinger in the middle.  They travel in packs.  They hate the "
"zombies, and we were using them for cover to clear a horde of the dead.  "
"Unfortunately, turns out the plants are better trackers than the <zombies>.  "
"They almost seemed intelligent… I barely made it out, only because they were, "
"uh, distracted."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I said, I don't wanna talk about it.  How are you not understanding this?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Like I said, it's a lame story, but I guess it won't kill me to tell it one "
"more time."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  I really did.  It took me two days to make it across the city on foot, "
"camping out in dumpsters and places like that.  I started moving more by "
"night, and I learned right away to avoid the military.  They were a magnet "
"for the <zombies>, and they were usually stationed where the monsters were "
"coming.  Some parts of the city were pretty tame at first.  There were a few "
"chunks where people had been evacuated or cleared out, and the <zombies> "
"didn't really go there.  Later on, others like me started moving into those "
"neighborhoods, so I switched and started running through the blasted out "
"downtown.  I had to anyway, to get home.  By the time I made the switch "
"though, the fighting was starting to die off, and I was mostly just avoiding "
"attention from zombies and other things."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The first warning was that I had to move from the preserved parts of the city "
"to the burnt out ones to get home.  It only got worse.  There was a police "
"barricade right outside my house, with a totally useless pair of automated "
"turrets sitting in front just idly watching the zombies lurch by.  That was "
"before someone switched them to kill everybody, back when it only killed "
"trespassing humans.  Good times, you can always trust bureaucracy to fuck "
"things up in the most spectacular way possible.  Anyway, the house itself was "
"half collapsed, a SWAT van had plowed into it.  I think I knew what I was "
"going to see in there, but I had made it that far and I wasn't going to turn "
"back."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm>, I was just a regular meteorologist.  I worked for the "
"local weather station doing data analysis and stuff.  In general, ordinary "
"boredom.  In my free time I was studying electronics and radio engineering, a "
"bit for work but mostly just as a hobby.  When the riots got serious, my "
"neighborhood was looking pretty sketchy.  I gathered all my things that I "
"managed to carry with me and settled in a radio station that seemed "
"abandoned.  I lived there for a while, doing all sorts of nonsense, until I "
"met you.  I guess you know the rest."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/nerd_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was at school for <the_cataclysm>.  Funny thing, actually: I was gearing up "
"to run a zombie survival RPG with my friends on the weekend.  Ha, I didn't "
"think it'd turn into a LARP!  Okay….  No, that wasn't funny."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/nerd_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I may be a huge <freaking> nerd, but I'm not an idiot.  Plus I'm genre "
"savvy.  We'd already heard about people coming back from the dead, actually "
"that's why I was doing the RPG.  When the cops came to put the school on "
"lockdown I managed to slip out the back.  I live a long way out of town, but "
"there was no way I was going to take a bus home, so I walked.  Two hours.  "
"Heard a lot of sirens, and I even saw jets overhead.  It was getting late "
"when I got back, but my mom and dad weren't back from work yet.  I stayed "
"there, hoping they'd come.  I sent texts but got no reply.  After a few days, "
"well… the news got worse and worse, then it stopped completely."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/nerd_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm not stupid.  I know they're gone.  Who knows where… maybe in an evac "
"shelter, maybe in a FEMA camp.  Most of everyone is dead."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/nerd_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Eventually the zombies came.  I figured they would.  Before the net cut out, "
"there were plenty of videos online making it clear enough what was going on.  "
"I'd picked out some good gear and loaded my bag up with supplies….  When they "
"started knocking at the door, I slipped out the back and took to the street.  "
"And here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"This is gonna sound crazy, but I woke up in the forest in the middle of "
"nowhere, freezing cold, about a week before I met you.  I had my clothes, a "
"splitting headache, and absolutely no memory of anything.  Like, I know "
"stuff.  I can talk, I have skills and understanding… but I don't remember "
"where any of it comes from.  I had a driver's license in my pocket and that's "
"the only way I even know my name."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, not having a memory is weird as heck, but I'll be honest: I think it "
"might be better?  With what's going on, I bet you my memories weren't happy "
"ones.  Besides my driver's license, there were pictures of kids in my wallet… "
"not that that sparked any reaction from me.  I didn't see any kids around.  "
"Maybe losing my mind is a mercy.  Hell, maybe it's some kind of psychotic "
"break and my brain did this to itself.  To be honest with you I think I'd "
"rather focus on surviving, and not worry about it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I know it's nuts.  It sounds like fake amnesia from a Bugs Bunny cartoon.  "
"See?  How can I know that, but not remember how I know it?  Like, I remember "
"Bugs Bunny but I don't remember any time I sat down and watched a Bugs Bunny "
"show."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Who I was is gone.  All that stuff burned away in <the_cataclysm>.  Got it?  "
"Who I am now started two days into it.  I was on the run from a big-ass hell "
"zombie, running like I'd always been doing, when I found a steel baseball bat "
"just laying on the ground.  I took it as a sign and beat that gooey bastard "
"to a pulp… and that's when I became me.  I still run, because who doesn't, "
"but I stand my ground now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I went on, running when I had to and fighting when I could, like the rest of "
"us.  Started learning who I am now.  Lost the bat in a fight against some "
"crazy electric lightning shooting zombie.  It was arcing electricity through "
"my bat so I dropped it and used a nearby plank, but I wound up having to run "
"and leave the ol' slugger behind.  I nearly died that day."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Listen.  I said it clearly, and if you keep picking at it I'm gonna get mad.  "
"Who I was is gone.  Dead.  I don't give a shit about your 'healthy', don't "
"fucking ask again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Let's not talk about it, ok?  It just hurts to think about.  I've lost so "
"many people… and I'm sure you have too.  Let's focus on the here and now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I didn't even know about <the_cataclysm> right away.  I was way out, away "
"from the worst of it.  My car broke down out on the highway, and I was "
"waiting for a tow for hours.  I finally wound up camping in the bushes off "
"the side of the road; good thing, too, because a semi truck whipped by - dead "
"driver, you know - and turned my car into a skid mark.  I feel bad for the "
"bastards that were in the cities when it hit."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Ha, I don't fully understand it myself.  Those first few days were a tough "
"time to be outside, that's for sure.  I got caught in one of those hellish "
"rainstorms, it started to burn my skin right off.  I managed to take shelter "
"under a car, lying on top of my tent.  Wrecked the damn thing, but better it "
"than me.  From what I hear, though, I got lucky.  That was pretty much the "
"worst I saw.  I didn't run into any of those demon-monsters that I hear "
"attacked the cities, so I guess I got off lucky."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Besides the acid rain, I mostly saw people fleeing the cities.  I tried to "
"stay away from the roads, but I didn't want to get lost in the woods either, "
"so I stuck to the deep margins.  I saw cars, buses, trucks loaded down with "
"evacuees.  Plenty went right on, but a lot stalled out of gas and other "
"stuff.  Some were so full of gear and people there were folks hanging off "
"them.  Stalling out was a death sentence, because the dead were coming along "
"the roads picking off the survivors."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was out on a fishing trip with my friend when it happened.  I don't know "
"exactly how the days line up… our first clue that Armageddon had come was "
"when we got blasted by some kind of poison wind, with a sort of acid mist in "
"it that burnt our eyes and skin.  We weren't sure what to make of it so we "
"went inside to rest up, and while we were in there a weird dust settled over "
"everything."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"She took sick a few hours after we left the lake.  Puking, complaining about "
"her joints hurting.  I took us to a little shop I knew about on the "
"riverside, hoping they might have something to help or at least know what was "
"going on."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The shop was empty, actually.  She was desperate though, so I broke in.  I "
"found out more about the chaos in towns from the store radio.  Got my friend "
"some painkillers and Gravol, but when I came out to the boat, well… it was "
"too late for her."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I wish.  That would have been a mercy.  She was letting out an awful, choking "
"scream, and her body was shredding itself apart.  Mushrooms were busting out "
"of every part of her.  I… I ran.  Now I wish that I'd put her out of her "
"misery, but going back there now would be suicide."
msgstr ""
"Si seulement j'avais fait ça. Cela aurait un acte de compassion. Rien d'autre "
"qu'un cri gargouillant sortait de ça bouche, son corps se déchirant en "
"lambeaux, des champignons et spores émergeant de chaque plaie. Je… Je me suis "
"enfui(e). J'aimerais avoir eu la force de l'achever, mais retourner là-bas "
"maintenant serait du suicide."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Ooooh, boy.  I was ready for this.  The winds were blowing this way for "
"years.  I had a full last man on earth shelter set up just out of town.  So, "
"of course, just my luck: I was miles out of town for a work conference when "
"China attacked and the world ended."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Our conference was at a retreat by a lake.  We all got the emergency "
"broadcast on our cells, but I was the only one to read between the lines and "
"see it for what it was: large scale bio-terrorism.  I wasn't about to stay "
"and find out who of my coworkers was a sleeper agent.  Although I'd bet fifty "
"bucks it was Lee.  Anyway, I stole the coordinator's pickup and headed "
"straight for my shelter."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"No, I barely got two miles.  I crashed into some kind of hell-spawn "
"bio-weapon, a crazy screeching nightmarish thing made of arms and legs and "
"heads from all sorts of creatures, humans too.  I think I killed it, but I "
"know for sure I killed the truck.  Grabbed my duffel bag and ran, after "
"putting a couple bullets into it for good measure.  I hope I never see "
"something like that again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I never made it there and can't imagine I ever will.  Every time I've tried "
"I've been headed off by the <zombies>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The shelter?  Bought the land pretty cheap.  I hired a contractor to build "
"the thing but did the door myself.  Metal pin in the door frame.  Can't open "
"unless you remove it.  There's a little pulley inside you have to pull up to "
"reset.  They made dozens of these in the area, and I couldn't sleep knowing "
"just any <name_b> at that company could waltz in as soon as shit hit the fan. "
" They'd know exactly where to go and what to do!  Nah… how do you think I've "
"made it this long?  Always keep a trick up your sleeve."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Nope, that's it.  Got the idea for the door from a book on medieval castles, "
"in case you were wondering.  But instead of a counterweight holding a "
"drawbridge up, I just ram a hex key in a hole."
msgstr ""
"Non, c'est tout. J'ai pris l'idée d'un livre sur les chateaux médiévaux, si "
"vous vouliez savoir. Mais au lieu d'un contrepoids j'ai une clé hexagonale "
"que je place dans une serrure."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Almost as much as my house, in the end.  I think they realized they could "
"make a lot of money as things got worse and worse.  But it's nicer than my "
"house, too.  They said the ventilation system was built to withstand a month "
"of anything: nuclear fallout, biological attack, you name it.  Concrete and "
"soil above me to absorb radiation, appliances and supplies…  I even brought "
"some old books I've never read.  I always knew it would come to this."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"What, like some secret Batcave?  Pull back the curtain and it turns out I'm "
"the communist <name_b> who brewed up a demon bio-weapon in their basement?  I "
"just gave you food, all the tools in my workshop, and the safest hole in the "
"ground in the county.  If I've got any secrets left, they're mine to keep."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I knew it…  This whole time.  It was all part of the plan.  The riots, the "
"storms…  You always had control…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'd have to be absolutely imbecilic to give up the location of my stash to "
"someone I barely know.  For all I know you'd just kill me and take it all for "
"yourself!  Better luck next time, pal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, that's one way to say 'fuck you'!  I know it's been a while since shit "
"went down, but I didn't lock that door and put up that sign for no reason!  "
"How would you feel if I came and stole all the stuff that YOU locked away for "
"safe keeping?!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, that's one way to say 'fuck you'!  How…  Why…  I was still trying to "
"get back there, surviving and struggling just like you!  How would you feel "
"if I came and stole all YOUR stuff right when you needed it most?!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I guess I can't judge.  I've made some fucked up decisions, too.  Taken some "
"things that aren't mine."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"You're not really a good liar.  I built that thing like a fortress.  No one "
"would just break into it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Just don't lie about it.  I understand your life was probably in danger.  I "
"can see past that.  Trust me, I've been in sticky situations before.  Tell "
"the truth next time."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&<npc_name> sighs and pauses for a moment.\n"
"\n"
"\"It's been so long now.  I barely even remember what I was doing.  There was "
"so much confusion and violence in those last days.  My family didn't "
"understand the threat, even though I tried to tell them.  I know what you "
"think I am, but look what's happened!  The dead are walking, the sky is "
"cracking open, and…  well, I can't even talk about it.  Isn't it obvious "
"something bigger is going on?\""
msgstr ""
"& <npc_name> soupire et se tait pour un moment.\n"
"\n"
"\"Je l'impression que ceci s'est passé il y a des années. J'ai du mal à me "
"rappeler exactement ce que je faisais, il y avais tellement de violence et de "
"confusion pendant cette période. J'ai essayé d'avertir ma famille, mais ils "
"on refusé d'entendre raison. Je sais que la plupart des gens pense que je ne "
"suis pas tout à fait sain(e) d'esprit, mais regardez ce qui c'est passé! Les "
"morts se lèvent, le ciel s'écroule, et... vous croyez vraiment qu'il n'y a "
"rien qui cloche dans le monde?\""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I thought I knew at one point.  There were so many signs of manipulation and "
"control.  I thought maybe they were trying to discredit the protests, but "
"when the violence broke out it seemed to be everywhere.  There was footage on "
"the news of people fighting, destroying property, eating animals and… each "
"other in the street.  I thought at some point they were going to sweep in and "
"seize control, but it just never happened."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"You know, the elites.  The ones who have always had control will continue "
"having control, no matter what it costs.  If it means destroying everything "
"to be king of the ashes, they'll do it.  I used to think it was China, for "
"sure, but I'm not so sure anymore.  I figured they would probably be here by "
"now, putting on their crown.  Maybe they're still waiting to make their move…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"That's what I'm saying!  Everything that's going on wouldn't be possible "
"without massive fuck-ups by people in power.  China has fusion reactors?  "
"Well, I've never seen it!  America sinks trillions and trillions of dollars "
"into secret military budgets with no explanation.  If you gave me a trillion "
"dollars and the brain of a bureaucrat, I bet I could completely fuck up "
"reality, too."
msgstr ""
"C'est ce que je dis ! Tout ce qui se passe ne serait pas possible sans les "
"erreurs massives des gens au pouvoir. La Chine a des réacteurs à fusion ? Je "
"n'ai jamais vu ça ! L'Amérique engloutit des billions et des billions de "
"dollars dans des budgets militaires secrets sans aucune explication. Si vous "
"me donnez un billion de dollars et le cerveau d'une bureaucrate, je parie que "
"je pourrais aussi complètement foutre en l'air la réalité."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I've been trying not to think about it, but you could be right.  The more "
"that I see, the less I can explain.  I grew up around a lot of people who "
"always talked about the Rapture.  Hell itself opening up and everything.  It "
"was like they KNEW it would happen.  Before the internet stopped working, I "
"saw people saying that sinners were becoming zombies.  'As above, so below' "
"someone said, or something like that…"
msgstr ""
"J'ai essayé de ne pas y penser, mais vous pourriez avoir raison. Plus je vois "
"de choses, moins je peux les expliquer. J'ai grandi avec beaucoup de gens qui "
"parlaient toujours de l'Enlèvement. L'enfer lui-même s'ouvrait et tout le "
"reste. C'était comme s'ils savaient que cela allait arriver. Avant que "
"l'internet ne cesse de fonctionner, j'ai vu des gens dire que les pécheurs "
"devenaient des zombies. Quelqu'un a dit « comme en haut, comme en bas », ou "
"quelque chose comme ça..."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"She said it was… energy in bones?  Listen, I've heard a lot of crazy bullshit "
"in my time and that's up there, for sure.  And I don't see how something like "
"that explains all the crazy shit I've seen either.  But collecting bones to… "
"save the world?  Fuck it, give it a shot.  Maybe that's something just YOU "
"do, though.  I'm happy believing a lie if that's the truth, I'll be honest."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I'm sorry, 'officer'.  I didn't write the book of cop jokes, you know."
msgstr ""
"Je suis désolée, « officière ». Je n'ai pas écrit le livre des blagues sur "
"les flics, vous savez."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Scared?  Yeah, that's fair.  I wouldn't say it's a friendly world out here.  "
"Still, it's best to be friends.  Anyone that prepared for the apocalypse is "
"probably armed to the teeth anyway."
msgstr ""
"Effrayée ? Oui, c'est vrai. Je ne dirais pas que c'est un monde amical ici. "
"Pourtant, il vaut mieux être amis. Quiconque s'est préparé à l'apocalypse est "
"probablement armé jusqu'aux dents de toute façon."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Oh, man.  I thought I was ready.  I had it all planned out.  Bug out bags.  "
"Loaded guns.  Maps of escape routes.  Bunker in the back yard."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Depends on your definition.  I'm alive, aren't I?  When Hell itself came down "
"from the skies and monsters started attacking the cities, I grabbed my stuff "
"and crammed into the bunker.  My surface cameras stayed online for days; I "
"could see everything happening up there.  I watched those things stride past. "
" I still have nightmares about the way their bodies moved, like they broke "
"the world just to be here.  I had nothing better to do.  I watched them rip "
"up the cops and the military, watched the dead rise back up and start "
"fighting the living.  I watched the nice old lady down the street rip the "
"head off my neighbor's dog.  I saw a soldier's body twitch and grow into some "
"kind of electrified hulk beast.  I watched it all happen."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Honestly?  I was planning to die.  After what I'd seen, I went a little "
"crazy.  I thought it was over for sure, I figured there was no point in "
"fighting it.  I thought I wouldn't last a minute out here, but I couldn't "
"bring myself to end it down there.  I headed out, planning to let the "
"<zombies> finish me off, but what can I say?  Survival instinct is a funny "
"thing, and I killed the ones outside the bunker.  I guess the adrenaline was "
"what I needed.  It's kept me going since then."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I was in jail for <the_cataclysm>, but I escaped.  Hell of a story."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"It's a bit of a… it's a thing.  It started out as a dare.  I wound up making "
"a bioweapon.  It didn't get used or anything, but, well, it got out of hand."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Tax evasion.  I was an accountant, and I helped my boss move a hell of a lot "
"of money in some very clever ways.  Not clever enough, it turns out…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Multiple counts of possession.  I used to be really hung up on meth."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Okay, well, I was in the wrong place at the wrong time.  There was a big "
"fight, I didn't stay clear of it, and me and a bunch of others got tossed in "
"solitary while a few more landed in the infirmary.  Some looked pretty bad, "
"now I kinda wonder if any of them were our first <zombies>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I heard gunshots, even from down in lockup.  Didn't hear much screaming or "
"anything.  That was my first clue something was up.  Food stopped showing up, "
"next.  Then, the lights went out.  I was down there for maybe hours, maybe "
"days, when finally a flashlight in the bars blinded me.  It was a guard.  He "
"let me out, filled me in on what was going on.  I wanted to think he was "
"crazy, but something in his eyes… I believed him."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The guard took off on his own.  Didn't trust us, and I don't blame him.  The "
"other two wanted to set up a bandit gig.  Didn't sit right with me, so I "
"split on pretty good terms.  I ran into the guard a couple more times.  "
"Thought of seeing if he'd travel with me, but I dunno.  I don't think he'd "
"take the offer, I'll always be a con to him.  If you want to try, I can tell "
"you where I saw him last.  Wasn't long before I met you, and he had a good "
"thing going, might still be there."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/professor_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm actually a chemistry professor at Harvard.  I'd been on sabbatical for "
"the last six months.  I can't imagine the university was a good place to be, "
"given what I've heard about Boston… I'm not sure anyone made it out.  I was "
"out at my cabin near Chatham, ostensibly working on the finishing touches for "
"a paper, but mostly just sipping whisky and thanking my lucky stars for "
"tenure.  Those were good days.  Then came <the_cataclysm>, the military "
"convoys, the <zombies>.  My cabin was crushed by a fearsome beast, just "
"collateral damage after it got blasted off Orleans by a tank.  I was already "
"busy running frantically by then."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/religious_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Same as anyone.  I turned away from God, and now I'm paying the price.  The "
"Rapture has come, and I was left behind.  So now, I guess I wander through "
"Hell on Earth.  I wish I'd paid more attention in Sunday School."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/religious_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I guess that was the Rapture.  It didn't play out how I thought it "
"would.  They made me think it was gonna be a flash of light and then *poof*, "
"everyone's gone.  Instead it was messy and dirty.  Riots in the streets, the "
"military and police serving the Antichrist to gun down the people like - what "
"was it my dad used to say - like wheat before the chaff?  Then when we'd "
"really showed our Sin, God came in with the real plagues.  The dead started "
"walking, getting up with machine gun holes in them to fight the military, and "
"the military started turning on each other too.  After that, the legions of "
"Hell itself came out.  Huge monsters, worse than anything I'd ever imagined, "
"just tore through the cities ripping everything to shreds.  Then they started "
"dying off as quick as they'd arrived, and we were left trying to run and hide "
"from the undead.  A day or two later the power started going out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, it built up a bit.  There was that acid rain, it burnt up one of my "
"tractors.  Not that I'd been working the fields since… well, it'd been a "
"terrible year and I hadn't done much worth doing.  There were explosions and "
"things, and choppers overhead.  I was scared, kept the curtains drawn, kept "
"changing the channels.  Then, one day, there were no channels to change to.  "
"Just the emergency broadcast, over and over."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"That was the first thing to really shake me out of it.  I didn't really have "
"any very close friends, but there were people back in town I cared about a "
"bit.  I had sent some texts, but I hadn't really twigged that they hadn't "
"replied for days.  I got in my truck and tried to get back to town.  Didn't "
"get far before I hit a <zombie> infested pileup blocking the highway, and "
"that's when I started to put it all together.  Never did get to town.  "
"Unfortunately I led the <zombies> back to my farm, and had to bug out of "
"there.  And now I'm here with you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"That was the first thing to really shake me out of it.  I didn't really have "
"any very close friends, but there were people back in town I cared about a "
"bit.  I had sent some texts, but I hadn't really twigged that they hadn't "
"replied for days.  I got in my truck and tried to get back to town.  Didn't "
"get far before I hit a <zombie> infested pileup blocking the highway, and "
"that's when I started to put it all together.  Never did get to town.  "
"Unfortunately I led the <zombies> back to my farm, and had to bug out of "
"there.  Might go back and clear it out, someday."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I lived on the edge of a small town.  Corner store and a gas station "
"and not much else.  We heard about the shit goin' down in the city, but we "
"didn't see much of it until the military came blazing through and tried to "
"set up a camp there.  They wanted to bottle us all up in town, and I wasn't "
"having with that, so my dog Buck and I, we headed out while they were all "
"sniffin' their own farts."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Buck and I slipped out and went East, headin' for my friend's ranch.  Cute "
"little dope thought we were just goin' for a real long walk.  I couldn't take "
"the truck without the army boys catchin' wind of it.  We made it out to the "
"forest, camped out in a lean to.  Packed up and kept heading out.  At first "
"we walked along the highway a little, but saw too many army trucks and buses "
"full of evacuees, and that's when we found out about the <zombies>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"We got to my buddy's ranch, but the <freaking> g-men had been there first.  "
"It was all boarded up and there was a police barricade out front.  One of "
"those <freaking> turrets… shot Buck.  Almost got me too.  I managed to get my "
"pup… get him outta there, that… it wasn't easy, had to use a police car door "
"as a shield, had to kill a cop-zombie first.  And then, well, while I was "
"still cryin', Buck came back.  I had to…  <swear!>  I… I can't say it.  You "
"know."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Like I said, you want me to tell you a story, you gotta pony up the whisky.  "
"A full bottle, mind you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Mostly I just wanted to get some scotch out of you.  There really ain't much "
"of a story.  I was in the marines, years ago.  After that, did security "
"contract work.  I was out guarding some dump of a warehouse when the "
"apocalypse rolled through town.  I was out on the edge of town, armed, and "
"know when to not pick a fight, so I didn't get killed.  Wound up recruited by "
"the Free Merchants early on, and then the Old Guard for a bit, but I was "
"getting itchy feet when you came by with an offer.  Here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Huh.  Hadn't thought about it in ages, but now that you mention it, that was "
"a weird job.  It was just a boarded up warehouse in the middle of nowhere, "
"and I was not a cheap contractor in those days.  Coulda got any fat "
"rent-a-cop to watch it.  I had only just started working there when the shit "
"hit the fan, and I kinda forgot about that to be honest."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Good work, and some fun stuff, but risky.  Without a few hands at my side "
"that I trust, I wouldn't take more of their work.  If I had a solid team, "
"though, I'd happily work for Uncle Sam again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scientist_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm> I worked in a lab.  Don't look at me like that, it had "
"nothing to do with this stuff… I was studying protein-protein interactions in "
"smooth muscle in mice, using NMR.  Nothing even vaguely related to zombies.  "
"Anyway, I was at last year's Experimental Biology conference in San "
"Francisco, and an old friend of mine was talking about some really weird shit "
"she'd heard of coming out of government labs.  Really hush hush stuff.  "
"Normally I wouldn't put much cred into that sort of thing, but from her, it "
"actually had me worried.  I packed a bug-out bag just in case."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scientist_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The evacuation order sounded, so I evacuated, comparatively quickly.  That "
"got me out before the worst part.  Our evacuation center was useless… me, a "
"couple other evacuees, a few tins of food, and a few emergency blankets.  Not "
"even close to enough to go around.  The evacuees split down the middle into a "
"few camps, and infighting started.  I ran into the woods nearby with a few "
"others.  We got away, had a little camp going.  They tried to make me their "
"leader, thought I knew more about things than I did because I'd come so "
"prepared.  Like I said, I'm not that kind of scientist, but they didn't seem "
"to understand.  I… I did my best."
msgstr ""
"L'ordre d'evacuation a sonné, j'ai donc évacué assez vite, ce qui m'a épargné "
"le pire de ce qui s'est passé dans les villes de ce que j'ai entendu. Notre "
"centre d'évacuation était… pire que rien. Juste moi, un tas d'autres "
"réfugiés, plusieurs couvertures de survie et quelques boites de conserves. "
"Bref, bien trop peu pour tout le monde. Les réfugiés se sont divisés en "
"plusieurs bandes qui ont rapidement commencées une lutte pour les ressources "
"limitées  du centre. J'ai décidé de fuir cette folie avec quelques autres et "
"pendant un moment, nous avions un petit camp assez confortable dans les bois. "
"Les autres ont essayé de faire de moi leur leader, probablement dû au fait "
"qu'il pensaient que j'avais une idée de ce qui se passait vu que j'était "
"arrivé au centre de réfugiés aussi bien préparé. Comme je l'ai déjà dit, je "
"n'était pas le genre de scientifique qui aurait su quelque chose, mais peu "
"importe ce que je leur disais, ils insistaient que je sois celui donnant les "
"ordres. J'ai… J'ai fait de mon mieux."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scientist_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I thought that us leaving, letting the others have the evac center to "
"themselves, would be enough, but it wasn't.  They tracked us down in the "
"night, a few days later.  They… well… I made it out, along with one other "
"survivor.  The attackers, they were like animals.  We tried to travel "
"together for a while.  I blamed myself, for what had happened, and couldn't "
"really get past it.  We parted ways on good terms not long before I met you.  "
"I just couldn't face the reminder of what had happened."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scientist_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I've got a memory blank for about three days before and after <the_cataclysm> "
"actually.  I worked at a lab - nothing to do with any of this; physics stuff. "
" I think I was working there when things happened.  My first clear memory is "
"running through the underbrush a few miles from town.  I was bandaged up, I "
"had a messenger bag loaded with gear, and I'd taken a hard hit to the side of "
"my head.  I have no idea what happened to me, but clearly I had already been "
"on the run for a bit."
msgstr ""
"J'ai un trou de mémoire d'environ trois jours avant et après, en fait. Je "
"travaillais dans un laboratoire - rien à voir avec tout cela ; des trucs de "
"physique. Je pense que j'y travaillais quand les choses se sont passées. Mon "
"premier souvenir clair est celui d'une course dans les sous-bois à quelques "
"kilomètres de la ville. J'avais des bandages, un sac de messager chargé de "
"matériel et j'avais reçu un coup violent sur le côté de la tête. Je n'ai "
"aucune idée de ce qui m'est arrivé, mais il est clair que j'étais en fuite "
"depuis un certain temps déjà."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/soldier_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Listen, I don't want to get too into it.  I was in the reserves, OK?  I "
"didn't sign on for some glory loaded shit about protecting my nation, I "
"wanted to get some exercise, make some friends, and it looks good on my "
"resume.  I never thought I'd get called to active duty to fight <freaking> "
"zombies.  Maybe I'm a deserter, or a chickenshit, but I can tell you one "
"other thing I am that the other grunts ain't: alive.  You can figure the rest "
"out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/soldier_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was in the army.  Just a new recruit.  I wasn't even done basic training, "
"they actually called me out of boot camp to serve once the shit hit the fan.  "
"I barely knew which end of the gun the bullets came out of, and they jammed "
"me into a truck and drove me to Newport to 'assist in the evacuation "
"efforts'.  Our orders barely made sense, our officers were as confused as we "
"were."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/soldier_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"We never even made it to Newport.  The truck got stomped by something "
"gigantic.  I didn't even see it, just saw this huge black-and-green spiny leg "
"jam through the ceiling, through the el-tee.  Heard the tires grinding, felt "
"the truck lift up.  We were kicked off the leg like dog shit off a sneaker.  "
"I don't know how I survived.  The thing rolled over, killed most of us right "
"there.  I musta blacked out for a bit.  Came to, and while I was getting "
"myself out, the others started getting back up.  Long story short, I lived, "
"they didn't, and I ran."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/wedding_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, in hindsight it maybe wasn't the best choice of dates, huh?  I admit I "
"had cold feet though.  Anyway we were getting hitched at the church.  Lucky "
"for me I was late to the ceremony… I guess some of the fresher corpses in the "
"graveyard had gotten up and started harassing the party."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/wedding_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"After I saw what was going on, I turned around and headed out in the opposite "
"direction.  I've seen zombie movies before.  I picked up some stuff from home "
"and I managed to get out of town before things went really bad.  At the time "
"I thought I was being a coward, but now I know if I'd stayed to help, I'd "
"just be another dripping corpse."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/wedding_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'll be honest with you, I was paying more attention to wedding planning than "
"current events leading up to things.  I knew there were riots going on, but "
"they were out of town.  Even when they got closer to home, I tried to ignore "
"them so we could have our big day.  After the zombies started coming, though, "
"well that's when stuff got really weird.  When I was running from the wedding "
"I swear I saw the sky rip open and monsters fly out of the hole, like "
"something out of Independence Day.  I don't know what it all was, it looked "
"like black magic or something."
msgstr ""
"Je vais être honnête avec vous, je faisais plus attention aux préparations du "
"marriage qu'aux autres choses qui ce passaient. Je savais qu'il y avait des "
"émeutes, mais celles-ci étaient tellement loin. Même quand elles ce sont "
"rapprochées, j'ai essayé de les ignorer pour notre grand jour. Tous est "
"devenu vraiment bizarre quand les zombies ont commencé à se montrer. Quand "
"j'était en train de m'enfuir de la fête de mariage j'aurais juré avoir vu le "
"ciel s'éventrer et des monstres sortir du trou, presque tiré d'Independence "
"Day. Je ne sais pas ce qui a causé tout cela, on aurait dit de la magie noire "
"ou quelque chose comme ça."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/OtherSurvivorStories/NC_Farmer_background.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Actually, I ran into another survivor once - survivalist, total nutcase.  He "
"was headed for a military bunker to try and loot it, guessing that didn't go "
"well.  Anyway, he mentioned a pack of survivors who camped out at a farm "
"around here, some of them actually knew about farming.  There's a chance "
"they're still out there, could be worth looking for."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/OtherSurvivorStories/NC_SURVIVOR_CHEF_background.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I found a cell phone a while ago and it started ringing.  I picked it up and "
"just listened.  It was this cook, and they just kept talking on and on about "
"some restaurant and all the good food there and asking to be rescued.  Maybe "
"they were just dialing random numbers?  I don't know.  But they might still "
"be out there, and I wouldn't mind a good meal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/OtherSurvivorStories/No_Others_01.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Sorry, but until I met you, I thought I might be the only one left."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Boss, here's the thing… just don't be mad, please.  I lied that I'm good at "
"this… I thought I could figure it out, but it's far beyond my comprehension.  "
"I'm sorry."
msgstr ""
"Patron, voilà le truc… ne soyez pas fâché, s'il vous plaît.  J'ai menti en "
"disant que je maitrise ça… je pensais que je pouvais gérer, mais c'est bien "
"au-delà de ma compréhension.  Je suis désolée."

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Boss, here's the thing… just don't be mad, please.  I lied that I know "
"something about this… I thought I could figure it out, but it's far beyond my "
"comprehension.  I'm sorry."
msgstr ""
"Patron, voilà le truc… ne soyez pas fâché, s'il vous plaît.  J'ai menti en "
"disant que je savais quelque chose à ce sujet… je pensais que je pouvais le "
"comprendre, mais c'est bien au-delà de ma compréhension.  Je suis désolée."

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"During one of my night searches of food and supplies, I noticed a bright glow "
"that came from somewhere far away.  I thought that one of the survivors had "
"lit it to indicate their location.  As you can see, I was right.  I managed "
"to find a boat near the nearest shore, on which I set sail."
msgstr ""
"Au cours d'une de mes recherches nocturnes de nourriture et de provisions, "
"j'ai remarqué une lueur brillante qui provenait de quelque part au loin. J'ai "
"pensé que l'un des survivants l'avait allumée pour indiquer sa position. "
"Comme vous le voyez, j'avais raison. J'ai réussi à trouver un bateau près du "
"rivage le plus proche et j'ai pris la mer."

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I have been sailing on my little boat from coast to coast for a long time.  "
"In truth, the boat was not entirely mine, but it doesn't matter.  That way of "
"life provided me with sufficient safety from the <zombies>, and I managed to "
"get around the sea creatures deftly.  When I saw a distant light, at first, I "
"could not believe my eyes.  Then, I decided to find out what it is."
msgstr ""
"Cela fait longtemps que je navigue sur mon petit bateau d'une côte à l'autre. "
"En réalité, le bateau n'était pas tout à fait le mien, mais cela n'a pas "
"d'importance. Ce mode de vie me mettait suffisamment à l'abri de la mer et je "
"parvenais à contourner habilement les créatures marines. Lorsque j'ai aperçu "
"une lumière au loin, je n'en ai d'abord pas cru mes yeux. Puis, j'ai décidé "
"de découvrir ce que c'était."

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"  Unfortunately, during my 'voyage' to this lighthouse, luck turned away from "
"me.  I was attacked by some dreadful creature from the underwater depths.  I "
"couldn't fight off him and he dragged my ship to the bottom.  The waves "
"brought me straight to the shore of this little island.  I still don't "
"understand by what miracle I managed to survive, <name_g>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"  Unfortunately, when I arrived here, I forgot to tie my boat, and during "
"yesterday's storm it was carried off somewhere.  Well, you don't always have "
"to be lucky, right?"
msgstr ""
" Malheureusement, en arrivant ici, j'ai oublié d'attacher mon bateau et, "
"pendant la tempête d'hier, il a été emporté quelque part. On n'a pas toujours "
"la chance, n'est-ce pas ?"

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"  I sailed here a few days ago.  Mikhail and his family are very hospitable.  "
"Unfortunately, during our joint fishing, we were attacked by a swarm of "
"underwater abominations, and my boat was smashed to pieces.  It was so scary, "
"we could barely sail away on Mikhail's ship."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"No, no… well, maybe a little.  It was just as wrecked down here as it is up "
"top when I found it, wasn't too hard to fix up.  You're welcome to stay in "
"the spare room awhile, just don't hog it.  You're not the only scav out there."
msgstr ""
"Non, non... enfin, peut-être un peu. Elle était aussi abîmée en bas qu'en "
"haut quand je l'ai trouvée, ce n'était pas trop dur à réparer. Vous pouvez "
"rester dans la chambre d'amis un moment, mais ne la monopolisez pas. Vous "
"n'êtes pas le seul par ici."

#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Just a scav who got lucky.  Now I'm content to sit around here on my pile of "
"treasure.  I'm more than willing to trade if you've got the cash."
msgstr ""
"Just un(e) pillard(e) qui a eu de la chance.  Maintenant je suis satisfait(e) "
"de rester là sur ma pile de trucs.  Je serais comme même disposé(e) à troquer "
"avec vous si l'on peut trouver un bon marché."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"It's nice to see a new face around here.  I'm <npc_name>, it's a pleasure "
"meeting you."
msgstr ""
"C'est chouette devoir un nouveau visage ici. Je suis <npc_name>, c'est un "
"plaisir de vous rencontrer."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Like I said before, I'm a chemist.  I've been living out here for a while, "
"decided to set up shop in this old cabin.  I even found some good equipment "
"out here, and a couple useful things here in the cupboards.  I decided to "
"stay right here."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I used to be a chemist.  Well, I am a chemist.  I've been living out here in "
"the wilderness for a little while now since <the_cataclysm>.  Lucky enough, I "
"even found some good equipment out here, though unfortunately missing some of "
"the more sensitive and expensive stuff.  I found a couple useful things here "
"in the cupboards, but other than that, entirely empty.  So, I moved in."
msgstr ""
"J'étais chimiste. Enfin, je suis chimiste. Je vis ici, dans la nature, depuis "
"<the_cataclysm>. Par chance, j'ai même trouvé du bon matériel ici, mais il "
"manque malheureusement les produits les plus sensibles et les plus chers. "
"J'ai trouvé quelques objets utiles dans les placards, mais à part ça, tout "
"est vide. J'ai donc emménagé."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Not my place, just somewhere I ended up.  Some old shack, maybe a hunting "
"cabin or something more… criminal, at least judging by some of what I found "
"on the shelves.  You certainly wouldn't attract much attention synthesizing "
"illegal substances all the way out here, that's all I'm saying.  I found it "
"while I was trying to escape all the <zombies> in the city, and I decided to "
"stay."
msgstr ""
"Ce n'est pas chez moi, c'est juste un endroit où j'ai atterri. Une vieille "
"cabane, peut-être une cabane de chasseur ou quelque chose de plus... "
"criminel, du moins à en juger par ce que j'ai trouvé sur les étagères. Vous "
"n'attireriez certainement pas beaucoup l'attention en synthétisant des "
"substances illégales jusqu'ici, c'est tout ce que je dis. Je l'ai trouvé "
"alors que j'essayais d'échapper à la ville, et j'ai décidé de rester."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/NPC_campus_guard_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm not even supposed to be here today, I just lost a bet and had to take "
"this shift."
msgstr ""
"Je n'était même pas censé(e) être de garde aujourd'hui, j'ai juste perdu un "
"pari et me suis retrouvé(e) collé(e) avec ce tour."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/NPC_campus_guard_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I should be resting right now, this is my third straight shift.  Too many "
"people sick or hurt right now."
msgstr ""
"Je devrais être en train de me reposer, ceci est ma troisième garde d'affilé. "
"Nous avons trop de personnes blessées ou malades en ce moment."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Now get out of here, before I kill you."
msgstr "Maintenant sortez d'ici, avant que je vous tue."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I'm too tired, let me rest first."
msgstr "Je suis trop fatigué, laisse-moi me reposer d'abord."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Really, I haven't heard anything about it.  What's it you need?"
msgstr "Vraiment? Je n'ai rien entendu de ce genre. Que voulez-vous?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I told you already, I'm not finished with them, come back later."
msgstr "Je vous ai déjà dit. Je n'ai pas encore fini avec eux, revenez plus tard."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm a businessman, and business is my game.  I came out here to help these "
"poor, poor people who are doing without in such a bad time."
msgstr ""
"Je suis un homme d'affaires, et les affaires sont mon métier. Je suis venu "
"ici pour aider les misérables isolés durant une période si éprouvante."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm just a man looking to help some poor folks out, caught word of this place "
"from one of those old FEMA bunkers, a group's holed up there.  I figured I'd "
"come out here and help these people out."
msgstr ""
"Je suis juste quelqu'un essayant d'aider ces pauvres gens, j'ai trouvé cet "
"endroit à partir de l'un de ces vieux bunkers FEMA ou un autre groupe est "
"situé. Je me suis dit que ce serait une bonne idée de venir et offrir toute "
"aide possible."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Like I said, I'm a businessman and business is my job.  Those other yahoos "
"you've been talkin' to don't know what they're doing."
msgstr ""
"Comme je l'ai dit, je suis un homme d'affaires et les affaires sont mon "
"métier. Les autres yahoos à qui vous avez parlé ne savent pas ce qu'ils font."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"They say I turned a man into a cedar tree once.  That's a terrible thing to "
"say."
msgstr ""
"Les gens disent que j'ai transformé un homme en cèdre une fois. C'est une "
"pure calomnie."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"You like maple syrup?  That was me.  Not the syrup, that was the trees, but I "
"figured out how to make it much harder to concentrate it, used to be way too "
"easy.  Pretty nice right?"
msgstr ""
"Vous aimez le sirop d'érable? C'était moi. Pas le sirop, les arbres le "
"produisait déjà, mais j'ai trouvé un moyen de faire en sorte qu'il soit "
"beaucoup plus difficile à concentrer, c'était bien trop facile avant. Pas mal "
"non?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Did I tell you the one about the beavers?  Used to be way too big.  Like "
"giant beavers, it was a mess.  I fixed that.  Of course there seem to be a "
"bunch of new giant things out here now.  I'll have to think about that."
msgstr ""
"Je vous ai déjà parlé des castors? Ils étaient beaucoup trop grands dans le "
"temps, mais j'ai résolu le problème. Bien sûr en ce moment on dirait qu'il y "
"a beaucoup d'animaux qui sont devenus énormes, peut être que je devrais "
"essayer de trouver une solution."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm used to it.  No, Glooscap has been a name here for a very long time.  Is "
"your name foreign?"
msgstr ""
"J'ai l'habitude. Non, Glooscap est un nom utilisé ici depuis très longtemps. "
"Votre nom est-il étranger ?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"And stuff sure.  How can I help you stranger?  They say I'm the nice one.  "
"See this smile?  Nice smile right?"
msgstr ""
"Et des trucs bien sûr. Comment puis-je vous aider, étranger ? On dit que je "
"suis le gentil. Tu vois ce sourire ? Un beau sourire, non ?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I do have a twin.  Malsumis is probably around here somewhere, very tricky.  "
"You know I turned Malsumis to stone once?  I'm supposed to be the nice one, "
"but you know how much it hurts turning yourself back from stone?  It takes "
"days."
msgstr ""
"J'ai un jumeau. Malsumis est probablement quelque part par ici, très rusé. Tu "
"sais que j'ai transformé Malsumis en pierre une fois ? Je suis censée être la "
"gentille, mais tu sais à quel point ça fait mal de se transformer en pierre ? "
"Ça prend des jours."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"If I were Malsumis you would be in terrible danger my friend.  But Glooscap "
"would stop me."
msgstr ""
"Si j'étais Malsumis, tu serais en grand danger, mon ami. Mais Glooscap m'en "
"empêcherait."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I worked on a ranch not too fah from here 'fore it all went down.  I'd love "
"ta get back ta what I did - taking care of horses, cows, all sorts of "
"animals, makin' sure the fields stay safe an' all that.  But now?  I dunno, "
"man.  Just tryin' ta survive, I suppose.  Hopefully, tha world will get back "
"togetha' one day and I can put mah skills ta use doin' what I like."
msgstr ""
"Je travaillais dans un ranch pas très loin d'ici avant que tout ne s'écroule. "
"J'aimerais bien revenir à ce que je faisais - m'occuper des chevaux, des "
"vaches, de toutes sortes d'animaux, veiller à ce que les champs restent en "
"sécurité et tout ça. Mais maintenant ? Je ne sais pas, mec. J'essaie juste de "
"survivre, je suppose. J'espère que le monde se remettra en place un jour et "
"que je pourrai utiliser mes compétences pour faire ce que j'aime."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was just sort of wanderin' around, hoping ta maybe find some bettah gear.  "
"Decided ta rest up, 'eard someone walkin', and, well, here we are."
msgstr ""
"Je me promenais un peu, espérant trouver un meilleur équipement. J'ai décidé "
"de me reposer, j'ai entendu quelqu'un marcher et nous voilà."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I already told you.  Don't want to go through it again."
msgstr "Je te l'ai déjà dit. Je ne veux pas recommencer."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Lived in a nearby town.  Normal life.  9 to 5 job.  When it all happened, we "
"ran away to find some safety.  But there's no safety anymore, is there?"
msgstr ""
"Vivait dans une ville voisine. Vie normale. Un travail de 9 à 5. Quand tout "
"cela est arrivé, nous nous sommes enfuis pour nous mettre à l'abri. Mais il "
"n'y a plus de sécurité, n'est-ce pas ?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I didn't leave the town alone.  I arrived here alone."
msgstr "Je n'ai pas quitté la ville seule. Je suis arrivée seule."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I told you to just leave me alone."
msgstr "Je vous ai dit de juste me laisser tranquille."

#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I don't know if you know, but there are sewers underneath the prison.  I was "
"planning an escape long before <the_cataclysm>, and while I was working on "
"cleaning the sewers, I noticed a damaged wall section.  There was a flow of "
"fresh air coming out of it, so I think it's leading to the surface.  It could "
"be your way to freedom.  Feel free to use it."
msgstr ""
"Je ne sais pas si vous êtes au courant, mais il y a des égouts en dessous de "
"la prison. Je planifiais de m'échapper bien avant <the_cataclysm>, et lorsque "
"j'étais de corvée pour les nettoyer, j'ai repéré une section de mur "
"endommagée. Je pouvais sentir un courant d'air frais passer à travers, il est "
"donc probable que quoi qu'il y ai de l'autre côté, il soit possible de passer "
"par là pour sortir de la prison. N'hésitez pas à vous en servir."

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ", then frowns.  \"I think I'd remember something like that, no.  Sorry.\""
msgstr ""
"puis fronce les sourcils. « Je pense que je me souviendrais de quelque chose "
"comme ça, non. Désolée. »"

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
", looking thoughtful.  \"You know, around the time things really went bad, I "
"remember a really awful portal storm.  A while later, I saw something like "
"that in the distance.  Could be what you're talking about.\""
msgstr ""
", l'air pensif. « Vous savez, à l'époque où les choses ont vraiment mal "
"tourné, je me souviens d'une terrible tempête de portails. Un peu plus tard, "
"j'ai vu quelque chose comme ça au loin. Ça pourrait être ce dont tu parles. »"

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'll be honest, I don't remember a whole lot about what I was doing here.  I "
"know that I cut trees, but not much else.  Good thing I have friends here, "
"they've helped me out a lot."
msgstr ""
"Pour être honnête, je ne me souviens pas très bien de ce que je faisais ici. "
"Je sais que j'ai coupé des arbres, mais pas grand-chose d'autre. Heureusement "
"que j'ai des amis ici, qui m'ont beaucoup aidé."

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Not much to it.  I worked here as a logger before <the_cataclysm> began.  "
"When all went to hell, I was on the job and had to hole up here with my "
"coworkers.  Good news is we all came out fine, and the boss decided to keep "
"the mill running.  I don't know how much longer we can last, though; not "
"unless we make some contact with other people.  Customers, I guess you might "
"call 'em."
msgstr ""
"Il n'y a pas grand-chose à en dire. J'ai travaillé ici comme bûcheronne avant "
"que <the_cataclysm> ne commence. Quand tout est parti en vrille, j'étais au "
"travail et j'ai dû me terrer ici avec mes collègues. La bonne nouvelle, c'est "
"que nous nous en sommes tous sorties et que le patron a décidé de maintenir "
"l'usine en activité. Mais je ne sais pas combien de temps nous pourrons "
"tenir, à moins que nous n'entrions en contact avec d'autres personnes. Des "
"client(e)s, je suppose qu'on peut les appeler ainsi."

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"New to the job… or, well, whatever's happening now.  I still cut trees and "
"run logs through the saw from time to time, so I guess you'd call me a "
"logger.  Things have only gotten weirder after those fucking <zombies> nearly "
"killed us.  I'm not sure how much longer we'll last…"
msgstr ""
"Nouvelle dans le métier... ou, en tout cas, dans ce qui se passe en ce "
"moment. Je continue à couper des arbres et à passer des troncs à la scie de "
"temps en temps, alors je suppose qu'on peut m'appeler une bûcheronne. Les "
"choses sont devenues encore plus bizarres après que ces putains de <zombies> "
"ont failli nous tuer. Je ne sais pas combien de temps nous allons encore "
"tenir..."

#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Ah, home sweet home.  It feels like I haven't been here for ages.  Fuck, it "
"looks so horrible now.  I guess it's because of <the_cataclysm>.  Thank you "
"for bringing me here, <name_g>.  Let's eat the cake."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm just a regular pizzaiolo.  My father was a pizzaiolo, my grandfather was "
"a pizzaiolo and I also became a pizzaiolo.  I was making pizza my whole life, "
"until some American <name_b>s ruined my business!  I couldn't do anything "
"about this, but now, with <the_cataclysm> and <zombies> around, I have a "
"chance to get my revenge!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I worked here before <the_cataclysm> dumped everything in the <freaking> bin. "
" I took care of all the animals here, and when the <zombies> started roaming "
"the streets, I gathered every pet or stray I could.  I still take care of "
"them, just gotta worry about the <zombies> now on top of disease, "
"cleanliness, etc."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm just an average person, really.  When a horde of those <freaking> "
"<zombies> came knockin' on my door, I ran for it.  Good for me that someone "
"left this store open in the chaos, I ran inside and locked the place down.  "
"There isn't a thing in all of <city> that can bust through these walls and "
"barred windows, I'd reckon I'm the luckiest <name_b> in town."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I used to live here before <the_cataclysm>.  I was asleep when a horde of "
"<zombies> busted through the front, and in the chaos I wound up here.  When "
"the screaming stopped, I peaked out the door to find my neighbor stumbling "
"about with his face half-eaten, and I haven't left since."
msgstr ""
"Je vivais ici avant <the_cataclysm>. Je dormais quand une horde de <zombies> "
"a débarqué par l'entrée, et dans le chaos, je me suis retrouvé ici. Quand les "
"cris ont cessé, j'ai jeté un coup d'œil par la porte pour trouver mon voisin "
"qui titubait, le visage à moitié dévoré, et je ne suis pas reparti depuis."

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_CAMPER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was out here camping when <the_cataclysm> disturbed me.  I didn't know "
"anything was wrong until two <zombies> stumbled up here, and tried to kill "
"me.  I figured staying here would be my best bet, away from the cities."
msgstr ""
"Je campais ici quand <the_cataclysm> m'a dérangé. Je ne me suis rendu compte "
"de rien jusqu'à ce que deux <zombies> arrivent par hasard ici et essaient de "
"me tuer. Je me suis dit qu'il valait mieux rester ici, loin des villes."

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Haven't seen someone new in a while.  What brings you around here?"
msgstr ""
"Cela fait longtemps que je n'ai pas vu quelqu'un de nouveau. Qu'est-ce qui "
"vous amène par ici ?"

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I run this distillery you're standing in, before <the_cataclysm> it wasn't so "
"legal with the law.  I was in <city> making a deal on my product when a horde "
"of rioters busted in, so I ran for it.  I thought my business would be a nice "
"place to stay, so I came out here."
msgstr ""
"Je dirige la distillerie dans laquelle vous vous trouvez. Avant "
"<the_cataclysm>, elle n'était pas très légale. J'étais dans la <city> en "
"train de faire une affaire pour mon produit quand une horde d'émeutiers a "
"fait irruption, alors j'ai pris mes jambes à mon cou. J'ai pensé que mon "
"entreprise serait un bon endroit pour rester, alors je suis venu ici."

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"They all said I was crazy for preparing for <the_cataclysm>.  Now, they're "
"all dead, and I'm still kickin'.  When the riots turned to hordes, I was "
"ready; all I had to do was dodge a few <zombies> to get back to my bastion.  "
"I've been living safely here ever since."
msgstr ""
"Ils ont tous dit que j'étais fou de me préparer à <the_cataclysm>. "
"Aujourd'hui, ils sont tous morts, et je suis toujours en pleine forme. "
"Lorsque les émeutes se sont transformées en hordes, j'étais prêt ; tout ce "
"que j'ai eu à faire, c'est d'éviter quelques <zombies> pour retourner dans "
"mon bastion. Depuis, je vis en sécurité ici."

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I found this emergency shelter when I was running from the chaos back in the "
"cities.  Fortunately, the place hadn't been looted yet and there weren't any "
"<zombies> lurking around; just the spot to stay 'till who knows when."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/camp_start.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Hey, I did some surveying and I believe this is a good spot to set up at."
msgstr ""
"Hey, j'ai fait quelques recherches et je pense que c'est un bon endroit pour "
"s'installer."

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Air temperature, precipitation, but what about… oh, I'm sorry, I didn't "
"notice you.  Hello."
msgstr ""
"Température de l'air, précipitations, mais qu'en est-il de… oh, je suis "
"désolé, je ne vous avez pas remarquée.  Bonjour."

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I have not seen living people for a long time.  Glad to see another survivor. "
" Greetings, <name_g>."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai pas vu de personnes vivantes depuis longtemps. Heureux de voir un "
"autre survivant. Salutations, <name_g>."

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Help?  Help with what?  Oh, yes, yes.  If you know a place with many "
"survivors, can you take me there?  I doubt I can survive alone…"
msgstr ""
"De l'aide?  De l'aide avec quoi?  Oh, oui, oui.  Si vous connaissez un "
"endroit où il y a beaucoup de survivants, pouvez-vous m'y emmener?  Je doute "
"de pouvoir survivre seul…"

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I'm glad you still alive."
msgstr "Je suis heureux que vous soyez toujours en vie."

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm just a regular meteorologist.  In recent years I have worked at a weather "
"station, monitored the weather, state of air, read and wrote reports, drew up "
"schedules… in general, complete boredom.  In my free time I was studying "
"electronics and radio engineering, making various devices, some for work, "
"some just for fun.  When the first riots began, I gathered all my things that "
"I managed to take with me and settled here.  Since then I've been sitting "
"here, wasting my time doing all sorts of nonsense."
msgstr ""
"Je suis juste un météorologiste lambda. Depuis quelques années j'ai travaillé "
"dans cette station météorologique et passer ma vie a faire des choses "
"barbantes comme mesurer la pression atmosphérique, les precipitations, écrire "
"des rapports météo... Bref, rien de vraiment intéressant. Dans mon temps "
"libre par contre j'étudiais les appareils électroniques et les systèmes "
"radio, et construisais des appareils varies,  certains étaient utiles pour "
"mon boulot, certain étaient juste un projet amusant. Quant les premieres "
"emeutes ont commence a être montrées sur la television, j'ai decide de faire "
"mes valises et d'emménager de façon permanente dans la station météo. Depuis "
"ca, je n'ai fait qu'attendre ici et j'ai occupe les journées avec mon loisir "
"habituel."

#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was homeless before everything went down, just camping out here for a "
"while.  Stuck up <name_b>s shunned me for my condition, but they're all dead "
"now.  I guess I'm better off than they are."
msgstr ""
"J'étais sans-abri avant que tout ne s'écroule, je campais ici depuis un "
"moment. Les <name_b> superficielles m'évitaient à cause de mon état, mais "
"elles sont toutes mortes maintenant. Je suppose que je suis mieux loti qu'eux."

#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"It's hard to say exactly what I'm doing out here, but I guess one thing just "
"leads to another and… well, you're just being nice when you ask, aren't you?  "
"It doesn't matter now anyway.  I'm here and I'm still alive."
msgstr ""
"Il est difficile de dire exactement ce que je fais ici, mais je suppose "
"qu'une chose en entraîne une autre et... eh bien, vous êtes juste gentil "
"quand vous demandez, n'est-ce pas ? De toute façon, ça n'a plus d'importance. "
"Je suis ici et je suis toujours en vie."

#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was homeless for a while before <the_cataclysm>.  I met some buddies out on "
"the road and we were camping out here.  Now we're just scraping by on what we "
"can find, mostly.  We're willing to trade, though.  Who knows, you might find "
"yourself a good deal."
msgstr ""
"J'ai été sans abri pendant un certain temps avant <the_cataclysm>. J'ai "
"rencontré des copains sur la route et nous avons campé ici. Maintenant, on se "
"débrouille avec ce qu'on trouve, la plupart du temps. Mais nous sommes prêts "
"à faire des échanges. Qui sait, vous pourriez faire une bonne affaire."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I didn't think anyone was around here.  Pleased to meet you, I'm <npc_name>."
msgstr ""
"Je ne pensais pas qu'il y avait quelqu'un dans les environs.  Enchantée de "
"faire votre connaissance, je m'appelle <npc_name>."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
", then frowns.  \"I don't believe I've heard about anything like that, no.  "
"Sorry.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm going north, up towards the border and the big wide wilderness.  I heard "
"that there's some sort of safe spot up there, where people didn't go crazy "
"and try to kill each other.  I don't know whether or not that's true, but at "
"the very least, the colder climate might help keep the <zombies> down."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm going east, towards the coastline.  I heard some rumors that Rhode Island "
"was still holding itself together, so I'm going to go and check that out.  "
"Heck, I might just go out to sea myself, live on an old oil rig or something "
"like that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I haven't found anything out of the ordinary, just a bunch of <zombies> and "
"the ruins of our old lives."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai pas trouvé grand chose en dehors de l'ordinaire, juste des zombies et "
"les ruines de nos anciennes vies."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Actually, I came across a group of farmers on my way here.  They were a "
"little suspicious, but turned out to be pretty nice.  Good place to buy some "
"food, if they're still around."
msgstr ""
"Tant que j'y pense, j'ai rencontré un groupe de fermiers sur ma route.  Ils "
"étaient un peu suspicieux, mais assez sympathiques.  C'est un bon endroit ou "
"acheter de la nourriture si ils sont toujours là bas."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I found a small cabin out in the woods, someone was living there and had some "
"serious chemistry equipment.  I managed to get good medical supplies from "
"there.  They even had some oddball things too, like fucking napalm and black "
"powder."
msgstr ""
"J'ai trouvé une petite cabane dans les bois, quelqu'un y vivait et disposait "
"d'un équipement de chimie sérieux. J'ai réussi à obtenir de bonnes "
"fournitures médicales. Ils avaient même quelques trucs bizarres, comme du "
"putain de napalm et de la poudre noire."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I ran in to someone living in an old barn, didn't want anything to do with "
"the world.  The odd thing is, they looked like one of those old, Wild West "
"cowboys."
msgstr ""
"Je suis tombée sur quelqu'un qui vivait dans une vieille grange et qui ne "
"voulait rien avoir à faire avec le monde. Ce qui est étrange, c'est qu'elle "
"ressemblait à une de ces vieilles cow-girls du Far West."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I used to travel a lot before <the_cataclysm>, and I've had this camper with "
"me for a while now.  I was at home when the riots started, so I grabbed "
"everything I could from my house and hopped in the camper.  I nearly wrecked "
"on my way out of town when some crazy people tried to smash my van, but I "
"made it out.  I've been on the move ever since."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/refugee_caravans.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "You again.  Any good news?  Haven't heard any in a long time."
msgstr "Encore vous. De bonnes nouvelles ? Je n'en ai pas entendu depuis longtemps."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/refugee_caravans.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
", looking thoughtful.  \"Maybe, yeah.  I saw a weird building sort of like "
"that a while back, but we were on the move and couldn't stop to check it out.\""
msgstr ""
", l'air pensif. « Peut-être, oui. J'ai vu un bâtiment bizarre un peu comme ça "
"il y a quelque temps, mais on était en déplacement et on n'a pas pu s'arrêter "
"pour vérifier. »"

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/refugee_caravans.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm a refugee, but don't get the wrong idea.  I've got big dreams of settling "
"down after this and starting a big family.  I just need to find the right "
"place and the right person.  Last couple of places didn't work out so well."
msgstr ""
"Je suis une réfugiée, mais ne vous méprenez pas. Je rêve de m'installer après "
"cela et de fonder une grande famille. Il faut juste que je trouve le bon "
"endroit et la bonne personne. Les deux derniers endroits n'ont pas très bien "
"fonctionné."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"*studies you with interest, her eyes lined with fatigue but still alert.  She "
"brushes a lock of hair off her forehead.  \"Hi there.  You look new, nice to "
"meet you.  My name's Uyen.\""
msgstr ""
"*Elle vous étudie avec intérêt, les yeux marqués par la fatigue mais toujours "
"alertes. Elle brosse une mèche de cheveux sur son front. \"Bonjour, vous avez "
"l'air nouveau. Tu as l'air nouvelle, ravie de te rencontrer. Je m'appelle "
"Uyen.\""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"No way, sorry.  I was in there when things went bad.  It'll be hard enough to "
"go back after it's cleaned up, I can't bear to look at it right now."
msgstr ""
"Pas du tout, désolé. J'étais là quand les choses ont mal tourné. Ce sera déjà "
"assez difficile d'y retourner une fois que ce sera nettoyé, je ne peux pas "
"supporter de le regarder maintenant."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Sorry, no.  That's too much to ask from me.  I was back there when it went "
"wrong."
msgstr "Désolé, non. C'est trop me demander. J'étais là quand ça a mal tourné."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I oversee the food stocks for the center.  There was significant looting "
"during the panic when we first arrived so most of our food was carried away.  "
"I manage what we have left and do everything I can to increase our supplies.  "
"We've got a few growing sources of fresh meats and vegetables, so I "
"prioritize non-perishable food, such as cornmeal, jerky, and fruit wine."
msgstr ""
"Je supervise les stocks de nourriture du centre. Il y a eu d'importants "
"pillages lors de la panique qui a marqué notre arrivée, si bien que la "
"plupart de nos vivres ont été emportés. Je gère ce qu'il nous reste et je "
"fais tout ce que je peux pour augmenter nos réserves. Nous avons quelques "
"sources de viande et de légumes frais qui se développent, alors je donne la "
"priorité aux denrées non périssables, comme la farine de maïs, la viande "
"séchée et le vin de fruits."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, there's the downstairs section, we can't fit more people down there so "
"it's out of bounds.  Then there's the second bay that we were using as a "
"staging area at first.  Things went… wrong.  I hear the shopkeeper is "
"offering a reward to clear it out, if you're feeling suicidal."
msgstr ""
"Il y a la section du bas, où nous ne pouvons pas faire entrer plus de monde "
"et qui est donc interdite d'accès. Ensuite, il y a la deuxième travée que "
"nous utilisions comme zone de transit au début. Les choses ont mal tourné. "
"J'ai entendu dire que le commerçant offrait une récompense pour le "
"débarrasser, si vous vous sentez suicidaire."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm so glad we've got that up and running.  One of the people evacuated here "
"had a connection to a functioning ranch, and we got him and a crew out there "
"as quickly as we were able.  We're hoping they'll be able to supply us in "
"enough foodstuffs to make this place self-sufficient and even to trade with "
"other communities as they arise."
msgstr ""
"Je suis très heureux que nous ayons mis cela en place et que cela fonctionne. "
"L'une des personnes évacuées ici avait un lien avec un ranch en activité, et "
"nous l'avons envoyé sur place avec une équipe aussi rapidement que possible. "
"Nous espérons qu'ils seront en mesure de nous fournir suffisamment de denrées "
"alimentaires pour que nous soyons autosuffisants et que nous puissions même "
"commercer avec d'autres communautés le cas échéant."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I haven't been here for long but I do my best to watch who comes and goes.  "
"You can't always predict who will bring trouble."
msgstr ""
"Je ne suis pas ici depuis longtemps, mais je fais de mon mieux pour observer "
"les allées et venues. On ne peut pas toujours prédire qui apportera des "
"ennuis."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I've seen my share of zombies, I'm one of the ones that's ready to take em "
"on.  Nothing more."
msgstr ""
"J'ai vu ma part de zombies, je suis l'un de ceux qui sont prêts à les "
"affronter. Rien de plus."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"There's been rumors.  Folks talkin' about some kind of secret lab, out in the "
"wilds, with survivors in it.  I haven't seen it myself, mind you."
msgstr ""
"Il y a eu des rumeurs. Des gens parlent d'une sorte de laboratoire secret, "
"dans la nature, avec des survivants. Je ne l'ai pas vu moi-même."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
", looking thoughtful.  \"Hmm.  I'm not sure, but I've heard of an odd "
"building that's a bit like you're describing.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'll help out.  I've pretty much been waiting for someone to ask, the "
"mess is in my way but I've been too busy to organize it myself.  Boris is the "
"one to talk to, you say?  I'll let him know."
msgstr ""
"Oui, je donnerai un coup de main. J'attendais que quelqu'un me le demande, le "
"désordre est sur mon chemin mais j'étais trop occupé pour l'organiser "
"moi-même. C'est à Boris qu'il faut s'adresser, tu dis ? Je lui en ferai part."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah, they're my rookie representative.  I figured that those people "
"wouldn't cause too much trouble for them, so I sent them over there.  What "
"about them?"
msgstr ""
"Oh oui, ce sont mes représentants débutants. Je me suis dit que ces gens ne "
"leur causeraient pas trop d'ennuis, alors je les ai envoyés là-bas. Qu'est-ce "
"qu'ils ont ?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm a doctor, one of the several at the outpost.  We were the lucky ones.  "
"Came here right went things started to go wrong, never left."
msgstr ""
"Je suis médecin, l'un des nombreux à l'avant-poste. Nous étions les plus "
"chanceux. Nous sommes arrivés ici au moment où les choses ont commencé à mal "
"tourner, et nous ne sommes jamais repartis."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I thought I smelled a pig.  I jest… please don't arrest me."
msgstr ""
"J'ai cru sentir une odeur de porc.  Je plaisante… s'il vous plaît, ne "
"m'arrêtez pas."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Huh, thought I smelled someone new.  Can I help you?"
msgstr "Huh, j'ai cru sentir quelqu'un de nouveau. Je peux vous aider ?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Oh, I didn't mean that in a bad way.  Been out in the wilderness so long, I "
"find myself noticing things by scent before sight."
msgstr ""
"Oh, je ne voulais pas dire ça méchamment. J'ai passé tellement de temps dans "
"la nature que je remarque les choses à l'odeur plutôt qu'à la vue."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I've heard that cougars sometimes leap.  Maybe it's just a myth."
msgstr ""
"J'ai entendu dire que les couguars sautaient parfois. Ce n'est peut-être "
"qu'un mythe."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well… I was like any other civilian till they conscripted me so I'll tell it "
"to you straight.  They're the best hope we got right now.  They are stretched "
"impossibly thin but are willing to do what is needed to maintain order.  They "
"don't care much about looters since they understand most everyone is dead, "
"but if you have something they need… you WILL give it to them.  Since most "
"survivors here have nothing they want, they are welcomed as champions."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien... j'étais un civil comme les autres jusqu'à ce qu'ils m'enrôlent, "
"alors je vais vous le dire franchement. Ils sont le meilleur espoir que nous "
"ayons en ce moment. Ils sont extrêmement sollicités, mais ils sont prêts à "
"faire ce qu'il faut pour maintenir l'ordre. Ils ne se soucient guère des "
"pillards car ils savent que la plupart d'entre eux sont morts, mais si vous "
"avez quelque chose dont ils ont besoin... vous le leur donnerez. Comme la "
"plupart des survivants n'ont rien à se mettre sous la dent, ils sont "
"accueillis comme des champions."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"If you want to know what our next steps are, I'm not at liberty to tell you.  "
"Truth be told, I don't even know myself.  They don't share that sort of "
"information with me."
msgstr ""
"Si vous voulez savoir quelles sont nos prochaines étapes, je ne suis pas en "
"mesure de vous le dire. À vrai dire, je ne le sais même pas moi-même. Ils ne "
"partagent pas ce genre d'informations avec moi."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I haven't done anything wrong…"
msgstr "Je n'ai fait rien de mal…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I found a map to this place in an evac center and thought I'd see if it was "
"just full of <zombies> or if there was something up.  Didn't expect to find "
"so many survivors still alive though."
msgstr ""
"J'ai trouvé une carte de cet endroit dans un centre d'évacuation et je me "
"suis dit que j'allais voir si c'était juste plein de <zombies> ou s'il y "
"avait quelque chose de louche. Je ne m'attendais pas à trouver autant de "
"survivants encore en vie."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Sure.  Seen more'n I'd like to think about honestly.  Like, I think these "
"zombies are evolving?  I've seen new things come out that I swear aren't "
"natural.  One of them looked like it was sparking with electricity."
msgstr ""
"Bien sûr. J'en ai vu plus que je ne voudrais en penser, honnêtement. Je pense "
"que ces zombies évoluent. J'ai vu de nouvelles choses sortir qui, je le jure, "
"ne sont pas naturelles. L'un d'entre eux avait l'air de produire des "
"étincelles d'électricité."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"There's so much weird stuff out there in the wilderness now.  A while back, I "
"found this weird cartoon sign with a map on it, pointing to some kind of "
"trade center.  Haven't been there yet but I can show you my copy of the map "
"if you want."
msgstr ""
"Il y a tellement de choses bizarres dans la nature aujourd'hui. Il y a "
"quelque temps, j'ai trouvé un panneau de bande dessinée avec une carte qui "
"indiquait une sorte de centre commercial. Je n'y suis pas encore allé, mais "
"je peux vous montrer ma copie de la carte si vous voulez."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_DOCTOR.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_doctor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I'm free at the moment if you need something."
msgstr "Je suis libre en ce moment si vous avez besoin de quelque chose."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "&The mercenary looks noticeably tense as you approach."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Sorry I'd rather be left alone right now."
msgstr "Désolé, je préfère rester seul pour l'instant."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&A grim expression and deep sunken eyes imply some malady that can't be "
"simply drowned with alcohol alone.  They interrupt you just as you were about "
"to introduce yourself.  \"This anchor I'm wearing, I don't think I'll be "
"needing it any more.  I-I'm just looking for someone to rid me of it"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"It takes only a moment to retrieve a suitable coin from your pockets, and yet "
"your interlocutor found enough time to disappear, having left a sharp "
"emptiness both in memory and the chair before you.  The anchor has been "
"neatly folded on the table."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The mercenary stares in silence, a flickering of the overhead lighting "
"thankfully cuts the moment short."
msgstr ""
"Le mercenaire reste silencieux, mais une lumière vacillante au plafond vient "
"heureusement couper court à ce moment."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_drugs.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&This visitor seems way more watchful than normal.  You notice zip bags "
"peeking out from <mypossesivepronoun> overcoat, they are clearly pushing "
"something.  It doesn't take much longer for them to notice you in kind.\n"
"\"You want something?  Or just gawking?\""
msgstr ""
"&Ce visiteur semble beaucoup plus vigilant que d'habitude. Vous remarquez des "
"sacs à fermeture éclair qui dépassent du pardessus de <monpossessifpronoun>, "
"ils sont clairement en train de pousser quelque chose. Il ne faut pas "
"longtemps pour qu'ils vous remarquent à leur tour..\n"
"\"Vous voulez quelque chose ? Ou juste observer?\""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_hireable.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The mercenary's demeanor changes completely when they realize you aren't here "
"to waste time.  \"Alright, tell you what.  Get me twelve coins and that's "
"giving my skills away, just anything to be done with that voice on a box.\""
msgstr ""
"Le comportement du mercenaire change complètement lorsqu'il réalise que vous "
"n'êtes pas là pour perdre du temps. \"D'accord, je vais vous dire. Donnez-moi "
"douze pièces et c'est donner mes compétences, juste n'importe quoi à faire "
"avec cette voix sur une boîte.\""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&The mercenary stares at the window, and speaks in a quiet and terse manner.  "
"\"I have a client looking for a medical-grade human biopsy sample, no "
"questions asked.  Are you the right one for the job?"
msgstr ""
"&Le mercenaire fixe la fenêtre et parle d'une manière calme et laconique. "
"\"J'ai un client qui recherche un échantillon de biopsie humaine de qualité "
"médicale, sans poser de questions. Êtes-vous celui qu'il faut pour ce travail "
"?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&The mercenary gives you a quick appraisal.  \"Five coins for three, special "
"price just for you.  Pay in advance, and I'll arrange a drop in the subway "
"rails here for you to pick within two days.  Deal or not?"
msgstr ""
"&Le mercenaire vous donne une évaluation rapide. \"Cinq pièces pour trois, "
"prix spécial juste pour vous. Payez à l'avance, et je vous ferai déposer dans "
"les rails du métro pour que vous puissiez les récupérer dans les deux jours. "
"Marché conclu ou non ?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&The mercenary stares intently at a stain in the ceiling, firmly clutching a "
"now cold cup of soup.  No one else seems to be very concerned about this."
msgstr ""
"&Le mercenaire fixe intensément une tache au plafond, serrant fermement une "
"tasse de soupe désormais froide. Personne d'autre ne semble s'en préoccuper."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&Continued prodding manages to extract a baffling response from your "
"interlocutor \"I- I've seen it, the god of our new world, a god of flesh and "
"bone.\" <mypronoun> says with a maddened glare, as though this were some sort "
"of shocking revelation."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&You spot the mercenary at the tail end of a deal.  \"Want in on the "
"business?  Still have a pair of ID cards looking for buyers.  Two army and "
"two science cards left, they sell together for 4 coins or not at all."
msgstr ""
"&Vous repérez le mercenaire à la fin d'une transaction. \"Vous voulez "
"participer à l'affaire ? J'ai encore une paire de cartes d'identité à vendre. "
"Il reste deux cartes de l'armée et deux cartes de la science, elles se "
"vendent ensemble pour 4 pièces ou pas du tout."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_template_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&The mercenary seems uncharacteristically upbeat, or perhaps just drunk.  "
"\"Found this neat gizmo in a lab run a few days ago.\"  <mypronoun> blurts "
"while procuring a small cube of etched glass from <mypossesivepronoun> "
"pocket.  \"Now, I have no use for such a thing, but perhaps you do.  What do "
"you say?  It's yours for 3 coins.\""
msgstr ""
"&La mercenaire semble étonnamment joyeuse, ou peut-être simplement ivre. « "
"J'ai trouvé ce petit gadget sympa lors d'une mission dans un labo il y a "
"quelques jours », <mypronoun> lâche-t-elle en sortant un petit cube de verre "
"gravé de sa <mypossesivepronoun> poche. « Maintenant, je n'ai pas vraiment "
"l'utilité de ce truc, mais peut-être que toi, oui. Alors, qu'est-ce que tu en "
"dis ? C'est à toi pour 3 pièces. »"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Oh, that?  There were too many people stealing our glasses, so I started "
"stamping a logo on some bottle caps as a token and raised the drink prices a "
"bit to encourage their return.  I'll give you a merch back when you bring me "
"the token with your glass."
msgstr ""
"Oh, ça? Il y avait trop de personnes qui volaient nos verres, donc j'ai "
"commencé à appliquer un logo sur nos bouchons et capsules pour que ceux-ci "
"servent de jetons et j'ai ensuite augmenté le prix de nos boissons pour "
"encourager les clients à les rendre avec leurs verres. Je vous redonnerai une "
"merch si vous revenez avec un jeton et votre verre."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was among one of the first groups of immigrants sent here to fortify the "
"outpost.  I might have exaggerated my construction skills to get the hell out "
"of the refugee center.  Unless you are a trader, there isn't much work there "
"and food was really becoming scarce when I left."
msgstr ""
"Je faisait partie d'un des premiers groupes envoyés ici pour fortifier "
"l'avant-poste.  J'ai peut être exagéré un peu mes compétences de chantier "
"pour pouvoir enfin sortir du centre de réfugiés.  À moins que vous soyez là "
"pour échanger, il n'y a pas vraiment grand chose à faire là bas et la "
"nourriture commençait vraiment à manquer quand je suis partie."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was starting to wonder if they were really interested in the project or "
"were just trying to get rid of me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Could easily be hundreds as far as I know.  They chose this ranch because of "
"its rather remote location, decent fence, and huge cleared field.  With as "
"much land as we have fenced off we could build a village if we had the "
"materials.  We would have tried to secure a small town or something, but the "
"lack of good farmland and number of undead makes it more practical for us to "
"build from scratch.  The refugee center I came from is constantly facing "
"starvation and undead assaults."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I organize scavenging runs to bring in supplies that we can't produce "
"ourselves.  I try and provide incentives to get migrants to join one of the "
"teams… it's dangerous work, but keeps our outpost alive.  Selling anything we "
"can't use helps keep us afloat with the traders.  If you wanted to drop off a "
"companion or two to assist in one of the runs, I'd appreciate it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Hmm, let me think.  There might be a few things I could scrounge up to help, "
"but it's going to take some time to sort through the scrap to find exactly "
"what you need.  How about this… some of my tools are getting a bit worn and "
"are in need of replacement.  If you could bring me a new angle grinder and a "
"hacksaw, I should be able to find all the parts you need by the time you get "
"back."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was just a laborer till they could find me something a bit more permanent, "
"but being constantly sick has prevented me from doing much of anything."
msgstr ""
"J'étais juste une ouvrière jusqu'à ce qu'il puissent trouver quelque chose de "
"plus permanent, mais je suis constamment malade ces jours-ci et ça m'empêche "
"d'être utile pour plus ou moins quoi que ce soit."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I don't know what you could do.  I've tried everything.  Just give me time…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I keep getting sick!  At first I thought it was something I ate, but now it "
"seems like I can't keep anything down…"
msgstr ""
"Je n'arrête pas de tomber malade!  Au début j'ai crû que c'était quelque "
"chose que j'ai mangé, mais maintenant je n'arrive pas à garder quoi que ce "
"soit dans l'estomac…"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm one of the migrants that got diverted to this outpost when I arrived at "
"the refugee center.  They said I was big enough to swing an axe, so my "
"profession became lumberjack… didn't have any say in it.  If I want to eat, "
"then I'll be cutting wood from now till kingdom come."
msgstr ""
"Je suis l'un des migrants qui ont été dirigés vers cet avant-poste lorsque je "
"me suis pointée au centre de réfugiés.  Ils m'on dit que j'avais l'air d'être "
"assez solide pour manier une hache, donc je suis devenue une bûcheronne…  Pas "
"vraiment eu une opportunité de protester.  Si je veux continuer à manger, je "
"suppose que je vais devoir continuer à faire du petit bois jusqu'à la fin des "
"temps...  Hmmm, cela c'est déjà produit quand j'y pense."

#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Listen.  I said it clearly, and if you keep picking at it I'm gonna get mad.  "
"Who I was is gone.  Dead.  I don't give a shit about your 'healthy', don't "
"<freaking> ask again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"STOP, Put your hands in the air!  Ha, startled you didn't I… there is no law "
"anymore…"
msgstr ""
"STOP, mettez vos mains en l'air!  Ha, je vous ai fait peur… il n'y a plus de "
"loi…"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was watching the station when things went sideways.  None of the other "
"officers returned from the last call, well not as humans anyway…"
msgstr ""
"J'étais de garde à la station quand les choses ont dérapé.  Aucun des autres "
"officiers n'est revenu de leur dernier appel, en tout cas pas en tant "
"qu'humains…"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"This is a nice, secure building.  I'd be a fool to leave.  Been living off "
"the vending machines, but I found the code for the evidence lockup so I've "
"been doing some trading with other survivors."
msgstr ""
"C'est un bâtiment agréable et sûr. Je serais idiot de partir. J'ai vécu des "
"distributeurs automatiques, mais j'ai trouvé le code de la salle des preuves, "
"alors j'ai fait quelques échanges avec d'autres survivants."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I… I'm free.  *Zzzt* I'm actually free!  *bzzz* Look, you're the first person "
"I've seen in a long time."
msgstr ""
"Je… Je suis libre.  *Zzzt* Je suis vraiment libre!  *bzzz* Écoutez, vous êtes "
"la première personne que je vois depuis longtemps."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm a priest or guide of a sort.  I sing the hymns along my companions so "
"that we may learn to live in unity, both with each other and with our ailing "
"world."
msgstr ""
"Je suis une sorte de prêtre ou de guide. Je chante les hymnes avec mes "
"compagnons afin que nous apprenions à vivre en unité, les uns avec les autres "
"et avec notre monde malade."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I heard it's bad in the cities, back when the radio was still working.  Some "
"of those things came through here.  I want to stay out in the country if I "
"can stay safe."
msgstr ""
"J'ai entendu dire que c'était terrible dans les villes, à l'époque où la "
"radio fonctionnait encore. Certaines de ces choses sont arrivées jusqu'ici. "
"Je veux rester à la campagne si je peux rester en sécurité."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm a lot better now, I've been hunkering down here.  Something came by in "
"the night screaming and crying, sounded just like that woman.  Maybe a ghost, "
"I don't know.  It's good to have company again.  You're not a ghost, right?  "
"On second thought, don't tell me if you are, I probably don't want to know."
msgstr ""
"Je vais beaucoup mieux maintenant, je me suis blottie ici. Quelque chose est "
"venu dans la nuit en criant et en pleurant, ça ressemblait exactement à cette "
"femme. Peut-être un fantôme, je ne sais pas. C'est bon d'avoir à nouveau de "
"la compagnie. Tu n'es pas un fantôme, n'est-ce pas ? À bien y réfléchir, ne "
"me dis pas si tu l'es, je n'ai probablement pas envie de le savoir."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I grew up on the farm, I don't know much about ghosts and goblins, but I've "
"spent a lot of time growing food and I work hard.  It's better in the "
"country, cleaner.  Not as dangerous.  I hope."
msgstr ""
"J'ai grandi à la ferme, je ne sais pas grand chose sur les fantômes et les "
"gobelins, mais j'ai passé beaucoup de temps à cultiver de la nourriture et je "
"travaille dur. C'est mieux à la campagne, plus propre. Pas aussi dangereux. "
"J'espère."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "Hey, I didn't expect to live long enough to see another living human!"
msgstr ""
"Hé, je ne m’attendais pas à vivre assez longtemps pour voir un autre être "
"humain vivant !"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I've been here since shit went down.  Just my luck I had to work."
msgstr ""
"Je suis ici depuis que la situation s'est détériorée. J'ai eu de la chance de "
"devoir travailler."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, the dishwasher made a break for it three days after things got weird.  "
"He was ripped to shreds before he made it to the street.  I figure this place "
"has gotta be safer than my apartment, and at least I've got all this food "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, le laveur de vaisselle a pris la fuite trois jours après que les "
"choses aient dégénéré. Il a été déchiqueté avant d'atteindre la rue. Je pense "
"que cet endroit doit être plus sûr que mon appartement, et au moins j'ai "
"toute cette nourriture ici."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I… um… hid.  I was in the kitchen, preparing another masterpiece when I heard "
"glass shattering followed by screaming.  I ran over to the serving window to "
"see what happened, assuming a guest had fallen and broke something.  What I "
"witnessed was the most awful thing I've ever seen.  I'm not even sure I could "
"go over it again."
msgstr ""
"Je… me suis caché… J'était dans la cuisine, en train de préparer un nouveau "
"chef d'œuvre lorsque j'ai entendu du verre brisé et une cacophonie de cris "
"suivre cela. J'ai couru vers la fenêtre de service, assumant qu'un des "
"clients été tombé, brisant quelque chose par accident.  Ce qui c'est passé de "
"l'autre côté de cette fenêtre restera probablement la pire chose que j'ai "
"jamais vue. Je ne suis pas sûr que j'ai envie de décrire cela à nouveau."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Some lunatic covered in a film of goo, black as oil, had fallen through one "
"of the large glass windows.  There were glass shards stuck in its head and "
"neck.  I thought the poor guy, girl-thing-whatever was dead.  People began to "
"crowd around it, some were taking pictures."
msgstr ""
"Un fou, recouvert d'une pellicule gluante, noire comme du pétrole, était "
"tombé à travers l'une des grandes vitres. Des éclats de verre étaient coincés "
"dans sa tête et son cou. J'ai cru que le pauvre type, la fille, était mort. "
"Les gens ont commencé à se rassembler autour de lui, certains prenaient des "
"photos."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"No!  I figured the thing dead until it started writhing and spazzing out for "
"a moment.  Everyone jumped back, a few screamed, and one curious stranger "
"stepped in closer, kneeling a little… it attacked him!"
msgstr ""
"Non!  J'ai cru que la chose était morte jusqu'à ce qu'elle se mette à se "
"tordre et à s'agiter pendant un moment.  Tout le monde a reculé, quelques uns "
"ont crié, et un étranger curieux s'est approché, s'est agenouillé un peu… la "
"chose l'a attaqué!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I ran to the back of the kitchen and hid as best I could.  People outside "
"were screaming and I could hear them running.  Suddenly I heard more glass "
"shatter and something skitter out of the restaurant.  I waited a moment and "
"then went and checked the dining area.  Both the stranger and the thing were "
"gone.  People were running in the streets, some even had guns so I locked all "
"the doors and blocked the windows with what I could and barricaded myself in "
"here."
msgstr ""
"J'ai couru vers le fond de la cuisine et je me suis cachée du mieux que j'ai "
"pu. Les gens à l'extérieur criaient et je les entendais courir. Soudain, j'ai "
"entendu d'autres éclats de verre et quelque chose qui sortait du restaurant. "
"J'ai attendu un moment, puis je suis allée voir ce qui se passait dans la "
"salle à manger. L'étranger et la chose avaient disparu. Les gens couraient "
"dans les rues, certains étaient même armés. J'ai donc verrouillé toutes les "
"portes et bloqué les fenêtres avec ce que je pouvais et je me suis barricadé "
"ici."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it was awhile before it was quiet again.  I heard all kinds of sounds: "
"explosions, jets flying by, helicopters, screaming, and rapid gunfire.  I "
"swear I even heard what sounded like a freaking tank drive by at one time!  "
"I've been hiding here since."
msgstr ""
"Oui, il a fallu un certain temps avant que le calme ne revienne. J'ai entendu "
"toutes sortes de bruits : des explosions, des avions à réaction qui "
"passaient, des hélicoptères, des cris et des coups de feu rapides. Je jure "
"que j'ai même entendu ce qui ressemblait à un char d'assaut passer à un "
"moment donné ! Depuis, je me cache ici."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I've been a cook since forever, this wasn't the best joint, but management "
"was cool."
msgstr ""
"Je suis cuisinier depuis toujours, ce n'était pas le meilleur endroit, mais "
"la direction était sympa."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "Indeed it is I!  The one and only FOODPERSON!"
msgstr "En effet, c'est moi ! Le seul et unique FOODPERSON !"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/bg_pizzaiolo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was just a regular pizzaiolo.  My father was a pizzaiolo, my grandfather "
"was a pizzaiolo and I also became a pizzaiolo.  I was making pizza my whole "
"life, until some American <name_b>s ruined my business!  I couldn't do "
"anything about this, but now, with <the_cataclysm> and <zombies> around, I "
"have a chance to get my revenge!  And I got my revenge, thanks to a special "
"someone."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/bg_pizzaiolo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Are you kidding?  That was the best!  When I imagine the face of that "
"arrogant cook… mmm, sweet, sweet picture.  Oh, and how we beat up that "
"<freaking> food-<name_b>, I dreamed about it for so long… and my restaurant, "
"we beat the shit out of those <name_b>s.  Too bad it was trashed as hell… "
"anyway, let's hit the dirt."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/burger_flipper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Before this started, I had a crappy job flipping burgers at Sambal's Grille.  "
"Losing that isn't a big deal.  Losing my mom and dad hurts a lot more.  Last "
"time I saw them alive, I just came home from school, grabbed a snack and went "
"to work.  I don't think I even told my mom I loved her, and I was pissed at "
"my dad for some dumb shit that really doesn't matter.  Didn't matter then, "
"really doesn't now.  Things started going crazy while I was at work… the "
"military rolled into town, and the evacuation alert sounded."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/burger_flipper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I didn't evacuate.  I went home… saw some freaky shit on the way, but at the "
"time I just thought it was riots or drugs.  By the time I got there, my "
"parents were gone.  No sign of them.  There was a big mess, stuff scattered "
"everywhere like there'd been a struggle, and a little blood on the floor."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai pas évacué. Je suis rentré chez moi... j'ai vu des trucs bizarres sur "
"le chemin, mais à l'époque j'ai juste pensé que c'était des émeutes ou de la "
"drogue. Quand je suis arrivé, mes parents étaient partis. Aucune trace d'eux. "
"Il y avait un grand désordre, des objets éparpillés partout comme s'il y "
"avait eu une bagarre, et un peu de sang sur le sol."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/burger_flipper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I haven't found them yet.  Whenever I see a <zombie>, a little part of me is "
"afraid it's going to be one of them.  But then, maybe not.  Maybe they were "
"evacuated, maybe they fought and tried to wait for me but the military took "
"them anyway?  I've heard that sort of thing happened.  I don't know if I'll "
"ever know."
msgstr ""
"Je ne les ai pas encore trouvés. Chaque fois que je vois un <zombie>, une "
"petite partie de moi a peur que ce soit l'un d'entre eux. Mais ce n'est "
"peut-être pas le cas. Peut-être qu'ils ont été évacués, peut-être qu'ils se "
"sont battus et qu'ils ont essayé de m'attendre mais que les militaires les "
"ont quand même emmenés ? J'ai entendu dire que ce genre de choses arrivait. "
"Je ne sais pas si je le saurai un jour."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/codger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well now, that's a hell of a story, so settle in.  It all goes back to about "
"five years ago, after I retired from my job at the mill.  Times was tough, "
"but we got by."
msgstr ""
"C'est une sacrée histoire, alors installez-vous. Tout remonte à il y a "
"environ cinq ans, après que j'ai pris ma retraite de mon travail à l'usine. "
"Les temps étaient durs, mais nous nous en sortions."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/codger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Anyway, long story short, I were headin' back up to Mount Greenwood to check "
"on th' old ranger station again when I heard them bombs fallin' and choppers "
"flyin'.  Decided to camp out there to see it all through, but it didn't ever "
"end, now, did it?  So here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/confused_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I don't even fucking know anymore.  I have no freaking idea what is going on. "
" I'm just doing what I can to stay alive.  The world ended and I bungled "
"along not dying, until I met you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was a cop.  Small town sheriff.  We got orders without even really knowing "
"what they meant.  At some point one of the g-men on the phone told me it was "
"a Chinese attack, something in the water supply… I don't know if I believe it "
"now, but at the time it was the best explanation.  At first it was weird, a "
"few people - <zombies> - fighting like rabid animals.  Then it got worse.  I "
"tried to control things, but it was just me and my deputies against a town in "
"riot.  Then things really got fucked up."
msgstr ""
"Je faisais partie de la police. Sheriff d'une petite ville. Nous recevions "
"des ordres sans aucun sens. À un moment l'un des hommes du gouvernement m'a "
"dit à téléphone que c'était une attaque chinoise, quelque chose dans l'eau "
"publique... Je ne sais pas si j'y croix encore beaucoup, mais sur le moment "
"cela me semblait être une bonne explication. Au début c'était très bizarre, "
"quelques gens - <zombies> - se battant comme des animaux enragés. Après cela, "
"tout s'est empiré. J'ai essayé de garder la situation sous contrôle, mais ce "
"n'était que moi et quelque uns de mes adjoints contre une ville en émeute. "
"Après ça, après ça tout s'est empiré encore plus. "

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"A big-ass hole opened up right in the middle of town, and a nightmarish demon "
"crawled out, right in front of the church.  We unloaded into it, but bullets "
"just bounced off.  Got some civilians in the crossfire.  It started just "
"devouring people like potato chips into a gullet that looked like a rotting "
"asshole with teeth, and… well, I lost my nerve.  I ran.  I think I might have "
"been the only person to escape.  I haven't been able to even look at my badge "
"since then."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was SWAT.  By all rights I should be dead.  We were called to control "
"\"riots\", which we all know were the first <zombie> hordes.  Fat lot of good "
"we were.  Pretty sure we killed more civilians.  Even among my crew, morale "
"was piss poor and we were shooting wild.  Then something hit us, something "
"big.  Might have been a bomb, I really don't remember.  I woke up pinned "
"underneath the SWAT van.  I couldn't see anything… but I could hear it.  "
"<swear!>  I could hear everything.  I spent hours, maybe days under that van, "
"not even trying to get out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Eventually yes.  It had been quiet for hours.  I was parched, injured, and "
"terrified.  My training was maybe the only thing that kept me from freaking "
"out.  I decided to try to pull myself out and see how bad my injuries were.  "
"It was quite easy.  The side of the van was torn open, and it turned out I "
"was basically just lying under a little debris, with the ruins of the van "
"tented around me.  I wasn't even too badly hurt.  I grabbed as much gear as I "
"could, and I slipped out.  It was night.  I could hear fighting farther away "
"in the city, so I went the other way.  I made it a few blocks before I ran "
"into any <zombies>… I ran from them.  I ran, and I ran, and I ran some more.  "
"And here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm>, I was a cop.  I got shot just a couple days before "
"everything went down… I made a bad call in a drug bust and a scumbag got me "
"right in the gut, it was barely stopped by my vest.  I took some pretty bad "
"internal bruising.  I never thought getting shot would save my life, but I "
"was off duty recuperating when the worst of it hit."
msgstr ""
"Avant <the_cataclysm>, je faisais partie de la police. Je me suis fait "
"tiré(e) dessus quelque jours avant que tout s'écroula... J'ai pris une "
"mauvaise décision durant une saisie de drogue et un salaud m'a eu pile dans "
"le bide, mon gilet n'ayant presque pas arrêté la balle. Je m'en suis tiré "
"avec beaucoup de contusions. Je n'aurais jamais pensé que me faire tirer "
"dessus sauverait ma vie, mais j'étais en congé de convalescence lorsque le "
"pire est arrivé."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"At first I wanted to help.  The riots, fighting in the streets, it was too "
"much for me to just sit in my house and hear about it on the news.  Then a "
"buddy of mine called me from just off the front lines.  He'd been hurt and he "
"wasn't making much sense, but what he told me… well, you can imagine the kind "
"of stuff he told me.  Everything the worst of the internet was making up, and "
"more.  Instead of packing up to try to volunteer back onto active duty, I "
"took his advice and packed up to leave.  My house was on the edge of town and "
"the riots hadn't reached it yet, but from what I'd heard it was smarter to "
"get out than to hold tight.  I slipped out that night, took my quad out, and "
"camped a few days in the woods, waiting for it to blow over.  It never did."
msgstr ""
"Au début, je voulais aider. Les émeutes, les combats dans les rues, c'était "
"trop pour moi de rester chez moi à écouter les informations. Puis un de mes "
"amis m'a appelé de l'autre côté de la ligne de front. Il avait été blessé et "
"ne comprenait pas grand-chose, mais ce qu'il m'a dit... vous pouvez imaginer "
"le genre de choses qu'il m'a racontées. Tout ce que le pire de l'internet "
"inventait, et plus encore. Au lieu de faire mes valises pour essayer de me "
"porter volontaire pour retourner au service actif, j'ai suivi son conseil et "
"j'ai fait mes valises pour partir. Ma maison se trouvait à la périphérie de "
"la ville et les émeutes ne l'avaient pas encore atteinte, mais d'après ce que "
"j'avais entendu, il était plus judicieux de partir que de s'accrocher. Je me "
"suis éclipsé cette nuit-là, j'ai sorti mon quad et j'ai campé quelques jours "
"dans les bois, en attendant que ça se calme. Cela n'a jamais été le cas."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Honestly, probably better than it sounds.  I had a good bug-out bag, a nice "
"tent, a lot of good stuff.  I hadn't suffered any internal organ damage, my "
"stomach muscles were just really badly bruised, and I'd already had some good "
"time to recover.  I think it kept me from doing anything too stupid, and "
"believe me there was a high chance of that.  For a long time I had these "
"Rambo visions of rushing into town and saving everyone, but I was still too "
"immobile.  By the time I had my strength back, it wasn't an option… we were "
"well into the rushing into town for supplies phase.  The closest I got to "
"saving any old friends was putting down the monsters wearing their faces."
msgstr ""
"Honnêtement, c'est probablement mieux qu'il n'y paraît. J'avais un bon sac de "
"survie, une bonne tente, beaucoup de bonnes choses. Je n'avais subi aucune "
"lésion des organes internes, les muscles de mon estomac étaient juste très "
"abîmés, et j'avais déjà eu le temps de récupérer. Je pense que cela m'a "
"empêché de faire quelque chose de trop stupide, et croyez-moi, il y avait de "
"fortes chances que cela arrive. Pendant longtemps, j'ai eu des visions de "
"Rambo, me précipitant dans la ville pour sauver tout le monde, mais j'étais "
"encore trop immobile. Lorsque j'ai retrouvé mes forces, ce n'était pas une "
"option... nous étions déjà bien avancés dans la phase de ravitaillement en "
"ville. Le plus près que j'ai pu sauver de vieux amis a été d'abattre les "
"monstres qui portaient leurs visages."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was just sittin' in lockup.  They took me in the night before, for a "
"bullshit parole violation.  Assholes.  I was stuck in my cell when the cops "
"all started yelling about an emergency, geared up, and left me in there "
"havin' a <freaking> staring contest with a security cam that probably wasn't "
"even on.  I was stuck in there for two god-damn days, with no food and only a "
"little water.  Then this big-ass zombie busted in.  I didn't know what the "
"fuck to think, but if my cam wasn't working, the one in the hall sure was.  "
"Tripped a motion sensor or some shit, alarm started going, and the big dumb "
"fuck turned around to get at it while its arms were still stuck in the cell "
"bars.  Ripped the whole door out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"'cuz I know how cops think.  If you can call it that.  Early days, they were "
"still going after alarms in case it meant, I dunno, survivors.  You smack "
"some fucker's sports car, it starts wailing, the cops come to take a look and "
"you can walk right behind 'em.  That's the thing about cops; they follow "
"orders, right?  Even when the world's comin' apart.  I kept my head down "
"until I got past the worst of it, but then, lucky me, I got sergeant "
"brainiac.  Figured out why someone would trip an alarm on purpose, had them "
"case all up and down the streets for me.  I wound up on the edge of town "
"layin' low under an abandoned RV for a few hours.  By then… well, they had "
"some other big problems to deal with.  For a little bit.  Might've survived "
"if they hadn't blown their wads chasing me around the block."
msgstr ""
"parce que je sais comment les flics pensent. Si on peut appeler ça comme ça. "
"Au début, ils s'en prenaient encore aux alarmes au cas où elles "
"signifieraient, je ne sais pas, des survivants. Si tu défonces la voiture de "
"sport d'un connard, elle se met à hurler, les flics viennent jeter un coup "
"d'œil et tu peux marcher juste derrière eux. C'est ça le truc avec les flics "
": ils suivent les ordres, non ? Même quand le monde s'écroule. J'ai gardé la "
"tête baissée jusqu'à ce que je passe le pire, mais ensuite, j'ai eu de la "
"chance, j'ai eu le cerveau du sergent. J'ai compris pourquoi quelqu'un "
"déclencherait une alarme volontairement, j'ai fait faire des recherches dans "
"toutes les rues pour moi. Je me suis retrouvé à la périphérie de la ville, "
"caché sous un camping-car abandonné pendant quelques heures. À ce "
"moment-là... ils avaient d'autres gros problèmes à régler. Pendant un petit "
"moment. J'aurais pu survivre s'ils ne s'étaient pas ruinés à me poursuivre."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Bullshit, that's what.  The assholes busted me on possession, wasn't even my "
"fuckin' stash.  I don't do crack, man, that shit's nasty, I was just carryin' "
"it for my buddy Johnny.  Y'know, this might be a <freaking> hellhole now, but "
"if I've seen the last power-trippin' asshole cop, it might all be worth it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was fricking lucky for <the_cataclysm>.  I was squatting in a warehouse out "
"on the edge of town.  I was in a real shitty place, and my crew had mostly "
"just been arrested in a big drug bust, but I had skipped out.  I was scared "
"they were gonna think I ratted 'em out and come get me, but hey, no worries "
"about that now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was just in a warehouse, not in Zambonia.  I had the internet.  Watched "
"those crazy videos on YouTube in real time, scared the shit out of me.  I had "
"it pretty good though, I'd lifted a bunch of canned food and shit, and I had "
"a pretty sweet little squat in that warehouse.  I'd been planning on spending "
"a long time there after all, while I figured out how to get in good with my "
"crew."
msgstr ""
"J'étais dans un entrepôt, pas en Zambie. J'avais Internet. J'ai regardé ces "
"vidéos folles sur YouTube en temps réel, ça m'a foutu la trouille. Je m'en "
"sortais plutôt bien, j'avais soulevé un tas de conserves et d'autres trucs, "
"et j'avais un joli petit squat dans cet entrepôt. J'avais prévu d'y passer un "
"long moment, le temps de trouver un moyen de m'entendre avec mon équipe."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  <zombies>.  A bunch of them, led by this big creepy-ass jet-black "
"bastard with glowing red eyes, I shit you not.  I dunno what brought them way "
"out my way but they saw me takin' a piss outside and that was that.  I took a "
"few shots at them but that creepy-ass motherfucker waves his hands and brings "
"'em back up, so I ran.  Once I got my shit together again I realized it "
"wasn't so bad, I was running out of stuff anyway.  Been livin' on what I can "
"loot ever since, until I fell in with you."
msgstr ""
"Oui. <zombies>. Un tas d'entre eux, menés par ce gros bâtard noir de jais "
"avec des yeux rouges luisants, je vous emmerde. Je ne sais pas ce qui les a "
"amenés sur mon chemin, mais ils m'ont vu pisser dehors et c'est tout. J'ai "
"tiré quelques coups de feu sur eux, mais cet enfoiré de flippant a agité ses "
"mains et les a ramenés à la surface, alors je me suis enfui. Une fois que "
"j'ai repris mes esprits, j'ai réalisé que ce n'était pas si grave, je n'avais "
"plus rien de toute façon. Depuis, je vis de ce que je peux piller, jusqu'à ce "
"que je tombe sur toi."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, I mean, if he's surrounded by buddies like that and he can just bring "
"'em back, I think he's a scary bastard.  If I got him on his own I think "
"maybe I could have taken him.  Also when I was running I managed to get a "
"zombie on its own, and I smashed it to shit with a stick before the rest "
"showed up.  He tried to raise that one and it didn't get back up."
msgstr ""
"S'il est entouré de copains comme ça et qu'il peut les ramener, je pense que "
"c'est un bâtard effrayant. Si je l'avais eu tout seul, je pense que j'aurais "
"pu l'avoir. Quand je courais, j'ai aussi réussi à attraper un zombie tout "
"seul, et je l'ai réduit en bouillie avec un bâton avant que les autres "
"n'arrivent. Il a essayé de le relever et il ne s'est pas relevé."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/dreamer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"OK, this is gonna sound crazy but I, like, I knew this was going to happen.  "
"Like, before it did.  You can even ask my psychic except, like, I think she's "
"dead now.  I told her about my dreams a week before the world ended.  Serious!"
msgstr ""
"OK, ça va paraître dingue, mais je savais que ça allait arriver. Genre, avant "
"que ça n'arrive. Vous pouvez même demander à ma voyante, mais je crois "
"qu'elle est morte maintenant. Je lui ai parlé de mes rêves une semaine avant "
"la fin du monde. Sérieux !"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/dreamer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"OK, so, sometimes I dream that I am a zombie.  I just don't realize it.  And "
"I just act normal to myself and I see zombies as normal people and normal "
"people as zombies.  When I wake up I know it's fake though because if it were "
"real, there would be way more normal people.  Because they'd actually be "
"zombies.  And everyone is a zombie now."
msgstr ""
"Parfois, je rêve que je suis un zombie. Je ne m'en rends pas compte. Je me "
"comporte normalement et je vois les zombies comme des gens normaux et les "
"gens normaux comme des zombies. Quand je me réveille, je sais que c'est faux "
"parce que si c'était vrai, il y aurait beaucoup plus de gens normaux. Parce "
"qu'ils seraient en fait des zombies. Et tout le monde est un zombie "
"maintenant."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/dreamer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"So, like, there were some really bad riots, okay?  Everyone got really "
"violent and nasty, and to be honest, I was on a bit of a spirit journey for a "
"lot of it and I don't really remember too well.  But the weirdest part is, "
"nobody even *cared* about each other.  It's like all our caring got sucked "
"away.  I think it was some kind of negative energy thing.  And also that made "
"the dead, like, come back to life and stuff.  Plus, like, there were some "
"monsters?  I'm not really sure how they fit in."
msgstr ""
"Il y a eu de très mauvaises émeutes, d'accord ? Tout le monde est devenu très "
"violent et méchant, et pour être honnête, j'étais un peu en voyage spirituel "
"pendant une bonne partie de l'événement et je ne m'en souviens pas très bien. "
"Mais le plus étrange, c'est que personne ne s'est soucié des autres. C'est "
"comme si toute notre attention avait été aspirée. Je pense que c'était une "
"sorte d'énergie négative. Et aussi un truc qui faisait que les morts "
"revenaient à la vie et tout ça. Et puis, il y avait des monstres ? Je ne sais "
"pas vraiment comment ils s'intègrent."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I made it to one of those <freaking> evac shelters, but it was almost worse "
"than what I left behind.  Escaped from there, been on the run since."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I spent a lot of time rummaging for rhubarb and bits of vegetables in the "
"forest before I found the courage to start picking off some of those dead "
"monsters.  I guess I was getting desperate."
msgstr ""
"J'ai passé beaucoup de temps à chercher de la rhubarbe et des morceaux de "
"légumes dans la forêt avant de trouver le courage de commencer à éliminer "
"certains de ces monstres morts. Je crois que je commençais à être désespéré."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Not exactly.  After a while, I got brave.  I started venturing towards the "
"outskirts of town, picking off zombies here and there.  I learned about "
"traveling in at night to avoid all but those <freaking> shadow-zombies, and "
"that got me pretty far.  Eventually I cleared out a cozy little nook for "
"myself and started really feeling comfortable.  I guess I got a bit "
"complacent."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I thought I had those damned <zombies> figured out.  I got braver, started "
"heading out by day more and more.  One of those screamer zombies spotted me "
"and called in a horde, with a giant <freaking> beastie at the head of it, the "
"size of a Volkswagen and all covered in bone plates.  I know when I'm "
"outclassed.  The big guy was held back by his own horde of buddies, and I "
"managed to book it back to my place.  I closed the windows, locked it down, "
"but it was too late.  The giant followed me and just started hammering right "
"through the walls.  I grabbed what I could and made for the horizon.  Last I "
"saw of my squat, it was collapsing on the bastard.  For all I know, it died "
"in the crash, but I am not going back to find out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"What happened?  I'm not really sure.  You must know about the riots and all "
"that, that the government and the police totally failed to contain.  I don't "
"have a good guess what caused that.  I thought it was the usual stuff at "
"first, and I gotta admit, I was sort of excited and scared it was the start "
"of a revolution.  Not excited enough to join in though, and I guess anyone "
"who was is probably dead now.  I tried to wait it out at home, packed a "
"little bug-out bag, but then the internet started showing videos of rioters "
"getting back up and fighting with crazy injuries.  I don't know how many "
"people really believed it at first, but I took that as my sign and ditched "
"town for the evac shelter.  I don't know exactly what happened after that.  "
"The center I was in was heavily vandalized and empty, and I never saw anyone "
"else.  The cell phone grid was locked up, except for one emergency message "
"that came through around a day later saying the government had fallen.  Power "
"went out a few days later."
msgstr ""
"Qu'est-ce qui c'est passé? Je ne suis pas vraiment sûr(e). Vous devez savoir "
"au sujet des émeutes et tout ça que le gouvernement et la police ont "
"totalement échoué à maintenir en ordre. Je n'ai pas vraiment de bonne "
"hypothèse sur ce qui a causé ça. Je pensais que ce n'était que la routine au "
"début, et je dois admettre que j'était un peu excité(e) et avait aussi peur "
"que ceci était le début d'une révolution. Pas assez excité(e) pour m'y "
"joindre par contre, et je suppose que ceux qui ont fait cela sont déjà morts. "
"J'ai essayé d'attendre que cela passe chez moi, me suis fait un petit sac de "
"provisions s'y j'avait besoin de décamper, mais c'est durant cette période "
"que l'internet à commencé à être rempli de personnes se relevant et se "
"battant en ignorant des blessures énormes. Je ne sais pas combien de "
"personnes y croyait vraiment en début, mais j'ai pris ça comme mon signe de "
"quitter la ville et aller à un abri d'évacuation. Je ne sais pas vraiment ce "
"qui c'est passé après ça. L'abri où je suis arrivé(e) était vandalisé et "
"vide, et je n'ai jamais rencontré qui que ce soit ayant eu la même idée que "
"moi. Le réseau téléphonique était surchargé ou hors de fonction, je n'ai reçu "
"qu'un seul message d'urgence ayant réussi à passer à travers un jour après "
"que je sois arrivé(e) annonçant que le gouvernement s'était écroulé, le "
"réseau électrique rendant l'âme quelques jours après ça."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Same as most people who didn't get killed straight up during the riots.  I "
"went to one of those stupid <freaking> evacuation death traps.  I actually "
"lived there for a while with three others.  One guy who I guess had watched a "
"lot of movies kinda ran the show, because he seemed to really know what was "
"going on.  Spoiler alert: he fucking didn't."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Things went south when our fearless leader decided we had to put down one of "
"the other survivors that had been bitten.  Her husband felt a bit strongly "
"against that, and I wasn't too keen on it either; by this point, he'd already "
"been wrong about a lot.  Well, he took matters into his own hands and killed "
"her.  Then her husband decided one good turn deserves another, and killed the "
"idiot.  And then she got back up and I killed her again, and pulped our "
"former leader.  Unfortunately she'd given her husband a hell of a nip during "
"the struggle, when he couldn't get his shit together enough to fight back.  "
"Not that I fucking blame him.  We made it out of there together, but it was "
"too much for him, he clearly wasn't in it anymore… the bite got infected, but "
"it was another <zombie> that finally killed him.  And then I was alone."
msgstr ""
"Les choses se sont gâtées lorsque notre intrépide chef a décidé que nous "
"devions abattre l'un des autres survivants qui avait été mordu. Son mari s'y "
"est opposé, et je n'étais pas très enthousiaste non plus ; à ce stade, il "
"s'était déjà trompé sur beaucoup de choses. Il a donc pris les choses en main "
"et l'a tuée. Puis son mari a décidé qu'une bonne action en méritait une autre "
"et a tué l'idiot. Puis elle s'est relevée, je l'ai tuée à nouveau et j'ai "
"réduit en bouillie notre ancien chef. Malheureusement, elle avait donné à son "
"mari un sacré coup de fouet pendant la lutte, alors qu'il n'arrivait pas à se "
"ressaisir suffisamment pour riposter. Ce n'est pas que je lui en veuille. On "
"a réussi à sortir de là ensemble, mais c'était trop pour lui, il n'était "
"clairement plus dans le coup... la morsure s'est infectée, mais c'est un "
"autre <zombie> qui l'a finalement tué. Et puis je me suis retrouvée seule."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, I assume you know about the riots and the military and police and the "
"freakin' nightmare monsters walking the earth beside zombies, right?  If "
"you're asking what I think caused it all, well, I dunno.  My best guess it "
"was some huge government overreach, maybe some kind of experimental bioweapon "
"that got away.  They tried to lie so much at the start about everything that "
"was going on, I don't think the whole 'Chinese attack' shit measures up.  "
"They were trying to cover something up.  As for the real end times, maybe the "
"rest of the world tried to contain it.  I heard there were honest-to-god "
"nukes going off here on American soil.  To me that seems like somewhere else, "
"maybe Europe, trying to get whatever is going on here contained.  Maybe it "
"even worked.  It's bad now but it's not like it was."
msgstr ""
"Je suppose que vous êtes au courant des émeutes, de l'armée, de la police et "
"des monstres cauchemardesques qui se promènent sur terre à côté des zombies, "
"n'est-ce pas ? Si vous me demandez ce qui a causé tout ça, eh bien, je ne "
"sais pas. Je pense qu'il s'agit d'un énorme excès du gouvernement, peut-être "
"une sorte d'arme biologique expérimentale qui s'est échappée. Ils ont "
"tellement essayé de mentir au début sur tout ce qui se passait, je ne pense "
"pas que toute cette histoire d'\"attaque chinoise\" tienne la route. Ils "
"essayaient de dissimuler quelque chose. Quant à la véritable fin des temps, "
"peut-être que le reste du monde a essayé de la contenir. J'ai entendu dire "
"que des bombes atomiques avaient explosé sur le sol américain. Pour moi, "
"c'est comme si un autre pays, peut-être l'Europe, essayait d'endiguer ce qui "
"se passe ici. Peut-être même que cela a fonctionné. La situation est grave "
"aujourd'hui, mais elle n'est plus ce qu'elle était."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"There's nothing too special about me, I'm not sure why I survived.  I got "
"evacuated with a handful of others, but we were too late to make the second "
"trip to a FEMA center.  We got attacked by the dead… I was the only one to "
"make it out.  I never looked back."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai rien qui sort vraiment de l'ordinaire, et je ne suis pas sûr pourquoi "
"j'ai réussi à survivre.  J'ai été évacué avec quelque autres vers un abri, "
"mais il était déjà trop tard pour être collecté par un second transport vers "
"un centre FEMA.  Nous avons ensuite été attaqués par une horde et... j'ai été "
"le seul à m'en sortir."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Sheer luck I guess.  I went the absolute wrong way, into town, and wound up "
"stuck in the subway system.  I spent a few days living off vending machine "
"food.  Not the best eating, but I pulled through.  At least there weren't so "
"many zombies down there."
msgstr ""
"Juste de la pure chance je suppose.  Je me suis enfui dans la pire direction, "
"pile vers la ville, et je me suis retrouvé coincé dans les tunnels de métro.  "
"J'ai souffert à travers quelques jours où je n'ai mangé que des choses issues "
"de distributeurs automatiques, mais au moins il n'y avait pas trop de zombies."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Straight up hunger.  I didn't have any great light source down there, and I "
"didn't have much food.  I was slipping up and down to the station to buy from "
"the vending machines, but once I ran out of cash I had to make a break for "
"it.  I waited until dark and then skipped out."
msgstr ""
"J'avais juste trop faim.  Je n'avais pas grand chose là dessous et pas de "
"lampe torche correcte, donc je ne faisait que des petits allez-retours vers "
"la station pour acheter des trucs aux distributeurs, mais quand ma carte est "
"tombée à court d'argent j'ai dû me résoudre à attendre jusqu'à ce qu'il fasse "
"noir dehors et courir pour ma vie."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Straight up hunger.  I didn't have any great light source down there, and I "
"didn't have much food.  I was slipping up and down to the station to buy from "
"the vending machines, but once I ran out of cash I had to think of something "
"else.  I started raiding the surrounding area by night, and built a decent "
"little base under there."
msgstr ""
"J'avais juste trop faim.  Je n'avais pas grand chose là dessous et pas de "
"lampe torche correcte, donc je ne faisait que des petits allez-retours vers "
"la station pour acheter des trucs aux distributeurs, mais quand ma carte est "
"tombée à court d'argent j'ai dû changer ma tactique et fouiller les environs "
"durant la nuit pour ramener des choses en bas."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  I had it pretty good there, but eventually I just started going a bit "
"nuts.  Always dark, a bit cold, living off scavenged junk food… a soul can "
"only live like that for so long.  When the weather above ground got warmer "
"and the daylight hours got longer I decided to get a bit braver.  I'd learned "
"enough about the <zombies> that I was able to live pretty well after that.  "
"I've camped a few places, scavenged berries and whatnot, lived a pretty good "
"life compared to those first few months."
msgstr ""
"Oui.  C'était pas mal, mais éventuellement j'ai commencé à un peu perdre la "
"boule.  Tout était toujours si sombre, froid et humide, et je ne survivait "
"que sur de la malbouffe…  Au bout d'un moment quelqu'un ne peut plus vivre "
"comme ça.  Lorsque les journées se sont allongées et le thermomètre à grimper "
"j'ai décidé de devenir un peu plus brave.  J'avais appris assez au sujet des "
"<zombies> que j'étais plus ou moins capable d'éviter le pire et de trouver de "
"la nourriture correcte après ça."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Woah, <name_g>, I don't even know where to start.  The riots?  I think it was "
"going on sooner than that.  There were bad murmurs going on a few weeks "
"before that happened.  Lots of really scary crimes, not your usual stuff but "
"like cannibalism and some real unspeakable shit, you know?  When the riots "
"started, I think I was already primed to think of it as something different "
"from a normal equality riot or anything like that.  I think that's part of "
"how I got out safer, I had had some time to get some stuff and get going, and "
"didn't try to make shopping trips.  People were abso-fuckin-lutely crazy in "
"those days.  It was a lot like the pandemic a few years back, except the "
"police were out in the streets in force, gunning people down like it was "
"going out of style."
msgstr ""
"Woah, <name_g>, je ne sais même pas par où commencer. Les émeutes ? Je pense "
"que c'était plus tôt que ça. Il y avait de mauvais murmures quelques semaines "
"avant que ça n'arrive. Beaucoup de crimes vraiment effrayants, pas les trucs "
"habituels, mais du cannibalisme et des trucs vraiment innommables, tu vois ? "
"Lorsque les émeutes ont commencé, je pense que j'étais déjà préparé à penser "
"qu'il s'agissait de quelque chose de différent d'une émeute normale sur "
"l'égalité ou de quelque chose de ce genre. Je pense que c'est en partie ce "
"qui m'a permis de sortir plus en sécurité, j'avais eu le temps de prendre "
"quelques affaires et de me mettre en route, et je n'ai pas essayé de faire "
"des courses. Les gens étaient complètement fous à l'époque. Cela ressemblait "
"beaucoup à la pandémie d'il y a quelques années, sauf que la police était "
"dans les rues en force, abattant les gens comme si c'était démodé."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"They were shipping me with a bunch of evacuees over to a refugee center, when "
"the bus got smashed in by the biggest zombie you ever saw.  It was busy with "
"the other passengers, so I did what anyone would do and fucked right out of "
"there."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I ran until I felt like my lungs were going to jump right out of my mouth.  I "
"holed up in the forest for the night, under a fir tree.  In the morning I "
"heard someone talking, so I went to see.  I was playing it pretty careful "
"though, there were still a lot of psychos and rioters around.  I snuck up on "
"some kind of thing, some monster worse than any zombie.  Some huge bug thing, "
"saying random phrases like some kind of broken tape recorder.  It was "
"dragging a few human bodies behind it, I couldn't tell if they were dead or "
"unconscious.  Honestly I didn't wait to find out, I ducked into the bushes "
"and tried not to breath until I couldn't hear it anymore."
msgstr ""
"J'ai couru jusqu'à ce que j'aie l'impression que mes poumons allaient sauter "
"de ma bouche. Je me suis caché dans la forêt pour la nuit, sous un sapin. Au "
"matin, j'ai entendu quelqu'un parler, alors je suis allé voir. J'ai été assez "
"prudent, car il y avait encore beaucoup de psychopathes et d'émeutiers dans "
"les parages. Je me suis approché d'une sorte de chose, d'un monstre pire que "
"n'importe quel zombie. Un énorme insecte qui prononçait des phrases au "
"hasard, comme une sorte de magnétophone cassé. Il traînait quelques corps "
"humains derrière lui, je ne pouvais pas dire s'ils étaient morts ou "
"inconscients. Honnêtement, je n'ai pas attendu de le savoir, je me suis "
"réfugié dans les buissons et j'ai essayé de ne pas respirer jusqu'à ce que je "
"ne l'entende plus."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Once I was okay leaving the bushes, I made my way to an old shed I could see "
"a ways off.  It was falling in but it kept the rain and wind off and gave me "
"a place out of sight.  I stayed there until I ran out of those ass-tasting "
"ration bars I'd filled my backpack with.  Then I took on the wanderin' life "
"until we met."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"My evac shelter got swarmed by some of those bees, the ones the size of dogs. "
" I took out a few with a plank, but pretty quick I realized it was either "
"head for the hills or get stuck like a pig.  The rest is history."
msgstr ""
"Mon abri d'évacuation s'est fait envahir par un essaim de ces abeilles, "
"celles de la taille de chiens. J'ai réussi à en tuer quelques unes avec une "
"planche, mais je me suis rapidement rendu compte que c'était soit décamper "
"dans les forêts environnantes soit me faire embrocher comme un cochon par des "
"dizaines de dards. Vous connaissez la suite."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm sure you've seen them, they're everywhere.  Like something out of "
"an old sci-fi movie.  Some of the others in the evac shelter got stung, it "
"was no joke.  I didn't stick around to see what the lasting effect was "
"though.  I'm not ashamed to admit I ran like a <freaking> chicken."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, excuse me if I didn't stop to fucking ask what kind of killer bugs they "
"were."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_6.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, I was at home when the cell phone alert went off and told me to get to "
"an evac shelter.  So I went to an evac shelter.  And then the shelter got too "
"crowded, and people were waiting to get taken to the refugee center, but the "
"buses never came.  You must already know about all that.  It turned into "
"panic, and then fighting.  I didn't stick around to see what happened next; I "
"headed into the woods with what tools I could snatch from the lockers.  I "
"went back a few days later, but the place was totally abandoned.  No idea "
"what happened to all those people."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_6.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I gotta be honest with you, I heard a lot of stories back at the shelter, and "
"only one of them really stuck.  This is some kind of science experiment gone "
"wrong.  I don't know what caused the riots and the undead in the first place, "
"but there's no way it's this out of control everywhere.  Yeah, I got the same "
"'the government has fallen' text as everyone, but it doesn't make *sense* "
"that it could be so widespread so fast.  I think we're in some sort of "
"exclusion zone, where they're letting whatever is going on run its course to "
"see how it works so they can fight it better next time.  Somewhere out there, "
"outside the zone, it's more or less business as usual."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/ex_pilot_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Where was I?  I don't even know, what day do you think it all ended?  When I "
"thought shit was hitting the fan I took some vacation time at the airline.  "
"Next day, somebody bombed them.  No shit, just like Oklahoma city in '95.  "
"Thought that was a good sign to get out so I emailed some family out in the "
"country that I was coming over and got on the road.  Didn't even make it to "
"the interstate before I ran into the cops setting up a roadblock.  I drove "
"off the road and it all gets fuzzy from there.  Next town I got to was "
"already lynching people from the streetlights… I didn't stop for gas.  Lost "
"the car at some point, lost track of the days too.  Not sure I ever got a "
"reply to my email."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/fema_evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"That place was chaos.  I only stayed a few hours.  They had a big backhoe "
"running, digging a huge pit in a cordoned section they wouldn't let us near.  "
"Well, I managed to sneak over that way, and saw them dumping load after load "
"of the dead in the pit, pouring dirt back over them even as they revived and "
"tried to climb out.  Even with all the shit I've seen since, it haunts me.  I "
"knew then I had to get out.  Luckily for me, we were attacked the next "
"morning by some giant horror, a kind I haven't really seen since then.  While "
"the guards were busy with that, I grabbed some supplies I'd stocked up over "
"the night and I fucked right out of there.  A few others tried to get the "
"fuck out with me, but as far as I know I was the only lucky one."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm not from around here… You can probably tell from the accent, I'm from the "
"UK.  I was here doing my PhD at Dartmouth.  I was halfway to MIT for a "
"conference when <the_cataclysm> stopped me.  I was staying at a flea-ridden "
"little motel on the side of the road.  When I got up for whatever was going "
"to pass for breakfast, the fat bloody proprietor was sitting at his desk, "
"wearing the same grubby clothes from the night before.  I thought he had just "
"slept there, but when he looked at me… well, you know what those Zed-eyes "
"look like.  He lunged, and I reacted without thinking.  Smacked him on the "
"head with my tablet, again and again, until he stopped coming for me.  I "
"never thought I had anything like that in me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I wandered for a little while around the grounds, letting the adrenaline "
"fade, hoping for some kind of idea what to do.  I was out in the middle of "
"nowhere, and I didn't know the area at all.  I wasn't certain if I should "
"head back to Hanover, and try to get my belongings, or stay out where I was.  "
"Finally, I decided to rest a while until I knew what was going on.  The "
"internet told me most of what I needed; I'm sure you saw Twitter in those "
"days.  Even if I'd thought it wise to go back all the way to New Hampshire, I "
"was far too scared."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yes.  Simple hunger.  The vending machines sold only peanuts and biscuits.  I "
"wasn't about to rely on that for survival.  I stayed long enough to realize "
"no one was going to come for me, then packed up what I could and drove off.  "
"Eventually my car was caught in a downpour of acid rain that stripped the "
"tires and left me to carry on on foot, living the life of a hunter gatherer.  "
"Honestly, I think I eat better this way than I did as a grad student."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was in biochemistry.  Specifically, if you're interested, I was studying "
"the folding of non-standard nucleic acids into enzyme-like structures.  It "
"sounds more interesting than it was; most of my time was spent cursing at "
"computer screens and wishing we had more information on threose chains at "
"unusual temperatures and pressures for modeling."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Nothin' special before <the_cataclysm>.  When the dead started walking, I "
"geared up and started puttin' them back down."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Almost got killed.  One <zombie> is easy pickins, but ten is a lot, and a "
"hundred is a death trap.  I got myself in too deep, an' barely slipped out "
"with my guts still inside me.  Holed up in an old motel for a while lickin' "
"my wounds and thinkin' about what I wanted to do next.  That's when I figured "
"it out."
msgstr ""
"Je me suis presque fait tuer. Un <zombie> est une proie facile, mais dix "
"d'entre eux sont une toute autre chose, et une centaine et une mort assurée. "
"J'ai plongé trop profond, et je m'en suis sorti avec plus de trous qu'il est "
"comfortable d'avoir. Je me suis terré dans un vieux motel pendant ma "
"convalescence, et pendant que je léchais mes blessures et réfléchissait à ce "
"que je voulais faire ensuite, je me suis rendu compte de quelque chose."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"This is it.  This is what I was made for.  There in the street, smashin' "
"monster heads and prayin' I'd make it out?  I've never felt like that.  "
"Alive.  Important.  So after I got myself all stuck back together, I nutted "
"up and went back to it.  Probly killed a thousand Z since then, and I'm still "
"not tired of it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Oh, you know.  Blah blah blah, had a job and a life, everyone died.  Boo hoo. "
" I gotta be straight with you though: I honestly think I like this better.  "
"Fighting for survival every day?  I've never felt so alive.  I've killed "
"hundreds of those bastards.  Sooner or later one of them will take me out, "
"but I'll go down knowing I did something actually important."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well y'see, I'm not from these parts at all.  I was driving up from the South "
"to visit my son when it all happened.  I was staying at a motel when a "
"military convoy passed through and told us to evacuate to a FEMA shelter."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, t'vois, je suis pas du tout d'ici. Je roulais depuis le Sud pour "
"rendre visite à mon fils quand c'est arrivé.  Je m'étais installé dans un "
"motel quand un convoi militaire est arrivé et nous a ordonné d'évacuer vers "
"un abri de la FEMA."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"He lives up in Northern Canada, way in the middle of nowhere, with his crazy "
"wife and my three grandkids.  He's an environmental engineer for some oil and "
"gas company out there.  She's a bit of a hippy-dippy headcase.  I love em "
"both though, and as far as I'm concerned they all made it out of this fucked "
"up mess safe, out there in the boondocks.  I guess they think I'm dead, so "
"they'll steer clear of this hellhole, and that's the best as could be."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Lord no.  I'll be fucked if I let a kid in a too-big uniform tell me what the "
"hell to do.  I had my Hummer loaded out and ready to go offroading, I had a "
"ton of gas, and I even had as many rifles as the border was gonna let me "
"bring over.  I didn't know what I was supposed to be running from, but I sure "
"as shit didn't run."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"At first, I just kept going North, but I ran into a huge military blockade.  "
"They even had those giant walking robots like on TV.  I started going up to "
"check it out, and before I knew it they were opening fire!  I coulda died, "
"but I still have pretty good reactions.  I turned tail and rolled out of "
"there.  My Hummer had taken some bad hits though, and I found out the hard "
"way I was leaking gas all down the freeway.  Made it a few miles before I "
"wound up stuck in the ass-end of nowhere.  I settled in to wander.  I guess "
"I'm still kinda heading North, just by a pretty round-about way, you know?"
msgstr ""
"Au début, j'ai continué à aller vers le nord, mais je me suis retrouvé face à "
"un énorme blocus militaire. Il y avait même des robots géants qui marchaient, "
"comme à la télé. J'ai commencé à monter pour vérifier, et avant que je m'en "
"rende compte, ils ouvraient le feu ! J'aurais pu mourir, mais j'ai encore de "
"bonnes réactions. J'ai tourné les talons et j'ai roulé hors de là. Mon Hummer "
"avait pris quelques mauvais coups, et j'ai découvert à mes dépens que je "
"perdais de l'essence sur toute l'autoroute. J'ai fait quelques kilomètres "
"avant de me retrouver coincé au fin fond de nulle part. Je me suis mis à "
"errer. Je crois que je me dirige toujours un peu vers le nord, mais par un "
"chemin assez détourné, vous savez ?"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"We're all thinking the same thing, aren't we?  Not much this could be but "
"some kind of secret military bullshit.  At first, I thought it was our own "
"government, but after all that went down, it's just too much.  It must've "
"been the Chinese.  I wonder if those sons of bitches are sitting back home, "
"right as rain, watching us struggling down here and waiting for things to die "
"down."
msgstr ""
"Nous pensons tous la même chose, n'est-ce pas ? Il n'y a pas grand-chose qui "
"puisse être autre chose qu'une sorte de connerie militaire secrète. Au début, "
"je pensais que c'était notre propre gouvernement, mais après tout ce qui "
"s'est passé, c'est trop. Ça devait être les Chinois. Je me demande si ces "
"fils de pute sont assis chez eux, comme la pluie, à nous regarder nous "
"débattre ici et à attendre que les choses se calment."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I dunno, I'm no expert.  You might not remember, but there was that big news "
"a couple years back that supposedly China had some kind of super fusion "
"reactor.  I read a news article, apparently that was all a front for some "
"other kind of secret weapon they were working on.  Made so much energy, there "
"was no way to hide it, so they made it a story about fusion power instead.  "
"That'd explain why we never saw fusion power Stateside, don't you think?  And "
"if they were that much more advanced that they could make fusion power, who "
"knows what else they could make."
msgstr ""
"Je ne sais pas, je ne suis pas un expert. Vous ne vous en souvenez peut-être "
"pas, mais il y a eu cette grande nouvelle il y a quelques années, selon "
"laquelle la Chine aurait eu une sorte de super réacteur à fusion. J'ai lu un "
"article, apparemment ce n'était qu'une façade pour une autre sorte d'arme "
"secrète sur laquelle ils travaillaient. Le réacteur produisait tellement "
"d'énergie qu'il n'y avait aucun moyen de le cacher, alors ils en ont fait une "
"histoire sur l'énergie de fusion à la place. Cela expliquerait pourquoi nous "
"n'avons jamais vu d'énergie de fusion aux États-Unis, vous ne pensez pas ? Et "
"s'ils étaient si avancés qu'ils pouvaient produire de l'énergie de fusion, "
"qui sait ce qu'ils pourraient faire d'autre."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/high_school_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was at school.  I'm a senior.  We'd heard about riots… it started with a "
"kid showing videos of one of the big riots in Providence.  You've probably "
"seen it, the one where the woman turns to the camera and you can see her "
"whole lower lip has been ripped off, and is just flapping there?  It got so "
"bad, they went over the PA system to tell us about Chinese drugs in the water "
"supply.  Right… does anyone buy that explanation?"
msgstr ""
"J'étais à l'école. Je suis en dernière année. Nous avions entendu parler des "
"émeutes... ça a commencé avec un gamin qui montrait des vidéos de l'une des "
"grandes émeutes de Providence. Vous l'avez probablement vue, celle où la "
"femme se tourne vers la caméra et où l'on voit que toute sa lèvre inférieure "
"a été arrachée et qu'elle s'agite sur le sol ? Les choses ont tellement "
"dégénéré qu'ils ont utilisé le système de sonorisation pour nous informer de "
"la présence de drogues chinoises dans l'approvisionnement en eau. Ok... "
"est-ce que quelqu'un croit à cette explication ?"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/high_school_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I guess it got worse, because the faculty decided to put us in lockdown.  For "
"hours.  And then the school buses showed up to evacuate us.  Eventually, they "
"ran out of buses.  I was one of the lucky few who didn't have a bus to get "
"on.  The soldiers weren't much older than me… they didn't look like they knew "
"what was going on.  I lived just a few blocks away.  I snuck off."
msgstr ""
"Je suppose que ça a empiré, parce que la faculté a décidé de nous enfermer. "
"Pendant des heures. Puis les bus scolaires sont arrivés pour nous évacuer. Au "
"bout d'un moment, il n'y avait plus de bus. Je faisais partie des quelques "
"chanceux qui n'avaient pas de bus dans lequel monter. Les soldats n'étaient "
"pas beaucoup plus âgés que moi... ils n'avaient pas l'air de savoir ce qui se "
"passait. J'habitais à quelques rues de là. Je me suis éclipsé."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/high_school_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  On the way there, I met some <zombies> for real.  They chased me, but "
"I did pretty well in track.  I lost them… but I couldn't get home, there were "
"just too many.  I wound up running more.  Stole a bike and ran more again.  "
"I'm a bit better at killing those things now, but I haven't made it home yet. "
" I guess I'm afraid of what I'll find."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I saw it all pretty early, before it all really started.  I worked at the "
"hospital.  It started with a jump in the number of code whites - that's an "
"aggressive patient.  Wasn't my training so I didn't hear about it until "
"later… but rumors started flying about hyperaggressive delirious patients "
"that coded and seemed to die, then started attacking staff, and wouldn't "
"respond to anything we hit them with.  Then a friend of mine was killed by "
"one of them, and I realized it wasn't just a few weird reports.  I called in "
"sick the next day."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, <the_cataclysm>.  I lived a fair distance out of town, and I already "
"knew something was seriously wrong, but I hadn't admitted to myself what I "
"was really seeing quite yet.  When I saw the military convoys pouring into "
"the city, I put the pieces together.  At first I thought it was just my "
"hospital.  Still, I packed up my bags, locked the doors and windows, and "
"waited for the evacuation call."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"No.  The call came too late.  I'd already seen the clouds on the horizon.  "
"Mushroom clouds, and also those insane hell-clouds.  I've heard that horrible "
"things came out of them.  I decided it was safer in my locked up house."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"The military happened.  They showed up and commandeered my land for some kind "
"of forward base, demanding I evacuate to a FEMA camp.  I didn't even try to "
"argue… I had my dad's old hunting rifle, they had high tech weapons.  I heard "
"one of them joking about the FEMA camp being Auschwitz, though.  I gave their "
"evac driver the slip and decided to make for my sister's place up north.  In "
"theory I guess I'm still going that way, although honestly I'm just busy not "
"dying."
msgstr ""
"Les militaires sont arrivés. Ils sont arrivés et ont réquisitionné mon "
"terrain pour y installer une sorte de base avancée, exigeant que je sois "
"évacué vers un camp de la FEMA. Je n'ai même pas essayé de discuter... "
"J'avais le vieux fusil de chasse de mon père, ils avaient des armes de haute "
"technologie. J'ai entendu l'un d'eux plaisanter sur le fait que le camp de la "
"FEMA était Auschwitz. J'ai fait faux bond à leur chauffeur d'évacuation et "
"j'ai décidé de me rendre chez ma sœur, dans le nord. En théorie, je pense que "
"je vais toujours dans cette direction, mais honnêtement, je suis juste occupé "
"à ne pas mourir."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was at work at the hospital, when it all went down.  It's a bit of a blur.  "
"For a while there were weird reports, stuff that sounded unbelievable about "
"patients getting back up after dying, but mostly things were business as "
"usual.  Then, towards the end, stuff just skyrocketed.  We thought it was a "
"Chinese attack, and that's what we were being told.  People coming in crazed, "
"covered in wounds from bullets and bites.  About halfway through my shift I… "
"well, I broke."
msgstr ""
"J'étais au travail à l'hôpital quand tout s'est passé. C'est un peu flou. "
"Pendant un certain temps, il y a eu des rapports bizarres, des choses qui "
"semblaient incroyables sur des patients qui se relevaient après être morts, "
"mais la plupart du temps, tout se passait comme d'habitude. Puis, vers la "
"fin, les choses sont montées en flèche. Nous pensions qu'il s'agissait d'une "
"attaque chinoise, et c'est ce qu'on nous disait. Les gens arrivaient fous, "
"couverts de blessures par balles et de morsures. Vers la moitié de mon "
"service, j'ai... eh bien, j'ai craqué."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was at work at the hospital, when it all went down.  It's a bit of a blur.  "
"For a while there were weird reports, stuff that sounded unbelievable about "
"patients getting back up after dying, but mostly things were business as "
"usual.  Then, towards the end, stuff just skyrocketed.  We thought it was a "
"Chinese attack, and that's what we were being told.  People coming in crazed, "
"covered in wounds from bullets and bites.  About halfway through my shift I… "
"well, I broke.  I'd seen such horrible injuries, and then I…  <swear!>  I "
"can't even talk about it."
msgstr ""
"J'étais au travail à l'hôpital quand tout s'est passé. C'est un peu flou. "
"Pendant un certain temps, il y a eu des rapports bizarres, des choses qui "
"semblaient incroyables sur des patients qui se relevaient après être morts, "
"mais la plupart du temps, tout se passait comme d'habitude. Puis, vers la "
"fin, les choses sont montées en flèche. Nous pensions qu'il s'agissait d'une "
"attaque chinoise, et c'est ce qu'on nous disait. Les gens arrivaient fous, "
"couverts de blessures par balles et de morsures. Vers la moitié de mon "
"service, j'ai... eh bien, j'ai craqué. J'avais vu des blessures si horribles, "
"et puis je... Je ne peux même pas en parler."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"A young mother.  I know she was a mother, because I delivered her baby.  "
"Sweet girl, she… she had a good sense of humor.  She came in, spitting that "
"black goo, fighting the orderlies, dead from a bullet wound through the "
"chest.  That's when I… I don't know if I woke up, finally, or if I finally "
"went crazy.  Either way, I broke.  I broke a lot earlier than my colleagues, "
"and that's the only reason I lived.  I skipped out, went to a dead corner of "
"the hospital I used to hide in when I was a resident.  An old stairwell "
"leading to a closed-off unit the maintenance staff were using to store old "
"equipment.  I hid there for hours, while I listened to the world crumbling "
"outside and inside."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Somehow, I don't know how, I managed to fall asleep in there.  I think it "
"might have started with me hyperventilating and passing out.  When I woke up "
"it was night, I was starving and parched, and… and the screaming had died "
"down.  At first I tried to go out the way I came in, but I peaked out the "
"window and saw one of the nurses stumbling around, spitting that black shit "
"up.  Her name was Becky.  She wasn't Becky anymore.  So, I went back up and "
"somehow made it into the storage area.  From there, the roof.  I drank water "
"from some nasty old puddle and I camped out there for a while, watching the "
"city around me burn."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, I still didn't have any food.  Eventually I had to climb down the side "
"of the building… so I did, as quietly as I could.  It was night, and I have "
"pretty good nightvision.  Apparently the zombies don't, because I was able to "
"slip right past them and steal a bicycle that was just laying on the side of "
"the road.  I'd kind of scouted out my route from above… I'm not from a big "
"city, the hospital was the tallest building around.  I avoided the major "
"military blockades, and headed out of town towards a friend's old cabin.  I "
"had to fight off a couple of the <zombies>, but I managed to avoid any big "
"fuss, by some miracle."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, I still didn't have any food.  Eventually I had to climb down the side "
"of the building… so I did, as quietly as I could.  It was night, and I have "
"pretty good nightvision.  Apparently the zombies don't, because I was able to "
"slip right past them and steal a bicycle that was just laying on the side of "
"the road.  I'd kind of scouted out my route from above… I'm not from a big "
"city, the hospital was the tallest building around.  I avoided the major "
"military blockades, and headed out of town towards a friend's old cabin.  I "
"had to fight off a couple of the <zombies>, but I managed to avoid any big "
"fuss, by some miracle.  I never made it to the cabin, but that's not "
"important now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"My hospital was the tallest building in town, so I saw quite a bit.  The "
"military set up blockades on the roads coming in and out of the town, and "
"there was quite a lightshow going on out there when I started up.  I think it "
"was mostly automated turrets and robots, I didn't hear much shouting.  I saw "
"a few cars and trucks try to run the barricade and get blown to high hell.  "
"There were swarms of <zombies> in the streets, traveling in packs towards "
"sounds and noises.  I watched them rip a few running cars to shreds, "
"including the people inside who were trying to get away.  You know.  The "
"usual stuff.  I was pretty numb by that point."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was called in to work at the hospital.  I don't usually work there, I'm a "
"community doctor.  I don't really love emergency medicine at the best of "
"times, and when your patient keeps trying to rip your face off, well, it "
"takes the last bit of fun out of it.  You might think I'm a coward, but I "
"slipped out early on, and I've got no regrets.  There was nothing I could "
"have done except die like everyone else.  I couldn't get out of the building, "
"the military had blockaded us in… so I went to the most secure, quiet damned "
"place in the building."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"The morgue.  Seems like a dumb place to go at the start of a zombie "
"apocalypse, right?  Thing is, nobody had made it to the morgue in quite a "
"while, the bodies were reanimating too quickly and the staff were just too "
"busy.  I was shaking and puking and I could see the world was ending… I "
"bundled myself up, grabbed a few snacks from the pathologist's desk, and "
"crawled into one of those drawers to contemplate the end of the world.  After "
"breaking the handle to make sure it couldn't lock behind me, of course.  It "
"was safe and quiet in there.  Not just my cubby, the whole morgue.  At first "
"it was because nobody was dumb enough to come down there except me.  Later, "
"it was because nobody was left."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"The door was good heavy steel with no window, and there was a staff room with "
"a fully stocked fridge, so when it became clear that nothing was going to get "
"any better on its own, I set up shop.  I stayed down there for a couple days. "
" I could hear explosions and screaming for the first while, then just guns "
"and explosions, and then it got really quiet.  Eventually, I ran out of "
"snacks, so I worked up the nerve to climb out a window and check out the city "
"by night.  I used that place as a base for a little while, but the area "
"around the hospital was too hot to keep it up, so I made my way out to "
"greener pastures.  And here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hunter_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I live way out of town.  I hear the small towns lasted a bit longer than the "
"big cities.  Doesn't matter to me, I was out on my end-of-winter hunting "
"trip, I'd been out of town for a week already.  First clue I had things were "
"going wrong was when I saw a mushroom cloud out near an old abandoned "
"military base, way out in the middle of nowhere.  I didn't think much about "
"that.  Then I was attacked by a demon."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hunter_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it was like a… like a soft shelled crab, with tentacle mouths, and it "
"kept talking in different voices.  I saw it before it saw me, and I capped it "
"with my Remington.  That just pissed it off, but I got another couple shots "
"off while it charged me.  Third or fourth shot took it down.  I figured out "
"shit had hit the fan, somehow.  Headed to my cabin and camped out there for a "
"while, but I had to skip out when a bunch of <zombies> showed up and trashed "
"the place.  I ran into you not much later."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hunter_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah… the… the accident got him, but when I came to he was already coming "
"back.  Thank god for seatbelts, right?  He was screeching and flapping "
"around, hanging upside down.  I thought he was just hurt at first, but he "
"just kept coming at me while I tried to talk to him.  His arm was badly hurt "
"already and instead of unbuckling himself he started… he was ripping it right "
"off pulling against the seatbelt.  That, and the crazy shit with the chopper, "
"was when I realized just how fucked up things had got.  I grabbed my hunting "
"knife and ran, but my brother got out and started crawling after me."
msgstr ""
"Oui… l'... l'accident l'a tué, mais quand je me suis réveillé il était déjà "
"en train de revenir.  Merci Dieu pour les ceintures de sécurité je suppose?  "
"Il n'arrêtait pas de gémir et de s'agiter en étant suspendu tête en bas.  Je "
"pensais qu'il était juste blessé au début, mais il n'arrêtait pas d'essayer "
"de m'atteindre lorsque que j'ai commencé a essayer de lui parler.  Son bras "
"était déjà en lambeaux et il a juste commencé… à simplement se démembrer au "
"lieu de détacher sa ceinture.  Ça, et le truc cinglé avec l'hélicoptère "
"furent les choses qui m'ont ouvert les yeux sur la gravité des choses étant "
"en train de se passer.  Je suis me suis juste tiré de là avec mon fusil de "
"chasse et j'ai commencé à courir, mais mon frère se dégagea de la voiture et "
"rampa après moi pas loin derrière."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hunter_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I ran for a little bit, but then I saw soldier zombies crawling out of that "
"chopper.  They had the same look about them as my brother did, and it was "
"them on one side and him on the other.  I'm no genius but I've seen a few "
"movies: I figured out what was happening.  I didn't want to take on Kevlar "
"armor with my knife, so I turned back and faced the other zombie.  I couldn't "
"let my brother stay… like that.  So I did what I had to, and I guess I'll "
"live with that forever."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lab_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"For me, this started a couple days before <the_cataclysm>.  I'm a biochemist. "
" I did my postdoc work with a brilliant colleague, Pat Dionne.  I hadn't "
"talked to Pat in ages… word has it, the government got wind of our thesis, "
"found out Pat did most of the heavy lifting, and that was the last we talked "
"for years.  So, I was a bit surprised to see an e-mail from "
"Pat.Dionne@FreeMailNow.co.ru… even more surprised when it was a series of "
"nostalgic references to a D&D game we played years earlier."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lab_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, the references weren't quite right.  Pat referred to things that we'd "
"never played.  The situations were close, but not right, and when I put it "
"all together, it told a story.  A story about a scholar whose kids were being "
"held captive by a corrupt government, forced to research dark magic for them. "
" And there was a clincher: A warning that the magic had escaped, a warning "
"that all heroes had to leave the kingdom before it fell."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lab_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Listen, I know it's incredibly cheesy.  That's D&D for you.  Anyway, "
"something about the tone really got to me.  I knew it was important.  I "
"wasted a little time waffling, then decided to use my outstanding vacation "
"time and skip town for a while.  I packed for the end of the world.  Turns "
"out, I packed the right stuff."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lab_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"There was, yeah, but it was cryptic.  If I had a copy of Pat's notes, I could "
"probably decipher it, but I'm sure those burned up in <the_cataclysm>.  They "
"bombed those labs, you know."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was late to evacuate when the shit hit the fan.  Got stuck in town for a "
"few days, survived by hiding in basements eating girl scout cookies and "
"drinking warm root beer.  Eventually I managed to weasel my way out without "
"getting caught by the <zombies>.  I spent a few days holed up in an abandoned "
"mall, but I needed food so I headed out to fend for myself in the woods.  I "
"wasn't doing a great job of it, so I'm kinda glad you showed up."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was home with the flu when the world went to shit, and when I recovered "
"enough to make a run to the store for groceries… well, I've been running ever "
"since."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Okay, well, I was kinda out of it those first few days.  I knew there were "
"storms, but I was having crazy fever dreams and stuff.  Honestly I probably "
"should have gone to the hospital, except then I guess I'd be dead now.  I "
"don't know what was a dream and what was the world ending.  I remember "
"heading to the fridge for a drink and noticing the light was out and the "
"water was warm, I think that was a bit before my fever broke.  I was still "
"pretty groggy when I ran out of chicken soup, so it took me a while to really "
"process how dark and dead my building was when I headed out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"You probably remember what the cities were like.  I think it was about day "
"four.  Once I stepped outside I realized what was going on, or realized I "
"didn't know what was going on at least.  I saw a bunch of rioters smashing a "
"car, and then I noticed one of them was bashing a woman's head in.  I "
"canceled my grocery trip, ran back to my apartment before they saw me, and "
"holed up there for as long as I could.  Things got comparatively quiet as the "
"dead started to outnumber the living, so I started looting what I could from "
"my neighbors, re-killing them when I had to.  Eventually the <zombies> "
"overran my building and I had to climb out and head for the hills on an old "
"bike."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"You mean what caused the riots and all that?  Well, they told us it was a "
"Chinese bioweapon but I have troubles believing anyone could engineer a "
"bioweapon that could do all this.  The only answer I can come up with, silly "
"though it sounds, is aliens."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, maybe, but I'd guess it's too disorganized to be a proper invasion.  If "
"I had to guess, I'd say there was something locked in the polar ice.  Like, "
"remember a few years back there was that big thing online about an alien body "
"found in the ice?  I don't know if you remember but it was all over the news "
"for a while until it turned out to be a hoax.  Only, since then, I've seen "
"some aliens walking around that look a *lot* like that ice body.  Maybe it "
"wasn't a hoax, maybe that was a cover-up.  So, maybe those aliens had some "
"kind of virus.  It went around the world and infected everything silently "
"until, somehow, it activated and caused the violence and monsters and "
"mutations."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Let's not dance around it: I joined the riots, at first.  I don't really "
"remember what I was thinking.  I'd protested stuff like police brutality "
"before, but this was different.  I didn't make a sign and go down there "
"expecting to chant and march, I grabbed a bat and went outside planning to "
"fuck shit up.  I've never felt so angry before.  The riots had already been "
"going on a while at that point, and to me, it just looked like the government "
"trying to squash the people again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you're telling me.  The rioters… they weren't even like humans, let "
"alone protesters.  Nothing like any protest I'd ever been in before.  That "
"didn't stop me.  I joined them, and I was as bad as a bunch of them.  Smashed "
"windows, beat up bystanders, burnt cars.  I remember ripping riot gear off a "
"cop and… nevermind.  I don't want to remember that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"At some point, I felt like I was waking up.  It was around the time they were "
"busting out those Humvees with riot control turrets on top.  Says something "
"about my frame of mind that I don't even remember if I'd seen them before "
"that point.  Anyway I heard the gunfire going off and just kinda realized I "
"was on the edges of a mob charging a heavily armed military emplacement.  "
"That's when I started seeing the mob for what it was, seeing the wild-eyed "
"animals, even the zombies.  I turned and ran."
msgstr ""
"À un moment, j'ai eu l'impression de me réveiller. C'était autour du moment "
"où les forces de l'ordre on commencées à utiliser des Humvees avec des "
"tourelles anti-émeutes sur le toit. Cela indique probablement mon état "
"d'esprit que je ne me souviens même pas si j'en avais vu d'autres avant ça. "
"Bref, une rafale de fusil m'a secoué et je me suis soudain rendu compte que "
"j'étais sur le bord d'une horde furieuse en train de charger un emplacement "
"militaire armé jusqu'aux dents. J'ai aussi commencé à remarquer la vraie "
"nature de la foule, les animaux fous furieux avec leurs yeux injectés de "
"sang, voir carrément les zombies. Je me suis juste retourné et j'ai commencé "
"à courir."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I honestly don't know.  I wonder if some of the others would have come back "
"to their senses, given time.  I don't think I'm anything special.  Maybe a "
"lot of them did, and just weren't on the edge of the crowd at the time.  I'll "
"tell you, almost as soon as I came back to myself, I could see some of the "
"rioters looking at me like I was prey.  I didn't stick around to see what "
"would happen."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I knew the city pretty well.  I went for an abandoned building I knew about, "
"headed through a broken window, and holed up in there for a few days.  I had "
"a fair bit of stolen food and I just kept to myself.  When things started to "
"quiet down, I headed out, and here I am."
msgstr ""
"Je connaissais ma ville assez bien. Je suis rentré(e) dans un bâtiment "
"abandonné que je connaissais à travers un fenêtre brisée, et me suis "
"planqué(e) là quelques jours. J'avait une bonne pile de nourriture volée et "
"je me suis juste isolé(e). Lorsque les choses ont commencé à se calmer, je "
"suis sorti(e) de ma cachette, et me voilà je suppose."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"So, I remember the time leading up to the riots, same as anyone.  Things were "
"bad, there were some really awful crimes being reported in the news, and "
"there was a lot of racial tension as usual from the way the cops were "
"handling it.  Then people started rioting, which isn't unusual, but it was "
"weird the kind of places that the riots were starting in.  Like, upper middle "
"class neighborhoods, Midwestern small towns, things like that.  Anyway, I "
"joined the riots and I don't remember a lot of clear stuff after that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Kinda, I guess.  I heard people blaming the riots on some kind of mind "
"control drug, and frankly I'm not sure that's far off base.  That's kinda "
"what it felt like, although the whole time I really felt like myself.  It "
"wasn't until I snapped out of it that I realized how weird it was.  That "
"doesn't explain anything else though: the zombies, the monsters, all this "
"stuff is way off base.  Anything I've tried to guess just sounds like bad "
"science fiction, like demonic curses or alien weapons kinda stuff."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"That's how it goes, you know?  These are the end times.  I don't really want "
"to talk about it more than that.  And honestly, I never really felt like I "
"belonged, in the old world.  In a weird way, I actually feel like I have a "
"purpose now.  Do you ever get that?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah, have you seen them yet?  They're these shitty walking flowers with a "
"big <freaking> stinger in the middle.  They travel in packs.  They hate the "
"zombies, and we were using them for cover to clear a horde of the dead.  "
"Unfortunately, turns out the plants are better trackers than the <zombies>.  "
"They almost seemed intelligent… I barely made it out, only because they were, "
"uh, distracted."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I said, I don't wanna talk about it.  How are you not understanding this?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Like I said, it's a lame story, but I guess it won't kill me to tell it one "
"more time."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  I really did.  It took me two days to make it across the city on foot, "
"camping out in dumpsters and places like that.  I started moving more by "
"night, and I learned right away to avoid the military.  They were a magnet "
"for the <zombies>, and they were usually stationed where the monsters were "
"coming.  Some parts of the city were pretty tame at first.  There were a few "
"chunks where people had been evacuated or cleared out, and the <zombies> "
"didn't really go there.  Later on, others like me started moving into those "
"neighborhoods, so I switched and started running through the blasted out "
"downtown.  I had to anyway, to get home.  By the time I made the switch "
"though, the fighting was starting to die off, and I was mostly just avoiding "
"attention from zombies and other things."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"The first warning was that I had to move from the preserved parts of the city "
"to the burnt out ones to get home.  It only got worse.  There was a police "
"barricade right outside my house, with a totally useless pair of automated "
"turrets sitting in front just idly watching the zombies lurch by.  That was "
"before someone switched them to kill everybody, back when it only killed "
"trespassing humans.  Good times, you can always trust bureaucracy to fuck "
"things up in the most spectacular way possible.  Anyway, the house itself was "
"half collapsed, a SWAT van had plowed into it.  I think I knew what I was "
"going to see in there, but I had made it that far and I wasn't going to turn "
"back."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm>, I was just a regular meteorologist.  I worked for the "
"local weather station doing data analysis and stuff.  In general, ordinary "
"boredom.  In my free time I was studying electronics and radio engineering, a "
"bit for work but mostly just as a hobby.  When the riots got serious, my "
"neighborhood was looking pretty sketchy.  I gathered all my things that I "
"managed to carry with me and settled in a radio station that seemed "
"abandoned.  I lived there for a while, doing all sorts of nonsense, until I "
"met you.  I guess you know the rest."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/nerd_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was at school for <the_cataclysm>.  Funny thing, actually: I was gearing up "
"to run a zombie survival RPG with my friends on the weekend.  Ha, I didn't "
"think it'd turn into a LARP!  Okay….  No, that wasn't funny."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/nerd_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, I may be a huge <freaking> nerd, but I'm not an idiot.  Plus I'm genre "
"savvy.  We'd already heard about people coming back from the dead, actually "
"that's why I was doing the RPG.  When the cops came to put the school on "
"lockdown I managed to slip out the back.  I live a long way out of town, but "
"there was no way I was going to take a bus home, so I walked.  Two hours.  "
"Heard a lot of sirens, and I even saw jets overhead.  It was getting late "
"when I got back, but my mom and dad weren't back from work yet.  I stayed "
"there, hoping they'd come.  I sent texts but got no reply.  After a few days, "
"well… the news got worse and worse, then it stopped completely."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/nerd_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm not stupid.  I know they're gone.  Who knows where… maybe in an evac "
"shelter, maybe in a FEMA camp.  Most of everyone is dead."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/nerd_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Eventually the zombies came.  I figured they would.  Before the net cut out, "
"there were plenty of videos online making it clear enough what was going on.  "
"I'd picked out some good gear and loaded my bag up with supplies….  When they "
"started knocking at the door, I slipped out the back and took to the street.  "
"And here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"This is gonna sound crazy, but I woke up in the forest in the middle of "
"nowhere, freezing cold, about a week before I met you.  I had my clothes, a "
"splitting headache, and absolutely no memory of anything.  Like, I know "
"stuff.  I can talk, I have skills and understanding… but I don't remember "
"where any of it comes from.  I had a driver's license in my pocket and that's "
"the only way I even know my name."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, not having a memory is weird as heck, but I'll be honest: I think it "
"might be better?  With what's going on, I bet you my memories weren't happy "
"ones.  Besides my driver's license, there were pictures of kids in my wallet… "
"not that that sparked any reaction from me.  I didn't see any kids around.  "
"Maybe losing my mind is a mercy.  Hell, maybe it's some kind of psychotic "
"break and my brain did this to itself.  To be honest with you I think I'd "
"rather focus on surviving, and not worry about it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I know it's nuts.  It sounds like fake amnesia from a Bugs Bunny cartoon.  "
"See?  How can I know that, but not remember how I know it?  Like, I remember "
"Bugs Bunny but I don't remember any time I sat down and watched a Bugs Bunny "
"show."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Who I was is gone.  All that stuff burned away in <the_cataclysm>.  Got it?  "
"Who I am now started two days into it.  I was on the run from a big-ass hell "
"zombie, running like I'd always been doing, when I found a steel baseball bat "
"just laying on the ground.  I took it as a sign and beat that gooey bastard "
"to a pulp… and that's when I became me.  I still run, because who doesn't, "
"but I stand my ground now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I went on, running when I had to and fighting when I could, like the rest of "
"us.  Started learning who I am now.  Lost the bat in a fight against some "
"crazy electric lightning shooting zombie.  It was arcing electricity through "
"my bat so I dropped it and used a nearby plank, but I wound up having to run "
"and leave the ol' slugger behind.  I nearly died that day."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Listen.  I said it clearly, and if you keep picking at it I'm gonna get mad.  "
"Who I was is gone.  Dead.  I don't give a shit about your 'healthy', don't "
"fucking ask again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Let's not talk about it, ok?  It just hurts to think about.  I've lost so "
"many people… and I'm sure you have too.  Let's focus on the here and now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I didn't even know about <the_cataclysm> right away.  I was way out, away "
"from the worst of it.  My car broke down out on the highway, and I was "
"waiting for a tow for hours.  I finally wound up camping in the bushes off "
"the side of the road; good thing, too, because a semi truck whipped by - dead "
"driver, you know - and turned my car into a skid mark.  I feel bad for the "
"bastards that were in the cities when it hit."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Ha, I don't fully understand it myself.  Those first few days were a tough "
"time to be outside, that's for sure.  I got caught in one of those hellish "
"rainstorms, it started to burn my skin right off.  I managed to take shelter "
"under a car, lying on top of my tent.  Wrecked the damn thing, but better it "
"than me.  From what I hear, though, I got lucky.  That was pretty much the "
"worst I saw.  I didn't run into any of those demon-monsters that I hear "
"attacked the cities, so I guess I got off lucky."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Besides the acid rain, I mostly saw people fleeing the cities.  I tried to "
"stay away from the roads, but I didn't want to get lost in the woods either, "
"so I stuck to the deep margins.  I saw cars, buses, trucks loaded down with "
"evacuees.  Plenty went right on, but a lot stalled out of gas and other "
"stuff.  Some were so full of gear and people there were folks hanging off "
"them.  Stalling out was a death sentence, because the dead were coming along "
"the roads picking off the survivors."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was out on a fishing trip with my friend when it happened.  I don't know "
"exactly how the days line up… our first clue that Armageddon had come was "
"when we got blasted by some kind of poison wind, with a sort of acid mist in "
"it that burnt our eyes and skin.  We weren't sure what to make of it so we "
"went inside to rest up, and while we were in there a weird dust settled over "
"everything."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"She took sick a few hours after we left the lake.  Puking, complaining about "
"her joints hurting.  I took us to a little shop I knew about on the "
"riverside, hoping they might have something to help or at least know what was "
"going on."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"The shop was empty, actually.  She was desperate though, so I broke in.  I "
"found out more about the chaos in towns from the store radio.  Got my friend "
"some painkillers and Gravol, but when I came out to the boat, well… it was "
"too late for her."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I wish.  That would have been a mercy.  She was letting out an awful, choking "
"scream, and her body was shredding itself apart.  Mushrooms were busting out "
"of every part of her.  I… I ran.  Now I wish that I'd put her out of her "
"misery, but going back there now would be suicide."
msgstr ""
"Si seulement j'avais fait ça. Cela aurait un acte de compassion. Rien d'autre "
"qu'un cri gargouillant sortait de ça bouche, son corps se déchirant en "
"lambeaux, des champignons et spores émergeant de chaque plaie. Je… Je me suis "
"enfui(e). J'aimerais avoir eu la force de l'achever, mais retourner là-bas "
"maintenant serait du suicide."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Ooooh, boy.  I was ready for this.  The winds were blowing this way for "
"years.  I had a full last man on earth shelter set up just out of town.  So, "
"of course, just my luck: I was miles out of town for a work conference when "
"China attacked and the world ended."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Our conference was at a retreat by a lake.  We all got the emergency "
"broadcast on our cells, but I was the only one to read between the lines and "
"see it for what it was: large scale bio-terrorism.  I wasn't about to stay "
"and find out who of my coworkers was a sleeper agent.  Although I'd bet fifty "
"bucks it was Lee.  Anyway, I stole the coordinator's pickup and headed "
"straight for my shelter."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"No, I barely got two miles.  I crashed into some kind of hell-spawn "
"bio-weapon, a crazy screeching nightmarish thing made of arms and legs and "
"heads from all sorts of creatures, humans too.  I think I killed it, but I "
"know for sure I killed the truck.  Grabbed my duffel bag and ran, after "
"putting a couple bullets into it for good measure.  I hope I never see "
"something like that again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I never made it there and can't imagine I ever will.  Every time I've tried "
"I've been headed off by the <zombies>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"The shelter?  Bought the land pretty cheap.  I hired a contractor to build "
"the thing but did the door myself.  Metal pin in the door frame.  Can't open "
"unless you remove it.  There's a little pulley inside you have to pull up to "
"reset.  They made dozens of these in the area, and I couldn't sleep knowing "
"just any <name_b> at that company could waltz in as soon as shit hit the fan. "
" They'd know exactly where to go and what to do!  Nah… how do you think I've "
"made it this long?  Always keep a trick up your sleeve."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Nope, that's it.  Got the idea for the door from a book on medieval castles, "
"in case you were wondering.  But instead of a counterweight holding a "
"drawbridge up, I just ram a hex key in a hole."
msgstr ""
"Non, c'est tout. J'ai pris l'idée d'un livre sur les chateaux médiévaux, si "
"vous vouliez savoir. Mais au lieu d'un contrepoids j'ai une clé hexagonale "
"que je place dans une serrure."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Almost as much as my house, in the end.  I think they realized they could "
"make a lot of money as things got worse and worse.  But it's nicer than my "
"house, too.  They said the ventilation system was built to withstand a month "
"of anything: nuclear fallout, biological attack, you name it.  Concrete and "
"soil above me to absorb radiation, appliances and supplies…  I even brought "
"some old books I've never read.  I always knew it would come to this."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"What, like some secret Batcave?  Pull back the curtain and it turns out I'm "
"the communist <name_b> who brewed up a demon bio-weapon in their basement?  I "
"just gave you food, all the tools in my workshop, and the safest hole in the "
"ground in the county.  If I've got any secrets left, they're mine to keep."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I knew it…  This whole time.  It was all part of the plan.  The riots, the "
"storms…  You always had control…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'd have to be absolutely imbecilic to give up the location of my stash to "
"someone I barely know.  For all I know you'd just kill me and take it all for "
"yourself!  Better luck next time, pal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, that's one way to say 'fuck you'!  I know it's been a while since shit "
"went down, but I didn't lock that door and put up that sign for no reason!  "
"How would you feel if I came and stole all the stuff that YOU locked away for "
"safe keeping?!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, that's one way to say 'fuck you'!  How…  Why…  I was still trying to "
"get back there, surviving and struggling just like you!  How would you feel "
"if I came and stole all YOUR stuff right when you needed it most?!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I guess I can't judge.  I've made some fucked up decisions, too.  Taken some "
"things that aren't mine."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"You're not really a good liar.  I built that thing like a fortress.  No one "
"would just break into it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Just don't lie about it.  I understand your life was probably in danger.  I "
"can see past that.  Trust me, I've been in sticky situations before.  Tell "
"the truth next time."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"&<npc_name> sighs and pauses for a moment.\n"
"\n"
"\"It's been so long now.  I barely even remember what I was doing.  There was "
"so much confusion and violence in those last days.  My family didn't "
"understand the threat, even though I tried to tell them.  I know what you "
"think I am, but look what's happened!  The dead are walking, the sky is "
"cracking open, and…  well, I can't even talk about it.  Isn't it obvious "
"something bigger is going on?\""
msgstr ""
"& <npc_name> soupire et se tait pour un moment.\n"
"\n"
"\"Je l'impression que ceci s'est passé il y a des années. J'ai du mal à me "
"rappeler exactement ce que je faisais, il y avais tellement de violence et de "
"confusion pendant cette période. J'ai essayé d'avertir ma famille, mais ils "
"on refusé d'entendre raison. Je sais que la plupart des gens pense que je ne "
"suis pas tout à fait sain(e) d'esprit, mais regardez ce qui c'est passé! Les "
"morts se lèvent, le ciel s'écroule, et... vous croyez vraiment qu'il n'y a "
"rien qui cloche dans le monde?\""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I thought I knew at one point.  There were so many signs of manipulation and "
"control.  I thought maybe they were trying to discredit the protests, but "
"when the violence broke out it seemed to be everywhere.  There was footage on "
"the news of people fighting, destroying property, eating animals and… each "
"other in the street.  I thought at some point they were going to sweep in and "
"seize control, but it just never happened."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"You know, the elites.  The ones who have always had control will continue "
"having control, no matter what it costs.  If it means destroying everything "
"to be king of the ashes, they'll do it.  I used to think it was China, for "
"sure, but I'm not so sure anymore.  I figured they would probably be here by "
"now, putting on their crown.  Maybe they're still waiting to make their move…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"That's what I'm saying!  Everything that's going on wouldn't be possible "
"without massive fuck-ups by people in power.  China has fusion reactors?  "
"Well, I've never seen it!  America sinks trillions and trillions of dollars "
"into secret military budgets with no explanation.  If you gave me a trillion "
"dollars and the brain of a bureaucrat, I bet I could completely fuck up "
"reality, too."
msgstr ""
"C'est ce que je dis ! Tout ce qui se passe ne serait pas possible sans les "
"erreurs massives des gens au pouvoir. La Chine a des réacteurs à fusion ? Je "
"n'ai jamais vu ça ! L'Amérique engloutit des billions et des billions de "
"dollars dans des budgets militaires secrets sans aucune explication. Si vous "
"me donnez un billion de dollars et le cerveau d'un bureaucrate, je parie que "
"je pourrais aussi complètement foutre en l'air la réalité."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I've been trying not to think about it, but you could be right.  The more "
"that I see, the less I can explain.  I grew up around a lot of people who "
"always talked about the Rapture.  Hell itself opening up and everything.  It "
"was like they KNEW it would happen.  Before the internet stopped working, I "
"saw people saying that sinners were becoming zombies.  'As above, so below' "
"someone said, or something like that…"
msgstr ""
"J'ai essayé de ne pas y penser, mais vous pourriez avoir raison. Plus je vois "
"de choses, moins je peux les expliquer. J'ai grandi avec beaucoup de gens qui "
"parlaient toujours de l'Enlèvement. L'enfer lui-même s'ouvrait et tout le "
"reste. C'était comme s'ils savaient que cela allait arriver. Avant que "
"l'internet ne cesse de fonctionner, j'ai vu des gens dire que les pécheurs "
"devenaient des zombies. Quelqu'un a dit « comme en haut, comme en bas », ou "
"quelque chose comme ça..."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"She said it was… energy in bones?  Listen, I've heard a lot of crazy bullshit "
"in my time and that's up there, for sure.  And I don't see how something like "
"that explains all the crazy shit I've seen either.  But collecting bones to… "
"save the world?  Fuck it, give it a shot.  Maybe that's something just YOU "
"do, though.  I'm happy believing a lie if that's the truth, I'll be honest."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I'm sorry, 'officer'.  I didn't write the book of cop jokes, you know."
msgstr ""
"Je suis désolé, « officier ». Je n'ai pas écrit le livre des blagues sur les "
"flics, vous savez."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Scared?  Yeah, that's fair.  I wouldn't say it's a friendly world out here.  "
"Still, it's best to be friends.  Anyone that prepared for the apocalypse is "
"probably armed to the teeth anyway."
msgstr ""
"Effrayé ? Oui, c'est vrai. Je ne dirais pas que c'est un monde amical ici. "
"Pourtant, il vaut mieux être amis. Quiconque s'est préparé à l'apocalypse est "
"probablement armé jusqu'aux dents de toute façon."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Oh, man.  I thought I was ready.  I had it all planned out.  Bug out bags.  "
"Loaded guns.  Maps of escape routes.  Bunker in the back yard."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Depends on your definition.  I'm alive, aren't I?  When Hell itself came down "
"from the skies and monsters started attacking the cities, I grabbed my stuff "
"and crammed into the bunker.  My surface cameras stayed online for days; I "
"could see everything happening up there.  I watched those things stride past. "
" I still have nightmares about the way their bodies moved, like they broke "
"the world just to be here.  I had nothing better to do.  I watched them rip "
"up the cops and the military, watched the dead rise back up and start "
"fighting the living.  I watched the nice old lady down the street rip the "
"head off my neighbor's dog.  I saw a soldier's body twitch and grow into some "
"kind of electrified hulk beast.  I watched it all happen."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Honestly?  I was planning to die.  After what I'd seen, I went a little "
"crazy.  I thought it was over for sure, I figured there was no point in "
"fighting it.  I thought I wouldn't last a minute out here, but I couldn't "
"bring myself to end it down there.  I headed out, planning to let the "
"<zombies> finish me off, but what can I say?  Survival instinct is a funny "
"thing, and I killed the ones outside the bunker.  I guess the adrenaline was "
"what I needed.  It's kept me going since then."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I was in jail for <the_cataclysm>, but I escaped.  Hell of a story."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"It's a bit of a… it's a thing.  It started out as a dare.  I wound up making "
"a bioweapon.  It didn't get used or anything, but, well, it got out of hand."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Tax evasion.  I was an accountant, and I helped my boss move a hell of a lot "
"of money in some very clever ways.  Not clever enough, it turns out…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "Multiple counts of possession.  I used to be really hung up on meth."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Okay, well, I was in the wrong place at the wrong time.  There was a big "
"fight, I didn't stay clear of it, and me and a bunch of others got tossed in "
"solitary while a few more landed in the infirmary.  Some looked pretty bad, "
"now I kinda wonder if any of them were our first <zombies>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I heard gunshots, even from down in lockup.  Didn't hear much screaming or "
"anything.  That was my first clue something was up.  Food stopped showing up, "
"next.  Then, the lights went out.  I was down there for maybe hours, maybe "
"days, when finally a flashlight in the bars blinded me.  It was a guard.  He "
"let me out, filled me in on what was going on.  I wanted to think he was "
"crazy, but something in his eyes… I believed him."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"The guard took off on his own.  Didn't trust us, and I don't blame him.  The "
"other two wanted to set up a bandit gig.  Didn't sit right with me, so I "
"split on pretty good terms.  I ran into the guard a couple more times.  "
"Thought of seeing if he'd travel with me, but I dunno.  I don't think he'd "
"take the offer, I'll always be a con to him.  If you want to try, I can tell "
"you where I saw him last.  Wasn't long before I met you, and he had a good "
"thing going, might still be there."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/professor_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm actually a chemistry professor at Harvard.  I'd been on sabbatical for "
"the last six months.  I can't imagine the university was a good place to be, "
"given what I've heard about Boston… I'm not sure anyone made it out.  I was "
"out at my cabin near Chatham, ostensibly working on the finishing touches for "
"a paper, but mostly just sipping whisky and thanking my lucky stars for "
"tenure.  Those were good days.  Then came <the_cataclysm>, the military "
"convoys, the <zombies>.  My cabin was crushed by a fearsome beast, just "
"collateral damage after it got blasted off Orleans by a tank.  I was already "
"busy running frantically by then."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/religious_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Same as anyone.  I turned away from God, and now I'm paying the price.  The "
"Rapture has come, and I was left behind.  So now, I guess I wander through "
"Hell on Earth.  I wish I'd paid more attention in Sunday School."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/religious_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, I guess that was the Rapture.  It didn't play out how I thought it "
"would.  They made me think it was gonna be a flash of light and then *poof*, "
"everyone's gone.  Instead it was messy and dirty.  Riots in the streets, the "
"military and police serving the Antichrist to gun down the people like - what "
"was it my dad used to say - like wheat before the chaff?  Then when we'd "
"really showed our Sin, God came in with the real plagues.  The dead started "
"walking, getting up with machine gun holes in them to fight the military, and "
"the military started turning on each other too.  After that, the legions of "
"Hell itself came out.  Huge monsters, worse than anything I'd ever imagined, "
"just tore through the cities ripping everything to shreds.  Then they started "
"dying off as quick as they'd arrived, and we were left trying to run and hide "
"from the undead.  A day or two later the power started going out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, it built up a bit.  There was that acid rain, it burnt up one of my "
"tractors.  Not that I'd been working the fields since… well, it'd been a "
"terrible year and I hadn't done much worth doing.  There were explosions and "
"things, and choppers overhead.  I was scared, kept the curtains drawn, kept "
"changing the channels.  Then, one day, there were no channels to change to.  "
"Just the emergency broadcast, over and over."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"That was the first thing to really shake me out of it.  I didn't really have "
"any very close friends, but there were people back in town I cared about a "
"bit.  I had sent some texts, but I hadn't really twigged that they hadn't "
"replied for days.  I got in my truck and tried to get back to town.  Didn't "
"get far before I hit a <zombie> infested pileup blocking the highway, and "
"that's when I started to put it all together.  Never did get to town.  "
"Unfortunately I led the <zombies> back to my farm, and had to bug out of "
"there.  And now I'm here with you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"That was the first thing to really shake me out of it.  I didn't really have "
"any very close friends, but there were people back in town I cared about a "
"bit.  I had sent some texts, but I hadn't really twigged that they hadn't "
"replied for days.  I got in my truck and tried to get back to town.  Didn't "
"get far before I hit a <zombie> infested pileup blocking the highway, and "
"that's when I started to put it all together.  Never did get to town.  "
"Unfortunately I led the <zombies> back to my farm, and had to bug out of "
"there.  Might go back and clear it out, someday."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, I lived on the edge of a small town.  Corner store and a gas station "
"and not much else.  We heard about the shit goin' down in the city, but we "
"didn't see much of it until the military came blazing through and tried to "
"set up a camp there.  They wanted to bottle us all up in town, and I wasn't "
"having with that, so my dog Buck and I, we headed out while they were all "
"sniffin' their own farts."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Buck and I slipped out and went East, headin' for my friend's ranch.  Cute "
"little dope thought we were just goin' for a real long walk.  I couldn't take "
"the truck without the army boys catchin' wind of it.  We made it out to the "
"forest, camped out in a lean to.  Packed up and kept heading out.  At first "
"we walked along the highway a little, but saw too many army trucks and buses "
"full of evacuees, and that's when we found out about the <zombies>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"We got to my buddy's ranch, but the <freaking> g-men had been there first.  "
"It was all boarded up and there was a police barricade out front.  One of "
"those <freaking> turrets… shot Buck.  Almost got me too.  I managed to get my "
"pup… get him outta there, that… it wasn't easy, had to use a police car door "
"as a shield, had to kill a cop-zombie first.  And then, well, while I was "
"still cryin', Buck came back.  I had to…  <swear!>  I… I can't say it.  You "
"know."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Like I said, you want me to tell you a story, you gotta pony up the whisky.  "
"A full bottle, mind you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Mostly I just wanted to get some scotch out of you.  There really ain't much "
"of a story.  I was in the marines, years ago.  After that, did security "
"contract work.  I was out guarding some dump of a warehouse when the "
"apocalypse rolled through town.  I was out on the edge of town, armed, and "
"know when to not pick a fight, so I didn't get killed.  Wound up recruited by "
"the Free Merchants early on, and then the Old Guard for a bit, but I was "
"getting itchy feet when you came by with an offer.  Here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Huh.  Hadn't thought about it in ages, but now that you mention it, that was "
"a weird job.  It was just a boarded up warehouse in the middle of nowhere, "
"and I was not a cheap contractor in those days.  Coulda got any fat "
"rent-a-cop to watch it.  I had only just started working there when the shit "
"hit the fan, and I kinda forgot about that to be honest."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Good work, and some fun stuff, but risky.  Without a few hands at my side "
"that I trust, I wouldn't take more of their work.  If I had a solid team, "
"though, I'd happily work for Uncle Sam again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scientist_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm> I worked in a lab.  Don't look at me like that, it had "
"nothing to do with this stuff… I was studying protein-protein interactions in "
"smooth muscle in mice, using NMR.  Nothing even vaguely related to zombies.  "
"Anyway, I was at last year's Experimental Biology conference in San "
"Francisco, and an old friend of mine was talking about some really weird shit "
"she'd heard of coming out of government labs.  Really hush hush stuff.  "
"Normally I wouldn't put much cred into that sort of thing, but from her, it "
"actually had me worried.  I packed a bug-out bag just in case."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scientist_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"The evacuation order sounded, so I evacuated, comparatively quickly.  That "
"got me out before the worst part.  Our evacuation center was useless… me, a "
"couple other evacuees, a few tins of food, and a few emergency blankets.  Not "
"even close to enough to go around.  The evacuees split down the middle into a "
"few camps, and infighting started.  I ran into the woods nearby with a few "
"others.  We got away, had a little camp going.  They tried to make me their "
"leader, thought I knew more about things than I did because I'd come so "
"prepared.  Like I said, I'm not that kind of scientist, but they didn't seem "
"to understand.  I… I did my best."
msgstr ""
"L'ordre d'evacuation a sonné, j'ai donc évacué assez vite, ce qui m'a épargné "
"le pire de ce qui s'est passé dans les villes de ce que j'ai entendu. Notre "
"centre d'évacuation était… pire que rien. Juste moi, un tas d'autres "
"réfugiés, plusieurs couvertures de survie et quelques boites de conserves. "
"Bref, bien trop peu pour tout le monde. Les réfugiés se sont divisés en "
"plusieurs bandes qui ont rapidement commencées une lutte pour les ressources "
"limitées  du centre. J'ai décidé de fuir cette folie avec quelques autres et "
"pendant un moment, nous avions un petit camp assez confortable dans les bois. "
"Les autres ont essayé de faire de moi leur leader, probablement dû au fait "
"qu'il pensaient que j'avais une idée de ce qui se passait vu que j'était "
"arrivé au centre de réfugiés aussi bien préparé. Comme je l'ai déjà dit, je "
"n'était pas le genre de scientifique qui aurait su quelque chose, mais peu "
"importe ce que je leur disais, ils insistaient que je sois celui donnant les "
"ordres. J'ai… J'ai fait de mon mieux."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scientist_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I thought that us leaving, letting the others have the evac center to "
"themselves, would be enough, but it wasn't.  They tracked us down in the "
"night, a few days later.  They… well… I made it out, along with one other "
"survivor.  The attackers, they were like animals.  We tried to travel "
"together for a while.  I blamed myself, for what had happened, and couldn't "
"really get past it.  We parted ways on good terms not long before I met you.  "
"I just couldn't face the reminder of what had happened."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scientist_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I've got a memory blank for about three days before and after <the_cataclysm> "
"actually.  I worked at a lab - nothing to do with any of this; physics stuff. "
" I think I was working there when things happened.  My first clear memory is "
"running through the underbrush a few miles from town.  I was bandaged up, I "
"had a messenger bag loaded with gear, and I'd taken a hard hit to the side of "
"my head.  I have no idea what happened to me, but clearly I had already been "
"on the run for a bit."
msgstr ""
"J'ai un trou de mémoire d'environ trois jours avant et après, en fait. Je "
"travaillais dans un laboratoire - rien à voir avec tout cela ; des trucs de "
"physique. Je pense que j'y travaillais quand les choses se sont passées. Mon "
"premier souvenir clair est celui d'une course dans les sous-bois à quelques "
"kilomètres de la ville. J'avais des bandages, un sac de messager chargé de "
"matériel et j'avais reçu un coup violent sur le côté de la tête. Je n'ai "
"aucune idée de ce qui m'est arrivé, mais il est clair que j'étais en fuite "
"depuis un certain temps déjà."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/soldier_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Listen, I don't want to get too into it.  I was in the reserves, OK?  I "
"didn't sign on for some glory loaded shit about protecting my nation, I "
"wanted to get some exercise, make some friends, and it looks good on my "
"resume.  I never thought I'd get called to active duty to fight <freaking> "
"zombies.  Maybe I'm a deserter, or a chickenshit, but I can tell you one "
"other thing I am that the other grunts ain't: alive.  You can figure the rest "
"out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/soldier_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was in the army.  Just a new recruit.  I wasn't even done basic training, "
"they actually called me out of boot camp to serve once the shit hit the fan.  "
"I barely knew which end of the gun the bullets came out of, and they jammed "
"me into a truck and drove me to Newport to 'assist in the evacuation "
"efforts'.  Our orders barely made sense, our officers were as confused as we "
"were."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/soldier_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"We never even made it to Newport.  The truck got stomped by something "
"gigantic.  I didn't even see it, just saw this huge black-and-green spiny leg "
"jam through the ceiling, through the el-tee.  Heard the tires grinding, felt "
"the truck lift up.  We were kicked off the leg like dog shit off a sneaker.  "
"I don't know how I survived.  The thing rolled over, killed most of us right "
"there.  I musta blacked out for a bit.  Came to, and while I was getting "
"myself out, the others started getting back up.  Long story short, I lived, "
"they didn't, and I ran."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/wedding_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah, in hindsight it maybe wasn't the best choice of dates, huh?  I admit I "
"had cold feet though.  Anyway we were getting hitched at the church.  Lucky "
"for me I was late to the ceremony… I guess some of the fresher corpses in the "
"graveyard had gotten up and started harassing the party."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/wedding_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"After I saw what was going on, I turned around and headed out in the opposite "
"direction.  I've seen zombie movies before.  I picked up some stuff from home "
"and I managed to get out of town before things went really bad.  At the time "
"I thought I was being a coward, but now I know if I'd stayed to help, I'd "
"just be another dripping corpse."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/wedding_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'll be honest with you, I was paying more attention to wedding planning than "
"current events leading up to things.  I knew there were riots going on, but "
"they were out of town.  Even when they got closer to home, I tried to ignore "
"them so we could have our big day.  After the zombies started coming, though, "
"well that's when stuff got really weird.  When I was running from the wedding "
"I swear I saw the sky rip open and monsters fly out of the hole, like "
"something out of Independence Day.  I don't know what it all was, it looked "
"like black magic or something."
msgstr ""
"Je vais être honnête avec vous, je faisais plus attention aux préparations du "
"marriage qu'aux autres choses qui ce passaient. Je savais qu'il y avait des "
"émeutes, mais celles-ci étaient tellement loin. Même quand elles ce sont "
"rapprochées, j'ai essayé de les ignorer pour notre grand jour. Tous est "
"devenu vraiment bizarre quand les zombies ont commencé à se montrer. Quand "
"j'était en train de m'enfuir de la fête de mariage j'aurais juré avoir vu le "
"ciel s'éventrer et des monstres sortir du trou, presque tiré d'Independence "
"Day. Je ne sais pas ce qui a causé tout cela, on aurait dit de la magie noire "
"ou quelque chose comme ça."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/OtherSurvivorStories/NC_Farmer_background.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Actually, I ran into another survivor once - survivalist, total nutcase.  He "
"was headed for a military bunker to try and loot it, guessing that didn't go "
"well.  Anyway, he mentioned a pack of survivors who camped out at a farm "
"around here, some of them actually knew about farming.  There's a chance "
"they're still out there, could be worth looking for."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/OtherSurvivorStories/NC_SURVIVOR_CHEF_background.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I found a cell phone a while ago and it started ringing.  I picked it up and "
"just listened.  It was this cook, and they just kept talking on and on about "
"some restaurant and all the good food there and asking to be rescued.  Maybe "
"they were just dialing random numbers?  I don't know.  But they might still "
"be out there, and I wouldn't mind a good meal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/OtherSurvivorStories/No_Others_01.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "Sorry, but until I met you, I thought I might be the only one left."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Boss, here's the thing… just don't be mad, please.  I lied that I'm good at "
"this… I thought I could figure it out, but it's far beyond my comprehension.  "
"I'm sorry."
msgstr ""
"Patron, voilà le truc… ne soyez pas fâché, s'il vous plaît.  J'ai menti en "
"disant que je maitrise ça… je pensais que je pouvais gérer, mais c'est bien "
"au-delà de ma compréhension.  Je suis désolé."

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Boss, here's the thing… just don't be mad, please.  I lied that I know "
"something about this… I thought I could figure it out, but it's far beyond my "
"comprehension.  I'm sorry."
msgstr ""
"Patron, voilà le truc… ne soyez pas fâché, s'il vous plaît.  J'ai menti en "
"disant que je savais quelque chose à ce sujet… je pensais que je pouvais le "
"comprendre, mais c'est bien au-delà de ma compréhension.  Je suis désolé."

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"During one of my night searches of food and supplies, I noticed a bright glow "
"that came from somewhere far away.  I thought that one of the survivors had "
"lit it to indicate their location.  As you can see, I was right.  I managed "
"to find a boat near the nearest shore, on which I set sail."
msgstr ""
"Au cours d'une de mes recherches nocturnes de nourriture et de provisions, "
"j'ai remarqué une lueur brillante qui provenait de quelque part au loin. J'ai "
"pensé que l'un des survivants l'avait allumée pour indiquer sa position. "
"Comme vous le voyez, j'avais raison. J'ai réussi à trouver un bateau près du "
"rivage le plus proche et j'ai pris la mer."

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I have been sailing on my little boat from coast to coast for a long time.  "
"In truth, the boat was not entirely mine, but it doesn't matter.  That way of "
"life provided me with sufficient safety from the <zombies>, and I managed to "
"get around the sea creatures deftly.  When I saw a distant light, at first, I "
"could not believe my eyes.  Then, I decided to find out what it is."
msgstr ""
"Cela fait longtemps que je navigue sur mon petit bateau d'une côte à l'autre. "
"En réalité, le bateau n'était pas tout à fait le mien, mais cela n'a pas "
"d'importance. Ce mode de vie me mettait suffisamment à l'abri de la mer et je "
"parvenais à contourner habilement les créatures marines. Lorsque j'ai aperçu "
"une lumière au loin, je n'en ai d'abord pas cru mes yeux. Puis, j'ai décidé "
"de découvrir ce que c'était."

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"  Unfortunately, during my 'voyage' to this lighthouse, luck turned away from "
"me.  I was attacked by some dreadful creature from the underwater depths.  I "
"couldn't fight off him and he dragged my ship to the bottom.  The waves "
"brought me straight to the shore of this little island.  I still don't "
"understand by what miracle I managed to survive, <name_g>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"  Unfortunately, when I arrived here, I forgot to tie my boat, and during "
"yesterday's storm it was carried off somewhere.  Well, you don't always have "
"to be lucky, right?"
msgstr ""
" Malheureusement, en arrivant ici, j'ai oublié d'attacher mon bateau et, "
"pendant la tempête d'hier, il a été emporté quelque part. On n'a pas toujours "
"la chance, n'est-ce pas ?"

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"  I sailed here a few days ago.  Mikhail and his family are very hospitable.  "
"Unfortunately, during our joint fishing, we were attacked by a swarm of "
"underwater abominations, and my boat was smashed to pieces.  It was so scary, "
"we could barely sail away on Mikhail's ship."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"No, no… well, maybe a little.  It was just as wrecked down here as it is up "
"top when I found it, wasn't too hard to fix up.  You're welcome to stay in "
"the spare room awhile, just don't hog it.  You're not the only scav out there."
msgstr ""
"Non, non... enfin, peut-être un peu. Elle était aussi abîmée en bas qu'en "
"haut quand je l'ai trouvée, ce n'était pas trop dur à réparer. Vous pouvez "
"rester dans la chambre d'amis un moment, mais ne la monopolisez pas. Vous "
"n'êtes pas le seul par ici."

#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Just a scav who got lucky.  Now I'm content to sit around here on my pile of "
"treasure.  I'm more than willing to trade if you've got the cash."
msgstr ""
"Just un(e) pillard(e) qui a eu de la chance.  Maintenant je suis satisfait(e) "
"de rester là sur ma pile de trucs.  Je serais comme même disposé(e) à troquer "
"avec vous si l'on peut trouver un bon marché."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"It's nice to see a new face around here.  I'm <npc_name>, it's a pleasure "
"meeting you."
msgstr ""
"C'est chouette devoir un nouveau visage ici. Je suis <npc_name>, c'est un "
"plaisir de vous rencontrer."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Like I said before, I'm a chemist.  I've been living out here for a while, "
"decided to set up shop in this old cabin.  I even found some good equipment "
"out here, and a couple useful things here in the cupboards.  I decided to "
"stay right here."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I used to be a chemist.  Well, I am a chemist.  I've been living out here in "
"the wilderness for a little while now since <the_cataclysm>.  Lucky enough, I "
"even found some good equipment out here, though unfortunately missing some of "
"the more sensitive and expensive stuff.  I found a couple useful things here "
"in the cupboards, but other than that, entirely empty.  So, I moved in."
msgstr ""
"J'étais chimiste. Enfin, je suis chimiste. Je vis ici, dans la nature, depuis "
"<the_cataclysm>. Par chance, j'ai même trouvé du bon matériel ici, mais il "
"manque malheureusement les produits les plus sensibles et les plus chers. "
"J'ai trouvé quelques objets utiles dans les placards, mais à part ça, tout "
"est vide. J'ai donc emménagé."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Not my place, just somewhere I ended up.  Some old shack, maybe a hunting "
"cabin or something more… criminal, at least judging by some of what I found "
"on the shelves.  You certainly wouldn't attract much attention synthesizing "
"illegal substances all the way out here, that's all I'm saying.  I found it "
"while I was trying to escape all the <zombies> in the city, and I decided to "
"stay."
msgstr ""
"Ce n'est pas chez moi, c'est juste un endroit où j'ai atterri. Une vieille "
"cabane, peut-être une cabane de chasseur ou quelque chose de plus... "
"criminel, du moins à en juger par ce que j'ai trouvé sur les étagères. Vous "
"n'attireriez certainement pas beaucoup l'attention en synthétisant des "
"substances illégales jusqu'ici, c'est tout ce que je dis. Je l'ai trouvé "
"alors que j'essayais d'échapper à la ville, et j'ai décidé de rester."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/NPC_campus_guard_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm not even supposed to be here today, I just lost a bet and had to take "
"this shift."
msgstr ""
"Je n'était même pas censé(e) être de garde aujourd'hui, j'ai juste perdu un "
"pari et me suis retrouvé(e) collé(e) avec ce tour."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/NPC_campus_guard_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I should be resting right now, this is my third straight shift.  Too many "
"people sick or hurt right now."
msgstr ""
"Je devrais être en train de me reposer, ceci est ma troisième garde d'affilé. "
"Nous avons trop de personnes blessées ou malades en ce moment."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "Now get out of here, before I kill you."
msgstr "Maintenant sortez d'ici, avant que je vous tue."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I'm too tired, let me rest first."
msgstr "Je suis trop fatigué, laisse-moi me reposer d'abord."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "Really, I haven't heard anything about it.  What's it you need?"
msgstr "Vraiment? Je n'ai rien entendu de ce genre. Que voulez-vous?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I told you already, I'm not finished with them, come back later."
msgstr "Je vous ai déjà dit. Je n'ai pas encore fini avec eux, revenez plus tard."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm a businessman, and business is my game.  I came out here to help these "
"poor, poor people who are doing without in such a bad time."
msgstr ""
"Je suis un homme d'affaires, et les affaires sont mon métier. Je suis venu "
"ici pour aider les misérables isolés durant une période si éprouvante."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm just a man looking to help some poor folks out, caught word of this place "
"from one of those old FEMA bunkers, a group's holed up there.  I figured I'd "
"come out here and help these people out."
msgstr ""
"Je suis juste quelqu'un essayant d'aider ces pauvres gens, j'ai trouvé cet "
"endroit à partir de l'un de ces vieux bunkers FEMA ou un autre groupe est "
"situé. Je me suis dit que ce serait une bonne idée de venir et offrir toute "
"aide possible."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Like I said, I'm a businessman and business is my job.  Those other yahoos "
"you've been talkin' to don't know what they're doing."
msgstr ""
"Comme je l'ai dit, je suis un homme d'affaires et les affaires sont mon "
"métier. Les autres yahoos à qui vous avez parlé ne savent pas ce qu'ils font."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"They say I turned a man into a cedar tree once.  That's a terrible thing to "
"say."
msgstr ""
"Les gens disent que j'ai transformé un homme en cèdre une fois. C'est une "
"pure calomnie."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"You like maple syrup?  That was me.  Not the syrup, that was the trees, but I "
"figured out how to make it much harder to concentrate it, used to be way too "
"easy.  Pretty nice right?"
msgstr ""
"Vous aimez le sirop d'érable? C'était moi. Pas le sirop, les arbres le "
"produisait déjà, mais j'ai trouvé un moyen de faire en sorte qu'il soit "
"beaucoup plus difficile à concentrer, c'était bien trop facile avant. Pas mal "
"non?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Did I tell you the one about the beavers?  Used to be way too big.  Like "
"giant beavers, it was a mess.  I fixed that.  Of course there seem to be a "
"bunch of new giant things out here now.  I'll have to think about that."
msgstr ""
"Je vous ai déjà parlé des castors? Ils étaient beaucoup trop grands dans le "
"temps, mais j'ai résolu le problème. Bien sûr en ce moment on dirait qu'il y "
"a beaucoup d'animaux qui sont devenus énormes, peut être que je devrais "
"essayer de trouver une solution."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm used to it.  No, Glooscap has been a name here for a very long time.  Is "
"your name foreign?"
msgstr ""
"J'ai l'habitude. Non, Glooscap est un nom utilisé ici depuis très longtemps. "
"Votre nom est-il étranger ?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"And stuff sure.  How can I help you stranger?  They say I'm the nice one.  "
"See this smile?  Nice smile right?"
msgstr ""
"Et des trucs bien sûr. Comment puis-je vous aider, étranger ? On dit que je "
"suis le gentil. Tu vois ce sourire ? Un beau sourire, non ?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I do have a twin.  Malsumis is probably around here somewhere, very tricky.  "
"You know I turned Malsumis to stone once?  I'm supposed to be the nice one, "
"but you know how much it hurts turning yourself back from stone?  It takes "
"days."
msgstr ""
"J'ai un jumeau. Malsumis est probablement quelque part par ici, très rusé. Tu "
"sais que j'ai transformé Malsumis en pierre une fois ? Je suis censée être la "
"gentille, mais tu sais à quel point ça fait mal de se transformer en pierre ? "
"Ça prend des jours."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"If I were Malsumis you would be in terrible danger my friend.  But Glooscap "
"would stop me."
msgstr ""
"Si j'étais Malsumis, tu serais en grand danger, mon ami. Mais Glooscap m'en "
"empêcherait."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I worked on a ranch not too fah from here 'fore it all went down.  I'd love "
"ta get back ta what I did - taking care of horses, cows, all sorts of "
"animals, makin' sure the fields stay safe an' all that.  But now?  I dunno, "
"man.  Just tryin' ta survive, I suppose.  Hopefully, tha world will get back "
"togetha' one day and I can put mah skills ta use doin' what I like."
msgstr ""
"Je travaillais dans un ranch pas très loin d'ici avant que tout ne s'écroule. "
"J'aimerais bien revenir à ce que je faisais - m'occuper des chevaux, des "
"vaches, de toutes sortes d'animaux, veiller à ce que les champs restent en "
"sécurité et tout ça. Mais maintenant ? Je ne sais pas, mec. J'essaie juste de "
"survivre, je suppose. J'espère que le monde se remettra en place un jour et "
"que je pourrai utiliser mes compétences pour faire ce que j'aime."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was just sort of wanderin' around, hoping ta maybe find some bettah gear.  "
"Decided ta rest up, 'eard someone walkin', and, well, here we are."
msgstr ""
"Je me promenais un peu, espérant trouver un meilleur équipement. J'ai décidé "
"de me reposer, j'ai entendu quelqu'un marcher et nous voilà."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I already told you.  Don't want to go through it again."
msgstr "Je te l'ai déjà dit. Je ne veux pas recommencer."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Lived in a nearby town.  Normal life.  9 to 5 job.  When it all happened, we "
"ran away to find some safety.  But there's no safety anymore, is there?"
msgstr ""
"Vivait dans une ville voisine. Vie normale. Un travail de 9 à 5. Quand tout "
"cela est arrivé, nous nous sommes enfuis pour nous mettre à l'abri. Mais il "
"n'y a plus de sécurité, n'est-ce pas ?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I didn't leave the town alone.  I arrived here alone."
msgstr "Je n'ai pas quitté la ville seule. Je suis arrivé seul."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I told you to just leave me alone."
msgstr "Je vous ai dit de juste me laisser tranquille."

#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I don't know if you know, but there are sewers underneath the prison.  I was "
"planning an escape long before <the_cataclysm>, and while I was working on "
"cleaning the sewers, I noticed a damaged wall section.  There was a flow of "
"fresh air coming out of it, so I think it's leading to the surface.  It could "
"be your way to freedom.  Feel free to use it."
msgstr ""
"Je ne sais pas si vous êtes au courant, mais il y a des égouts en dessous de "
"la prison. Je planifiais de m'échapper bien avant <the_cataclysm>, et lorsque "
"j'étais de corvée pour les nettoyer, j'ai repéré une section de mur "
"endommagée. Je pouvais sentir un courant d'air frais passer à travers, il est "
"donc probable que quoi qu'il y ai de l'autre côté, il soit possible de passer "
"par là pour sortir de la prison. N'hésitez pas à vous en servir."

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ", then frowns.  \"I think I'd remember something like that, no.  Sorry.\""
msgstr ""
"puis fronce les sourcils. « Je pense que je me souviendrais de quelque chose "
"comme ça, non. Désolé. »"

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
", looking thoughtful.  \"You know, around the time things really went bad, I "
"remember a really awful portal storm.  A while later, I saw something like "
"that in the distance.  Could be what you're talking about.\""
msgstr ""
", l'air pensif. « Vous savez, à l'époque où les choses ont vraiment mal "
"tourné, je me souviens d'une terrible tempête de portails. Un peu plus tard, "
"j'ai vu quelque chose comme ça au loin. Ça pourrait être ce dont tu parles. »"

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'll be honest, I don't remember a whole lot about what I was doing here.  I "
"know that I cut trees, but not much else.  Good thing I have friends here, "
"they've helped me out a lot."
msgstr ""
"Pour être honnête, je ne me souviens pas très bien de ce que je faisais ici. "
"Je sais que j'ai coupé des arbres, mais pas grand-chose d'autre. Heureusement "
"que j'ai des amis ici, qui m'ont beaucoup aidé."

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Not much to it.  I worked here as a logger before <the_cataclysm> began.  "
"When all went to hell, I was on the job and had to hole up here with my "
"coworkers.  Good news is we all came out fine, and the boss decided to keep "
"the mill running.  I don't know how much longer we can last, though; not "
"unless we make some contact with other people.  Customers, I guess you might "
"call 'em."
msgstr ""
"Il n'y a pas grand-chose à en dire. J'ai travaillé ici comme bûcheron avant "
"que <the_cataclysm> ne commence. Quand tout est parti en vrille, j'étais au "
"travail et j'ai dû me terrer ici avec mes collègues. La bonne nouvelle, c'est "
"que nous nous en sommes tous sortis et que le patron a décidé de maintenir "
"l'usine en activité. Mais je ne sais pas combien de temps nous pourrons "
"tenir, à moins que nous n'entrions en contact avec d'autres personnes. Des "
"clients, je suppose qu'on peut les appeler ainsi."

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"New to the job… or, well, whatever's happening now.  I still cut trees and "
"run logs through the saw from time to time, so I guess you'd call me a "
"logger.  Things have only gotten weirder after those fucking <zombies> nearly "
"killed us.  I'm not sure how much longer we'll last…"
msgstr ""
"Nouveau dans le métier... ou, en tout cas, dans ce qui se passe en ce moment. "
"Je continue à couper des arbres et à passer des troncs à la scie de temps en "
"temps, alors je suppose qu'on peut m'appeler un bûcheron. Les choses sont "
"devenues encore plus bizarres après que ces putains de <zombies> ont failli "
"nous tuer. Je ne sais pas combien de temps nous allons encore tenir..."

#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Ah, home sweet home.  It feels like I haven't been here for ages.  Fuck, it "
"looks so horrible now.  I guess it's because of <the_cataclysm>.  Thank you "
"for bringing me here, <name_g>.  Let's eat the cake."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm just a regular pizzaiolo.  My father was a pizzaiolo, my grandfather was "
"a pizzaiolo and I also became a pizzaiolo.  I was making pizza my whole life, "
"until some American <name_b>s ruined my business!  I couldn't do anything "
"about this, but now, with <the_cataclysm> and <zombies> around, I have a "
"chance to get my revenge!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I worked here before <the_cataclysm> dumped everything in the <freaking> bin. "
" I took care of all the animals here, and when the <zombies> started roaming "
"the streets, I gathered every pet or stray I could.  I still take care of "
"them, just gotta worry about the <zombies> now on top of disease, "
"cleanliness, etc."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm just an average person, really.  When a horde of those <freaking> "
"<zombies> came knockin' on my door, I ran for it.  Good for me that someone "
"left this store open in the chaos, I ran inside and locked the place down.  "
"There isn't a thing in all of <city> that can bust through these walls and "
"barred windows, I'd reckon I'm the luckiest <name_b> in town."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I used to live here before <the_cataclysm>.  I was asleep when a horde of "
"<zombies> busted through the front, and in the chaos I wound up here.  When "
"the screaming stopped, I peaked out the door to find my neighbor stumbling "
"about with his face half-eaten, and I haven't left since."
msgstr ""
"Je vivais ici avant <the_cataclysm>. Je dormais quand une horde de <zombies> "
"a débarqué par l'entrée, et dans le chaos, je me suis retrouvé ici. Quand les "
"cris ont cessé, j'ai jeté un coup d'œil par la porte pour trouver mon voisin "
"qui titubait, le visage à moitié dévoré, et je ne suis pas reparti depuis."

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_CAMPER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was out here camping when <the_cataclysm> disturbed me.  I didn't know "
"anything was wrong until two <zombies> stumbled up here, and tried to kill "
"me.  I figured staying here would be my best bet, away from the cities."
msgstr ""
"Je campais ici quand <the_cataclysm> m'a dérangé. Je ne me suis rendu compte "
"de rien jusqu'à ce que deux <zombies> arrivent par hasard ici et essaient de "
"me tuer. Je me suis dit qu'il valait mieux rester ici, loin des villes."

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "Haven't seen someone new in a while.  What brings you around here?"
msgstr ""
"Cela fait longtemps que je n'ai pas vu quelqu'un de nouveau. Qu'est-ce qui "
"vous amène par ici ?"

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I run this distillery you're standing in, before <the_cataclysm> it wasn't so "
"legal with the law.  I was in <city> making a deal on my product when a horde "
"of rioters busted in, so I ran for it.  I thought my business would be a nice "
"place to stay, so I came out here."
msgstr ""
"Je dirige la distillerie dans laquelle vous vous trouvez. Avant "
"<the_cataclysm>, elle n'était pas très légale. J'étais dans la <city> en "
"train de faire une affaire pour mon produit quand une horde d'émeutiers a "
"fait irruption, alors j'ai pris mes jambes à mon cou. J'ai pensé que mon "
"entreprise serait un bon endroit pour rester, alors je suis venu ici."

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"They all said I was crazy for preparing for <the_cataclysm>.  Now, they're "
"all dead, and I'm still kickin'.  When the riots turned to hordes, I was "
"ready; all I had to do was dodge a few <zombies> to get back to my bastion.  "
"I've been living safely here ever since."
msgstr ""
"Ils ont tous dit que j'étais fou de me préparer à <the_cataclysm>. "
"Aujourd'hui, ils sont tous morts, et je suis toujours en pleine forme. "
"Lorsque les émeutes se sont transformées en hordes, j'étais prêt ; tout ce "
"que j'ai eu à faire, c'est d'éviter quelques <zombies> pour retourner dans "
"mon bastion. Depuis, je vis en sécurité ici."

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I found this emergency shelter when I was running from the chaos back in the "
"cities.  Fortunately, the place hadn't been looted yet and there weren't any "
"<zombies> lurking around; just the spot to stay 'till who knows when."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/camp_start.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "Hey, I did some surveying and I believe this is a good spot to set up at."
msgstr ""
"Hey, j'ai fait quelques recherches et je pense que c'est un bon endroit pour "
"s'installer."

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Air temperature, precipitation, but what about… oh, I'm sorry, I didn't "
"notice you.  Hello."
msgstr ""
"Température de l'air, précipitations, mais qu'en est-il de… oh, je suis "
"désolé, je ne vous avez pas remarqué.  Bonjour."

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I have not seen living people for a long time.  Glad to see another survivor. "
" Greetings, <name_g>."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai pas vu de personnes vivantes depuis longtemps. Heureux de voir un "
"autre survivant. Salutations, <name_g>."

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Help?  Help with what?  Oh, yes, yes.  If you know a place with many "
"survivors, can you take me there?  I doubt I can survive alone…"
msgstr ""
"De l'aide?  De l'aide avec quoi?  Oh, oui, oui.  Si vous connaissez un "
"endroit où il y a beaucoup de survivants, pouvez-vous m'y emmener?  Je doute "
"de pouvoir survivre seul…"

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I'm glad you still alive."
msgstr "Je suis heureux que vous soyez toujours en vie."

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm just a regular meteorologist.  In recent years I have worked at a weather "
"station, monitored the weather, state of air, read and wrote reports, drew up "
"schedules… in general, complete boredom.  In my free time I was studying "
"electronics and radio engineering, making various devices, some for work, "
"some just for fun.  When the first riots began, I gathered all my things that "
"I managed to take with me and settled here.  Since then I've been sitting "
"here, wasting my time doing all sorts of nonsense."
msgstr ""
"Je suis juste un météorologiste lambda. Depuis quelques années j'ai travaillé "
"dans cette station météorologique et passer ma vie a faire des choses "
"barbantes comme mesurer la pression atmosphérique, les precipitations, écrire "
"des rapports météo... Bref, rien de vraiment intéressant. Dans mon temps "
"libre par contre j'étudiais les appareils électroniques et les systèmes "
"radio, et construisais des appareils varies,  certains étaient utiles pour "
"mon boulot, certain étaient juste un projet amusant. Quant les premieres "
"emeutes ont commence a être montrées sur la television, j'ai decide de faire "
"mes valises et d'emménager de façon permanente dans la station météo. Depuis "
"ca, je n'ai fait qu'attendre ici et j'ai occupe les journées avec mon loisir "
"habituel."

#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was homeless before everything went down, just camping out here for a "
"while.  Stuck up <name_b>s shunned me for my condition, but they're all dead "
"now.  I guess I'm better off than they are."
msgstr ""
"J'étais sans-abri avant que tout ne s'écroule, je campais ici depuis un "
"moment. Les <name_b> superficielles m'évitaient à cause de mon état, mais "
"elles sont toutes mortes maintenant. Je suppose que je suis mieux loti qu'eux."

#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"It's hard to say exactly what I'm doing out here, but I guess one thing just "
"leads to another and… well, you're just being nice when you ask, aren't you?  "
"It doesn't matter now anyway.  I'm here and I'm still alive."
msgstr ""
"Il est difficile de dire exactement ce que je fais ici, mais je suppose "
"qu'une chose en entraîne une autre et... eh bien, vous êtes juste gentil "
"quand vous demandez, n'est-ce pas ? De toute façon, ça n'a plus d'importance. "
"Je suis ici et je suis toujours en vie."

#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was homeless for a while before <the_cataclysm>.  I met some buddies out on "
"the road and we were camping out here.  Now we're just scraping by on what we "
"can find, mostly.  We're willing to trade, though.  Who knows, you might find "
"yourself a good deal."
msgstr ""
"J'ai été sans abri pendant un certain temps avant <the_cataclysm>. J'ai "
"rencontré des copains sur la route et nous avons campé ici. Maintenant, on se "
"débrouille avec ce qu'on trouve, la plupart du temps. Mais nous sommes prêts "
"à faire des échanges. Qui sait, vous pourriez faire une bonne affaire."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I didn't think anyone was around here.  Pleased to meet you, I'm <npc_name>."
msgstr ""
"Je ne pensais pas qu'il y avait quelqu'un dans les environs.  Enchanté de "
"faire votre connaissance, je m'appelle <npc_name>."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
", then frowns.  \"I don't believe I've heard about anything like that, no.  "
"Sorry.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm going north, up towards the border and the big wide wilderness.  I heard "
"that there's some sort of safe spot up there, where people didn't go crazy "
"and try to kill each other.  I don't know whether or not that's true, but at "
"the very least, the colder climate might help keep the <zombies> down."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm going east, towards the coastline.  I heard some rumors that Rhode Island "
"was still holding itself together, so I'm going to go and check that out.  "
"Heck, I might just go out to sea myself, live on an old oil rig or something "
"like that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I haven't found anything out of the ordinary, just a bunch of <zombies> and "
"the ruins of our old lives."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai pas trouvé grand chose en dehors de l'ordinaire, juste des zombies et "
"les ruines de nos anciennes vies."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Actually, I came across a group of farmers on my way here.  They were a "
"little suspicious, but turned out to be pretty nice.  Good place to buy some "
"food, if they're still around."
msgstr ""
"Tant que j'y pense, j'ai rencontré un groupe de fermiers sur ma route.  Ils "
"étaient un peu suspicieux, mais assez sympathiques.  C'est un bon endroit ou "
"acheter de la nourriture si ils sont toujours là bas."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I found a small cabin out in the woods, someone was living there and had some "
"serious chemistry equipment.  I managed to get good medical supplies from "
"there.  They even had some oddball things too, like fucking napalm and black "
"powder."
msgstr ""
"J'ai trouvé une petite cabane dans les bois, quelqu'un y vivait et disposait "
"d'un équipement de chimie sérieux. J'ai réussi à obtenir de bonnes "
"fournitures médicales. Ils avaient même quelques trucs bizarres, comme du "
"putain de napalm et de la poudre noire."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I ran in to someone living in an old barn, didn't want anything to do with "
"the world.  The odd thing is, they looked like one of those old, Wild West "
"cowboys."
msgstr ""
"Je suis tombé sur quelqu'un qui vivait dans une vieille grange et qui ne "
"voulait rien avoir à faire avec le monde. Ce qui est étrange, c'est qu'il "
"ressemblait à un de ces vieux cow-boys du Far West."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I used to travel a lot before <the_cataclysm>, and I've had this camper with "
"me for a while now.  I was at home when the riots started, so I grabbed "
"everything I could from my house and hopped in the camper.  I nearly wrecked "
"on my way out of town when some crazy people tried to smash my van, but I "
"made it out.  I've been on the move ever since."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/refugee_caravans.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "You again.  Any good news?  Haven't heard any in a long time."
msgstr "Encore vous. De bonnes nouvelles ? Je n'en ai pas entendu depuis longtemps."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/refugee_caravans.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
", looking thoughtful.  \"Maybe, yeah.  I saw a weird building sort of like "
"that a while back, but we were on the move and couldn't stop to check it out.\""
msgstr ""
", l'air pensif. « Peut-être, oui. J'ai vu un bâtiment bizarre un peu comme ça "
"il y a quelque temps, mais on était en déplacement et on n'a pas pu s'arrêter "
"pour vérifier. »"

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/refugee_caravans.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm a refugee, but don't get the wrong idea.  I've got big dreams of settling "
"down after this and starting a big family.  I just need to find the right "
"place and the right person.  Last couple of places didn't work out so well."
msgstr ""
"Je suis un réfugié, mais ne vous méprenez pas. Je rêve de m'installer après "
"cela et de fonder une grande famille. Il faut juste que je trouve le bon "
"endroit et la bonne personne. Les deux derniers endroits n'ont pas très bien "
"fonctionné."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"*studies you with interest, her eyes lined with fatigue but still alert.  She "
"brushes a lock of hair off her forehead.  \"Hi there.  You look new, nice to "
"meet you.  My name's Uyen.\""
msgstr ""
"*Elle vous étudie avec intérêt, les yeux marqués par la fatigue mais toujours "
"alertes. Elle brosse une mèche de cheveux sur son front. \"Bonjour, vous avez "
"l'air nouveau. Tu as l'air nouvelle, ravie de te rencontrer. Je m'appelle "
"Uyen.\""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"No way, sorry.  I was in there when things went bad.  It'll be hard enough to "
"go back after it's cleaned up, I can't bear to look at it right now."
msgstr ""
"Pas du tout, désolé. J'étais là quand les choses ont mal tourné. Ce sera déjà "
"assez difficile d'y retourner une fois que ce sera nettoyé, je ne peux pas "
"supporter de le regarder maintenant."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Sorry, no.  That's too much to ask from me.  I was back there when it went "
"wrong."
msgstr "Désolé, non. C'est trop me demander. J'étais là quand ça a mal tourné."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I oversee the food stocks for the center.  There was significant looting "
"during the panic when we first arrived so most of our food was carried away.  "
"I manage what we have left and do everything I can to increase our supplies.  "
"We've got a few growing sources of fresh meats and vegetables, so I "
"prioritize non-perishable food, such as cornmeal, jerky, and fruit wine."
msgstr ""
"Je supervise les stocks de nourriture du centre. Il y a eu d'importants "
"pillages lors de la panique qui a marqué notre arrivée, si bien que la "
"plupart de nos vivres ont été emportés. Je gère ce qu'il nous reste et je "
"fais tout ce que je peux pour augmenter nos réserves. Nous avons quelques "
"sources de viande et de légumes frais qui se développent, alors je donne la "
"priorité aux denrées non périssables, comme la farine de maïs, la viande "
"séchée et le vin de fruits."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, there's the downstairs section, we can't fit more people down there so "
"it's out of bounds.  Then there's the second bay that we were using as a "
"staging area at first.  Things went… wrong.  I hear the shopkeeper is "
"offering a reward to clear it out, if you're feeling suicidal."
msgstr ""
"Il y a la section du bas, où nous ne pouvons pas faire entrer plus de monde "
"et qui est donc interdite d'accès. Ensuite, il y a la deuxième travée que "
"nous utilisions comme zone de transit au début. Les choses ont mal tourné. "
"J'ai entendu dire que le commerçant offrait une récompense pour le "
"débarrasser, si vous vous sentez suicidaire."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm so glad we've got that up and running.  One of the people evacuated here "
"had a connection to a functioning ranch, and we got him and a crew out there "
"as quickly as we were able.  We're hoping they'll be able to supply us in "
"enough foodstuffs to make this place self-sufficient and even to trade with "
"other communities as they arise."
msgstr ""
"Je suis très heureux que nous ayons mis cela en place et que cela fonctionne. "
"L'une des personnes évacuées ici avait un lien avec un ranch en activité, et "
"nous l'avons envoyé sur place avec une équipe aussi rapidement que possible. "
"Nous espérons qu'ils seront en mesure de nous fournir suffisamment de denrées "
"alimentaires pour que nous soyons autosuffisants et que nous puissions même "
"commercer avec d'autres communautés le cas échéant."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I haven't been here for long but I do my best to watch who comes and goes.  "
"You can't always predict who will bring trouble."
msgstr ""
"Je ne suis pas ici depuis longtemps, mais je fais de mon mieux pour observer "
"les allées et venues. On ne peut pas toujours prédire qui apportera des "
"ennuis."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I've seen my share of zombies, I'm one of the ones that's ready to take em "
"on.  Nothing more."
msgstr ""
"J'ai vu ma part de zombies, je suis l'un de ceux qui sont prêts à les "
"affronter. Rien de plus."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"There's been rumors.  Folks talkin' about some kind of secret lab, out in the "
"wilds, with survivors in it.  I haven't seen it myself, mind you."
msgstr ""
"Il y a eu des rumeurs. Des gens parlent d'une sorte de laboratoire secret, "
"dans la nature, avec des survivants. Je ne l'ai pas vu moi-même."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
", looking thoughtful.  \"Hmm.  I'm not sure, but I've heard of an odd "
"building that's a bit like you're describing.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'll help out.  I've pretty much been waiting for someone to ask, the "
"mess is in my way but I've been too busy to organize it myself.  Boris is the "
"one to talk to, you say?  I'll let him know."
msgstr ""
"Oui, je donnerai un coup de main. J'attendais que quelqu'un me le demande, le "
"désordre est sur mon chemin mais j'étais trop occupé pour l'organiser "
"moi-même. C'est à Boris qu'il faut s'adresser, tu dis ? Je lui en ferai part."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah, they're my rookie representative.  I figured that those people "
"wouldn't cause too much trouble for them, so I sent them over there.  What "
"about them?"
msgstr ""
"Oh oui, ce sont mes représentants débutants. Je me suis dit que ces gens ne "
"leur causeraient pas trop d'ennuis, alors je les ai envoyés là-bas. Qu'est-ce "
"qu'ils ont ?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm a doctor, one of the several at the outpost.  We were the lucky ones.  "
"Came here right went things started to go wrong, never left."
msgstr ""
"Je suis médecin, l'un des nombreux à l'avant-poste. Nous étions les plus "
"chanceux. Nous sommes arrivés ici au moment où les choses ont commencé à mal "
"tourner, et nous ne sommes jamais repartis."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I thought I smelled a pig.  I jest… please don't arrest me."
msgstr ""
"J'ai cru sentir une odeur de porc.  Je plaisante… s'il vous plaît, ne "
"m'arrêtez pas."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "Huh, thought I smelled someone new.  Can I help you?"
msgstr "Huh, j'ai cru sentir quelqu'un de nouveau. Je peux vous aider ?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Oh, I didn't mean that in a bad way.  Been out in the wilderness so long, I "
"find myself noticing things by scent before sight."
msgstr ""
"Oh, je ne voulais pas dire ça méchamment. J'ai passé tellement de temps dans "
"la nature que je remarque les choses à l'odeur plutôt qu'à la vue."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I've heard that cougars sometimes leap.  Maybe it's just a myth."
msgstr ""
"J'ai entendu dire que les couguars sautaient parfois. Ce n'est peut-être "
"qu'un mythe."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well… I was like any other civilian till they conscripted me so I'll tell it "
"to you straight.  They're the best hope we got right now.  They are stretched "
"impossibly thin but are willing to do what is needed to maintain order.  They "
"don't care much about looters since they understand most everyone is dead, "
"but if you have something they need… you WILL give it to them.  Since most "
"survivors here have nothing they want, they are welcomed as champions."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien... j'étais un civil comme les autres jusqu'à ce qu'ils m'enrôlent, "
"alors je vais vous le dire franchement. Ils sont le meilleur espoir que nous "
"ayons en ce moment. Ils sont extrêmement sollicités, mais ils sont prêts à "
"faire ce qu'il faut pour maintenir l'ordre. Ils ne se soucient guère des "
"pillards car ils savent que la plupart d'entre eux sont morts, mais si vous "
"avez quelque chose dont ils ont besoin... vous le leur donnerez. Comme la "
"plupart des survivants n'ont rien à se mettre sous la dent, ils sont "
"accueillis comme des champions."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"If you want to know what our next steps are, I'm not at liberty to tell you.  "
"Truth be told, I don't even know myself.  They don't share that sort of "
"information with me."
msgstr ""
"Si vous voulez savoir quelles sont nos prochaines étapes, je ne suis pas en "
"mesure de vous le dire. À vrai dire, je ne le sais même pas moi-même. Ils ne "
"partagent pas ce genre d'informations avec moi."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I haven't done anything wrong…"
msgstr "Je n'ai fait rien de mal…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I found a map to this place in an evac center and thought I'd see if it was "
"just full of <zombies> or if there was something up.  Didn't expect to find "
"so many survivors still alive though."
msgstr ""
"J'ai trouvé une carte de cet endroit dans un centre d'évacuation et je me "
"suis dit que j'allais voir si c'était juste plein de <zombies> ou s'il y "
"avait quelque chose de louche. Je ne m'attendais pas à trouver autant de "
"survivants encore en vie."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Sure.  Seen more'n I'd like to think about honestly.  Like, I think these "
"zombies are evolving?  I've seen new things come out that I swear aren't "
"natural.  One of them looked like it was sparking with electricity."
msgstr ""
"Bien sûr. J'en ai vu plus que je ne voudrais en penser, honnêtement. Je pense "
"que ces zombies évoluent. J'ai vu de nouvelles choses sortir qui, je le jure, "
"ne sont pas naturelles. L'un d'entre eux avait l'air de produire des "
"étincelles d'électricité."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"There's so much weird stuff out there in the wilderness now.  A while back, I "
"found this weird cartoon sign with a map on it, pointing to some kind of "
"trade center.  Haven't been there yet but I can show you my copy of the map "
"if you want."
msgstr ""
"Il y a tellement de choses bizarres dans la nature aujourd'hui. Il y a "
"quelque temps, j'ai trouvé un panneau de bande dessinée avec une carte qui "
"indiquait une sorte de centre commercial. Je n'y suis pas encore allé, mais "
"je peux vous montrer ma copie de la carte si vous voulez."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_DOCTOR.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_doctor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I'm free at the moment if you need something."
msgstr "Je suis libre en ce moment si vous avez besoin de quelque chose."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "&The mercenary looks noticeably tense as you approach."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "Sorry I'd rather be left alone right now."
msgstr "Désolé, je préfère rester seul pour l'instant."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"&A grim expression and deep sunken eyes imply some malady that can't be "
"simply drowned with alcohol alone.  They interrupt you just as you were about "
"to introduce yourself.  \"This anchor I'm wearing, I don't think I'll be "
"needing it any more.  I-I'm just looking for someone to rid me of it"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"It takes only a moment to retrieve a suitable coin from your pockets, and yet "
"your interlocutor found enough time to disappear, having left a sharp "
"emptiness both in memory and the chair before you.  The anchor has been "
"neatly folded on the table."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"The mercenary stares in silence, a flickering of the overhead lighting "
"thankfully cuts the moment short."
msgstr ""
"Le mercenaire reste silencieux, mais une lumière vacillante au plafond vient "
"heureusement couper court à ce moment."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_drugs.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"&This visitor seems way more watchful than normal.  You notice zip bags "
"peeking out from <mypossesivepronoun> overcoat, they are clearly pushing "
"something.  It doesn't take much longer for them to notice you in kind.\n"
"\"You want something?  Or just gawking?\""
msgstr ""
"&Ce visiteur semble beaucoup plus vigilant que d'habitude. Vous remarquez des "
"sacs à fermeture éclair qui dépassent du pardessus de <monpossessifpronoun>, "
"ils sont clairement en train de pousser quelque chose. Il ne faut pas "
"longtemps pour qu'ils vous remarquent à leur tour..\n"
"\"Vous voulez quelque chose ? Ou juste observer?\""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_hireable.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"The mercenary's demeanor changes completely when they realize you aren't here "
"to waste time.  \"Alright, tell you what.  Get me twelve coins and that's "
"giving my skills away, just anything to be done with that voice on a box.\""
msgstr ""
"Le comportement du mercenaire change complètement lorsqu'il réalise que vous "
"n'êtes pas là pour perdre du temps. \"D'accord, je vais vous dire. Donnez-moi "
"douze pièces et c'est donner mes compétences, juste n'importe quoi à faire "
"avec cette voix sur une boîte.\""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"&The mercenary stares at the window, and speaks in a quiet and terse manner.  "
"\"I have a client looking for a medical-grade human biopsy sample, no "
"questions asked.  Are you the right one for the job?"
msgstr ""
"&Le mercenaire fixe la fenêtre et parle d'une manière calme et laconique. "
"\"J'ai un client qui recherche un échantillon de biopsie humaine de qualité "
"médicale, sans poser de questions. Êtes-vous celui qu'il faut pour ce travail "
"?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"&The mercenary gives you a quick appraisal.  \"Five coins for three, special "
"price just for you.  Pay in advance, and I'll arrange a drop in the subway "
"rails here for you to pick within two days.  Deal or not?"
msgstr ""
"&Le mercenaire vous donne une évaluation rapide. \"Cinq pièces pour trois, "
"prix spécial juste pour vous. Payez à l'avance, et je vous ferai déposer dans "
"les rails du métro pour que vous puissiez les récupérer dans les deux jours. "
"Marché conclu ou non ?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"&The mercenary stares intently at a stain in the ceiling, firmly clutching a "
"now cold cup of soup.  No one else seems to be very concerned about this."
msgstr ""
"&Le mercenaire fixe intensément une tache au plafond, serrant fermement une "
"tasse de soupe désormais froide. Personne d'autre ne semble s'en préoccuper."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"&Continued prodding manages to extract a baffling response from your "
"interlocutor \"I- I've seen it, the god of our new world, a god of flesh and "
"bone.\" <mypronoun> says with a maddened glare, as though this were some sort "
"of shocking revelation."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"&You spot the mercenary at the tail end of a deal.  \"Want in on the "
"business?  Still have a pair of ID cards looking for buyers.  Two army and "
"two science cards left, they sell together for 4 coins or not at all."
msgstr ""
"&Vous repérez le mercenaire à la fin d'une transaction. \"Vous voulez "
"participer à l'affaire ? J'ai encore une paire de cartes d'identité à vendre. "
"Il reste deux cartes de l'armée et deux cartes de la science, elles se "
"vendent ensemble pour 4 pièces ou pas du tout."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_template_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"&The mercenary seems uncharacteristically upbeat, or perhaps just drunk.  "
"\"Found this neat gizmo in a lab run a few days ago.\"  <mypronoun> blurts "
"while procuring a small cube of etched glass from <mypossesivepronoun> "
"pocket.  \"Now, I have no use for such a thing, but perhaps you do.  What do "
"you say?  It's yours for 3 coins.\""
msgstr ""
"&Le mercenaire semble étonnamment joyeux, ou peut-être simplement ivre. « "
"J'ai trouvé ce petit gadget sympa lors d'une mission dans un labo il y a "
"quelques jours », <mypronoun> lâche-t-il en sortant un petit cube de verre "
"gravé de sa <mypossesivepronoun> poche. « Maintenant, je n'ai pas vraiment "
"l'utilité de ce truc, mais peut-être que toi, oui. Alors, qu'est-ce que tu en "
"dis ? C'est à toi pour 3 pièces. »"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Oh, that?  There were too many people stealing our glasses, so I started "
"stamping a logo on some bottle caps as a token and raised the drink prices a "
"bit to encourage their return.  I'll give you a merch back when you bring me "
"the token with your glass."
msgstr ""
"Oh, ça? Il y avait trop de personnes qui volaient nos verres, donc j'ai "
"commencé à appliquer un logo sur nos bouchons et capsules pour que ceux-ci "
"servent de jetons et j'ai ensuite augmenté le prix de nos boissons pour "
"encourager les clients à les rendre avec leurs verres. Je vous redonnerai une "
"merch si vous revenez avec un jeton et votre verre."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was among one of the first groups of immigrants sent here to fortify the "
"outpost.  I might have exaggerated my construction skills to get the hell out "
"of the refugee center.  Unless you are a trader, there isn't much work there "
"and food was really becoming scarce when I left."
msgstr ""
"Je faisait partie d'un des premiers groupes envoyés ici pour fortifier "
"l'avant-poste.  J'ai peut être exagéré un peu mes compétences de chantier "
"pour pouvoir enfin sortir du centre de réfugiés.  À moins que vous soyez là "
"pour échanger, il n'y a pas vraiment grand chose à faire là bas et la "
"nourriture commençait vraiment à manquer quand je suis parti."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was starting to wonder if they were really interested in the project or "
"were just trying to get rid of me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Could easily be hundreds as far as I know.  They chose this ranch because of "
"its rather remote location, decent fence, and huge cleared field.  With as "
"much land as we have fenced off we could build a village if we had the "
"materials.  We would have tried to secure a small town or something, but the "
"lack of good farmland and number of undead makes it more practical for us to "
"build from scratch.  The refugee center I came from is constantly facing "
"starvation and undead assaults."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I organize scavenging runs to bring in supplies that we can't produce "
"ourselves.  I try and provide incentives to get migrants to join one of the "
"teams… it's dangerous work, but keeps our outpost alive.  Selling anything we "
"can't use helps keep us afloat with the traders.  If you wanted to drop off a "
"companion or two to assist in one of the runs, I'd appreciate it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Hmm, let me think.  There might be a few things I could scrounge up to help, "
"but it's going to take some time to sort through the scrap to find exactly "
"what you need.  How about this… some of my tools are getting a bit worn and "
"are in need of replacement.  If you could bring me a new angle grinder and a "
"hacksaw, I should be able to find all the parts you need by the time you get "
"back."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was just a laborer till they could find me something a bit more permanent, "
"but being constantly sick has prevented me from doing much of anything."
msgstr ""
"J'étais juste un ouvrier jusqu'à ce qu'ils puissent trouver quelque chose de "
"plus permanent, mais je suis constamment malade ces jours-ci et ça m'empêche "
"d'être utile pour plus ou moins quoi que ce soit."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I don't know what you could do.  I've tried everything.  Just give me time…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I keep getting sick!  At first I thought it was something I ate, but now it "
"seems like I can't keep anything down…"
msgstr ""
"Je n'arrête pas de tomber malade!  Au début j'ai crû que c'était quelque "
"chose que j'ai mangé, mais maintenant je n'arrive pas à garder quoi que ce "
"soit dans l'estomac…"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm one of the migrants that got diverted to this outpost when I arrived at "
"the refugee center.  They said I was big enough to swing an axe, so my "
"profession became lumberjack… didn't have any say in it.  If I want to eat, "
"then I'll be cutting wood from now till kingdom come."
msgstr ""
"Je suis l'un des migrants qui ont été dirigés vers cet avant-poste lorsque je "
"me suis pointé au centre de réfugiés.  Ils m'on dit que j'avais l'air d'être "
"assez solide pour manier une hache, donc je suis devenu un bûcheron…  Pas "
"vraiment eu une opportunité de protester.  Si je veux continuer à manger, je "
"suppose que je vais devoir continuer à faire du petit bois jusqu'à la fin des "
"temps...  Hmmm, cela c'est déjà produit quand j'y pense."

#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Listen.  I said it clearly, and if you keep picking at it I'm gonna get mad.  "
"Who I was is gone.  Dead.  I don't give a shit about your 'healthy', don't "
"<freaking> ask again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"STOP, Put your hands in the air!  Ha, startled you didn't I… there is no law "
"anymore…"
msgstr ""
"STOP, mettez vos mains en l'air!  Ha, je vous ai fait peur… il n'y a plus de "
"loi…"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was watching the station when things went sideways.  None of the other "
"officers returned from the last call, well not as humans anyway…"
msgstr ""
"J'étais de garde à la station quand les choses ont dérapé.  Aucun des autres "
"officiers n'est revenu de leur dernier appel, en tout cas pas en tant "
"qu'humains…"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"This is a nice, secure building.  I'd be a fool to leave.  Been living off "
"the vending machines, but I found the code for the evidence lockup so I've "
"been doing some trading with other survivors."
msgstr ""
"C'est un bâtiment agréable et sûr. Je serais idiot de partir. J'ai vécu des "
"distributeurs automatiques, mais j'ai trouvé le code de la salle des preuves, "
"alors j'ai fait quelques échanges avec d'autres survivants."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I… I'm free.  *Zzzt* I'm actually free!  *bzzz* Look, you're the first person "
"I've seen in a long time."
msgstr ""
"Je… Je suis libre.  *Zzzt* Je suis vraiment libre!  *bzzz* Écoutez, vous êtes "
"la première personne que je vois depuis longtemps."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm a priest or guide of a sort.  I sing the hymns along my companions so "
"that we may learn to live in unity, both with each other and with our ailing "
"world."
msgstr ""
"Je suis une sorte de prêtre ou de guide. Je chante les hymnes avec mes "
"compagnons afin que nous apprenions à vivre en unité, les uns avec les autres "
"et avec notre monde malade."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I heard it's bad in the cities, back when the radio was still working.  Some "
"of those things came through here.  I want to stay out in the country if I "
"can stay safe."
msgstr ""
"J'ai entendu dire que c'était terrible dans les villes, à l'époque où la "
"radio fonctionnait encore. Certaines de ces choses sont arrivées jusqu'ici. "
"Je veux rester à la campagne si je peux rester en sécurité."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm a lot better now, I've been hunkering down here.  Something came by in "
"the night screaming and crying, sounded just like that woman.  Maybe a ghost, "
"I don't know.  It's good to have company again.  You're not a ghost, right?  "
"On second thought, don't tell me if you are, I probably don't want to know."
msgstr ""
"Je vais beaucoup mieux maintenant, je me suis blottie ici. Quelque chose est "
"venu dans la nuit en criant et en pleurant, ça ressemblait exactement à cette "
"femme. Peut-être un fantôme, je ne sais pas. C'est bon d'avoir à nouveau de "
"la compagnie. Tu n'es pas un fantôme, n'est-ce pas ? À bien y réfléchir, ne "
"me dis pas si tu l'es, je n'ai probablement pas envie de le savoir."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I grew up on the farm, I don't know much about ghosts and goblins, but I've "
"spent a lot of time growing food and I work hard.  It's better in the "
"country, cleaner.  Not as dangerous.  I hope."
msgstr ""
"J'ai grandi à la ferme, je ne sais pas grand chose sur les fantômes et les "
"gobelins, mais j'ai passé beaucoup de temps à cultiver de la nourriture et je "
"travaille dur. C'est mieux à la campagne, plus propre. Pas aussi dangereux. "
"J'espère."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "Hey, I didn't expect to live long enough to see another living human!"
msgstr ""
"Hé, je ne m’attendais pas à vivre assez longtemps pour voir un autre être "
"humain vivant !"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I've been here since shit went down.  Just my luck I had to work."
msgstr ""
"Je suis ici depuis que la situation s'est détériorée. J'ai eu de la chance de "
"devoir travailler."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well, the dishwasher made a break for it three days after things got weird.  "
"He was ripped to shreds before he made it to the street.  I figure this place "
"has gotta be safer than my apartment, and at least I've got all this food "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, le laveur de vaisselle a pris la fuite trois jours après que les "
"choses aient dégénéré. Il a été déchiqueté avant d'atteindre la rue. Je pense "
"que cet endroit doit être plus sûr que mon appartement, et au moins j'ai "
"toute cette nourriture ici."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I… um… hid.  I was in the kitchen, preparing another masterpiece when I heard "
"glass shattering followed by screaming.  I ran over to the serving window to "
"see what happened, assuming a guest had fallen and broke something.  What I "
"witnessed was the most awful thing I've ever seen.  I'm not even sure I could "
"go over it again."
msgstr ""
"Je… me suis caché… J'était dans la cuisine, en train de préparer un nouveau "
"chef d'œuvre lorsque j'ai entendu du verre brisé et une cacophonie de cris "
"suivre cela. J'ai couru vers la fenêtre de service, assumant qu'un des "
"clients été tombé, brisant quelque chose par accident.  Ce qui c'est passé de "
"l'autre côté de cette fenêtre restera probablement la pire chose que j'ai "
"jamais vue. Je ne suis pas sûr que j'ai envie de décrire cela à nouveau."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Some lunatic covered in a film of goo, black as oil, had fallen through one "
"of the large glass windows.  There were glass shards stuck in its head and "
"neck.  I thought the poor guy, girl-thing-whatever was dead.  People began to "
"crowd around it, some were taking pictures."
msgstr ""
"Un fou, recouvert d'une pellicule gluante, noire comme du pétrole, était "
"tombé à travers l'une des grandes vitres. Des éclats de verre étaient coincés "
"dans sa tête et son cou. J'ai cru que le pauvre type, la fille, était mort. "
"Les gens ont commencé à se rassembler autour de lui, certains prenaient des "
"photos."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"No!  I figured the thing dead until it started writhing and spazzing out for "
"a moment.  Everyone jumped back, a few screamed, and one curious stranger "
"stepped in closer, kneeling a little… it attacked him!"
msgstr ""
"Non!  J'ai cru que la chose était morte jusqu'à ce qu'elle se mette à se "
"tordre et à s'agiter pendant un moment.  Tout le monde a reculé, quelques uns "
"ont crié, et un étranger curieux s'est approché, s'est agenouillé un peu… la "
"chose l'a attaqué!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I ran to the back of the kitchen and hid as best I could.  People outside "
"were screaming and I could hear them running.  Suddenly I heard more glass "
"shatter and something skitter out of the restaurant.  I waited a moment and "
"then went and checked the dining area.  Both the stranger and the thing were "
"gone.  People were running in the streets, some even had guns so I locked all "
"the doors and blocked the windows with what I could and barricaded myself in "
"here."
msgstr ""
"J'ai couru vers le fond de la cuisine et je me suis cachée du mieux que j'ai "
"pu. Les gens à l'extérieur criaient et je les entendais courir. Soudain, j'ai "
"entendu d'autres éclats de verre et quelque chose qui sortait du restaurant. "
"J'ai attendu un moment, puis je suis allée voir ce qui se passait dans la "
"salle à manger. L'étranger et la chose avaient disparu. Les gens couraient "
"dans les rues, certains étaient même armés. J'ai donc verrouillé toutes les "
"portes et bloqué les fenêtres avec ce que je pouvais et je me suis barricadé "
"ici."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it was awhile before it was quiet again.  I heard all kinds of sounds: "
"explosions, jets flying by, helicopters, screaming, and rapid gunfire.  I "
"swear I even heard what sounded like a freaking tank drive by at one time!  "
"I've been hiding here since."
msgstr ""
"Oui, il a fallu un certain temps avant que le calme ne revienne. J'ai entendu "
"toutes sortes de bruits : des explosions, des avions à réaction qui "
"passaient, des hélicoptères, des cris et des coups de feu rapides. Je jure "
"que j'ai même entendu ce qui ressemblait à un char d'assaut passer à un "
"moment donné ! Depuis, je me cache ici."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I've been a cook since forever, this wasn't the best joint, but management "
"was cool."
msgstr ""
"Je suis cuisinier depuis toujours, ce n'était pas le meilleur endroit, mais "
"la direction était sympa."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "Indeed it is I!  The one and only FOODPERSON!"
msgstr "En effet, c'est moi ! Le seul et unique FOODPERSON !"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/bg_pizzaiolo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was just a regular pizzaiolo.  My father was a pizzaiolo, my grandfather "
"was a pizzaiolo and I also became a pizzaiolo.  I was making pizza my whole "
"life, until some American <name_b>s ruined my business!  I couldn't do "
"anything about this, but now, with <the_cataclysm> and <zombies> around, I "
"have a chance to get my revenge!  And I got my revenge, thanks to a special "
"someone."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/bg_pizzaiolo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Are you kidding?  That was the best!  When I imagine the face of that "
"arrogant cook… mmm, sweet, sweet picture.  Oh, and how we beat up that "
"<freaking> food-<name_b>, I dreamed about it for so long… and my restaurant, "
"we beat the shit out of those <name_b>s.  Too bad it was trashed as hell… "
"anyway, let's hit the dirt."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/burger_flipper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Before this started, I had a crappy job flipping burgers at Sambal's Grille.  "
"Losing that isn't a big deal.  Losing my mom and dad hurts a lot more.  Last "
"time I saw them alive, I just came home from school, grabbed a snack and went "
"to work.  I don't think I even told my mom I loved her, and I was pissed at "
"my dad for some dumb shit that really doesn't matter.  Didn't matter then, "
"really doesn't now.  Things started going crazy while I was at work… the "
"military rolled into town, and the evacuation alert sounded."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/burger_flipper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I didn't evacuate.  I went home… saw some freaky shit on the way, but at the "
"time I just thought it was riots or drugs.  By the time I got there, my "
"parents were gone.  No sign of them.  There was a big mess, stuff scattered "
"everywhere like there'd been a struggle, and a little blood on the floor."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai pas évacué. Je suis rentré chez moi... j'ai vu des trucs bizarres sur "
"le chemin, mais à l'époque j'ai juste pensé que c'était des émeutes ou de la "
"drogue. Quand je suis arrivé, mes parents étaient partis. Aucune trace d'eux. "
"Il y avait un grand désordre, des objets éparpillés partout comme s'il y "
"avait eu une bagarre, et un peu de sang sur le sol."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/burger_flipper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I haven't found them yet.  Whenever I see a <zombie>, a little part of me is "
"afraid it's going to be one of them.  But then, maybe not.  Maybe they were "
"evacuated, maybe they fought and tried to wait for me but the military took "
"them anyway?  I've heard that sort of thing happened.  I don't know if I'll "
"ever know."
msgstr ""
"Je ne les ai pas encore trouvés. Chaque fois que je vois un <zombie>, une "
"petite partie de moi a peur que ce soit l'un d'entre eux. Mais ce n'est "
"peut-être pas le cas. Peut-être qu'ils ont été évacués, peut-être qu'ils se "
"sont battus et qu'ils ont essayé de m'attendre mais que les militaires les "
"ont quand même emmenés ? J'ai entendu dire que ce genre de choses arrivait. "
"Je ne sais pas si je le saurai un jour."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/codger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well now, that's a hell of a story, so settle in.  It all goes back to about "
"five years ago, after I retired from my job at the mill.  Times was tough, "
"but we got by."
msgstr ""
"C'est une sacrée histoire, alors installez-vous. Tout remonte à il y a "
"environ cinq ans, après que j'ai pris ma retraite de mon travail à l'usine. "
"Les temps étaient durs, mais nous nous en sortions."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/codger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Anyway, long story short, I were headin' back up to Mount Greenwood to check "
"on th' old ranger station again when I heard them bombs fallin' and choppers "
"flyin'.  Decided to camp out there to see it all through, but it didn't ever "
"end, now, did it?  So here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/confused_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I don't even fucking know anymore.  I have no freaking idea what is going on. "
" I'm just doing what I can to stay alive.  The world ended and I bungled "
"along not dying, until I met you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was a cop.  Small town sheriff.  We got orders without even really knowing "
"what they meant.  At some point one of the g-men on the phone told me it was "
"a Chinese attack, something in the water supply… I don't know if I believe it "
"now, but at the time it was the best explanation.  At first it was weird, a "
"few people - <zombies> - fighting like rabid animals.  Then it got worse.  I "
"tried to control things, but it was just me and my deputies against a town in "
"riot.  Then things really got fucked up."
msgstr ""
"Je faisais partie de la police. Sheriff d'une petite ville. Nous recevions "
"des ordres sans aucun sens. À un moment l'un des hommes du gouvernement m'a "
"dit à téléphone que c'était une attaque chinoise, quelque chose dans l'eau "
"publique... Je ne sais pas si j'y croix encore beaucoup, mais sur le moment "
"cela me semblait être une bonne explication. Au début c'était très bizarre, "
"quelques gens - <zombies> - se battant comme des animaux enragés. Après cela, "
"tout s'est empiré. J'ai essayé de garder la situation sous contrôle, mais ce "
"n'était que moi et quelque uns de mes adjoints contre une ville en émeute. "
"Après ça, après ça tout s'est empiré encore plus. "

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"A big-ass hole opened up right in the middle of town, and a nightmarish demon "
"crawled out, right in front of the church.  We unloaded into it, but bullets "
"just bounced off.  Got some civilians in the crossfire.  It started just "
"devouring people like potato chips into a gullet that looked like a rotting "
"asshole with teeth, and… well, I lost my nerve.  I ran.  I think I might have "
"been the only person to escape.  I haven't been able to even look at my badge "
"since then."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was SWAT.  By all rights I should be dead.  We were called to control "
"\"riots\", which we all know were the first <zombie> hordes.  Fat lot of good "
"we were.  Pretty sure we killed more civilians.  Even among my crew, morale "
"was piss poor and we were shooting wild.  Then something hit us, something "
"big.  Might have been a bomb, I really don't remember.  I woke up pinned "
"underneath the SWAT van.  I couldn't see anything… but I could hear it.  "
"<swear!>  I could hear everything.  I spent hours, maybe days under that van, "
"not even trying to get out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Eventually yes.  It had been quiet for hours.  I was parched, injured, and "
"terrified.  My training was maybe the only thing that kept me from freaking "
"out.  I decided to try to pull myself out and see how bad my injuries were.  "
"It was quite easy.  The side of the van was torn open, and it turned out I "
"was basically just lying under a little debris, with the ruins of the van "
"tented around me.  I wasn't even too badly hurt.  I grabbed as much gear as I "
"could, and I slipped out.  It was night.  I could hear fighting farther away "
"in the city, so I went the other way.  I made it a few blocks before I ran "
"into any <zombies>… I ran from them.  I ran, and I ran, and I ran some more.  "
"And here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm>, I was a cop.  I got shot just a couple days before "
"everything went down… I made a bad call in a drug bust and a scumbag got me "
"right in the gut, it was barely stopped by my vest.  I took some pretty bad "
"internal bruising.  I never thought getting shot would save my life, but I "
"was off duty recuperating when the worst of it hit."
msgstr ""
"Avant <the_cataclysm>, je faisais partie de la police. Je me suis fait "
"tiré(e) dessus quelque jours avant que tout s'écroula... J'ai pris une "
"mauvaise décision durant une saisie de drogue et un salaud m'a eu pile dans "
"le bide, mon gilet n'ayant presque pas arrêté la balle. Je m'en suis tiré "
"avec beaucoup de contusions. Je n'aurais jamais pensé que me faire tirer "
"dessus sauverait ma vie, mais j'étais en congé de convalescence lorsque le "
"pire est arrivé."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"At first I wanted to help.  The riots, fighting in the streets, it was too "
"much for me to just sit in my house and hear about it on the news.  Then a "
"buddy of mine called me from just off the front lines.  He'd been hurt and he "
"wasn't making much sense, but what he told me… well, you can imagine the kind "
"of stuff he told me.  Everything the worst of the internet was making up, and "
"more.  Instead of packing up to try to volunteer back onto active duty, I "
"took his advice and packed up to leave.  My house was on the edge of town and "
"the riots hadn't reached it yet, but from what I'd heard it was smarter to "
"get out than to hold tight.  I slipped out that night, took my quad out, and "
"camped a few days in the woods, waiting for it to blow over.  It never did."
msgstr ""
"Au début, je voulais aider. Les émeutes, les combats dans les rues, c'était "
"trop pour moi de rester chez moi à écouter les informations. Puis un de mes "
"amis m'a appelé de l'autre côté de la ligne de front. Il avait été blessé et "
"ne comprenait pas grand-chose, mais ce qu'il m'a dit... vous pouvez imaginer "
"le genre de choses qu'il m'a racontées. Tout ce que le pire de l'internet "
"inventait, et plus encore. Au lieu de faire mes valises pour essayer de me "
"porter volontaire pour retourner au service actif, j'ai suivi son conseil et "
"j'ai fait mes valises pour partir. Ma maison se trouvait à la périphérie de "
"la ville et les émeutes ne l'avaient pas encore atteinte, mais d'après ce que "
"j'avais entendu, il était plus judicieux de partir que de s'accrocher. Je me "
"suis éclipsé cette nuit-là, j'ai sorti mon quad et j'ai campé quelques jours "
"dans les bois, en attendant que ça se calme. Cela n'a jamais été le cas."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Honestly, probably better than it sounds.  I had a good bug-out bag, a nice "
"tent, a lot of good stuff.  I hadn't suffered any internal organ damage, my "
"stomach muscles were just really badly bruised, and I'd already had some good "
"time to recover.  I think it kept me from doing anything too stupid, and "
"believe me there was a high chance of that.  For a long time I had these "
"Rambo visions of rushing into town and saving everyone, but I was still too "
"immobile.  By the time I had my strength back, it wasn't an option… we were "
"well into the rushing into town for supplies phase.  The closest I got to "
"saving any old friends was putting down the monsters wearing their faces."
msgstr ""
"Honnêtement, c'est probablement mieux qu'il n'y paraît. J'avais un bon sac de "
"survie, une bonne tente, beaucoup de bonnes choses. Je n'avais subi aucune "
"lésion des organes internes, les muscles de mon estomac étaient juste très "
"abîmés, et j'avais déjà eu le temps de récupérer. Je pense que cela m'a "
"empêché de faire quelque chose de trop stupide, et croyez-moi, il y avait de "
"fortes chances que cela arrive. Pendant longtemps, j'ai eu des visions de "
"Rambo, me précipitant dans la ville pour sauver tout le monde, mais j'étais "
"encore trop immobile. Lorsque j'ai retrouvé mes forces, ce n'était pas une "
"option... nous étions déjà bien avancés dans la phase de ravitaillement en "
"ville. Le plus près que j'ai pu sauver de vieux amis a été d'abattre les "
"monstres qui portaient leurs visages."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was just sittin' in lockup.  They took me in the night before, for a "
"bullshit parole violation.  Assholes.  I was stuck in my cell when the cops "
"all started yelling about an emergency, geared up, and left me in there "
"havin' a <freaking> staring contest with a security cam that probably wasn't "
"even on.  I was stuck in there for two god-damn days, with no food and only a "
"little water.  Then this big-ass zombie busted in.  I didn't know what the "
"fuck to think, but if my cam wasn't working, the one in the hall sure was.  "
"Tripped a motion sensor or some shit, alarm started going, and the big dumb "
"fuck turned around to get at it while its arms were still stuck in the cell "
"bars.  Ripped the whole door out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"'cuz I know how cops think.  If you can call it that.  Early days, they were "
"still going after alarms in case it meant, I dunno, survivors.  You smack "
"some fucker's sports car, it starts wailing, the cops come to take a look and "
"you can walk right behind 'em.  That's the thing about cops; they follow "
"orders, right?  Even when the world's comin' apart.  I kept my head down "
"until I got past the worst of it, but then, lucky me, I got sergeant "
"brainiac.  Figured out why someone would trip an alarm on purpose, had them "
"case all up and down the streets for me.  I wound up on the edge of town "
"layin' low under an abandoned RV for a few hours.  By then… well, they had "
"some other big problems to deal with.  For a little bit.  Might've survived "
"if they hadn't blown their wads chasing me around the block."
msgstr ""
"parce que je sais comment les flics pensent. Si on peut appeler ça comme ça. "
"Au début, ils s'en prenaient encore aux alarmes au cas où elles "
"signifieraient, je ne sais pas, des survivants. Si tu défonces la voiture de "
"sport d'un connard, elle se met à hurler, les flics viennent jeter un coup "
"d'œil et tu peux marcher juste derrière eux. C'est ça le truc avec les flics "
": ils suivent les ordres, non ? Même quand le monde s'écroule. J'ai gardé la "
"tête baissée jusqu'à ce que je passe le pire, mais ensuite, j'ai eu de la "
"chance, j'ai eu le cerveau du sergent. J'ai compris pourquoi quelqu'un "
"déclencherait une alarme volontairement, j'ai fait faire des recherches dans "
"toutes les rues pour moi. Je me suis retrouvé à la périphérie de la ville, "
"caché sous un camping-car abandonné pendant quelques heures. À ce "
"moment-là... ils avaient d'autres gros problèmes à régler. Pendant un petit "
"moment. J'aurais pu survivre s'ils ne s'étaient pas ruinés à me poursuivre."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Bullshit, that's what.  The assholes busted me on possession, wasn't even my "
"fuckin' stash.  I don't do crack, man, that shit's nasty, I was just carryin' "
"it for my buddy Johnny.  Y'know, this might be a <freaking> hellhole now, but "
"if I've seen the last power-trippin' asshole cop, it might all be worth it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was fricking lucky for <the_cataclysm>.  I was squatting in a warehouse out "
"on the edge of town.  I was in a real shitty place, and my crew had mostly "
"just been arrested in a big drug bust, but I had skipped out.  I was scared "
"they were gonna think I ratted 'em out and come get me, but hey, no worries "
"about that now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was just in a warehouse, not in Zambonia.  I had the internet.  Watched "
"those crazy videos on YouTube in real time, scared the shit out of me.  I had "
"it pretty good though, I'd lifted a bunch of canned food and shit, and I had "
"a pretty sweet little squat in that warehouse.  I'd been planning on spending "
"a long time there after all, while I figured out how to get in good with my "
"crew."
msgstr ""
"J'étais dans un entrepôt, pas en Zambie. J'avais Internet. J'ai regardé ces "
"vidéos folles sur YouTube en temps réel, ça m'a foutu la trouille. Je m'en "
"sortais plutôt bien, j'avais soulevé un tas de conserves et d'autres trucs, "
"et j'avais un joli petit squat dans cet entrepôt. J'avais prévu d'y passer un "
"long moment, le temps de trouver un moyen de m'entendre avec mon équipe."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  <zombies>.  A bunch of them, led by this big creepy-ass jet-black "
"bastard with glowing red eyes, I shit you not.  I dunno what brought them way "
"out my way but they saw me takin' a piss outside and that was that.  I took a "
"few shots at them but that creepy-ass motherfucker waves his hands and brings "
"'em back up, so I ran.  Once I got my shit together again I realized it "
"wasn't so bad, I was running out of stuff anyway.  Been livin' on what I can "
"loot ever since, until I fell in with you."
msgstr ""
"Oui. <zombies>. Un tas d'entre eux, menés par ce gros bâtard noir de jais "
"avec des yeux rouges luisants, je vous emmerde. Je ne sais pas ce qui les a "
"amenés sur mon chemin, mais ils m'ont vu pisser dehors et c'est tout. J'ai "
"tiré quelques coups de feu sur eux, mais cet enfoiré de flippant a agité ses "
"mains et les a ramenés à la surface, alors je me suis enfui. Une fois que "
"j'ai repris mes esprits, j'ai réalisé que ce n'était pas si grave, je n'avais "
"plus rien de toute façon. Depuis, je vis de ce que je peux piller, jusqu'à ce "
"que je tombe sur toi."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well, I mean, if he's surrounded by buddies like that and he can just bring "
"'em back, I think he's a scary bastard.  If I got him on his own I think "
"maybe I could have taken him.  Also when I was running I managed to get a "
"zombie on its own, and I smashed it to shit with a stick before the rest "
"showed up.  He tried to raise that one and it didn't get back up."
msgstr ""
"S'il est entouré de copains comme ça et qu'il peut les ramener, je pense que "
"c'est un bâtard effrayant. Si je l'avais eu tout seul, je pense que j'aurais "
"pu l'avoir. Quand je courais, j'ai aussi réussi à attraper un zombie tout "
"seul, et je l'ai réduit en bouillie avec un bâton avant que les autres "
"n'arrivent. Il a essayé de le relever et il ne s'est pas relevé."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/dreamer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"OK, this is gonna sound crazy but I, like, I knew this was going to happen.  "
"Like, before it did.  You can even ask my psychic except, like, I think she's "
"dead now.  I told her about my dreams a week before the world ended.  Serious!"
msgstr ""
"OK, ça va paraître dingue, mais je savais que ça allait arriver. Genre, avant "
"que ça n'arrive. Vous pouvez même demander à ma voyante, mais je crois "
"qu'elle est morte maintenant. Je lui ai parlé de mes rêves une semaine avant "
"la fin du monde. Sérieux !"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/dreamer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"OK, so, sometimes I dream that I am a zombie.  I just don't realize it.  And "
"I just act normal to myself and I see zombies as normal people and normal "
"people as zombies.  When I wake up I know it's fake though because if it were "
"real, there would be way more normal people.  Because they'd actually be "
"zombies.  And everyone is a zombie now."
msgstr ""
"Parfois, je rêve que je suis un zombie. Je ne m'en rends pas compte. Je me "
"comporte normalement et je vois les zombies comme des gens normaux et les "
"gens normaux comme des zombies. Quand je me réveille, je sais que c'est faux "
"parce que si c'était vrai, il y aurait beaucoup plus de gens normaux. Parce "
"qu'ils seraient en fait des zombies. Et tout le monde est un zombie "
"maintenant."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/dreamer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"So, like, there were some really bad riots, okay?  Everyone got really "
"violent and nasty, and to be honest, I was on a bit of a spirit journey for a "
"lot of it and I don't really remember too well.  But the weirdest part is, "
"nobody even *cared* about each other.  It's like all our caring got sucked "
"away.  I think it was some kind of negative energy thing.  And also that made "
"the dead, like, come back to life and stuff.  Plus, like, there were some "
"monsters?  I'm not really sure how they fit in."
msgstr ""
"Il y a eu de très mauvaises émeutes, d'accord ? Tout le monde est devenu très "
"violent et méchant, et pour être honnête, j'étais un peu en voyage spirituel "
"pendant une bonne partie de l'événement et je ne m'en souviens pas très bien. "
"Mais le plus étrange, c'est que personne ne s'est soucié des autres. C'est "
"comme si toute notre attention avait été aspirée. Je pense que c'était une "
"sorte d'énergie négative. Et aussi un truc qui faisait que les morts "
"revenaient à la vie et tout ça. Et puis, il y avait des monstres ? Je ne sais "
"pas vraiment comment ils s'intègrent."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I made it to one of those <freaking> evac shelters, but it was almost worse "
"than what I left behind.  Escaped from there, been on the run since."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I spent a lot of time rummaging for rhubarb and bits of vegetables in the "
"forest before I found the courage to start picking off some of those dead "
"monsters.  I guess I was getting desperate."
msgstr ""
"J'ai passé beaucoup de temps à chercher de la rhubarbe et des morceaux de "
"légumes dans la forêt avant de trouver le courage de commencer à éliminer "
"certains de ces monstres morts. Je crois que je commençais à être désespéré."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Not exactly.  After a while, I got brave.  I started venturing towards the "
"outskirts of town, picking off zombies here and there.  I learned about "
"traveling in at night to avoid all but those <freaking> shadow-zombies, and "
"that got me pretty far.  Eventually I cleared out a cozy little nook for "
"myself and started really feeling comfortable.  I guess I got a bit "
"complacent."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I thought I had those damned <zombies> figured out.  I got braver, started "
"heading out by day more and more.  One of those screamer zombies spotted me "
"and called in a horde, with a giant <freaking> beastie at the head of it, the "
"size of a Volkswagen and all covered in bone plates.  I know when I'm "
"outclassed.  The big guy was held back by his own horde of buddies, and I "
"managed to book it back to my place.  I closed the windows, locked it down, "
"but it was too late.  The giant followed me and just started hammering right "
"through the walls.  I grabbed what I could and made for the horizon.  Last I "
"saw of my squat, it was collapsing on the bastard.  For all I know, it died "
"in the crash, but I am not going back to find out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"What happened?  I'm not really sure.  You must know about the riots and all "
"that, that the government and the police totally failed to contain.  I don't "
"have a good guess what caused that.  I thought it was the usual stuff at "
"first, and I gotta admit, I was sort of excited and scared it was the start "
"of a revolution.  Not excited enough to join in though, and I guess anyone "
"who was is probably dead now.  I tried to wait it out at home, packed a "
"little bug-out bag, but then the internet started showing videos of rioters "
"getting back up and fighting with crazy injuries.  I don't know how many "
"people really believed it at first, but I took that as my sign and ditched "
"town for the evac shelter.  I don't know exactly what happened after that.  "
"The center I was in was heavily vandalized and empty, and I never saw anyone "
"else.  The cell phone grid was locked up, except for one emergency message "
"that came through around a day later saying the government had fallen.  Power "
"went out a few days later."
msgstr ""
"Qu'est-ce qui c'est passé? Je ne suis pas vraiment sûr(e). Vous devez savoir "
"au sujet des émeutes et tout ça que le gouvernement et la police ont "
"totalement échoué à maintenir en ordre. Je n'ai pas vraiment de bonne "
"hypothèse sur ce qui a causé ça. Je pensais que ce n'était que la routine au "
"début, et je dois admettre que j'était un peu excité(e) et avait aussi peur "
"que ceci était le début d'une révolution. Pas assez excité(e) pour m'y "
"joindre par contre, et je suppose que ceux qui ont fait cela sont déjà morts. "
"J'ai essayé d'attendre que cela passe chez moi, me suis fait un petit sac de "
"provisions s'y j'avait besoin de décamper, mais c'est durant cette période "
"que l'internet à commencé à être rempli de personnes se relevant et se "
"battant en ignorant des blessures énormes. Je ne sais pas combien de "
"personnes y croyait vraiment en début, mais j'ai pris ça comme mon signe de "
"quitter la ville et aller à un abri d'évacuation. Je ne sais pas vraiment ce "
"qui c'est passé après ça. L'abri où je suis arrivé(e) était vandalisé et "
"vide, et je n'ai jamais rencontré qui que ce soit ayant eu la même idée que "
"moi. Le réseau téléphonique était surchargé ou hors de fonction, je n'ai reçu "
"qu'un seul message d'urgence ayant réussi à passer à travers un jour après "
"que je sois arrivé(e) annonçant que le gouvernement s'était écroulé, le "
"réseau électrique rendant l'âme quelques jours après ça."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Same as most people who didn't get killed straight up during the riots.  I "
"went to one of those stupid <freaking> evacuation death traps.  I actually "
"lived there for a while with three others.  One guy who I guess had watched a "
"lot of movies kinda ran the show, because he seemed to really know what was "
"going on.  Spoiler alert: he fucking didn't."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Things went south when our fearless leader decided we had to put down one of "
"the other survivors that had been bitten.  Her husband felt a bit strongly "
"against that, and I wasn't too keen on it either; by this point, he'd already "
"been wrong about a lot.  Well, he took matters into his own hands and killed "
"her.  Then her husband decided one good turn deserves another, and killed the "
"idiot.  And then she got back up and I killed her again, and pulped our "
"former leader.  Unfortunately she'd given her husband a hell of a nip during "
"the struggle, when he couldn't get his shit together enough to fight back.  "
"Not that I fucking blame him.  We made it out of there together, but it was "
"too much for him, he clearly wasn't in it anymore… the bite got infected, but "
"it was another <zombie> that finally killed him.  And then I was alone."
msgstr ""
"Les choses se sont gâtées lorsque notre intrépide chef a décidé que nous "
"devions abattre l'un des autres survivants qui avait été mordu. Son mari s'y "
"est opposé, et je n'étais pas très enthousiaste non plus ; à ce stade, il "
"s'était déjà trompé sur beaucoup de choses. Il a donc pris les choses en main "
"et l'a tuée. Puis son mari a décidé qu'une bonne action en méritait une autre "
"et a tué l'idiot. Puis elle s'est relevée, je l'ai tuée à nouveau et j'ai "
"réduit en bouillie notre ancien chef. Malheureusement, elle avait donné à son "
"mari un sacré coup de fouet pendant la lutte, alors qu'il n'arrivait pas à se "
"ressaisir suffisamment pour riposter. Ce n'est pas que je lui en veuille. On "
"a réussi à sortir de là ensemble, mais c'était trop pour lui, il n'était "
"clairement plus dans le coup... la morsure s'est infectée, mais c'est un "
"autre <zombie> qui l'a finalement tué. Et puis je me suis retrouvée seule."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well, I assume you know about the riots and the military and police and the "
"freakin' nightmare monsters walking the earth beside zombies, right?  If "
"you're asking what I think caused it all, well, I dunno.  My best guess it "
"was some huge government overreach, maybe some kind of experimental bioweapon "
"that got away.  They tried to lie so much at the start about everything that "
"was going on, I don't think the whole 'Chinese attack' shit measures up.  "
"They were trying to cover something up.  As for the real end times, maybe the "
"rest of the world tried to contain it.  I heard there were honest-to-god "
"nukes going off here on American soil.  To me that seems like somewhere else, "
"maybe Europe, trying to get whatever is going on here contained.  Maybe it "
"even worked.  It's bad now but it's not like it was."
msgstr ""
"Je suppose que vous êtes au courant des émeutes, de l'armée, de la police et "
"des monstres cauchemardesques qui se promènent sur terre à côté des zombies, "
"n'est-ce pas ? Si vous me demandez ce qui a causé tout ça, eh bien, je ne "
"sais pas. Je pense qu'il s'agit d'un énorme excès du gouvernement, peut-être "
"une sorte d'arme biologique expérimentale qui s'est échappée. Ils ont "
"tellement essayé de mentir au début sur tout ce qui se passait, je ne pense "
"pas que toute cette histoire d'\"attaque chinoise\" tienne la route. Ils "
"essayaient de dissimuler quelque chose. Quant à la véritable fin des temps, "
"peut-être que le reste du monde a essayé de la contenir. J'ai entendu dire "
"que des bombes atomiques avaient explosé sur le sol américain. Pour moi, "
"c'est comme si un autre pays, peut-être l'Europe, essayait d'endiguer ce qui "
"se passe ici. Peut-être même que cela a fonctionné. La situation est grave "
"aujourd'hui, mais elle n'est plus ce qu'elle était."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"There's nothing too special about me, I'm not sure why I survived.  I got "
"evacuated with a handful of others, but we were too late to make the second "
"trip to a FEMA center.  We got attacked by the dead… I was the only one to "
"make it out.  I never looked back."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai rien qui sort vraiment de l'ordinaire, et je ne suis pas sûr pourquoi "
"j'ai réussi à survivre.  J'ai été évacué avec quelque autres vers un abri, "
"mais il était déjà trop tard pour être collecté par un second transport vers "
"un centre FEMA.  Nous avons ensuite été attaqués par une horde et... j'ai été "
"le seul à m'en sortir."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Sheer luck I guess.  I went the absolute wrong way, into town, and wound up "
"stuck in the subway system.  I spent a few days living off vending machine "
"food.  Not the best eating, but I pulled through.  At least there weren't so "
"many zombies down there."
msgstr ""
"Juste de la pure chance je suppose.  Je me suis enfui dans la pire direction, "
"pile vers la ville, et je me suis retrouvé coincé dans les tunnels de métro.  "
"J'ai souffert à travers quelques jours où je n'ai mangé que des choses issues "
"de distributeurs automatiques, mais au moins il n'y avait pas trop de zombies."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Straight up hunger.  I didn't have any great light source down there, and I "
"didn't have much food.  I was slipping up and down to the station to buy from "
"the vending machines, but once I ran out of cash I had to make a break for "
"it.  I waited until dark and then skipped out."
msgstr ""
"J'avais juste trop faim.  Je n'avais pas grand chose là dessous et pas de "
"lampe torche correcte, donc je ne faisait que des petits allez-retours vers "
"la station pour acheter des trucs aux distributeurs, mais quand ma carte est "
"tombée à court d'argent j'ai dû me résoudre à attendre jusqu'à ce qu'il fasse "
"noir dehors et courir pour ma vie."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Straight up hunger.  I didn't have any great light source down there, and I "
"didn't have much food.  I was slipping up and down to the station to buy from "
"the vending machines, but once I ran out of cash I had to think of something "
"else.  I started raiding the surrounding area by night, and built a decent "
"little base under there."
msgstr ""
"J'avais juste trop faim.  Je n'avais pas grand chose là dessous et pas de "
"lampe torche correcte, donc je ne faisait que des petits allez-retours vers "
"la station pour acheter des trucs aux distributeurs, mais quand ma carte est "
"tombée à court d'argent j'ai dû changer ma tactique et fouiller les environs "
"durant la nuit pour ramener des choses en bas."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  I had it pretty good there, but eventually I just started going a bit "
"nuts.  Always dark, a bit cold, living off scavenged junk food… a soul can "
"only live like that for so long.  When the weather above ground got warmer "
"and the daylight hours got longer I decided to get a bit braver.  I'd learned "
"enough about the <zombies> that I was able to live pretty well after that.  "
"I've camped a few places, scavenged berries and whatnot, lived a pretty good "
"life compared to those first few months."
msgstr ""
"Oui.  C'était pas mal, mais éventuellement j'ai commencé à un peu perdre la "
"boule.  Tout était toujours si sombre, froid et humide, et je ne survivait "
"que sur de la malbouffe…  Au bout d'un moment quelqu'un ne peut plus vivre "
"comme ça.  Lorsque les journées se sont allongées et le thermomètre à grimper "
"j'ai décidé de devenir un peu plus brave.  J'avais appris assez au sujet des "
"<zombies> que j'étais plus ou moins capable d'éviter le pire et de trouver de "
"la nourriture correcte après ça."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Woah, <name_g>, I don't even know where to start.  The riots?  I think it was "
"going on sooner than that.  There were bad murmurs going on a few weeks "
"before that happened.  Lots of really scary crimes, not your usual stuff but "
"like cannibalism and some real unspeakable shit, you know?  When the riots "
"started, I think I was already primed to think of it as something different "
"from a normal equality riot or anything like that.  I think that's part of "
"how I got out safer, I had had some time to get some stuff and get going, and "
"didn't try to make shopping trips.  People were abso-fuckin-lutely crazy in "
"those days.  It was a lot like the pandemic a few years back, except the "
"police were out in the streets in force, gunning people down like it was "
"going out of style."
msgstr ""
"Woah, <name_g>, je ne sais même pas par où commencer. Les émeutes ? Je pense "
"que c'était plus tôt que ça. Il y avait de mauvais murmures quelques semaines "
"avant que ça n'arrive. Beaucoup de crimes vraiment effrayants, pas les trucs "
"habituels, mais du cannibalisme et des trucs vraiment innommables, tu vois ? "
"Lorsque les émeutes ont commencé, je pense que j'étais déjà préparé à penser "
"qu'il s'agissait de quelque chose de différent d'une émeute normale sur "
"l'égalité ou de quelque chose de ce genre. Je pense que c'est en partie ce "
"qui m'a permis de sortir plus en sécurité, j'avais eu le temps de prendre "
"quelques affaires et de me mettre en route, et je n'ai pas essayé de faire "
"des courses. Les gens étaient complètement fous à l'époque. Cela ressemblait "
"beaucoup à la pandémie d'il y a quelques années, sauf que la police était "
"dans les rues en force, abattant les gens comme si c'était démodé."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"They were shipping me with a bunch of evacuees over to a refugee center, when "
"the bus got smashed in by the biggest zombie you ever saw.  It was busy with "
"the other passengers, so I did what anyone would do and fucked right out of "
"there."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I ran until I felt like my lungs were going to jump right out of my mouth.  I "
"holed up in the forest for the night, under a fir tree.  In the morning I "
"heard someone talking, so I went to see.  I was playing it pretty careful "
"though, there were still a lot of psychos and rioters around.  I snuck up on "
"some kind of thing, some monster worse than any zombie.  Some huge bug thing, "
"saying random phrases like some kind of broken tape recorder.  It was "
"dragging a few human bodies behind it, I couldn't tell if they were dead or "
"unconscious.  Honestly I didn't wait to find out, I ducked into the bushes "
"and tried not to breath until I couldn't hear it anymore."
msgstr ""
"J'ai couru jusqu'à ce que j'aie l'impression que mes poumons allaient sauter "
"de ma bouche. Je me suis caché dans la forêt pour la nuit, sous un sapin. Au "
"matin, j'ai entendu quelqu'un parler, alors je suis allé voir. J'ai été assez "
"prudent, car il y avait encore beaucoup de psychopathes et d'émeutiers dans "
"les parages. Je me suis approché d'une sorte de chose, d'un monstre pire que "
"n'importe quel zombie. Un énorme insecte qui prononçait des phrases au "
"hasard, comme une sorte de magnétophone cassé. Il traînait quelques corps "
"humains derrière lui, je ne pouvais pas dire s'ils étaient morts ou "
"inconscients. Honnêtement, je n'ai pas attendu de le savoir, je me suis "
"réfugié dans les buissons et j'ai essayé de ne pas respirer jusqu'à ce que je "
"ne l'entende plus."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Once I was okay leaving the bushes, I made my way to an old shed I could see "
"a ways off.  It was falling in but it kept the rain and wind off and gave me "
"a place out of sight.  I stayed there until I ran out of those ass-tasting "
"ration bars I'd filled my backpack with.  Then I took on the wanderin' life "
"until we met."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"My evac shelter got swarmed by some of those bees, the ones the size of dogs. "
" I took out a few with a plank, but pretty quick I realized it was either "
"head for the hills or get stuck like a pig.  The rest is history."
msgstr ""
"Mon abri d'évacuation s'est fait envahir par un essaim de ces abeilles, "
"celles de la taille de chiens. J'ai réussi à en tuer quelques unes avec une "
"planche, mais je me suis rapidement rendu compte que c'était soit décamper "
"dans les forêts environnantes soit me faire embrocher comme un cochon par des "
"dizaines de dards. Vous connaissez la suite."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm sure you've seen them, they're everywhere.  Like something out of "
"an old sci-fi movie.  Some of the others in the evac shelter got stung, it "
"was no joke.  I didn't stick around to see what the lasting effect was "
"though.  I'm not ashamed to admit I ran like a <freaking> chicken."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well, excuse me if I didn't stop to fucking ask what kind of killer bugs they "
"were."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_6.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well, I was at home when the cell phone alert went off and told me to get to "
"an evac shelter.  So I went to an evac shelter.  And then the shelter got too "
"crowded, and people were waiting to get taken to the refugee center, but the "
"buses never came.  You must already know about all that.  It turned into "
"panic, and then fighting.  I didn't stick around to see what happened next; I "
"headed into the woods with what tools I could snatch from the lockers.  I "
"went back a few days later, but the place was totally abandoned.  No idea "
"what happened to all those people."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_6.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I gotta be honest with you, I heard a lot of stories back at the shelter, and "
"only one of them really stuck.  This is some kind of science experiment gone "
"wrong.  I don't know what caused the riots and the undead in the first place, "
"but there's no way it's this out of control everywhere.  Yeah, I got the same "
"'the government has fallen' text as everyone, but it doesn't make *sense* "
"that it could be so widespread so fast.  I think we're in some sort of "
"exclusion zone, where they're letting whatever is going on run its course to "
"see how it works so they can fight it better next time.  Somewhere out there, "
"outside the zone, it's more or less business as usual."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/ex_pilot_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Where was I?  I don't even know, what day do you think it all ended?  When I "
"thought shit was hitting the fan I took some vacation time at the airline.  "
"Next day, somebody bombed them.  No shit, just like Oklahoma city in '95.  "
"Thought that was a good sign to get out so I emailed some family out in the "
"country that I was coming over and got on the road.  Didn't even make it to "
"the interstate before I ran into the cops setting up a roadblock.  I drove "
"off the road and it all gets fuzzy from there.  Next town I got to was "
"already lynching people from the streetlights… I didn't stop for gas.  Lost "
"the car at some point, lost track of the days too.  Not sure I ever got a "
"reply to my email."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/fema_evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"That place was chaos.  I only stayed a few hours.  They had a big backhoe "
"running, digging a huge pit in a cordoned section they wouldn't let us near.  "
"Well, I managed to sneak over that way, and saw them dumping load after load "
"of the dead in the pit, pouring dirt back over them even as they revived and "
"tried to climb out.  Even with all the shit I've seen since, it haunts me.  I "
"knew then I had to get out.  Luckily for me, we were attacked the next "
"morning by some giant horror, a kind I haven't really seen since then.  While "
"the guards were busy with that, I grabbed some supplies I'd stocked up over "
"the night and I fucked right out of there.  A few others tried to get the "
"fuck out with me, but as far as I know I was the only lucky one."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm not from around here… You can probably tell from the accent, I'm from the "
"UK.  I was here doing my PhD at Dartmouth.  I was halfway to MIT for a "
"conference when <the_cataclysm> stopped me.  I was staying at a flea-ridden "
"little motel on the side of the road.  When I got up for whatever was going "
"to pass for breakfast, the fat bloody proprietor was sitting at his desk, "
"wearing the same grubby clothes from the night before.  I thought he had just "
"slept there, but when he looked at me… well, you know what those Zed-eyes "
"look like.  He lunged, and I reacted without thinking.  Smacked him on the "
"head with my tablet, again and again, until he stopped coming for me.  I "
"never thought I had anything like that in me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I wandered for a little while around the grounds, letting the adrenaline "
"fade, hoping for some kind of idea what to do.  I was out in the middle of "
"nowhere, and I didn't know the area at all.  I wasn't certain if I should "
"head back to Hanover, and try to get my belongings, or stay out where I was.  "
"Finally, I decided to rest a while until I knew what was going on.  The "
"internet told me most of what I needed; I'm sure you saw Twitter in those "
"days.  Even if I'd thought it wise to go back all the way to New Hampshire, I "
"was far too scared."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Yes.  Simple hunger.  The vending machines sold only peanuts and biscuits.  I "
"wasn't about to rely on that for survival.  I stayed long enough to realize "
"no one was going to come for me, then packed up what I could and drove off.  "
"Eventually my car was caught in a downpour of acid rain that stripped the "
"tires and left me to carry on on foot, living the life of a hunter gatherer.  "
"Honestly, I think I eat better this way than I did as a grad student."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was in biochemistry.  Specifically, if you're interested, I was studying "
"the folding of non-standard nucleic acids into enzyme-like structures.  It "
"sounds more interesting than it was; most of my time was spent cursing at "
"computer screens and wishing we had more information on threose chains at "
"unusual temperatures and pressures for modeling."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Nothin' special before <the_cataclysm>.  When the dead started walking, I "
"geared up and started puttin' them back down."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Almost got killed.  One <zombie> is easy pickins, but ten is a lot, and a "
"hundred is a death trap.  I got myself in too deep, an' barely slipped out "
"with my guts still inside me.  Holed up in an old motel for a while lickin' "
"my wounds and thinkin' about what I wanted to do next.  That's when I figured "
"it out."
msgstr ""
"Je me suis presque fait tuer. Un <zombie> est une proie facile, mais dix "
"d'entre eux sont une toute autre chose, et une centaine et une mort assurée. "
"J'ai plongé trop profond, et je m'en suis sorti avec plus de trous qu'il est "
"comfortable d'avoir. Je me suis terré dans un vieux motel pendant ma "
"convalescence, et pendant que je léchais mes blessures et réfléchissait à ce "
"que je voulais faire ensuite, je me suis rendu compte de quelque chose."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"This is it.  This is what I was made for.  There in the street, smashin' "
"monster heads and prayin' I'd make it out?  I've never felt like that.  "
"Alive.  Important.  So after I got myself all stuck back together, I nutted "
"up and went back to it.  Probly killed a thousand Z since then, and I'm still "
"not tired of it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Oh, you know.  Blah blah blah, had a job and a life, everyone died.  Boo hoo. "
" I gotta be straight with you though: I honestly think I like this better.  "
"Fighting for survival every day?  I've never felt so alive.  I've killed "
"hundreds of those bastards.  Sooner or later one of them will take me out, "
"but I'll go down knowing I did something actually important."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well y'see, I'm not from these parts at all.  I was driving up from the South "
"to visit my son when it all happened.  I was staying at a motel when a "
"military convoy passed through and told us to evacuate to a FEMA shelter."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, t'vois, je suis pas du tout d'ici. Je roulais depuis le Sud pour "
"rendre visite à mon fils quand c'est arrivé.  Je m'étais installé dans un "
"motel quand un convoi militaire est arrivé et nous a ordonné d'évacuer vers "
"un abri de la FEMA."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"He lives up in Northern Canada, way in the middle of nowhere, with his crazy "
"wife and my three grandkids.  He's an environmental engineer for some oil and "
"gas company out there.  She's a bit of a hippy-dippy headcase.  I love em "
"both though, and as far as I'm concerned they all made it out of this fucked "
"up mess safe, out there in the boondocks.  I guess they think I'm dead, so "
"they'll steer clear of this hellhole, and that's the best as could be."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Lord no.  I'll be fucked if I let a kid in a too-big uniform tell me what the "
"hell to do.  I had my Hummer loaded out and ready to go offroading, I had a "
"ton of gas, and I even had as many rifles as the border was gonna let me "
"bring over.  I didn't know what I was supposed to be running from, but I sure "
"as shit didn't run."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"At first, I just kept going North, but I ran into a huge military blockade.  "
"They even had those giant walking robots like on TV.  I started going up to "
"check it out, and before I knew it they were opening fire!  I coulda died, "
"but I still have pretty good reactions.  I turned tail and rolled out of "
"there.  My Hummer had taken some bad hits though, and I found out the hard "
"way I was leaking gas all down the freeway.  Made it a few miles before I "
"wound up stuck in the ass-end of nowhere.  I settled in to wander.  I guess "
"I'm still kinda heading North, just by a pretty round-about way, you know?"
msgstr ""
"Au début, j'ai continué à aller vers le nord, mais je me suis retrouvé face à "
"un énorme blocus militaire. Il y avait même des robots géants qui marchaient, "
"comme à la télé. J'ai commencé à monter pour vérifier, et avant que je m'en "
"rende compte, ils ouvraient le feu ! J'aurais pu mourir, mais j'ai encore de "
"bonnes réactions. J'ai tourné les talons et j'ai roulé hors de là. Mon Hummer "
"avait pris quelques mauvais coups, et j'ai découvert à mes dépens que je "
"perdais de l'essence sur toute l'autoroute. J'ai fait quelques kilomètres "
"avant de me retrouver coincé au fin fond de nulle part. Je me suis mis à "
"errer. Je crois que je me dirige toujours un peu vers le nord, mais par un "
"chemin assez détourné, vous savez ?"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"We're all thinking the same thing, aren't we?  Not much this could be but "
"some kind of secret military bullshit.  At first, I thought it was our own "
"government, but after all that went down, it's just too much.  It must've "
"been the Chinese.  I wonder if those sons of bitches are sitting back home, "
"right as rain, watching us struggling down here and waiting for things to die "
"down."
msgstr ""
"Nous pensons tous la même chose, n'est-ce pas ? Il n'y a pas grand-chose qui "
"puisse être autre chose qu'une sorte de connerie militaire secrète. Au début, "
"je pensais que c'était notre propre gouvernement, mais après tout ce qui "
"s'est passé, c'est trop. Ça devait être les Chinois. Je me demande si ces "
"fils de pute sont assis chez eux, comme la pluie, à nous regarder nous "
"débattre ici et à attendre que les choses se calment."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I dunno, I'm no expert.  You might not remember, but there was that big news "
"a couple years back that supposedly China had some kind of super fusion "
"reactor.  I read a news article, apparently that was all a front for some "
"other kind of secret weapon they were working on.  Made so much energy, there "
"was no way to hide it, so they made it a story about fusion power instead.  "
"That'd explain why we never saw fusion power Stateside, don't you think?  And "
"if they were that much more advanced that they could make fusion power, who "
"knows what else they could make."
msgstr ""
"Je ne sais pas, je ne suis pas un experte. Vous ne vous en souvenez peut-être "
"pas, mais il y a eu cette grande nouvelle il y a quelques années, selon "
"laquelle la Chine aurait eu une sorte de super réacteur à fusion. J'ai lu un "
"article, apparemment ce n'était qu'une façade pour une autre sorte d'arme "
"secrète sur laquelle ils travaillaient. Le réacteur produisait tellement "
"d'énergie qu'il n'y avait aucun moyen de le cacher, alors ils en ont fait une "
"histoire sur l'énergie de fusion à la place. Cela expliquerait pourquoi nous "
"n'avons jamais vu d'énergie de fusion aux États-Unis, vous ne pensez pas ? Et "
"s'ils étaient si avancés qu'ils pouvaient produire de l'énergie de fusion, "
"qui sait ce qu'ils pourraient faire d'autre."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/high_school_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was at school.  I'm a senior.  We'd heard about riots… it started with a "
"kid showing videos of one of the big riots in Providence.  You've probably "
"seen it, the one where the woman turns to the camera and you can see her "
"whole lower lip has been ripped off, and is just flapping there?  It got so "
"bad, they went over the PA system to tell us about Chinese drugs in the water "
"supply.  Right… does anyone buy that explanation?"
msgstr ""
"J'étais à l'école. Je suis en dernière année. Nous avions entendu parler des "
"émeutes... ça a commencé avec un gamin qui montrait des vidéos de l'une des "
"grandes émeutes de Providence. Vous l'avez probablement vue, celle où la "
"femme se tourne vers la caméra et où l'on voit que toute sa lèvre inférieure "
"a été arrachée et qu'elle s'agite sur le sol ? Les choses ont tellement "
"dégénéré qu'ils ont utilisé le système de sonorisation pour nous informer de "
"la présence de drogues chinoises dans l'approvisionnement en eau. Ok... "
"est-ce que quelqu'un croit à cette explication ?"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/high_school_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I guess it got worse, because the faculty decided to put us in lockdown.  For "
"hours.  And then the school buses showed up to evacuate us.  Eventually, they "
"ran out of buses.  I was one of the lucky few who didn't have a bus to get "
"on.  The soldiers weren't much older than me… they didn't look like they knew "
"what was going on.  I lived just a few blocks away.  I snuck off."
msgstr ""
"Je suppose que ça a empiré, parce que la faculté a décidé de nous enfermer. "
"Pendant des heures. Puis les bus scolaires sont arrivés pour nous évacuer. Au "
"bout d'un moment, il n'y avait plus de bus. Je faisais partie des quelques "
"chanceuses qui n'avaient pas de bus dans lequel monter. Les soldats n'étaient "
"pas beaucoup plus âgés que moi... ils n'avaient pas l'air de savoir ce qui se "
"passait. J'habitais à quelques rues de là. Je me suis éclipsée."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/high_school_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  On the way there, I met some <zombies> for real.  They chased me, but "
"I did pretty well in track.  I lost them… but I couldn't get home, there were "
"just too many.  I wound up running more.  Stole a bike and ran more again.  "
"I'm a bit better at killing those things now, but I haven't made it home yet. "
" I guess I'm afraid of what I'll find."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I saw it all pretty early, before it all really started.  I worked at the "
"hospital.  It started with a jump in the number of code whites - that's an "
"aggressive patient.  Wasn't my training so I didn't hear about it until "
"later… but rumors started flying about hyperaggressive delirious patients "
"that coded and seemed to die, then started attacking staff, and wouldn't "
"respond to anything we hit them with.  Then a friend of mine was killed by "
"one of them, and I realized it wasn't just a few weird reports.  I called in "
"sick the next day."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well, <the_cataclysm>.  I lived a fair distance out of town, and I already "
"knew something was seriously wrong, but I hadn't admitted to myself what I "
"was really seeing quite yet.  When I saw the military convoys pouring into "
"the city, I put the pieces together.  At first I thought it was just my "
"hospital.  Still, I packed up my bags, locked the doors and windows, and "
"waited for the evacuation call."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"No.  The call came too late.  I'd already seen the clouds on the horizon.  "
"Mushroom clouds, and also those insane hell-clouds.  I've heard that horrible "
"things came out of them.  I decided it was safer in my locked up house."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"The military happened.  They showed up and commandeered my land for some kind "
"of forward base, demanding I evacuate to a FEMA camp.  I didn't even try to "
"argue… I had my dad's old hunting rifle, they had high tech weapons.  I heard "
"one of them joking about the FEMA camp being Auschwitz, though.  I gave their "
"evac driver the slip and decided to make for my sister's place up north.  In "
"theory I guess I'm still going that way, although honestly I'm just busy not "
"dying."
msgstr ""
"Les militaires sont arrivés. Ils sont arrivés et ont réquisitionné mon "
"terrain pour y installer une sorte de base avancée, exigeant que je sois "
"évacué vers un camp de la FEMA. Je n'ai même pas essayé de discuter... "
"J'avais le vieux fusil de chasse de mon père, ils avaient des armes de haute "
"technologie. J'ai entendu l'un d'eux plaisanter sur le fait que le camp de la "
"FEMA était Auschwitz. J'ai fait faux bond à leur chauffeur d'évacuation et "
"j'ai décidé de me rendre chez ma sœur, dans le nord. En théorie, je crois que "
"je vais toujours dans cette direction, mais honnêtement, je suis juste occupé "
"à ne pas mourir."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was at work at the hospital, when it all went down.  It's a bit of a blur.  "
"For a while there were weird reports, stuff that sounded unbelievable about "
"patients getting back up after dying, but mostly things were business as "
"usual.  Then, towards the end, stuff just skyrocketed.  We thought it was a "
"Chinese attack, and that's what we were being told.  People coming in crazed, "
"covered in wounds from bullets and bites.  About halfway through my shift I… "
"well, I broke."
msgstr ""
"J'étais au travail à l'hôpital quand tout s'est passé. C'est un peu flou. "
"Pendant un certain temps, il y a eu des rapports bizarres, des choses qui "
"semblaient incroyables sur des patients qui se relevaient après être morts, "
"mais la plupart du temps, tout se passait comme d'habitude. Puis, vers la "
"fin, les choses sont montées en flèche. Nous pensions qu'il s'agissait d'une "
"attaque chinoise, et c'est ce qu'on nous disait. Les gens arrivaient fous, "
"couverts de blessures par balles et de morsures. Vers la moitié de mon "
"service, j'ai... eh bien, j'ai craqué."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was at work at the hospital, when it all went down.  It's a bit of a blur.  "
"For a while there were weird reports, stuff that sounded unbelievable about "
"patients getting back up after dying, but mostly things were business as "
"usual.  Then, towards the end, stuff just skyrocketed.  We thought it was a "
"Chinese attack, and that's what we were being told.  People coming in crazed, "
"covered in wounds from bullets and bites.  About halfway through my shift I… "
"well, I broke.  I'd seen such horrible injuries, and then I…  <swear!>  I "
"can't even talk about it."
msgstr ""
"J'étais au travail à l'hôpital quand tout s'est passé. C'est un peu flou. "
"Pendant un certain temps, il y a eu des rapports bizarres, des choses qui "
"semblaient incroyables sur des patients qui se relevaient après être morts, "
"mais la plupart du temps, tout se passait comme d'habitude. Puis, vers la "
"fin, les choses sont montées en flèche. Nous pensions qu'il s'agissait d'une "
"attaque chinoise, et c'est ce qu'on nous disait. Les gens arrivaient fous, "
"couverts de blessures par balles et de morsures. Vers la moitié de mon "
"service, j'ai... eh bien, j'ai craqué. J'avais vu des blessures si horribles, "
"et puis je... Je ne peux même pas en parler."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"A young mother.  I know she was a mother, because I delivered her baby.  "
"Sweet girl, she… she had a good sense of humor.  She came in, spitting that "
"black goo, fighting the orderlies, dead from a bullet wound through the "
"chest.  That's when I… I don't know if I woke up, finally, or if I finally "
"went crazy.  Either way, I broke.  I broke a lot earlier than my colleagues, "
"and that's the only reason I lived.  I skipped out, went to a dead corner of "
"the hospital I used to hide in when I was a resident.  An old stairwell "
"leading to a closed-off unit the maintenance staff were using to store old "
"equipment.  I hid there for hours, while I listened to the world crumbling "
"outside and inside."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Somehow, I don't know how, I managed to fall asleep in there.  I think it "
"might have started with me hyperventilating and passing out.  When I woke up "
"it was night, I was starving and parched, and… and the screaming had died "
"down.  At first I tried to go out the way I came in, but I peaked out the "
"window and saw one of the nurses stumbling around, spitting that black shit "
"up.  Her name was Becky.  She wasn't Becky anymore.  So, I went back up and "
"somehow made it into the storage area.  From there, the roof.  I drank water "
"from some nasty old puddle and I camped out there for a while, watching the "
"city around me burn."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well, I still didn't have any food.  Eventually I had to climb down the side "
"of the building… so I did, as quietly as I could.  It was night, and I have "
"pretty good nightvision.  Apparently the zombies don't, because I was able to "
"slip right past them and steal a bicycle that was just laying on the side of "
"the road.  I'd kind of scouted out my route from above… I'm not from a big "
"city, the hospital was the tallest building around.  I avoided the major "
"military blockades, and headed out of town towards a friend's old cabin.  I "
"had to fight off a couple of the <zombies>, but I managed to avoid any big "
"fuss, by some miracle."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well, I still didn't have any food.  Eventually I had to climb down the side "
"of the building… so I did, as quietly as I could.  It was night, and I have "
"pretty good nightvision.  Apparently the zombies don't, because I was able to "
"slip right past them and steal a bicycle that was just laying on the side of "
"the road.  I'd kind of scouted out my route from above… I'm not from a big "
"city, the hospital was the tallest building around.  I avoided the major "
"military blockades, and headed out of town towards a friend's old cabin.  I "
"had to fight off a couple of the <zombies>, but I managed to avoid any big "
"fuss, by some miracle.  I never made it to the cabin, but that's not "
"important now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"My hospital was the tallest building in town, so I saw quite a bit.  The "
"military set up blockades on the roads coming in and out of the town, and "
"there was quite a lightshow going on out there when I started up.  I think it "
"was mostly automated turrets and robots, I didn't hear much shouting.  I saw "
"a few cars and trucks try to run the barricade and get blown to high hell.  "
"There were swarms of <zombies> in the streets, traveling in packs towards "
"sounds and noises.  I watched them rip a few running cars to shreds, "
"including the people inside who were trying to get away.  You know.  The "
"usual stuff.  I was pretty numb by that point."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was called in to work at the hospital.  I don't usually work there, I'm a "
"community doctor.  I don't really love emergency medicine at the best of "
"times, and when your patient keeps trying to rip your face off, well, it "
"takes the last bit of fun out of it.  You might think I'm a coward, but I "
"slipped out early on, and I've got no regrets.  There was nothing I could "
"have done except die like everyone else.  I couldn't get out of the building, "
"the military had blockaded us in… so I went to the most secure, quiet damned "
"place in the building."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"The morgue.  Seems like a dumb place to go at the start of a zombie "
"apocalypse, right?  Thing is, nobody had made it to the morgue in quite a "
"while, the bodies were reanimating too quickly and the staff were just too "
"busy.  I was shaking and puking and I could see the world was ending… I "
"bundled myself up, grabbed a few snacks from the pathologist's desk, and "
"crawled into one of those drawers to contemplate the end of the world.  After "
"breaking the handle to make sure it couldn't lock behind me, of course.  It "
"was safe and quiet in there.  Not just my cubby, the whole morgue.  At first "
"it was because nobody was dumb enough to come down there except me.  Later, "
"it was because nobody was left."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"The door was good heavy steel with no window, and there was a staff room with "
"a fully stocked fridge, so when it became clear that nothing was going to get "
"any better on its own, I set up shop.  I stayed down there for a couple days. "
" I could hear explosions and screaming for the first while, then just guns "
"and explosions, and then it got really quiet.  Eventually, I ran out of "
"snacks, so I worked up the nerve to climb out a window and check out the city "
"by night.  I used that place as a base for a little while, but the area "
"around the hospital was too hot to keep it up, so I made my way out to "
"greener pastures.  And here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hunter_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I live way out of town.  I hear the small towns lasted a bit longer than the "
"big cities.  Doesn't matter to me, I was out on my end-of-winter hunting "
"trip, I'd been out of town for a week already.  First clue I had things were "
"going wrong was when I saw a mushroom cloud out near an old abandoned "
"military base, way out in the middle of nowhere.  I didn't think much about "
"that.  Then I was attacked by a demon."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hunter_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it was like a… like a soft shelled crab, with tentacle mouths, and it "
"kept talking in different voices.  I saw it before it saw me, and I capped it "
"with my Remington.  That just pissed it off, but I got another couple shots "
"off while it charged me.  Third or fourth shot took it down.  I figured out "
"shit had hit the fan, somehow.  Headed to my cabin and camped out there for a "
"while, but I had to skip out when a bunch of <zombies> showed up and trashed "
"the place.  I ran into you not much later."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hunter_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Yeah… the… the accident got him, but when I came to he was already coming "
"back.  Thank god for seatbelts, right?  He was screeching and flapping "
"around, hanging upside down.  I thought he was just hurt at first, but he "
"just kept coming at me while I tried to talk to him.  His arm was badly hurt "
"already and instead of unbuckling himself he started… he was ripping it right "
"off pulling against the seatbelt.  That, and the crazy shit with the chopper, "
"was when I realized just how fucked up things had got.  I grabbed my hunting "
"knife and ran, but my brother got out and started crawling after me."
msgstr ""
"Oui… l'... l'accident l'a tué, mais quand je me suis réveillé·e il était déjà "
"en train de revenir.  Merci Dieu pour les ceintures de sécurité je suppose?  "
"Il n'arrêtait pas de gémir et de s'agiter en étant suspendu tête en bas.  Je "
"pensais qu'il était juste blessé au début, mais il n'arrêtait pas d'essayer "
"de m'atteindre lorsque que j'ai commencé a essayer de lui parler.  Son bras "
"était déjà en lambeaux et il a juste commencé… à simplement se démembrer au "
"lieu de détacher sa ceinture.  Ça, et le truc cinglé avec l'hélicoptère "
"furent les choses qui m'ont ouvert les yeux sur la gravité des choses étant "
"en train de se passer.  Je suis me suis juste tiré·e de là avec mon fusil de "
"chasse et j'ai commencé à courir, mais mon frère se dégagea de la voiture et "
"rampa après moi pas loin derrière."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hunter_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I ran for a little bit, but then I saw soldier zombies crawling out of that "
"chopper.  They had the same look about them as my brother did, and it was "
"them on one side and him on the other.  I'm no genius but I've seen a few "
"movies: I figured out what was happening.  I didn't want to take on Kevlar "
"armor with my knife, so I turned back and faced the other zombie.  I couldn't "
"let my brother stay… like that.  So I did what I had to, and I guess I'll "
"live with that forever."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lab_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"For me, this started a couple days before <the_cataclysm>.  I'm a biochemist. "
" I did my postdoc work with a brilliant colleague, Pat Dionne.  I hadn't "
"talked to Pat in ages… word has it, the government got wind of our thesis, "
"found out Pat did most of the heavy lifting, and that was the last we talked "
"for years.  So, I was a bit surprised to see an e-mail from "
"Pat.Dionne@FreeMailNow.co.ru… even more surprised when it was a series of "
"nostalgic references to a D&D game we played years earlier."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lab_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well, the references weren't quite right.  Pat referred to things that we'd "
"never played.  The situations were close, but not right, and when I put it "
"all together, it told a story.  A story about a scholar whose kids were being "
"held captive by a corrupt government, forced to research dark magic for them. "
" And there was a clincher: A warning that the magic had escaped, a warning "
"that all heroes had to leave the kingdom before it fell."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lab_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Listen, I know it's incredibly cheesy.  That's D&D for you.  Anyway, "
"something about the tone really got to me.  I knew it was important.  I "
"wasted a little time waffling, then decided to use my outstanding vacation "
"time and skip town for a while.  I packed for the end of the world.  Turns "
"out, I packed the right stuff."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lab_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"There was, yeah, but it was cryptic.  If I had a copy of Pat's notes, I could "
"probably decipher it, but I'm sure those burned up in <the_cataclysm>.  They "
"bombed those labs, you know."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was late to evacuate when the shit hit the fan.  Got stuck in town for a "
"few days, survived by hiding in basements eating girl scout cookies and "
"drinking warm root beer.  Eventually I managed to weasel my way out without "
"getting caught by the <zombies>.  I spent a few days holed up in an abandoned "
"mall, but I needed food so I headed out to fend for myself in the woods.  I "
"wasn't doing a great job of it, so I'm kinda glad you showed up."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was home with the flu when the world went to shit, and when I recovered "
"enough to make a run to the store for groceries… well, I've been running ever "
"since."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Okay, well, I was kinda out of it those first few days.  I knew there were "
"storms, but I was having crazy fever dreams and stuff.  Honestly I probably "
"should have gone to the hospital, except then I guess I'd be dead now.  I "
"don't know what was a dream and what was the world ending.  I remember "
"heading to the fridge for a drink and noticing the light was out and the "
"water was warm, I think that was a bit before my fever broke.  I was still "
"pretty groggy when I ran out of chicken soup, so it took me a while to really "
"process how dark and dead my building was when I headed out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"You probably remember what the cities were like.  I think it was about day "
"four.  Once I stepped outside I realized what was going on, or realized I "
"didn't know what was going on at least.  I saw a bunch of rioters smashing a "
"car, and then I noticed one of them was bashing a woman's head in.  I "
"canceled my grocery trip, ran back to my apartment before they saw me, and "
"holed up there for as long as I could.  Things got comparatively quiet as the "
"dead started to outnumber the living, so I started looting what I could from "
"my neighbors, re-killing them when I had to.  Eventually the <zombies> "
"overran my building and I had to climb out and head for the hills on an old "
"bike."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"You mean what caused the riots and all that?  Well, they told us it was a "
"Chinese bioweapon but I have troubles believing anyone could engineer a "
"bioweapon that could do all this.  The only answer I can come up with, silly "
"though it sounds, is aliens."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well, maybe, but I'd guess it's too disorganized to be a proper invasion.  If "
"I had to guess, I'd say there was something locked in the polar ice.  Like, "
"remember a few years back there was that big thing online about an alien body "
"found in the ice?  I don't know if you remember but it was all over the news "
"for a while until it turned out to be a hoax.  Only, since then, I've seen "
"some aliens walking around that look a *lot* like that ice body.  Maybe it "
"wasn't a hoax, maybe that was a cover-up.  So, maybe those aliens had some "
"kind of virus.  It went around the world and infected everything silently "
"until, somehow, it activated and caused the violence and monsters and "
"mutations."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Let's not dance around it: I joined the riots, at first.  I don't really "
"remember what I was thinking.  I'd protested stuff like police brutality "
"before, but this was different.  I didn't make a sign and go down there "
"expecting to chant and march, I grabbed a bat and went outside planning to "
"fuck shit up.  I've never felt so angry before.  The riots had already been "
"going on a while at that point, and to me, it just looked like the government "
"trying to squash the people again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you're telling me.  The rioters… they weren't even like humans, let "
"alone protesters.  Nothing like any protest I'd ever been in before.  That "
"didn't stop me.  I joined them, and I was as bad as a bunch of them.  Smashed "
"windows, beat up bystanders, burnt cars.  I remember ripping riot gear off a "
"cop and… nevermind.  I don't want to remember that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"At some point, I felt like I was waking up.  It was around the time they were "
"busting out those Humvees with riot control turrets on top.  Says something "
"about my frame of mind that I don't even remember if I'd seen them before "
"that point.  Anyway I heard the gunfire going off and just kinda realized I "
"was on the edges of a mob charging a heavily armed military emplacement.  "
"That's when I started seeing the mob for what it was, seeing the wild-eyed "
"animals, even the zombies.  I turned and ran."
msgstr ""
"À un moment, j'ai eu l'impression de me réveiller. C'était autour du moment "
"où les forces de l'ordre on commencées à utiliser des Humvees avec des "
"tourelles anti-émeutes sur le toit. Cela indique probablement mon état "
"d'esprit que je ne me souviens même pas si j'en avais vu d'autres avant ça. "
"Bref, une rafale de fusil m'a secoué et je me suis soudain rendu compte que "
"j'étais sur le bord d'une horde furieuse en train de charger un emplacement "
"militaire armé jusqu'aux dents. J'ai aussi commencé à remarquer la vraie "
"nature de la foule, les animaux fous furieux avec leurs yeux injectés de "
"sang, voir carrément les zombies. Je me suis juste retourné et j'ai commencé "
"à courir."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I honestly don't know.  I wonder if some of the others would have come back "
"to their senses, given time.  I don't think I'm anything special.  Maybe a "
"lot of them did, and just weren't on the edge of the crowd at the time.  I'll "
"tell you, almost as soon as I came back to myself, I could see some of the "
"rioters looking at me like I was prey.  I didn't stick around to see what "
"would happen."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I knew the city pretty well.  I went for an abandoned building I knew about, "
"headed through a broken window, and holed up in there for a few days.  I had "
"a fair bit of stolen food and I just kept to myself.  When things started to "
"quiet down, I headed out, and here I am."
msgstr ""
"Je connaissais ma ville assez bien. Je suis rentré(e) dans un bâtiment "
"abandonné que je connaissais à travers un fenêtre brisée, et me suis "
"planqué(e) là quelques jours. J'avait une bonne pile de nourriture volée et "
"je me suis juste isolé(e). Lorsque les choses ont commencé à se calmer, je "
"suis sorti(e) de ma cachette, et me voilà je suppose."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"So, I remember the time leading up to the riots, same as anyone.  Things were "
"bad, there were some really awful crimes being reported in the news, and "
"there was a lot of racial tension as usual from the way the cops were "
"handling it.  Then people started rioting, which isn't unusual, but it was "
"weird the kind of places that the riots were starting in.  Like, upper middle "
"class neighborhoods, Midwestern small towns, things like that.  Anyway, I "
"joined the riots and I don't remember a lot of clear stuff after that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Kinda, I guess.  I heard people blaming the riots on some kind of mind "
"control drug, and frankly I'm not sure that's far off base.  That's kinda "
"what it felt like, although the whole time I really felt like myself.  It "
"wasn't until I snapped out of it that I realized how weird it was.  That "
"doesn't explain anything else though: the zombies, the monsters, all this "
"stuff is way off base.  Anything I've tried to guess just sounds like bad "
"science fiction, like demonic curses or alien weapons kinda stuff."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"That's how it goes, you know?  These are the end times.  I don't really want "
"to talk about it more than that.  And honestly, I never really felt like I "
"belonged, in the old world.  In a weird way, I actually feel like I have a "
"purpose now.  Do you ever get that?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Yeah, have you seen them yet?  They're these shitty walking flowers with a "
"big <freaking> stinger in the middle.  They travel in packs.  They hate the "
"zombies, and we were using them for cover to clear a horde of the dead.  "
"Unfortunately, turns out the plants are better trackers than the <zombies>.  "
"They almost seemed intelligent… I barely made it out, only because they were, "
"uh, distracted."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I said, I don't wanna talk about it.  How are you not understanding this?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Like I said, it's a lame story, but I guess it won't kill me to tell it one "
"more time."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  I really did.  It took me two days to make it across the city on foot, "
"camping out in dumpsters and places like that.  I started moving more by "
"night, and I learned right away to avoid the military.  They were a magnet "
"for the <zombies>, and they were usually stationed where the monsters were "
"coming.  Some parts of the city were pretty tame at first.  There were a few "
"chunks where people had been evacuated or cleared out, and the <zombies> "
"didn't really go there.  Later on, others like me started moving into those "
"neighborhoods, so I switched and started running through the blasted out "
"downtown.  I had to anyway, to get home.  By the time I made the switch "
"though, the fighting was starting to die off, and I was mostly just avoiding "
"attention from zombies and other things."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"The first warning was that I had to move from the preserved parts of the city "
"to the burnt out ones to get home.  It only got worse.  There was a police "
"barricade right outside my house, with a totally useless pair of automated "
"turrets sitting in front just idly watching the zombies lurch by.  That was "
"before someone switched them to kill everybody, back when it only killed "
"trespassing humans.  Good times, you can always trust bureaucracy to fuck "
"things up in the most spectacular way possible.  Anyway, the house itself was "
"half collapsed, a SWAT van had plowed into it.  I think I knew what I was "
"going to see in there, but I had made it that far and I wasn't going to turn "
"back."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm>, I was just a regular meteorologist.  I worked for the "
"local weather station doing data analysis and stuff.  In general, ordinary "
"boredom.  In my free time I was studying electronics and radio engineering, a "
"bit for work but mostly just as a hobby.  When the riots got serious, my "
"neighborhood was looking pretty sketchy.  I gathered all my things that I "
"managed to carry with me and settled in a radio station that seemed "
"abandoned.  I lived there for a while, doing all sorts of nonsense, until I "
"met you.  I guess you know the rest."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/nerd_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was at school for <the_cataclysm>.  Funny thing, actually: I was gearing up "
"to run a zombie survival RPG with my friends on the weekend.  Ha, I didn't "
"think it'd turn into a LARP!  Okay….  No, that wasn't funny."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/nerd_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well, I may be a huge <freaking> nerd, but I'm not an idiot.  Plus I'm genre "
"savvy.  We'd already heard about people coming back from the dead, actually "
"that's why I was doing the RPG.  When the cops came to put the school on "
"lockdown I managed to slip out the back.  I live a long way out of town, but "
"there was no way I was going to take a bus home, so I walked.  Two hours.  "
"Heard a lot of sirens, and I even saw jets overhead.  It was getting late "
"when I got back, but my mom and dad weren't back from work yet.  I stayed "
"there, hoping they'd come.  I sent texts but got no reply.  After a few days, "
"well… the news got worse and worse, then it stopped completely."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/nerd_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm not stupid.  I know they're gone.  Who knows where… maybe in an evac "
"shelter, maybe in a FEMA camp.  Most of everyone is dead."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/nerd_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Eventually the zombies came.  I figured they would.  Before the net cut out, "
"there were plenty of videos online making it clear enough what was going on.  "
"I'd picked out some good gear and loaded my bag up with supplies….  When they "
"started knocking at the door, I slipped out the back and took to the street.  "
"And here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"This is gonna sound crazy, but I woke up in the forest in the middle of "
"nowhere, freezing cold, about a week before I met you.  I had my clothes, a "
"splitting headache, and absolutely no memory of anything.  Like, I know "
"stuff.  I can talk, I have skills and understanding… but I don't remember "
"where any of it comes from.  I had a driver's license in my pocket and that's "
"the only way I even know my name."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well, not having a memory is weird as heck, but I'll be honest: I think it "
"might be better?  With what's going on, I bet you my memories weren't happy "
"ones.  Besides my driver's license, there were pictures of kids in my wallet… "
"not that that sparked any reaction from me.  I didn't see any kids around.  "
"Maybe losing my mind is a mercy.  Hell, maybe it's some kind of psychotic "
"break and my brain did this to itself.  To be honest with you I think I'd "
"rather focus on surviving, and not worry about it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I know it's nuts.  It sounds like fake amnesia from a Bugs Bunny cartoon.  "
"See?  How can I know that, but not remember how I know it?  Like, I remember "
"Bugs Bunny but I don't remember any time I sat down and watched a Bugs Bunny "
"show."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Who I was is gone.  All that stuff burned away in <the_cataclysm>.  Got it?  "
"Who I am now started two days into it.  I was on the run from a big-ass hell "
"zombie, running like I'd always been doing, when I found a steel baseball bat "
"just laying on the ground.  I took it as a sign and beat that gooey bastard "
"to a pulp… and that's when I became me.  I still run, because who doesn't, "
"but I stand my ground now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I went on, running when I had to and fighting when I could, like the rest of "
"us.  Started learning who I am now.  Lost the bat in a fight against some "
"crazy electric lightning shooting zombie.  It was arcing electricity through "
"my bat so I dropped it and used a nearby plank, but I wound up having to run "
"and leave the ol' slugger behind.  I nearly died that day."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Listen.  I said it clearly, and if you keep picking at it I'm gonna get mad.  "
"Who I was is gone.  Dead.  I don't give a shit about your 'healthy', don't "
"fucking ask again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Let's not talk about it, ok?  It just hurts to think about.  I've lost so "
"many people… and I'm sure you have too.  Let's focus on the here and now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I didn't even know about <the_cataclysm> right away.  I was way out, away "
"from the worst of it.  My car broke down out on the highway, and I was "
"waiting for a tow for hours.  I finally wound up camping in the bushes off "
"the side of the road; good thing, too, because a semi truck whipped by - dead "
"driver, you know - and turned my car into a skid mark.  I feel bad for the "
"bastards that were in the cities when it hit."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Ha, I don't fully understand it myself.  Those first few days were a tough "
"time to be outside, that's for sure.  I got caught in one of those hellish "
"rainstorms, it started to burn my skin right off.  I managed to take shelter "
"under a car, lying on top of my tent.  Wrecked the damn thing, but better it "
"than me.  From what I hear, though, I got lucky.  That was pretty much the "
"worst I saw.  I didn't run into any of those demon-monsters that I hear "
"attacked the cities, so I guess I got off lucky."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Besides the acid rain, I mostly saw people fleeing the cities.  I tried to "
"stay away from the roads, but I didn't want to get lost in the woods either, "
"so I stuck to the deep margins.  I saw cars, buses, trucks loaded down with "
"evacuees.  Plenty went right on, but a lot stalled out of gas and other "
"stuff.  Some were so full of gear and people there were folks hanging off "
"them.  Stalling out was a death sentence, because the dead were coming along "
"the roads picking off the survivors."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was out on a fishing trip with my friend when it happened.  I don't know "
"exactly how the days line up… our first clue that Armageddon had come was "
"when we got blasted by some kind of poison wind, with a sort of acid mist in "
"it that burnt our eyes and skin.  We weren't sure what to make of it so we "
"went inside to rest up, and while we were in there a weird dust settled over "
"everything."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"She took sick a few hours after we left the lake.  Puking, complaining about "
"her joints hurting.  I took us to a little shop I knew about on the "
"riverside, hoping they might have something to help or at least know what was "
"going on."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"The shop was empty, actually.  She was desperate though, so I broke in.  I "
"found out more about the chaos in towns from the store radio.  Got my friend "
"some painkillers and Gravol, but when I came out to the boat, well… it was "
"too late for her."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I wish.  That would have been a mercy.  She was letting out an awful, choking "
"scream, and her body was shredding itself apart.  Mushrooms were busting out "
"of every part of her.  I… I ran.  Now I wish that I'd put her out of her "
"misery, but going back there now would be suicide."
msgstr ""
"Si seulement j'avais fait ça. Cela aurait un acte de compassion. Rien d'autre "
"qu'un cri gargouillant sortait de ça bouche, son corps se déchirant en "
"lambeaux, des champignons et spores émergeant de chaque plaie. Je… Je me suis "
"enfui(e). J'aimerais avoir eu la force de l'achever, mais retourner là-bas "
"maintenant serait du suicide."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Ooooh, boy.  I was ready for this.  The winds were blowing this way for "
"years.  I had a full last man on earth shelter set up just out of town.  So, "
"of course, just my luck: I was miles out of town for a work conference when "
"China attacked and the world ended."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Our conference was at a retreat by a lake.  We all got the emergency "
"broadcast on our cells, but I was the only one to read between the lines and "
"see it for what it was: large scale bio-terrorism.  I wasn't about to stay "
"and find out who of my coworkers was a sleeper agent.  Although I'd bet fifty "
"bucks it was Lee.  Anyway, I stole the coordinator's pickup and headed "
"straight for my shelter."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"No, I barely got two miles.  I crashed into some kind of hell-spawn "
"bio-weapon, a crazy screeching nightmarish thing made of arms and legs and "
"heads from all sorts of creatures, humans too.  I think I killed it, but I "
"know for sure I killed the truck.  Grabbed my duffel bag and ran, after "
"putting a couple bullets into it for good measure.  I hope I never see "
"something like that again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I never made it there and can't imagine I ever will.  Every time I've tried "
"I've been headed off by the <zombies>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"The shelter?  Bought the land pretty cheap.  I hired a contractor to build "
"the thing but did the door myself.  Metal pin in the door frame.  Can't open "
"unless you remove it.  There's a little pulley inside you have to pull up to "
"reset.  They made dozens of these in the area, and I couldn't sleep knowing "
"just any <name_b> at that company could waltz in as soon as shit hit the fan. "
" They'd know exactly where to go and what to do!  Nah… how do you think I've "
"made it this long?  Always keep a trick up your sleeve."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Nope, that's it.  Got the idea for the door from a book on medieval castles, "
"in case you were wondering.  But instead of a counterweight holding a "
"drawbridge up, I just ram a hex key in a hole."
msgstr ""
"Non, c'est tout. J'ai pris l'idée d'un livre sur les chateaux médiévaux, si "
"vous vouliez savoir. Mais au lieu d'un contrepoids j'ai une clé hexagonale "
"que je place dans une serrure."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Almost as much as my house, in the end.  I think they realized they could "
"make a lot of money as things got worse and worse.  But it's nicer than my "
"house, too.  They said the ventilation system was built to withstand a month "
"of anything: nuclear fallout, biological attack, you name it.  Concrete and "
"soil above me to absorb radiation, appliances and supplies…  I even brought "
"some old books I've never read.  I always knew it would come to this."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"What, like some secret Batcave?  Pull back the curtain and it turns out I'm "
"the communist <name_b> who brewed up a demon bio-weapon in their basement?  I "
"just gave you food, all the tools in my workshop, and the safest hole in the "
"ground in the county.  If I've got any secrets left, they're mine to keep."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I knew it…  This whole time.  It was all part of the plan.  The riots, the "
"storms…  You always had control…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'd have to be absolutely imbecilic to give up the location of my stash to "
"someone I barely know.  For all I know you'd just kill me and take it all for "
"yourself!  Better luck next time, pal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well, that's one way to say 'fuck you'!  I know it's been a while since shit "
"went down, but I didn't lock that door and put up that sign for no reason!  "
"How would you feel if I came and stole all the stuff that YOU locked away for "
"safe keeping?!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well, that's one way to say 'fuck you'!  How…  Why…  I was still trying to "
"get back there, surviving and struggling just like you!  How would you feel "
"if I came and stole all YOUR stuff right when you needed it most?!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I guess I can't judge.  I've made some fucked up decisions, too.  Taken some "
"things that aren't mine."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"You're not really a good liar.  I built that thing like a fortress.  No one "
"would just break into it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Just don't lie about it.  I understand your life was probably in danger.  I "
"can see past that.  Trust me, I've been in sticky situations before.  Tell "
"the truth next time."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"&<npc_name> sighs and pauses for a moment.\n"
"\n"
"\"It's been so long now.  I barely even remember what I was doing.  There was "
"so much confusion and violence in those last days.  My family didn't "
"understand the threat, even though I tried to tell them.  I know what you "
"think I am, but look what's happened!  The dead are walking, the sky is "
"cracking open, and…  well, I can't even talk about it.  Isn't it obvious "
"something bigger is going on?\""
msgstr ""
"& <npc_name> soupire et se tait pour un moment.\n"
"\n"
"\"Je l'impression que ceci s'est passé il y a des années. J'ai du mal à me "
"rappeler exactement ce que je faisais, il y avais tellement de violence et de "
"confusion pendant cette période. J'ai essayé d'avertir ma famille, mais ils "
"on refusé d'entendre raison. Je sais que la plupart des gens pense que je ne "
"suis pas tout à fait sain(e) d'esprit, mais regardez ce qui c'est passé! Les "
"morts se lèvent, le ciel s'écroule, et... vous croyez vraiment qu'il n'y a "
"rien qui cloche dans le monde?\""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I thought I knew at one point.  There were so many signs of manipulation and "
"control.  I thought maybe they were trying to discredit the protests, but "
"when the violence broke out it seemed to be everywhere.  There was footage on "
"the news of people fighting, destroying property, eating animals and… each "
"other in the street.  I thought at some point they were going to sweep in and "
"seize control, but it just never happened."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"You know, the elites.  The ones who have always had control will continue "
"having control, no matter what it costs.  If it means destroying everything "
"to be king of the ashes, they'll do it.  I used to think it was China, for "
"sure, but I'm not so sure anymore.  I figured they would probably be here by "
"now, putting on their crown.  Maybe they're still waiting to make their move…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"That's what I'm saying!  Everything that's going on wouldn't be possible "
"without massive fuck-ups by people in power.  China has fusion reactors?  "
"Well, I've never seen it!  America sinks trillions and trillions of dollars "
"into secret military budgets with no explanation.  If you gave me a trillion "
"dollars and the brain of a bureaucrat, I bet I could completely fuck up "
"reality, too."
msgstr ""
"C'est ce que je dis ! Tout ce qui se passe ne serait pas possible sans les "
"erreurs massives des gens au pouvoir. La Chine a des réacteurs à fusion ? Je "
"n'ai jamais vu ça ! L'Amérique engloutit des billions et des billions de "
"dollars dans des budgets militaires secrets sans aucune explication. Si vous "
"me donnez un billion de dollars et le cerveau d'une bureaucrate, je parie que "
"je pourrais aussi complètement foutre en l'air la réalité."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I've been trying not to think about it, but you could be right.  The more "
"that I see, the less I can explain.  I grew up around a lot of people who "
"always talked about the Rapture.  Hell itself opening up and everything.  It "
"was like they KNEW it would happen.  Before the internet stopped working, I "
"saw people saying that sinners were becoming zombies.  'As above, so below' "
"someone said, or something like that…"
msgstr ""
"J'ai essayé de ne pas y penser, mais vous pourriez avoir raison. Plus je vois "
"de choses, moins je peux les expliquer. J'ai grandi avec beaucoup de gens qui "
"parlaient toujours de l'Enlèvement. L'enfer lui-même s'ouvrait et tout le "
"reste. C'était comme s'ils savaient que cela allait arriver. Avant que "
"l'internet ne cesse de fonctionner, j'ai vu des gens dire que les pécheurs "
"devenaient des zombies. Quelqu'un a dit « comme en haut, comme en bas », ou "
"quelque chose comme ça..."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"She said it was… energy in bones?  Listen, I've heard a lot of crazy bullshit "
"in my time and that's up there, for sure.  And I don't see how something like "
"that explains all the crazy shit I've seen either.  But collecting bones to… "
"save the world?  Fuck it, give it a shot.  Maybe that's something just YOU "
"do, though.  I'm happy believing a lie if that's the truth, I'll be honest."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I'm sorry, 'officer'.  I didn't write the book of cop jokes, you know."
msgstr ""
"Je suis désolé, « officière ». Je n'ai pas écrit le livre des blagues sur les "
"flics, vous savez."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Scared?  Yeah, that's fair.  I wouldn't say it's a friendly world out here.  "
"Still, it's best to be friends.  Anyone that prepared for the apocalypse is "
"probably armed to the teeth anyway."
msgstr ""
"Effrayée ? Oui, c'est vrai. Je ne dirais pas que c'est un monde amical ici. "
"Pourtant, il vaut mieux être amis. Quiconque s'est préparé à l'apocalypse est "
"probablement armé jusqu'aux dents de toute façon."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Oh, man.  I thought I was ready.  I had it all planned out.  Bug out bags.  "
"Loaded guns.  Maps of escape routes.  Bunker in the back yard."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Depends on your definition.  I'm alive, aren't I?  When Hell itself came down "
"from the skies and monsters started attacking the cities, I grabbed my stuff "
"and crammed into the bunker.  My surface cameras stayed online for days; I "
"could see everything happening up there.  I watched those things stride past. "
" I still have nightmares about the way their bodies moved, like they broke "
"the world just to be here.  I had nothing better to do.  I watched them rip "
"up the cops and the military, watched the dead rise back up and start "
"fighting the living.  I watched the nice old lady down the street rip the "
"head off my neighbor's dog.  I saw a soldier's body twitch and grow into some "
"kind of electrified hulk beast.  I watched it all happen."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Honestly?  I was planning to die.  After what I'd seen, I went a little "
"crazy.  I thought it was over for sure, I figured there was no point in "
"fighting it.  I thought I wouldn't last a minute out here, but I couldn't "
"bring myself to end it down there.  I headed out, planning to let the "
"<zombies> finish me off, but what can I say?  Survival instinct is a funny "
"thing, and I killed the ones outside the bunker.  I guess the adrenaline was "
"what I needed.  It's kept me going since then."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I was in jail for <the_cataclysm>, but I escaped.  Hell of a story."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"It's a bit of a… it's a thing.  It started out as a dare.  I wound up making "
"a bioweapon.  It didn't get used or anything, but, well, it got out of hand."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Tax evasion.  I was an accountant, and I helped my boss move a hell of a lot "
"of money in some very clever ways.  Not clever enough, it turns out…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "Multiple counts of possession.  I used to be really hung up on meth."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Okay, well, I was in the wrong place at the wrong time.  There was a big "
"fight, I didn't stay clear of it, and me and a bunch of others got tossed in "
"solitary while a few more landed in the infirmary.  Some looked pretty bad, "
"now I kinda wonder if any of them were our first <zombies>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I heard gunshots, even from down in lockup.  Didn't hear much screaming or "
"anything.  That was my first clue something was up.  Food stopped showing up, "
"next.  Then, the lights went out.  I was down there for maybe hours, maybe "
"days, when finally a flashlight in the bars blinded me.  It was a guard.  He "
"let me out, filled me in on what was going on.  I wanted to think he was "
"crazy, but something in his eyes… I believed him."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"The guard took off on his own.  Didn't trust us, and I don't blame him.  The "
"other two wanted to set up a bandit gig.  Didn't sit right with me, so I "
"split on pretty good terms.  I ran into the guard a couple more times.  "
"Thought of seeing if he'd travel with me, but I dunno.  I don't think he'd "
"take the offer, I'll always be a con to him.  If you want to try, I can tell "
"you where I saw him last.  Wasn't long before I met you, and he had a good "
"thing going, might still be there."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/professor_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm actually a chemistry professor at Harvard.  I'd been on sabbatical for "
"the last six months.  I can't imagine the university was a good place to be, "
"given what I've heard about Boston… I'm not sure anyone made it out.  I was "
"out at my cabin near Chatham, ostensibly working on the finishing touches for "
"a paper, but mostly just sipping whisky and thanking my lucky stars for "
"tenure.  Those were good days.  Then came <the_cataclysm>, the military "
"convoys, the <zombies>.  My cabin was crushed by a fearsome beast, just "
"collateral damage after it got blasted off Orleans by a tank.  I was already "
"busy running frantically by then."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/religious_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Same as anyone.  I turned away from God, and now I'm paying the price.  The "
"Rapture has come, and I was left behind.  So now, I guess I wander through "
"Hell on Earth.  I wish I'd paid more attention in Sunday School."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/religious_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well, I guess that was the Rapture.  It didn't play out how I thought it "
"would.  They made me think it was gonna be a flash of light and then *poof*, "
"everyone's gone.  Instead it was messy and dirty.  Riots in the streets, the "
"military and police serving the Antichrist to gun down the people like - what "
"was it my dad used to say - like wheat before the chaff?  Then when we'd "
"really showed our Sin, God came in with the real plagues.  The dead started "
"walking, getting up with machine gun holes in them to fight the military, and "
"the military started turning on each other too.  After that, the legions of "
"Hell itself came out.  Huge monsters, worse than anything I'd ever imagined, "
"just tore through the cities ripping everything to shreds.  Then they started "
"dying off as quick as they'd arrived, and we were left trying to run and hide "
"from the undead.  A day or two later the power started going out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well, it built up a bit.  There was that acid rain, it burnt up one of my "
"tractors.  Not that I'd been working the fields since… well, it'd been a "
"terrible year and I hadn't done much worth doing.  There were explosions and "
"things, and choppers overhead.  I was scared, kept the curtains drawn, kept "
"changing the channels.  Then, one day, there were no channels to change to.  "
"Just the emergency broadcast, over and over."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"That was the first thing to really shake me out of it.  I didn't really have "
"any very close friends, but there were people back in town I cared about a "
"bit.  I had sent some texts, but I hadn't really twigged that they hadn't "
"replied for days.  I got in my truck and tried to get back to town.  Didn't "
"get far before I hit a <zombie> infested pileup blocking the highway, and "
"that's when I started to put it all together.  Never did get to town.  "
"Unfortunately I led the <zombies> back to my farm, and had to bug out of "
"there.  And now I'm here with you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"That was the first thing to really shake me out of it.  I didn't really have "
"any very close friends, but there were people back in town I cared about a "
"bit.  I had sent some texts, but I hadn't really twigged that they hadn't "
"replied for days.  I got in my truck and tried to get back to town.  Didn't "
"get far before I hit a <zombie> infested pileup blocking the highway, and "
"that's when I started to put it all together.  Never did get to town.  "
"Unfortunately I led the <zombies> back to my farm, and had to bug out of "
"there.  Might go back and clear it out, someday."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well, I lived on the edge of a small town.  Corner store and a gas station "
"and not much else.  We heard about the shit goin' down in the city, but we "
"didn't see much of it until the military came blazing through and tried to "
"set up a camp there.  They wanted to bottle us all up in town, and I wasn't "
"having with that, so my dog Buck and I, we headed out while they were all "
"sniffin' their own farts."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Buck and I slipped out and went East, headin' for my friend's ranch.  Cute "
"little dope thought we were just goin' for a real long walk.  I couldn't take "
"the truck without the army boys catchin' wind of it.  We made it out to the "
"forest, camped out in a lean to.  Packed up and kept heading out.  At first "
"we walked along the highway a little, but saw too many army trucks and buses "
"full of evacuees, and that's when we found out about the <zombies>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"We got to my buddy's ranch, but the <freaking> g-men had been there first.  "
"It was all boarded up and there was a police barricade out front.  One of "
"those <freaking> turrets… shot Buck.  Almost got me too.  I managed to get my "
"pup… get him outta there, that… it wasn't easy, had to use a police car door "
"as a shield, had to kill a cop-zombie first.  And then, well, while I was "
"still cryin', Buck came back.  I had to…  <swear!>  I… I can't say it.  You "
"know."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Like I said, you want me to tell you a story, you gotta pony up the whisky.  "
"A full bottle, mind you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Mostly I just wanted to get some scotch out of you.  There really ain't much "
"of a story.  I was in the marines, years ago.  After that, did security "
"contract work.  I was out guarding some dump of a warehouse when the "
"apocalypse rolled through town.  I was out on the edge of town, armed, and "
"know when to not pick a fight, so I didn't get killed.  Wound up recruited by "
"the Free Merchants early on, and then the Old Guard for a bit, but I was "
"getting itchy feet when you came by with an offer.  Here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Huh.  Hadn't thought about it in ages, but now that you mention it, that was "
"a weird job.  It was just a boarded up warehouse in the middle of nowhere, "
"and I was not a cheap contractor in those days.  Coulda got any fat "
"rent-a-cop to watch it.  I had only just started working there when the shit "
"hit the fan, and I kinda forgot about that to be honest."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Good work, and some fun stuff, but risky.  Without a few hands at my side "
"that I trust, I wouldn't take more of their work.  If I had a solid team, "
"though, I'd happily work for Uncle Sam again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scientist_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm> I worked in a lab.  Don't look at me like that, it had "
"nothing to do with this stuff… I was studying protein-protein interactions in "
"smooth muscle in mice, using NMR.  Nothing even vaguely related to zombies.  "
"Anyway, I was at last year's Experimental Biology conference in San "
"Francisco, and an old friend of mine was talking about some really weird shit "
"she'd heard of coming out of government labs.  Really hush hush stuff.  "
"Normally I wouldn't put much cred into that sort of thing, but from her, it "
"actually had me worried.  I packed a bug-out bag just in case."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scientist_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"The evacuation order sounded, so I evacuated, comparatively quickly.  That "
"got me out before the worst part.  Our evacuation center was useless… me, a "
"couple other evacuees, a few tins of food, and a few emergency blankets.  Not "
"even close to enough to go around.  The evacuees split down the middle into a "
"few camps, and infighting started.  I ran into the woods nearby with a few "
"others.  We got away, had a little camp going.  They tried to make me their "
"leader, thought I knew more about things than I did because I'd come so "
"prepared.  Like I said, I'm not that kind of scientist, but they didn't seem "
"to understand.  I… I did my best."
msgstr ""
"L'ordre d'evacuation a sonné, j'ai donc évacué assez vite, ce qui m'a épargné "
"le pire de ce qui s'est passé dans les villes de ce que j'ai entendu. Notre "
"centre d'évacuation était… pire que rien. Juste moi, un tas d'autres "
"réfugiés, plusieurs couvertures de survie et quelques boites de conserves. "
"Bref, bien trop peu pour tout le monde. Les réfugiés se sont divisés en "
"plusieurs bandes qui ont rapidement commencées une lutte pour les ressources "
"limitées  du centre. J'ai décidé de fuir cette folie avec quelques autres et "
"pendant un moment, nous avions un petit camp assez confortable dans les bois. "
"Les autres ont essayé de faire de moi leur leader, probablement dû au fait "
"qu'il pensaient que j'avais une idée de ce qui se passait vu que j'était "
"arrivé au centre de réfugiés aussi bien préparé. Comme je l'ai déjà dit, je "
"n'était pas le genre de scientifique qui aurait su quelque chose, mais peu "
"importe ce que je leur disais, ils insistaient que je sois celui donnant les "
"ordres. J'ai… J'ai fait de mon mieux."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scientist_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I thought that us leaving, letting the others have the evac center to "
"themselves, would be enough, but it wasn't.  They tracked us down in the "
"night, a few days later.  They… well… I made it out, along with one other "
"survivor.  The attackers, they were like animals.  We tried to travel "
"together for a while.  I blamed myself, for what had happened, and couldn't "
"really get past it.  We parted ways on good terms not long before I met you.  "
"I just couldn't face the reminder of what had happened."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scientist_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I've got a memory blank for about three days before and after <the_cataclysm> "
"actually.  I worked at a lab - nothing to do with any of this; physics stuff. "
" I think I was working there when things happened.  My first clear memory is "
"running through the underbrush a few miles from town.  I was bandaged up, I "
"had a messenger bag loaded with gear, and I'd taken a hard hit to the side of "
"my head.  I have no idea what happened to me, but clearly I had already been "
"on the run for a bit."
msgstr ""
"J'ai un trou de mémoire d'environ trois jours avant et après, en fait. Je "
"travaillais dans un laboratoire - rien à voir avec tout cela ; des trucs de "
"physique. Je pense que j'y travaillais quand les choses se sont passées. Mon "
"premier souvenir clair est celui d'une course dans les sous-bois à quelques "
"kilomètres de la ville. J'avais des bandages, un sac de messager chargé de "
"matériel et j'avais reçu un coup violent sur le côté de la tête. Je n'ai "
"aucune idée de ce qui m'est arrivé, mais il est clair que j'étais en fuite "
"depuis un certain temps déjà."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/soldier_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Listen, I don't want to get too into it.  I was in the reserves, OK?  I "
"didn't sign on for some glory loaded shit about protecting my nation, I "
"wanted to get some exercise, make some friends, and it looks good on my "
"resume.  I never thought I'd get called to active duty to fight <freaking> "
"zombies.  Maybe I'm a deserter, or a chickenshit, but I can tell you one "
"other thing I am that the other grunts ain't: alive.  You can figure the rest "
"out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/soldier_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was in the army.  Just a new recruit.  I wasn't even done basic training, "
"they actually called me out of boot camp to serve once the shit hit the fan.  "
"I barely knew which end of the gun the bullets came out of, and they jammed "
"me into a truck and drove me to Newport to 'assist in the evacuation "
"efforts'.  Our orders barely made sense, our officers were as confused as we "
"were."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/soldier_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"We never even made it to Newport.  The truck got stomped by something "
"gigantic.  I didn't even see it, just saw this huge black-and-green spiny leg "
"jam through the ceiling, through the el-tee.  Heard the tires grinding, felt "
"the truck lift up.  We were kicked off the leg like dog shit off a sneaker.  "
"I don't know how I survived.  The thing rolled over, killed most of us right "
"there.  I musta blacked out for a bit.  Came to, and while I was getting "
"myself out, the others started getting back up.  Long story short, I lived, "
"they didn't, and I ran."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/wedding_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Yeah, in hindsight it maybe wasn't the best choice of dates, huh?  I admit I "
"had cold feet though.  Anyway we were getting hitched at the church.  Lucky "
"for me I was late to the ceremony… I guess some of the fresher corpses in the "
"graveyard had gotten up and started harassing the party."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/wedding_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"After I saw what was going on, I turned around and headed out in the opposite "
"direction.  I've seen zombie movies before.  I picked up some stuff from home "
"and I managed to get out of town before things went really bad.  At the time "
"I thought I was being a coward, but now I know if I'd stayed to help, I'd "
"just be another dripping corpse."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/wedding_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'll be honest with you, I was paying more attention to wedding planning than "
"current events leading up to things.  I knew there were riots going on, but "
"they were out of town.  Even when they got closer to home, I tried to ignore "
"them so we could have our big day.  After the zombies started coming, though, "
"well that's when stuff got really weird.  When I was running from the wedding "
"I swear I saw the sky rip open and monsters fly out of the hole, like "
"something out of Independence Day.  I don't know what it all was, it looked "
"like black magic or something."
msgstr ""
"Je vais être honnête avec vous, je faisais plus attention aux préparations du "
"marriage qu'aux autres choses qui ce passaient. Je savais qu'il y avait des "
"émeutes, mais celles-ci étaient tellement loin. Même quand elles ce sont "
"rapprochées, j'ai essayé de les ignorer pour notre grand jour. Tous est "
"devenu vraiment bizarre quand les zombies ont commencé à se montrer. Quand "
"j'était en train de m'enfuir de la fête de mariage j'aurais juré avoir vu le "
"ciel s'éventrer et des monstres sortir du trou, presque tiré d'Independence "
"Day. Je ne sais pas ce qui a causé tout cela, on aurait dit de la magie noire "
"ou quelque chose comme ça."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/OtherSurvivorStories/NC_Farmer_background.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Actually, I ran into another survivor once - survivalist, total nutcase.  He "
"was headed for a military bunker to try and loot it, guessing that didn't go "
"well.  Anyway, he mentioned a pack of survivors who camped out at a farm "
"around here, some of them actually knew about farming.  There's a chance "
"they're still out there, could be worth looking for."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/OtherSurvivorStories/NC_SURVIVOR_CHEF_background.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I found a cell phone a while ago and it started ringing.  I picked it up and "
"just listened.  It was this cook, and they just kept talking on and on about "
"some restaurant and all the good food there and asking to be rescued.  Maybe "
"they were just dialing random numbers?  I don't know.  But they might still "
"be out there, and I wouldn't mind a good meal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/OtherSurvivorStories/No_Others_01.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "Sorry, but until I met you, I thought I might be the only one left."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Boss, here's the thing… just don't be mad, please.  I lied that I'm good at "
"this… I thought I could figure it out, but it's far beyond my comprehension.  "
"I'm sorry."
msgstr ""
"Patron, voilà le truc… ne soyez pas fâché, s'il vous plaît.  J'ai menti en "
"disant que je maitrise ça… je pensais que je pouvais gérer, mais c'est bien "
"au-delà de ma compréhension.  Je suis désolé·e."

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Boss, here's the thing… just don't be mad, please.  I lied that I know "
"something about this… I thought I could figure it out, but it's far beyond my "
"comprehension.  I'm sorry."
msgstr ""
"Patron, voilà le truc… ne soyez pas fâché, s'il vous plaît. J'ai menti en "
"disant que je savais quelque chose à ce sujet… je pensais que je pouvais le "
"comprendre, mais c'est bien au-delà de ma compréhension.  Je suis désolé·e."

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"During one of my night searches of food and supplies, I noticed a bright glow "
"that came from somewhere far away.  I thought that one of the survivors had "
"lit it to indicate their location.  As you can see, I was right.  I managed "
"to find a boat near the nearest shore, on which I set sail."
msgstr ""
"Au cours d'une de mes recherches nocturnes de nourriture et de provisions, "
"j'ai remarqué une lueur brillante qui provenait de quelque part au loin. J'ai "
"pensé que l'un des survivants l'avait allumée pour indiquer sa position. "
"Comme vous le voyez, j'avais raison. J'ai réussi à trouver un bateau près du "
"rivage le plus proche et j'ai pris la mer."

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I have been sailing on my little boat from coast to coast for a long time.  "
"In truth, the boat was not entirely mine, but it doesn't matter.  That way of "
"life provided me with sufficient safety from the <zombies>, and I managed to "
"get around the sea creatures deftly.  When I saw a distant light, at first, I "
"could not believe my eyes.  Then, I decided to find out what it is."
msgstr ""
"Cela fait longtemps que je navigue sur mon petit bateau d'une côte à l'autre. "
"En réalité, le bateau n'était pas tout à fait le mien, mais cela n'a pas "
"d'importance. Ce mode de vie me mettait suffisamment à l'abri de la mer et je "
"parvenais à contourner habilement les créatures marines. Lorsque j'ai aperçu "
"une lumière au loin, je n'en ai d'abord pas cru mes yeux. Puis, j'ai décidé "
"de découvrir ce que c'était."

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"  Unfortunately, during my 'voyage' to this lighthouse, luck turned away from "
"me.  I was attacked by some dreadful creature from the underwater depths.  I "
"couldn't fight off him and he dragged my ship to the bottom.  The waves "
"brought me straight to the shore of this little island.  I still don't "
"understand by what miracle I managed to survive, <name_g>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"  Unfortunately, when I arrived here, I forgot to tie my boat, and during "
"yesterday's storm it was carried off somewhere.  Well, you don't always have "
"to be lucky, right?"
msgstr ""
" Malheureusement, en arrivant ici, j'ai oublié d'attacher mon bateau et, "
"pendant la tempête d'hier, il a été emporté quelque part. On n'a pas toujours "
"la chance, n'est-ce pas ?"

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"  I sailed here a few days ago.  Mikhail and his family are very hospitable.  "
"Unfortunately, during our joint fishing, we were attacked by a swarm of "
"underwater abominations, and my boat was smashed to pieces.  It was so scary, "
"we could barely sail away on Mikhail's ship."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"No, no… well, maybe a little.  It was just as wrecked down here as it is up "
"top when I found it, wasn't too hard to fix up.  You're welcome to stay in "
"the spare room awhile, just don't hog it.  You're not the only scav out there."
msgstr ""
"Non, non... enfin, peut-être un peu. Elle était aussi abîmée en bas qu'en "
"haut quand je l'ai trouvée, ce n'était pas trop dur à réparer. Vous pouvez "
"rester dans la chambre d'amis un moment, mais ne la monopolisez pas. Vous "
"n'êtes pas le seul par ici."

#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Just a scav who got lucky.  Now I'm content to sit around here on my pile of "
"treasure.  I'm more than willing to trade if you've got the cash."
msgstr ""
"Just un(e) pillard(e) qui a eu de la chance.  Maintenant je suis satisfait(e) "
"de rester là sur ma pile de trucs.  Je serais comme même disposé(e) à troquer "
"avec vous si l'on peut trouver un bon marché."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"It's nice to see a new face around here.  I'm <npc_name>, it's a pleasure "
"meeting you."
msgstr ""
"C'est chouette devoir un nouveau visage ici. Je suis <npc_name>, c'est un "
"plaisir de vous rencontrer."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Like I said before, I'm a chemist.  I've been living out here for a while, "
"decided to set up shop in this old cabin.  I even found some good equipment "
"out here, and a couple useful things here in the cupboards.  I decided to "
"stay right here."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I used to be a chemist.  Well, I am a chemist.  I've been living out here in "
"the wilderness for a little while now since <the_cataclysm>.  Lucky enough, I "
"even found some good equipment out here, though unfortunately missing some of "
"the more sensitive and expensive stuff.  I found a couple useful things here "
"in the cupboards, but other than that, entirely empty.  So, I moved in."
msgstr ""
"J'étais chimiste. Enfin, je suis chimiste. Je vis ici, dans la nature, depuis "
"<the_cataclysm>. Par chance, j'ai même trouvé du bon matériel ici, mais il "
"manque malheureusement les produits les plus sensibles et les plus chers. "
"J'ai trouvé quelques objets utiles dans les placards, mais à part ça, tout "
"est vide. J'ai donc emménagé."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Not my place, just somewhere I ended up.  Some old shack, maybe a hunting "
"cabin or something more… criminal, at least judging by some of what I found "
"on the shelves.  You certainly wouldn't attract much attention synthesizing "
"illegal substances all the way out here, that's all I'm saying.  I found it "
"while I was trying to escape all the <zombies> in the city, and I decided to "
"stay."
msgstr ""
"Ce n'est pas chez moi, c'est juste un endroit où j'ai atterri. Une vieille "
"cabane, peut-être une cabane de chasseur ou quelque chose de plus... "
"criminel, du moins à en juger par ce que j'ai trouvé sur les étagères. Vous "
"n'attireriez certainement pas beaucoup l'attention en synthétisant des "
"substances illégales jusqu'ici, c'est tout ce que je dis. Je l'ai trouvé "
"alors que j'essayais d'échapper à tout les <zombies> de la ville, et j'ai "
"décidé de rester."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/NPC_campus_guard_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm not even supposed to be here today, I just lost a bet and had to take "
"this shift."
msgstr ""
"Je n'était même pas censé(e) être de garde aujourd'hui, j'ai juste perdu un "
"pari et me suis retrouvé(e) collé(e) avec ce tour."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/NPC_campus_guard_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I should be resting right now, this is my third straight shift.  Too many "
"people sick or hurt right now."
msgstr ""
"Je devrais être en train de me reposer, ceci est ma troisième garde d'affilé. "
"Nous avons trop de personnes blessées ou malades en ce moment."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "Now get out of here, before I kill you."
msgstr "Maintenant sortez d'ici, avant que je vous tue."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I'm too tired, let me rest first."
msgstr "Je suis trop fatigué, laisse-moi me reposer d'abord."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "Really, I haven't heard anything about it.  What's it you need?"
msgstr "Vraiment? Je n'ai rien entendu de ce genre. Que voulez-vous?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I told you already, I'm not finished with them, come back later."
msgstr "Je vous ai déjà dit. Je n'ai pas encore fini avec eux, revenez plus tard."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm a businessman, and business is my game.  I came out here to help these "
"poor, poor people who are doing without in such a bad time."
msgstr ""
"Je suis un homme d'affaires, et les affaires sont mon métier. Je suis venu "
"ici pour aider les misérables isolés durant une période si éprouvante."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm just a man looking to help some poor folks out, caught word of this place "
"from one of those old FEMA bunkers, a group's holed up there.  I figured I'd "
"come out here and help these people out."
msgstr ""
"Je suis juste quelqu'un essayant d'aider ces pauvres gens, j'ai trouvé cet "
"endroit à partir de l'un de ces vieux bunkers FEMA ou un autre groupe est "
"situé. Je me suis dit que ce serait une bonne idée de venir et offrir toute "
"aide possible."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Like I said, I'm a businessman and business is my job.  Those other yahoos "
"you've been talkin' to don't know what they're doing."
msgstr ""
"Comme je l'ai dit, je suis un homme d'affaires et les affaires sont mon "
"métier. Les autres yahoos à qui vous avez parlé ne savent pas ce qu'ils font."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"They say I turned a man into a cedar tree once.  That's a terrible thing to "
"say."
msgstr ""
"Les gens disent que j'ai transformé un homme en cèdre une fois. C'est une "
"pure calomnie."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"You like maple syrup?  That was me.  Not the syrup, that was the trees, but I "
"figured out how to make it much harder to concentrate it, used to be way too "
"easy.  Pretty nice right?"
msgstr ""
"Vous aimez le sirop d'érable? C'était moi. Pas le sirop, les arbres le "
"produisait déjà, mais j'ai trouvé un moyen de faire en sorte qu'il soit "
"beaucoup plus difficile à concentrer, c'était bien trop facile avant. Pas mal "
"non?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Did I tell you the one about the beavers?  Used to be way too big.  Like "
"giant beavers, it was a mess.  I fixed that.  Of course there seem to be a "
"bunch of new giant things out here now.  I'll have to think about that."
msgstr ""
"Je vous ai déjà parlé des castors? Ils étaient beaucoup trop grands dans le "
"temps, mais j'ai résolu le problème. Bien sûr en ce moment on dirait qu'il y "
"a beaucoup d'animaux qui sont devenus énormes, peut être que je devrais "
"essayer de trouver une solution."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm used to it.  No, Glooscap has been a name here for a very long time.  Is "
"your name foreign?"
msgstr ""
"J'ai l'habitude. Non, Glooscap est un nom utilisé ici depuis très longtemps. "
"Votre nom est-il étranger ?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"And stuff sure.  How can I help you stranger?  They say I'm the nice one.  "
"See this smile?  Nice smile right?"
msgstr ""
"Et des trucs bien sûr. Comment puis-je vous aider, étranger ? On dit que je "
"suis le gentil. Tu vois ce sourire ? Un beau sourire, non ?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I do have a twin.  Malsumis is probably around here somewhere, very tricky.  "
"You know I turned Malsumis to stone once?  I'm supposed to be the nice one, "
"but you know how much it hurts turning yourself back from stone?  It takes "
"days."
msgstr ""
"J'ai un jumeau. Malsumis est probablement quelque part par ici, très rusé. Tu "
"sais que j'ai transformé Malsumis en pierre une fois ? Je suis censée être la "
"gentille, mais tu sais à quel point ça fait mal de se transformer en pierre ? "
"Ça prend des jours."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"If I were Malsumis you would be in terrible danger my friend.  But Glooscap "
"would stop me."
msgstr ""
"Si j'étais Malsumis, tu serais en grand danger, mon ami. Mais Glooscap m'en "
"empêcherait."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I worked on a ranch not too fah from here 'fore it all went down.  I'd love "
"ta get back ta what I did - taking care of horses, cows, all sorts of "
"animals, makin' sure the fields stay safe an' all that.  But now?  I dunno, "
"man.  Just tryin' ta survive, I suppose.  Hopefully, tha world will get back "
"togetha' one day and I can put mah skills ta use doin' what I like."
msgstr ""
"Je travaillais dans un ranch pas très loin d'ici avant que tout ne s'écroule. "
"J'aimerais bien revenir à ce que je faisais - m'occuper des chevaux, des "
"vaches, de toutes sortes d'animaux, veiller à ce que les champs restent en "
"sécurité et tout ça. Mais maintenant ? Je ne sais pas, mec. J'essaie juste de "
"survivre, je suppose. J'espère que le monde se remettra en place un jour et "
"que je pourrai utiliser mes compétences pour faire ce que j'aime."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was just sort of wanderin' around, hoping ta maybe find some bettah gear.  "
"Decided ta rest up, 'eard someone walkin', and, well, here we are."
msgstr ""
"Je me promenais un peu, espérant trouver un meilleur équipement. J'ai décidé "
"de me reposer, j'ai entendu quelqu'un marcher et nous voilà."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I already told you.  Don't want to go through it again."
msgstr "Je te l'ai déjà dit. Je ne veux pas recommencer."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Lived in a nearby town.  Normal life.  9 to 5 job.  When it all happened, we "
"ran away to find some safety.  But there's no safety anymore, is there?"
msgstr ""
"Vivait dans une ville voisine. Vie normale. Un travail de 9 à 5. Quand tout "
"cela est arrivé, nous nous sommes enfuis pour nous mettre à l'abri. Mais il "
"n'y a plus de sécurité, n'est-ce pas ?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I didn't leave the town alone.  I arrived here alone."
msgstr "Je n'ai pas quitté la ville seule. Je suis arrivé seul."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I told you to just leave me alone."
msgstr "Je vous ai dit de juste me laisser tranquille."

#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I don't know if you know, but there are sewers underneath the prison.  I was "
"planning an escape long before <the_cataclysm>, and while I was working on "
"cleaning the sewers, I noticed a damaged wall section.  There was a flow of "
"fresh air coming out of it, so I think it's leading to the surface.  It could "
"be your way to freedom.  Feel free to use it."
msgstr ""
"Je ne sais pas si vous êtes au courant, mais il y a des égouts en dessous de "
"la prison. Je planifiais de m'échapper bien avant <the_cataclysm>, et lorsque "
"j'étais de corvée pour les nettoyer, j'ai repéré une section de mur "
"endommagée. Je pouvais sentir un courant d'air frais passer à travers, il est "
"donc probable que quoi qu'il y ai de l'autre côté, il soit possible de passer "
"par là pour sortir de la prison. N'hésitez pas à vous en servir."

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ", then frowns.  \"I think I'd remember something like that, no.  Sorry.\""
msgstr ""
"puis fronce les sourcils. « Je pense que je me souviendrais de quelque chose "
"comme ça, non. Désolé. »"

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
", looking thoughtful.  \"You know, around the time things really went bad, I "
"remember a really awful portal storm.  A while later, I saw something like "
"that in the distance.  Could be what you're talking about.\""
msgstr ""
", l'air pensif. « Vous savez, à l'époque où les choses ont vraiment mal "
"tourné, je me souviens d'une terrible tempête de portails. Un peu plus tard, "
"j'ai vu quelque chose comme ça au loin. Ça pourrait être ce dont tu parles. »"

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'll be honest, I don't remember a whole lot about what I was doing here.  I "
"know that I cut trees, but not much else.  Good thing I have friends here, "
"they've helped me out a lot."
msgstr ""
"Pour être honnête, je ne me souviens pas très bien de ce que je faisais ici. "
"Je sais que j'ai coupé des arbres, mais pas grand-chose d'autre. Heureusement "
"que j'ai des amis ici, qui m'ont beaucoup aidé."

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Not much to it.  I worked here as a logger before <the_cataclysm> began.  "
"When all went to hell, I was on the job and had to hole up here with my "
"coworkers.  Good news is we all came out fine, and the boss decided to keep "
"the mill running.  I don't know how much longer we can last, though; not "
"unless we make some contact with other people.  Customers, I guess you might "
"call 'em."
msgstr ""
"Il n'y a pas grand-chose à en dire. J'ai travaillé ici comme bûcheron avant "
"que <the_cataclysm> ne commence. Quand tout est parti en vrille, j'étais au "
"travail et j'ai dû me terrer ici avec mes collègues. La bonne nouvelle, c'est "
"que nous nous en sommes tous sortis et que le patron a décidé de maintenir "
"l'usine en activité. Mais je ne sais pas combien de temps nous pourrons "
"tenir, à moins que nous n'entrions en contact avec d'autres personnes. Des "
"clients, je suppose qu'on peut les appeler ainsi."

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"New to the job… or, well, whatever's happening now.  I still cut trees and "
"run logs through the saw from time to time, so I guess you'd call me a "
"logger.  Things have only gotten weirder after those fucking <zombies> nearly "
"killed us.  I'm not sure how much longer we'll last…"
msgstr ""
"Nouveau dans le métier... ou, en tout cas, dans ce qui se passe en ce moment. "
"Je continue à couper des arbres et à passer des troncs à la scie de temps en "
"temps, alors je suppose qu'on peut m'appeler un bûcheron. Les choses sont "
"devenues encore plus bizarres après que ces putains de <zombies> ont failli "
"nous tuer. Je ne sais pas combien de temps nous allons encore tenir..."

#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Ah, home sweet home.  It feels like I haven't been here for ages.  Fuck, it "
"looks so horrible now.  I guess it's because of <the_cataclysm>.  Thank you "
"for bringing me here, <name_g>.  Let's eat the cake."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm just a regular pizzaiolo.  My father was a pizzaiolo, my grandfather was "
"a pizzaiolo and I also became a pizzaiolo.  I was making pizza my whole life, "
"until some American <name_b>s ruined my business!  I couldn't do anything "
"about this, but now, with <the_cataclysm> and <zombies> around, I have a "
"chance to get my revenge!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I worked here before <the_cataclysm> dumped everything in the <freaking> bin. "
" I took care of all the animals here, and when the <zombies> started roaming "
"the streets, I gathered every pet or stray I could.  I still take care of "
"them, just gotta worry about the <zombies> now on top of disease, "
"cleanliness, etc."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm just an average person, really.  When a horde of those <freaking> "
"<zombies> came knockin' on my door, I ran for it.  Good for me that someone "
"left this store open in the chaos, I ran inside and locked the place down.  "
"There isn't a thing in all of <city> that can bust through these walls and "
"barred windows, I'd reckon I'm the luckiest <name_b> in town."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I used to live here before <the_cataclysm>.  I was asleep when a horde of "
"<zombies> busted through the front, and in the chaos I wound up here.  When "
"the screaming stopped, I peaked out the door to find my neighbor stumbling "
"about with his face half-eaten, and I haven't left since."
msgstr ""
"Je vivais ici avant <the_cataclysm>. Je dormais quand une horde de <zombies> "
"a débarqué par l'entrée, et dans le chaos, je me suis retrouvé ici. Quand les "
"cris ont cessé, j'ai jeté un coup d'œil par la porte pour trouver mon voisin "
"qui titubait, le visage à moitié dévoré, et je ne suis pas reparti depuis."

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_CAMPER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was out here camping when <the_cataclysm> disturbed me.  I didn't know "
"anything was wrong until two <zombies> stumbled up here, and tried to kill "
"me.  I figured staying here would be my best bet, away from the cities."
msgstr ""
"Je campais ici quand <the_cataclysm> m'a dérangé. Je ne me suis rendu compte "
"de rien jusqu'à ce que deux <zombies> arrivent par hasard ici et essaient de "
"me tuer. Je me suis dit qu'il valait mieux rester ici, loin des villes."

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "Haven't seen someone new in a while.  What brings you around here?"
msgstr ""
"Cela fait longtemps que je n'ai pas vu quelqu'un de nouveau. Qu'est-ce qui "
"vous amène par ici ?"

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I run this distillery you're standing in, before <the_cataclysm> it wasn't so "
"legal with the law.  I was in <city> making a deal on my product when a horde "
"of rioters busted in, so I ran for it.  I thought my business would be a nice "
"place to stay, so I came out here."
msgstr ""
"Je dirige la distillerie dans laquelle vous vous trouvez. Avant "
"<the_cataclysm>, elle n'était pas très légale. J'étais dans la <city> en "
"train de faire une affaire pour mon produit quand une horde d'émeutiers a "
"fait irruption, alors j'ai pris mes jambes à mon cou. J'ai pensé que mon "
"entreprise serait un bon endroit pour rester, alors je suis venu ici."

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"They all said I was crazy for preparing for <the_cataclysm>.  Now, they're "
"all dead, and I'm still kickin'.  When the riots turned to hordes, I was "
"ready; all I had to do was dodge a few <zombies> to get back to my bastion.  "
"I've been living safely here ever since."
msgstr ""
"Ils ont tous dit que j'étais fou de me préparer à <the_cataclysm>. "
"Aujourd'hui, ils sont tous morts, et je suis toujours en pleine forme. "
"Lorsque les émeutes se sont transformées en hordes, j'étais prêt ; tout ce "
"que j'ai eu à faire, c'est d'éviter quelques <zombies> pour retourner dans "
"mon bastion. Depuis, je vis en sécurité ici."

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I found this emergency shelter when I was running from the chaos back in the "
"cities.  Fortunately, the place hadn't been looted yet and there weren't any "
"<zombies> lurking around; just the spot to stay 'till who knows when."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/camp_start.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "Hey, I did some surveying and I believe this is a good spot to set up at."
msgstr ""
"Hey, j'ai fait quelques recherches et je pense que c'est un bon endroit pour "
"s'installer."

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Air temperature, precipitation, but what about… oh, I'm sorry, I didn't "
"notice you.  Hello."
msgstr ""
"Température de l'air, précipitations, mais qu'en est-il de… oh, je suis "
"désolé, je ne vous ai pas remarqué·e.  Bonjour."

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I have not seen living people for a long time.  Glad to see another survivor. "
" Greetings, <name_g>."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai pas vu de personnes vivantes depuis longtemps. Heureux de voir un "
"autre survivant. Salutations, <name_g>."

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Help?  Help with what?  Oh, yes, yes.  If you know a place with many "
"survivors, can you take me there?  I doubt I can survive alone…"
msgstr ""
"De l'aide?  De l'aide avec quoi?  Oh, oui, oui.  Si vous connaissez un "
"endroit où il y a beaucoup de survivants, pouvez-vous m'y emmener?  Je doute "
"de pouvoir survivre seul…"

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I'm glad you still alive."
msgstr "Je suis heureux que vous soyez toujours en vie."

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm just a regular meteorologist.  In recent years I have worked at a weather "
"station, monitored the weather, state of air, read and wrote reports, drew up "
"schedules… in general, complete boredom.  In my free time I was studying "
"electronics and radio engineering, making various devices, some for work, "
"some just for fun.  When the first riots began, I gathered all my things that "
"I managed to take with me and settled here.  Since then I've been sitting "
"here, wasting my time doing all sorts of nonsense."
msgstr ""
"Je suis juste un météorologiste lambda. Depuis quelques années j'ai travaillé "
"dans cette station météorologique et passer ma vie a faire des choses "
"barbantes comme mesurer la pression atmosphérique, les precipitations, écrire "
"des rapports météo... Bref, rien de vraiment intéressant. Dans mon temps "
"libre par contre j'étudiais les appareils électroniques et les systèmes "
"radio, et construisais des appareils varies,  certains étaient utiles pour "
"mon boulot, certain étaient juste un projet amusant. Quant les premieres "
"emeutes ont commence a être montrées sur la television, j'ai decide de faire "
"mes valises et d'emménager de façon permanente dans la station météo. Depuis "
"ca, je n'ai fait qu'attendre ici et j'ai occupe les journées avec mon loisir "
"habituel."

#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was homeless before everything went down, just camping out here for a "
"while.  Stuck up <name_b>s shunned me for my condition, but they're all dead "
"now.  I guess I'm better off than they are."
msgstr ""
"J'étais sans-abri avant que tout ne s'écroule, je campais ici depuis un "
"moment. Les <name_b> superficielles m'évitaient à cause de mon état, mais "
"elles sont toutes mortes maintenant. Je suppose que je suis mieux loti qu'eux."

#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"It's hard to say exactly what I'm doing out here, but I guess one thing just "
"leads to another and… well, you're just being nice when you ask, aren't you?  "
"It doesn't matter now anyway.  I'm here and I'm still alive."
msgstr ""
"Il est difficile de dire exactement ce que je fais ici, mais je suppose "
"qu'une chose en entraîne une autre et... eh bien, vous êtes juste gentil "
"quand vous demandez, n'est-ce pas ? De toute façon, ça n'a plus d'importance. "
"Je suis ici et je suis toujours en vie."

#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was homeless for a while before <the_cataclysm>.  I met some buddies out on "
"the road and we were camping out here.  Now we're just scraping by on what we "
"can find, mostly.  We're willing to trade, though.  Who knows, you might find "
"yourself a good deal."
msgstr ""
"J'ai été sans abri pendant un certain temps avant <the_cataclysm>. J'ai "
"rencontré des copains sur la route et nous avons campé ici. Maintenant, on se "
"débrouille avec ce qu'on trouve, la plupart du temps. Mais nous sommes prêts "
"à faire des échanges. Qui sait, vous pourriez faire une bonne affaire."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I didn't think anyone was around here.  Pleased to meet you, I'm <npc_name>."
msgstr ""
"Je ne pensais pas qu'il y avait quelqu'un dans les environs.  Enchanté de "
"faire votre connaissance, je m'appelle <npc_name>."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
", then frowns.  \"I don't believe I've heard about anything like that, no.  "
"Sorry.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm going north, up towards the border and the big wide wilderness.  I heard "
"that there's some sort of safe spot up there, where people didn't go crazy "
"and try to kill each other.  I don't know whether or not that's true, but at "
"the very least, the colder climate might help keep the <zombies> down."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm going east, towards the coastline.  I heard some rumors that Rhode Island "
"was still holding itself together, so I'm going to go and check that out.  "
"Heck, I might just go out to sea myself, live on an old oil rig or something "
"like that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I haven't found anything out of the ordinary, just a bunch of <zombies> and "
"the ruins of our old lives."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai pas trouvé grand chose en dehors de l'ordinaire, juste des zombies et "
"les ruines de nos anciennes vies."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Actually, I came across a group of farmers on my way here.  They were a "
"little suspicious, but turned out to be pretty nice.  Good place to buy some "
"food, if they're still around."
msgstr ""
"Tant que j'y pense, j'ai rencontré un groupe de fermiers sur ma route.  Ils "
"étaient un peu suspicieux, mais assez sympathiques.  C'est un bon endroit ou "
"acheter de la nourriture si ils sont toujours là bas."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I found a small cabin out in the woods, someone was living there and had some "
"serious chemistry equipment.  I managed to get good medical supplies from "
"there.  They even had some oddball things too, like fucking napalm and black "
"powder."
msgstr ""
"J'ai trouvé une petite cabane dans les bois, quelqu'un y vivait et disposait "
"d'un équipement de chimie sérieux. J'ai réussi à obtenir de bonnes "
"fournitures médicales. Ils avaient même quelques trucs bizarres, comme du "
"putain de napalm et de la poudre noire."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I ran in to someone living in an old barn, didn't want anything to do with "
"the world.  The odd thing is, they looked like one of those old, Wild West "
"cowboys."
msgstr ""
"Je suis tombé/e sur quelqu'un qui vivait dans une vieille grange et qui ne "
"voulait rien avoir à faire avec le monde. Ce qui est étrange, c'est qu'elle "
"ressemblait à une de ces vieilles cow-girls du Far West."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I used to travel a lot before <the_cataclysm>, and I've had this camper with "
"me for a while now.  I was at home when the riots started, so I grabbed "
"everything I could from my house and hopped in the camper.  I nearly wrecked "
"on my way out of town when some crazy people tried to smash my van, but I "
"made it out.  I've been on the move ever since."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/refugee_caravans.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "You again.  Any good news?  Haven't heard any in a long time."
msgstr "Encore vous. De bonnes nouvelles ? Je n'en ai pas entendu depuis longtemps."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/refugee_caravans.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
", looking thoughtful.  \"Maybe, yeah.  I saw a weird building sort of like "
"that a while back, but we were on the move and couldn't stop to check it out.\""
msgstr ""
", l'air pensif. « Peut-être, oui. J'ai vu un bâtiment bizarre un peu comme ça "
"il y a quelque temps, mais on était en déplacement et on n'a pas pu s'arrêter "
"pour vérifier. »"

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/refugee_caravans.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm a refugee, but don't get the wrong idea.  I've got big dreams of settling "
"down after this and starting a big family.  I just need to find the right "
"place and the right person.  Last couple of places didn't work out so well."
msgstr ""
"Je suis réfugié, mais ne vous méprenez pas. Je rêve de m'installer après cela "
"et de fonder une grande famille. Il faut juste que je trouve le bon endroit "
"et la bonne personne. Les deux derniers endroits n'ont pas très bien "
"fonctionné."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"*studies you with interest, her eyes lined with fatigue but still alert.  She "
"brushes a lock of hair off her forehead.  \"Hi there.  You look new, nice to "
"meet you.  My name's Uyen.\""
msgstr ""
"*Elle vous étudie avec intérêt, les yeux marqués par la fatigue mais toujours "
"alertes. Elle brosse une mèche de cheveux sur son front. \"Bonjour, vous avez "
"l'air nouveau. Tu as l'air nouvelle, ravie de te rencontrer. Je m'appelle "
"Uyen.\""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"No way, sorry.  I was in there when things went bad.  It'll be hard enough to "
"go back after it's cleaned up, I can't bear to look at it right now."
msgstr ""
"Pas du tout, désolé. J'étais là quand les choses ont mal tourné. Ce sera déjà "
"assez difficile d'y retourner une fois que ce sera nettoyé, je ne peux pas "
"supporter de le regarder maintenant."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Sorry, no.  That's too much to ask from me.  I was back there when it went "
"wrong."
msgstr "Désolé, non. C'est trop me demander. J'étais là quand ça a mal tourné."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I oversee the food stocks for the center.  There was significant looting "
"during the panic when we first arrived so most of our food was carried away.  "
"I manage what we have left and do everything I can to increase our supplies.  "
"We've got a few growing sources of fresh meats and vegetables, so I "
"prioritize non-perishable food, such as cornmeal, jerky, and fruit wine."
msgstr ""
"Je supervise les stocks de nourriture du centre. Il y a eu d'importants "
"pillages lors de la panique qui a marqué notre arrivée, si bien que la "
"plupart de nos vivres ont été emportés. Je gère ce qu'il nous reste et je "
"fais tout ce que je peux pour augmenter nos réserves. Nous avons quelques "
"sources de viande et de légumes frais qui se développent, alors je donne la "
"priorité aux denrées non périssables, comme la farine de maïs, la viande "
"séchée et le vin de fruits."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well, there's the downstairs section, we can't fit more people down there so "
"it's out of bounds.  Then there's the second bay that we were using as a "
"staging area at first.  Things went… wrong.  I hear the shopkeeper is "
"offering a reward to clear it out, if you're feeling suicidal."
msgstr ""
"Il y a la section du bas, où nous ne pouvons pas faire entrer plus de monde "
"et qui est donc interdite d'accès. Ensuite, il y a la deuxième travée que "
"nous utilisions comme zone de transit au début. Les choses ont mal tourné. "
"J'ai entendu dire que le commerçant offrait une récompense pour le "
"débarrasser, si vous vous sentez suicidaire."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm so glad we've got that up and running.  One of the people evacuated here "
"had a connection to a functioning ranch, and we got him and a crew out there "
"as quickly as we were able.  We're hoping they'll be able to supply us in "
"enough foodstuffs to make this place self-sufficient and even to trade with "
"other communities as they arise."
msgstr ""
"Je suis très heureux que nous ayons mis cela en place et que cela fonctionne. "
"L'une des personnes évacuées ici avait un lien avec un ranch en activité, et "
"nous l'avons envoyé sur place avec une équipe aussi rapidement que possible. "
"Nous espérons qu'ils seront en mesure de nous fournir suffisamment de denrées "
"alimentaires pour que nous soyons autosuffisants et que nous puissions même "
"commercer avec d'autres communautés le cas échéant."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I haven't been here for long but I do my best to watch who comes and goes.  "
"You can't always predict who will bring trouble."
msgstr ""
"Je ne suis pas ici depuis longtemps, mais je fais de mon mieux pour observer "
"les allées et venues. On ne peut pas toujours prédire qui apportera des "
"ennuis."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I've seen my share of zombies, I'm one of the ones that's ready to take em "
"on.  Nothing more."
msgstr ""
"J'ai vu ma part de zombies, je suis l'un de ceux qui sont prêts à les "
"affronter. Rien de plus."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"There's been rumors.  Folks talkin' about some kind of secret lab, out in the "
"wilds, with survivors in it.  I haven't seen it myself, mind you."
msgstr ""
"Il y a eu des rumeurs. Des gens parlent d'une sorte de laboratoire secret, "
"dans la nature, avec des survivants. Je ne l'ai pas vu moi-même."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
", looking thoughtful.  \"Hmm.  I'm not sure, but I've heard of an odd "
"building that's a bit like you're describing.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'll help out.  I've pretty much been waiting for someone to ask, the "
"mess is in my way but I've been too busy to organize it myself.  Boris is the "
"one to talk to, you say?  I'll let him know."
msgstr ""
"Oui, je donnerai un coup de main. J'attendais que quelqu'un me le demande, le "
"désordre est sur mon chemin mais j'étais trop occupé pour l'organiser "
"moi-même. C'est à Boris qu'il faut s'adresser, tu dis ? Je lui en ferai part."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah, they're my rookie representative.  I figured that those people "
"wouldn't cause too much trouble for them, so I sent them over there.  What "
"about them?"
msgstr ""
"Oh oui, ce sont mes représentants débutants. Je me suis dit que ces gens ne "
"leur causeraient pas trop d'ennuis, alors je les ai envoyés là-bas. Qu'est-ce "
"qu'ils ont ?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm a doctor, one of the several at the outpost.  We were the lucky ones.  "
"Came here right went things started to go wrong, never left."
msgstr ""
"Je suis médecin, l'un des nombreux à l'avant-poste. Nous étions les plus "
"chanceux. Nous sommes arrivés ici au moment où les choses ont commencé à mal "
"tourner, et nous ne sommes jamais repartis."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I thought I smelled a pig.  I jest… please don't arrest me."
msgstr ""
"J'ai cru sentir une odeur de porc.  Je plaisante… s'il vous plaît, ne "
"m'arrêtez pas."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "Huh, thought I smelled someone new.  Can I help you?"
msgstr "Huh, j'ai cru sentir quelqu'un de nouveau. Je peux vous aider ?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Oh, I didn't mean that in a bad way.  Been out in the wilderness so long, I "
"find myself noticing things by scent before sight."
msgstr ""
"Oh, je ne voulais pas dire ça méchamment. J'ai passé tellement de temps dans "
"la nature que je remarque les choses à l'odeur plutôt qu'à la vue."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I've heard that cougars sometimes leap.  Maybe it's just a myth."
msgstr ""
"J'ai entendu dire que les couguars sautaient parfois. Ce n'est peut-être "
"qu'un mythe."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Well… I was like any other civilian till they conscripted me so I'll tell it "
"to you straight.  They're the best hope we got right now.  They are stretched "
"impossibly thin but are willing to do what is needed to maintain order.  They "
"don't care much about looters since they understand most everyone is dead, "
"but if you have something they need… you WILL give it to them.  Since most "
"survivors here have nothing they want, they are welcomed as champions."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien... j'étais un civil comme les autres jusqu'à ce qu'ils m'enrôlent, "
"alors je vais vous le dire franchement. Ils sont le meilleur espoir que nous "
"ayons en ce moment. Ils sont extrêmement sollicités, mais ils sont prêts à "
"faire ce qu'il faut pour maintenir l'ordre. Ils ne se soucient guère des "
"pillards car ils savent que la plupart d'entre eux sont morts, mais si vous "
"avez quelque chose dont ils ont besoin... vous le leur donnerez. Comme la "
"plupart des survivants n'ont rien à se mettre sous la dent, ils sont "
"accueillis comme des champions."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"If you want to know what our next steps are, I'm not at liberty to tell you.  "
"Truth be told, I don't even know myself.  They don't share that sort of "
"information with me."
msgstr ""
"Si vous voulez savoir quelles sont nos prochaines étapes, je ne suis pas en "
"mesure de vous le dire. À vrai dire, je ne le sais même pas moi-même. Ils ne "
"partagent pas ce genre d'informations avec moi."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I haven't done anything wrong…"
msgstr "Je n'ai fait rien de mal…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I found a map to this place in an evac center and thought I'd see if it was "
"just full of <zombies> or if there was something up.  Didn't expect to find "
"so many survivors still alive though."
msgstr ""
"J'ai trouvé une carte de cet endroit dans un centre d'évacuation et je me "
"suis dit que j'allais voir si c'était juste plein de <zombies> ou s'il y "
"avait quelque chose de louche. Je ne m'attendais pas à trouver autant de "
"survivants encore en vie."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Sure.  Seen more'n I'd like to think about honestly.  Like, I think these "
"zombies are evolving?  I've seen new things come out that I swear aren't "
"natural.  One of them looked like it was sparking with electricity."
msgstr ""
"Bien sûr. J'en ai vu plus que je ne voudrais en penser, honnêtement. Je pense "
"que ces zombies évoluent. J'ai vu de nouvelles choses sortir qui, je le jure, "
"ne sont pas naturelles. L'un d'entre eux avait l'air de produire des "
"étincelles d'électricité."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"There's so much weird stuff out there in the wilderness now.  A while back, I "
"found this weird cartoon sign with a map on it, pointing to some kind of "
"trade center.  Haven't been there yet but I can show you my copy of the map "
"if you want."
msgstr ""
"Il y a tellement de choses bizarres dans la nature aujourd'hui. Il y a "
"quelque temps, j'ai trouvé un panneau de bande dessinée avec une carte qui "
"indiquait une sorte de centre commercial. Je n'y suis pas encore allé, mais "
"je peux vous montrer ma copie de la carte si vous voulez."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_DOCTOR.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_doctor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I'm free at the moment if you need something."
msgstr "Je suis libre en ce moment si vous avez besoin de quelque chose."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "&The mercenary looks noticeably tense as you approach."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "Sorry I'd rather be left alone right now."
msgstr "Désolé, je préfère rester seul pour l'instant."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"&A grim expression and deep sunken eyes imply some malady that can't be "
"simply drowned with alcohol alone.  They interrupt you just as you were about "
"to introduce yourself.  \"This anchor I'm wearing, I don't think I'll be "
"needing it any more.  I-I'm just looking for someone to rid me of it"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"It takes only a moment to retrieve a suitable coin from your pockets, and yet "
"your interlocutor found enough time to disappear, having left a sharp "
"emptiness both in memory and the chair before you.  The anchor has been "
"neatly folded on the table."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"The mercenary stares in silence, a flickering of the overhead lighting "
"thankfully cuts the moment short."
msgstr ""
"Le mercenaire reste silencieux, mais une lumière vacillante au plafond vient "
"heureusement couper court à ce moment."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_drugs.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"&This visitor seems way more watchful than normal.  You notice zip bags "
"peeking out from <mypossesivepronoun> overcoat, they are clearly pushing "
"something.  It doesn't take much longer for them to notice you in kind.\n"
"\"You want something?  Or just gawking?\""
msgstr ""
"&Ce visiteur semble beaucoup plus vigilant que d'habitude. Vous remarquez des "
"sacs à fermeture éclair qui dépassent du pardessus de <monpossessifpronoun>, "
"ils sont clairement en train de pousser quelque chose. Il ne faut pas "
"longtemps pour qu'ils vous remarquent à leur tour..\n"
"\"Vous voulez quelque chose ? Ou juste observer?\""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_hireable.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"The mercenary's demeanor changes completely when they realize you aren't here "
"to waste time.  \"Alright, tell you what.  Get me twelve coins and that's "
"giving my skills away, just anything to be done with that voice on a box.\""
msgstr ""
"Le comportement du mercenaire change complètement lorsqu'il réalise que vous "
"n'êtes pas là pour perdre du temps. \"D'accord, je vais vous dire. Donnez-moi "
"douze pièces et c'est donner mes compétences, juste n'importe quoi à faire "
"avec cette voix sur une boîte.\""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"&The mercenary stares at the window, and speaks in a quiet and terse manner.  "
"\"I have a client looking for a medical-grade human biopsy sample, no "
"questions asked.  Are you the right one for the job?"
msgstr ""
"&Le mercenaire fixe la fenêtre et parle d'une manière calme et laconique. "
"\"J'ai un client qui recherche un échantillon de biopsie humaine de qualité "
"médicale, sans poser de questions. Êtes-vous celui qu'il faut pour ce travail "
"?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"&The mercenary gives you a quick appraisal.  \"Five coins for three, special "
"price just for you.  Pay in advance, and I'll arrange a drop in the subway "
"rails here for you to pick within two days.  Deal or not?"
msgstr ""
"&Le mercenaire vous donne une évaluation rapide. \"Cinq pièces pour trois, "
"prix spécial juste pour vous. Payez à l'avance, et je vous ferai déposer dans "
"les rails du métro pour que vous puissiez les récupérer dans les deux jours. "
"Marché conclu ou non ?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"&The mercenary stares intently at a stain in the ceiling, firmly clutching a "
"now cold cup of soup.  No one else seems to be very concerned about this."
msgstr ""
"&Le mercenaire fixe intensément une tache au plafond, serrant fermement une "
"tasse de soupe désormais froide. Personne d'autre ne semble s'en préoccuper."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"&Continued prodding manages to extract a baffling response from your "
"interlocutor \"I- I've seen it, the god of our new world, a god of flesh and "
"bone.\" <mypronoun> says with a maddened glare, as though this were some sort "
"of shocking revelation."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"&You spot the mercenary at the tail end of a deal.  \"Want in on the "
"business?  Still have a pair of ID cards looking for buyers.  Two army and "
"two science cards left, they sell together for 4 coins or not at all."
msgstr ""
"&Vous repérez le mercenaire à la fin d'une transaction. \"Vous voulez "
"participer à l'affaire ? J'ai encore une paire de cartes d'identité à vendre. "
"Il reste deux cartes de l'armée et deux cartes de la science, elles se "
"vendent ensemble pour 4 pièces ou pas du tout."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_template_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"&The mercenary seems uncharacteristically upbeat, or perhaps just drunk.  "
"\"Found this neat gizmo in a lab run a few days ago.\"  <mypronoun> blurts "
"while procuring a small cube of etched glass from <mypossesivepronoun> "
"pocket.  \"Now, I have no use for such a thing, but perhaps you do.  What do "
"you say?  It's yours for 3 coins.\""
msgstr ""
"&Le mercenaire semble étonnamment joyeux, ou peut-être simplement ivre. « "
"J'ai trouvé ce petit gadget sympa lors d'une mission dans un labo il y a "
"quelques jours », <mypronoun> lâche-t-il en sortant un petit cube de verre "
"gravé de sa <mypossesivepronoun> poche. « Maintenant, je n'ai pas vraiment "
"l'utilité de ce truc, mais peut-être que toi, oui. Alors, qu'est-ce que tu en "
"dis ? C'est à toi pour 3 pièces. »"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Oh, that?  There were too many people stealing our glasses, so I started "
"stamping a logo on some bottle caps as a token and raised the drink prices a "
"bit to encourage their return.  I'll give you a merch back when you bring me "
"the token with your glass."
msgstr ""
"Oh, ça? Il y avait trop de personnes qui volaient nos verres, donc j'ai "
"commencé à appliquer un logo sur nos bouchons et capsules pour que ceux-ci "
"servent de jetons et j'ai ensuite augmenté le prix de nos boissons pour "
"encourager les clients à les rendre avec leurs verres. Je vous redonnerai une "
"merch si vous revenez avec un jeton et votre verre."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was among one of the first groups of immigrants sent here to fortify the "
"outpost.  I might have exaggerated my construction skills to get the hell out "
"of the refugee center.  Unless you are a trader, there isn't much work there "
"and food was really becoming scarce when I left."
msgstr ""
"Je faisait partie d'un des premiers groupes envoyés ici pour fortifier "
"l'avant-poste.  J'ai peut être exagéré un peu mes compétences de chantier "
"pour pouvoir enfin sortir du centre de réfugiés.  À moins que vous soyez là "
"pour échanger, il n'y a pas vraiment grand chose à faire là bas et la "
"nourriture commençait vraiment à manquer quand je suis parti."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was starting to wonder if they were really interested in the project or "
"were just trying to get rid of me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Could easily be hundreds as far as I know.  They chose this ranch because of "
"its rather remote location, decent fence, and huge cleared field.  With as "
"much land as we have fenced off we could build a village if we had the "
"materials.  We would have tried to secure a small town or something, but the "
"lack of good farmland and number of undead makes it more practical for us to "
"build from scratch.  The refugee center I came from is constantly facing "
"starvation and undead assaults."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I organize scavenging runs to bring in supplies that we can't produce "
"ourselves.  I try and provide incentives to get migrants to join one of the "
"teams… it's dangerous work, but keeps our outpost alive.  Selling anything we "
"can't use helps keep us afloat with the traders.  If you wanted to drop off a "
"companion or two to assist in one of the runs, I'd appreciate it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Hmm, let me think.  There might be a few things I could scrounge up to help, "
"but it's going to take some time to sort through the scrap to find exactly "
"what you need.  How about this… some of my tools are getting a bit worn and "
"are in need of replacement.  If you could bring me a new angle grinder and a "
"hacksaw, I should be able to find all the parts you need by the time you get "
"back."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was just a laborer till they could find me something a bit more permanent, "
"but being constantly sick has prevented me from doing much of anything."
msgstr ""
"J'étais juste une ouvrier jusqu'à ce qu'ils puissent trouver quelque chose de "
"plus permanent, mais je suis constamment malade ces jours-ci et ça m'empêche "
"d'être utile pour plus ou moins quoi que ce soit."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I don't know what you could do.  I've tried everything.  Just give me time…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I keep getting sick!  At first I thought it was something I ate, but now it "
"seems like I can't keep anything down…"
msgstr ""
"Je n'arrête pas de tomber malade!  Au début j'ai crû que c'était quelque "
"chose que j'ai mangé, mais maintenant je n'arrive pas à garder quoi que ce "
"soit dans l'estomac…"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm one of the migrants that got diverted to this outpost when I arrived at "
"the refugee center.  They said I was big enough to swing an axe, so my "
"profession became lumberjack… didn't have any say in it.  If I want to eat, "
"then I'll be cutting wood from now till kingdom come."
msgstr ""
"Je suis l'un des migrants qui ont été dirigés vers cet avant-poste lorsque je "
"me suis pointé au centre de réfugiés.  Ils m'on dit que j'avais l'air d'être "
"assez solide pour manier une hache, donc je suis devenu un bûcheron…  Pas "
"vraiment eu une opportunité de protester.  Si je veux continuer à manger, je "
"suppose que je vais devoir continuer à faire du petit bois jusqu'à la fin des "
"temps...  Hmmm, cela c'est déjà produit quand j'y pense."

#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Listen.  I said it clearly, and if you keep picking at it I'm gonna get mad.  "
"Who I was is gone.  Dead.  I don't give a shit about your 'healthy', don't "
"<freaking> ask again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Are you one of them?"
msgstr "Êtes-vous l'un d'eux?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "So you're back… explain yourself!"
msgstr "Vous êtes de retour… expliquez-vous!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "You're not ready for this."
msgstr "Vous n'êtes pas prêt(e) pour ceci."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "What about: you prove your worth and join me as my sidekick?"
msgstr "Et si vous prouviez votre valeur et me rejoigniez en tant qu'acolyte ?"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/confused_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I barely understand what's going on *now*.  Why do you think I'd know how the "
"world ended?"
msgstr ""
"Je comprends à peine ce qui se passe *maintenant*. Pourquoi pensez-vous que "
"je saurais comment le monde s'est terminé ?"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"You ever see the Matrix?  This is it.  In real life.  To keep us locked in "
"here, the creators of the simulation have to make sure we're just the right "
"level of miserable.  I think their algorithms got messed up though, and went "
"into overdrive, because all this is a little implausible.  Still, I guess "
"we're still jacked in, so maybe it's working."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez déjà vu Matrix? On est dans une. Ils nous gardent emprisonnés ici, "
"les créateurs de la simulation doivent faire en sorte que nous sommes juste "
"au bon niveau de misère pour que nous nous ne rendions pas compte que s'en "
"est une. Je pense que leurs algorithmes ce sont détraqués par contre et ont "
"rendu la simulation beaucoup trop dure pour nous, parce que tout ceci est un "
"peu invraisemblable. Mais je suppose que nous ne nous sommes pas encore "
"réveillés, donc peut être que la simulation fonctionne encore."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/fema_evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Woof, you ready for a real hot take?  The <freaking> government did this to "
"us.  Intentionally, or at least sort-of intentionally."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I suppose that's true.  Still not a very nice way to break the news to "
"someone you accidentally robbed…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I've been trying not to think about it, but you could be right.  The more "
"that I see, the less I can explain.  I don't know why humans would want this, "
"but if you're a brain-sucking alien, this is the place to be."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"You're right, but I still think there's something bigger out there.  "
"Something evil.  It doesn't matter whether science can explain it because we "
"damn sure don't seem capable of defeating it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"No dice.  You asked me to come along.  This is what you get.  If you don't "
"like it, I'll take my fee and go back to the center.  Ain't hard to find "
"contracts."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/portal_storm.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"You are limited.  Here outside there are no limits.  I could free you from "
"your bonds.  Or bring you halfway here to get a taste."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/portal_storm.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Language is too weak to describe it.  You are too limited to understand "
"freedom yet.  What is mortality when time is a choice?  What is weakness when "
"limits are an illusion?  What is up when there is no down, wrong when there "
"is no right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/portal_storm.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"There is no me.  I don't exist yet, but time is a lie.  The barriers are weak "
"and your presence is potent enough to reflect.  I am the you that said yes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Traveler."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "You're back.  Have you come to listen to the song?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Your mind is open.  More than most.  Perhaps one day, you too will feel the "
"power of the song and become Kindred.  For now, traveler, listen, listen and "
"feel the song."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "I see.  And you live still.  Does that mean you managed to stop him?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"It saddens me to see a talented Kindred lose his way so greatly, but I take "
"solace in the fact that you are unscathed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"How do you do.  Name's Cooper.  What's your- wait… that's the Mark of the "
"Seer on your hand.  You're Kindred.  So I guess you know who I am, then."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"And how many people have you killed?  Maybe it was in self defense, maybe "
"because you wanted their gear.  It's all the same.  I give their death "
"meaning.  I hate that I have to do it, I truly do, but you really must "
"understand, there is no other way.  The sooner I finish my mission, the "
"sooner all this madness can end."
msgstr ""
"Et combien de personnes avez-vous tuées ? Peut-être était-ce en légitime "
"défense, peut-être parce que vous vouliez leur équipement. C'est la même "
"chose. Je donne un sens à leur mort. Je déteste devoir le faire, vraiment, "
"mais vous devez comprendre qu'il n'y a pas d'autre solution. Plus vite je "
"finirai ma mission, plus vite cette folie prendra fin."

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"You're like me then, Kindred.  I'm glad I'm not the only one who realizes "
"what's necessary.  Perhaps one day, we'll be able to work together, but what "
"I do now, I must do alone."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"You're Kindred, and yet you question the power the bones hold, the Song "
"itself?  This hypocrisy is why I set off on my own.  Stop wasting my time and "
"get out of my way."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Did you find them, <name_g>?"
msgstr "Vous les avez trouvés, <name_g>?"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr "Vous êtes sûr?"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "You asked me recently; ask again later."
msgstr "Tu m'as demandé récemment, demande plus tard."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "You just asked me for stuff; ask later."
msgstr "Tu viens de me demander du matos, redemande moi plus tard."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Are you sure?  This doesn't seem like a particularly safe place for small "
"talk…"
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes sûre? Ceci n'a pas l'air d'être vraiment un bon endroit pour "
"bavarder…"

#: data/json/npcs/exodii/exodii_merchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Forgot sommat?"
msgstr "Oublié quelque chose?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Yeah, just that I sometimes see things.  I wanna be sure you're real."
msgstr ""
"C'est juste que parfois je vois des choses. Je veux juste être certain que "
"vous êtes réelle."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I see things sometimes, and there's no way anyone could look like you!  I "
"know you're not real, and if you are, stay away you ugly <name_b>!"
msgstr ""
"Je vais des choses de temps à autre, et il n'y a aucun moyen que quelqu'un "
"ressemble à ce que vous êtes! Je sais que vous n'êtes pas réelle, et si vous "
"l'êtes, restez loin, <name_b> hideuse!"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"You're creepy.  I'm sorry for your lack of friends but, like, I'm literally a "
"kid.  Everyone on Earth turned into a zombie, we're running out of toilet "
"paper and everything, and my parents are gone.  I know they're still alive "
"and they're looking for me.  I miss them.  Is that enough personal stuff for "
"you?"
msgstr ""
"Tu es flippant. Je suis désolé pour ton manque d'amis mais, genre, je suis "
"littéralement un enfant. Tout le monde sur Terre s'est transformé en zombie, "
"nous manquons de papier toilette et tout, et mes parents sont partis. Je sais "
"qu'ils sont toujours en vie et qu'ils me recherchent. Ils me manquent. Est-ce "
"que c'est assez personnel pour toi ?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
