msgid ""
"Well, you got me there.  I sure ain't one to block a fellow farmer's right to "
"reclaim this God-given earth."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
