#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Barry!  Oh my god, you found him!"
msgstr "Barry! Oh mon dieu vous l'avez trouvé!"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*eyes you up and down with a nervous smile.  \"I almost didn't expect you to "
"show up.\"  He hesitates, letting out a soft laugh.  \"That sounds bad.  I "
"just mean, I can't really believe we're doing this.  Thank you… for doing "
"this.  You ready to get Uncle Barry?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
", looking at your marshal badge immediately.  \"You said you'd keep that "
"goddamn piece of tin out of my sight.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I see you took the badge off.  Fine, then, but you'd better not let anyone "
"here know you've got ties to the Marshals.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*nods slowly.  \"I understand.  You tried.  We could maybe… no, nevermind.  "
"Time is important here, we can't spend forever hoping to get everything in "
"place if we want to get Uncle Barry back alive.  Let's do it without the "
"gear.\""
msgstr ""
"*hoche lentement la tête. « Je comprends. Tu as essayé. On pourrait "
"peut-être… non, peu importe. Le temps est important ici, on ne peut pas "
"passer une éternité à espérer que tout soit en place si on veut que l'oncle "
"Barry revienne vivant. Faisons-le sans le matériel. »"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Hello traveler, what brings you here?"
msgstr "Bonjour, qu'est ce qui vous amène ici?"

#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Hey, who the fuck are you?  I haven't seen you 'round.  Ah, fuck it, it "
"doesn't matter.\n"
"Here's the rules.  The first and most important one: ALWAYS CLOSE THE FUCKING "
"ENTRY DOOR BEHIND YOUR ASS!  If you're okay with that, the following rules "
"are: don't fuck with us, don't steal from us, don't start a fight without a "
"reason with someone from us.  Got it, punk?  Now get lost."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Are you deaf or stupid?  I said I don't give a fuck for you and your "
"<freaking> problems.  Bother me one more time, and you'll regret that.  Get "
"outta my sight."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "You think you're immortal, huh, <name_b>?"
msgstr "Vous pensez que vous êtes immortel(le) hein, <name_b>?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "You look like you haven't eaten in days."
msgstr "Vous avez l'air de ne pas avoir mangé depuis un bon moment."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Sure.  After what you did for me, I'd equip an army for you.  I'll need some "
"money to negotiate with the caravans and scavengers that come by.  What level "
"of protection are you thinking?  I can do 2mm, 4mm, and 6mm suits depending "
"on how much you want to resemble a tank, or I can make you a suit of "
"chainmail instead if you want a little more flexibility.  Materials costs are "
"300 merch to pay for the food I need to do the labor plus 100 merch per 2mm "
"or 50 merch for the chainmail.  Whatever I save in non-scaling bits like the "
"chain and leather, I get gouged in looking for so much bulk metal."
msgstr ""
"Bien sûr. Après ce que vous avez fait(e) pour moi, je pourrais équiper une "
"armée pour vous. J'aurais besoin d'argent pour négocier avec les caravanes et "
"voyageurs pour les matériaux nécessaires. Quel niveau de protection avez-vous "
"envie d'avoir,? Je peux vous fournir une armure de 2, 4 ou 6mm d'épaisseur, "
"tout dépends de quel degré d'air de famille vous voulez avoir avoir avec un "
"tank. Je peux aussi vous fournir une armure en cotte de mailles si vous "
"préféreriez. Le prix de base est 300 merch de base pour les matériaux et "
"pouvoir me nourrir, 100 merch par mm de plus que 2mm, ou juste 50 en plus "
"pour une combinaison de cotte de mailles, dû au fait que ce que j'épargne en "
"matériaux comme la maille et le cuir, je me fais saigner lorsque j'essaie de "
"trouver d'aussi grandes quantités de métal."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah; the designs you showed me call for 'em.  Not sure what they are myself, "
"but the pictures are real descriptive about how to use them.  To make "
"anything, I'll need one of each of those wire kits.  Got any?"
msgstr ""
"Oui, les modèles que vous m'avez montrés en ont besoin. Je ne sais pas trop "
"ce que c'est, mais les photos décrivent bien comment les utiliser. Pour "
"fabriquer quoi que ce soit, j'aurai besoin d'un exemplaire de chacun de ces "
"kits de fils. Tu en as ?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Thanks, sugar!  If you ever have me make some armor, just let me know if you "
"want me to use these in it."
msgstr ""
"Merci, mon sucre ! Si jamais tu me demandes de faire une armure, fais-moi "
"savoir si tu veux que j'utilise ces produits."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Sure.  After what you've done for me, I'll forge you the finest work of art.  "
"The price and waiting time depend on the size of the weapon in question, but "
"it will take me a fair amount of money to buy the quality steel I need from "
"the scavengers, and even forging a short blade will take a few days.\n"
"\n"
"I can also temper your weapon, but that will cost an additional 50 merch and "
"take an additional 2 days, but I assure you, it's worth it."
msgstr ""
"Bien sûr. Après ce que vous avez fait pour moi, je vous forgerai la plus "
"belle des œuvres d'art. Le prix et le temps d'attente dépendent de la taille "
"de l'arme en question, mais il me faudra une bonne somme d'argent pour "
"acheter aux récupérateurs l'acier de qualité dont j'ai besoin, et même la "
"forge d'une lame courte prendra quelques jours.\n"
"\n"
"Je peux également tremper votre arme, mais cela coûtera 50 merch "
"supplémentaires et prendra 2 jours de plus, mais je vous assure que cela en "
"vaut la peine."

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Hey stranger.  How's life treatin' ya these days?"
msgstr "Hé, l'étranger. Comment la vie te traite-t-elle ces jours-ci ?"

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Oh, you're not one of the <zombies>.  Come on in, just don't cause any "
"trouble."
msgstr "Oh, vous n'êtes pas l'un des <zombies>. Entrez, mais ne causez pas d'ennuis."

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Oh, you're not one of them.  Those <zombies>, I mean.  Come on in, just don't "
"cause any trouble."
msgstr ""
"Oh, vous n'êtes pas l'un d'entre eux. De ces <zombies>, je veux dire. Entrez, "
"mais ne causez pas d'ennuis."

#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I guess you probably wouldn't have noticed this place before shit hit the "
"fan, but I've been down here for quite a while."
msgstr ""
"Vous n'auriez sans doute pas remarqué cet endroit avant que les choses ne se "
"gâtent, mais je suis ici depuis un certain temps."

#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
