msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "How are you here?  Are you one of them, somehow?  What's going on?"
msgstr ""
"Comment êtes-vous ici ? Êtes-vous l'un d'entre eux, d'une manière ou d'une "
"autre ? Que se passe-t-il ?"

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Well well, another traveler.  Don't try anything, you're outnumbered here and "
"we're well armed."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, un autre voyageur. Ne tentez rien, vous êtes moins nombreux que nous "
"et nous sommes bien armés."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"No offense, but my clients definitely would not like me giving strangers "
"directions to their hideouts.  You'll have to find them on their own terms."
msgstr ""
"Ne le prenez pas mal, mais mes clients n'aimeraient certainement pas que je "
"donne à des étrangers des indications sur leurs cachettes. Vous devrez les "
"trouver par vos propres moyens."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to say it after all you've done for me, but… I don't suppose you've "
"got anything to eat?"
msgstr ""
"Je suis désolée de dire ça après tout ce que vous avez fait pour moi, mais… "
"je suppose que vous n'avez rien à manger?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Well… you have shown that you can survive out there, and you've been able to "
"provide food, so I know you're thriving more than we are here.  All right, "
"I'll tell you what.  I'm not going anywhere without my friends here, we've "
"been through way too much together.  If you can convince Luo, Brandon, and "
"Yusuke to come along, then I'll go."
msgstr ""
"Bon, vous m'avez montré que vous êtes capable de vous débrouiller dehors et "
"trouvez de la nourriture, donc je sais qu'il est probable que nos chances "
"avec vous sont plus favorables que si l'on restait ici. Si vous arrivez à "
"convaincre mes amis Luo, Brandon et Yusuke d'aussi partir avec vous, j'irais "
"avec."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm real hungry and they put drugs in most of the food.  I can see "
"you're not like that."
msgstr ""
"Oui, j'ai vraiment faim et ils mettent de la drogue dans la plupart des "
"aliments. Je vois que tu n'es pas comme ça."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Fuck off, dickwaddle."
msgstr "Va te faire foutre, crétin."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Look, I'm sorry for freaking out earlier.  You might be an asshole but I'm "
"sure you didn't mean it like that.  My blood sugar is hella low, I get a bit "
"cranky.  We cool?"
msgstr ""
"Ecoute, je suis désolé d'avoir paniqué tout à l'heure. Tu es peut-être un "
"connard, mais je suis sûr que tu ne voulais pas dire ça. Mon taux de sucre "
"est très bas, je suis un peu grincheux. On est d'accord ?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Hey there, not-asshole.  Good to see you again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Oooooh.  Oh.  You did not just fucking go there.  Let's leave the fatties to "
"die, hey?  Wanna know how easy it is to find fucking *thyroid medication* "
"after the apocalypse, asshat?  Besides, there are more skills than heavy "
"lifting needed now… no, you know what?  Screw it.  You're not worth my time."
msgstr ""
"Oooooh. Oh. Tu n'as pas fait ça, putain. Laissons les gros mourir, hein ? Tu "
"veux savoir à quel point c'est facile de trouver des putains de *médicaments "
"pour la thyroïde* après l'apocalypse, connard ? En plus, il y a plus de "
"compétences que de poids lourds nécessaires maintenant... non, tu sais quoi ? "
"On s'en fout. Vous ne valez pas la peine que je vous consacre du temps."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Thanks again for the grub, my friend."
msgstr "Merci encore pour la nourriture, mon ami."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Oh, wow!  You're a real gem, you know that?  Thanks for even thinking of it."
msgstr "Oh, wow ! Vous êtes un vrai bijou, vous le savez ? Merci d'y avoir pensé."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Well… I'll be honest, I didn't even think Dave could be sorted out, and "
"you've gone and called my bluff!  It's a darn fine thing you've done for that "
"poor soul.  Listen, I wasn't… entirely serious about wanting to come with "
"you, but if you can convince the others to go, then I guess I'll come along."
msgstr ""
"Je vais être honnête, je ne pensais même pas que Dave pouvait s'en sortir, et "
"vous m'avez fait mentir ! C'est une sacrée bonne chose que vous ayez fait "
"pour cette pauvre âme. Ecoutez, je n'étais pas... tout à fait sérieux sur le "
"fait de vouloir venir avec vous, mais si vous pouvez convaincre les autres "
"d'y aller, alors je suppose que je viendrai."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Hey there, friend."
msgstr "Salut l'ami."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Well now, that's quite a kind offer, and I appreciate you looking past my "
"full-body pubic hair.  Sorry though.  I've come to feel sort of responsible "
"for this little gaggle of squatters.  As long as I'm the only one providing "
"for them, I don't think I can leave."
msgstr ""
"C'est une offre très gentille, et j'apprécie que vous regardiez au-delà de "
"mes poils pubiens. Mais je suis désolé. Je me sens un peu responsable de ce "
"petit groupe de squatters. Tant que je serai la seule à subvenir à leurs "
"besoins, je ne pense pas pouvoir partir."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*seems impossibly young at first glance, her dark face nervous when she sees "
"you looking her way.  On closer inspection as you approach, you see that she "
"is likely in her early teens, but the contrast to the weary faces around "
"makes her age stand out.  \"Oh, uh… hi.  You look new.  I'm Aleesha.\""
msgstr ""
"*Elle semble incroyablement jeune à première vue, son visage sombre est "
"nerveux lorsqu'elle voit que vous regardez dans sa direction. En y regardant "
"de plus près, vous vous apercevez qu'elle est probablement au début de "
"l'adolescence, mais le contraste avec les visages fatigués qui l'entourent "
"fait ressortir son âge. \"Oh, euh... Bonjour. Tu as l'air nouvelle. Je "
"m'appelle Aleesha.\""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "You're back, and still alive!  Whoa."
msgstr "Vous êtes de retour, et toujours vivant! Wow."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
