msgid "It is good to see you again, my friend."
msgstr "Cela fait plaisir de vous revoir mon ami."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Hello, my friend."
msgstr "Bonjour mon ami."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Yes, my friend.  You have done so much for me, I would be glad to teach you "
"what I can.  I must ask a small amount in trade, for materials.  I hope you "
"understand."
msgstr ""
"Oui, mon ami. Vous avez tant fait pour moi, je serais heureux de vous "
"enseigner ce que je peux. Je dois vous demander une petite somme en échange, "
"pour les matériaux. J'espère que vous comprendrez."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Have you had a problem with memory, friend?  I was the one who asked you "
"this, I thought I explained why I could not."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Hmm, well it is not ideal but I appreciate you trying and being willing to "
"help.  I will have to do my best despite the bad memories.  Thank you, my "
"friend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Thank you for trying, my friend.  With you and me that will be five, I will "
"do my best to be strong and assist in the cleanup."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"That is quite alright, four should be enough though I appreciate your offer.  "
"Four people will make the job much easier and I will do my best even if it is "
"painful.  My thanks, friend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Have you heard anything back from the ranch about jobs yet?"
msgstr "Avez-vous eu des nouvelles du ranch en ce qui concerne les emplois ?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Always good to see you, friend."
msgstr "Toujours bon de vous voir."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "My savior!  My patron of the arts!  You're always welcome here, friend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Where you say you're from again?  You're not as worldly as you look.  I'm "
"talking about weed.  Marijuana.  Wondered if you've happened upon any."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Sold!  Thanks for helping me out, friend."
msgstr "Vendu!  Merci pour le coup de main."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Sure thing, friend!  Let's see how you can move to this one."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Oh my, am I dealing with a professional dancer here?  Sweet moves, friend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Daym.  You're probably the best dancer I've ever had the honor of meeting.  "
"Well done.  Well done indeed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Sure, I could teach you the basics, it'll cost you merch though.  Since you "
"helped me out, I can shave a bit off the price, let's say 4 merch, plus a bit "
"in trade depending on how in-depth you're looking for?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"&\"Holy shit, what are the odds?  OK, stand back and hold on.\"  Jenny begins "
"peppering you with questions, which you answer to the best of your ability.  "
"She seems quite satisfied.  \"Well, I can't thank you enough,\" she smiles "
"after a few minutes.  \"You probably just saved me weeks of reinventing the "
"wheel.  Here, it's not much but it's all I've got.\"  She hands you a bundle "
"of the local currency."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Things are coming along.  I have a lot of studying to do before I know how to "
"fix my design issues, but the book you brought definitely has everything I "
"need.  Now that I've got some progress to show, administration is much more "
"willing to help me get the parts I need.  You've been a great gofer, but I "
"can probably handle the rest on my own.  Check back in a week or two!"
msgstr ""
"Les choses avancent. J'ai encore beaucoup d'études à faire avant de savoir "
"comment résoudre mes problèmes de conception, mais le livre que vous avez "
"apporté contient certainement tout ce dont j'ai besoin. Maintenant que j'ai "
"des progrès à montrer, l'administration est beaucoup plus disposée à m'aider "
"à obtenir les pièces dont j'ai besoin. Tu as été d'une aide précieuse, mais "
"je peux probablement me débrouiller seul pour le reste. Revenez dans une "
"semaine ou deux !"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"*turns to look at you, lifting an enormous cowboy hat off his eyes.  He "
"appears to be in the process of growing out a set of bushy muttonchops and a "
"handlebar mustache.  Bright blue eyes peer out from his wrinkled face.  "
"\"Howdy, pardner.  They call me Clemens.  John Clemens.  I'm an ol' cowhand.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"*tips his cowboy hat and sets his feet far apart as he faces you.  \"Howdy, "
"pardner.\""
msgstr ""
"*Il coiffe son chapeau de cow-boy et écarte les pieds pour vous faire face. "
"\"Howdy, pardner.\""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"*is a well-kept middle aged woman with dark hair tied back in a long braid.  "
"She looks surprised as you approach.  \"Ah!  You are new.  I'm sorry, I'm "
"Mangalpreet.\""
msgstr ""
"*La femme est une femme d'âge moyen, bien entretenue, aux cheveux bruns "
"attachés en une longue tresse. Elle a l'air surpris lorsque vous vous "
"approchez. \"Ah ! Vous êtes nouvelle. Je suis désolée, je suis Mangalpreet.\""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
