#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "*peers at you for a while before speaking.  \"Oh, you're back.\""
msgstr ""
"*Il vous regarde un moment avant de prendre la parole. \"Oh, tu es de "
"retour\"."

